msgid ""
"Export a [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], or [PackedStringArray] property "
"as an absolute path to a directory. The path can be picked from the entire "
"filesystem. See [annotation @export_dir] to limit it to the project folder "
"and its subfolders.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_DIR].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_global_dir var sprite_folder_path: String\n"
"@export_global_dir var sprite_folder_paths: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], ຫຼື [PackedStringArray] "
"ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ path ແບບອັບໂຊລູດ (absolute path) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ. ສາມາດເລືອກ path "
"ຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [annotation @export_dir] "
"ເພື່ອຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_DIR].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_global_dir var sprite_folder_path: String\n"
"@export_global_dir var sprite_folder_paths: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export a [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], or [PackedStringArray] property "
"as an absolute path to a file. The path can be picked from the entire "
"filesystem. See [annotation @export_file] to limit it to the project folder "
"and its subfolders.\n"
"If [param filter] is provided, only matching files will be available for "
"picking.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_FILE].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_global_file var sound_effect_path: String\n"
"@export_global_file(\"*.txt\") var notes_path: String\n"
"@export_global_file var multiple_paths: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], ຫຼື [PackedStringArray] "
"ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ path ແບບອັບໂຊລູດ (absolute path) ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌. ສາມາດເລືອກ path "
"ຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [annotation @export_file] "
"ເພື່ອຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"ຖ້າກຳນົດ [param filter], ຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_GLOBAL_FILE].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_global_file var sound_effect_path: String\n"
"@export_global_file(\"*.txt\") var notes_path: String\n"
"@export_global_file var multiple_paths: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Define a new group for the following exported properties. This helps to "
"organize properties in the Inspector dock. Groups can be added with an "
"optional [param prefix], which would make group to only consider properties "
"that have this prefix. The grouping will break on the first property that "
"doesn't have a prefix. The prefix is also removed from the property's name in "
"the Inspector dock.\n"
"If no [param prefix] is provided, then every following property will be added "
"to the group. The group ends when then next group or category is defined. You "
"can also force end a group by using this annotation with empty strings for "
"parameters, [code]@export_group(\"\", \"\")[/code].\n"
"Groups cannot be nested, use [annotation @export_subgroup] to add subgroups "
"within groups.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Racer Properties\")\n"
"@export var nickname = \"Nick\"\n"
"@export var age = 26\n"
"\n"
"@export_group(\"Car Properties\", \"car_\")\n"
"@export var car_label = \"Speedy\"\n"
"@export var car_number = 3\n"
"\n"
"@export_group(\"\", \"\")\n"
"@export var ungrouped_number = 3\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດກຸ່ມ (group) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ export ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດລະບຽບຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ "
"Inspector dock. ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param prefix] ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກຸ່ມຮັບສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີ prefix ນັ້ນນຳໜ້າ. ການຈັດກຸ່ມຈະຢຸດລົງເມື່ອຮອດຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ "
"prefix ດັ່ງກ່າວ. prefix ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ Inspector dock.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ກຳນົດ [param prefix], ທຸກໆຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕາມມາຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ. "
"ກຸ່ມຈະສິ້ນສຸດລົງເມື່ອມີການປະກາດກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ໝວດໝູ່ໃໝ່. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຈົບກຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນນີ້ພ້ອມກັບ string ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ "
"[code]@export_group(\"\", \"\")[/code].\n"
"ກຸ່ມບໍ່ສາມາດຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [annotation @export_subgroup] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Racer Properties\")\n"
"@export var nickname = \"Nick\"\n"
"@export var age = 26\n"
"\n"
"@export_group(\"Car Properties\", \"car_\")\n"
"@export var car_label = \"Speedy\"\n"
"@export var car_number = 3\n"
"\n"
"@export_group(\"\", \"\")\n"
"@export var ungrouped_number = 3\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export a [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], [PackedStringArray], [Dictionary] "
"or [Array][lb][Dictionary][rb] property with a large [TextEdit] widget "
"instead of a [LineEdit]. This adds support for multiline content and makes it "
"easier to edit large amount of text stored in the property.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_multiline var character_biography\n"
"@export_multiline var npc_dialogs: Array[String]\n"
"@export_multiline(\"monospace\", \"no_wrap\") var favorite_ascii_art: String\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], [PackedStringArray], "
"[Dictionary] ຫຼື [Array][lb][Dictionary][rb] ໂດຍໃຊ້ widget [TextEdit] "
"ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ແທນ [LineEdit]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບເນື້ອຫາແບບຫຼາຍແຖວ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_multiline var character_biography\n"
"@export_multiline var npc_dialogs: Array[String]\n"
"@export_multiline(\"monospace\", \"no_wrap\") var favorite_ascii_art: String\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export a [NodePath] or [Array][lb][NodePath][rb] property with a filter for "
"allowed node types.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_NODE_PATH_VALID_TYPES].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_node_path(\"Button\", \"TouchScreenButton\") var some_button\n"
"@export_node_path(\"Button\", \"TouchScreenButton\") var many_buttons: "
"Array[NodePath]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The type must be a native class or a globally registered script "
"(using the [code]class_name[/code] keyword) that inherits [Node]."
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [NodePath] ຫຼື [Array][lb][NodePath][rb] "
"ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຄັດກອງປະເພດໂນດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_NODE_PATH_VALID_TYPES].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_node_path(\"Button\", \"TouchScreenButton\") var some_button\n"
"@export_node_path(\"Button\", \"TouchScreenButton\") var many_buttons: "
"Array[NodePath]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຕ້ອງເປັນ native class ຫຼື ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກລົງທະບຽນແບບ global "
"(ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສະຫງວນ [code]class_name[/code]) ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Node]."

msgid ""
"Export a [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], or [PackedStringArray] property "
"with a placeholder text displayed in the editor widget when no value is "
"present.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_PLACEHOLDER_TEXT].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_placeholder(\"Name in lowercase\") var character_id: String\n"
"@export_placeholder(\"Name in lowercase\") var friend_ids: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [String], [Array][lb][String][rb], ຫຼື [PackedStringArray] "
"ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ placeholder ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນ widget ຂອງ editor ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃສ່ຄ່າໃດໆ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_PLACEHOLDER_TEXT].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_placeholder(\"Name in lowercase\") var character_id: String\n"
"@export_placeholder(\"Name in lowercase\") var friend_ids: Array[String]\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export an [int], [float], [Array][lb][int][rb], [Array][lb][float][rb], "
"[PackedByteArray], [PackedInt32Array], [PackedInt64Array], "
"[PackedFloat32Array], or [PackedFloat64Array] property as a range value. The "
"range must be defined by [param min] and [param max], as well as an optional "
"[param step] and a variety of extra hints. The [param step] defaults to "
"[code]1[/code] for integer properties. For floating-point numbers this value "
"depends on your [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/"
"default_float_step] setting.\n"
"If hints [code]\"or_greater\"[/code] and [code]\"or_less\"[/code] are "
"provided, the editor widget will not cap the value at range boundaries. The "
"[code]\"exp\"[/code] hint will make the edited values on range to change "
"exponentially. The [code]\"prefer_slider\"[/code] hint will make integer "
"values use the slider instead of arrows for editing, while [code]"
"\"hide_control\"[/code] will hide the element controlling the value of the "
"editor widget.\n"
"Hints also allow to indicate the units for the edited value. Using [code]"
"\"radians_as_degrees\"[/code] you can specify that the actual value is in "
"radians, but should be displayed in degrees in the Inspector dock (the range "
"values are also in degrees). [code]\"degrees\"[/code] allows to add a degree "
"sign as a unit suffix (the value is unchanged). Finally, a custom suffix can "
"be provided using [code]\"suffix:unit\"[/code], where \"unit\" can be any "
"string.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_RANGE].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_range(0, 20) var number\n"
"@export_range(-10, 20) var number\n"
"@export_range(-10, 20, 0.2) var number: float\n"
"@export_range(0, 20) var numbers: Array[float]\n"
"\n"
"@export_range(0, 100, 1, \"or_greater\") var power_percent\n"
"@export_range(0, 100, 1, \"or_greater\", \"or_less\") var health_delta\n"
"\n"
"@export_range(-180, 180, 0.001, \"radians_as_degrees\") var angle_radians\n"
"@export_range(0, 360, 1, \"degrees\") var angle_degrees\n"
"@export_range(-8, 8, 2, \"suffix:px\") var target_offset\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [int], [float], [Array][lb][int][rb], [Array][lb][float][rb], "
"[PackedByteArray], [PackedInt32Array], [PackedInt64Array], "
"[PackedFloat32Array], ຫຼື [PackedFloat64Array] ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຊ່ວງຄ່າ (range). "
"ຊ່ວງຄ່າຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [param min] ແລະ [param max], ລວມທັງ [param step] "
"ທີ່ສາມາດລະບຸເພີ່ມໄດ້ ແລະ hints ອື່ນໆ. ຄ່າ [param step] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]1[/code] "
"ສຳລັບເລກຖ້ວນ. ສຳລັບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member EditorSettings.interface/"
"inspector/default_float_step].\n"
"ຖ້າລະບຸ hint [code]\"or_greater\"[/code] ຫຼື [code]\"or_less\"[/code], widget ໃນ "
"editor ຈະບໍ່ຈຳກັດຄ່າໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ. hint [code]\"exp\"[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງນັ້ນເປັນແບບ exponential. hint [code]\"prefer_slider\"[/code] "
"ຈະໃຫ້ໃຊ້ slider ແທນລູກສອນໃນການປັບຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [code]\"hide_control\"[/code] "
"ຈະເຊື່ອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມຄ່າຂອງ widget.\n"
"Hints ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດລະບຸຫົວໜ່ວຍຂອງຄ່າທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ການໃຊ້ [code]\"radians_as_degrees\"[/"
"code] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດວ່າຄ່າຈິງແມ່ນເຣດຽນ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ສະແດງເປັນອົງສາໃນ Inspector dock. [code]"
"\"degrees\"[/code] ຈະເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງໝາຍອົງສາເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍ (ຄ່າຈິງບໍ່ປ່ຽນ). ສຸດທ້າຍ, "
"ສາມາດກຳນົດຫົວໜ່ວຍເອງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [code]\"suffix:unit\"[/code].\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_RANGE].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_range(0, 20) var number\n"
"@export_range(-10, 20) var number\n"
"@export_range(-10, 20, 0.2) var number: float\n"
"@export_range(0, 20) var numbers: Array[float]\n"
"\n"
"@export_range(0, 100, 1, \"or_greater\") var power_percent\n"
"@export_range(0, 100, 1, \"or_greater\", \"or_less\") var health_delta\n"
"\n"
"@export_range(-180, 180, 0.001, \"radians_as_degrees\") var angle_radians\n"
"@export_range(0, 360, 1, \"degrees\") var angle_degrees\n"
"@export_range(-8, 8, 2, \"suffix:px\") var target_offset\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export a property with [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] flag. The property "
"is not displayed in the editor, but it is serialized and stored in the scene "
"or resource file. This can be useful for [annotation @tool] scripts. Also the "
"property value is copied when [method Resource.duplicate] or [method "
"Node.duplicate] is called, unlike non-exported variables.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a # Not stored in the file, not displayed in the editor.\n"
"@export_storage var b # Stored in the file, not displayed in the editor.\n"
"@export var c: int # Stored in the file, displayed in the editor.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດພ້ອມກັບ flag [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE]. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ "
"editor, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກ serialized ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນສາກ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສະຄຣິບແບບ [annotation @tool]. ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຈະຖືກສຳເນົາເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Resource.duplicate] ຫຼື [method "
"Node.duplicate], ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ export.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a # ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກໃນໄຟລ໌, ບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ editor.\n"
"@export_storage var b # ບັນທຶກໃນໄຟລ໌, ບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ editor.\n"
"@export var c: int # ບັນທຶກໃນໄຟລ໌, ສະແດງໃນ editor.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Define a new subgroup for the following exported properties. This helps to "
"organize properties in the Inspector dock. Subgroups work exactly like "
"groups, except they need a parent group to exist. See [annotation "
"@export_group].\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Racer Properties\")\n"
"@export var nickname = \"Nick\"\n"
"@export var age = 26\n"
"\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Car Properties\", \"car_\")\n"
"@export var car_label = \"Speedy\"\n"
"@export var car_number = 3\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Subgroups cannot be nested, but you can use the slash separator "
"([code]/[/code]) to achieve the desired effect:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Car Properties\")\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels\", \"wheel_\")\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels/Front\", \"front_wheel_\")\n"
"@export var front_wheel_strength = 10\n"
"@export var front_wheel_mobility = 5\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels/Rear\", \"rear_wheel_\")\n"
"@export var rear_wheel_strength = 8\n"
"@export var rear_wheel_mobility = 3\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels\", \"wheel_\")\n"
"@export var wheel_material: PhysicsMaterial\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍ (subgroup) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ export ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດລະບຽບຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ "
"Inspector dock. ກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບກຸ່ມທຸກປະການ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການກຸ່ມຫຼັກ (parent group) ກ່ອນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [annotation @export_group].\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Racer Properties\")\n"
"@export var nickname = \"Nick\"\n"
"@export var age = 26\n"
"\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Car Properties\", \"car_\")\n"
"@export var car_label = \"Speedy\"\n"
"@export var car_number = 3\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ slash ([code]/[/"
"code]) ເພື່ອສ້າງຜົນລັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export_group(\"Car Properties\")\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels\", \"wheel_\")\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels/Front\", \"front_wheel_\")\n"
"@export var front_wheel_strength = 10\n"
"@export var front_wheel_mobility = 5\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels/Rear\", \"rear_wheel_\")\n"
"@export var rear_wheel_strength = 8\n"
"@export var rear_wheel_mobility = 3\n"
"@export_subgroup(\"Wheels\", \"wheel_\")\n"
"@export var wheel_material: PhysicsMaterial\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Export a [Callable] property as a clickable button with the label [param "
"text]. When the button is pressed, the callable is called.\n"
"If [param icon] is specified, it is used to fetch an icon for the button via "
"[method Control.get_theme_icon], from the [code]\"EditorIcons\"[/code] theme "
"type. If [param icon] is omitted, the default [code]\"Callable\"[/code] icon "
"is used instead.\n"
"Consider using the [EditorUndoRedoManager] to allow the action to be reverted "
"safely.\n"
"See also [constant PROPERTY_HINT_TOOL_BUTTON].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Sprite2D\n"
"\n"
"@export_tool_button(\"Hello\") var hello_action = hello\n"
"@export_tool_button(\"Randomize the color!\", \"ColorRect\")\n"
"var randomize_color_action = randomize_color\n"
"\n"
"func hello():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello world!\")\n"
"\n"
"func randomize_color():\n"
"\tvar undo_redo = EditorInterface.get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"\tundo_redo.create_action(\"Randomized Sprite2D Color\")\n"
"\tundo_redo.add_do_property(self, &\"self_modulate\", Color(randf(), randf(), "
"randf()))\n"
"\tundo_redo.add_undo_property(self, &\"self_modulate\", self_modulate)\n"
"\tundo_redo.commit_action()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The property is exported without the [constant "
"PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] flag because a [Callable] cannot be properly "
"serialized and stored in a file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In an exported project neither [EditorInterface] nor "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] exist, which may cause some scripts to break. To "
"prevent this, you can use [method Engine.get_singleton] and omit the static "
"type from the variable declaration:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var undo_redo = "
"Engine.get_singleton(&\"EditorInterface\").get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Avoid storing lambda callables in member variables of "
"[RefCounted]-based classes (e.g. resources), as this can lead to memory "
"leaks. Use only method callables and optionally [method Callable.bind] or "
"[method Callable.unbind]."
msgstr ""
"Export ຄຸນສົມບັດ [Callable] ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ສາມາດຄລິກໄດ້ ພ້ອມກັບປ້າຍຊື່ [param text]. "
"ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ, ຟັງຊັນ (callable) ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ຖ້າລະບຸ [param icon], ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງໄອຄອນມາສະແດງໃນປຸ່ມຜ່ານ [method "
"Control.get_theme_icon] ຈາກປະເພດທີມ [code]\"EditorIcons\"[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ລະບຸ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄອຄອນ [code]\"Callable\"[/code] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທນ.\n"
"ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [EditorUndoRedoManager] ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການກະທຳ (undo) "
"ໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [constant PROPERTY_HINT_TOOL_BUTTON].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Sprite2D\n"
"\n"
"@export_tool_button(\"Hello\") var hello_action = hello\n"
"@export_tool_button(\"Randomize the color!\", \"ColorRect\")\n"
"var randomize_color_action = randomize_color\n"
"\n"
"func hello():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello world!\")\n"
"\n"
"func randomize_color():\n"
"\tvar undo_redo = EditorInterface.get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"\tundo_redo.create_action(\"Randomized Sprite2D Color\")\n"
"\tundo_redo.add_do_property(self, &\"self_modulate\", Color(randf(), randf(), "
"randf()))\n"
"\tundo_redo.add_undo_property(self, &\"self_modulate\", self_modulate)\n"
"\tundo_redo.commit_action()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກ export ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ flag [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] "
"ເພາະ [Callable] ບໍ່ສາມາດ serialize ແລະ ບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເອັກສະພອດໄປແລ້ວ ຈະບໍ່ມີ [EditorInterface] ຫຼື "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager], ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບບາງອັນເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [method Engine.get_singleton] ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດ static type "
"ໃນການປະກາດຕົວປ່ຽນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var undo_redo = "
"Engine.get_singleton(&\"EditorInterface\").get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເກັບ lambda callables ໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກຂອງຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ "
"[RefCounted] (ເຊັ່ນ resources), ເພາະອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຮົ່ວໄຫຼ (memory "
"leaks). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ method callables ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ [method Callable.bind] ຫຼື "
"[method Callable.unbind] ຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"Add a custom icon to the current script. The icon specified at [param "
"icon_path] is displayed in the Scene dock for every node of that class, as "
"well as in various editor dialogs.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@icon(\"res://path/to/class/icon.svg\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the script can have a custom icon. Inner classes are not "
"supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As annotations describe their subject, the [annotation @icon] "
"annotation must be placed before the class definition and inheritance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike most other annotations, the argument of the [annotation "
"@icon] annotation must be a string literal (constant expressions are not "
"supported)."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄອຄອນສ່ວນຕົວໃຫ້ກັບສະຄຣິບປັດຈຸບັນ. ໄອຄອນທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param icon_path] ຈະສະແດງໃນ Scene "
"dock ສຳລັບທຸກໆໂນດຂອງຄລາດນັ້ນ, ລວມທັງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ່າງໆ ຂອງ editor.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@icon(\"res://path/to/class/icon.svg\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະເພາະຕົວສະຄຣິບຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ມີໄອຄອນສ່ວນຕົວໄດ້. Inner classes ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງມັນ, ແອນໂນເທຊັນ [annotation "
"@icon] ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກວາງໄວ້ກ່ອນການປະກາດຄລາດ ແລະ ການສືບທອດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນອື່ນໆ ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ອາກິວເມນຂອງ [annotation @icon] "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນ string literal (ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ constant expressions)."

msgid ""
"Mark the following property as assigned when the [Node] is ready. Values for "
"these properties are not assigned immediately when the node is initialized "
"([method Object._init]), and instead are computed and stored right before "
"[method Node._ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@onready var character_name = $Label\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເມື່ອ [Node] ກຽມພ້ອມແລ້ວ (ready). "
"ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂນດ ([method Object._init]), "
"ແຕ່ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method Node._ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@onready var character_name = $Label\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Mark the following method for remote procedure calls. See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/networking/high_level_multiplayer.html]High-level multiplayer[/"
"url].\n"
"If [param mode] is set as [code]\"any_peer\"[/code], allows any peer to call "
"this RPC function. Otherwise, only the authority peer is allowed to call it "
"and [param mode] should be kept as [code]\"authority\"[/code]. When "
"configuring functions as RPCs with [method Node.rpc_config], each of these "
"modes respectively corresponds to the [constant "
"MultiplayerAPI.RPC_MODE_AUTHORITY] and [constant "
"MultiplayerAPI.RPC_MODE_ANY_PEER] RPC modes. See [enum "
"MultiplayerAPI.RPCMode]. If a peer that is not the authority tries to call a "
"function that is only allowed for the authority, the function will not be "
"executed. If the error can be detected locally (when the RPC configuration is "
"consistent between the local and the remote peer), an error message will be "
"displayed on the sender peer. Otherwise, the remote peer will detect the "
"error and print an error there.\n"
"If [param sync] is set as [code]\"call_remote\"[/code], the function will "
"only be executed on the remote peer, but not locally. To run this function "
"locally too, set [param sync] to [code]\"call_local\"[/code]. When "
"configuring functions as RPCs with [method Node.rpc_config], this is "
"equivalent to setting [code]call_local[/code] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"The [param transfer_mode] accepted values are [code]\"unreliable\"[/code], "
"[code]\"unreliable_ordered\"[/code], or [code]\"reliable\"[/code]. It sets "
"the transfer mode of the underlying [MultiplayerPeer]. See [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode].\n"
"The [param transfer_channel] defines the channel of the underlying "
"[MultiplayerPeer]. See [member MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel].\n"
"The order of [param mode], [param sync] and [param transfer_mode] does not "
"matter, but values related to the same argument must not be used more than "
"once. [param transfer_channel] always has to be the 4th argument (you must "
"specify 3 preceding arguments).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@rpc\n"
"func fn(): pass\n"
"\n"
"@rpc(\"any_peer\", \"unreliable_ordered\")\n"
"func fn_update_pos(): pass\n"
"\n"
"@rpc(\"authority\", \"call_remote\", \"reliable\", 0) # Equivalent to @rpc\n"
"func fn_default(): pass\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Methods annotated with [annotation @rpc] cannot receive objects "
"which define required parameters in [method Object._init]. See [method "
"Object._init] for more details."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດເມທອດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນໄລຍະໄກ (remote procedure calls). ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/networking/high_level_multiplayer.html]High-level "
"multiplayer[/url].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]\"any_peer\"[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ peer "
"ໃດກໍໄດ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ RPC ນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ authority peer ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"[param mode] ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]\"authority\"[/code]. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຟັງຊັນເປັນ RPC ດ້ວຍ "
"[method Node.rpc_config], ແຕ່ລະໂໝດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະກົງກັບ [constant "
"MultiplayerAPI.RPC_MODE_AUTHORITY] ແລະ [constant "
"MultiplayerAPI.RPC_MODE_ANY_PEER] ຕາມລຳດັບ. ເບິ່ງ [enum MultiplayerAPI.RPCMode]. "
"ຖ້າ peer ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ authority ພະຍາຍາມເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສະເພາະ authority, "
"ຟັງຊັນນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າສາມາດກວດພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ (ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RPC "
"ຂອງທັງສອງຝ່າຍກົງກັນ), ຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ຝັ່ງຜູ້ສົ່ງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຝັ່ງຜູ້ຮັບຈະກວດພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງ error ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param sync] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]\"call_remote\"[/code], "
"ຟັງຊັນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະຢູ່ຝັ່ງ peer ໄລຍະໄກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນເຄື່ອງຕົວເອງ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລັນໃນເຄື່ອງຕົວເອງນຳ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [param sync] ເປັນ [code]\"call_local\"[/code]. "
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຟັງຊັນເປັນ RPC ດ້ວຍ [method Node.rpc_config], ນີ້ຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ "
"[code]call_local[/code] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ [param transfer_mode] ແມ່ນ [code]\"unreliable\"[/code], [code]"
"\"unreliable_ordered\"[/code], ຫຼື [code]\"reliable\"[/code]. "
"ມັນເປັນການຕັ້ງໂໝດການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer]. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"MultiplayerPeer.transfer_mode].\n"
"[param transfer_channel] ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (channel) ຂອງ [MultiplayerPeer]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [member MultiplayerPeer.transfer_channel].\n"
"ລຳດັບຂອງ [param mode], [param sync] ແລະ [param transfer_mode] ຈະວາງແນວໃດກໍໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອາກິວເມນດຽວກັນຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ. [param transfer_channel] "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນອາກິວເມນທີ 4 ສະເໝີ (ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸ 3 ອາກິວເມນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນໃຫ້ຄົບ).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@rpc\n"
"func fn(): pass\n"
"\n"
"@rpc(\"any_peer\", \"unreliable_ordered\")\n"
"func fn_update_pos(): pass\n"
"\n"
"@rpc(\"authority\", \"call_remote\", \"reliable\", 0) # ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ @rpc\n"
"func fn_default(): pass\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດທີ່ໃຊ້ [annotation @rpc] "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບອອບເຈັກທີ່ມີການກຳນົດພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນ [method Object._init] ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Object._init] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Make a script with static variables to not persist after all references are "
"lost. If the script is loaded again the static variables will revert to their "
"default values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As annotations describe their subject, the [annotation "
"@static_unload] annotation must be placed before the class definition and "
"inheritance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Currently, due to a bug, scripts are never freed, even if "
"[annotation @static_unload] annotation is used."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນແບບ static ບໍ່ຄົງຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກການອ້າງອີງທັງໝົດຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຖ້າສະຄຣິບຖືກໂຫລດໃໝ່, "
"ຕົວປ່ຽນ static ຈະກັບໄປເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງມັນ, ແອນໂນເທຊັນ [annotation "
"@static_unload] ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກວາງໄວ້ກ່ອນການປະກາດຄລາດ ແລະ ການສືບທອດ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມີບັກ (bug), ສະຄຣິບຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ແອນໂນເທຊັນ [annotation @static_unload] ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Mark the current script as a tool script, allowing it to be loaded and "
"executed by the editor. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/"
"running_code_in_the_editor.html]Running code in the editor[/url].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As annotations describe their subject, the [annotation @tool] "
"annotation must be placed before the class definition and inheritance."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບປັດຈຸບັນເປັນ tool script, ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດຖືກໂຫລດ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"(editor) ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/"
"running_code_in_the_editor.html]Running code in the editor[/url].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງມັນ, ແອນໂນເທຊັນ [annotation "
"@tool] ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກວາງໄວ້ກ່ອນການປະກາດຄລາດ ແລະ ການສືບທອດ."

msgid ""
"Mark the following statement to ignore the specified [param warning]. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.html]GDScript "
"warning system[/url].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func test():\n"
"\tprint(\"hello\")\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t@warning_ignore(\"unreachable_code\")\n"
"\tprint(\"unreachable\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [annotation @warning_ignore_start] and [annotation "
"@warning_ignore_restore]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຂ້າມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (ignore warning) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param warning]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.html]GDScript "
"warning system[/url].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func test():\n"
"\tprint(\"ສະບາຍດີ\")\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t@warning_ignore(\"unreachable_code\")\n"
"\tprint(\"ໄປບໍ່ຮອດ\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [annotation @warning_ignore_start] ແລະ [annotation "
"@warning_ignore_restore]."

msgid ""
"Stops ignoring the listed warning types after [annotation "
"@warning_ignore_start]. Ignoring the specified warning types will be reset to "
"Project Settings. This annotation can be omitted to ignore the warning types "
"until the end of the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike most other annotations, arguments of the [annotation "
"@warning_ignore_restore] annotation must be string literals (constant "
"expressions are not supported)."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດການຂ້າມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ [annotation @warning_ignore_start]. "
"ການຂ້າມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຖືກກັບໄປໃຊ້ຕາມ Project Settings. ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະເວັ້ນແອນໂນເທຊັນນີ້ໄດ້ "
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການຂ້າມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຈົນຈົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກແອນໂນເທຊັນອື່ນໆ ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ອາກິວເມນຂອງ [annotation "
"@warning_ignore_restore] ຕ້ອງເປັນ string literal (ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ constant expressions)."

msgid "Global scope constants and functions."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນໃນລະດັບ Global scope."

msgid ""
"A list of global scope enumerated constants and built-in functions. This is "
"all that resides in the globals, constants regarding error codes, keycodes, "
"property hints, etc.\n"
"Singletons are also documented here, since they can be accessed from "
"anywhere.\n"
"For the entries that can only be accessed from scripts written in GDScript, "
"see [@GDScript]."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວລະດັບ global. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມມີທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ globals, "
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error codes), ລະຫັດປຸ່ມກົດ (keycodes), property hints, ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"Singletons ກໍຖືກລວມໄວ້ໃນນີ້ຄືກັນ ເພາະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທຸກບ່ອນ.\n"
"ສຳລັບສິ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຈາກສະຄຣິບທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍ GDScript, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [@GDScript]."

msgid "Random number generation"
msgstr "ການສຸ່ມຕົວເລກ"

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute value of a [Variant] parameter [param x] (i.e. non-"
"negative value). Supported types: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], "
"[Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = abs(-1)\n"
"# a is 1\n"
"\n"
"var b = abs(-1.2)\n"
"# b is 1.2\n"
"\n"
"var c = abs(Vector2(-3.5, -4))\n"
"# c is (3.5, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var d = abs(Vector2i(-5, -6))\n"
"# d is (5, 6)\n"
"\n"
"var e = abs(Vector3(-7, 8.5, -3.8))\n"
"# e is (7, 8.5, 3.8)\n"
"\n"
"var f = abs(Vector3i(-7, -8, -9))\n"
"# f is (7, 8, 9)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method absf], [method absi], "
"[method Vector2.abs], [method Vector2i.abs], [method Vector3.abs], [method "
"Vector3i.abs], [method Vector4.abs], or [method Vector4i.abs]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳບູນ (absolute value) ຂອງ [param x] (ຄື ຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນລົບ). ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: "
"[int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = abs(-1)\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 1\n"
"\n"
"var b = abs(-1.2)\n"
"# b ແມ່ນ 1.2\n"
"\n"
"var c = abs(Vector2(-3.5, -4))\n"
"# c ແມ່ນ (3.5, 4)\n"
"\n"
"var d = abs(Vector2i(-5, -6))\n"
"# d ແມ່ນ (5, 6)\n"
"\n"
"var e = abs(Vector3(-7, 8.5, -3.8))\n"
"# e ແມ່ນ (7, 8.5, 3.8)\n"
"\n"
"var f = abs(Vector3i(-7, -8, -9))\n"
"# f ແມ່ນ (7, 8, 9)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method absf], [method "
"absi], [method Vector2.abs], [method Vector2i.abs], [method Vector3.abs], "
"[method Vector3i.abs], [method Vector4.abs], ຫຼື [method Vector4i.abs]."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute value of float parameter [param x] (i.e. positive "
"value).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# a is 1.2\n"
"var a = absf(-1.2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ [param x] (ຄື ຄ່າບວກ).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 1.2\n"
"var a = absf(-1.2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute value of int parameter [param x] (i.e. positive value).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# a is 1\n"
"var a = absi(-1)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງເລກຖ້ວນ [param x] (ຄື ຄ່າບວກ).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 1\n"
"var a = absi(-1)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the arc cosine of [param x] in radians. Use to get the angle of "
"cosine [param x]. [param x] will be clamped between [code]-1.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive), in order to prevent [method acos] from "
"returning [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# c is 0.523599 or 30 degrees if converted with rad_to_deg(c)\n"
"var c = acos(0.866025)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc cosine ຂອງ [param x] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມຈາກຄ່າ cosine "
"[param x]. ຄ່າ [param x] ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-1.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ [method acos] ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# c ແມ່ນ 0.523599 ຫຼື 30 ອົງສາ ຖ້າແປງດ້ວຍ rad_to_deg(c)\n"
"var c = acos(0.866025)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic arc (also called inverse) cosine of [param x], "
"returning a value in radians. Use it to get the angle from an angle's cosine "
"in hyperbolic space if [param x] is larger or equal to 1. For values of "
"[param x] lower than 1, it will return 0, in order to prevent [method acosh] "
"from returning [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = acosh(2) # Returns 1.31695789692482\n"
"cosh(a) # Returns 2\n"
"\n"
"var b = acosh(-1) # Returns 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic arc cosine (ຫຼື inverse hyperbolic cosine) ຂອງ [param x] "
"ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມໃນພື້ນທີ່ hyperbolic ຖ້າ [param x] ມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ "
"1. ສຳລັບຄ່າ [param x] ທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 1, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ 0 ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ [method acosh] ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ "
"[constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = acosh(2) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.31695789692482\n"
"cosh(a) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2\n"
"\n"
"var b = acosh(-1) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the difference between the two angles (in radians), in the range of "
"[code][-PI, +PI][/code]. When [param from] and [param to] are opposite, "
"returns [code]-PI[/code] if [param from] is smaller than [param to], or "
"[code]PI[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງສອງມຸມ (ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ), ໂດຍຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][-PI, +PI][/code]. ເມື່ອ "
"[param from] ແລະ [param to] ຢູ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-PI[/code] ຖ້າ [param "
"from] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param to], ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]PI[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc sine of [param x] in radians. Use to get the angle of sine "
"[param x]. [param x] will be clamped between [code]-1.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusive), in order to prevent [method asin] from returning [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# s is 0.523599 or 30 degrees if converted with rad_to_deg(s)\n"
"var s = asin(0.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc sine ຂອງ [param x] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມຈາກຄ່າ sine [param "
"x]. ຄ່າ [param x] ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-1.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ [method asin] ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# s ແມ່ນ 0.523599 ຫຼື 30 ອົງສາ ຖ້າແປງດ້ວຍ rad_to_deg(s)\n"
"var s = asin(0.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic arc (also called inverse) sine of [param x], returning "
"a value in radians. Use it to get the angle from an angle's sine in "
"hyperbolic space.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = asinh(0.9) # Returns 0.8088669356527824\n"
"sinh(a) # Returns 0.9\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic arc sine (ຫຼື inverse hyperbolic sine) ຂອງ [param x] "
"ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມໃນພື້ນທີ່ hyperbolic.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = asinh(0.9) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.8088669356527824\n"
"sinh(a) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.9\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the arc tangent of [param x] in radians. Use it to get the angle from "
"an angle's tangent in trigonometry.\n"
"The method cannot know in which quadrant the angle should fall. See [method "
"atan2] if you have both [code]y[/code] and [code skip-lint]x[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atan(0.5) # a is 0.463648\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If [param x] is between [code]-PI / 2[/code] and [code]PI / 2[/code] "
"(inclusive), [code]atan(tan(x))[/code] is equal to [param x]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc tangent ຂອງ [param x] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມໃນໄຕມຸມມິຕິ.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຮູ້ໄດ້ວ່າມຸມຄວນຢູ່ໃນ quadrant ໃດ. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method atan2] ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີທັງຄ່າ "
"[code]y[/code] ແລະ [code]x[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atan(0.5) # a ແມ່ນ 0.463648\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຖ້າ [param x] ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]-PI / 2[/code] ຫາ [code]PI / 2[/code], ຄ່າ "
"[code]atan(tan(x))[/code] ຈະເທົ່າກັບ [param x]."

msgid ""
"Returns the arc tangent of [code]y/x[/code] in radians. Use to get the angle "
"of tangent [code]y/x[/code]. To compute the value, the method takes into "
"account the sign of both arguments in order to determine the quadrant.\n"
"Important note: The Y coordinate comes first, by convention.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atan2(0, -1) # a is 3.141593\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ arc tangent ຂອງ [code]y/x[/code] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມຈາກຄ່າ "
"tangent [code]y/x[/code]. ໃນການຄຳນວນ, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະພິຈາລະນາເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂອງທັງສອງອາກິວເມນເພື່ອລະບຸ quadrant ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດສຳຄັນ: ຕາມທຳນຽມແລ້ວ ຄ່າພິກັດ Y ຈະມາກ່ອນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atan2(0, -1) # a ແມ່ນ 3.141593\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic arc (also called inverse) tangent of [param x], "
"returning a value in radians. Use it to get the angle from an angle's tangent "
"in hyperbolic space if [param x] is between -1 and 1 (non-inclusive).\n"
"In mathematics, the inverse hyperbolic tangent is only defined for -1 < "
"[param x] < 1 in the real set, so values equal or lower to -1 for [param x] "
"return negative [constant @GDScript.INF] and values equal or higher than 1 "
"return positive [constant @GDScript.INF] in order to prevent [method atanh] "
"from returning [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atanh(0.9) # Returns 1.47221948958322\n"
"tanh(a) # Returns 0.9\n"
"\n"
"var b = atanh(-2) # Returns -inf\n"
"tanh(b) # Returns -1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic arc tangent (ຫຼື inverse hyperbolic tangent) ຂອງ [param x] "
"ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າຂອງມຸມໃນພື້ນທີ່ hyperbolic ຖ້າ [param x] ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ -1 ຫາ 1 "
"(ບໍ່ລວມ -1 ແລະ 1).\n"
"ໃນທາງຄະນິດສາດ, inverse hyperbolic tangent ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບ -1 < [param x] < "
"1 ໃນກຸ່ມຈຳນວນຈິງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ -1 ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant @GDScript.INF] ເປັນລົບ "
"ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 1 ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant @GDScript.INF] ເປັນບວກ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ "
"[method atanh] ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [constant @GDScript.NAN].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = atanh(0.9) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.47221948958322\n"
"tanh(a) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.9\n"
"\n"
"var b = atanh(-2) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -inf\n"
"tanh(b) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the derivative at the given [param t] on a one-dimensional "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A9zier_curve]Bézier curve[/url] "
"defined by the given [param control_1], [param control_2], and [param end] "
"points."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອະນຸພັນ (derivative) ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param t] ເທິງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/B%C3%A9zier_curve]Bézier curve[/url] ແບບມິຕິດຽວ ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຈຸດ [param "
"control_1], [param control_2], ແລະ [param end]."

msgid ""
"Returns the point at the given [param t] on a one-dimensional [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A9zier_curve]Bézier curve[/url] defined by the "
"given [param control_1], [param control_2], and [param end] points."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param t] ເທິງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"B%C3%A9zier_curve]Bézier curve[/url] ແບບມິຕິດຽວ ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຈຸດ [param control_1], "
"[param control_2], ແລະ [param end]."

msgid ""
"Decodes a byte array back to a [Variant] value, without decoding objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you need object deserialization, see [method "
"bytes_to_var_with_objects]."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດ byte array ກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າ [Variant], ໂດຍບໍ່ຖອດລະຫັດອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ deserialization ສຳລັບອອບເຈັກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method "
"bytes_to_var_with_objects]."

msgid ""
"Decodes a byte array back to a [Variant] value. Decoding objects is allowed.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized object can contain code which gets executed. Do "
"not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources to "
"avoid potential security threats (remote code execution)."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດ byte array ກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າ [Variant]. ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຖອດລະຫັດອອບເຈັກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ອອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກ deserialized ອາດຈະມີໂຄດທີ່ສາມາດຖືກລັນໄດ້. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າອອບເຈັກນັ້ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນໄພຄຸກຄາມດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ (remote "
"code execution)."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] upward (towards positive infinity), returning the smallest "
"whole number that is not less than [param x]. Supported types: [int], "
"[float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var i = ceil(1.45) # i is 2.0\n"
"i = ceil(1.001)    # i is 2.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method floor], [method round], and [method snapped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method ceilf], [method ceili], "
"[method Vector2.ceil], [method Vector3.ceil], or [method Vector4.ceil]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ຂຶ້ນ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂບວກ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param x]. "
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var i = ceil(1.45) # i ແມ່ນ 2.0\n"
"i = ceil(1.001)    # i ແມ່ນ 2.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method floor], [method round], ແລະ [method snapped].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method ceilf], [method "
"ceili], [method Vector2.ceil], [method Vector3.ceil], ຫຼື [method Vector4.ceil]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] upward (towards positive infinity), returning the smallest "
"whole number that is not less than [param x].\n"
"A type-safe version of [method ceil], returning a [float]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ຂຶ້ນ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂບວກ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param x].\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [method ceil], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [float]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] upward (towards positive infinity), returning the smallest "
"whole number that is not less than [param x].\n"
"A type-safe version of [method ceil], returning an [int]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ຂຶ້ນ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂບວກ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param x].\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [method ceil], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [int]."

msgid ""
"Clamps the [param value], returning a [Variant] not less than [param min] and "
"not more than [param max]. Any values that can be compared with the less than "
"and greater than operators will work.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = clamp(-10, -1, 5)\n"
"# a is -1\n"
"\n"
"var b = clamp(8.1, 0.9, 5.5)\n"
"# b is 5.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method clampf], [method clampi], "
"[method Vector2.clamp], [method Vector2i.clamp], [method Vector3.clamp], "
"[method Vector3i.clamp], [method Vector4.clamp], [method Vector4i.clamp], or "
"[method Color.clamp] (not currently supported by this method).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this on vectors it will [i]not[/i] perform component-"
"wise clamping, and will pick [param min] if [code]value < min[/code] or "
"[param max] if [code]value > max[/code]. To perform component-wise clamping "
"use the methods listed above."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຄ່າ (clamp) [param value], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນ [Variant] ທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param min] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param max]. ທຸກຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດປຽບທຽບດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ \"ນ້ອຍກວ່າ\" ຫຼື \"ຫຼາຍກວ່າ\" "
"ແມ່ນສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = clamp(-10, -1, 5)\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ -1\n"
"\n"
"var b = clamp(8.1, 0.9, 5.5)\n"
"# b ແມ່ນ 5.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method clampf], [method "
"clampi], [method Vector2.clamp], [method Vector2i.clamp], [method "
"Vector3.clamp], [method Vector3i.clamp], [method Vector4.clamp], [method "
"Vector4i.clamp], ຫຼື [method Color.clamp].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກັບ vector ມັນຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ໄດ້ເຮັດການ clamp ແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ "
"(component-wise), ແຕ່ຈະເລືອກ [param min] ຖ້າ [code]value < min[/code] ຫຼື ເລືອກ "
"[param max] ຖ້າ [code]value > max[/code]. ເພື່ອເຮັດການ clamp ແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ."

msgid ""
"Clamps the [param value], returning a [float] not less than [param min] and "
"not more than [param max].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var speed = 42.1\n"
"var a = clampf(speed, 1.0, 20.5) # a is 20.5\n"
"\n"
"speed = -10.0\n"
"var b = clampf(speed, -1.0, 1.0) # b is -1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຄ່າ [param value], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນ [float] ທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param min] ແລະ ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param "
"max].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var speed = 42.1\n"
"var a = clampf(speed, 1.0, 20.5) # a ແມ່ນ 20.5\n"
"\n"
"speed = -10.0\n"
"var b = clampf(speed, -1.0, 1.0) # b ແມ່ນ -1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Clamps the [param value], returning an [int] not less than [param min] and "
"not more than [param max].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var speed = 42\n"
"var a = clampi(speed, 1, 20) # a is 20\n"
"\n"
"speed = -10\n"
"var b = clampi(speed, -1, 1) # b is -1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດຄ່າ [param value], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນ [int] ທີ່ບໍ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param min] ແລະ ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param "
"max].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var speed = 42\n"
"var a = clampi(speed, 1, 20) # a ແມ່ນ 20\n"
"\n"
"speed = -10\n"
"var b = clampi(speed, -1, 1) # b ແມ່ນ -1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the cosine of angle [param angle_rad] in radians.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"cos(PI * 2)         # Returns 1.0\n"
"cos(PI)             # Returns -1.0\n"
"cos(deg_to_rad(90)) # Returns 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ cosine ຂອງມຸມ [param angle_rad] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"cos(PI * 2)         # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"cos(PI)             # ສົ່ງຄືນ -1.0\n"
"cos(deg_to_rad(90)) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic cosine of [param x] in radians.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(cosh(1)) # Prints 1.543081\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hyperbolic cosine ຂອງ [param x] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(cosh(1)) # ສະແດງ 1.543081\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Cubic interpolates between two values by the factor defined in [param weight] "
"with [param pre] and [param post] values."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບກຳລັງສາມ (Cubic interpolation) ລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param "
"weight] ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ [param pre] ແລະ [param post]."

msgid ""
"Cubic interpolates between two rotation values with shortest path by the "
"factor defined in [param weight] with [param pre] and [param post] values. "
"See also [method lerp_angle]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບກຳລັງສາມລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າການໝຸນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param weight] "
"ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ [param pre] ແລະ [param post]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method lerp_angle]."

msgid ""
"Cubic interpolates between two rotation values with shortest path by the "
"factor defined in [param weight] with [param pre] and [param post] values. "
"See also [method lerp_angle].\n"
"It can perform smoother interpolation than [method cubic_interpolate] by the "
"time values."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບກຳລັງສາມລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າການໝຸນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param weight] "
"ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ [param pre] ແລະ [param post]. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method lerp_angle].\n"
"ມັນສາມາດເຮັດການແທນຄ່າໄດ້ກ້ຽງກວ່າ [method cubic_interpolate] ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງເວລາ."

msgid ""
"Cubic interpolates between two values by the factor defined in [param weight] "
"with [param pre] and [param post] values.\n"
"It can perform smoother interpolation than [method cubic_interpolate] by the "
"time values."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບກຳລັງສາມລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param weight] ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ [param pre] "
"ແລະ [param post].\n"
"ມັນສາມາດເຮັດການແທນຄ່າໄດ້ກ້ຽງກວ່າ [method cubic_interpolate] ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງເວລາ."

msgid "Converts from decibels to linear energy (audio)."
msgstr "ແປງຈາກເດຊີເບລ (decibels) ເປັນພະລັງງານສຽງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear energy)."

msgid ""
"Converts an angle expressed in degrees to radians.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var r = deg_to_rad(180) # r is 3.141593\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງມຸມຈາກຫົວໜ່ວຍອົງສາ (degrees) ເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var r = deg_to_rad(180) # r ແມ່ນ 3.141593\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns an \"eased\" value of [param x] based on an easing function defined "
"with [param curve]. This easing function is based on an exponent. The [param "
"curve] can be any floating-point number, with specific values leading to the "
"following behaviors:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Lower than -1.0 (exclusive): Ease in-out\n"
"- -1.0: Linear\n"
"- Between -1.0 and 0.0 (exclusive): Ease out-in\n"
"- 0.0: Constant\n"
"- Between 0.0 to 1.0 (exclusive): Ease out\n"
"- 1.0: Linear\n"
"- Greater than 1.0 (exclusive): Ease in\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"ease_cheatsheet.png]ease() curve values cheatsheet[/url]\n"
"See also [method smoothstep]. If you need to perform more advanced "
"transitions, use [method Tween.interpolate_value]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ \"eased\" ຂອງ [param x] ໂດຍອີງຕາມ easing function ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [param "
"curve]. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ໃຊ້ເລກກຳລັງ. [param curve] ສາມາດເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃດກໍໄດ້ "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- ນ້ອຍກວ່າ -1.0: Ease in-out\n"
"- -1.0: Linear (ເສັ້ນຊື່)\n"
"- ລະຫວ່າງ -1.0 ຫາ 0.0: Ease out-in\n"
"- 0.0: Constant (ຄ່າຄົງທີ່)\n"
"- ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0: Ease out\n"
"- 1.0: Linear (ເສັ້ນຊື່)\n"
"- ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1.0: Ease in\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"ease_cheatsheet.png]ease() curve values cheatsheet[/url]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method smoothstep]. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method Tween.interpolate_value]."

msgid ""
"Returns a human-readable name for the given [enum Error] code.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(OK)                              # Prints 0\n"
"print(error_string(OK))                # Prints \"OK\"\n"
"print(error_string(ERR_BUSY))          # Prints \"Busy\"\n"
"print(error_string(ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY)) # Prints \"Out of memory\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ສຳລັບລະຫັດ [enum Error] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(OK)                              # ສະແດງ 0\n"
"print(error_string(OK))                # ສະແດງ \"OK\"\n"
"print(error_string(ERR_BUSY))          # ສະແດງ \"Busy\"\n"
"print(error_string(ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY)) # ສະແດງ \"Out of memory\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"The natural exponential function. It raises the mathematical constant [i]e[/"
"i] to the power of [param x] and returns it.\n"
"[i]e[/i] has an approximate value of 2.71828, and can be obtained with "
"[code]exp(1)[/code].\n"
"For exponents to other bases use the method [method pow].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = exp(2) # Approximately 7.39\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນເລກກຳລັງທຳມະຊາດ. ມັນຈະຍົກກຳລັງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທາງຄະນິດສາດ [i]e[/i] ດ້ວຍ [param x] "
"ແລ້ວສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັບ.\n"
"[i]e[/i] ມີຄ່າປະມານ 2.71828, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກ [code]exp(1)[/code].\n"
"ສຳລັບເລກກຳລັງທີ່ມີຖານອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method pow].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = exp(2) # ມີຄ່າປະມານ 7.39\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] downward (towards negative infinity), returning the largest "
"whole number that is not more than [param x]. Supported types: [int], "
"[float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = floor(2.99) # a is 2.0\n"
"a = floor(-2.99)    # a is -3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method ceil], [method round], and [method snapped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method floorf], [method floori], "
"[method Vector2.floor], [method Vector3.floor], or [method Vector4.floor]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ລົງ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂລົບ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param x]. "
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = floor(2.99) # a ແມ່ນ 2.0\n"
"a = floor(-2.99)    # a ແມ່ນ -3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method ceil], [method round], ແລະ [method snapped].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method floorf], [method "
"floori], [method Vector2.floor], [method Vector3.floor], ຫຼື [method "
"Vector4.floor]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] downward (towards negative infinity), returning the largest "
"whole number that is not more than [param x].\n"
"A type-safe version of [method floor], returning a [float]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ລົງ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂລົບ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param x].\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [method floor], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [float]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] downward (towards negative infinity), returning the largest "
"whole number that is not more than [param x].\n"
"A type-safe version of [method floor], returning an [int].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function is [i]not[/i] the same as [code]int(x)[/code], "
"which rounds towards 0."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ລົງ (ໄປທາງອະສົງໄຂລົບ), ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [param x].\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [method floor], ໂດຍສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [int].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ຄືກັນ[/i] ກັບ [code]int(x)[/code], ເພາະ [code]int(x)[/"
"code] ຈະປັດເຂົ້າຫາ 0."

msgid ""
"Returns the floating-point remainder of [param x] divided by [param y], "
"keeping the sign of [param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var remainder = fmod(7, 5.5) # remainder is 1.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"For the integer remainder operation, use the [code]%[/code] operator."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນເສດຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຈາກການຫານ [param x] ດ້ວຍ [param y], ໂດຍຮັກສາເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂອງ "
"[param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var remainder = fmod(7, 5.5) # ສ່ວນເສດແມ່ນ 1.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ສຳລັບການຫາສ່ວນເສດຂອງເລກຖ້ວນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]%[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the floating-point modulus of [param x] divided by [param y], "
"wrapping equally in positive and negative.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\" (x)  (fmod(x, 1.5))   (fposmod(x, 1.5))\")\n"
"for i in 7:\n"
"\tvar x = i * 0.5 - 1.5\n"
"\tprint(\"%4.1f           %4.1f  | %4.1f\" % [x, fmod(x, 1.5), fposmod(x, "
"1.5)])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Prints:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" (x)  (fmod(x, 1.5))   (fposmod(x, 1.5))\n"
"-1.5           -0.0  |  0.0\n"
"-1.0           -1.0  |  0.5\n"
"-0.5           -0.5  |  1.0\n"
" 0.0            0.0  |  0.0\n"
" 0.5            0.5  |  0.5\n"
" 1.0            1.0  |  1.0\n"
" 1.5            0.0  |  0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ modulus ຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຈາກການຫານ [param x] ດ້ວຍ [param y], ໂດຍມີການໝູນຄືນ "
"(wrapping) ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນທັງຄ່າບວກ ແລະ ຄ່າລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\" (x)  (fmod(x, 1.5))   (fposmod(x, 1.5))\")\n"
"for i in 7:\n"
"\tvar x = i * 0.5 - 1.5\n"
"\tprint(\"%4.1f           %4.1f  | %4.1f\" % [x, fmod(x, 1.5), fposmod(x, "
"1.5)])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຜົນການສະແດງ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" (x)  (fmod(x, 1.5))   (fposmod(x, 1.5))\n"
"-1.5           -0.0  |  0.0\n"
"-1.0           -1.0  |  0.5\n"
"-0.5           -0.5  |  1.0\n"
" 0.0            0.0  |  0.0\n"
" 0.5            0.5  |  0.5\n"
" 1.0            1.0  |  1.0\n"
" 1.5            0.0  |  0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the integer hash of the passed [param variable].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(hash(\"a\")) # Prints 177670\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(GD.Hash(\"a\")); // Prints 177670\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ hash ທີ່ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນຂອງ [param variable] ທີ່ສົ່ງມາ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(hash(\"a\")) # ສະແດງ 177670\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(GD.Hash(\"a\")); // ສະແດງ 177670\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the [Object] that corresponds to [param instance_id]. All Objects "
"have a unique instance ID. See also [method Object.get_instance_id].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var drink = \"water\"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar id = get_instance_id()\n"
"\tvar instance = instance_from_id(id)\n"
"\tprint(instance.drink) # Prints \"water\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic string Drink { get; set; } = \"water\";\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tulong id = GetInstanceId();\n"
"\t\tvar instance = (MyNode)InstanceFromId(Id);\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(instance.Drink); // Prints \"water\"\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Object] ທີ່ກົງກັບ [param instance_id]. ທຸກໆ Object ຈະມີ instance ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method Object.get_instance_id].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var drink = \"ນ້ຳ\"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar id = get_instance_id()\n"
"\tvar instance = instance_from_id(id)\n"
"\tprint(instance.drink) # ສະແດງ \"ນ້ຳ\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic string Drink { get; set; } = \"ນ້ຳ\";\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tulong id = GetInstanceId();\n"
"\t\tvar instance = (MyNode)InstanceFromId(Id);\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(instance.Drink); // ສະແດງ \"ນ້ຳ\"\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns an interpolation or extrapolation factor considering the range "
"specified in [param from] and [param to], and the interpolated value "
"specified in [param weight]. The returned value will be between [code]0.0[/"
"code] and [code]1.0[/code] if [param weight] is between [param from] and "
"[param to] (inclusive). If [param weight] is located outside this range, then "
"an extrapolation factor will be returned (return value lower than [code]0.0[/"
"code] or greater than [code]1.0[/code]). Use [method clamp] on the result of "
"[method inverse_lerp] if this is not desired.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# The interpolation ratio in the `lerp()` call below is 0.75.\n"
"var middle = lerp(20, 30, 0.75)\n"
"# middle is now 27.5.\n"
"\n"
"# Now, we pretend to have forgotten the original ratio and want to get it "
"back.\n"
"var ratio = inverse_lerp(20, 30, 27.5)\n"
"# ratio is now 0.75.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method lerp], which performs the reverse of this operation, and "
"[method remap] to map a continuous series of values to another."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາສ່ວນການແທນຄ່າ (interpolation) ຫຼື ການຄາດຄະເນຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງ (extrapolation) "
"ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາຈາກຊ່ວງທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param from] ແລະ [param to], ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການແທນຄ່າໃນ "
"[param weight]. ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code] ຖ້າ "
"[param weight] ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ຫາ [param to]. ຖ້າ [param weight] "
"ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງນີ້, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນອັດຕາສ່ວນແບບ extrapolation (ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[code]1.0[/code]). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method clamp] ກັບຜົນລັບຂອງ [method inverse_lerp] "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ອັດຕາສ່ວນການແທນຄ່າໃນ `lerp()` ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນ 0.75.\n"
"var middle = lerp(20, 30, 0.75)\n"
"# middle ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນ 27.5.\n"
"\n"
"# ຕອນນີ້, ສົມມຸດວ່າພວກເຮົາລືມອັດຕາສ່ວນເດີມ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການເອົາມັນກັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"var ratio = inverse_lerp(20, 30, 27.5)\n"
"# ratio ຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນ 0.75.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method lerp], ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບຟັງຊັນນີ້, ແລະ [method remap] "
"ເພື່ອແຜນຜັງຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າຈາກຊ່ວງໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກຊ່ວງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param a] and [param b] are approximately equal "
"to each other.\n"
"Here, \"approximately equal\" means that [param a] and [param b] are within a "
"small internal epsilon of each other, which scales with the magnitude of the "
"numbers.\n"
"Infinity values of the same sign are considered equal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param a] ແລະ [param b] ມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ.\n"
"ຄຳວ່າ \"ໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ\" ໃນທີ່ນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງ [param a] ແລະ [param b] ມີສ່ວນຕ່າງກັນພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ "
"(internal epsilon), ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບຂະໜາດຕາມຄ່າຂອງຕົວເລກນັ້ນໆ.\n"
"ຄ່າອະສົງໄຂ (infinity) ທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍດຽວກັນຈະຖືວ່າເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param x] is a finite value, i.e. it is not [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN], positive infinity, or negative infinity. See also [method "
"is_inf] and [method is_nan]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param x] ເປັນຄ່າຈຳກັດ (finite) ຫຼື ບໍ່, ເຊິ່ງກໍຄືມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN], ອະສົງໄຂບວກ, ຫຼື ອະສົງໄຂລົບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method is_inf] ແລະ "
"[method is_nan]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param x] is either positive infinity or "
"negative infinity. See also [method is_finite] and [method is_nan]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນອະສົງໄຂບວກ ຫຼື ອະສົງໄຂລົບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[method is_finite] ແລະ [method is_nan]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the Object that corresponds to [param id] is a "
"valid object (e.g. has not been deleted from memory). All Objects have a "
"unique instance ID."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ Object ທີ່ກົງກັບ [param id] ຍັງຄົງມີຢູ່ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຍັງບໍ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ). ທຸກໆ Object ຈະມີ instance ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param instance] is a valid Object (e.g. has not "
"been deleted from memory)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param instance] ຍັງຄົງມີຢູ່ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຍັງບໍ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param x] is a NaN (\"Not a Number\" or invalid) "
"value. This method is needed as [constant @GDScript.NAN] is not equal to "
"itself, which means [code]x == NAN[/code] can't be used to check whether a "
"value is a NaN."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນຄ່າ NaN (\"Not a Number\" ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ). "
"ເມທອດນີ້ມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນເພາະ [constant @GDScript.NAN] ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບຕົວມັນເອງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການໃຊ້ [code]x == NAN[/code] ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບຄ່າ NaN ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code], for value types, if [param a] and [param b] share "
"the same value. Returns [code]true[/code], for reference types, if the "
"references of [param a] and [param b] are the same.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Vector2 is a value type\n"
"var vec2_a = Vector2(0, 0)\n"
"var vec2_b = Vector2(0, 0)\n"
"var vec2_c = Vector2(1, 1)\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_a)  # true\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_b)  # true\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_c)  # false\n"
"\n"
"# Array is a reference type\n"
"var arr_a = []\n"
"var arr_b = []\n"
"is_same(arr_a, arr_a)  # true\n"
"is_same(arr_a, arr_b)  # false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"These are [Variant] value types: [code]null[/code], [bool], [int], [float], "
"[String], [StringName], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i], [Rect2], [Rect2i], [Transform2D], [Transform3D], "
"[Plane], [Quaternion], [AABB], [Basis], [Projection], [Color], [NodePath], "
"[RID], [Callable] and [Signal].\n"
"These are [Variant] reference types: [Object], [Dictionary], [Array], "
"[PackedByteArray], [PackedInt32Array], [PackedInt64Array], "
"[PackedFloat32Array], [PackedFloat64Array], [PackedStringArray], "
"[PackedVector2Array], [PackedVector3Array], [PackedVector4Array], and "
"[PackedColorArray]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນແບບ value type ຖ້າ [param a] ແລະ [param b] "
"ມີຄ່າຄືກັນ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນແບບ reference type ຖ້າການອ້າງອີງຂອງ "
"[param a] ແລະ [param b] ຊີ້ໄປທີ່ຈຸດດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Vector2 ແມ່ນ value type\n"
"var vec2_a = Vector2(0, 0)\n"
"var vec2_b = Vector2(0, 0)\n"
"var vec2_c = Vector2(1, 1)\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_a)  # true\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_b)  # true\n"
"is_same(vec2_a, vec2_c)  # false\n"
"\n"
"# Array ແມ່ນ reference type\n"
"var arr_a = []\n"
"var arr_b = []\n"
"is_same(arr_a, arr_a)  # true\n"
"is_same(arr_a, arr_b)  # false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄື [Variant] value types: [code]null[/code], [bool], [int], [float], "
"[String], [StringName], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i], [Rect2], [Rect2i], [Transform2D], [Transform3D], "
"[Plane], [Quaternion], [AABB], [Basis], [Projection], [Color], [NodePath], "
"[RID], [Callable] ແລະ [Signal].\n"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄື [Variant] reference types: [Object], [Dictionary], [Array], "
"[PackedByteArray], [PackedInt32Array], [PackedInt64Array], "
"[PackedFloat32Array], [PackedFloat64Array], [PackedStringArray], "
"[PackedVector2Array], [PackedVector3Array], [PackedVector4Array], ແລະ "
"[PackedColorArray]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param x] is zero or almost zero. The comparison "
"is done using a tolerance calculation with a small internal epsilon.\n"
"This function is faster than using [method is_equal_approx] with one value as "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນສູນ ຫຼື ເກືອບເປັນສູນ. "
"ການປຽບທຽບແມ່ນໃຊ້ການຄຳນວນຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນດ້ວຍຄ່າ epsilon ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ.\n"
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄວກວ່າການໃຊ້ [method is_equal_approx] ໂດຍປຽບທຽບຄ່າໜຶ່ງເປັນສູນ."

msgid ""
"Linearly interpolates between two values by the factor defined in [param "
"weight]. To perform interpolation, [param weight] should be between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). However, values outside "
"this range are allowed and can be used to perform [i]extrapolation[/i]. If "
"this is not desired, use [method clampf] to limit [param weight].\n"
"Both [param from] and [param to] must be the same type. Supported types: "
"[int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector3], [Vector4], [Color], [Quaternion], "
"[Basis], [Transform2D], [Transform3D].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"lerp(0, 4, 0.75) # Returns 3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method inverse_lerp] which performs the reverse of this operation. "
"To perform eased interpolation with [method lerp], combine it with [method "
"ease] or [method smoothstep]. See also [method remap] to map a continuous "
"series of values to another.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method lerpf], [method "
"Vector2.lerp], [method Vector3.lerp], [method Vector4.lerp], [method "
"Color.lerp], [method Quaternion.slerp], [method Basis.slerp], [method "
"Transform2D.interpolate_with], or [method Transform3D.interpolate_with]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (Linear interpolation) ລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param "
"weight]. ໃນການແທນຄ່າ, [param weight] ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/"
"code]. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງນີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດການຄາດຄະເນຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງ (extrapolation) "
"ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method clampf] ເພື່ອຈຳກັດຄ່າ [param weight].\n"
"ທັງ [param from] ແລະ [param to] ຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນ. ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [int], "
"[float], [Vector2], [Vector3], [Vector4], [Color], [Quaternion], [Basis], "
"[Transform2D], [Transform3D].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"lerp(0, 4, 0.75) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method inverse_lerp] ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບຟັງຊັນນີ້. "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບມີ easing, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method lerp] ຮ່ວມກັບ [method ease] ຫຼື [method "
"smoothstep]. ເບິ່ງ [method remap] ເພື່ອແຜນຜັງຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method lerpf], [method "
"Vector2.lerp], [method Vector3.lerp], [method Vector4.lerp], [method "
"Color.lerp], [method Quaternion.slerp], [method Basis.slerp], [method "
"Transform2D.interpolate_with], ຫຼື [method Transform3D.interpolate_with]."

msgid ""
"Linearly interpolates between two values by the factor defined in [param "
"weight]. To perform interpolation, [param weight] should be between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). However, values outside "
"this range are allowed and can be used to perform [i]extrapolation[/i]. If "
"this is not desired, use [method clampf] on the result of this function.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"lerpf(0, 4, 0.75) # Returns 3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method inverse_lerp] which performs the reverse of this operation. "
"To perform eased interpolation with [method lerp], combine it with [method "
"ease] or [method smoothstep]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄູນ [param weight]. [param weight] "
"ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງນີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດການຄາດຄະເນຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງ (extrapolation) ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method clampf] ກັບຜົນລັບຂອງຟັງຊັນນີ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"lerpf(0, 4, 0.75) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [method inverse_lerp] ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບຟັງຊັນນີ້. "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດການແທນຄ່າແບບມີ easing ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method lerp] ຮ່ວມກັບ [method ease] ຫຼື [method "
"smoothstep]."

msgid ""
"Converts from linear energy to decibels (audio). Since volume is not normally "
"linear, this can be used to implement volume sliders that behave as "
"expected.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Change the Master bus's volume through a [Slider] node, which "
"ranges from [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db(AudioServer.get_bus_index(\"Master\"), "
"linear_to_db($Slider.value))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງຈາກພະລັງງານສຽງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear energy) ເປັນເດຊີເບລ (decibels). "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກລະດັບສຽງປົກກະຕິບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນແບບເສັ້ນຊື່, ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈຶ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງ slider "
"ປັບສຽງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດຫວັງ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງຂອງ Master bus ຜ່ານໂນດ [Slider] ທີ່ມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"AudioServer.set_bus_volume_db(AudioServer.get_bus_index(\"Master\"), "
"linear_to_db($Slider.value))\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natural_logarithm]natural "
"logarithm[/url] of [param x] (base [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"E_(mathematical_constant)]e[/url], with [i]e[/i] being approximately "
"2.71828). This is the amount of time needed to reach a certain level of "
"continuous growth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not the same as the \"log\" function on most "
"calculators, which uses a base 10 logarithm. To use base 10 logarithm, use "
"[code]log(x) / log(10)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"log(10) # Returns 2.302585\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The logarithm of [code]0[/code] returns [code]-inf[/code], while "
"negative values return [code]-nan[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natural_logarithm]natural "
"logarithm[/url] ຂອງ [param x] (ຖານ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"E_(mathematical_constant)]e[/url], ເຊິ່ງ [i]e[/i] ມີຄ່າປະມານ 2.71828). "
"ນີ້ຄືໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ບັນລຸລະດັບການເຕີບໂຕຕໍ່ເນື່ອງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັບຟັງຊັນ \"log\" ໃນເຄື່ອງຄິດເລກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ຖານ 10. "
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ logarithm ຖານ 10, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]log(x) / log(10)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"log(10) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2.302585\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ logarithm ຂອງ [code]0[/code] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-inf[/code], "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າລົບຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-nan[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum of the given numeric values. This function can take any "
"number of arguments.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"max(1, 7, 3, -6, 5) # Returns 7\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this on vectors it will [i]not[/i] perform component-"
"wise maximum, and will pick the largest value when compared using [code]x < "
"y[/code]. To perform component-wise maximum, use [method Vector2.max], "
"[method Vector2i.max], [method Vector3.max], [method Vector3i.max], [method "
"Vector4.max], and [method Vector4i.max]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດຈາກກຸ່ມຕົວເລກທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມນຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"max(1, 7, 3, -6, 5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 7\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກັບ vector ມັນຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ໄດ້ປຽບທຽບແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ (component-"
"wise), ແຕ່ຈະເລືອກ vector ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອປຽບທຽບດ້ວຍ [code]x < y[/code]. "
"ເພື່ອຫາຄ່າສູງສຸດແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Vector2.max], [method Vector2i.max], "
"[method Vector3.max], [method Vector3i.max], [method Vector4.max], ຫຼື [method "
"Vector4i.max]."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum of two [float] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"maxf(3.6, 24)   # Returns 24.0\n"
"maxf(-3.99, -4) # Returns -3.99\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"maxf(3.6, 24)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 24.0\n"
"maxf(-3.99, -4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -3.99\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum of two [int] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"maxi(1, 2)   # Returns 2\n"
"maxi(-3, -4) # Returns -3\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"maxi(1, 2)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2\n"
"maxi(-3, -4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -3\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the minimum of the given numeric values. This function can take any "
"number of arguments.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"min(1, 7, 3, -6, 5) # Returns -6\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this on vectors it will [i]not[/i] perform component-"
"wise minimum, and will pick the smallest value when compared using [code]x < "
"y[/code]. To perform component-wise minimum, use [method Vector2.min], "
"[method Vector2i.min], [method Vector3.min], [method Vector3i.min], [method "
"Vector4.min], and [method Vector4i.min]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດຈາກກຸ່ມຕົວເລກທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມນຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"min(1, 7, 3, -6, 5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -6\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກັບ vector ມັນຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ໄດ້ປຽບທຽບແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ (component-"
"wise), ແຕ່ຈະເລືອກ vector ທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອປຽບທຽບດ້ວຍ [code]x < y[/code]. "
"ເພື່ອຫາຄ່ານ້ອຍສຸດແຍກແຕ່ລະຄ່າ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method Vector2.min], [method Vector2i.min], "
"[method Vector3.min], [method Vector3i.min], [method Vector4.min], ຫຼື [method "
"Vector4i.min]."

msgid ""
"Returns the minimum of two [float] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"minf(3.6, 24)   # Returns 3.6\n"
"minf(-3.99, -4) # Returns -4.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"minf(3.6, 24)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.6\n"
"minf(-3.99, -4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -4.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the minimum of two [int] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"mini(1, 2)   # Returns 1\n"
"mini(-3, -4) # Returns -4\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່າ [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"mini(1, 2)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1\n"
"mini(-3, -4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -4\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Moves [param from] toward [param to] by the [param delta] amount. Will not go "
"past [param to].\n"
"Use a negative [param delta] value to move away.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"move_toward(5, 10, 4)    # Returns 9\n"
"move_toward(10, 5, 4)    # Returns 6\n"
"move_toward(5, 10, 9)    # Returns 10\n"
"move_toward(10, 5, -1.5) # Returns 11.5\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຄ່າຈາກ [param from] ໄປຫາ [param to] ດ້ວຍຈຳນວນ [param delta]. ໂດຍຄ່າຈະບໍ່ເກີນ "
"[param to].\n"
"ໃຊ້ຄ່າ [param delta] ເປັນລົບເພື່ອຍ້າຍອອກຫ່າງ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"move_toward(5, 10, 4)    # ສົ່ງຄືນ 9\n"
"move_toward(10, 5, 4)    # ສົ່ງຄືນ 6\n"
"move_toward(5, 10, 9)    # ສົ່ງຄືນ 10\n"
"move_toward(10, 5, -1.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 11.5\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the smallest integer power of 2 that is greater than or equal to "
"[param value].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"nearest_po2(3) # Returns 4\n"
"nearest_po2(4) # Returns 4\n"
"nearest_po2(5) # Returns 8\n"
"\n"
"nearest_po2(0)  # Returns 0 (this may not be expected)\n"
"nearest_po2(-1) # Returns 0 (this may not be expected)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Due to its implementation, this method returns [code]0[/code] "
"rather than [code]1[/code] for values less than or equal to [code]0[/code], "
"with an exception for [param value] being the smallest negative 64-bit "
"integer ([code]-9223372036854775808[/code]) in which case the [param value] "
"is returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2 ທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ເຊິ່ງມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [param value].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"nearest_po2(3) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 4\n"
"nearest_po2(4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 4\n"
"nearest_po2(5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 8\n"
"\n"
"nearest_po2(0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0 (ອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້)\n"
"nearest_po2(-1) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0 (ອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຍ້ອນການອອກແບບພາຍໃນ, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code] ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]1[/code] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code]. ຍົກເວັ້ນກໍລະນີທີ່ [param value] "
"ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ 64-bit ທີ່ມີຄ່າລົບຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ ([code]-9223372036854775808[/code]) "
"ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່ານັ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Wraps [param value] between [code]0[/code] and the [param length]. If the "
"limit is reached, the next value the function returns is decreased to the "
"[code]0[/code] side or increased to the [param length] side (like a triangle "
"wave). If [param length] is less than zero, it becomes positive.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"pingpong(-3.0, 3.0) # Returns 3.0\n"
"pingpong(-2.0, 3.0) # Returns 2.0\n"
"pingpong(-1.0, 3.0) # Returns 1.0\n"
"pingpong(0.0, 3.0)  # Returns 0.0\n"
"pingpong(1.0, 3.0)  # Returns 1.0\n"
"pingpong(2.0, 3.0)  # Returns 2.0\n"
"pingpong(3.0, 3.0)  # Returns 3.0\n"
"pingpong(4.0, 3.0)  # Returns 2.0\n"
"pingpong(5.0, 3.0)  # Returns 1.0\n"
"pingpong(6.0, 3.0)  # Returns 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການໝູນຄ່າ [param value] ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [param length]. "
"ຖ້າຄ່າຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດ, ຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ຟັງຊັນສົ່ງຄືນຈະຫຼຸດລົງໄປຫາຝັ່ງ [code]0[/code] ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໄປຫາຝັ່ງ [param "
"length] (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຄື້ນຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ). ຖ້າ [param length] ນ້ອຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຄ່າບວກ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"pingpong(-3.0, 3.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.0\n"
"pingpong(-2.0, 3.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2.0\n"
"pingpong(-1.0, 3.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"pingpong(0.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"pingpong(1.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"pingpong(2.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2.0\n"
"pingpong(3.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.0\n"
"pingpong(4.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2.0\n"
"pingpong(5.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"pingpong(6.0, 3.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the integer modulus of [param x] divided by [param y] that wraps "
"equally in positive and negative.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"#(i)  (i % 3)   (posmod(i, 3))\")\n"
"for i in range(-3, 4):\n"
"\tprint(\"%2d       %2d  | %2d\" % [i, i % 3, posmod(i, 3)])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Prints:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"(i)  (i % 3)   (posmod(i, 3))\n"
"-3        0  |  0\n"
"-2       -2  |  1\n"
"-1       -1  |  2\n"
" 0        0  |  0\n"
" 1        1  |  1\n"
" 2        2  |  2\n"
" 3        0  |  0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ modulus ຂອງເລກຖ້ວນຈາກການຫານ [param x] ດ້ວຍ [param y], ໂດຍມີການໝູນຄືນ "
"(wrapping) ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນທັງຄ່າບວກ ແລະ ຄ່າລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(\"#(i)  (i % 3)   (posmod(i, 3))\")\n"
"for i in range(-3, 4):\n"
"\tprint(\"%2d       %2d  | %2d\" % [i, i % 3, posmod(i, 3)])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຜົນການສະແດງ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"(i)  (i % 3)   (posmod(i, 3))\n"
"-3        0  |  0\n"
"-2       -2  |  1\n"
"-1       -1  |  2\n"
" 0        0  |  0\n"
" 1        1  |  1\n"
" 2        2  |  2\n"
" 3        0  |  0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the result of [param base] raised to the power of [param exp].\n"
"In GDScript, this is the equivalent of the [code]**[/code] operator.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"pow(2, 5)   # Returns 32.0\n"
"pow(4, 1.5) # Returns 8.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັບຂອງ [param base] ຍົກກຳລັງດ້ວຍ [param exp].\n"
"ໃນ GDScript, ສິ່ງນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບຕົວດຳເນີນການ [code]**[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"pow(2, 5)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 32.0\n"
"pow(4, 1.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 8.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts one or more arguments of any type to string in the best way possible "
"and prints them to the console.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = [1, 2, 3]\n"
"print(\"a\", \"b\", a) # Prints \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array a = [1, 2, 3];\n"
"GD.Print(\"a\", \"b\", a); // Prints \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider using [method push_error] and [method push_warning] to "
"print error and warning messages instead of [method print] or [method "
"print_rich]. This distinguishes them from print messages used for debugging "
"purposes, while also displaying a stack trace when an error or warning is "
"printed. See also [member Engine.print_to_stdout] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/disable_stdout]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງອາກິວເມນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ (ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້) ໃຫ້ເປັນ string ດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນອອກທາງ "
"console.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = [1, 2, 3]\n"
"print(\"a\", \"b\", a) # ສະແດງ \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array a = [1, 2, 3];\n"
"GD.Print(\"a\", \"b\", a); // ສະແດງ \"ab[1, 2, 3]\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method push_error] ແລະ [method push_warning] "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ແລະ warning ແທນການໃຊ້ [method print] ຫຼື [method "
"print_rich]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍແຍກພວກມັນອອກຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການ debug ແລະ ຍັງສະແດງ stack "
"trace ນຳນຳ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [member Engine.print_to_stdout] ແລະ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/disable_stdout]."

msgid ""
"Converts one or more arguments of any type to string in the best way possible "
"and prints them to the console.\n"
"The following BBCode tags are supported: [code]b[/code], [code]i[/code], "
"[code]u[/code], [code]s[/code], [code]indent[/code], [code]code[/code], "
"[code]url[/code], [code]center[/code], [code]right[/code], [code]color[/"
"code], [code]bgcolor[/code], [code]fgcolor[/code].\n"
"URL tags only support URLs wrapped by a URL tag, not URLs with a different "
"title.\n"
"When printing to standard output, the supported subset of BBCode is converted "
"to ANSI escape codes for the terminal emulator to display. Support for ANSI "
"escape codes varies across terminal emulators, especially for italic and "
"strikethrough. In standard output, [code]code[/code] is represented with "
"faint text but without any font change. Unsupported tags are left as-is in "
"standard output.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript skip-lint]\n"
"print_rich(\"[color=green][b]Hello world![/b][/color]\") # Prints \"Hello "
"world!\", in green with a bold font.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp skip-lint]\n"
"GD.PrintRich(\"[color=green][b]Hello world![/b][/color]\"); // Prints \"Hello "
"world!\", in green with a bold font.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider using [method push_error] and [method push_warning] to "
"print error and warning messages instead of [method print] or [method "
"print_rich]. This distinguishes them from print messages used for debugging "
"purposes, while also displaying a stack trace when an error or warning is "
"printed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Output displayed in the editor supports clickable [code skip-"
"lint][url=address]text[/url][/code] tags. The [code skip-lint][url][/code] "
"tag's [code]address[/code] value is handled by [method OS.shell_open] when "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"ແປງອາກິວເມນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ (ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້) ໃຫ້ເປັນ string ດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນອອກທາງ "
"console.\n"
"ຮອງຮັບ BBCode ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: [code]b[/code], [code]i[/code], [code]u[/code], [code]s[/"
"code], [code]indent[/code], [code]code[/code], [code]url[/code], "
"[code]center[/code], [code]right[/code], [code]color[/code], [code]bgcolor[/"
"code], [code]fgcolor[/code].\n"
"ແທັກ URL ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ URL ທີ່ຖືກຄຸມດ້ວຍແທັກ URL ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ URL ທີ່ມີຊື່ຫົວຂໍ້ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອສະແດງຜົນອອກທາງ standard output, BBCode ບາງສ່ວນຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ ANSI escape codes "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ terminal emulator ສະແດງຜົນ. ການຮອງຮັບ ANSI escape codes ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມ "
"terminal ແຕ່ລະຕົວ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຕົວເນັ້ນ (italic) ແລະ ຕົວຂີດຂ້າ (strikethrough). ໃນ "
"standard output, [code]code[/code] ຈະສະແດງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມສີຈາງໆ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນຟອນ. "
"ແທັກທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຈະຖືກສະແດງຕາມຮູບແບບເດີມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript skip-lint]\n"
"print_rich(\"[color=green][b]ສະບາຍດີ![/b][/color]\") # ສະແດງ \"ສະບາຍດີ!\" "
"ເປັນສີຂຽວ ແລະ ໂຕເຂັ້ມ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp skip-lint]\n"
"GD.PrintRich(\"[color=green][b]ສະບາຍດີ![/b][/color]\"); // ສະແດງ \"ສະບາຍດີ!\" "
"ເປັນສີຂຽວ ແລະ ໂຕເຂັ້ມ.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method push_error] ແລະ [method push_warning] "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ແລະ warning ແທນການໃຊ້ [method print] ຫຼື [method "
"print_rich]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍແຍກພວກມັນອອກຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug ທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຍັງສະແດງ stack trace "
"ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຜົນການສະແດງໃນ editor ຈະຮອງຮັບແທັກ [code skip-lint]"
"[url=address]text[/url][/code] ທີ່ສາມາດຄລິກໄດ້. ຄ່າ [code]address[/code] ໃນແທັກ "
"[code skip-lint][url][/code] ຈະຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍ [method OS.shell_open] ເມື່ອມີການຄລິກ."

msgid ""
"If verbose mode is enabled ([method OS.is_stdout_verbose] returning "
"[code]true[/code]), converts one or more arguments of any type to string in "
"the best way possible and prints them to the console."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ verbose ([method OS.is_stdout_verbose] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code]), "
"ຈະແປງອາກິວເມນຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ເປັນ string ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນອອກທາງ console."

msgid ""
"Prints one or more arguments to strings in the best way possible to standard "
"error line.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"printerr(\"prints to stderr\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintErr(\"prints to stderr\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງອາກິວເມນຕ່າງໆ ໃນຮູບແບບ string ອອກທາງຊ່ອງທາງ standard error (stderr).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"printerr(\"ສະແດງຜົນທາງ stderr\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintErr(\"ສະແດງຜົນທາງ stderr\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Prints one or more arguments to strings in the best way possible to the OS "
"terminal. Unlike [method print], no newline is automatically added at the "
"end.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The OS terminal is [i]not[/i] the same as the editor's Output "
"dock. The output sent to the OS terminal can be seen when running Godot from "
"a terminal. On Windows, this requires using the [code]console.exe[/code] "
"executable.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Prints \"ABC\" to terminal.\n"
"printraw(\"A\")\n"
"printraw(\"B\")\n"
"printraw(\"C\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Prints \"ABC\" to terminal.\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"A\");\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"B\");\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"C\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ພິມໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອາຄິວເມນ (arguments) ເປັນສະຕຣິງ (strings) ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໄປຍັງເທີມິນໍ "
"(terminal) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method print], "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ທ້າຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທີມິນໍຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການແມ່ນ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ອັນດຽວກັນກັບ dock Output "
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor). "
"ຜົນການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຍັງເທີມິນໍຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Godot ຈາກເທີມິນໍ. ໃນ "
"Windows, ນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ [code]console.exe[/code] ໃນການເປີດ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ພິມ \"ABC\" ໄປຍັງເທີມິນໍ.\n"
"printraw(\"A\")\n"
"printraw(\"B\")\n"
"printraw(\"C\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ພິມ \"ABC\" ໄປຍັງເທີມິນໍ.\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"A\");\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"B\");\n"
"GD.PrintRaw(\"C\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Prints one or more arguments to the console with a space between each "
"argument.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"prints(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") # Prints \"A B C\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintS(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"); // Prints \"A B C\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ພິມໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອາຄິວເມນໄປຍັງຄອນໂຊນ (console) ໂດຍມີການຍະວ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະອາຄິວເມນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"prints(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") # ພິມ \"A B C\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintS(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"); // ພິມ \"A B C\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Prints one or more arguments to the console with a tab between each "
"argument.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"printt(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") # Prints \"A       B       C\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintT(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"); // Prints \"A       B       C\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ພິມໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອາຄິວເມນໄປຍັງຄອນໂຊນ (console) ໂດຍມີການໃຊ້ແທັບ (tab) ລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະອາຄິວເມນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"printt(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") # ພິມ \"A       B       C\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PrintT(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"); // ພິມ \"A       B       C\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Pushes an error message to Godot's built-in debugger and to the OS terminal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"push_error(\"test error\") # Prints \"test error\" to debugger and terminal "
"as an error.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PushError(\"test error\"); // Prints \"test error\" to debugger and "
"terminal as an error.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function does not pause project execution. To print an "
"error message and pause project execution in debug builds, use "
"[code]assert(false, \"test error\")[/code] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error message) ໄປຍັງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈຸດບົກພ່ອງ (debugger) ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ Godot ແລະ "
"ເທີມິນໍຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"push_error(\"test error\") # ພິມ \"test error\" ໄປຍັງ debugger ແລະ terminal "
"ໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PushError(\"test error\"); // ພິມ \"test error\" ໄປຍັງ debugger ແລະ terminal "
"ໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ. ເພື່ອພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ "
"ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໃນ debug builds, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]assert(false, \"test error\")"
"[/code] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Pushes a warning message to Godot's built-in debugger and to the OS "
"terminal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"push_warning(\"test warning\") # Prints \"test warning\" to debugger and "
"terminal as a warning.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PushWarning(\"test warning\"); // Prints \"test warning\" to debugger and "
"terminal as a warning.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳເຕືອນ (warning message) ໄປຍັງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈຸດບົກພ່ອງ (debugger) ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ Godot "
"ແລະ ເທີມິນໍຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"push_warning(\"test warning\") # ພິມ \"test warning\" ໄປຍັງ debugger ແລະ "
"terminal ໃນຮູບແບບຄຳເຕືອນ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.PushWarning(\"test warning\"); // ພິມ \"test warning\" ໄປຍັງ debugger ແລະ "
"terminal ໃນຮູບແບບຄຳເຕືອນ.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Converts an angle expressed in radians to degrees.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"rad_to_deg(0.523599) # Returns 30\n"
"rad_to_deg(PI)       # Returns 180\n"
"rad_to_deg(PI * 2)   # Returns 360\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງມຸມຈາກເຣດຽນ (radians) ມາເປັນອົງສາ (degrees).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"rad_to_deg(0.523599) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 30\n"
"rad_to_deg(PI)       # ສົ່ງຄືນ 180\n"
"rad_to_deg(PI * 2)   # ສົ່ງຄືນ 360\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Given a [param seed], returns a [PackedInt64Array] of size [code]2[/code], "
"where its first element is the randomized [int] value, and the second element "
"is the same as [param seed]. Passing the same [param seed] consistently "
"returns the same array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] \"Seed\" here refers to the internal state of the pseudo random "
"number generator, currently implemented as a 64 bit integer.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = rand_from_seed(4)\n"
"\n"
"print(a[0]) # Prints 2879024997\n"
"print(a[1]) # Prints 4\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບ [param seed], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [PackedInt64Array] ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດ [code]2[/code], "
"ໂດຍທີ່ອົງປະກອບທຳອິດແມ່ນຄ່າ [int] ທີ່ຖືກສຸ່ມ, ແລະ ອົງປະກອບທີສອງແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [param seed]. "
"ການສົ່ງຄ່າ [param seed] ເດີມເຂົ້າໄປ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ເດີມສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] \"Seed\" ໃນທີ່ນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງສະຖານະພາຍໃນຂອງຕົວສ້າງເລກສຸ່ມທຽມ (pseudo random "
"number generator), ເຊິ່ງໃນປັດຈຸບັນຖືກສ້າງເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ 64 ບິດ (64 bit integer).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = rand_from_seed(4)\n"
"\n"
"print(a[0]) # ພິມ 2879024997\n"
"print(a[1]) # ພິມ 4\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a random floating-point value between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] (inclusive).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randf() # Returns e.g. 0.375671\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Randf(); // Returns e.g. 0.375671\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point) ແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/"
"code] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randf() # ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: 0.375671\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Randf(); // ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: 0.375671\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a random floating-point value between [param from] and [param to] "
"(inclusive).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randf_range(0, 20.5) # Returns e.g. 7.45315\n"
"randf_range(-10, 10) # Returns e.g. -3.844535\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.RandRange(0.0, 20.5);   // Returns e.g. 7.45315\n"
"GD.RandRange(-10.0, 10.0); // Returns e.g. -3.844535\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ຫາ [param to] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randf_range(0, 20.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: 7.45315\n"
"randf_range(-10, 10) # ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: -3.844535\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.RandRange(0.0, 20.5);   // ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: 7.45315\n"
"GD.RandRange(-10.0, 10.0); // ສົ່ງຄືນ ຕົວຢ່າງ: -3.844535\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution]normally-"
"distributed[/url], pseudo-random floating-point value from the specified "
"[param mean] and a standard [param deviation]. This is also known as a "
"Gaussian distribution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method uses the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/url] algorithm."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມແບບສຸ່ມທຽມ (pseudo-random) ທີ່ມີ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Normal_distribution]ການແຈກຢາຍແບບປົກກະຕິ[/url] (normally-distributed) "
"ຈາກຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ [param mean] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຄ່າຜັນປ່ຽນມາດຕະຖານ [param deviation]. "
"ນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າການແຈກຢາຍແບບກົສ໌ (Gaussian distribution).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ (algorithm) [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Box%E2%80%93Muller_transform]Box-Muller transform[/url]."

msgid ""
"Returns a random unsigned 32-bit integer. Use remainder to obtain a random "
"value in the interval [code][0, N - 1][/code] (where N is smaller than "
"2^32).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randi()           # Returns random integer between 0 and 2^32 - 1\n"
"randi() % 20      # Returns random integer between 0 and 19\n"
"randi() % 100     # Returns random integer between 0 and 99\n"
"randi() % 100 + 1 # Returns random integer between 1 and 100\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Randi();           // Returns random integer between 0 and 2^32 - 1\n"
"GD.Randi() % 20;      // Returns random integer between 0 and 19\n"
"GD.Randi() % 100;     // Returns random integer between 0 and 99\n"
"GD.Randi() % 100 + 1; // Returns random integer between 1 and 100\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນບວກ 32 ບິດ (unsigned 32-bit integer) ແບບສຸ່ມ. ໃຊ້ການຫານເອົາເສດ "
"(remainder) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສຸ່ມໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, N - 1][/code] (ບ່ອນທີ່ N ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 2^32).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randi()           # ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 2^32 - 1\n"
"randi() % 20      # ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 19\n"
"randi() % 100     # ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 99\n"
"randi() % 100 + 1 # ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 100\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Randi();           // ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 2^32 - 1\n"
"GD.Randi() % 20;      // ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 19\n"
"GD.Randi() % 100;     // ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 99\n"
"GD.Randi() % 100 + 1; // ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 100\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a random signed 32-bit integer between [param from] and [param to] "
"(inclusive). If [param to] is lesser than [param from], they are swapped.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randi_range(0, 1)      # Returns either 0 or 1\n"
"randi_range(-10, 1000) # Returns random integer between -10 and 1000\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.RandRange(0, 1);      // Returns either 0 or 1\n"
"GD.RandRange(-10, 1000); // Returns random integer between -10 and 1000\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ 32 ບິດ (signed 32-bit integer) ແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ຫາ [param "
"to] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້). ຖ້າ [param to] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [param from], ຄ່າທັງສອງຈະຖືກສະຫຼັບກັນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"randi_range(0, 1)      # ສົ່ງຄືນບໍ່ 0 ກໍ 1\n"
"randi_range(-10, 1000) # ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ -10 ຫາ 1000\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.RandRange(0, 1);      // ສົ່ງຄືນບໍ່ 0 ກໍ 1\n"
"GD.RandRange(-10, 1000); // ສົ່ງຄືນເລກຖ້ວນແບບສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ -10 ຫາ 1000\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Randomizes the seed (or the internal state) of the random number generator. "
"The current implementation uses a number based on the device's time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function is called automatically when the project is run. "
"If you need to fix the seed to have consistent, reproducible results, use "
"[method seed] to initialize the random number generator."
msgstr ""
"ສຸ່ມຄ່າ seed (ຫຼື ສະຖານະພາຍໃນ) ຂອງຕົວສ້າງເລກສຸ່ມ. "
"ການເຮັດວຽກໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃຊ້ຕົວເລກທີ່ອີງຕາມເວລາຂອງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂປຣເຈັກ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ seed "
"ໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຄືເກົ່າທຸກຄັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method seed] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວສ້າງເລກສຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"Maps a [param value] from range [code][istart, istop][/code] to [code]"
"[ostart, ostop][/code]. See also [method lerp] and [method inverse_lerp]. If "
"[param value] is outside [code][istart, istop][/code], then the resulting "
"value will also be outside [code][ostart, ostop][/code]. If this is not "
"desired, use [method clamp] on the result of this function.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"remap(75, 0, 100, -1, 1) # Returns 0.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"For complex use cases where multiple ranges are needed, consider using "
"[Curve] or [Gradient] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [code]istart == istop[/code], the return value is undefined "
"(most likely NaN, INF, or -INF)."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຄ່າ [param value] ຈາກຊ່ວງ [code][istart, istop][/code] ໄປເປັນຊ່ວງ [code]"
"[ostart, ostop][/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method lerp] ແລະ [method inverse_lerp] ປະກອບ. ຖ້າ "
"[param value] ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ [code][istart, istop][/code], ຄ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບກໍຈະຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ [code]"
"[ostart, ostop][/code] ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method clamp] "
"ກັບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງຟັງຊັນນີ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"remap(75, 0, 100, -1, 1) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.5\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍຊ່ວງ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [Curve] ຫຼື [Gradient] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [code]istart == istop[/code], ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະເປັນ "
"NaN, INF, ຫຼື -INF)."

msgid ""
"Allocates a unique ID which can be used by the implementation to construct an "
"RID. This is used mainly from native extensions to implement servers."
msgstr ""
"ຈອງ ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງ RID. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ຈາກ native extensions "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ server."

msgid ""
"Creates an RID from a [param base]. This is used mainly from native "
"extensions to build servers."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ RID ຈາກ [param base]. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ຈາກ native extensions ເພື່ອສ້າງ server."

msgid ""
"Rotates [param from] toward [param to] by the [param delta] amount. Will not "
"go past [param to].\n"
"Similar to [method move_toward], but interpolates correctly when the angles "
"wrap around [constant @GDScript.TAU].\n"
"If [param delta] is negative, this function will rotate away from [param to], "
"toward the opposite angle, and will not go past the opposite angle."
msgstr ""
"ໝູນ [param from] ໄປຫາ [param to] ຕາມຈຳນວນ [param delta]. ຈະບໍ່ໝູນກາຍ [param to].\n"
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method move_toward], ແຕ່ຈະຄິດໄລ່ການແຊກ (interpolation) "
"ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອມຸມໝູນຄົບຮອບ [constant @GDScript.TAU].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param delta] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະໝູນອອກຫ່າງຈາກ [param to], ໄປຫາທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, "
"ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໝູນກາຍມຸມກົງກັນຂ້າມນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] to the nearest whole number, with halfway cases rounded away "
"from 0. Supported types: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], "
"[Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"round(2.4) # Returns 2\n"
"round(2.5) # Returns 3\n"
"round(2.6) # Returns 3\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method floor], [method ceil], and [method snapped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method roundf], [method roundi], "
"[method Vector2.round], [method Vector3.round], or [method Vector4.round]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ໃຫ້ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ, ໂດຍທີ່ກໍລະນີເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຈະປັດອອກຈາກ 0. ປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: "
"[int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], "
"[Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"round(2.4) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 2\n"
"round(2.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3\n"
"round(2.6) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method floor], [method ceil], ແລະ [method snapped] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method roundf], [method "
"roundi], [method Vector2.round], [method Vector3.round], ຫຼື [method "
"Vector4.round]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] to the nearest whole number, with halfway cases rounded away "
"from 0.\n"
"A type-safe version of [method round], returning a [float]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ໃຫ້ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ, ໂດຍທີ່ກໍລະນີເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຈະປັດອອກຈາກ 0.\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພທາງດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type-safe) ຂອງ [method round], ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ "
"[float]."

msgid ""
"Rounds [param x] to the nearest whole number, with halfway cases rounded away "
"from 0.\n"
"A type-safe version of [method round], returning an [int]."
msgstr ""
"ປັດ [param x] ໃຫ້ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ, ໂດຍທີ່ກໍລະນີເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຈະປັດອອກຈາກ 0.\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພທາງດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type-safe) ຂອງ [method round], ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ "
"[int]."

msgid ""
"Sets the seed for the random number generator to [param base]. Setting the "
"seed manually can ensure consistent, repeatable results for most random "
"functions.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_seed = \"Godot Rocks\".hash()\n"
"seed(my_seed)\n"
"var a = randf() + randi()\n"
"seed(my_seed)\n"
"var b = randf() + randi()\n"
"# a and b are now identical\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ulong mySeed = (ulong)GD.Hash(\"Godot Rocks\");\n"
"GD.Seed(mySeed);\n"
"var a = GD.Randf() + GD.Randi();\n"
"GD.Seed(mySeed);\n"
"var b = GD.Randf() + GD.Randi();\n"
"// a and b are now identical\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າ seed ໃຫ້ກັບຕົວສ້າງເລກສຸ່ມເປັນ [param base]. ການກຳນົດ seed "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈາກຟັງຊັນສຸ່ມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະອອກມາຄືເກົ່າທຸກຄັ້ງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_seed = \"Godot Rocks\".hash()\n"
"seed(my_seed)\n"
"var a = randf() + randi()\n"
"seed(my_seed)\n"
"var b = randf() + randi()\n"
"# ຕອນນີ້ a ແລະ b ແມ່ນຄືກັນ\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ulong mySeed = (ulong)GD.Hash(\"Godot Rocks\");\n"
"GD.Seed(mySeed);\n"
"var a = GD.Randf() + GD.Randi();\n"
"GD.Seed(mySeed);\n"
"var b = GD.Randf() + GD.Randi();\n"
"// ຕອນນີ້ a ແລະ b ແມ່ນຄືກັນ\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the same type of [Variant] as [param x], with [code]-1[/code] for "
"negative values, [code]1[/code] for positive values, and [code]0[/code] for "
"zeros. For [code]nan[/code] values it returns 0.\n"
"Supported types: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], "
"[Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sign(-6.0) # Returns -1\n"
"sign(0.0)  # Returns 0\n"
"sign(6.0)  # Returns 1\n"
"sign(NAN)  # Returns 0\n"
"\n"
"sign(Vector3(-6.0, 0.0, 6.0)) # Returns (-1, 0, 1)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method signf], [method signi], "
"[method Vector2.sign], [method Vector2i.sign], [method Vector3.sign], [method "
"Vector3i.sign], [method Vector4.sign], or [method Vector4i.sign]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Variant] ປະເພດດຽວກັບ [param x], ໂດຍມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]-1[/code] ສຳລັບຄ່າລົບ, "
"[code]1[/code] ສຳລັບຄ່າບວກ, ແລະ [code]0[/code] ສຳລັບຄ່າສູນ. ສຳລັບຄ່າ [code]nan[/"
"code] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ 0.\n"
"ປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sign(-6.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -1\n"
"sign(0.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0\n"
"sign(6.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1\n"
"sign(NAN)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0\n"
"\n"
"sign(Vector3(-6.0, 0.0, 6.0)) # ສົ່ງຄືນ (-1, 0, 1)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method signf], [method "
"signi], [method Vector2.sign], [method Vector2i.sign], [method Vector3.sign], "
"[method Vector3i.sign], [method Vector4.sign], ຫຼື [method Vector4i.sign]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]-1.0[/code] if [param x] is negative, [code]1.0[/code] if "
"[param x] is positive, and [code]0.0[/code] if [param x] is zero. For "
"[code]nan[/code] values of [param x] it returns 0.0.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"signf(-6.5) # Returns -1.0\n"
"signf(0.0)  # Returns 0.0\n"
"signf(6.5)  # Returns 1.0\n"
"signf(NAN)  # Returns 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1.0[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນລົບ, [code]1.0[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] "
"ເປັນບວກ, ແລະ [code]0.0[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນສູນ. ສຳລັບຄ່າ [code]nan[/code] ຂອງ "
"[param x] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"signf(-6.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -1.0\n"
"signf(0.0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"signf(6.5)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"signf(NAN)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]-1[/code] if [param x] is negative, [code]1[/code] if [param x] "
"is positive, and [code]0[/code] if [param x] is zero.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"signi(-6) # Returns -1\n"
"signi(0)  # Returns 0\n"
"signi(6)  # Returns 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນລົບ, [code]1[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນບວກ, "
"ແລະ [code]0[/code] ຖ້າ [param x] ເປັນສູນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"signi(-6) # ສົ່ງຄືນ -1\n"
"signi(0)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0\n"
"signi(6)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the sine of angle [param angle_rad] in radians.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sin(0.523599)       # Returns 0.5\n"
"sin(deg_to_rad(90)) # Returns 1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ຊິນ (sine) ຂອງມຸມ [param angle_rad] ໃນຮູບແບບເຣດຽນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sin(0.523599)       # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.5\n"
"sin(deg_to_rad(90)) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic sine of [param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = log(2.0) # Returns 0.693147\n"
"sinh(a) # Returns 0.75\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ໄຮເປີໂບລິກຊິນ (hyperbolic sine) ຂອງ [param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = log(2.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.693147\n"
"sinh(a) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.75\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a smooth cubic Hermite interpolation between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code].\n"
"For positive ranges (when [code]from <= to[/code]) the return value is "
"[code]0[/code] when [code]x <= from[/code], and [code]1[/code] when [code]x "
">= to[/code]. If [param x] lies between [param from] and [param to], the "
"return value follows an S-shaped curve that smoothly transitions from "
"[code]0[/code] to [code]1[/code].\n"
"For negative ranges (when [code]from > to[/code]) the function is mirrored "
"and returns [code]1[/code] when [code]x <= to[/code] and [code]0[/code] when "
"[code]x >= from[/code].\n"
"This S-shaped curve is the cubic Hermite interpolator, given by [code]f(y) = "
"3*y^2 - 2*y^3[/code] where [code]y = (x-from) / (to-from)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, -5.0) # Returns 0.0\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 0.5) # Returns 0.15625\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 1.0) # Returns 0.5\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 2.0) # Returns 1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Compared to [method ease] with a curve value of [code]-1.6521[/code], [method "
"smoothstep] returns the smoothest possible curve with no sudden changes in "
"the derivative. If you need to perform more advanced transitions, use [Tween] "
"or [AnimationPlayer].\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"smoothstep_ease_comparison.png]Comparison between smoothstep() and ease(x, "
"-1.6521) return values[/url]\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"smoothstep_range.webp]Smoothstep() return values with positive, zero, and "
"negative ranges[/url]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການແຊກ (interpolation) ແບບ cubic Hermite ທີ່ສະມູດ (smooth) ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/"
"code] ແລະ [code]1[/code].\n"
"ສຳລັບຊ່ວງທີ່ເປັນບວກ (ເມື່ອ [code]from <= to[/code]) ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code] ເມື່ອ "
"[code]x <= from[/code], ແລະ ເປັນ [code]1[/code] ເມື່ອ [code]x >= to[/code]. ຖ້າ "
"[param x] ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param from] ແລະ [param to], ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເປັນໄປຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບຕົວ S "
"ທີ່ປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈາກ [code]0[/code] ໄປຫາ [code]1[/code] ຢ່າງສະມູດ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຊ່ວງທີ່ເປັນລົບ (ເມື່ອ [code]from > to[/code]) ຟັງຊັນຈະຖືກປີ້ນ (mirror) ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]1[/code] ເມື່ອ [code]x <= to[/code] ແລະ [code]0[/code] ເມື່ອ [code]x >= "
"from[/code].\n"
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບຕົວ S ນີ້ແມ່ນ cubic Hermite interpolator, ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສູດ [code]f(y) = 3*y^2 - "
"2*y^3[/code] ໂດຍທີ່ [code]y = (x-from) / (to-from)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, -5.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.0\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 0.5) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.15625\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 1.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.5\n"
"smoothstep(0, 2, 2.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1.0\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [method ease] ທີ່ມີຄ່າ curve ເປັນ [code]-1.6521[/code], [method "
"smoothstep] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ສະມູດທີ່ສຸດໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງແບບກະທັນຫັນໃນຄ່າອະນຸພັນ "
"(derivative). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [Tween] ຫຼື "
"[AnimationPlayer].\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"smoothstep_ease_comparison.png]ການປຽບທຽບລະຫວ່າງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກ smoothstep() ແລະ "
"ease(x, -1.6521)[/url]\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"smoothstep_range.webp]ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກ Smoothstep() ໃນຊ່ວງບວກ, ສູນ, ແລະ ລົບ[/url]"

msgid ""
"Returns the multiple of [param step] that is the closest to [param x]. This "
"can also be used to round a floating-point number to an arbitrary number of "
"decimals.\n"
"The returned value is the same type of [Variant] as [param step]. Supported "
"types: [int], [float], [Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], "
"[Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snapped(100, 32)  # Returns 96\n"
"snapped(3.14159, 0.01)  # Returns 3.14\n"
"\n"
"snapped(Vector2(34, 70), Vector2(8, 8))  # Returns (32, 72)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method ceil], [method floor], and [method round].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For better type safety, use [method snappedf], [method "
"snappedi], [method Vector2.snapped], [method Vector2i.snapped], [method "
"Vector3.snapped], [method Vector3i.snapped], [method Vector4.snapped], or "
"[method Vector4i.snapped]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທະວີຄູນຂອງ [param step] ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ [param x] ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັດຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃຫ້ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເປັນ [Variant] ປະເພດດຽວກັບ [param step]. ປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [int], [float], "
"[Vector2], [Vector2i], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snapped(100, 32)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 96\n"
"snapped(3.14159, 0.01)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.14\n"
"\n"
"snapped(Vector2(34, 70), Vector2(8, 8))  # ສົ່ງຄືນ (32, 72)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method ceil], [method floor], ແລະ [method round] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method snappedf], [method "
"snappedi], [method Vector2.snapped], [method Vector2i.snapped], [method "
"Vector3.snapped], [method Vector3i.snapped], [method Vector4.snapped], ຫຼື "
"[method Vector4i.snapped]."

msgid ""
"Returns the multiple of [param step] that is the closest to [param x]. This "
"can also be used to round a floating-point number to an arbitrary number of "
"decimals.\n"
"A type-safe version of [method snapped], returning a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snappedf(32.0, 2.5)  # Returns 32.5\n"
"snappedf(3.14159, 0.01)  # Returns 3.14\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທະວີຄູນຂອງ [param step] ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ [param x] ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັດຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃຫ້ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້.\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພທາງດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type-safe) ຂອງ [method snapped], ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ "
"[float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snappedf(32.0, 2.5)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 32.5\n"
"snappedf(3.14159, 0.01)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.14\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the multiple of [param step] that is the closest to [param x].\n"
"A type-safe version of [method snapped], returning an [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snappedi(53, 16)  # Returns 48\n"
"snappedi(4096, 100)  # Returns 4100\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທະວີຄູນຂອງ [param step] ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ [param x] ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ປອດໄພທາງດ້ານປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ (type-safe) ຂອງ [method snapped], ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ "
"[int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"snappedi(53, 16)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 48\n"
"snappedi(4096, 100)  # ສົ່ງຄືນ 4100\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the square root of [param x], where [param x] is a non-negative "
"number.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sqrt(9)     # Returns 3\n"
"sqrt(10.24) # Returns 3.2\n"
"sqrt(-1)    # Returns NaN\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative values of [param x] return NaN (\"Not a Number\"). In "
"C#, if you need negative inputs, use [code]System.Numerics.Complex[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮາກຂັ້ນສອງ (square root) ຂອງ [param x], ໂດຍທີ່ [param x] ຕ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າລົບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"sqrt(9)     # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3\n"
"sqrt(10.24) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 3.2\n"
"sqrt(-1)    # ສົ່ງຄືນ NaN\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າລົບຂອງ [param x] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ NaN (\"Not a Number\"). ໃນ C#, "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]System.Numerics.Complex[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the first non-zero digit, after the decimal point. "
"Note that the maximum return value is 10, which is a design decision in the "
"implementation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var n = step_decimals(5)       # n is 0\n"
"n = step_decimals(1.0005)      # n is 4\n"
"n = step_decimals(0.000000005) # n is 9\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວເລກທຳອິດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ ຫຼັງຈຸດທົດສະນິຍົມ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 10, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນການອອກແບບຂອງການເຮັດວຽກນີ້.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var n = step_decimals(5)       # n ແມ່ນ 0\n"
"n = step_decimals(1.0005)      # n ແມ່ນ 4\n"
"n = step_decimals(0.000000005) # n ແມ່ນ 9\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts one or more arguments of any [Variant] type to a [String] in the "
"best way possible.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = [10, 20, 30]\n"
"var b = str(a)\n"
"print(len(a)) # Prints 3 (the number of elements in the array).\n"
"print(len(b)) # Prints 12 (the length of the string \"[10, 20, 30]\").\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອາຄິວເມນຂອງ [Variant] ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [String] ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = [10, 20, 30]\n"
"var b = str(a)\n"
"print(len(a)) # ພິມ 3 (ຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບໃນອາເຣ).\n"
"print(len(b)) # ພິມ 12 (ຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣິງ \"[10, 20, 30]\").\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts a formatted [param string] that was returned by [method var_to_str] "
"to the original [Variant].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var data = '{ \"a\": 1, \"b\": 2 }' # data is a String\n"
"var dict = str_to_var(data)     # dict is a Dictionary\n"
"print(dict[\"a\"])                # Prints 1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string data = \"{ \\\"a\\\": 1, \\\"b\\\": 2 }\";           // data is a "
"string\n"
"var dict = GD.StrToVar(data).AsGodotDictionary(); // dict is a Dictionary\n"
"GD.Print(dict[\"a\"]);                              // Prints 1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param string] ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກ [method var_to_str] ໃຫ້ກັບໄປເປັນ "
"[Variant] ຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var data = '{ \"a\": 1, \"b\": 2 }' # data ແມ່ນ String\n"
"var dict = str_to_var(data)     # dict ແມ່ນ Dictionary\n"
"print(dict[\"a\"])                # ພິມ 1\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"string data = \"{ \\\"a\\\": 1, \\\"b\\\": 2 }\";           // data ແມ່ນ "
"string\n"
"var dict = GD.StrToVar(data).AsGodotDictionary(); // dict ແມ່ນ Dictionary\n"
"GD.Print(dict[\"a\"]);                              // ພິມ 1\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the tangent of angle [param angle_rad] in radians.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"tan(deg_to_rad(45)) # Returns 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ຕັງຊັງ (tangent) ຂອງມຸມ [param angle_rad] ໃນຮູບແບບເຣດຽນ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"tan(deg_to_rad(45)) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the hyperbolic tangent of [param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = log(2.0) # Returns 0.693147\n"
"tanh(a)          # Returns 0.6\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ໄຮເປີໂບລິກຕັງຊັງ (hyperbolic tangent) ຂອງ [param x].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = log(2.0) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.693147\n"
"tanh(a)          # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0.6\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Converts the given [param variant] to the given [param type], using the [enum "
"Variant.Type] values. This method is generous with how it handles types, it "
"can automatically convert between array types, convert numeric [String]s to "
"[int], and converting most things to [String].\n"
"If the type conversion cannot be done, this method will return the default "
"value for that type, for example converting [Rect2] to [Vector2] will always "
"return [constant Vector2.ZERO]. This method will never show error messages as "
"long as [param type] is a valid Variant type.\n"
"The returned value is a [Variant], but the data inside and its type will be "
"the same as the requested type.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"type_convert(\"Hi!\", TYPE_INT) # Returns 0\n"
"type_convert(\"123\", TYPE_INT) # Returns 123\n"
"type_convert(123.4, TYPE_INT) # Returns 123\n"
"type_convert(5, TYPE_VECTOR2) # Returns (0, 0)\n"
"type_convert(\"Hi!\", TYPE_NIL) # Returns null\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param variant] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param type] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [enum "
"Variant.Type]. ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດຈັດການກັບປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼາກຫຼາຍ, ມັນສາມາດແປງລະຫວ່າງປະເພດອາເຣ "
"(array) ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແປງ [String] ທີ່ເປັນຕົວເລກໃຫ້ເປັນ [int], ແລະ "
"ແປງເກືອບທຸກຢ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນ [String].\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດແປງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default value) ຂອງປະເພດນັ້ນໆ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ການແປງ [Rect2] ເປັນ [Vector2] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant Vector2.ZERO] ສະເໝີ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຕາບໃດທີ່ [param type] ເປັນປະເພດ Variant ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [Variant], ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບປະເພດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"type_convert(\"Hi!\", TYPE_INT) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 0\n"
"type_convert(\"123\", TYPE_INT) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 123\n"
"type_convert(123.4, TYPE_INT) # ສົ່ງຄືນ 123\n"
"type_convert(5, TYPE_VECTOR2) # ສົ່ງຄືນ (0, 0)\n"
"type_convert(\"Hi!\", TYPE_NIL) # ສົ່ງຄືນ null\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a human-readable name of the given [param type], using the [enum "
"Variant.Type] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(TYPE_INT) # Prints 2\n"
"print(type_string(TYPE_INT)) # Prints \"int\"\n"
"print(type_string(TYPE_STRING)) # Prints \"String\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method typeof]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ທີ່ຄົນສາມາດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ຂອງ [param type] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [enum "
"Variant.Type].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(TYPE_INT) # ພິມ 2\n"
"print(type_string(TYPE_INT)) # ພິມ \"int\"\n"
"print(type_string(TYPE_STRING)) # ພິມ \"String\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method typeof] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the internal type of the given [param variable], using the [enum "
"Variant.Type] values.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"json.parse('[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]')\n"
"var result = json.get_data()\n"
"if typeof(result) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\tprint(result[0]) # Prints \"a\"\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"Unexpected result!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"See also [method type_string]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດພາຍໃນຂອງ [param variable] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [enum Variant.Type].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"json.parse('[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]')\n"
"var result = json.get_data()\n"
"if typeof(result) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\tprint(result[0]) # ພິມ \"a\"\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"Unexpected result!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method type_string] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Encodes a [Variant] value to a byte array, without encoding objects. "
"Deserialization can be done with [method bytes_to_var].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you need object serialization, see [method "
"var_to_bytes_with_objects].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Encoding [Callable] is not supported and will result in an empty "
"value, regardless of the data."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encode) ຄ່າ [Variant] ໃຫ້ເປັນອາເຣຂອງໄບຕ໌ (byte array) ໂດຍບໍ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດວັດຖຸ "
"(objects). ສາມາດຖອດລະຫັດ (deserialization) ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method bytes_to_var].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດວັດຖຸ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method "
"var_to_bytes_with_objects].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ [Callable] ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"Encodes a [Variant] value to a byte array. Encoding objects is allowed (and "
"can potentially include executable code). Deserialization can be done with "
"[method bytes_to_var_with_objects].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Encoding [Callable] is not supported and will result in an empty "
"value, regardless of the data."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encode) ຄ່າ [Variant] ໃຫ້ເປັນອາເຣຂອງໄບຕ໌. ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດວັດຖຸ (ແລະ "
"ອາດລວມເຖິງໂຄ້ດທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້). ສາມາດຖອດລະຫັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"bytes_to_var_with_objects].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ [Callable] ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"Converts a [Variant] [param variable] to a formatted [String] that can then "
"be parsed using [method str_to_var].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = { \"a\": 1, \"b\": 2 }\n"
"print(var_to_str(a))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { [\"a\"] = 1, [\"b\"] = 2 };\n"
"GD.Print(GD.VarToStr(a));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Prints:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"a\": 1,\n"
"\t\"b\": 2\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Converting [Signal] or [Callable] is not supported and will "
"result in an empty value for these types, regardless of their data."
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param variable] ປະເພດ [Variant] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [String] ທີ່ຈັດຮູບແບບແລ້ວ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳມາປະມວນຜົນ (parse) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method str_to_var].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = { \"a\": 1, \"b\": 2 }\n"
"print(var_to_str(a))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { [\"a\"] = 1, [\"b\"] = 2 };\n"
"GD.Print(GD.VarToStr(a));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ພິມ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"a\": 1,\n"
"\t\"b\": 2\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການແປງ [Signal] ຫຼື [Callable] ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າຫວ່າງເປົ່າສຳລັບປະເພດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [WeakRef] instance holding a weak reference to [param obj]. Returns "
"an empty [WeakRef] instance if [param obj] is [code]null[/code]. Prints an "
"error and returns [code]null[/code] if [param obj] is neither [Object]-"
"derived nor [code]null[/code].\n"
"A weak reference to an object is not enough to keep the object alive: when "
"the only remaining references to a referent are weak references, garbage "
"collection is free to destroy the referent and reuse its memory for something "
"else. However, until the object is actually destroyed the weak reference may "
"return the object even if there are no strong references to it."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [WeakRef] ທີ່ຖືການອ້າງອີງແບບອ່ອນ (weak reference) ໄປຫາ "
"[param obj]. ສົ່ງຄືນ [WeakRef] ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຖ້າ [param obj] ແມ່ນ [code]null[/code]. "
"ພິມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າ [param obj] ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງສິ່ງທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[Object] ຫຼື [code]null[/code].\n"
"ການອ້າງອີງແບບອ່ອນໄປຫາວັດຖຸແມ່ນບໍ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຄົງຢູ່ໄດ້: "
"ເມື່ອການອ້າງອີງທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່ມີພຽງແຕ່ການອ້າງອີງແບບອ່ອນ, ລະບົບຈະກຳຈັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ (garbage "
"collection) ສາມາດທຳລາຍວັດຖຸນັ້ນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງມັນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຈົນກວ່າວັດຖຸນັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍແທ້ໆ, ການອ້າງອີງແບບອ່ອນອາດຈະຍັງສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸນັ້ນໄດ້ຢູ່ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການອ້າງອີງແບບແຂງ (strong reference) ໄປຫາມັນແລ້ວກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Wraps the [Variant] [param value] between [param min] and [param max]. [param "
"min] is [i]inclusive[/i] while [param max] is [i]exclusive[/i]. This can be "
"used for creating loop-like behavior or infinite surfaces.\n"
"Variant types [int] and [float] are supported. If any of the arguments is "
"[float], this function returns a [float], otherwise it returns an [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = wrap(4, 5, 10)\n"
"# a is 9 (int)\n"
"\n"
"var a = wrap(7, 5, 10)\n"
"# a is 7 (int)\n"
"\n"
"var a = wrap(10.5, 5, 10)\n"
"# a is 5.5 (float)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸມ (wrap) ຄ່າ [param value] ຂອງ [Variant] ໃຫ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param min] ແລະ [param "
"max]. [param min] ແມ່ນ [i]ລວມເຖິງ[/i] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [param max] ແມ່ນ [i]ບໍ່ລວມ[/i]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບວົນຊ້ຳ ຫຼື ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ.\n"
"ຮອງຮັບປະເພດ Variant [int] ແລະ [float]. ຖ້າອາຄິວເມນໃດໜຶ່ງເປັນ [float], "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [float], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var a = wrap(4, 5, 10)\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 9 (int)\n"
"\n"
"var a = wrap(7, 5, 10)\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 7 (int)\n"
"\n"
"var a = wrap(10.5, 5, 10)\n"
"# a ແມ່ນ 5.5 (float)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Wraps the float [param value] between [param min] and [param max]. [param "
"min] is [i]inclusive[/i] while [param max] is [i]exclusive[/i]. This can be "
"used for creating loop-like behavior or infinite surfaces.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Infinite loop between 5.0 and 9.9\n"
"value = wrapf(value + 0.1, 5.0, 10.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Infinite rotation (in radians)\n"
"angle = wrapf(angle + 0.1, 0.0, TAU)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Infinite rotation (in radians)\n"
"angle = wrapf(angle + 0.1, -PI, PI)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param min] is [code]0[/code], this is equivalent to [method "
"fposmod], so prefer using that instead. [method wrapf] is more flexible than "
"using the [method fposmod] approach by giving the user control over the "
"minimum value."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸມຄ່າ [float] [param value] ໃຫ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param min] ແລະ [param max]. [param min] "
"ແມ່ນ [i]ລວມເຖິງ[/i] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [param max] ແມ່ນ [i]ບໍ່ລວມ[/i]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບວົນຊ້ຳ ຫຼື ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ວົນຊ້ຳບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດລະຫວ່າງ 5.0 ຫາ 9.9\n"
"value = wrapf(value + 0.1, 5.0, 10.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ການໝູນບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (ໃນຮູບແບບເຣດຽນ)\n"
"angle = wrapf(angle + 0.1, 0.0, TAU)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ການໝູນບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (ໃນຮູບແບບເຣດຽນ)\n"
"angle = wrapf(angle + 0.1, -PI, PI)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [param min] ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code], ນີ້ຈະເທົ່າກັບ [method fposmod], "
"ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ວິທີນັ້ນແທນ. [method wrapf] ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນກວ່າ [method fposmod] "
"ຍ້ອນວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Wraps the integer [param value] between [param min] and [param max]. [param "
"min] is [i]inclusive[/i] while [param max] is [i]exclusive[/i]. This can be "
"used for creating loop-like behavior or infinite surfaces.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Infinite loop between 5 and 9\n"
"frame = wrapi(frame + 1, 5, 10)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# result is -2\n"
"var result = wrapi(-6, -5, -1)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸມຄ່າເລກຖ້ວນ [param value] ໃຫ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [param min] ແລະ [param max]. [param min] "
"ແມ່ນ [i]ລວມເຖິງ[/i] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [param max] ແມ່ນ [i]ບໍ່ລວມ[/i]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບວົນຊ້ຳ ຫຼື ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ວົນຊ້ຳບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດລະຫວ່າງ 5 ຫາ 9\n"
"frame = wrapi(frame + 1, 5, 10)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ -2\n"
"var result = wrapi(-6, -5, -1)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

