msgid ""
"Adds a 6-band equalizer audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Gives you control over frequencies from 32 Hz to 10000 Hz. Each frequency can "
"be modulated between -60/+24 dB."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກເຄື່ອງປັບແຕ່ງສຽງແບບ 6 ແຖບ ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຖີ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 32 Hz ຫາ 10000 Hz. ແຕ່ລະຄວາມຖີ່ສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງ -60/+24 "
"dB."

msgid ""
"Frequency bands:\n"
"Band 1: 32 Hz\n"
"Band 2: 100 Hz\n"
"Band 3: 320 Hz\n"
"Band 4: 1000 Hz\n"
"Band 5: 3200 Hz\n"
"Band 6: 10000 Hz\n"
"See also [AudioEffectEQ], [AudioEffectEQ10], [AudioEffectEQ21]."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບຄວາມຖີ່:\n"
"Band 1: 32 Hz\n"
"Band 2: 100 Hz\n"
"Band 3: 320 Hz\n"
"Band 4: 1000 Hz\n"
"Band 5: 3200 Hz\n"
"Band 6: 10000 Hz\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [AudioEffectEQ], [AudioEffectEQ10], [AudioEffectEQ21] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Base class for filters. Use effects that inherit this class instead of using "
"it directly."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຟິວເຕີ (filters). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາສນີ້ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"A \"filter\" controls the gain of frequencies, using [member cutoff_hz] as a "
"frequency threshold. Filters can help to give room for each sound, and create "
"interesting effects.\n"
"There are different types of filter that inherit this class:\n"
"Shelf filters: [AudioEffectLowShelfFilter] and [AudioEffectHighShelfFilter]\n"
"Band-pass and notch filters: [AudioEffectBandPassFilter], "
"[AudioEffectBandLimitFilter], and [AudioEffectNotchFilter]\n"
"Low/high-pass filters: [AudioEffectLowPassFilter] and "
"[AudioEffectHighPassFilter]"
msgstr ""
"\"ຟິວເຕີ\" (filter) ຈະຄວບຄຸມຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່, ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member cutoff_hz] "
"ເປັນເກນຄວາມຖີ່. ຟິວເຕີຊ່ວຍສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະສຽງ ແລະ ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ.\n"
"ມີຟິວເຕີຫຼາຍປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາສນີ້:\n"
"Shelf filters: [AudioEffectLowShelfFilter] ແລະ [AudioEffectHighShelfFilter]\n"
"Band-pass ແລະ notch filters: [AudioEffectBandPassFilter], "
"[AudioEffectBandLimitFilter], ແລະ [AudioEffectNotchFilter]\n"
"Low/high-pass filters: [AudioEffectLowPassFilter] ແລະ "
"[AudioEffectHighPassFilter]"

msgid ""
"Frequency threshold for the filter, in Hz. Value can range from 1 to 20500."
msgstr "ເກນຄວາມຖີ່ສຳລັບຟິວເຕີ ເປັນ Hz. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 1 ຫາ 20500."

msgid ""
"Steepness of the cutoff curve in dB per octave (twice the frequency above "
"[member cutoff_hz], or half the frequency below [member cutoff_hz]), also "
"known as the \"order\" of the filter. Higher orders have a more aggressive "
"cutoff."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ ເປັນ dB ຕໍ່ອັອກເທັບ (octave) (ສອງເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງເທິງ "
"[member cutoff_hz], ຫຼື ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ [member cutoff_hz]), ຫຼື ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ "
"\"order\" ຂອງຟິວເຕີ. Order ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະມີການຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຮຸນແຮງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Gain of the frequencies affected by the filter. This property is only "
"available for [AudioEffectLowShelfFilter] and [AudioEffectHighShelfFilter]. "
"Value can range from 0 to 4."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຟິວເຕີ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີໃຫ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບ "
"[AudioEffectLowShelfFilter] ແລະ [AudioEffectHighShelfFilter]. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 "
"ຫາ 4."

msgid ""
"Gain at or directly next to the [member cutoff_hz] frequency threshold. Value "
"can range from 0 to 1.\n"
"Its exact behavior depends on the selected filter type:\n"
"- For shelf filters, it accentuates or masks the order by increasing "
"frequencies right next to the [member cutoff_hz] frequency and decreasing "
"frequencies on the opposite side.\n"
"- For the band-pass and notch filters, it widens or narrows the filter at the "
"[member cutoff_hz] frequency threshold.\n"
"- For low/high-pass filters, it increases or decreases frequencies at the "
"[member cutoff_hz] frequency threshold."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຢູ່ທີ່ ຫຼື ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆເກນຄວາມຖີ່ [member cutoff_hz]. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1.\n"
"ພຶດຕິກຳຕົວຈິງຂອງມັນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະເພດຂອງຟິວເຕີທີ່ເລືອກ:\n"
"- ສຳລັບ shelf filters, ມັນຈະເນັ້ນ ຫຼື ບັງ order ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງເກນຄວາມຖີ່ [member "
"cutoff_hz] ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ໃນດ້ານກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"
"- ສຳລັບ band-pass ແລະ notch filters, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟິວເຕີກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ແຄບລົງຢູ່ທີ່ເກນຄວາມຖີ່ "
"[member cutoff_hz].\n"
"- ສຳລັບ low/high-pass filters, ມັນຈະເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ເກນຄວາມຖີ່ [member cutoff_hz]."

msgid ""
"Cutting off at 6 dB per octave. One octave is twice the frequency above "
"[member cutoff_hz], or half the frequency below [member cutoff_hz]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ 6 dB ຕໍ່ອັອກເທັບ. ໜຶ່ງອັອກເທັບແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງເທິງ [member cutoff_hz], ຫຼື "
"ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ [member cutoff_hz]."

msgid ""
"Cutting off at 12 dB per octave. One octave is twice the frequency above "
"[member cutoff_hz], or half the frequency below [member cutoff_hz]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ 12 dB ຕໍ່ອັອກເທັບ. ໜຶ່ງອັອກເທັບແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງເທິງ [member cutoff_hz], ຫຼື "
"ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ [member cutoff_hz]."

msgid ""
"Cutting off at 18 dB per octave. One octave is twice the frequency above "
"[member cutoff_hz], or half the frequency below [member cutoff_hz]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ 18 dB ຕໍ່ອັອກເທັບ. ໜຶ່ງອັອກເທັບແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງເທິງ [member cutoff_hz], ຫຼື "
"ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ [member cutoff_hz]."

msgid ""
"Cutting off at 24 dB per octave. One octave is twice the frequency above "
"[member cutoff_hz], or half the frequency below [member cutoff_hz]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ 24 dB ຕໍ່ອັອກເທັບ. ໜຶ່ງອັອກເທັບແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງເທິງ [member cutoff_hz], ຫຼື "
"ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ [member cutoff_hz]."

msgid ""
"Adds a limiter audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Prevents audio signals from exceeding a specified volume level."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງຈຳກັດລະດັບສຽງ (limiter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສັນຍານສຽງເກີນລະດັບສຽງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"A \"limiter\" disallows audio signals from exceeding a given volume threshold "
"level in dB. Hard limiters predict volume peaks, and will smoothly apply gain "
"reduction when a peak crosses the ceiling threshold level to prevent "
"clipping. It preserves the waveform and prevents it from crossing the ceiling "
"threshold level. Adding one in the Master bus is recommended as a safety "
"measure to prevent sudden volume peaks from occurring, and to prevent "
"distortion caused by clipping, when the volume exceeds 0 dB.\n"
"If clipping is desired, consider [constant AudioEffectDistortion.MODE_CLIP]."
msgstr ""
"\"ເຄື່ອງຈຳກັດສຽງ\" ຫຼື \"limiter\" ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສັນຍານສຽງເກີນລະດັບເກນສຽງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ dB. "
"Hard limiters ຈະຄາດການຈຸດສູງສຸດຂອງລະດັບສຽງ (peaks), ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ການຫຼຸດເກນ (gain "
"reduction) ຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນເມື່ອຈຸດສູງສຸດເກີນລະດັບເພດານ (ceiling) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສຽງແຕກ (clipping). "
"ມັນຈະຮັກສາຮູບຮ່າງຄື້ນ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນເກີນລະດັບເພດານ. ການເພີ່ມ limiter ໃນບັສ Master "
"ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳເພື່ອເປັນມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດສຽງດັງຂຶ້ນມາທັນທີທັນໃດ, ແລະ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ distortion ທີ່ເກີດຈາກສຽງແຕກ ເມື່ອລະດັບສຽງເກີນ 0 dB.\n"
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [constant AudioEffectDistortion.MODE_CLIP]."

msgid ""
"The waveform's maximum allowed value, in dB. This value can range from -24 to "
"0.\n"
"The default value of -0.3 prevents potential inter-sample peaks (ISP) from "
"crossing over 0 dB, which can cause slight distortion on some older hardware."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງຄື້ນ, ເປັນ dB. ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ -24 ຫາ 0.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ -0.3 ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດ inter-sample peaks (ISP) ທີ່ອາດຈະເກີນ 0 dB, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ distortion ເລັກນ້ອຍໃນອຸປະກອນຮາດແວເກົ່າບາງຊະນິດ."

msgid "Gain before limiting, in dB. Value can range from -24 to 24."
msgstr "ຄ່າເກນ (gain) ກ່ອນການຈຳກັດສຽງ ເປັນ dB. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ -24 ຫາ 24."

msgid ""
"Time it takes in seconds for the gain reduction to fully release. Value can "
"range from 0.01 to 3."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນວິນາທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຫຼຸດເກນ (gain reduction) ປ່ອຍອອກຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ "
"0.01 ຫາ 3."

msgid "Adds a high-pass filter to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟິວເຕີຜ່ານສູງ (high-pass filter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"high-pass\" filter attenuates frequencies lower than [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] and allows higher frequencies to pass "
"unchanged.\n"
"This filter can be used to remove \"strength\" from a sound, and give low-end "
"space for basses and impact sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ \"high-pass\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຟິວເຕີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົບ \"ນ້ຳໜັກ\" ຫຼື \"ພະລັງ\" ອອກຈາກສຽງ, ແລະ "
"ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ໃນຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳໃຫ້ກັບສຽງເບສ (basses) ແລະ ສຽງກະທົບ."

msgid "Adds a high-shelf filter to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟິວເຕີປັບຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ (high-shelf filter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"high-shelf\" filter controls the gain of all frequencies above [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz].\n"
"This filter can be used to increase or decrease clarity of a sound."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ \"high-shelf\" ຈະຄວບຄຸມຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງທຸກໆຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz].\n"
"ຟິວເຕີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງສຽງ."

msgid "Manipulates the audio it receives for a given effect."
msgstr "ຈັດການສຽງທີ່ມັນໄດ້ຮັບສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"An audio effect instance manipulates the audio it receives for a given "
"effect. This instance is automatically created by an [AudioEffect] when it is "
"added to a bus, and should usually not be created directly. If necessary, it "
"can be fetched at run-time with [method AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."
msgstr ""
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງເອັບເຟັກສຽງ (audio effect instance) "
"ຈະຈັດການສຽງທີ່ມັນໄດ້ຮັບສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ "
"[AudioEffect] ເມື່ອມັນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນບັສ, ແລະ ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຄວນສ້າງມັນໂດຍກົງ. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, "
"ສາມາດດຶງເອົາມັນໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ [method "
"AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."

msgid ""
"Called by the [AudioServer] to process this effect. When [method "
"_process_silence] is not overridden or it returns [code]false[/code], this "
"method is called only when the bus is active.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not useful to override this method in GDScript or C#. Only "
"GDExtension can take advantage of it."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍ [AudioServer] ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນເອັບເຟັກນີ້. ເມື່ອ [method _process_silence] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນທັບ ຫຼື ມັນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code], "
"ວິທີການນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອບັສເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມັນບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ໃນ GDScript ຫຼື C#. ສະເພາະ GDExtension "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the processing behavior of this effect "
"instance.\n"
"Should return [code]true[/code] to force the [AudioServer] to always call "
"[method _process], even if the bus has been muted or cannot otherwise be "
"heard."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວິທີການນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳການປະມວນຜົນຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເອັບເຟັກນີ້.\n"
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ [AudioServer] ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method _process] "
"ສະເໝີ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າບັສຈະຖືກປິດສຽງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Use [AudioEffectHardLimiter] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [AudioEffectHardLimiter] ແທນ."

msgid "Adds a soft-clip limiter audio effect to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງຈຳກັດລະດັບສຽງແບບ soft-clip ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"limiter\" is an audio effect designed to stop audio signals from "
"exceeding a specified volume threshold level, and usually works by decreasing "
"the volume or soft-clipping the audio. Adding one in the Master bus is always "
"recommended to prevent clipping when the volume goes above 0 dB.\n"
"Soft clipping starts to decrease the peaks a little below the volume "
"threshold level and progressively increases its effect as the input volume "
"increases such that the threshold level is never exceeded.\n"
"If hard clipping is desired, consider [constant "
"AudioEffectDistortion.MODE_CLIP]."
msgstr ""
"\"ເຄື່ອງຈຳກັດສຽງ\" ຫຼື \"limiter\" "
"ແມ່ນເອັບເຟັກສຽງທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຢຸດສັນຍານສຽງບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີນລະດັບເກນສຽງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແລະ "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການຫຼຸດລະດັບສຽງ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກແບບນຸ່ມນວນ (soft-clipping). "
"ການເພີ່ມ limiter ໃນບັສ Master ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳສະເໝີເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສຽງແຕກ (clipping) "
"ເມື່ອລະດັບສຽງເກີນ 0 dB.\n"
"Soft clipping ຈະເລີ່ມຫຼຸດຈຸດສູງສຸດ (peaks) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ລະດັບທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນສຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ "
"ຈະເພີ່ມຜົນກະທົບຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆເມື່ອລະດັບສຽງຂາເຂົ້າເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະດັບສຽງຈະບໍ່ເກີນເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກແບບຮຸນແຮງ (hard clipping), ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [constant "
"AudioEffectDistortion.MODE_CLIP]."

msgid ""
"The waveform's maximum allowed value, in dB. Value can range from -20 to -0.1."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຮູບຮ່າງຄື້ນ, ເປັນ dB. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ -20 ຫາ -0.1."

msgid ""
"Modifies the volume of the limited waves, in dB. Value can range from 0 to 6."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແປງລະດັບສຽງຂອງຄື້ນທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ, ເປັນ dB. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 6."

msgid ""
"This property has no effect on the audio. Use [AudioEffectHardLimiter] "
"instead, as this Limiter effect is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງຕໍ່ກັບສຽງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [AudioEffectHardLimiter] ແທນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກເອັບເຟັກ "
"Limiter ນີ້ແມ່ນເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ (deprecated)."

msgid ""
"The volume threshold level from which the limiter begins to be active, in dB. "
"Value can range from -30 to 0."
msgstr "ລະດັບເກນສຽງທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈຳກັດສຽງຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ເປັນ dB. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ -30 ຫາ 0."

msgid "Adds a low-pass filter to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟິວເຕີຜ່ານຕ່ຳ (low-pass filter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"low-pass\" filter attenuates frequencies higher than [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] and allows lower frequencies to pass unchanged.\n"
"This filter can be used to muffle sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ \"low-pass\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຟິວເຕີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງອູ້ອີ້ (muffle)."

msgid "Adds a low-shelf filter to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟິວເຕີປັບຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (low-shelf filter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"low-shelf\" filter controls the gain of all frequencies below [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz].\n"
"This filter can be used to adjust the \"strength\" of a sound, by increasing "
"or decreasing its low-end."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ \"low-shelf\" ຈະຄວບຄຸມຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງທຸກໆຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz].\n"
"ຟິວເຕີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບ \"ນ້ຳໜັກ\" ຫຼື \"ພະລັງ\" ຂອງສຽງ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຢ່ານຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Adds a notch filter to an audio bus."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟິວເຕີຕັດບາງຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ (notch filter) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"A \"notch\" filter attenuates frequencies at [member "
"AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] and allows frequencies outside the frequency "
"threshold to pass unchanged. It is a narrower and stronger version of "
"[AudioEffectBandLimitFilter], and is the opposite of "
"[AudioEffectBandPassFilter].\n"
"This filter can be used to give more room for other sounds to play at that "
"frequency. Because of how much it attenuates frequencies, it can also be used "
"to completely remove undesired frequencies."
msgstr ""
"ຟິວເຕີ \"notch\" ຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ [member AudioEffectFilter.cutoff_hz] ແລະ "
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກເກນຄວາມຖີ່ຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ມັນເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ແຄບກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ແຮງກວ່າຂອງ [AudioEffectBandLimitFilter], ແລະ ເປັນສິ່ງກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ "
"[AudioEffectBandPassFilter].\n"
"ຟິວເຕີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບສຽງອື່ນໆໃນຄວາມຖີ່ນັ້ນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົບຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການອອກຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a panner audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Pans the sound left or right."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ (panner) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ແຍກສຽງໄປທາງຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ທາງຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Determines how much of the audio signal is sent to the left and right "
"channels. This helps with audio spatialization, giving sounds distinct places "
"in a mix.\n"
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D] and [AudioStreamPlayer3D] handle panning automatically, "
"following where the source of the sound is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າສັນຍານສຽງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຊ່ອງສຽງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງມິຕິສຽງ "
"(spatialization), ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງມີຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຊັດເຈນໃນການປະສົມສຽງ.\n"
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D] ແລະ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ຈະຈັດການການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ "
"(panning) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ມາຂອງສຽງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Pan position. Negative values pan the sound to the left, positive pan to the "
"right. Value can range from -1 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ (pan). ຄ່າລົບຈະແຍກສຽງໄປທາງຊ້າຍ, ຄ່າບວກຈະແຍກສຽງໄປທາງຂວາ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ -1 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Adds a phaser audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Creates several notch and peak filters that sweep across the spectrum."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງເຟເຊີ (phaser) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ສ້າງຟິວເຕີແບບ notch ແລະ peak ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ກວາດຜ່ານສະເປັກຕຣຳ (spectrum)."

msgid ""
"A \"phaser\" effect creates a copy of the original audio that phase-rotates "
"differently across the entire frequency spectrum, with the use of a series of "
"all-pass filter stages (6 in this effect). This copy modulates with a low-"
"frequency oscillator and combines with the original audio, resulting in peaks "
"and troughs that sweep across the spectrum.\n"
"This effect can be used to create a \"glassy\" or \"bubbly\" sound."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"phaser\" ຈະສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ມີການໝູນເຟສ (phase-rotate) "
"ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປທົ່ວທຸກສະເປັກຕຣຳຄວາມຖີ່, ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊຸດຂອງ all-pass filter (6 "
"ຂັ້ນຕອນໃນເອັບເຟັກນີ້). ສຳເນົານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນ (modulate) ດ້ວຍຕົວສັ່ນສະເທືອນຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (LFO) ແລະ "
"ປະສົມເຂົ້າກັບສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຈຸດສູງສຸດ (peaks) ແລະ ຈຸດຕ່ຳສຸດ (troughs) "
"ທີ່ກວາດຜ່ານສະເປັກຕຣຳ.\n"
"ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສຽງທີ່ຄືກັບສຽງແກ້ວ ຫຼື ສຽງຟອງນ້ຳ."

msgid "Intensity of the effect. Value can range from 0.1 to 4.0."
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນຂອງເອັບເຟັກ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0.1 ຫາ 4.0."

msgid ""
"The volume ratio of the filtered audio that is fed back to the all-pass "
"filters. The higher the value, the sharper and louder the peak filters "
"created by the effect. Value can range from 0.1 to 0.9."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນລະດັບສຽງຂອງສຽງທີ່ຖືກກອງເຊິ່ງຖືກປ້ອນກັບໄປຫາ all-pass filters. ຍິ່ງຄ່າສູງຂຶ້ນ, peak "
"filters ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍເອັບເຟັກກໍຈະຍິ່ງຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ດັງຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0.1 ຫາ 0.9."

msgid ""
"Determines the maximum frequency affected by the low-frequency oscillator "
"modulations, in Hz. Value can range from 10 to 10000."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມຖີ່ສູງສຸດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປັບປ່ຽນຂອງ LFO, ເປັນ Hz. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 10 ຫາ 10000."

msgid ""
"Determines the minimum frequency affected by the low-frequency oscillator "
"modulations, in Hz. Value can range from 10 to 10000."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປັບປ່ຽນຂອງ LFO, ເປັນ Hz. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 10 ຫາ 10000."

msgid ""
"Adjusts the rate in Hz at which the effect sweeps up and down across the "
"frequency range. Value can range from 0.01 to 20."
msgstr ""
"ປັບອັດຕາເປັນ Hz ທີ່ເອັບເຟັກຈະກວາດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງຜ່ານຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0.01 ຫາ 20."

msgid ""
"Adds a pitch-shifting audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Raises or lowers the pitch of the input audio."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ (pitch-shifting) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ຂອງສຽງຂາເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Allows modulation of pitch without modifying speed. All frequencies can be "
"raised or lowered with minimal effect on transients."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມໄວ. ທຸກໆຄວາມຖີ່ສາມາດຖືກເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດລົງ "
"ໂດຍສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ກັບສຽງຊົ່ວຄາວ (transients) ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The size of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Fast_Fourier_transform]Fast Fourier transform[/url] buffer. Higher values "
"smooth out the effect over time, but have greater latency. The effects of "
"this higher latency are especially noticeable on audio signals that have "
"sudden amplitude changes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງບັຟເຟີ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fast_Fourier_transform]Fast "
"Fourier transform[/url] (FFT). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກເບິ່ງນຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຜົນກະທົບຂອງຄວາມໜ່ວງທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນນີ້ຈະສັງເກດໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນສັນຍານສຽງທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງແອມພລິຈູດຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ."

msgid ""
"The oversampling factor to use. Higher values result in better quality, but "
"are more demanding on the CPU and may cause audio cracking if the CPU can't "
"keep up."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈການຊຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງແຕກຖ້າ CPU ເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ທັນ."

msgid ""
"The pitch scale to use. [code]1.0[/code] is the default pitch and plays "
"sounds unaffected. [member pitch_scale] can range from 0 (infinitely low "
"pitch, inaudible) to 16 (16 times higher than the initial pitch)."
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນລະດັບສຽງ (pitch scale) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນລະດັບສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະຫຼິ້ນສຽງໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆ. [member pitch_scale] ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 "
"(ລະດັບສຽງຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດຈົນບໍ່ໄດ້ຍິນ) ຫາ 16 (ສູງກວ່າລະດັບສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 16 ເທົ່າ)."

msgid ""
"Use a buffer of 256 samples for the Fast Fourier transform. Lowest latency, "
"but least stable over time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ບັຟເຟີຂະໜາດ 256 ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Fast Fourier transform. ມີຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ."

msgid ""
"Use a buffer of 512 samples for the Fast Fourier transform. Low latency, but "
"less stable over time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ບັຟເຟີຂະໜາດ 512 ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Fast Fourier transform. ມີຄວາມໜ່ວງຕ່ຳ, "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນໜ້ອຍເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ."

msgid ""
"Use a buffer of 1024 samples for the Fast Fourier transform. This is a "
"compromise between latency and stability over time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ບັຟເຟີຂະໜາດ 1024 ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Fast Fourier transform. "
"ເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງລະຫວ່າງຄວາມໜ່ວງ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຖຽນ."

msgid ""
"Use a buffer of 2048 samples for the Fast Fourier transform. High latency, "
"but stable over time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ບັຟເຟີຂະໜາດ 2048 ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Fast Fourier transform. ມີຄວາມໜ່ວງສູງ, "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ."

msgid ""
"Use a buffer of 4096 samples for the Fast Fourier transform. Highest latency, "
"but most stable over time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ບັຟເຟີຂະໜາດ 4096 ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Fast Fourier transform. ມີຄວາມໜ່ວງສູງທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum FFTSize] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum FFTSize]."

msgid "Audio effect used for recording the sound from an audio bus."
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກສຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Allows the user to record the sound from an audio bus into an "
"[AudioStreamWAV]. When used on the Master audio bus, this includes all audio "
"output by Godot.\n"
"Unlike [AudioEffectCapture], this effect encodes the recording with the given "
"format (8-bit, 16-bit, or compressed) instead of giving access to the raw "
"audio samples.\n"
"Can be used (with an [AudioStreamMicrophone]) to record from a microphone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] must be "
"[code]true[/code] for audio input to work. See also that setting's "
"description for caveats related to permissions and operating system privacy "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກບັສສຽງລົງໃນ [AudioStreamWAV]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບບັສສຽງ Master, "
"ມັນຈະລວມເອົາສຽງທັງໝົດທີ່ສົ່ງອອກມາຈາກ Godot.\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກ [AudioEffectCapture], ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດການບັນທຶກດ້ວຍຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ (8-bit, "
"16-bit, ຫຼື ແບບບີບອັດ) ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວຢ່າງສຽງດິບ.\n"
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ (ຮ່ວມກັບ [AudioStreamMicrophone]) ເພື່ອບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂາເຂົ້າສຽງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນຕື່ມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງກ່ຽວກັບການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid "Recording with microphone"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກດ້ວຍໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ"

msgid "Returns the recorded sample."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້."

msgid "Returns whether the recording is active or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າການບັນທຶກສຽງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the sound will be recorded. Note that restarting the "
"recording will remove the previously recorded sample."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການເລີ່ມການບັນທຶກໃໝ່ຈະລົບຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນອອກ."

msgid "Specifies the format in which the sample will be recorded."
msgstr "ລະບຸຮູບແບບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການບັນທຶກຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a reverberation audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Emulates an echo by playing a blurred version of the input audio."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງກ້ອງ (reverberation) ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ຈຳລອງສຽງສະທ້ອນໂດຍການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຂາເຂົ້າໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ມົວ (blurred)."

msgid ""
"A \"reverb\" effect plays the input audio back continuously, decaying over a "
"period of time. It simulates sounds in different kinds of spaces, ranging "
"from small rooms, to big caverns.\n"
"See also [AudioEffectDelay] for a non-blurry type of echo."
msgstr ""
"ເອັບເຟັກ \"reverb\" ຈະຫຼິ້ນສຽງຂາເຂົ້າຄືນໃໝ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍໆເບົາລົງເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ. "
"ມັນຈຳລອງສຽງໃນພື້ນທີ່ປະເພດຕ່າງໆ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຫ້ອງນ້ອຍໆ ໄປຫາຖ້ຳໃຫຍ່.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [AudioEffectDelay] ສຳລັບສຽງສະທ້ອນປະເພດທີ່ບໍ່ມົວ."

msgid ""
"Defines how reflective the imaginary room's walls are. The more reflective, "
"the more high frequency content the reverb has. Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຝາຂອງຫ້ອງສົມມຸດມີການສະທ້ອນຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຍິ່ງສະທ້ອນຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, reverb "
"ກໍຈະຍິ່ງມີເນື້ອໃນຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"The volume ratio of the original audio. At 0, only the modified audio is "
"outputted. Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນລະດັບສຽງຂອງສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ທີ່ຄ່າ 0, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ສຽງທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"High-pass filter allows frequencies higher than a certain cutoff threshold "
"and attenuates frequencies lower than the cutoff threshold. Value can range "
"from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"High-pass filter ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ສູງກວ່າເກນການຕັດທີ່ກຳນົດຜ່ານໄປໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຫຼຸດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນການຕັດ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Gain of early reflection copies. At higher values, early reflection copies "
"are louder and ring out for longer. Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງການສະທ້ອນສຽງໃນໄລຍະທຳອິດ (early reflection). ທີ່ຄ່າສູງຂຶ້ນ, "
"ການສະທ້ອນໃນໄລຍະທຳອິດຈະດັງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ກ້ອງກັງວານໄດ້ດົນຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Time between the original audio and the early reflections of the reverb "
"signal, in milliseconds. Value can range from 20 to 500."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາລະຫວ່າງສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນໃນໄລຍະທຳອິດຂອງສັນຍານ reverb, ເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 20 ຫາ 500."

msgid ""
"Dimensions of simulated room. Bigger means more echoes. Value can range from "
"0 to 1."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຫ້ອງຈຳລອງ. ຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດກໍຍິ່ງມີສຽງສະທ້ອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Widens or narrows the stereo image of the reverb tail. At 1, it fully widens. "
"Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມິຕິສຽງ stereo ຂອງສ່ວນຫາງ reverb ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ແຄບລົງ. ທີ່ຄ່າ 1, ມັນຈະກວ້າງທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"The volume ratio of the modified audio. At 0, only the original audio is "
"outputted. Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນລະດັບສຽງຂອງສຽງທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ. ທີ່ຄ່າ 0, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ສຽງຕົ້ນສະບັບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Creates an [AudioEffectInstance] which performs frequency analysis and "
"exposes results to be accessed in real-time."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [AudioEffectInstance] ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ວິເຄາະຄວາມຖີ່ ແລະ ເປີດເຜີຍຜົນລັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ແບບສົດໆ "
"(real-time)."

msgid ""
"Calculates a Fourier Transform of the audio signal. This effect does not "
"alter the audio. Can be used for creating real-time audio visualizations, "
"like a spectrogram.\n"
"This resource configures an [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance], which "
"performs the actual analysis at runtime. An instance should be obtained with "
"[method AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance] to make use of this effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນ Fourier Transform ຂອງສັນຍານສຽງ. ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງສຽງ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການສະແດງພາບສຽງແບບສົດໆ ເຊັ່ນ spectrogram.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຈະກຳນົດຄ່າ [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzerInstance], "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ວິເຄາະຕົວຈິງໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກ. ຄວນດຶງເອົາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ດ້ວຍ [method "
"AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກນີ້."

msgid "Audio Spectrum Visualizer Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການສະແດງພາບສະເປັກຕຣຳສຽງ"

msgid ""
"The length of the buffer to keep, in seconds. Higher values keep data around "
"for longer, but require more memory. Value can range from 0.1 to 4."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງບັຟເຟີທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້, ເປັນວິນາທີ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໄດ້ດົນຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0.1 ຫາ 4."

msgid ""
"The size of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Fast_Fourier_transform]Fast Fourier transform[/url] buffer. Higher values "
"smooth out the spectrum analysis over time, but have greater latency. The "
"effects of this higher latency are especially noticeable with sudden "
"amplitude changes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງບັຟເຟີ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fast_Fourier_transform]Fast "
"Fourier transform[/url]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການວິເຄາະສະເປັກຕຣຳເບິ່ງນຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມໜ່ວງ "
"(latency) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຜົນກະທົບຂອງຄວາມໜ່ວງທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນນີ້ຈະສັງເກດໄດ້ຊັດເຈນເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງແອມພລິຈູດຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ."

msgid "Queryable instance of an [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer]."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ສາມາດສອບຖາມຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຂອງ [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer]."

msgid ""
"The runtime part of an [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer], which can be used to "
"query the magnitude of a frequency range on its host bus.\n"
"An instance of this class can be obtained with [method "
"AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຂອງ [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer], "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມຄ່າຂະໜາດ (magnitude) ຂອງຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ໃນບັສທີ່ມັນຢູ່.\n"
"ສາມາດດຶງເອົາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method AudioServer.get_bus_effect_instance]."

msgid ""
"Returns the magnitude of the frequencies from [param from_hz] to [param "
"to_hz] in linear energy as a Vector2. The [code]x[/code] component of the "
"return value represents the left stereo channel, and [code]y[/code] "
"represents the right channel.\n"
"[param mode] determines how the frequency range will be processed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດ (magnitude) ຂອງຄວາມຖີ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ [param from_hz] ຫາ [param to_hz] "
"ໃນຮູບແບບພະລັງງານເສັ້ນຊື່ເປັນ Vector2. ອົງປະກອບ [code]x[/code] "
"ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໝາຍເຖິງຊ່ອງສຽງຊ້າຍ, ແລະ [code]y[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຊ່ອງສຽງຂວາ.\n"
"[param mode] ຈະກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນແນວໃດ."

msgid "Use the average value across the frequency range as magnitude."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍທົ່ວຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ເປັນຄ່າຂະໜາດ (magnitude)."

msgid "Use the maximum value of the frequency range as magnitude."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຄວາມຖີ່ເປັນຄ່າຂະໜາດ (magnitude)."

msgid ""
"Adds a stereo manipulation audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Controls gain of the side channels, and widens the stereo image."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກສຽງການຈັດການ stereo ໃຫ້ກັບບັສສຽງ.\n"
"ຄວບຄຸມຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງຊ່ອງສຽງດ້ານຂ້າງ, ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມິຕິສຽງ stereo ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adjusts gain of the left and right channels, and makes mono sounds stereo "
"through phase shifting."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງຊ່ອງສຽງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ, ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງແບບ mono ກາຍເປັນ stereo "
"ຜ່ານການເລື່ອນເຟສ (phase shifting)."

msgid ""
"Gain of the side channels, if they exist. A value of 0 will downmix stereo to "
"mono. Value can range from 0 to 4."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເກນ (gain) ຂອງຊ່ອງສຽງດ້ານຂ້າງ, ຖ້າມີ. ຄ່າ 0 ຈະລວມສຽງ stereo ໃຫ້ເປັນ mono. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 4."

msgid ""
"Widens the stereo image through phase shifting in conjunction with [member "
"time_pullout_ms]. Just pans sound to the left channel if [member "
"time_pullout_ms] is 0. Value can range from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມິຕິສຽງ stereo ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານການເລື່ອນເຟສ ຮ່ວມກັບ [member time_pullout_ms]. ຖ້າ "
"[member time_pullout_ms] ເປັນ 0 ມັນຈະພຽງແຕ່ແຍກສຽງໄປທາງຊ່ອງສຽງຊ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1."

msgid ""
"Widens the stereo image through phase shifting in conjunction with [member "
"surround]. Just delays the right channel if [member surround] is 0. Value is "
"in milliseconds, and can range from 0 to 50."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມິຕິສຽງ stereo ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານການເລື່ອນເຟສ ຮ່ວມກັບ [member surround]. ຖ້າ [member "
"surround] ເປັນ 0 ມັນຈະພຽງແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງສຽງຂວາຊ້າລົງ (delay). ຄ່າເປັນມິນລິວິນາທີ, ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຕັ້ງໄດ້ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 50."

msgid "Overrides the location sounds are heard from."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບ (override) ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Once added to the scene tree and enabled using [method make_current], this "
"node will override the location sounds are heard from. Only one "
"[AudioListener2D] can be current. Using [method make_current] will disable "
"the previous [AudioListener2D].\n"
"If there is no active [AudioListener2D] in the current [Viewport], center of "
"the screen will be used as a hearing point for the audio. [AudioListener2D] "
"needs to be inside [SceneTree] to function."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ scene tree ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍໃຊ້ [method make_current], ໂນດ (node) "
"ນີ້ຈະຂຽນທັບຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງ. ສາມາດມີ [AudioListener2D] ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ການໃຊ້ [method make_current] ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານ [AudioListener2D] ອັນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ [AudioListener2D] ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃສ [Viewport] ປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ຈຸດເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດຮັບຟັງສຽງ. [AudioListener2D] ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນ "
"[SceneTree] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Disables the [AudioListener2D]. If it's not set as current, this method will "
"have no effect."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ [AudioListener2D]. ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ, ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this [AudioListener2D] is currently active."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [AudioListener2D] ນີ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Makes the [AudioListener2D] active, setting it as the hearing point for the "
"sounds. If there is already another active [AudioListener2D], it will be "
"disabled.\n"
"This method will have no effect if the [AudioListener2D] is not added to "
"[SceneTree]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ [AudioListener2D] ເຮັດວຽກ, ໂດຍຕັ້ງມັນໃຫ້ເປັນຈຸດຮັບຟັງສຽງ. ຖ້າມີ [AudioListener2D] "
"ອື່ນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"ເມັດທອດ (method) ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງຖ້າ [AudioListener2D] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [SceneTree]."

msgid ""
"Once added to the scene tree and enabled using [method make_current], this "
"node will override the location sounds are heard from. This can be used to "
"listen from a location different from the [Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ (scene tree) ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍໃຊ້ [method make_current] ແລ້ວ, "
"ໂນດ (node) ນີ້ຈະແທນທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຟັງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [Camera3D] ໄດ້."

msgid "Disables the listener to use the current camera's listener instead."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວຮັບຟັງ ເພື່ອໄປໃຊ້ຕົວຮັບຟັງຂອງກ້ອງປະຈຸບັນແທນ."

msgid "Returns the listener's global orthonormalized [Transform3D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ແບບ orthonormalized ທົ່ວໂລກຂອງຕົວຮັບຟັງຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the listener was made current using [method "
"make_current], [code]false[/code] otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There may be more than one AudioListener3D marked as \"current\" "
"in the scene tree, but only the one that was made current last will be used."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວຮັບຟັງຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວປະຈຸບັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method make_current], "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນແມ່ນສົ່ງ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອາດມີ AudioListener3D ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຕົວທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າເປັນ \"current\" "
"ໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ, ແຕ່ສະເພາະຕົວທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວປະຈຸບັນຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Enables the listener. This will override the current camera's listener."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວຮັບຟັງ. ອັນນີ້ຈະແທນທີ່ຕົວຮັບຟັງຂອງກ້ອງປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If not [constant DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED], this listener will simulate the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/url] for "
"objects changed in particular [code]_process[/code] methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Doppler effect will only be heard on [AudioStreamPlayer3D]s "
"if [member AudioStreamPlayer3D.doppler_tracking] is not set to [constant "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED], ຕົວຮັບຟັງນີ້ຈະຈຳລອງ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການ ດອບເພລີ (Doppler effect)[/url] "
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນເມັດທອດ [code]_process[/code] ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປາກົດການ ດອບເພລີ ຈະໄດ້ຍິນໃນ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.doppler_tracking] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Disables [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/"
"url] simulation (default)."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການ ດອບເພລີ[/"
"url] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/"
"url] by tracking positions of objects that are changed in [code]_process[/"
"code]. Changes in the relative velocity of this listener compared to those "
"objects affect how audio is perceived (changing the audio's [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການ ດອບເພລີ[/url] "
"ໂດຍການຕິດຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ [code]_process[/code]. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄວາມໄວສຳພັດຂອງຕົວຮັບຟັງນີ້ເມື່ອທຽບກັບວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ສຽງ (ປ່ຽນແປງ "
"[member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale] ຂອງສຽງ)."

msgid ""
"Simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/"
"url] by tracking positions of objects that are changed in "
"[code]_physics_process[/code]. Changes in the relative velocity of this "
"listener compared to those objects affect how audio is perceived (changing "
"the audio's [member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການ ດອບເພລີ[/url] "
"ໂດຍການຕິດຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ [code]_physics_process[/code]. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄວາມໄວສຳພັດຂອງຕົວຮັບຟັງນີ້ເມື່ອທຽບກັບວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ສຽງ (ປ່ຽນແປງ "
"[member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale] ຂອງສຽງ)."

msgid "Base class for audio samples."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (audio samples)."

msgid "Meta class for playing back audio samples."
msgstr "ເມຕາຄລາສ (Meta class) ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ."

msgid "Server interface for low-level audio access."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສເຊີເວີ (Server interface) ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງສຽງໃນລະດັບຕໍ່າ (low-level)."

msgid ""
"[AudioServer] is a low-level server interface for audio access. It is in "
"charge of creating sample data (playable audio) as well as its playback via a "
"voice interface."
msgstr ""
"[AudioServer] ແມ່ນອິນເຕີເຟສເຊີເວີລະດັບຕໍ່າສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງສຽງ. ມັນມີໜ້າທີ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ "
"(ສຽງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້) ລວມທັງການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟສສຽງ (voice interface)."

msgid "Audio Device Changer Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການປ່ຽນອຸປະກອນສຽງ"

msgid "Adds a bus at [param at_position]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມບັສ (bus) ທີ່ [param at_position]."

msgid ""
"Adds an [AudioEffect] effect to the bus [param bus_idx] at [param "
"at_position]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກ [AudioEffect] ໃສ່ບັສ [param bus_idx] ທີ່ [param at_position]."

msgid "Generates an [AudioBusLayout] using the available buses and effects."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [AudioBusLayout] ໂດຍໃຊ້ບັສ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the number of channels of the bus at index [param bus_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຊ່ອງ (channels) ຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AudioEffect] at position [param effect_idx] in bus [param "
"bus_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioEffect] ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param effect_idx] ໃນບັສ [param bus_idx] ຄືນມາ."

msgid "Returns the number of effects on the bus at [param bus_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເອັບເຟັກໃນບັສທີ່ [param bus_idx] ຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AudioEffectInstance] assigned to the given bus and effect "
"indices (and optionally channel)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioEffectInstance] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບບັສ ແລະ ດັດຊະນີເອັບເຟັກທີ່ລະບຸ (ແລະ ຊ່ອງສຽງຖ້າມີ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the bus with the name [param bus_name]. Returns "
"[code]-1[/code] if no bus with the specified name exist."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງບັສທີ່ມີຊື່ [param bus_name]. ສົງຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີບັສທີ່ມີຊື່ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid "Returns the name of the bus with the index [param bus_idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງບັສທີ່ມີດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the peak volume of the left speaker at bus index [param bus_idx] and "
"channel index [param channel]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລະດັບສຽງສູງສຸດ (peak volume) ຂອງລຳໂພງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍທີ່ດັດຊະນີບັສ [param bus_idx] ແລະ "
"ດັດຊະນີຊ່ອງສຽງ [param channel]."

msgid ""
"Returns the peak volume of the right speaker at bus index [param bus_idx] and "
"channel index [param channel]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລະດັບສຽງສູງສຸດ (peak volume) ຂອງລຳໂພງເບື້ອງຂວາທີ່ດັດຊະນີບັສ [param bus_idx] ແລະ "
"ດັດຊະນີຊ່ອງສຽງ [param channel]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the bus that the bus at index [param bus_idx] sends to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງບັສທີ່ບັສໃນດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ສົ່ງສັນຍານໄປຫາ."

msgid "Returns the volume of the bus at index [param bus_idx] in dB."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລະດັບສຽງຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ເປັນໜ່ວຍ dB ຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the volume of the bus at index [param bus_idx] as a linear value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is equivalent to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] on the result of [method get_bus_volume_db]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລະດັບສຽງຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ເປັນຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມານີ້ເທົ່າກັບຜົນຂອງ [method @GlobalScope.db_to_linear] "
"ຈາກຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [method get_bus_volume_db]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the current audio driver. The default usually depends on "
"the operating system, but may be overridden via the [code]--audio-driver[/"
"code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url]. [code]--headless[/code] also automatically sets the audio "
"driver to [code]Dummy[/code]. See also [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/"
"driver]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງໄດຣເວີສຽງ (audio driver) ປະຈຸບັນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຜ່ານ [code]--audio-driver[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]. ນອກຈາກນີ້ "
"[code]--headless[/code] ຈະຕັ້ງໄດຣເວີສຽງເປັນ [code]Dummy[/code] ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/driver]."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute size of the microphone input buffer. This is set to a "
"multiple of the audio latency and can be used to estimate the minimum rate at "
"which the frames need to be fetched."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຂະໜາດສຳບູນຂອງບັບເຟີ (buffer) ຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຈຳນວນເທົ່າຂອງຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງສຽງ (audio latency) ແລະ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະມານອັດຕາຕໍ່າສຸດໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the names of all audio input devices detected on the system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] must be "
"[code]true[/code] for audio input to work. See also that setting's "
"description for caveats related to permissions and operating system privacy "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ອຸປະກອນຮັບສັນຍານສຽງເຂົ້າ (input devices) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກວດພົບໃນລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຮັບສຽງເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງເລື່ອງການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedVector2Array] containing exactly [param frames] audio "
"samples from the internal microphone buffer if available, otherwise returns "
"an empty [PackedVector2Array].\n"
"The buffer is filled at the rate of [method get_input_mix_rate] frames per "
"second when [method set_input_device_active] has successfully been set to "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"The samples are signed floating-point PCM values between [code]-1[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [PackedVector2Array] ທີ່ມີຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ [param frames] ເຟຣມ "
"ຈາກບັບເຟີໄມໂຄຣໂຟນພາຍໃນຖ້າມີ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [PackedVector2Array] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"ບັບເຟີຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນອັດຕາ [method get_input_mix_rate] ເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ ເມື່ອ [method "
"set_input_device_active] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງສຽງແມ່ນຄ່າ floating-point PCM ແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍລະຫວ່າງ [code]-1[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of frames available to read using [method "
"get_input_frames]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method get_input_frames]."

msgid "Returns the sample rate at the input of the [AudioServer]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sample rate) ທີ່ຂາເຂົ້າຂອງ [AudioServer]."

msgid "Returns the sample rate at the output of the [AudioServer]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ (sample rate) ທີ່ຂາອອກຂອງ [AudioServer]."

msgid "Returns the names of all audio output devices detected on the system."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ອຸປະກອນສົ່ງສັນຍານສຽງອອກ (output devices) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກວດພົບໃນລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the audio driver's effective output latency. This is based on [member "
"ProjectSettings.audio/driver/output_latency], but the exact returned value "
"will differ depending on the operating system and audio driver.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can be expensive; it is not recommended to call [method "
"get_output_latency] every frame."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມໜ່ວງຂາອອກ (output latency) ຕົວຈິງຂອງໄດຣເວີສຽງ. ອັນນີ້ອີງຕາມ [member "
"ProjectSettings.audio/driver/output_latency], "
"ແຕ່ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ໄດຣເວີສຽງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ; ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"get_output_latency] ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ."

msgid "Returns the speaker configuration."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳໂພງ."

msgid "Returns the relative time since the last mix occurred, in seconds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເວລາສຳພັດນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການປະສົມສຽງ (mix) ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid "Returns the relative time until the next mix occurs, in seconds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເວລາສຳພັດຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການປະສົມສຽງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the bus at index [param bus_idx] is bypassing effects."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ຈະຂ້າມ (bypass) ເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the effect at index [param effect_idx] on the bus at "
"index [param bus_idx] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເອັບເຟັກທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param effect_idx] ໃນບັສດັດຊະນີ [param "
"bus_idx] ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the bus at index [param bus_idx] is muted."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ຈະຖືກປິດສຽງ (mute)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the bus at index [param bus_idx] is in solo mode."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ Solo (ຫຼິ້ນສະເພາະບັສນີ້)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the stream is registered as a sample. The engine will "
"not have to register it before playing the sample.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the stream will have to be registered before playing "
"it. To prevent lag spikes, register the stream as sample with [method "
"register_stream_as_sample]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຕຣີມ (stream) ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (sample). "
"ເອນຈິນ (engine) ຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນມັນກ່ອນຫຼິ້ນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ສະຕຣີມຈະຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນການຫຼິ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນອາການແລັກ (lag "
"spikes), ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນສະຕຣີມເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງດ້ວຍ [method register_stream_as_sample]."

msgid ""
"Locks the audio driver's main loop.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Remember to unlock it afterwards."
msgstr ""
"ລັອກລູບຫຼັກ (main loop) ຂອງໄດຣເວີສຽງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຢ່າລືມປົດລັອກ (unlock) ມັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

msgid "Moves the bus from index [param index] to index [param to_index]."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍບັສຈາກດັດຊະນີ [param index] ໄປຫາ [param to_index]."

msgid ""
"Forces the registration of a stream as a sample.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Lag spikes may occur when calling this method, especially on "
"single-threaded builds. It is suggested to call this method while loading "
"assets, where the lag spike could be masked, instead of registering the "
"sample right before it needs to be played."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບການລົງທະບຽນສະຕຣີມໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອາດເກີດອາການແລັກ (lag spikes) ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນເວີຊັນທີ່ເປັນ single-threaded. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໂຫຼດແອສເຊັດ "
"(assets), ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສັງເກດເຫັນອາການແລັກ, ແທນທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງກ່ອນຈະຫຼິ້ນທັນທີ."

msgid "Removes the bus at index [param index]."
msgstr "ລຶບບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Removes the effect at index [param effect_idx] from the bus at index [param "
"bus_idx]."
msgstr "ລຶບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param effect_idx] ອອກຈາກບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx]."

msgid "Overwrites the currently used [AudioBusLayout]."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບ [AudioBusLayout] ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Sets the name of the bus at index [param bus_idx] to [param name]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ເປັນ [param name]."

msgid ""
"Connects the output of the bus at [param bus_idx] to the bus named [param "
"send]."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາອອກຂອງບັສທີ່ [param bus_idx] ໄປຫາບັສທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param send]."

msgid ""
"Sets the volume in decibels of the bus at index [param bus_idx] to [param "
"volume_db]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງລະດັບສຽງເປັນເດຊີເບລຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ເປັນ [param volume_db]."

msgid ""
"Sets the volume as a linear value of the bus at index [param bus_idx] to "
"[param volume_linear].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this method is equivalent to calling [method "
"set_bus_volume_db] with the result of [method @GlobalScope.linear_to_db] on a "
"value."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງລະດັບສຽງເປັນຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ຂອງບັສທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param bus_idx] ເປັນ [param "
"volume_linear].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນ [method set_bus_volume_db] ດ້ວຍຜົນຈາກ "
"[method @GlobalScope.linear_to_db]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], all instances of [AudioStreamPlayback] will call "
"[method AudioStreamPlayback._tag_used_streams] every mix step.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is enabled by default in the editor, as it is used by "
"editor plugins for the audio stream previews."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ທຸກໆ instance ຂອງ [AudioStreamPlayback] ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method AudioStreamPlayback._tag_used_streams] ໃນທຸກໆຂັ້ນຕອນການປະສົມສຽງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ editor, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍປລັກອິນຂອງ editor "
"ສຳລັບການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview) ສະຕຣີມສຽງ."

msgid ""
"If [param active] is [code]true[/code], starts the microphone input stream "
"specified by [member input_device] or returns an error if it failed.\n"
"If [param active] is [code]false[/code], stops the input stream if it is "
"running."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param active] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເລີ່ມການຮັບສັນຍານສຽງຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນທີ່ລະບຸໃນ "
"[member input_device] ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄ່າຜິດພາດຖ້າບໍ່ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param active] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະຢຸດການຮັບສັນຍານສຽງຖ້າມັນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid "Swaps the position of two effects in bus [param bus_idx]."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເອັບເຟັກສອງຕົວໃນບັສ [param bus_idx]."

msgid ""
"Unlocks the audio driver's main loop. (After locking it, you should always "
"unlock it.)"
msgstr "ປົດລັອກລູບຫຼັກຂອງໄດຣເວີສຽງ (ຫຼັງຈາກລັອກມັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນປົດລັອກມັນສະເໝີ)."

msgid "Number of available audio buses."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນບັສສຽງທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Name of the current device for audio input (see [method "
"get_input_device_list]). On systems with multiple audio inputs (such as "
"analog, USB and HDMI audio), this can be used to select the audio input "
"device. The value [code]\"Default\"[/code] will record audio on the system-"
"wide default audio input. If an invalid device name is set, the value will be "
"reverted back to [code]\"Default\"[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] must be "
"[code]true[/code] for audio input to work. See also that setting's "
"description for caveats related to permissions and operating system privacy "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ອຸປະກອນປະຈຸບັນສຳລັບການຮັບສຽງ (ເບິ່ງ [method get_input_device_list]). "
"ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີການຮັບສຽງຫຼາຍທາງ (ເຊັ່ນ analog, USB ແລະ HDMI audio), "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກອຸປະກອນຮັບສຽງໄດ້. ຄ່າ [code]\"Default\"[/code] "
"ຈະບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກອຸປະກອນຮັບສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄ່າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນກັບເປັນ [code]"
"\"Default\"[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຮັບສຽງເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງເລື່ອງການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Name of the current device for audio output (see [method "
"get_output_device_list]). On systems with multiple audio outputs (such as "
"analog, USB and HDMI audio), this can be used to select the audio output "
"device. The value [code]\"Default\"[/code] will play audio on the system-wide "
"default audio output. If an invalid device name is set, the value will be "
"reverted back to [code]\"Default\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ອຸປະກອນປະຈຸບັນສຳລັບການສົ່ງສຽງອອກ (ເບິ່ງ [method get_output_device_list]). "
"ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີທາງອອກຂອງສຽງຫຼາຍທາງ (ເຊັ່ນ analog, USB ແລະ HDMI audio), "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກອຸປະກອນສົ່ງສຽງອອກໄດ້. ຄ່າ [code]\"Default\"[/code] "
"ຈະຫຼິ້ນສຽງຜ່ານອຸປະກອນສົ່ງສຽງອອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄ່າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນກັບເປັນ "
"[code]\"Default\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Scales the rate at which audio is played (i.e. setting it to [code]0.5[/code] "
"will make the audio be played at half its speed). See also [member "
"Engine.time_scale] to affect the general simulation speed, which is "
"independent from [member AudioServer.playback_speed_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ປັບອັດຕາຄວາມໄວໃນການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.5[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຫຼິ້ນດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ). ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member Engine.time_scale] "
"ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມໄວໃນການຈຳລອງທົ່ວໄປ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຈາກ [member "
"AudioServer.playback_speed_scale]."

msgid "Emitted when an audio bus is added, deleted, or moved."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (emitted) ເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ, ລຶບ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍບັສສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the audio bus at [param bus_index] is renamed from [param "
"old_name] to [param new_name]."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອບັສສຽງທີ່ [param bus_index] ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ອອກຈາກ [param old_name] ເປັນ [param "
"new_name]."

msgid "Two or fewer speakers were detected."
msgstr "ກວດພົບລຳໂພງສອງຕົວ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ."

msgid "A 3.1 channel surround setup was detected."
msgstr "ກວດພົບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງຮອບທິດທາງແບບ 3.1 ແຊນແນວ."

msgid "A 5.1 channel surround setup was detected."
msgstr "ກວດພົບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງຮອບທິດທາງແບບ 5.1 ແຊນແນວ."

msgid "A 7.1 channel surround setup was detected."
msgstr "ກວດພົບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງຮອບທິດທາງແບບ 7.1 ແຊນແນວ."

msgid ""
"The playback will be considered of the type declared at [member "
"ProjectSettings.audio/general/default_playback_type]."
msgstr ""
"ການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາເປັນປະເພດທີ່ປະກາດໄວ້ໃນ [member ProjectSettings.audio/general/"
"default_playback_type]."

msgid "Force the playback to be considered as a stream."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຖືກພິຈາລະນາເປັນແບບສະຕຣີມ (stream)."

msgid ""
"Force the playback to be considered as a sample. This can provide lower "
"latency and more stable playback (with less risk of audio crackling), at the "
"cost of having less flexibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only currently supported on the web platform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AudioEffect]s are not supported when playback is considered as "
"a sample."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຖືກພິຈາລະນາເປັນແບບຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (sample). ອັນນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງຕໍ່າລົງ ແລະ "
"ການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ສະຖຽນກວ່າ (ຫຼຸດຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງສຽງແຕກ), ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນທີ່ໜ້ອຍລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນປະຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເທິງເວັບແພລັດຟອມ (web platform) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [AudioEffect] ເມື່ອການຫຼິ້ນຄືນຖືກພິຈາລະນາເປັນແບບຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum PlaybackType] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum PlaybackType] enum."

msgid "Base class for audio streams."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບສະຕຣີມສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Base class for audio streams. Audio streams are used for sound effects and "
"music playback, and support WAV (via [AudioStreamWAV]), Ogg (via "
"[AudioStreamOggVorbis]), and MP3 (via [AudioStreamMP3]) file formats."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບສະຕຣີມສຽງ. ສະຕຣີມສຽງແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສຽງ ແລະ ການຫຼິ້ນເພງ, ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ "
"WAV (ຜ່ານ [AudioStreamWAV]), Ogg (ຜ່ານ [AudioStreamOggVorbis]), ແລະ MP3 (ຜ່ານ "
"[AudioStreamMP3])."

msgid "Audio streams"
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມສຽງ"

msgid "Audio Generator Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຄື່ອງສ້າງສຽງ"

msgid "Override this method to return the bar beats of this stream."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບ (Override) ເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າຈັງຫວະໃນຫ້ອງເພງ (bar beats) ຂອງສະຕຣີມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Should return the total number of beats of this audio "
"stream. Used by the engine to determine the position of every beat.\n"
"Ideally, the returned value should be based off the stream's sample rate "
"([member AudioStreamWAV.mix_rate], for example)."
msgstr ""
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະທັງໝົດຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້. "
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍເອນຈິນເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຕ່ລະຈັງຫວະ.\n"
"ຕາມຫຼັກການແລ້ວ, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນອີງຕາມອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງສະຕຣີມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [member "
"AudioStreamWAV.mix_rate])."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Should return the tempo of this audio stream, in beats "
"per minute (BPM). Used by the engine to determine the position of every "
"beat.\n"
"Ideally, the returned value should be based off the stream's sample rate "
"([member AudioStreamWAV.mix_rate], for example)."
msgstr ""
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມໄວ (tempo) ຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ ເປັນຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະຕໍ່ນາທີ (BPM). "
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍເອນຈິນເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຕ່ລະຈັງຫວະ.\n"
"ຕາມຫຼັກການແລ້ວ, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນອີງຕາມອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງສະຕຣີມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [member "
"AudioStreamWAV.mix_rate])."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the returned value of [method get_length]. "
"Should return the length of this audio stream, in seconds."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂອງ [method get_length]. "
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Return the controllable parameters of this stream. This array contains "
"dictionaries with a property info description format (see [method "
"Object.get_property_list]). Additionally, the default value for this "
"parameter must be added tho each dictionary in \"default_value\" field."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຂອງສະຕຣີມນີ້. ອາເຣ (array) ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍ ດິກຊັນນາຣີ (dictionaries) "
"ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບຄຳອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ມູນພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_property_list]). ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຕ່ລະດິກຊັນນາຣີໃນຟິວ \"default_value\"."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the name assigned to this audio stream. "
"Unused by the engine."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້. ເອນຈິນບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the tags for this audio stream. Should "
"return a [Dictionary] of strings with the tag as the key and its content as "
"the value.\n"
"Commonly used tags include [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], "
"[code]album[/code], [code]tracknumber[/code], and [code]date[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງແທັກ (tags) ສຳລັບສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [Dictionary] "
"ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໂດຍມີແທັກເປັນ ຄີ (key) ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນເປັນ ຄ່າ (value).\n"
"ແທັກທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປລວມມີ [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], [code]album[/code], "
"[code]tracknumber[/code], ແລະ [code]date[/code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return [code]true[/code] if this stream has a loop."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມນີ້ມີການວົນຊໍ້າ (loop)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the returned value of [method "
"instantiate_playback]. Should return a new [AudioStreamPlayback] created when "
"the stream is played (such as by an [AudioStreamPlayer])."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂອງ [method instantiate_playback]. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[AudioStreamPlayback] ໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອສະຕຣີມຖືກຫຼິ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍ [AudioStreamPlayer])."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the returned value of [method "
"is_monophonic]. Should return [code]true[/code] if this audio stream only "
"supports one channel."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂອງ [method is_monophonic]. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Returns if the current [AudioStream] can be used as a sample. Only static "
"streams can be sampled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ [AudioStream] ປະຈຸບັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ສະເພາະສະຕຣີມທີ່ຄົງທີ່ (static) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້."

msgid "Generates an [AudioSample] based on the current stream."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [AudioSample] ໂດຍອີງຕາມສະຕຣີມປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the length of the audio stream in seconds. If this stream is an "
"[AudioStreamRandomizer], returns the length of the last played stream. If "
"this stream has an indefinite length (such as for [AudioStreamGenerator] and "
"[AudioStreamMicrophone]), returns [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງເປັນວິນາທີ. ຖ້າສະຕຣີມນີ້ແມ່ນ [AudioStreamRandomizer], "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣີມທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າສະຕຣີມນີ້ມີຄວາມຍາວທີ່ບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[AudioStreamGenerator] ແລະ [AudioStreamMicrophone]), ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns a newly created [AudioStreamPlayback] intended to play this audio "
"stream. Useful for when you want to extend [method _instantiate_playback] but "
"call [method instantiate_playback] from an internally held AudioStream "
"subresource. An example of this can be found in the source code for "
"[code]AudioStreamRandomPitch::instantiate_playback[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioStreamPlayback] ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[method _instantiate_playback] ແຕ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method instantiate_playback] "
"ຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ AudioStream ທີ່ຖືໄວ້ພາຍໃນ. ຕົວຢ່າງສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ "
"[code]AudioStreamRandomPitch::instantiate_playback[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stream is a collection of other streams, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມເປັນການລວມຕົວຂອງສະຕຣີມອື່ນໆ, ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນແມ່ນສົ່ງ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this audio stream only supports one channel "
"([i]monophony[/i]), or [code]false[/code] if the audio stream supports two or "
"more channels ([i]polyphony[/i])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງດຽວ ([i]monophony[/i]), ຫຼື "
"[code]false[/code] ຖ້າຮອງຮັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ສອງຊ່ອງຂຶ້ນໄປ ([i]polyphony[/i])."

msgid "Signal to be emitted to notify when the parameter list changed."
msgstr "ສັນຍານທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອລາຍການພາຣາມິເຕີມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "An audio stream with utilities for procedural sound generation."
msgstr "ສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບການສ້າງສຽງແບບໂປຣຊີເຈີຣໍ (procedural generation)."

msgid ""
"[AudioStreamGenerator] is a type of audio stream that does not play back "
"sounds on its own; instead, it expects a script to generate audio data for "
"it. See also [AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback].\n"
"Here's a sample on how to use it to generate a sine wave:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var playback # Will hold the AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback.\n"
"@onready var sample_hz = $AudioStreamPlayer.stream.mix_rate\n"
"var pulse_hz = 440.0 # The frequency of the sound wave.\n"
"var phase = 0.0\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$AudioStreamPlayer.play()\n"
"\tplayback = $AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback()\n"
"\tfill_buffer()\n"
"\n"
"func fill_buffer():\n"
"\tvar increment = pulse_hz / sample_hz\n"
"\tvar frames_available = playback.get_frames_available()\n"
"\n"
"\tfor i in range(frames_available):\n"
"\t\tplayback.push_frame(Vector2.ONE * sin(phase * TAU))\n"
"\t\tphase = fmod(phase + increment, 1.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export] public AudioStreamPlayer Player { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"private AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback _playback; // Will hold the "
"AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback.\n"
"private float _sampleHz;\n"
"private float _pulseHz = 440.0f; // The frequency of the sound wave.\n"
"private double phase = 0.0;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (Player.Stream is AudioStreamGenerator generator) // Type as a generator "
"to access MixRate.\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_sampleHz = generator.MixRate;\n"
"\t\tPlayer.Play();\n"
"\t\t_playback = (AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback)Player.GetStreamPlayback();\n"
"\t\tFillBuffer();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void FillBuffer()\n"
"{\n"
"\tfloat increment = _pulseHz / _sampleHz;\n"
"\tint framesAvailable = _playback.GetFramesAvailable();\n"
"\n"
"\tfor (int i = 0; i < framesAvailable; i++)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_playback.PushFrame(Vector2.One * (float)Mathf.Sin(phase * Mathf.Tau));\n"
"\t\tphase = Mathf.PosMod(phase + increment, 1.0);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In the example above, the \"AudioStreamPlayer\" node must use an "
"[AudioStreamGenerator] as its stream. The [code]fill_buffer[/code] function "
"provides audio data for approximating a sine wave.\n"
"See also [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer] for performing real-time audio "
"spectrum analysis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to performance constraints, this class is best used from C# "
"or from a compiled language via GDExtension. If you still want to use this "
"class from GDScript, consider using a lower [member mix_rate] such as 11,025 "
"Hz or 22,050 Hz."
msgstr ""
"[AudioStreamGenerator] ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼິ້ນສຽງດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ; "
"ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງການສະຄຣິບເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນສຽງໃຫ້ມັນ. ເບິ່ງ [AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback] ປະກອບ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອສ້າງຄື້ນຊາຍ (sine wave):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var playback # ຈະເກັບຄ່າ AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback.\n"
"@onready var sample_hz = $AudioStreamPlayer.stream.mix_rate\n"
"var pulse_hz = 440.0 # ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງຄື້ນສຽງ.\n"
"var phase = 0.0\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$AudioStreamPlayer.play()\n"
"\tplayback = $AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback()\n"
"\tfill_buffer()\n"
"\n"
"func fill_buffer():\n"
"\tvar increment = pulse_hz / sample_hz\n"
"\tvar frames_available = playback.get_frames_available()\n"
"\n"
"\tfor i in range(frames_available):\n"
"\t\tplayback.push_frame(Vector2.ONE * sin(phase * TAU))\n"
"\t\tphase = fmod(phase + increment, 1.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export] public AudioStreamPlayer Player { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"private AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback _playback; // ຈະເກັບຄ່າ "
"AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback.\n"
"private float _sampleHz;\n"
"private float _pulseHz = 440.0f; // ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງຄື້ນສຽງ.\n"
"private double phase = 0.0;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (Player.Stream is AudioStreamGenerator generator) // ກໍານົດປະເພດເປັນ "
"generator ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ MixRate.\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_sampleHz = generator.MixRate;\n"
"\t\tPlayer.Play();\n"
"\t\t_playback = (AudioStreamGeneratorPlayback)Player.GetStreamPlayback();\n"
"\t\tFillBuffer();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void FillBuffer()\n"
"{\n"
"\tfloat increment = _pulseHz / _sampleHz;\n"
"\tint framesAvailable = _playback.GetFramesAvailable();\n"
"\n"
"\tfor (int i = 0; i < framesAvailable; i++)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_playback.PushFrame(Vector2.One * (float)Mathf.Sin(phase * Mathf.Tau));\n"
"\t\tphase = Mathf.PosMod(phase + increment, 1.0);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ໂນດ \"AudioStreamPlayer\" ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [AudioStreamGenerator] "
"ເປັນສະຕຣີມຂອງມັນ. ຟັງຊັນ [code]fill_buffer[/code] ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເພື່ອສ້າງຄື້ນຊາຍ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [AudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer] ເພື່ອວິເຄາະສະເປັກຕຣຳຂອງສຽງແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ, ຄລາສນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນພາສາ C# ຫຼື "
"ພາສາທີ່ຄອມພາຍ (compiled) ຜ່ານ GDExtension. ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄລາສນີ້ຈາກ GDScript, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [member mix_rate] ທີ່ຕໍ່າລົງ ເຊັ່ນ 11,025 Hz ຫຼື 22,050 Hz."

msgid ""
"The length of the buffer to generate (in seconds). Lower values result in "
"less latency, but require the script to generate audio data faster, resulting "
"in increased CPU usage and more risk for audio cracking if the CPU can't keep "
"up."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງບັບເຟີທີ່ຈະສ້າງ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າລົງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວາມໜ່ວງໜ້ອຍລົງ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນສຽງໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການນຳໃຊ້ CPU ສູງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ສຽງຈະແຕກຖ້າ CPU ເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ທັນ."

msgid ""
"The sample rate to use (in Hz). Higher values are more demanding for the CPU "
"to generate, but result in better quality.\n"
"In games, common sample rates in use are [code]11025[/code], [code]16000[/"
"code], [code]22050[/code], [code]32000[/code], [code]44100[/code], and "
"[code]48000[/code].\n"
"According to the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nyquist%E2%80%93Shannon_sampling_theorem]Nyquist-Shannon sampling theorem[/"
"url], there is no quality difference to human hearing when going past 40,000 "
"Hz (since most humans can only hear up to ~20,000 Hz, often less). If you are "
"generating lower-pitched sounds such as voices, lower sample rates such as "
"[code]32000[/code] or [code]22050[/code] may be usable with no loss in "
"quality.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AudioStreamGenerator] is not automatically resampling input "
"data, to produce expected result [member mix_rate_mode] should match the "
"sampling rate of input data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you are using [AudioEffectCapture] as the source of your "
"data, set [member mix_rate_mode] to [constant MIX_RATE_INPUT] or [constant "
"MIX_RATE_OUTPUT] to automatically match current [AudioServer] mixing rate."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ເປັນ Hz). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໜັກຂຶ້ນໃນການສ້າງ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນເກມ, ອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ [code]11025[/code], [code]16000[/code], "
"[code]22050[/code], [code]32000[/code], [code]44100[/code], ແລະ [code]48000[/"
"code].\n"
"ອີງຕາມ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nyquist%E2%80%93Shannon_sampling_theorem]ທິດສະດີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Nyquist-Shannon[/"
"url], ຈະບໍ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຄຸນນະພາບສຳລັບການຟັງຂອງມະນຸດເມື່ອເກີນ 40,000 Hz "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກມະນຸດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງສູງສຸດພຽງ ~20,000 Hz). ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງສຽງທີ່ມີລະດັບສຽງຕໍ່າ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ສຽງເວົ້າ, ອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຕໍ່າລົງ ເຊັ່ນ [code]32000[/code] ຫຼື [code]22050[/code] "
"ອາດຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [AudioStreamGenerator] ຈະບໍ່ທຳການປ່ຽນອັດຕາສຸ່ມ (resampling) "
"ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ [member mix_rate_mode] "
"ຄວນຈະກົງກັບອັດຕາສຸ່ມຂອງຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ [AudioEffectCapture] ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"mix_rate_mode] ເປັນ [constant MIX_RATE_INPUT] ຫຼື [constant MIX_RATE_OUTPUT] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບອັດຕາການປະສົມຂອງ [AudioServer] ປະຈຸບັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Mixing rate mode. If set to [constant MIX_RATE_CUSTOM], [member mix_rate] is "
"used, otherwise current [AudioServer] mixing rate is used."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດອັດຕາການປະສົມ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MIX_RATE_CUSTOM], ຈະໃຊ້ [member mix_rate], "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ອັດຕາການປະສົມຂອງ [AudioServer] ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Current [AudioServer] output mixing rate."
msgstr "ອັດຕາການປະສົມຂາອອກຂອງ [AudioServer] ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Current [AudioServer] input mixing rate."
msgstr "ອັດຕາການປະສົມຂາເຂົ້າຂອງ [AudioServer] ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Custom mixing rate, specified by [member mix_rate]."
msgstr "ອັດຕາການປະສົມແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ລະບຸໂດຍ [member mix_rate]."

msgid "Maximum value for the mixing rate mode enum."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບ enum ໂໝດອັດຕາການປະສົມ."

msgid "Plays back audio generated using [AudioStreamGenerator]."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສຽງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ [AudioStreamGenerator]."

msgid ""
"This class is meant to be used with [AudioStreamGenerator] to play back the "
"generated audio in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລາສນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [AudioStreamGenerator] ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌."

msgid "Godot 3.2 will get new audio features"
msgstr "Godot 3.2 ຈະມີຟີເຈີສຽງໃໝ່ໆ"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a buffer of the size [param amount] can be "
"pushed to the audio sample data buffer without overflowing it, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັບເຟີຂະໜາດ [param amount] ສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງ (pushed) "
"ໄປຫາບັບເຟີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນລົ້ນ (overflow), ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ແມ່ນສົ່ງ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Clears the audio sample data buffer."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນບັບເຟີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of frames that can be pushed to the audio sample data "
"buffer without overflowing it. If the result is [code]0[/code], the buffer is "
"full."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ສາມາດສົ່ງໄປຫາບັບເຟີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນລົ້ນ. ຖ້າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ "
"[code]0[/code], ສະແດງວ່າບັບເຟີເຕັມແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of times the playback skipped due to a buffer underrun in "
"the audio sample data. This value is reset at the start of the playback."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຂ້າມໄປ ເນື່ອງຈາກເກີດ buffer underrun ໃນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລ້າງໃໝ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Pushes several audio data frames to the buffer. This is usually more "
"efficient than [method push_frame] in C# and compiled languages via "
"GDExtension, but [method push_buffer] may be [i]less[/i] efficient in "
"GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຽງຫຼາຍໆເຟຣມເຂົ້າຫາບັບເຟີ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າ [method push_frame] "
"ໃນພາສາ C# ແລະ ພາສາທີ່ຄອມພາຍຜ່ານ GDExtension, ແຕ່ [method push_buffer] "
"ອາດຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບ [i]ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ[/i] ໃນ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Pushes a single audio data frame to the buffer. This is usually less "
"efficient than [method push_buffer] in C# and compiled languages via "
"GDExtension, but [method push_frame] may be [i]more[/i] efficient in GDScript."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຽງພຽງເຟຣມດຽວເຂົ້າຫາບັບເຟີ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບໜ້ອຍກວ່າ [method "
"push_buffer] ໃນພາສາ C# ແລະ ພາສາທີ່ຄອມພາຍຜ່ານ GDExtension, ແຕ່ [method push_frame] "
"ອາດຈະມີປະສິດທິພາບ [i]ຫຼາຍກວ່າ[/i] ໃນ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Audio stream that can playback music interactively, combining clips and a "
"transition table."
msgstr ""
"ສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນເພງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ (interactive), ໂດຍການລວມຄລິບສຽງ ແລະ "
"ຕາຕະລາງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (transition table)."

msgid ""
"This is an audio stream that can playback music interactively, combining "
"clips and a transition table. Clips must be added first, and then the "
"transition rules via the [method add_transition]. Additionally, this stream "
"exports a property parameter to control the playback via [AudioStreamPlayer], "
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D], or [AudioStreamPlayer3D].\n"
"The way this is used is by filling a number of clips, then configuring the "
"transition table. From there, clips are selected for playback and the music "
"will smoothly go from the current to the new one while using the "
"corresponding transition rule defined in the transition table."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນເພງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໂດຍລວມຄລິບສຽງ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ. "
"ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄລິບສຽງເຂົ້າໄປກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງກຳນົດກົດການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຜ່ານ [method add_transition]. "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສະຕຣີມນີ້ຍັງສົ່ງອອກພາຣາມິເຕີພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການຫຼິ້ນຜ່ານ [AudioStreamPlayer], "
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D], ຫຼື [AudioStreamPlayer3D].\n"
"ວິທີການໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ຄືການຕື່ມຄລິບສຽງຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງເຂົ້າໄປ, ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາຕະລາງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, "
"ເມື່ອເລືອກຄລິບທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນ, ເພງຈະປ່ຽນຈາກຄລິບປະຈຸບັນໄປຫາຄລິບໃໝ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid ""
"Add a transition between two clips. Provide the indices of the source and "
"destination clips, or use the [constant CLIP_ANY] constant to indicate that "
"transition happens to/from any clip to this one.\n"
"* [param from_time] indicates the moment in the current clip the transition "
"will begin after triggered.\n"
"* [param to_time] indicates the time in the next clip that the playback will "
"start from.\n"
"* [param fade_mode] indicates how the fade will happen between clips. If "
"unsure, just use [constant FADE_AUTOMATIC] which uses the most common type of "
"fade for each situation.\n"
"* [param fade_beats] indicates how many beats the fade will take. Using "
"decimals is allowed.\n"
"* [param use_filler_clip] indicates that there will be a filler clip used "
"between the source and destination clips.\n"
"* [param filler_clip] the index of the filler clip.\n"
"* If [param hold_previous] is used, then this clip will be remembered. This "
"can be used together with [constant AUTO_ADVANCE_RETURN_TO_HOLD] to return to "
"this clip after another is done playing."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງສອງຄລິບ. ລະບຸດັດຊະນີຂອງຄລິບຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ປາຍທາງ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [constant "
"CLIP_ANY] ເພື່ອບອກວ່າການປ່ຽນຜ່ານເກີດຂຶ້ນ ຈາກ/ໄປຫາ ຄລິບໃດກໍ່ໄດ້.\n"
"* [param from_time] ລະບຸຊ່ວງເວລາໃນຄລິບປະຈຸບັນທີ່ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼັງຈາກຖືກກະຕຸ້ນ.\n"
"* [param to_time] ລະບຸເວລາໃນຄລິບຖັດໄປທີ່ການຫຼິ້ນຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"* [param fade_mode] ລະບຸວິທີການເຟດ (fade) ລະຫວ່າງຄລິບ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant "
"FADE_AUTOMATIC] ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ປະເພດການເຟດທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສະຖານະການ.\n"
"* [param fade_beats] ລະບຸວ່າການເຟດຈະໃຊ້ຈຳນວນຈັກຈັງຫວະ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໄດ້.\n"
"* [param use_filler_clip] ລະບຸວ່າຈະມີການໃຊ້ຄລິບຂັ້ນກາງ (filler clip) ລະຫວ່າງຄລິບຕົ້ນທາງ "
"ແລະ ປາຍທາງ.\n"
"* [param filler_clip] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງຄລິບຂັ້ນກາງ.\n"
"* ຖ້າໃຊ້ [param hold_previous], ຄລິບນີ້ຈະຖືກຈົດຈຳໄວ້. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant "
"AUTO_ADVANCE_RETURN_TO_HOLD] ເພື່ອກັບມາຫາຄລິບນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິບອື່ນຫຼິ້ນຈົບ."

msgid ""
"Erase a transition by providing [param from_clip] and [param to_clip] clip "
"indices. [constant CLIP_ANY] can be used for either argument or both."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານໂດຍການລະບຸດັດຊະນີຄລິບ [param from_clip] ແລະ [param to_clip]. ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[constant CLIP_ANY] ສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ທັງສອງກໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Return whether a clip has auto-advance enabled. See [method "
"set_clip_auto_advance]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າຄລິບໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto-advance) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_clip_auto_advance]."

msgid ""
"Return the clip towards which the clip referenced by [param clip_index] will "
"auto-advance to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄລິບທີ່ຄລິບອ້າງອີງໂດຍ [param clip_index] ຈະເລື່ອນໄປຫາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Return the name of a clip."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງຄລິບ."

msgid "Return the [AudioStream] associated with a clip."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioStream] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄລິບ."

msgid ""
"Return the time (in beats) for a transition (see [method add_transition])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າເວລາ (ເປັນຈັງຫວະ) ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_transition])."

msgid "Return the mode for a transition (see [method add_transition])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າໂໝດສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_transition])."

msgid "Return the filler clip for a transition (see [method add_transition])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄລິບຂັ້ນກາງສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_transition])."

msgid ""
"Return the source time position for a transition (see [method "
"add_transition])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງເວລາຕົ້ນທາງສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_transition])."

msgid "Return the list of transitions (from, to interleaved)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍການຂອງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ຕົ້ນທາງ, ປາຍທາງ ແບບສະຫຼັບກັນ)."

msgid ""
"Return the destination time position for a transition (see [method "
"add_transition])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງເວລາປາຍທາງສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_transition])."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a given transition exists (was added via [method "
"add_transition])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ຖືກເພີ່ມຜ່ານ [method "
"add_transition])."

msgid ""
"Return whether a transition uses the [i]hold previous[/i] functionality (see "
"[method add_transition])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າການປ່ຽນຜ່ານມີການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [i]hold previous[/i] ຫຼື ບໍ່ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"add_transition])."

msgid ""
"Return whether a transition uses the [i]filler clip[/i] functionality (see "
"[method add_transition])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າການປ່ຽນຜ່ານມີການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [i]filler clip[/i] ຫຼື ບໍ່ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"add_transition])."

msgid "Set whether a clip will auto-advance by changing the auto-advance mode."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຄລິບຈະເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການປ່ຽນໂໝດການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Set the index of the next clip towards which this clip will auto advance to "
"when finished. If the clip being played loops, then auto-advance will be "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງຄລິບຖັດໄປທີ່ຄລິບນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນໄປຫາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຫຼິ້ນຈົບ. ຖ້າຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນມີການວົນຊໍ້າ "
"(loop), ການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid "Set the name of the current clip (for easier identification)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບຄລິບປະຈຸບັນ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບຸໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ)."

msgid "Set the [AudioStream] associated with the current clip."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [AudioStream] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄລິບປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Amount of clips contained in this interactive player."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄລິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນແບບໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້."

msgid ""
"Index of the initial clip, which will be played first when this stream is "
"played."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີຂອງຄລິບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດເມື່ອສະຕຣີມນີ້ຖືກຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Start transition as soon as possible, don't wait for any specific time "
"position."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການປ່ຽນຜ່ານໃຫ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Transition when the clip playback position reaches the next beat."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຜ່ານເມື່ອຕຳແໜ່ງການຫຼິ້ນຄລິບຮອດຈັງຫວະຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Transition when the clip playback position reaches the next bar."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຜ່ານເມື່ອຕຳແໜ່ງການຫຼິ້ນຄລິບຮອດຫ້ອງເພງຖັດໄປ."

msgid "Transition when the current clip finished playing."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຜ່ານເມື່ອຄລິບປະຈຸບັນຫຼິ້ນຈົບ."

msgid ""
"Transition to the same position in the destination clip. This is useful when "
"both clips have exactly the same length and the music should fade between "
"them."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຜ່ານໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນໃນຄລິບປາຍທາງ. ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທັງສອງຄລິບມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເພງເຟດລະຫວ່າງກັນ."

msgid "Transition to the start of the destination clip."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຜ່ານໄປຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄລິບປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"Transition to the last played position in the destination clip, if there was "
"a previous transition from that clip. Otherwise, plays from the start of the "
"destination clip."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຜ່ານໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນຄລິບປາຍທາງ, ຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນຜ່ານມາກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈາກຄລິບນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະຫຼິ້ນຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄລິບປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"Do not use fade for the transition. This is useful when transitioning from a "
"clip-end to clip-beginning, and each clip has their begin/end."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ໃຊ້ການເຟດສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກຕອນຈົບຄລິບໄປຫາຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄລິບໃໝ່ "
"ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະຄລິບມີຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ/ຈົບ ຂອງມັນເອງ."

msgid "Use a fade-in in the next clip, let the current clip finish."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການເຟດເຂົ້າ (fade-in) ໃນຄລິບຖັດໄປ, ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄລິບປະຈຸບັນຫຼິ້ນໃຫ້ຈົບ."

msgid "Use a fade-out in the current clip, the next clip will start by itself."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການເຟດອອກ (fade-out) ໃນຄລິບປະຈຸບັນ, ຄລິບຖັດໄປຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid "Use a cross-fade between clips."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການເຟດສະຫຼັບກັນ (cross-fade) ລະຫວ່າງຄລິບ."

msgid ""
"Use automatic fade logic depending on the transition from/to. It is "
"recommended to use this by default."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ລະບົບການເຟດອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈາກ/ໄປຫາ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Disable auto-advance (default)."
msgstr "ປິດການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Enable auto-advance, a clip must be specified."
msgstr "ເປີດການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຕ້ອງລະບຸຄລິບທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນໄປ."

msgid ""
"Enable auto-advance, but instead of specifying a clip, the playback will "
"return to hold (see [method add_transition])."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດການເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ແທນທີ່ຈະລະບຸຄລິບ, ການຫຼິ້ນຈະກັບໄປຫາຄລິບທີ່ຖືກຈຳໄວ້ (hold) (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method add_transition])."

msgid ""
"This constant describes that any clip is valid for a specific transition as "
"either source or destination."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ອະທິບາຍວ່າຄລິບໃດກໍ່ຕາມສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຕົ້ນທາງ ຫຼື ປາຍທາງ."

msgid "Plays real-time audio input data."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນຂໍ້ມູນສຽງຂາເຂົ້າແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌."

msgid ""
"When used directly in an [AudioStreamPlayer] node, [AudioStreamMicrophone] "
"plays back microphone input in real-time. This can be used in conjunction "
"with [AudioEffectCapture] to process the data or save it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] must be "
"[code]true[/code] for audio input to work. See also that setting's "
"description for caveats related to permissions and operating system privacy "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງໃນໂນດ [AudioStreamPlayer], [AudioStreamMicrophone] "
"ຈະຫຼິ້ນສຽງຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌. ອັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [AudioEffectCapture] "
"ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ບັນທຶກມັນໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ProjectSettings.audio/driver/enable_input] ຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຮັບສຽງເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງເລື່ອງການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid "Audio Mic Record Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການບັນທຶກສຽງຈາກໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ"

msgid "MP3 audio stream driver."
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີສະຕຣີມສຽງ MP3."

msgid ""
"MP3 audio stream driver. See [member data] if you want to load an MP3 file at "
"run-time. More info can be found in [ResourceImporterMP3].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class can optionally support legacy MP1 and MP2 formats, "
"provided that the engine is compiled with the "
"[code]minimp3_extra_formats=yes[/code] SCons option. These extra formats are "
"not enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"ໄດຣເວີສະຕຣີມສຽງ MP3. ເບິ່ງ [member data] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ MP3 ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣັນທາມ "
"(run-time). ສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນ [ResourceImporterMP3].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບເກົ່າແກ່ຢ່າງ MP1 ແລະ MP2 ໄດ້, "
"ຫາກເອນຈິນຖືກຄອມພາຍດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ SCons [code]minimp3_extra_formats=yes[/code]. "
"ຮູບແບບພິເສດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Runtime file loading and saving"
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ໃນຂະນະຣັນທາມ"

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamMP3] instance from the given buffer. The buffer "
"must contain MP3 data."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [AudioStreamMP3] instance ໃໝ່ຈາກບັບເຟີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ບັບເຟີຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ MP3."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamMP3] instance from the given file path. The file "
"must be in MP3 format."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [AudioStreamMP3] instance ໃໝ່ຈາກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file path) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ MP3."

msgid "The number of beats within a single bar in the audio track."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະພາຍໃນໜຶ່ງຫ້ອງເພງ (bar) ໃນແທຣັກສຽງ."

msgid ""
"The length of the audio track, in beats. The actual duration of the audio "
"file might be longer than what is indicated by this property. It defines the "
"end of the audio for looping, [AudioStreamPlaylist], and "
"[AudioStreamInteractive]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ ເປັນຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະ. "
"ໄລຍະເວລາຕົວຈິງຂອງໄຟລ໌ສຽງອາດຈະຍາວກວ່າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້. ມັນກຳນົດຈຸດຈົບຂອງສຽງສຳລັບການວົນຊໍ້າ "
"(looping), [AudioStreamPlaylist], ແລະ [AudioStreamInteractive]."

msgid "The tempo of the audio track, measured in beats per minute."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວ (tempo) ຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ, ວັດແທກເປັນຈຳນວນຈັງຫວະຕໍ່ນາທີ (BPM)."

msgid ""
"Contains the audio data in bytes.\n"
"You can load a file without having to import it beforehand using the code "
"snippet below. Keep in mind that this snippet loads the whole file into "
"memory and may not be ideal for huge files (hundreds of megabytes or more).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func load_mp3(path):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar sound = AudioStreamMP3.new()\n"
"\tsound.data = file.get_buffer(file.get_length())\n"
"\treturn sound\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public AudioStreamMP3 LoadMP3(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tvar sound = new AudioStreamMP3();\n"
"\tsound.Data = file.GetBuffer(file.GetLength());\n"
"\treturn sound;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເປັນໄບຕ໌ (bytes).\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງທຳການນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. "
"ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຈະໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (RAM) "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍເມກາໄບຕ໌ຂຶ້ນໄປ).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func load_mp3(path):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar sound = AudioStreamMP3.new()\n"
"\tsound.data = file.get_buffer(file.get_length())\n"
"\treturn sound\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public AudioStreamMP3 LoadMP3(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tvar sound = new AudioStreamMP3();\n"
"\tsound.Data = file.GetBuffer(file.GetLength());\n"
"\treturn sound;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the stream will play again from the specified [member "
"loop_offset] once it reaches the end of the audio track, or once it reaches "
"the end of the last beat according to the amount specified in [member "
"beat_count]. Useful for ambient sounds and background music."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຕຣີມຈະຫຼິ້ນຊໍ້າອີກຄັ້ງຈາກ [member loop_offset] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ "
"ເມື່ອມັນຮອດຕອນຈົບຂອງແທຣັກສຽງ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອຮອດຕອນຈົບຂອງຈັງຫວະສຸດທ້າຍຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member "
"beat_count]. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສຽງບັນຍາກາດ (ambient) ແລະ ເພງປະກອບພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Time in seconds at which the stream starts after being looped."
msgstr "ເວລາເປັນວິນາທີທີ່ສະຕຣີມຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການວົນຊໍ້າ (looped)."

msgid "A class representing an Ogg Vorbis audio stream."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງ Ogg Vorbis."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamOggVorbis] instance from the given buffer. The "
"buffer must contain Ogg Vorbis data."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [AudioStreamOggVorbis] instance ໃໝ່ຈາກບັບເຟີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ບັບເຟີຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ Ogg "
"Vorbis."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamOggVorbis] instance from the given file path. The "
"file must be in Ogg Vorbis format."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [AudioStreamOggVorbis] instance ໃໝ່ຈາກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ Ogg "
"Vorbis."

msgid "Contains the raw Ogg data for this stream."
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ Ogg ແບບດິບ (raw) ສຳລັບສະຕຣີມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Contains user-defined tags if found in the Ogg Vorbis data.\n"
"Commonly used tags include [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], "
"[code]album[/code], [code]tracknumber[/code], and [code]date[/code] "
"([code]date[/code] does not have a standard date format).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] No tag is [i]guaranteed[/i] to be present in every file, so make "
"sure to account for the keys not always existing."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍແທັກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ ຫາກກວດພົບໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Ogg Vorbis.\n"
"ແທັກທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປລວມມີ [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], [code]album[/code], "
"[code]tracknumber[/code], ແລະ [code]date[/code] ([code]date[/code] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບວັນທີທີ່ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີການ [i]ຮັບປະກັນ[/i] ວ່າຈະມີແທັກໃນທຸກໆໄຟລ໌, ສະນັ້ນ ຄວນກວດສອບກໍລະນີທີ່ ຄີ "
"(keys) ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Meta class for playing back audio."
msgstr "ເມຕາຄລາສສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Can play, loop, pause a scroll through audio. See [AudioStream] and "
"[AudioStreamOggVorbis] for usage."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນ, ວົນຊໍ້າ, ຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ເລື່ອນຜ່ານສຽງໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [AudioStream] ແລະ "
"[AudioStreamOggVorbis] ສຳລັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Should return how many times this audio stream has "
"looped. Most built-in playbacks always return [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ໄດ້ວົນຊໍ້າໄປຈັກຄັ້ງແລ້ວ. "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງລະບົບຫຼິ້ນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Return the current value of a playback parameter by name (see [method "
"AudioStream._get_parameter_list])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າປະຈຸບັນຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີການຫຼິ້ນຕາມຊື່ (ເບິ່ງ [method AudioStream._get_parameter_list])."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Should return the current progress along the audio "
"stream, in seconds."
msgstr "ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າຄວາມຄືບໜ້າປະຈຸບັນຂອງສະຕຣີມສຽງ ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Should return [code]true[/code] if this playback is "
"active and playing its audio stream."
msgstr ""
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຄວນສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຫຼິ້ນນີ້ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ "
"ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມສຽງຂອງມັນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize how the audio stream is mixed. This method "
"is called even if the playback is not active.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not useful to override this method in GDScript or C#. Only "
"GDExtension can take advantage of it."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການປະສົມ (mix) ສະຕຣີມສຽງ. "
"ເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການຫຼິ້ນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ກໍ່ຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript ຫຼື C#. ສະເພາະ GDExtension "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize what happens when seeking this audio stream "
"at the given [param position], such as by calling [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer.seek]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທຳການຄົ້ນຫາ (seeking) ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນສະຕຣີມສຽງນີ້ ທີ່ "
"[param position] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method AudioStreamPlayer.seek]."

msgid ""
"Set the current value of a playback parameter by name (see [method "
"AudioStream._get_parameter_list])."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະຈຸບັນຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີການຫຼິ້ນຕາມຊື່ (ເບິ່ງ [method AudioStream._get_parameter_list])."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize what happens when the playback starts at "
"the given position, such as by calling [method AudioStreamPlayer.play]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອການຫຼິ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method AudioStreamPlayer.play]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to customize what happens when the playback is stopped, "
"such as by calling [method AudioStreamPlayer.stop]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອການຫຼິ້ນຖືກຢຸດ, ເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer.stop]."

msgid ""
"Overridable method. Called whenever the audio stream is mixed if the playback "
"is active and [method AudioServer.set_enable_tagging_used_audio_streams] has "
"been set to [code]true[/code]. Editor plugins may use this method to \"tag\" "
"the current position along the audio stream and display it in a preview."
msgstr ""
"ເມັດທອດທີ່ຂຽນທັບໄດ້. ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ສະຕຣີມສຽງຖືກປະສົມ ຫາກການຫຼິ້ນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ [method "
"AudioServer.set_enable_tagging_used_audio_streams] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ປລັກອິນຂອງ Editor ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ \"tag\" ຕຳແໜ່ງປະຈຸບັນໃນສະຕຣີມສຽງ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງມັນໃນຕົວຢ່າງ (preview)."

msgid "Returns the number of times the stream has looped."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ສະຕຣີມໄດ້ວົນຊໍ້າ."

msgid "Returns the current position in the stream, in seconds."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງປະຈຸບັນໃນສະຕຣີມ ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AudioSamplePlayback] associated with this [AudioStreamPlayback] "
"for playing back the audio sample of this stream."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioSamplePlayback] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [AudioStreamPlayback] ນີ້ "
"ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງຂອງສະຕຣີມນີ້."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the stream is playing."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Mixes up to [param frames] of audio from the stream from the current "
"position, at a rate of [param rate_scale], advancing the stream.\n"
"Returns a [PackedVector2Array] where each element holds the left and right "
"channel volume levels of each frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Can return fewer frames than requested, make sure to use the "
"size of the return value."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມ (Mixes) ສຽງສູງສຸດ [param frames] ເຟຣມ ຈາກສະຕຣີມໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງປະຈຸບັນ, ດ້ວຍອັດຕາ "
"[param rate_scale], ແລະ ເລື່ອນສະຕຣີມໄປ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedVector2Array] ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບຈະເກັບລະດັບສຽງຂອງຊ່ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ "
"ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນເຟຣມໜ້ອຍກວ່າທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ກວດສອບຂະໜາດຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid "Seeks the stream at the given [param time], in seconds."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ (Seeks) ຕຳແໜ່ງໃນສະຕຣີມທີ່ [param time] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Associates [AudioSamplePlayback] to this [AudioStreamPlayback] for playing "
"back the audio sample of this stream."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງ [AudioSamplePlayback] ໃສ່ກັບ [AudioStreamPlayback] ນີ້ "
"ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງຂອງສະຕຣີມນີ້."

msgid "Starts the stream from the given [param from_pos], in seconds."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມຈາກ [param from_pos] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid "Stops the stream."
msgstr "ຢຸດສະຕຣີມ."

msgid "Playback component of [AudioStreamInteractive]."
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບການຫຼິ້ນ (Playback component) ຂອງ [AudioStreamInteractive]."

msgid ""
"Playback component of [AudioStreamInteractive]. Contains functions to change "
"the currently played clip."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບການຫຼິ້ນຂອງ [AudioStreamInteractive]. "
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Return the index of the currently playing clip. You can use this to get the "
"name of the currently playing clip with [method "
"AudioStreamInteractive.get_clip_name].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Get the currently playing clip name from inside an "
"[AudioStreamPlayer] node.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var playing_clip_name = "
"stream.get_clip_name(get_stream_playback().get_current_clip_index())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອເອົາຊື່ຂອງຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[method AudioStreamInteractive.get_clip_name].\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ການເອົາຊື່ຂອງຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຈາກພາຍໃນໂນດ [AudioStreamPlayer].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var playing_clip_name = "
"stream.get_clip_name(get_stream_playback().get_current_clip_index())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Switch to a clip (by index)."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບໄປຫາຄລິບ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ດັດຊະນີ)."

msgid "Switch to a clip (by name)."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບໄປຫາຄລິບ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່)."

msgid "Playback class used for [AudioStreamOggVorbis]."
msgstr "ຄລາສການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [AudioStreamOggVorbis]."

msgid ""
"Playback component of [AudioStreamOggVorbis]. Uses "
"[OggPacketSequencePlayback] for playback data."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບການຫຼິ້ນຂອງ [AudioStreamOggVorbis]. ໃຊ້ [OggPacketSequencePlayback] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Playback class used for [AudioStreamPlaylist]."
msgstr "ຄລາສການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [AudioStreamPlaylist]."

msgid ""
"Playback component of [AudioStreamPlaylist]. Handles the playback of multiple "
"[AudioStream]s in sequence."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບການຫຼິ້ນຂອງ [AudioStreamPlaylist]. ຈັດການການຫຼິ້ນ [AudioStream] "
"ຫຼາຍໆອັນຕາມລຳດັບ."

msgid "Playback instance for [AudioStreamPolyphonic]."
msgstr "Instance ການຫຼິ້ນສຳລັບ [AudioStreamPolyphonic]."

msgid ""
"Playback instance for [AudioStreamPolyphonic]. After setting the "
"[code]stream[/code] property of [AudioStreamPlayer], [AudioStreamPlayer2D], "
"or [AudioStreamPlayer3D], the playback instance can be obtained by calling "
"[method AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback], [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer2D.get_stream_playback] or [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.get_stream_playback] methods."
msgstr ""
"Instance ການຫຼິ້ນສຳລັບ [AudioStreamPolyphonic]. ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ [code]stream[/"
"code] ຂອງ [AudioStreamPlayer], [AudioStreamPlayer2D], ຫຼື [AudioStreamPlayer3D] "
"ແລ້ວ, ສາມາດເອົາ instance ການຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດ [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback], [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer2D.get_stream_playback] ຫຼື [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.get_stream_playback]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the stream associated with the given integer ID "
"is still playing. Check [method play_stream] for information on when this ID "
"becomes invalid."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຕຣີມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ integer ID ທີ່ກຳນົດຍັງກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່. ກວດສອບ "
"[method play_stream] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນວ່າເມື່ອໃດ ID ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Play an [AudioStream] at a given offset, volume, pitch scale, playback type, "
"and bus. Playback starts immediately.\n"
"The return value is a unique integer ID that is associated to this playback "
"stream and which can be used to control it.\n"
"This ID becomes invalid when the stream ends (if it does not loop), when the "
"[AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic] is stopped, or when [method stop_stream] is "
"called.\n"
"This function returns [constant INVALID_ID] if the amount of streams "
"currently playing equals [member AudioStreamPolyphonic.polyphony]. If you "
"need a higher amount of maximum polyphony, raise this value."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼິ້ນ [AudioStream] ຕາມຄ່າ offset, volume, pitch scale, playback type, ແລະ bus "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ການຫຼິ້ນຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທັນທີ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ integer ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ ເຊິ່ງກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສະຕຣີມການຫຼິ້ນນີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມມັນໄດ້.\n"
"ID ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເມື່ອສະຕຣີມຈົບລົງ (ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ວົນຊໍ້າ), ເມື່ອ [AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic] "
"ຖືກຢຸດ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method stop_stream].\n"
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant INVALID_ID] ຖ້າຈຳນວນສະຕຣີມທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນເທົ່າກັບ [member "
"AudioStreamPolyphonic.polyphony]. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈຳນວນ polyphony ສູງສຸດທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Change the stream pitch scale. The [param stream] argument is an integer ID "
"returned by [method play_stream]."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ (pitch scale) ຂອງສະຕຣີມ. ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param stream] ແມ່ນ integer ID "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [method play_stream]."

msgid ""
"Change the stream volume (in db). The [param stream] argument is an integer "
"ID returned by [method play_stream]."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນລະດັບຄວາມດັງ (volume) ຂອງສະຕຣີມ (ເປັນ dB). ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param stream] ແມ່ນ integer "
"ID ທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [method play_stream]."

msgid ""
"Stop a stream. The [param stream] argument is an integer ID returned by "
"[method play_stream], which becomes invalid after calling this function."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດສະຕຣີມ. ພາຣາມິເຕີ [param stream] ແມ່ນ integer ID ທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ [method play_stream], "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returned by [method play_stream] in case it could not allocate a stream for "
"playback."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method play_stream] ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດສັນ (allocate) ສະຕຣີມສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນໄດ້."

msgid "Playback class used for resampled [AudioStream]s."
msgstr "ຄລາສການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [AudioStream] ທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນອັດຕາສຸ່ມ (resampled)."

msgid ""
"Playback class used to mix an [AudioStream]'s audio samples to [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate] using cubic interpolation."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະສົມຕົວຢ່າງສຽງຂອງ [AudioStream] ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບ [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate] ໂດຍໃຊ້ການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄິວບິກ (cubic interpolation)."

msgid ""
"Returns an [AudioStream]'s sample rate, in Hz. Used to perform resampling."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [AudioStream] ເປັນ Hz. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອທຳການປ່ຽນອັດຕາສຸ່ມ (resampling)."

msgid ""
"Called by [method begin_resample] to mix an [AudioStream] to [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate]. Uses [method _get_stream_sampling_rate] as the "
"source sample rate. Returns the number of mixed frames."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍ [method begin_resample] ເພື່ອປະສົມ [AudioStream] ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບ [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate]. ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method _get_stream_sampling_rate] "
"ເປັນອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຕົ້ນທາງ. ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຳນວນເຟຣມທີ່ຖືກປະສົມແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Called when an [AudioStream] is played. Clears the cubic interpolation "
"history and starts mixing by calling [method _mix_resampled]."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [AudioStream] ຖືກຫຼິ້ນ. ຈະລ້າງປະຫວັດການແຊກຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄິວບິກ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມການປະສົມສຽງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method _mix_resampled]."

msgid "Playback class used for [AudioStreamSynchronized]."
msgstr "ຄລາສການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [AudioStreamSynchronized]."

msgid ""
"Playback component of [AudioStreamSynchronized]. Handles the playback of "
"multiple [AudioStream]s in synchrony."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບການຫຼິ້ນຂອງ [AudioStreamSynchronized]. ຈັດການການຫຼິ້ນ [AudioStream] "
"ຫຼາຍໆອັນໃຫ້ພ້ອມພຽງກັນ (synchrony)."

msgid "A node for audio playback."
msgstr "ໂນດສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ."

msgid ""
"The [AudioStreamPlayer] node plays an audio stream non-positionally. It is "
"ideal for user interfaces, menus, or background music.\n"
"To use this node, [member stream] needs to be set to a valid [AudioStream] "
"resource. Playing more than one sound at the same time is also supported, see "
"[member max_polyphony].\n"
"If you need to play audio at a specific position, use [AudioStreamPlayer2D] "
"or [AudioStreamPlayer3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [AudioStreamPlayer] ໃຊ້ຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມສຽງແບບບໍ່ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ (non-positionally). "
"ມັນເໝາະສຳລັບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI), ເມນູ, ຫຼື ເພງປະກອບພື້ນຫຼັງ.\n"
"ໃນການໃຊ້ໂນດນີ້, ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member stream] ໃຫ້ເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [AudioStream] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຮອງຮັບການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງສຽງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ, ເບິ່ງ [member max_polyphony].\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼິ້ນສຽງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [AudioStreamPlayer2D] ຫຼື "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position in the [AudioStream] of the latest sound, in seconds. "
"Returns [code]0.0[/code] if no sounds are playing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The position is not always accurate, as the [AudioServer] does "
"not mix audio every processed frame. To get more accurate results, add "
"[method AudioServer.get_time_since_last_mix] to the returned position.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method always returns [code]0.0[/code] if the [member "
"stream] is an [AudioStreamInteractive], since it can have multiple clips "
"playing at once."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ [AudioStream] ຂອງສຽງຫຼ້າສຸດ ເປັນວິນາທີ. ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສຽງໃດກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕຳແໜ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນສະເໝີໄປ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ [AudioServer] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ປະສົມສຽງໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມທີ່ປະມວນຜົນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ບວກ [method "
"AudioServer.get_time_since_last_mix] ເຂົ້າກັບຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ສະເໝີ ຖ້າ [member stream] ເປັນ "
"[AudioStreamInteractive], ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນສາມາດມີຫຼາຍຄລິບຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the latest [AudioStreamPlayback] of this node, usually the most "
"recently created by [method play]. If no sounds are playing, this method "
"fails and returns an empty playback."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [AudioStreamPlayback] ຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງໂນດນີ້, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນອັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍ [method "
"play]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສຽງໃດກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່, ເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າການຫຼິ້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any sound is active, even if [member "
"stream_paused] is set to [code]true[/code]. See also [member playing] and "
"[method get_stream_playback]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີສຽງໃດໜຶ່ງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member stream_paused] "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ກໍ່ຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [member playing] ແລະ [method "
"get_stream_playback] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Plays a sound from the beginning, or the given [param from_position] in "
"seconds."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສຽງຈາກຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ຈາກ [param from_position] ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Restarts all sounds to be played from the given [param to_position], in "
"seconds. Does nothing if no sounds are playing."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນທຸກສຽງໃໝ່ຈາກ [param to_position] ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນວິນາທີ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງຖ້າບໍ່ມີສຽງໃດກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່."

msgid "Stops all sounds from this node."
msgstr "ຢຸດທຸກສຽງຈາກໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node calls [method play] when entering the tree."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method play] ເມື່ອມັນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ "
"(scene tree)."

msgid ""
"The target bus name. All sounds from this node will be playing on this bus.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] At runtime, if no bus with the given name exists, all sounds "
"will fall back on [code]\"Master\"[/code]. See also [method "
"AudioServer.get_bus_name]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງບັສເປົ້າໝາຍ. ທຸກສຽງຈາກໂນດນີ້ຈະຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນບັສນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນເວລາຣັນທາມ, ຖ້າບໍ່ມີບັສທີ່ມີຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດຢູ່, ທຸກສຽງຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ບັສ [code]"
"\"Master\"[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method AudioServer.get_bus_name] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of sounds this node can play at the same time. Calling "
"[method play] after this value is reached will cut off the oldest sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສຽງສູງສຸດທີ່ໂນດນີ້ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method play] ຫຼັງຈາກຄ່ານີ້ຮອດກຳນົດ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ເກົ່າທີ່ສຸດຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid ""
"The mix target channels. Has no effect when two speakers or less are detected "
"(see [enum AudioServer.SpeakerMode])."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງທາງການປະສົມເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອກວດພົບລຳໂພງສອງຕົວຫຼືໜ້ອຍກວ່າ (ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"AudioServer.SpeakerMode])."

msgid ""
"The audio's pitch and tempo, as a multiplier of the [member stream]'s sample "
"rate. A value of [code]2.0[/code] doubles the audio's pitch, while a value of "
"[code]0.5[/code] halves the pitch."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ (tempo) ຂອງສຽງ, ເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [member "
"stream]. ຄ່າ [code]2.0[/code] ຈະເພີ່ມລະດັບສຽງເປັນສອງເທົ່າ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0.5[/"
"code] ຈະຫຼຸດລະດັບສຽງລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"The playback type of the stream player. If set other than to the default "
"value, it will force that playback type."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການຫຼິ້ນ (playback type) ຂອງເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປະເພດການຫຼິ້ນນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node is playing sounds. Setting this property has "
"the same effect as [method play] and [method stop]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດນີ້ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນສຽງຢູ່. ການຕັ້ງພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້ມີຜົນຄືກັນກັບການໃຊ້ [method "
"play] ແລະ [method stop]."

msgid ""
"The [AudioStream] resource to be played. Setting this property stops all "
"currently playing sounds. If left empty, the [AudioStreamPlayer] does not "
"work."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [AudioStream] ທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້ຈະຢຸດທຸກສຽງທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ. "
"ຖ້າປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, [AudioStreamPlayer] ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the sounds are paused. Setting [member stream_paused] "
"to [code]false[/code] resumes all sounds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is automatically changed when exiting or entering "
"the tree, or this node is paused (see [member Node.process_mode])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ. ການຕັ້ງ [member stream_paused] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງທັງໝົດຫຼິ້ນຕໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອອອກ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຖືກສັ່ງໃຫ້ຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (ເບິ່ງ [member Node.process_mode])."

msgid ""
"Volume of sound, in decibels. This is an offset of the [member stream]'s "
"volume.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To convert between decibel and linear energy (like most volume "
"sliders do), use [member volume_linear], or [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] and [method @GlobalScope.linear_to_db]."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງ ເປັນເດຊີເບລ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າ offset ຂອງລະດັບສຽງຂອງ [member stream].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອແປງລະຫວ່າງເດຊີເບລ ແລະ ຄ່າພະລັງງານແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ "
"(ຄືກັບຕົວປັບລະດັບສຽງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member volume_linear], ຫຼື [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] ແລະ [method @GlobalScope.linear_to_db]."

msgid ""
"Volume of sound, as a linear value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This member modifies [member volume_db] for convenience. The "
"returned value is equivalent to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] on [member volume_db]. Setting this member is "
"equivalent to setting [member volume_db] to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.linear_to_db] on a value."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງ ເປັນຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະມາຊິກນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງ [member volume_db] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເທົ່າກັບຜົນຂອງ [method @GlobalScope.db_to_linear] ຈາກ [member "
"volume_db]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member volume_db] ດ້ວຍຜົນຈາກ [method "
"@GlobalScope.linear_to_db]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a sound finishes playing without interruptions. This signal is "
"[i]not[/i] emitted when calling [method stop], or when exiting the tree while "
"sounds are playing."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (Emitted) ເມື່ອສຽງຫຼິ້ນຈົບໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຂັດຈັງຫວະ. ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method stop], ຫຼື ເມື່ອອອກຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກໃນຂະນະທີ່ສຽງກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່."

msgid "The audio will be played only on the first channel. This is the default."
msgstr "ສຽງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນສະເພາະໃນຊ່ອງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The audio will be played on all surround channels."
msgstr "ສຽງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນໃນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງສຽງຮອບທິດທາງ (surround channels)."

msgid ""
"The audio will be played on the second channel, which is usually the center."
msgstr "ສຽງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນໃນຊ່ອງທີ່ສອງ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນລຳໂພງກາງ (center)."

msgid "Plays positional sound in 2D space."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສຽງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2 ມິຕິ (2D space)."

msgid ""
"Plays audio that is attenuated with distance to the listener.\n"
"By default, audio is heard from the screen center. This can be changed by "
"adding an [AudioListener2D] node to the scene and enabling it by calling "
"[method AudioListener2D.make_current] on it.\n"
"See also [AudioStreamPlayer] to play a sound non-positionally.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Hiding an [AudioStreamPlayer2D] node does not disable its audio "
"output. To temporarily disable an [AudioStreamPlayer2D]'s audio output, set "
"[member volume_db] to a very low value like [code]-100[/code] (which isn't "
"audible to human hearing)."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼິ້ນສຽງທີ່ຈະຄ່ອຍໆເບົາລົງ (attenuated) ຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກຕົວຮັບຟັງ.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະໄດ້ຍິນສຽງຈາກກາງໜ້າຈໍ. ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມໂນດ [AudioListener2D] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນສາກ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method AudioListener2D.make_current] ທີ່ໂນດນັ້ນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [AudioStreamPlayer] ປະກອບ ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງແບບບໍ່ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຊື່ອງ (hiding) ໂນດ [AudioStreamPlayer2D] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນການປິດສຽງຂາອອກຂອງມັນ. ເພື່ອປິດສຽງຊົ່ວຄາວ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member volume_db] ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າຫຼາຍໆ "
"ເຊັ່ນ [code]-100[/code] (ເຊິ່ງມະນຸດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຍິນ)."

msgid "Returns the position in the [AudioStream]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງໃນ [AudioStream] ຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AudioStreamPlayback] object associated with this "
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າອັອບເຈັກ [AudioStreamPlayback] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [AudioStreamPlayer2D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the [AudioStreamPlayer] can return the [AudioStreamPlayback] "
"object or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ [AudioStreamPlayer] ສາມາດສົ່ງຄືນອັອບເຈັກ [AudioStreamPlayback] ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Queues the audio to play on the next physics frame, from the given position "
"[param from_position], in seconds."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຄິວ (Queues) ໃຫ້ສຽງຫຼິ້ນໃນເຟຣມຟີຊິກ (physics frame) ຖັດໄປ, ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກ [param "
"from_position] ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid "Sets the position from which audio will be played, in seconds."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນສຽງ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

msgid "Stops the audio."
msgstr "ຢຸດສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Determines which [Area2D] layers affect the sound for reverb and audio bus "
"effects. Areas can be used to redirect [AudioStream]s so that they play in a "
"certain audio bus. An example of how you might use this is making a \"water\" "
"area so that sounds played in the water are redirected through an audio bus "
"to make them sound like they are being played underwater."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າເລເຢີ (layers) ຂອງ [Area2D] ໃດທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສຽງສຳລັບ reverb ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຂອງບັສສຽງ. "
"ພື້ນທີ່ (Areas) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງຂອງ [AudioStream] ໃຫ້ໄປຫຼິ້ນໃນບັສສຽງທີ່ກຳນົດໄດ້. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ການສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ \"ນໍ້າ\" "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໃນນໍ້າຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານບັສສຽງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຄືກັບວ່າກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃຕ້ນໍ້າ."

msgid "The volume is attenuated over distance with this as an exponent."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງຈະຄ່ອຍໆເບົາລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນເລກກຳລັງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], audio plays when added to scene tree."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະຫຼິ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົ້ນໄມ້ສາກ."

msgid ""
"Bus on which this audio is playing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When setting this property, keep in mind that no validation is "
"performed to see if the given name matches an existing bus. This is because "
"audio bus layouts might be loaded after this property is set. If this given "
"name can't be resolved at runtime, it will fall back to [code]\"Master\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ບັສທີ່ສຽງນີ້ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້, ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບວ່າຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸນັ້ນກົງກັບບັສທີ່ມີຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າບັສສຽງ (audio bus layouts) ອາດຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງພຣັອບເພີຕີ້ນີ້. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸໃນເວລາຣັນທາມ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ບັສ [code]\"Master\"[/code]."

msgid "Maximum distance from which audio is still hearable."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ຍັງສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນສຽງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of sounds this node can play at the same time. Playing "
"additional sounds after this value is reached will cut off the oldest sounds."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສຽງສູງສຸດທີ່ໂນດນີ້ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ການຫຼິ້ນສຽງເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼັງຈາກຄ່ານີ້ຮອດກຳນົດ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ເກົ່າທີ່ສຸດຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid ""
"Scales the panning strength for this node by multiplying the base [member "
"ProjectSettings.audio/general/2d_panning_strength] with this factor. Higher "
"values will pan audio from left to right more dramatically than lower values."
msgstr ""
"ປັບລະດັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງການແຍກສຽງຊ້າຍຂວາ (panning) ສຳລັບໂນດນີ້ ໂດຍການຄູນຄ່າພື້ນຖານ [member "
"ProjectSettings.audio/general/2d_panning_strength] ດ້ວຍຕົວຄູນນີ້. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງແຍກຊ້າຍຂວາໄດ້ຊັດເຈນກວ່າຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າ."

msgid ""
"The pitch and the tempo of the audio, as a multiplier of the audio sample's "
"sample rate."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ແລະ ຄວາມໄວ (tempo) ຂອງສຽງ, ເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງອັດຕາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງສຽງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], audio is playing or is queued to be played (see [method "
"play])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ ຫຼື ຖືກຈັດຄິວເພື່ອລໍຖ້າຫຼິ້ນ (ເບິ່ງ [method play])."

msgid "The [AudioStream] object to be played."
msgstr "ອັອບເຈັກ [AudioStream] ທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the playback is paused. You can resume it by setting "
"[member stream_paused] to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຫຼິ້ນຈະຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ. ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼິ້ນຕໍ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member "
"stream_paused] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Base volume before attenuation, in decibels."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງພື້ນຖານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການຫຼຸດລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງ, ເປັນເດຊີເບລ."

msgid ""
"Base volume before attenuation, as a linear value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This member modifies [member volume_db] for convenience. The "
"returned value is equivalent to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] on [member volume_db]. Setting this member is "
"equivalent to setting [member volume_db] to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.linear_to_db] on a value."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບສຽງພື້ນຖານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການຫຼຸດລົງຕາມໄລຍະທາງ, ເປັນຄ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະມາຊິກນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງ [member volume_db] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເທົ່າກັບຜົນຂອງ [method @GlobalScope.db_to_linear] ຈາກ [member "
"volume_db]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member volume_db] ດ້ວຍຜົນຈາກ [method "
"@GlobalScope.linear_to_db]."

msgid "Emitted when the audio stops playing."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອສຽງຢຸດຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Plays positional sound in 3D space."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສຽງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D."

msgid ""
"Plays audio with positional sound effects, based on the relative position of "
"the audio listener. Positional effects include distance attenuation, "
"directionality, and the Doppler effect. For greater realism, a low-pass "
"filter is applied to distant sounds. This can be disabled by setting [member "
"attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz] to [code]20500[/code].\n"
"By default, audio is heard from the camera position. This can be changed by "
"adding an [AudioListener3D] node to the scene and enabling it by calling "
"[method AudioListener3D.make_current] on it.\n"
"See also [AudioStreamPlayer] to play a sound non-positionally.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Hiding an [AudioStreamPlayer3D] node does not disable its audio "
"output. To temporarily disable an [AudioStreamPlayer3D]'s audio output, set "
"[member volume_db] to a very low value like [code]-100[/code] (which isn't "
"audible to human hearing)."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼິ້ນສຽງພ້ອມກັບເອັບເຟັກສຽງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຜູ້ຟັງສຽງ. ເອັບເຟັກຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງລວມມີ "
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມແຮງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງ, ທິດທາງ, ແລະ ປະກົດການດັອບເປີ (Doppler effect). "
"ເພື່ອຄວາມສົມຈິງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຕົວຕອງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (low-pass filter) ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບສຽງທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member attenuation_filter_cutoff_hz] ເປັນ [code]20500[/"
"code].\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສຽງຈະຖືກໄດ້ຍິນຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມໂນດ "
"[AudioListener3D] ເຂົ້າໃນສາກ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"AudioListener3D.make_current].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [AudioStreamPlayer] ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງແບບບໍ່ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຊື່ອງໂນດ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດການສົ່ງສັນຍານສຽງຂອງມັນ. "
"ເພື່ອປິດສຽງຂອງ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ຊົ່ວຄາວ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member volume_db] "
"ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ [code]-100[/code] (ເຊິ່ງຫູມະນຸດບໍ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AudioStreamPlayback] object associated with this "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອັອບເຈັກ [AudioStreamPlayback] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Determines which [Area3D] layers affect the sound for reverb and audio bus "
"effects. Areas can be used to redirect [AudioStream]s so that they play in a "
"certain audio bus. An example of how you might use this is making a \"water\" "
"area so that sounds played in the water are redirected through an audio bus "
"to make them sound like they are being played underwater."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າເລເຢີ [Area3D] ໃດທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ສຽງສຳລັບສຽງກ້ອງ (reverb) ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກບັສສຽງ (audio "
"bus). ພື້ນທີ່ (Areas) ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທິດທາງ [AudioStream] ໃຫ້ໄປຫຼິ້ນໃນບັສສຽງໃດໜຶ່ງ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ການສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ \"ນ້ຳ\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສຽງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນໃນນ້ຳຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານບັສສຽງ "
"ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງຄືກັບວ່າກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃຕ້ນ້ຳ."

msgid ""
"The cutoff frequency of the attenuation low-pass filter, in Hz. A sound above "
"this frequency is attenuated more than a sound below this frequency. To "
"disable this effect, set this to [code]20500[/code] as this frequency is "
"above the human hearing limit."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມຖີ່ຕັດ (cutoff frequency) ຂອງຕົວຕອງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳໃນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສຽງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ Hz. "
"ສຽງທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຫຼາຍກວ່າສຽງທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]20500[/code] ເພາະຄວາມຖີ່ນີ້ສູງກວ່າຂີດຈຳກັດການໄດ້ຍິນຂອງມະນຸດ."

msgid "Amount how much the filter affects the loudness, in decibels."
msgstr "ປະລິມານທີ່ຕົວຕອງມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມດັງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ເດຊີເບລ (decibels)."

msgid ""
"Decides if audio should get quieter with distance linearly, quadratically, "
"logarithmically, or not be affected by distance, effectively disabling "
"attenuation."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າສຽງຄວນຈະຄ່ອຍລົງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບ ເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear), ກຳລັງສອງ (quadratic), ລໍກາຣິດ "
"(logarithmic), ຫຼື ບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີຜົນຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງເລີຍ (ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປິດການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສຽງ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], audio plays when the AudioStreamPlayer3D node is added "
"to scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະຫຼິ້ນເມື່ອໂນດ AudioStreamPlayer3D ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ scene "
"tree."

msgid ""
"The bus on which this audio is playing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When setting this property, keep in mind that no validation is "
"performed to see if the given name matches an existing bus. This is because "
"audio bus layouts might be loaded after this property is set. If this given "
"name can't be resolved at runtime, it will fall back to [code]\"Master\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ບັສ (bus) ທີ່ສຽງນີ້ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບວ່າຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸນັ້ນກົງກັບບັສທີ່ມີຢູ່ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າໂຄງສ້າງບັສສຽງອາດຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້. "
"ຖ້າຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ບັສ [code]\"Master\"[/code] "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Decides in which step the Doppler effect should be calculated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member doppler_tracking] is not [constant "
"DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED] but the current [Camera3D]/[AudioListener3D] has "
"doppler tracking disabled, the Doppler effect will be heard but will not take "
"the movement of the current listener into account. If accurate Doppler effect "
"is desired, doppler tracking should be enabled on both the "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D] and the current [Camera3D]/[AudioListener3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຄວນຄຳນວນປະກົດການດັອບເປີ (Doppler effect) ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນໃດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member doppler_tracking] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant "
"DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED] ແຕ່ [Camera3D]/[AudioListener3D] "
"ປັດຈຸບັນຖືກປິດການຕິດຕາມດັອບເປີໄວ້, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຍິນເອັບເຟັກດັອບເປີ "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະບໍ່ຄຳນວນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ຟັງປັດຈຸບັນເຂົ້າໄປນຳ. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການເອັບເຟັກດັອບເປີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ຄວນເປີດການຕິດຕາມດັອບເປີທັງໃນ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ແລະ [Camera3D]/"
"[AudioListener3D] ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The angle in which the audio reaches a listener unattenuated."
msgstr "ມຸມທີ່ສຽງສົ່ງໄປຫາຜູ້ຟັງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມແຮງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the audio should be attenuated according to the "
"direction of the sound."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະຖືກຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມແຮງຕາມທິດທາງຂອງສຽງ."

msgid ""
"Attenuation factor used if listener is outside of [member "
"emission_angle_degrees] and [member emission_angle_enabled] is set, in "
"decibels."
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ຫາກຜູ້ຟັງຢູ່ນອກ [member emission_angle_degrees] ແລະ ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member emission_angle_enabled], ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ເດຊີເບລ."

msgid "Sets the absolute maximum of the sound level, in decibels."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບສຽງສູງສຸດຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ເດຊີເບລ."

msgid ""
"The distance past which the sound can no longer be heard at all. Only has an "
"effect if set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code]. [member max_distance] "
"works in tandem with [member unit_size]. However, unlike [member unit_size] "
"whose behavior depends on the [member attenuation_model], [member "
"max_distance] always works in a linear fashion. This can be used to prevent "
"the [AudioStreamPlayer3D] from requiring audio mixing when the listener is "
"far away, which saves CPU resources."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ກາຍຈາກນັ້ນໄປຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງເລີຍ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code]. "
"[member max_distance] ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ [member unit_size]. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນບໍ່ຄືກັບ "
"[member unit_size] ທີ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂຶ້ນກັບ [member attenuation_model], ເພາະ [member "
"max_distance] ຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ສະເໝີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D] ຕ້ອງປະສົມສຽງ (audio mixing) ເມື່ອຜູ້ຟັງຢູ່ໄກຫຼາຍ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປະຢັດຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU."

msgid "The [AudioStream] resource to be played."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [AudioStream] ທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The factor for the attenuation effect. Higher values make the sound audible "
"over a larger distance."
msgstr "ປັດໄຈສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສຽງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງໃນໄລຍະທີ່ໄກຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The base sound level before attenuation, in decibels."
msgstr "ລະດັບສຽງພື້ນຖານກ່ອນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ເດຊີເບລ."

msgid ""
"The base sound level before attenuation, as a linear value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This member modifies [member volume_db] for convenience. The "
"returned value is equivalent to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.db_to_linear] on [member volume_db]. Setting this member is "
"equivalent to setting [member volume_db] to the result of [method "
"@GlobalScope.linear_to_db] on a value."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບສຽງພື້ນຖານກ່ອນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ (attenuation), ເປັນຄ່າແບບລີເນຍ (linear value).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະມາຊິກນີ້ປັບປ່ຽນ [member volume_db] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບຜົນຂອງ [method @GlobalScope.db_to_linear] ໃນ [member "
"volume_db]. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະມາຊິກນີ້ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member volume_db] ໃຫ້ເປັນຜົນຂອງ "
"[method @GlobalScope.linear_to_db] ໃນຄ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Attenuation of loudness according to linear distance."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມດັງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear distance)."

msgid "Attenuation of loudness according to squared distance."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມດັງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບກຳລັງສອງ (squared distance)."

msgid "Attenuation of loudness according to logarithmic distance."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມດັງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບລໍກາຣິດ (logarithmic distance)."

msgid ""
"No attenuation of loudness according to distance. The sound will still be "
"heard positionally, unlike an [AudioStreamPlayer]. [constant "
"ATTENUATION_DISABLED] can be combined with a [member max_distance] value "
"greater than [code]0.0[/code] to achieve linear attenuation clamped to a "
"sphere of a defined size."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມດັງຕາມໄລຍະທາງ. ສຽງຍັງຄົງໄດ້ຍິນແບບມີຕຳແໜ່ງ, ບໍ່ຄືກັບ [AudioStreamPlayer]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] ຮ່ວມກັບຄ່າ [member max_distance] ທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນແບບລີເນຍທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດຊົງກົມຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Disables doppler tracking."
msgstr "ປິດການຕິດຕາມດັອບເປີ (doppler tracking)."

msgid ""
"Executes doppler tracking during process frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການຕິດຕາມດັອບເປີໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມປະມວນຜົນ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"Executes doppler tracking during physics frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການຕິດຕາມດັອບເປີໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມຟີຊິກ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"[AudioStream] that includes sub-streams and plays them back like a playlist."
msgstr ""
"[AudioStream] ທີ່ລວມມີສາຍສຽງຍ່ອຍ (sub-streams) ແລະ ຫຼິ້ນພວກມັນຄືກັບລາຍການເພງ (playlist)."

msgid ""
"An audio stream that can play back sub-streams in sequence. Streams can be "
"added to the Playlist with [method set_list_stream], and shuffled with "
"[member shuffle]."
msgstr ""
"ສະຕຣີມສຽງທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມຍ່ອຍຕາມລຳດັບໄດ້. ສາມາດເພີ່ມສະຕຣີມເຂົ້າໃນ Playlist ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"set_list_stream], ແລະ ສຸ່ມລຳດັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [member shuffle]."

msgid ""
"Returns the BPM of the playlist, which can vary depending on the clip being "
"played."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ BPM ຂອງລາຍການເພງ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຄລິບທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the stream at playback position index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສາຍສຽງຕາມດັດຊະນີ (index) ຕຳແໜ່ງການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid "Sets the stream at playback position index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສາຍສຽງຕາມດັດຊະນີ (index) ຕຳແໜ່ງການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Fade time used when a stream ends, when going to the next one. Streams are "
"expected to have an extra bit of audio after the end to help with fading."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາໃນການເຮັດ Fade ເມື່ອສະຕຣີມຈົບລົງ ແລະ ກຳລັງຈະປ່ຽນໄປສະຕຣີມຖັດໄປ. "
"ສະຕຣີມຄວນມີສຽງສ່ວນເກີນເລັກນ້ອຍຫຼັງຈາກຈົບເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການເຮັດ Fade."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the playlist will loop, otherwise the playlist will end "
"when the last stream is finished."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການເພງຈະຫຼິ້ນວົນຊ້ຳ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນລາຍການເພງຈະຈົບລົງເມື່ອສາຍສຽງສຸດທ້າຍຫຼິ້ນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the playlist will shuffle each time playback starts and "
"each time it loops."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການເພງຈະຖືກສຸ່ມ (shuffle) ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເລີ່ມຫຼິ້ນ ແລະ ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ວົນຊ້ຳ."

msgid "Amount of streams in the playlist."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງໃນລາຍການເພງ."

msgid "Maximum amount of streams supported in the playlist."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງສູງສຸດທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນລາຍການເພງ."

msgid ""
"AudioStream that lets the user play custom streams at any time from code, "
"simultaneously using a single player."
msgstr ""
"AudioStream ທີ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ທຸກເວລາຈາກໂຄ້ດ, ໂດຍຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍສຽງຜ່ານຕົວຫຼິ້ນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"AudioStream that lets the user play custom streams at any time from code, "
"simultaneously using a single player.\n"
"Playback control is done via the [AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic] instance set "
"inside the player, which can be obtained via [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback], [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer2D.get_stream_playback] or [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.get_stream_playback] methods. Obtaining the playback "
"instance is only valid after the [code]stream[/code] property is set as an "
"[AudioStreamPolyphonic] in those players."
msgstr ""
"AudioStream ທີ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ທຸກເວລາຈາກໂຄ້ດ, "
"ໂດຍຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍສຽງຜ່ານຕົວຫຼິ້ນດຽວ.\n"
"ການຄວບຄຸມການຫຼິ້ນແມ່ນເຮັດຜ່ານ instance [AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic] "
"ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ພາຍໃນຕົວຫຼິ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເອົາມາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການ [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer.get_stream_playback], [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer2D.get_stream_playback] ຫຼື [method "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.get_stream_playback]. ການເອົາ instance "
"ການຫຼິ້ນມາໃຊ້ນັ້ນຈະເຮັດໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]stream[/code] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[AudioStreamPolyphonic] ໃນຕົວຫຼິ້ນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Maximum amount of simultaneous streams that can be played."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

msgid "Wraps a pool of audio streams with pitch and volume shifting."
msgstr ""
"ລວມກຸ່ມຂອງສາຍສຽງເຂົ້າກັນ ພ້ອມກັບການປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ແລະ ຄວາມດັງ (volume) ແບບສຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"Picks a random AudioStream from the pool, depending on the playback mode, and "
"applies random pitch shifting and volume shifting during playback."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ AudioStream ແບບສຸ່ມຈາກກຸ່ມ (pool), ຂຶ້ນກັບໂໝດການຫຼິ້ນ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ "
"(pitch) ແລະ ຄວາມດັງແບບສຸ່ມໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Insert a stream at the specified index. If the index is less than zero, the "
"insertion occurs at the end of the underlying pool."
msgstr "ແຊກສະຕຣີມໃສ່ຕາມລຳດັບ (index) ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າລຳດັບນ້ອຍກວ່າສູນ, ຈະຖືກແຊກໃສ່ທາງທ້າຍຂອງກຸ່ມ."

msgid "Returns the stream at the specified index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສາຍສຽງຕາມດັດຊະນີ (index) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the probability weight associated with the stream at the given index."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກຄວາມໜ້າຈະເປັນ (probability weight) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາຍສຽງຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Move a stream from one index to another."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍສາຍສຽງຈາກດັດຊະນີໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກດັດຊະນີໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Remove the stream at the specified index."
msgstr "ລຶບສາຍສຽງຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸອອກ."

msgid "Set the AudioStream at the specified index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ AudioStream ຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Set the probability weight of the stream at the specified index. The higher "
"this value, the more likely that the randomizer will choose this stream "
"during random playback modes."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກຄວາມໜ້າຈະເປັນຂອງສະຕຣີມຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ລະບຸ. ຍິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງ, "
"ຕົວສຸ່ມກໍຍິ່ງມີໂອກາດເລືອກສະຕຣີມນີ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງໂໝດການຫຼິ້ນແບບສຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"Controls how this AudioStreamRandomizer picks which AudioStream to play next."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ AudioStreamRandomizer ນີ້ເລືອກ AudioStream ທີ່ຈະຫຼິ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"The largest possible frequency multiplier of the random pitch variation. "
"Pitch will be randomly chosen within a range of [code skip-lint]1.0 / "
"random_pitch[/code] and [code skip-lint]random_pitch[/code]. A value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] means no variation. A value of [code]2.0[/code] means pitch "
"will be randomized between double and half.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property also sets [member random_pitch_semitones]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມຖີ່ສູງສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຂອງການປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງ (pitch) ແບບສຸ່ມ. "
"ລະດັບສຽງຈະຖືກເລືອກແບບສຸ່ມພາຍໃນຊ່ວງ [code skip-lint]1.0 / random_pitch[/code] ແລະ "
"[code skip-lint]random_pitch[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ຄ່າ [code]2.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງລະດັບສຽງຈະຖືກສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງສອງເທົ່າ ແລະ ເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຍັງຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member random_pitch_semitones] ນຳອີກ."

msgid ""
"The largest possible distance, in semitones, of the random pitch variation. A "
"value of [code]0.0[/code] means no variation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property also sets [member random_pitch]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ (ໃນໜ່ວຍ semitones) ຂອງການປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງແບບສຸ່ມ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຍັງຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member random_pitch] ນຳອີກ."

msgid ""
"The intensity of random volume variation. Volume will be increased or "
"decreased by a random value up to [code skip-lint]random_volume_offset_db[/"
"code]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] means no variation. A value of [code]3.0[/"
"code] means volume will be randomized between [code]-3.0 dB[/code] and [code]"
"+3.0 dB[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນຂອງການປ່ຽນຄວາມດັງແບບສຸ່ມ. ຄວາມດັງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດດ້ວຍຄ່າແບບສຸ່ມສູງສຸດບໍ່ເກີນ [code "
"skip-lint]random_volume_offset_db[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຄ່າ [code]3.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມດັງຈະຖືກສຸ່ມລະຫວ່າງ [code]-3.0 "
"dB[/code] ແລະ [code]+3.0 dB[/code]."

msgid ""
"The [AudioStream] at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. streams_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"[AudioStream] ຢູ່ທີ່ລຳດັບ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. streams_count - 1[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"The probability weight of the [AudioStream] at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. streams_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""
"ນ້ຳໜັກຄວາມໜ້າຈະເປັນຂອງ [AudioStream] ຢູ່ທີ່ລຳດັບ [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [code]index[/code] ແມ່ນຄ່າຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0 .. streams_count - 1[/"
"code]."

msgid "The number of streams in the stream pool."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງໃນກຸ່ມສາຍສຽງ (stream pool)."

msgid ""
"Pick a stream at random according to the probability weights chosen for each "
"stream, but avoid playing the same stream twice in a row whenever possible. "
"If only 1 sound is present in the pool, the same sound will always play, "
"effectively allowing repeats to occur."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກສະຕຣີມແບບສຸ່ມຕາມນ້ຳໜັກຄວາມໜ້າຈະເປັນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສະຕຣີມ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມເດີມຊ້ຳກັນສອງຄັ້ງຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ. ຖ້າໃນກຸ່ມມີພຽງ 1 ສຽງ, "
"ສຽງເດີມກໍຈະຫຼິ້ນຕະຫຼອດ."

msgid ""
"Pick a stream at random according to the probability weights chosen for each "
"stream. If only 1 sound is present in the pool, the same sound will always "
"play."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກສະຕຣີມແບບສຸ່ມຕາມນ້ຳໜັກຄວາມໜ້າຈະເປັນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າໃນກຸ່ມມີພຽງ 1 ສຽງ, "
"ສຽງເດີມກໍຈະຫຼິ້ນຕະຫຼອດ."

msgid ""
"Play streams in the order they appear in the stream pool. If only 1 sound is "
"present in the pool, the same sound will always play."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສະຕຣີມຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມສະຕຣີມ. ຖ້າໃນກຸ່ມມີພຽງ 1 ສຽງ, ສຽງເດີມກໍຈະຫຼິ້ນຕະຫຼອດ."

msgid ""
"Stream that can be fitted with sub-streams, which will be played in-sync."
msgstr ""
"ສາຍສຽງທີ່ສາມາດໃສ່ສາຍສຽງຍ່ອຍ (sub-streams) ເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນ (in-sync)."

msgid ""
"This is a stream that can be fitted with sub-streams, which will be played in-"
"sync. The streams begin at exactly the same time when play is pressed, and "
"will end when the last of them ends. If one of the sub-streams loops, then "
"playback will continue."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຕຣີມທີ່ສາມາດໃສ່ສະຕຣີມຍ່ອຍເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງພວກມັນຈະຫຼິ້ນພ້ອມກັນ (in-sync). "
"ສະຕຣີມທັງໝົດຈະເລີ່ມໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນທັນທີທີ່ກົດຫຼິ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະຈົບລົງເມື່ອສະຕຣີມອັນສຸດທ້າຍຈົບ. "
"ຖ້າມີສະຕຣີມຍ່ອຍອັນໃດໜຶ່ງວົນຊ້ຳ (loop), ການຫຼິ້ນກໍຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "Get one of the synchronized streams, by index."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນສາຍສຽງທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໜຶ່ງສາຍ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມດັດຊະນີ."

msgid "Get the volume of one of the synchronized streams, by index."
msgstr "ດຶງຄ່າຄວາມດັງຂອງສາຍສຽງທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໜຶ່ງສາຍ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມດັດຊະນີ."

msgid "Set one of the synchronized streams, by index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສາຍສຽງທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໜຶ່ງສາຍ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມດັດຊະນີ."

msgid "Set the volume of one of the synchronized streams, by index."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມດັງຂອງສາຍສຽງທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໜຶ່ງສາຍ, ໂດຍອີງຕາມດັດຊະນີ."

msgid "Set the total amount of streams that will be played back synchronized."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນແບບຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

msgid "Maximum amount of streams that can be synchronized."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສາຍສຽງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້."

msgid "Stores audio data loaded from WAV files."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຽງທີ່ໂຫຼດມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ WAV."

msgid ""
"AudioStreamWAV stores sound samples loaded from WAV files. To play the stored "
"sound, use an [AudioStreamPlayer] (for non-positional audio) or "
"[AudioStreamPlayer2D]/[AudioStreamPlayer3D] (for positional audio). The sound "
"can be looped.\n"
"This class can also be used to store dynamically-generated PCM audio data. "
"See also [AudioStreamGenerator] for procedural audio generation."
msgstr ""
"AudioStreamWAV ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ໂຫຼດມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ WAV. ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງທີ່ເກັບໄວ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[AudioStreamPlayer] (ສຳລັບສຽງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ) ຫຼື [AudioStreamPlayer2D]/"
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D] (ສຳລັບສຽງທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ). ສຽງສາມາດຫຼິ້ນວົນຊ້ຳໄດ້.\n"
"ຄລາດນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຽງ PCM ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບໄດນາມິກ. ເບິ່ງ [AudioStreamGenerator] "
"ສຳລັບການສ້າງສຽງແບບ procedural."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamWAV] instance from the given buffer. The buffer "
"must contain WAV data.\n"
"The keys and values of [param options] match the properties of "
"[ResourceImporterWAV]. The usage of [param options] is identical to [method "
"AudioStreamWAV.load_from_file]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ instance [AudioStreamWAV] ໃໝ່ຈາກບັບເຟີ (buffer) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ບັບເຟີຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນ WAV.\n"
"ຄີ (keys) ແລະ ຄ່າ (values) ຂອງ [param options] ຈະກົງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ "
"[ResourceImporterWAV]. ການໃຊ້ [param options] ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [method "
"AudioStreamWAV.load_from_file]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [AudioStreamWAV] instance from the given file path. The file "
"must be in WAV format.\n"
"The keys and values of [param options] match the properties of "
"[ResourceImporterWAV].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Load the first file dropped as a WAV and play it:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@onready var audio_player = $AudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tget_window().files_dropped.connect(_on_files_dropped)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_files_dropped(files):\n"
"\tif files[0].get_extension() == \"wav\":\n"
"\t\taudio_player.stream = AudioStreamWAV.load_from_file(files[0], {\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"force/max_rate\": true,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"force/max_rate_hz\": 11025\n"
"\t\t\t})\n"
"\t\taudio_player.play()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ instance [AudioStreamWAV] ໃໝ່ຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ (file path) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"WAV.\n"
"ຄີ (keys) ແລະ ຄ່າ (values) ຂອງ [param options] ຈະກົງກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ "
"[ResourceImporterWAV].\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດທີ່ຖືກລາກມາປ່ອຍ (dropped) ເປັນ WAV ແລະ ຫຼິ້ນມັນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@onready var audio_player = $AudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tget_window().files_dropped.connect(_on_files_dropped)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_files_dropped(files):\n"
"\tif files[0].get_extension() == \"wav\":\n"
"\t\taudio_player.stream = AudioStreamWAV.load_from_file(files[0], {\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"force/max_rate\": true,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\"force/max_rate_hz\": 11025\n"
"\t\t\t})\n"
"\t\taudio_player.play()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Saves the AudioStreamWAV as a WAV file to [param path]. Samples with IMA "
"ADPCM or Quite OK Audio formats can't be saved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A [code].wav[/code] extension is automatically appended to "
"[param path] if it is missing."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກ AudioStreamWAV ເປັນໄຟລ໌ WAV ໄປຍັງ [param path]. ຕົວຢ່າງສຽງທີ່ມີຮູບແບບ IMA ADPCM ຫຼື "
"Quite OK Audio ບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນາມສະກຸນ [code].wav[/code] ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທ້າຍ [param path] "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າມັນບໍ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"Contains the audio data in bytes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member format] is set to [constant FORMAT_8_BITS], this "
"property expects signed 8-bit PCM data. To convert from unsigned 8-bit PCM, "
"subtract 128 from each byte.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member format] is set to [constant FORMAT_QOA], this "
"property expects data from a full QOA file."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນສຽງເປັນໄບຕ໌ (bytes).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member format] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant FORMAT_8_BITS], "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນ PCM ແບບ signed 8-bit. ເພື່ອແປງຈາກ unsigned 8-bit PCM, ໃຫ້ລົບ "
"128 ອອກຈາກແຕ່ລະໄບຕ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member format] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant FORMAT_QOA], "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌ QOA ແບບເຕັມ."

msgid "Audio format."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບສຽງ (Audio format)."

msgid ""
"The loop start point (in number of samples, relative to the beginning of the "
"stream)."
msgstr "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການວົນຊ້ຳ (ໃນຮູບແບບຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (samples), ທຽບກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງສາຍສຽງ)."

msgid ""
"The loop end point (in number of samples, relative to the beginning of the "
"stream)."
msgstr "ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດການວົນຊ້ຳ (ໃນຮູບແບບຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ (samples), ທຽບກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງສາຍສຽງ)."

msgid "The loop mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການວົນຊ້ຳ (The loop mode)."

msgid ""
"The sample rate for mixing this audio. Higher values require more storage "
"space, but result in better quality.\n"
"In games, common sample rates in use are [code]11025[/code], [code]16000[/"
"code], [code]22050[/code], [code]32000[/code], [code]44100[/code], and "
"[code]48000[/code].\n"
"According to the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nyquist%E2%80%93Shannon_sampling_theorem]Nyquist-Shannon sampling theorem[/"
"url], there is no quality difference to human hearing when going past 40,000 "
"Hz (since most humans can only hear up to ~20,000 Hz, often less). If you are "
"using lower-pitched sounds such as voices, lower sample rates such as "
"[code]32000[/code] or [code]22050[/code] may be usable with no loss in "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບການປະສົມສຽງນີ້. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃນເກມ, ອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ແມ່ນ [code]11025[/code], [code]16000[/code], "
"[code]22050[/code], [code]32000[/code], [code]44100[/code], ແລະ [code]48000[/"
"code].\n"
"ອີງຕາມ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Nyquist%E2%80%93Shannon_sampling_theorem]ທິດສະດີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Nyquist-Shannon[/"
"url], ຈະບໍ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງດ້ານຄຸນນະພາບຕໍ່ການໄດ້ຍິນຂອງມະນຸດເມື່ອກາຍ 40,000 Hz "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກມະນຸດສ່ວນຫຼາຍສາມາດໄດ້ຍິນສຽງໄດ້ສູງສຸດປະມານ ~20,000 Hz, ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່ານັ້ນ). "
"ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ສຽງທີ່ມີລະດັບສຽງຕ່ຳ ເຊັ່ນ: ສຽງເວົ້າ, ອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ [code]32000[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]22050[/code] ອາດຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], audio is stereo."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສຽງຈະເປັນລະບົບສະເຕຣິໂອ (stereo)."

msgid ""
"Contains user-defined tags if found in the WAV data.\n"
"Commonly used tags include [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], "
"[code]album[/code], [code]tracknumber[/code], and [code]date[/code] "
"([code]date[/code] does not have a standard date format).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] No tag is [i]guaranteed[/i] to be present in every file, so make "
"sure to account for the keys not always existing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only WAV files using a [code]LIST[/code] chunk with an "
"identifier of [code]INFO[/code] to encode the tags are currently supported."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຈຸແທັກ (tags) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ ຖ້າຫາກພົບໃນຂໍ້ມູນ WAV.\n"
"ແທັກທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປປະກອບມີ [code]title[/code], [code]artist[/code], [code]album[/code], "
"[code]tracknumber[/code], ແລະ [code]date[/code] ([code]date[/code] "
"ບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບວັນທີມາດຕະຖານ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ມີການ [i]ຮັບປະກັນ[/i] ວ່າທຸກໄຟລ໌ຈະມີແທັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນກວດສອບກໍລະນີທີ່ຄີ "
"(keys) ບໍ່ມີຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ WAV ທີ່ໃຊ້ [code]LIST[/code] chunk ທີ່ມີ "
"identifier ເປັນ [code]INFO[/code] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດແທັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "8-bit PCM audio codec."
msgstr "ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດສຽງ (codec) 8-bit PCM."

msgid "16-bit PCM audio codec."
msgstr "ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດສຽງ (codec) 16-bit PCM."

msgid "Audio is lossily compressed as IMA ADPCM."
msgstr "ສຽງຖືກບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossy) ເປັນ IMA ADPCM."

msgid ""
"Audio is lossily compressed as [url=https://qoaformat.org/]Quite OK Audio[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງຖືກບີບອັດແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossy) ເປັນ [url=https://qoaformat.org/]Quite OK "
"Audio[/url]."

msgid "Audio does not loop."
msgstr "ສຽງບໍ່ມີການວົນຊ້ຳ."

msgid ""
"Audio loops the data between [member loop_begin] and [member loop_end], "
"playing forward only."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງວົນຊ້ຳຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [member loop_begin] ແລະ [member loop_end], ໂດຍຫຼິ້ນໄປທາງໜ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Audio loops the data between [member loop_begin] and [member loop_end], "
"playing back and forth."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງວົນຊ້ຳຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [member loop_begin] ແລະ [member loop_end], ໂດຍຫຼິ້ນກັບໄປກັບມາ "
"(back and forth)."

msgid ""
"Audio loops the data between [member loop_begin] and [member loop_end], "
"playing backward only."
msgstr ""
"ສຽງວົນຊ້ຳຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [member loop_begin] ແລະ [member loop_end], ໂດຍຫຼິ້ນຖອຍຫຼັງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Awaits a specified signal."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າສັນຍານ (signal) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"[AwaitTweener] is used to await a specified signal, allowing asynchronous "
"steps in [Tween] animation. See [method Tween.tween_await] for more usage "
"information.\n"
"The [signal Tweener.finished] signal is emitted when either the awaited "
"signal is received, when timeout is reached, or when the target object is "
"freed."
msgstr ""
"[AwaitTweener] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລໍຖ້າສັນຍານ (signal) ທີ່ລະບຸ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ asynchronous "
"ໃນແອນິເມຊັນ [Tween]. ເບິ່ງ [method Tween.tween_await] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ສັນຍານ [signal Tweener.finished] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານທີ່ລໍຖ້າ, ເມື່ອໝົດເວລາ "
"(timeout), ຫຼື ເມື່ອອອບເຈັກເປົ້າໝາຍຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມ (freed)."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum time an [AwaitTweener] can wait for the signal. Can be used "
"as a safeguard for signals that may never be emitted. If not specified, the "
"tweener will wait indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ [AwaitTweener] ສາມາດລໍຖ້າສັນຍານໄດ້. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນມາດຕະການປ້ອງກັນສຳລັບສັນຍານທີ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເລີຍ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້, tweener "
"ຈະລໍຖ້າໄປເລື້ອຍໆໂດຍບໍ່ມີກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"A node that copies a region of the screen to a buffer for access in shader "
"code."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສຳເນົາພື້ນທີ່ຂອງໜ້າຈໍໄປຍັງ ບັຟເຟີ (buffer) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນໂຄດເຊດເດີ (shader "
"code)."

msgid ""
"Node for back-buffering the currently-displayed screen. The region defined in "
"the [BackBufferCopy] node is buffered with the content of the screen it "
"covers, or the entire screen according to the [member copy_mode]. It can be "
"accessed in shader scripts using the screen texture (i.e. a uniform sampler "
"with [code]hint_screen_texture[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since this node inherits from [Node2D] (and not [Control]), "
"anchors and margins won't apply to child [Control]-derived nodes. This can be "
"problematic when resizing the window. To avoid this, add [Control]-derived "
"nodes as [i]siblings[/i] to the [BackBufferCopy] node instead of adding them "
"as children."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດສຳລັບເຮັດ back-buffering ຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ບໍລິເວນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນໂນດ "
"[BackBufferCopy] ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນບັບເຟີພ້ອມກັບເນື້ອຫາຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມັນກວມເອົາ, ຫຼື ທັງໝົດໜ້າຈໍຕາມ "
"[member copy_mode]. ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນສະຄຣິບເຊດເດີ (shader) ໂດຍໃຊ້ screen texture "
"(ເຊັ່ນ uniform sampler ທີ່ມີ [code]hint_screen_texture[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກໂນດນີ້ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Node2D] (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [Control]), anchors ແລະ "
"margins ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບໂນດລູກທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Control]. "
"ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນບັນຫາເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກ [Control] "
"ເປັນ [i]siblings[/i] (ໂນດລະດັບດຽວກັນ) ກັບໂນດ [BackBufferCopy] ແທນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເປັນໂນດລູກ."

msgid "Screen-reading shaders"
msgstr "ເຊດເດີການອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (Screen-reading shaders)"

msgid "Buffer mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດບັຟເຟີ (Buffer mode)."

msgid ""
"The area covered by the [BackBufferCopy]. Only used if [member copy_mode] is "
"[constant COPY_MODE_RECT]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກປົກຄຸມໂດຍ [BackBufferCopy]. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member copy_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"COPY_MODE_RECT]."

msgid ""
"Disables the buffering mode. This means the [BackBufferCopy] node will "
"directly use the portion of screen it covers."
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດບັຟເຟີ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໂນດ [BackBufferCopy] ຈະໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມັນປົກຄຸມຢູ່ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "[BackBufferCopy] buffers a rectangular region."
msgstr "[BackBufferCopy] ເຮັດບັຟເຟີໃຫ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ຮູບຊົງສີ່ລ່ຽມ."

msgid "[BackBufferCopy] buffers the entire screen."
msgstr "[BackBufferCopy] ເຮັດບັຟເຟີໃຫ້ກັບທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Abstract base class for GUI buttons."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບປຸ່ມ GUI."

msgid ""
"[BaseButton] is an abstract base class for GUI buttons. It doesn't display "
"anything by itself."
msgstr "[BaseButton] ແມ່ນຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບປຸ່ມ GUI. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງຜົນຫຍັງດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Called when the button is pressed. If you need to know the button's pressed "
"state (and [member toggle_mode] is active), use [method _toggled] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮູ້ສະຖານະການກົດຂອງປຸ່ມ (ແລະ [member toggle_mode] "
"ເປີດຢູ່), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _toggled] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the button is toggled (only if [member toggle_mode] is active)."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກສະຫຼັບສະຖານະ (toggled) (ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member toggle_mode] ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່)."

msgid ""
"Returns the visual state used to draw the button. This is useful mainly when "
"implementing your own draw code by either overriding _draw() or connecting to "
"\"draw\" signal. The visual state of the button is defined by the [enum "
"DrawMode] enum."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະທາງສາຍຕາ (visual state) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມປຸ່ມ. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເມື່ອທ່ານຂຽນໂຄ້ດໃນການແຕ້ມເອງ ໂດຍການຂຽນທັບ _draw() ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານ "
"\"draw\". ສະຖານະທາງສາຍຕາຂອງປຸ່ມຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ enum [enum DrawMode]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the mouse has entered the button and has not "
"left it yet."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນພື້ນທີ່ປຸ່ມ ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນອອກໄປເທື່ອ."

msgid ""
"Changes the [member button_pressed] state of the button, without emitting "
"[signal toggled]. Use when you just want to change the state of the button "
"without sending the pressed event (e.g. when initializing scene). Only works "
"if [member toggle_mode] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method doesn't unpress other buttons in [member "
"button_group]."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນສະຖານະ [member button_pressed] ຂອງປຸ່ມໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal toggled]. "
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ປ່ຽນສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງເຫດການການກົດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາກ). "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member toggle_mode] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປຍົກເລີກການກົດຂອງປຸ່ມອື່ນໆໃນ [member button_group]."

msgid "Determines when the button is considered clicked."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າປຸ່ມຈະຖືກຖືວ່າຖືກຄລິກເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"The [ButtonGroup] associated with the button. Not to be confused with node "
"groups.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The button will be configured as a radio button if a "
"[ButtonGroup] is assigned to it."
msgstr ""
"[ButtonGroup] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບປຸ່ມ. ບໍ່ຄວນສັບສົນກັບກຸ່ມໂນດ (node groups).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປຸ່ມຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນປຸ່ມເລືອກ (radio button) ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດ [ButtonGroup] "
"ໃຫ້ກັບມັນ."

msgid ""
"Binary mask to choose which mouse buttons this button will respond to.\n"
"To allow both left-click and right-click, use [code]MOUSE_BUTTON_MASK_LEFT | "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_MASK_RIGHT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Binary mask ເພື່ອເລືອກວ່າປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ໃດແດ່.\n"
"ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທັງຄລິກຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຄລິກຂວາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [code]MOUSE_BUTTON_MASK_LEFT | "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_MASK_RIGHT[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button's state is pressed. Means the button is "
"pressed down or toggled (if [member toggle_mode] is active). Only works if "
"[member toggle_mode] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the value of [member button_pressed] will result in "
"[signal toggled] to be emitted. If you want to change the pressed state "
"without emitting that signal, use [method set_pressed_no_signal]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມແມ່ນຖືກກົດຢູ່. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າປຸ່ມຖືກກົດລົງ ຫຼື ຖືກສະຫຼັບ (ຖ້າ "
"[member toggle_mode] ເປີດຢູ່). ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member toggle_mode] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງ [member button_pressed] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal "
"toggled] ອອກມາ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນສະຖານະການກົດໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງສັນຍານນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"set_pressed_no_signal]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button is in disabled state and can't be clicked or "
"toggled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the button is disabled while held down, [signal button_up] "
"will be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຄລິກ ຫຼື ສະຫຼັບໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າປຸ່ມຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດຄ້າງໄວ້, ສັນຍານ [signal button_up] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button stays pressed when moving the cursor outside "
"the button while pressing it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only affects the button's visual appearance. "
"Signals will be emitted at the same moment regardless of this property's "
"value."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຖືກກົດເມື່ອເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີ (cursor) "
"ອອກໄປນອກປຸ່ມໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດມັນຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ກັບຮູບລັກສະນະທາງສາຍຕາຂອງປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໃນເວລາເດີມໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

msgid "[Shortcut] associated to the button."
msgstr "[Shortcut] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບປຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button will highlight for a short amount of time "
"when its shortcut is activated. If [code]false[/code] and [member "
"toggle_mode] is [code]false[/code], the shortcut will activate without any "
"visual feedback."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະມີການໄຮໄລ້ (highlight) ໃນໄລຍະເວລາສັ້ນໆເມື່ອ shortcut "
"ຂອງມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] ແລະ [member toggle_mode] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], shortcut ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສະແດງຜົນທາງສາຍຕາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button will add information about its shortcut in "
"the tooltip. This includes the shortcut's events and its [member "
"Resource.resource_name]. If both events and name are empty, the shortcut will "
"not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property does nothing when the tooltip control is "
"customized using [method Control._make_custom_tooltip]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ shortcut ຂອງມັນລົງໃນ tooltip. "
"ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງເຫດການ (events) ຂອງ shortcut ແລະ [member Resource.resource_name] "
"ຂອງມັນ. ຖ້າທັງເຫດການ ແລະ ຊື່ວ່າງຢູ່, shortcut ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອມີການປັບແຕ່ງ tooltip ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"Control._make_custom_tooltip]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button is in toggle mode. Makes the button flip "
"state between pressed and unpressed each time its area is clicked."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສະຫຼັບ (toggle mode). "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບສະຖານະລະຫວ່າງການກົດ ແລະ ການປ່ອຍ ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ບໍລິເວນຂອງມັນຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid "Emitted when the button starts being held down."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເລີ່ມກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid "Emitted when the button stops being held down."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຊົາກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the button is toggled or pressed. This is on [signal "
"button_down] if [member action_mode] is [constant ACTION_MODE_BUTTON_PRESS] "
"and on [signal button_up] otherwise.\n"
"If you need to know the button's pressed state (and [member toggle_mode] is "
"active), use [signal toggled] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກສະຫຼັບ ຫຼື ຖືກກົດ. ນີ້ຈະເປັນ [signal button_down] ຖ້າ [member action_mode] "
"ເປັນ [constant ACTION_MODE_BUTTON_PRESS] ແລະ ຈະເປັນ [signal button_up] "
"ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮູ້ສະຖານະການກົດຂອງປຸ່ມ (ແລະ [member toggle_mode] ເປີດຢູ່), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສັນຍານ "
"[signal toggled] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the button was just toggled between pressed and normal states "
"(only if [member toggle_mode] is active). The new state is contained in the "
"[param toggled_on] argument."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອປຸ່ມຫາກໍມີການສະຫຼັບສະຖານະລະຫວ່າງການກົດ ແລະ ສະຖານະປົກກະຕິ (ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member "
"toggle_mode] ເປີດຢູ່). ສະຖານະໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (argument) [param toggled_on]."

msgid ""
"The normal state (i.e. not pressed, not hovered, not toggled and enabled) of "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານະປົກກະຕິ (ຄື: ບໍ່ໄດ້ກົດ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຊີ້, ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະຫຼັບສະຖານະ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່) ຂອງປຸ່ມ."

msgid "The state of buttons are pressed."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The state of buttons are hovered."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ຢູ່ (hovered)."

msgid "The state of buttons are disabled."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ (disabled)."

msgid "The state of buttons are both hovered and pressed."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກເມົາສ໌ຊີ້ຢູ່ ແລະ ຖືກກົດໄປພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid "Require just a press to consider the button clicked."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ການກົດລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພື່ອຖືວ່າປຸ່ມຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid ""
"Require a press and a subsequent release before considering the button "
"clicked."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການທັງການກົດລົງ ແລະ ການປ່ອຍມືອອກຕາມຫຼັງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າປຸ່ມຖືກຄລິກ."

msgid "Abstract base class for defining the 3D rendering properties of meshes."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານນາມມະທຳສຳລັບກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດການສະແດງຜົນ 3D ຂອງເມຊ (meshes)."

msgid ""
"This class serves as a default material with a wide variety of rendering "
"features and properties without the need to write shader code. See the "
"tutorial below for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນວັດສະດຸ (material) ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ລູກຫຼິ້ນໃນການສະແດງຜົນຫຼາກຫຼາຍ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີ (shader). ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນລຸ່ມນີ້ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid "Standard Material 3D and ORM Material 3D"
msgstr "Standard Material 3D ແລະ ORM Material 3D"

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param feature] is enabled."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param feature] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param flag] is enabled."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param flag] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Texture2D] associated with the specified texture [param param]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Texture2D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພາຣາມີເຕີພື້ນຜິວ [param param] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], enables the specified [param "
"feature]. Many features that are available in [BaseMaterial3D] need to be "
"enabled before use. This way, the cost for using the feature is only incurred "
"when specified. Features can also be enabled by setting their corresponding "
"property to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [param feature] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຫຼາຍລູກຫຼິ້ນ (features) ທີ່ມີໃນ [BaseMaterial3D] ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ລູກຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], enables the specified [param flag]. "
"Flags are optional behavior that can be turned on and off. Only one flag can "
"be enabled at a time with this function, the flag enumerators cannot be bit-"
"masked together to enable or disable multiple flags at once. Flags can also "
"be enabled by setting their corresponding property to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [param flag] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ທຸງ "
"(flags) ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທາງເລືອກທີ່ສາມາດເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໄດ້. ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ເທື່ອລະທຸງດຽວດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນນີ້, "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ bit-mask ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຫຼາຍທຸງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. "
"ທຸງຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "Sets the texture for the slot specified by [param param]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param param]."

msgid ""
"The material's base color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member detail_enabled] is [code]true[/code] and a [member "
"detail_albedo] texture is specified, [member albedo_color] will [i]not[/i] "
"modulate the detail texture. This can be used to color partial areas of a "
"material by not specifying an albedo texture and using a transparent [member "
"detail_albedo] texture instead."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຖານ (base color) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member detail_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ມີການກຳນົດພື້ນຜິວ [member detail_albedo], [member albedo_color] ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ໄປປ່ຽນສີຂອງ detail texture. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບາຍສີບາງສ່ວນຂອງວັດສະດຸໂດຍການບໍ່ກຳນົດ albedo "
"texture ແລະ ໃຊ້ [member detail_albedo] ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແທນ."

msgid ""
"Texture to multiply by [member albedo_color]. Used for basic texturing of "
"objects.\n"
"If the texture appears unexpectedly too dark or too bright, check [member "
"albedo_texture_force_srgb]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ຈະນຳມາຄູນກັບ [member albedo_color]. "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໃສ່ພື້ນຜິວພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ກັບອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"ຖ້າພື້ນຜິວປາກົດມືດເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ແຈ້ງເກີນໄປແບບຜິດປົກກະຕິ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ [member "
"albedo_texture_force_srgb]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces a conversion of the [member albedo_texture] from "
"nonlinear sRGB encoding to linear encoding. See also [member "
"vertex_color_is_srgb].\n"
"This should only be enabled when needed (typically when using a "
"[ViewportTexture] as [member albedo_texture]). If [member "
"albedo_texture_force_srgb] is [code]true[/code] when it shouldn't be, the "
"texture will appear to be too dark. If [member albedo_texture_force_srgb] is "
"[code]false[/code] when it shouldn't be, the texture will appear to be too "
"bright."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການແປງ [member albedo_texture] "
"ຈາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບ nonlinear ໃຫ້ເປັນ linear. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"vertex_color_is_srgb] ນຳ.\n"
"ນີ້ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ [ViewportTexture] ເປັນ [member "
"albedo_texture]). ຖ້າ [member albedo_texture_force_srgb] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ທັງທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນ, ພື້ນຜິວຈະປາກົດມືດເກີນໄປ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] ທັງທີ່ຄວນຈະເປີດ, "
"ພື້ນຜິວຈະປາກົດແຈ້ງເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"Enables multichannel signed distance field rendering shader. Use [member "
"msdf_pixel_range] and [member msdf_outline_size] to configure MSDF parameters."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ multichannel signed distance field (MSDF) rendering shader. ໃຊ້ "
"[member msdf_pixel_range] ແລະ [member msdf_outline_size] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ MSDF."

msgid "Threshold at which antialiasing will be applied on the alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Threshold) ທີ່ການລົບຮອຍຢັກ (antialiasing) ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຊ່ອງອັລຟາ (alpha "
"channel)."

msgid "The type of alpha antialiasing to apply."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງການລົບຮອຍຢັກອັລຟາ (alpha antialiasing) ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The hashing scale for Alpha Hash. Recommended values between [code]0[/code] "
"and [code]2[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ມາຕຣາສ່ວນການເຮັດແຮຊ (hashing scale) ສຳລັບ Alpha Hash. ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ "
"[code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]2[/code]."

msgid ""
"Threshold at which the alpha scissor will discard values. Higher values will "
"result in more pixels being discarded. If the material becomes too opaque at "
"a distance, try increasing [member alpha_scissor_threshold]. If the material "
"disappears at a distance, try decreasing [member alpha_scissor_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"ເກນ (threshold) ທີ່ alpha scissor ຈະຕັດຄ່າຖິ້ມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊລ (pixels) "
"ຖືກຕັດຖິ້ມຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າວັດສະດຸເບິ່ງຄືທຶບແສງເກີນໄປໃນໄລຍະໄກ, ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມ [member "
"alpha_scissor_threshold]. ຖ້າວັດສະດຸຫາຍໄປໃນໄລຍະໄກ, ໃຫ້ລອງຫຼຸດ [member "
"alpha_scissor_threshold]."

msgid ""
"The strength of the anisotropy effect. This is multiplied by [member "
"anisotropy_flowmap]'s alpha channel if a texture is defined there and the "
"texture contains an alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ anisotropy (ການສະທ້ອນແສງແບບບໍ່ສົມມາດ). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ alpha "
"channel ຂອງ [member anisotropy_flowmap] ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດພື້ນຜິວໄວ້ ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນມີ alpha "
"channel."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], anisotropy is enabled. Anisotropy changes the shape of "
"the specular blob and aligns it to tangent space. This is useful for brushed "
"aluminum and hair reflections.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Mesh tangents are needed for anisotropy to work. If the mesh "
"does not contain tangents, the anisotropy effect will appear broken.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Material anisotropy should not to be confused with anisotropic "
"texture filtering, which can be enabled by setting [member texture_filter] to "
"[constant TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ anisotropy. Anisotropy ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຊົງຂອງ specular "
"blob ແລະ ຈັດວາງໃຫ້ກົງກັບ tangent space. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນຂອງອາລູມີນຽມຂັດ ຫຼື "
"ເສັ້ນຜົມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Mesh tangents ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ anisotropy ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ຖ້າ mesh ບໍ່ມີ "
"tangents, ເອັບເຟັກ anisotropy ຈະເບິ່ງຄືເພ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄວນສັບສົນ material anisotropy ກັບ anisotropic texture filtering, "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member texture_filter] ເປັນ [constant "
"TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS_ANISOTROPIC]."

msgid ""
"Texture that offsets the tangent map for anisotropy calculations and "
"optionally controls the anisotropy effect (if an alpha channel is present). "
"The flowmap texture is expected to be a derivative map, with the red channel "
"representing distortion on the X axis and green channel representing "
"distortion on the Y axis. Values below 0.5 will result in negative "
"distortion, whereas values above 0.5 will result in positive distortion.\n"
"If present, the texture's alpha channel will be used to multiply the strength "
"of the [member anisotropy] effect. Fully opaque pixels will keep the "
"anisotropy effect's original strength while fully transparent pixels will "
"disable the anisotropy effect entirely. The flowmap texture's blue channel is "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຊົດເຊີຍ tangent map ສຳລັບການຄຳນວນ anisotropy ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມເອັບເຟັກ anisotropy ໄດ້ (ຖ້າມີ alpha channel). ພື້ນຜິວ flowmap ນີ້ຄວນເປັນ "
"derivative map, ໂດຍທີ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ (red channel) ແທນການບິດບ້ຽວໃນແກນ X ແລະ ຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ "
"(green channel) ແທນການບິດບ້ຽວໃນແກນ Y. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0.5 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການບິດບ້ຽວທາງລົບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າສູງກວ່າ 0.5 ຈະໃຫ້ການບິດບ້ຽວທາງບວກ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີ, alpha channel ຂອງພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄູນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ [member anisotropy]. "
"ພິກເຊລທີ່ທຶບແສງເຕັມສ່ວນຈະຮັກສາຄວາມເຂັ້ມເດີມຂອງ anisotropy ໄວ້, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພິກເຊລທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສເຕັມສ່ວນຈະປິດເອັບເຟັກ anisotropy ທັງໝົດ. ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ (blue channel) "
"ຂອງພື້ນຜິວ flowmap ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], ambient occlusion is enabled. Ambient occlusion darkens "
"areas based on the [member ao_texture]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເງົາໃນຈຸດອັບ (ambient occlusion) "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງພື້ນທີ່ມືດລົງໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member ao_texture]."

msgid ""
"Amount that ambient occlusion affects lighting from lights. If [code]0[/"
"code], ambient occlusion only affects ambient light. If [code]1[/code], "
"ambient occlusion affects lights just as much as it affects ambient light. "
"This can be used to impact the strength of the ambient occlusion effect, but "
"typically looks unrealistic."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານທີ່ ambient occlusion ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ແສງຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code], "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນສະເພາະແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]1[/code], "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ແສງທົ່ວໄປເທົ່າກັບແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ ambient "
"occlusion ໄດ້, ແຕ່ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວມັນຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ສົມຈິງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], use [code]UV2[/code] coordinates to look up from the "
"[member ao_texture]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພິກັດ [code]UV2[/code] ໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ [member "
"ao_texture]."

msgid ""
"Texture that defines the amount of ambient occlusion for a given point on the "
"object."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດປະລິມານຂອງ ambient occlusion ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດເທິງອັອບເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Specifies the channel of the [member ao_texture] in which the ambient "
"occlusion information is stored. This is useful when you store the "
"information for multiple effects in a single texture. For example if you "
"stored metallic in the red channel, roughness in the blue, and ambient "
"occlusion in the green you could reduce the number of textures you use."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຊ່ອງ (channel) ຂອງ [member ao_texture] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ambient occlusion. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຫຼາຍເອັບເຟັກໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານເກັບ metallic "
"ໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງ, roughness ໃນຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ, ແລະ ambient occlusion ໃນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ, "
"ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຫຼຸດຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລົງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The color used by the backlight effect. Represents the light passing through "
"an object."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເອັບເຟັກແສງສ່ອງທາງຫຼັງ (backlight effect). ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງແສງທີ່ສ່ອງຜ່ານອັອບເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the backlight effect is enabled. See also [member "
"subsurf_scatter_transmittance_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເອັບເຟັກແສງສ່ອງທາງຫຼັງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"subsurf_scatter_transmittance_enabled] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Texture used to control the backlight effect per-pixel. Added to [member "
"backlight]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເອັບເຟັກແສງສ່ອງທາງຫຼັງໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. ຈະຖືກນຳໄປບວກເຂົ້າກັບ [member "
"backlight]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the bent normal map is enabled. This allows for more "
"accurate indirect lighting and specular occlusion."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ bent normal map. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຄຳນວນແສງທາງອ້ອມ "
"(indirect lighting) ແລະ specular occlusion ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Texture that specifies the average direction of incoming ambient light at a "
"given pixel. The [member bent_normal_texture] only uses the red and green "
"channels; the blue and alpha channels are ignored. The normal read from "
"[member bent_normal_texture] is oriented around the surface normal provided "
"by the [Mesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A bent normal map is different from a regular normal map. When "
"baking a bent normal map make sure to use [b]a cosine distribution[/b] for "
"the bent normal map to work correctly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The mesh must have both normals and tangents defined in its "
"vertex data. Otherwise, the shading produced by the bent normal map will not "
"look correct. If creating geometry with [SurfaceTool], you can use [method "
"SurfaceTool.generate_normals] and [method SurfaceTool.generate_tangents] to "
"automatically generate normals and tangents respectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot expects the bent normal map to use X+, Y+, and Z+ "
"coordinates. See [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]this page[/url] for a "
"comparison of normal map coordinates expected by popular engines."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ລະບຸທິດທາງສະເລ່ຍຂອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ເຂົ້າມາໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. [member "
"bent_normal_texture] ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ ແລະ alpha "
"ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຄ່າ normal ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຈາກ [member bent_normal_texture] ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງອ້ອມຮອບ "
"surface normal ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ [Mesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] bent normal map ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ normal map ທົ່ວໄປ. ເມື່ອ baking bent "
"normal map ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ [b]a cosine distribution[/b] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] mesh ຕ້ອງມີທັງ normals ແລະ tangents ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ vertex. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເງົາທີ່ເກີດຈາກ bent normal map ຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າສ້າງ geometry ດ້ວຍ [SurfaceTool], "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method SurfaceTool.generate_normals] ແລະ [method "
"SurfaceTool.generate_tangents] ເພື່ອສ້າງ normals ແລະ tangents ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ bent normal map ໃຊ້ພິກັດ X+, Y+, ແລະ Z+. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]ໜ້ານີ້[/url] "
"ສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບພິກັດ normal map ທີ່ເອັນຈິ້ນຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the shader will keep the scale set for the mesh. "
"Otherwise, the scale is lost when billboarding. Only applies when [member "
"billboard_mode] is not [constant BILLBOARD_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊດເດີ (shader) ຈະຮັກສາຂະໜາດ (scale) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບ mesh. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂະໜາດຈະເສຍໄປເມື່ອເຮັດ billboarding. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member "
"billboard_mode] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant BILLBOARD_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Controls how the object faces the camera.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Billboard mode is not suitable for VR because the left-right "
"vector of the camera is not horizontal when the screen is attached to your "
"head instead of on the table. See [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"issues/41567]GitHub issue #41567[/url] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ອອບເຈັກຫັນໜ້າເຂົ້າຫາ ກ້ອງ (camera).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ Billboard ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ VR ເພາະວ່າ vector ຊ້າຍ-ຂວາ "
"ຂອງກ້ອງຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນແນວນອນເມື່ອໜ້າຈໍຕິດຢູ່ກັບຫົວຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/issues/41567]GitHub issue #41567[/url]."

msgid ""
"The material's blend mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values other than [code]Mix[/code] force the object into the "
"transparent pipeline."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າອື່ນໆນອກຈາກ [code]Mix[/code] "
"ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ອອບເຈັກເຂົ້າສູ່ຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນແບບໂປ່ງໃສ (transparent pipeline)."

msgid ""
"Sets the strength of the clearcoat effect. Setting to [code]0[/code] looks "
"the same as disabling the clearcoat effect."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກ ເຄຼຍໂຄດ (clearcoat). ການຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code] "
"ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນຄືກັບການປິດເອັບເຟັກເຄຼຍໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], clearcoat rendering is enabled. Adds a secondary "
"transparent pass to the lighting calculation resulting in an added specular "
"blob. This makes materials appear as if they have a clear layer on them that "
"can be either glossy or rough.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Clearcoat rendering is not visible if the material's [member "
"shading_mode] is [constant SHADING_MODE_UNSHADED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ clearcoat rendering. "
"ເປັນການເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຊັ້ນທີສອງເຂົ້າໃນການຄຳນວນແສງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີ specular blob "
"ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມີຊັ້ນເຄືອບໃສໆຢູ່ເທິງຜິວ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເງົາ ຫຼື ຂຸຂະກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] clearcoat ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນຖ້າ [member shading_mode] ຂອງວັດສະດຸຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant SHADING_MODE_UNSHADED]."

msgid ""
"Sets the roughness of the clearcoat pass. A higher value results in a rougher "
"clearcoat while a lower value results in a smoother clearcoat."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຂຸຂະ (roughness) ຂອງຊັ້ນເຄຼຍໂຄດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄຼຍໂຄດເບິ່ງຂຸຂະຂຶ້ນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າຕ່ຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນ."

msgid ""
"Texture that defines the strength of the clearcoat effect and the glossiness "
"of the clearcoat. Strength is specified in the red channel while glossiness "
"is specified in the green channel."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ກຳນົດຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ clearcoat ແລະ ຄວາມເງົາຂອງ clearcoat. "
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຈະຖືກລະບຸໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງ (red channel) ສ່ວນຄວາມເງົາຈະລະບຸໃນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ (green "
"channel)."

msgid ""
"Determines which side of the triangle to cull depending on whether the "
"triangle faces towards or away from the camera."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະຕັດ (cull) ດ້ານໃດຂອງສາມຫຼ່ຽມຖິ້ມ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າສາມຫຼ່ຽມນັ້ນຫັນໜ້າເຂົ້າຫາ ຫຼື ຫັນໜີຈາກກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Determines when depth rendering takes place. See also [member transparency]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າການສະແດງຜົນຄວາມເລິກ (depth rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໃດ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"transparency] ປະກອບ."

msgid "May be affected by future rendering pipeline changes."
msgstr ""
"ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງລະບົບການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering pipeline) ໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid ""
"Determines which comparison operator is used when testing depth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing [member depth_test] to a non-default value only has a "
"visible effect when used on a transparent material, or a material that has "
"[member depth_draw_mode] set to [constant DEPTH_DRAW_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການປຽບທຽບ (comparison operator) ໃດເມື່ອທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ (depth "
"testing).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນ [member depth_test] ເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ "
"ຈະເຫັນຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸທີ່ຕັ້ງ [member depth_draw_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant DEPTH_DRAW_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"Texture that specifies the color of the detail overlay. [member "
"detail_albedo]'s alpha channel is used as a mask, even when the material is "
"opaque. To use a dedicated texture as a mask, see [member detail_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member detail_albedo] is [i]not[/i] modulated by [member "
"albedo_color]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ລະບຸສີຂອງຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ (detail overlay). ຊ່ອງ alpha ຂອງ [member "
"detail_albedo] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ mask, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າວັດສະດຸຈະທຶບແສງກໍຕາມ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວສະເພາະເປັນ "
"mask, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [member detail_mask].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member detail_albedo] ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ຖືກປ່ຽນສີໂດຍ [member "
"albedo_color]."

msgid ""
"Specifies how the [member detail_albedo] should blend with the current "
"[code]ALBEDO[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ [member detail_albedo] ຄວນຈະປະສົມ (blend) ກັບ [code]ALBEDO[/code] "
"ປັດຈຸບັນແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the detail overlay. Detail is a second texture "
"that gets mixed over the surface of the object based on [member detail_mask] "
"and [member detail_albedo]'s alpha channel. This can be used to add variation "
"to objects, or to blend between two different albedo/normal textures."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ (detail overlay). Detail "
"ແມ່ນພື້ນຜິວທີສອງທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາປະສົມລົງເທິງຜິວຂອງອອບເຈັກໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member detail_mask] ແລະ ຊ່ອງ "
"alpha ຂອງ [member detail_albedo]. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃຫ້ກັບອອບເຈັກ ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອປະສົມລະຫວ່າງສອງ albedo/normal texture ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Texture used to specify how the detail textures get blended with the base "
"textures. [member detail_mask] can be used together with [member "
"detail_albedo]'s alpha channel (if any)."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບຸວ່າ detail textures ຈະຖືກປະສົມກັບ base textures ແນວໃດ. "
"[member detail_mask] ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຊ່ອງ alpha ຂອງ [member detail_albedo] (ຖ້າມີ) "
"ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Texture that specifies the per-pixel normal of the detail overlay. The "
"[member detail_normal] texture only uses the red and green channels; the blue "
"and alpha channels are ignored. The normal read from [member detail_normal] "
"is oriented around the surface normal provided by the [Mesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot expects the normal map to use X+, Y+, and Z+ coordinates. "
"See [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]this page[/url] for a "
"comparison of normal map coordinates expected by popular engines."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ລະບຸຄ່າ normal ແບບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລຂອງຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ. [member "
"detail_normal] ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວ; ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ ແລະ alpha ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຄ່າ normal "
"ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຈາກ [member detail_normal] ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງອ້ອມຮອບ surface normal ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"[Mesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ normal map ໃຊ້ພິກັດ X+, Y+, ແລະ Z+. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]ໜ້ານີ້[/url] "
"ສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບພິກັດ normal map ທີ່ເອັນຈິ້ນຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Specifies whether to use [code]UV[/code] or [code]UV2[/code] for the detail "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ [code]UV[/code] ຫຼື [code]UV2[/code] ສຳລັບຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ (detail layer)."

msgid "The algorithm used for diffuse light scattering."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກະຈາຍແສງສະທ້ອນ (diffuse light scattering)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the object receives no ambient light."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອັອບເຈັກຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງສະຫວ່າງໂດຍຮອບ (ambient light)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the object will not be affected by fog (neither "
"volumetric nor depth fog). This is useful for unshaded or transparent "
"materials (e.g. particles), which without this setting will be affected even "
"if fully transparent."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອອບເຈັກຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກໝອກ (ທັງ volumetric fog ແລະ "
"depth fog). ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບວັດສະດຸແບບ unshaded ຫຼື ໂປ່ງໃສ (ເຊັ່ນ: ພາກທິເຄິລ), "
"ເຊິ່ງຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ ພວກມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກໝອກເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໂປ່ງໃສເຕັມທີກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the object receives no shadow that would otherwise be "
"cast onto it."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອັອບເຈັກຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບເງົາໃດໆ ທີ່ຄວນຈະຕົກກະທົບໃສ່ມັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables specular occlusion even if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/specular_occlusion/enabled] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດ specular occlusion ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/specular_occlusion/enabled] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the object appears fully opaque.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member distance_fade_max_distance] is less than [member "
"distance_fade_min_distance], the behavior will be reversed. The object will "
"start to fade away at [member distance_fade_max_distance] and will fully "
"disappear once it reaches [member distance_fade_min_distance]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງທີ່ອອບເຈັກປາກົດເປັນແບບທຶບແສງເຕັມສ່ວນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member distance_fade_max_distance] ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [member "
"distance_fade_min_distance], ພຶດຕິກຳຈະຖືກສະຫຼັບກັນ. ອອບເຈັກຈະເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປທີ່ [member "
"distance_fade_max_distance] ແລະ ຈະຫາຍໄປທັງໝົດເມື່ອຮອດ [member "
"distance_fade_min_distance]."

msgid ""
"Distance at which the object starts to become visible. If the object is less "
"than this distance away, it will be invisible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member distance_fade_min_distance] is greater than [member "
"distance_fade_max_distance], the behavior will be reversed. The object will "
"start to fade away at [member distance_fade_max_distance] and will fully "
"disappear once it reaches [member distance_fade_min_distance]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງທີ່ອອບເຈັກເລີ່ມເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ຖ້າອອບເຈັກຢູ່ໃກ້ກວ່າໄລຍະທາງນີ້, ມັນຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member distance_fade_min_distance] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [member "
"distance_fade_max_distance], ພຶດຕິກຳຈະຖືກສະຫຼັບກັນ. ອອບເຈັກຈະເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປທີ່ [member "
"distance_fade_max_distance] ແລະ ຈະຫາຍໄປທັງໝົດເມື່ອຮອດ [member "
"distance_fade_min_distance]."

msgid ""
"Specifies which type of fade to use. Can be any of the [enum "
"DistanceFadeMode]s."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງການຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍ (fade) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ [enum "
"DistanceFadeMode]."

msgid "The emitted light's color. See [member emission_enabled]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງແສງທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ເບິ່ງ [member emission_enabled] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body emits light. Emitting light makes the object "
"appear brighter. The object can also cast light on other objects if a "
"[VoxelGI], SDFGI, or [LightmapGI] is used and this object is used in baked "
"lighting."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸນັ້ນຈະແຜ່ແສງອອກມາ (emit light). "
"ການແຜ່ແສງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອອບເຈັກເບິ່ງຄືແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ. ອອບເຈັກຍັງສາມາດສ່ອງແສງໄປໃສ່ອອບເຈັກອື່ນໄດ້ ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ "
"[VoxelGI], SDFGI, ຫຼື [LightmapGI] ແລະ ອອບເຈັກນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນ baked lighting."

msgid "Multiplier for emitted light. See [member emission_enabled]."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບແສງທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ເບິ່ງ [member emission_enabled] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Luminance of emitted light, measured in nits (candela per square meter). Only "
"available when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] is enabled. The default is roughly equivalent to an "
"indoor lightbulb."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ຂອງແສງທີ່ແຜ່ອອກມາ, ແທກເປັນໜ່ວຍ nits (candela ຕໍ່ຕາແມັດ). "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units]. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນປະມານເທົ່າກັບດອກໄຟທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເຮືອນ."

msgid "Use [code]UV2[/code] to read from the [member emission_texture]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [code]UV2[/code] ເພື່ອອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ [member emission_texture]."

msgid ""
"Sets how [member emission] interacts with [member emission_texture]. Can "
"either add or multiply."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າ [member emission] ຈະມີປະຕິກິລິຍາກັບ [member emission_texture] ແນວໃດ. "
"ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງການບວກ (add) ຫຼື ການຄູນ (multiply)."

msgid "Texture that specifies how much surface emits light at a given point."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວຈະປ່ອຍແສງອອກມາຫຼາຍປານໃດໃນແຕ່ລະຈຸດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the object is rendered at the same size regardless of "
"distance. The object's size on screen is the same as if the camera was "
"[code]1.0[/code] units away from the object's origin, regardless of the "
"actual distance from the camera. The [Camera3D]'s field of view (or [member "
"Camera3D.size] when in orthogonal/frustum mode) still affects the size the "
"object is drawn at."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອອບເຈັກຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍຂະໜາດດຽວກັນສະເໝີໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄລຍະທາງ. "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງອອບເຈັກເທິງໜ້າຈໍຈະເທົ່າກັບຕອນທີ່ກ້ອງຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອອບເຈັກ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຢູນິດ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, field of view ຂອງ [Camera3D] (ຫຼື [member Camera3D.size] "
"ໃນໂໝດ orthogonal/frustum) ຍັງຄົງສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຂະໜາດທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Overrides the [Camera3D]'s field of view angle (in degrees).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This behaves as if the field of view is set on a [Camera3D] with "
"[member Camera3D.keep_aspect] set to [constant Camera3D.KEEP_HEIGHT]. "
"Additionally, it may not look correct on a non-perspective camera where the "
"field of view setting is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບມຸມ field of view ຂອງ [Camera3D] (ໃນໜ່ວຍອົງສາ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳຄືກັບວ່າມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ field of view ໃນ [Camera3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດ "
"[member Camera3D.keep_aspect] ເປັນ [constant Camera3D.KEEP_HEIGHT]. ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ມັນອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນກ້ອງແບບ non-perspective ເຊິ່ງຈະລະເລີຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ field of view."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the vertex grow setting. This can be used to "
"create mesh-based outlines using a second material pass and its [member "
"cull_mode] set to [constant CULL_FRONT]. See also [member grow_amount].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Vertex growth cannot create new vertices, which means that "
"visible gaps may occur in sharp corners. This can be alleviated by designing "
"the mesh to use smooth normals exclusively using [url=http://"
"wiki.polycount.com/wiki/Face_weighted_normals]face weighted normals[/url] in "
"the 3D authoring software. In this case, grow will be able to join every "
"outline together, just like in the original mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ vertex grow. ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບ "
"(outlines) ໃຫ້ກັບ mesh ໂດຍໃຊ້ material pass ທີສອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງ [member cull_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant CULL_FRONT]. ເບິ່ງ [member grow_amount] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Vertex growth ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ vertex ໃໝ່ໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອາດຈະເຫັນຊ່ອງວ່າງຢູ່ຕາມມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມ. ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການອອກແບບ mesh ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"smooth normals ໂດຍສະເພາະ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Face_weighted_normals]face weighted normals[/url] ໃນໂປຣແກຣມສ້າງ 3D. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, "
"grow ຈະສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທຸກເສັ້ນຂອບເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ຄືກັນກັບໃນ mesh ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"Grows object vertices in the direction of their normals. Only effective if "
"[member grow] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍຈຸດຈອມ (vertices) ຂອງອັອບເຈັກໄປໃນທິດທາງຂອງເສັ້ນນໍມໍ (normals). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ "
"[member grow] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses parallax occlusion mapping to represent depth in "
"the material instead of simple offset mapping (see [member "
"heightmap_enabled]). This results in a more convincing depth effect, but is "
"much more expensive on the GPU. Only enable this on materials where it makes "
"a significant visual difference."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ parallax occlusion mapping "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຄວາມເລິກໃນວັດສະດຸ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ offset mapping ແບບທຳມະດາ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"heightmap_enabled]). ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄດ້ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມເລິກທີ່ສົມຈິງກວ່າ, ແຕ່ກໍຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທາງສາຍຕາຢ່າງຊັດເຈນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], height mapping is enabled (also called \"parallax "
"mapping\" or \"depth mapping\"). See also [member normal_enabled]. Height "
"mapping is a demanding feature on the GPU, so it should only be used on "
"materials where it makes a significant visual difference.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Height mapping is not supported if triplanar mapping is used on "
"the same material. The value of [member heightmap_enabled] will be ignored if "
"[member uv1_triplanar] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ height mapping (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"parallax mapping\" "
"ຫຼື \"depth mapping\"). ເບິ່ງ [member normal_enabled] ນຳ. Height mapping "
"ເປັນລູກຫຼິ້ນທີ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU ສູງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Height mapping ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຖ້າຫາກມີການໃຊ້ triplanar mapping "
"ໃນວັດສະດຸດຽວກັນ. ຄ່າຂອງ [member heightmap_enabled] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າ [member "
"uv1_triplanar] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], flips the mesh's binormal vectors when interpreting the "
"height map. If the heightmap effect looks strange when the camera moves (even "
"with a reasonable [member heightmap_scale]), try setting this to [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະຫຼັບ (flip) vector binormal ຂອງ mesh ເມື່ອແປຄວາມໝາຍ "
"height map. ຖ້າເອັບເຟັກ heightmap ເບິ່ງຄືແປກໆເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງ [member "
"heightmap_scale] ໄດ້ເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ), ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], flips the mesh's tangent vectors when interpreting the "
"height map. If the heightmap effect looks strange when the camera moves (even "
"with a reasonable [member heightmap_scale]), try setting this to [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະຫຼັບ (flip) vector tangent ຂອງ mesh ເມື່ອແປຄວາມໝາຍ "
"height map. ຖ້າເອັບເຟັກ heightmap ເບິ່ງຄືແປກໆເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕັ້ງ [member "
"heightmap_scale] ໄດ້ເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ), ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], interprets the height map texture as a depth map, with "
"brighter values appearing to be \"lower\" in altitude compared to darker "
"values.\n"
"This can be enabled for compatibility with some materials authored for Godot "
"3.x. This is not necessary if the Invert import option was used to invert the "
"depth map in Godot 3.x, in which case [member heightmap_flip_texture] should "
"remain [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແປຄວາມໝາຍຂອງພື້ນຜິວ height map ໃຫ້ເປັນ depth map, "
"ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ແຈ້ງກວ່າຈະປາກົດວ່າ \"ຕ່ຳກວ່າ\" ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄ່າທີ່ມືດກວ່າ.\n"
"ນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບວັດສະດຸບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ Godot 3.x. "
"ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຖ້າຫາກໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ Invert ຕອນນຳເຂົ້າເພື່ອສະຫຼັບ depth map ໃນ Godot 3.x ແລ້ວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ [member heightmap_flip_texture] ຄວນເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຄືເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"The number of layers to use for parallax occlusion mapping when the camera is "
"up close to the material. Higher values result in a more convincing depth "
"effect, especially in materials that have steep height changes. Higher values "
"have a significant cost on the GPU, so it should only be increased on "
"materials where it makes a significant visual difference.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member heightmap_deep_parallax] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊັ້ນ (layers) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ parallax occlusion mapping ເມື່ອກ້ອງຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບວັດສະດຸ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມເລິກທີ່ສົມຈິງກວ່າ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສູງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU ຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນເພີ່ມສະເພາະກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member heightmap_deep_parallax] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of layers to use for parallax occlusion mapping when the camera is "
"far away from the material. Higher values result in a more convincing depth "
"effect, especially in materials that have steep height changes. Higher values "
"have a significant cost on the GPU, so it should only be increased on "
"materials where it makes a significant visual difference.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member heightmap_deep_parallax] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊັ້ນ (layers) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ parallax occlusion mapping ເມື່ອກ້ອງຢູ່ໄກຈາກວັດສະດຸ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມເລິກທີ່ສົມຈິງກວ່າ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສູງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU ຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນເພີ່ມສະເພາະກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member heightmap_deep_parallax] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The heightmap scale to use for the parallax effect (see [member "
"heightmap_enabled]). The default value is tuned so that the highest point "
"(value = 255) appears to be 5 cm higher than the lowest point (value = 0). "
"Higher values result in a deeper appearance, but may result in artifacts "
"appearing when looking at the material from oblique angles, especially when "
"the camera moves. Negative values can be used to invert the parallax effect, "
"but this is different from inverting the texture using [member "
"heightmap_flip_texture] as the material will also appear to be \"closer\" to "
"the camera. In most cases, [member heightmap_scale] should be kept to a "
"positive value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the height map effect looks strange regardless of this value, "
"try adjusting [member heightmap_flip_binormal] and [member "
"heightmap_flip_tangent]. See also [member heightmap_texture] for "
"recommendations on authoring heightmap textures, as the way the heightmap "
"texture is authored affects how [member heightmap_scale] behaves."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງ heightmap ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ parallax (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"heightmap_enabled]). ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຖືກປັບໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຈຸດທີ່ສູງສຸດ (value = 255) "
"ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າສູງກວ່າຈຸດທີ່ຕ່ຳສຸດ (value = 0) ຢູ່ 5 ຊມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືເລິກຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມ (artifacts) ປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເບິ່ງວັດສະດຸຈາກມຸມສະຫຼຽງ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຕອນກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່. ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບເພື່ອສະຫຼັບເອັບເຟັກ parallax ໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ນີ້ຈະຕ່າງຈາກການສະຫຼັບພື້ນຜິວດ້ວຍ [member heightmap_flip_texture] ເພາະວັດສະດຸຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ "
"\"ໃກ້\" ກ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນຕັ້ງ [member heightmap_scale] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າບວກໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເອັບເຟັກ height map ເບິ່ງຄືແປກໆບໍ່ວ່າຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ລອງປັບ [member "
"heightmap_flip_binormal] ແລະ [member heightmap_flip_tangent]. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"heightmap_texture] ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ heightmap texture."

msgid ""
"The texture to use as a height map. See also [member heightmap_enabled].\n"
"For best results, the texture should be normalized (with [member "
"heightmap_scale] reduced to compensate). In [url=https://gimp.org]GIMP[/url], "
"this can be done using [b]Colors > Auto > Equalize[/b]. If the texture only "
"uses a small part of its available range, the parallax effect may look "
"strange, especially when the camera moves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To reduce memory usage and improve loading times, you may be "
"able to use a lower-resolution heightmap texture as most heightmaps are only "
"comprised of low-frequency data."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນ height map. ເບິ່ງ [member heightmap_enabled] ນຳ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ພື້ນຜິວຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການເຮັດ normalize (ໂດຍການຫຼຸດ [member "
"heightmap_scale] ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍ). ໃນ [url=https://gimp.org]GIMP[/url], "
"ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [b]Colors > Auto > Equalize[/b]. "
"ຖ້າພື້ນຜິວໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ສ່ວນນ້ອຍໆຂອງຊ່ວງທີ່ມີໃຫ້, ເອັບເຟັກ parallax ອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືແປກໆ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຕອນກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການໂຫຼດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະໃຊ້ "
"heightmap texture ທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳກໍໄດ້ ເພາະ heightmap ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນແບບ low-"
"frequency."

msgid ""
"A high value makes the material appear more like a metal. Non-metals use "
"their albedo as the diffuse color and add diffuse to the specular reflection. "
"With non-metals, the reflection appears on top of the albedo color. Metals "
"use their albedo as a multiplier to the specular reflection and set the "
"diffuse color to black resulting in a tinted reflection. Materials work "
"better when fully metal or fully non-metal, values between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code] should only be used for blending between metal and non-metal "
"sections. To alter the amount of reflection use [member roughness]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸເບິ່ງຄືໂລຫະ (metal) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂລຫະ (non-metals) ຈະໃຊ້ "
"albedo ເປັນສີ diffuse ແລະ ເພີ່ມ diffuse ເຂົ້າໃນການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular. ສຳລັບ non-"
"metals, ການສະທ້ອນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ເທິງສີ albedo. ສ່ວນໂລຫະຈະໃຊ້ albedo ເປັນຕົວຄູນໃຫ້ກັບ specular "
"reflection ແລະ ຕັ້ງສີ diffuse ເປັນສີດຳ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ການສະທ້ອນທີ່ມີສີເຈືອປົນ. "
"ວັດສະດຸຈະເບິ່ງດີກວ່າເມື່ອເປັນໂລຫະທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂລຫະທັງໝົດ, ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]1[/code] ຄວນໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນໂລຫະ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂລຫະເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອປັບປະລິມານການສະທ້ອນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member roughness]."

msgid ""
"Adjusts the strength of specular reflections. Specular reflections are "
"composed of scene reflections and the specular lobe which is the bright spot "
"that is reflected from light sources. When set to [code]0.0[/code], no "
"specular reflections will be visible. This differs from the [constant "
"SPECULAR_DISABLED] [enum SpecularMode] as [constant SPECULAR_DISABLED] only "
"applies to the specular lobe from the light source.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member metallic], this is not energy-conserving, so it "
"should be left at [code]0.5[/code] in most cases. See also [member roughness]."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular. ການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular ປະກອບດ້ວຍການສະທ້ອນຈາກສາກ "
"ແລະ specular lobe ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຈຸດແຈ້ງທີ່ສະທ້ອນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/"
"code], ຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular. ນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [constant SPECULAR_DISABLED] "
"[enum SpecularMode] ເພາະ [constant SPECULAR_DISABLED] ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ specular "
"lobe ຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄືກັບ [member metallic], ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ energy-conserving, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຄວນປ່ອຍໄວ້ທີ່ [code]0.5[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [member roughness] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Texture used to specify metallic for an object. This is multiplied by [member "
"metallic]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄວາມເປັນໂລຫະ (metallic) ສຳລັບອັອບເຈັກ. ຈະຖືກນຳໄປຄູນກັບ [member "
"metallic]."

msgid ""
"Specifies the channel of the [member metallic_texture] in which the metallic "
"information is stored. This is useful when you store the information for "
"multiple effects in a single texture. For example if you stored metallic in "
"the red channel, roughness in the blue, and ambient occlusion in the green "
"you could reduce the number of textures you use."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຊ່ອງ (channel) ຂອງ [member metallic_texture] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ metallic. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຫຼາຍເອັບເຟັກໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານເກັບ metallic "
"ໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງ, roughness ໃນຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ, ແລະ ambient occlusion ໃນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ, "
"ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຫຼຸດຈຳນວນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລົງໄດ້."

msgid "The width of the shape outline."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຮູບຊົງ."

msgid ""
"The width of the range around the shape between the minimum and maximum "
"representable signed distance."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຊ່ວງອ້ອມຮອບຮູບຊົງ ລະຫວ່າງຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດຂອງ signed distance "
"ທີ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], depth testing is disabled and the object will be drawn "
"in render order."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການກວດສອບຄວາມເລິກ (depth testing) ຈະຖືກປິດ ແລະ "
"ອັອບເຈັກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຕາມລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນ (render order)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], normal mapping is enabled. This has a slight "
"performance cost, especially on mobile GPUs."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຮັດ Normal mapping ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເຄື່ອງເລັກນ້ອຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນ GPU ມືຖື."

msgid "The strength of the normal map's effect."
msgstr "ຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກ normal map."

msgid ""
"Texture used to specify the normal at a given pixel. The [member "
"normal_texture] only uses the red and green channels; the blue and alpha "
"channels are ignored. The normal read from [member normal_texture] is "
"oriented around the surface normal provided by the [Mesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The mesh must have both normals and tangents defined in its "
"vertex data. Otherwise, the normal map won't render correctly and will only "
"appear to darken the whole surface. If creating geometry with [SurfaceTool], "
"you can use [method SurfaceTool.generate_normals] and [method "
"SurfaceTool.generate_tangents] to automatically generate normals and tangents "
"respectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot expects the normal map to use X+, Y+, and Z+ coordinates. "
"See [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]this page[/url] for a "
"comparison of normal map coordinates expected by popular engines.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member detail_enabled] is [code]true[/code], the [member "
"detail_albedo] texture is drawn [i]below[/i] the [member normal_texture]. To "
"display a normal map [i]above[/i] the [member detail_albedo] texture, use "
"[member detail_normal] instead."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບຸຄ່າ normal ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. [member normal_texture] "
"ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວ; ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ ແລະ alpha ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຄ່າ normal ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຈາກ "
"[member normal_texture] ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງອ້ອມຮອບ surface normal ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ [Mesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] mesh ຕ້ອງມີທັງ normals ແລະ tangents ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ vertex. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"normal map ຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຈະປາກົດວ່າເຮັດໃຫ້ຜິວໜ້າທັງໝົດມືດລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າສ້າງ geometry "
"ດ້ວຍ [SurfaceTool], ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method SurfaceTool.generate_normals] ແລະ "
"[method SurfaceTool.generate_tangents] ເພື່ອສ້າງ normals ແລະ tangents "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ normal map ໃຊ້ພິກັດ X+, Y+, ແລະ Z+.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member detail_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຜິວ [member "
"detail_albedo] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ [i]ລຸ່ມ[/i] [member normal_texture]. ເພື່ອສະແດງ normal "
"map ຢູ່ [i]ເທິງ[/i] [member detail_albedo], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member detail_normal] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The Occlusion/Roughness/Metallic texture to use. This is a more efficient "
"replacement of [member ao_texture], [member roughness_texture] and [member "
"metallic_texture] in [ORMMaterial3D]. Ambient occlusion is stored in the red "
"channel. Roughness map is stored in the green channel. Metallic map is stored "
"in the blue channel. The alpha channel is ignored."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ Occlusion/Roughness/Metallic (ORM) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນການປ່ຽນແທນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າສຳລັບ "
"[member ao_texture], [member roughness_texture] ແລະ [member metallic_texture] "
"ໃນ [ORMMaterial3D]. Ambient occlusion ຈະຖືກເກັບໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງ, Roughness map "
"ເກັບໃນຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ, ແລະ Metallic map ເກັບໃນຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ. ສ່ວນຊ່ອງ alpha ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"The number of horizontal frames in the particle sprite sheet. Only enabled "
"when using [constant BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]. See [member billboard_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມໃນແນວນອນຂອງ particle sprite sheet. ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant "
"BILLBOARD_PARTICLES] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member billboard_mode] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particle animations are looped. Only enabled when using "
"[constant BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]. See [member billboard_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອນິເມຊັນຂອງພາກທິເຄິລ (particle) ຈະວົນຊ້ຳ. "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant BILLBOARD_PARTICLES] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"billboard_mode] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"The number of vertical frames in the particle sprite sheet. Only enabled when "
"using [constant BILLBOARD_PARTICLES]. See [member billboard_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມໃນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງ particle sprite sheet. ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant "
"BILLBOARD_PARTICLES] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member billboard_mode] ປະກອບ."

msgid "The point size in pixels. See [member use_point_size]."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຈຸດໃນໜ່ວຍພິກເຊລ. ເບິ່ງ [member use_point_size] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Distance over which the fade effect takes place. The larger the distance the "
"longer it takes for an object to fade."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກການຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍ (fade) ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຍິ່ງໄລຍະຫ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເທົ່າໃດ "
"ກໍຍິ່ງໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນການທີ່ອັອບເຈັກຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the proximity fade effect is enabled. The proximity "
"fade effect fades out each pixel based on its distance to another object."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ proximity fade. "
"ເອັບເຟັກນີ້ຈະຄ່ອຍໆເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລຈາງຫາຍໄປໂດຍອີງຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງມັນກັບອອບເຈັກອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the refraction effect is enabled. Distorts transparency "
"based on light from behind the object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Refraction is implemented using the screen texture. Only opaque "
"materials will appear in the refraction, since transparent materials do not "
"appear in the screen texture."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກການຫັກເຫແສງ (refraction). "
"ມັນຈະບິດບ້ຽວຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໂດຍອີງຕາມແສງຈາກທາງຫຼັງອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຫັກເຫແສງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ screen texture. "
"ຈະມີພຽງວັດສະດຸທີ່ທຶບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນການຫັກເຫ, ເພາະວັດສະດຸທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ screen "
"texture."

msgid "The strength of the refraction effect."
msgstr "ຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກການຫັກເຫແສງ (refraction effect)."

msgid ""
"Texture that controls the strength of the refraction per-pixel. Multiplied by "
"[member refraction_scale]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມແຮງຂອງການຫັກເຫແສງໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. ຈະຖືກນຳໄປຄູນກັບ [member "
"refraction_scale]."

msgid ""
"Specifies the channel of the [member refraction_texture] in which the "
"refraction information is stored. This is useful when you store the "
"information for multiple effects in a single texture. For example if you "
"stored refraction in the red channel, roughness in the blue, and ambient "
"occlusion in the green you could reduce the number of textures you use."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຊ່ອງ (channel) ຂອງ [member refraction_texture] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ refraction. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຫຼາຍເອັບເຟັກໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ."

msgid "Sets the strength of the rim lighting effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກແສງຂອບ (rim lighting effect)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], rim effect is enabled. Rim lighting increases the "
"brightness at glancing angles on an object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Rim lighting is not visible if the material's [member "
"shading_mode] is [constant SHADING_MODE_UNSHADED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກຂອບແສງ (rim effect). Rim lighting "
"ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຢູ່ຕາມມຸມຂອບຂອງອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Rim lighting ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນຖ້າ [member shading_mode] ຂອງວັດສະດຸຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant SHADING_MODE_UNSHADED]."

msgid ""
"Texture used to set the strength of the rim lighting effect per-pixel. "
"Multiplied by [member rim]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກແສງຂອບໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. ຈະຖືກນຳໄປຄູນກັບ [member rim]."

msgid ""
"The amount of to blend light and albedo color when rendering rim effect. If "
"[code]0[/code] the light color is used, while [code]1[/code] means albedo "
"color is used. An intermediate value generally works best."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງສີແສງ ແລະ ສີ albedo ເມື່ອສະແດງຜົນ rim effect. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code] ຈະໃຊ້ສີແສງ, ຖ້າເປັນ [code]1[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ສີ albedo. ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Surface reflection. A value of [code]0[/code] represents a perfect mirror "
"while a value of [code]1[/code] completely blurs the reflection. See also "
"[member metallic]."
msgstr ""
"ການສະທ້ອນຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງກະຈົກທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1[/"
"code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະທ້ອນມົວທັງໝົດ. ເບິ່ງ [member metallic] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Texture used to control the roughness per-pixel. Multiplied by [member "
"roughness]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຂຸຂະ (roughness) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ. ຈະຖືກນຳໄປຄູນກັບ [member "
"roughness]."

msgid ""
"Specifies the channel of the [member roughness_texture] in which the "
"roughness information is stored. This is useful when you store the "
"information for multiple effects in a single texture. For example if you "
"stored metallic in the red channel, roughness in the blue, and ambient "
"occlusion in the green you could reduce the number of textures you use."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຊ່ອງ (channel) ຂອງ [member roughness_texture] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ roughness. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຫຼາຍເອັບເຟັກໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Sets whether the shading takes place, per-pixel, per-vertex or unshaded. Per-"
"vertex lighting is faster, making it the best choice for mobile applications, "
"however it looks considerably worse than per-pixel. Unshaded rendering is the "
"fastest, but disables all interactions with lights."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ມີການໃຫ້ເງົາ (shading) ແບບໃດ: ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ (per-pixel), ແຕ່ລະຈຸດ (per-"
"vertex) ຫຼື ບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີເງົາ (unshaded). ການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ per-vertex ຈະໄວກວ່າ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເໝາະສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນມືຖື, ແຕ່ຮູບລັກສະນະຈະດ້ອຍກວ່າ per-pixel. ການສະແດງຜົນແບບ unshaded "
"ຈະໄວທີ່ສຸດ ແຕ່ຈະປິດການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບແສງທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the \"shadow to opacity\" render mode where "
"lighting modifies the alpha so shadowed areas are opaque and non-shadowed "
"areas are transparent. Useful for overlaying shadows onto a camera feed in AR."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ \"shadow to opacity\" ໂດຍທີ່ແສງຈະໄປປັບຄ່າ "
"alpha ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີເງົາທຶບແສງ ແລະ ບໍລິເວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເງົາໂປ່ງໃສ. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການວາງເງົາຊ້ອນລົງເທິງພາບຈາກກ້ອງໃນ AR."

msgid ""
"The method for rendering the specular blob.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member specular_mode] only applies to the specular blob. It "
"does not affect specular reflections from the sky, screen-space reflections, "
"[VoxelGI], SDFGI or [ReflectionProbe]s. To disable reflections from these "
"sources as well, set [member metallic_specular] to [code]0.0[/code] instead."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການໃນການສະແດງຜົນ specular blob.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member specular_mode] ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ specular blob ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການສະທ້ອນແບບ specular ຈາກທ້ອງຟ້າ, screen-space reflections, [VoxelGI], "
"SDFGI ຫຼື [ReflectionProbe]. ເພື່ອປິດການສະທ້ອນຈາກແຫຼ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນນຳ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"metallic_specular] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ແທນ."

msgid "The primary color of the stencil effect."
msgstr "ສີຫຼັກຂອງເອັບເຟັກສະເຕນຊິລ (stencil effect)."

msgid "The comparison operator to use for stencil masking operations."
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການປຽບທຽບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ stencil masking."

msgid "The flags dictating how the stencil operation behaves."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (flags) ທີ່ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ stencil."

msgid "The stencil effect mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດຂອງເອັບເຟັກສະເຕນຊິລ (stencil effect mode)."

msgid "The outline thickness for [constant STENCIL_MODE_OUTLINE]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບສຳລັບ [constant STENCIL_MODE_OUTLINE]."

msgid "The stencil reference value (0-255). Typically a power of 2."
msgstr "ຄ່າອ້າງອີງຂອງ stencil (0-255). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນຄ່າເລກກຳລັງຂອງ 2."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subsurface scattering is enabled. Emulates light that "
"penetrates an object's surface, is scattered, and then emerges. Subsurface "
"scattering quality is controlled by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"environment/subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_quality].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Subsurface scattering is not supported on viewports that have a "
"transparent background (where [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is [code]true[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ subsurface scattering (ການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວວັດຖຸ). "
"ເປັນການຈຳລອງແສງທີ່ຊອດຜ່ານຜິວອອບເຈັກ, ກະເຈິງຢູ່ທາງໃນ, ແລ້ວກໍອອກມາ. ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ subsurface "
"scattering ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/"
"subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_quality].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] subsurface scattering ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ viewport ທີ່ມີພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subsurface scattering will use a special mode optimized "
"for the color and density of human skin, such as boosting the intensity of "
"the red channel in subsurface scattering."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], subsurface scattering ຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດພິເສດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບສີ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຜິວໜັງມະນຸດ, ເຊັ່ນການເພີ່ມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງຊ່ອງສີແດງໃນການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ."

msgid ""
"The strength of the subsurface scattering effect. The depth of the effect is "
"also controlled by [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/"
"subsurface_scattering/subsurface_scattering_scale], which is set globally."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ subsurface scattering. ຄວາມເລິກຂອງເອັບເຟັກຍັງຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/subsurface_scattering/"
"subsurface_scattering_scale] ເຊິ່ງເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບສາກົນ (global)."

msgid ""
"Texture used to control the subsurface scattering strength. Stored in the red "
"texture channel. Multiplied by [member subsurf_scatter_strength]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ subsurface scattering. "
"ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງຂອງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [member subsurf_scatter_strength]."

msgid "The intensity of the subsurface scattering transmittance effect."
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງເອັບເຟັກການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ (subsurface scattering transmittance)."

msgid ""
"The color to multiply the subsurface scattering transmittance effect with. "
"Ignored if [member subsurf_scatter_skin_mode] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ຈະນຳມາຄູນກັບເອັບເຟັກການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າ [member "
"subsurf_scatter_skin_mode] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "The depth of the subsurface scattering transmittance effect."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລິກຂອງເອັບເຟັກການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables subsurface scattering transmittance. Only "
"effective if [member subsurf_scatter_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. See also "
"[member backlight_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member "
"subsurf_scatter_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"backlight_enabled] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"The texture to use for multiplying the intensity of the subsurface scattering "
"transmittance intensity. See also [member subsurf_scatter_texture]. Ignored "
"if [member subsurf_scatter_skin_mode] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄູນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"subsurf_scatter_texture] ນຳ. ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າ [member subsurf_scatter_skin_mode] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Filter flags for the texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member heightmap_texture] is always sampled with linear "
"filtering, even if nearest-neighbor filtering is selected here. This is to "
"ensure the heightmap effect looks as intended. If you need sharper height "
"transitions between pixels, resize the heightmap texture in an image editor "
"with nearest-neighbor filtering."
msgstr ""
"ທຸງການກັ່ນຕອງ (Filter flags) ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member heightmap_texture] ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍ linear filtering "
"ສະເໝີ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເລືອກ nearest-neighbor filtering ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ກໍຕາມ. "
"ນີ້ກໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເອັບເຟັກ heightmap ຈະອອກມາຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໄວ້. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການປ່ຽນລະດັບຄວາມສູງທີ່ຄົມຊັດລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊລ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ heightmap texture "
"ໃນໂປຣແກຣມແຕ່ງຮູບໂດຍໃຊ້ nearest-neighbor filtering."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the texture repeats when exceeding the texture's size. "
"See [constant FLAG_USE_TEXTURE_REPEAT]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຊ້ຳເມື່ອກາຍຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[constant FLAG_USE_TEXTURE_REPEAT] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"The material's transparency mode. Some transparency modes will disable shadow "
"casting. Any transparency mode other than [constant TRANSPARENCY_DISABLED] "
"has a greater performance impact compared to opaque rendering. See also "
"[member blend_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ (transparency mode) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ. ບາງໂໝດອາດຈະປິດການເກີດເງົາ (shadow "
"casting). ໂໝດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໃດໆກໍຕາມທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant TRANSPARENCY_DISABLED] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າການສະແດງຜົນແບບທຶບແສງ (opaque). ເບິ່ງ [member blend_mode] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] use [member fov_override] to override the [Camera3D]'s "
"field of view angle."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member fov_override] ເພື່ອທັບຊ້ອນມຸມມອງ (field of "
"view) ຂອງ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables parts of the shader required for "
"[GPUParticles3D] trails to function. This also requires using a mesh with "
"appropriate skinning, such as [RibbonTrailMesh] or [TubeTrailMesh]. Enabling "
"this feature outside of materials used in [GPUParticles3D] meshes will break "
"material rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງເຊດເດີທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ [GPUParticles3D] "
"trails ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ນີ້ຍັງຕ້ອງການການໃຊ້ mesh ທີ່ມີການເຮັດ skinning ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[RibbonTrailMesh] ຫຼື [TubeTrailMesh]. ການເປີດໃຊ້ລູກຫຼິ້ນນີ້ກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"[GPUParticles3D] meshes ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນວັດສະດຸເພ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], render point size can be changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only effective for objects whose geometry is point-based "
"rather than triangle-based. See also [member point_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຈຸດທີ່ສະແດງຜົນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບອອບເຈັກທີ່ມີ geometry ແບບຈຸດ (point-based) "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແບບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ (triangle-based). ເບິ່ງ [member point_size] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] use [member z_clip_scale] to scale the object being "
"rendered towards the camera to avoid clipping into things like walls."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ [member z_clip_scale] "
"ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດອອບເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າຫາກ້ອງ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການທະລຸ (clipping) "
"ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສິ່ງຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ: ຝາ."

msgid ""
"How much to offset the [code]UV[/code] coordinates. This amount will be added "
"to [code]UV[/code] in the vertex function. This can be used to offset a "
"texture. The Z component is used when [member uv1_triplanar] is enabled, but "
"it is not used anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະການຊົດເຊີຍ (offset) ຂອງພິກັດ [code]UV[/code]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບ [code]UV[/code] "
"ໃນ vertex function. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລື່ອນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄ່າໃນແກນ Z ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member "
"uv1_triplanar] ເປີດຢູ່, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"How much to scale the [code]UV[/code] coordinates. This is multiplied by "
"[code]UV[/code] in the vertex function. The Z component is used when [member "
"uv1_triplanar] is enabled, but it is not used anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງພິກັດ [code]UV[/code]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄູນກັບ [code]UV[/code] ໃນ vertex "
"function. ຄ່າໃນແກນ Z ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member uv1_triplanar] ເປີດຢູ່, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], instead of using [code]UV[/code] textures will use a "
"triplanar texture lookup to determine how to apply textures. Triplanar uses "
"the orientation of the object's surface to blend between texture coordinates. "
"It reads from the source texture 3 times, once for each axis and then blends "
"between the results based on how closely the pixel aligns with each axis. "
"This is often used for natural features to get a realistic blend of "
"materials. Because triplanar texturing requires many more texture reads per-"
"pixel it is much slower than normal UV texturing. Additionally, because it is "
"blending the texture between the three axes, it is unsuitable when you are "
"trying to achieve crisp texturing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [code]UV[/code] ທຳມະດາ ພື້ນຜິວຈະໃຊ້ triplanar "
"texture lookup ເພື່ອກຳນົດການນຳໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວ. Triplanar ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງຂອງຜິວອອບເຈັກເພື່ອປະສົມ "
"(blend) ລະຫວ່າງພິກັດພື້ນຜິວ. ມັນຈະອ່ານຈາກພື້ນຜິວຕົ້ນສະບັບ 3 ຄັ້ງ (ແກນລະຄັ້ງ) ແລ້ວນຳມາປະສົມກັນ. "
"ມັກໃຊ້ກັບພື້ນຜິວທຳມະຊາດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການປະສົມວັດສະດຸທີ່ສົມຈິງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ triplanar "
"ຕ້ອງອ່ານພື້ນຜິວຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ພິກເຊລ ມັນຈຶ່ງຊ້າກວ່າການໃຊ້ UV ປົກກະຕິຫຼາຍ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ຍ້ອນມັນມີການປະສົມພື້ນຜິວລະຫວ່າງສາມແກນ ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ເໝາະສົມຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຄົມຊັດ."

msgid ""
"A lower number blends the texture more softly while a higher number blends "
"the texture more sharply.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member uv1_triplanar_sharpness] is clamped between [code]0.0[/"
"code] and [code]150.0[/code] (inclusive) as values outside that range can "
"look broken depending on the mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະປະສົມພື້ນຜິວແບບນຸ່ມນວນກວ່າ, ສ່ວນຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະປະສົມພື້ນຜິວແບບຄົມຊັດກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member uv1_triplanar_sharpness] ຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]150.0[/code] ເພາະຄ່ານອກຊ່ວງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄືເພ ຂຶ້ນກັບລັກສະນະຂອງ mesh."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], triplanar mapping for [code]UV[/code] is calculated in "
"world space rather than object local space. See also [member uv1_triplanar]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຮັດ triplanar mapping ສຳລັບ [code]UV[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໃນ world space ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ object local space. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"uv1_triplanar] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"How much to offset the [code]UV2[/code] coordinates. This amount will be "
"added to [code]UV2[/code] in the vertex function. This can be used to offset "
"a texture. The Z component is used when [member uv2_triplanar] is enabled, "
"but it is not used anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະການຊົດເຊີຍ (offset) ຂອງພິກັດ [code]UV2[/code]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບ [code]UV2[/"
"code] ໃນ vertex function."

msgid ""
"How much to scale the [code]UV2[/code] coordinates. This is multiplied by "
"[code]UV2[/code] in the vertex function. The Z component is used when [member "
"uv2_triplanar] is enabled, but it is not used anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງພິກັດ [code]UV2[/code]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄູນກັບ [code]UV2[/code] ໃນ vertex "
"function."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], instead of using [code]UV2[/code] textures will use a "
"triplanar texture lookup to determine how to apply textures. Triplanar uses "
"the orientation of the object's surface to blend between texture coordinates. "
"It reads from the source texture 3 times, once for each axis and then blends "
"between the results based on how closely the pixel aligns with each axis. "
"This is often used for natural features to get a realistic blend of "
"materials. Because triplanar texturing requires many more texture reads per-"
"pixel it is much slower than normal UV texturing. Additionally, because it is "
"blending the texture between the three axes, it is unsuitable when you are "
"trying to achieve crisp texturing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [code]UV2[/code] ທຳມະດາ ພື້ນຜິວຈະໃຊ້ triplanar "
"texture lookup ເພື່ອກຳນົດການນຳໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວ."

msgid ""
"A lower number blends the texture more softly while a higher number blends "
"the texture more sharply.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member uv2_triplanar_sharpness] is clamped between [code]0.0[/"
"code] and [code]150.0[/code] (inclusive) as values outside that range can "
"look broken depending on the mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະປະສົມພື້ນຜິວແບບນຸ່ມນວນກວ່າ, ສ່ວນຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະປະສົມພື້ນຜິວແບບຄົມຊັດກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member uv2_triplanar_sharpness] ຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຫາ [code]150.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], triplanar mapping for [code]UV2[/code] is calculated in "
"world space rather than object local space. See also [member uv2_triplanar]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຮັດ triplanar mapping ສຳລັບ [code]UV2[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໃນ world space ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ object local space."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], vertex colors are considered to be stored in nonlinear "
"sRGB encoding and are converted to linear encoding during rendering. If "
"[code]false[/code], vertex colors are considered to be stored in linear "
"encoding and are rendered as-is. See also [member "
"albedo_texture_force_srgb].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective when using the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຖືວ່າສີຂອງ vertex ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບ sRGB (nonlinear) ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ linear ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສະແດງຜົນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະຖືວ່າຖືກເກັບເປັນ "
"linear ແລະ ຈະສະແດງຜົນຕາມນັ້ນເລີຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member albedo_texture_force_srgb] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"Compatibility ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the vertex color is used as albedo color."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສີຂອງຈຸດຈອມ (vertex color) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນສີພື້ນຜິວ (albedo "
"color)."

msgid ""
"Scales the object being rendered towards the camera to avoid clipping into "
"things like walls. This is intended to be used for objects that are fixed "
"with respect to the camera like player arms, tools, etc. Lighting and shadows "
"will continue to work correctly when this setting is adjusted, but screen-"
"space effects like SSAO and SSR may break with lower scales. Therefore, try "
"to keep this setting as close to [code]1.0[/code] as possible."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດອອບເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າຫາກ້ອງ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການທະລຸເຂົ້າໄປໃນສິ່ງຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນຝາ. "
"ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບອອບເຈັກທີ່ຢູ່ຄົງທີ່ກັບກ້ອງ ເຊັ່ນ: ແຂນຂອງຕົວລະຄອນ, ເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ແສງ ແລະ "
"ເງົາຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແຕ່ເອັບເຟັກ screen-space ເຊັ່ນ SSAO ແລະ SSR "
"ອາດຈະເພໄດ້ຖ້າໃຊ້ scale ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວນພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ໃກ້ກັບ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel color."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດສີໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel metallic value."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າຄວາມເປັນໂລຫະ (metallic) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel roughness value."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າຄວາມຂຸຂະ (roughness) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel emission color."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດສີຂອງການປ່ອຍແສງ (emission) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel normal vector."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດ ເວກເຕີນໍມໍ (normal vector) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel bent normal vector."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ລະບຸ bent normal vector ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel rim value."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າແສງຂອບ (rim) ໃນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel clearcoat value."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າ clearcoat ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Texture specifying per-pixel flowmap direction for use with [member "
"anisotropy]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດທິດທາງ flowmap ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ ສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ [member anisotropy]."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel ambient occlusion value."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າ ambient occlusion ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel height."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄວາມສູງຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel subsurface scattering."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ (subsurface scattering) ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel transmittance for subsurface scattering."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າການສ່ອງຜ່ານ (transmittance) ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ ສຳລັບການກະເຈິງແສງໃຕ້ຜິວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel backlight color."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດສີແສງດ້ານຫຼັງ (backlight) ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel refraction strength."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄວາມແຮງຂອງການຫັກເຫແສງ (refraction) ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel detail mask blending value."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າການປະສົມ (blending) ຂອງ detail mask ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel detail color."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດສີລາຍລະອຽດ (detail color) ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture specifying per-pixel detail normal."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດ detail normal ຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Texture holding ambient occlusion, roughness, and metallic."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ເກັບຄ່າ ambient occlusion, roughness, ແລະ metallic."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum TextureParam] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [enum TextureParam]."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel only. This makes the texture "
"look pixelated from up close, and grainy from a distance (due to mipmaps not "
"being sampled)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ "
"ເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດຫຍາບເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ mipmaps)."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels. This makes the "
"texture look smooth from up close, and grainy from a distance (due to mipmaps "
"not being sampled)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ "
"ເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດຫຍາບເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ mipmaps)."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between the "
"nearest 2 mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] "
"is [code]true[/code]). This makes the texture look pixelated from up close, "
"and smooth from a distance."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and between the "
"nearest 2 mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] "
"is [code]true[/code]). This makes the texture look smooth from up close, and "
"smooth from a distance."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນທັງໄລຍະໃກ້ ແລະ ໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between 2 mipmaps "
"(or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) based on the "
"angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the texture look "
"pixelated from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic filtering "
"improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with the camera, "
"but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be changed by "
"adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ "
"ແລະ ກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ ລຽບນຽນຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ການຕອງແບບ "
"Anisotropic ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບເທັກເຈີເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລະດັບສາຍຕາກັບກ້ອງ "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ສາມາດປັບລະດັບໄດ້ທີ່ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and blends between 2 "
"mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) "
"based on the angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the "
"texture look smooth from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic "
"filtering improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with "
"the camera, but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be "
"changed by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຕອງເທັກເຈີຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນທັງໄລຍະໃກ້ ແລະ ໄລຍະໄກ. "
"ການຕອງແບບ Anisotropic ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບເທັກເຈີເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລະດັບສາຍຕາກັບກ້ອງ. "
"ສາມາດປັບລະດັບໄດ້ທີ່ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum TextureFilter] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum TextureFilter]."

msgid "Use [code]UV[/code] with the detail texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [code]UV[/code] ກັບ detail texture."

msgid "Use [code]UV2[/code] with the detail texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [code]UV2[/code] ກັບ detail texture."

msgid "The material will not use transparency. This is the fastest to render."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ເຣັນເດີໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The material will use the texture's alpha values for transparency. This is "
"the slowest to render, and disables shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ alpha ຂອງເທັກເຈີເພື່ອເຮັດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ເຣັນເດີຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ "
"ຈະປິດຕົວເລືອກການຖ່າຍເທເງົາ."

msgid ""
"The material will cut off all values below a threshold, the rest will remain "
"opaque. The opaque portions will be rendered in the depth prepass. This is "
"faster to render than alpha blending, but slower than opaque rendering. This "
"also supports casting shadows."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຈະຕັດຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າເກນ (threshold) ອອກ, ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະເປັນແບບທຶບແສງ. "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ທຶບແສງຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໃນ depth prepass. ວິທີນີ້ເຣັນເດີໄວກວ່າ alpha blending ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ "
"opaque. ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຖ່າຍເທເງົາ."

msgid ""
"The material will cut off all values below a spatially-deterministic "
"threshold, the rest will remain opaque. This is faster to render than alpha "
"blending, but slower than opaque rendering. This also supports casting "
"shadows. Alpha hashing is suited for hair rendering."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຈະຕັດຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າເກນແບບ spatially-deterministic ອອກ. ວິທີນີ້ໄວກວ່າ alpha blending "
"ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ opaque. ຮອງຮັບການຖ່າຍເທເງົາ. Alpha hashing ເໝາະສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີເສັ້ນຜົມ."

msgid ""
"The material will use the texture's alpha value for transparency, but will "
"discard fragments with an alpha of less than 0.99 during the depth prepass "
"and fragments with an alpha less than 0.1 during the shadow pass. This also "
"supports casting shadows."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ alpha ເພື່ອຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ແຕ່ຈະຖິ້ມສ່ວນທີ່ມີຄ່າ alpha ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 0.99 ໃນຊ່ວງ depth "
"prepass ແລະ ຖິ້ມສ່ວນທີ່ມີ alpha ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 0.1 ໃນຊ່ວງ shadow pass. ຮອງຮັບການຖ່າຍເທເງົາ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Transparency] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum Transparency]."

msgid ""
"The object will not receive shadows. This is the fastest to render, but it "
"disables all interactions with lights."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະບໍ່ຮັບເງົາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີເຣັນເດີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ ແຕ່ມັນຈະປິດການຕອບສະໜອງກັບແສງທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The object will be shaded per pixel. Useful for realistic shading effects."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກເຮັດເງົາແບບຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກທີ່ເນັ້ນຄວາມສົມຈິງ."

msgid ""
"The object will be shaded per vertex. Useful when you want cheaper shaders "
"and do not care about visual quality."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກເຮັດເງົາແບບຕໍ່ຈຸດ (vertex). ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການເຣັນເດີແບບປະຢັດຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ເນັ້ນຄຸນນະພາບຂອງພາບ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ShadingMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ShadingMode]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member emission_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member emission_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member normal_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member normal_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member rim_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member rim_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member clearcoat_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member clearcoat_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member anisotropy_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member anisotropy_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member ao_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ao_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member heightmap_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member heightmap_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member subsurf_scatter_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member subsurf_scatter_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member subsurf_scatter_transmittance_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member subsurf_scatter_transmittance_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member backlight_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member backlight_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member refraction_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member refraction_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member detail_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member detail_enabled]."

msgid "Constant for setting [member bent_normal_enabled]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member bent_normal_enabled]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Feature] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum Feature]."

msgid ""
"Default blend mode. The color of the object is blended over the background "
"based on the object's alpha value."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສີຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກປະສົມທັບພື້ນຫຼັງໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າ alpha ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid "The color of the object is added to the background."
msgstr "ສີຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບສີຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງ (Additive)."

msgid "The color of the object is subtracted from the background."
msgstr "ສີຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກລົບອອກຈາກສີຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງ (Subtractive)."

msgid "The color of the object is multiplied by the background."
msgstr "ສີຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຄູນເຂົ້າກັບສີຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງ (Multiplicative)."

msgid ""
"The color of the object is added to the background and the alpha channel is "
"used to mask out the background. This is effectively a hybrid of the blend "
"mix and add modes, useful for effects like fire where you want the flame to "
"add but the smoke to mix. By default, this works with unshaded materials "
"using premultiplied textures. For shaded materials, use the "
"[code]PREMUL_ALPHA_FACTOR[/code] built-in so that lighting can be modulated "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ alpha ເພື່ອບັງພື້ນຫຼັງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງໂໝດ mix "
"ແລະ add, ເໝາະສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຄືໄຟ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແປວໄຟບວກແສງເຂົ້າໄປ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຄວັນໄຟປະສົມເຂົ້າກັບສາກ. "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະໃຊ້ກັບວັດສະດຸແບບ unshaded ທີ່ໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີແບບ premultiplied."

msgid "Disables Alpha AntiAliasing for the material."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Alpha AntiAliasing ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸນີ້."

msgid ""
"Enables AlphaToCoverage. Alpha values in the material are passed to the "
"AntiAliasing sample mask."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ AlphaToCoverage. ຄ່າ Alpha ໃນວັດສະດຸຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ AntiAliasing sample mask."

msgid ""
"Enables AlphaToCoverage and forces all non-zero alpha values to [code]1[/"
"code]. Alpha values in the material are passed to the AntiAliasing sample "
"mask."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ AlphaToCoverage ແລະ ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຄ່າ alpha ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນກາຍເປັນ [code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Default depth draw mode. Depth is drawn only for opaque objects during the "
"opaque prepass (if any) and during the opaque pass."
msgstr "ໂໝດການແຕ້ມຄວາມເລິກ (depth draw) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄວາມເລິກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມສະເພາະວັດຖຸທຶບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Objects will write to depth during the opaque and the transparent passes. "
"Transparent objects that are close to the camera may obscure other "
"transparent objects behind them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not influence whether transparent objects are included "
"in the depth prepass or not. For that, see [enum Transparency]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະຂຽນຄ່າຄວາມເລິກທັງໃນຊ່ວງ opaque ແລະ transparent. "
"ວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກ້ອງອາດຈະບັງວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສອື່ນໆທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການລວມວັດຖຸໂປ່ງໃສໃນ depth prepass, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [enum "
"Transparency] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Objects will not write their depth to the depth buffer, even during the depth "
"prepass (if enabled)."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະບໍ່ຂຽນຄ່າຄວາມເລິກລົງໃນ depth buffer, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ depth prepass ກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Depth test will discard the pixel if it is behind other pixels."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກຈະຖິ້ມພິກເຊວຖ້າມັນຢູ່ດ້ານຫຼັງພິກເຊວອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Depth test will discard the pixel if it is in front of other pixels. Useful "
"for stencil effects."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກຈະຖິ້ມພິກເຊວຖ້າມັນຢູ່ດ້ານໜ້າພິກເຊວອື່ນ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ stencil effects."

msgid ""
"Default cull mode. The back of the object is culled when not visible. Back "
"face triangles will be culled when facing the camera. This results in only "
"the front side of triangles being drawn. For closed-surface meshes, this "
"means that only the exterior of the mesh will be visible."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການຄັດອອກ (cull mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ດ້ານຫຼັງຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຖືກຄັດອອກເມື່ອເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ້ມສະເພາະດ້ານໜ້າຂອງສາມຫຼ່ຽມເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Front face triangles will be culled when facing the camera. This results in "
"only the back side of triangles being drawn. For closed-surface meshes, this "
"means that the interior of the mesh will be drawn instead of the exterior."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ານໜ້າຂອງສາມຫຼ່ຽມຈະຖືກຄັດອອກເມື່ອຫັນໜ້າຫາກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຕ້ມສະເພາະດ້ານໃນຂອງ mesh ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"No face culling is performed; both the front face and back face will be "
"visible."
msgstr "ຈະບໍ່ມີການຄັດອອກ; ຈະເຫັນທັງດ້ານໜ້າ ແລະ ດ້ານຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Disables the depth test, so this object is drawn on top of all others drawn "
"before it. This puts the object in the transparent draw pass where it is "
"sorted based on distance to camera. Objects drawn after it in the draw order "
"may cover it. This also disables writing to depth."
msgstr "ປິດການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸນີ້ຖືກແຕ້ມທັບເທິງວັດຖຸອື່ນໆທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມມາກ່ອນໜ້າ."

msgid "Set [code]ALBEDO[/code] to the per-vertex color specified in the mesh."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ [code]ALBEDO[/code] ຕາມສີຂອງແຕ່ລະຈຸດ (per-vertex) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ mesh."

msgid ""
"Vertex colors are considered to be stored in nonlinear sRGB encoding and are "
"converted to linear encoding during rendering. See also [member "
"vertex_color_is_srgb].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective when using the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຈຸດ (vertex colors) ຈະຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບ sRGB ແລະ ຖືກແປງເປັນ linear "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣັນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Uses point size to alter the size of primitive points. Also changes the "
"albedo texture lookup to use [code]POINT_COORD[/code] instead of [code]UV[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ point size ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງຈຸດ primitive."

msgid ""
"Object is scaled by depth so that it always appears the same size on screen."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມຄວາມເລິກເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນເປັນຂະໜາດດຽວກັນຕະຫຼອດເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Shader will keep the scale set for the mesh. Otherwise the scale is lost when "
"billboarding. Only applies when [member billboard_mode] is [constant "
"BILLBOARD_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Shader ຈະຮັກສາຂະໜາດ (scale) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃຫ້ mesh. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຂະໜາດຈະເສຍໄປເມື່ອໃຊ້ billboarding."

msgid ""
"Use triplanar texture lookup for all texture lookups that would normally use "
"[code]UV[/code]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີແບບ triplanar ແທນການໃຊ້ [code]UV[/code] ແບບປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"Use triplanar texture lookup for all texture lookups that would normally use "
"[code]UV2[/code]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາເທັກເຈີແບບ triplanar ແທນການໃຊ້ [code]UV2[/code] ແບບປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"Use [code]UV2[/code] coordinates to look up from the [member ao_texture]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພິກັດ [code]UV2[/code] ເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າຈາກ [member ao_texture]."

msgid ""
"Use [code]UV2[/code] coordinates to look up from the [member "
"emission_texture]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພິກັດ [code]UV2[/code] ເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າຈາກ [member emission_texture]."

msgid ""
"Forces the shader to convert albedo from nonlinear sRGB encoding to linear "
"encoding. See also [member albedo_texture_force_srgb]."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ shader ແປງ albedo ຈາກ sRGB ເປັນ linear."

msgid "Disables receiving shadows from other objects."
msgstr "ປິດການຮັບເງົາຈາກວັດຖຸອື່ນ."

msgid "Disables receiving ambient light."
msgstr "ປິດການຮັບແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light)."

msgid "Enables the shadow to opacity feature."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ shadow to opacity."

msgid ""
"Enables the texture to repeat when UV coordinates are outside the 0-1 range. "
"If using one of the linear filtering modes, this can result in artifacts at "
"the edges of a texture when the sampler filters across the edges of the "
"texture."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີເຮັດຊໍ້າ (repeat) ເມື່ອພິກັດ UV ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ 0-1."

msgid ""
"Invert values read from a depth texture to convert them to height values "
"(heightmap)."
msgstr "ກັບຄ່າທີ່ອ່ານຈາກ depth texture ເພື່ອແປງເປັນຄ່າຄວາມສູງ (heightmap)."

msgid ""
"Enables the skin mode for subsurface scattering which is used to improve the "
"look of subsurface scattering when used for human skin."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ skin mode ສຳລັບ subsurface scattering ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜິວໜັງມະນຸດເບິ່ງສົມຈິງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enables parts of the shader required for [GPUParticles3D] trails to function. "
"This also requires using a mesh with appropriate skinning, such as "
"[RibbonTrailMesh] or [TubeTrailMesh]. Enabling this feature outside of "
"materials used in [GPUParticles3D] meshes will break material rendering."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສ່ວນຂອງ shader ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ [GPUParticles3D] trails."

msgid "Enables multichannel signed distance field rendering shader."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ shader ສຳລັບເຣັນເດີ multichannel signed distance field (MSDF)."

msgid "Disables receiving depth-based or volumetric fog."
msgstr "ປິດການຮັບໝອກແບບ depth-based ຫຼື volumetric fog."

msgid "Disables specular occlusion."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ specular occlusion."

msgid "Enables using [member z_clip_scale]."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member z_clip_scale]."

msgid "Enables using [member fov_override]."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member fov_override]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Flags] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum Flags]."

msgid "Default diffuse scattering algorithm."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິດທຶມການກະຈາຍແສງ (diffuse scattering) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Diffuse scattering ignores roughness."
msgstr "ການກະຈາຍແສງຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າ roughness."

msgid "Extends Lambert to cover more than 90 degrees when roughness increases."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ Lambert ໃຫ້ຄອບຄຸມຫຼາຍກວ່າ 90 ອົງສາເມື່ອ roughness ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Uses a hard cut for lighting, with smoothing affected by roughness."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຕັດແສງແບບແຂງ (hard cut) ໂດຍມີຄວາມນຽນຕາມຄ່າ roughness."

msgid ""
"Default specular blob.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Forward+ uses multiscattering for more accurate reflections, "
"although the impact of multiscattering is more noticeable on rough metallic "
"surfaces than on smooth, non-metallic surfaces.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Mobile and Compatibility don't perform multiscattering for "
"performance reasons. Instead, they perform single scattering, which means "
"rough metallic surfaces may look slightly darker than intended."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບແສງສະທ້ອນ (specular blob) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Toon blob which changes size based on roughness."
msgstr "ແສງສະທ້ອນແບບ Toon ທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຕາມຄ່າ roughness."

msgid ""
"No specular blob. This is slightly faster to render than other specular modes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແສງສະທ້ອນ. ວິທີນີ້ເຣັນເດີໄວກວ່າໂໝດອື່ນໆເລັກນ້ອຍ."

msgid "Billboard mode is disabled."
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດ Billboard."

msgid "The object's Z axis will always face the camera."
msgstr "ແກນ Z ຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຫັນໜ້າເຂົ້າຫາກ້ອງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

msgid "The object's X axis will always face the camera."
msgstr "ແກນ X ຂອງວັດຖຸຈະຫັນໜ້າເຂົ້າຫາກ້ອງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

msgid ""
"Used for particle systems when assigned to [GPUParticles3D] and "
"[CPUParticles3D] nodes (flipbook animation). Enables [code]particles_anim_*[/"
"code] properties.\n"
"The [member ParticleProcessMaterial.anim_speed_min] or [member "
"CPUParticles3D.anim_speed_min] should also be set to a value bigger than zero "
"for the animation to play."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລະບົບ particle (flipbook animation). ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[code]particles_anim_*[/code]."

msgid "Used to read from the red channel of a texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງສີແດງ (red channel) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Used to read from the green channel of a texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ (green channel) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Used to read from the blue channel of a texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ (blue channel) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Used to read from the alpha channel of a texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງ alpha ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"Used to read from the linear (non-perceptual) average of the red, green and "
"blue channels of a texture."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າສະເລ່ຍແບບ linear ຈາກຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ຂອງເທັກເຈີ."

msgid "Adds the emission color to the color from the emission texture."
msgstr "ບວກສີການເປັ່ງແສງ (emission color) ເຂົ້າກັບສີຈາກ emission texture."

msgid "Multiplies the emission color by the color from the emission texture."
msgstr "ຄູນສີການເປັ່ງແສງ (emission color) ກັບສີຈາກ emission texture."

msgid "Do not use distance fade."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໃຊ້ການຈາງຫາຍຕາມໄລຍະທາງ (distance fade)."

msgid ""
"Smoothly fades the object out based on each pixel's distance from the camera "
"using the alpha channel."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຈາກກ້ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ alpha."

msgid ""
"Smoothly fades the object out based on each pixel's distance from the camera "
"using a dithering approach. Dithering discards pixels based on a set pattern "
"to smoothly fade without enabling transparency. On certain hardware, this can "
"be faster than [constant DISTANCE_FADE_PIXEL_ALPHA]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ dithering. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະຖິ້ມພິກເຊວຕາມຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືຈາງຫາຍໄປໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ."

msgid ""
"Smoothly fades the object out based on the object's distance from the camera "
"using a dithering approach. Dithering discards pixels based on a set pattern "
"to smoothly fade without enabling transparency. On certain hardware, this can "
"be faster than [constant DISTANCE_FADE_PIXEL_ALPHA] and [constant "
"DISTANCE_FADE_PIXEL_DITHER]."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປຕາມໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງວັດຖຸຈາກກ້ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ dithering."

msgid "Disables stencil operations."
msgstr "ປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ stencil."

msgid ""
"Stencil preset which applies an outline to the object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires a [member Material.next_pass] material which will be "
"automatically applied. Any manual changes made to [member Material.next_pass] "
"will be lost when the stencil properties are modified or the scene is "
"reloaded. To safely apply a [member Material.next_pass] material on a "
"material that uses stencil presets, use [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_overlay] instead."
msgstr "Stencil preset ສຳລັບສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບ (outline) ໃຫ້ວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Stencil preset which shows a silhouette of the object behind walls.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires a [member Material.next_pass] material which will be "
"automatically applied. Any manual changes made to [member Material.next_pass] "
"will be lost when the stencil properties are modified or the scene is "
"reloaded. To safely apply a [member Material.next_pass] material on a "
"material that uses stencil presets, use [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.material_overlay] instead."
msgstr "Stencil preset ສຳລັບສະແດງເງົາຮ່າງ (silhouette) ຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງກຳແພງ."

msgid "Enables stencil operations without a preset."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ stencil ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ preset."

msgid ""
"The material will only be rendered where it passes a stencil comparison with "
"existing stencil buffer values."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີສະເພາະຈຸດທີ່ຜ່ານການປຽບທຽບ stencil ກັບຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ stencil buffer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The material will write the reference value to the stencil buffer where it "
"passes the depth test."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸຈະຂຽນຄ່າອ້າງອີງລົງໃນ stencil buffer ໃນຈຸດທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid ""
"The material will write the reference value to the stencil buffer where it "
"fails the depth test."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸຈະຂຽນຄ່າອ້າງອີງລົງໃນ stencil buffer ໃນຈຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid "Always passes the stencil test."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is less than the existing "
"stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງນ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is equal to the existing "
"stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງເທົ່າກັບຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is less than or equal to the "
"existing stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is greater than the existing "
"stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is not equal to the existing "
"stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Passes the stencil test when the reference value is greater than or equal to "
"the existing stencil value."
msgstr "ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ stencil ເມື່ອຄ່າອ້າງອີງຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າ stencil ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "A 3×3 matrix for representing 3D rotation and scale."
msgstr "ມາທຣິກ (Matrix) 3x3 ສຳລັບສະແດງການໝຸນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດໃນແບບ 3D."

msgid ""
"The [Basis] built-in [Variant] type is a 3×3 [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Matrix_(mathematics)]matrix[/url] used to represent 3D rotation, scale, "
"and shear. It is frequently used within a [Transform3D].\n"
"A [Basis] is composed by 3 axis vectors, each representing a column of the "
"matrix: [member x], [member y], and [member z]. The length of each axis "
"([method Vector3.length]) influences the basis's scale, while the direction "
"of all axes influence the rotation. Usually, these axes are perpendicular to "
"one another. However, when you rotate any axis individually, the basis "
"becomes sheared. Applying a sheared basis to a 3D model will make the model "
"appear distorted.\n"
"A [Basis] is:\n"
"- [b]Orthogonal[/b] if its axes are perpendicular to each other.\n"
"- [b]Normalized[/b] if the length of every axis is [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"- [b]Uniform[/b] if all axes share the same length (see [method get_scale]).\n"
"- [b]Orthonormal[/b] if it is both orthogonal and normalized, which allows it "
"to only represent rotations (see [method orthonormalized]).\n"
"- [b]Conformal[/b] if it is both orthogonal and uniform, which ensures it is "
"not distorted.\n"
"For a general introduction, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/math/"
"matrices_and_transforms.html]Matrices and transforms[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot uses a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Right-"
"hand_rule]right-handed coordinate system[/url], which is a common standard. "
"For directions, the convention for built-in types like [Camera3D] is for -Z "
"to point forward (+X is right, +Y is up, and +Z is back). Other objects may "
"use different direction conventions. For more information, see the "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/"
"model_export_considerations.html#d-asset-direction-conventions]3D asset "
"direction conventions[/url] tutorial.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The basis matrices are exposed as [url=https://"
"www.mindcontrol.org/~hplus/graphics/matrix-layout.html]column-major[/url] "
"order, which is the same as OpenGL. However, they are stored internally in "
"row-major order, which is the same as DirectX.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a basis will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's equal to [constant IDENTITY]. Otherwise, a basis will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[Basis] ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ເປັນມາທຣິກ 3x3 ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສະແດງການໝຸນ (rotation), ຂະໜາດ "
"(scale), ແລະ ການບິດ (shear) ແບບ 3D. ມັນມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ [Transform3D].\n"
"Basis ປະກອບດ້ວຍ 3 ເວກເຕີແກນ ເຊິ່ງແທນແຕ່ລະຄໍລຳຂອງມາທຣິກ: [member x], [member y], ແລະ "
"[member z]."

msgid "Matrices and transforms"
msgstr "ມາທຣິກ ແລະ ການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (Transforms)"

msgid "Using 3D transforms"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ 3D transforms"

msgid "Matrix Transform Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Matrix Transform"

msgid "2.5D Game Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເກມ 2.5D"

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Basis] identical to [constant IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Basis] with all of its components set "
"to [constant Vector3.ZERO]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Basis] ທີ່ມີຄ່າຄືກັບ [constant IDENTITY]."

msgid "Constructs a [Basis] as a copy of the given [Basis]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Basis] ໂດຍການກັອບປີ້ຈາກ [Basis] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Basis] that only represents rotation, rotated around the [param "
"axis] by the given [param angle], in radians. The axis must be a normalized "
"vector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the same as using [method rotated] on the [constant "
"IDENTITY] basis. With more than one angle consider using [method from_euler], "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Basis] ທີ່ສະແດງສະເພາະການໝຸນຮອບແກນ [param axis] ດ້ວຍມຸມ [param angle] "
"ທີ່ເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians)."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Basis] that only represents rotation from the given "
"[Quaternion].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternions [i]only[/i] store rotation, not scale. Because of "
"this, conversions from [Basis] to [Quaternion] cannot always be reversed."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Basis] ທີ່ສະແດງສະເພາະການໝຸນຈາກ [Quaternion] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Basis] from 3 axis vectors. These are the columns of the basis "
"matrix."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Basis] ຈາກເວກເຕີແກນ 3 ອັນ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄໍລຳຂອງມາທຣິກ basis."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Determinant]determinant[/url] "
"of this basis's matrix. For advanced math, this number can be used to "
"determine a few attributes:\n"
"- If the determinant is exactly [code]0.0[/code], the basis is not invertible "
"(see [method inverse]).\n"
"- If the determinant is a negative number, the basis represents a negative "
"scale.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the basis's scale is the same for every axis, its determinant "
"is always that scale by the power of 3."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ determinant ຂອງມາທຣິກ basis ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [Basis] that only represents rotation from the given "
"[Vector3] of [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/"
"url], in radians.\n"
"- The [member Vector3.x] should contain the angle around the [member x] axis "
"(pitch);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.y] should contain the angle around the [member y] axis "
"(yaw);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.z] should contain the angle around the [member z] axis "
"(roll).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Creates a Basis whose z axis points down.\n"
"var my_basis = Basis.from_euler(Vector3(TAU / 4, 0, 0))\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.z) # Prints (0.0, -1.0, 0.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Creates a Basis whose z axis points down.\n"
"var myBasis = Basis.FromEuler(new Vector3(Mathf.Tau / 4.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f));\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Z); // Prints (0, -1, 0)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The order of each consecutive rotation can be changed with [param order] (see "
"[enum EulerOrder] constants). In Godot, Euler angles always use intrinsic "
"order. By default, the intrinsic YXZ convention is used ([constant "
"EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): the basis rotates first around the local Y axis (yaw), "
"then local X (pitch), and lastly local Z (roll). When using the opposite "
"method [method get_euler] to decompose a rotation, this order is reversed."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Basis] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສະແດງສະເພາະການໝຸນຈາກ [Vector3] ຂອງມຸມອອຍເລີ (Euler angles) "
"ໃນຮູບແບບເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a new [Basis] that only represents scale, with no rotation or "
"shear, from the given [param scale] vector.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis.from_scale(Vector3(2, 4, 8))\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.x) # Prints (2.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.y) # Prints (0.0, 4.0, 0.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.z) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 8.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = Basis.FromScale(new Vector3(2.0f, 4.0f, 8.0f));\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.X); // Prints (2, 0, 0)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Y); // Prints (0, 4, 0)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Z); // Prints (0, 0, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In linear algebra, the matrix of this basis is also known as a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diagonal_matrix]diagonal matrix[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Basis] ໃໝ່ທີ່ສະແດງສະເພາະຂະໜາດ (scale) ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການໝຸນ ຫຼື ການບິດ ຈາກເວກເຕີ [param "
"scale] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns this basis's rotation as a [Vector3] of [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians. For the returned value:\n"
"- The [member Vector3.x] contains the angle around the [member x] axis "
"(pitch);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.y] contains the angle around the [member y] axis "
"(yaw);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.z] contains the angle around the [member z] axis "
"(roll).\n"
"The order of each consecutive rotation can be changed with [param order] (see "
"[enum EulerOrder] constants). In Godot, Euler angles always use intrinsic "
"order. By default, the intrinsic YXZ convention is used ([constant "
"EULER_ORDER_YXZ]): since we are decomposing, local Z (roll) is calculated "
"first, then local X (pitch), and lastly local Y (yaw). When using the "
"opposite method [method from_euler] to compose a rotation, this order is "
"reversed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For this method to return correctly, the basis needs to be "
"[i]orthonormal[/i] (see [method orthonormalized]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Euler angles are much more intuitive but are not suitable for 3D "
"math. Because of this, consider using the [method get_rotation_quaternion] "
"method instead, which returns a [Quaternion].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the Inspector dock, a basis's rotation is often displayed in "
"Euler angles (in degrees), as is the case with the [member Node3D.rotation] "
"property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການໝຸນຂອງ basis ນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບ [Vector3] ຂອງມຸມອອຍເລີ (Euler angles) ເປັນເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"Returns this basis's rotation as a [Quaternion].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternions are much more suitable for 3D math but are less "
"intuitive. For user interfaces, consider using the [method get_euler] method, "
"which returns Euler angles."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການໝຸນຂອງ basis ນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບ [Quaternion]."

msgid ""
"Returns the length of each axis of this basis, as a [Vector3]. If the basis "
"is not sheared, this value is the scaling factor. It is not affected by "
"rotation.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis(\n"
"\tVector3(2, 0, 0),\n"
"\tVector3(0, 4, 0),\n"
"\tVector3(0, 0, 8)\n"
")\n"
"# Rotating the Basis in any way preserves its scale.\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.rotated(Vector3.UP, TAU / 2)\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.rotated(Vector3.RIGHT, TAU / 4)\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.get_scale()) # Prints (2.0, 4.0, 8.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = new Basis(\n"
"\tVector3(2.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tVector3(0.0f, 4.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tVector3(0.0f, 0.0f, 8.0f)\n"
");\n"
"// Rotating the Basis in any way preserves its scale.\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Rotated(Vector3.Up, Mathf.Tau / 2.0f);\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Rotated(Vector3.Right, Mathf.Tau / 4.0f);\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Scale); // Prints (2, 4, 8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the value returned by [method determinant] is negative, the "
"scale is also negative."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຕ່ລະແກນໃນ basis ນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບ [Vector3]. ຖ້າ basis ບໍ່ໄດ້ບິດ, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຄືຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດ (scaling factor)."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invertible_matrix]inverse of "
"this basis's matrix[/url]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມາທຣິກປີ້ນກັບ (inverse matrix) ຂອງ basis ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this basis is conformal. A conformal basis is "
"both [i]orthogonal[/i] (the axes are perpendicular to each other) and "
"[i]uniform[/i] (the axes share the same length). This method can be "
"especially useful during physics calculations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ basis ນີ້ເປັນແບບ conformal (ແກນຕັ້ງສາກກັນ ແລະ "
"ມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັນທຸກແກນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this basis and [param b] are approximately "
"equal, by calling [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on all vector "
"components."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ basis ນີ້ ແລະ [param b] ມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this basis is finite, by calling [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] on all vector components."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ basis ນີ້ມີຄ່າທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (finite)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this basis is orthonormal. An orthonormal basis "
"is both [i]orthogonal[/i] (the axes are perpendicular to each other) and "
"[i]normalized[/i] (the length of every axis is [code]1.0[/code]). This method "
"can be especially useful during physics calculations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ basis ນີ້ເປັນແບບ orthonormal (ແກນຕັ້ງສາກກັນ ແລະ "
"ທຸກແກນມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັບ 1.0)."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Basis] with a rotation such that the forward axis (-Z) points "
"towards the [param target] position.\n"
"By default, the -Z axis (camera forward) is treated as forward (implies +X is "
"right). If [param use_model_front] is [code]true[/code], the +Z axis (asset "
"front) is treated as forward (implies +X is left) and points toward the "
"[param target] position.\n"
"The up axis (+Y) points as close to the [param up] vector as possible while "
"staying perpendicular to the forward axis. The returned basis is "
"orthonormalized (see [method orthonormalized]).\n"
"The [param target] and the [param up] cannot be [constant Vector3.ZERO], and "
"shouldn't be colinear to avoid unintended rotation around local Z axis."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Basis] ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການໝຸນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແກນດ້ານໜ້າຫັນໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງ [param target]."

msgid ""
"Returns the orthonormalized version of this basis. An orthonormal basis is "
"both [i]orthogonal[/i] (the axes are perpendicular to each other) and "
"[i]normalized[/i] (the axes have a length of [code]1.0[/code]), which also "
"means it can only represent a rotation.\n"
"It is often useful to call this method to avoid rounding errors on a rotating "
"basis:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Rotate this Node3D every frame.\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tbasis = basis.rotated(Vector3.UP, TAU * delta)\n"
"\tbasis = basis.rotated(Vector3.RIGHT, TAU * delta)\n"
"\tbasis = basis.orthonormalized()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Rotate this Node3D every frame.\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tBasis = Basis.Rotated(Vector3.Up, Mathf.Tau * (float)delta)\n"
"\t\t\t.Rotated(Vector3.Right, Mathf.Tau * (float)delta)\n"
"\t\t\t.Orthonormalized();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ basis ລຸ້ນທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນ orthonormalized (ທຸກແກນຕັ້ງສາກກັນ ແລະ ຍາວ 1.0). "
"ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກການຄຳນວນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໃນການໝຸນວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this basis rotated around the given [param axis] by the "
"given [param angle] (in radians).\n"
"The [param axis] must be a normalized vector (see [method "
"Vector3.normalized]). If [param angle] is positive, the basis is rotated "
"counter-clockwise around the axis.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis.IDENTITY\n"
"var angle = TAU / 2\n"
"\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.rotated(Vector3.UP, angle)    # Rotate around the up axis "
"(yaw).\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.rotated(Vector3.RIGHT, angle) # Rotate around the right "
"axis (pitch).\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.rotated(Vector3.BACK, angle)  # Rotate around the back "
"axis (roll).\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = Basis.Identity;\n"
"var angle = Mathf.Tau / 2.0f;\n"
"\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Rotated(Vector3.Up, angle);    // Rotate around the up axis "
"(yaw).\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Rotated(Vector3.Right, angle); // Rotate around the right "
"axis (pitch).\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Rotated(Vector3.Back, angle);  // Rotate around the back "
"axis (roll).\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນກັອບປີ້ຂອງ basis ທີ່ຖືກໝຸນຮອບແກນ [param axis] ດ້ວຍມຸມ [param angle] (ເປັນເຣດຽນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns this basis with each axis's components scaled by the given [param "
"scale]'s components.\n"
"The basis matrix's rows are multiplied by [param scale]'s components. This "
"operation is a global scale (relative to the parent).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis(\n"
"\tVector3(1, 1, 1),\n"
"\tVector3(2, 2, 2),\n"
"\tVector3(3, 3, 3)\n"
")\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.scaled(Vector3(0, 2, -2))\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.x) # Prints (0.0, 2.0, -2.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.y) # Prints (0.0, 4.0, -4.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.z) # Prints (0.0, 6.0, -6.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = new Basis(\n"
"\tnew Vector3(1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector3(2.0f, 2.0f, 2.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector3(3.0f, 3.0f, 3.0f)\n"
");\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Scaled(new Vector3(0.0f, 2.0f, -2.0f));\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.X); // Prints (0, 2, -2)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Y); // Prints (0, 4, -4)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Z); // Prints (0, 6, -6)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ basis ທີ່ແຕ່ລະແກນຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມເວກເຕີ [param scale]. ນີ້ແມ່ນການປັບຂະໜາດແບບ global "
"(ທຽບກັບ parent)."

msgid ""
"Returns this basis with each axis scaled by the corresponding component in "
"the given [param scale].\n"
"The basis matrix's columns are multiplied by [param scale]'s components. This "
"operation is a local scale (relative to self).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis(\n"
"    Vector3(1, 1, 1),\n"
"    Vector3(2, 2, 2),\n"
"    Vector3(3, 3, 3)\n"
")\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.scaled_local(Vector3(0, 2, -2))\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.x) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.y) # Prints (4.0, 4.0, 4.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.z) # Prints (-6.0, -6.0, -6.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = new Basis(\n"
"    new Vector3(1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f),\n"
"    new Vector3(2.0f, 2.0f, 2.0f),\n"
"    new Vector3(3.0f, 3.0f, 3.0f)\n"
");\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.ScaledLocal(new Vector3(0.0f, 2.0f, -2.0f));\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.X); // Prints (0, 0, 0)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Y); // Prints (4, 4, 4)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Z); // Prints (-6, -6, -6)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ basis ທີ່ແຕ່ລະແກນຖືກປັບຂະໜາດຕາມເວກເຕີ [param scale]. ນີ້ແມ່ນການປັບຂະໜາດແບບ local "
"(ທຽບກັບຕົວເອງ)."

msgid ""
"Performs a spherical-linear interpolation with the [param to] basis, given a "
"[param weight]. Both this basis and [param to] should represent a rotation.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Smoothly rotate a [Node3D] to the target basis over time, "
"with a [Tween]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var start_basis = Basis.IDENTITY\n"
"var target_basis = Basis.IDENTITY.rotated(Vector3.UP, TAU / 2)\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tcreate_tween().tween_method(interpolate, 0.0, 1.0, "
"5.0).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_EXPO)\n"
"\n"
"func interpolate(weight):\n"
"\tbasis = start_basis.slerp(target_basis, weight)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການ Interpolation ແບບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊົງກົມ (Spherical-linear interpolation) ໄປຫາ "
"basis [param to] ດ້ວຍຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ [param weight]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transposed dot product between [param with] and the [member x] "
"axis (see [method transposed]).\n"
"This is equivalent to [code]basis.x.dot(vector)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ transposed dot product ລະຫວ່າງ [param with] ແລະ ແກນ [member x]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transposed dot product between [param with] and the [member y] "
"axis (see [method transposed]).\n"
"This is equivalent to [code]basis.y.dot(vector)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ transposed dot product ລະຫວ່າງ [param with] ແລະ ແກນ [member y]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transposed dot product between [param with] and the [member z] "
"axis (see [method transposed]).\n"
"This is equivalent to [code]basis.z.dot(vector)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ transposed dot product ລະຫວ່າງ [param with] ແລະ ແກນ [member z]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transposed version of this basis. This turns the basis matrix's "
"columns into rows, and its rows into columns.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_basis = Basis(\n"
"\tVector3(1, 2, 3),\n"
"\tVector3(4, 5, 6),\n"
"\tVector3(7, 8, 9)\n"
")\n"
"my_basis = my_basis.transposed()\n"
"\n"
"print(my_basis.x) # Prints (1.0, 4.0, 7.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.y) # Prints (2.0, 5.0, 8.0)\n"
"print(my_basis.z) # Prints (3.0, 6.0, 9.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myBasis = new Basis(\n"
"\tnew Vector3(1.0f, 2.0f, 3.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector3(4.0f, 5.0f, 6.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector3(7.0f, 8.0f, 9.0f)\n"
");\n"
"myBasis = myBasis.Transposed();\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.X); // Prints (1, 4, 7)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Y); // Prints (2, 5, 8)\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis.Z); // Prints (3, 6, 9)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຸ້ນທີ່ສະຫຼັບແຖວເປັນຄໍລຳ (transposed) ຂອງ basis ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The basis's X axis, and the column [code]0[/code] of the matrix.\n"
"On the identity basis, this vector points right ([constant Vector3.RIGHT])."
msgstr "ແກນ X ຂອງ basis ແລະ ເປັນຄໍລຳທີ [code]0[/code] ຂອງມາທຣິກ."

msgid ""
"The basis's Y axis, and the column [code]1[/code] of the matrix.\n"
"On the identity basis, this vector points up ([constant Vector3.UP])."
msgstr "ແກນ Y ຂອງ basis ແລະ ເປັນຄໍລຳທີ [code]1[/code] ຂອງມາທຣິກ."

msgid ""
"The basis's Z axis, and the column [code]2[/code] of the matrix.\n"
"On the identity basis, this vector points back ([constant Vector3.BACK])."
msgstr "ແກນ Z ຂອງ basis ແລະ ເປັນຄໍລຳທີ [code]2[/code] ຂອງມາທຣິກ."

msgid ""
"The identity [Basis]. This is an orthonormal basis with no rotation, no "
"shear, and a scale of [constant Vector3.ONE]. This also means that:\n"
"- The [member x] points right ([constant Vector3.RIGHT]);\n"
"- The [member y] points up ([constant Vector3.UP]);\n"
"- The [member z] points back ([constant Vector3.BACK]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var basis = Basis.IDENTITY\n"
"print(\"| X | Y | Z\")\n"
"print(\"| %.f | %.f | %.f\" % [basis.x.x, basis.y.x, basis.z.x])\n"
"print(\"| %.f | %.f | %.f\" % [basis.x.y, basis.y.y, basis.z.y])\n"
"print(\"| %.f | %.f | %.f\" % [basis.x.z, basis.y.z, basis.z.z])\n"
"# Prints:\n"
"# | X | Y | Z\n"
"# | 1 | 0 | 0\n"
"# | 0 | 1 | 0\n"
"# | 0 | 0 | 1\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If a [Vector3] or another [Basis] is transformed (multiplied) by this "
"constant, no transformation occurs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, this constant is equivalent to creating a "
"[constructor Basis] without any arguments. It can be used to make your code "
"clearer, and for consistency with C#."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ Identity [Basis]. ນີ້ແມ່ນ basis ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການໝຸນ, ບໍ່ມີການບິດ ແລະ ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ 1.0 "
"ໃນທຸກແກນ."

msgid ""
"When any basis is multiplied by [constant FLIP_X], it negates all components "
"of the [member x] axis (the X column).\n"
"When [constant FLIP_X] is multiplied by any basis, it negates the [member "
"Vector3.x] component of all axes (the X row)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄູນ basis ໃດໆກັບ [constant FLIP_X], ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າທັງໝົດໃນແກນ [member x] "
"ກາຍເປັນຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມ."

msgid ""
"When any basis is multiplied by [constant FLIP_Y], it negates all components "
"of the [member y] axis (the Y column).\n"
"When [constant FLIP_Y] is multiplied by any basis, it negates the [member "
"Vector3.y] component of all axes (the Y row)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄູນ basis ໃດໆກັບ [constant FLIP_Y], ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າທັງໝົດໃນແກນ [member y] "
"ກາຍເປັນຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມ."

msgid ""
"When any basis is multiplied by [constant FLIP_Z], it negates all components "
"of the [member z] axis (the Z column).\n"
"When [constant FLIP_Z] is multiplied by any basis, it negates the [member "
"Vector3.z] component of all axes (the Z row)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄູນ basis ໃດໆກັບ [constant FLIP_Z], ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າທັງໝົດໃນແກນ [member z] "
"ກາຍເປັນຄ່າກົງກັນຂ້າມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both [Basis] matrices are not "
"equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າໃນມາທຣິກ [Basis] ທັງສອງບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Transforms (multiplies) the [param right] basis by this basis.\n"
"This is the operation performed between parent and child [Node3D]s."
msgstr "ແປງ (ຄູນ) basis [param right] ດ້ວຍ basis ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Transforms (multiplies) the [param right] vector by this basis, returning a "
"[Vector3].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Basis that swaps the X/Z axes and doubles the scale.\n"
"var my_basis = Basis(Vector3(0, 2, 0), Vector3(2, 0, 0), Vector3(0, 0, 2))\n"
"print(my_basis * Vector3(1, 2, 3)) # Prints (4.0, 2.0, 6.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Basis that swaps the X/Z axes and doubles the scale.\n"
"var myBasis = new Basis(new Vector3(0, 2, 0), new Vector3(2, 0, 0), new "
"Vector3(0, 0, 2));\n"
"GD.Print(myBasis * new Vector3(1, 2, 3)); // Prints (4, 2, 6)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ແປງ (ຄູນ) ເວກເຕີ [param right] ດ້ວຍ basis ນີ້ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ [Vector3]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies all components of the [Basis] by the given [float]. This affects "
"the basis's scale uniformly, resizing all 3 axes by the [param right] value."
msgstr "ຄູນທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Basis] ດ້ວຍເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ [float]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies all components of the [Basis] by the given [int]. This affects the "
"basis's scale uniformly, resizing all 3 axes by the [param right] value."
msgstr "ຄູນທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Basis] ດ້ວຍເລກຖ້ວນ [int]."

msgid ""
"Divides all components of the [Basis] by the given [float]. This affects the "
"basis's scale uniformly, resizing all 3 axes by the [param right] value."
msgstr "ຫານທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Basis] ດ້ວຍເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ [float]."

msgid ""
"Divides all components of the [Basis] by the given [int]. This affects the "
"basis's scale uniformly, resizing all 3 axes by the [param right] value."
msgstr "ຫານທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Basis] ດ້ວຍເລກຖ້ວນ [int]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the components of both [Basis] matrices are "
"exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າໃນມາທຣິກ [Basis] ທັງສອງເທົ່າກັນທຸກປະການ."

msgid ""
"Accesses each axis (column) of this basis by their index. Index [code]0[/"
"code] is the same as [member x], index [code]1[/code] is the same as [member "
"y], and index [code]2[/code] is the same as [member z].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C++, this operator accesses the rows of the basis matrix, "
"[i]not[/i] the columns. For the same behavior as scripting languages, use the "
"[code]set_column[/code] and [code]get_column[/code] methods."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າເຖິງແຕ່ລະແກນ (ຄໍລຳ) ຂອງ basis ດ້ວຍເລກດັດຊະນີ (index)."

msgid "Boolean matrix."
msgstr "ມາທຣິກແບບບູລີນ (Boolean matrix)."

msgid ""
"A two-dimensional array of boolean values, can be used to efficiently store a "
"binary matrix (every matrix element takes only one bit) and query the values "
"using natural cartesian coordinates."
msgstr "ອາເຣ 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ເກັບຄ່າບູລີນ (true/false) ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບມາທຣິກແບບໄບນາຣີຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Returns an image of the same size as the bitmap and with an [enum "
"Image.Format] of type [constant Image.FORMAT_L8]. [code]true[/code] bits of "
"the bitmap are being converted into white pixels, and [code]false[/code] bits "
"into black."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າກັບ bitmap. ຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຈະກາຍເປັນພິກເຊວສີຂາວ ແລະ "
"[code]false[/code] ເປັນສີດຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a bitmap with the specified size, filled with [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ bitmap ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]false[/code] ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a bitmap that matches the given image dimensions, every element of "
"the bitmap is set to [code]false[/code] if the alpha value of the image at "
"that position is equal to [param threshold] or less, and [code]true[/code] in "
"other case."
msgstr "ສ້າງ bitmap ຈາກຮູບພາບ ໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຄ່າ alpha ແລະ [param threshold] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns bitmap's value at the specified position."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງ bitmap ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns bitmap's dimensions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງ bitmap."

msgid "Returns the number of bitmap elements that are set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບໃນ bitmap ທີ່ມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Applies morphological dilation or erosion to the bitmap. If [param pixels] is "
"positive, dilation is applied to the bitmap. If [param pixels] is negative, "
"erosion is applied to the bitmap. [param rect] defines the area where the "
"morphological operation is applied. Pixels located outside the [param rect] "
"are unaffected by [method grow_mask]."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ງານການຂະຫຍາຍ (dilation) ຫຼື ການກັດເຊາະ (erosion) ກັບ bitmap."

msgid ""
"Creates an [Array] of polygons covering a rectangular portion of the bitmap. "
"It uses a marching squares algorithm, followed by Ramer-Douglas-Peucker (RDP) "
"reduction of the number of vertices. Each polygon is described as a "
"[PackedVector2Array] of its vertices.\n"
"To get polygons covering the whole bitmap, pass:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"Rect2(Vector2(), get_size())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[param epsilon] is passed to RDP to control how accurately the polygons cover "
"the bitmap: a lower [param epsilon] corresponds to more points in the "
"polygons."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Array] ຂອງ polygons ທີ່ຄອບຄຸມສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງ bitmap."

msgid "Resizes the image to [param new_size]."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດຮູບພາບເປັນ [param new_size]."

msgid ""
"Sets the bitmap's element at the specified position, to the specified value."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງປະກອບຂອງ bitmap ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "Sets a rectangular portion of the bitmap to the specified value."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງ bitmap ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "A material that processes blit calls to a DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸທີ່ປະມວນຜົນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ blit ໄປຫາ DrawableTexture."

msgid ""
"A material resource that can be used by DrawableTextures when processing blit "
"calls to draw."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນວັດສະດຸທີ່ DrawableTextures ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນການປະມວນຜົນ blit ເພື່ອແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The manner in which the newly blitted texture is blended with the original "
"DrawableTexture."
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ເທັກເຈີໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປະສົມເຂົ້າກັບ DrawableTexture ເດີມ."

msgid ""
"Mix blending mode. Colors are assumed to be independent of the alpha "
"(opacity) value."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບ Mix. ສີຈະຖືກຄຳນວນແຍກຈາກຄ່າ alpha."

msgid "Additive blending mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບບວກ (Additive)."

msgid "Subtractive blending mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບລົບ (Subtractive)."

msgid "Multiplicative blending mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບຄູນ (Multiplicative)."

msgid "No blending mode, direct color copy."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີໂໝດການປະສົມ, ກັອບປີ້ສີໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "A joint used with [Skeleton2D] to control and animate other nodes."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ [Skeleton2D] ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດອື່ນເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

msgid ""
"A hierarchy of [Bone2D]s can be bound to a [Skeleton2D] to control and "
"animate other [Node2D] nodes.\n"
"You can use [Bone2D] and [Skeleton2D] nodes to animate 2D meshes created with "
"the [Polygon2D] UV editor.\n"
"Each bone has a [member rest] transform that you can reset to with [method "
"apply_rest]. These rest poses are relative to the bone's parent.\n"
"If in the editor, you can set the rest pose of an entire skeleton using a "
"menu option, from the code, you need to iterate over the bones to set their "
"individual rest poses."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງ [Bone2D] ສາມາດຜູກກັບ [Skeleton2D] ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດ [Node2D] "
"ອື່ນເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

msgid ""
"Resets the bone to the rest pose. This is equivalent to setting [member "
"Node2D.transform] to [member rest]."
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດກະດູກໃຫ້ກັບຄືນສູ່ທ່າພັກ (rest pose)."

msgid ""
"Returns whether this [Bone2D] is going to autocalculate its length and bone "
"angle using its first [Bone2D] child node, if one exists. If there are no "
"[Bone2D] children, then it cannot autocalculate these values and will print a "
"warning."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [Bone2D] ນີ້ຈະຄຳນວນຄວາມຍາວ ແລະ ມຸມຂອງກະດູກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the angle of the bone in the [Bone2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is different from the [Bone2D]'s rotation. The bone's angle "
"is the rotation of the bone shown by the gizmo, which is unaffected by the "
"[Bone2D]'s [member Node2D.transform]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມຂອງກະດູກໃນ [Bone2D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the node's index as part of the entire skeleton. See [Skeleton2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີ (index) ຂອງໂນດໃນຖານະສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ skeleton."

msgid "Returns the length of the bone in the [Bone2D] node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກໃນໂນດ [Bone2D]."

msgid ""
"Returns the node's [member rest] [Transform2D] if it doesn't have a parent, "
"or its rest pose relative to its parent."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ຂອງທ່າພັກ [member rest] ຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], the [Bone2D] node will attempt to "
"automatically calculate the bone angle and length using the first child "
"[Bone2D] node, if one exists. If none exist, the [Bone2D] cannot "
"automatically calculate these values and will print a warning."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ [Bone2D] ຈະພະຍາຍາມຄຳນວນມຸມ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຍາວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the bone angle for the [Bone2D]. This is typically set to the rotation "
"from the [Bone2D] to a child [Bone2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is different from the [Bone2D]'s rotation. The bone's angle "
"is the rotation of the bone shown by the gizmo, which is unaffected by the "
"[Bone2D]'s [member Node2D.transform]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມກະດູກສຳລັບ [Bone2D]."

msgid "Sets the length of the bone in the [Bone2D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກໃນ [Bone2D]."

msgid ""
"Rest transform of the bone. You can reset the node's transforms to this value "
"using [method apply_rest]."
msgstr "ຄ່າການແປງຮູບຮ່າງ (transform) ຂອງທ່າພັກ."

msgid ""
"А node that dynamically copies or overrides the 3D transform of a bone in its "
"parent [Skeleton3D]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ແທນທີ່ 3D transform ຂອງກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] ຂອງ parent ແບບໄດນາມິກ."

msgid ""
"This node selects a bone in a [Skeleton3D] and attaches to it. This means "
"that the [BoneAttachment3D] node will either dynamically copy or override the "
"3D transform of the selected bone."
msgstr "ໂນດນີ້ເລືອກກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] ແລະ ຕິດເຂົ້າກັບມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the parent or external [Skeleton3D] node if it exists, otherwise "
"returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ຖ້າມີຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"A function that is called automatically when the [Skeleton3D] is updated. "
"This function is where the [BoneAttachment3D] node updates its position so it "
"is correctly bound when it is [i]not[/i] set to override the bone pose."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Skeleton3D] ຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid "The index of the attached bone."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຕິດຢູ່."

msgid "The name of the attached bone."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຖືກຕິດຢູ່."

msgid "The [NodePath] to the external [Skeleton3D] node."
msgstr "[NodePath] ທີ່ໄປຫາໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Whether the [BoneAttachment3D] node will override the bone pose of the bone "
"it is attached to. When set to [code]true[/code], the [BoneAttachment3D] node "
"can change the pose of the bone. When set to [code]false[/code], the "
"[BoneAttachment3D] will always be set to the bone's transform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This override performs interruptively in the skeleton update "
"process using signals due to the old design. It may cause unintended behavior "
"when used at the same time with [SkeletonModifier3D]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໂນດ [BoneAttachment3D] ຈະແທນທີ່ທ່າທາງ (pose) ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ມັນຕິດຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Whether the [BoneAttachment3D] node will use an external [Skeleton3D] node "
"rather than attempting to use its parent node as the [Skeleton3D]. When set "
"to [code]true[/code], the [BoneAttachment3D] node will use the external "
"[Skeleton3D] node set in [member external_skeleton]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າໂນດ [BoneAttachment3D] ຈະໃຊ້ໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ພາຍນອກແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ parent ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "A node that may modify Skeleton3D's bone with associating the two bones."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງກະດູກຂອງ Skeleton3D ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກະດູກສອງອັນ."

msgid ""
"Base class of [SkeletonModifier3D] that modifies the bone set in [method "
"set_apply_bone] based on the transform of the bone retrieved by [method "
"get_reference_bone].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] parameter. "
"This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the IK has "
"multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/amount[/code])."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງ [SkeletonModifier3D] ທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງກະດູກຕາມການອ້າງອີງ."

msgid "Clear all settings."
msgstr "ລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Returns the apply amount of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະລິມານການນຳໃຊ້ (apply amount) ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the apply bone of the setting at [param index]. This bone will be "
"modified."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກະດູກທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the apply bone name of the setting at [param index]. This bone will "
"be modified."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference bone of the setting at [param index].\n"
"This bone will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກະດູກອ້າງອີງຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference bone name of the setting at [param index].\n"
"This bone will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກອ້າງອີງຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference node path of the setting at [param index].\n"
"This node will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໂນດອ້າງອີງ (reference node path) ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference target type of the setting at [param index]. See also "
"[enum ReferenceType]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍອ້າງອີງຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the number of settings in the modifier."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ modifier."

msgid "Sets the apply amount of the setting at [param index] to [param amount]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະລິມານການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index] ເປັນ [param amount]."

msgid ""
"Sets the apply bone of the setting at [param index] to [param bone]. This "
"bone will be modified."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກະດູກທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the apply bone of the setting at [param index] to [param bone_name]. "
"This bone will be modified."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference bone of the setting at [param index] to [param bone].\n"
"This bone will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກະດູກອ້າງອີງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference bone of the setting at [param index] to [param "
"bone_name].\n"
"This bone will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກອ້າງອີງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference node path of the setting at [param index] to [param "
"node].\n"
"This node will be only referenced and not modified by this modifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໂນດອ້າງອີງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference target type of the setting at [param index] to [param "
"type]. See also [enum ReferenceType]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍອ້າງອີງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param index]."

msgid "Sets the number of settings in the modifier."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ modifier."

msgid ""
"The reference target is a bone. In this case, the reference target spaces is "
"local space."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍອ້າງອີງແມ່ນກະດູກ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງຈະເປັນ local space."

msgid ""
"The reference target is a [Node3D]. In this case, the reference target spaces "
"is model space.\n"
"In other words, the reference target's coordinates are treated as if it were "
"placed directly under [Skeleton3D] which parent of the [BoneConstraint3D]."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍອ້າງອີງແມ່ນ [Node3D]. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພື້ນທີ່ອ້າງອີງຈະເປັນ model space."

msgid ""
"Describes a mapping of bone names for retargeting [Skeleton3D] into common "
"names defined by a [SkeletonProfile]."
msgstr ""
"ອະທິບາຍການຈັບຄູ່ຊື່ກະດູກສຳລັບການ retarget [Skeleton3D] ໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ສາກົນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[SkeletonProfile]."

msgid ""
"This class contains a dictionary that uses a list of bone names in "
"[SkeletonProfile] as key names.\n"
"By assigning the actual [Skeleton3D] bone name as the key value, it maps the "
"[Skeleton3D] to the [SkeletonProfile]."
msgstr "ຄລາສນີ້ເກັບ Dictionary ທີ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ກະດູກໃນ [SkeletonProfile] ເປັນ Key."

msgid "Retargeting 3D Skeletons"
msgstr "ການ Retargeting 3D Skeletons"

msgid ""
"Returns a profile bone name having [param skeleton_bone_name]. If not found, "
"an empty [StringName] will be returned.\n"
"In the retargeting process, the returned bone name is the bone name of the "
"target skeleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກໃນ profile ທີ່ມີ [param skeleton_bone_name]."

msgid ""
"Returns a skeleton bone name is mapped to [param profile_bone_name].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the returned bone name is the bone name of the "
"source skeleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກ skeleton ທີ່ຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບ [param profile_bone_name]."

msgid ""
"Maps a skeleton bone name to [param profile_bone_name].\n"
"In the retargeting process, the setting bone name is the bone name of the "
"source skeleton."
msgstr "ຈັບຄູ່ຊື່ກະດູກ skeleton ກັບ [param profile_bone_name]."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonProfile] of the mapping target. Key names in the [BoneMap] are "
"synchronized with it."
msgstr "[SkeletonProfile] ຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍການຈັບຄູ່."

msgid ""
"This signal is emitted when change the key value in the [BoneMap]. This is "
"used to validate mapping and to update [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr "ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າ Key ໃນ [BoneMap]."

msgid ""
"This signal is emitted when change the value in profile or change the "
"reference of profile. This is used to update key names in the [BoneMap] and "
"to redraw the [BoneMap] editor."
msgstr "ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າໃນ profile ຫຼື ປ່ຽນການອ້າງອີງ profile."

msgid ""
"A node that propagates and disperses the child bone's twist to the parent "
"bones."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ ແລະ ກະຈາຍການບິດ (twist) ຈາກກະດູກລູກໄປຫາກະດູກພໍ່ແມ່."

msgid ""
"This [BoneTwistDisperser3D] allows for smooth twist interpolation between "
"multiple bones by dispersing the end bone's twist to the parents. This only "
"changes the twist without changing the global position of each joint.\n"
"This is useful for smoothly twisting bones in combination with "
"[CopyTransformModifier3D] and IK.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an extracted twist is greater than 180 degrees, flipping "
"occurs. This is similar to [ConvertTransformModifier3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] parameter. "
"This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the IK has "
"multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."
msgstr "ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການບິດຂອງກະດູກນຽນຂຶ້ນໂດຍການກະຈາຍແຮງບິດຈາກກະດູກປາຍໄປຫາກະດູກຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Clears all settings."
msgstr "ລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the damping curve when [method get_disperse_mode] is [constant "
"DISPERSE_MODE_CUSTOM]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນ (damping curve) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ CUSTOM."

msgid ""
"Returns whether to use automatic amount assignment or to allow manual "
"assignment."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ການກຳນົດປະລິມານແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Returns the end bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີກະດູກປາຍຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tail direction of the end bone of the bone chain when [method "
"is_end_bone_extended] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທິດທາງປາຍຂອງກະດູກສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid "Returns the end bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກປາຍຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the bone index at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີກະດູກທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ [param joint]."

msgid "Returns the bone name at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ [param joint]."

msgid "Returns the joint count of the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the twist amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method get_disperse_mode] is [constant DISPERSE_MODE_CUSTOM]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະລິມານການບິດທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ [param joint] ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ CUSTOM."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference bone to extract twist of the setting at [param index].\n"
"This bone is either the end of the chain or its parent, depending on [method "
"is_end_bone_extended]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກະດູກອ້າງອີງເພື່ອດຶງຄ່າການບິດອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the reference bone name to extract twist of the setting at [param "
"index].\n"
"This bone is either the end of the chain or its parent, depending on [method "
"is_end_bone_extended]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກອ້າງອີງເພື່ອດຶງຄ່າການບິດອອກມາ."

msgid "Returns the root bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີກະດູກຕົ້ນ (root bone) ຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Returns the root bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ກະດູກຕົ້ນ (root bone) ຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the rotation to an arbitrary state before twisting for the current "
"bone pose to extract the twist when [method is_twist_from_rest] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນການໝຸນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການບິດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position at which to divide the segment between joints for weight "
"assignment when [method get_disperse_mode] is [constant "
"DISPERSE_MODE_WEIGHTED]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ແບ່ງສ່ວນລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສຳລັບການກຳນົດນ້ຳໜັກ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the end bone is extended to have a tail."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າກະດູກປາຍຖືກຕໍ່ອອກໄປໃຫ້ມີສ່ວນຫາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if extracting the twist amount from the difference "
"between the bone rest and the current bone pose."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າດຶງປະລິມານການບິດຈາກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງທ່າພັກ ແລະ ທ່າປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the damping curve when [method get_disperse_mode] is [constant "
"DISPERSE_MODE_CUSTOM]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນ (damping curve) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ CUSTOM."

msgid ""
"Sets whether to use automatic amount assignment or to allow manual assignment."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຈະໃຊ້ການກຳນົດປະລິມານແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Sets the end bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີກະດູກປາຍຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone tail direction of the bone chain when [method "
"is_end_bone_extended] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງປາຍກະດູກສຸດທ້າຍເມື່ອມີການຕໍ່ຫາງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The end bone must be a child of the root bone."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ກະດູກປາຍຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the end bone is extended to have a "
"tail.\n"
"If [param enabled] is [code]false[/code], [method get_reference_bone] becomes "
"a parent of the end bone and it uses the vector to the end bone as a twist "
"axis."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກະດູກປາຍຈະຖືກຕໍ່ຫາງອອກໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the twist amount at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list when "
"[method get_disperse_mode] is [constant DISPERSE_MODE_CUSTOM]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປະລິມານການບິດທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ [param joint] ໃນໂໝດ CUSTOM."

msgid "Sets the root bone index of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າດັດຊະນີກະດູກຕົ້ນຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid "Sets the root bone name of the bone chain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ກະດູກຕົ້ນຂອງຕ່ອງໂສ້ກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the rotation to an arbitrary state before twisting for the current bone "
"pose to extract the twist when [method is_twist_from_rest] is [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"In other words, by calling [method set_twist_from] by [signal "
"SkeletonModifier3D.modification_processed] of a specific "
"[SkeletonModifier3D], you can extract only the twists generated by modifiers "
"processed after that but before this [BoneTwistDisperser3D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝຸນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນການບິດ."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], it extracts the twist amount from "
"the difference between the bone rest and the current bone pose.\n"
"If [param enabled] is [code]false[/code], it extracts the twist amount from "
"the difference between [method get_twist_from] and the current bone pose. See "
"also [method set_twist_from]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະດຶງຄ່າການບິດຈາກທ່າພັກຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the position at which to divide the segment between joints for weight "
"assignment when [method get_disperse_mode] is [constant "
"DISPERSE_MODE_WEIGHTED].\n"
"For example, when [param weight_position] is [code]0.5[/code], if two bone "
"segments with a length of [code]1.0[/code] exist between three joints, "
"weights are assigned to each joint from root to end at ratios of [code]0.5[/"
"code], [code]1.0[/code], and [code]0.5[/code]. Then amounts become "
"[code]0.25[/code], [code]0.75[/code], and [code]1.0[/code] respectively."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງແບ່ງສ່ວນລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສຳລັບການກຳນົດນ້ຳໜັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone pose "
"every frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone rest "
"and caches it."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], solver ຈະດຶງແກນກະດູກຈາກທ່າທາງໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ."

msgid "The number of settings."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Assign amounts so that they monotonically increase from [code]0.0[/code] to "
"[code]1.0[/code], ensuring all weights are equal. For example, with five "
"joints, the amounts would be [code]0.2[/code], [code]0.4[/code], [code]0.6[/"
"code], [code]0.8[/code], and [code]1.0[/code] starting from the root bone."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະລິມານໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທົ່າໆກັນຈາກ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0."

msgid ""
"Assign amounts so that they monotonically increase from [code]0.0[/code] to "
"[code]1.0[/code], based on the length of the bones between joint segments. "
"See also [method set_weight_position]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະລິມານໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"You can assign arbitrary amounts to the joint list. See also [method "
"set_joint_twist_amount].\n"
"When [method is_end_bone_extended] is [code]false[/code], a child of the "
"reference bone exists solely to determine the twist axis, so its custom "
"amount has absolutely no effect at all."
msgstr "ກຳນົດປະລິມານແບບກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid "A built-in boolean type."
msgstr "ປະເພດບູລີນ (Boolean) ທີ່ຕິດຕາມາ."

msgid ""
"The [bool] is a built-in [Variant] type that may only store one of two "
"values: [code]true[/code] or [code]false[/code]. You can imagine it as a "
"switch that can be either turned on or off, or as a binary digit that can "
"either be 1 or 0.\n"
"Booleans can be directly used in [code]if[/code], and other conditional "
"statements:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var can_shoot = true\n"
"if can_shoot:\n"
"\tlaunch_bullet()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"bool canShoot = true;\n"
"if (canShoot)\n"
"{\n"
"\tLaunchBullet();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"All comparison operators return booleans ([code]==[/code], [code]>[/code], "
"[code]<=[/code], etc.). As such, it is not necessary to compare booleans "
"themselves. You do not need to add [code]== true[/code] or [code]== false[/"
"code].\n"
"Booleans can be combined with the logical operators [code]and[/code], "
"[code]or[/code], [code]not[/code] to create complex conditions:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if bullets > 0 and not is_reloading():\n"
"\tlaunch_bullet()\n"
"\n"
"if bullets == 0 or is_reloading():\n"
"\tplay_clack_sound()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if (bullets > 0 && !IsReloading())\n"
"{\n"
"\tLaunchBullet();\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"if (bullets == 0 || IsReloading())\n"
"{\n"
"\tPlayClackSound();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In modern programming languages, logical operators are evaluated "
"in order. All remaining conditions are skipped if their result would have no "
"effect on the final value. This concept is known as [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Short-circuit_evaluation]short-circuit evaluation[/url] "
"and can be useful to avoid evaluating expensive conditions in some "
"performance-critical cases.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By convention, built-in methods and properties that return "
"booleans are usually defined as yes-no questions, single adjectives, or "
"similar ([method String.is_empty], [method Node.can_process], [member "
"Camera2D.enabled], etc.)."
msgstr ""
"[bool] ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ເກັບຄ່າໄດ້ພຽງສອງຢ່າງຄື: [code]true[/code] (ຈິງ) ຫຼື "
"[code]false[/code] (ເທັດ)."

msgid "Constructs a [bool] set to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [bool] ທີ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Constructs a [bool] as a copy of the given [bool]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [bool] ໂດຍການກັອບປີ້ຈາກ [bool] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Casts a [float] value to a [bool]. Returns [code]false[/code] if [param from] "
"is equal to [code]0.0[/code] (including [code]-0.0[/code]), and [code]true[/"
"code] for all other values (including [constant @GDScript.INF] and [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN])."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າ [float] ເປັນ [bool]. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]0.0[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Casts an [int] value to a [bool]. Returns [code]false[/code] if [param from] "
"is equal to [code]0[/code], and [code]true[/code] for all other values."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າ [int] ເປັນ [bool]. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if one [bool] is [code]true[/code] and the other "
"[bool] is [code]false[/code]. Equivalent to logical XOR (NEQ)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າບູລີນອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງເປັນຈິງ ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເປັນເທັດ (XOR)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [bool] is [code]false[/code] and [param "
"right] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບູລີນດ້ານຊ້າຍເປັນ [code]false[/code] ແລະ ດ້ານຂວາເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [bool]s are [code]true[/code], or if both "
"[bool]s are [code]false[/code]. Equivalent to logical XNOR (EQ)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າທັງສອງມີຄ່າຄືກັນ (XNOR)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [bool] is [code]true[/code] and [param "
"right] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບູລີນດ້ານຊ້າຍເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ດ້ານຂວາເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid "A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ (Container) ທີ່ຈັດວາງໂນດລູກໃນແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically, "
"rearranging them automatically when their minimum size changes."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດວາງໂນດລູກໃນແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ "
"ຈະຈັດລຽງໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງໂນດປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [Control] node to the box as a spacer. If [param begin] is [code]true[/"
"code], it will insert the [Control] node in front of all other children."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂນດ [Control] ເຂົ້າໄປໃນບ໋ອກເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຂັ້ນ (spacer)."

msgid ""
"The alignment of the container's children (must be one of [constant "
"ALIGNMENT_BEGIN], [constant ALIGNMENT_CENTER], or [constant ALIGNMENT_END])."
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດລູກພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [BoxContainer] will arrange its children "
"vertically, rather than horizontally.\n"
"Can't be changed when using [HBoxContainer] and [VBoxContainer]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [BoxContainer] ຈະຈັດວາງໂນດລູກໃນແນວຕັ້ງແທນແນວນອນ."

msgid ""
"The child controls will be arranged at the beginning of the container, i.e. "
"top if orientation is vertical, left if orientation is horizontal (right for "
"RTL layout)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍເຖິງ ດ້ານເທິງ ຖ້າແນວວາງເປັນແນວຕັ້ງ, "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ຖ້າແນວວາງເປັນແນວນອນ (ດ້ານຂວາ ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບ RTL)."

msgid "The child controls will be centered in the container."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ຈຸດກາງຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"The child controls will be arranged at the end of the container, i.e. bottom "
"if orientation is vertical, right if orientation is horizontal (left for RTL "
"layout)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍເຖິງ ດ້ານລຸ່ມ ຖ້າແນວວາງເປັນແນວຕັ້ງ, "
"ດ້ານຂວາ ຖ້າແນວວາງເປັນແນວນອນ (ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບ RTL)."

msgid "The space between the [BoxContainer]'s elements, in pixels."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງອົງປະກອບຂອງ [BoxContainer], ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Generate an axis-aligned box [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ຈັດວາງຕາມແກນ."

msgid ""
"Generate an axis-aligned box [PrimitiveMesh].\n"
"The box's UV layout is arranged in a 3×2 layout that allows texturing each "
"face individually. To apply the same texture on all faces, change the "
"material's UV property to [code]Vector3(3, 2, 1)[/code]. This is equivalent "
"to adding [code]UV *= vec2(3.0, 2.0)[/code] in a vertex shader.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a large textured [BoxMesh] (e.g. as a floor), you may "
"stumble upon UV jittering issues depending on the camera angle. To solve "
"this, increase [member subdivide_depth], [member subdivide_height] and "
"[member subdivide_width] until you no longer notice UV jittering."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ຈັດວາງຕາມແກນ.\n"
"ການຈັດວາງ UV ຂອງກ່ອງຈະຖືກຈັດໃນຮູບແບບ 3x2 ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃສ່ລວດລາຍ (texture) "
"ໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານແຍກກັນໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ລວດລາຍດຽວກັນກັບທຸກດ້ານ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດ UV ຂອງວັດສະດຸ (material) "
"ເປັນ [code]Vector3(3, 2, 1)[/code]. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການເພີ່ມ [code]UV *= vec2(3.0, 2.0)"
"[/code] ໃນ vertex shader.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [BoxMesh] ທີ່ມີລວດລາຍຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເຮັດເປັນພື້ນ), "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບກັບບັນຫາ UV ສັ່ນໄຫວ (jittering) ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບມຸມຂອງກ້ອງ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່າ "
"[member subdivide_depth], [member subdivide_height] ແລະ [member "
"subdivide_width] ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສັງເກດເຫັນການສັ່ນໄຫວຂອງ UV."

msgid "The box's width, height and depth."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມສູງ ແລະ ຄວາມເລິກ ຂອງກ່ອງ."

msgid "Number of extra edge loops inserted along the Z axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ edge loops ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ແຊກຕາມແກນ Z."

msgid "Number of extra edge loops inserted along the Y axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ edge loops ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ແຊກຕາມແກນ Y."

msgid "Number of extra edge loops inserted along the X axis."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ edge loops ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ແຊກຕາມແກນ X."

msgid "Cuboid shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສາກສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ occlusion culling ໃນ [OccluderInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"[BoxOccluder3D] stores a cuboid shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""
"[BoxOccluder3D] ເກັບຮັກສາຮູບຊົງກ່ອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສາກທີ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບ occlusion culling "
"ຂອງເອັນຈິນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ [OccluderInstance3D] ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ occlusion culling."

msgid "The box's size in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກ່ອງໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid "A 3D box shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D box shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a shape "
"for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [BoxShape3D] is fast to check collisions against. It is "
"faster than [CapsuleShape3D] and [CylinderShape3D], but slower than "
"[SphereShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ 3D, ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປັນຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [BoxShape3D] ສາມາດກວດສອບການຕຳກັນໄດ້ໄວ. ມັນໄວກວ່າ "
"[CapsuleShape3D] ແລະ [CylinderShape3D], ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ [SphereShape3D]."

msgid "3D Kinematic Character Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການສາທິດ ຕົວລະຄອນ Kinematic 3D"

msgid "A themed button that can contain text and an icon."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມແບບມີທີມທີ່ສາມາດມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ໄອຄອນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"[Button] is the standard themed button. It can contain text and an icon, and "
"it will display them according to the current [Theme].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Create a button and connect a method that will be called when "
"the button is pressed:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\tbutton.text = \"Click me\"\n"
"\tbutton.pressed.connect(_button_pressed)\n"
"\tadd_child(button)\n"
"\n"
"func _button_pressed():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello world!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\tbutton.Text = \"Click me\";\n"
"\tbutton.Pressed += ButtonPressed;\n"
"\tAddChild(button);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void ButtonPressed()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Hello world!\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Buttons support multitouch via touch input, allowing multiple "
"buttons to be pressed at the same time. Otherwise, mouse input is used, "
"limiting interaction to one button press at a time."
msgstr ""
"[Button] ແມ່ນປຸ່ມແບບມີທີມມາດຕະຖານ. ມັນສາມາດບັນຈຸຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ໄອຄອນໄດ້, ແລະ "
"ຈະສະແດງພວກມັນຕາມ [Theme] ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ສ້າງປຸ່ມ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເມັດທອດທີ່ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar button = Button.new()\n"
"\tbutton.text = \"ຄລິກຂ້ອຍ\"\n"
"\tbutton.pressed.connect(_button_pressed)\n"
"\tadd_child(button)\n"
"\n"
"func _button_pressed():\n"
"\tprint(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar button = new Button();\n"
"\tbutton.Text = \"ຄລິກຂ້ອຍ\";\n"
"\tbutton.Pressed += ButtonPressed;\n"
"\tAddChild(button);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void ButtonPressed()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ!\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [BaseButton] ເຊິ່ງມີຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມັດທອດທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປຸ່ມຮອງຮັບການສຳພັດຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multitouch) ຜ່ານການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນການສຳພັດ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດກົດຫຼາຍປຸ່ມພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະໃຊ້ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເມົາສ໌, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດການໂຕ້ຕອບໃຫ້ກົດໄດ້ເທື່ອລະປຸ່ມ."

msgid "Operating System Testing Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການສາທິດ ການທົດສອບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

msgid "Text alignment policy for the button's text."
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງປຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນນອກຈາກ [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Autowrap space trimming flags. See [constant "
"TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_START_EDGE_SPACES] and [constant "
"TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_END_EDGE_SPACES] for more info."
msgstr ""
"ແຟລັກການຕັດຊ່ອງວ່າງສຳລັບການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Autowrap). ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_START_EDGE_SPACES] ແລະ [constant "
"TextServer.BREAK_TRIM_END_EDGE_SPACES] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text that is too large to fit the button is clipped "
"horizontally. If [code]false[/code], the button will always be wide enough to "
"hold the text. The text is not vertically clipped, and the button's height is "
"not affected by this property."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນກວ່າຈະພໍດີກັບປຸ່ມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກໃນແນວນອນ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ປຸ່ມຈະກວ້າງພໍທີ່ຈະບັນຈຸຂໍ້ຄວາມສະເໝີ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດໃນແນວຕັ້ງ, ແລະ "
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງປຸ່ມຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

msgid ""
"When enabled, the button's icon will expand/shrink to fit the button's size "
"while keeping its aspect. See also [theme_item icon_max_width]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໄອຄອນຂອງປຸ່ມຈະຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫົດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂະໜາດຂອງປຸ່ມໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນໄວ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ [theme_item icon_max_width] ປະກອບ."

msgid "Flat buttons don't display decoration."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມແບບຮາບພຽງ (Flat) ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງການຕົກແຕ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Button's icon, if text is present the icon will be placed before the text.\n"
"To edit margin and spacing of the icon, use [theme_item h_separation] theme "
"property and [code]content_margin_*[/code] properties of the used "
"[StyleBox]es."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນຂອງປຸ່ມ, ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໄອຄອນຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂອບ ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງໄອຄອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີມ [theme_item h_separation] ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]content_margin_*[/code] ຂອງ [StyleBox] ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Specifies if the icon should be aligned horizontally to the left, right, or "
"center of a button. Uses the same [enum HorizontalAlignment] constants as the "
"text alignment. If centered horizontally and vertically, text will draw on "
"top of the icon."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າໄອຄອນຄວນຖືກຈັດວາງແນວນອນໄປທາງຊ້າຍ, ຂວາ ຫຼື ກາງຂອງປຸ່ມ. ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"HorizontalAlignment] ດຽວກັນກັບການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າຈັດວາງຢູ່ກາງທັງແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ, "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເທິງໄອຄອນ."

msgid ""
"Language code used for line-breaking and text shaping algorithms. If left "
"empty, the current locale is used instead."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ແລະ ອັລກໍຣິທຶມການສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າປ່ອຍໃຫ້ວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ "
"locale ປັດຈຸບັນແທນ."

msgid "The button's text that will be displayed inside the button's area."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງປຸ່ມ."

msgid "Base text writing direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງພື້ນຖານຂອງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the clipping behavior when the text exceeds the node's bounding "
"rectangle."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳການຕັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ (clipping) ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Specifies if the icon should be aligned vertically to the top, bottom, or "
"center of a button. Uses the same [enum VerticalAlignment] constants as the "
"text alignment. If centered horizontally and vertically, text will draw on "
"top of the icon."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າໄອຄອນຄວນຖືກຈັດວາງແນວຕັ້ງໄປທາງເທິງ, ລຸ່ມ ຫຼື ກາງຂອງປຸ່ມ. ໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"VerticalAlignment] ດຽວກັນກັບການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າຈັດວາງຢູ່ກາງທັງແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ, "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເທິງໄອຄອນ."

msgid "Default text [Color] of the [Button]."
msgstr "[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Button]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [Button] is disabled."
msgstr "[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Text [Color] used when the [Button] is focused. Only replaces the normal text "
"color of the button. Disabled, hovered, and pressed states take precedence "
"over this color."
msgstr ""
"[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກໂຟກັສ. ຈະປ່ຽນແທນສີຂໍ້ຄວາມປົກກະຕິຂອງປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ສະຖານະປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ (hovered) ແລະ ການກົດ ຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າສີນີ້."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [Button] is being hovered."
msgstr "[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [Button]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [Button] is being hovered and pressed."
msgstr "[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ ແລະ ກົດ [Button] ພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid "The tint of text outline of the [Button]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (outline) ຂອງ [Button]."

msgid "Text [Color] used when the [Button] is being pressed."
msgstr "[Color] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Icon modulate [Color] used when the [Button] is disabled."
msgstr "[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Icon modulate [Color] used when the [Button] is focused. Only replaces the "
"normal modulate color of the button. Disabled, hovered, and pressed states "
"take precedence over this color."
msgstr ""
"[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກໂຟກັສ. ຈະປ່ຽນແທນສີການປັບສີປົກກະຕິຂອງປຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ສະຖານະປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ ແລະ ການກົດ ຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າສີນີ້."

msgid "Icon modulate [Color] used when the [Button] is being hovered."
msgstr "[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [Button]."

msgid ""
"Icon modulate [Color] used when the [Button] is being hovered and pressed."
msgstr "[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ ແລະ ກົດ [Button] ພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid "Default icon modulate [Color] of the [Button]."
msgstr "[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Button]."

msgid "Icon modulate [Color] used when the [Button] is being pressed."
msgstr "[Color] ການປັບສີໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"This constant acts as a boolean. If [code]true[/code], the minimum size of "
"the button and text/icon alignment is always based on the largest stylebox "
"margins, otherwise it's based on the current button state stylebox margins."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ boolean. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງປຸ່ມ ແລະ "
"ການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ/ໄອຄອນ ຈະອີງຕາມຂອບຂອງ stylebox ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດສະເໝີ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈະອີງຕາມຂອບຂອງ "
"stylebox ຕາມສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງປຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"The horizontal space between [Button]'s icon and text. Negative values will "
"be treated as [code]0[/code] when used."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວນອນລະຫວ່າງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ [Button]. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນລົບຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນ [code]0[/"
"code] ເມື່ອຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum allowed width of the [Button]'s icon. This limit is applied on "
"top of the default size of the icon, or its expanded size if [member "
"expand_icon] is [code]true[/code]. The height is adjusted according to the "
"icon's ratio. If the button has additional icons (e.g. [CheckBox]), they will "
"also be limited."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງໄອຄອນຂອງ [Button]. ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄອຄອນ, "
"ຫຼື ຂະໜາດທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍອອກຖ້າ [member expand_icon] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ຄວາມສູງຈະຖືກປັບຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງໄອຄອນ. ຖ້າປຸ່ມມີໄອຄອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເຊັ່ນ [CheckBox]), "
"ພວກມັນກໍຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Additional vertical spacing between lines (in pixels), spacing is added to "
"line descent. This value can be negative."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງເພີ່ມເຕີມລະຫວ່າງແຖວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ), ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ line descent. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດເປັນລົບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The size of the text outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (outline).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ຟອນທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field], ຄ່າ [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] ຂອງມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/i] ຂອງຄ່າ "
"[theme_item outline_size] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແຕ່ງຂອບເບິ່ງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຂອບອາດຈະປະກົດວ່າຖືກຕັດອອກກ່ອນທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນ."

msgid "[Font] of the [Button]'s text."
msgstr "[Font] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [Button]."

msgid "Font size of the [Button]'s text."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [Button]."

msgid ""
"Default icon for the [Button]. Appears only if [member icon] is not assigned."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Button]. ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຖ້າ [member icon] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is disabled."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is disabled (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is focused. The [theme_item focus] "
"[StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a partially "
"transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base [StyleBox] remains "
"visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well "
"for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a "
"[StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will "
"harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກໂຟກັສ. [theme_item focus] [StyleBox] ຈະຖືກສະແດງ "
"[i]ທັບ[/i] [StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ "
"[StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານຍັງຄົງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. [StyleBox] ທີ່ສະແດງເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນກ້ອງ "
"ຈະເໝາະສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [StyleBoxEmpty]. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການນຳໃຊ້ຄີບອດ/ຄອນໂທຣລເລີ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility)."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being hovered."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [Button]."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being hovered (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [Button] (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being pressed and hovered at the same "
"time."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກກົດ ແລະ ມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being pressed and hovered at the same "
"time (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ຖືກກົດ ແລະ ມີການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານພ້ອມກັນ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "Default [StyleBox] for the [Button]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Button]."

msgid "Default [StyleBox] for the [Button] (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [Button] (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being pressed."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ກຳລັງຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Button] is being pressed (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [Button] ກຳລັງຖືກກົດ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"A group of buttons that doesn't allow more than one button to be pressed at a "
"time."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກົດຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງປຸ່ມໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"A group of [BaseButton]-derived buttons. The buttons in a [ButtonGroup] are "
"treated like radio buttons: No more than one button can be pressed at a time. "
"Some types of buttons (such as [CheckBox]) may have a special appearance in "
"this state.\n"
"Every member of a [ButtonGroup] should have [member BaseButton.toggle_mode] "
"set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມຂອງປຸ່ມທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [BaseButton]. ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆໃນ [ButtonGroup] ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ "
"(radio buttons): ບໍ່ສາມາດກົດໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງປຸ່ມໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ປຸ່ມບາງປະເພດ (ເຊັ່ນ [CheckBox]) "
"ອາດຈະມີຮູບລັກສະນະພິເສດໃນສະຖານະນີ້.\n"
"ສະມາຊິກທຸກຄົນຂອງ [ButtonGroup] ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member BaseButton.toggle_mode] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Button]s who have this as their [ButtonGroup] (see "
"[member BaseButton.button_group])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງ [Button] ທີ່ມີອັນນີ້ເປັນ [ButtonGroup] ຂອງພວກເຂົາ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"BaseButton.button_group])."

msgid "Returns the current pressed button."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກກົດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it is possible to unpress all buttons in this "
"[ButtonGroup]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດຍົກເລີກການກົດ (unpress) ທຸກປຸ່ມໃນ [ButtonGroup] ນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid "Emitted when one of the buttons of the group is pressed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງໃນກຸ່ມຖືກກົດ."

msgid "A built-in type representing a method or a standalone function."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງເມັດທອດ ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນອິດສະຫຼະ."

msgid ""
"[Callable] is a built-in [Variant] type that represents a function. It can "
"either be a method within an [Object] instance, or a custom callable used for "
"different purposes (see [method is_custom]). Like all [Variant] types, it can "
"be stored in variables and passed to other functions. It is most commonly "
"used for signal callbacks.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func print_args(arg1, arg2, arg3 = \"\"):\n"
"\tprints(arg1, arg2, arg3)\n"
"\n"
"func test():\n"
"\tvar callable = Callable(self, \"print_args\")\n"
"\tcallable.call(\"hello\", \"world\")  # Prints \"hello world \".\n"
"\tcallable.call(Vector2.UP, 42, callable)  # Prints \"(0.0, -1.0) 42 "
"Node(node.gd)::print_args\"\n"
"\tcallable.call(\"invalid\")  # Invalid call, should have at least 2 "
"arguments.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Default parameter values are not supported.\n"
"public void PrintArgs(Variant arg1, Variant arg2, Variant arg3 = default)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.PrintS(arg1, arg2, arg3);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Invalid calls fail silently.\n"
"\tCallable callable = new Callable(this, MethodName.PrintArgs);\n"
"\tcallable.Call(\"hello\", \"world\"); // Default parameter values are not "
"supported, should have 3 arguments.\n"
"\tcallable.Call(Vector2.Up, 42, callable); // Prints \"(0, -1) 42 "
"Node(Node.cs)::PrintArgs\"\n"
"\tcallable.Call(\"invalid\"); // Invalid call, should have 3 arguments.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In GDScript, it's possible to create lambda functions within a method. Lambda "
"functions are custom callables that are not associated with an [Object] "
"instance. Optionally, lambda functions can also be named. The name will be "
"displayed in the debugger, or when calling [method get_method].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tvar my_lambda = func (message):\n"
"\t\tprint(message)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Prints \"Hello everyone!\"\n"
"\tmy_lambda.call(\"Hello everyone!\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Prints \"Attack!\", when the button_pressed signal is emitted.\n"
"\tbutton_pressed.connect(func(): print(\"Attack!\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"In GDScript, you can access methods and global functions as [Callable]s:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"tween.tween_callback(node.queue_free)  # Object methods.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(array.clear)  # Methods of built-in types.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(print.bind(\"Test\"))  # Global functions.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Dictionary] does not support the above due to ambiguity with "
"keys.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dictionary = { \"hello\": \"world\" }\n"
"\n"
"# This will not work, `clear` is treated as a key.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(dictionary.clear)\n"
"\n"
"# This will work.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(Callable.create(dictionary, \"clear\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a callable will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's null (see [method is_null]). Otherwise, a callable will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[Callable] ແມ່ນປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ ເຊິ່ງແທນຟັງຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງ. ມັນສາມາດເປັນວິທີການ "
"(method) ພາຍໃນ instance ຂອງ [Object], ຫຼື ເປັນ callable ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງຕ່າງໆ "
"(ເບິ່ງ [method is_custom]). ຄືກັນກັບປະເພດ [Variant] ອື່ນໆ, ມັນສາມາດເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງໄປຫາຟັງຊັນອື່ນໄດ້. ມັນມັກຖືກໃຊ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຮຽກຄືນສັນຍານ (signal callbacks).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func print_args(arg1, arg2, arg3 = \"\"):\n"
"\tprints(arg1, arg2, arg3)\n"
"\n"
"func test():\n"
"\tvar callable = Callable(self, \"print_args\")\n"
"\tcallable.call(\"hello\", \"world\")  # ພິມ \"hello world \".\n"
"\tcallable.call(Vector2.UP, 42, callable)  # ພິມ \"(0.0, -1.0) 42 "
"Node(node.gd)::print_args\"\n"
"\tcallable.call(\"invalid\")  # ການຮຽກໃຊ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄວນມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2 ອາຄິວເມັ້ນ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ.\n"
"public void PrintArgs(Variant arg1, Variant arg2, Variant arg3 = default)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.PrintS(arg1, arg2, arg3);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ການຮຽກໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈະບໍ່ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"\tCallable callable = new Callable(this, MethodName.PrintArgs);\n"
"\tcallable.Call(\"hello\", \"world\"); // ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ, ຄວນມີ 3 ອາຄິວເມັ້ນ.\n"
"\tcallable.Call(Vector2.Up, 42, callable); // ພິມ \"(0, -1) 42 "
"Node(Node.cs)::PrintArgs\"\n"
"\tcallable.Call(\"invalid\"); // ການຮຽກໃຊ້ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄວນມີ 3 ອາຄິວເມັ້ນ.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ໃນ GDScript, ສາມາດສ້າງ lambda functions ພາຍໃນວິທີການໄດ້. Lambda functions ແມ່ນ "
"custom callables ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ instance ຂອງ [Object]. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ lambda "
"functions ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ. ຊື່ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ debugger ຫຼື ເມື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ [method get_method].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tvar my_lambda = func (message):\n"
"\t\tprint(message)\n"
"\n"
"\t# ພິມ \"Hello everyone!\"\n"
"\tmy_lambda.call(\"Hello everyone!\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# ພິມ \"Attack!\" ເມື່ອສັນຍານ button_pressed ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"\tbutton_pressed.connect(func(): print(\"Attack!\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ໃນ GDScript, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງວິທີການ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນສາກົນ (global functions) ໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[Callable] ໄດ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"tween.tween_callback(node.queue_free)  # ວິທີການຂອງອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(array.clear)  # ວິທີການຂອງປະເພດ built-in.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(print.bind(\"Test\"))  # ຟັງຊັນສາກົນ.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Dictionary] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຂ້າງເທິງເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມກຳກວມກັບຄີ (keys).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var dictionary = { \"hello\": \"world\" }\n"
"\n"
"# ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້, `clear` ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຄີ.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(dictionary.clear)\n"
"\n"
"# ນີ້ຈຶ່ງຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"tween.tween_callback(Callable.create(dictionary, \"clear\"))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູນີນ (boolean), callable ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນເປັນ null (ເບິ່ງ [method is_null]). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ສະເໝີ."

msgid "Constructs an empty [Callable], with no object nor method bound."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Callable] ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸ (object) ຫຼື ເມັດທອດຖືກຜູກມັດໄວ້."

msgid "Constructs a [Callable] as a copy of the given [Callable]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Callable] ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຈາກ [Callable] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Callable] for the method named [param method] in the specified "
"[param object].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For methods of built-in [Variant] types, use [method create] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Callable] ໃໝ່ສຳລັບເມັດທອດທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [param method] ໃນ [param object] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບເມັດທອດຂອງປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method create] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this [Callable] with one or more arguments bound. When "
"called, the bound arguments are passed [i]after[/i] the arguments supplied by "
"[method call]. See also [method unbind].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When this method is chained with other similar methods, the "
"order in which the argument list is modified is read from right to left."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງ [Callable] ນີ້ ໂດຍມີການຜູກ (bound) ອາຄິວເມັ້ນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຕົວເຂົ້າໄວ້. "
"ເມື່ອຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້, ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ຜູກໄວ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ [method call]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method unbind] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອວິທີການນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ກັນ (chained) ກັບວິທີການອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, "
"ລຳດັບໃນການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການອາຄິວເມັ້ນຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກຂວາໄປຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this [Callable] with one or more arguments bound, reading "
"them from an array. When called, the bound arguments are passed [i]after[/i] "
"the arguments supplied by [method call]. See also [method unbind].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When this method is chained with other similar methods, the "
"order in which the argument list is modified is read from right to left."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງ [Callable] ນີ້ ໂດຍມີການຜູກອາຄິວເມັ້ນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຕົວ ໂດຍອ່ານຄ່າຈາກອາເຣ (array). "
"ເມື່ອຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້, ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ຜູກໄວ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ [method call]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method unbind] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອວິທີການນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ກັນກັບວິທີການອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, "
"ລຳດັບໃນການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການອາຄິວເມັ້ນຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກຂວາໄປຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Calls the method represented by this [Callable]. Arguments can be passed and "
"should match the method's signature."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽກໃຊ້ເມັດທອດທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນໂດຍ [Callable] ນີ້. ສາມາດສົ່ງອາກິວເມັນ (arguments) ເຂົ້າໄປໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຄວນກົງກັບ signature ຂອງເມັດທອດ."

msgid ""
"Calls the method represented by this [Callable] in deferred mode, i.e. at the "
"end of the current frame. Arguments can be passed and should match the "
"method's signature.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tgrab_focus.call_deferred()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tCallable.From(GrabFocus).CallDeferred();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Deferred calls are processed at idle time. Idle time happens "
"mainly at the end of process and physics frames. In it, deferred calls will "
"be run until there are none left, which means you can defer calls from other "
"deferred calls and they'll still be run in the current idle time cycle. This "
"means you should not call a method deferred from itself (or from a method "
"called by it), as this causes infinite recursion the same way as if you had "
"called the method directly.\n"
"See also [method Object.call_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽກໃຊ້ວິທີການທີ່ [Callable] ນີ້ເປັນຕົວແທນໃນໂໝດທີ່ຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປ (deferred mode), "
"ນັ້ນກໍຄືເມື່ອຈົບເຟຣມ (frame) ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສາມາດສົ່ງອາຄິວເມັ້ນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ຄວນກົງກັບ signature "
"ຂອງວິທີການນັ້ນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tgrab_focus.call_deferred()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tCallable.From(GrabFocus).CallDeferred();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮຽກໃຊ້ແບບ deferred ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຊ່ວງ idle time (ຊ່ວງເວລາວ່າງ). "
"idle time ມັກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກຈົບເຟຣມ process ແລະ physics. ໃນຊ່ວງນັ້ນ, ການຮຽກໃຊ້ແບບ "
"deferred ຈະຖືກລັນຈົນກວ່າຈະໝົດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນຮຽກໃຊ້ວິທີການແບບ deferred "
"ຈາກພາຍໃນວິທີການດຽວກັນ ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການເຮັດຊ້ຳບໍ່ຮູ້ຈົບ (infinite recursion).\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Object.call_deferred] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Calls the method represented by this [Callable]. Unlike [method call], this "
"method expects all arguments to be contained inside the [param arguments] "
"[Array]."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽກໃຊ້ເມັດທອດທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນໂດຍ [Callable] ນີ້. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method call], "
"ເມັດທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ອາກິວເມັນທັງໝົດຖືກບັນຈຸຢູ່ພາຍໃນ [Array] ຂອງ [param arguments]."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [Callable] for the method named [param method] in the specified "
"[param variant]. To represent a method of a built-in [Variant] type, a custom "
"callable is used (see [method is_custom]). If [param variant] is [Object], "
"then a standard callable will be created instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is always necessary for the [Dictionary] type, as "
"property syntax is used to access its entries. You may also use this method "
"when [param variant]'s type is not known in advance (for polymorphism)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Callable] ໃໝ່ສຳລັບວິທີການທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param method] ໃນ [param variant] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ເພື່ອແທນວິທີການຂອງປະເພດ [Variant] ແບບ built-in, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ custom callable (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method is_custom]). ຖ້າ [param variant] ເປັນ [Object], ຈະມີການສ້າງ standard "
"callable ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສະເໝີສຳລັບປະເພດ [Dictionary]. "
"ທ່ານອາດໃຊ້ວິທີການນີ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ຮູ້ປະເພດຂອງ [param variant] ລ່ວງໜ້າ (ສຳລັບ polymorphism)."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of arguments this [Callable] should take, including "
"optional arguments. This means that any arguments bound with [method bind] "
"are [i]subtracted[/i] from the result, and any arguments unbound with [method "
"unbind] are [i]added[/i] to the result."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນອາຄິວເມັ້ນທັງໝົດທີ່ [Callable] ນີ້ຄວນຮັບ, ລວມທັງອາຄິວເມັ້ນທາງເລືອກ. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອາຄິວເມັ້ນໃດໆທີ່ຜູກໄວ້ດ້ວຍ [method bind] ຈະຖືກ [i]ລົບອອກ[/i] ຈາກຜົນລັດ, ແລະ "
"ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ຖືກປົດອອກດ້ວຍ [method unbind] ຈະຖືກ [i]ບວກເຂົ້າ[/i] ໃສ່ຜົນລັດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the array of arguments bound via successive [method bind] or [method "
"unbind] calls. These arguments will be added [i]after[/i] the arguments "
"passed to the call, from which [method get_unbound_arguments_count] arguments "
"on the right have been previously excluded.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func get_effective_arguments(callable, call_args):\n"
"\tassert(call_args.size() - callable.get_unbound_arguments_count() >= 0)\n"
"\tvar result = call_args.slice(0, call_args.size() - "
"callable.get_unbound_arguments_count())\n"
"\tresult.append_array(callable.get_bound_arguments())\n"
"\treturn result\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ຖືກຜູກໄວ້ຜ່ານການຮຽກໃຊ້ [method bind] ຫຼື [method unbind] ຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ. "
"ອາຄິວເມັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ອາຄິວເມັ້ນທີ່ສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ໃນຕອນຮຽກໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the total amount of arguments bound via successive [method bind] or "
"[method unbind] calls. This is the same as the size of the array returned by "
"[method get_bound_arguments]. See [method get_bound_arguments] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [method get_bound_arguments_count] and [method "
"get_unbound_arguments_count] methods can both return positive values."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນອາຄິວເມັ້ນທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກຜູກໄວ້ຜ່ານການຮຽກໃຊ້ [method bind] ຫຼື [method unbind] ຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຂະໜາດຂອງອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ [method get_bound_arguments]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the method represented by this [Callable]. If the "
"callable is a GDScript lambda function, returns the function's name or [code]"
"\"<anonymous lambda>\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງເມັດທອດທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນໂດຍ [Callable] ນີ້. ຖ້າ callable ເປັນຟັງຊັນ lambda ຂອງ "
"GDScript, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຟັງຊັນ ຫຼື [code]\"<anonymous lambda>\"[/code]."

msgid "Returns the object on which this [Callable] is called."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸ (object) ທີ່ [Callable] ນີ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID of this [Callable]'s object (see [method "
"Object.get_instance_id])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງວັດຖຸໃນ [Callable] ນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method Object.get_instance_id])."

msgid ""
"Returns the total amount of arguments unbound via successive [method bind] or "
"[method unbind] calls. See [method get_bound_arguments] for details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [method get_bound_arguments_count] and [method "
"get_unbound_arguments_count] methods can both return positive values."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນອາຄິວເມັ້ນທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກປົດອອກ (unbound) ຜ່ານການຮຽກໃຊ້ [method bind] ຫຼື [method "
"unbind] ຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 32-bit hash value of this [Callable]'s object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Callable]s with equal content will always produce identical "
"hash values. However, the reverse is not true. Returning identical hash "
"values does [i]not[/i] imply the callables are equal, because different "
"callables can have identical hash values due to hash collisions. The engine "
"uses a 32-bit hash algorithm for [method hash]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຮຊ (hash value) ແບບ 32-ບິດ ຂອງອອບເຈັກ [Callable] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Callable] is a custom callable. Custom "
"callables are used:\n"
"- for binding/unbinding arguments (see [method bind] and [method unbind]);\n"
"- for representing methods of built-in [Variant] types (see [method "
"create]);\n"
"- for representing global, lambda, and RPC functions in GDScript;\n"
"- for other purposes in the core, GDExtension, and C#."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Callable] ນີ້ແມ່ນ custom callable. Custom callables "
"ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້:\n"
"- ສຳລັບການຜູກ ຫຼື ປົດອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (ເບິ່ງ [method bind] ແລະ [method unbind]);\n"
"- ສຳລັບແທນວິທີການຂອງປະເພດ [Variant] ແບບ built-in (ເບິ່ງ [method create]);\n"
"- ສຳລັບແທນຟັງຊັນສາກົນ (global), lambda, ແລະ RPC ໃນ GDScript;\n"
"- ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນໆໃນ core, GDExtension, ແລະ C#."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Callable] has no target to call the method "
"on. Equivalent to [code]callable == Callable()[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [i]not[/i] the same as [code]not is_valid()[/code] and "
"using [code]not is_null()[/code] will [i]not[/i] guarantee that this callable "
"can be called. Use [method is_valid] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Callable] ນີ້ບໍ່ມີເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ວິທີການ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]callable == Callable()[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ສິ່ງດຽວກັນກັບ [code]not is_valid()[/code]. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method is_valid] ແທນເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Callable] is a standard callable. This "
"method is the opposite of [method is_custom]. Returns [code]false[/code] if "
"this callable is a lambda function."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Callable] ນີ້ແມ່ນ callable ມາດຕະຖານ. ເມັດທອດນີ້ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ "
"[method is_custom]. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ຖ້າ callable ນີ້ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນ lambda."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the callable's object exists and has a valid "
"method name assigned, or is a custom callable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າວັດຖຸຂອງ callable ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ມີການກຳນົດຊື່ເມັດທອດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຫຼື ເປັນ "
"custom callable."

msgid ""
"Perform an RPC (Remote Procedure Call) on all connected peers. This is used "
"for multiplayer and is normally not available, unless the function being "
"called has been marked as [i]RPC[/i] (using [annotation @GDScript.@rpc] or "
"[method Node.rpc_config]). Calling this method on unsupported functions will "
"result in an error. See [method Node.rpc]."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການ RPC (Remote Procedure Call) ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທັງໝົດ (all peers). "
"ນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຫຼິ້ນແບບຫຼາຍຄົນ (multiplayer) ແລະ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ "
"ນອກຈາກວ່າຟັງຊັນທີ່ຖືກຮຽກນັ້ນຈະຖືກໝາຍເປັນ [i]RPC[/i] (ໂດຍໃຊ້ [annotation @GDScript.@rpc] "
"ຫຼື [method Node.rpc_config]). ເບິ່ງ [method Node.rpc]."

msgid ""
"Perform an RPC (Remote Procedure Call) on a specific peer ID (see multiplayer "
"documentation for reference). This is used for multiplayer and is normally "
"not available unless the function being called has been marked as [i]RPC[/i] "
"(using [annotation @GDScript.@rpc] or [method Node.rpc_config]). Calling this "
"method on unsupported functions will result in an error. See [method "
"Node.rpc_id]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ RPC ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີ peer ID ສະເພາະ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.rpc_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this [Callable] with a number of arguments unbound. In "
"other words, when the new callable is called the last few arguments supplied "
"by the user are ignored, according to [param argcount]. The remaining "
"arguments are passed to the callable. This allows to use the original "
"callable in a context that attempts to pass more arguments than this callable "
"can handle, e.g. a signal with a fixed number of arguments. See also [method "
"bind].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When this method is chained with other similar methods, the "
"order in which the argument list is modified is read from right to left.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfoo.unbind(1).call(1, 2) # Calls foo(1).\n"
"\tfoo.bind(3, 4).unbind(1).call(1, 2) # Calls foo(1, 3, 4), note that it does "
"not change the arguments from bind.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງ [Callable] ນີ້ ໂດຍມີການປົດອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (unbound) ຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ callable ໃໝ່ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້, ອາຄິວເມັ້ນສອງສາມຕົວສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສົ່ງມາຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຕາມ "
"[param argcount]. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ callable "
"ຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນບໍລິບົດທີ່ມີການສົ່ງອາຄິວເມັ້ນຫຼາຍເກີນກວ່າທີ່ມັນຈະຮັບໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ສັນຍານທີ່ມີຈຳນວນອາຄິວເມັ້ນຄົງທີ່. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method bind] ນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອວິທີການນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຕໍ່ກັນກັບວິທີການອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, "
"ລຳດັບໃນການແກ້ໄຂລາຍການອາຄິວເມັ້ນຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກຂວາໄປຊ້າຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tfoo.unbind(1).call(1, 2) # ຮຽກໃຊ້ foo(1).\n"
"\tfoo.bind(3, 4).unbind(1).call(1, 2) # ຮຽກໃຊ້ foo(1, 3, 4).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if both [Callable]s invoke different targets."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Callable] ທັງສອງຮຽກໃຊ້ເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both [Callable]s invoke the same custom target."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Callable] ທັງສອງຮຽກໃຊ້ເປົ້າໝາຍ custom ດຽວກັນ."

msgid "Calls the specified method after optional delay."
msgstr "ຮຽກໃຊ້ເມັດທອດທີ່ລະບຸ ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດເວລາການລໍຖ້າ (ຖ້າມີ)."

msgid ""
"[CallbackTweener] is used to call a method in a tweening sequence. See "
"[method Tween.tween_callback] for more usage information.\n"
"The tweener will finish automatically if the callback's target object is "
"freed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_callback] is the only correct way to create "
"[CallbackTweener]. Any [CallbackTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"[CallbackTweener] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ວິທີການໃນລຳດັບຂອງການເຮັດ tween. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Tween.tween_callback] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"tweener ຈະຈົບການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າອອບເຈັກເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ callback ຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method Tween.tween_callback] ແມ່ນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການສ້າງ "
"[CallbackTweener]. ການສ້າງ [CallbackTweener] ດ້ວຍຕົວເອງຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Makes the callback call delayed by given time in seconds.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Call [method Node.queue_free] after 2 seconds:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_callback(queue_free).set_delay(2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຮຽກໃຊ້ callback ຊັກຊ້າຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນວິນາທີ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຮຽກໃຊ້ [method Node.queue_free] ຫຼັງຈາກ 2 ວິນາທີ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var tween = get_tree().create_tween()\n"
"tween.tween_callback(queue_free).set_delay(2)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Camera node for 2D scenes."
msgstr "ໂນດກ້ອງສຳລັບສາກ 2D."

msgid ""
"Camera node for 2D scenes. It forces the screen (current layer) to scroll "
"following this node. This makes it easier (and faster) to program scrollable "
"scenes than manually changing the position of [CanvasItem]-based nodes.\n"
"Cameras register themselves in the nearest [Viewport] node (when ascending "
"the tree). Only one camera can be active per viewport. If no viewport is "
"available ascending the tree, the camera will register in the global "
"viewport.\n"
"This node is intended to be a simple helper to get things going quickly, but "
"more functionality may be desired to change how the camera works. To make "
"your own custom camera node, inherit it from [Node2D] and change the "
"transform of the canvas by setting [member Viewport.canvas_transform] in "
"[Viewport] (you can obtain the current [Viewport] by using [method "
"Node.get_viewport]).\n"
"Note that the [Camera2D] node's [member Node2D.global_position] doesn't "
"represent the actual position of the screen, which may differ due to applied "
"smoothing or limits. You can use [method get_screen_center_position] to get "
"the real position. Same for the node's [member Node2D.global_rotation] which "
"may be different due to applied rotation smoothing. You can use [method "
"get_screen_rotation] to get the current rotation of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດກ້ອງ (Camera node) ສຳລັບສາກ 2D. ມັນຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍ (ເລເຢີປັດຈຸບັນ) ເລື່ອນຕາມໂນດນີ້. "
"ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມສາກທີ່ເລື່ອນໄດ້ງ່າຍ ແລະ ໄວກວ່າການປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດ [CanvasItem] "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"ກ້ອງຈະລົງທະບຽນຕົວເອງໃນໂນດ [Viewport] ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ສາມາດມີກ້ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (active) "
"ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ viewport.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: [member Node2D.global_position] ຂອງໂນດ [Camera2D] "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ແທນຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຈິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນຍ້ອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ smoothing ຫຼື limits. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_screen_center_position] ເພື່ອເອົາຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຈິງໄດ້. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ "
"[member Node2D.global_rotation] ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຕ່າງຈາກການໝຸນຕົວຈິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[method get_screen_rotation] ເພື່ອເອົາຄ່າການໝຸນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້."

msgid "2D Isometric Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການສາທິດ 2D Isometric"

msgid ""
"Aligns the camera to the tracked node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling [method force_update_scroll] after this method is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດວາງກ້ອງໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງຕິດຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮຽກໃຊ້ [method force_update_scroll] ຫຼັງຈາກເມັດທອດນີ້."

msgid "Forces the camera to update scroll immediately."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ກ້ອງອັບເດດການເລື່ອນ (scroll) ໃນທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified [enum Side]'s margin. See also [member "
"drag_bottom_margin], [member drag_top_margin], [member drag_left_margin], and "
"[member drag_right_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບ (margin) ຂອງ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [member drag_bottom_margin], "
"[member drag_top_margin], [member drag_left_margin], ແລະ [member "
"drag_right_margin] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the camera limit for the specified [enum Side]. See also [member "
"limit_bottom], [member limit_top], [member limit_left], and [member "
"limit_right]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂີດຈຳກັດ (limit) ຂອງກ້ອງສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [member limit_bottom], "
"[member limit_top], [member limit_left], ແລະ [member limit_right] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the center of the screen from this camera's point of view, in global "
"coordinates.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The exact targeted position of the camera may be different. See "
"[method get_target_position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດກາງຂອງໜ້າຈໍຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງນີ້, ໃນພິກັດໂລກ (global coordinates).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງກ້ອງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_target_position] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current screen rotation from this camera's point of view.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The screen rotation can be different from [member "
"Node2D.global_rotation] if the camera is rotating smoothly due to [member "
"rotation_smoothing_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການໝຸນຂອງໜ້າຈໍປັດຈຸບັນຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໝຸນຂອງໜ້າຈໍອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [member Node2D.global_rotation] "
"ຖ້າກ້ອງກຳລັງໝຸນແບບນຸ່ມນວນ (smoothly) ຍ້ອນການເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"rotation_smoothing_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Returns this camera's target position, in global coordinates.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is not the same as [member "
"Node2D.global_position], as it is affected by the drag properties. It is also "
"not the same as the current position if [member position_smoothing_enabled] "
"is [code]true[/code] (see [method get_screen_center_position])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງກ້ອງນີ້ ໃນພິກັດ global.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນບໍ່ແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນກັບ [member Node2D.global_position] "
"ເພາະມັນໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ drag. ມັນຍັງບໍ່ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຖ້າ [member "
"position_smoothing_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Camera2D] is the active camera (see "
"[method Viewport.get_camera_2d])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [Camera2D] ນີ້ແມ່ນກ້ອງທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ (active) (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Viewport.get_camera_2d])."

msgid ""
"Forces this [Camera2D] to become the current active one. [member enabled] "
"must be [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ [Camera2D] ນີ້ກາຍເປັນກ້ອງທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. [member enabled] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera's position immediately to its current smoothing destination.\n"
"This method has no effect if [member position_smoothing_enabled] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ປາຍທາງການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບນຽນ (smoothing) ປັດຈຸບັນໃນທັນທີ.\n"
"ເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [member position_smoothing_enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified [enum Side]'s margin. See also [member "
"drag_bottom_margin], [member drag_top_margin], [member drag_left_margin], and "
"[member drag_right_margin]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບ (margin) ຂອງ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [member drag_bottom_margin], "
"[member drag_top_margin], [member drag_left_margin], ແລະ [member "
"drag_right_margin] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera limit for the specified [enum Side]. See also [member "
"limit_bottom], [member limit_top], [member limit_left], and [member "
"limit_right]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດ (limit) ຂອງກ້ອງສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [member limit_bottom], "
"[member limit_top], [member limit_left], ແລະ [member limit_right] ປະກອບ."

msgid "The Camera2D's anchor point."
msgstr "ຈຸດຍຶດ (anchor point) ຂອງ Camera2D."

msgid ""
"The custom [Viewport] node attached to the [Camera2D]. If [code]null[/code] "
"or not a [Viewport], uses the default viewport instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [Viewport] ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [Camera2D]. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code] ຫຼື ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"[Viewport], ຈະໃຊ້ viewport ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Bottom margin needed to drag the camera. A value of [code]1[/code] makes the "
"camera move only when reaching the bottom edge of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບດ້ານລຸ່ມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລາກກ້ອງ. ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera only moves when reaching the horizontal "
"(left and right) drag margins. If [code]false[/code], the camera moves "
"horizontally regardless of margins."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບການລາກແນວນອນ (ຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາ) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແນວນອນໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂອບ."

msgid ""
"The relative horizontal drag offset of the camera between the right "
"([code]-1[/code]) and left ([code]1[/code]) drag margins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Used to set the initial horizontal drag offset; determine the "
"current offset; or force the current offset. It's not automatically updated "
"when [member drag_horizontal_enabled] is [code]true[/code] or the drag "
"margins are changed."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຊົດເຊີຍ (offset) ການລາກໃນແນວນອນຂອງກ້ອງ ລະຫວ່າງຂອບການລາກເບື້ອງຂວາ ([code]-1[/"
"code]) ແລະ ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ([code]1[/code])."

msgid ""
"Left margin needed to drag the camera. A value of [code]1[/code] makes the "
"camera move only when reaching the left edge of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບດ້ານຊ້າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລາກກ້ອງ. ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຈໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Right margin needed to drag the camera. A value of [code]1[/code] makes the "
"camera move only when reaching the right edge of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບດ້ານຂວາທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລາກກ້ອງ. ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບຂວາຂອງໜ້າຈໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Top margin needed to drag the camera. A value of [code]1[/code] makes the "
"camera move only when reaching the top edge of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບດ້ານເທິງທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການລາກກ້ອງ. ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera only moves when reaching the vertical (top "
"and bottom) drag margins. If [code]false[/code], the camera moves vertically "
"regardless of the drag margins."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຂອບການລາກແນວຕັ້ງ (ເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແນວຕັ້ງໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂອບການລາກ."

msgid ""
"The relative vertical drag offset of the camera between the bottom ([code]-1[/"
"code]) and top ([code]1[/code]) drag margins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Used to set the initial vertical drag offset; determine the "
"current offset; or force the current offset. It's not automatically updated "
"when [member drag_vertical_enabled] is [code]true[/code] or the drag margins "
"are changed."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຊົດເຊີຍການລາກໃນແນວຕັ້ງຂອງກ້ອງ ລະຫວ່າງຂອບການລາກເບື້ອງລຸ່ມ ([code]-1[/code]) ແລະ "
"ເບື້ອງເທິງ ([code]1[/code])."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draws the camera's drag margin rectangle in the editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອບການລາກຂອງກ້ອງໃນ editor."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws the camera's limits rectangle in the editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງກ້ອງໃນ editor."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws the camera's screen rectangle in the editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໜ້າຈໍຂອງກ້ອງໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"Controls whether the camera can be active or not. If [code]true[/code], the "
"[Camera2D] will become the main camera when it enters the scene tree and "
"there is no active camera currently (see [method Viewport.get_camera_2d]).\n"
"When the camera is currently active and [member enabled] is set to "
"[code]false[/code], the next enabled [Camera2D] in the scene tree will become "
"active."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າກ້ອງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກ (active) ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Camera2D] "
"ຈະກາຍເປັນກ້ອງຫຼັກເມື່ອມັນເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ມີກ້ອງອື່ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"
"ເມື່ອກ້ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຖືກຕັ້ງ [member enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], [Camera2D] "
"ຕົວຖັດໄປທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນ scene tree ຈະກາຍເປັນກ້ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera's rendered view is not affected by its "
"[member Node2D.rotation] and [member Node2D.global_rotation]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມຸມມອງທີ່ກ້ອງສະແດງອອກມາຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member "
"Node2D.rotation] ແລະ [member Node2D.global_rotation] ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Bottom scroll limit in pixels. The camera stops moving when reaching this "
"value, but [member offset] can push the view past the limit."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການເລື່ອນດ້ານລຸ່ມເປັນພິກເຊວ. ກ້ອງຈະຢຸດເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຄ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ [member offset] "
"ສາມາດດັນມຸມມອງໃຫ້ກາຍຂີດຈຳກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the limits will be enabled. Disabling this will allow "
"the camera to focus anywhere, when the four [code]limit_*[/code] properties "
"will not work."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂີດຈຳກັດ. "
"ການປິດໃຊ້ງານອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກ້ອງສາມາດໂຟກັສໄປບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]limit_*[/code] "
"ທັງສີ່ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Left scroll limit in pixels. The camera stops moving when reaching this "
"value, but [member offset] can push the view past the limit."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການເລື່ອນດ້ານຊ້າຍເປັນພິກເຊວ. ກ້ອງຈະຢຸດເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຄ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ [member offset] "
"ສາມາດດັນມຸມມອງໃຫ້ກາຍຂີດຈຳກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Right scroll limit in pixels. The camera stops moving when reaching this "
"value, but [member offset] can push the view past the limit."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການເລື່ອນດ້ານຂວາເປັນພິກເຊວ. ກ້ອງຈະຢຸດເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຄ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ [member offset] "
"ສາມາດດັນມຸມມອງໃຫ້ກາຍຂີດຈຳກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera smoothly stops when reaches its limits.\n"
"This property has no effect if [member position_smoothing_enabled] is "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To immediately update the camera's position to be within limits "
"without smoothing, even with this setting enabled, invoke [method "
"reset_smoothing]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກ້ອງຈະຄ່ອຍໆຢຸດຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນເມື່ອຮອດຂອບເຂດ (limits) ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [member position_smoothing_enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Top scroll limit in pixels. The camera stops moving when reaching this value, "
"but [member offset] can push the view past the limit."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການເລື່ອນດ້ານເທິງເປັນພິກເຊວ. ກ້ອງຈະຢຸດເຄື່ອນທີ່ເມື່ອໄປຮອດຄ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ [member offset] "
"ສາມາດດັນມຸມມອງໃຫ້ກາຍຂີດຈຳກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The camera's relative offset. Useful for looking around or camera shake "
"animations. The offsetted camera can go past the limits defined in [member "
"limit_top], [member limit_bottom], [member limit_left] and [member "
"limit_right]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຊົດເຊີຍ (offset) ຂອງກ້ອງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເບິ່ງອ້ອມໆ ຫຼື ເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນກ້ອງສັ່ນ (camera "
"shake). ກ້ອງທີ່ມີການຊົດເຊີຍສາມາດອອກນອກຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ limits ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera's view smoothly moves towards its target "
"position at [member position_smoothing_speed]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍຢ່າງລຽບນຽນຕາມຄວາມໄວ "
"[member position_smoothing_speed]."

msgid ""
"Speed in pixels per second of the camera's smoothing effect when [member "
"position_smoothing_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເປັນພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີຂອງເອັບເຟັກການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບນຽນຂອງກ້ອງເມື່ອ [member "
"position_smoothing_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid "The camera's process callback."
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ຄືນ (callback) ໃນຂະບວນການຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera's view smoothly rotates, via asymptotic "
"smoothing, to align with its target rotation at [member "
"rotation_smoothing_speed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if [member ignore_rotation] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງຈະໝຸນຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບການໝຸນເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The angular, asymptotic speed of the camera's rotation smoothing effect when "
"[member rotation_smoothing_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການໝຸນແບບນຸ່ມນວນຂອງກ້ອງ ເມື່ອ [member rotation_smoothing_enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The camera's zoom. Higher values are more zoomed in. For example, a zoom of "
"[code]Vector2(2.0, 2.0)[/code] will be twice as zoomed in on each axis (the "
"view covers an area four times smaller). In contrast, a zoom of "
"[code]Vector2(0.5, 0.5)[/code] will be twice as zoomed out on each axis (the "
"view covers an area four times larger). The X and Y components should "
"generally always be set to the same value, unless you wish to stretch the "
"camera view.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] does [i]not[/i] take [Camera2D] "
"zoom into account. This means that zooming in/out will cause bitmap fonts and "
"rasterized (non-MSDF) dynamic fonts to appear blurry or pixelated unless the "
"font is part of a [CanvasLayer] that makes it ignore camera zoom. To ensure "
"text remains crisp regardless of zoom, you can enable MSDF font rendering by "
"enabling [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] (applies to the default "
"project font only), or enabling [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] in "
"the import options of a DynamicFont for custom fonts. On system fonts, "
"[member SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] can be enabled in the "
"inspector."
msgstr ""
"ການຊູມ (zoom) ຂອງກ້ອງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໝາຍເຖິງການຊູມເຂົ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຊູມ "
"[code]Vector2(2.0, 2.0)[/code] ຈະຊູມເຂົ້າເປັນສອງເທົ່າໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ການຊູມ "
"[code]Vector2(0.5, 0.5)[/code] ຈະຊູມອອກເປັນສອງເທົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຊູມຂອງ [Camera2D] ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຟອນແບບບິດແມັບ (bitmap) ຫຼື "
"ຟອນໄດນາມິກທົ່ວໄປເບິ່ງຄືແຕກ ຫຼື ມົວເມື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າຫຼາຍໆ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງຄົມຊັດ, ທ່ານຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ MSDF "
"font rendering."

msgid ""
"The camera's position is fixed so that the top-left corner is always at the "
"origin."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (origin) ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The camera's position takes into account vertical/horizontal offsets and the "
"screen size."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງຈະຄິດໄລ່ລວມເຖິງໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ/ແນວນອນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The camera updates during physics frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ກ້ອງຈະອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມຟີຊິກ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS])."

msgid ""
"The camera updates during process frames (see [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."
msgstr ""
"ກ້ອງຈະອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມຂະບວນການ (ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS])."

msgid "Camera node, displays from a point of view."
msgstr "ໂນດກ້ອງ, ສະແດງຜົນຈາກມຸມມອງໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"[Camera3D] is a special node that displays what is visible from its current "
"location. Cameras register themselves in the nearest [Viewport] node (when "
"ascending the tree). Only one camera can be active per viewport. If no "
"viewport is available ascending the tree, the camera will register in the "
"global viewport. In other words, a camera just provides 3D display "
"capabilities to a [Viewport], and, without one, a scene registered in that "
"[Viewport] (or higher viewports) can't be displayed."
msgstr ""
"[Camera3D] ແມ່ນໂນດພິເສດທີ່ສະແດງສິ່ງທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງມັນ. ກ້ອງຈະລົງທະບຽນຕົວເອງໃນໂນດ "
"[Viewport] ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ. ສາມາດມີກ້ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ viewport. ເວົ້າງ່າຍໆກໍຄື, "
"ກ້ອງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການສະແດງຜົນ 3D ແກ່ [Viewport], ຖ້າບໍ່ມີກ້ອງ, ສາກທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ "
"[Viewport] ນັ້ນກໍຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If this is the current camera, remove it from being current. If [param "
"enable_next] is [code]true[/code], request to make the next camera current, "
"if any."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າອັນນີ້ແມ່ນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເອົາມັນອອກຈາກການເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າ [param enable_next] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຈະຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ກ້ອງຖັດໄປກາຍເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນ (ຖ້າມີ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the projection matrix that this camera uses to render to its "
"associated viewport. The camera must be part of the scene tree to function."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ projection matrix ທີ່ກ້ອງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໄປຫາ viewport ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. "
"ກ້ອງຕ້ອງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ scene tree ຈຶ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the camera's RID from the [RenderingServer]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງກ້ອງຈາກ [RenderingServer]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform of the camera plus the vertical ([member v_offset]) and "
"horizontal ([member h_offset]) offsets; and any other adjustments made to the "
"position and orientation of the camera by subclassed cameras such as "
"[XRCamera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ transform ຂອງກ້ອງ ລວມທັງໄລຍະຊົດເຊີຍແນວຕັ້ງ ([member v_offset]) ແລະ ແນວນອນ "
"([member h_offset]); ລວມເຖິງການປັບແຕ່ງອື່ນໆຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ທິດທາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member cull_mask] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 20."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າເລເຢີ (layer) ທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [member cull_mask] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່, ໂດຍລະບຸ [param "
"layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 20."

msgid ""
"Returns the camera's frustum planes in world space units as an array of "
"[Plane]s in the following order: near, far, left, top, right, bottom. Not to "
"be confused with [member frustum_offset]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ frustum planes ຂອງກ້ອງໃນໜ່ວຍ world space ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Plane] ຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້: "
"near, far, left, top, right, bottom."

msgid ""
"Returns the RID of a pyramid shape encompassing the camera's view frustum, "
"ignoring the camera's near plane. The tip of the pyramid represents the "
"position of the camera."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງຮູບຊົງປີຣາມິດທີ່ຄອບຄຸມ view frustum ຂອງກ້ອງ, ໂດຍລະເລີຍ near plane ຂອງກ້ອງ. "
"ປາຍຍອດຂອງປີຣາມິດແທນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given position is behind the camera (the "
"blue part of the linked diagram). [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/"
"godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/camera3d_position_frustum.png]See this "
"diagram[/url] for an overview of position query methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A position which returns [code]false[/code] may still be outside "
"the camera's field of view."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງກ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ກໍອາດຈະຍັງຢູ່ນອກ field of view "
"ຂອງກ້ອງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given position is inside the camera's "
"frustum (the green part of the linked diagram). [url=https://"
"raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"camera3d_position_frustum.png]See this diagram[/url] for an overview of "
"position query methods."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ frustum ຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Makes this camera the current camera for the [Viewport] (see class "
"description). If the camera node is outside the scene tree, it will attempt "
"to become current once it's added."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກ້ອງນີ້ເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນສຳລັບ [Viewport]. ຖ້າໂນດກ້ອງຢູ່ນອກ scene tree, "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມກາຍເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນທັນທີທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns a normal vector from the screen point location directed along the "
"camera. Orthogonal cameras are normalized. Perspective cameras account for "
"perspective, screen width/height, etc."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ vector normal ຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຕາມແນວກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 3D point in world space that maps to the given 2D coordinate in "
"the [Viewport] rectangle on a plane that is the given [param z_depth] "
"distance into the scene away from the camera."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດ 3D ໃນ world space ທີ່ກົງກັບພິກັດ 2D ໃນ [Viewport] ທີ່ໄລຍະຄວາມເລິກ [param "
"z_depth] ຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a normal vector in world space, that is the result of projecting a "
"point on the [Viewport] rectangle by the inverse camera projection. This is "
"useful for casting rays in the form of (origin, normal) for object "
"intersection or picking."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ vector normal ໃນ world space ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກການສາຍ (projecting) ຈຸດເທິງ "
"[Viewport]. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຍິງລັງສີ (ray casting)."

msgid ""
"Returns a 3D position in world space, that is the result of projecting a "
"point on the [Viewport] rectangle by the inverse camera projection. This is "
"useful for casting rays in the form of (origin, normal) for object "
"intersection or picking."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D ໃນ world space ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກການສາຍຈຸດເທິງ [Viewport]. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຍິງລັງສີ."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member cull_mask], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 20."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານເລເຢີ (layer) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member cull_mask] ຕາມຄ່າ [param value] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ "
"(ເລກເລເຢີລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 20)."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera projection to frustum mode (see [constant "
"PROJECTION_FRUSTUM]), by specifying a [param size], an [param offset], and "
"the [param z_near] and [param z_far] clip planes in world space units. The "
"[param size] parameter represents the size of the near plane, either its "
"width or height depending on the value of [member keep_aspect]. See also "
"[member frustum_offset]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສາຍພາບຂອງກ້ອງເປັນໂໝດ frustum."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera projection to orthogonal mode (see [constant "
"PROJECTION_ORTHOGONAL]), by specifying a [param size], and the [param z_near] "
"and [param z_far] clip planes in world space units.\n"
"As a hint, 3D games that look 2D often use this projection, with [param size] "
"specified in pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສາຍພາບຂອງກ້ອງເປັນໂໝດ orthogonal.\n"
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ເກມ 3D ທີ່ເບິ່ງຄື 2D ມັກຈະໃຊ້ການສາຍພາບແບບນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the camera projection to perspective mode (see [constant "
"PROJECTION_PERSPECTIVE]), by specifying a [param fov] (field of view) angle "
"in degrees, and the [param z_near] and [param z_far] clip planes in world "
"space units."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສາຍພາບຂອງກ້ອງເປັນໂໝດ perspective ໂດຍລະບຸມຸມ [param fov] ເປັນອົງສາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 2D coordinate in the [Viewport] rectangle that maps to the given "
"3D point in world space.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using this to position GUI elements over a 3D viewport, use "
"[method is_position_behind] to prevent them from appearing if the 3D point is "
"behind the camera:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# This code block is part of a script that inherits from Node3D.\n"
"# `control` is a reference to a node inheriting from Control.\n"
"control.visible = not "
"get_viewport().get_camera_3d().is_position_behind(global_transform.origin)\n"
"control.position = "
"get_viewport().get_camera_3d().unproject_position(global_transform.origin)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນພິກັດ 2D ໃນ [Viewport] ທີ່ກົງກັບຈຸດ 3D ໃນ world space.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ GUI ເທິງ viewport 3D, ຄວນໃຊ້ [method "
"is_position_behind] ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມັນປາກົດຖ້າຈຸດ 3D ນັ້ນຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງກ້ອງ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"control.visible = not "
"get_viewport().get_camera_3d().is_position_behind(global_transform.origin)\n"
"control.position = "
"get_viewport().get_camera_3d().unproject_position(global_transform.origin)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "The [CameraAttributes] to use for this camera."
msgstr "[CameraAttributes] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້."

msgid "The [Compositor] to use for this camera."
msgstr "[Compositor] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້."

msgid ""
"The culling mask that describes which [member VisualInstance3D.layers] are "
"rendered by this camera. By default, all 20 user-visible layers are "
"rendered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since the [member cull_mask] allows for 32 layers to be stored "
"in total, there are an additional 12 layers that are only used internally by "
"the engine and aren't exposed in the editor. Setting [member cull_mask] using "
"a script allows you to toggle those reserved layers, which can be useful for "
"editor plugins.\n"
"To adjust [member cull_mask] more easily using a script, use [method "
"get_cull_mask_value] and [method set_cull_mask_value].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [VoxelGI], SDFGI and [LightmapGI] will always take all layers "
"into account to determine what contributes to global illumination. If this is "
"an issue, set [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DISABLED] for meshes and [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] to [constant Light3D.BAKE_DISABLED] for lights to "
"exclude them from global illumination."
msgstr ""
"ມາກການຄັດອອກ (culling mask) ທີ່ອະທິບາຍວ່າ [member VisualInstance3D.layers] "
"ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໂດຍກ້ອງນີ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທັງໝົດ 20 ເລເຢີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໄດ້ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກ [member cull_mask] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທັງໝົດ 32 ເລເຢີ, ຈຶ່ງມີອີກ "
"12 ເລເຢີເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ໃຊ້ສະເພາະພາຍໃນໂດຍເອນຈິນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor). "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member cull_mask] "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດປິດເລເຢີທີ່ສະຫງວນໄວ້ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບປັກອິນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ເພື່ອປັບ [member cull_mask] ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_cull_mask_value] "
"ແລະ [method set_cull_mask_value].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [VoxelGI], SDFGI ແລະ [LightmapGI] "
"ຈະນຳເອົາທຸກເລເຢີມາພິຈາລະນາສະເໝີເພື່ອຄຳນວນຫາສິ່ງທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວເຖິງ (global "
"illumination). ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DISABLED] ສຳລັບເມດຊ໌ (meshes) ແລະ [member "
"Light3D.light_bake_mode] ເປັນ [constant Light3D.BAKE_DISABLED] "
"ສຳລັບແສງສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນພວກມັນອອກຈາກການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the ancestor [Viewport] is currently using this "
"camera.\n"
"If multiple cameras are in the scene, one will always be made current. For "
"example, if two [Camera3D] nodes are present in the scene and only one is "
"current, setting one camera's [member current] to [code]false[/code] will "
"cause the other camera to be made current."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [Viewport] ຕົ້ນຕະກູນແມ່ນກຳລັງໃຊ້ກ້ອງນີ້ຢູ່.\n"
"ຖ້າມີກ້ອງຫຼາຍຕົວຢູ່ໃນສາກ, ກ້ອງຕົວໜຶ່ງຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າມີໂນດ [Camera3D] "
"ສອງຕົວຢູ່ໃນສາກ ແລະ ມີພຽງຕົວດຽວທີ່ເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member current] "
"ຂອງກ້ອງຕົວໜຶ່ງໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງອີກຕົວໜຶ່ງກາຍເປັນກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນແທນ."

msgid ""
"If not [constant DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED], this camera will simulate the "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/url] for "
"objects changed in particular [code]_process[/code] methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Doppler effect will only be heard on [AudioStreamPlayer3D]s "
"if [member AudioStreamPlayer3D.doppler_tracking] is not set to [constant "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ [constant DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED], ກ້ອງນີ້ຈະຈຳລອງ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການດອບເປຼີ (Doppler effect)[/url] "
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນເມທອດ [code]_process[/code] ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປາກົດການດອບເປຼີຈະໄດ້ຍິນໃນ [AudioStreamPlayer3D] ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.doppler_tracking] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ [constant "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.DOPPLER_TRACKING_DISABLED]."

msgid "The [Environment] to use for this camera."
msgstr "[Environment] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້."

msgid ""
"The distance to the far culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis. Higher values allow the camera to see further away, while "
"decreasing [member far] can improve performance if it results in objects "
"being partially or fully culled."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຂອບເຂດການຄັດອອກທາງໄກສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້ ໂດຍທຽບກັບແກນ Z ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງມັນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກ້ອງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໄກຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການຫຼຸດຄ່າ [member far] "
"ລົງສາມາດປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ ຫາກມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຖືກຄັດອອກບາງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The camera's field of view angle (in degrees). Only applicable in perspective "
"mode. Since [member keep_aspect] locks one axis, [member fov] sets the other "
"axis' field of view angle.\n"
"For reference, the default vertical field of view value ([code]75.0[/code]) "
"is equivalent to a horizontal FOV of:\n"
"- ~91.31 degrees in a 4:3 viewport\n"
"- ~101.67 degrees in a 16:10 viewport\n"
"- ~107.51 degrees in a 16:9 viewport\n"
"- ~121.63 degrees in a 21:9 viewport"
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງພາບ (field of view) ຂອງກ້ອງ (ເປັນອົງສາ). ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ perspective ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກ [member keep_aspect] ຈະລັອກແກນໜຶ່ງໄວ້, [member fov] "
"ຈຶ່ງເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມມອງພາບຂອງອີກແກນໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງ, ຄ່າມຸມມອງພາບແນວຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ([code]75.0[/code]) ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບ FOV "
"ແນວນອນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ~91.31 ອົງສາ ໃນວິວພອດ 4:3\n"
"- ~101.67 ອົງສາ ໃນວິວພອດ 16:10\n"
"- ~107.51 ອົງສາ ໃນວິວພອດ 16:9\n"
"- ~121.63 ອົງສາ ໃນວິວພອດ 21:9"

msgid ""
"The camera's frustum offset. This can be changed from the default to create "
"\"tilted frustum\" effects such as [url=https://zdoom.org/wiki/Y-shearing]Y-"
"shearing[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member projection] is [constant "
"PROJECTION_FRUSTUM]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງ (offset) ຂອງຟຣັສຕຳ (frustum) ຂອງກ້ອງ. ສາມາດປ່ຽນຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ "
"\"tilted frustum\" ເຊັ່ນ [url=https://zdoom.org/wiki/Y-shearing]Y-shearing[/"
"url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member projection] ເປັນ [constant PROJECTION_FRUSTUM] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The horizontal (X) offset of the camera viewport."
msgstr "ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງແນວນອນ (X) ຂອງວິວພອດກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The axis to lock during [member fov]/[member size] adjustments. Can be either "
"[constant KEEP_WIDTH] or [constant KEEP_HEIGHT]."
msgstr ""
"ແກນທີ່ຈະລັອກໃນລະຫວ່າງການປັບ [member fov]/[member size]. ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງ [constant "
"KEEP_WIDTH] ຫຼື [constant KEEP_HEIGHT]."

msgid ""
"The distance to the near culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis. Lower values allow the camera to see objects more up close to "
"its origin, at the cost of lower precision across the [i]entire[/i] range. "
"Values lower than the default can lead to increased Z-fighting."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຂອບເຂດການຄັດອອກທາງໃກ້ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້ ໂດຍທຽບກັບແກນ Z ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງມັນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກ້ອງເບິ່ງເຫັນວັດຖຸໄດ້ໃກ້ກັບຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງມັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຄວາມຊັດເຈນທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງໃນ [i]ຕະຫຼອດ[/i] ຊ່ວງໄລຍະ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ Z-fighting ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The camera's projection mode. In [constant PROJECTION_PERSPECTIVE] mode, "
"objects' Z distance from the camera's local space scales their perceived size."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການສາຍພາບ (projection) ຂອງກ້ອງ. ໃນໂໝດ [constant PROJECTION_PERSPECTIVE], "
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕາມແກນ Z ຂອງວັດຖຸຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງກ້ອງ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຂະໜາດຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປາກົດ."

msgid ""
"The camera's size in meters measured as the diameter of the width or height, "
"depending on [member keep_aspect]. Only applicable in orthogonal and frustum "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງກ້ອງເປັນແມັດ ທີ່ວັດແທກເປັນເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງ, ຂຶ້ນກັບ [member "
"keep_aspect]. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ orthogonal ແລະ frustum ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The vertical (Y) offset of the camera viewport."
msgstr "ຄ່າການເຍື້ອງແນວຕັ້ງ (Y) ຂອງວິວພອດກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Perspective projection. Objects on the screen becomes smaller when they are "
"far away."
msgstr "ການສາຍພາບແບບເປສເປັກທີບ (Perspective). ວັດຖຸເທິງໜ້າຈໍຈະນ້ອຍລົງເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ໄກອອກໄປ."

msgid ""
"Orthogonal projection, also known as orthographic projection. Objects remain "
"the same size on the screen no matter how far away they are."
msgstr ""
"ການສາຍພາບແບບອໍໂທໂກນໍ (Orthogonal) ຫຼື ເອີ້ນອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງວ່າ orthographic projection. "
"ວັດຖຸຈະມີຂະໜາດເທົ່າເດີມເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະຢູ່ໄກປານໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Frustum projection. This mode allows adjusting [member frustum_offset] to "
"create \"tilted frustum\" effects."
msgstr ""
"ການສາຍພາບແບບຟຣັສຕຳ (Frustum). ໂໝດນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບ [member frustum_offset] "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ \"tilted frustum\"."

msgid ""
"Preserves the horizontal aspect ratio; also known as Vert- scaling. This is "
"usually the best option for projects running in portrait mode, as taller "
"aspect ratios will benefit from a wider vertical FOV."
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບແນວນອນ; ຫຼື ເອີ້ນອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງວ່າ Vert- scaling. "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດແນວຕັ້ງ (portrait), "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກ FOV ແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ກວ້າງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Preserves the vertical aspect ratio; also known as Hor+ scaling. This is "
"usually the best option for projects running in landscape mode, as wider "
"aspect ratios will automatically benefit from a wider horizontal FOV."
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບແນວຕັ້ງ; ຫຼື ເອີ້ນອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງວ່າ Hor+ scaling. "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດແນວນອນ (landscape), "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບທີ່ກວ້າງກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກ FOV ແນວນອນທີ່ກວ້າງກວ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/"
"url] by tracking positions of objects that are changed in [code]_process[/"
"code]. Changes in the relative velocity of this camera compared to those "
"objects affect how audio is perceived (changing the audio's [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການດອບເປຼີ (Doppler "
"effect)[/url] ໂດຍການຕິດຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ [code]_process[/code]. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄວາມໄວທຽບສຳພັດຂອງກ້ອງນີ້ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສຽງ (ປ່ຽນແປງ "
"[member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale] ຂອງສຽງ)."

msgid ""
"Simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]Doppler effect[/"
"url] by tracking positions of objects that are changed in "
"[code]_physics_process[/code]. Changes in the relative velocity of this "
"camera compared to those objects affect how audio is perceived (changing the "
"audio's [member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale])."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppler_effect]ປາກົດການດອບເປຼີ (Doppler "
"effect)[/url] ໂດຍການຕິດຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ [code]_physics_process[/code]. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄວາມໄວທຽບສຳພັດຂອງກ້ອງນີ້ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສຽງ (ປ່ຽນແປງ "
"[member AudioStreamPlayer3D.pitch_scale] ຂອງສຽງ)."

msgid "Parent class for camera settings."
msgstr "ຄລາສແມ່ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Controls camera-specific attributes such as depth of field and exposure "
"override.\n"
"When used in a [WorldEnvironment] it provides default settings for exposure, "
"auto-exposure, and depth of field that will be used by all cameras without "
"their own [CameraAttributes], including the editor camera. When used in a "
"[Camera3D] it will override any [CameraAttributes] set in the "
"[WorldEnvironment]. When used in [VoxelGI] or [LightmapGI], only the exposure "
"settings will be used.\n"
"See also [Environment] for general 3D environment settings.\n"
"This is a pure virtual class that is inherited by [CameraAttributesPhysical] "
"and [CameraAttributesPractical]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄຸນລັກສະນະສະເພາະຂອງກ້ອງ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ (depth of field) ແລະ "
"ການແຊກແຊງການຮັບແສງ (exposure override).\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment], ມັນຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຮັບແສງ, ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກ້ອງທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [CameraAttributes] ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ, "
"ລວມທັງກ້ອງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [Camera3D], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງ (override) ທຸກ "
"[CameraAttributes] ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື "
"[LightmapGI], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [Environment] ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ 3D ທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄລາສສະເໝືອນແທ້ (pure virtual class) ທີ່ຖືກສືບທອດໂດຍ [CameraAttributesPhysical] "
"ແລະ [CameraAttributesPractical]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the tonemapping auto exposure mode of the scene "
"renderer. If [code]true[/code], the renderer will automatically determine the "
"exposure setting to adapt to the scene's illumination and the observed "
"light.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Auto-exposure is only supported in the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto exposure) ແບບ "
"tonemapping ຂອງຕົວກຳນົດການເຣັນເດີສາກ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຕົວກຳນົດການເຣັນເດີຈະກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບແສງສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ "
"ແລະ ແສງທີ່ສັງເກດເຫັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The scale of the auto exposure effect. Affects the intensity of auto exposure."
msgstr "ສະເກລຂອງເອັບເຟັກການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The speed of the auto exposure effect. Affects the time needed for the camera "
"to perform auto exposure."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວຂອງເອັບເຟັກການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເວລາທີ່ກ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການປັບການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Multiplier for the exposure amount. A higher value results in a brighter "
"image."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບປະລິມານການຮັບແສງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sensitivity of camera sensors, measured in ISO. A higher sensitivity results "
"in a brighter image.\n"
"If [member auto_exposure_enabled] is [code]true[/code], this can be used as a "
"method of exposure compensation, doubling the value will increase the "
"exposure value (measured in EV100) by 1 stop.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວແສງຂອງເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງ, ວັດແທກເປັນ ISO. ຄວາມໄວແສງທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member auto_exposure_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນວິທີການຊົດເຊີຍການຮັບແສງໄດ້, ການເພີ່ມຄ່າເປັນສອງເທົ່າຈະເພີ່ມຄ່າການຮັບແສງ (ວັດແທກເປັນ "
"EV100) ຂຶ້ນ 1 ສະຕັອບ (stop).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Physically-based camera settings."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງແບບອີງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"[CameraAttributesPhysical] is used to set rendering settings based on a "
"physically-based camera's settings. It is responsible for exposure, auto-"
"exposure, and depth of field.\n"
"When used in a [WorldEnvironment] it provides default settings for exposure, "
"auto-exposure, and depth of field that will be used by all cameras without "
"their own [CameraAttributes], including the editor camera. When used in a "
"[Camera3D] it will override any [CameraAttributes] set in the "
"[WorldEnvironment] and will override the [Camera3D]s [member Camera3D.far], "
"[member Camera3D.near], [member Camera3D.fov], and [member "
"Camera3D.keep_aspect] properties. When used in [VoxelGI] or [LightmapGI], "
"only the exposure settings will be used.\n"
"The default settings are intended for use in an outdoor environment, tips for "
"settings for use in an indoor environment can be found in each setting's "
"documentation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Auto-exposure is only supported in the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"[CameraAttributesPhysical] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຣັນເດີໂດຍອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງກ້ອງແບບຟີຊິກ. "
"ມັນມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຮັບແສງ, ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ (depth of "
"field).\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment], ມັນຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຮັບແສງ, ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກ້ອງທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [CameraAttributes] ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ, "
"ລວມທັງກ້ອງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [Camera3D], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງ (override) ທຸກ "
"[CameraAttributes] ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment] ແລະ ຈະແຊກແຊງພຣັອບເພີຕີ [member "
"Camera3D.far], [member Camera3D.near], [member Camera3D.fov], ແລະ [member "
"Camera3D.keep_aspect] ຂອງ [Camera3D] ນັ້ນໆ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື [LightmapGI], "
"ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນອອກແບບມາສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກາງແຈ້ງ, "
"ສ່ວນຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມພາຍໃນອາຄານ "
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນເອກະສານຂອງແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ (Depth of field blur) "
"ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility."

msgid "Physical light and camera units"
msgstr "ຫົວໜ່ວຍແສງ ແລະ ກ້ອງແບບຟີຊິກ"

msgid ""
"Returns the vertical field of view that corresponds to the [member "
"frustum_focal_length]. This value is calculated internally whenever [member "
"frustum_focal_length] is changed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມມອງພາບແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ກົງກັບ [member frustum_focal_length]. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນພາຍໃນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ [member frustum_focal_length]."

msgid ""
"The maximum luminance (in EV100) used when calculating auto exposure. When "
"calculating scene average luminance, color values will be clamped to at least "
"this value. This limits the auto-exposure from exposing below a certain "
"brightness, resulting in a cut off point where the scene will remain bright."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ (ໃນ EV100) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງສາກ, ຄ່າສີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ຄ່ານີ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮັບແສງຕ່ຳກວ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຈຸດຕັດທີ່ສາກຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The minimum luminance (in EV100) used when calculating auto exposure. When "
"calculating scene average luminance, color values will be clamped to at least "
"this value. This limits the auto-exposure from exposing above a certain "
"brightness, resulting in a cut off point where the scene will remain dark."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດ (ໃນ EV100) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງສາກ, ຄ່າສີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ຄ່ານີ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮັບແສງເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຈຸດຕັດທີ່ສາກຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມມືດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Size of the aperture of the camera, measured in f-stops. An f-stop is a "
"unitless ratio between the focal length of the camera and the diameter of the "
"aperture. A high aperture setting will result in a smaller aperture which "
"leads to a dimmer image and sharper focus. A low aperture results in a wide "
"aperture which lets in more light resulting in a brighter, less-focused "
"image. Default is appropriate for outdoors at daytime (i.e. for use with a "
"default [DirectionalLight3D]), for indoor lighting, a value between 2 and 4 "
"is more appropriate.\n"
"Only available when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູຮັບແສງ (aperture) ຂອງກ້ອງ, ວັດແທກເປັນ f-stops. f-stop "
"ແມ່ນອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະໂຟກັສຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຂອງຮູຮັບແສງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ f-"
"stop ທີ່ສູງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູຮັບແສງນ້ອຍລົງ ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ພາບມືດລົງ ແລະ ມີໂຟກັສທີ່ຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ f-stop ທີ່ຕ່ຳ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູຮັບແສງກວ້າງ ເຊິ່ງປ່ອຍໃຫ້ແສງເຂົ້າມາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງໂຟກັສຈະຫຼຸດລົງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບກາງແຈ້ງໃນເວລາກາງເວັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [DirectionalLight3D] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ສຳລັບແສງສະຫວ່າງພາຍໃນອາຄານ ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 2 ຫາ 4 "
"ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Time for shutter to open and close, evaluated as [code]1 / shutter_speed[/"
"code] seconds. A higher value will allow less light (leading to a darker "
"image), while a lower value will allow more light (leading to a brighter "
"image).\n"
"Only available when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາທີ່ຊັດເຕີເປີດ ແລະ ປິດ, ຄິດໄລ່ເປັນ [code]1 / shutter_speed[/code] ວິນາທີ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ແສງເຂົ້າມານ້ອຍລົງ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບມືດລົງ), "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ແສງເຂົ້າມາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ).\n"
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Override value for [member Camera3D.far]. Used internally when calculating "
"depth of field. When attached to a [Camera3D] as its [member "
"Camera3D.attributes], it will override the [member Camera3D.far] property."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແຊກແຊງ (override) ສຳລັບ [member Camera3D.far]. "
"ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ (depth of field). ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [Camera3D] ໃນຖານະ "
"[member Camera3D.attributes], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງພຣັອບເພີຕີ [member Camera3D.far]."

msgid ""
"Distance between camera lens and camera aperture, measured in millimeters. "
"Controls field of view and depth of field. A larger focal length will result "
"in a smaller field of view and a narrower depth of field meaning fewer "
"objects will be in focus. A smaller focal length will result in a wider field "
"of view and a larger depth of field meaning more objects will be in focus. "
"When attached to a [Camera3D] as its [member Camera3D.attributes], it will "
"override the [member Camera3D.fov] property and the [member "
"Camera3D.keep_aspect] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງເລນກ້ອງ ແລະ ຮູຮັບແສງຂອງກ້ອງ, ວັດແທກເປັນມິນລິແມັດ. ຄວບຄຸມມຸມມອງພາບ (field of "
"view) ແລະ ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ (depth of field). "
"ໄລຍະໂຟກັສທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມຸມມອງພາບແຄບລົງ ແລະ ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບແຄບລົງ "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະມີວັດຖຸຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັສໜ້ອຍລົງ. ໄລຍະໂຟກັສທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມຸມມອງພາບກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະມີວັດຖຸຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັສຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [Camera3D] "
"ໃນຖານະ [member Camera3D.attributes], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງພຣັອບເພີຕີ [member Camera3D.fov] "
"ແລະ [member Camera3D.keep_aspect]."

msgid ""
"Distance from camera of object that will be in focus, measured in meters. "
"Internally this will be clamped to be at least 1 millimeter larger than "
"[member frustum_focal_length]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງຫາວັດຖຸທີ່ຈະຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັສ, ວັດແທກເປັນແມັດ. ພາຍໃນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"[member frustum_focal_length] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 ມິນລິແມັດ."

msgid ""
"Override value for [member Camera3D.near]. Used internally when calculating "
"depth of field. When attached to a [Camera3D] as its [member "
"Camera3D.attributes], it will override the [member Camera3D.near] property."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແຊກແຊງ (override) ສຳລັບ [member Camera3D.near]. "
"ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ (depth of field). ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [Camera3D] ໃນຖານະ "
"[member Camera3D.attributes], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງພຣັອບເພີຕີ [member Camera3D.near]."

msgid "Camera settings in an easy to use format."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ງ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Controls camera-specific attributes such as auto-exposure, depth of field, "
"and exposure override.\n"
"When used in a [WorldEnvironment] it provides default settings for exposure, "
"auto-exposure, and depth of field that will be used by all cameras without "
"their own [CameraAttributes], including the editor camera. When used in a "
"[Camera3D] it will override any [CameraAttributes] set in the "
"[WorldEnvironment]. When used in [VoxelGI] or [LightmapGI], only the exposure "
"settings will be used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Auto-exposure is only supported in the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມຄຸນລັກສະນະສະເພາະຂອງກ້ອງ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ ແລະ "
"ການແຊກແຊງການຮັບແສງ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment], ມັນຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຮັບແສງ, ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກ້ອງທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [CameraAttributes] ເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ, "
"ລວມທັງກ້ອງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [Camera3D], ມັນຈະແຊກແຊງ (override) ທຸກ "
"[CameraAttributes] ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [WorldEnvironment]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື "
"[LightmapGI], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ (Depth of field blur) "
"ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ "
"Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The maximum sensitivity (in ISO) used when calculating auto exposure. When "
"calculating scene average luminance, color values will be clamped to at least "
"this value. This limits the auto-exposure from exposing below a certain "
"brightness, resulting in a cut off point where the scene will remain bright."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວແສງສູງສຸດ (ເປັນ ISO) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງສາກ, ຄ່າສີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ຄ່ານີ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮັບແສງຕ່ຳກວ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຈຸດຕັດທີ່ສາກຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The minimum sensitivity (in ISO) used when calculating auto exposure. When "
"calculating scene average luminance, color values will be clamped to at least "
"this value. This limits the auto-exposure from exposing above a certain "
"brightness, resulting in a cut off point where the scene will remain dark."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວແສງຕ່ຳສຸດ (ເປັນ ISO) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ເມື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງສາກ, ຄ່າສີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) ໄວ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ຄ່ານີ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮັບແສງເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຈຸດຕັດທີ່ສາກຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມມືດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the maximum amount of blur. When using physically-based blur amounts, "
"will instead act as a multiplier. High values lead to an increased amount of "
"blurriness, but can be much more expensive to calculate. It is best to keep "
"this as low as possible for a given art style."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະລິມານຄວາມເບຼີ (blur) ສູງສຸດ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ປະລິມານຄວາມເບຼີແບບອີງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ, "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນແທນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມເບຼີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນການຄຳນວນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ທາງທີ່ດີຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຕາມຮູບແບບສິລະປະທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Objects further from the [Camera3D] by this amount will be blurred by the "
"depth of field effect. Measured in meters."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໄກຈາກ [Camera3D] ເກີນກວ່າໄລຍະນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເບຼີໂດຍເອັບເຟັກຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ. "
"ວັດແທກເປັນແມັດ."

msgid ""
"Enables depth of field blur for objects further than [member "
"dof_blur_far_distance]. Strength of blur is controlled by [member "
"dof_blur_amount] and modulated by [member dof_blur_far_transition].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is not supported on viewports that have a "
"transparent background (where [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is [code]true[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໄກກວ່າ [member dof_blur_far_distance]. "
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການເບຼີແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member dof_blur_amount] ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍ [member "
"dof_blur_far_transition].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນວິວພອດທີ່ມີພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ (ບ່ອນທີ່ [member "
"Viewport.transparent_bg] ເປັນ [code]true[/code])."

msgid ""
"When positive, distance over which (starting from [member "
"dof_blur_far_distance]) blur effect will scale from 0 to [member "
"dof_blur_amount]. When negative, uses physically-based scaling so depth of "
"field effect will scale from 0 at [member dof_blur_far_distance] and will "
"increase in a physically accurate way as objects get further from the "
"[Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ແມ່ນໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມເບຼີ (ເລີ່ມຈາກ [member dof_blur_far_distance]) "
"ຈະປ່ຽນສະເກລຈາກ 0 ຫາ [member dof_blur_amount]. ເມື່ອເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນສະເກລແບບອີງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ ເຊິ່ງເອັບເຟັກຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບຈະເລີ່ມຈາກ 0 ຢູ່ທີ່ [member "
"dof_blur_far_distance] ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກເມື່ອວັດຖຸຢູ່ໄກອອກໄປຈາກ "
"[Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"Objects closer from the [Camera3D] by this amount will be blurred by the "
"depth of field effect. Measured in meters."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຈາກ [Camera3D] ຫຼາຍກວ່າໄລຍະນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເບຼີໂດຍເອັບເຟັກຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບ. "
"ວັດແທກເປັນແມັດ."

msgid ""
"Enables depth of field blur for objects closer than [member "
"dof_blur_near_distance]. Strength of blur is controlled by [member "
"dof_blur_amount] and modulated by [member dof_blur_near_transition].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile "
"rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depth of field blur is not supported on viewports that have a "
"transparent background (where [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is [code]true[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກວ່າ [member dof_blur_near_distance]. "
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການເບຼີແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ [member dof_blur_amount] ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍ [member "
"dof_blur_near_transition].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣັນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບຼີຂອງຄວາມຊັດເຈນພາບ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນວິວພອດທີ່ມີພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ (ບ່ອນທີ່ [member "
"Viewport.transparent_bg] ເປັນ [code]true[/code])."

msgid ""
"When positive, distance over which blur effect will scale from 0 to [member "
"dof_blur_amount], ending at [member dof_blur_near_distance]. When negative, "
"uses physically-based scaling so depth of field effect will scale from 0 at "
"[member dof_blur_near_distance] and will increase in a physically accurate "
"way as objects get closer to the [Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ແມ່ນໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມເບຼີຈະປ່ຽນສະເກລຈາກ 0 ຫາ [member "
"dof_blur_amount] ໂດຍສິ້ນສຸດຢູ່ທີ່ [member dof_blur_near_distance]. ເມື່ອເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນສະເກລແບບອີງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ ເຊິ່ງເອັບເຟັກຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງພາບຈະເລີ່ມຈາກ 0 ຢູ່ທີ່ [member "
"dof_blur_near_distance] ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກເມື່ອວັດຖຸຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ [Camera3D] "
"ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A camera feed gives you access to a single physical camera attached to your "
"device."
msgstr "Camera feed ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຕົວຈິງອັນດຽວທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid ""
"A camera feed gives you access to a single physical camera attached to your "
"device. When enabled, Godot will start capturing frames from the camera which "
"can then be used. See also [CameraServer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many cameras will return YCbCr images which are split into two "
"textures and need to be combined in a shader. Godot does this automatically "
"for you if you set the environment to show the camera image in the "
"background.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is currently only implemented on Linux, Android, "
"macOS, and iOS. On other platforms no [CameraFeed]s will be available. To get "
"a [CameraFeed] on iOS, enable [member EditorExportPlatformIOS.modules/camera]."
msgstr ""
"Camera feed ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຕົວຈິງອັນດຽວທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"Godot ຈະເລີ່ມການຈັບພາບ (capture frames) ຈາກກ້ອງເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ງານຕໍ່ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"[CameraServer] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກ້ອງຫຼາຍຊະນິດຈະສົ່ງຄືນຮູບພາບແບບ YCbCr ເຊິ່ງຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນສອງເທັກເຈີ "
"(textures) ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳມາລວມກັນໃນເຊດເດີ (shader). Godot "
"ຈະເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃຫ້ສະແດງຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Linux, Android, macOS ແລະ iOS "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆຈະບໍ່ມີ [CameraFeed] ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ [CameraFeed] ໃນ iOS, "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member EditorExportPlatformIOS.modules/camera]."

msgid "Called when the camera feed is activated."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ camera feed ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Called when the camera feed is deactivated."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ camera feed ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Override this method to define supported formats of the camera feed."
msgstr "ແຊກແຊງ (Override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຂອງ camera feed."

msgid "Override this method to set the format of the camera feed."
msgstr "ແຊກແຊງ (Override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຮູບແບບຂອງ camera feed."

msgid "Returns feed image data type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຂອງ feed."

msgid "Returns the unique ID for this feed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນສຳລັບ feed ນີ້."

msgid "Returns the camera's name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns the position of camera on the device."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງໃນອຸປະກອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the texture backend ID (usable by some external libraries that need a "
"handle to a texture to write data)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (backend ID) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ "
"(ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບບາງໄລບຣາຣີພາຍນອກທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕົວອ້າງອີງເທັກເຈີເພື່ອຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ)."

msgid "Sets the feed as external feed provided by another library."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ feed ເປັນ feed ພາຍນອກທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍໄລບຣາຣີອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the feed format parameters for the given [param index] in the [member "
"formats] array. Returns [code]true[/code] on success. By default, the YUYV "
"encoded stream is transformed to [constant FEED_RGB]. The YUYV encoded stream "
"output format can be changed by setting [param parameters]'s [code]output[/"
"code] entry to one of the following:\n"
"- [code]\"separate\"[/code] will result in [constant FEED_YCBCR_SEP];\n"
"- [code]\"grayscale\"[/code] will result in desaturated [constant FEED_RGB];\n"
"- [code]\"copy\"[/code] will result in [constant FEED_YCBCR]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີຮູບແບບ feed ສຳລັບ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນອາເຣ [member formats]. ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກສຳເລັດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສະຕຣີມທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ YUYV ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ "
"[constant FEED_RGB]. ຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກຂອງສະຕຣີມ YUYV ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[code]output[/code] ໃນ [param parameters] ເປັນອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- [code]\"separate\"[/code] ຈະສົ່ງຜົນເປັນ [constant FEED_YCBCR_SEP];\n"
"- [code]\"grayscale\"[/code] ຈະສົ່ງຜົນເປັນ [constant FEED_RGB] ແບບຂາວດຳ "
"(desaturated);\n"
"- [code]\"copy\"[/code] ຈະສົ່ງຜົນເປັນ [constant FEED_YCBCR]."

msgid "Sets the camera's name."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid "Sets the position of this camera."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງນີ້."

msgid "Sets RGB image for this feed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບ RGB ສຳລັບ feed ນີ້."

msgid "Sets YCbCr image for this feed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບ YCbCr ສຳລັບ feed ນີ້."

msgid "Sets Y and CbCr images for this feed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບ Y ແລະ CbCr ສຳລັບ feed ນີ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the feed is active."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], feed ນີ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The transform applied to the camera's image."
msgstr "ການແປງ (transform) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບຂອງກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Formats supported by the feed. Each entry is a [Dictionary] describing format "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ (Formats) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ feed. ແຕ່ລະລາຍການແມ່ນ [Dictionary] "
"ທີ່ອະທິບາຍພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຮູບແບບ."

msgid "Emitted when the format has changed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຮູບແບບມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when a new frame is available."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີເຟຣມໃໝ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "No image set for the feed."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບສຳລັບ feed."

msgid "Feed supplies RGB images."
msgstr "Feed ສະໜອງຮູບພາບ RGB."

msgid "Feed supplies YCbCr images that need to be converted to RGB."
msgstr "Feed ສະໜອງຮູບພາບ YCbCr ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ແປງເປັນ RGB."

msgid ""
"Feed supplies separate Y and CbCr images that need to be combined and "
"converted to RGB."
msgstr "Feed ສະໜອງຮູບພາບ Y ແລະ CbCr ແຍກກັນ ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ນຳມາລວມກັນ ແລະ ແປງເປັນ RGB."

msgid "Feed supplies external image."
msgstr "Feed ສະໜອງຮູບພາບຈາກພາຍນອກ."

msgid "Unspecified position."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid "Camera is mounted at the front of the device."
msgstr "ກ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ດ້ານໜ້າຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

msgid "Camera is mounted at the back of the device."
msgstr "ກ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ດ້ານຫຼັງຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

msgid "Server keeping track of different cameras accessible in Godot."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕາມກ້ອງຕ່າງໆທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນ Godot."

msgid ""
"The [CameraServer] keeps track of different cameras accessible in Godot. "
"These are external cameras such as webcams or the cameras on your phone.\n"
"It is notably used to provide AR modules with a video feed from the camera.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is currently only implemented on Linux, Android, "
"macOS, and iOS. On other platforms no [CameraFeed]s will be available. To get "
"a [CameraFeed] on iOS, enable [member EditorExportPlatformIOS.modules/camera]."
msgstr ""
"[CameraServer] ຈະຕິດຕາມກ້ອງຕ່າງໆທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນ Godot. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນກ້ອງພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເວັບແຄມ ຫຼື ກ້ອງໃນໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຫຼັກເພື່ອສະໜອງວິດີໂອຟີດຈາກກ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບໂມດູນ AR.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ຄລາສນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ Linux, Android, macOS ແລະ iOS "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນແພລັດຟອມອື່ນໆຈະບໍ່ມີ [CameraFeed] ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ [CameraFeed] ໃນ iOS, "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member EditorExportPlatformIOS.modules/camera]."

msgid "Adds the camera [param feed] to the camera server."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກ້ອງ [param feed] ເຂົ້າໃນ camera server."

msgid "Returns an array of [CameraFeed]s."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [CameraFeed]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [CameraFeed] corresponding to the camera with the given [param "
"index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [CameraFeed] ທີ່ກົງກັບກ້ອງຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the number of [CameraFeed]s registered."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ [CameraFeed] ທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້."

msgid "Removes the specified camera [param feed]."
msgstr "ລຶບກ້ອງ [param feed] ທີ່ກຳນົດອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the server is actively monitoring available camera "
"feeds.\n"
"This has a performance cost, so only set it to [code]true[/code] when you're "
"actively accessing the camera.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] After setting it to [code]true[/code], you can receive updated "
"camera feeds through the [signal camera_feeds_updated] signal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tCameraServer.camera_feeds_updated.connect(_on_camera_feeds_updated)\n"
"\tCameraServer.monitoring_feeds = true\n"
"\n"
"func _on_camera_feeds_updated():\n"
"\tvar feeds = CameraServer.feeds()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tCameraServer.CameraFeedsUpdated += OnCameraFeedsUpdated;\n"
"\tCameraServer.MonitoringFeeds = true;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"void OnCameraFeedsUpdated()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar feeds = CameraServer.Feeds();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊີເວີຈະກຳລັງຕິດຕາມເບິ່ງ camera feeds ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ທ່ານສາມາດຮັບຄ່າ camera feeds "
"ທີ່ອັບເດດໄດ້ຜ່ານສັນຍານ [signal camera_feeds_updated].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tCameraServer.camera_feeds_updated.connect(_on_camera_feeds_updated)\n"
"\tCameraServer.monitoring_feeds = true\n"
"\n"
"func _on_camera_feeds_updated():\n"
"\tvar feeds = CameraServer.feeds()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tCameraServer.CameraFeedsUpdated += OnCameraFeedsUpdated;\n"
"\tCameraServer.MonitoringFeeds = true;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"void OnCameraFeedsUpdated()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar feeds = CameraServer.Feeds();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Emitted when a [CameraFeed] is added (e.g. a webcam is plugged in)."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ [CameraFeed] (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອສຽບເວັບແຄມ)."

msgid "Emitted when a [CameraFeed] is removed (e.g. a webcam is unplugged)."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອມີການລຶບ [CameraFeed] (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອຖອດເວັບແຄມອອກ)."

msgid "Emitted when camera feeds are updated."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອ camera feeds ມີການອັບເດດ."

msgid "The RGBA camera image."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບກ້ອງແບບ RGBA."

msgid "The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YCbCr]YCbCr[/url] camera image."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບກ້ອງແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YCbCr]YCbCr[/url]."

msgid "The Y component camera image."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບກ້ອງສ່ວນປະກອບ Y."

msgid "The CbCr component camera image."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບກ້ອງສ່ວນປະກອບ CbCr."

msgid "Texture provided by a [CameraFeed]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ [CameraFeed]."

msgid ""
"This texture gives access to the camera texture provided by a [CameraFeed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many cameras supply YCbCr images which need to be converted in a "
"shader."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເທັກເຈີຂອງກ້ອງທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ [CameraFeed].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກ້ອງຫຼາຍຊະນິດສະໜອງຮູບພາບແບບ YCbCr ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແປງໃນເຊດເດີ (shader)."

msgid "The ID of the [CameraFeed] for which we want to display the image."
msgstr "ID ຂອງ [CameraFeed] ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການສະແດງຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"Convenience property that gives access to the active property of the "
"[CameraFeed]."
msgstr "ພຣັອບເພີຕີທີ່ອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງພຣັອບເພີຕີ 'active' ຂອງ [CameraFeed]."

msgid ""
"Which image within the [CameraFeed] we want access to, important if the "
"camera image is split in a Y and CbCr component."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບໃດພາຍໃນ [CameraFeed] ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫາກຮູບພາບກ້ອງຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນສ່ວນປະກອບ Y ແລະ CbCr."

msgid "Merges several 2D nodes into a single draw operation."
msgstr "ລວມໂນດ 2D ຫຼາຍໂນດເຂົ້າເປັນການວາດພາບອັນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Child [CanvasItem] nodes of a [CanvasGroup] are drawn as a single object. It "
"allows to e.g. draw overlapping translucent 2D nodes without causing the "
"overlapping sections to be more opaque than intended (set the [member "
"CanvasItem.self_modulate] property on the [CanvasGroup] to achieve this "
"effect).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [CanvasGroup] uses a custom shader to read from the "
"backbuffer to draw its children. Assigning a [Material] to the [CanvasGroup] "
"overrides the built-in shader. To duplicate the behavior of the built-in "
"shader in a custom [Shader], use the following:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"shader_type canvas_item;\n"
"render_mode unshaded;\n"
"\n"
"uniform sampler2D screen_texture : hint_screen_texture, repeat_disable, "
"filter_nearest;\n"
"\n"
"void fragment() {\n"
"\tvec4 c = textureLod(screen_texture, SCREEN_UV, 0.0);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (c.a > 0.0001) {\n"
"\t\tc.rgb /= c.a;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tCOLOR *= c;\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since [CanvasGroup] and [member CanvasItem.clip_children] both "
"utilize the backbuffer, children of a [CanvasGroup] who have their [member "
"CanvasItem.clip_children] set to anything other than [constant "
"CanvasItem.CLIP_CHILDREN_DISABLED] will not function correctly."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດລູກ [CanvasItem] ຂອງ [CanvasGroup] ຈະຖືກວາດເປັນວັດຖຸອັນດຽວ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດວາດໂນດ "
"2D ທີ່ໂປ່ງແສງຊ້ອນທັບກັນໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນນັ້ນມີຄວາມຕຶບແສງເກີນກວ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໄວ້ "
"(ຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອບເພີຕີ [member CanvasItem.self_modulate] ໃນ [CanvasGroup] "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກນີ້).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [CanvasGroup] ໃຊ້ເຊດເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ backbuffer "
"ເພື່ອວາດໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ. ການກຳນົດ [Material] ໃຫ້ກັບ [CanvasGroup] ຈະເປັນການແຊກແຊງ "
"(override) ເຊດເດີທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ. ເພື່ອເຮັດຕາມພຶດຕິກຳຂອງເຊດເດີໃນຕົວກັບ [Shader] ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"shader_type canvas_item;\n"
"render_mode unshaded;\n"
"\n"
"uniform sampler2D screen_texture : hint_screen_texture, repeat_disable, "
"filter_nearest;\n"
"\n"
"void fragment() {\n"
"\tvec4 c = textureLod(screen_texture, SCREEN_UV, 0.0);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (c.a > 0.0001) {\n"
"\t\tc.rgb /= c.a;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tCOLOR *= c;\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກ [CanvasGroup] ແລະ [member CanvasItem.clip_children] "
"ຕ່າງກໍໃຊ້ backbuffer ຄືກັນ, ໂນດລູກຂອງ [CanvasGroup] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"CanvasItem.clip_children] ເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນນອກຈາກ [constant "
"CanvasItem.CLIP_CHILDREN_DISABLED] ຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the margin used to expand the clearing rect of this "
"[CanvasGroup]. This expands the area of the backbuffer that will be used by "
"the [CanvasGroup]. A smaller margin will reduce the area of the backbuffer "
"used which can increase performance, however if [member use_mipmaps] is "
"enabled, a small margin may result in mipmap errors at the edge of the "
"[CanvasGroup]. Accordingly, this should be left as small as possible, but "
"should be increased if artifacts appear along the edges of the canvas group."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງມາກຈິນ (margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການລຶບ (clearing rect) ຂອງ "
"[CanvasGroup] ນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຂະຫຍາຍພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ backbuffer ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [CanvasGroup]. "
"ມາກຈິນທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະຫຼຸດພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ backbuffer ທີ່ໃຊ້ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ "
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ [member use_mipmaps], ມາກຈິນທີ່ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ mipmap "
"ຢູ່ຂອບຂອງ [CanvasGroup]. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ຄວນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫາກມີສິ່ງຜິດປົກກະຕິ (artifacts) ປາກົດຢູ່ຕາມຂອບຂອງ canvas group."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of a margin used to expand the drawable rect of this "
"[CanvasGroup]. The size of the [CanvasGroup] is determined by fitting a rect "
"around its children then expanding that rect by [member fit_margin]. This "
"increases both the backbuffer area used and the area covered by the "
"[CanvasGroup] both of which can reduce performance. This should be kept as "
"small as possible and should only be expanded when an increased size is "
"needed (e.g. for custom shader effects)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງມາກຈິນ (margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ວາດໄດ້ (drawable rect) ຂອງ "
"[CanvasGroup] ນີ້. ຂະໜາດຂອງ [CanvasGroup] ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍການສ້າງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມລ້ອມຮອບໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ "
"ແລ້ວຂະຫຍາຍສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມນັ້ນອອກດ້ວຍ [member fit_margin]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມທັງພື້ນທີ່ backbuffer ທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ [CanvasGroup] ກວມເອົາ ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງຢ່າງນີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບລົງໄດ້. "
"ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ຄວນຂະຫຍາຍອອກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຂະໜາດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກເຊດເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], calculates mipmaps for the backbuffer before drawing "
"the [CanvasGroup] so that mipmaps can be used in a custom [ShaderMaterial] "
"attached to the [CanvasGroup]. Generating mipmaps has a performance cost so "
"this should not be enabled unless required."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຄຳນວນ mipmaps ສຳລັບ backbuffer ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະວາດ "
"[CanvasGroup] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ mipmaps ໃນ [ShaderMaterial] ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [CanvasGroup] "
"ໄດ້. ການສ້າງ mipmaps ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນບໍ່ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ງານນອກຈາກຈະຈຳເປັນ."

msgid "Abstract base class for everything in 2D space."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2D."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for everything in 2D space. Canvas items are laid out in "
"a tree; children inherit and extend their parent's transform. [CanvasItem] is "
"extended by [Control] for GUI-related nodes, and by [Node2D] for 2D game "
"objects.\n"
"Any [CanvasItem] can draw. For this, [method queue_redraw] is called by the "
"engine, then [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] will be received on idle time to "
"request a redraw. Because of this, canvas items don't need to be redrawn on "
"every frame, improving the performance significantly. Several functions for "
"drawing on the [CanvasItem] are provided (see [code]draw_*[/code] functions). "
"However, they can only be used inside [method _draw], its corresponding "
"[method Object._notification] or methods connected to the [signal draw] "
"signal.\n"
"Canvas items are drawn in tree order on their canvas layer. By default, "
"children are on top of their parents, so a root [CanvasItem] will be drawn "
"behind everything. This behavior can be changed on a per-item basis.\n"
"A [CanvasItem] can be hidden, which will also hide its children. By adjusting "
"various other properties of a [CanvasItem], you can also modulate its color "
"(via [member modulate] or [member self_modulate]), change its Z-index, blend "
"mode, and more.\n"
"Note that properties like transform, modulation, and visibility are only "
"propagated to [i]direct[/i] [CanvasItem] child nodes. If there is a non-"
"[CanvasItem] node in between, like [Node] or [AnimationPlayer], the "
"[CanvasItem] nodes below will have an independent position and [member "
"modulate] chain. See also [member top_level]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ ສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2D. ລາຍການແຄນວາສ (Canvas items) "
"ຖືກຈັດວາງແບບໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້; ໂນດລູກຈະສືບທອດ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍການແປງ (transform) ຂອງໂນດແມ່. "
"[CanvasItem] ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍ [Control] ສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ GUI, ແລະ ໂດຍ [Node2D] "
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸເກມ 2D.\n"
"[CanvasItem] ໃດໆກໍຕາມສາມາດວາດພາບໄດ້. ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້, [method queue_redraw] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ, ຈາກນັ້ນ [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຊ່ວງເວລາຫວ່າງ "
"(idle time) ເພື່ອຮ້ອງຂໍການວາດໃໝ່. ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ລາຍການແຄນວາສຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງວາດໃໝ່ໃນທຸກໆເຟຣມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ມີຟັງຊັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງສຳລັບການວາດໃນ [CanvasItem] (ເບິ່ງຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]draw_*[/code]). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ພວກມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະພາຍໃນ [method _draw], "
"[method Object._notification] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ຫຼື ເມທອດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານ [signal draw].\n"
"ລາຍການແຄນວາສຈະຖືກວາດຕາມລຳດັບຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ໃນເລເຢີແຄນວາສຂອງພວກມັນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ໂນດລູກຈະຢູ່ເທິງໂນດແມ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ເປັນຮາກ (root) ຈະຖືກວາດຢູ່ດ້ານຫຼັງທຸກຢ່າງ. "
"ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະລາຍການ.\n"
"[CanvasItem] ສາມາດຖືກເຊື່ອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນການເຊື່ອງໂນດລູກຂອງມັນນຳ. "
"ໂດຍການປັບພຣັອບເພີຕີອື່ນໆຂອງ [CanvasItem], ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປັບສີຂອງມັນ (ຜ່ານ [member modulate] "
"ຫຼື [member self_modulate]), ປ່ຽນຄ່າ Z-index, ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ພຣັອບເພີຕີ ເຊັ່ນ: ການແປງ (transform), ການປັບສີ (modulation) ແລະ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ "
"(visibility) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາໂນດລູກ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຢູ່ [i]ໂດຍກົງ[/i] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າມີໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"[CanvasItem] ຂັ້ນກາງ ຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ [Node] ຫຼື [AnimationPlayer], ໂນດ [CanvasItem] "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມລົງໄປຈະມີຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ສາຍໂສ້ [member modulate] ທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"top_level] ປະກອບ."

msgid "Viewport and canvas transforms"
msgstr "ການແປງ (transforms) ຂອງວິວພອດ ແລະ ແຄນວາສ"

msgid "Custom drawing in 2D"
msgstr "ການວາດພາບແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ 2D"

msgid ""
"Called when [CanvasItem] has been requested to redraw (after [method "
"queue_redraw] is called, either manually or by the engine).\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] notification in [method "
"Object._notification]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອ [CanvasItem] ໄດ້ຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ວາດໃໝ່ (ຫຼັງຈາກ [method queue_redraw] ຖືກເອີ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ໂດຍເອນຈິນ).\n"
"ກົງກັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] ໃນ [method Object._notification]."

msgid ""
"Subsequent drawing commands will be ignored unless they fall within the "
"specified animation slice. This is a faster way to implement animations that "
"loop on background rather than redrawing constantly."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງການວາດທີ່ຕາມມາຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ນອກຈາກພວກມັນຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງແອນິເມຊັນ (animation slice) ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ໄວກວ່າໃນການສ້າງແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ ແທນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງວາດໃໝ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

msgid ""
"Draws an unfilled arc between the given angles with a uniform [param color] "
"and [param width] and optional antialiasing (supported only for positive "
"[param width]). The larger the value of [param point_count], the smoother the "
"curve. [param center] is defined in local space. For elliptical arcs, see "
"[method draw_ellipse_arc]. See also [method draw_circle].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, it will be ignored and the arc will be drawn "
"using [constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. This means that when "
"the CanvasItem is scaled, the arc will remain thin. If this behavior is not "
"desired, then pass a positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"The arc is drawn from [param start_angle] towards the value of [param "
"end_angle] so in clockwise direction if [code]start_angle < end_angle[/code] "
"and counter-clockwise otherwise. Passing the same angles but in reversed "
"order will produce the same arc. If absolute difference of [param "
"start_angle] and [param end_angle] is greater than [constant @GDScript.TAU] "
"radians, then a full circle arc is drawn (i.e. arc will not overlap itself)."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີພື້ນລະຫວ່າງມຸມທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [param color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກໄດ້ (ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ [param width] ທີ່ມີຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ຍິ່ງຄ່າຂອງ "
"[param point_count] ຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງກໍຈະຍິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ. [param center] "
"ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ສຳລັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບວົງລີ, ເບິ່ງ [method draw_ellipse_arc]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"draw_circle] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ [constant "
"RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, "
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]1.0[/code].\n"
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຈາກ [param start_angle] ໄປຫາຄ່າຂອງ [param end_angle] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນທິດທາງຕາມເຂັມໂມງຖ້າ [code]start_angle < end_angle[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈະເປັນທິດທາງທວນເຂັມໂມງໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ. ການສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມດຽວກັນແຕ່ສະຫຼັບລຳດັບຈະໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງດຽວກັນ. "
"ຖ້າຜົນຕ່າງສຳບູນຂອງ [param start_angle] ແລະ [param end_angle] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [constant "
"@GDScript.TAU] ເຣດຽນ, ຈະເປັນການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບວົງມົນເຕັມ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະບໍ່ຊ້ອນທັບຕົວມັນເອງ)."

msgid ""
"Draws a string first character using a custom font. If [param oversampling] "
"is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise "
"viewport oversampling settings are used. [param pos] is defined in local "
"space."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ. [param pos] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ."

msgid ""
"Draws a string first character outline using a custom font. If [param "
"oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, "
"otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used. [param pos] is defined in "
"local space."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ. [param pos] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ."

msgid ""
"Draws a circle, with [param position] defined in local space. See also "
"[method draw_ellipse], [method draw_arc], [method draw_polyline], and [method "
"draw_polygon].\n"
"If [param filled] is [code]true[/code], the circle will be filled with the "
"[param color] specified. If [param filled] is [code]false[/code], the circle "
"will be drawn as a stroke with the [param color] and [param width] "
"specified.\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then two-point primitives will be drawn instead "
"of a four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, the "
"lines will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a positive "
"[param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"If [param antialiased] is [code]true[/code], half transparent \"feathers\" "
"will be attached to the boundary, making outlines smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param width] is only effective if [param filled] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງມົນ, ໂດຍມີ [param position] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_ellipse], "
"[method draw_arc], [method draw_polyline], ແລະ [method draw_polygon] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບວົງມົນຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍ [param color] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຮູບວົງມົນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບດ້ວຍ "
"[param color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param antialiased] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີ \"ຂົນ\" ແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຕິດຢູ່ຕາມຂອບ "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບລຽບນຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param width] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a colored polygon of any number of points, convex or concave. The "
"points in the [param points] array are defined in local space. Unlike [method "
"draw_polygon], a single color must be specified for the whole polygon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you frequently redraw the same polygon with a large number of "
"vertices, consider pre-calculating the triangulation with [method "
"Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] and using [method draw_mesh], [method "
"draw_multimesh], or [method RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ມີສີ ໂດຍມີຈຳນວນຈຸດເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້, ທັງແບບນູນ ຫຼື ແບບຫວຳ. ຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນອາເຣ [param "
"points] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method draw_polygon], "
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸສີດຽວສຳລັບທັງໝົດຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈເດີມຊ້ຳໆ ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມ (vertices) ຫຼາຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການຄຳນວນການແບ່ງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈ (triangulation) ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າດ້ວຍ [method "
"Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] ແລະ ໃຊ້ [method draw_mesh], [method "
"draw_multimesh], ຫຼື [method RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a dashed line from a 2D point to another, with a given color and width. "
"The [param from] and [param to] positions are defined in local space. See "
"also [method draw_line], [method draw_multiline], and [method "
"draw_polyline].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then a two-point primitives will be drawn "
"instead of a four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, "
"the line parts will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a "
"positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[param dash] is the length of each dash in pixels, with the gap between each "
"dash being the same length. If [param aligned] is [code]true[/code], the "
"length of the first and last dashes may be shortened or lengthened to allow "
"the line to begin and end at the precise points defined by [param from] and "
"[param to]. Both ends are always symmetrical when [param aligned] is "
"[code]true[/code]. If [param aligned] is [code]false[/code], all dashes will "
"have the same length, but the line may appear incomplete at the end due to "
"the dash length not dividing evenly into the line length. Only full dashes "
"are drawn when [param aligned] is [code]false[/code].\n"
"If [param antialiased] is [code]true[/code], half transparent \"feathers\" "
"will be attached to the boundary, making outlines smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param antialiased] is only effective if [param width] is "
"greater than [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂາດຈາກຈຸດ 2D ໄປຫາອີກຈຸດໜຶ່ງ, ດ້ວຍສີ ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ແລະ "
"[param to] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_line], [method draw_multiline], "
"ແລະ [method draw_polyline] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[param width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[param dash] ແມ່ນຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນຂາດເປັນພິກເຊວ, "
"ໂດຍມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນຂາດທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັນ. ຖ້າ [param aligned] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ຄວາມຍາວຂອງເສັ້ນຂາດທຳອິດ ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍອາດຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ສັ້ນລົງ ຫຼື ຍາວຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເສັ້ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param from] ແລະ [param to] ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ທັງສອງສົ້ນຈະສົມມາດກັນສະເໝີເມື່ອ [param aligned] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ຖ້າ [param "
"aligned] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ເສັ້ນຂາດທັງໝົດຈະມີຄວາມຍາວເທົ່າກັນ, "
"ແຕ່ເສັ້ນອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ສົມບູນໃນຕອນທ້າຍເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຍາວຂອງເສັ້ນຂາດບໍ່ສາມາດຫານຂາດກັບຄວາມຍາວຂອງເສັ້ນທັງໝົດ. "
"ຈະມີການແຕ້ມສະເພາະເສັ້ນຂາດທີ່ເຕັມສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນເມື່ອ [param aligned] ເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param antialiased] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີ \"ຂົນ\" ແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຕິດຢູ່ຕາມຂອບ "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບລຽບນຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param antialiased] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws an ellipse with semi-major axis [param major] and semi-minor axis "
"[param minor]. See also [method draw_circle], [method draw_ellipse_arc], "
"[method draw_polyline], and [method draw_polygon].\n"
"If [param filled] is [code]true[/code], the ellipse will be filled with the "
"[param color] specified. If [param filled] is [code]false[/code], the ellipse "
"will be drawn as a stroke with the [param color] and [param width] "
"specified.\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then two-point primitives will be drawn instead "
"of four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, the lines "
"will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a positive "
"[param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"If [param antialiased] is [code]true[/code], half transparent \"feathers\" "
"will be attached to the boundary, making outlines smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param width] is only effective if [param filled] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງລີດ້ວຍເຄິ່ງແກນເອກ [param major] ແລະ ເຄິ່ງແກນໂທ [param minor]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"draw_circle], [method draw_ellipse_arc], [method draw_polyline], ແລະ [method "
"draw_polygon] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບວົງລີຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍ [param color] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. "
"ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຮູບວົງລີຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບດ້ວຍ [param "
"color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param antialiased] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີ \"ຂົນ\" ແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຕິດຢູ່ຕາມຂອບ "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບລຽບນຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param width] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws an unfilled elliptical arc between the given angles with a uniform "
"[param color] and [param width] and optional antialiasing (supported only for "
"positive [param width]). The larger the value of [param point_count], the "
"smoother the curve. For circular arcs, see [method draw_arc]. See also "
"[method draw_ellipse].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, it will be ignored and the arc will be drawn "
"using [constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. This means that when "
"the CanvasItem is scaled, the arc will remain thin. If this behavior is not "
"desired, then pass a positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"The arc is drawn from [param start_angle] towards the value of [param "
"end_angle] so in clockwise direction if [code]start_angle < end_angle[/code] "
"and counter-clockwise otherwise. Passing the same angles but in reversed "
"order will produce the same arc. If absolute difference of [param "
"start_angle] and [param end_angle] is greater than [constant @GDScript.TAU] "
"radians, then a full ellipse is drawn (i.e. arc will not overlap itself)."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງວົງລີທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີພື້ນລະຫວ່າງມຸມທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [param color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ "
"ແລະ ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກໄດ້ (ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ [param width] ທີ່ມີຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ຍິ່ງຄ່າຂອງ "
"[param point_count] ຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງກໍຈະຍິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ສຳລັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບວົງມົນ, ເບິ່ງ "
"[method draw_arc]. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_ellipse] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ [constant "
"RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, "
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]1.0[/code].\n"
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຖືກແຕ້ມຈາກ [param start_angle] ໄປຫາຄ່າຂອງ [param end_angle] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນທິດທາງຕາມເຂັມໂມງຖ້າ [code]start_angle < end_angle[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈະເປັນທິດທາງທວນເຂັມໂມງໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ. ການສົ່ງຄ່າມຸມດຽວກັນແຕ່ສະຫຼັບລຳດັບຈະໃຫ້ຜົນເປັນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງດຽວກັນ. "
"ຖ້າຜົນຕ່າງສຳບູນຂອງ [param start_angle] ແລະ [param end_angle] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [constant "
"@GDScript.TAU] ເຣດຽນ, ຈະເປັນການແຕ້ມຮູບວົງລີເຕັມ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະບໍ່ຊ້ອນທັບຕົວມັນເອງ)."

msgid ""
"After submitting all animations slices via [method draw_animation_slice], "
"this function can be used to revert drawing to its default state (all "
"subsequent drawing commands will be visible). If you don't care about this "
"particular use case, usage of this function after submitting the slices is "
"not required."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ສົ່ງ animation slices ທັງໝົດຜ່ານ [method draw_animation_slice] ແລ້ວ, "
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການແຕ້ມກັບຄືນສູ່ສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"(ຄຳສັ່ງການແຕ້ມທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ). ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ສົນໃຈກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ນີ້ເປັນພິເສດ, "
"ການໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງ slices ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a textured rectangle region of the font texture with LCD subpixel anti-"
"aliasing at a given position, optionally modulated by a color. The [param "
"rect] is defined in local space.\n"
"Texture is drawn using the following blend operation, blend mode of the "
"[CanvasItemMaterial] is ignored:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"dst.r = texture.r * modulate.r * modulate.a + dst.r * (1.0 - texture.r * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.g = texture.g * modulate.g * modulate.a + dst.g * (1.0 - texture.g * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.b = texture.b * modulate.b * modulate.a + dst.b * (1.0 - texture.b * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.a = modulate.a + dst.a * (1.0 - modulate.a);\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຂອງຟອນ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍການລຶບຮອຍຢັກແບບ LCD subpixel "
"ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ສາມາດເລືອກປັບສີໄດ້ (modulated). [param rect] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ.\n"
"ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການປະສົມ (blend) ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ໂດຍຈະລະເລີຍໂໝດການປະສົມຂອງ "
"[CanvasItemMaterial]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"dst.r = texture.r * modulate.r * modulate.a + dst.r * (1.0 - texture.r * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.g = texture.g * modulate.g * modulate.a + dst.g * (1.0 - texture.g * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.b = texture.b * modulate.b * modulate.a + dst.b * (1.0 - texture.b * "
"modulate.a);\n"
"dst.a = modulate.a + dst.a * (1.0 - modulate.a);\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a line from a 2D point to another, with a given color and width. It can "
"be optionally antialiased. The [param from] and [param to] positions are "
"defined in local space. See also [method draw_dashed_line], [method "
"draw_multiline], and [method draw_polyline].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then a two-point primitive will be drawn "
"instead of a four-point one. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, "
"the line will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a "
"positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຊື່ຈາກຈຸດ 2D ໄປຫາອີກຈຸດໜຶ່ງ, ດ້ວຍສີ ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກໄດ້. "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param from] ແລະ [param to] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"draw_dashed_line], [method draw_multiline], ແລະ [method draw_polyline] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Draws a [Mesh] in 2D, using the provided texture. See [MeshInstance2D] for "
"related documentation. The [param transform] is defined in local space.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [Mesh] ໃນຮູບແບບ 2D, ໂດຍໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເບິ່ງ [MeshInstance2D] "
"ສຳລັບເອກະສານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. [param transform] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a textured rectangle region of the multichannel signed distance field "
"texture at a given position, optionally modulated by a color. The [param "
"rect] is defined in local space. See [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] for more information and caveats "
"about MSDF font rendering.\n"
"If [param outline] is positive, each alpha channel value of pixel in region "
"is set to maximum value of true distance in the [param outline] radius.\n"
"Value of the [param pixel_range] should the same that was used during "
"distance field texture generation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມພື້ນທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບ multichannel signed distance field (MSDF) "
"ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ສາມາດເລືອກປັບສີໄດ້. [param rect] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງກ່ຽວກັບການເຣັນເດີຟອນແບບ MSDF.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param outline] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ແຕ່ລະຄ່າຂອງຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (alpha channel) "
"ຂອງພິກເຊວໃນພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ແທ້ຈິງໃນລັດສະໝີ [param outline].\n"
"ຄ່າຂອງ [param pixel_range] ຄວນເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ distance field "
"texture.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws multiple disconnected lines with a uniform [param width] and [param "
"color]. Each line is defined by two consecutive points from [param points] "
"array in local space, i.e. i-th segment consists of [code]points[2 * i][/"
"code], [code]points[2 * i + 1][/code] endpoints. When drawing large amounts "
"of lines, this is faster than using individual [method draw_line] calls. To "
"draw interconnected lines, use [method draw_polyline] instead.\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then two-point primitives will be drawn instead "
"of a four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, the "
"lines will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a positive "
"[param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param antialiased] is only effective if [param width] is "
"greater than [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຊື່ຫຼາຍເສັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍ [param width] ແລະ [param color] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ. "
"ແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍສອງຈຸດທີ່ລຽງກັນຈາກອາເຣ [param points] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສ່ວນທີ i "
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດປາຍ [code]points[2 * i][/code] ແລະ [code]points[2 * i + 1][/code]. "
"ເມື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະໄວກວ່າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method draw_line] ເທື່ອລະເສັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method draw_polyline] ແທນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param antialiased] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws multiple disconnected lines with a uniform [param width] and segment-by-"
"segment coloring. Each segment is defined by two consecutive points from "
"[param points] array in local space and a corresponding color from [param "
"colors] array, i.e. i-th segment consists of [code]points[2 * i][/code], "
"[code]points[2 * i + 1][/code] endpoints and has [code]colors[i][/code] "
"color. When drawing large amounts of lines, this is faster than using "
"individual [method draw_line] calls. To draw interconnected lines, use "
"[method draw_polyline_colors] instead.\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then two-point primitives will be drawn instead "
"of a four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, the "
"lines will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a positive "
"[param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param antialiased] is only effective if [param width] is "
"greater than [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຊື່ຫຼາຍເສັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍ [param width] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດສີແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ. "
"ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍສອງຈຸດທີ່ລຽງກັນຈາກອາເຣ [param points] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ ແລະ ສີທີ່ກົງກັນຈາກອາເຣ "
"[param colors], ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສ່ວນທີ i ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດປາຍ [code]points[2 * i][/code], "
"[code]points[2 * i + 1][/code] ແລະ ມີສີ [code]colors[i][/code]. "
"ເມື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະໄວກວ່າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method draw_line] ເທື່ອລະເສັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method draw_polyline_colors] ແທນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param antialiased] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] into lines and draws it using the specified [param font] "
"at the [param pos] in local space (top-left corner). The text will have its "
"color multiplied by [param modulate]. If [param width] is greater than or "
"equal to 0, the text will be clipped if it exceeds the specified width. If "
"[param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling "
"factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used."
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງ [param text] ອອກເປັນແຕ່ລະແຖວ ແລະ ແຕ້ມມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [param font] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ "
"[param pos] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ (ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ). ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີສີທີ່ຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [param modulate]. ຖ້າ "
"[param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 0, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped) ຖ້າມັນເກີນຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] to the lines and draws text outline using the specified "
"[param font] at the [param pos] in local space (top-left corner). The text "
"will have its color multiplied by [param modulate]. If [param width] is "
"greater than or equal to 0, the text will be clipped if it exceeds the "
"specified width. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as "
"font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used."
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງ [param text] ອອກເປັນແຕ່ລະແຖວ ແລະ ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍໃຊ້ [param font] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ [param pos] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ (ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງ). ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີສີທີ່ຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [param "
"modulate]. ຖ້າ [param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 0, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped) "
"ຖ້າມັນເກີນຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Draws a [MultiMesh] in 2D with the provided texture. See "
"[MultiMeshInstance2D] for related documentation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [MultiMesh] ໃນຮູບແບບ 2D ດ້ວຍພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ເບິ່ງ [MultiMeshInstance2D] "
"ສຳລັບເອກະສານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a solid polygon of any number of points, convex or concave. Unlike "
"[method draw_colored_polygon], each point's color can be changed "
"individually. The [param points] array is defined in local space. See also "
"[method draw_polyline] and [method draw_polyline_colors]. If you need more "
"flexibility (such as being able to use bones), use [method "
"RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you frequently redraw the same polygon with a large number of "
"vertices, consider pre-calculating the triangulation with [method "
"Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] and using [method draw_mesh], [method "
"draw_multimesh], or [method RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແບບທຶບທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຈຸດເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້, ທັງແບບນູນ ຫຼື ແບບຫວຳ. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method "
"draw_colored_polygon], ສີຂອງແຕ່ລະຈຸດສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ແຍກກັນ. ອາເຣ [param points] "
"ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_polyline] ແລະ [method draw_polyline_colors] "
"ຕື່ມອີກ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການໃຊ້ກະດູກ/bones), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍແຈເດີມຊ້ຳໆ ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຈຸດຈອມ (vertices) ຫຼາຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການຄຳນວນການແບ່ງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈ (triangulation) ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າດ້ວຍ [method "
"Geometry2D.triangulate_polygon] ແລະ ໃຊ້ [method draw_mesh], [method "
"draw_multimesh], ຫຼື [method RenderingServer.canvas_item_add_triangle_array] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws interconnected line segments with a uniform [param color] and [param "
"width] and optional antialiasing (supported only for positive [param width]). "
"The [param points] array is defined in local space. When drawing large "
"amounts of lines, this is faster than using individual [method draw_line] "
"calls. To draw disconnected lines, use [method draw_multiline] instead. See "
"also [method draw_polygon].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, it will be ignored and the polyline will be "
"drawn using [constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. This means that "
"when the CanvasItem is scaled, the polyline will remain thin. If this "
"behavior is not desired, then pass a positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍ [param color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກໄດ້ (ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ [param width] ທີ່ມີຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ອາເຣ [param "
"points] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເມື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະໄວກວ່າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"draw_line] ເທື່ອລະເສັ້ນ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method draw_multiline] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method draw_polygon] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂພລີລາຍ (polyline) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ CanvasItem "
"ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນໂພລີລາຍຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param width] "
"ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Draws interconnected line segments with a uniform [param width], point-by-"
"point coloring, and optional antialiasing (supported only for positive [param "
"width]). Colors assigned to line points match by index between [param points] "
"and [param colors], i.e. each line segment is filled with a gradient between "
"the colors of the endpoints. The [param points] array is defined in local "
"space. When drawing large amounts of lines, this is faster than using "
"individual [method draw_line] calls. To draw disconnected lines, use [method "
"draw_multiline_colors] instead. See also [method draw_polygon].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, it will be ignored and the polyline will be "
"drawn using [constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. This means that "
"when the CanvasItem is scaled, the polyline will remain thin. If this "
"behavior is not desired, then pass a positive [param width] like [code]1.0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍ [param width] ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ, ການກຳນົດສີແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະຈຸດ, ແລະ "
"ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ການລຶບຮອຍຢັກໄດ້ (ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ [param width] ທີ່ມີຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ). "
"ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ແກ່ຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງເສັ້ນຈະກົງກັນຕາມລຳດັບດັດສະນີລະຫວ່າງ [param points] ແລະ [param "
"colors], ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍສີແບບໄລ່ລະດັບ (gradient) "
"ລະຫວ່າງສີຂອງຈຸດປາຍ. ອາເຣ [param points] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເມື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະໄວກວ່າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method draw_line] ເທື່ອລະເສັ້ນ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"draw_multiline_colors] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_polygon] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ມັນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂພລີລາຍ (polyline) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[constant RenderingServer.PRIMITIVE_LINE_STRIP]. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ CanvasItem "
"ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນໂພລີລາຍຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param width] "
"ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Draws a custom primitive. 1 point for a point, 2 points for a line, 3 points "
"for a triangle, and 4 points for a quad. If 0 points or more than 4 points "
"are specified, nothing will be drawn and an error message will be printed. "
"The [param points] array is defined in local space. See also [method "
"draw_line], [method draw_polyline], [method draw_polygon], and [method "
"draw_rect].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບກຳນົດເອງ. 1 ຈຸດສຳລັບຈຸດ, 2 ຈຸດສຳລັບເສັ້ນ, 3 ຈຸດສຳລັບຮູບສາມແຈ, ແລະ 4 "
"ຈຸດສຳລັບຮູບສີ່ແຈ (quad). ຖ້າລະບຸ 0 ຈຸດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 4 ຈຸດ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການແຕ້ມຫຍັງ ແລະ "
"ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດສະແດງອອກມາ. ອາເຣ [param points] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"draw_line], [method draw_polyline], [method draw_polygon], ແລະ [method "
"draw_rect] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a rectangle. If [param filled] is [code]true[/code], the rectangle will "
"be filled with the [param color] specified. If [param filled] is [code]false[/"
"code], the rectangle will be drawn as a stroke with the [param color] and "
"[param width] specified. The [param rect] is specified in local space. See "
"also [method draw_texture_rect].\n"
"If [param width] is negative, then two-point primitives will be drawn instead "
"of a four-point ones. This means that when the CanvasItem is scaled, the "
"lines will remain thin. If this behavior is not desired, then pass a positive "
"[param width] like [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"If [param antialiased] is [code]true[/code], half transparent \"feathers\" "
"will be attached to the boundary, making outlines smooth.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param width] is only effective if [param filled] is "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unfilled rectangles drawn with a negative [param width] may not "
"display perfectly. For example, corners may be missing or brighter due to "
"overlapping lines (for a translucent [param color])."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ. ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍ "
"[param color] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບດ້ວຍ [param color] ແລະ [param width] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. [param "
"rect] ຖືກລະບຸໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_texture_rect] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param width] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈະມີການແຕ້ມພຣິມິທິບແບບສອງຈຸດແທນແບບສີ່ຈຸດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອ "
"CanvasItem ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ, ເສັ້ນຈະຍັງຄົງຄວາມບາງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [param "
"width] ເປັນຄ່າບວກ ເຊັ່ນ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param antialiased] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີ \"ຂົນ\" ແບບເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຕິດຢູ່ຕາມຂອບ "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບລຽບນຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param width] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [param filled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີພື້ນທີ່ແຕ້ມດ້ວຍ [param width] ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າລົບອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ສົມບູນ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມຸມອາດຈະຫາຍໄປ ຫຼື ສ່າງກວ່າປົກກະຕິເນື່ອງຈາກເສັ້ນຊ້ອນທັບກັນ (ສຳລັບ [param color] "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ)."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom local transform for drawing via components. Anything drawn "
"afterwards will be transformed by this.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] does [i]not[/i] take [param "
"scale] into account. This means that scaling up/down will cause bitmap fonts "
"and rasterized (non-MSDF) dynamic fonts to appear blurry or pixelated. To "
"ensure text remains crisp regardless of scale, you can enable MSDF font "
"rendering by enabling [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] (applies to the default "
"project font only), or enabling [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] in "
"the import options of a DynamicFont for custom fonts. On system fonts, "
"[member SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] can be enabled in the "
"inspector."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າການແປງ (transform) ໂລຄໍແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຜ່ານຄອມໂພເນນ (components). "
"ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] [i]ບໍ່ໄດ້[/i] ນຳເອົາ [param scale] "
"ມາຄຳນວນນຳ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຢໍ້ຂະໜາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບິດແມັບຟອນ (bitmap fonts) ແລະ "
"ຣາສເຕີຣາຍຟອນ (rasterized dynamic fonts - ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ MSDF) ເບິ່ງຄືມົວ ຫຼື ເຫັນເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງຄົງຄວາມຄົມຊັດບໍ່ວ່າຈະປັບຂະໜາດໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການເຣັນເດີຟອນແບບ "
"MSDF ໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] "
"(ມີຜົນສະເພາະຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ), ຫຼື ເປີດ [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] "
"ໃນຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າ (import options) ຂອງ DynamicFont ສຳລັບຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ສຳລັບຟອນຂອງລະບົບ (system fonts), ສາມາດເປີດ [member "
"SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] ໄດ້ໃນອິນສະເປັກເຕີ (inspector)."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom local transform for drawing via matrix. Anything drawn "
"afterwards will be transformed by this."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າການແປງ (transform) ໂລຄໍແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຜ່ານແມັດທຣິກ (matrix). "
"ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Draws [param text] using the specified [param font] at the [param pos] in "
"local space (bottom-left corner using the baseline of the font). The text "
"will have its color multiplied by [param modulate]. If [param width] is "
"greater than or equal to 0, the text will be clipped if it exceeds the "
"specified width. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as "
"font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Draw \"Hello world\", using the project's default font:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"draw_string(ThemeDB.fallback_font, Vector2(64, 64), \"Hello world\", "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, ThemeDB.fallback_font_size)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"DrawString(ThemeDB.FallbackFont, new Vector2(64, 64), \"Hello world\", "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, ThemeDB.FallbackFontSize);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See also [method Font.draw_string]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [param text] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param font] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ [param pos] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ "
"(ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມໂດຍໃຊ້ baseline ຂອງຟອນ). ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີສີທີ່ຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [param modulate]. ຖ້າ [param "
"width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 0, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped) ຖ້າມັນເກີນຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ "
"[param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ແຕ້ມ \"Hello world\", ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"draw_string(ThemeDB.fallback_font, Vector2(64, 64), \"Hello world\", "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, ThemeDB.fallback_font_size)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"DrawString(ThemeDB.FallbackFont, new Vector2(64, 64), \"Hello world\", "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, ThemeDB.FallbackFontSize);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method Font.draw_string] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Draws [param text] outline using the specified [param font] at the [param "
"pos] in local space (bottom-left corner using the baseline of the font). The "
"text will have its color multiplied by [param modulate]. If [param width] is "
"greater than or equal to 0, the text will be clipped if it exceeds the "
"specified width. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as "
"font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງ [param text] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param font] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ [param pos] "
"ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ (ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມໂດຍໃຊ້ baseline ຂອງຟອນ). ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີສີທີ່ຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍ [param modulate]. "
"ຖ້າ [param width] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 0, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped) "
"ຖ້າມັນເກີນຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງວິວພອດ."

msgid ""
"Draws a styled rectangle. The [param rect] is defined in local space.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີສະໄຕລ໌ (styled rectangle). [param rect] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a texture at a given position. The [param position] is defined in local "
"space.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ. [param position] ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a textured rectangle at a given position, optionally modulated by a "
"color. The [param rect] is defined in local space. If [param transpose] is "
"[code]true[/code], the texture will have its X and Y coordinates swapped. See "
"also [method draw_rect] and [method draw_texture_rect_region].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ສາມາດເລືອກປັບສີໄດ້. [param rect] "
"ຖືກກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ. ຖ້າ [param transpose] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກສະຫຼັບຄ່າພິກັດ "
"X ແລະ Y. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_rect] ແລະ [method draw_texture_rect_region] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Draws a textured rectangle from a texture's region (specified by [param "
"src_rect]) at a given position in local space, optionally modulated by a "
"color. If [param transpose] is [code]true[/code], the texture will have its X "
"and Y coordinates swapped. See also [method draw_texture_rect].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, and meshes stored only inside local "
"variables should [b]not[/b] be used with this method in GDScript, because the "
"drawing operation doesn't begin immediately once this method is called. In "
"GDScript, when the function with the local variables ends, the local "
"variables get destroyed before the rendering takes place."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວຈາກບາງສ່ວນຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (ລະບຸໂດຍ [param src_rect]) "
"ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍ, ສາມາດເລືອກປັບສີໄດ້. ຖ້າ [param transpose] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກສະຫຼັບຄ່າພິກັດ X ແລະ Y. ເບິ່ງ [method draw_texture_rect] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Styleboxes, textures, ແລະ meshes ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍ (local "
"variables) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ [b]ບໍ່ຄວນ[/b] ນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບເມັດທອດນີ້ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການແຕ້ມບໍ່ໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມັດທອດນີ້. ໃນ GDScript, "
"ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີຕົວປ່ຽນໂລຄໍສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍກ່ອນທີ່ການເຣັນເດີ (rendering) ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Forces the node's transform to update. Fails if the node is not inside the "
"tree. See also [method get_transform].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For performance reasons, transform changes are usually "
"accumulated and applied [i]once[/i] at the end of the frame. The update "
"propagates through [CanvasItem] children, as well. Therefore, use this method "
"only when you need an up-to-date transform (such as during physics "
"operations)."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການອັບເດດການແປງ (transform) ຂອງໂນດ. ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ Scene Tree. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_transform] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ, ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປງມັກຈະຖືກສະສົມໄວ້ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ [i]ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ[/"
"i] ໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງເຟຣມ. ການອັບເດດຈະແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍໄປຫາໂນດລູກຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນຳ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄ່າການແປງທີ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ສຸດ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການດຳເນີນການດ້ານຟີຊິກ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the [World2D] canvas where this node is registered to, "
"used by the [RenderingServer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງແຄນວາສ [World2D] ທີ່ໂນດນີ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingServer]."

msgid ""
"Returns the internal canvas item [RID] used by the [RenderingServer] for this "
"node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງ canvas item ພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [RenderingServer] ສຳລັບໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [CanvasLayer] that contains this node, or [code]null[/code] if "
"the node is not in any [CanvasLayer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [CanvasLayer] ທີ່ບັນຈຸໂນດນີ້, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຖ້າໂນດບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ [CanvasLayer] "
"ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform of this node, converted from its registered canvas's "
"coordinate system to its viewport's coordinate system. See also [method "
"Node.get_viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຂອງໂນດນີ້, ໂດຍປ່ຽນຈາກລະບົບພິກັດຂອງແຄນວາສທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ "
"ໄປເປັນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງວິວພອດ. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.get_viewport] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns mouse cursor's global position relative to the [CanvasLayer] that "
"contains this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For screen-space coordinates (e.g. when using a non-embedded "
"[Popup]), you can use [method DisplayServer.mouse_get_position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງສາກົນ (global position) ຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ ທີ່ທຽບກັບ [CanvasLayer] ທີ່ບັນຈຸໂນດນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບພິກັດໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [Popup] ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຝັງຢູ່), ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[method DisplayServer.mouse_get_position] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the global transform matrix of this item, i.e. the combined transform "
"up to the topmost [CanvasItem] node. The topmost item is a [CanvasItem] that "
"either has no parent, has non-[CanvasItem] parent or it has [member "
"top_level] enabled."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນແມັດທຣິກການແປງສາກົນ (global transform matrix) ຂອງໄອເທັມນີ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຜົນລວມຂອງການແປງທັງໝົດຂຶ້ນໄປຫາໂນດ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດ. ໄອເທັມເທິງສຸດແມ່ນ "
"[CanvasItem] ທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂນດແມ່, ມີໂນດແມ່ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [CanvasItem], ຫຼື ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"top_level]."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform from the local coordinate system of this [CanvasItem] "
"to the [Viewport]s coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຈາກລະບົບພິກັດໂລຄໍຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ ໄປຫາລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ "
"[Viewport]."

msgid "Get the value of a shader parameter as set on this instance."
msgstr "ດຶງຄ່າຂອງພາລາມິເຕີເຊດເດີ (shader parameter) ຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the mouse's position in this [CanvasItem] using the local coordinate "
"system of this [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເມົາສ໌ໃນ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດໂລຄໍຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform of this [CanvasItem] in global screen coordinates (i.e. "
"taking window position into account). Mostly useful for editor plugins.\n"
"Equivalent to [method get_global_transform_with_canvas] if the window is "
"embedded (see [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍສາກົນ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລວມເອົາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວິນໂດນຳ). ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບປລັກອິນຂອງເອດິເຕີ.\n"
"ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [method get_global_transform_with_canvas] ຖ້າວິນໂດຖືກຝັງໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows])."

msgid "Returns the transform matrix of this [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແມັດທຣິກການແປງ (transform matrix) ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns this node's viewport boundaries as a [Rect2]. See also [method "
"Node.get_viewport]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂອບເຂດວິວພອດຂອງໂນດນີ້ເປັນ [Rect2]. ເບິ່ງ [method Node.get_viewport] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform of this node, converted from its registered canvas's "
"coordinate system to its viewport embedder's coordinate system. See also "
"[method Viewport.get_final_transform] and [method Node.get_viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຂອງໂນດນີ້, ໂດຍປ່ຽນຈາກລະບົບພິກັດຂອງແຄນວາສທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ "
"ໄປເປັນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ viewport embedder. ເບິ່ງ [method Viewport.get_final_transform] "
"ແລະ [method Node.get_viewport] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the layer at the given index is set in [member "
"visibility_layer]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເລເຢີໃນດັດສະນີທີ່ກຳນົດຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ [member visibility_layer]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [World2D] this node is registered to.\n"
"Usually, this is the same as this node's viewport (see [method "
"Node.get_viewport] and [method Viewport.find_world_2d])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [World2D] ທີ່ໂນດນີ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້.\n"
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ນີ້ແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັບວິວພອດຂອງໂນດນີ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method Node.get_viewport] ແລະ [method "
"Viewport.find_world_2d])."

msgid ""
"Hide the [CanvasItem] if it's currently visible. This is equivalent to "
"setting [member visible] to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງ [CanvasItem] ຖ້າມັນກຳລັງສະແດງຢູ່. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member visible] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node receives [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever its local transform changes. "
"This is enabled with [method set_notify_local_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂນດໄດ້ຮັບ [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການແປງໂລຄໍຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method set_notify_local_transform]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node receives [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever its global transform changes. This "
"is enabled with [method set_notify_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂນດໄດ້ຮັບ [constant NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການແປງສາກົນຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ. ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method set_notify_transform]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is present in the [SceneTree], its "
"[member visible] property is [code]true[/code] and all its ancestors are also "
"visible. If any ancestor is hidden, this node will not be visible in the "
"scene tree, and is therefore not drawn (see [method _draw]).\n"
"Visibility is checked only in parent nodes that inherit from [CanvasItem], "
"[CanvasLayer], and [Window]. If the parent is of any other type (such as "
"[Node], [AnimationPlayer], or [Node3D]), it is assumed to be visible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not take [member visibility_layer] into "
"account, so even if this method returns [code]true[/code], the node might end "
"up not being rendered."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂນດມີຢູ່ໃນ [SceneTree], ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member visible] "
"ຂອງມັນເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ໂນດບັນພະບຸລຸດທັງໝົດຂອງມັນກໍສະແດງຢູ່ຄືກັນ. "
"ຖ້າບັນພະບຸລຸດໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້, ໂນດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ scene tree, ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຖືກແຕ້ມ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method _draw]).\n"
"ການກວດສອບການສະແດງຜົນຈະເຮັດສະເພາະໃນໂນດແມ່ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CanvasItem], [CanvasLayer], "
"ແລະ [Window]. ຖ້າໂນດແມ່ເປັນປະເພດອື່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ [Node], [AnimationPlayer], ຫຼື [Node3D]), "
"ຈະຖືວ່າມັນສະແດງຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເອົາ [member visibility_layer] ມາຄຳນວນນຳ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], ແຕ່ໂນດກໍອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຣັນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Transforms [param viewport_point] from the viewport's coordinates to this "
"node's local coordinates.\n"
"For the opposite operation, use [method get_global_transform_with_canvas].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var viewport_point = get_global_transform_with_canvas() * local_point\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ແປງ [param viewport_point] ຈາກພິກັດຂອງວິວພອດໄປເປັນພິກັດໂລຄໍຂອງໂນດນີ້.\n"
"ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_global_transform_with_canvas].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var viewport_point = get_global_transform_with_canvas() * local_point\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the given [param event] with its coordinates converted from "
"global space to this [CanvasItem]'s local space. If not possible, returns the "
"same [InputEvent] unchanged."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງ [param event] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍມີພິກັດທີ່ປ່ຽນຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສາກົນ (global space) "
"ໄປເປັນພື້ນທີ່ໂລຄໍຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [InputEvent] "
"ອັນເດີມໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Moves this node below its siblings, usually causing the node to draw on top "
"of its siblings. Does nothing if this node does not have a parent. See also "
"[method Node.move_child]."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍໂນດນີ້ໄປໄວ້ລຸ່ມໂນດລະດັບດຽວກັນ (siblings), "
"ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດຖືກແຕ້ມທັບເທິງໂນດອື່ນໆໃນລະດັບດຽວກັນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນຖ້າໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ມີໂນດແມ່. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method Node.move_child] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Queues the [CanvasItem] to redraw. During idle time, if [CanvasItem] is "
"visible, [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] is sent and [method _draw] is called. "
"This only occurs [b]once[/b] per frame, even if this method has been called "
"multiple times."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຄິວໃຫ້ [CanvasItem] ແຕ້ມໃໝ່. ໃນລະຫວ່າງເວລາຫວ່າງ (idle time), ຖ້າ [CanvasItem] "
"ສະແດງຢູ່, [constant NOTIFICATION_DRAW] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງ ແລະ [method _draw] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ [b]ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ[/b] ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເມັດທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Set the value of a shader uniform for this instance only ([url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.html#per-instance-"
"uniforms]per-instance uniform[/url]). See also [method "
"ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] to assign a uniform on all instances "
"using the same [ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a shader uniform to be assignable on a per-instance basis, "
"it [i]must[/i] be defined with [code]instance uniform ...[/code] rather than "
"[code]uniform ...[/code] in the shader code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] is case-sensitive and must match the name of the "
"uniform in the code exactly (not the capitalized name in the inspector)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ shader uniform ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ([url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.html#per-instance-"
"uniforms]per-instance uniform[/url]). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ uniform ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ "
"[ShaderMaterial] ອັນດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ shader uniform ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້, ມັນ "
"[i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [code]instance uniform ...[/code] ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]uniform ...[/code] ໃນໂຄ້ດຂອງເຊດເດີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param name] ແມ່ນຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ມີຜົນ (case-sensitive) ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງ uniform ໃນໂໂຄ້ດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ທີ່ເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໃນອິນສະເປັກເຕີ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will receive [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever its local transform changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many canvas items such as [Bone2D] or [CollisionShape2D] "
"automatically enable this in order to function correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດຈະໄດ້ຮັບ [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການແປງໂລຄໍຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] canvas items ຫຼາຍຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ [Bone2D] ຫຼື [CollisionShape2D] "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will receive [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever its global transform changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many canvas items such as [Camera2D] or [Light2D] automatically "
"enable this in order to function correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດຈະໄດ້ຮັບ [constant NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການແປງສາກົນຂອງມັນປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] canvas items ຫຼາຍຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ [Camera2D] ຫຼື [Light2D] "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Set/clear individual bits on the rendering visibility layer. This simplifies "
"editing this [CanvasItem]'s visibility layer."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ/ລຶບ ແຕ່ລະບິດໃນ rendering visibility layer. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂ visibility layer "
"ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Show the [CanvasItem] if it's currently hidden. This is equivalent to setting "
"[member visible] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For controls that inherit [Popup], the correct way to make them "
"visible is to call one of the multiple [code]popup*()[/code] functions "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [CanvasItem] ຖ້າມັນກຳລັງຖືກເຊື່ອງຢູ່. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member visible] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (controls) ທີ່ສືບທອດ [Popup], "
"ວິທີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສະແດງອອກມາແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [code]popup*()[/code] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The mode in which this node clips its children, acting as a mask.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Clipping nodes cannot be nested or placed within a "
"[CanvasGroup]. If an ancestor of this node clips its children or is a "
"[CanvasGroup], then this node's clip mode should be set to [constant "
"CLIP_CHILDREN_DISABLED] to avoid unexpected behavior."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດທີ່ໂນດນີ້ໃຊ້ຕັດ (clip) ໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບໜ້າກາກ (mask).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ຕັດບໍ່ສາມາດຊ້ອນກັນ ຫຼື ວາງໄວ້ໃນ [CanvasGroup] ໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງໂນດນີ້ມີການຕັດໂນດລູກ ຫຼື ເປັນ [CanvasGroup], ໂໝດການຕັດຂອງໂນດນີ້ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant CLIP_CHILDREN_DISABLED] ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ."

msgid ""
"The rendering layers in which this [CanvasItem] responds to [Light2D] nodes."
msgstr "Rendering layers ທີ່ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ໂນດ [Light2D]."

msgid "The material applied to this [CanvasItem]."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [CanvasItem] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The color applied to this [CanvasItem]. This property does affect child "
"[CanvasItem]s, unlike [member self_modulate] which only affects the node "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [CanvasItem] ນີ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ເປັນລູກນຳ, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ [member "
"self_modulate] ທີ່ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຕົວໂນດເອງ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, oversampling for this [CanvasItem] is automatically adjusted with "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ສຳລັບ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຕາມຂະໜາດ "
"(scale) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The color applied to this [CanvasItem]. This property does [b]not[/b] affect "
"child [CanvasItem]s, unlike [member modulate] which affects both the node "
"itself and its children.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Internal children are also not affected by this property (see "
"the [code]include_internal[/code] parameter in [method Node.add_child]). For "
"built-in nodes this includes sliders in [ColorPicker], and the tab bar in "
"[TabContainer]."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [CanvasItem] ນີ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ [b]ບໍ່ມີຜົນ[/b] ຕໍ່ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ເປັນລູກ, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ "
"[member modulate] ທີ່ມີຜົນທັງຕົວໂນດເອງ ແລະ ໂນດລູກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດລູກພາຍໃນ (Internal children) ກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄືກັນ "
"(ເບິ່ງພາລາມິເຕີ [code]include_internal[/code] ໃນ [method Node.add_child]). "
"ສຳລັບໂນດສຳເລັດຮູບ, ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມເຖິງແຖບເລື່ອນໃນ [ColorPicker], ແລະ ແຖບແທັບໃນ [TabContainer]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], this node draws behind its parent."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດນີ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງໂນດແມ່."

msgid "The filtering mode used to render this [CanvasItem]'s texture(s)."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filtering mode) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣັນເດີພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The repeating mode used to render this [CanvasItem]'s texture(s). It affects "
"what happens when the texture is sampled outside its extents, for example by "
"setting a [member Sprite2D.region_rect] that is larger than the texture or "
"assigning [Polygon2D] UV points outside the texture.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [TextureRect] is not affected by [member texture_repeat], as it "
"uses its own texture repeating implementation."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeating mode) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣັນເດີພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ນີ້. "
"ມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງພື້ນຜິວນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງມັນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍການຕັ້ງ [member "
"Sprite2D.region_rect] ໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າພື້ນຜິວ ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຈຸດ [Polygon2D] UV ໄວ້ຂ້າງນອກພື້ນຜິວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [TextureRect] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຈາກ [member texture_repeat], "
"ເພາະວ່າມັນໃຊ້ລະບົບການເຮັດຊ້ຳພື້ນຜິວຂອງມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this [CanvasItem] will [i]not[/i] inherit its transform "
"from parent [CanvasItem]s. Its draw order will also be changed to make it "
"draw on top of other [CanvasItem]s that do not have [member top_level] set to "
"[code]true[/code]. The [CanvasItem] will effectively act as if it was placed "
"as a child of a bare [Node]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ສືບທອດການແປງ (transform) "
"ຈາກໂນດແມ່. ລຳດັບການແຕ້ມຂອງມັນກໍຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຖືກແຕ້ມທັບເທິງ [CanvasItem] ອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງ "
"[member top_level] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. [CanvasItem] "
"ນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບວ່າມັນຖືກວາງໄວ້ເປັນລູກຂອງ [Node] ທຳມະດາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the parent [CanvasItem]'s [member material] is used as "
"this node's material."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [member material] ຂອງໂນດແມ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນວັດສະດຸຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"The rendering layer in which this [CanvasItem] is rendered by [Viewport] "
"nodes. A [Viewport] will render a [CanvasItem] if it and all its parents "
"share a layer with the [Viewport]'s canvas cull mask.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A [CanvasItem] does not inherit its parents' visibility layers. "
"This means that if a parent [CanvasItem] does not have all the same layers as "
"its child, the child may not be visible even if both the parent and child "
"have [member visible] set to [code]true[/code]. For example, if a parent has "
"layer 1 and a child has layer 2, the child will not be visible in a "
"[Viewport] with the canvas cull mask set to layer 1 or 2 (see [member "
"Viewport.canvas_cull_mask]). To ensure that both the parent and child are "
"visible, the parent must have both layers 1 and 2, or the child must have "
"[member top_level] set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Rendering layer ທີ່ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຖືກເຣັນເດີໂດຍໂນດ [Viewport]. ໂດຍ [Viewport] "
"ຈະເຣັນເດີ [CanvasItem] ຖ້າຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ທັງໝົດມີ layer ຮ່ວມກັນກັບ canvas cull mask "
"ຂອງ [Viewport].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [CanvasItem] ຈະບໍ່ສືບທອດ visibility layers ຈາກໂນດແມ່. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າໂນດແມ່ບໍ່ມີ layer ຄືກັນກັບໂນດລູກ, ໂນດລູກອາດຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທັງໂນດແມ່ ແລະ "
"ໂນດລູກຈະຕັ້ງ [member visible] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ກໍຕາມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າໂນດແມ່ຢູ່ layer "
"1 ແລະ ໂນດລູກຢູ່ layer 2, ໂນດລູກຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ [Viewport] ທີ່ມີ canvas cull mask ຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"layer 1 ຫຼື 2 (ເບິ່ງ [member Viewport.canvas_cull_mask]). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທັງໂນດແມ່ ແລະ "
"ໂນດລູກສະແດງຜົນ, ໂນດແມ່ຕ້ອງມີທັງ layer 1 ແລະ 2, ຫຼື ໂນດລູກຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member top_level] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this [CanvasItem] may be drawn. Whether this "
"[CanvasItem] is actually drawn depends on the visibility of all of its "
"[CanvasItem] ancestors. In other words: this [CanvasItem] will be drawn when "
"[method is_visible_in_tree] returns [code]true[/code] and all [CanvasItem] "
"ancestors share at least one [member visibility_layer] with this "
"[CanvasItem].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For controls that inherit [Popup], the correct way to make them "
"visible is to call one of the multiple [code]popup*()[/code] functions "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [CanvasItem] ນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. ແຕ່ວ່າ [CanvasItem] "
"ນີ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່ນັ້ນ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການສະແດງຜົນຂອງບັນພະບຸລຸດ [CanvasItem] ທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ. "
"ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື: [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມເມື່ອ [method is_visible_in_tree] ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]true[/code] ແລະ ບັນພະບຸລຸດ [CanvasItem] ທັງໝົດມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ [member "
"visibility_layer] ຮ່ວມກັບ [CanvasItem] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (controls) ທີ່ສືບທອດ [Popup], "
"ວິທີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນສະແດງອອກມາແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ [code]popup*()[/code] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this and child [CanvasItem] nodes with a higher Y "
"position are rendered in front of nodes with a lower Y position. If "
"[code]false[/code], this and child [CanvasItem] nodes are rendered normally "
"in scene tree order.\n"
"With Y-sorting enabled on a parent node ('A') but disabled on a child node "
"('B'), the child node ('B') is sorted but its children ('C1', 'C2', etc.) "
"render together on the same Y position as the child node ('B'). This allows "
"you to organize the render order of a scene without changing the scene tree.\n"
"Nodes sort relative to each other only if they are on the same [member "
"z_index]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ໂນດລູກ [CanvasItem] ທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ Y ສູງກວ່າ "
"ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີໄວ້ທາງໜ້າຂອງໂນດທີ່ມີຕຳແໜ່ງ Y ຕ່ຳກວ່າ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ໂນດນີ້ ແລະ "
"ໂນດລູກ ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີຕາມລຳດັບປົກກະຕິໃນ scene tree.\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Y-sorting ໃນໂນດແມ່ ('A') ແຕ່ປິດໃຊ້ໃນໂນດລູກ ('B'), ໂນດລູກ ('B') ຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບ "
"ແຕ່ໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ ('C1', 'C2', ແລະອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກເຣັນເດີພ້ອມກັນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ Y ດຽວກັນກັບໂນດລູກ ('B'). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດລະບຽບລຳດັບການເຣັນເດີຂອງສາກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງໂຄງສ້າງ scene tree.\n"
"ໂນດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບທຽບກັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຢູ່ໃນ [member z_index] ດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node's final Z index is relative to its parent's Z "
"index.\n"
"For example, if [member z_index] is [code]2[/code] and its parent's final Z "
"index is [code]3[/code], then this node's final Z index will be [code]5[/"
"code] ([code]2 + 3[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ Z index ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂນດນີ້ ຈະທຽບກັບ Z index ຂອງໂນດແມ່.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ [member z_index] ແມ່ນ [code]2[/code] ແລະ Z index ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂນດແມ່ແມ່ນ "
"[code]3[/code], ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Z index ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂນດນີ້ຈະເປັນ [code]5[/code] ([code]2 + 3[/"
"code])."

msgid ""
"The order in which this node is drawn. A node with a higher Z index will "
"display in front of others. Must be between [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_ITEM_Z_MIN] and [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_ITEM_Z_MAX] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Z index does [b]not[/b] affect the order in which "
"[CanvasItem] nodes are processed or the way input events are handled. This is "
"especially important to keep in mind for [Control] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບທີ່ໂນດນີ້ຖືກແຕ້ມ. ໂນດທີ່ມີ Z index ສູງກວ່າຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງໜ້າຂອງໂນດອື່ນໆ. ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ "
"[constant RenderingServer.CANVAS_ITEM_Z_MIN] ແລະ [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_ITEM_Z_MAX] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານັ້ນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Z index [b]ບໍ່ມີຜົນ[/b] ຕໍ່ລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນຂອງໂນດ [CanvasItem] ຫຼື "
"ວິທີການຈັດການເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input events). ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງຈື່ໄວ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [Control]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [CanvasItem] must redraw, [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_DRAW] notification, and [i]before[/i] [method _draw] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Deferred connections do not allow drawing through the "
"[code]draw_*[/code] methods."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອ [CanvasItem] ຕ້ອງແຕ້ມໃໝ່, [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_DRAW] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ແລະ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ທີ່ [method _draw] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບດີເຟີ (Deferred connections) ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແຕ້ມຜ່ານເມັດທອດ "
"[code]draw_*[/code] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Emitted when this node becomes hidden, i.e. it's no longer visible in the "
"tree (see [method is_visible_in_tree])."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຖືກເຊື່ອງ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງໃນ scene tree ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"is_visible_in_tree])."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [CanvasItem]'s boundaries (position or size) change, or when "
"an action took place that may have affected these boundaries (e.g. changing "
"[member Sprite2D.texture])."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຂອບເຂດ (ຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດ) ຂອງ [CanvasItem] ປ່ຽນແປງ, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອມີການກະທຳບາງຢ່າງທີ່ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຂອບເຂດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການປ່ຽນ [member "
"Sprite2D.texture])."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [CanvasItem]'s visibility changes, either because its own "
"[member visible] property changed or because its visibility in the tree "
"changed (see [method is_visible_in_tree]).\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_VISIBILITY_CHANGED] notification."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [CanvasItem] ປ່ຽນແປງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຍ້ອນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"visible] ຂອງມັນເອງປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ຍ້ອນການສະແດງຜົນໃນ scene tree ປ່ຽນແປງ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"is_visible_in_tree]).\n"
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ [i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_VISIBILITY_CHANGED] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Notification received when this node's global transform changes, if [method "
"is_transform_notification_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. See also [method "
"set_notify_transform] and [method get_transform].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many canvas items such as [Camera2D] or [CollisionObject2D] "
"automatically enable this in order to function correctly."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອການແປງສາກົນ (global transform) ຂອງໂນດນີ້ປ່ຽນແປງ, ຖ້າ [method "
"is_transform_notification_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_notify_transform] ແລະ [method get_transform] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] canvas items ຫຼາຍຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ [Camera2D] ຫຼື [CollisionObject2D] "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Notification received when this node's transform changes, if [method "
"is_local_transform_notification_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. This is not "
"received when a parent [Node2D]'s transform changes. See also [method "
"set_notify_local_transform].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many canvas items such as [Camera2D] or [CollisionShape2D] "
"automatically enable this in order to function correctly."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອການແປງ (transform) ຂອງໂນດນີ້ປ່ຽນແປງ, ຖ້າ [method "
"is_local_transform_notification_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອການແປງຂອງໂນດແມ່ [Node2D] ປ່ຽນແປງ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_notify_local_transform] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] canvas items ຫຼາຍຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ [Camera2D] ຫຼື [CollisionShape2D] "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "The [CanvasItem] is requested to draw (see [method _draw])."
msgstr "[CanvasItem] ໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ແຕ້ມ (ເບິ່ງ [method _draw])."

msgid ""
"Notification received when this node's visibility changes (see [member "
"visible] and [method is_visible_in_tree]).\n"
"This notification is received [i]before[/i] the related [signal "
"visibility_changed] signal."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອການສະແດງຜົນຂອງໂນດນີ້ປ່ຽນແປງ (ເບິ່ງ [member visible] ແລະ [method "
"is_visible_in_tree]).\n"
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ [i]ກ່ອນ[/i] ສັນຍານ [signal visibility_changed] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid "The [CanvasItem] has entered the canvas."
msgstr "[CanvasItem] ໄດ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ແຄນວາສ."

msgid ""
"The [CanvasItem] has exited the canvas.\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""
"[CanvasItem] ໄດ້ອອກຈາກແຄນວາສ.\n"
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃນລຳດັບທີ່ຍ້ອນກັບ."

msgid ""
"Notification received when this [CanvasItem] is registered to a new [World2D] "
"(see [method get_world_2d])."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອ [CanvasItem] ນີ້ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າໃນ [World2D] ໃໝ່ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_world_2d])."

msgid "The [CanvasItem] will inherit the filter from its parent."
msgstr "[CanvasItem] ຈະສືບທອດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter) ຈາກໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between the "
"nearest 2 mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] "
"is [code]true[/code]). This makes the texture look pixelated from up close, "
"and smooth from a distance.\n"
"Use this for non-pixel art textures that may be viewed at a low scale (e.g. "
"due to [Camera2D] zoom or sprite scaling), as mipmaps are important to smooth "
"out pixels that are smaller than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ, ແລະ ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກທາງໄກ.\n"
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ດ (non-pixel art) ທີ່ອາດຈະຖືກເບິ່ງໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຍ້ອນການຊູມຂອງ [Camera2D] ຫຼື ການປັບຂະໜາດສະໄປຣດ໌), ເພາະ mipmaps "
"ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນ."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and between the "
"nearest 2 mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] "
"is [code]true[/code]). This makes the texture look smooth from up close, and "
"smooth from a distance.\n"
"Use this for non-pixel art textures that may be viewed at a low scale (e.g. "
"due to [Camera2D] zoom or sprite scaling), as mipmaps are important to smooth "
"out pixels that are smaller than on-screen pixels."
msgstr ""
"ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps "
"ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນທັງເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ ຈາກທາງໄກ.\n"
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບພິກເຊວອາຣ໌ດ (non-pixel art) ທີ່ອາດຈະຖືກເບິ່ງໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຍ້ອນການຊູມຂອງ [Camera2D] ຫຼື ການປັບຂະໜາດສະໄປຣດ໌), ເພາະ mipmaps "
"ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າພິກເຊວເທິງໜ້າຈໍເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນ."

msgid ""
"The texture filter reads from the nearest pixel and blends between 2 mipmaps "
"(or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) based on the "
"angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the texture look "
"pixelated from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic filtering "
"improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with the camera, "
"but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be changed by "
"adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS] is usually more appropriate in this case."
msgstr ""
"ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ຈະອ່ານຈາກພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 mipmaps (ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ "
"ລຽບນຽນເມື່ອເບິ່ງຈາກທາງໄກ. ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ Anisotropic "
"ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບພື້ນຜິວເທິງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເກືອບຈະຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ "
"anisotropic ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. [constant "
"TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS] ມັກຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"The texture filter blends between the nearest 4 pixels and blends between 2 "
"mipmaps (or uses the nearest mipmap if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"textures/default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] is [code]true[/code]) "
"based on the angle between the surface and the camera view. This makes the "
"texture look smooth from up close, and smooth from a distance. Anisotropic "
"filtering improves texture quality on surfaces that are almost in line with "
"the camera, but is slightly slower. The anisotropic filtering level can be "
"changed by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This texture filter is rarely useful in 2D projects. [constant "
"TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS] is usually more appropriate in this case."
msgstr ""
"ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filter) ຈະປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 4 ພິກເຊວທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 2 "
"mipmaps (ຫຼື ໃຊ້ mipmap ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/"
"default_filters/use_nearest_mipmap_filter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]) "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ມຸມມອງຂອງກ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນຜິວເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນທັງເມື່ອເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ ແລະ "
"ຈາກທາງໄກ. ການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ Anisotropic ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບພື້ນຜິວເທິງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເກືອບຈະຂະໜານກັບກ້ອງ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າເລັກນ້ອຍ. ລະດັບການກັ່ນຕອງແບບ anisotropic ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປັບ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/default_filters/"
"anisotropic_filtering_level].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ 2D. [constant "
"TEXTURE_FILTER_LINEAR_WITH_MIPMAPS] ມັກຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid "The [CanvasItem] will inherit the repeat mode from its parent."
msgstr "[CanvasItem] ຈະສືບທອດໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeat mode) ຈາກໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"The texture does not repeat. Sampling the texture outside its extents will "
"result in \"stretching\" of the edge pixels. You can avoid this by ensuring a "
"1-pixel fully transparent border on each side of the texture."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວຈະບໍ່ມີການເຮັດຊ້ຳ. ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງພື້ນຜິວນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ຂອບຖືກ \"ດຶງຢືດ\" "
"ອອກມາ. ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ 1 "
"ພິກເຊວໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງພື້ນຜິວ."

msgid "The texture repeats when exceeding the texture's size."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວຈະເຮັດຊ້ຳເມື່ອເກີນຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວ."

msgid ""
"The texture repeats when the exceeding the texture's size in a \"2×2 tiled "
"mode\". Repeated textures at even positions are mirrored."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວຈະເຮັດຊ້ຳເມື່ອເກີນຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນຜິວໃນໂໝດ \"2x2 tiled mode\". "
"ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເຮັດຊ້ຳໃນຕຳແໜ່ງເລກຄູ່ຈະຖືກເຮັດແບບກະຈົກ (mirrored)."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum TextureRepeat] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum TextureRepeat]."

msgid "Children are drawn over this node and are not clipped."
msgstr "ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມທັບເທິງໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກຕັດອອກ (clipped)."

msgid ""
"This node is used as a mask and is [b]not[/b] drawn. The mask is based on "
"this node's alpha channel: Opaque pixels are kept, transparent pixels are "
"discarded, and semi-transparent pixels are blended in according to their "
"opacity. Children are clipped to this node's drawn area."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໜ້າກາກ (mask) ແລະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ຖືກແຕ້ມ. ໜ້າກາກແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (alpha "
"channel) ຂອງໂນດນີ້: ພິກເຊວທີ່ທຶບແສງຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້, ພິກເຊວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກຖິ້ມ, ແລະ "
"ພິກເຊວທີ່ເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກປະສົມເຂົ້າກັນຕາມຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງມັນ. "
"ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຕາມພື້ນທີ່ການແຕ້ມຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"This node is used as a mask and is also drawn. The mask is based on this "
"node's alpha channel: Opaque pixels are kept, transparent pixels are "
"discarded, and semi-transparent pixels are blended in according to their "
"opacity. Children are clipped to the parent's drawn area."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໜ້າກາກ (mask) ແລະ ຖືກແຕ້ມນຳອີກ. ໜ້າກາກແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (alpha channel) "
"ຂອງໂນດນີ້: ພິກເຊວທີ່ທຶບແສງຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້, ພິກເຊວທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກຖິ້ມ, ແລະ "
"ພິກເຊວທີ່ເຄິ່ງໂປ່ງໃສຈະຖືກປະສົມເຂົ້າກັນຕາມຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງມັນ. "
"ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຕາມພື້ນທີ່ການແຕ້ມຂອງໂນດແມ່."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ClipChildrenMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum ClipChildrenMode]."

msgid "The [CanvasItem] will inherit the oversampling mode from its parent."
msgstr "[CanvasItem] ຈະສືບທອດໂໝດການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling mode) ຈາກໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"The oversampling is not affected by [CanvasItem] scale, and is equal to the "
"[Viewport] oversampling."
msgstr ""
"ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຈາກຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງ [CanvasItem], ແລະ "
"ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງ [Viewport]."

msgid ""
"The oversampling is a product of [CanvasItem] scale and [Viewport] "
"oversampling."
msgstr ""
"ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນ (oversampling) ແມ່ນຜົນມາຈາກຂະໜາດຂອງ [CanvasItem] ແລະ "
"ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເກີນຂອງ [Viewport]."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum OversamplingWithScale] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ [enum OversamplingWithScale]."

msgid "A material for [CanvasItem]s."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ສຳລັບ [CanvasItem]."

msgid ""
"[CanvasItemMaterial]s provide a means of modifying the textures associated "
"with a CanvasItem. They specialize in describing blend and lighting behaviors "
"for textures. Use a [ShaderMaterial] to more fully customize a material's "
"interactions with a [CanvasItem]."
msgstr ""
"[CanvasItemMaterial] ໃຫ້ວິທີການໃນການແກ້ໄຂພື້ນຜິວ (textures) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ CanvasItem. "
"ມັນເນັ້ນໃສ່ການອະທິບາຍພຶດຕິກຳການປະສົມ (blend) ແລະ ແສງສະຫວ່າງສຳລັບພື້ນຜິວ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[ShaderMaterial] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງວັດສະດຸກັັບ [CanvasItem] ໃຫ້ສົມບູນຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The manner in which a material's rendering is applied to underlying textures."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທີ່ການເຣັນເດີຂອງວັດສະດຸນຳໃຊ້ກັບພື້ນຜິວ (textures) ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "The manner in which material reacts to lighting."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທີ່ວັດສະດຸຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ແສງສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The number of columns in the spritesheet assigned as [Texture2D] for a "
"[GPUParticles2D] or [CPUParticles2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only used and visible in the editor if [member "
"particles_animation] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຖັນ (columns) ໃນ spritesheet ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles2D] ຫຼື "
"[CPUParticles2D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນເອດິເຕີກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"particles_animation] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the particles animation will loop.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only used and visible in the editor if [member "
"particles_animation] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແອນິເມຊັນຂອງພາກຕິເຄິລ (particles) ຈະຫຼິ້ນວົນຊ້ຳ (loop).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນເອດິເຕີກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"particles_animation] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of rows in the spritesheet assigned as [Texture2D] for a "
"[GPUParticles2D] or [CPUParticles2D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only used and visible in the editor if [member "
"particles_animation] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແຖວ (rows) ໃນ spritesheet ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນ [Texture2D] ສຳລັບ [GPUParticles2D] ຫຼື "
"[CPUParticles2D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນເອດິເຕີກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"particles_animation] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enable spritesheet-based animation features when "
"assigned to [GPUParticles2D] and [CPUParticles2D] nodes. The [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.anim_speed_max] or [member "
"CPUParticles2D.anim_speed_max] should also be set to a positive value for the "
"animation to play.\n"
"This property (and other [code]particles_anim_*[/code] properties that depend "
"on it) has no effect on other types of nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດແອນິເມຊັນແບບ spritesheet ເມື່ອຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles2D] ແລະ [CPUParticles2D]. ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.anim_speed_max] ຫຼື [member "
"CPUParticles2D.anim_speed_max] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າບວກເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນຫຼິ້ນ.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ (ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]particles_anim_*[/code] ອື່ນໆທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບມັນ) "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບໂນດປະເພດອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Mix blending mode. Colors are assumed to be premultiplied by the alpha "
"(opacity) value."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບ Mix (Mix blending mode). ຈະຖືວ່າສີຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຖືກຄູນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າດ້ວຍຄ່າອັນຟາ "
"(ຄວາມທຶບແສງ) ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Render the material using both light and non-light sensitive material "
"properties."
msgstr "ເຣັນເດີວັດສະດຸໂດຍໃຊ້ທັງຄຸນສົມບັດວັດສະດຸທີ່ໄວຕໍ່ແສງ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄວຕໍ່ແສງ."

msgid "Render the material as if there were no light."
msgstr "ເຣັນເດີວັດສະດຸຄືກັບວ່າບໍ່ມີແສງສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid "Render the material as if there were only light."
msgstr "ເຣັນເດີວັດສະດຸຄືກັບວ່າມີພຽງແຕ່ແສງສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid "A node used for independent rendering of objects within a 2D scene."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີວັດຖຸແຍກຕ່າງຫາກພາຍໃນສາກ (scene) 2D."

msgid ""
"[CanvasItem]-derived nodes that are direct or indirect children of a "
"[CanvasLayer] will be drawn in that layer. The layer is a numeric index that "
"defines the draw order. The default 2D scene renders with index [code]0[/"
"code], so a [CanvasLayer] with index [code]-1[/code] will be drawn below, and "
"a [CanvasLayer] with index [code]1[/code] will be drawn above. This order "
"will hold regardless of the [member CanvasItem.z_index] of the nodes within "
"each layer.\n"
"[CanvasLayer]s can be hidden and they can also optionally follow the "
"viewport. This makes them useful for HUDs like health bar overlays (on layers "
"[code]1[/code] and higher) or backgrounds (on layers [code]-1[/code] and "
"lower).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded [Window]s are placed on layer [code]1024[/code]. "
"[CanvasItem]s on layers [code]1025[/code] and higher appear in front of "
"embedded windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each [CanvasLayer] is drawn on one specific [Viewport] and "
"cannot be shared between multiple [Viewport]s, see [member custom_viewport]. "
"When using multiple [Viewport]s, for example in a split-screen game, you need "
"to create an individual [CanvasLayer] for each [Viewport] you want it to be "
"drawn on."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CanvasItem] ເຊິ່ງເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ທາງອ້ອມຂອງ [CanvasLayer] "
"ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃນເລເຢີນັ້ນ. ເລເຢີແມ່ນດັດສະນີຕົວເລກທີ່ກຳນົດລຳດັບການແຕ້ມ. ສາກ 2D "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເຣັນເດີດ້ວຍດັດສະນີ [code]0[/code], ດັ່ງນັ້ນ [CanvasLayer] ທີ່ມີດັດສະນີ [code]-1[/"
"code] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມ, ແລະ [CanvasLayer] ທີ່ມີດັດສະນີ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງເທິງ. ລຳດັບນີ້ຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈ [member CanvasItem.z_index] "
"ຂອງໂນດຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນແຕ່ລະເລເຢີ.\n"
"[CanvasLayer] ສາມາດຖືກເຊື່ອງໄດ້ ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມວິວພອດໄດ້ນຳ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ HUD ເຊັ່ນ: ແຖບເລືອດທີ່ສະແດງທັບ (ໃນເລເຢີ [code]1[/code] ແລະ "
"ສູງກວ່າ) ຫຼື ພື້ນຫຼັງ (ໃນເລເຢີ [code]-1[/code] ແລະ ຕ່ຳກວ່າ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Window] ທີ່ຖືກຝັງໄວ້ຈະຖືກວາງຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີ [code]1024[/code]. [CanvasItem] "
"ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີ [code]1025[/code] ແລະ ສູງກວ່າ ຈະປະກົດຢູ່ທາງໜ້າຂອງວິນໂດທີ່ຖືກຝັງໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະ [CanvasLayer] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃສ່ [Viewport] ໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍ [Viewport] ໄດ້, ເບິ່ງ [member custom_viewport]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ "
"[Viewport], ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນເກມແບບແບ່ງໜ້າຈໍ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ [CanvasLayer] "
"ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [Viewport] ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັນແຕ້ມໃສ່."

msgid "Canvas layers"
msgstr "ເລເຢີແຄນວາສ"

msgid "Returns the RID of the canvas used by this layer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງແຄນວາສທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເລເຢີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the transform from the [CanvasLayer]s coordinate system to the "
"[Viewport]s coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ຈາກລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ [CanvasLayer] ໄປຫາລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ [Viewport]."

msgid ""
"Hides any [CanvasItem] under this [CanvasLayer]. This is equivalent to "
"setting [member visible] to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງ [CanvasItem] ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ [CanvasLayer] ນີ້. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member "
"visible] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Shows any [CanvasItem] under this [CanvasLayer]. This is equivalent to "
"setting [member visible] to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [CanvasItem] ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ [CanvasLayer] ນີ້. ນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງ [member "
"visible] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The custom [Viewport] node assigned to the [CanvasLayer]. If [code]null[/"
"code], uses the default viewport instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [Viewport] ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ [CanvasLayer]. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], "
"ຈະໃຊ້ວິວພອດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທນ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the [CanvasLayer] maintains its position in world space. If "
"disabled, the [CanvasLayer] stays in a fixed position on the screen.\n"
"Together with [member follow_viewport_scale], this can be used for a "
"pseudo-3D effect."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, [CanvasLayer] ຈະຮັກສາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນໄວ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງໂລກ (world space). ຖ້າປິດໃຊ້, "
"[CanvasLayer] ຈະຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຄົງທີ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member follow_viewport_scale], ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ 3D ແບບຫຼອກໆ "
"(pseudo-3D) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Scales the layer when using [member follow_viewport_enabled]. Layers moving "
"into the foreground should have increasing scales, while layers moving into "
"the background should have decreasing scales."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດເລເຢີເມື່ອໃຊ້ [member follow_viewport_enabled]. "
"ເລເຢີທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ມາມາທາງໜ້າຄວນມີຂະໜາດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລເຢີທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປທາງຫຼັງຄວນມີຂະໜາດທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Layer index for draw order. Lower values are drawn behind higher values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If multiple CanvasLayers have the same layer index, [CanvasItem] "
"children of one CanvasLayer are drawn behind the [CanvasItem] children of the "
"other CanvasLayer. Which CanvasLayer is drawn in front is non-deterministic.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The layer index should be between [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_LAYER_MIN] and [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_LAYER_MAX] (inclusive). Any other value will wrap "
"around."
msgstr ""
"ດັດສະນີເລເຢີສຳລັບລຳດັບການແຕ້ມ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າມີຫຼາຍ CanvasLayers ທີ່ມີດັດສະນີເລເຢີດຽວກັນ, ໂນດລູກ [CanvasItem] ຂອງ "
"CanvasLayer ໜຶ່ງ ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງຂອງໂນດລູກ [CanvasItem] ຂອງອີກ CanvasLayer ໜຶ່ງ. "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ວ່າ CanvasLayer ໃດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ດັດສະນີເລເຢີຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_LAYER_MIN] ແລະ [constant "
"RenderingServer.CANVAS_LAYER_MAX] (ລວມທັງສອງຄ່ານັ້ນ). ຄ່າອື່ນໆນອກຈາກນີ້ຈະຖືກທົບກັບ (wrap "
"around)."

msgid "The layer's base offset."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດ (offset) ພື້ນຖານຂອງເລເຢີ."

msgid "The layer's rotation in radians."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຂອງເລເຢີໃນໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ (radians)."

msgid "The layer's scale."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງເລເຢີ."

msgid "The layer's transform."
msgstr "ການແປງ (transform) ຂອງເລເຢີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], any [CanvasItem] under this [CanvasLayer] will be "
"hidden.\n"
"Unlike [member CanvasItem.visible], visibility of a [CanvasLayer] isn't "
"propagated to underlying layers."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], [CanvasItem] ໃດໆທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ [CanvasLayer] ນີ້ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້.\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກ [member CanvasItem.visible], ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ [CanvasLayer] "
"ຈະບໍ່ແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍໄປຫາເລເຢີທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Emitted when visibility of the layer is changed. See [member visible]."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອການສະແດງຜົນຂອງເລເຢີປ່ຽນແປງ. ເບິ່ງ [member visible]."

msgid "A node that applies a color tint to a canvas."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ການຍ້ອມສີ (color tint) ໃຫ້ກັບແຄນວາສ."

msgid ""
"[CanvasModulate] applies a color tint to all nodes on a canvas. Only one can "
"be used to tint a canvas, but [CanvasLayer]s can be used to render things "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"[CanvasModulate] ນຳໃຊ້ການຍ້ອມສີໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂນດໃນແຄນວາສ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວເພື່ອຍ້ອມສີແຄນວາສ, ແຕ່ [CanvasLayer] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຣັນເດີສິ່ງຕ່າງໆແຍກກັນໄດ້."

msgid "2D lights and shadows"
msgstr "ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ 2D"

msgid "The tint color to apply."
msgstr "ສີຍ້ອມທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Texture with optional normal and specular maps for use in 2D rendering."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (Texture) ທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ normal map ແລະ specular map ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ 2D."

msgid ""
"[CanvasTexture] is an alternative to [ImageTexture] for 2D rendering. It "
"allows using normal maps and specular maps in any node that inherits from "
"[CanvasItem]. [CanvasTexture] also allows overriding the texture's filter and "
"repeat mode independently of the node's properties (or the project "
"settings).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [CanvasTexture] cannot be used in 3D. It will not display "
"correctly when applied to any [VisualInstance3D], such as [Sprite3D] or "
"[Decal]. For physically-based materials in 3D, use [BaseMaterial3D] instead."
msgstr ""
"[CanvasTexture] ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກແທນ [ImageTexture] ສຳລັບການເຣັນເດີ 2D. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"normal maps ແລະ specular maps ໃນໂນດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CanvasItem]. "
"[CanvasTexture] ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter) ແລະ ໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (repeat) "
"ຂອງພື້ນຜິວໄດ້ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ (ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [CanvasTexture] ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ 3D ໄດ້. ມັນຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບ "
"[VisualInstance3D] ໃດໆ ເຊັ່ນ [Sprite3D] ຫຼື [Decal]. ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸແບບອີງຕາມຟີຊິກ "
"(physically-based materials) ໃນ 3D, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [BaseMaterial3D] ແທນ."

msgid "2D Lights and Shadows"
msgstr "ແສງ ແລະ ເງົາ 2D"

msgid ""
"The diffuse (color) texture to use. This is the main texture you want to set "
"in most cases."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວແບບດິຟຟິວສ໌ (diffuse texture) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກຳນົດສີ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພື້ນຜິວຫຼັກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"The normal map texture to use. Only has a visible effect if [Light2D]s are "
"affecting this [CanvasTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot expects the normal map to use X+, Y+, and Z+ coordinates. "
"See [url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]this page[/url] for a "
"comparison of normal map coordinates expected by popular engines."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ normal map ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຈະມີຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີ [Light2D] ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ [CanvasTexture] "
"ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ normal map ໃຊ້ພິກັດ X+, Y+, ແລະ Z+. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=http://wiki.polycount.com/wiki/"
"Normal_Map_Technical_Details#Common_Swizzle_Coordinates]ໜ້ານີ້[/url] "
"ສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບພິກັດ normal map ທີ່ເອັນຈິນຍອດນິຍົມຕ່າງໆຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"The multiplier for specular reflection colors. The [Light2D]'s color is also "
"taken into account when determining the reflection color. Only has a visible "
"effect if [Light2D]s are affecting this [CanvasTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບສີຂອງການສະທ້ອນແສງ (specular reflection). ສີຂອງ [Light2D] "
"ກໍຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ນຳໃນການກຳນົດສີສະທ້ອນ. ຈະມີຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີ [Light2D] ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ "
"[CanvasTexture] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The specular exponent for [Light2D] specular reflections. Higher values "
"result in a more glossy/\"wet\" look, with reflections becoming more "
"localized and less visible overall. The default value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"disables specular reflections entirely. Only has a visible effect if "
"[Light2D]s are affecting this [CanvasTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລກຊີ້ກຳລັງ (specular exponent) ສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນແສງຂອງ [Light2D]. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືມີຄວາມມັນວາວ/\"ປຽກ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍການສະທ້ອນຈະເຫັນສະເພາະບາງຈຸດ ແລະ "
"ເຫັນໜ້ອຍລົງໃນພາບລວມ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະປິດການສະທ້ອນແສງທັງໝົດ. "
"ຈະມີຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີ [Light2D] ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ [CanvasTexture] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The specular map to use for [Light2D] specular reflections. This should be a "
"grayscale or colored texture, with brighter areas resulting in a higher "
"[member specular_shininess] value. Using a colored [member specular_texture] "
"allows controlling specular shininess on a per-channel basis. Only has a "
"visible effect if [Light2D]s are affecting this [CanvasTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ແຜນທີ່ specular ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນ specular ຂອງ [Light2D]. ນີ້ຄວນເປັນພື້ນຜິວແບບສີຂາວດຳ "
"ຫຼື ແບບມີສີ, ໂດຍທີ່ບໍລິເວນທີ່ແຈ້ງກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຄ່າ [member specular_shininess] ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ການໃຊ້ "
"[member specular_texture] ແບບມີສີ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຄວາມເງົາຂອງ specular "
"ຕາມແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີໄດ້. ຈະມີຜົນໃຫ້ເຫັນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [Light2D] ຕ່າງໆສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ [CanvasTexture] "
"ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The texture filtering mode to use when drawing this [CanvasTexture]."
msgstr "ໂໝດການກັ່ນຕອງພື້ນຜິວ (texture filtering mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແຕ້ມ [CanvasTexture] ນີ້."

msgid "The texture repeat mode to use when drawing this [CanvasTexture]."
msgstr "ໂໝດການເຮັດຊ້ຳພື້ນຜິວ (texture repeat mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແຕ້ມ [CanvasTexture] ນີ້."

msgid "Class representing a capsule-shaped [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ."

msgid ""
"Total height of the capsule mesh (including the hemispherical ends).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member height] of a capsule must be at least twice its "
"[member radius]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a circle. If the [member "
"height] is less than twice the [member radius], the properties adjust to a "
"valid value."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງແຄບຊູນເມສ (ລວມທັງສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ເປັນຮູບເຄິ່ງວົງມົນ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member height] ຂອງແຄບຊູນຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member radius]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບວົງມົນ. ຖ້າ [member height] ໜ້ອຍກວ່າສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member "
"radius], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Number of radial segments on the capsule mesh."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສ່ວນ (segments) ຕາມແນວລັດສະໝີຂອງແຄບຊູນເມສ."

msgid ""
"Radius of the capsule mesh.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member radius] of a capsule cannot be greater than half of "
"its [member height]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a circle. If the [member "
"radius] is greater than half of the [member height], the properties adjust to "
"a valid value."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງແຄບຊູນເມສ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member radius] ຂອງແຄບຊູນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member height]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບວົງມົນ. ຖ້າ [member radius] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member "
"height], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Number of rings along the height of the capsule."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວົງແຫວນ (rings) ຕາມລວງສູງຂອງແຄບຊູນ."

msgid "A 2D capsule shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະທະກັນ (collision) ທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 2D capsule shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [CapsuleShape2D] is fast to check collisions against, but "
"it is slower than [RectangleShape2D] and [CircleShape2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ 2D, ທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອມອບຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [CapsuleShape2D] ມີຄວາມໄວໃນການກວດສອບການປະທະ, ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ "
"[RectangleShape2D] ແລະ [CircleShape2D]."

msgid ""
"The capsule's full height, including the semicircles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member height] of a capsule must be at least twice its "
"[member radius]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a circle. If the [member "
"height] is less than twice the [member radius], the properties adjust to a "
"valid value."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງແຄບຊູນ, ລວມທັງສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນເຄິ່ງວົງມົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member height] ຂອງແຄບຊູນຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member radius]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບວົງມົນ. ຖ້າ [member height] ໜ້ອຍກວ່າສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member "
"radius], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The capsule's height, excluding the semicircles. This is the height of the "
"central rectangular part in the middle of the capsule, and is the distance "
"between the centers of the two semicircles. This is a wrapper for [member "
"height]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງແຄບຊູນ, ບໍ່ລວມສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນເຄິ່ງວົງມົນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມສູງຂອງສ່ວນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ຢູ່ທາງກາງຂອງແຄບຊູນ, "
"ແລະ ແມ່ນໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງເຄິ່ງວົງມົນທັງສອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຄອບ (wrapper) [member "
"height] ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The capsule's radius.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member radius] of a capsule cannot be greater than half of "
"its [member height]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a circle. If the [member "
"radius] is greater than half of the [member height], the properties adjust to "
"a valid value."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງແຄບຊູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member radius] ຂອງແຄບຊູນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member height]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບວົງມົນ. ຖ້າ [member radius] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member "
"height], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "A 3D capsule shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະທະກັນ (collision) ທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D capsule shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [CapsuleShape3D] is fast to check collisions against. It "
"is faster than [CylinderShape3D], but slower than [SphereShape3D] and "
"[BoxShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງແຄບຊູນ 3D, ທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອມອບຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [CapsuleShape3D] ມີຄວາມໄວໃນການກວດສອບການປະທະ. ມັນໄວກວ່າ "
"[CylinderShape3D], ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ [SphereShape3D] ແລະ [BoxShape3D]."

msgid ""
"The capsule's full height, including the hemispheres.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member height] of a capsule must be at least twice its "
"[member radius]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a sphere. If the [member "
"height] is less than twice the [member radius], the properties adjust to a "
"valid value."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງແຄບຊູນ, ລວມທັງສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນຮູບເຄິ່ງຊົງກົມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member height] ຂອງແຄບຊູນຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member radius]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມ. ຖ້າ [member height] ໜ້ອຍກວ່າສອງເທົ່າຂອງ [member "
"radius], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The capsule's height, excluding the hemispheres. This is the height of the "
"central cylindrical part in the middle of the capsule, and is the distance "
"between the centers of the two hemispheres. This is a wrapper for [member "
"height]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງແຄບຊູນ, ບໍ່ລວມສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນເຄິ່ງຊົງກົມ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມສູງຂອງສ່ວນຮູບຊົງກະບອກທີ່ຢູ່ທາງກາງຂອງແຄບຊູນ, ແລະ "
"ແມ່ນໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງເຄິ່ງຊົງກົມທັງສອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຄອບ (wrapper) [member "
"height] ໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The capsule's radius.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member radius] of a capsule cannot be greater than half of "
"its [member height]. Otherwise, the capsule becomes a sphere. If the [member "
"radius] is greater than half of the [member height], the properties adjust to "
"a valid value."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງແຄບຊູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member radius] ຂອງແຄບຊູນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member height]. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຄບຊູນຈະກາຍເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມ. ຖ້າ [member radius] ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງ [member "
"height], ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Rotation based cyclic coordinate descent inverse kinematics solver."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂອິນເວີສຄິເນມາຕິກ (IK solver) ແບບ cyclic coordinate descent ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ການໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"[CCDIK3D] is rotation based IK, enabling fast and effective tracking even "
"with large joint rotations. It's especially suitable for chains with "
"limitations, providing smoother and more stable target tracking compared to "
"[FABRIK3D].\n"
"The resulting twist around the forward vector will always be kept from the "
"previous pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the target is close to the root, it can cause unnatural "
"movement, including joint flips and oscillations."
msgstr ""
"[CCDIK3D] ແມ່ນ IK ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ການໝຸນ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕາມ (tracking) ເຮັດໄດ້ໄວ ແລະ ມີປະສິດທິພາບ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມີການໝຸນຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກໍຕາມ. ມັນເໝາະສົມເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບສາຍໂສ້ (chains) ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ, "
"ໂດຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕາມເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ລຽບນຽນ ແລະ ສະຖຽນກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [FABRIK3D].\n"
"ຜົນຂອງການບິດ (twist) ອ້ອມຮອບແກນໄປທາງໜ້າ (forward vector) ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຈາກທ່າທາງ "
"(pose) ກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (root), "
"ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ, ລວມທັງການພິກຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ ແລະ ການສັ່ນສະເທືອນ."

msgid "A container that keeps child controls in its center."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ (container) ທີ່ຈັດວາງຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກ (child controls) ໄວ້ທາງກາງ."

msgid ""
"[CenterContainer] is a container that keeps all of its child controls in its "
"center at their minimum size."
msgstr ""
"[CenterContainer] "
"ແມ່ນຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດວາງທຸກຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກຂອງມັນໄວ້ທາງກາງດ້ວຍຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຸດຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], centers children relative to the [CenterContainer]'s "
"top left corner."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຈັດວາງລູກໃຫ້ຢູ່ທາງກາງໂດຍທຽບກັບມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງ "
"[CenterContainer]."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] to apply inverse kinematics to bone chains containing "
"an arbitrary number of bones."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Inverse Kinematics "
"ກັບສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກທີ່ມີຈຳນວນກະດູກເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Base class of [SkeletonModifier3D] that automatically generates a joint list "
"from the bones between the root bone and the end bone.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All the methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if the "
"IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງ [SkeletonModifier3D] ທີ່ສ້າງລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ຈາກກະດູກທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງກະດູກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (root bone) ແລະ ກະດູກປາຍ (end bone).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທຸກເມັດທອດໃນຄລາສນີ້ຮັບພາລາມິເຕີ [code]index[/code]. "
"ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ລະບຸວ່າຈະໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດ ຖ້າ IK ມີຫຼາຍລາຍການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]settings/"
"<index>/root_bone_name[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns the end bone tail length of the bone chain when [method "
"is_end_bone_extended] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວສ່ວນຫາງຂອງກະດູກປາຍໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method is_end_bone_extended] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone tail length of the bone chain when [method "
"is_end_bone_extended] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວສ່ວນຫາງຂອງກະດູກປາຍໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ ເມື່ອ [method is_end_bone_extended] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The end bone must be the root bone or a child of the root bone. "
"If they are the same, the tail must be extended by [method "
"set_extend_end_bone] to modify the bone."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງກະດູກປາຍໃນສາຍໂສ້ກະດູກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກະດູກປາຍຕ້ອງແມ່ນກະດູກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (root bone) ຫຼື ເປັນລູກຂອງກະດູກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າມັນແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນ, ສ່ວນຫາງຕ້ອງຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກໂດຍ [method set_extend_end_bone] "
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂກະດູກ."

msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the end bone is extended to have a "
"tail.\n"
"The extended tail config is allocated to the last element in the joint list. "
"In other words, if you set [param enabled] to [code]false[/code], the config "
"of the last element in the joint list has no effect in the simulated result."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກະດູກປາຍຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີສ່ວນຫາງ.\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນຫາງທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍອອກຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອົງປະກອບສຸດທ້າຍໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງອົງປະກອບສຸດທ້າຍໃນລາຍການຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຜົນລັດການຈຳລອງ."

msgid "A 2D physics body specialized for characters moved by script."
msgstr "ໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກ 2D ທີ່ສ້າງມາສະເພາະສຳລັບຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"[CharacterBody2D] is a specialized class for physics bodies that are meant to "
"be user-controlled. They are not affected by physics at all, but they affect "
"other physics bodies in their path. They are mainly used to provide high-"
"level API to move objects with wall and slope detection ([method "
"move_and_slide] method) in addition to the general collision detection "
"provided by [method PhysicsBody2D.move_and_collide]. This makes it useful for "
"highly configurable physics bodies that must move in specific ways and "
"collide with the world, as is often the case with user-controlled "
"characters.\n"
"For game objects that don't require complex movement or collision detection, "
"such as moving platforms, [AnimatableBody2D] is simpler to configure."
msgstr ""
"[CharacterBody2D] ແມ່ນຄລາສພິເສດສຳລັບໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ. "
"ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຟີຊິກໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກອື່ນໆທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງພວກມັນ. "
"ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ API ລະດັບສູງໃນການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍວັດຖຸ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍການກວດສອບຝາ ແລະ ທາງລາດຊັນ "
"(ເມັດທອດ [method move_and_slide]) ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກການກວດສອບການປະທະທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ "
"[method PhysicsBody2D.move_and_collide]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກທີ່ຕ້ອງການການປັບແຕ່ງສູງ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນຮູບແບບສະເພາະ ແລະ "
"ປະທະກັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆໃນໂລກ, ຄືກັບກໍລະນີຂອງຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ.\n"
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸໃນເກມທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຫຼື ການກວດສອບການປະທະທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ເຊ່ນ: ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"[AnimatableBody2D] ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

msgid "Kinematic character (2D)"
msgstr "ຕົວລະຄອນແບບຄິເນມາຕິກ (2D)"

msgid "Using CharacterBody2D"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ CharacterBody2D"

msgid "2D Kinematic Character Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຕົວລະຄອນຄິເນມາຕິກ 2D"

msgid ""
"Allows to manually apply a snap to the floor regardless of the body's "
"velocity. This function does nothing when [method is_on_floor] returns "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ການດູດຕິດ (snap) ກັບພື້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄວາມໄວຂອງໂບດີ້. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຫຍັງເມື່ອ "
"[method is_on_floor] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the floor's collision angle at the last collision point according to "
"[param up_direction], which is [constant Vector2.UP] by default. This value "
"is always positive and only valid after calling [method move_and_slide] and "
"when [method is_on_floor] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມການປະທະຂອງພື້ນ ທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຕາມ [param up_direction], "
"ເຊິ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector2.UP]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນບວກສະເໝີ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ແລະ ເມື່ອ [method is_on_floor] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision normal of the floor at the last collision point. Only "
"valid after calling [method move_and_slide] and when [method is_on_floor] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] The collision normal is not always the same as the surface "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກ (collision normal) ຂອງພື້ນ ທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ແລະ ເມື່ອ [method is_on_floor] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກຂອງການປະທະອາດຈະບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (surface "
"normal) ສະເໝີໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns the last motion applied to the [CharacterBody2D] during the last call "
"to [method move_and_slide]. The movement can be split into multiple motions "
"when sliding occurs, and this method return the last one, which is useful to "
"retrieve the current direction of the movement."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (motion) ລ້າສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [CharacterBody2D] ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວອາດຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນຫຼາຍສ່ວນເມື່ອເກີດການສະໄລ້ "
"(sliding), ແລະ ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [KinematicCollision2D] if a collision occurred. The returned value "
"contains information about the latest collision that occurred during the last "
"call to [method move_and_slide]. Returns [code]null[/code] if no collision "
"occurred. See also [method get_slide_collision]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [KinematicCollision2D] ຖ້າມີການປະທະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະລ້າສຸດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປະທະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_slide_collision] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the linear velocity of the platform at the last collision point. Only "
"valid after calling [method move_and_slide]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນ (linear velocity) ຂອງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the travel (position delta) that occurred during the last call to "
"[method move_and_slide]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະການເຄື່ອນທີ່ (position delta) ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current real velocity since the last call to [method "
"move_and_slide]. For example, when you climb a slope, you will move "
"diagonally even though the velocity is horizontal. This method returns the "
"diagonal movement, as opposed to [member velocity] which returns the "
"requested velocity."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວແທ້ຈິງໃນປັດຈຸບັນນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຂຶ້ນທາງລາດຊັນ, ທ່ານຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແນວສະຫຼຽງເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຄວາມໄວຈະຢູ່ໃນແນວນອນກໍຕາມ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຕາມແນວສະຫຼຽງນັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກ [member velocity] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [KinematicCollision2D], which contains information about a "
"collision that occurred during the last call to [method move_and_slide]. "
"Since the body can collide several times in a single call to [method "
"move_and_slide], you must specify the index of the collision in the range 0 "
"to ([method get_slide_collision_count] - 1). See also [method "
"get_last_slide_collision].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Iterate through the collisions with a [code]for[/code] loop:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in get_slide_collision_count():\n"
"\tvar collision = get_slide_collision(i)\n"
"\tprint(\"Collided with: \", collision.get_collider().name)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < GetSlideCollisionCount(); i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tKinematicCollision2D collision = GetSlideCollision(i);\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Collided with: \", (collision.GetCollider() as Node).Name);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [KinematicCollision2D], ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກໂບດີ້ສາມາດປະທະໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸດັດສະນີຂອງການປະທະໃນຊ່ວງ 0 ຫາ ([method "
"get_slide_collision_count] - 1). ເບິ່ງ [method get_last_slide_collision] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ວົນຊ້ຳຜ່ານການປະທະຕ່າງໆດ້ວຍລູບ [code]for[/code]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in get_slide_collision_count():\n"
"\tvar collision = get_slide_collision(i)\n"
"\tprint(\"Collided with: \", collision.get_collider().name)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < GetSlideCollisionCount(); i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tKinematicCollision2D collision = GetSlideCollision(i);\n"
"\tGD.Print(\"Collided with: \", (collision.GetCollider() as Node).Name);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the number of times the body collided and changed direction during "
"the last call to [method move_and_slide]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ໂບດີ້ປະທະ ແລະ ປ່ຽນທິດທາງໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the collision normal of the wall at the last collision point. Only "
"valid after calling [method move_and_slide] and when [method is_on_wall] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] The collision normal is not always the same as the surface "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກ (collision normal) ຂອງຝາ ທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ແລະ ເມື່ອ [method is_on_wall] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກຂອງການປະທະອາດຈະບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບຄ່າແນວຕັ້ງສາກຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (surface "
"normal) ສະເໝີໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided with the ceiling on the last "
"call of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. The "
"[member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"ceiling\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບເພດານໃນການເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide] "
"ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member up_direction] ແລະ "
"[member floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ເພດານ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided only with the ceiling on the "
"last call of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. "
"The [member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"ceiling\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບ \"ເພດານ\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member "
"up_direction] ແລະ [member floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ເພດານ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided with the floor on the last "
"call of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. The "
"[member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"floor\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບພື້ນໃນການເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member up_direction] ແລະ [member "
"floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ພື້ນ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided only with the floor on the "
"last call of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. "
"The [member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"floor\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບ \"ພື້ນ\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member "
"up_direction] ແລະ [member floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ພື້ນ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided with a wall on the last call "
"of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. The "
"[member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"wall\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບຝາໃນການເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member up_direction] ແລະ [member "
"floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ຝາ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided only with a wall on the last "
"call of [method move_and_slide]. Otherwise, returns [code]false[/code]. The "
"[member up_direction] and [member floor_max_angle] are used to determine "
"whether a surface is \"wall\" or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບ \"ຝາ\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]. ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ [member "
"up_direction] ແລະ [member floor_max_angle] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນແມ່ນ \"ຝາ\" ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Moves the body based on [member velocity]. If the body collides with another, "
"it will slide along the other body (by default only on floor) rather than "
"stop immediately. If the other body is a [CharacterBody2D] or [RigidBody2D], "
"it will also be affected by the motion of the other body. You can use this to "
"make moving and rotating platforms, or to make nodes push other nodes.\n"
"This method should be used in [method Node._physics_process] (or in a method "
"called by [method Node._physics_process]), as it uses the physics step's "
"[code]delta[/code] value automatically in calculations. Otherwise, the "
"simulation will run at an incorrect speed.\n"
"Modifies [member velocity] if a slide collision occurred. To get the latest "
"collision call [method get_last_slide_collision], for detailed information "
"about collisions that occurred, use [method get_slide_collision].\n"
"When the body touches a moving platform, the platform's velocity is "
"automatically added to the body motion. If a collision occurs due to the "
"platform's motion, it will always be first in the slide collisions.\n"
"The general behavior and available properties change according to the [member "
"motion_mode].\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided, otherwise, returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໂບດີ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member velocity]. ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ, ມັນຈະສະໄລ້ໄປຕາມວັດຖຸນັ້ນ "
"(ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສະໄລ້ສະເພາະຢູ່ເທິງພື້ນ) ແທນທີ່ຈະຢຸດທັນທີ. ຖ້າວັດຖຸອື່ນນັ້ນແມ່ນ [CharacterBody2D] ຫຼື "
"[RigidBody2D], ມັນກໍຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນນຳ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄດ້, ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດຍູ້ໂນດອື່ນ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນ [method Node._physics_process] (ຫຼື ໃນເມັດທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍ [method "
"Node._physics_process]), ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]delta[/code] "
"ຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການຄຳນວນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຈຳລອງຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຈະມີການແກ້ໄຂ [member velocity] ຖ້າເກີດການປະທະແບບສະໄລ້. ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການປະທະລ້າສຸດ ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນ "
"[method get_last_slide_collision], ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method get_slide_collision].\n"
"ເມື່ອໂບດີ້ສຳຜັດກັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ຄວາມໄວຂອງແພລັດຟອມຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງໂບດີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ຖ້າເກີດການປະທະຍ້ອນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງແພລັດຟອມ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດເປັນລຳດັບທຳອິດໃນລາຍການການປະທະແບບສະໄລ້ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ພຶດຕິກຳທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມ [member motion_mode].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body will be able to move on the floor only. This "
"option avoids to be able to walk on walls, it will however allow to slide "
"down along them."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂບດີ້ຈະສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງພື້ນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສາມາດຍ່າງເທິງຝາໄດ້, ແຕ່ຈະຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະໄລ້ລົງຕາມຝາໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code] (by default), the body will move faster on downward "
"slopes and slower on upward slopes.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the body will always move at the same speed on the "
"ground no matter the slope. Note that you need to use [member "
"floor_snap_length] to stick along a downward slope at constant speed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ໂບດີ້ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນທາງລາດລົງ ແລະ "
"ຊ້າລົງໃນທາງລາດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂບດີ້ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວເທົ່າເດີມສະເໝີຢູ່ເທິງພື້ນ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈວ່າທາງຈະລາດຊັນປານໃດ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [member floor_snap_length] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂບດີ້ຕິດຢູ່ກັບທາງລາດລົງດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວທີ່ຄົງທີ່."

msgid ""
"Maximum angle (in radians) where a slope is still considered a floor (or a "
"ceiling), rather than a wall, when calling [method move_and_slide]. The "
"default value equals 45 degrees."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມສູງສຸດ (ໃນໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ) ທີ່ທາງລາດຊັນຍັງຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນພື້ນ (ຫຼື ເພດານ), ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຝາ, ເມື່ອເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide]. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບ 45 ອົງສາ."

msgid ""
"Sets a snapping distance. When set to a value different from [code]0.0[/"
"code], the body is kept attached to slopes when calling [method "
"move_and_slide]. The snapping vector is determined by the given distance "
"along the opposite direction of the [member up_direction].\n"
"As long as the snapping vector is in contact with the ground and the body "
"moves against [member up_direction], the body will remain attached to the "
"surface. Snapping is not applied if the body moves along [member "
"up_direction], meaning it contains vertical rising velocity, so it will be "
"able to detach from the ground when jumping or when the body is pushed up by "
"something. If you want to apply a snap without taking into account the "
"velocity, use [method apply_floor_snap]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄລຍະການດູດຕິດ (snapping distance). ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ໂບດີ້ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໃຫ້ຕິດຢູ່ກັບທາງລາດຊັນເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide]. "
"ເວກເຕີການດູດຕິດຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ລະບຸ ຕາມທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມຂອງ [member up_direction].\n"
"ຕາບໃດທີ່ເວກເຕີການດູດຕິດຍັງສຳຜັດກັບພື້ນ ແລະ ໂບດີ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ສວນທາງກັບ [member up_direction], "
"ໂບດີ້ຈະຍັງຄົງຕິດຢູ່ກັບພື້ນຜິວ. ການດູດຕິດຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຖ້າໂບດີ້ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຕາມ [member up_direction], "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີຄວາມໄວໃນແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ກຳລັງຂຶ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະສາມາດແຍກຕົວອອກຈາກພື້ນໄດ້ໃນເວລາໂດດ ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອໂບດີ້ຖືກຍູ້ຂຶ້ນໂດຍບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ການດູດຕິດໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄວາມໄວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"apply_floor_snap]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the body will not slide on slopes when calling [method "
"move_and_slide] when the body is standing still.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the body will slide on floor's slopes when [member "
"velocity] applies a downward force."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂບດີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະໄລ້ລົງຕາມທາງລາດຊັນເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂບດີ້ກຳລັງຢືນຢູ່ກັບທີ່.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ໂບດີ້ຈະສະໄລ້ລົງຕາມທາງລາດຊັນຂອງພື້ນ ເມື່ອ [member velocity] "
"ມີແຮງກົດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of times the body can change direction before it stops when "
"calling [method move_and_slide]. Must be greater than zero."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງສູງສຸດທີ່ໂບດີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນທິດທາງໄດ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຢຸດ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide]. "
"ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the motion mode which defines the behavior of [method move_and_slide]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂໝດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (motion mode) ເຊິ່ງຈະກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ [method move_and_slide]."

msgid ""
"Collision layers that will be included for detecting floor bodies that will "
"act as moving platforms to be followed by the [CharacterBody2D]. By default, "
"all floor bodies are detected and propagate their velocity."
msgstr ""
"Collision layers ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາລວມໃນການກວດສອບວັດຖຸເທິງພື້ນ ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນແພລັດຟອມເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃຫ້ "
"[CharacterBody2D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸເທິງພື້ນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກກວດສອບ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄວາມໄວຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the behavior to apply when you leave a moving platform. By default, to "
"be physically accurate, when you leave the last platform velocity is applied."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເພື່ອຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງທາງຟີຊິກ, "
"ເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກແພລັດຟອມ ຄວາມໄວລ້າສຸດຂອງແພລັດຟອມຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Collision layers that will be included for detecting wall bodies that will "
"act as moving platforms to be followed by the [CharacterBody2D]. By default, "
"all wall bodies are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Collision layers ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາລວມໃນການກວດສອບວັດຖຸທີ່ເປັນຝາ ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນແພລັດຟອມເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃຫ້ "
"[CharacterBody2D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເປັນຝາທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Extra margin used for collision recovery when calling [method "
"move_and_slide].\n"
"If the body is at least this close to another body, it will consider them to "
"be colliding and will be pushed away before performing the actual motion.\n"
"A higher value means it's more flexible for detecting collision, which helps "
"with consistently detecting walls and floors.\n"
"A lower value forces the collision algorithm to use more exact detection, so "
"it can be used in cases that specifically require precision, e.g at very low "
"scale to avoid visible jittering, or for stability with a stack of character "
"bodies."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຂອບ (margin) ພິເສດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການປະທະ ເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method move_and_slide].\n"
"ຖ້າໂບດີ້ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນໃນໄລຍະນີ້, ມັນຈະຖືວ່າພວກມັນປະທະກັນ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກຍູ້ອອກກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວແທ້ຈິງ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນການກວດສອບການປະທະ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກວດສອບຝາ ແລະ "
"ພື້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ລະບົບການປະທະໃຊ້ການກວດສອບທີ່ຊັດເຈນກວ່າ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊັດເຈນເປັນພິເສດ, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ໃນຂະໜາດທີ່ນ້ອຍຫຼາຍເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສັ່ນສະເທືອນ (jittering) ທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ, ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອຄວາມສະຖຽນເມື່ອມີຕົວລະຄອນຢືນຊ້ອນກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], during a jump against the ceiling, the body will slide, "
"if [code]false[/code] it will be stopped and will fall vertically."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໃນລະຫວ່າງການໂດດໄປປະທະເພດານ, ໂບດີ້ຈະສະໄລ້ໄປຕາມເພດານ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ມັນຈະຢຸດທັນທີ ແລະ ຕົກລົງມາໃນແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Vector pointing upwards, used to determine what is a wall and what is a floor "
"(or a ceiling) when calling [method move_and_slide]. Defaults to [constant "
"Vector2.UP]. As the vector will be normalized it can't be equal to [constant "
"Vector2.ZERO], if you want all collisions to be reported as walls, consider "
"using [constant MOTION_MODE_FLOATING] as [member motion_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ຂຶ້ນເທິງ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າອັນໃດແມ່ນຝາ ແລະ ອັນໃດແມ່ນພື້ນ (ຫຼື ເພດານ) ເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide]. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector2.UP]. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເວກເຕີຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນນໍມໍໄລຊ໌ (normalized), ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເທົ່າກັບ [constant "
"Vector2.ZERO] ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກການປະທະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນຝາ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ "
"[constant MOTION_MODE_FLOATING] ເປັນ [member motion_mode]."

msgid ""
"Current velocity vector in pixels per second, used and modified during calls "
"to [method move_and_slide].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A common mistake is setting this property to the desired "
"velocity multiplied by [code]delta[/code], which produces a motion vector in "
"pixels."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີຄວາມໄວປັດຈຸບັນໃນໜ່ວຍພິກເຊວຕໍ່ວິນາທີ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄູນດ້ວຍ "
"[code]delta[/code], ເຊິ່ງຈະກາຍເປັນເວກເຕີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນໜ່ວຍພິກເຊວແທນ."

msgid ""
"Minimum angle (in radians) where the body is allowed to slide when it "
"encounters a wall. The default value equals 15 degrees. This property only "
"affects movement when [member motion_mode] is [constant MOTION_MODE_FLOATING]."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຕ່ຳສຸດ (ໃນໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ) ທີ່ໂບດີ້ຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະໄລ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອປະທະກັບຝາ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບ 15 "
"ອົງສາ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member motion_mode] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"MOTION_MODE_FLOATING] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Apply when notions of walls, ceiling and floor are relevant. In this mode the "
"body motion will react to slopes (acceleration/slowdown). This mode is "
"suitable for sided games like platformers."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອແນວຄິດເລື່ອງຝາ, ເພດານ ແລະ ພື້ນມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງໂບດີ້ຈະຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ທາງລາດຊັນ (ການເລັ່ງ/ການຜ່ອນຄວາມໄວ). "
"ໂໝດນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບເກມແນວດ້ານຂ້າງ ເຊັ່ນ: ເກມແພລັດຟອມມໍ."

msgid ""
"Apply when there is no notion of floor or ceiling. All collisions will be "
"reported as [code]on_wall[/code]. In this mode, when you slide, the speed "
"will always be constant. This mode is suitable for top-down games."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີແນວຄິດເລື່ອງພື້ນ ຫຼື ເພດານ. ທຸກການປະທະຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນ [code]on_wall[/code]. "
"ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ເມື່ອທ່ານສະໄລ້, ຄວາມໄວຈະຄົງທີ່ສະເໝີ. ໂໝດນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບເກມແນວມຸມມອງຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ (top-"
"down)."

msgid ""
"Add the last platform velocity to the [member velocity] when you leave a "
"moving platform."
msgstr ""
"ບວກຄວາມໄວລ້າສຸດຂອງແພລັດຟອມເຂົ້າໃນ [member velocity] ເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Add the last platform velocity to the [member velocity] when you leave a "
"moving platform, but any downward motion is ignored. It's useful to keep full "
"jump height even when the platform is moving down."
msgstr ""
"ບວກຄວາມໄວລ້າສຸດຂອງແພລັດຟອມເຂົ້າໃນ [member velocity] ເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ແຕ່ຈະລະເລີຍການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນແນວລົງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮັກສາຄວາມສູງຂອງການໂດດໃຫ້ເຕັມສ່ວນ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າແພລັດຟອມຈະກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ລົງກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Do nothing when leaving a platform."
msgstr "ບໍ່ເຮັດຫຍັງເມື່ອອອກຈາກແພລັດຟອມ."

msgid "A 3D physics body specialized for characters moved by script."
msgstr "ໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກ 3D ທີ່ສ້າງມາສະເພາະສຳລັບຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"[CharacterBody3D] is a specialized class for physics bodies that are meant to "
"be user-controlled. They are not affected by physics at all, but they affect "
"other physics bodies in their path. They are mainly used to provide high-"
"level API to move objects with wall and slope detection ([method "
"move_and_slide] method) in addition to the general collision detection "
"provided by [method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide]. This makes it useful for "
"highly configurable physics bodies that must move in specific ways and "
"collide with the world, as is often the case with user-controlled "
"characters.\n"
"For game objects that don't require complex movement or collision detection, "
"such as moving platforms, [AnimatableBody3D] is simpler to configure."
msgstr ""
"[CharacterBody3D] ແມ່ນຄລາສພິເສດສຳລັບໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ. "
"ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຟີຊິກໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກອື່ນໆທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງພວກມັນ. "
"ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ API ລະດັບສູງໃນການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍວັດຖຸ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍການກວດສອບຝາ ແລະ ທາງລາດຊັນ "
"(ເມັດທອດ [method move_and_slide]) ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກການກວດສອບການປະທະທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍ "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂບດີ້ຟີຊິກທີ່ຕ້ອງການການປັບແຕ່ງສູງ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນຮູບແບບສະເພາະ ແລະ "
"ປະທະກັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆໃນໂລກ, ຄືກັບກໍລະນີຂອງຕົວລະຄອນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ.\n"
"ສຳລັບວັດຖຸໃນເກມທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຫຼື ການກວດສອບການປະທະທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ເຊ່ນ: ແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"[AnimatableBody3D] ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns the floor's collision angle at the last collision point according to "
"[param up_direction], which is [constant Vector3.UP] by default. This value "
"is always positive and only valid after calling [method move_and_slide] and "
"when [method is_on_floor] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມການປະທະຂອງພື້ນ ທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ ໂດຍອ້າງອີງຕາມ [param up_direction], "
"ເຊິ່ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector3.UP]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນບວກສະເໝີ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ແລະ ເມື່ອ [method is_on_floor] ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the last motion applied to the [CharacterBody3D] during the last call "
"to [method move_and_slide]. The movement can be split into multiple motions "
"when sliding occurs, and this method return the last one, which is useful to "
"retrieve the current direction of the movement."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (motion) ລ້າສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [CharacterBody3D] ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວອາດຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນຫຼາຍສ່ວນເມື່ອເກີດການສະໄລ້ "
"(sliding), ແລະ ວິທີນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນທິດທາງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [KinematicCollision3D] if a collision occurred. The returned value "
"contains information about the latest collision that occurred during the last "
"call to [method move_and_slide]. Returns [code]null[/code] if no collision "
"occurred. See also [method get_slide_collision]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [KinematicCollision3D] ຖ້າມີການປະທະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະລ້າສຸດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປະທະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_slide_collision] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the angular velocity of the platform at the last collision point. "
"Only valid after calling [method move_and_slide]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ຂອງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຈຸດປະທະລ້າສຸດ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [KinematicCollision3D], which contains information about a "
"collision that occurred during the last call to [method move_and_slide]. "
"Since the body can collide several times in a single call to [method "
"move_and_slide], you must specify the index of the collision in the range 0 "
"to ([method get_slide_collision_count] - 1). See also [method "
"get_last_slide_collision]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [KinematicCollision3D], ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide] ຄັ້ງລ້າສຸດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກໂບດີ້ສາມາດປະທະໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນການເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide] ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸດັດສະນີຂອງການປະທະໃນຊ່ວງ 0 ຫາ ([method "
"get_slide_collision_count] - 1). ເບິ່ງ [method get_last_slide_collision] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Moves the body based on [member velocity]. If the body collides with another, "
"it will slide along the other body rather than stop immediately. If the other "
"body is a [CharacterBody3D] or [RigidBody3D], it will also be affected by the "
"motion of the other body. You can use this to make moving and rotating "
"platforms, or to make nodes push other nodes.\n"
"This method should be used in [method Node._physics_process] (or in a method "
"called by [method Node._physics_process]), as it uses the physics step's "
"[code]delta[/code] value automatically in calculations. Otherwise, the "
"simulation will run at an incorrect speed.\n"
"Modifies [member velocity] if a slide collision occurred. To get the latest "
"collision call [method get_last_slide_collision], for more detailed "
"information about collisions that occurred, use [method "
"get_slide_collision].\n"
"When the body touches a moving platform, the platform's velocity is "
"automatically added to the body motion. If a collision occurs due to the "
"platform's motion, it will always be first in the slide collisions.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the body collided, otherwise, returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໂບດີ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member velocity]. ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ, "
"ມັນຈະສະໄລ້ໄປຕາມວັດຖຸນັ້ນແທນທີ່ຈະຢຸດທັນທີ. ຖ້າວັດຖຸອື່ນນັ້ນແມ່ນ [CharacterBody3D] ຫຼື "
"[RigidBody3D], ມັນກໍຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນນຳ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄດ້, ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂນດຍູ້ໂນດອື່ນ.\n"
"ວິທີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນ [method Node._physics_process] (ຫຼື ໃນເມັດທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍ [method "
"Node._physics_process]), ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]delta[/code] "
"ຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການຄຳນວນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຈຳລອງຈະເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຈະມີການແກ້ໄຂ [member velocity] ຖ້າເກີດການປະທະແບບສະໄລ້. ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການປະທະລ້າສຸດ ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນ "
"[method get_last_slide_collision], ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການປະທະທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method get_slide_collision].\n"
"ເມື່ອໂບດີ້ສຳຜັດກັບແພລັດຟອມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່, "
"ຄວາມໄວຂອງແພລັດຟອມຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງໂບດີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ຖ້າເກີດການປະທະຍ້ອນການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງແພລັດຟອມ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດເປັນລຳດັບທຳອິດໃນລາຍການການປະທະແບບສະໄລ້ສະເໝີ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໂບດີ້ປະທະ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Collision layers that will be included for detecting floor bodies that will "
"act as moving platforms to be followed by the [CharacterBody3D]. By default, "
"all floor bodies are detected and propagate their velocity."
msgstr ""
"Collision layers ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາລວມໃນການກວດສອບວັດຖຸເທິງພື້ນ ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນແພລັດຟອມເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃຫ້ "
"[CharacterBody3D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸເທິງພື້ນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກກວດສອບ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄວາມໄວຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"Collision layers that will be included for detecting wall bodies that will "
"act as moving platforms to be followed by the [CharacterBody3D]. By default, "
"all wall bodies are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Collision layers ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາລວມໃນການກວດສອບວັດຖຸທີ່ເປັນຝາ ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນແພລັດຟອມເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃຫ້ "
"[CharacterBody3D] ເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸທີ່ເປັນຝາທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"Vector pointing upwards, used to determine what is a wall and what is a floor "
"(or a ceiling) when calling [method move_and_slide]. Defaults to [constant "
"Vector3.UP]. As the vector will be normalized it can't be equal to [constant "
"Vector3.ZERO], if you want all collisions to be reported as walls, consider "
"using [constant MOTION_MODE_FLOATING] as [member motion_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີທີ່ຊີ້ຂຶ້ນເທິງ, ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າອັນໃດແມ່ນຝາ ແລະ ອັນໃດແມ່ນພື້ນ (ຫຼື ເພດານ) ເມື່ອເອີ້ນ [method "
"move_and_slide]. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant Vector3.UP]. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເວກເຕີຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນນໍມໍໄລຊ໌ (normalized), ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເທົ່າກັບ [constant "
"Vector3.ZERO] ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກການປະທະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນຝາ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ "
"[constant MOTION_MODE_FLOATING] ເປັນ [member motion_mode]."

msgid ""
"Current velocity vector (typically meters per second), used and modified "
"during calls to [method move_and_slide].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A common mistake is setting this property to the desired "
"velocity multiplied by [code]delta[/code], which produces a motion vector "
"(typically in meters)."
msgstr ""
"ເວກເຕີຄວາມໄວປັດຈຸບັນ (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນໜ່ວຍແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ), ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງການເອີ້ນ "
"[method move_and_slide].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄູນດ້ວຍ "
"[code]delta[/code], ເຊິ່ງຈະກາຍເປັນເວກເຕີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນໜ່ວຍແມັດ) ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Minimum angle (in radians) where the body is allowed to slide when it "
"encounters a wall. The default value equals 15 degrees. When [member "
"motion_mode] is [constant MOTION_MODE_GROUNDED], it only affects movement if "
"[member floor_block_on_wall] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຕ່ຳສຸດ (ໃນໜ່ວຍເຣດຽນ) ທີ່ໂບດີ້ຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະໄລ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອປະທະກັບຝາ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບ 15 "
"ອົງສາ. ເມື່ອ [member motion_mode] ແມ່ນ [constant MOTION_MODE_GROUNDED], "
"ມັນຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member floor_block_on_wall] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Apply when notions of walls, ceiling and floor are relevant. In this mode the "
"body motion will react to slopes (acceleration/slowdown). This mode is "
"suitable for grounded games like platformers."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອແນວຄິດເລື່ອງຝາ, ເພດານ ແລະ ພື້ນມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງໂບດີ້ຈະຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ທາງລາດຊັນ (ການເລັ່ງ/ການຜ່ອນຄວາມໄວ). "
"ໂໝດນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບເກມທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ເທິງພື້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ເກມແພລັດຟອມມໍ."

msgid ""
"Apply when there is no notion of floor or ceiling. All collisions will be "
"reported as [code]on_wall[/code]. In this mode, when you slide, the speed "
"will always be constant. This mode is suitable for games without ground like "
"space games."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີແນວຄິດເລື່ອງພື້ນ ຫຼື ເພດານ. ທຸກການປະທະຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນ [code]on_wall[/code]. "
"ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ເມື່ອທ່ານສະໄລ້, ຄວາມໄວຈະຄົງທີ່ສະເໝີ. ໂໝດນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບເກມທີ່ບໍ່ມີພື້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ເກມຍານອະວະກາດ."

msgid ""
"Controls how an individual character will be displayed in a [RichTextEffect]."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວອັກສອນໃນ [RichTextEffect]."

msgid ""
"By setting various properties on this object, you can control how individual "
"characters will be displayed in a [RichTextEffect]."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆໃນອັອບເຈັກນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວອັກສອນໃນ "
"[RichTextEffect] ໄດ້."

msgid "BBCode in RichTextLabel"
msgstr "BBCode ໃນ RichTextLabel"

msgid "The color the character will be drawn with."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແຕ້ມຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"The time elapsed since the [RichTextLabel] was added to the scene tree (in "
"seconds). Time stops when the [RichTextLabel] is paused (see [member "
"Node.process_mode]). Resets when the text in the [RichTextLabel] is changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Time still passes while the [RichTextLabel] is hidden."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາທີ່ຜ່ານໄປນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ [RichTextLabel] ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ scene tree (ໃນໜ່ວຍວິນາທີ). "
"ເວລາຈະຢຸດເມື່ອ [RichTextLabel] ຖືກພັກ (ເບິ່ງ [member Node.process_mode]). ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ "
"(reset) ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ [RichTextLabel] ປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເວລາຈະຍັງຄົງຜ່ານໄປເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [RichTextLabel] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Contains the arguments passed in the opening BBCode tag. By default, "
"arguments are strings; if their contents match a type such as [bool], [int] "
"or [float], they will be converted automatically. Color codes in the form "
"[code]#rrggbb[/code] or [code]#rgb[/code] will be converted to an opaque "
"[Color]. String arguments may not contain spaces, even if they're quoted. If "
"present, quotes will also be present in the final string.\n"
"For example, the opening BBCode tag [code][example foo=hello bar=true baz=42 "
"color=#ffffff][/code] will map to the following [Dictionary]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\"foo\": \"hello\", \"bar\": true, \"baz\": 42, \"color\": Color(1, 1, 1, "
"1)}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍອາຄິວເມນ (arguments) ທີ່ສົ່ງມາໃນແທັກ BBCode ເປີດ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ອາຄິວເມນຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (strings); ຖ້າເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນກົງກັບປະເພດເຊັ່ນ [bool], [int] ຫຼື "
"[float], ພວກມັນຈະຖືກແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ລະຫັດສີໃນຮູບແບບ [code]#rrggbb[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]#rgb[/code] ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ [Color] ແບບທຶບແສງ. ອາຄິວເມນແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າກໍຕາມ. ຖ້າມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ, ພວກມັນກໍຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມສຸດທ້າຍນຳ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແທັກ BBCode ເປີດ [code][example foo=hello bar=true baz=42 color=#ffffff]"
"[/code] ຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບ [Dictionary] ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\"foo\": \"hello\", \"bar\": true, \"baz\": 42, \"color\": Color(1, 1, 1, "
"1)}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"[TextServer] RID of the font used to render glyph, this value can be used "
"with [code]TextServer.font_*[/code] methods to retrieve font information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"RID ຂອງ [TextServer] ຂອງຟອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣັນເດີກລິບ (glyph), ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບເມັດທອດ "
"[code]TextServer.font_*[/code] ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຟອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Number of glyphs in the grapheme cluster. This value is set in the first "
"glyph of a cluster.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂອງກລິບ (glyphs) ໃນກຸ່ມກຣາຟີມ (grapheme cluster). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນກລິບທຳອິດຂອງກຸ່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Glyph flags. See [enum TextServer.GraphemeFlag] for more info.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"ທຸງຂອງກລິບ. ເບິ່ງ [enum TextServer.GraphemeFlag] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Glyph index specific to the [member font]. If you want to replace this glyph, "
"use [method TextServer.font_get_glyph_index] with [member font] to get a new "
"glyph index for a single character."
msgstr ""
"ດັດສະນີກລິບ (Glyph index) ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກັບ [member font]. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນກລິບນີ້, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method TextServer.font_get_glyph_index] ຮ່ວມກັບ [member font] "
"ເພື່ອຮັບດັດສະນີກລິບໃໝ່ສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ."

msgid "The position offset the character will be drawn with (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທີ່ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], FX transform is called for outline drawing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ FX transform ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Absolute character range in the string, corresponding to the glyph.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງຕົວອັກສອນແບບສຳບູນ (absolute) ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ glyph.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The character offset of the glyph, relative to the current [RichTextEffect] "
"custom block.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Read-only. Setting this property won't affect drawing."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ຂອງ glyph, ທຽບກັບບລັອກກຳນົດເອງ [RichTextEffect] ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The current transform of the current glyph. It can be overridden (for "
"example, by driving the position and rotation from a curve). You can also "
"alter the existing value to apply transforms on top of other effects."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງ (transform) ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ glyph ປັດຈຸບັນ. ມັນສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບໄດ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໂດຍການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝຸນຈາກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ). "
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການແປງເທິງເອັບເຟັກ (effect) ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the character will be drawn. If [code]false[/code], the "
"character will be hidden. Characters around hidden characters will reflow to "
"take the space of hidden characters. If this is not desired, set their "
"[member color] to [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 0)[/code] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. "
"ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຮອບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງຈະຈັດລຽງໃໝ່ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ບ່ອນວ່າງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແບບນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member color] ຂອງພວກມັນເປັນ [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 0)[/"
"code] ແທນ."

msgid "A button that represents a binary choice."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງການເລືອກແບບສອງທາງ (binary)."

msgid ""
"[CheckBox] allows the user to choose one of only two possible options. It's "
"similar to [CheckButton] in functionality, but it has a different appearance. "
"To follow established UX patterns, it's recommended to use [CheckBox] when "
"toggling it has [b]no[/b] immediate effect on something. For example, it "
"could be used when toggling it will only do something once a confirmation "
"button is pressed.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node.\n"
"When [member BaseButton.button_group] specifies a [ButtonGroup], [CheckBox] "
"changes its appearance to that of a radio button and uses the various "
"[code]radio_*[/code] theme properties."
msgstr ""
"[CheckBox] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງໜຶ່ງໃນສອງຕົວເລືອກ. ມັນມີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ "
"[CheckButton], ແຕ່ມີຮູບລັກສະນະທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມຮູບແບບ UX ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[CheckBox] ເມື່ອການສະຫຼັບປ່ຽນມັນ [b]ບໍ່ມີ[/b] ຜົນກະທົບທັນທີຕໍ່ບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ມັນອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອການສະຫຼັບປ່ຽນຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການກົດປຸ່ມຢືນຢັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [BaseButton] ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມທອດ (method) ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດ (node) "
"ນີ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອ [member BaseButton.button_group] ກຳນົດ [ButtonGroup], [CheckBox] "
"ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງມັນເປັນແບບປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio button) ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຮູບແບບ (theme) ຕ່າງໆ "
"ຂອງ [code]radio_*[/code]."

msgid "The color of the checked icon when the checkbox is pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (checked) ເມື່ອ checkbox ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The color of the unchecked icon when the checkbox is not pressed."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ (unchecked) ເມື່ອ checkbox ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "The vertical offset used when rendering the check icons (in pixels)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ (vertical offset) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid "The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is checked."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is checked and is disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is configured as a radio button "
"and is checked."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ ແລະ ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is configured as a radio "
"button, is disabled, and is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ, ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is configured as a radio button "
"and is unchecked."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid "The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is unchecked."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"The check icon to display when the [CheckBox] is unchecked and is disabled."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckBox] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"[CheckButton] is a toggle button displayed as a check field. It's similar to "
"[CheckBox] in functionality, but it has a different appearance. To follow "
"established UX patterns, it's recommended to use [CheckButton] when toggling "
"it has an [b]immediate[/b] effect on something. For example, it can be used "
"when pressing it shows or hides advanced settings, without asking the user to "
"confirm this action.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node."
msgstr ""
"[CheckButton] ແມ່ນປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ (toggle) ທີ່ສະແດງເປັນຊ່ອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກ. ມັນມີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ "
"[CheckBox], ແຕ່ມີຮູບລັກສະນະທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມຮູບແບບ UX ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[CheckButton] ເມື່ອການສະຫຼັບປ່ຽນມັນມີຜົນກະທົບ [b]ທັນທີ[/b] ຕໍ່ບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ມັນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອການກົດມັນຈະສະແດງ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນການກະທຳນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [BaseButton] ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມທອດ (method) ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດ (node) "
"ນີ້."

msgid "The vertical offset used when rendering the toggle icons (in pixels)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ (vertical offset) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນໄອຄອນສະຫຼັບ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is checked (for left-to-right "
"layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ຖືກເລືອກ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is checked and disabled (for left-"
"to-right layouts)."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is checked and disabled (for right-"
"to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is checked (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ຖືກເລືອກ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is unchecked (for left-to-right "
"layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is unchecked and disabled (for "
"left-to-right layouts)."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is unchecked and disabled (for "
"right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ "
"(ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"The icon to display when the [CheckButton] is unchecked (for right-to-left "
"layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ [CheckButton] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid "A 2D circle shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງວົງມົນ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນທາງຟີຊິກ (physics collision)."

msgid ""
"A 2D circle shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [CircleShape2D] is fast to check collisions against. It "
"is faster than [RectangleShape2D] and [CapsuleShape2D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງວົງມົນ 2D, ທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape2D].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [CircleShape2D] ມີຄວາມໄວໃນການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນ. ມັນໄວກວ່າ "
"[RectangleShape2D] ແລະ [CapsuleShape2D]."

msgid "The circle's radius."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງວົງມົນ."

msgid "A class information repository."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄລາດ (class)."

msgid ""
"Provides access to metadata stored for every available engine class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Script-defined classes with [code]class_name[/code] are not part "
"of [ClassDB], so they will not return reflection data such as a method or "
"property list. However, [GDExtension]-defined classes [i]are[/i] part of "
"[ClassDB], so they will return reflection data."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ສຳລັບທຸກຄລາດຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍ [code]class_name[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ "
"[ClassDB], ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ reflection ເຊັ່ນ: ລາຍຊື່ເມທອດ ຫຼື ຄຸນສົມບັດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [GDExtension] [i]ແມ່ນ[/i] ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ [ClassDB], "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ reflection."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if objects can be instantiated from the specified "
"[param class], otherwise returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າວັດຖຸສາມາດຖືກສ້າງ (instantiated) ຈາກ [param class] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Calls a static method on a class."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດສະແຕຕິກ (static method) ໃນຄລາດ."

msgid "Returns whether the specified [param class] is available or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ນັ້ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Returns the API type of the specified [param class]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດ API ຂອງ [param class] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all the keys in [param enum] of [param class] or its "
"ancestry."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ມີຄີ (keys) ທັງໝົດໃນ [param enum] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື "
"ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns an array with all the enums of [param class] or its ancestry."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ມີ enum ທັງໝົດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the integer constant [param name] of [param class] or "
"its ancestry. Always returns 0 when the constant could not be found."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຳນວນເຕັມ [param name] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ. ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"0 ສະເໝີເມື່ອບໍ່ພົບຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

msgid ""
"Returns which enum the integer constant [param name] of [param class] or its "
"ancestry belongs to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຳນວນເຕັມ [param name] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນນັ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບ enum "
"ໃດ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with the names all the integer constants of [param class] or "
"its ancestry."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ມີຊື່ຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຳນວນເຕັມທັງໝົດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of arguments of the method [param method] of [param class] "
"or its ancestry if [param no_inheritance] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຂອງອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ຂອງເມທອດ [param method] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື "
"ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param no_inheritance] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all the methods of [param class] or its ancestry if "
"[param no_inheritance] is [code]false[/code]. Every element of the array is a "
"[Dictionary] with the following keys: [code]args[/code], [code]default_args[/"
"code], [code]flags[/code], [code]id[/code], [code]name[/code], [code]return: "
"(class_name, hint, hint_string, name, type, usage)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In exported release builds the debug info is not available, so "
"the returned dictionaries will contain only method names."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ມີເມທອດທັງໝົດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param no_inheritance] "
"ເປັນ [code]false[/code]. ທຸກໆອົງປະກອບຂອງອາເຣແມ່ນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]args[/"
"code], [code]default_args[/code], [code]flags[/code], [code]id[/code], "
"[code]name[/code], [code]return: (class_name, hint, hint_string, name, type, "
"usage)[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນການບິວ (build) ແບບ exported release, ຂໍ້ມູນ debug ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ dictionary ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຊື່ເມທອດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Returns the value of [param property] of [param object] or its ancestry."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງ [param property] ຂອງ [param object] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default value of [param property] of [param class] or its "
"ancestor classes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [param property] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ຄລາດບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the getter method name of [param property] of [param class]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ເມທອດ getter ຂອງ [param property] ຂອງ [param class]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all the properties of [param class] or its ancestry if "
"[param no_inheritance] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ທັງໝົດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param "
"no_inheritance] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Returns the setter method name of [param property] of [param class]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ເມທອດ setter ຂອງ [param property] ຂອງ [param class]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [param signal] data of [param class] or its ancestry. The "
"returned value is a [Dictionary] with the following keys: [code]args[/code], "
"[code]default_args[/code], [code]flags[/code], [code]id[/code], [code]name[/"
"code], [code]return: (class_name, hint, hint_string, name, type, usage)[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ [param signal] ຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ "
"[Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]args[/code], [code]default_args[/code], "
"[code]flags[/code], [code]id[/code], [code]name[/code], [code]return: "
"(class_name, hint, hint_string, name, type, usage)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with all the signals of [param class] or its ancestry if "
"[param no_inheritance] is [code]false[/code]. Every element of the array is a "
"[Dictionary] as described in [method class_get_signal]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣທີ່ມີສັນຍານ (signals) ທັງໝົດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param "
"no_inheritance] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]. ທຸກໆອົງປະກອບຂອງອາເຣແມ່ນ [Dictionary] "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [method class_get_signal]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param class] or its ancestry has an enum called [param name] "
"or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນມີ enum ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param name] ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param class] or its ancestry has an integer constant called "
"[param name] or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນມີຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈຳນວນເຕັມທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param name] ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param class] (or its ancestry if [param no_inheritance] is "
"[code]false[/code]) has a method called [param method] or not."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] (ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param no_inheritance] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]) ມີເມທອດທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param method] ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param class] or its ancestry has a signal called [param "
"signal] or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] ຫຼື ບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນມີສັນຍານທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param signal] ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Sets [param property] value of [param object] to [param value]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param property] ຂອງ [param object] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value]."

msgid ""
"Returns the names of all engine classes available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Script-defined classes with [code]class_name[/code] are not "
"included in this list. Use [method ProjectSettings.get_global_class_list] to "
"get a list of script-defined classes instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງທຸກຄລາດ (class) ເອນຈິນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍ [code]class_name[/code] ຈະບໍ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ນີ້. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method ProjectSettings.get_global_class_list] "
"ເພື່ອຮັບລາຍຊື່ຄລາດທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສະຄຣິບແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the names of all engine classes that directly or indirectly inherit "
"from [param class]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງທຸກຄລາດເອນຈິນທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [param class] ໂດຍທາງກົງ ຫຼື ທາງອ້ອມ."

msgid "Returns the parent class of [param class]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄລາດແມ່ (parent class) ຂອງ [param class]."

msgid "Creates an instance of [param class]."
msgstr "ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [param class]."

msgid "Returns whether this [param class] is enabled or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] ນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether [param class] (or its ancestor classes if [param "
"no_inheritance] is [code]false[/code]) has an enum called [param enum] that "
"is a bitfield."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param class] (ຫຼື ຄລາດບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງມັນ ຖ້າ [param no_inheritance] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]) ມີ enum ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [param enum] ທີ່ເປັນ bitfield ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Returns whether [param inherits] is an ancestor of [param class] or not."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param inherits] ເປັນບັນພະບຸລຸດຂອງ [param class] ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Native Core class type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄລາດ Core ພື້ນຖານ (Native)."

msgid "Native Editor class type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄລາດ Editor ພື້ນຖານ (Native)."

msgid "GDExtension class type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄລາດ GDExtension."

msgid "GDExtension Editor class type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄລາດ GDExtension Editor."

msgid "Unknown class type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄລາດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ."

msgid "A multiline text editor designed for editing code."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍບັນທັດທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໂຄດ (code)."

msgid ""
"CodeEdit is a specialized [TextEdit] designed for editing plain text code "
"files. It has many features commonly found in code editors such as line "
"numbers, line folding, code completion, indent management, and string/comment "
"management.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of locale, [CodeEdit] will by default always use left-"
"to-right text direction to correctly display source code."
msgstr ""
"CodeEdit ແມ່ນ [TextEdit] ພິເສດທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໂຄດຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ. "
"ມັນມີຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ມັກພົບໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂຄດ ເຊັ່ນ: ເລກບັນທັດ, ການພັບບັນທັດ, ການເຕີມໂຄດອັດຕະໂນມັດ, "
"ການຈັດການການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ, ແລະ ການຈັດການຂໍ້ຄວາມ/ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comment).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (locale), ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ [CodeEdit] "
"ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາສະເໝີ ເພື່ອສະແດງຊອສໂຄດ (source code) ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define how the selected entry should be inserted. If "
"[param replace] is [code]true[/code], any existing text should be replaced."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກຄວນຖືກແຊກແນວໃດ. ຖ້າ [param replace] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຄວນຖືກແທນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define what items in [param candidates] should be "
"displayed.\n"
"Both [param candidates] and the return is an [Array] of [Dictionary], see "
"[method get_code_completion_option] for [Dictionary] content."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າລາຍການໃດໃນ [param candidates] ຄວນຖືກສະແດງ.\n"
"ທັງ [param candidates] ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [Array] ຂອງ [Dictionary], ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_code_completion_option] ສຳລັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [Dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define what happens when the user requests code "
"completion. If [param force] is [code]true[/code], any checks should be "
"bypassed."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າຈະເກີດຫຍັງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍການເຕີມໂຄດອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າ [param force] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການກວດສອບໃດໆ ຄວນຖືກຂ້າມໄປ."

msgid ""
"Adds a brace pair.\n"
"Both the start and end keys must be symbols. Only the start key has to be "
"unique."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄູ່ຂອງວົງເລັບ.\n"
"ທັງຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຄີສິ້ນສຸດຕ້ອງເປັນສັນຍາລັກ. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊ້ຳໃຜ."

msgid ""
"Submits an item to the queue of potential candidates for the autocomplete "
"menu. Call [method update_code_completion_options] to update the list.\n"
"[param location] indicates location of the option relative to the location of "
"the code completion query. See [enum CodeEdit.CodeCompletionLocation] for how "
"to set this value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This list will replace all current candidates."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງລາຍການໄປຫາຄິວ (queue) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ມີໂອກາດຖືກເລືອກສຳລັບເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method update_code_completion_options] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍຊື່.\n"
"[param location] ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງການສອບຖາມການເຕີມໂຄດ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [enum CodeEdit.CodeCompletionLocation] ສຳລັບວິທີຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍຊື່ນີ້ຈະແທນທີ່ລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Adds a comment delimiter from [param start_key] to [param end_key]. Both keys "
"should be symbols, and [param start_key] must not be shared with other "
"delimiters.\n"
"If [param line_only] is [code]true[/code] or [param end_key] is an empty "
"[String], the region does not carry over to the next line."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ (delimiter) ຄຳອະທິບາຍຈາກ [param start_key] ຫາ [param end_key]. "
"ທັງສອງຄີຄວນເປັນສັນຍາລັກ, ແລະ [param start_key] ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດອື່ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param line_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຫຼື [param end_key] ເປັນ [String] "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຂອບເຂດນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໄປຫາບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Defines a string delimiter from [param start_key] to [param end_key]. Both "
"keys should be symbols, and [param start_key] must not be shared with other "
"delimiters.\n"
"If [param line_only] is [code]true[/code] or [param end_key] is an empty "
"[String], the region does not carry over to the next line."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ (delimiter) ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) ຈາກ [param start_key] ຫາ [param "
"end_key]. ທັງສອງຄີຄວນເປັນສັນຍາລັກ, ແລະ [param start_key] "
"ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດອື່ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param line_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຫຼື [param end_key] ເປັນ [String] "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຂອບເຂດນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໄປຫາບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is foldable. A line is foldable "
"if it is the start of a valid code region (see [method "
"get_code_region_start_tag]), if it is the start of a comment or string block, "
"or if the next non-empty line is more indented (see [method "
"TextEdit.get_indent_level])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມານັ້ນສາມາດພັບໄດ້. "
"ບັນທັດຈະພັບໄດ້ຖ້າມັນເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_code_region_start_tag]), ຖ້າມັນເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງບລັອກຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ບໍ່ຫວ່າງມີການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າເຂົ້າໄປຫຼາຍກວ່າ (ເບິ່ງ [method TextEdit.get_indent_level])."

msgid "Cancels the autocomplete menu."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Clears all bookmarked lines."
msgstr "ລຶບບຸກມາກ (bookmark) ອອກຈາກທຸກບັນທັດ."

msgid "Clears all breakpointed lines."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ອອກຈາກທຸກບັນທັດ."

msgid "Removes all comment delimiters."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Clears all executed lines."
msgstr "ລຶບເຄື່ອງໝາຍບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Removes all string delimiters."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Inserts the selected entry into the text. If [param replace] is [code]true[/"
"code], any existing text is replaced rather than merged."
msgstr ""
"ແຊກລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກເຂົ້າໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າ [param replace] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການລວມເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Converts the indents of lines between [param from_line] and [param to_line] "
"to tabs or spaces as set by [member indent_use_spaces].\n"
"Values of [code]-1[/code] convert the entire text."
msgstr ""
"ແປງການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຂອງບັນທັດລະຫວ່າງ [param from_line] ແລະ [param to_line] ໃຫ້ເປັນແຖບ (tab) "
"ຫຼື ຍະຫວ່າງ (space) ຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໂດຍ [member indent_use_spaces].\n"
"ຄ່າ [code]-1[/code] ຈະແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new code region with the selection. At least one single line "
"comment delimiter have to be defined (see [method add_comment_delimiter]).\n"
"A code region is a part of code that is highlighted when folded and can help "
"organize your script.\n"
"Code region start and end tags can be customized (see [method "
"set_code_region_tags]).\n"
"Code regions are delimited using start and end tags (respectively "
"[code]region[/code] and [code]endregion[/code] by default) preceded by one "
"line comment delimiter. (eg. [code]#region[/code] and [code]#endregion[/code])"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຂອບເຂດໂຄດໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການເລືອກ. ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍແບບບັນທັດດຽວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ "
"(ເບິ່ງ [method add_comment_delimiter]).\n"
"ຂອບເຂດໂຄດແມ່ນສ່ວນຂອງໂຄດທີ່ຈະຖືກໄຮໄລ້ (highlight) ເມື່ອຖືກພັບ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຈັດລະບຽບສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້.\n"
"ແທັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_code_region_tags]).\n"
"ຂອບເຂດໂຄດຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ແທັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ (ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]region[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]endregion[/code] ຕາມລຳດັບ) ເຊິ່ງນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍບັນທັດດຽວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[code]#region[/code] ແລະ [code]#endregion[/code])"

msgid "Deletes all lines that are selected or have a caret on them."
msgstr "ລຶບບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ມີເຄີເຊີ (caret) ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"If there is no selection, indentation is inserted at the caret. Otherwise, "
"the selected lines are indented like [method indent_lines]. Equivalent to the "
"[member ProjectSettings.input/ui_text_indent] action. The indentation "
"characters used depend on [member indent_use_spaces] and [member indent_size]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກ, ການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຈະຖືກແຊກຢູ່ບ່ອນເຄີເຊີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຄືກັບ [method "
"indent_lines]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການກະທຳ [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_text_indent]. "
"ຕົວອັກສອນຫຍໍ້ໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ [member indent_use_spaces] ແລະ [member indent_size]."

msgid ""
"Duplicates all lines currently selected with any caret. Duplicates the entire "
"line beneath the current one no matter where the caret is within the line."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຊ້ຳບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍເຄີເຊີໃດໆ. ຈະເຮັດຊ້ຳທັງບັນທັດໄວ້ລຸ່ມບັນທັດປັດຈຸບັນ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າເຄີເຊີຈະຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໃນບັນທັດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Duplicates all selected text and duplicates all lines with a caret on them."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Folds all lines that are possible to be folded (see [method can_fold_line])."
msgstr "ພັບທຸກບັນທັດທີ່ສາມາດພັບໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method can_fold_line])."

msgid "Folds the given line, if possible (see [method can_fold_line])."
msgstr "ພັບບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method can_fold_line])."

msgid "Gets the matching auto brace close key for [param open_key]."
msgstr "ຮັບຄີປິດວົງເລັບອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ກົງກັບ [param open_key]."

msgid "Gets all bookmarked lines."
msgstr "ຮັບລາຍຊື່ບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕັ້ງບຸກມາກໄວ້."

msgid "Gets all breakpointed lines."
msgstr "ຮັບລາຍຊື່ບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຸດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Gets the completion option at [param index]. The return [Dictionary] has the "
"following key-values:\n"
"[code]kind[/code]: [enum CodeCompletionKind]\n"
"[code]display_text[/code]: Text that is shown on the autocomplete menu.\n"
"[code]insert_text[/code]: Text that is to be inserted when this item is "
"selected.\n"
"[code]font_color[/code]: Color of the text on the autocomplete menu.\n"
"[code]icon[/code]: Icon to draw on the autocomplete menu.\n"
"[code]default_value[/code]: Value of the symbol."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດທີ່ [param index]. [Dictionary] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະມີຄ່າຄີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"[code]kind[/code]: [enum CodeCompletionKind]\n"
"[code]display_text[/code]: ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[code]insert_text[/code]: ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະຖືກແຊກເມື່ອລາຍການນີ້ຖືກເລືອກ.\n"
"[code]font_color[/code]: ສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[code]icon[/code]: ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມໃນເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[code]default_value[/code]: ຄ່າຂອງສັນຍາລັກ."

msgid ""
"Gets all completion options, see [method get_code_completion_option] for "
"return content."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງ [method get_code_completion_option] ສຳລັບເນື້ອໃນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid "Gets the index of the current selected completion option."
msgstr "ຮັບລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns the code region end tag (without comment delimiter)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແທັກສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍ)."

msgid "Returns the code region start tag (without comment delimiter)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແທັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍ)."

msgid "Gets the end key for a string or comment region index."
msgstr "ຮັບຄີສິ້ນສຸດສຳລັບລຳດັບຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [param line] [param column] is in a string or comment, returns the end "
"position of the region. If not or no end could be found, both [Vector2] "
"values will be [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param line] [param column] ຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ພົບຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ, ທັງສອງຄ່າ [Vector2] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]-1[/code]."

msgid "Gets the start key for a string or comment region index."
msgstr "ຮັບຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບລຳດັບຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [param line] [param column] is in a string or comment, returns the start "
"position of the region. If not or no start could be found, both [Vector2] "
"values will be [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param line] [param column] ຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂອບເຂດນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ພົບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທັງສອງຄ່າ [Vector2] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]-1[/code]."

msgid "Gets all executing lines."
msgstr "ຮັບລາຍຊື່ບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "Returns all lines that are currently folded."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກພັບຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the full text with char [code]0xFFFF[/code] at the caret location."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໂດຍມີຕົວອັກສອນ [code]0xFFFF[/code] ຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the full text with char [code]0xFFFF[/code] at the cursor location."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໂດຍມີຕົວອັກສອນ [code]0xFFFF[/code] ຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the full text with char [code]0xFFFF[/code] at the specified location."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໂດຍມີຕົວອັກສອນ [code]0xFFFF[/code] ຢູ່ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if close key [param close_key] exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄີສິ້ນສຸດ [param close_key] ຢູ່."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if open key [param open_key] exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [param open_key] ຢູ່."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if comment [param start_key] exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄຳອະທິບາຍ [param start_key] ຢູ່."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if string [param start_key] exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param start_key] ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Indents all lines that are selected or have a caret on them. Uses spaces or a "
"tab depending on [member indent_use_spaces]. See [method unindent_lines]."
msgstr ""
"ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່. ໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ແຖບ ຂຶ້ນກັບ [member indent_use_spaces]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method unindent_lines]."

msgid ""
"Returns delimiter index if [param line] [param column] is in a comment. If "
"[param column] is not provided, will return delimiter index if the entire "
"[param line] is a comment. Otherwise [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ ຖ້າ [param line] [param column] ຢູ່ໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ "
"[param column], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຖ້າທັງ [param line] ເປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the delimiter index if [param line] [param column] is in a string. If "
"[param column] is not provided, will return the delimiter index if the entire "
"[param line] is a string. Otherwise [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດ ຖ້າ [param line] [param column] ຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ [param "
"column], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຖ້າທັງ [param line] ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]-1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is bookmarked. See [method "
"set_line_as_bookmarked]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກຕັ້ງບຸກມາກໄວ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_line_as_bookmarked]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is breakpointed. See [method "
"set_line_as_breakpoint]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຸດໄວ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_line_as_breakpoint]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is a code region end. See [method "
"set_code_region_tags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_code_region_tags]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is a code region start. See "
"[method set_code_region_tags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_code_region_tags]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is marked as executing. See "
"[method set_line_as_executing]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ວ່າກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_line_as_executing]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given line is folded. See [method fold_line]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຖືກພັບໄວ້. ເບິ່ງ [method fold_line]."

msgid ""
"Joins all selected lines or lines containing a caret with their next line. "
"Whitespace in between will be removed. If the next line has content, the "
"[param line_ending] will be inserted in between."
msgstr ""
"ລວມບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ບັນທັດທີ່ມີເຄີເຊີເຂົ້າກັບບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປ. ຍະຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງກາງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. "
"ຖ້າບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປມີເນື້ອໃນ, [param line_ending] ຈະຖືກແຊກໄວ້ລະຫວ່າງກາງ."

msgid "Moves all lines down that are selected or have a caret on them."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່ລົງລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Moves all lines up that are selected or have a caret on them."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່ຂຶ້ນເທິງ."

msgid "Removes the comment delimiter with [param start_key]."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍດ້ວຍ [param start_key]."

msgid "Removes the string delimiter with [param start_key]."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param start_key]."

msgid ""
"Emits [signal code_completion_requested], if [param force] is [code]true[/"
"code] will bypass all checks. Otherwise will check that the caret is in a "
"word or in front of a prefix. Will ignore the request if all current options "
"are of type file path, node path, or signal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal code_completion_requested], ຖ້າ [param force] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຈະຂ້າມການກວດສອບທັງໝົດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະກວດສອບວ່າເຄີເຊີຢູ່ໃນຄຳສັບ ຫຼື ຢູ່ໜ້າຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix) ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່. ຈະປະຕິເສດການຮ້ອງຂໍຖ້າຕົວເລືອກປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດເປັນປະເພດເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file path), ເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ "
"(node path), ຫຼື ສັນຍານ."

msgid "Sets the current selected completion option."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Sets the code hint text. Pass an empty string to clear."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຂໍ້ຄວາມແນະນຳໂຄດ (code hint). ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າເພື່ອລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the code hint will draw below the main caret. If "
"[code]false[/code], the code hint will draw above the main caret. See [method "
"set_code_hint]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແນະນຳໂຄດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມເຄີເຊີຫຼັກ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code], ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງເຄີເຊີຫຼັກ. ເບິ່ງ [method set_code_hint]."

msgid "Sets the code region start and end tags (without comment delimiter)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແທັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດໂຄດ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the given line as bookmarked. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_bookmarks] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item bookmark] "
"icon in the gutter for this line. See [method get_bookmarked_lines] and "
"[method is_line_bookmarked]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນບຸກມາກ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member "
"gutters_draw_bookmarks] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມໄອຄອນ [theme_item "
"bookmark] ໃນສ່ວນຂອບ (gutter) ສຳລັບບັນທັດນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method get_bookmarked_lines] ແລະ "
"[method is_line_bookmarked]."

msgid ""
"Sets the given line as a breakpoint. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_breakpoints_gutter] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item "
"breakpoint] icon in the gutter for this line. See [method "
"get_breakpointed_lines] and [method is_line_breakpointed]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນຈຸດຢຸດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member "
"gutters_draw_breakpoints_gutter] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມໄອຄອນ "
"[theme_item breakpoint] ໃນສ່ວນຂອບສຳລັບບັນທັດນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_breakpointed_lines] ແລະ [method is_line_breakpointed]."

msgid ""
"Sets the given line as executing. If [code]true[/code] and [member "
"gutters_draw_executing_lines] is [code]true[/code], draws the [theme_item "
"executing_line] icon in the gutter for this line. See [method "
"get_executing_lines] and [method is_line_executing]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເປັນບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ [member "
"gutters_draw_executing_lines] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມໄອຄອນ [theme_item "
"executing_line] ໃນສ່ວນຂອບສຳລັບບັນທັດນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method get_executing_lines] ແລະ "
"[method is_line_executing]."

msgid "Sets the symbol emitted by [signal symbol_validate] as a valid lookup."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງສັນຍາລັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ [signal symbol_validate] ເປັນການຄົ້ນຫາ (lookup) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Toggle the folding of the code block at the given line."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບການພັບຂອງບລັອກໂຄດຢູ່ບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Toggle the folding of the code block on all lines with a caret on them."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບການພັບຂອງບລັອກໂຄດໃນທຸກບັນທັດທີ່ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່."

msgid "Unfolds all lines that are folded."
msgstr "ຄາຍການພັບຂອງທຸກບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກພັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Unfolds the given line if it is folded or if it is hidden under a folded line."
msgstr "ຄາຍການພັບຂອງບັນທັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ຖ້າມັນຖືກພັບຢູ່ ຫຼື ຖ້າມັນຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃຕ້ບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກພັບ."

msgid ""
"Unindents all lines that are selected or have a caret on them. Uses spaces or "
"a tab depending on [member indent_use_spaces]. Equivalent to the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_text_dedent] action. See [method indent_lines]."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າບັນທັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ມີເຄີເຊີຢູ່. ໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ແຖບ ຂຶ້ນກັບ [member "
"indent_use_spaces]. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການກະທຳ [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_text_dedent]. ເບິ່ງ [method indent_lines]."

msgid ""
"Submits all completion options added with [method "
"add_code_completion_option]. Will try to force the autocomplete menu to "
"popup, if [param force] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will replace all current candidates."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດທັງໝົດທີ່ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍ [method add_code_completion_option]. "
"ຈະພະຍາຍາມບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເມນູເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ ຖ້າ [param force] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ຈະແທນທີ່ລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [member auto_brace_completion_pairs] to "
"automatically insert the closing brace when the opening brace is inserted by "
"typing or autocompletion. Also automatically removes the closing brace when "
"using backspace on the opening brace."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ [member auto_brace_completion_pairs] "
"ເພື່ອແຊກວົງເລັບປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການໃສ່ວົງເລັບເປີດໂດຍການພິມ ຫຼື ການເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຈະລຶບວົງເລັບປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໃຊ້ backspace ລຶບວົງເລັບເປີດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights brace pairs when the caret is on either one, "
"using [member auto_brace_completion_pairs]. If matching, the pairs will be "
"underlined. If a brace is unmatched, it is colored with [theme_item "
"brace_mismatch_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໄຮໄລ້ຄູ່ວົງເລັບເມື່ອເຄີເຊີຢູ່ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"auto_brace_completion_pairs]. ຖ້າມັນກົງກັນ, ຄູ່ວົງເລັບຈະຖືກຂີດກ້ອງ. ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ກົງກັນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກໃສ່ສີດ້ວຍ [theme_item brace_mismatch_color]."

msgid ""
"Sets the brace pairs to be autocompleted. For each entry in the dictionary, "
"the key is the opening brace and the value is the closing brace that matches "
"it. A brace is a [String] made of symbols. See [member "
"auto_brace_completion_enabled] and [member "
"auto_brace_completion_highlight_matching]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄູ່ວົງເລັບທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນ dictionary, ຄີ (key) ແມ່ນວົງເລັບເປີດ "
"ແລະ ຄ່າ (value) ແມ່ນວົງເລັບປິດທີ່ກົງກັບມັນ. ວົງເລັບແມ່ນ [String] ທີ່ສ້າງມາຈາກສັນຍາລັກ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member auto_brace_completion_enabled] ແລະ [member "
"auto_brace_completion_highlight_matching]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_text_completion_query] action requests code completion. To handle it, see "
"[method _request_code_completion] or [signal code_completion_requested]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການກະທຳ [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_text_completion_query] ຈະຮ້ອງຂໍການເຕີມໂຄດ. ເພື່ອຈັດການມັນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method "
"_request_code_completion] ຫຼື [signal code_completion_requested]."

msgid "Sets prefixes that will trigger code completion."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefixes) ທີ່ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the comment delimiters. All existing comment delimiters will be removed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຄຳອະທິບາຍ. ຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the string delimiters. All existing string delimiters will be removed."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], bookmarks are drawn in the gutter. This gutter is "
"shared with breakpoints and executing lines. See [method "
"set_line_as_bookmarked]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບຸກມາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບ (gutter). ສ່ວນຂອບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຈຸດຢຸດ "
"ແລະ ບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ. ເບິ່ງ [method set_line_as_bookmarked]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], breakpoints are drawn in the gutter. This gutter is "
"shared with bookmarks and executing lines. Clicking the gutter will toggle "
"the breakpoint for the line, see [method set_line_as_breakpoint]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoints) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບ. "
"ສ່ວນຂອບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບບຸກມາກ ແລະ ບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ. "
"ການກົດທີ່ສ່ວນຂອບຈະເປັນການສະຫຼັບການຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຸດສຳລັບບັນທັດນັ້ນ, ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_line_as_breakpoint]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], executing lines are marked in the gutter. This gutter "
"is shared with breakpoints and bookmarks. See [method set_line_as_executing]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຈະຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນຂອບ. "
"ສ່ວນຂອບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຈຸດຢຸດ ແລະ ບຸກມາກ. ເບິ່ງ [method set_line_as_executing]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the fold gutter is drawn. In this gutter, the "
"[theme_item can_fold_code_region] icon is drawn for each foldable line (see "
"[method can_fold_line]) and the [theme_item folded_code_region] icon is drawn "
"for each folded line (see [method is_line_folded]). These icons can be "
"clicked to toggle the fold state, see [method toggle_foldable_line]. [member "
"line_folding] must be [code]true[/code] to show icons."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນຂອບສຳລັບການພັບຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. ໃນສ່ວນຂອບນີ້, ໄອຄອນ [theme_item "
"can_fold_code_region] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບັນທັດທີ່ພັບໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [method can_fold_line]) "
"ແລະ ໄອຄອນ [theme_item folded_code_region] ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກພັບໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method is_line_folded]). ໄອຄອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບສະຖານະການພັບໄດ້, ເບິ່ງ [method "
"toggle_foldable_line]. [member line_folding] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງໄອຄອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the line number gutter is drawn. Line numbers start at "
"[code]1[/code] and are incremented for each line of text. Clicking and "
"dragging in the line number gutter will select entire lines of text."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສ່ວນຂອບເລກບັນທັດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມ. ເລກບັນທັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ [code]1[/code] "
"ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະບັນທັດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ການກົດ ແລະ "
"ລາກໃນສ່ວນຂອບເລກບັນທັດຈະເປັນການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງບັນທັດ."

msgid "The minimum width in digits reserved for the line number gutter."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂັ້ນຕ່ຳໃນຮູບແບບຈຳນວນຫຼັກທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ສຳລັບສ່ວນຂອບເລກບັນທັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], line numbers drawn in the gutter are zero padded based "
"on the total line count. Requires [member gutters_draw_line_numbers] to be "
"set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ເລກບັນທັດທີ່ແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍເລກສູນນຳໜ້າໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນບັນທັດທັງໝົດ. ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member gutters_draw_line_numbers] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], an extra indent is automatically inserted when a new "
"line is added and a prefix in [member indent_automatic_prefixes] is found. If "
"a brace pair opening key is found, the matching closing brace will be moved "
"to another new line (see [member auto_brace_completion_pairs])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າພິເສດຈະຖືກແຊກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມບັນທັດໃໝ່ ແລະ "
"ພົບຄຳນຳໜ້າໃນ [member indent_automatic_prefixes]. ຖ້າພົບຄີເປີດວົງເລັບ, "
"ວົງເລັບປິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປບັນທັດໃໝ່ອີກບັນທັດໜຶ່ງ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"auto_brace_completion_pairs])."

msgid ""
"Prefixes to trigger an automatic indent. Used when [member indent_automatic] "
"is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນຳໜ້າທີ່ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member indent_automatic] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Size of the tabulation indent (one [kbd]Tab[/kbd] press) in characters. If "
"[member indent_use_spaces] is enabled the number of spaces to use."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າດ້ວຍແຖບ (ການກົດ [kbd]Tab[/kbd] ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ) ໃນຮູບແບບຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນ. ຖ້າ "
"[member indent_use_spaces] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ຈະເປັນຈຳນວນຍະຫວ່າງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs for indentation."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຍະຫວ່າງແທນແຖບສຳລັບການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lines can be folded. Otherwise, line folding methods "
"like [method fold_line] will not work and [method can_fold_line] will always "
"return [code]false[/code]. See [member gutters_draw_fold_gutter]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ບັນທັດຈະສາມາດພັບໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມທອດການພັບບັນທັດເຊັ່ນ [method "
"fold_line] ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ [method can_fold_line] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ສະເໝີ. ເບິ່ງ [member gutters_draw_fold_gutter]."

msgid ""
"Draws vertical lines at the provided columns. The first entry is considered a "
"main hard guideline and is drawn more prominently."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນແນວຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ຄໍລຳ (column) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ລາຍການທຳອິດຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນເສັ້ນແນະນຳຫຼັກ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃຫ້ໂດດເດັ່ນກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Set when a validated word from [signal symbol_validate] is clicked, the "
"[signal symbol_lookup] should be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າເມື່ອມີການກົດຄຳສັບທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບແລ້ວຈາກ [signal symbol_validate], ຄວນຈະມີການສົ່ງສັນຍານ "
"[signal symbol_lookup] ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [signal symbol_hovered] signal is emitted when "
"hovering over a word."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສັນຍານ [signal symbol_hovered] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເອົາເຄີເຊີໄປວາງເທິງຄຳສັບ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a breakpoint is added or removed from a line. If the line is "
"removed via backspace, a signal is emitted at the old line."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ອອກຈາກບັນທັດ. ຖ້າບັນທັດຖືກລຶບຜ່ານ "
"backspace, ສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາທີ່ບັນທັດເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user requests code completion. This signal will not be sent "
"if [method _request_code_completion] is overridden or [member "
"code_completion_enabled] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍການເຕີມໂຄດ. ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຖ້າ [method "
"_request_code_completion] ຖືກຂຽນທັບ ຫຼື [member code_completion_enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user hovers over a symbol. Unlike [signal "
"Control.mouse_entered], this signal is not emitted immediately, but when the "
"cursor is over the symbol for [member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/"
"tooltip_delay_sec] seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member symbol_tooltip_on_hover] must be [code]true[/code] for "
"this signal to be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເຄີເຊີເທິງສັນຍາລັກ. ຕ່າງຈາກ [signal Control.mouse_entered], "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາທັນທີ, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີວາງຢູ່ເທິງສັນຍາລັກເປັນເວລາຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/tooltip_delay_sec] ວິນາທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member symbol_tooltip_on_hover] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັນຍານນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ."

msgid "Emitted when the user has clicked on a valid symbol."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດທີ່ສັນຍາລັກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user hovers over a symbol. The symbol should be validated "
"and responded to, by calling [method set_symbol_lookup_word_as_valid].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member symbol_lookup_on_click] must be [code]true[/code] for "
"this signal to be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເຄີເຊີເທິງສັນຍາລັກ. ສັນຍາລັກຄວນຖືກກວດສອບ ແລະ ຕອບສະໜອງໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method set_symbol_lookup_word_as_valid].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member symbol_lookup_on_click] ຕ້ອງເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັນຍານນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ."

msgid "Marks the option as a class."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນຄລາດ (class)."

msgid "Marks the option as a function."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນຟັງຊັນ (function)."

msgid "Marks the option as a Godot signal."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນສັນຍານ (signal) ຂອງ Godot."

msgid "Marks the option as a variable."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນ (variable)."

msgid "Marks the option as a member."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນສະມາຊິກ (member)."

msgid "Marks the option as an enum entry."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນລາຍການ enum."

msgid "Marks the option as a constant."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant)."

msgid "Marks the option as a Godot node path."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (node path) ຂອງ Godot."

msgid "Marks the option as a file path."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file path)."

msgid "Marks the option as unclassified or plain text."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນແບບບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດປະເພດ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ."

msgid "Marks the option as a keyword."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕົວເລືອກເປັນຄຳສະເພາະ (keyword)."

msgid ""
"The option is local to the location of the code completion query - e.g. a "
"local variable. Subsequent value of location represent options from the outer "
"class, the exact value represent how far they are (in terms of inner classes)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນຢູ່ພາຍໃນ (local) ກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງການສອບຖາມການເຕີມໂຄດ - ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕົວປ່ຽນພາຍໃນ. "
"ຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປຂອງ location ຈະສະແດງເຖິງຕົວເລືອກຈາກຄລາດພາຍນອກ, "
"ຄ່າທີ່ແນ່ນອນຈະສະແດງເຖິງໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງພວກມັນ (ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຄລາດພາຍໃນ)."

msgid ""
"The option is from the containing class or a parent class, relative to the "
"location of the code completion query. Perform a bitwise OR with the class "
"depth (e.g. [code]0[/code] for the local class, [code]1[/code] for the "
"parent, [code]2[/code] for the grandparent, etc.) to store the depth of an "
"option in the class or a parent class."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນມາຈາກຄລາດທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່ ຫຼື ຄລາດແມ່, ທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງການສອບຖາມການເຕີມໂຄດ. ປະມວນຜົນ "
"bitwise OR ກັບຄວາມເລິກຂອງຄລາດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]0[/code] ສຳລັບຄລາດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, [code]1[/"
"code] ສຳລັບຄລາດແມ່, [code]2[/code] ສຳລັບຄລາດປູ່ຍ່າ, ແລະອື່ນໆ) "
"ເພື່ອເກັບຮັກສາຄວາມເລິກຂອງຕົວເລືອກໃນຄລາດ ຫຼື ຄລາດແມ່."

msgid ""
"The option is from user code which is not local and not in a derived class "
"(e.g. Autoload Singletons)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນມາຈາກໂຄດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນຄລາດທີ່ສືບທອດມາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"Autoload Singletons)."

msgid ""
"The option is from other engine code, not covered by the other enum constants "
"- e.g. built-in classes."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນມາຈາກໂຄດເອນຈິນອື່ນໆ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຄອບຄຸມໂດຍຄ່າຄົງທີ່ enum ອື່ນ - ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຄລາດທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບລະບົບ (built-in classes)."

msgid "[Color] of the bookmark icon for bookmarked lines."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງໄອຄອນບຸກມາກສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ຕັ້ງບຸກມາກໄວ້."

msgid "[Color] of the text to highlight mismatched braces."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອໄຮໄລ້ຄູ່ວົງເລັບທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid "[Color] of the breakpoint icon for bookmarked lines."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງໄອຄອນຈຸດຢຸດສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຸດໄວ້."

msgid "[Color] for all icons related to line folding."
msgstr "[Color] ສຳລັບທຸກໄອຄອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການພັບບັນທັດ."

msgid "Sets the background [Color] for the code completion popup."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Color] ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບປັອບອັບ (popup) ການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"Background highlight [Color] for matching text in code completion options."
msgstr "[Color] ໄຮໄລ້ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນໃນຕົວເລືອກການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid "[Color] of the scrollbar in the code completion popup."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ (scrollbar) ໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid "[Color] of the scrollbar in the code completion popup when hovered."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດເມື່ອມີເຄີເຊີວາງຢູ່ເທິງ."

msgid ""
"Background highlight [Color] for the current selected option item in the code "
"completion popup."
msgstr "[Color] ໄຮໄລ້ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບລາຍການຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid "[Color] of the executing icon for executing lines."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງໄອຄອນປະມວນຜົນສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "[Color] of background line highlight for folded code region."
msgstr "[Color] ຂອງໄຮໄລ້ບັນທັດພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຂອບເຂດໂຄດທີ່ຖືກພັບ."

msgid ""
"[Color] of the main line length guideline, secondary guidelines will have 50% "
"alpha applied."
msgstr ""
"[Color] ຂອງເສັ້ນແນະນຳຄວາມຍາວບັນທັດຫຼັກ, ເສັ້ນແນະນຳຮອງຈະມີການໃຊ້ຄ່າອັລຟາ (alpha) 50%."

msgid "Sets the [Color] of line numbers."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Color] ຂອງເລກບັນທັດ."

msgid ""
"Max number of options to display in the code completion popup at any one time."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Max width of options in the code completion popup. Options longer than this "
"will be cut off."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດຂອງຕົວເລືອກໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດ. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຍາວກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກ."

msgid "Width of the scrollbar in the code completion popup."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນໃນປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the bookmark gutter for bookmarked lines."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບບຸກມາກສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ຕັ້ງບຸກມາກໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the breakpoint gutter for breakpointed "
"lines."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບຈຸດຢຸດສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຸດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a line can "
"be folded."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບການພັບບັນທັດເມື່ອບັນທັດນັ້ນພັບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a code "
"region can be folded."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບການພັບບັນທັດເມື່ອຂອບເຂດໂຄດນັ້ນພັບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Background panel for the color preview box in autocompletion (visible when "
"the color is translucent)."
msgstr "ແຜງພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຊ່ອງສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສີໃນການເຕີມອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອສີມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ)."

msgid "Icon to draw in the executing gutter for executing lines."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບການປະມວນຜົນສຳລັບບັນທັດທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a line is "
"folded and can be unfolded."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບການພັບບັນທັດເມື່ອບັນທັດຖືກພັບ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຄາຍການພັບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw in the line folding gutter when a code "
"region is folded and can be unfolded."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມໃນສ່ວນຂອບການພັບບັນທັດເມື່ອຂອບເຂດໂຄດຖືກພັບ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຄາຍການພັບໄດ້."

msgid "Sets a custom [Texture2D] to draw at the end of a folded line."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແຕ້ມຢູ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງບັນທັດທີ່ຖືກພັບ."

msgid "[StyleBox] for the code completion popup."
msgstr "[StyleBox] ສຳລັບປັອບອັບການເຕີມໂຄດ."

msgid "A syntax highlighter intended for code."
msgstr "ຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ (syntax highlighter) ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບໂຄດ."

msgid ""
"By adjusting various properties of this resource, you can change the colors "
"of strings, comments, numbers, and other text patterns inside a [TextEdit] "
"control."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍການປັບຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource) ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນສີຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ, "
"ຕົວເລກ ແລະ ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນໆ ພາຍໃນຕົວຄວບຄຸມ [TextEdit]."

msgid ""
"Adds a color region (such as for comments or strings) from [param start_key] "
"to [param end_key]. Both keys should be symbols, and [param start_key] must "
"not be shared with other delimiters.\n"
"If [param line_only] is [code]true[/code] or [param end_key] is an empty "
"[String], the region does not carry over to the next line."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຂອບເຂດສີ (ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ) ຈາກ [param start_key] ຫາ [param "
"end_key]. ທັງສອງຄີຄວນເປັນສັນຍາລັກ, ແລະ [param start_key] "
"ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວກຳນົດຂອບເຂດອື່ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param line_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຫຼື [param end_key] ເປັນ [String] "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຂອບເຂດນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໄປຫາບັນທັດຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the color for a keyword.\n"
"The keyword cannot contain any symbols except '_'."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບຄຳສະເພາະ (keyword).\n"
"ຄຳສະເພາະບໍ່ສາມາດມີສັນຍາລັກໃດໆ ຍົກເວັ້ນ '_'."

msgid ""
"Sets the color for a member keyword.\n"
"The member keyword cannot contain any symbols except '_'.\n"
"It will not be highlighted if preceded by a '.'."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກ (member keyword).\n"
"ຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກບໍ່ສາມາດມີສັນຍາລັກໃດໆ ຍົກເວັ້ນ '_'.\n"
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເນັ້ນສີຖ້າຫາກນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ '.'."

msgid "Removes all color regions."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຂອບເຂດສີອອກ."

msgid "Removes all keywords."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຄຳສະເພາະອອກ."

msgid "Removes all member keywords."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກອອກ."

msgid "Returns the color for a keyword."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີສຳລັບຄຳສະເພາະ."

msgid "Returns the color for a member keyword."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີສຳລັບຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the start key exists, else [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the keyword exists, else [code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄຳສະເພາະຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the member keyword exists, else [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Removes the color region that uses that start key."
msgstr "ລຶບຂອບເຂດສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນັ້ນອອກ."

msgid "Removes the keyword."
msgstr "ລຶບຄຳສະເພາະອອກ."

msgid "Removes the member keyword."
msgstr "ລຶບຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກອອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the color regions. All existing regions will be removed. The "
"[Dictionary] key is the region start and end key, separated by a space. The "
"value is the region color."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບເຂດສີ. ທຸກຂອບເຂດທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. ຄີຂອງ [Dictionary] ແມ່ນຄີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຂອບເຂດ ເຊິ່ງແຍກກັນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ. ສ່ວນຄ່າແມ່ນສີຂອງຂອບເຂດນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets color for functions. A function is a non-keyword string followed by a "
"'('."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບຟັງຊັນ. ຟັງຊັນແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳສະເພາະ ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍ '('."

msgid ""
"Sets the keyword colors. All existing keywords will be removed. The "
"[Dictionary] key is the keyword. The value is the keyword color."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງຄຳສະເພາະ. ທຸກຄຳສະເພາະທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. ຄີຂອງ [Dictionary] ແມ່ນຄຳສະເພາະ. "
"ສ່ວນຄ່າແມ່ນສີຂອງຄຳສະເພາະນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the member keyword colors. All existing member keyword will be removed. "
"The [Dictionary] key is the member keyword. The value is the member keyword "
"color."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກ. ທຸກຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. ຄີຂອງ [Dictionary] "
"ແມ່ນຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກ. ສ່ວນຄ່າແມ່ນສີຂອງຄຳສະເພາະສະມາຊິກນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets color for member variables. A member variable is non-keyword, non-"
"function string proceeded with a '.'."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ. ຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳສະເພາະ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນ ແລະ ນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ "
"'.'."

msgid "Sets the color for numbers."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບຕົວເລກ."

msgid "Sets the color for symbols."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີສຳລັບສັນຍາລັກ."

msgid "Abstract base class for 2D physics objects."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 2D physics objects. [CollisionObject2D] can hold any "
"number of [Shape2D]s for collision. Each shape must be assigned to a [i]shape "
"owner[/i]. Shape owners are not nodes and do not appear in the editor, but "
"are accessible through code using the [code]shape_owner_*[/code] methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only collisions between objects within the same canvas "
"([Viewport] canvas or [CanvasLayer]) are supported. The behavior of "
"collisions between objects in different canvases is undefined."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳສຳລັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D. [CollisionObject2D] ສາມາດບັນຈຸ [Shape2D] "
"ເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ [i]ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ (shape owner)[/i]. "
"ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງບໍ່ແມ່ນໂນດ ແລະ ບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານໂຄດໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]shape_owner_*[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການຕຳກັນລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຄນວາສ (canvas) ດຽວກັນ "
"([Viewport] canvas ຫຼື [CanvasLayer]). "
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງການຕຳກັນລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່າງແຄນວາສກັນແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Accepts unhandled [InputEvent]s. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the "
"clicked [Shape2D]. Connect to [signal input_event] to easily pick up these "
"events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _input_event] requires [member input_pickable] to be "
"[code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [InputEvent] ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການ. [param shape_idx] ແມ່ນລຳດັບລູກຂອງ [Shape2D] "
"ທີ່ຖືກກົດ. ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ [signal input_event] ເພື່ອຮັບເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດ [method _input_event] ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີບິດ (bit) ຂອງ [member collision_layer] "
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າ (mouse pointer) ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"input_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] "
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ດຽວກັນ ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject2D] ດຽວກັນ "
"ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes or moves "
"from one shape to another. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the newly "
"entered [Shape2D]. Requires [member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] "
"and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍຈາກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ. [param "
"shape_idx] ແມ່ນລຳດັບລູກຂອງ [Shape2D] ທີ່ຫາກໍເຂົ້າໄປ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] "
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits any of this object's shapes. [param "
"shape_idx] is the child index of the exited [Shape2D]. Requires [member "
"input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. [param shape_idx] ແມ່ນລຳດັບລູກຂອງ "
"[Shape2D] ທີ່ອອກມາ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງມີບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member collision_layer] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າເລເຢີ (layer) ທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່, ໂດຍກຳນົດ "
"[param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member collision_mask] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າເລເຢີທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [member collision_mask] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່, ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param "
"layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid "Returns the object's [RID]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [RID] ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by the given [param owner_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"owner_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by given [param owner_id]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"owner_id]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [code]owner_id[/code] identifiers. You can use these "
"ids in other methods that take [code]owner_id[/code] as an argument."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງຕົວລະບຸ [code]owner_id[/code]. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ID ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນເມທອດອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຮັບ "
"[code]owner_id[/code] ເປັນອາກິວເມນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the shape owner and its shapes are disabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງຂອງມັນຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if collisions for the shape owner originating from "
"this [CollisionObject2D] will not be reported to collided with "
"[CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຕຳກັນສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ມາຈາກ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລາຍງານໃຫ້ກັບ [CollisionObject2D] ທີ່ຖືກຕຳ."

msgid "Removes the given shape owner."
msgstr "ລຶບເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member collision_layer], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມ [param value], ຈະເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານເລເຢີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member collision_layer], "
"ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member collision_mask], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມ [param value], ຈະເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານເລເຢີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member collision_mask], "
"ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid "Returns the [code]owner_id[/code] of the given shape."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]owner_id[/code] ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Adds a [Shape2D] to the shape owner."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [Shape2D] ເຂົ້າໃນເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Removes all shapes from the shape owner."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຮູບຊົງອອກຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Returns the parent object of the given shape owner."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸແມ່ (parent object) ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the [Shape2D] with the given ID from the given shape owner."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Shape2D] ທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the number of shapes the given shape owner contains."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຮູບຊົງທີ່ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງນັ້ນບັນຈຸຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the child index of the [Shape2D] with the given ID from the given "
"shape owner."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບລູກ (child index) ຂອງ [Shape2D] ທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the shape owner's [Transform2D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Removes a shape from the given shape owner."
msgstr "ລຶບຮູບຊົງອອກຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], disables the given shape owner."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"If [param enable] is [code]true[/code], collisions for the shape owner "
"originating from this [CollisionObject2D] will not be reported to collided "
"with [CollisionObject2D]s."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຕຳກັນສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ມາຈາກ "
"[CollisionObject2D] ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລາຍງານໃຫ້ກັບ [CollisionObject2D] ທີ່ຖືກຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] of the shape owner "
"identified by the given [param owner_id] to [param direction]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]one_way_collision_direction[/code] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"owner_id] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param direction]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] of the shape owner identified "
"by given [param owner_id] to [param margin] pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [code]one_way_collision_margin[/code] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"owner_id] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param margin] ພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Sets the [Transform2D] of the given shape owner."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform2D] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject2D is in. Collision objects can exist "
"in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຢີຟີຊິກທີ່ CollisionObject2D ນີ້ຢູ່. ວັດຖຸການຕຳກັນສາມາດຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 1 ຫາ 32 "
"ເລເຢີ. ເບິ່ງ [member collision_mask] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກວດສອບ (scan). ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject2D scans. Collision objects can scan "
"one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຢີຟີຊິກທີ່ CollisionObject2D ນີ້ກວດສອບ (scan). "
"ວັດຖຸການຕຳກັນສາມາດກວດສອບເລເຢີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 1 ຫາ 32 ເລເຢີ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກວດສອບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The priority used to solve colliding when occurring penetration. The higher "
"the priority is, the lower the penetration into the object will be. This can "
"for example be used to prevent the player from breaking through the "
"boundaries of a level."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (priority) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແກ້ໄຂການຕຳກັນເມື່ອເກີດການແຊກຊຶມ (penetration). "
"ຍິ່ງລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງເທົ່າໃດ, ການແຊກຊຶມເຂົ້າໄປໃນວັດຖຸກໍຈະຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນທະລຸຜ່ານຂອບເຂດຂອງດ່ານ."

msgid ""
"Defines the behavior in physics when [member Node.process_mode] is set to "
"[constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳໃນທາງຟີຊິກເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this object is pickable. A pickable object can detect "
"the mouse pointer entering/leaving, and if the mouse is inside it, report "
"input events. Requires at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ວັດຖຸນີ້ຈະສາມາດຖືກເລືອກໄດ້ (pickable). "
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄດ້ສາມາດກວດພົບເຄີເຊີເມົ້າທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ ຫຼື ອອກໄປ, ແລະ ຖ້າເມົ້າຢູ່ພາຍໃນວັດຖຸ, "
"ມັນຈະລາຍງານເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input events). ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when an input event occurs. Requires [member input_pickable] to be "
"[code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set. "
"See [method _input_event] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method _input_event] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this signal to be emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject2D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject2D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject2D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສັນຍານນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ຖ້າເມົ້າຍ້າຍໄວພໍ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເຊັ່ນກັນ ຖ້າມີ [CollisionObject2D] ອື່ນຊ້ອນທັບກັບ "
"[CollisionObject2D] ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject2D] won't cause this signal to be emitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject2D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject2D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject2D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສັນຍານນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ຖ້າເມົ້າຍ້າຍໄວພໍ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ [CollisionObject2D] "
"ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເຊັ່ນກັນ ຖ້າມີ [CollisionObject2D] ອື່ນຊ້ອນທັບກັບ "
"[CollisionObject2D] ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes or moves "
"from one shape to another. [param shape_idx] is the child index of the newly "
"entered [Shape2D]. Requires [member input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] "
"and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍຈາກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກຮູບຊົງໜຶ່ງ. "
"[param shape_idx] ແມ່ນລຳດັບລູກຂອງ [Shape2D] ທີ່ຫາກໍເຂົ້າໄປ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"input_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits any of this object's shapes. [param "
"shape_idx] is the child index of the exited [Shape2D]. Requires [member "
"input_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. [param shape_idx] ແມ່ນລຳດັບລູກຂອງ "
"[Shape2D] ທີ່ອອກມາ. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [CollisionObject2D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is processed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະລຶບອອກຈາກການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກເພື່ອຢຸດການໂຕ້ຕອບທາງຟີຊິກທັງໝົດກັບ [CollisionObject2D] ນີ້.\n"
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມກັບເຂົ້າໄປໃນການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], make the body static. Doesn't affect [Area2D]. "
"[PhysicsBody2D] can't be affected by forces or other bodies while static.\n"
"Automatically set [PhysicsBody2D] back to its original mode when the [Node] "
"is processed again."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸເປັນແບບຢູ່ກັບທີ່ (static). ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Area2D]. [PhysicsBody2D] "
"ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແຮງ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ກັບທີ່.\n"
"ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [PhysicsBody2D] ກັບຄືນສູ່ໂໝດເດີມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], do not affect the physics simulation."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກ."

msgid "Abstract base class for 3D physics objects."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 3D physics objects. [CollisionObject3D] can hold any "
"number of [Shape3D]s for collision. Each shape must be assigned to a [i]shape "
"owner[/i]. Shape owners are not nodes and do not appear in the editor, but "
"are accessible through code using the [code]shape_owner_*[/code] methods.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] With a non-uniform scale, this node will likely not behave as "
"expected. It is advised to keep its scale the same on all axes and adjust its "
"collision shape(s) instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳສຳລັບວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D. [CollisionObject3D] ສາມາດບັນຈຸ [Shape3D] "
"ເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ [i]ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ (shape owner)[/i]. "
"ເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງບໍ່ແມ່ນໂນດ ແລະ ບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານໂຄດໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]shape_owner_*[/code].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຖ້າມີການປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ທີ່ບໍ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ, "
"ໂນດນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮັກສາຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນໃນທຸກແກນ ແລະ "
"ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Receives unhandled [InputEvent]s. [param event_position] is the location in "
"world space of the mouse pointer on the surface of the shape with index "
"[param shape_idx] and [param normal] is the normal vector of the surface at "
"that point. Connect to the [signal input_event] signal to easily pick up "
"these events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _input_event] requires [member input_ray_pickable] to be "
"[code]true[/code] and at least one [member collision_layer] bit to be set."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [InputEvent] ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການ. [param event_position] ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກ "
"(world space) ຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເທິງພື້ນຜິວຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີລຳດັບ [param shape_idx] ແລະ [param "
"normal] ແມ່ນເວກເຕີແນວສາກ (normal vector) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ. ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາສັນຍານ [signal "
"input_event] ເພື່ອຮັບເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດ [method _input_event] ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"input_ray_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject3D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_ray_pickable] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject3D] "
"ດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Called when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set. Note that moving between different shapes "
"within a single [CollisionObject3D] won't cause this function to be called."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member input_ray_pickable] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ [CollisionObject3D] "
"ດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid "Adds a [Shape3D] to the shape owner."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [Shape3D] ເຂົ້າໃນເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Returns the [Shape3D] with the given ID from the given shape owner."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Shape3D] ທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the child index of the [Shape3D] with the given ID from the given "
"shape owner."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລຳດັບລູກ (child index) ຂອງ [Shape3D] ທີ່ມີ ID ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຈາກເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the shape owner's [Transform3D]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform3D] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "Sets the [Transform3D] of the given shape owner."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Transform3D] ຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject3D [b]is in[/b]. Collision objects can "
"exist in one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member "
"collision_mask].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຢີຟີຊິກທີ່ CollisionObject3D ນີ້ [b]ຢູ່[/b]. ວັດຖຸການຕຳກັນສາມາດຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ "
"1 ຫາ 32 ເລເຢີ. ເບິ່ງ [member collision_mask] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກວດສອບ (scan). ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this CollisionObject3D [b]scans[/b]. Collision objects can "
"scan one or more of 32 different layers. See also [member collision_layer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Object A can detect a contact with object B only if object B is "
"in any of the layers that object A scans. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຢີຟີຊິກທີ່ CollisionObject3D ນີ້ [b]ກວດສອບ (scan)[/b]. "
"ວັດຖຸການຕຳກັນສາມາດກວດສອບເລເຢີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 1 ຫາ 32 ເລເຢີ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ວັດຖຸ A ສາມາດກວດພົບການສຳຜັດກັບວັດຖຸ B ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຢີໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ວັດຖຸ A "
"ກວດສອບ. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [CollisionObject3D] will continue to receive input "
"events as the mouse is dragged across its shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [CollisionObject3D] "
"ຈະສືບຕໍ່ຮັບເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ເມົ້າຖືກລາກຜ່ານຮູບຊົງຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the object receives an unhandled [InputEvent]. [param "
"event_position] is the location in world space of the mouse pointer on the "
"surface of the shape with index [param shape_idx] and [param normal] is the "
"normal vector of the surface at that point."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອວັດຖຸໄດ້ຮັບ [InputEvent] ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການ. [param event_position] "
"ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລກຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເທິງພື້ນຜິວຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີລຳດັບ [param shape_idx] ແລະ [param "
"normal] ແມ່ນເວກເຕີແນວສາກຂອງພື້ນຜິວຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer enters any of this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject3D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject3D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject3D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບຊົງໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"input_ray_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ຖ້າເມົ້າຍ້າຍໄວພໍ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ [CollisionObject3D] "
"ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເຊັ່ນກັນ ຖ້າມີ [CollisionObject3D] ອື່ນຊ້ອນທັບກັບ "
"[CollisionObject3D] ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse pointer exits all this object's shapes. Requires "
"[member input_ray_pickable] to be [code]true[/code] and at least one [member "
"collision_layer] bit to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lack of continuous collision detection, this signal "
"may not be emitted in the expected order if the mouse moves fast enough and "
"the [CollisionObject3D]'s area is small. This signal may also not be emitted "
"if another [CollisionObject3D] is overlapping the [CollisionObject3D] in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົ້າອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບຊົງຂອງວັດຖຸນີ້. ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ [member "
"input_ray_pickable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງບິດຂອງ [member "
"collision_layer] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດການກວດສອບການຕຳກັນແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, "
"ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ຖ້າເມົ້າຍ້າຍໄວພໍ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ [CollisionObject3D] "
"ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ສັນຍານນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເຊັ່ນກັນ ຖ້າມີ [CollisionObject3D] ອື່ນຊ້ອນທັບກັບ "
"[CollisionObject3D] ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], remove from the physics simulation to stop all "
"physics interactions with this [CollisionObject3D].\n"
"Automatically re-added to the physics simulation when the [Node] is processed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະລຶບອອກຈາກການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກເພື່ອຢຸດການໂຕ້ຕອບທາງຟີຊິກທັງໝົດກັບ [CollisionObject3D] ນີ້.\n"
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມກັບເຂົ້າໄປໃນການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກຄັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"When [member Node.process_mode] is set to [constant "
"Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], make the body static. Doesn't affect [Area3D]. "
"[PhysicsBody3D] can't be affected by forces or other bodies while static.\n"
"Automatically set [PhysicsBody3D] back to its original mode when the [Node] "
"is processed again."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member Node.process_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Node.PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸເປັນແບບຢູ່ກັບທີ່ (static). ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Area3D]. [PhysicsBody3D] "
"ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກກະທົບໂດຍແຮງ ຫຼື ວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ກັບທີ່.\n"
"ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ [PhysicsBody3D] ກັບຄືນສູ່ໂໝດເດີມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ [Node] ຖືກປະມວນຜົນອີກຄັ້ງ."

msgid "A node that provides a polygon shape to a [CollisionObject2D] parent."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ (polygon) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject2D]."

msgid ""
"A node that provides a polygon shape to a [CollisionObject2D] parent and "
"allows it to be edited. The polygon can be concave or convex. This can give a "
"detection shape to an [Area2D], turn a [PhysicsBody2D] into a solid object, "
"or give a hollow shape to a [StaticBody2D].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionPolygon2D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its polygon instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject2D] ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. "
"ຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມສາມາດເປັນແບບຍຸບ (concave) ຫຼື ແບບໂນນ (convex). ນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຊົງການກວດພົບໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[Area2D], ປ່ຽນ [PhysicsBody2D] ໃຫ້ເປັນວັດຖຸແຂງ, ຫຼື ສ້າງຮູບຊົງແບບກວາງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[StaticBody2D].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] [CollisionPolygon2D] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ (scale) ແບບບໍ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮັກສາຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນໃນທຸກແກນ ແລະ "
"ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມແທນ."

msgid "Collision build mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການສ້າງການຕຳກັນ (Collision build mode)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], no collisions will be detected. This property should be "
"changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດພົບການຕຳກັນ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄວນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ [method "
"Object.set_deferred]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only edges that face up, relative to "
"[CollisionPolygon2D]'s rotation, will collide with other objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if this [CollisionPolygon2D] is a "
"child of an [Area2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The one way collision direction can be configured by setting "
"[member one_way_collision_direction]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຂອບທີ່ຫັນໜ້າຂຶ້ນເທິງ (ທຽບກັບການໝຸນຂອງ "
"[CollisionPolygon2D]) ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຕຳກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [CollisionPolygon2D] ນີ້ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດ [Area2D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທິດທາງການຕຳກັນແບບທາງດຽວສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດ [member "
"one_way_collision_direction]."

msgid "The direction used for one-way collision."
msgstr "ທິດທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນແບບທາງດຽວ (one-way collision)."

msgid ""
"The margin used for one-way collision (in pixels). Higher values will make "
"the shape thicker, and work better for colliders that enter the polygon at a "
"high velocity."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນແບບທາງດຽວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງໜາຂຶ້ນ "
"ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຂົ້າມາຕຳຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວສູງ."

msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices. Each point will be connected to the next, and "
"the final point will be connected to the first.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned vertices are in the local coordinate space of the "
"given [CollisionPolygon2D]."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ. ແຕ່ລະຈຸດຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາຈຸດຕໍ່ໄປ, ແລະ "
"ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາກັບຈຸດທຳອິດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຸດຍອດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local coordinate space) ຂອງ "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Collisions will include the polygon and its contained area. In this mode the "
"node has the same effect as several [ConvexPolygonShape2D] nodes, one for "
"each convex shape in the convex decomposition of the polygon (but without the "
"overhead of multiple nodes)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕຳກັນຈະລວມເອົາຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ພາຍໃນຂອງມັນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ໂນດຈະມີຜົນຄືກັບໂນດ "
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] ຫຼາຍໆ ໂນດລວມກັນ ໂດຍແບ່ງຕາມຮູບຊົງໂນນຂອງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ "
"(ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຄືກັບການມີຫຼາຍໂນດ)."

msgid ""
"Collisions will only include the polygon edges. In this mode the node has the "
"same effect as a single [ConcavePolygonShape2D] made of segments, with the "
"restriction that each segment (after the first one) starts where the previous "
"one ends, and the last one ends where the first one starts (forming a closed "
"but hollow polygon)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕຳກັນຈະລວມເອົາສະເພາະຂອບຂອງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ໂນດຈະມີຜົນຄືກັບໂນດ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] ອັນດຽວທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກເສັ້ນຊື່ຫຼາຍໆ ເສັ້ນຕໍ່ກັນ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນ "
"(ຫຼັງຈາກເສັ້ນທຳອິດ) ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບ່ອນທີ່ເສັ້ນກ່ອນໜ້າສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ແລະ ເສັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍຈະສິ້ນສຸດບ່ອນທີ່ເສັ້ນທຳອິດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"(ສ້າງເປັນຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມແບບປິດແຕ່ກວາງທາງໃນ)."

msgid ""
"A node that provides a thickened polygon shape (a prism) to a "
"[CollisionObject3D] parent."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມແບບມີຄວາມໜາ (ຊົງປະຣິຊຶມ) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"A node that provides a thickened polygon shape (a prism) to a "
"[CollisionObject3D] parent and allows it to be edited. The polygon can be "
"concave or convex. This can give a detection shape to an [Area3D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody3D] into a solid object.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionShape3D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its shape resource instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງຮູບຊົງຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມແບບມີຄວາມໜາ (ຊົງປະຣິຊຶມ) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject3D] ແລະ "
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມສາມາດເປັນແບບຍຸບ ຫຼື ແບບໂນນ. ນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຊົງການກວດພົບໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[Area3D] ຫຼື ປ່ຽນ [PhysicsBody3D] ໃຫ້ເປັນວັດຖຸແຂງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] [CollisionShape3D] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮັກສາຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນໃນທຸກແກນ ແລະ "
"ປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນຮູບຊົງແທນ."

msgid ""
"The collision shape color that is displayed in the editor, or in the running "
"project if [b]Debug > Visible Collision Shapes[/b] is checked at the top of "
"the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value is [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/"
"collision/shape_color]. The [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] value documented "
"here is a placeholder, and not the actual default debug color."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ ຖ້າຫາກເລືອກ [b]Debug > "
"Visible Collision Shapes[/b] ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [member ProjectSettings.debug/shapes/collision/"
"shape_color]. ຄ່າ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າສົມມຸດ "
"(placeholder), ບໍ່ແມ່ນສີ debug ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທ້ໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the shape is displayed, it will show a solid fill "
"color in addition to its wireframe."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອມີການສະແດງຮູບຊົງ, ມັນຈະສະແດງສີພື້ນຫຼັງແບບເຕັມ (solid fill) "
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກເສັ້ນໂຄງ (wireframe)."

msgid ""
"Length that the resulting collision extends in either direction perpendicular "
"to its 2D polygon."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວທີ່ການຕຳກັນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ 2D ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], no collision will be produced. This property should be "
"changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງການຕຳກັນ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄວນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ [method "
"Object.set_deferred]."

msgid ""
"The collision margin for the generated [Shape3D]. See [member Shape3D.margin] "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງການຕຳກັນ (collision margin) ສຳລັບ [Shape3D] ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Shape3D.margin] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Array of vertices which define the 2D polygon in the local XY plane."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມ 2D ໃນລະນາບ XY ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid "A node that provides a [Shape2D] to a [CollisionObject2D] parent."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງ [Shape2D] ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject2D]."

msgid ""
"A node that provides a [Shape2D] to a [CollisionObject2D] parent and allows "
"it to be edited. This can give a detection shape to an [Area2D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody2D] into a solid object."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງ [Shape2D] ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject2D] ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຊົງການກວດພົບໃຫ້ກັບ [Area2D] ຫຼື ປ່ຽນ [PhysicsBody2D] ໃຫ້ເປັນວັດຖຸແຂງ."

msgid ""
"A disabled collision shape has no effect in the world. This property should "
"be changed with [method Object.set_deferred]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ໃນໂລກ. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຄວນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ [method "
"Object.set_deferred]."

msgid ""
"Sets whether this collision shape should only detect collision on one side "
"(top or bottom).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property has no effect if this [CollisionShape2D] is a "
"child of an [Area2D] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The one way collision direction can be configured by setting "
"[member one_way_collision_direction]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນນີ້ຄວນກວດພົບການຕຳກັນພຽງແຕ່ເບື້ອງດຽວ (ເທິງ ຫຼື ລຸ່ມ) ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [CollisionShape2D] ນີ້ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດ [Area2D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທິດທາງການຕຳກັນແບບທາງດຽວສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດ [member "
"one_way_collision_direction]."

msgid ""
"The margin used for one-way collision (in pixels). Higher values will make "
"the shape thicker, and work better for colliders that enter the shape at a "
"high velocity."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນແບບທາງດຽວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ຄ່າຍິ່ງສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງໜາຂຶ້ນ "
"ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຂົ້າມາຕຳຮູບຊົງດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວສູງ."

msgid "The actual shape owned by this collision shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຕົວຈິງທີ່ເປັນຂອງຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນນີ້."

msgid "A node that provides a [Shape3D] to a [CollisionObject3D] parent."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງ [Shape3D] ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject3D]."

msgid ""
"A node that provides a [Shape3D] to a [CollisionObject3D] parent and allows "
"it to be edited. This can give a detection shape to an [Area3D] or turn a "
"[PhysicsBody3D] into a solid object.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] A non-uniformly scaled [CollisionShape3D] will likely not "
"behave as expected. Make sure to keep its scale the same on all axes and "
"adjust its [member shape] resource instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດທີ່ສະໜອງ [Shape3D] ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸແມ່ [CollisionObject3D] ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຊົງການກວດພົບໃຫ້ກັບ [Area3D] ຫຼື ປ່ຽນ [PhysicsBody3D] ໃຫ້ເປັນວັດຖຸແຂງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] [CollisionShape3D] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ "
"ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮັກສາຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນໃນທຸກແກນ ແລະ "
"ປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນ [member shape] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the collision shape's shape to the addition of all its convexed "
"[MeshInstance3D] siblings geometry."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຊົງຂອງຮູບຊົງການຕຳກັນໃຫ້ເປັນການລວມເອົາເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງ [MeshInstance3D] "
"ທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລະດັບດຽວກັນ (siblings) ທີ່ເປັນແບບໂນນ."

msgid "Use [signal Resource.changed] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [signal Resource.changed] ແທນ."

msgid "This method does nothing."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫຍັງ."

msgid "A color represented in RGBA format."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ RGBA."

msgid ""
"A color represented in RGBA format by a red ([member r]), green ([member g]), "
"blue ([member b]), and alpha ([member a]) component. Each component is a 32-"
"bit floating-point value, usually ranging from [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/"
"code]. Some properties (such as [member CanvasItem.modulate]) may support "
"values greater than [code]1.0[/code], for overbright or HDR (High Dynamic "
"Range) colors.\n"
"Colors can be created in a number of ways: By the various [Color] "
"constructors, by static methods such as [method from_hsv], and by using a "
"name from the set of standardized colors based on [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X11_color_names]X11 color names[/url] with the addition "
"of [constant TRANSPARENT].\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"color_constants.png]Color constants cheatsheet[/url]\n"
"Although [Color] may be used to store values of any encoding, the red "
"([member r]), green ([member g]), and blue ([member b]) properties of [Color] "
"are expected by Godot to be encoded using the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/SRGB#Transfer_function_(%22gamma%22)]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/"
"url] unless otherwise stated. This color encoding is used by many traditional "
"art and web tools, making it easy to match colors between Godot and these "
"tools. Godot uses [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rec._709]Rec. ITU-R "
"BT.709[/url] color primaries, which are used by the sRGB standard.\n"
"All physical simulation, such as lighting calculations, and colorimetry "
"transformations, such as [method get_luminance], must be performed on "
"linearly encoded values to produce correct results. When performing these "
"calculations, convert [Color] to and from linear encoding using [method "
"srgb_to_linear] and [method linear_to_srgb].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a Color will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it is equal to [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code] (opaque black). "
"Otherwise, a Color will always evaluate to [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, color constants are defined in the [code]Colors[/code] "
"static class instead of [code skip-lint]Color[/code]. Additionally, named "
"colors use [code]PascalCase[/code] syntax instead of [code]UPPER_SNAKE_CASE[/"
"code]. For example, [code skip-lint]Color.ALICE_BLUE[/code] in GDScript is "
"[code skip-lint]Colors.AliceBlue[/code] in C#."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ RGBA ໂດຍປະກອບດ້ວຍ ສີແດງ ([member r]), ສີຂຽວ ([member g]), ສີຟ້າ "
"([member b]), ແລະ ອັລຟາ ([member a]). ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບແມ່ນຄ່າເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 32 ບິດ "
"(floating-point), ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະມີຄ່າຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. "
"ບາງຄຸນສົມບັດ (ເຊັ່ນ [member CanvasItem.modulate]) ອາດຈະຮອງຮັບຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1.0[/"
"code] ສຳລັບສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ສີ HDR (High Dynamic Range).\n"
"ສີສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ: ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄອນສະຕຣັກເຕີ (constructors) [Color] ຕ່າງໆ, "
"ໂດຍເມທອດສະແຕຕິກເຊັ່ນ [method from_hsv], ແລະ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊື່ຈາກຊຸດຂອງສີມາດຕະຖານຕາມ "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X11_color_names]X11 color names[/url] "
"ໂດຍມີການເພີ່ມ [constant TRANSPARENT] ເຂົ້າໄປ.\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"color_constants.png]ແຜ່ນລວມຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງສີ (Color constants cheatsheet)[/url]\n"
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [Color] ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າຂອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃດໆ ກໍຕາມ, ແຕ່ຄຸນສົມບັດສີແດງ "
"([member r]), ສີຂຽວ ([member g]), ແລະ ສີຟ້າ ([member b]) ຂອງ [Color] ຖືກຄາດຫວັງໂດຍ "
"Godot ວ່າຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"SRGB#Transfer_function_(%22gamma%22)]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url] "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນຈະລະບຸໄວ້ເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນ. ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດສີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເຄື່ອງມືສິລະປະ ແລະ ເວັບແບບດັ້ງເດີມຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຕໍ່ການຈັບຄູ່ສີລະຫວ່າງ Godot ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. Godot ໃຊ້ສີຫຼັກ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rec._709]Rec. ITU-R BT.709[/url], ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ "
"sRGB.\n"
"ການຈຳລອງທາງກາຍະພາບທັງໝົດ, ເຊັ່ນ: ການຄຳນວນແສງສະຫວ່າງ, ແລະ ການແປງຄ່າສີ (colorimetry "
"transformations), ເຊັ່ນ [method get_luminance], "
"ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປະຕິບັດໃນຄ່າທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linearly encoded) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ເມື່ອປະຕິບັດການຄຳນວນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ແປງ [Color] ໄປ ແລະ ຈາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"srgb_to_linear] ແລະ [method linear_to_srgb].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງບູລີນ (boolean), ສີ ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນເທົ່າກັບ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 1)[/code] (ສີດຳທີບ). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສີ ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງສີຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຄລາດສະແຕຕິກ [code]Colors[/code] "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ [code skip-lint]Color[/code]. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສີທີ່ມີຊື່ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ "
"[code]PascalCase[/code] ແທນ [code]UPPER_SNAKE_CASE[/code]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code skip-"
"lint]Color.ALICE_BLUE[/code] ໃນ GDScript ຈະເປັນ [code skip-"
"lint]Colors.AliceBlue[/code] ໃນ C#."

msgid "2D GD Paint Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການແຕ້ມ 2D GD Paint"

msgid "Tween Interpolation Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການແຊກຄ່າ Tween (Tween Interpolation Demo)"

msgid "GUI Drag And Drop Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ GUI (GUI Drag And Drop Demo)"

msgid ""
"Constructs a default [Color] from opaque black. This is the same as [constant "
"BLACK].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Color] with all of its components set "
"to [code]0.0[/code] (transparent black)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກສີດຳທີບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [constant BLACK].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ C#, ນີ້ຈະສ້າງ [Color] ທີ່ທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] "
"(ສີດຳໂປ່ງໃສ)."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from the existing color, with [member a] set to the "
"given [param alpha] value.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(Color.RED, 0.2) # 20% opaque red.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(Colors.Red, 0.2f); // 20% opaque red.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກສີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member a] ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ [param alpha] ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(Color.RED, 0.2) # ສີແດງທີບ 20%.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(Colors.Red, 0.2f); // ສີແດງທີບ 20%.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Constructs a [Color] as a copy of the given [Color]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Color] ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຈາກ [Color] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] either from an HTML color code or from a standardized "
"color name. The supported color names are the same as the constants."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກລະຫັດສີ HTML ຫຼື ຈາກຊື່ສີມາດຕະຖານ. ຊື່ສີທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] either from an HTML color code or from a standardized "
"color name, with [param alpha] on the range of 0.0 to 1.0. The supported "
"color names are the same as the constants."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກລະຫັດສີ HTML ຫຼື ຈາກຊື່ສີມາດຕະຖານ, ໂດຍມີ [param alpha] ໃນຊ່ວງ 0.0 ຫາ "
"1.0. ຊື່ສີທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່."

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from RGB values, typically between 0.0 and 1.0. [member "
"a] is set to 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7) # Similar to `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, 178, "
"255)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f); // Similar to `Color.Color8(51, 255, "
"178, 255)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກຄ່າ RGB, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0. [member a] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7) # ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, 178, "
"255)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f); // ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ `Color.Color8(51, 255, "
"178, 255)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Constructs a [Color] from RGBA values, typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7, 0.8) # Similar to `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, "
"178, 204)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f, 0.8f); // Similar to "
"`Color.Color8(51, 255, 178, 255, 204)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກຄ່າ RGBA, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(0.2, 1.0, 0.7, 0.8) # ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ `Color.from_rgba8(51, 255, "
"178, 204)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(0.2f, 1.0f, 0.7f, 0.8f); // ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ `Color.Color8(51, "
"255, 178, 255, 204)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from overlaying this color over the given "
"color. In a painting program, you can imagine it as the [param over] color "
"painted over this color (including alpha).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var bg = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.5) # Green with alpha of 50%\n"
"var fg = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.5) # Red with alpha of 50%\n"
"var blended_color = bg.blend(fg) # Brown with alpha of 75%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var bg = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Green with alpha of 50%\n"
"var fg = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // Red with alpha of 50%\n"
"Color blendedColor = bg.Blend(fg); // Brown with alpha of 75%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີໃໝ່ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການວາງສີນີ້ທັບລົງເທິງສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໃນໂປຣແກຣມແຕ້ມຮູບ, "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈິນຕະນາການໄດ້ວ່າມັນຄືສີ [param over] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມທັບລົງເທິງສີນີ້ (ລວມທັງຄ່າອັນຟາ).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var bg = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.5) # ສີຂຽວທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 50%\n"
"var fg = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.5) # ສີແດງທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 50%\n"
"var blended_color = bg.blend(fg) # ສີນ້ຳຕານທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 75%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var bg = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // ສີຂຽວທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 50%\n"
"var fg = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.5f); // ສີແດງທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 50%\n"
"Color blendedColor = bg.Blend(fg); // ສີນ້ຳຕານທີ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ 75%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a new color with all components clamped between the components of "
"[param min] and [param max], by running [method @GlobalScope.clamp] on each "
"component."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີໃໝ່ໂດຍທີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບທັງໝົດຖືກຈຳກັດຂອບເຂດ (clamp) ລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [param min] "
"ແລະ [param max], ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method @GlobalScope.clamp] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from making this color darker by the specified "
"[param amount] (ratio from 0.0 to 1.0). See also [method lightened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var darkgreen = green.darkened(0.2) # 20% darker than regular green\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color darkgreen = green.Darkened(0.2f); // 20% darker than regular green\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີໃໝ່ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຮັດໃຫ້ສີນີ້ເຂັ້ມຂຶ້ນຕາມ [param amount] ທີ່ລະບຸ (ອັດຕາສ່ວນແຕ່ 0.0 ຫາ "
"1.0). ເບິ່ງ [method lightened] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var darkgreen = green.darkened(0.2) # ເຂັ້ມກວ່າສີຂຽວປົກກະຕິ 20%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color darkgreen = green.Darkened(0.2f); // ເຂັ້ມກວ່າສີຂຽວປົກກະຕິ 20%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Constructs a color from an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HSL_and_HSV]HSV "
"profile[/url]. The hue ([param h]), saturation ([param s]), and value ([param "
"v]) are typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_hsv(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromHsv(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສີຈາກ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HSL_and_HSV]HSV profile[/url]. "
"ຄ່າຂອງ ສີສັນ ([param h]), ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ([param s]), ແລະ ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ([param v]) "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_hsv(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromHsv(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Constructs a color from an [url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/"
"colorpicker/]OK HSL profile[/url]. The hue ([param h]), saturation ([param "
"s]), and lightness ([param l]) are typically between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_ok_hsl(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromOkHsl(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສີຈາກ [url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]OK HSL profile[/"
"url]. ຄ່າຂອງ ສີສັນ ([param h]), ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ([param s]), ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ([param l]) "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color.from_ok_hsl(0.58, 0.5, 0.79, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = Color.FromOkHsl(0.58f, 0.5f, 0.79f, 0.8f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a [Color] constructed from red ([param r8]), green ([param g8]), blue "
"([param b8]), and optionally alpha ([param a8]) integer channels, each "
"divided by [code]255.0[/code] for their final value.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var red = Color.from_rgba8(255, 0, 0)             # Same as Color(1, 0, 0).\n"
"var dark_blue = Color.from_rgba8(0, 0, 51)        # Same as Color(0, 0, "
"0.2).\n"
"var my_color = Color.from_rgba8(306, 255, 0, 102) # Same as Color(1.2, 1, 0, "
"0.4).\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the lower precision of [method from_rgba8] compared to "
"the standard [Color] constructor, a color created with [method from_rgba8] "
"will generally not be equal to the same color created with the standard "
"[Color] constructor. Use [method is_equal_approx] for comparisons to avoid "
"issues with floating-point precision error."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [Color] ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກຊ່ອງສີຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ສີແດງ ([param r8]), ສີຂຽວ ([param g8]), "
"ສີຟ້າ ([param b8]), ແລະ ອາດລວມເຖິງ ອັນຟາ ([param a8]), ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຄ່າຈະຖືກຫານດ້ວຍ "
"[code]255.0[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var red = Color.from_rgba8(255, 0, 0)             # ຄືກັນກັບ Color(1, 0, 0).\n"
"var dark_blue = Color.from_rgba8(0, 0, 51)        # ຄືກັນກັບ Color(0, 0, 0.2).\n"
"var my_color = Color.from_rgba8(306, 255, 0, 102) # ຄືກັນກັບ Color(1.2, 1, 0, "
"0.4).\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າຂອງ [method from_rgba8] ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"constructor ຂອງ [Color] ມາດຕະຖານ, ສີທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ [method from_rgba8] "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບສີດຽວກັນທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ constructor [Color] ມາດຕະຖານ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"is_equal_approx] ສຳລັບການປຽບທຽບເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາຄວາມຜິດພາດຈາກຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid ""
"Decodes a [Color] from an RGBE9995 format integer. See [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBE9995]."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດ [Color] ຈາກເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນຮູບແບບ RGBE9995. ເບິ່ງ [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBE9995]."

msgid ""
"Creates a [Color] from the given string, which can be either an HTML color "
"code or a named color (case-insensitive). Returns [param default] if the "
"color cannot be inferred from the string.\n"
"If you want to create a color from String in a constant expression, use the "
"equivalent constructor instead (i.e. [code]Color(\"color string\")[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [Color] ຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້, ເຊິ່ງອາດເປັນລະຫັດສີ HTML ຫຼື ຊື່ສີ (ບໍ່ຈຳແນກຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ). "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [param default] ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸສີຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສີຈາກ String ໃນ constant expression, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ constructor ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແທນ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: [code]Color(\"color string\")[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns the light intensity of the color, as a value between 0.0 and 1.0 "
"(inclusive). This is useful when determining light or dark color. Colors with "
"a luminance smaller than 0.5 can be generally considered dark.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method get_luminance] relies on the color using linear encoding "
"to return an accurate relative luminance value. If the color uses the default "
"nonlinear sRGB encoding, use [method srgb_to_linear] to convert it to linear "
"encoding first."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຂອງສີ, ເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການລະບຸວ່າສີສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື "
"ມືດ. ສີທີ່ມີຄ່າ luminance ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 0.5 ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຖືວ່າເປັນສີມືດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method get_luminance] ອີງໃສ່ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"luminance ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າສີໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບ nonlinear ມາດຕະຖານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"srgb_to_linear] ເພື່ອແປງເປັນ linear ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] associated with the provided [param hex] integer in 32-"
"bit RGBA format (8 bits per channel). This method is the inverse of [method "
"to_rgba32].\n"
"In GDScript and C#, the [int] is best visualized with hexadecimal notation "
"([code]\"0x\"[/code] prefix, making it [code]\"0xRRGGBBAA\"[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color.hex(0xff0000ff)\n"
"var dark_cyan = Color.hex(0x008b8bff)\n"
"var my_color = Color.hex(0xbbefd2a4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(0xff0000ff);\n"
"var dark_cyan = new Color(0x008b8bff);\n"
"var my_color = new Color(0xbbefd2a4);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you want to use hex notation in a constant expression, use the equivalent "
"constructor instead (i.e. [code]Color(0xRRGGBBAA)[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [Color] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ [param hex] ໃນຮູບແບບ RGBA 32 ບິດ (8 ບິດ "
"ຕໍ່ຊ່ອງ). ວິທີນີ້ເປັນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method to_rgba32].\n"
"ໃນ GDScript ແລະ C#, [int] ຈະເບິ່ງງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ hexadecimal (ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ [code]"
"\"0x\"[/code], ເປັນ [code]\"0xRRGGBBAA\"[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color.hex(0xff0000ff)\n"
"var dark_cyan = Color.hex(0x008b8bff)\n"
"var my_color = Color.hex(0xbbefd2a4)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(0xff0000ff);\n"
"var dark_cyan = new Color(0x008b8bff);\n"
"var my_color = new Color(0xbbefd2a4);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ hex notation ໃນ constant expression, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ constructor "
"ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າແທນ (ເຊັ່ນ: [code]Color(0xRRGGBBAA)[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] associated with the provided [param hex] integer in 64-"
"bit RGBA format (16 bits per channel). This method is the inverse of [method "
"to_rgba64].\n"
"In GDScript and C#, the [int] is best visualized with hexadecimal notation "
"([code]\"0x\"[/code] prefix, making it [code]\"0xRRRRGGGGBBBBAAAA\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [Color] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ [param hex] ໃນຮູບແບບ RGBA 64 ບິດ (16 ບິດ "
"ຕໍ່ຊ່ອງ). ວິທີນີ້ເປັນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method to_rgba64].\n"
"ໃນ GDScript ແລະ C#, [int] ຈະເບິ່ງງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ hexadecimal (ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ [code]"
"\"0x\"[/code], ເປັນ [code]\"0xRRRRGGGGBBBBAAAA\"[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns a new color from [param rgba], an HTML hexadecimal color string. "
"[param rgba] is not case-sensitive, and may be prefixed by a hash sign "
"([code]#[/code]).\n"
"[param rgba] must be a valid three-digit or six-digit hexadecimal color "
"string, and may contain an alpha channel value. If [param rgba] does not "
"contain an alpha channel value, an alpha channel value of 1.0 is applied. If "
"[param rgba] is invalid, returns an empty color.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var blue = Color.html(\"#0000ff\") # blue is Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.html(\"#0F0\")   # green is Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.html(\"663399cc\") # col is Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var blue = Color.FromHtml(\"#0000ff\"); // blue is Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.FromHtml(\"#0F0\");   // green is Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.FromHtml(\"663399cc\"); // col is Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີໃໝ່ຈາກ [param rgba], ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມລະຫັດສີ HTML hexadecimal. [param rgba] "
"ບໍ່ຈຳແນກຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ ແລະ ອາດມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash ([code]#[/code]) ນຳໜ້າ.\n"
"[param rgba] ຕ້ອງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມລະຫັດສີ hexadecimal 3 ຫຼັກ ຫຼື 6 ຫຼັກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ "
"ອາດມີຄ່າຊ່ອງອັນຟາ. ຖ້າ [param rgba] ບໍ່ມີຄ່າອັນຟາ, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າອັນຟາເປັນ 1.0. ຖ້າ [param rgba] "
"ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນສີຫວ່າງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var blue = Color.html(\"#0000ff\") # blue ແມ່ນ Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.html(\"#0F0\")   # green ແມ່ນ Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.html(\"663399cc\") # col ແມ່ນ Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var blue = Color.FromHtml(\"#0000ff\"); // blue ແມ່ນ Color(0.0, 0.0, 1.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var green = Color.FromHtml(\"#0F0\");   // green ແມ່ນ Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)\n"
"var col = Color.FromHtml(\"663399cc\"); // col ແມ່ນ Color(0.4, 0.2, 0.6, 0.8)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param color] is a valid HTML hexadecimal color "
"string. The string must be a hexadecimal value (case-insensitive) of either "
"3, 4, 6 or 8 digits, and may be prefixed by a hash sign ([code]#[/code]). "
"This method is identical to [method String.is_valid_html_color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF\")   # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55AAFF20\") # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"55AAFF\")    # Returns true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#F2C\")      # Returns true\n"
"\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#AABBC\")    # Returns false\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF5\")  # Returns false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF\");   // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF20\"); // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"55AAFF\");    // Returns true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#F2C\");      // Returns true\n"
"\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#AABBC\");    // Returns false\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55aaFF5\");  // Returns false\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param color] ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມລະຫັດສີ HTML hexadecimal "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ້ອງເປັນຄ່າ hexadecimal (ບໍ່ຈຳແນກຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ) ທີ່ມີ 3, 4, 6 ຫຼື 8 ຫຼັກ, ແລະ "
"ອາດມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ hash ([code]#[/code]) ນຳໜ້າ. ວິທີນີ້ຄືກັນກັບ [method "
"String.is_valid_html_color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF\")   # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55AAFF20\") # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"55AAFF\")    # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#F2C\")      # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#AABBC\")    # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ false\n"
"Color.html_is_valid(\"#55aaFF5\")  # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF\");   // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55AAFF20\"); // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"55AAFF\");    // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#F2C\");      // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ true\n"
"\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#AABBC\");    // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ false\n"
"Color.HtmlIsValid(\"#55aaFF5\");  // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ false\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns the color with its [member r], [member g], and [member b] components "
"inverted ([code](1 - r, 1 - g, 1 - b, a)[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var black = Color.WHITE.inverted()\n"
"var color = Color(0.3, 0.4, 0.9)\n"
"var inverted_color = color.inverted() # Equivalent to `Color(0.7, 0.6, 0.1)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var black = Colors.White.Inverted();\n"
"var color = new Color(0.3f, 0.4f, 0.9f);\n"
"Color invertedColor = color.Inverted(); // Equivalent to `new Color(0.7f, "
"0.6f, 0.1f)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີທີ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບ [member r], [member g], ແລະ [member b] ແບບກັບດ້ານ (inverted) "
"([code](1 - r, 1 - g, 1 - b, a)[/code]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var black = Color.WHITE.inverted()\n"
"var color = Color(0.3, 0.4, 0.9)\n"
"var inverted_color = color.inverted() # ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ `Color(0.7, 0.6, 0.1)`\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var black = Colors.White.Inverted();\n"
"var color = new Color(0.3f, 0.4f, 0.9f);\n"
"Color invertedColor = color.Inverted(); // ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ `new Color(0.7f, 0.6f, "
"0.1f)`\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this color and [param to] are approximately "
"equal, by running [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on each component."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສີນີ້ ແລະ [param to] ມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ, ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the linear interpolation between this color's components and [param "
"to]'s components. The interpolation factor [param weight] should be between "
"0.0 and 1.0 (inclusive). See also [method @GlobalScope.lerp].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n"
"var aqua = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.2) # Returns Color(0.8, 0.2, 0.16)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.5) # Returns Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.4)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 1.0) # Returns Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"var aqua = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f);\n"
"\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.2f); // Returns Color(0.8f, 0.2f, 0.16f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.5f); // Returns Color(0.5f, 0.5f, 0.4f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 1.0f); // Returns Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນການແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນ (linear interpolation) ລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງສີນີ້ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [param to]. ຕົວຄູນການແຊກຄ່າ [param weight] ຄວນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method @GlobalScope.lerp] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var red = Color(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n"
"var aqua = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.2) # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.8, 0.2, 0.16)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 0.5) # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.4)\n"
"red.lerp(aqua, 1.0) # ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.8)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var red = new Color(1.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"var aqua = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f);\n"
"\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.2f); // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.8f, 0.2f, 0.16f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 0.5f); // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.5f, 0.5f, 0.4f)\n"
"red.Lerp(aqua, 1.0f); // ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.8f)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a new color resulting from making this color lighter by the specified "
"[param amount], which should be a ratio from 0.0 to 1.0. See also [method "
"darkened].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var light_green = green.lightened(0.2) # 20% lighter than regular green\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color lightGreen = green.Lightened(0.2f); // 20% lighter than regular green\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີໃໝ່ທີ່ເກີດຈາກການເຮັດໃຫ້ສີນີ້ຈາງລົງ (ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ) ຕາມ [param amount] ທີ່ລະບຸ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຄວນເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນແຕ່ 0.0 ຫາ 1.0. ເບິ່ງ [method darkened] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var green = Color(0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n"
"var light_green = green.lightened(0.2) # ຈາງກວ່າສີຂຽວປົກກະຕິ 20%\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var green = new Color(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f);\n"
"Color lightGreen = green.Lightened(0.2f); // ຈາງກວ່າສີຂຽວປົກກະຕິ 20%\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the color that is encoded using the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url]. This "
"method requires the original color to use linear encoding. See also [method "
"srgb_to_linear] which performs the opposite operation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The color's alpha channel ([member a]) is not affected. The "
"alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, regardless of the color "
"space of the other color channels."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງສີທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url]. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສີຕົ້ນສະບັບໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear. ເບິ່ງ [method srgb_to_linear] "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊ່ອງອັນຟາຂອງສີ ([member a]) ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. "
"ຊ່ອງອັນຟາຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ສະເໝີ, ບໍ່ວ່າສີອື່ນໆຈະຢູ່ໃນ color space ໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the color that uses linear encoding. This method requires "
"the original color to be encoded using the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/url]. See also [method linear_to_srgb] "
"which performs the opposite operation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The color's alpha channel ([member a]) is not affected. The "
"alpha channel is always stored with linear encoding, regardless of the color "
"space of the other color channels."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງສີທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear. ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສີຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SRGB]nonlinear sRGB transfer function[/"
"url]. ເບິ່ງ [method linear_to_srgb] ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊ່ອງອັນຟາຂອງສີ ([member a]) ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. "
"ຊ່ອງອັນຟາຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ສະເໝີ, ບໍ່ວ່າສີອື່ນໆຈະຢູ່ໃນ color space ໃດກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the color converted to a 32-bit integer in ABGR format (each "
"component is 8 bits). ABGR is the reversed version of the default RGBA "
"format.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr32()) # Prints 4281565439\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr32()); // Prints 4281565439\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນສີທີ່ແປງເປັນເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ 32 ບິດໃນຮູບແບບ ABGR (ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບມີ 8 ບິດ). ABGR "
"ແມ່ນຮູບແບບທີ່ປີ້ນກັບຂອງ RGBA ມາດຕະຖານ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var color = Color(1, 0.5, 0.2)\n"
"print(color.to_abgr32()) # ສະແດງຜົນ 4281565439\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var color = new Color(1.0f, 0.5f, 0.2f);\n"
"GD.Print(color.ToAbgr32()); // ສະແດງຜົນ 4281565439\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

