msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the colors are not exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສີບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Color] by the components of the given "
"[Color]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Color] by the given [float]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Color] by the given [int]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Adds each component of the [Color] with the components of the given [Color]."
msgstr "ບວກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ກັບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Subtracts each component of the [Color] by the components of the given "
"[Color]."
msgstr "ລົບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Divides each component of the [Color] by the components of the given [Color]."
msgstr "ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Divides each component of the [Color] by the given [float]."
msgstr "ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Divides each component of the [Color] by the given [int]."
msgstr "ຫານແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the colors are exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສີເທົ່າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"is_equal_approx] ແທນ ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Access color components using their index. [code][0][/code] is equivalent to "
"[member r], [code][1][/code] is equivalent to [member g], [code][2][/code] is "
"equivalent to [member b], and [code][3][/code] is equivalent to [member a]."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງສີໂດຍໃຊ້ດັດຊະນີ (index). [code][0][/code] ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member r], "
"[code][1][/code] ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member g], [code][2][/code] ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member b], "
"ແລະ [code][3][/code] ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member a]."

msgid ""
"Returns the same value as if the [code]+[/code] was not there. Unary [code]+[/"
"code] does nothing, but sometimes it can make your code more readable."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນຄ່າເດີມຄືກັບວ່າບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [code]+[/code]. Unary [code]+[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດຫຍັງເລີຍ, "
"ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະຫັດ (code) ຂອງເຈົ້າອ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Inverts the given color. This is equivalent to [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] "
"or [code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. Unlike with "
"[method inverted], the [member a] component is inverted, too."
msgstr ""
"ກັບດ້ານ (Invert) ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. ຕ່າງຈາກ [method "
"inverted] ບ່ອນທີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ [member a] ກໍຈະຖືກກັບດ້ານຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"A resource class for managing a palette of colors, which can be loaded and "
"saved using [ColorPicker]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource class) ສຳລັບຈັດການຈານສີ (palette), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໂຫຼດ ແລະ "
"ບັນທຶກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [ColorPicker]."

msgid ""
"The [ColorPalette] resource is designed to store and manage a collection of "
"colors. This resource is useful in scenarios where a predefined set of colors "
"is required, such as for creating themes, designing user interfaces, or "
"managing game assets. The built-in [ColorPicker] control can also make use of "
"[ColorPalette] without additional code."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [ColorPalette] ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ຈັດການຊຸດຂອງສີ. "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ຕ້ອງການຊຸດສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສ້າງທີມ (theme), "
"ການອອກແບບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຫຼື ການຈັດການຊັບສິນໃນເກມ. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມ [ColorPicker] "
"ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ [ColorPalette] ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຂຽນລະຫັດເພີ່ມ."

msgid "A [PackedColorArray] containing the colors in the palette."
msgstr "[PackedColorArray] ທີ່ບັນຈຸສີຕ່າງໆໃນຈານສີ."

msgid "A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color."
msgstr "ວິດເຈັດ (widget) ທີ່ສະໜອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລືອກ ຫຼື ປັບປ່ຽນສີ."

msgid ""
"A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color. It "
"can optionally provide functionalities like a color sampler (eyedropper), "
"color modes, and presets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This control is the color picker widget itself. You can use a "
"[ColorPickerButton] instead if you need a button that brings up a "
"[ColorPicker] in a popup."
msgstr ""
"ວິດເຈັດ (widget) ທີ່ສະໜອງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລືອກ ຫຼື ປັບປ່ຽນສີ. ມັນສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆໄດ້ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ (eyedropper), ໂໝດສີ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສີລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວວິດເຈັດເລືອກສີເອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [ColorPickerButton] "
"ແທນໄດ້ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປຸ່ມທີ່ສະແດງ [ColorPicker] ໃນປັອບອັບ (popup)."

msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color presets. The presets are displayed in "
"the color picker and the user will be able to select them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສີທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets). presets ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງໃນຕົວເລືອກສີ ແລະ "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະສາມາດເລືອກພວກມັນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການ presets ນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບ [i]ຕົວເລືອກສີນີ້[/i] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color recent presets so that it can be "
"picked later. Recent presets are the colors that were picked recently, a new "
"preset is automatically created and added to recent presets when you pick a "
"new color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The recent presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. "
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດແມ່ນສີທີ່ຖືກເລືອກເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, preset ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກສີໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບ [i]ຕົວເລືອກສີນີ້[/i] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color presets of this color picker."
msgstr "ລຶບສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກລາຍການ presets ຂອງຕົວເລືອກສີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color recent presets of this color "
"picker."
msgstr "ລຶບສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ອອກຈາກລາຍການສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຕົວເລືອກສີນີ້."

msgid "Returns the list of colors in the presets of the color picker."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນລາຍການສີໃນ presets ຂອງຕົວເລືອກສີ."

msgid "Returns the list of colors in the recent presets of the color picker."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນລາຍການສີໃນສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຕົວເລືອກສີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it's possible to add presets under Swatches. If "
"[code]false[/code], the button to add presets is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດເພີ່ມ presets ພາຍໃຕ້ Swatches ໄດ້. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ປຸ່ມເພີ່ມ presets ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The currently selected color."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The currently selected color mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດສີທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color mode buttons are visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມໂໝດສີຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the color will apply only after the user releases the "
"mouse button, otherwise it will apply immediately even in mouse motion event "
"(which can cause performance issues)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສີຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທັນທີເຖິງວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນເຫດການການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງເມົາສ໌ "
"(ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ)."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows an alpha channel slider (opacity)."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງແຖບເລື່ອນຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows an intensity slider. The intensity is applied as "
"follows: convert the color to linear encoding, multiply it by [code]2 ** "
"intensity[/code], and then convert it back to nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງແຖບເລື່ອນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນ. ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ດັ່ງນີ້: "
"ແປງສີເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear, ຄູນມັນດ້ວຍ [code]2 ** intensity[/code], "
"ແລ້ວແປງກັບເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບ nonlinear."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the hex color code input field is visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຫ້ອງປ້ອນລະຫັດສີ hex ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "The shape of the color space view."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຂອງມຸມມອງພື້ນທີ່ສີ (color space)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Swatches and Recent Colors presets are visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], Swatches ແລະ ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sampler and color preview are visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງສີຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sliders are visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນສີຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid "Emitted when the color is changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນສີ."

msgid "Emitted when a preset is added."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ preset."

msgid "Emitted when a preset is removed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອມີການລຶບ preset ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in sRGB color space."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂສີດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນ ສີແດງ/ສີຂຽວ/ສີຟ້າ ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ sRGB."

msgid "Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Value sliders."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂສີດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນ ສີສັນ/ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ/ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (HSV)."

msgid "This is replaced by [constant MODE_LINEAR]."
msgstr "ນີ້ຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ [constant MODE_LINEAR]."

msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in linear color space."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂສີດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນ ສີແດງ/ສີຂຽວ/ສີຟ້າ ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ linear."

msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Lightness sliders.\n"
"OKHSL is a new color space similar to HSL but that better match perception by "
"leveraging the Oklab color space which is designed to be simple to use, while "
"doing a good job at predicting perceived lightness, chroma and hue.\n"
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]Okhsv and Okhsl color "
"spaces[/url]"
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂສີດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນ ສີສັນ/ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ/ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (HSL).\n"
"OKHSL ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີໃໝ່ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ HSL ແຕ່ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້ດີກວ່າ ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ Oklab "
"ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ໄດ້ດີໃນການຄາດຄະເນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ, ຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ "
"ແລະ ສີສັນທີ່ຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້.\n"
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]ພື້ນທີ່ສີ Okhsv ແລະ Okhsl[/url]"

msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແບບ HSV Color Model."

msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space with a wheel."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແບບ HSV Color Model ພ້ອມກັບວົງລໍ້ສີ."

msgid "HSV Color Model circle color space. Use Saturation as a radius."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີຮູບວົງມົນແບບ HSV Color Model. ໃຊ້ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວເປັນລັດສະໝີ."

msgid "HSL OK Color Model circle color space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີຮູບວົງມົນແບບ HSL OK Color Model."

msgid ""
"The color space shape and the shape select button are hidden. Can't be "
"selected from the shapes popup."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງພື້ນທີ່ສີ ແລະ ປຸ່ມເລືອກຮູບຊົງຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ຈາກປັອບອັບຮູບຊົງ."

msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant lightness."
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແບບ OKHSL Color Model ທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຄົງທີ່."

msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant saturation."
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແບບ OKHSL Color Model ທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຄົງທີ່."

msgid ""
"Color of rectangle or circle drawn when a picker shape part is focused but "
"not editable via keyboard or joypad. Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, "
"so a partially transparent color should be used to ensure the picker shape "
"remains visible."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ ຫຼື ວົງມົນທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມເມື່ອສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກສີຖືກໂຟກັສ (focus) "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຜ່ານຄີບອດ ຫຼື ຈອຍແພັດ. ມັນຈະສະແດງ [i]ເທິງ[/i] ຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກສີ, "
"ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ສີທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກສີຍັງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Overrides the [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] theme property of the "
"sliders."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີມ [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] ຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ."

msgid "The width of the hue selection slider."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນເລືອກສີສັນ (hue)."

msgid "The minimum width of the color labels next to sliders."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງປ້າຍຊື່ສີທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນ."

msgid "The margin around the [ColorPicker]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (margin) ອ້ອມຮອບ [ColorPicker]."

msgid "The height of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງກ່ອງເລືອກ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ-ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The width of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງກ່ອງເລືອກ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ-ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The icon for the \"Add Preset\" button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມ \"ເພີ່ມ Preset\"."

msgid "The texture for the arrow grabber."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ສຳລັບຕົວຈັບຮູບລູກສອນ."

msgid ""
"The icon for the button that copies the color in text format to the clipboard."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມທີ່ຄັດລອກສີໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຍັງ ຄລິບບອດ (clipboard)."

msgid "Custom texture for the hue selection slider on the right."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນເລືອກສີສັນທາງດ້ານຂວາ."

msgid "The icon for the button that switches color text to hexadecimal."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມທີ່ສະຫຼັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສີເປັນເລກຖານສິບຫົກ (hexadecimal)."

msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when expanded."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບເມນູ presets ສີແບບເລື່ອນລົງເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when folded."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບເມນູ presets ສີແບບເລື່ອນລົງເມື່ອພັບເຂົ້າ."

msgid "The icon for color preset option menu."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບເມນູຕົວເລືອກ presets ສີ."

msgid ""
"The indicator used to signalize that the color value is outside the 0-1 range."
msgstr "ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກວ່າຄ່າຂອງສີຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ 0-1."

msgid ""
"The image displayed over the color box/circle (depending on the [member "
"picker_shape]), marking the currently selected color."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງເທິງກ່ອງສີ/ວົງມົນ (ຂຶ້ນກັບ [member picker_shape]), ເພື່ອໝາຍສີທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The fill image displayed behind the picker cursor."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງຂອງເຄີເຊີຕົວເລືອກສີ."

msgid ""
"Background panel for the color preview box (visible when the color is "
"translucent)."
msgstr "ແຜງພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບກ່ອງຕົວຢ່າງສີ (ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ເມື່ອສີມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ)."

msgid ""
"The icon for the revert button (visible on the middle of the \"old\" color "
"when it differs from the currently selected color). This icon is modulated "
"with a dark color if the \"old\" color is bright enough, so the icon should "
"be bright to ensure visibility in both scenarios."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມຄືນຄ່າ (ຈະເຫັນຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງສີ \"ເກົ່າ\" ເມື່ອມັນຕ່າງຈາກສີທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ). "
"ໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ມືດລົງຖ້າສີ \"ເກົ່າ\" ສະຫວ່າງພໍ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄອຄອນຄວນຈະສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນທັງສອງສະຖານະການ."

msgid "The icon for the screen color picker button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມເລືອກສີຈາກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "The icon for circular picker shapes."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກແບບວົງມົນ."

msgid "The icon for rectangular picker shapes."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກແບບສີ່ແຈສາກ."

msgid "The icon for rectangular wheel picker shapes."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກແບບວົງລໍ້ສີ່ແຈສາກ."

msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the circle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent [StyleBox] "
"should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A [StyleBox] that "
"represents an outline or an underline works well for this purpose. To disable "
"the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that "
"disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/controller navigation "
"usability, so this is not recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນຮູບວົງມົນຂອງຕົວເລືອກຖືກໂຟກັສ (focused). ມັນຈະສະແດງ [i]ເທິງ[/i] "
"ຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກຍັງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. [StyleBox] ທີ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື "
"ເສັ້ນກ້ອງຈະເໝາະສົມກັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເປັນ [StyleBoxEmpty]. "
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານຄີບອດ/ຄອນໂທຣເລີ, "
"ສະນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the rectangle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent [StyleBox] "
"should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A [StyleBox] that "
"represents an outline or an underline works well for this purpose. To disable "
"the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that "
"disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/controller navigation "
"usability, so this is not recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງຕົວເລືອກຖືກໂຟກັສ (focused). ມັນຈະສະແດງ [i]ເທິງ[/"
"i] ຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກຍັງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. [StyleBox] ທີ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື "
"ເສັ້ນກ້ອງຈະເໝາະສົມກັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເປັນ [StyleBoxEmpty]. "
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານຄີບອດ/ຄອນໂທຣເລີ, "
"ສະນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used for the old color sample part when it is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the sample, so a partially transparent [StyleBox] "
"should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A [StyleBox] that "
"represents an outline or an underline works well for this purpose. To disable "
"the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that "
"disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/controller navigation "
"usability, so this is not recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ່ວນຕົວຢ່າງສີເກົ່າເມື່ອຖືກໂຟກັສ. ມັນຈະສະແດງ [i]ເທິງ[/i] ຕົວຢ່າງສີ, "
"ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບຊົງຕົວເລືອກຍັງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. "
"[StyleBox] ທີ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນກ້ອງຈະເໝາະສົມກັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ເພື່ອປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສ, "
"ໃຫ້ກຳນົດເປັນ [StyleBoxEmpty]. ໝາຍເຫດ: "
"ການປິດເອັບເຟັກການໂຟກັສຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານຄີບອດ/ຄອນໂທຣເລີ, "
"ສະນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

msgid "A button that brings up a [ColorPicker] when pressed."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ຈະສະແດງ [ColorPicker] ເມື່ອຖືກກົດ."

msgid ""
"Encapsulates a [ColorPicker], making it accessible by pressing a button. "
"Pressing the button will toggle the [ColorPicker]'s visibility.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods associated "
"with this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, the button may not be wide enough for the color "
"preview swatch to be visible. Make sure to set [member "
"Control.custom_minimum_size] to a big enough value to give the button enough "
"space."
msgstr ""
"ຮວບຮວມ [ColorPicker] ເຂົ້າໄວ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ. "
"ການກົດປຸ່ມຈະເປັນການສະຫຼັບການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງ [ColorPicker].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [BaseButton] ນຳ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ວິທີການທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂນດ (node) ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ປຸ່ມອາດຈະບໍ່ກວ້າງພໍທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນຕົວຢ່າງສີ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member Control.custom_minimum_size] ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າໃຫຍ່ພໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ປຸ່ມມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [ColorPicker] that this node toggles.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [ColorPicker] ທີ່ໂນດນີ້ສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ທຳລາຍມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງ ຫຼື ເພ "
"(crash). ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.visible] "
"ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the control's [PopupPanel] which allows you to connect to popup "
"signals. This allows you to handle events when the ColorPicker is shown or "
"hidden.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນ [PopupPanel] ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບສັນຍານປັອບອັບໄດ້. "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈັດການກັບເຫດການຕ່າງໆເມື່ອ ColorPicker ຖືກສະແດງ ຫຼື ຖືກເຊື່ອງ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ທຳລາຍມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງ ຫຼື ເພ "
"(crash). ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member Window.visible] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the alpha channel in the displayed [ColorPicker] will "
"be visible."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຊ່ອງອັນຟາໃນ [ColorPicker] ທີ່ສະແດງຈະຖືກເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the intensity slider in the displayed [ColorPicker] "
"will be visible."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນໃນ [ColorPicker] ທີ່ສະແດງຈະຖືກເຫັນ."

msgid "Emitted when the color changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອສີມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is created (the button is pressed for the "
"first time)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອ [ColorPicker] ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຖືກກົດເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ)."

msgid "Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is closed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອ [ColorPicker] ຖືກປິດ."

msgid "The background of the color preview rect on the button."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຕົວຢ່າງສີເທິງປຸ່ມ."

msgid "A control that displays a solid color rectangle."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ສະແດງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກສີພື້ນ."

msgid ""
"Displays a rectangle filled with a solid [member color]. If you need to "
"display the border alone, consider using a [Panel] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍ [member color] ສີດຽວ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ເສັ້ນຂອບ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [Panel] ແທນ."

msgid "The fill color of the rectangle."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ."

msgid ""
"More customization of the rendering pipeline will be added in the future."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ rendering pipeline ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid "Stores attributes used to customize how a Viewport is rendered."
msgstr "ຈັດເກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການເຣັນເດີ (render) ຂອງ Viewport."

msgid ""
"The compositor resource stores attributes used to customize how a [Viewport] "
"is rendered."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ compositor ຈັດເກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການເຣັນເດີ (render) ຂອງ "
"[Viewport]."

msgid "The Compositor"
msgstr "The Compositor"

msgid ""
"The custom [CompositorEffect]s that are applied during rendering of viewports "
"using this compositor."
msgstr ""
"[CompositorEffect] ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣັນເດີ viewports ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"compositor ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The implementation may change as more of the rendering internals are exposed "
"over time."
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ອາດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງການເຣັນເດີຈະຖືກເປີດເຜີຍເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

msgid "This resource allows for creating a custom rendering effect."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງເອັບເຟັກການເຣັນເດີ (rendering effect) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"This resource defines a custom rendering effect that can be applied to "
"[Viewport]s through the viewports' [Environment]. You can implement a "
"callback that is called during rendering at a given stage of the rendering "
"pipeline and allows you to insert additional passes. Note that this callback "
"happens on the rendering thread. CompositorEffect is an abstract base class "
"and must be extended to implement specific rendering logic."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ກຳນົດເອັບເຟັກການເຣັນເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບ [Viewport] ຜ່ານ "
"[Environment] ຂອງ viewports ໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ callback "
"ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣັນເດີໃນຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ rendering pipeline ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແຊກ "
"pass ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ: callback ນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ rendering thread. CompositorEffect "
"ແມ່ນ abstract base class ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍ (extended) ເພື່ອສ້າງ logic "
"ການເຣັນເດີສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"Implement this function with your custom rendering code. [param "
"effect_callback_type] should always match the effect callback type you've "
"specified in [member effect_callback_type]. [param render_data] provides "
"access to the rendering state, it is only valid during rendering and should "
"not be stored."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຟັງຊັນນີ້ດ້ວຍລະຫັດເຣັນເດີແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງເຈົ້າ. [param effect_callback_type] "
"ຄວນກົງກັບປະເພດຂອງ effect callback ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member effect_callback_type]. "
"[param render_data] ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານະການເຣັນເດີ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຣັນເດີເທ່ານັ້ນ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຈັດເກັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a color buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var color_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"color\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ MSAA ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນການ resolve ຄ່າ color buffer "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ effect ຈະເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [method _render_callback], ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ resolved buffer ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var color_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"color\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a depth buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"depth\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ MSAA ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນການ resolve ຄ່າ depth buffer "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ effect ຈະເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [method _render_callback], ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ resolved buffer ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"depth\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"The type of effect that is implemented, determines at what stage of rendering "
"the callback is called."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງ effect ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນຕົວລະບຸວ່າ callback "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນໃດຂອງການເຣັນເດີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this rendering effect is applied to any viewport it is "
"added to."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເອັບເຟັກການເຣັນເດີນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ viewport ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມັນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers motion vectors being calculated during the "
"opaque render state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the motion vector buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var motion_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_velocity_texture()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ motion vectors ໃນລະຫວ່າງສະຖານະ "
"opaque render.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [method _render_callback], ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ motion vector buffer "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var motion_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_velocity_texture()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers normal and roughness data to be output "
"during our depth pre-pass, only applicable for the Forward+ renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the roughness buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The raw normal and roughness buffer is stored in an optimized format, "
"different than the one available in Spatial shaders. When sampling the "
"buffer, a conversion function must be applied. Use this function, copied from "
"[url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]here[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 normal_roughness_compatibility(vec4 p_normal_roughness) {\n"
"\tfloat roughness = p_normal_roughness.w;\n"
"\tif (roughness > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\troughness = 1.0 - roughness;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\troughness /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"roughness);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ normal ແລະ roughness ອອກມາໃນລະຫວ່າງ "
"depth pre-pass, ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ Forward+ renderer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ [method _render_callback], ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ roughness buffer "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນ normal ແລະ roughness ແບບດິບ (raw) ຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຕ່າງຈາກຮູບແບບທີ່ມີໃນ Spatial shaders. ເມື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ buffer, ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການແປງ. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້, ເຊິ່ງຄັດລອກມາຈາກ [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]ບ່ອນນີ້[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 normal_roughness_compatibility(vec4 p_normal_roughness) {\n"
"\tfloat roughness = p_normal_roughness.w;\n"
"\tif (roughness > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\troughness = 1.0 - roughness;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\troughness /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"roughness);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers specular data being rendered to a separate "
"buffer and combined after effects have been applied, only applicable for the "
"Forward+ renderer."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນ specular ຖືກເຣັນເດີແຍກໄປຍັງ buffer ອື່ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນຫຼັງຈາກ apply effect ແລ້ວ, ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ Forward+ renderer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The callback is called before our opaque rendering pass, but after depth "
"prepass (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"Callback ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນ opaque rendering pass, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ຫຼັງ depth prepass (ຖ້າມີ)."

msgid ""
"The callback is called after our opaque rendering pass, but before our sky is "
"rendered."
msgstr ""
"Callback ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກ opaque rendering pass, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ກ່ອນການເຣັນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ (sky)."

msgid ""
"The callback is called after our sky is rendered, but before our back buffers "
"are created (and if enabled, before subsurface scattering and/or screen space "
"reflections)."
msgstr ""
"Callback ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກການເຣັນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ກ່ອນການສ້າງ back buffers (ແລະ "
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະຢູ່ກ່ອນ subsurface scattering ແລະ/ຫຼື screen space reflections)."

msgid ""
"The callback is called before our transparent rendering pass, but after our "
"sky is rendered and we've created our back buffers."
msgstr ""
"Callback ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນ transparent rendering pass, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກການເຣັນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ "
"ການສ້າງ back buffers ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The callback is called after our transparent rendering pass, but before any "
"built-in post-processing effects and output to our render target."
msgstr ""
"Callback ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກ transparent rendering pass, ແຕ່ຈະຢູ່ກ່ອນ post-processing "
"effects ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາກັບລະບົບ ແລະ ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອອກໄປຍັງ render target."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EffectCallbackType] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum EffectCallbackType]."

msgid "An optionally compressed [Cubemap]."
msgstr "[Cubemap] ທີ່ສາມາດບີບອັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A cubemap that is loaded from a [code].ccube[/code] file. This file format is "
"internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image formats with the "
"import system. [CompressedCubemap] can use one of 4 compression methods:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. The "
"[b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the required "
"storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU as the "
"texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Cubemap] for a general description of cubemaps."
msgstr ""
"Cubemap ທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດຈາກໄຟລ໌ [code].ccube[/code]. ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot; "
"ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບອື່ນໆຜ່ານລະບົບການນຳເຂົ້າ. "
"[CompressedCubemap] ສາມາດໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດໄດ້ 4 ແບບ:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP ຫຼື PNG, ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດໃນ GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດໃນ GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (ບີບອັດໃນ GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດໃນ GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (ບີບອັດໃນ GPU. ມີຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍກວ່າ VRAM Compressed, ແຕ່ບີບອັດຊ້າກວ່າ "
"ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳກວ່າ VRAM Compressed)\n"
"ສະເພາະ [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ GPU ໄດ້ແທ້ໆ. "
"ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [b]Lossless[/b] ແລະ [b]Lossy[/b] ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບໃນດິສກ໌ (disk), "
"ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ GPU ເນື່ອງຈາກ texture ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປ GPU ແບບບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງເວລາໃນການໂຫຼດ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ texture ທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ "
"VRAM ຈະໂຫຼດໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ texture ທີ່ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ lossless ຫຼື lossy. ການບີບອັດແບບ VRAM "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍແຕກ (artifacts) ໄດ້ ແລະ ເໝາະສຳລັບການໃຊ້ໃນ 3D rendering, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 2D.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [Cubemap] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທົ່ວໄປຂອງ cubemaps."

