"ສະເພາະ [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ GPU ໄດ້ແທ້ໆ. "
"ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [b]Lossless[/b] ແລະ [b]Lossy[/b] ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບໃນດິສກ໌, "
"ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ GPU ເນື່ອງຈາກ texture ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປ GPU ແບບບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງເວລາໃນການໂຫຼດ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ texture ທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ "
"VRAM ຈະໂຫຼດໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ texture ທີ່ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ lossless ຫຼື lossy. ການບີບອັດແບບ VRAM "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍແຕກ (artifacts) ໄດ້ ແລະ ເໝາະສຳລັບການໃຊ້ໃນ 3D rendering, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 2D.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [Texture2DArray] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທົ່ວໄປຂອງ texture arrays."

msgid "Texture with 3 dimensions, optionally compressed."
msgstr "Texture ແບບ 3 ມິຕິ, ສາມາດບີບອັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"[CompressedTexture3D] is the VRAM-compressed counterpart of [ImageTexture3D]. "
"The file extension for [CompressedTexture3D] files is [code].ctex3d[/code]. "
"This file format is internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image "
"formats with the import system.\n"
"[CompressedTexture3D] uses VRAM compression, which allows to reduce memory "
"usage on the GPU when rendering the texture. This also improves loading "
"times, as VRAM-compressed textures are faster to load compared to textures "
"using lossless compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts "
"and is intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Texture3D] for a general description of 3D textures."
msgstr ""
"[CompressedTexture3D] ແມ່ນຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ VRAM ຂອງ [ImageTexture3D]. "
"ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບ [CompressedTexture3D] ແມ່ນ [code].ctex3d[/code]. "
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງ Godot; "
"ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບແບບຮູບພາບອື່ນໆຜ່ານລະບົບການນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"
"[CompressedTexture3D] ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ VRAM, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນ GPU "
"ເມື່ອເຣັນເດີ texture. ນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງເວລາໃນການໂຫຼດ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ texture ທີ່ບີບອັດແບບ VRAM "
"ຈະໂຫຼດໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ texture ທີ່ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບ lossless. ການບີບອັດແບບ VRAM "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍແຕກ (artifacts) ໄດ້ ແລະ ເໝາະສຳລັບການໃຊ້ໃນ 3D rendering, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 2D.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [Texture3D] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທົ່ວໄປຂອງ texture 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "The [CompressedTexture3D]'s file path to a [code].ctex3d[/code] file."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ (path) ຂອງ [CompressedTexture3D] ໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ [code].ctex3d[/code]."

msgid "Base class for texture arrays that can optionally be compressed."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານ (base class) ສຳລັບ texture arrays ທີ່ສາມາດບີບອັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Base class for [CompressedTexture2DArray] and [CompressedTexture3D]. Cannot "
"be used directly, but contains all the functions necessary for accessing the "
"derived resource types. See also [TextureLayered]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ [CompressedTexture2DArray] ແລະ [CompressedTexture3D]. "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍກົງໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ສືບທອດມາ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[TextureLayered] ນຳ."

msgid "Loads the texture at [param path]."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດ texture ທີ່ [param path]."

msgid "The path the texture should be loaded from."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ (path) ທີ່ texture ຄວນຖືກໂຫຼດມາ."

msgid "A 2D polyline shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງເສັ້ນ polyline 2 ມິຕິ ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳ (collision) ທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 2D polyline shape, intended for use in physics. Used internally in "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] when it's in [constant "
"CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SEGMENTS] mode.\n"
"Being just a collection of interconnected line segments, "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the most freely configurable single 2D shape. It "
"can be used to form polygons of any nature, or even shapes that don't enclose "
"an area. However, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is [i]hollow[/i] even if the "
"interconnected line segments do enclose an area, which often makes it "
"unsuitable for physics or detection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used for collision, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is intended to "
"work with static [CollisionShape2D] nodes like [StaticBody2D] and will likely "
"not behave well for [CharacterBody2D]s or [RigidBody2D]s in a mode other than "
"Static.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Physics bodies that are small have a chance to clip through "
"this shape when moving fast. This happens because on one frame, the physics "
"body may be on the \"outside\" of the shape, and on the next frame it may be "
"\"inside\" it. [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is hollow, so it won't detect a "
"collision.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Due to its complexity, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the "
"slowest 2D collision shape to check collisions against. Its use should "
"generally be limited to level geometry. If the polyline is closed, "
"[CollisionPolygon2D]'s [constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] mode can be "
"used, which decomposes the polygon into convex ones; see "
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D]'s documentation for instructions."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງເສັ້ນ polyline 2 ມິຕິ, ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ [CollisionPolygon2D] "
"ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ [constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SEGMENTS].\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນພຽງການລວມຕົວກັນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] ຈຶ່ງເປັນຮູບຊົງ 2 "
"ມິຕິທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະທີ່ສຸດ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ (polygon) ໃນຮູບແບບໃດກໍໄດ້, ຫຼື "
"ແມ່ນແຕ່ຮູບຊົງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດລ້ອມພື້ນທີ່. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] ແມ່ນ [i]ເປັນຮູ "
"(hollow)[/i] ເຖິງວ່າເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນຈະປິດລ້ອມພື້ນທີ່ກໍຕາມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການກວດສອບທາງຟີຊິກ ຫຼື ການກວດຈັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳ (collision), [ConcavePolygonShape2D] "
"ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບໂນດ [CollisionShape2D] ທີ່ເປັນແບບ static ເຊັ່ນ "
"[StaticBody2D] ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີກັບ [CharacterBody2D] ຫຼື [RigidBody2D] "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ Static.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍມີໂອກາດທີ່ຈະທະລຸຜ່ານຮູບຊົງນີ້ເມື່ອເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. "
"ນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າໃນເຟຣມ (frame) ໜຶ່ງ, ວັດຖຸອາດຈະຢູ່ \"ຂ້າງນອກ\" ຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ແລະ "
"ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປມັນອາດຈະໄປຢູ່ \"ຂ້າງໃນ\". [ConcavePolygonShape2D] ເປັນຮູ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ກວດພົບການຕຳ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງມັນ, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] ແມ່ນຮູບຊົງການຕຳ "
"2 ມິຕິທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດໃນການກວດສອບ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນຈຳກັດການໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ສະເພາະກັບເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງສາກ "
"(level geometry). ຖ້າເສັ້ນ polyline ເປັນແບບປິດ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant "
"CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] ຂອງ [CollisionPolygon2D] ແທນໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະແຍກຮູບຫຼາຍແຈອອກເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແບບນູນ (convex); ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຂອງ [ConvexPolygonShape2D] "
"ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

msgid ""
"The array of points that make up the [ConcavePolygonShape2D]'s line segments. "
"The array (of length divisible by two) is naturally divided into pairs (one "
"pair for each segment); each pair consists of the starting point of a segment "
"and the endpoint of a segment."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣ (array) ຂອງຈຸດທີ່ປະກອບເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ຂອງ [ConcavePolygonShape2D]. ອາເຣ "
"(ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວຫານຂາດໃຫ້ສອງ) ຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນຄູ່ໂດຍທຳມະຊາດ (ໜຶ່ງຄູ່ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເສັ້ນ); "
"ແຕ່ລະຄູ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງເສັ້ນ."

msgid "A 3D trimesh shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ trimesh 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D trimesh shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"Being just a collection of interconnected triangles, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] "
"is the most freely configurable single 3D shape. It can be used to form "
"polyhedra of any nature, or even shapes that don't enclose a volume. However, "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] is [i]hollow[/i] even if the interconnected triangles "
"do enclose a volume, which often makes it unsuitable for physics or "
"detection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used for collision, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is intended to "
"work with static [CollisionShape3D] nodes like [StaticBody3D] and will likely "
"not behave well for [CharacterBody3D]s or [RigidBody3D]s in a mode other than "
"Static.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Physics bodies that are small have a chance to clip through "
"this shape when moving fast. This happens because on one frame, the physics "
"body may be on the \"outside\" of the shape, and on the next frame it may be "
"\"inside\" it. [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is hollow, so it won't detect a "
"collision.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Due to its complexity, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is the "
"slowest 3D collision shape to check collisions against. Its use should "
"generally be limited to level geometry. For convex geometry, "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] should be used. For dynamic physics bodies that need "
"concave collision, several [ConvexPolygonShape3D]s can be used to represent "
"its collision by using convex decomposition; see [ConvexPolygonShape3D]'s "
"documentation for instructions."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງ trimesh 3 ມິຕິ, ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງແກ່ "
"[CollisionShape3D].\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເປັນພຽງການລວມຕົວກັນຂອງຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ຈຶ່ງເປັນຮູບຊົງ "
"3 ມິຕິທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະທີ່ສຸດ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຊົງ 3 ມິຕິ (polyhedra) "
"ໃນຮູບແບບໃດກໍໄດ້, ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ຮູບຊົງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດລ້ອມປະລິມານ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] ແມ່ນ [i]ເປັນຮູ (hollow)[/i] "
"ເຖິງວ່າຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນຈະປິດລ້ອມປະລິມານກໍຕາມ, "
"ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການກວດສອບທາງຟີຊິກ ຫຼື ການກວດຈັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳ (collision), [ConcavePolygonShape3D] "
"ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ທີ່ເປັນແບບ static ເຊັ່ນ "
"[StaticBody3D] ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີກັບ [CharacterBody3D] ຫຼື [RigidBody3D] "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ Static.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍມີໂອກາດທີ່ຈະທະລຸຜ່ານຮູບຊົງນີ້ເມື່ອເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. "
"ນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າໃນເຟຣມໜຶ່ງ, ວັດຖຸອາດຈະຢູ່ \"ຂ້າງນອກ\" ຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ແລະ ໃນເຟຣມຖັດໄປມັນອາດຈະໄປຢູ່ "
"\"ຂ້າງໃນ\". [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ເປັນຮູ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ກວດພົບການຕຳ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງມັນ, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ແມ່ນຮູບຊົງການຕຳ "
"3 ມິຕິທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດໃນການກວດສອບ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄວນຈຳກັດການໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ສະເພາະກັບເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງສາກ. "
"ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດແບບນູນ, ຄວນໃຊ້ [ConvexPolygonShape3D]. ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທາງຟີຊິກແບບໄດນາມິກ "
"(dynamic) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການການຕຳແບບເວົ້າ (concave), ສາມາດໃຊ້ [ConvexPolygonShape3D] "
"ຫຼາຍໆອັນມາປະກອບກັນເພື່ອແທນການຕຳໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ convex decomposition; ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຂອງ "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the faces of the trimesh shape as an array of vertices. The array (of "
"length divisible by three) is naturally divided into triples; each triple of "
"vertices defines a triangle."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນດ້ານ (faces) ຂອງຮູບຊົງ trimesh ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ (vertices). ອາເຣ "
"(ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວຫານຂາດໃຫ້ສາມ) ຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນກຸ່ມລະສາມຈຸດໂດຍທຳມະຊາດ; "
"ແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມສາມຈຸດຈະກຳນົດເປັນຮູບສາມແຈໜຶ່ງຮູບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the faces of the trimesh shape from an array of vertices. The [param "
"faces] array should be composed of triples such that each triple of vertices "
"defines a triangle."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ານ (faces) ຂອງຮູບຊົງ trimesh ຈາກອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ. ອາເຣ [param faces] "
"ຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍກຸ່ມລະສາມຈຸດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມສາມຈຸດກຳນົດເປັນຮູບສາມແຈໜຶ່ງຮູບ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], collisions occur on both sides of the concave "
"shape faces. Otherwise they occur only along the face normals."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຕຳຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງຮູບຊົງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະຕາມແນວ normal ຂອງດ້ານນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 3D physics bodies in a way that simulates a "
"ball-and-socket joint."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ (joint) ທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິສອງອັນໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຈຳລອງແບບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ລູກໝາກ (ball-and-"
"socket)."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 3D physics bodies in a way that simulates a "
"ball-and-socket joint. The twist axis is initiated as the X axis of the "
"[ConeTwistJoint3D]. Once the physics bodies swing, the twist axis is "
"calculated as the middle of the X axes of the joint in the local space of the "
"two physics bodies. Useful for limbs like shoulders and hips, lamps hanging "
"off a ceiling, etc."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ທາງຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3 ມິຕິສອງອັນໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຈຳລອງແບບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ລູກໝາກ. ແກນບິດ (twist axis) "
"ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນແກນ X ຂອງ [ConeTwistJoint3D]. ເມື່ອວັດຖຸຟີຊິກແກວ່ງ, "
"ແກນບິດຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເປັນຄ່າກາງຂອງແກນ X ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໃນ local space ຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກທັງສອງ. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຂອງອະໄວຍະວະ ເຊັ່ນ: ບ່າ ແລະ ສະໂພກ, ໂຄມໄຟທີ່ແຂວນຈາກເພດານ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Returns the value of the specified parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ (parameter) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sets the value of the specified parameter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ (parameter) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"The speed with which the swing or twist will take place.\n"
"The higher, the faster."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວທີ່ການແກວ່ງ ຫຼື ການບິດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຍິ່ງຄ່າສູງ, ຍິ່ງໄວ."

msgid ""
"Defines, how fast the swing- and twist-speed-difference on both sides gets "
"synced."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຄວາມໄວໃນການແກວ່ງ ແລະ ການບິດຂອງທັງສອງເບື້ອງຈະຖືກຊິງຄ໌ (synced) "
"ເຂົ້າຫາກັນໄວເທົ່າໃດ."

msgid ""
"The ease with which the joint starts to twist. If it's too low, it takes more "
"force to start twisting the joint."
msgstr "ຄວາມງ່າຍທີ່ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະເລີ່ມບິດ. ຖ້າຄ່ານີ້ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ, ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຮງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເລີ່ມບິດຂໍ້ຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Swing is rotation from side to side, around the axis perpendicular to the "
"twist axis.\n"
"The swing span defines, how much rotation will not get corrected along the "
"swing axis.\n"
"Could be defined as looseness in the [ConeTwistJoint3D].\n"
"If below 0.05, this behavior is locked."
msgstr ""
"Swing ແມ່ນການໝຸນຈາກເບື້ອງໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກເບື້ອງໜຶ່ງ ອ້ອມຮອບແກນທີ່ຕັ້ງສາກກັບແກນບິດ.\n"
"ໄລຍະການແກວ່ງ (swing span) ກຳນົດວ່າການໝຸນເທົ່າໃດທີ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂຕາມແກນແກວ່ງ.\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດເປັນຄວາມຫຼົມໃນ [ConeTwistJoint3D].\n"
"ຖ້າຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0.05, ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຈະຖືກລັອກ."

msgid ""
"Twist is the rotation around the twist axis, this value defined how far the "
"joint can twist.\n"
"Twist is locked if below 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Twist ແມ່ນການໝຸນອ້ອມແກນບິດ, ຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສາມາດບິດໄດ້ໄກປານໃດ.\n"
"Twist ຈະຖືກລັອກຖ້າຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0.05."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Param] enum."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ [enum Param] enum."

msgid "Helper class to handle INI-style files."
msgstr "ຄລາສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຮູບແບບ INI."

msgid ""
"This helper class can be used to store [Variant] values on the filesystem "
"using INI-style formatting. The stored values are identified by a section and "
"a key:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"[section]\n"
"some_key=42\n"
"string_example=\"Hello World3D!\"\n"
"a_vector=Vector3(1, 0, 2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The stored data can be saved to or parsed from a file, though ConfigFile "
"objects can also be used directly without accessing the filesystem.\n"
"The following example shows how to create a simple [ConfigFile] and save it "
"on disc:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Create new ConfigFile object.\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Store some values.\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10)\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001)\n"
"\n"
"# Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n"
"config.save(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Create new ConfigFile object.\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Store some values.\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10);\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001);\n"
"\n"
"// Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n"
"config.Save(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This example shows how the above file could be loaded:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var score_data = {}\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Load data from a file.\n"
"var err = config.load(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"\n"
"# If the file didn't load, ignore it.\n"
"if err != OK:\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\n"
"# Iterate over all sections.\n"
"for player in config.get_sections():\n"
"\t# Fetch the data for each section.\n"
"\tvar player_name = config.get_value(player, \"player_name\")\n"
"\tvar player_score = config.get_value(player, \"best_score\")\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var score_data = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Load data from a file.\n"
"Error err = config.Load(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"\n"
"// If the file didn't load, ignore it.\n"
"if (err != Error.Ok)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Iterate over all sections.\n"
"foreach (String player in config.GetSections())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Fetch the data for each section.\n"
"\tvar player_name = (String)config.GetValue(player, \"player_name\");\n"
"\tvar player_score = (int)config.GetValue(player, \"best_score\");\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Any operation that mutates the ConfigFile such as [method set_value], [method "
"clear], or [method erase_section], only changes what is loaded in memory. If "
"you want to write the change to a file, you have to save the changes with "
"[method save], [method save_encrypted], or [method save_encrypted_pass].\n"
"Keep in mind that section and property names can't contain spaces. Anything "
"after a space will be ignored on save and on load.\n"
"ConfigFiles can also contain manually written comment lines starting with a "
"semicolon ([code];[/code]). Those lines will be ignored when parsing the "
"file. Note that comments will be lost when saving the ConfigFile. This can "
"still be useful for dedicated server configuration files, which are typically "
"never overwritten without explicit user action.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The file extension given to a ConfigFile does not have any "
"impact on its formatting or behavior. By convention, the [code].cfg[/code] "
"extension is used here, but any other extension such as [code].ini[/code] is "
"also valid. Since neither [code].cfg[/code] nor [code].ini[/code] are "
"standardized, Godot's ConfigFile formatting may differ from files written by "
"other programs."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າ [Variant] ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ INI. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຈະຖືກລະບຸໂດຍ ສ່ວນ (section) ແລະ ຄີ (key):\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"[section]\n"
"some_key=42\n"
"string_example=\"Hello World3D!\"\n"
"a_vector=Vector3(1, 0, 2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ສາມາດບັນທຶກລົງ ຫຼື ອ່ານຈາກໄຟລ໌ໄດ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ ConfigFile objects "
"ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງວິທີສ້າງ [ConfigFile] ແບບງ່າຍໆ ແລະ ບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ສ້າງ ConfigFile object ໃໝ່.\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# ເກັບບາງຄ່າໄວ້.\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10)\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001)\n"
"\n"
"# ບັນທຶກລົງໄຟລ໌ (ຂຽນທັບຖ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ).\n"
"config.save(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ສ້າງ ConfigFile object ໃໝ່.\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// ເກັບບາງຄ່າໄວ້.\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10);\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001);\n"
"\n"
"// ບັນທຶກລົງໄຟລ໌ (ຂຽນທັບຖ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ).\n"
"config.Save(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສະແດງວິທີການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຂ້າງເທິງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var score_data = {}\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌.\n"
"var err = config.load(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"\n"
"# ຖ້າໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມໄປ.\n"
"if err != OK:\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\n"
"# ວົນຮອບທຸກໆສ່ວນ (sections).\n"
"for player in config.get_sections():\n"
"\t# ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ.\n"
"\tvar player_name = config.get_value(player, \"player_name\")\n"
"\tvar player_score = config.get_value(player, \"best_score\")\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var score_data = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌.\n"
"Error err = config.Load(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"\n"
"// ຖ້າໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມໄປ.\n"
"if (err != Error.Ok)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// ວົນຮອບທຸກໆສ່ວນ (sections).\n"
"foreach (String player in config.GetSections())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ.\n"
"\tvar player_name = (String)config.GetValue(player, \"player_name\");\n"
"\tvar player_score = (int)config.GetValue(player, \"best_score\");\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ການດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງ ConfigFile ເຊັ່ນ [method set_value], [method clear], ຫຼື "
"[method erase_section] ຈະປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະສິ່ງທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນການປ່ຽນແປງລົງໃນໄຟລ໌, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບັນທຶກດ້ວຍ [method save], [method "
"save_encrypted], ຫຼື [method save_encrypted_pass].\n"
"ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຊື່ສ່ວນ (section) ແລະ ຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດ (property) ບໍ່ສາມາດມີຍະຫວ່າງໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງຍະຫວ່າງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໃນເວລາບັນທຶກ ແລະ ເວລາໂຫຼດ.\n"
"ConfigFile ຍັງສາມາດມີແຖວຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comment) ທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍມືໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳຈຸດ "
"([code];[/code]). ແຖວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອມີການວິເຄາະ (parsing) ໄຟລ໌. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ "
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍຈະຫາຍໄປເມື່ອບັນທຶກ ConfigFile. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ dedicated "
"server ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຖືກຂຽນທັບໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກະທຳຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມອບໃຫ້ ConfigFile ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບແບບ ຫຼື ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງມັນ. "
"ຕາມທຳນຽມແລ້ວ ຈະໃຊ້ນາມສະກຸນ [code].cfg[/code] ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ແຕ່ນາມສະກຸນອື່ນໆເຊັ່ນ [code].ini[/"
"code] ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າທັງ [code].cfg[/code] ແລະ [code].ini[/code] "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ, ຮູບແບບ ConfigFile ຂອງ Godot ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຂຽນໂດຍໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນ."

msgid "Removes the entire contents of the config."
msgstr "ລຶບເນື້ອໃນທັງໝົດຂອງ config."

msgid ""
"Obtain the text version of this config file (the same text that would be "
"written to a file)."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ config ນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌)."

msgid ""
"Deletes the specified section along with all the key-value pairs inside. "
"Raises an error if the section does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບສ່ວນ (section) ທີ່ລະບຸ ພ້ອມກັບຄູ່ຄ່າ key-value ທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. "
"ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖ້າບໍ່ມີສ່ວນນັ້ນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Deletes the specified key in a section. Raises an error if either the section "
"or the key do not exist."
msgstr "ລຶບຄີ (key) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖ້າບໍ່ມີສ່ວນ ຫຼື ຄີນັ້ນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all defined key identifiers in the specified section. "
"Raises an error and returns an empty array if the section does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ຂອງຕົວລະບຸຄີທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ລະບຸ. ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າບໍ່ມີສ່ວນນັ້ນຢູ່."

msgid "Returns an array of all defined section identifiers."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ຂອງຕົວລະບຸສ່ວນ (section identifiers) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the current value for the specified section and key. If either the "
"section or the key do not exist, the method returns the fallback [param "
"default] value. If [param default] is not specified or set to [code]null[/"
"code], an error is also raised."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນສຳລັບສ່ວນ ແລະ ຄີທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າສ່ວນ ຫຼື ຄີບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ເມທອດຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສຳຮອງ [param "
"default]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ [param default] ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]null[/code], ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified section exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີສ່ວນ (section) ທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified section-key pair exists."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຄູ່ສ່ວນ-ຄີ (section-key) ທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Loads the config file specified as a parameter. The file's contents are "
"parsed and loaded in the [ConfigFile] object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ config ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນພາລາມິເຕີ. ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກວິເຄາະ ແລະ ໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນ [ConfigFile] "
"object ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Loads the encrypted config file specified as a parameter, using the provided "
"[param key] to decrypt it. The file's contents are parsed and loaded in the "
"[ConfigFile] object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ config ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param key] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເພື່ອຖອດລະຫັດ. "
"ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກວິເຄາະ ແລະ ໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນ [ConfigFile] object ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Loads the encrypted config file specified as a parameter, using the provided "
"[param password] to decrypt it. The file's contents are parsed and loaded in "
"the [ConfigFile] object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ config ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param password] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເພື່ອຖອດລະຫັດ. "
"ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກວິເຄາະ ແລະ ໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນ [ConfigFile] object ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Parses the passed string as the contents of a config file. The string is "
"parsed and loaded in the ConfigFile object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ວິເຄາະຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) ທີ່ສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ config. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກວິເຄາະ ແລະ "
"ໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນ ConfigFile object ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the file specified as a "
"parameter. The output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [ConfigFile] object ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸເປັນພາລາມິເຕີ. "
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງແບບ INI.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the AES-256 encrypted file "
"specified as a parameter, using the provided [param key] to encrypt it. The "
"output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [ConfigFile] object ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ AES-256 ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param key] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງແບບ INI.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the AES-256 encrypted file "
"specified as a parameter, using the provided [param password] to encrypt it. "
"The output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນຂອງ [ConfigFile] object ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ AES-256 ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param password] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງແບບ INI.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫາກສຳເລັດ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ [enum Error] ອື່ນໆ ຫາກການດຳເນີນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Assigns a value to the specified key of the specified section. If either the "
"section or the key do not exist, they are created. Passing a [code]null[/"
"code] value deletes the specified key if it exists, and deletes the section "
"if it ends up empty once the key has been removed."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບຄີ (key) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນສ່ວນ (section) ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າສ່ວນ ຫຼື ຄີບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ການສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຈະລຶບຄີທີ່ລະບຸຫາກມັນມີຢູ່, ແລະ "
"ຈະລຶບສ່ວນນັ້ນອອກຫາກມັນກາຍເປັນສ່ວນຫວ່າງເປົ່າຫຼັງຈາກລຶບຄີອອກແລ້ວ."

msgid "A dialog used for confirmation of actions."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກ (dialog) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນການກະທຳ."

msgid ""
"A dialog used for confirmation of actions. This window is similar to "
"[AcceptDialog], but pressing its Cancel button can have a different outcome "
"from pressing the OK button. The order of the two buttons varies depending on "
"the host OS.\n"
"To get cancel action, you can use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_cancel_button().pressed.connect(_on_canceled)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetCancelButton().Pressed += OnCanceled;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AcceptDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call "
"one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""
"ໄດອາລັອກທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນການກະທຳ. ວິນໂດນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [AcceptDialog], ແຕ່ການກົດປຸ່ມ ຍົກເລີກ "
"(Cancel) ສາມາດໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການກົດປຸ່ມ ຕົກລົງ (OK). "
"ລຳດັບຂອງສອງປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS).\n"
"ເພື່ອຮັບການກະທຳການຍົກເລີກ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_cancel_button().pressed.connect(_on_canceled)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetCancelButton().Pressed += OnCanceled;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [AcceptDialog] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງອອກມາ, "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]popup_*[/code] ໃດໜຶ່ງຈາກ [Window] ໃນໂນດ, ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped]."

msgid ""
"Returns the cancel button.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນປຸ່ມຍົກເລີກ (cancel button).\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ທຳລາຍມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງ ຫຼື ຫຼົ້ມໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ຫຼື ໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.visible] "
"ຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"The text displayed by the cancel button (see [method get_cancel_button])."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນປຸ່ມຍົກເລີກ (ເບິ່ງ [method get_cancel_button])."

msgid "Base class for all GUI containers."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ GUI containers ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Base class for all GUI containers. A [Container] automatically arranges its "
"child controls in a certain way. This class can be inherited to make custom "
"container types."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ GUI containers ທັງໝົດ. [Container] ຈະຈັດລຽງ child controls "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດຖືກສືບທອດ (inherited) ເພື່ອສ້າງປະເພດ container "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Implement to return a list of allowed horizontal [enum Control.SizeFlags] for "
"child nodes. This doesn't technically prevent the usages of any other size "
"flags, if your implementation requires that. This only limits the options "
"available to the user in the Inspector dock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Having no size flags is equal to having [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. As such, this value is always implicitly allowed."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການ [enum Control.SizeFlags] ລວງນອນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບໂນດລູກ (child "
"nodes). ຕາມທາງເຕັກນິກແລ້ວ ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອງກັນການໃຊ້ size flags ອື່ນໆ "
"ຖ້າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ມັນພຽງແຕ່ຈຳກັດຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Inspector dock ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການບໍ່ມີ size flags ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການມີ [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈຶ່ງຖືກອະນຸຍາດໂດຍປະຍາຍສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Implement to return a list of allowed vertical [enum Control.SizeFlags] for "
"child nodes. This doesn't technically prevent the usages of any other size "
"flags, if your implementation requires that. This only limits the options "
"available to the user in the Inspector dock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Having no size flags is equal to having [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. As such, this value is always implicitly allowed."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການ [enum Control.SizeFlags] ລວງຕັ້ງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບໂນດລູກ (child "
"nodes). ຕາມທາງເຕັກນິກແລ້ວ ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອງກັນການໃຊ້ size flags ອື່ນໆ "
"ຖ້າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ມັນພຽງແຕ່ຈຳກັດຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Inspector dock ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການບໍ່ມີ size flags ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການມີ [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈຶ່ງຖືກອະນຸຍາດໂດຍປະຍາຍສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Fit a child control in a given rect. This is mainly a helper for creating "
"custom container classes."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດ child control ໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຮູບສີ່ແຈ (rect) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງຄລາສ container ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Queue resort of the contained children. This is called automatically anyway, "
"but can be called upon request."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຄິວ (queue) ເພື່ອຈັດລຽງໂນດລູກພາຍໃນໃໝ່. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຢູ່ແລ້ວ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this container is marked as a region for accessibility. "
"Use [member Control.accessibility_name] to give the region a descriptive "
"name. Screen readers can navigate between regions using landmark navigation."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], container ນີ້ຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ "
"(accessibility). ໃຊ້ [member Control.accessibility_name] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນ. "
"ເຄື່ອງອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (Screen readers) ສາມາດນຳທາງລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ຕ່າງໆ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການນຳທາງແບບ landmark."

msgid "Emitted when children are going to be sorted."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂນດລູກກຳລັງຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງ."

msgid "Emitted when sorting the children is needed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຈັດລຽງໂນດລູກ."

msgid ""
"Notification just before children are going to be sorted, in case there's "
"something to process beforehand."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ອນທີ່ໂນດລູກຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີບາງຢ່າງຕ້ອງປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Notification for when sorting the children, it must be obeyed immediately."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີການຈັດລຽງໂນດລູກ, ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປະຕິບັດຕາມທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Base class for all GUI controls. Adapts its position and size based on its "
"parent control."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ GUI controls ທັງໝົດ. ປັບຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນຕາມ parent control."

msgid ""
"Base class for all UI-related nodes. [Control] features a bounding rectangle "
"that defines its extents, an anchor position relative to its parent control "
"or the current viewport, and offsets relative to the anchor. The offsets "
"update automatically when the node, any of its parents, or the screen size "
"change.\n"
"For more information on Godot's UI system, anchors, offsets, and containers, "
"see the related tutorials in the manual. To build flexible UIs, you'll need a "
"mix of UI elements that inherit from [Control] and [Container] nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since both [Node2D] and [Control] inherit from [CanvasItem], "
"they share several concepts from the class such as the [member "
"CanvasItem.z_index] and [member CanvasItem.visible] properties.\n"
"[b]User Interface nodes and input[/b]\n"
"Godot propagates input events via viewports. Each [Viewport] is responsible "
"for propagating [InputEvent]s to their child nodes. As the [member "
"SceneTree.root] is a [Window], this already happens automatically for all UI "
"elements in your game.\n"
"Input events are propagated through the [SceneTree] from the root node to all "
"child nodes by calling [method Node._input]. For UI elements specifically, it "
"makes more sense to override the virtual method [method _gui_input], which "
"filters out unrelated input events, such as by checking z-order, [member "
"mouse_filter], focus, or if the event was inside of the control's bounding "
"box.\n"
"Call [method accept_event] so no other node receives the event. Once you "
"accept an input, it becomes handled so [method Node._unhandled_input] will "
"not process it.\n"
"Only one [Control] node can be in focus. Only the node in focus will receive "
"events. To get the focus, call [method grab_focus]. [Control] nodes lose "
"focus when another node grabs it, or if you hide the node in focus. Focus "
"will not be represented visually if gained via mouse/touch input, only "
"appearing with keyboard/gamepad input (for accessibility), or via [method "
"grab_focus].\n"
"Set [member mouse_filter] to [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to tell a "
"[Control] node to ignore mouse or touch events. You'll need it if you place "
"an icon on top of a button.\n"
"[Theme] resources change the control's appearance. The [member theme] of a "
"[Control] node affects all of its direct and indirect children (as long as a "
"chain of controls is uninterrupted). To override some of the theme items, "
"call one of the [code]add_theme_*_override[/code] methods, like [method "
"add_theme_font_override]. You can also override theme items in the "
"Inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Theme items are [i]not[/i] [Object] properties. This means you "
"can't access their values using [method Object.get] and [method Object.set]. "
"Instead, use the [code]get_theme_*[/code] and [code]add_theme_*_override[/"
"code] methods provided by this class."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໂນດ (nodes) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ UI ທັງໝົດ. [Control] ມີຄຸນສົມບັດເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອບເຂດ "
"(bounding rectangle) ທີ່ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂອງມັນ, ຕຳແໜ່ງສະໝໍ (anchor position) ທີ່ທຽບກັບ "
"parent control ຫຼື viewport ປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offsets) ທີ່ທຽບກັບສະໝໍ. "
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໂນດ, ໂນດແມ່ (parents) ຫຼື ຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບ UI ຂອງ Godot, ສະໝໍ, ໄລຍະຫ່າງ ແລະ container, "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນຄູ່ມື. ເພື່ອສ້າງ UI ທີ່ຢືດຢຸ່ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ UI elements ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[Control] ແລະ [Container] ປະສົມກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກທັງ [Node2D] ແລະ [Control] ຕ່າງກໍສືບທອດມາຈາກ [CanvasItem], "
"ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງມີແນວຄວາມຄິດບາງຢ່າງຮ່ວມກັນ ເຊັ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.z_index] ແລະ "
"[member CanvasItem.visible].\n"
"[b]ໂນດສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ອິນພຸດ (Input)[/b]\n"
"Godot ສົ່ງຕໍ່ເຫດການອິນພຸດ (input events) ຜ່ານ viewports. ແຕ່ລະ [Viewport] ມີໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ "
"[InputEvent] ໄປຫາໂນດລູກຂອງພວກມັນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ [member SceneTree.root] ເປັນ [Window], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຶ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບທຸກ UI elements ໃນເກມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"ເຫດການອິນພຸດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຜ່ານ [SceneTree] ຈາກ root node ໄປຫາໂນດລູກທັງໝົດໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method Node._input]. ສຳລັບ UI elements ໂດຍສະເພາະ, ມັນຈະມີປະໂຫຍດກວ່າຫາກຂຽນທັບ "
"(override) ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ [method _gui_input], ເຊິ່ງຈະກັ່ນຕອງເຫດການອິນພຸດທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງອອກ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ການກວດສອບລຳດັບ z (z-order), [member mouse_filter], ໂຟກັດ (focus) ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າເຫດການນັ້ນເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອງ control.\n"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method accept_event] ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ໂນດອື່ນໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຍອມຮັບ (accept) "
"ອິນພຸດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການແລ້ວ ດັ່ງນັ້ນ [method Node._unhandled_input] "
"ຈະບໍ່ປະມວນຜົນມັນ.\n"
"ມີພຽງແຕ່ໂນດ [Control] ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດໄດ້. "
"ສະເພາະໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການ. ເພື່ອດຶງໂຟກັດ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method grab_focus]. "
"ໂນດ [Control] ຈະເສຍໂຟກັດເມື່ອໂນດອື່ນດຶງມັນໄປ ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານເຊື່ອງໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດ. "
"ໂຟກັດຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນດ້ວຍຕາຫາກໄດ້ຮັບຜ່ານການໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌/ສຳພັດ, ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄີບອດ/ຈອຍເກມ "
"(ເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງ) ຫຼື ຜ່ານ [method grab_focus].\n"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member mouse_filter] ເປັນ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] ເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ໂນດ "
"[Control] ລະເລີຍເຫດການເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ການສຳພັດ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການສິ່ງນີ້ຫາກທ່ານວາງໄອຄອນໄວ້ເທິງປຸ່ມ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Theme] ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງ control. [member theme] ຂອງໂນດ "
"[Control] ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດລູກທັງໝົດ (ຕາບໃດທີ່ສາຍສຳພັນຂອງ controls ບໍ່ຖືກຂາດຕອນ). "
"ເພື່ອຂຽນທັບບາງລາຍການໃນ theme, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]add_theme_*_override[/code] "
"ໃດໜຶ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ [method add_theme_font_override]. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຂຽນທັບລາຍການ theme ໃນ "
"Inspector ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການ Theme [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [Object]. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Object.get] ແລະ [method "
"Object.set]. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]get_theme_*[/code] ແລະ "
"[code]add_theme_*_override[/code] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໃນຄລາສນີ້ແທນ."

msgid "GUI documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດສະນີເອກະສານ GUI"

msgid "Control node gallery"
msgstr "ຄັງລວມໂນດ Control"

msgid "Multiple resolutions"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດຫຼາຍແບບ"

msgid "All GUI Demos"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ GUI ທັງໝົດ"

msgid ""
"Return the description of the keyboard shortcuts and other contextual help "
"for this control."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງຄີລັດຄີບອດ (keyboard shortcuts) ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳອື່ນໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບ "
"control ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to test if [param data] from a control's [method "
"_get_drag_data] can be dropped at [param at_position]. [param at_position] is "
"local to this control.\n"
"This method should only be used to test the data. Process the data in [method "
"_drop_data].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drop "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\t# Check position if it is relevant to you\n"
"\t# Otherwise, just check data\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"expected\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Check position if it is relevant to you\n"
"\t// Otherwise, just check data\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"expected\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າ [param data] ຈາກ [method _get_drag_data] ຂອງ "
"control ສາມາດວາງ (drop) ລົງທີ່ [param at_position] ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. [param at_position] "
"ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງທຽບກັບ control ນີ້.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບຂໍ້ມູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສ່ວນການປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ເຮັດໃນ [method _drop_data].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າການລາກຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄີລັດຄີບອດ ຫຼື [method accessibility_drag], "
"[param at_position] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Vector2.INF], ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງລາຍການ/"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງວາງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\t# ກວດສອບຕຳແໜ່ງຫາກມັນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບທ່ານ\n"
"\t# ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"expected\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ກວດສອບຕຳແໜ່ງຫາກມັນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບທ່ານ\n"
"\t// ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"expected\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to pass you the [param data] from a control's [method "
"_get_drag_data] result. Godot first calls [method _can_drop_data] to test if "
"[param data] is allowed to drop at [param at_position] where [param "
"at_position] is local to this control.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drop "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"color\")\n"
"\n"
"func _drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\tvar color = data[\"color\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"color\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _DropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\tColor color = data.AsGodotDictionary()[\"color\"].AsColor();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງ [param data] ຈາກຜົນລັບຂອງ [method _get_drag_data] "
"ໃຫ້ທ່ານ. ທຳອິດ Godot ຈະເອີ້ນ [method _can_drop_data] ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າ [param data] "
"ຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວາງທີ່ [param at_position] ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າການລາກຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄີລັດຄີບອດ ຫຼື [method accessibility_drag], "
"[param at_position] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Vector2.INF], ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງລາຍການ/"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງວາງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"color\")\n"
"\n"
"func _drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\tvar color = data[\"color\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"color\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _DropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\tColor color = data.AsGodotDictionary()[\"color\"].AsColor();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Override this method to return a human-readable description of the position "
"of the child [param node] in the custom container, added to the [member "
"accessibility_name]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (Override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ກ່ຽວກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param "
"node] ລູກ ໃນ custom container, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [member accessibility_name]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the cursor shape for "
"the position [param at_position] in the control's local coordinates, which "
"will typically be used while hovering over this control. See [method "
"get_cursor_shape].\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງເຄີເຊີ (cursor "
"shape) ສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງ [param at_position] ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ control, "
"ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ມາເທິງ control ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_cursor_shape].\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."

msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to get data that can be dragged and dropped onto "
"controls that expect drop data. Returns [code]null[/code] if there is no data "
"to drag. Controls that want to receive drop data should implement [method "
"_can_drop_data] and [method _drop_data]. [param at_position] is local to this "
"control. Drag may be forced with [method force_drag].\n"
"A preview that will follow the mouse that should represent the data can be "
"set with [method set_drag_preview]. A good time to set the preview is in this "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drag "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\tvar mydata = make_data() # This is your custom method generating the drag "
"data.\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(make_preview(mydata)) # This is your custom method "
"generating the preview of the drag data.\n"
"\treturn mydata\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar myData = MakeData(); // This is your custom method generating the drag "
"data.\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(MakePreview(myData)); // This is your custom method "
"generating the preview of the drag data.\n"
"\treturn myData;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Godot ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເອົາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງລົງໃນ controls ທີ່ຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການວາງ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ລາກ. Controls ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການວາງຄວນຂຽນ "
"[method _can_drop_data] ແລະ [method _drop_data]. [param at_position] "
"ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງທຽບກັບ control ນີ້. ການລາກສາມາດບັງຄັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method force_drag].\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງສະແດງ (preview) ທີ່ຈະເລື່ອນຕາມເມົາສ໌ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"set_drag_preview]. ເວລາທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ preview ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນເມທອດນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າການລາກຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄີລັດຄີບອດ ຫຼື [method accessibility_drag], "
"[param at_position] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant Vector2.INF], ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງລາຍການ/"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງລາກ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\tvar mydata = make_data() # ນີ້ແມ່ນເມທອດກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກ.\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(make_preview(mydata)) # "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເມທອດກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງສະແດງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກ.\n"
"\treturn mydata\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar myData = MakeData(); // ນີ້ແມ່ນເມທອດກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກ.\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(MakePreview(myData)); // "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເມທອດກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງສະແດງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການລາກ.\n"
"\treturn myData;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the maximum size for "
"this control. Alternative to [member custom_maximum_size] for controlling "
"maximum size via code. The actual maximum size will be the max value of these "
"two (in each axis separately).\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will not be called when the script is attached to a "
"[Control] node that already overrides its maximum size (e.g. "
"[ScrollContainer]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended to use [method get_bound_minimum_size] instead "
"of [method get_combined_minimum_size] when implementing this method, as the "
"former respects maximum size limits when calculating the minimum size, while "
"the latter does not."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດສຳລັບ control ນີ້. "
"ເປັນທາງເລືອກນອກຈາກ [member custom_maximum_size] ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ. "
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຕົວຈິງຈະແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່ານີ້ (ໃນແຕ່ລະແກນແຍກກັນ).\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບຖືກຜູກກັບໂນດ [Control] "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງມັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ເຊັ່ນ: [ScrollContainer]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_bound_minimum_size] ແທນ [method "
"get_combined_minimum_size] ເມື່ອຂຽນເມທອດນີ້ "
"ເພາະແບບທຳອິດຈະຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂອບເຂດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດໃນເວລາຄຳນວນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແບບຫຼັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the minimum size for "
"this control. Alternative to [member custom_minimum_size] for controlling "
"minimum size via code. The actual minimum size will be the max value of these "
"two (in each axis separately).\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will not be called when the script is attached to a "
"[Control] node that already overrides its minimum size (e.g. [Label], "
"[Button], [PanelContainer] etc.). It can only be used with most basic GUI "
"nodes, like [Control], [Container], [Panel] etc."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບ control ນີ້. "
"ເປັນທາງເລືອກນອກຈາກ [member custom_minimum_size] ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ. "
"ຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຕົວຈິງຈະແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງສອງຄ່ານີ້ (ໃນແຕ່ລະແກນແຍກກັນ).\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບຖືກຜູກກັບໂນດ [Control] "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງມັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ເຊັ່ນ: [Label], [Button], [PanelContainer] ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ). ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບໂນດ GUI ພື້ນຖານເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ [Control], [Container], [Panel] "
"ເປັນຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the tooltip text for "
"the position [param at_position] in the control's local coordinates, which "
"will typically appear when the cursor is resting over this control. See "
"[method get_tooltip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method returns an empty [String] and [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] is not overridden, no tooltip is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip "
"text) ສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງ [param at_position] ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ control, "
"ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີຢຸດຢູ່ເທິງ control ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [method get_tooltip].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [String] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip], ຈະບໍ່ມີການສະແດງ tooltip ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Return the auto-translation mode at the given [param at_position]. If not "
"implemented, the [member tooltip_auto_translate_mode] property will be used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການແປພາສາອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto-translation mode) ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param at_position] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member tooltip_auto_translate_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Override this method to handle "
"and accept inputs on UI elements. See also [method accept_event].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Click on the control to print a message:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n"
"\t\tif event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT and event.pressed:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"I've been clicked D:\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _GuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton mb)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (mb.ButtonIndex == MouseButton.Left && mb.Pressed)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"I've been clicked D:\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If the [param event] inherits [InputEventMouse], this method will [b]not[/b] "
"be called when:\n"
"- the control's [member mouse_filter] is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- the control is obstructed by another control on top, that doesn't have "
"[member mouse_filter] set to [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- the control's parent has [member mouse_filter] set to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP] or has accepted the event;\n"
"- the control's parent has [member clip_contents] enabled and the [param "
"event]'s position is outside the parent's rectangle;\n"
"- the [param event]'s position is outside the control (see [method "
"_has_point]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param event]'s position is relative to this control's "
"origin."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ ແລະ "
"ຍອມຮັບອິນພຸດໃນ UI elements. ເບິ່ງ [method accept_event] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຄລິກໃສ່ control ເພື່ອພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n"
"\t\tif event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT and event.pressed:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"ຂ້ອຍຖືກຄລິກແລ້ວ D:\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _GuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton mb)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (mb.ButtonIndex == MouseButton.Left && mb.Pressed)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"ຂ້ອຍຖືກຄລິກແລ້ວ D:\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ຖ້າ [param event] ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [InputEventMouse], ເມທອດນີ້ຈະ [b]ບໍ່[/b] ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອ:\n"
"- [member mouse_filter] ຂອງ control ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- control ຖືກບັງໂດຍ control ອື່ນທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງ [member mouse_filter] ເປັນ "
"[constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- ໂນດແມ່ (parent) ຂອງ control ມີ [member mouse_filter] ເປັນ [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP] ຫຼື ໄດ້ຍອມຮັບເຫດການນັ້ນໄປແລ້ວ;\n"
"- ໂນດແມ່ຂອງ control ເປີດໃຊ້ [member clip_contents] ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param event] "
"ຢູ່ນອກຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອງໂນດແມ່;\n"
"- ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param event] ຢູ່ນອກ control (ເບິ່ງ [method _has_point]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [param event] ແມ່ນທຽບກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (origin) ຂອງ control ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns whether the given "
"[param point] is inside this control.\n"
"If not overridden, default behavior is checking if the point is within the "
"control's Rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a point is inside the control, you can "
"use [code]Rect2(Vector2.ZERO, size).has_point(point)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param point] "
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຢູ່ພາຍໃນ control ນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການກວດສອບວ່າຈຸດນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນ Rect ຂອງ control ບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງຢູ່ໃນ control, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ "
"[code]Rect2(Vector2.ZERO, size).has_point(point)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns a [Control] node that "
"should be used as a tooltip instead of the default one. [param for_text] is "
"the return value of [method get_tooltip].\n"
"The returned node must be of type [Control] or Control-derived. It can have "
"child nodes of any type. It is freed when the tooltip disappears, so make "
"sure you always provide a new instance (if you want to use a pre-existing "
"node from your scene tree, you can duplicate it and pass the duplicated "
"instance). When [code]null[/code] or a non-Control node is returned, the "
"default tooltip will be used instead.\n"
"The returned node will be added as child to a [PopupPanel], so you should "
"only provide the contents of that panel. That [PopupPanel] can be themed "
"using [method Theme.set_stylebox] for the type [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] "
"(see [member tooltip_text] for an example).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The tooltip is shrunk to minimal size. If you want to ensure "
"it's fully visible, you might want to set its [member custom_minimum_size] to "
"some non-zero value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The node (and any relevant children) should have their [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] set to [code]true[/code] when returned, otherwise, the "
"viewport that instantiates it will not be able to calculate its minimum size "
"reliably.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If overridden, this method is called even if [method "
"get_tooltip] returns an empty string. When this happens with the default "
"tooltip, it is not displayed. To copy this behavior, return [code]null[/code] "
"in this method when [param for_text] is empty.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Use a constructed node as a tooltip:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\tlabel.text = for_text\n"
"\treturn label\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar label = new Label();\n"
"\tlabel.Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn label;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Use a scene instance as a tooltip:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar tooltip = preload(\"res://some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\ttooltip.get_node(\"Label\").text = for_text\n"
"\treturn tooltip\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode tooltip = ResourceLoader.Load<PackedScene>(\"res://"
"some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").Instantiate();\n"
"\ttooltip.GetNode<Label>(\"Label\").Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn tooltip;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (Virtual method) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນຂຶ້ນເອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ [Control] ທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ "
"tooltip ແທນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. [param for_text] ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກ [method get_tooltip].\n"
"ໂນດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດ [Control] ຫຼື ສືບທອດມາຈາກ Control. ມັນສາມາດມີໂນດລູກປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກທຳລາຍເມື່ອ tooltip ຫາຍໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ສະເໝີ "
"(ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໂນດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນ scene tree, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັັັັັດຊ້ຳ (duplicate) ມັນແລ້ວສົ່ງ "
"instance ທີ່ເຮັດຊ້ຳນັ້ນມາ). ເມື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຫຼື ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Control, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ "
"tooltip ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແທນ.\n"
"ໂນດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນລູກຂອງ [PopupPanel], ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຄວນກຳນົດພຽງແຕ່ເນື້ອໃນຂອງແຜງ (panel) "
"ນັ້ນ. [PopupPanel] ນັ້ນສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບ (themed) ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Theme.set_stylebox] "
"ສຳລັບປະເພດ [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Tooltip ຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ. "
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສະແດງອອກມາຄົບຖ້ວນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member "
"custom_minimum_size] ຂອງມັນໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ (ແລະ ໂນດລູກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ) ຄວນຕັ້ງ [member CanvasItem.visible] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຖືກສົ່ງຄືນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ viewport "
"ທີ່ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄຳນວນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກຂຽນທັບ, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [method get_tooltip] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າກໍຕາມ. ເພື່ອຮັກສາພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] "
"ໃນເມທອດນີ້ເມື່ອ [param for_text] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ໃຊ້ໂນດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນ tooltip:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\tlabel.text = for_text\n"
"\treturn label\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar label = new Label();\n"
"\tlabel.Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn label;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"User defined BiDi algorithm override function.\n"
"Returns an [Array] of [Vector3i] text ranges and text base directions, in the "
"left-to-right order. Ranges should cover full source [param text] without "
"overlaps. BiDi algorithm will be used on each range separately."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນຂຽນທັບ (override) ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ BiDi ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງ [Vector3i] ຊ່ວງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ທິດທາງພື້ນຖານຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ຕາມລຳດັບຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ. ຊ່ວງຄວນກວມເອົາ [param text] ຕົ້ນສະບັບທັງໝົດໂດຍບໍ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ "
"BiDi ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນແຕ່ລະຊ່ວງແຍກກັນ."

msgid ""
"Marks an input event as handled. Once you accept an input event, it stops "
"propagating, even to nodes listening to [method Node._unhandled_input] or "
"[method Node._unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect the methods in [Input], only the way events "
"are propagated."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າເຫດການອິນພຸດໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຍອມຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດ, ມັນຈະຢຸດການສົ່ງຕໍ່, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນໂນດທີ່ລໍຖ້າຟັງ [method Node._unhandled_input] ຫຼື [method "
"Node._unhandled_key_input] ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ເມທອດໃນ [Input], ມີຜົນພຽງແຕ່ວິທີການສົ່ງຕໍ່ເຫດການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Starts drag-and-drop operation without using a mouse."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ (drag-and-drop) ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌."

msgid "Ends drag-and-drop operation without using a mouse."
msgstr "ສິ້ນສຸດການດຳເນີນການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ (drag-and-drop) ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param name]. "
"Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for the "
"control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_color].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Override a [Label]'s color and reset it later:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Given the child Label node \"MyLabel\", override its font color with a "
"custom value.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color(1, 0.5, 0))\n"
"# Reset the font color of the child label.\n"
"$MyLabel.remove_theme_color_override(\"font_color\")\n"
"# Alternatively it can be overridden with the default value from the Label "
"type.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", "
"get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Label\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Given the child Label node \"MyLabel\", override its font color with a "
"custom value.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", new "
"Color(1, 0.5f, 0));\n"
"// Reset the font color of the child label.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").RemoveThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\");\n"
"// Alternatively it can be overridden with the default value from the Label "
"type.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", "
"GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Label\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ theme [Color] ດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດສະເໝີເມື່ອມີການດຶງລາຍການ theme ສຳລັບ control. "
"ສາມາດລຶບການຂຽນທັບອອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ຂຽນທັບສີຂອງ [Label] ແລະ ຣີເຊັດມັນພາຍຫຼັງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ສຳລັບໂນດ Label ລູກ \"MyLabel\", ຂຽນທັບສີຟອນດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color(1, 0.5, 0))\n"
"# ຣີເຊັດສີຟອນຂອງໂນດ Label ລູກ.\n"
"$MyLabel.remove_theme_color_override(\"font_color\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ສຳລັບໂນດ Label ລູກ \"MyLabel\", ຂຽນທັບສີຟອນດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", new "
"Color(1, 0.5f, 0));\n"
"// ຣີເຊັດສີຟອນຂອງໂນດ Label ລູກ.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").RemoveThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme constant with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_constant_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_constant]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ theme constant ດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດສະເໝີເມື່ອມີການດຶງລາຍການ theme ສຳລັບ control. "
"ສາມາດລຶບການຂຽນທັບອອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method remove_theme_constant_override].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_constant] ຕື່ມ."

