msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_stylebox].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Modify a property in a [StyleBox] by duplicating it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# The snippet below assumes the child node \"MyButton\" has a StyleBoxFlat "
"assigned.\n"
"# Resources are shared across instances, so we need to duplicate it\n"
"# to avoid modifying the appearance of all other buttons.\n"
"var new_stylebox_normal = "
"$MyButton.get_theme_stylebox(\"normal\").duplicate()\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_width_top = 3\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_color = Color(0, 1, 0.5)\n"
"$MyButton.add_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\", new_stylebox_normal)\n"
"# Remove the stylebox override.\n"
"$MyButton.remove_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// The snippet below assumes the child node \"MyButton\" has a StyleBoxFlat "
"assigned.\n"
"// Resources are shared across instances, so we need to duplicate it\n"
"// to avoid modifying the appearance of all other buttons.\n"
"StyleBoxFlat newStyleboxNormal = "
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").GetThemeStylebox(\"normal\").Duplicate() as "
"StyleBoxFlat;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderWidthTop = 3;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderColor = new Color(0, 1, 0.5f);\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").AddThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\", "
"newStyleboxNormal);\n"
"// Remove the stylebox override.\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").RemoveThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ theme [StyleBox] ດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. "
"ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດສະເໝີເມື່ອມີການດຶງລາຍການ theme ສຳລັບ control. "
"ສາມາດລຶບການຂຽນທັບອອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_stylebox] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ [StyleBox] ໂດຍການເຮັດຊ້ຳ (duplicate) ມັນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າໂນດລູກ \"MyButton\" ມີ StyleBoxFlat ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"# ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (Resources) ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທຸກໆ instance, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳມັນ\n"
"# ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງປຸ່ມອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ.\n"
"var new_stylebox_normal = "
"$MyButton.get_theme_stylebox(\"normal\").duplicate()\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_width_top = 3\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_color = Color(0, 1, 0.5)\n"
"$MyButton.add_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\", new_stylebox_normal)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າໂນດລູກ \"MyButton\" ມີ StyleBoxFlat ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"
"StyleBoxFlat newStyleboxNormal = "
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").GetThemeStylebox(\"normal\").Duplicate() as "
"StyleBoxFlat;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderWidthTop = 3;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderColor = new Color(0, 1, 0.5f);\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").AddThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\", "
"newStyleboxNormal);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Prevents [code]*_theme_*_override[/code] methods from emitting [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] until [method end_bulk_theme_override] is called."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເມທອດ [code]*_theme_*_override[/code] ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] ຈົນກ່ວາ [method end_bulk_theme_override] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Ends a bulk theme override update. See [method begin_bulk_theme_override]."
msgstr ""
"ສິ້ນສຸດການອັບເດດການຂຽນທັບ theme ແບບກຸ່ມ. ເບິ່ງ [method begin_bulk_theme_override]."

msgid "Finds the next (below in the tree) [Control] that can receive the focus."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ [Control] ຖັດໄປ (ລົງໄປຕາມລຳດັບໃນ tree) ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Finds the previous (above in the tree) [Control] that can receive the focus."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ [Control] ກ່ອນໜ້າ (ຂຶ້ນໄປຕາມລຳດັບໃນ tree) ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Finds the next [Control] that can receive the focus on the specified [enum "
"Side].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is different from [method get_focus_neighbor], which "
"returns the path of a specified focus neighbor."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາ [Control] ຖັດໄປທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັດໄດ້ໃນ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [method get_focus_neighbor] ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຄືນພາດ (path) "
"ຂອງ focus neighbor ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Forces drag and bypasses [method _get_drag_data] and [method "
"set_drag_preview] by passing [param data] and [param preview]. Drag will "
"start even if the mouse is neither over nor pressed on this control.\n"
"The methods [method _can_drop_data] and [method _drop_data] must be "
"implemented on controls that want to receive drop data."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບການລາກ ແລະ ຂ້າມ [method _get_drag_data] ແລະ [method set_drag_preview] "
"ໂດຍການສົ່ງ [param data] ແລະ [param preview] ເຂົ້າໄປໂດຍກົງ. "
"ການລາກຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເມົາສ໌ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ເທິງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ກົດໃສ່ control ນີ້ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງມີການຂຽນເມທອດ [method _can_drop_data] ແລະ [method _drop_data] ໃນ controls "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການວາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the anchor for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method for [member "
"anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member anchor_right] and [member "
"anchor_top]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະໝໍ (anchor) ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເປັນເມທອດ getter ສຳລັບ [member "
"anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member anchor_right] ແລະ [member "
"anchor_top]."

msgid ""
"Returns [member offset_left] and [member offset_top]. See also [member "
"position]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [member offset_left] ແລະ [member offset_top]. ເບິ່ງ [member position] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the bound value of [method get_combined_minimum_size] by [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"This value is the true minimum size of the container, as the maximum size has "
"priority over the minimum size.\n"
"For example, if the combined minimum size is (100, 100) and the combined "
"maximum size is (50, 150), the bound minimum size will be (50, 100)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອບເຂດຂອງ [method get_combined_minimum_size] ໂດຍ [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ແທ້ຈິງຂອງ container, ເນື່ອງຈາກຂະໜາດສູງສຸດມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດລວມແມ່ນ (100, 100) ແລະ ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດລວມແມ່ນ (50, 150), "
"ຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຜູກມັດໄວ້ຈະແມ່ນ (50, 100)."

msgid ""
"Returns the combined maximum size from [member custom_maximum_size] and "
"[method get_maximum_size], as well as the [member custom_maximum_size] of "
"this node's parent if it is a Control node with [member "
"propagate_maximum_size] set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດລວມຈາກ [member custom_maximum_size] ແລະ [method "
"get_maximum_size], ລວມທັງ [member custom_maximum_size] ຂອງໂນດແມ່ ຫາກມັນເປັນໂນດ "
"Control ທີ່ຕັ້ງ [member propagate_maximum_size] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the combined minimum size from [member custom_minimum_size] and "
"[method get_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດລວມຈາກ [member custom_minimum_size] ແລະ [method "
"get_minimum_size]."

msgid ""
"Returns the combined value of [member pivot_offset] and [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio], in pixels. The ratio is multiplied by the control's size."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລວມຂອງ [member pivot_offset] ແລະ [member pivot_offset_ratio] ເປັນພິກເຊວ. "
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນ (ratio) ຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຂະໜາດຂອງ control."

msgid ""
"Returns the mouse cursor shape for this control when hovered over [param "
"at_position] in local coordinates. For most controls, this is the same as "
"[member mouse_default_cursor_shape], but some built-in controls implement "
"more complex logic.\n"
"You can override [method _get_cursor_shape] to implement custom behavior for "
"this method."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ສຳລັບ control ນີ້ເມື່ອເລື່ອນມາເທິງ [param at_position] "
"ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ສຳລັບ controls ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [member "
"mouse_default_cursor_shape], ແຕ່ບາງ controls "
"ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບລະບົບອາດຈະມີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນທັບ [method _get_cursor_shape] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳເອງສຳລັບເມທອດນີ້."

msgid "Returns [member offset_right] and [member offset_bottom]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [member offset_right] ແລະ [member offset_bottom]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [member focus_mode], but takes the [member "
"focus_behavior_recursive] into account. If [member focus_behavior_recursive] "
"is set to [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], or it is set to [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] and its ancestor is set to [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], then this returns [constant FOCUS_NONE]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [member focus_mode] ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member focus_behavior_recursive]. ຖ້າ "
"[member focus_behavior_recursive] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], "
"ຫຼື ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] ແລະ ໂນດບັນພະບຸລຸດຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant FOCUS_NONE]."

msgid ""
"Returns the focus neighbor for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method for "
"[member focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] and [member focus_neighbor_top].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To find the next [Control] on the specific [enum Side], even if "
"a neighbor is not assigned, use [method find_valid_focus_neighbor]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ focus neighbor ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເປັນເມທອດ getter ສຳລັບ [member "
"focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] ແລະ [member focus_neighbor_top].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ [Control] ຖັດໄປໃນ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດ "
"neighbor ໄວ້ກໍຕາມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method find_valid_focus_neighbor]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the control relative to the containing "
"canvas. See [member global_position] and [member size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node itself or any parent [CanvasItem] between the node "
"and the canvas have a non default rotation or skew, the resulting size is "
"likely not meaningful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] to "
"[code]true[/code] can lead to rounding inaccuracies between the displayed "
"control and the returned [Rect2]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງ control ທຽບກັບ canvas ທີ່ບັນຈຸມັນຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"global_position] ແລະ [member size].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກໂນດນັ້ນເອງ ຫຼື ໂນດແມ່ [CanvasItem] ໃດໜຶ່ງລະຫວ່າງໂນດ ແລະ canvas "
"ມີການໝຸນ (rotation) ຫຼື ການບິດ (skew) ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ຂະໜາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງ [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນໃນການປັດເສດລະຫວ່າງ control ທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum size for this control. See [member custom_maximum_size]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດສູງສຸດສຳລັບ control ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [member custom_maximum_size]."

msgid ""
"Returns the minimum size for this control. See [member custom_minimum_size]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບ control ນີ້. ເບິ່ງ [member custom_minimum_size]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [member mouse_filter], but takes the [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] into account. If [member mouse_behavior_recursive] "
"is set to [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], or it is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] and its ancestor is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], then this returns [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [member mouse_filter] ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member mouse_behavior_recursive]. ຖ້າ "
"[member mouse_behavior_recursive] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], "
"ຫຼື ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] ແລະ ໂນດບັນພະບຸລຸດຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."

msgid ""
"Returns the offset for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method for [member "
"offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member offset_right] and [member "
"offset_top]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເປັນເມທອດ getter ສຳລັບ [member "
"offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member offset_right] ແລະ [member "
"offset_top]."

msgid "Returns the width/height occupied in the parent control."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມກວ້າງ/ຄວາມສູງ ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ parent control."

msgid "Returns the parent control node."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ control ທີ່ເປັນ parent."

msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the control in the coordinate system of the "
"containing node. See [member position], [member scale] and [member size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member rotation] is not the default rotation, the resulting "
"size is not meaningful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] to "
"[code]true[/code] can lead to rounding inaccuracies between the displayed "
"control and the returned [Rect2]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງ control ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງໂນດທີ່ບັນຈຸມັນຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [member position], "
"[member scale] ແລະ [member size].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກ [member rotation] ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ຂະໜາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງ [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນໃນການປັດເສດລະຫວ່າງ control ທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of this [Control] in global screen coordinates (i.e. "
"taking window position into account). Mostly useful for editor plugins.\n"
"Equivalent to [code]get_screen_transform().origin[/code] (see [method "
"CanvasItem.get_screen_transform]).\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Show a popup at the mouse position:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_position() + "
"get_screen_transform().basis_xform(get_local_mouse_position())\n"
"\n"
"# The above code is equivalent to:\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_transform() * get_local_mouse_position()\n"
"\n"
"popup_menu.reset_size()\n"
"popup_menu.popup()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ [Control] ນີ້ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍສ່ວນລວມ (global screen coordinates) "
"(ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວິນໂດນຳ). ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ editor plugins.\n"
"ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]get_screen_transform().origin[/code] (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"CanvasItem.get_screen_transform]).\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ສະແດງປັອບອັບ (popup) ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_position() + "
"get_screen_transform().basis_xform(get_local_mouse_position())\n"
"\n"
"# ໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ:\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_transform() * get_local_mouse_position()\n"
"\n"
"popup_menu.reset_size()\n"
"popup_menu.popup()\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns a [Color] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has a color item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type]. If "
"[param theme_type] is omitted the class name of the current control is used "
"as the type, or [member theme_type_variation] if it is defined. If the type "
"is a class name its parent classes are also checked, in order of inheritance. "
"If the type is a variation its base types are checked, in order of "
"dependency, then the control's class name and its parent classes are "
"checked.\n"
"For the current control its local overrides are considered first (see [method "
"add_theme_color_override]), then its assigned [member theme]. After the "
"current control, each parent control and its assigned [member theme] are "
"considered; controls without a [member theme] assigned are skipped. If no "
"matching [Theme] is found in the tree, the custom project [Theme] (see "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/custom]) and the default [Theme] are used "
"(see [ThemeDB]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\")\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Button\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\");\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Button\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Color] ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການສີທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ [param theme_type], "
"ຊື່ຄຼາສຂອງຄອນໂທຣລປະຈຸບັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນປະເພດ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [member theme_type_variation] "
"ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດໄວ້. ຖ້າປະເພດເປັນຊື່ຄຼາສ, ຄຼາສແມ່ຂອງມັນກໍຈະຖືກກວດສອບນຳຕາມລຳດັບການສືບທອດ. "
"ຖ້າປະເພດເປັນ variation, ປະເພດພື້ນຖານຂອງມັນຈະຖືກກວດສອບຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງກວດສອບຊື່ຄຼາສຂອງຄອນໂທຣລ ແລະ ຄຼາສແມ່ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລປະຈຸບັນ, ການຂຽນທັບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local overrides) ຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາກ່ອນ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"add_theme_color_override]), ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງແມ່ນ [member theme] ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ຫຼັງຈາກຄອນໂທຣລປະຈຸບັນ, ແຕ່ລະຄອນໂທຣລແມ່ ແລະ [member theme] ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາ; "
"ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ບໍ່ມີ [member theme] ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree, ຈະນຳໃຊ້ "
"custom project [Theme] (ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/custom]) ແລະ "
"[Theme] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເບິ່ງ [ThemeDB]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# ດຶງເອົາສີຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບຄຼາສຂອງ Control ປະຈຸບັນ, ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\")\n"
"\t# ດຶງເອົາສີຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບຄຼາສ Button.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Button\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ດຶງເອົາສີຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບຄຼາສຂອງ Control ປະຈຸບັນ, ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\");\n"
"\t// ດຶງເອົາສີຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບຄຼາສ Button.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Button\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns a constant from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a constant item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constant) ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ມີ "
"[param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default base scale value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_base_scale] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນພື້ນຖານ (base scale) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] "
"ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member Theme.default_base_scale] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default font from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຟອນ (font) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member "
"Theme.default_font] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default font size value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font_size] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີຄ່າ [member "
"Theme.default_font_size] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Font] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has a font item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Font] ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການຟອນທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a font size from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຟອນຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ມີ "
"[param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns an icon from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໄອຄອນ (icon) ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການໄອຄອນທີ່ມີ "
"[param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [StyleBox] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a stylebox item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [StyleBox] ຈາກ [Theme] ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ຖ້າ [Theme] ນັ້ນມີລາຍການ stylebox ທີ່ມີ "
"[param name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the tooltip text for the position [param at_position] in the "
"control's local coordinates, which will typically appear when the cursor is "
"resting over this control. By default, it returns [member tooltip_text].\n"
"You can override [method _get_tooltip] to implement custom behavior for this "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method returns an empty [String] and [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] is not overridden, no tooltip is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳອະທິບາຍເຄື່ອງມື (tooltip) ສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງ [param at_position] "
"ໃນພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງຄອນໂທຣລ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ຢຸດຢູ່ເທິງຄອນໂທຣລນີ້. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະຄືນຄ່າ [member tooltip_text].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນທັບ [method _get_tooltip] ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບເມທອດນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ຄືນຄ່າ [String] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນທັບ, ຈະບໍ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍເຄື່ອງມືສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates an [InputEventMouseButton] that attempts to click the control. If the "
"event is received, the control gains focus.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [InputEventMouseButton] ທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຄລິກຄອນໂທຣລ. ຖ້າໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການ, "
"ຄອນໂທຣລຈະໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # ເມື່ອຄລິກໂນດ Control ອື່ນ, ໂນດນີ້ຈະຖືກຄລິກແທນ.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // ເມື່ອຄລິກໂນດ Control ອື່ນ, ໂນດນີ້ຈະຖືກຄລິກແທນ.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Steal the focus from another control and become the focused control (see "
"[member focus_mode]).\n"
"If [param hide_focus] is [code]true[/code], the control will not visually "
"show its focused state. Has no effect for [LineEdit] and [TextEdit] when "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/common/show_focus_state_on_pointer_event] is set "
"to [code]Text Input Controls[/code], or for any control when it is set to "
"[code]Always[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this method together with [method Callable.call_deferred] "
"makes it more reliable, especially when called inside [method Node._ready]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາໂຟກັສຈາກຄອນໂທຣລອື່ນມາເປັນຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສ (ເບິ່ງ [member focus_mode]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param hide_focus] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຄອນໂທຣລຈະບໍ່ສະແດງສະຖານະຖືກໂຟກັສໃຫ້ເຫັນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ [LineEdit] ແລະ [TextEdit] ເມື່ອ "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/common/show_focus_state_on_pointer_event] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]Text Input Controls[/code], ຫຼື ສຳລັບຄອນໂທຣລໃດໆເມື່ອຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]Always[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method Callable.call_deferred] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ແນ່ນອນກວ່າ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ [method Node._ready]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is the current focused control. See [member "
"focus_mode].\n"
"If [param ignore_hidden_focus] is [code]true[/code], controls that have their "
"focus hidden will always return [code]false[/code]. Hidden focus happens "
"automatically when controls gain focus via mouse input, or manually using "
"[method grab_focus] with [code]hide_focus[/code] set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້ານີ້ຄືຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [member focus_mode].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param ignore_hidden_focus] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ມີການເຊື່ອງໂຟກັສໄວ້ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code] ສະເໝີ. "
"ການເຊື່ອງໂຟກັສຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຄອນໂທຣລໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສຜ່ານທາງເມົາສ໌, ຫຼື ເຮັດເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method grab_focus] ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [code]hide_focus[/code] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a color item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການສີທີ່ມີ [param name] ແລະ "
"[param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [Color] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_color_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [Color] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_color_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a constant item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຄ່າຄົງທີ່ທີ່ມີ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme constant "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_constant_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param "
"name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_constant_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a font item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຟອນທີ່ມີ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [Font] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [Font] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_font_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme font size "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_size_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_font_size_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການໄອຄອນທີ່ມີ [param name] "
"ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme icon with "
"the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_icon_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບໄອຄອນຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param "
"name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_icon_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that has "
"a stylebox item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີ [Theme] ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ tree ທີ່ມີລາຍການ stylebox ທີ່ມີ [param "
"name] ແລະ [param theme_type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method get_theme_color] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [StyleBox] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_stylebox_override]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [StyleBox] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ "
"[param name] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໂນດ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_theme_stylebox_override]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a drag operation is successful. Alternative to "
"[method Viewport.gui_is_drag_successful].\n"
"Best used with [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_DRAG_END]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການລາກ (drag) ສຳເລັດຜົນ. ເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ [method "
"Viewport.gui_is_drag_successful].\n"
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດຮ່ວມກັບ [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_DRAG_END]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the layout is right-to-left. See also [member "
"layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຈັດວາງເປັນແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"layout_direction] ປະກອບ."

msgid "Give up the focus. No other control will be able to receive input."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການໂຟກັສ. ຈະບໍ່ມີຄອນໂທຣລອື່ນໃດສາມາດຮັບອິນພຸດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_color_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [Color] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] "
"ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ [method add_theme_color_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme constant with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_constant_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ "
"[method add_theme_constant_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [Font] with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_font_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [Font] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] "
"ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ [method add_theme_font_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme font size with the specified [param "
"name] previously added by [method add_theme_font_size_override] or via the "
"Inspector dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] "
"ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ [method add_theme_font_size_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme icon with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_icon_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບໄອຄອນຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ "
"[method add_theme_icon_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name] previously added by [method add_theme_stylebox_override] or via the "
"Inspector dock."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ (override) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ [StyleBox] ຂອງທີມດ້ວຍ [param name] "
"ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍ [method add_theme_stylebox_override] ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"Resets the size to [method get_combined_minimum_size]. This is equivalent to "
"calling [code]set_size(Vector2())[/code] (or any size below the minimum)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຄືນໃໝ່ເປັນ [method get_combined_minimum_size]. ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[code]set_size(Vector2())[/code] (ຫຼື ຂະໜາດໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the anchor for the specified [enum Side] to [param anchor]. A setter "
"method for [member anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member "
"anchor_right] and [member anchor_top].\n"
"If [param keep_offset] is [code]true[/code], offsets aren't updated after "
"this operation.\n"
"If [param push_opposite_anchor] is [code]true[/code] and the opposite anchor "
"overlaps this anchor, the opposite one will have its value overridden. For "
"example, when setting left anchor to 1 and the right anchor has value of 0.5, "
"the right anchor will also get value of 1. If [param push_opposite_anchor] "
"was [code]false[/code], the left anchor would get value 0.5."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຸດຢຶດ (anchor) ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param anchor]. ເປັນເມທອດ setter "
"ສຳລັບ [member anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member anchor_right] ແລະ "
"[member anchor_top].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_offset] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ offset "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເດດຫຼັງຈາກການປະຕິບັດການນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param push_opposite_anchor] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ແລະ "
"ຈຸດຢຶດດ້ານກົງກັນຂ້າມຊ້ອນທັບກັບຈຸດຢຶດນີ້, ດ້ານກົງກັນຂ້າມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບຄ່າໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຈຸດຢຶດຊ້າຍເປັນ 1 "
"ແລະ ຈຸດຢຶດຂວາມີຄ່າເປັນ 0.5, ຈຸດຢຶດຂວາກໍຈະໄດ້ຄ່າເປັນ 1 ຄືກັນ. ຖ້າ [param "
"push_opposite_anchor] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈຸດຢຶດຊ້າຍຈະໄດ້ຄ່າ 0.5."

msgid ""
"Works the same as [method set_anchor], but instead of [code]keep_offset[/"
"code] argument and automatic update of offset, it allows to set the offset "
"yourself (see [method set_offset])."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ [method set_anchor], ແຕ່ແທນທີ່ຈະມີ argument [code]keep_offset[/code] "
"ແລະ ການອັບເດດ offset ອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ offset ດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"set_offset])."

msgid ""
"Sets both anchor preset and offset preset. See [method set_anchors_preset] "
"and [method set_offsets_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງ anchor preset ແລະ offset preset. ເບິ່ງ [method set_anchors_preset] ແລະ "
"[method set_offsets_preset]."

msgid ""
"Sets the anchors to a [param preset] from [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"This is the code equivalent to using the Layout menu in the 2D editor.\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's position will also be "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຸດຢຶດ (anchors) ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param preset] ຈາກ [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ເມນູ Layout ໃນ 2D editor.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_offsets] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຄອນໂທຣລກໍຈະຖືກອັບເດດນຳ."

msgid ""
"Sets [member offset_left] and [member offset_top] at the same time. "
"Equivalent of changing [member position]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member offset_left] ແລະ [member offset_top] ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການປ່ຽນ "
"[member position]."

msgid ""
"Sets the given callables to be used instead of the control's own drag-and-"
"drop virtual methods. If a callable is empty, its respective virtual method "
"is used as normal.\n"
"The arguments for each callable should be exactly the same as their "
"respective virtual methods, which would be:\n"
"- [param drag_func] corresponds to [method _get_drag_data] and requires a "
"[Vector2];\n"
"- [param can_drop_func] corresponds to [method _can_drop_data] and requires "
"both a [Vector2] and a [Variant];\n"
"- [param drop_func] corresponds to [method _drop_data] and requires both a "
"[Vector2] and a [Variant]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ callables ທີ່ຈະນຳມາໃຊ້ແທນ virtual methods ຂອງການລາກແລະວາງ (drag-and-drop) "
"ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລເອງ. ຖ້າ callable ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, virtual method ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"Argument ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ callable ຄວນຈະຄືກັນກັບ virtual method ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ:\n"
"- [param drag_func] ກົງກັບ [method _get_drag_data] ແລະ ຕ້ອງການ [Vector2];\n"
"- [param can_drop_func] ກົງກັບ [method _can_drop_data] ແລະ ຕ້ອງການທັງ [Vector2] "
"ແລະ [Variant];\n"
"- [param drop_func] ກົງກັບ [method _drop_data] ແລະ ຕ້ອງການທັງ [Vector2] ແລະ "
"[Variant]."

msgid ""
"Shows the given control at the mouse pointer. A good time to call this method "
"is in [method _get_drag_data]. The control must not be in the scene tree. You "
"should not free the control, and you should not keep a reference to the "
"control beyond the duration of the drag. It will be deleted automatically "
"after the drag has ended.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var color = Color(1, 0, 0, 1)\n"
"\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\t# Use a control that is not in the tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = ColorPickerButton.new()\n"
"\tcpb.color = color\n"
"\tcpb.size = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(cpb)\n"
"\treturn color\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"private Color _color = new Color(1, 0, 0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Use a control that is not in the tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = new ColorPickerButton();\n"
"\tcpb.Color = _color;\n"
"\tcpb.Size = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(cpb);\n"
"\treturn _color;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ທີ່ຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌. ຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ດີໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນ [method "
"_get_drag_data]. ຄອນໂທຣລຕ້ອງບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນ scene tree. ທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນ free ຄອນໂທຣລ, ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນເກັບ "
"reference ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລໄວ້ດົນເກີນກວ່າໄລຍະເວລາຂອງການລາກ. "
"ມັນຈະຖືກລຶບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການລາກສິ້ນສຸດລົງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var color = Color(1, 0, 0, 1)\n"
"\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\t# ໃຊ້ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = ColorPickerButton.new()\n"
"\tcpb.color = color\n"
"\tcpb.size = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(cpb)\n"
"\treturn color\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"private Color _color = new Color(1, 0, 0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// ໃຊ້ຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = new ColorPickerButton();\n"
"\tcpb.Color = _color;\n"
"\tcpb.Size = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(cpb);\n"
"\treturn _color;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Sets [member offset_right] and [member offset_bottom] at the same time."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member offset_right] ແລະ [member offset_bottom] ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the focus neighbor for the specified [enum Side] to the [Control] at "
"[param neighbor] node path. A setter method for [member "
"focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] and [member focus_neighbor_top]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຟກັສຂ້າງຄຽງ (focus neighbor) ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ກັບ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ຕາມ "
"node path [param neighbor]. ເປັນເມທອດ setter ສຳລັບ [member "
"focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] ແລະ [member focus_neighbor_top]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member global_position] to given [param position].\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member global_position] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_offsets] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຢຶດ (anchors) "
"ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລຈະຖືກອັບເດດແທນ offset."

msgid ""
"Sets the offset for the specified [enum Side] to [param offset]. A setter "
"method for [member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member "
"offset_right] and [member offset_top]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ offset ສຳລັບ [enum Side] ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ເປັນ [param offset]. ເປັນເມທອດ setter ສຳລັບ "
"[member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member offset_right] ແລະ "
"[member offset_top]."

msgid ""
"Sets the offsets to a [param preset] from [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"This is the code equivalent to using the Layout menu in the 2D editor.\n"
"Use parameter [param resize_mode] with constants from [enum "
"Control.LayoutPresetMode] to better determine the resulting size of the "
"[Control]. Constant size will be ignored if used with presets that change "
"size, e.g. [constant PRESET_LEFT_WIDE].\n"
"Use parameter [param margin] to determine the gap between the [Control] and "
"the edges."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ offset ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param preset] ຈາກ [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໃຊ້ເມນູ Layout ໃນ 2D editor.\n"
"ໃຊ້ພາລາມີເຕີ [param resize_mode] ຮ່ວມກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ຈາກ [enum Control.LayoutPresetMode] "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂະໜາດຜົນລັດຂອງ [Control] ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຂະໜາດຄົງທີ່ (constant size) ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າໃຊ້ກັບ "
"preset ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ເຊັ່ນ [constant PRESET_LEFT_WIDE].\n"
"ໃຊ້ພາລາມີເຕີ [param margin] ເພື່ອກຳນົດໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງ [Control] ແລະ ຂອບ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member position] to given [param position].\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member position] ໃຫ້ເປັນ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_offsets] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຢຶດ (anchors) "
"ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລຈະຖືກອັບເດດແທນ offset."

msgid ""
"Sets the size (see [member size]).\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດ (ເບິ່ງ [member size]).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_offsets] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດຢຶດ (anchors) "
"ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລຈະຖືກອັບເດດແທນ offset."

msgid ""
"Invalidates the maximum size cache in this node and in parent nodes up to top "
"level. Intended to be used with [method get_maximum_size] when the return "
"value is changed. Setting [member custom_maximum_size] directly calls this "
"method automatically.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling this method also calls [method update_minimum_size] "
"since the combined minimum size may be affected by the maximum size change."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ cache ຂອງຂະໜາດສູງສຸດໃນໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ຂຶ້ນໄປຫາລະດັບສູງສຸດໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[method get_maximum_size] ເມື່ອຄ່າທີ່ຄືນມາຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"custom_maximum_size] ໂດຍກົງຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຍັງຈະເອີ້ນ [method update_minimum_size] ນຳ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດລວມອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Invalidates the minimum size cache in this node and in parent nodes up to top "
"level. Intended to be used with [method get_minimum_size] when the return "
"value is changed. Setting [member custom_minimum_size] directly calls this "
"method automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ cache ຂອງຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດໃນໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ຂຶ້ນໄປຫາລະດັບສູງສຸດໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້. ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[method get_minimum_size] ເມື່ອຄ່າທີ່ຄືນມາຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"custom_minimum_size] ໂດຍກົງຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Moves the mouse cursor to [param position], relative to [member position] of "
"this [Control].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS and "
"Linux. It has no effect on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ໄປທີ່ [param position], ທຽບກັບ [member position] ຂອງ [Control] ນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method warp_mouse] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Windows, macOS ແລະ Linux "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນ Android, iOS ແລະ Web."

msgid "The paths to the nodes which are controlled by this node."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid "The paths to the nodes which are describing this node."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງອະທິບາຍໂນດນີ້."

msgid "The human-readable node description that is reported to assistive apps."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍໂນດທີ່ມະນຸດສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລາຍງານໃຫ້ກັບແອັບຯຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (assistive apps)."

msgid "The paths to the nodes which this node flows into."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ໂນດນີ້ໄຫຼ (flow) ເຂົ້າໄປຫາ."

msgid "The paths to the nodes which label this node."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃຫ້ກັບໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"The mode with which a live region updates. A live region is a [Node] that is "
"updated as a result of an external event when the user's focus may be "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດທີ່ live region ໃຊ້ອັບເດດ. live region ແມ່ນ [Node] "
"ທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດເປັນຜົນມາຈາກເຫດການພາຍນອກ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂຟກັສຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ອາດຈະຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນ."

msgid "The human-readable node name that is reported to assistive apps."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂນດທີ່ມະນຸດສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລາຍງານໃຫ້ກັບແອັບຯຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (assistive apps)."

msgid ""
"Anchors the bottom edge of the node to the origin, the center, or the end of "
"its parent control. It changes how the bottom offset updates when the node "
"moves or changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງໂນດໄວ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (origin), ຈຸດກາງ (center), ຫຼື ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ (end) "
"ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລແມ່. ມັນຈະປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ offset ດ້ານລຸ່ມອັບເດດເມື່ອໂນດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Anchor] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

msgid ""
"Anchors the left edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of its "
"parent control. It changes how the left offset updates when the node moves or "
"changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for convenience."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຂອບຊ້າຍຂອງໂນດໄວ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດກາງ ຫຼື ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຄອນໂທຣລແມ່. ມັນຈະປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ offset "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍອັບເດດເມື່ອໂນດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Anchor] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

msgid ""
"Anchors the right edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of "
"its parent control. It changes how the right offset updates when the node "
"moves or changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຂອບຂວາຂອງໂນດໄວ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດກາງ ຫຼື ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຄອນໂທຣລແມ່. ມັນຈະປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ offset "
"ດ້ານຂວາອັບເດດເມື່ອໂນດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Anchor] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

msgid ""
"Anchors the top edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of its "
"parent control. It changes how the top offset updates when the node moves or "
"changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for convenience."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຂອບເທິງຂອງໂນດໄວ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດກາງ ຫຼື ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຄອນໂທຣລແມ່. ມັນຈະປ່ຽນວິທີທີ່ offset "
"ດ້ານເທິງອັບເດດເມື່ອໂນດຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum Anchor] ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ."

msgid ""
"Use [member Node.auto_translate_mode] and [method Node.can_auto_translate] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member Node.auto_translate_mode] ແລະ [method Node.can_auto_translate] "
"ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Toggles if any text should automatically change to its translated version "
"depending on the current locale."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດໜຶ່ງຄວນຈະປ່ຽນເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ແປແລ້ວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ locale ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Enables whether rendering of [CanvasItem] based children should be clipped to "
"this control's rectangle. If [code]true[/code], parts of a child which would "
"be visibly outside of this control's rectangle will not be rendered and won't "
"receive input."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານວ່າການເຣນເດີ (rendering) ຂອງໂນດລູກທີ່ອີງຕາມ [CanvasItem] ຄວນຖືກຕັດ (clipped) "
"ໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງຄອນໂທຣລນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ສ່ວນຂອງໂນດລູກທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງຄອນໂທຣລນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຣນເດີ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອິນພຸດ."

msgid ""
"The maximum size of this Control's bounding rectangle. If set to a value "
"greater than or equal to [code](0, 0)[/code], the node's bounding rectangle "
"will never exceed this size. A value below [code](0, 0)[/code] means there is "
"no maximum size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The final effective maximum size may be subject to parent "
"Container sizing and propagated maximum sizes. See also: [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not all [Control] subtypes handle a custom maximum size "
"gracefully, which may lead to unexpected behavior if the control's contents "
"exceed this size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value has priority over [member custom_minimum_size]. For "
"example, if you set [member custom_maximum_size] to [code](100, 100)[/code] "
"and [member custom_minimum_size] to [code](200, 200)[/code], the resulting "
"size will be [code](100, 100)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended to use [method get_bound_minimum_size] instead "
"of [method get_combined_minimum_size] when using this property, as the former "
"respects maximum size limits when calculating the minimum size, while the "
"latter does not."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອບເຂດ (bounding rectangle) ຂອງຄອນໂທຣລນີ້. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [code](0, 0)[/code], ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດຈະບໍ່ເກີນຂະໜາດນີ້. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]"
"(0, 0)[/code] ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ມີຜົນຕົວຈິງອາດຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງ Container ແມ່ ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ມາ. ເບິ່ງຕື່ມ: [method get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກປະເພດຍ່ອຍຂອງ [Control] "
"ທີ່ຈະຈັດການຂະໜາດສູງສຸດແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດຖ້າເນື້ອໃນຂອງຄອນໂທຣລເກີນຂະໜາດນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າ [member custom_minimum_size]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງ [member custom_maximum_size] ເປັນ [code](100, 100)[/code] ແລະ [member "
"custom_minimum_size] ເປັນ [code](200, 200)[/code], ຂະໜາດຜົນລັດຈະເປັນ [code](100, "
"100)[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_bound_minimum_size] ແທນ [method "
"get_combined_minimum_size] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, "
"ເພາະວ່າແບບທຳອິດຈະຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດໃນເວລາຄຳນວນຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແບບຫຼັງຈະບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"The minimum size of the node's bounding rectangle. If you set it to a value "
"greater than [code](0, 0)[/code], the node's bounding rectangle will always "
"have at least this size. Note that [Control] nodes have their internal "
"minimum size returned by [method get_minimum_size]. It depends on the "
"control's contents, like text, textures, or style boxes. The actual minimum "
"size is the maximum value of this property and the internal minimum size (see "
"[method get_combined_minimum_size]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member custom_maximum_size] has priority over this property. "
"For example, if you set [member custom_minimum_size] to [code](200, 200)[/"
"code] and [member custom_maximum_size] to [code](100, 100)[/code], the "
"resulting size will be [code](100, 100)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ [code](0, 0)[/code], "
"ຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດຈະມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເທົ່ານີ້ສະເໝີ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າໂນດ [Control] "
"ຈະມີຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດພາຍໃນທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາໂດຍ [method get_minimum_size]. "
"ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ພື້ນຜິວ (textures), ຫຼື ກ່ອງຮູບແບບ (style boxes). "
"ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຕົວຈິງແມ່ນຄ່າສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດພາຍໃນ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_combined_minimum_size]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member custom_maximum_size] ມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງ [member custom_minimum_size] ເປັນ [code](200, 200)[/code] ແລະ [member "
"custom_maximum_size] ເປັນ [code](100, 100)[/code], ຂະໜາດທີ່ໄດ້ຈະແມ່ນ [code](100, "
"100)[/code]."

msgid ""
"Determines which controls can be focused together with [member focus_mode]. "
"See [method get_focus_mode_with_override]. Since the default behavior is "
"[constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], this can be used to prevent all children "
"controls from getting focused."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັສໄດ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member focus_mode]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override]. ເນື່ອງຈາກພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທັງໝົດຮັບໂຟກັສໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Determines which controls can be focused. Only one control can be focused at "
"a time, and the focused control will receive keyboard, gamepad, and mouse "
"events in [method _gui_input]. Use [method get_focus_mode_with_override] to "
"determine if a control can grab focus, since [member "
"focus_behavior_recursive] also affects it. See also [method grab_focus]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັສໄດ້. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຕົວຄວບຄຸມດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກໂຟກັສໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ, "
"ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການຈາກຄີບອດ, ຈອຍເກມ, ແລະ ເມົາສ໌ໃນ [method "
"_gui_input]. ໃຊ້ [method get_focus_mode_with_override] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັສໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ເພາະວ່າ [member focus_behavior_recursive] "
"ກໍມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ມັນຄືກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method grab_focus] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the down "
"arrow on the keyboard or down on a gamepad by default. You can change the key "
"by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_down] input action. The node "
"must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus to "
"the closest [Control] to the bottom of this one."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດລູກສອນລົງເທິງຄີບອດ ຫຼື "
"ກົດລົງເທິງຈອຍເກມໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_down]. ໂນດນັ້ນຕ້ອງເປັນ [Control]. ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, "
"Godot ຈະໃຫ້ໂຟກັສກັບ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທາງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the left "
"arrow on the keyboard or left on a gamepad by default. You can change the key "
"by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_left] input action. The node "
"must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus to "
"the closest [Control] to the left of this one."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດລູກສອນຊ້າຍເທິງຄີບອດ ຫຼື "
"ກົດຊ້າຍເທິງຈອຍເກມໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_left]. ໂນດນັ້ນຕ້ອງເປັນ [Control]. ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, "
"Godot ຈະໃຫ້ໂຟກັສກັບ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the right "
"arrow on the keyboard or right on a gamepad by default. You can change the "
"key by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_right] input action. The "
"node must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus "
"to the closest [Control] to the right of this one."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດລູກສອນຂວາເທິງຄີບອດ ຫຼື "
"ກົດຂວາເທິງຈອຍເກມໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_right]. ໂນດນັ້ນຕ້ອງເປັນ [Control]. ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, "
"Godot ຈະໃຫ້ໂຟກັສກັບ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the top "
"arrow on the keyboard or top on a gamepad by default. You can change the key "
"by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] input action. The node "
"must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus to "
"the closest [Control] to the top of this one."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດລູກສອນຂຶ້ນເທິງຄີບອດ ຫຼື "
"ກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງຈອຍເກມໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_up]. ໂນດນັ້ນຕ້ອງເປັນ [Control]. ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, "
"Godot ຈະໃຫ້ໂຟກັສກັບ [Control] ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດທາງດ້ານເທິງຂອງໂນດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses [kbd]Tab[/"
"kbd] on a keyboard by default. You can change the key by editing the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_next] input action.\n"
"If this property is not set, Godot will select a \"best guess\" based on "
"surrounding nodes in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດ [kbd]Tab[/kbd] ເທິງຄີບອດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_focus_next].\n"
"ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, Godot ຈະເລືອກໂນດທີ່ \"ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ\" ໂດຍອີງຕາມໂນດອ້ອມຂ້າງໃນ Scene "
"Tree."

msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses [kbd]Shift "
"+ Tab[/kbd] on a keyboard by default. You can change the key by editing the "
"[member ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_prev] input action.\n"
"If this property is not set, Godot will select a \"best guess\" based on "
"surrounding nodes in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ Godot ວ່າຄວນໃຫ້ໂຟກັສໄປທີ່ໂນດໃດ ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດ [kbd]Shift + Tab[/kbd] "
"ເທິງຄີບອດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນພຸດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_prev].\n"
"ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, Godot ຈະເລືອກໂນດທີ່ \"ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ\" ໂດຍອີງຕາມໂນດອ້ອມຂ້າງໃນ Scene "
"Tree."

msgid ""
"The node's global position, relative to the world (usually to the "
"[CanvasLayer])."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງສາກົນ (global position) ຂອງໂນດ, ເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບໂລກ (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນທຽບກັບ "
"[CanvasLayer])."

msgid ""
"Controls layout direction and text writing direction. Right-to-left layouts "
"are necessary for certain languages (e.g. Arabic and Hebrew). See also "
"[method is_layout_rtl]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມທິດທາງຂອງການຈັດວາງ (layout) ແລະ ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ "
"(Right-to-left) ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບບາງພາສາ (ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາອາຣັບ ແລະ ພາສາຮີບຣູ). ເບິ່ງ [method "
"is_layout_rtl] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically converts code line numbers, list indices, "
"[SpinBox] and [ProgressBar] values from the Western Arabic (0..9) to the "
"numeral systems used in current locale.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers within the text are not automatically converted, it can "
"be done manually, using [method TextServer.format_number]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປ່ຽນເລກລຳດັບແຖວຂອງໂຄ້ດ, ດັດຊະນີລາຍການ, ຄ່າຂອງ [SpinBox] "
"ແລະ [ProgressBar] ຈາກຕົວເລກອາຣັບສາກົນ (0..9) ໃຫ້ເປັນລະບົບຕົວເລກທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (locale) "
"ປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລກພາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method TextServer.format_number]."

msgid ""
"Determines which controls can receive mouse input together with [member "
"mouse_filter]. See [method get_mouse_filter_with_override]. Since the default "
"behavior is [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], this can be used to prevent "
"all children controls from receiving mouse input."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member mouse_filter]. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_mouse_filter_with_override]. ເນື່ອງຈາກພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທັງໝົດຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"The default cursor shape for this control. Useful for Godot plugins and "
"applications or games that use the system's mouse cursors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, shapes may vary depending on the cursor theme of the "
"system."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຮ່າງເຄີເຊີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບປລັກອິນ Godot ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື "
"ເກມທີ່ໃຊ້ເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ຮູບຮ່າງອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຮູບແບບເຄີເຊີ (cursor theme) "
"ຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Determines which controls will be able to receive mouse button input events "
"through [method _gui_input] and the [signal mouse_entered], and [signal "
"mouse_exited] signals. Also determines how these events should be propagated. "
"See the constants to learn what each does. Use [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] to determine if a control can receive mouse "
"input, since [member mouse_behavior_recursive] also affects it."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດທີ່ຈະສາມາດຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [method _gui_input] ແລະ ສັນຍານ "
"[signal mouse_entered], [signal mouse_exited]. "
"ນອກນັ້ນຍັງກຳນົດວ່າເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ (propagate) ແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ (constants) "
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແຕ່ລະອັນ. ໃຊ້ [method get_mouse_filter_with_override] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມສາມາດຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ເພາະວ່າ [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] ກໍມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ມັນຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"When enabled, scroll wheel events processed by [method _gui_input] will be "
"passed to the parent control even if [member mouse_filter] is set to "
"[constant MOUSE_FILTER_STOP].\n"
"You should disable it on the root of your UI if you do not want scroll events "
"to go to the [method Node._unhandled_input] processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Because this property defaults to [code]true[/code], this allows "
"nested scrollable containers to work out of the box."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເຫດການການໝຸນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ (scroll wheel) ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໂດຍ [method _gui_input] "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member mouse_filter] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP] ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"ທ່ານຄວນປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນຢູ່ທີ່ root ຂອງ UI ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຫດການການສະໂຄຣລ໌ (scroll) "
"ໄປຫາການປະມວນຜົນ [method Node._unhandled_input].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພາະວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສະໂຄຣລ໌ໄດ້ແບບຊ້ອນກັນສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Distance between the node's bottom edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_bottom].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງໂນດ ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member anchor_bottom].\n"
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (Offsets) ມັກຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫາກໂນດຂອງທ່ານເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [Container]. "
"ອັອຟເຊັດຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Distance between the node's left edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_left].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂອບຊ້າຍຂອງໂນດ ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member anchor_left].\n"
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (Offsets) ມັກຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫາກໂນດຂອງທ່ານເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [Container]. "
"ອັອຟເຊັດຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Distance between the node's right edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_right].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂອບຂວາຂອງໂນດ ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member anchor_right].\n"
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (Offsets) ມັກຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫາກໂນດຂອງທ່ານເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [Container]. "
"ອັອຟເຊັດຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Distance between the node's top edge and its parent control, based on [member "
"anchor_top].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂອບເທິງຂອງໂນດ ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [member anchor_top].\n"
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (Offsets) ມັກຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫາກໂນດຂອງທ່ານເປັນລູກໂດຍກົງຂອງ [Container]. "
"ອັອຟເຊັດຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໂນດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies all offset transform properties. Otherwise, no "
"offset transform is applied and the properties have no effect."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການແປງຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (offset transform) ທັງໝົດ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Pivot used by [member offset_transform_rotation] and [member "
"offset_transform_scale] in absolute units.\n"
"The final pivot position is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດໝຸນ (Pivot) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [member offset_transform_rotation] ແລະ [member "
"offset_transform_scale] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍສຳບູນ (absolute units).\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດໝຸນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Same as [member offset_transform_pivot] but expressed in units relative to "
"the [Control] [member size] where [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-left "
"corner of this control, and [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-right "
"corner.\n"
"The final pivot position is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_pivot].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ [member offset_transform_pivot] ແຕ່ສະແດງໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ [member size] ຂອງ "
"[Control] ໂດຍທີ່ [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] ແມ່ນມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້, ແລະ "
"[code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] ແມ່ນມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາ.\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດໝຸນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member offset_transform_pivot].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Position offset in absolute units. The final offset is the combined value of "
"this property and [member offset_transform_position_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍສຳບູນ. ອັອຟເຊັດສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member "
"offset_transform_position_ratio].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Same as [member offset_transform_position] but expressed in units relative to "
"the [Control] [member size] where [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-left "
"corner of this control, and [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-right "
"corner.\n"
"The final offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_position].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ [member offset_transform_position] ແຕ່ສະແດງໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ [member size] "
"ຂອງ [Control] ໂດຍທີ່ [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] ແມ່ນມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້, ແລະ "
"[code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] ແມ່ນມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາ.\n"
"ອັອຟເຊັດສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member offset_transform_position].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Rotation offset. The rotation pivot is defined by [member "
"offset_transform_pivot] and [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ອັອຟເຊັດການໝຸນ. ຈຸດໝຸນການໝຸນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member offset_transform_pivot] ແລະ [member "
"offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Scale offset. The scale pivot is defined by [member offset_transform_pivot] "
"and [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ອັອຟເຊັດການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍ (Scale). ຈຸດໝຸນການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member "
"offset_transform_pivot] ແລະ [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the offset transforms is only applied visually and does "
"not affect input. In other words, this Control will still receive input "
"events at its original location before the offset transform is applied.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the entire transform of this Control is affected and "
"input events will register where the Control is visually.\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະທາງດ້ານສາຍຕາເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອິນພຸດ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື "
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຍັງຄົງຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມຂອງມັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ.\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການແປງຄ່າທັງໝົດຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຈະມີຜົນ ແລະ "
"ເຫດການອິນພຸດຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕົວຄວບຄຸມປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ.\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member offset_transform_enabled] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"By default, the node's pivot is its top-left corner. When you change its "
"[member rotation] or [member scale], it will rotate or scale around this "
"pivot.\n"
"The actual offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio]."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດໝຸນຂອງໂນດແມ່ນຢູ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ. ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນ [member rotation] ຫຼື [member "
"scale], ມັນຈະໝຸນ ຫຼື ຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍອ້ອມຈຸດໝຸນນີ້.\n"
"ອັອຟເຊັດຕົວຈິງແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member pivot_offset_ratio]."

msgid ""
"Same as [member pivot_offset], but expressed as uniform vector, where "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-left corner of this control, and "
"[code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-right corner. Set this property to "
"[code]Vector2(0.5, 0.5)[/code] to pivot around this control's center.\n"
"The actual offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"pivot_offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືກັນກັບ [member pivot_offset], ແຕ່ສະແດງເປັນເວັກເຕີຄົງທີ່, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/"
"code] ແມ່ນມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້, ແລະ [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] ແມ່ນມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາ. "
"ຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປັນ [code]Vector2(0.5, 0.5)[/code] ເພື່ອໝຸນອ້ອມຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ.\n"
"ອັອຟເຊັດຕົວຈິງແມ່ນຄ່າລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ [member pivot_offset]."

msgid ""
"The node's position, relative to its containing node. It corresponds to the "
"rectangle's top-left corner. The property is not affected by [member "
"pivot_offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດ, ເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບໂນດທີ່ບັນຈຸມັນຢູ່. ມັນກົງກັບມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈ. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member pivot_offset]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this Control's children will use the value returned by "
"[method get_combined_maximum_size] in their own size calculations."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດລູກຂອງ Control ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈາກ [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size] ໃນການຄິດໄລ່ຂະໜາດຂອງພວກມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"The node's rotation around its pivot, in radians. See [member pivot_offset] "
"to change the pivot's position.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in the inspector in degrees. If you want "
"to use degrees in a script, use [member rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""
"ການໝຸນຂອງໂນດອ້ອມຈຸດໝຸນຂອງມັນ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ ເຣດຽນ (radians). ເບິ່ງ [member pivot_offset] "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດໝຸນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນອິນສະເປັກເຕີ (inspector) ເປັນອົງສາ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອົງສາໃນສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member rotation_degrees]."

msgid ""
"Helper property to access [member rotation] in degrees instead of radians."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຊ່ວຍໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [member rotation] ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍອົງສາ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນເຣດຽນ."

msgid ""
"The node's scale, relative to its [member size]. Change this property to "
"scale the node around its [member pivot_offset]. The Control's tooltip will "
"also scale according to this value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is mainly intended to be used for animation "
"purposes. To support multiple resolutions in your project, use an appropriate "
"viewport stretch mode as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]documentation[/url] instead of scaling Controls "
"individually.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] does [i]not[/i] take [Control] "
"[member scale] into account. This means that scaling up/down will cause "
"bitmap fonts and rasterized (non-MSDF) dynamic fonts to appear blurry or "
"pixelated. To ensure text remains crisp regardless of scale, you can enable "
"MSDF font rendering by enabling [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] (applies to the default "
"project font only), or enabling [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] in "
"the import options of a DynamicFont for custom fonts. On system fonts, "
"[member SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] can be enabled in the "
"inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the Control node is a child of a [Container] node, the scale "
"will be reset to [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] when the scene is instantiated. "
"To set the Control's scale when it's instantiated, wait for one frame using "
"[code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] then set its [member scale] "
"property."
msgstr ""
"ການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍ (scale) ຂອງໂນດ, ເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບ [member size] ຂອງມັນ. ປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເພື່ອຍໍ້-"
"ຂະຫຍາຍໂນດອ້ອມ [member pivot_offset]. Tooltip ຂອງ Control ກໍຈະຍໍ້-"
"ຂະຫຍາຍຕາມຄ່ານີ້ຄືກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ. ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍຄວາມລະອຽດ "
"(resolutions) ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ viewport stretch mode "
"ທີ່ເໝາະສົມຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/rendering/"
"multiple_resolutions.html]ເອກະສານ[/url] ແທນທີ່ຈະໄປປັບ scale ຂອງແຕ່ລະ Control "
"ແຍກກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ນຳເອົາ [member "
"scale] ຂອງ [Control] ມາຄິດໄລ່. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຂະຫຍາຍ/ຍໍ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟອນແບັບແມັບ (bitmap "
"fonts) ແລະ ຟອນໄດນາມິກທີ່ເປັນແຣສເຕີ (non-MSDF) ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນແບບມົວ ຫຼື ແຕກເປັນເມັດພິກເຊວ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງຄົງຄົມຊັດບໍ່ວ່າຈະຂະຫຍາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ MSDF font rendering "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] "
"(ມີຜົນກັບຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ), ຫຼື ເປີດ [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/"
"b] ໃນຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າ (import options) ຂອງ DynamicFont ສຳລັບຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ສຳລັບຟອນຂອງລະບົບ, ສາມາດເປີດ [member "
"SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] ໄດ້ໃນອິນສະເປັກເຕີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໂນດ Control ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດ [Container], ຄ່າ scale ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ເປັນ "
"[code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] ເມື່ອ scene ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ scale ຂອງ Control "
"ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງ, ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າໜຶ່ງເຟຣມໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] "
"ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດ [member scale] ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"The [Node] which must be a parent of the focused [Control] for the shortcut "
"to be activated. If [code]null[/code], the shortcut can be activated when any "
"control is focused (a global shortcut). This allows shortcuts to be accepted "
"only when the user has a certain area of the GUI focused."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [Node] ທີ່ຕ້ອງເປັນແມ່ຂອງ [Control] ທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ປຸ່ມລັດ (shortcut) ເຮັດວຽກ. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code], ປຸ່ມລັດສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເມື່ອຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດໆກໍຕາມຖືກໂຟກັສ (ເປັນປຸ່ມລັດທົ່ວໄປ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປຸ່ມລັດຖືກຍອມຮັບສະເພາະເວລາທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂຟກັສຢູ່ໃນບາງພື້ນທີ່ຂອງ GUI ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The size of the node's bounding rectangle, in the node's coordinate system. "
"[Container] nodes update this property automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດ, ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງໂນດເອງ. ໂນດ [Container] "
"ຈະອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] nodes how they should resize and place the node "
"on the X axis. Use a combination of the [enum SizeFlags] constants to change "
"the flags. See the constants to learn what each does."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ວ່າຄວນປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ແລະ ວາງໂນດນີ້ແນວໃດໃນແກນ X. "
"ໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum SizeFlags] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແຟລັກ (flags). "
"ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ວ່າແຕ່ລະອັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"If the node and at least one of its neighbors uses the [constant SIZE_EXPAND] "
"size flag, the parent [Container] will let it take more or less space "
"depending on this property. If this node has a stretch ratio of 2 and its "
"neighbor a ratio of 1, this node will take two thirds of the available space."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ ແລະ ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໃນໂນດຂ້າງຄຽງຂອງມັນໃຊ້ແຟລັກ [constant SIZE_EXPAND], ຕົວ "
"[Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ມັນກິນພື້ນທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍລົງ ຂຶ້ນກັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້. "
"ຖ້າໂນດນີ້ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນການຍືດ (stretch ratio) ແມ່ນ 2 ແລະ ໂນດຂ້າງຄຽງແມ່ນ 1, "
"ໂນດນີ້ຈະກິນພື້ນທີ່ສອງໃນສາມຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] nodes how they should resize and place the node "
"on the Y axis. Use a combination of the [enum SizeFlags] constants to change "
"the flags. See the constants to learn what each does."
msgstr ""
"ບອກໂນດ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ວ່າຄວນປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ແລະ ວາງໂນດນີ້ແນວໃດໃນແກນ Y. "
"ໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum SizeFlags] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແຟລັກ (flags). "
"ເບິ່ງຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ວ່າແຕ່ລະອັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"The [Theme] resource this node and all its [Control] and [Window] children "
"use. If a child node has its own [Theme] resource set, theme items are merged "
"with child's definitions having higher priority.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Window] styles will have no effect unless the window is "
"embedded."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Theme] ທີ່ໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ໂນດລູກ [Control] ກັບ [Window] ທັງໝົດຂອງມັນນຳໃຊ້. "
"ຖ້າໂນດລູກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Theme] ຂອງມັນເອງ, "
"ລາຍການທີມຈະຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າກັບການກຳນົດຂອງໂນດລູກ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮູບແບບຂອງ [Window] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ນອກຈາກວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນຈະຖືກຝັງ (embedded) ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The name of a theme type variation used by this [Control] to look up its own "
"theme items. When empty, the class name of the node is used (e.g. [code skip-"
"lint]Button[/code] for the [Button] control), as well as the class names of "
"all parent classes (in order of inheritance).\n"
"When set, this property gives the highest priority to the type of the "
"specified name. This type can in turn extend another type, forming a "
"dependency chain. See [method Theme.set_type_variation]. If the theme item "
"cannot be found using this type or its base types, lookup falls back on the "
"class names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To look up [Control]'s own items use various [code]get_theme_*[/"
"code] methods without specifying [code]theme_type[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Theme items are looked for in the tree order, from branch to "
"root, where each [Control] node is checked for its [member theme] property. "
"The earliest match against any type/class name is returned. The project-level "
"Theme and the default Theme are checked last."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງການປ່ຽນແປງປະເພດທີມ (theme type variation) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [Control] "
"ນີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາລາຍການທີມຂອງມັນເອງ. ເມື່ອວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ຄລາດ (class name) ຂອງໂນດ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"[code skip-lint]Button[/code] ສຳລັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມ [Button]), ລວມເຖິງຊື່ຄລາດຂອງຄລາດແມ່ທັງໝົດ "
"(ຕາມລຳດັບການສືບທອດ).\n"
"ເມື່ອຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງສຸດແກ່ປະເພດຂອງຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ. ປະເພດນີ້ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ "
"(extend) ປະເພດອື່ນໄດ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເປັນຕ່ອງໂສ້ຄວາມກ່ຽວພັນກັນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Theme.set_type_variation]. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບລາຍການທີມໂດຍໃຊ້ປະເພດນີ້ ຫຼື ປະເພດພື້ນຖານຂອງມັນ, "
"ລະບົບຈະກັບໄປຊອກຫາຈາກຊື່ຄລາດແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຊອກຫາລາຍການຂອງ [Control] ເອງ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີ [code]get_theme_*[/"
"code] ຕ່າງໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລະບຸ [code]theme_type[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ລາຍການທີມຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຕາມລຳດັບຂອງ tree, ຈາກກິ່ງ (branch) ໄປຫາຮາກ "
"(root), ໂດຍແຕ່ລະໂນດ [Control] ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຄຸນສົມບັດ [member theme] ຂອງມັນ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັນອັນທຳອິດກັບປະເພດ/ຊື່ຄລາດໃດໆ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາ. ສ່ວນ Theme ລະດັບໂປຣເຈັກ ແລະ Theme "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກກວດສອບເປັນອັນດັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Defines if tooltip text should automatically change to its translated version "
"depending on the current locale. Uses the same auto translate mode as this "
"control when set to [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Tooltips customized using [method _make_custom_tooltip] do not "
"use this auto translate mode automatically."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມ tooltip ຄວນຈະປ່ຽນເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ແປແລ້ວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບ locale ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ໃຊ້ໂໝດການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດດຽວກັນກັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Tooltips ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method _make_custom_tooltip] "
"ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ໂໝດການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The default tooltip text. The tooltip appears when the user's mouse cursor "
"stays idle over this control for a few moments, provided that the [member "
"mouse_filter] property is not [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]. The time "
"required for the tooltip to appear can be changed with the [member "
"ProjectSettings.gui/timers/tooltip_delay_sec] setting.\n"
"This string is the default return value of [method get_tooltip]. Override "
"[method _get_tooltip] to generate tooltip text dynamically. Override [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] to customize the tooltip interface and behavior.\n"
"The tooltip popup will use either a default implementation, or a custom one "
"that you can provide by overriding [method _make_custom_tooltip]. The default "
"tooltip includes a [PopupPanel] and [Label] whose theme properties can be "
"customized using [Theme] methods with the [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] and "
"[code]\"TooltipLabel\"[/code] respectively. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var style_box = StyleBoxFlat.new()\n"
"style_box.set_bg_color(Color(1, 1, 0))\n"
"style_box.set_border_width_all(2)\n"
"# We assume here that the `theme` property has been assigned a custom Theme "
"beforehand.\n"
"theme.set_stylebox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", style_box)\n"
"theme.set_color(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", Color(0, 1, 1))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var styleBox = new StyleBoxFlat();\n"
"styleBox.SetBgColor(new Color(1, 1, 0));\n"
"styleBox.SetBorderWidthAll(2);\n"
"// We assume here that the `Theme` property has been assigned a custom Theme "
"beforehand.\n"
"Theme.SetStyleBox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", styleBox);\n"
"Theme.SetColor(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", new Color(0, 1, 1));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ tooltip ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. tooltip "
"ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢຸດນິ້ງຢູ່ເທິງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຈັກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"mouse_filter] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]. ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ tooltip "
"ຈະປະກົດສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/"
"tooltip_delay_sec].\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [method get_tooltip]. ສາມາດ Override [method "
"_get_tooltip] ເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມ tooltip ແບບໄດນາມິກ. Override [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງອິນເຕີເຟດ ແລະ ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ tooltip.\n"
"ປັອບອັບ tooltip ຈະໃຊ້ການເຮັດວຽກແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ແບບທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເອງໂດຍການ override [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip]. tooltip ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະປະກອບມີ [PopupPanel] ແລະ [Label] "
"ເຊິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດທີມຂອງພວກມັນສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຂອງ [Theme] ກັບ [code]"
"\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] ແລະ [code]\"TooltipLabel\"[/code] ຕາມລຳດັບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var style_box = StyleBoxFlat.new()\n"
"style_box.set_bg_color(Color(1, 1, 0))\n"
"style_box.set_border_width_all(2)\n"
"# ສົມມຸດວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ `theme` ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ.\n"
"theme.set_stylebox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", style_box)\n"
"theme.set_color(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", Color(0, 1, 1))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var styleBox = new StyleBoxFlat();\n"
"styleBox.SetBgColor(new Color(1, 1, 0));\n"
"styleBox.SetBorderWidthAll(2);\n"
"// ສົມມຸດວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ `Theme` ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ.\n"
"Theme.SetStyleBox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", styleBox);\n"
"Theme.SetColor(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", new Color(0, 1, 1));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"The translation context used when translating this control's displayed text, "
"if it has any. Also used when generating translation templates."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິບົດການແປ (translation context) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສະແດງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້, ຖ້າມີ. "
"ນອກນັ້ນຍັງໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງແມ່ແບບການແປ (translation templates) ອີກດ້ວຍ."

msgid "Emitted when the node gains focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂນດໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Emitted when the node loses focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂນດເສຍໂຟກັສ."

msgid "Emitted when the node receives an [InputEvent]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂນດໄດ້ຮັບ [InputEvent]."

msgid "Emitted when the node's maximum size changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໂນດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when the node's minimum size changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງໂນດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor enters the control's (or any child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided "
"its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect, which Control "
"receives the signal."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (ຫຼື ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກໃດໜຶ່ງ), "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] "
"ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor leaves the control's (and all child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided "
"its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect, which Control "
"receives the signal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check whether the mouse truly left the area, "
"ignoring any top nodes, you can use code like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _on_mouse_exited():\n"
"\tif not Rect2(Vector2(), size).has_point(get_local_mouse_position()):\n"
"\t\t# Not hovering over area.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທັງໝົດ), "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] "
"ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control "
"ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ແທ້ໆຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດແບບນີ້:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _on_mouse_exited():\n"
"\tif not Rect2(Vector2(), size).has_point(get_local_mouse_position()):\n"
"\t\t# ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ເທິງພື້ນທີ່.\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "Emitted when the control changes size."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຕົວຄວບຄຸມປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the size flags changes. See [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] and [member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນແຟລັກຂະໜາດ (size flags) ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] ແລະ [member size_flags_vertical]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the [constant NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] notification is sent."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ [constant NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ."

msgid "The node cannot grab focus. Use with [member focus_mode]."
msgstr "ໂນດບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັສໄດ້. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member focus_mode]."

msgid ""
"The node can only grab focus on mouse clicks. Use with [member focus_mode]."
msgstr "ໂນດສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັສໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີການຄລິກເມົາສ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member focus_mode]."

msgid ""
"The node can grab focus on mouse click, using the arrows and the Tab keys on "
"the keyboard, or using the D-pad buttons on a gamepad. Use with [member "
"focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັສໄດ້ຈາກການຄລິກເມົາສ໌, ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມ Tab ເທິງຄີບອດ, ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ D-"
"pad ເທິງຈອຍເກມ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member focus_mode]."

msgid ""
"The node can grab focus only when screen reader is active. Use with [member "
"focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັສໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຕົວອ່ານໜ້າຈໍ (screen reader) ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member "
"focus_mode]."

msgid ""
"Inherits the [member focus_behavior_recursive] from the parent control. If "
"there is no parent control, this is the same as [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ສືບທອດ [member focus_behavior_recursive] ຈາກຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, "
"ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."

msgid ""
"Prevents the control from getting focused. [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override] will return [constant FOCUS_NONE]."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຖືກໂຟກັສ. [method get_focus_mode_with_override] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ "
"[constant FOCUS_NONE]."

msgid ""
"Allows the control to be focused, depending on the [member focus_mode]. This "
"can be used to ignore the parent's [member focus_behavior_recursive]. [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override] will return the [member focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຖືກໂຟກັສໄດ້, ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບ [member focus_mode]. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົນໃຈ "
"[member focus_behavior_recursive] ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ [member focus_mode]."

msgid ""
"Inherits the [member mouse_behavior_recursive] from the parent control. If "
"there is no parent control, this is the same as [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"ສືບທອດ [member mouse_behavior_recursive] ຈາກຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່, "
"ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."

msgid ""
"Prevents the control from receiving mouse input. [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] will return [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກເມົາສ໌. [method get_mouse_filter_with_override] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."

msgid ""
"Allows the control to receive mouse input, depending on the [member "
"mouse_filter]. This can be used to ignore the parent's [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive]. [method get_mouse_filter_with_override] will "
"return the [member mouse_filter]."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກເມົາສ໌, ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບ [member mouse_filter]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົນໃຈ [member mouse_behavior_recursive] ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ [member mouse_filter]."

msgid "Sent when the node changes size. Use [member size] to get the new size."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ. ໃຊ້ [member size] ເພື່ອຮັບຄ່າຂະໜາດໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor enters the control's (or any child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided "
"its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER_SELF]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (ຫຼື ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກໃດໜຶ່ງ), "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] "
"ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control "
"ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER_SELF] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor leaves the control's (and all child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided "
"its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's "
"currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT_SELF]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ (ແລະ ຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທັງໝົດ), "
"ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] "
"ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control "
"ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT_SELF] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "The reason this notification is sent may change in the future."
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນທີ່ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor enters the control's visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided its [member mouse_filter] "
"lets the event reach it and regardless if it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control "
"ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor leaves the control's visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided its [member mouse_filter] "
"lets the event reach it and regardless if it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັງໂດຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ຫຼື "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າ [member mouse_filter] ຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຫດການສົ່ງມາເຖິງ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຕອນນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ Control "
"ໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Sent when the node grabs focus."
msgstr "ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດດຶງໂຟກັສມາ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the node loses focus.\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດເສຍໂຟກັສ.\n"
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃນລຳດັບຍ້ອນກັບ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the node needs to refresh its theme items. This happens in one of "
"the following cases:\n"
"- The [member theme] property is changed on this node or any of its "
"ancestors.\n"
"- The [member theme_type_variation] property is changed on this node.\n"
"- One of the node's theme property overrides is changed.\n"
"- The node enters the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As an optimization, this notification won't be sent from changes "
"that occur while this node is outside of the scene tree. Instead, all of the "
"theme item updates can be applied at once when the node enters the scene "
"tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This notification is received alongside [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE], so if you are instantiating a scene, the child "
"nodes will not be initialized yet. You can use it to setup theming for this "
"node, child nodes created from script, or if you want to access child nodes "
"added in the editor, make sure the node is ready using [method "
"Node.is_node_ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED:\n"
"\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n"
"\t\t\tawait ready # Wait until ready signal.\n"
"\t\t$Label.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color.YELLOW)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດຕ້ອງການອັບເດດລາຍການທີມໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member theme] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂນດນີ້ ຫຼື ໂນດບັນພະບຸລຸດ.\n"
"- ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member theme_type_variation] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂນດນີ້.\n"
"- ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າ override ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີມໃນໂນດ.\n"
"- ໂນດເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ, ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂນດຢູ່ນອກ "
"scene tree. ແຕ່ການອັບເດດລາຍການທີມທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນເມື່ອໂນດເຂົ້າສູ່ scene tree.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບພ້ອມກັບ [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE], ດັ່ງນັ້ນຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງ scene (instantiating), "
"ໂນດລູກອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມໃຫ້ກັບໂນດນີ້, "
"ໂນດລູກທີ່ສ້າງຈາກສະຄຣິບ, ຫຼື ຫາກຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂນດລູກທີ່ເພີ່ມໃນ editor, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂນດນັ້ນພ້ອມແລ້ວໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Node.is_node_ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED:\n"
"\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n"
"\t\t\tawait ready # ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ ready.\n"
"\t\t$Label.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color.YELLOW)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Sent when this node is inside a [ScrollContainer] which has begun being "
"scrolled when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a touch event[/i]. This "
"notification is [i]not[/i] sent when scrolling by dragging the scrollbar, "
"scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/web "
"platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຢູ່ໃນ [ScrollContainer] ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ເລີ່ມມີການສະໂຄຣລ໌ (scroll) "
"ໂດຍການລາກບໍລິເວນທີ່ສະໂຄຣລ໌ໄດ້ [i]ດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ (touch event)[/i]. ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ [i]ຈະບໍ່[/"
"i] ຖືກສົ່ງເມື່ອມີການສະໂຄຣລ໌ໂດຍການລາກ scrollbar, ການໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ຄີບອດ/ຈອຍເກມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສະເພາະໃນ Android ຫຼື iOS, ຫຼື ໃນແພລັດຟອມ desktop/web "
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when this node is inside a [ScrollContainer] which has stopped being "
"scrolled when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a touch event[/i]. This "
"notification is [i]not[/i] sent when scrolling by dragging the scrollbar, "
"scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/web "
"platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຢູ່ໃນ [ScrollContainer] ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຢຸດການສະໂຄຣລ໌ (scroll) "
"ຫຼັງຈາກການລາກບໍລິເວນທີ່ສະໂຄຣລ໌ໄດ້ [i]ດ້ວຍການສຳຜັດ (touch event)[/i]. ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ "
"[i]ຈະບໍ່[/i] ຖືກສົ່ງເມື່ອມີການສະໂຄຣລ໌ໂດຍການລາກ scrollbar, ການໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ຄີບອດ/"
"ຈອຍເກມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສະເພາະໃນ Android ຫຼື iOS, ຫຼື ໃນແພລັດຟອມ desktop/web "
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sent when the control layout direction is changed from LTR or RTL or vice "
"versa. This notification is propagated to child Control nodes as result of a "
"change to [member layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາເມື່ອທິດທາງການຈັດວາງ (layout direction) ຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມປ່ຽນຈາກ LTR ເປັນ RTL ຫຼື "
"ກົງກັນຂ້າມ. ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາໂນດ Control ທີ່ເປັນລູກ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ "
"[member layout_direction]."

msgid ""
"Show the system's arrow mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Use with "
"[member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບລູກສອນຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member "
"mouse_default_cursor_shape]."

msgid ""
"Show the system's I-beam mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. The I-"
"beam pointer has a shape similar to \"I\". It tells the user they can "
"highlight or insert text."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບໂຕ I (I-beam) ຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Show the system's pointing hand mouse cursor when the user hovers the node."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບມືຊີ້ຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ."

msgid "Show the system's cross mouse cursor when the user hovers the node."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບກາກະບາດຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's wait mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Often an "
"hourglass."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບລໍຖ້າຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນຮູບໂມງຊາຍ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's busy mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Often an "
"arrow with a small hourglass."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບລະບົບກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. "
"ມັກຈະເປັນຮູບລູກສອນທີ່ມີຮູບໂມງຊາຍນ້ອຍໆ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's drag mouse cursor, often a closed fist or a cross symbol, "
"when the user hovers the node. It tells the user they're currently dragging "
"an item, like a node in the Scene dock."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບກຳລັງລາກ (drag) ຂອງລະບົບ, ມັກຈະເປັນຮູບກຳມື ຫຼື ສັນຍະລັກກາກະບາດ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາກຳລັງລາກລາຍການບາງຢ່າງຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ ໂນດໃນ Scene dock."

msgid ""
"Show the system's drop mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. It can be "
"an open hand. It tells the user they can drop an item they're currently "
"grabbing, like a node in the Scene dock."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບວາງ (drop) ຂອງລະບົບ. ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຮູບມືແບ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດວາງລາຍການທີ່ກຳລັງຈັບຢູ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Show the system's forbidden mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Often "
"a crossed circle."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບຫ້າມຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ມັກຈະເປັນຮູບວົງມົນທີ່ມີຂີດຂວາງ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's vertical resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"A double-headed vertical arrow. It tells the user they can resize the window "
"or the panel vertically."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບປັບຂະໜາດແນວຕັ້ງຂອງລະບົບ. ເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວໃນແນວຕັ້ງ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ແຜງໃນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Show the system's horizontal resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the "
"node. A double-headed horizontal arrow. It tells the user they can resize the "
"window or the panel horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບປັບຂະໜາດແນວນອນຂອງລະບົບ. ເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວໃນແນວນອນ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ແຜງໃນແນວນອນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Show the system's window resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes from the bottom left to the top "
"right. It tells the user they can resize the window or the panel both "
"horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ເຄີເຊີເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວທີ່ແລ່ນຈາກລຸ່ມຊ້າຍໄປຫາເທິງຂວາ. "
"ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ແຜງໄດ້ທັງແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's window resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes from the top left to the bottom "
"right, the opposite of [constant CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. It tells the user they "
"can resize the window or the panel both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ເຄີເຊີເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວທີ່ແລ່ນຈາກເທິງຊ້າຍໄປຫາລຸ່ມຂວາ, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ [constant "
"CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ແຜງໄດ້ທັງແນວນອນ ແລະ "
"ແນວຕັ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's move mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. It shows 2 "
"double-headed arrows at a 90 degree angle. It tells the user they can move a "
"UI element freely."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບຍ້າຍຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ມັນສະແດງເປັນຮູບລູກສອນສອງຫົວ 2 "
"ອັນຕັດກັນ 90 ອົງສາ. ມັນບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາສາມາດຍ້າຍອົງປະກອບ UI ໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ."

msgid ""
"Show the system's vertical split mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"On Windows, it's the same as [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບແຍກແນວຕັ້ງຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ໃນ Windows, ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ "
"[constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."

msgid ""
"Show the system's horizontal split mouse cursor when the user hovers the "
"node. On Windows, it's the same as [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບແຍກແນວນອນຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ. ໃນ Windows, "
"ມັນຈະຄືກັນກັບ [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."

msgid ""
"Show the system's help mouse cursor when the user hovers the node, a question "
"mark."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເປັນຮູບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງລະບົບເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂນດ, ເປັນຮູບເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມ."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top-left of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດ (Snap) ຕົວຢຶດ (anchors) ທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top-right of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ມຸມເທິງຂວາຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom-left of the parent control's bounds. Use "
"with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຊ້າຍຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom-right of the parent control's bounds. Use "
"with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the left edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຂອບຊ້າຍຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the top edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຂອບເທິງຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the right edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຂອບຂວາຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the bottom edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງຂອບເຂດຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the left edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the left edge and the top offset relative to the top left "
"corner of the node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຂອບຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຊ້າຍຈະກາຍເປັນທຽບໃສ່ຂອບຊ້າຍ ແລະ "
"ອັອຟເຊັດເທິງທຽບໃສ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງແມ່ຂອງໂນດ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the top left corner, the top offset relative to the top "
"edge, and the right offset relative to the top right corner of the node's "
"parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຂອບເທິງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຊ້າຍຈະທຽບໃສ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ, "
"ອັອຟເຊັດເທິງທຽບໃສ່ຂອບເທິງ, ແລະ ອັອຟເຊັດຂວາທຽບໃສ່ມຸມເທິງຂວາຂອງແມ່ຂອງໂນດ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the right edge of the parent control. The right offset "
"becomes relative to the right edge and the top offset relative to the top "
"right corner of the node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຂອບຂວາຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຂວາຈະທຽບໃສ່ຂອບຂວາ ແລະ "
"ອັອຟເຊັດເທິງທຽບໃສ່ມຸມເທິງຂວາຂອງແມ່ຂອງໂນດ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the bottom left corner, the bottom offset relative to the "
"bottom edge, and the right offset relative to the bottom right corner of the "
"node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດຊ້າຍຈະທຽບໃສ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຊ້າຍ, "
"ອັອຟເຊັດລຸ່ມທຽບໃສ່ຂອບລຸ່ມ, ແລະ ອັອຟເຊັດຂວາທຽບໃສ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາຂອງແມ່ຂອງໂນດ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to a vertical line that cuts the parent control in half. "
"Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ເສັ້ນແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ແບ່ງເຄິ່ງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to a horizontal line that cuts the parent control in half. "
"Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ເສັ້ນແນວນອນທີ່ແບ່ງເຄິ່ງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the respective corners of the parent control. Set all 4 "
"offsets to 0 after you applied this preset and the [Control] will fit its "
"parent control. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປທີ່ແຕ່ລະມຸມຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດທັງ 4 ເປັນ 0 ຫຼັງຈາກນຳໃຊ້ພຣີເຊັດນີ້ ແລ້ວ "
"[Control] ຈະມີຂະໜາດພໍດີກັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່. ໃຊ້ກັບ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid "The control will be resized to its minimum size."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງມັນ."

msgid "The control's width will not change."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "The control's height will not change."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "The control's size will not change."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to align the node with its start, either the top "
"or the left edge. It is mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] and "
"other shrink size flags, but can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in some "
"containers. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this flag is equal to not having any size flags."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ໃຫ້ຈັດວາງໂນດໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຂອບເທິງ ຫຼື ຂອບຊ້າຍ. "
"ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant SIZE_FILL] ແລະ ແຟລັກການຫຍໍ້ອື່ນໆບໍ່ໄດ້, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[constant SIZE_EXPAND] ໄດ້ໃນບາງຄອນເທນເນີ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member size_flags_horizontal] "
"ແລະ [member size_flags_vertical].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງແຟລັກນີ້ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບການບໍ່ມີແຟລັກຂະໜາດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to expand the bounds of this node to fill all "
"the available space without pushing any other node. It is mutually exclusive "
"with shrink size flags. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດນີ້ເພື່ອເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ໄປດັນໂນດອື່ນ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບແຟລັກການຫຍໍ້ຂະໜາດໄດ້. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member size_flags_horizontal] ແລະ "
"[member size_flags_vertical]."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to let this node take all the available space on "
"the axis you flag. If multiple neighboring nodes are set to expand, they'll "
"share the space based on their stretch ratio. See [member "
"size_flags_stretch_ratio]. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and "
"[member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ໃຫ້ໂນດນີ້ກິນພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແກນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. "
"ຖ້າມີໂນດຂ້າງຄຽງຫຼາຍອັນຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ expand, ພວກມັນຈະແບ່ງພື້ນທີ່ກັນໂດຍອີງຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນການຍືດ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member size_flags_stretch_ratio]. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member size_flags_horizontal] ແລະ "
"[member size_flags_vertical]."

msgid ""
"Sets the node's size flags to both fill and expand. See [constant SIZE_FILL] "
"and [constant SIZE_EXPAND] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຟລັກຂະໜາດຂອງໂນດໃຫ້ເປັນທັງ fill ແລະ expand. ເບິ່ງ [constant SIZE_FILL] ແລະ "
"[constant SIZE_EXPAND] ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to center the node in the available space. It is "
"mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] and other shrink size flags, but "
"can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in some containers. Use with [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] and [member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ໃຫ້ຈັດວາງໂນດໄວ້ຈຸດໃຈກາງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant "
"SIZE_FILL] ແລະ ແຟລັກການຫຍໍ້ອື່ນໆໄດ້, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant SIZE_EXPAND] "
"ໄດ້ໃນບາງຄອນເທນເນີ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member size_flags_horizontal] ແລະ [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."

msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to align the node with its end, either the "
"bottom or the right edge. It is mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] "
"and other shrink size flags, but can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in "
"some containers. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"ບອກ [Container] ທີ່ເປັນແມ່ໃຫ້ຈັດວາງໂນດໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຂອບລຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຂອບຂວາ. "
"ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [constant SIZE_FILL] ແລະ ແຟລັກການຫຍໍ້ອື່ນໆໄດ້, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[constant SIZE_EXPAND] ໄດ້ໃນບາງຄອນເທນເນີ. ໃຊ້ກັບ [member size_flags_horizontal] "
"ແລະ [member size_flags_vertical]."

msgid ""
"The control will receive mouse movement input events and mouse button input "
"events if clicked on through [method _gui_input]. The control will also "
"receive the [signal mouse_entered] and [signal mouse_exited] signals. These "
"events are automatically marked as handled, and they will not propagate "
"further to other controls. This also results in blocking signals in other "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ເຫດການອິນພຸດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ ຫາກມີການຄລິກຜ່ານ "
"[method _gui_input]. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຍັງຈະໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ [signal mouse_entered] ແລະ [signal "
"mouse_exited] ອີກດ້ວຍ. ເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຈັດການແລ້ວ (handled) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ "
"ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການບລັອກສັນຍານໃນຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆອີກດ້ວຍ."

msgid ""
"The control will receive mouse movement input events and mouse button input "
"events if clicked on through [method _gui_input]. The control will also "
"receive the [signal mouse_entered] and [signal mouse_exited] signals.\n"
"If this control does not handle the event, the event will propagate up to its "
"parent control if it has one. The event is bubbled up the node hierarchy "
"until it reaches a non-[CanvasItem], a control with [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP], or a [CanvasItem] with [member CanvasItem.top_level] "
"enabled. This will allow signals to fire in all controls it reaches. If no "
"control handled it, the event will be passed to [method Node._shortcut_input] "
"for further processing."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ເຫດການອິນພຸດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ ຫາກມີການຄລິກຜ່ານ "
"[method _gui_input]. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຍັງຈະໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ [signal mouse_entered] ແລະ [signal "
"mouse_exited] ອີກດ້ວຍ.\n"
"ຖ້າຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດການກັບເຫດການ, ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່ຂອງມັນ (ຖ້າມີ). "
"ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງຂຶ້ນໄປຕາມລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂນດຈົນກວ່າມັນຈະໄປເຖິງໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [CanvasItem], ຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ມີ "
"[constant MOUSE_FILTER_STOP], ຫຼື [CanvasItem] ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"CanvasItem.top_level]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສັນຍານເຮັດວຽກໃນທຸກຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ມັນໄປເຖິງ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃດຈັດການມັນ, ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ [method Node._shortcut_input] "
"ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"The control will not receive any mouse movement input events nor mouse button "
"input events through [method _gui_input]. The control will also not receive "
"the [signal mouse_entered] nor [signal mouse_exited] signals. This will not "
"block other controls from receiving these events or firing the signals. "
"Ignored events will not be handled automatically. If a child has [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_PASS] and an event was passed to this control, the event will "
"further propagate up to the control's parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the control has received [signal mouse_entered] but not "
"[signal mouse_exited], changing the [member mouse_filter] to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] will cause [signal mouse_exited] to be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບເຫດການອິນພຸດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ເຫດການອິນພຸດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຜ່ານ [method "
"_gui_input]. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຍັງຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ [signal mouse_entered] ຫຼື [signal "
"mouse_exited]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ບລັອກຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນຈາກການຮັບເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຫຼື ການສົ່ງສັນຍານ. "
"ເຫດການທີ່ຖືກລະເລີຍຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າໂນດລູກມີ [constant MOUSE_FILTER_PASS] "
"ແລະ ເຫດການຖືກສົ່ງມາຍັງຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້, ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕົວຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຮັບ [signal mouse_entered] ແລ້ວແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບ [signal "
"mouse_exited], ການປ່ຽນ [member mouse_filter] ເປັນ [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal mouse_exited] ອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Snaps one of the 4 anchor's sides to the origin of the node's [code]Rect[/"
"code], in the top left. Use it with one of the [code]anchor_*[/code] member "
"variables, like [member anchor_left]. To change all 4 anchors at once, use "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດດ້ານໃດດ້ານໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (origin) ຂອງ [code]Rect[/code] ຂອງໂນດ, "
"ຢູ່ທີ່ມຸມເທິງຊ້າຍ. ໃຊ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ [code]anchor_*[/code] ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ [member "
"anchor_left]. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕົວຢຶດທັງໝົດ 4 ອັນພ້ອມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Snaps one of the 4 anchor's sides to the end of the node's [code]Rect[/code], "
"in the bottom right. Use it with one of the [code]anchor_*[/code] member "
"variables, like [member anchor_left]. To change all 4 anchors at once, use "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"ຢຶດດ້ານໃດດ້ານໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວຢຶດທັງ 4 ໄປຫາຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ (end) ຂອງ [code]Rect[/code] ຂອງໂນດ, "
"ຢູ່ທີ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຂວາ. ໃຊ້ກັບຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ [code]anchor_*[/code] ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ [member "
"anchor_left]. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕົວຢຶດທັງໝົດ 4 ອັນພ້ອມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_anchors_preset]."

msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the parent control layout "
"direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກທິດທາງການຈັດວາງຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມແມ່."

msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the current locale. Right-to-left "
"layout direction is automatically used for languages that require it such as "
"Arabic and Hebrew, but only if a valid translation file is loaded for the "
"given language (unless said language is configured as a fallback in [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/locale/fallback]). For all other "
"languages (or if no valid translation file is found by Godot), left-to-right "
"layout direction is used. If using [TextServerFallback] ([member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/text_driver]), left-to-right "
"layout direction is always used regardless of the language. Right-to-left "
"layout direction can also be forced using [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"force_right_to_left_layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກ locale ປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ ພາສາອາຣັບ ແລະ "
"ຮີບຣູ, ແຕ່ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບພາສານັ້ນໆ "
"(ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າພາສານັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນພາສາສຳຮອງ (fallback) ໃນ [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/locale/fallback]). ສຳລັບພາສາອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ (ຫຼື ຖ້າ "
"Godot ບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ), ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ "
"[TextServerFallback] ([member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"text_driver]), ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງຊ້າຍຫາຂວາສະເໝີ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນພາສາໃດກໍຕາມ. "
"ນອກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທິດທາງຂວາຫາຊ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"force_right_to_left_layout_direction]."

msgid "Left-to-right layout direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ."

msgid "Right-to-left layout direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the system locale. Right-to-left "
"layout direction is automatically used for languages that require it such as "
"Arabic and Hebrew, but only if a valid translation file is loaded for the "
"given language. For all other languages (or if no valid translation file is "
"found by Godot), left-to-right layout direction is used. If using "
"[TextServerFallback] ([member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"text_driver]), left-to-right layout direction is always used regardless of "
"the language."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກ locale ຂອງລະບົບ. "
"ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ ພາສາອາຣັບ ແລະ "
"ຮີບຣູ, ແຕ່ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບພາສານັ້ນໆ. ສຳລັບພາສາອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງການຈັດວາງແບບຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ [TextServerFallback], "
"ຈະໃຊ້ທິດທາງຊ້າຍຫາຂວາສະເໝີ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum LayoutDirection] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum LayoutDirection]."

msgid "Use [constant LAYOUT_DIRECTION_APPLICATION_LOCALE] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant LAYOUT_DIRECTION_APPLICATION_LOCALE] ແທນ."

msgid "Text writing direction is the same as layout direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມຄືກັນກັບທິດທາງການຈັດວາງ."

msgid ""
"Automatic text writing direction, determined from the current locale and text "
"content."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກ locale ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Left-to-right text writing direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ."

msgid "Right-to-left text writing direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] that apply transform to the bone which converted from "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ກັບກະດູກທີ່ຖືກແປງມາຈາກຕົວອ້າງອີງ."

msgid ""
"Apply the copied transform of the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] to the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] about the specific axis with remapping it "
"with some options.\n"
"There are 4 ways to apply the transform, depending on the combination of "
"[method set_relative] and [method set_additive].\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"pose.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"rest.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and add it to the apply bone's pose.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and the apply bone's pose is replaced "
"with it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative option is available only in the case [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] is [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. See also [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If there is a rotation greater than [code]180[/code] degrees "
"with constrained axes, flipping may occur."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າທີ່ກັອບປີ້ມາຈາກກະດູກທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] ໄປຍັງກະດູກທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] ໃນແກນທີ່ລະບຸ ໂດຍມີການເຮັດ remapping "
"ດ້ວຍບາງຕົວເລືອກ.\n"
"ມີ 4 ວິທີໃນການນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າ, ຂຶ້ນກັບການປະສົມປະສານຂອງ [method set_relative] ແລະ "
"[method set_additive]:\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງ (pose) ອ້າງອີງທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ rest ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແບບສຳບູນ (absolute) ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແບບສຳບູນ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກ Relative ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType] ຕື່ມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກມີການໝຸນເກີນ [code]180[/code] ອົງສາໃນແກນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດ (constrained "
"axes), ອາດຈະເກີດການປີ້ນ (flipping) ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the axis of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແກນຂອງການແປງຄ່າປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the maximum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the minimum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the operation of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການປະຕິບັດການ (operation) ຂອງການແປງຄ່າປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the axis of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແກນຂອງການແປງຄ່າຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the maximum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the minimum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Returns the operation of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການປະຕິບັດການຂອງການແປງຄ່າຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the additive option is enabled in the setting at "
"[param index]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຕົວເລືອກ additive ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets additive option in the setting at [param index] to [param enabled]. This "
"mainly affects the process of applying transform to the [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone].\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the processed transform is "
"added to the pose of the current apply bone.\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]false[/code], the pose of the current apply "
"bone is replaced with the processed transform. However, if set [method "
"set_relative] to [code]true[/code], the transform is relative to rest."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ additive ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param enabled]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຫຼັກຕໍ່ຂະບວນການນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າກັບ [method BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone].\n"
"ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງຄ່າທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວຈະຖືກບວກເຂົ້າກັບ "
"pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], pose "
"ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍການແປງຄ່າທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກຕັ້ງ [method "
"set_relative] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງຄ່າຈະທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest."

msgid "Sets the axis of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແກນຂອງການແປງຄ່າປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the maximum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the minimum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the operation of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປະຕິບັດການຂອງການແປງຄ່າປາຍທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the axis of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແກນຂອງການແປງຄ່າຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the maximum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the minimum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid "Sets the operation of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການປະຕິບັດການຂອງການແປງຄ່າຕົ້ນທາງການເຮັດ remapping."

msgid ""
"Sets relative option in the setting at [param index] to [param enabled].\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the extracted and applying "
"transform is relative to the rest.\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]false[/code], the extracted transform is "
"absolute."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ relative ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param enabled].\n"
"ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງຄ່າທີ່ດຶງອອກມາ ແລະ "
"ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຈະທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest.\n"
"ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການແປງຄ່າທີ່ດຶງອອກມາຈະເປັນແບບສຳບູນ "
"(absolute)."

msgid "Convert with position. Transfer the difference."
msgstr "ແປງດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງ. ສົ່ງຕໍ່ສ່ວນຕ່າງ."

msgid "Convert with rotation. The angle is the roll for the specified axis."
msgstr "ແປງດ້ວຍການໝຸນ. ມຸມແມ່ນຄ່າ roll ສຳລັບແກນທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Convert with scale. Transfers the ratio, not the difference."
msgstr "ແປງດ້ວຍການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍ. ສົ່ງຕໍ່ອັດຕາສ່ວນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນຕ່າງ."

msgid "A 2D convex polygon shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງພະຫຸແຈນູນ (convex polygon) 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 2D convex polygon shape, intended for use in physics. Used internally in "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] when it's in [constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] "
"mode.\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] is [i]solid[/i], which means it detects collisions "
"from objects that are fully inside it, unlike [ConcavePolygonShape2D] which "
"is hollow. This makes it more suitable for both detection and physics.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] A concave polygon can be split up into several "
"convex polygons. This allows dynamic physics bodies to have complex concave "
"collisions (at a performance cost) and can be achieved by using several "
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] nodes or by using the [CollisionPolygon2D] node in "
"[constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] mode. To generate a collision "
"polygon from a sprite, select the [Sprite2D] node, go to the [b]Sprite2D[/b] "
"menu that appears above the viewport, and choose [b]Create Polygon2D Sibling[/"
"b].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape2D] is faster to check collisions "
"against compared to [ConcavePolygonShape2D], but it is slower than primitive "
"collision shapes such as [CircleShape2D] and [RectangleShape2D]. Its use "
"should generally be limited to medium-sized objects that cannot have their "
"collision accurately represented by primitive shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງພະຫຸແຈນູນ 2D, ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຟີຊິກ. ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ [CollisionPolygon2D] ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ "
"[constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS].\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] ມີລັກສະນະ [i]ຕັນ (solid)[/i], "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນສາມາດກວດຈັບການຕຳຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ຕ່າງຈາກ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] ທີ່ມີລັກສະນະເປັນຮູ (hollow). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບທັງການກວດຈັບ ແລະ ຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] ພະຫຸແຈຫວຳ (concave polygon) "
"ສາມາດຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນພະຫຸແຈນູນຫຼາຍອັນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກແບບໄດນາມິກມີການຕຳແບບຫວຳທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ "
"(ໂດຍມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ) ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂນດ [ConvexPolygonShape2D] "
"ຫຼາຍອັນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໂນດ [CollisionPolygon2D] ໃນໂໝດ [constant "
"CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS]. ເພື່ອສ້າງພະຫຸແຈການຕຳຈາກ sprite, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດ "
"[Sprite2D], ໄປທີ່ເມນູ [b]Sprite2D[/b] ທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງ viewport, ແລ້ວເລືອກ [b]Create "
"Polygon2D Sibling[/b].\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape2D] ຈະກວດສອບການຕຳໄດ້ໄວກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D], ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າຮູບຊົງການຕຳພື້ນຖານ (primitive) ເຊັ່ນ "
"[CircleShape2D] ແລະ [RectangleShape2D]. "
"ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງມັນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນຈຳກັດໄວ້ກັບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດກາງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງພື້ນຖານມາແທນການຕຳໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Based on the set of points provided, this assigns the [member points] "
"property using the convex hull algorithm, removing all unneeded points. See "
"[method Geometry2D.convex_hull] for details."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມຊຸດຂອງຈຸດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດ [member points] ໂດຍໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມ convex hull, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະລຶບຈຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດອອກ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຢູ່ທີ່ [method Geometry2D.convex_hull]."

msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices that form a convex hull. Can be in either "
"clockwise or counterclockwise order.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Only set this property to a list of points that actually form "
"a convex hull. Use [method set_point_cloud] to generate the convex hull of an "
"arbitrary set of points."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຈຸດຍອດ (vertices) ຂອງພະຫຸແຈທີ່ປະກອບກັນເປັນ convex hull. ສາມາດລຽງລຳດັບຕາມເຂັມໂມງ "
"ຫຼື ທວນເຂັມໂມງກໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຄວນຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການຂອງຈຸດທີ່ປະກອບເປັນ convex hull ແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_point_cloud] ເພື່ອສ້າງ convex hull ຈາກຊຸດຂອງຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "A 3D convex polyhedron shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງພະຫຸໜ້ານູນ (convex polyhedron) 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕຳກັນທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D convex polyhedron shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to "
"provide a shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] is [i]solid[/i], which means it detects collisions "
"from objects that are fully inside it, unlike [ConcavePolygonShape3D] which "
"is hollow. This makes it more suitable for both detection and physics.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] A concave polyhedron can be split up into "
"several convex polyhedra. This allows dynamic physics bodies to have complex "
"concave collisions (at a performance cost) and can be achieved by using "
"several [ConvexPolygonShape3D] nodes. To generate a convex decomposition from "
"a mesh, select the [MeshInstance3D] node, go to the [b]Mesh[/b] menu that "
"appears above the viewport, and choose [b]Create Multiple Convex Collision "
"Siblings[/b]. Alternatively, [method "
"MeshInstance3D.create_multiple_convex_collisions] can be called in a script "
"to perform this decomposition at run-time.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape3D] is faster to check collisions "
"against compared to [ConcavePolygonShape3D], but it is slower than primitive "
"collision shapes such as [SphereShape3D] and [BoxShape3D]. Its use should "
"generally be limited to medium-sized objects that cannot have their collision "
"accurately represented by primitive shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງພະຫຸໜ້ານູນ 3D, ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຟີຊິກ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະໜອງຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] ມີລັກສະນະ [i]ຕັນ (solid)[/i], "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນສາມາດກວດຈັບການຕຳຈາກວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ຕ່າງຈາກ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] ທີ່ມີລັກສະນະເປັນຮູ (hollow). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບທັງການກວດຈັບ ແລະ ຟີຊິກ.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] ພະຫຸໜ້າຫວຳ (concave polyhedron) "
"ສາມາດຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນພະຫຸໜ້ານູນຫຼາຍອັນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກແບບໄດນາມິກມີການຕຳແບບຫວຳທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ "
"(ໂດຍມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ) ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂນດ [ConvexPolygonShape3D] "
"ຫຼາຍອັນ. ເພື່ອສ້າງ convex decomposition ຈາກ mesh, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂນດ [MeshInstance3D], "
"ໄປທີ່ເມນູ [b]Mesh[/b] ທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງ viewport, ແລ້ວເລືອກ [b]Create Multiple Convex "
"Collision Siblings[/b]. ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງຄື ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"MeshInstance3D.create_multiple_convex_collisions] "
"ໃນສະຄຣິບເພື່ອເຮັດການແຍກຮູບຊົງໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (run-time).\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape3D] ຈະກວດສອບການຕຳໄດ້ໄວກວ່າເມື່ອທຽບໃສ່ກັບ "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D], ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າຮູບຊົງການຕຳພື້ນຖານ ເຊັ່ນ [SphereShape3D] ແລະ "
"[BoxShape3D]. "
"ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງມັນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນຈຳກັດໄວ້ກັບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດກາງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງພື້ນຖານມາແທນການຕຳໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "The list of 3D points forming the convex polygon shape."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງຈຸດ 3D ທີ່ປະກອບກັນເປັນຮູບຊົງພະຫຸແຈນູນ."

msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] that apply transform to the bone which copied from "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"[SkeletonModifier3D] ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ກັບກະດູກເຊິ່ງກັອບປີ້ມາຈາກຕົວອ້າງອີງ."

msgid ""
"Apply the copied transform of the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] to the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] with processing it with some masks and "
"options.\n"
"There are 4 ways to apply the transform, depending on the combination of "
"[method set_relative] and [method set_additive].\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"pose.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"rest.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and add it to the apply bone's pose.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and the apply bone's pose is replaced "
"with it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative option is available only in the case [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] is [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. See also [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າທີ່ກັອບປີ້ມາຈາກກະດູກທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] ໄປຍັງກະດູກທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] ໂດຍມີການປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ masks ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ.\n"
"ມີ 4 ວິທີໃນການນຳໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າ, ຂຶ້ນກັບການປະສົມປະສານຂອງ [method set_relative] ແລະ "
"[method set_additive]:\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງ (pose) ອ້າງອີງທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງທີ່ທຽບໃສ່ກັບ rest ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ rest ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແບບສຳບູນ (absolute) ແລ້ວບວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- ດຶງທ່າທາງອ້າງອີງແບບສຳບູນ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ pose ຂອງກະດູກທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກ Relative ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] ແມ່ນ [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Returns the axis flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຟລັກແກນ (axis flags) ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the copy flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຟລັກການກັອບປີ້ (copy flags) ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the invert flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າແຟລັກການປີ້ນ (invert flags) ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the X-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການເປີດໃຊ້ງານມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ X ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param "
"index]. ເບິ່ງ [method set_axis_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the X-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການປີ້ນມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ X ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_invert_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the Y-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການເປີດໃຊ້ງານມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ Y ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param "
"index]. ເບິ່ງ [method set_axis_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the Y-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການປີ້ນມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ Y ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_invert_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the Z-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການເປີດໃຊ້ງານມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ Z ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param "
"index]. ເບິ່ງ [method set_axis_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the Z-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການປີ້ນມີແຟລັກສຳລັບແກນ Z ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_invert_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the position in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການກັອບປີ້ມີແຟລັກສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_copy_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the rotation in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການກັອບປີ້ມີແຟລັກສຳລັບການໝຸນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method set_copy_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the scale in the "
"setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກແຟລັກການກັອບປີ້ມີແຟລັກສຳລັບການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [param "
"index]. ເບິ່ງ [method set_copy_flags] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Sets the flags to copy axes. If the flag is valid, the axis is copied."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຟລັກເພື່ອລະບຸແກນທີ່ຈະກັອບປີ້. ຫາກແຟລັກຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແກນນັ້ນຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid "If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the X-axis will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ X ຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the X-axis will be inverted."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ X ຈະຖືກປີ້ນ."

msgid "If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Y-axis will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ Y ຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Y-axis will be inverted."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ Y ຈະຖືກປີ້ນ."

msgid "If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Z-axis will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ Z ຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Z-axis will be inverted."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແກນ Z ຈະຖືກປີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the flags to process the transform operations. If the flag is valid, the "
"transform operation is processed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the rotation is valid for only one axis, it respects the roll "
"of the valid axis. If the rotation is valid for two axes, it discards the "
"roll of the invalid axis."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຟລັກເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນການປະຕິບັດການແປງຄ່າ. ຫາກແຟລັກຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກການໝຸນໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແກນດຽວ, ມັນຈະອີງຕາມຄ່າ roll ຂອງແກນນັ້ນ. "
"ຫາກການໝຸນໃຊ້ໄດ້ສອງແກນ, ມັນຈະຖິ້ມຄ່າ roll ຂອງແກນທີ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the position will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຕຳແໜ່ງຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the rotation will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການໝຸນຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid "If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the scale will be copied."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງ [param enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the flags to inverte axes. If the flag is valid, the axis is copied.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] An inverted scale means an inverse number, not a negative scale. "
"For example, inverting [code]2.0[/code] means [code]0.5[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] An inverted rotation flips the elements of the quaternion. For "
"example, a two-axis inversion will flip the roll of each axis, and a three-"
"axis inversion will flip the final orientation. However, be aware that "
"flipping only one axis may cause unintended rotation by the unflipped axes, "
"due to the characteristics of the quaternion."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຟລັກເພື່ອປີ້ນແກນ. ຫາກແຟລັກຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແກນນັ້ນຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ແບບປີ້ນຄ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປີ້ນ scale ໝາຍເຖິງເລກສ່ວນປີ້ນ (inverse number), ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າລົບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ການປີ້ນ [code]2.0[/code] ຈະໄດ້ [code]0.5[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປີ້ນການໝຸນຈະປີ້ນອົງປະກອບຂອງ quaternion. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປີ້ນສອງແກນຈະປີ້ນຄ່າ "
"roll ຂອງແຕ່ລະແກນ, ແລະ ການປີ້ນສາມແກນຈະປີ້ນທິດທາງສຸດທ້າຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຂໍໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າການປີ້ນພຽງແກນດຽວອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການໝຸນທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍແກນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປີ້ນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງ quaternion."

msgid "If set, allows to copy the position."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ຕຳແໜ່ງ."

msgid "If set, allows to copy the rotation."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ການໝຸນ."

msgid "If set, allows to copy the scale."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍ."

msgid "If set, allows to copy the position/rotation/scale."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ ຕຳແໜ່ງ/ການໝຸນ/ການຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍ."

msgid "If set, allows to process the X-axis."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນແກນ X."

msgid "If set, allows to process the Y-axis."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນແກນ Y."

msgid "If set, allows to process the Z-axis."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນແກນ Z."

msgid "If set, allows to process the all axes."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນທຸກແກນ."

msgid "A CPU-based 2D particle emitter."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (particle) 2D ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU."

msgid ""
"CPU-based 2D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles2D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດອະນຸພາກ 2D ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງລະບົບອະນຸພາກ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [GPUParticles2D] ຕື່ມ, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນແຕ່ໃຊ້ຮາດແວຊ່ວຍເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ (hardware "
"acceleration), ແຕ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນອຸປະກອນຮຸ່ນເກົ່າ."

msgid "Particle systems (2D)"
msgstr "ລະບົບອະນຸພາກ (2D)"

msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles2D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດນີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍມີການລະບຸ "
"[ParticleProcessMaterial]."

msgid "Returns the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Curve] ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [enum Parameter]."

msgid "Returns the maximum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the minimum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Returns the enabled state of the given particle flag."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າສະຖານະການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂອງແຟລັກອະນຸພາກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Requests the particles to process for extra process time during a single "
"frame.\n"
"[param process_time] defines the time that the particles will process while "
"emitting is on. [param process_time_residual] defines the time that particles "
"will process with emitting turned off for the simulation. When combined with "
"[member speed_scale] set to [code]0.0[/code], this is useful to be able to "
"seek a particle system timeline."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກປະມວນຜົນເປັນເວລາພິເສດພາຍໃນເຟຣມດຽວ.\n"
"[param process_time] ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ອະນຸພາກຈະປະມວນຜົນໃນຂະນະທີ່ການປ່ອຍ (emitting) ເປີດຢູ່. "
"[param process_time_residual] "
"ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ອະນຸພາກຈະປະມວນຜົນໂດຍປິດການປ່ອຍໄວ້ສຳລັບການຈຳລອງ (simulation). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[member speed_scale] ທີ່ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງ (seek) "
"ທາມລາຍຂອງລະບົບອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Restarts the particle emitter.\n"
"If [param keep_seed] is [code]true[/code], the current random seed will be "
"preserved. Useful for seeking and playback."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກໃໝ່.\n"
"ຫາກ [param keep_seed] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ random seed ປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງ ແລະ ການຫຼິ້ນຄືນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Curve] ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [enum Parameter]. ຄວນຈະເປັນ [Curve] ແບບ unit."

msgid "Sets the maximum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Sets the minimum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Enables or disables the given particle flag."
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານແຟລັກອະນຸພາກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Number of particles emitted in one emission cycle."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນອະນຸພາກທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນໜຶ່ງຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's rotation will be animated along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກເຮັດແອນິເມຊັນຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid "Maximum initial rotation applied to each particle, in degrees."
msgstr "ຄ່າການໝຸນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍອົງສາ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angle_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member angle_max]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (angular velocity) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ "
"unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle in "
"[i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດ (ຄວາມໄວການໝຸນ) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ [i]ອົງສາ[/i] "
"ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angular_velocity_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member angular_velocity_max]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's animation offset will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດແອນິເມຊັນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum animation offset that corresponds to frame index in the texture. "
"[code]0[/code] is the first frame, [code]1[/code] is the last one. See "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດແອນິເມຊັນສູງສຸດທີ່ກົງກັບດັດຊະນີເຟຣມໃນພື້ນຜິວ. [code]0[/code] ແມ່ນເຟຣມທຳອິດ, [code]1[/"
"code] ແມ່ນເຟຣມສຸດທ້າຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation] ຕື່ມ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_offset_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member anim_offset_max]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's animation speed will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວແອນິເມຊັນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum particle animation speed. Animation speed of [code]1[/code] means "
"that the particles will make full [code]0[/code] to [code]1[/code] offset "
"cycle during lifetime, [code]2[/code] means [code]2[/code] cycles etc.\n"
"With animation speed greater than [code]1[/code], remember to enable [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] property if you want the animation to "
"repeat."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວແອນິເມຊັນອະນຸພາກສູງສຸດ. ຄວາມໄວແອນິເມຊັນ [code]1[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອະນຸພາກຈະຄົບຮອບວຽນອັອຟເຊັດ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]1[/code] "
"ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸຂອງມັນ, [code]2[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງ [code]2[/code] ຮອບວຽນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]1[/code], ຢ່າລືມເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແອນິເມຊັນຫຼິ້ນຊ້ຳ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_speed_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member anim_speed_max]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color. If [member texture] is defined, it will be "
"multiplied by this color."
msgstr "ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ. ຫາກມີການກຳນົດ [member texture], ມັນຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍສີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color])."
msgstr "ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Gradient] ນີ້ (ຄູນກັບ [member color])."

msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Gradient] ນີ້ຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸຂອງມັນ (ຄູນກັບ [member color])."

msgid "Damping will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມໜ່ວງ (Damping) ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"The maximum rate at which particles lose velocity. For example value of "
"[code]100[/code] means that the particle will go from [code]100[/code] "
"velocity to [code]0[/code] in [code]1[/code] second."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸພາກສູນເສຍຄວາມໄວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າ [code]100[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນຈາກຄວາມໄວ [code]100[/code] ໄປຫາ [code]0[/code] ພາຍໃນ "
"[code]1[/code] ວິນາທີ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member damping_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member damping_max]."

msgid "Unit vector specifying the particles' emission direction."
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີຫົວໜ່ວຍ (Unit vector) ທີ່ລະບຸທິດທາງການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ."

msgid "Particle draw order."
msgstr "ລຳດັບການແຕ້ມອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງ [Color] ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນ (modulate) ອະນຸພາກ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] "
"ຫຼື [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

msgid ""
"Sets the direction the particles will be emitted in when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງທິດທາງທີ່ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

msgid ""
"Sets the initial positions to spawn particles when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະສ້າງ (spawn) ອະນຸພາກ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] ຫຼື "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດຂອງຮູບສີ່ແຈ ຫາກ [member emission_shape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."

msgid ""
"The ring's inner radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີວົງໃນຂອງວົງແຫວນ ຫາກ [member emission_shape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid ""
"The ring's outer radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີວົງນອກຂອງວົງແຫວນ ຫາກ [member emission_shape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid "Particles will be emitted inside this region."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູບຊົງກົມ ຫາກ [member emission_shape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles are being emitted. [member emitting] can be "
"used to start and stop particles from emitting. However, if [member one_shot] "
"is [code]true[/code] setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/code] will not "
"restart the emission cycle until after all active particles finish "
"processing. You can use the [signal finished] signal to be notified once all "
"active particles finish processing."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ. [member emitting] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມ "
"ຫຼື ຢຸດການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກ [member one_shot] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ການຕັ້ງ [member emitting] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍໃໝ່ "
"ຈົນກວ່າອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສັນຍານ [signal finished] "
"ເພື່ອຮັບແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"How rapidly particles in an emission cycle are emitted. If greater than "
"[code]0[/code], there will be a gap in emissions before the next cycle begins."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກໃນໜຶ່ງຮອບວຽນ. ຫາກມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0[/code], "
"ຈະມີຊ່ວງວ່າງກ່ອນທີ່ຮອບວຽນຖັດໄປຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the simulation of the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາເຟຣມ (frame rate) ຂອງລະບົບອະນຸພາກຖືກຄົງທີ່ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປ່ຽນຄ່າເປັນ 2 "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເຣັນເດີທີ່ 2 ເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. "
"ໝາຍເຫດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຂອງລະບົບອະນຸພາກເອງຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results in fractional delta calculation which has a "
"smoother particles display effect."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ delta ແບບເສດສ່ວນ (fractional) "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນອະນຸພາກເບິ່ງລື່ນໄຫຼຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Gravity applied to every particle."
msgstr "ແຮງດຶງດູດ (Gravity) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບທຸກອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's hue will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr "ຄ່າສີ (hue) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum initial hue variation applied to each particle. It will shift the "
"particle color's hue."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມຜັນຜວນຂອງສີ (hue variation) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ. ມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າສີ (hue) "
"ຂອງອະນຸພາກ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member hue_variation_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member hue_variation_max]."

msgid ""
"Maximum initial velocity magnitude for each particle. Direction comes from "
"[member direction] and [member spread]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ. ທິດທາງແມ່ນມາຈາກ [member direction] ແລະ "
"[member spread]."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member initial_velocity_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member initial_velocity_max]."

msgid "Amount of time each particle will exist."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະຄົງຕົວຢູ່."

msgid "Particle lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສຸ່ມຂອງອາຍຸອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's linear acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງແນວຊື່ (linear acceleration) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. "
"ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum linear acceleration applied to each particle in the direction of "
"motion."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງແນວຊື່ສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກໃນທິດທາງຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member linear_accel_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member linear_accel_max]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space (known "
"as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate along the "
"[CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or rotated. If "
"[code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will not move or "
"rotate along the [CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດຂອງໂນດແມ່ (ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ ພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຫຼື local "
"coordinates). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄປຕາມໂນດ [CPUParticles2D] (ແລະ "
"ແມ່ຂອງມັນ) ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດສາກົນ (global "
"coordinates); ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ໝຸນໄປຕາມໂນດ [CPUParticles2D] ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only one emission cycle occurs. If set [code]true[/"
"code] during a cycle, emission will stop at the cycle's end."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເກີດການປ່ອຍພຽງຮອບວຽນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຮອບວຽນ, ການປ່ອຍຈະຢຸດລົງເມື່ອຈົບຮອບວຽນນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's orbital velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນວົງໂຄຈອນ (orbital velocity) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. "
"ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum orbital velocity applied to each particle. Makes the particles circle "
"around origin. Specified in number of full rotations around origin per second."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນວົງໂຄຈອນສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກໝຸນເປັນວົງມົນອ້ອມຈຸດກຳເນີດ. "
"ລະບຸເປັນຈຳນວນຮອບການໝຸນເຕັມອ້ອມຈຸດກຳເນີດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member orbit_velocity_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member orbit_velocity_max]."

msgid "Align Y axis of particle with the direction of its velocity."
msgstr "ຈັດແກນ Y ຂອງອະນຸພາກໃຫ້ກົງກັບທິດທາງຄວາມໄວຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Particle system starts as if it had already run for this many seconds."
msgstr "ລະບົບອະນຸພາກຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄືກັບວ່າມັນໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກມາແລ້ວຈັກວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's radial acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມລັດສະໝີ (radial acceleration) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. "
"ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum radial acceleration applied to each particle. Makes particle "
"accelerate away from the origin or towards it if negative."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມລັດສະໝີສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເລັ່ງອອກຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດ ຫຼື "
"ເຂົ້າຫາຈຸດກຳເນີດຫາກເປັນຄ່າລົບ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member radial_accel_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member radial_accel_max]."

msgid "Emission lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສຸ່ມຂອງອາຍຸການປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid "Maximum initial scale applied to each particle."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member scale_amount_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member scale_amount_max]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's horizontal scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດແນວນອນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve].\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [member split_scale]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's vertical scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit "
"[Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດແນວຕັ້ງຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve].\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [member split_scale]."

msgid ""
"Sets the random seed used by the particle system. Only effective if [member "
"use_fixed_seed] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ random seed ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບອະນຸພາກ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member use_fixed_seed] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Particle system's running speed scaling ratio. A value of [code]0[/code] can "
"be used to pause the particles."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນການປັບຄວາມໄວໃນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບອະນຸພາກ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ເພື່ອຢຸດອະນຸພາກຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scale curve will be split into x and y components. "
"See [member scale_curve_x] and [member scale_curve_y]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂະໜາດ (scale curve) ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນສ່ວນປະກອບ x "
"ແລະ y. ເບິ່ງ [member scale_curve_x] ແລະ [member scale_curve_y]."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial direction range from [code]+spread[/code] to [code]-"
"spread[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງທິດທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]+spread[/code] ຫາ [code]-spread[/code] "
"ອົງສາ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's tangential acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should "
"be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມແນວສຳຜັດ (tangential acceleration) ຂອງແຕ່ລະອະນຸພາກຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມ [Curve] "
"ນີ້. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Maximum tangential acceleration applied to each particle. Tangential "
"acceleration is perpendicular to the particle's velocity giving the particles "
"a swirling motion."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດສູງສຸດທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນ (particle). "
"ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດແມ່ນຕັ້ງສາກກັບຄວາມໄວຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ພາກຕິເຄິນມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບໝຸນວົນ."

msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member tangential_accel_max]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [member tangential_accel_max]."

msgid "Particle texture. If [code]null[/code], particles will be squares."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຜິວ (texture) ຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະເປັນຮູບສີ່ລ່ຽມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will use the same seed for every simulation "
"using the seed defined in [member seed]. This is useful for situations where "
"the visual outcome should be consistent across replays, for example when "
"using Movie Maker mode."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ seed ດຽວກັນໃນທຸກໆການຈຳລອງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ seed "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [member seed]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທາງພາບມີຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັນໃນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຫຼິ້ນຄືນ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ "
"Movie Maker."

msgid ""
"Emitted when all active particles have finished processing. When [member "
"one_shot] is disabled, particles will process continuously, so this is never "
"emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອພາກຕິເຄິນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທັງໝົດສິ້ນສຸດການປະມວນຜົນ. ເມື່ອ [member one_shot] "
"ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະປະມວນຜົນຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາ."

msgid "Particles are drawn in the order emitted."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນຕາມລຳດັບການປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Particles are drawn in order of remaining lifetime. In other words, the "
"particle with the highest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນຕາມລຳດັບຂອງອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ "
"ພາກຕິເຄິນທີ່ມີອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານເຫຼືອຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດຈະຖືກສະແດງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າໝູ່."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set initial velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angular velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set orbital velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມໄວໃນວົງໂຄຈອນ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set linear acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມເລັ່ງເຊີງເສັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set radial acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມລັດສະໝີ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set tangential acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set damping properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດການໜ່ວງ (damping)."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angle properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງມຸມ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set scale properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຂະໜາດ (scale)."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set hue variation properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີ (hue variation)."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation speed properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມໄວຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation offset properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], ແລະ [method "
"set_param_curve] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດໄລຍະເລື່ອມ (offset) ຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Parameter] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [Parameter]."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_align_y]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_particle_flag] ເພື່ອກຳນົດ [member particle_flag_align_y]."

msgid "Present for consistency with 3D particle nodes, not used in 2D."
msgstr "ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງກັບໂນດພາກຕິເຄິນ 3 ມິຕິ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ParticleFlags] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [ParticleFlags]."

msgid "All particles will be emitted from a single point."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກຈຸດດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the volume of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນບໍລິມາດຂອງຊົງກົມທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ແປເປັນສອງມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted on the surface of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເທິງຜິວຂອງຊົງກົມທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ແປເປັນສອງມິຕິ."

msgid "Particles will be emitted in the area of a rectangle."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງຮູບສີ່ລ່ຽມຜືນຜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເລືອກແບບສຸ່ມຈາກ [member emission_points]. "
"ສີຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຕາມ [member emission_colors]."

msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle velocity and rotation will be set based on [member "
"emission_normals]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເລືອກແບບສຸ່ມຈາກ [member emission_points]. ຄວາມໄວ ແລະ "
"ການໝຸນຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກກຳນົດຕາມ [member emission_normals]. ສີຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຕາມ "
"[member emission_colors]."

msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the area of a ring parameterized by its outer "
"and inner radius."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ຂອງວົງແຫວນທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EmissionShape] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [EmissionShape]."

msgid "A CPU-based 3D particle emitter."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ອຍພາກຕິເຄິນ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກບົນ CPU."

msgid ""
"CPU-based 3D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles3D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດພາກຕິເຄິນ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ເຮັດວຽກບົນ CPU ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງລະບົບພາກຕິເຄິນ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [GPUParticles3D] ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນແຕ່ຮອງຮັບການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍຮາດແວ (GPU), "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນອຸປະກອນຮຸ່ນເກົ່າ."

msgid "Particle systems (3D)"
msgstr "ລະບົບພາກຕິເຄິນ (3D)"

msgid ""
"Returns the axis-aligned bounding box that contains all the particles that "
"are active in the current frame."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ (AABB) ທີ່ບັນຈຸພາກຕິເຄິນທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles3D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດນີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍມີການກຳນົດ "
"[ParticleProcessMaterial]."

msgid "Maximum angle."
msgstr "ມຸມສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum angle."
msgstr "ມຸມຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity (rotation speed) will vary along this "
"[Curve] over its lifetime. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມ (ຄວາມໄວໃນການໝຸນ) ຂອງແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ [Curve] "
"ນີ້ຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ. ຄວນຈະເປັນ unit [Curve]."

msgid ""
"Minimum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle in "
"[i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕ່ຳສຸດ (ຄວາມໄວໃນການໝຸນ) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນ ເປັນ [i]ອົງສາ[/i] ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid "Maximum animation offset."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເລື່ອມ (offset) ສູງສຸດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid "Minimum animation offset."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເລື່ອມ (offset) ຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid "Maximum particle animation speed."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວສູງສຸດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນພາກຕິເຄິນ."

msgid "Minimum particle animation speed."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງແອນິເມຊັນພາກຕິເຄິນ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex colors. To "
"have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in "
"the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member color] will "
"have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member color] ຈະຄູນກັບສີຂອງ vertex ຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນໃນ "
"[BaseMaterial3D], [member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]ຕ້ອງ[/"
"i] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ສຳລັບ [ShaderMaterial], ຕ້ອງໃສ່ [code]ALBEDO *= "
"COLOR.rgb;[/code] ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]fragment()[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, [member color] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's "
"vertex colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in "
"the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_initial_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມໄລ່ສີ [Gradient] ນີ້ (ຄູນກັບ [member color]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] ຈະຄູນກັບສີ vertex ຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນໃນ [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສຳລັບ [ShaderMaterial], ຕ້ອງໃສ່ [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]fragment()[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, [member color_initial_ramp] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in "
"the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member color_ramp] "
"will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມໄລ່ສີ [Gradient] ນີ້ຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (ຄູນກັບ [member "
"color]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member color_ramp] ຈະຄູນກັບສີ vertex ຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນໃນ "
"[BaseMaterial3D], [member BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]ຕ້ອງ[/"
"i] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ສຳລັບ [ShaderMaterial], ຕ້ອງໃສ່ [code]ALBEDO *= "
"COLOR.rgb;[/code] ໃນຟັງຊັນ [code]fragment()[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, [member "
"color_ramp] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid "Maximum damping."
msgstr "ການໜ່ວງ (damping) ສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum damping."
msgstr "ການໜ່ວງ (damping) ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດຂອງຮູບສີ່ລ່ຽມຖ້າ [member emission_shape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_colors] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted in "
"the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"emission_colors] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ [Color] ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນສີພາກຕິເຄິນເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] ຫຼື "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member emission_colors] ຈະຄູນກັບສີ vertex ຂອງພາກຕິເຄິນ. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນໃນ [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]ຕ້ອງ[/i] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສຳລັບ [ShaderMaterial], ຕ້ອງໃສ່ [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] ໃນຟັງຊັນ "
"[code]fragment()[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, [member emission_colors] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The axis of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "ແກນຂອງວົງແຫວນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid ""
"The angle of the cone when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]. "
"The default angle of 90 degrees results in a ring, while an angle of 0 "
"degrees results in a cone. Intermediate values will result in a ring where "
"one end is larger than the other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on [member emission_ring_height], the angle may be "
"clamped if the ring's end is reached to form a perfect cone."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມຂອງຮູບຈວຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]. ມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 90 "
"ອົງສາຈະໄດ້ຮູບວົງແຫວນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມຸມ 0 ອົງສາຈະໄດ້ຮູບຈວຍ. "
"ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ວົງແຫວນທີ່ປາຍຂ້າງໜຶ່ງໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອີກຂ້າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອີງຕາມ [member emission_ring_height], "
"ມຸມອາດຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຖ້າຮອດປາຍວົງແຫວນເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບຈວຍທີ່ສົມບູນ."

msgid ""
"The height of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງວົງແຫວນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid ""
"The inner radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນຂອງວົງແຫວນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid ""
"The radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງວົງແຫວນເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [enum EmissionShape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມຖ້າ [enum EmissionShape] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາເຟຣມ (frame rate) ຂອງລະບົບພາກຕິເຄິນຖືກຄົງທີ່ໄວ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປ່ຽນຄ່າເປັນ 2 "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາກຕິເຄິນສະແດງຜົນທີ່ 2 ເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບພາກຕິເຄິນເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Amount of [member spread] in Y/Z plane. A value of [code]1[/code] restricts "
"particles to X/Z plane."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການກະຈາຍ [member spread] ໃນລະນັບ Y/Z. ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] "
"ຈະຈຳກັດພາກຕິເຄິນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນລະນັບ X/Z."

msgid "Maximum hue variation."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີ (hue) ສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum hue variation."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີ (hue) ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "Maximum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Minimum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Maximum linear acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງເຊີງເສັ້ນສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum linear acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງເຊີງເສັ້ນຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space (known "
"as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate along the "
"[CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or rotated. If "
"[code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will not move or "
"rotate along the [CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດຂອງໂນດແມ່ (local coordinates). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາກຕິເຄິນເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄປຕາມໂນດ [CPUParticles3D] (ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນ). "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດໂລກ (global coordinates); "
"ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ໝຸນໄປຕາມໂນດ [CPUParticles3D] ເມື່ອໂນດນັ້ນຖືກເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"The [Mesh] used for each particle. If [code]null[/code], particles will be "
"spheres."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະເປັນຮູບຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Maximum orbit velocity."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວໃນວົງໂຄຈອນສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum orbit velocity."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວໃນວົງໂຄຈອນຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], particles will not move on the Z axis."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Z."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles rotate around Y axis by [member angle_min]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະໝຸນຮອບແກນ Y ຕາມ [member angle_min]."

msgid "Maximum radial acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມລັດສະໝີສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum radial acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມລັດສະໝີຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "Maximum scale."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ (scale) ສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum scale."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the x axis."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສຳລັບຂະໜາດຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ ຕາມແກນ X."

msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the y axis."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສຳລັບຂະໜາດຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ ຕາມແກນ Y."

msgid "Curve for the scale over life, along the z axis."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສຳລັບຂະໜາດຕະຫຼອດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ ຕາມແກນ Z."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], three different scale curves can be specified, "
"one per scale axis."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສາມາດກຳນົດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂະໜາດໄດ້ສາມແບບ, ແບບລະໜຶ່ງແກນ."

msgid ""
"Each particle's initial direction range from [code]+spread[/code] to [code]-"
"spread[/code] degrees. Applied to X/Z plane and Y/Z planes."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະພາກຕິເຄິນຈະມີຊ່ວງແຕ່ [code]+spread[/code] ຫາ [code]-spread[/code] "
"ອົງສາ. ນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະນັບ X/Z ແລະ Y/Z."

msgid "Maximum tangent acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດສູງສຸດ."

msgid "Minimum tangent acceleration."
msgstr "ຄວາມເລັ່ງຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The [AABB] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active.\n"
"Grow the box if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [AABB] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles → "
"Generate AABB[/b] editor tool."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ [AABB] ທີ່ກຳນົດບໍລິເວນຂອງໂນດທີ່ຕ້ອງປະກົດເທິງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບພາກຕິເຄິນເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"ຂະຫຍາຍກ່ອງນີ້ຖ້າພາກຕິເຄິນປະກົດ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປແບບກະທັນຫັນເມື່ອໂນດເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ. ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[AABB] ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [b]Particles → Generate AABB[/b] ໃນ editor."

msgid "Particles are drawn in order of depth."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມເລິກ."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_rotate_y]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_particle_flag] ເພື່ອກຳນົດ [member particle_flag_rotate_y]."

msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_disable_z]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [method set_particle_flag] ເພື່ອກຳນົດ [member particle_flag_disable_z]."

msgid "Particles will be emitted in the volume of a sphere."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນບໍລິມາດຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Particles will be emitted on the surface of a sphere."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາເທິງຜິວຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Particles will be emitted in the volume of a box."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພາຍໃນບໍລິມາດຂອງກ່ອງ."

msgid "Particles will be emitted in a ring or cylinder."
msgstr "ພາກຕິເຄິນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນຮູບວົງແຫວນ ຫຼື ຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid "Provides access to advanced cryptographic functionalities."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລັບ (cryptographic) ຂັ້ນສູງ."

msgid ""
"The Crypto class provides access to advanced cryptographic functionalities.\n"
"Currently, this includes asymmetric key encryption/decryption, signing/"
"verification, and generating cryptographically secure random bytes, RSA keys, "
"HMAC digests, and self-signed [X509Certificate]s.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Generate new RSA key.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"\n"
"# Generate new self-signed certificate with the given key.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"\n"
"# Save key and certificate in the user folder.\n"
"key.save(\"user://generated.key\")\n"
"cert.save(\"user://generated.crt\")\n"
"\n"
"# Encryption\n"
"var data = \"Some data\"\n"
"var encrypted = crypto.encrypt(key, data.to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# Decryption\n"
"var decrypted = crypto.decrypt(key, encrypted)\n"
"\n"
"# Signing\n"
"var signature = crypto.sign(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, data.sha256_buffer(), "
"key)\n"
"\n"
"# Verifying\n"
"var verified = crypto.verify(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), signature, key)\n"
"\n"
"# Checks\n"
"assert(verified)\n"
"assert(data.to_utf8_buffer() == decrypted)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Diagnostics;\n"
"\n"
"Crypto crypto = new Crypto();\n"
"\n"
"// Generate new RSA key.\n"
"CryptoKey key = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"\n"
"// Generate new self-signed certificate with the given key.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\");\n"
"\n"
"// Save key and certificate in the user folder.\n"
"key.Save(\"user://generated.key\");\n"
"cert.Save(\"user://generated.crt\");\n"
"\n"
"// Encryption\n"
"string data = \"Some data\";\n"
"byte[] encrypted = crypto.Encrypt(key, data.ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\n"
"// Decryption\n"
"byte[] decrypted = crypto.Decrypt(key, encrypted);\n"
"\n"
"// Signing\n"
"byte[] signature = crypto.Sign(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), key);\n"
"\n"
"// Verifying\n"
"bool verified = crypto.Verify(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, "
"Data.Sha256Buffer(), signature, key);\n"
"\n"
"// Checks\n"
"Debug.Assert(verified);\n"
"Debug.Assert(data.ToUtf8Buffer() == decrypted);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສ Crypto ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລັບຂັ້ນສູງ.\n"
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ/ຖອດລະຫັດແບບກະແຈບໍ່ສົມມາດ, ການເຊັນ/ກວດສອບລາຍເຊັນ, ແລະ "
"ການສ້າງໄບຕ໌ສຸ່ມທີ່ປອດໄພ, ກະແຈ RSA, HMAC digests, ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ [X509Certificate] "
"ທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"\n"
"# ສ້າງກະແຈ RSA ໃໝ່.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"\n"
"# ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃໝ່ດ້ວຍກະແຈທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"\n"
"# ບັນທຶກກະແຈ ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນໂຟນເດີ user.\n"
"key.save(\"user://generated.key\")\n"
"cert.save(\"user://generated.crt\")\n"
"\n"
"# ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"var data = \"Some data\"\n"
"var encrypted = crypto.encrypt(key, data.to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\n"
"# ການຖອດລະຫັດ\n"
"var decrypted = crypto.decrypt(key, encrypted)\n"
"\n"
"# ການເຊັນລາຍເຊັນ\n"
"var signature = crypto.sign(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, data.sha256_buffer(), "
"key)\n"
"\n"
"# ການກວດສອບລາຍເຊັນ\n"
"var verified = crypto.verify(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, "
"data.sha256_buffer(), signature, key)\n"
"\n"
"# ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ\n"
"assert(verified)\n"
"assert(data.to_utf8_buffer() == decrypted)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Compares two [PackedByteArray]s for equality without leaking timing "
"information in order to prevent timing attacks.\n"
"See [url=https://paragonie.com/blog/2015/11/preventing-timing-attacks-on-"
"string-comparison-with-double-hmac-strategy]this blog post[/url] for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ປຽບທຽບ [PackedByteArray] ສອງອັນວ່າເທົ່າກັນຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນດ້ານເວລາຮົ່ວໄຫຼ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການໂຈມຕີແບບ timing attacks.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [url=https://paragonie.com/blog/2015/11/preventing-timing-attacks-on-"
"string-comparison-with-double-hmac-strategy]ໂພສບລັອກນີ້[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Decrypt the given [param ciphertext] with the provided private [param key].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum size of accepted ciphertext is limited by the key "
"size."
msgstr ""
"ຖອດລະຫັດ [param ciphertext] ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍກະແຈສ່ວນຕົວ [param key].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງ ciphertext ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງກະແຈ."

msgid ""
"Encrypt the given [param plaintext] with the provided public [param key].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum size of accepted plaintext is limited by the key "
"size."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ [param plaintext] ທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍກະແຈສາທາລະນະ [param key].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງ plaintext ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງກະແຈ."

msgid ""
"Generates a [PackedByteArray] of cryptographically secure random bytes with "
"given [param size]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [PackedByteArray] ຂອງໄບຕ໌ສຸ່ມທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພທາງລະຫັດລັບຕາມ [param size] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Generates an RSA [CryptoKey] that can be used for creating self-signed "
"certificates and passed to [method StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream]."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ RSA [CryptoKey] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຍັງ [method "
"StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream]."

msgid ""
"Generates a self-signed [X509Certificate] from the given [CryptoKey] and "
"[param issuer_name]. The certificate validity will be defined by [param "
"not_before] and [param not_after] (first valid date and last valid date). The "
"[param issuer_name] must contain at least \"CN=\" (common name, i.e. the "
"domain name), \"O=\" (organization, i.e. your company name), \"C=\" (country, "
"i.e. 2 lettered ISO-3166 code of the country the organization is based in).\n"
"A small example to generate an RSA key and an X509 self-signed certificate.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"# Generate 4096 bits RSA key.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"# Generate self-signed certificate using the given key.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, \"CN=example.com,O=A "
"Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var crypto = new Crypto();\n"
"// Generate 4096 bits RSA key.\n"
"CryptoKey key = crypto.GenerateRsa(4096);\n"
"// Generate self-signed certificate using the given key.\n"
"X509Certificate cert = crypto.GenerateSelfSignedCertificate(key, "
"\"CN=mydomain.com,O=My Game Company,C=IT\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [X509Certificate] ແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກ [CryptoKey] ແລະ [param issuer_name] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [param not_before] ແລະ [param not_after] "
"(ວັນທີເລີ່ມໃຊ້ ແລະ ວັນທີໝົດອາຍຸ). [param issuer_name] ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ \"CN=\" (ຊື່ສາມັນ ຫຼື "
"ຊື່ໂດເມນ), \"O=\" (ອົງກອນ ຫຼື ຊື່ບໍລິສັດ), \"C=\" (ປະເທດ ຫຼື ລະຫັດ ISO-3166 ສອງຕົວອັກສອນ).\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງການສ້າງກະແຈ RSA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ X509:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var crypto = Crypto.new()\n"
"# ສ້າງກະແຈ RSA 4096 bits.\n"
"var key = crypto.generate_rsa(4096)\n"
"# ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ກະແຈທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"var cert = crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate(key, \"CN=example.com,O=A "
"Game Company,C=IT\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Generates an [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC]HMAC[/url] digest of "
"[param msg] using [param key]. The [param hash_type] parameter is the hashing "
"algorithm that is used for the inner and outer hashes.\n"
"Currently, only [constant HashingContext.HASH_SHA256] and [constant "
"HashingContext.HASH_SHA1] are supported."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC]HMAC[/url] digest ຂອງ [param msg] "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param key]. ພາລາມິເຕີ [param hash_type] ແມ່ນອັລກໍຣິທຶມການແຮຊ (hashing) ທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"
"ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ [constant HashingContext.HASH_SHA256] ແລະ [constant "
"HashingContext.HASH_SHA1]."

msgid ""
"Sign a given [param hash] of type [param hash_type] with the provided private "
"[param key]."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັນລາຍເຊັນ [param hash] ຂອງປະເພດ [param hash_type] ດ້ວຍກະແຈສ່ວນຕົວ [param key] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Verify that a given [param signature] for [param hash] of type [param "
"hash_type] against the provided public [param key]."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າ [param signature] ທີ່ກຳນົດສຳລັບ [param hash] ປະເພດ [param hash_type] "
"ກົງກັບກະແຈສາທາລະນະ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "A cryptographic key (RSA or elliptic-curve)."
msgstr "ກະແຈເຂົ້າລະຫັດລັບ (RSA ຫຼື elliptic-curve)."

msgid ""
"The CryptoKey class represents a cryptographic key. Keys can be loaded and "
"saved like any other [Resource].\n"
"They can be used to generate a self-signed [X509Certificate] via [method "
"Crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate] and as private key in [method "
"StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream] along with the appropriate certificate."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສ CryptoKey ສະແດງເຖິງກະແຈເຂົ້າລະຫັດລັບ. ກະແຈສາມາດໂຫຼດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄດ້ຄືກັບ [Resource] "
"ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ພວກມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ [X509Certificate] ແບບເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຜ່ານ [method "
"Crypto.generate_self_signed_certificate] ແລະ ໃຊ້ເປັນກະແຈສ່ວນຕົວໃນ [method "
"StreamPeerTLS.accept_stream] ຮ່ວມກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

msgid "SSL certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this CryptoKey only has the public part, and not "
"the private one."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ CryptoKey ນີ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ສ່ວນສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Loads a key from [param path]. If [param public_only] is [code]true[/code], "
"only the public key will be loaded.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param path] should be a \"*.pub\" file if [param public_only] "
"is [code]true[/code], a \"*.key\" file otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດກະແຈຈາກ [param path]. ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະໂຫຼດສະເພາະກະແຈສາທາລະນະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param path] ຄວນເປັນໄຟລ໌ \"*.pub\" ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ \"*.key\"."

msgid ""
"Loads a key from the given [param string_key]. If [param public_only] is "
"[code]true[/code], only the public key will be loaded."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດກະແຈຈາກ [param string_key] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ຈະໂຫຼດສະເພາະກະແຈສາທາລະນະ."

msgid ""
"Saves a key to the given [param path]. If [param public_only] is [code]true[/"
"code], only the public key will be saved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param path] should be a \"*.pub\" file if [param public_only] "
"is [code]true[/code], a \"*.key\" file otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກກະແຈໄປຍັງ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ຈະບັນທຶກສະເພາະກະແຈສາທາລະນະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param path] ຄວນເປັນໄຟລ໌ \"*.pub\" ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ \"*.key\"."

msgid ""
"Returns a string containing the key in PEM format. If [param public_only] is "
"[code]true[/code], only the public key will be included."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) ທີ່ມີກະແຈໃນຮູບແບບ PEM. ຖ້າ [param public_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ຈະລວມເອົາສະເພາະກະແຈສາທາລະນະ."

msgid "A CSG Box shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ CSG."

msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a box for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງກ່ອງສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ (level prototyping). ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG "
"ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU ຫຼາຍກວ່າການສ້າງ [MeshInstance3D] ດ້ວຍ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ "
"CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU ຫຼາຍເຊັ່ນກັນ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "Prototyping levels with CSG"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານດ້ວຍ CSG"

msgid "The material used to render the box."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນກ່ອງ."

msgid "A CSG node that allows you to combine other CSG modifiers."
msgstr "ໂນດ CSG ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລວມຕົວແກ້ໄຂ CSG ອື່ນໆເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"For complex arrangements of shapes, it is sometimes needed to add structure "
"to your CSG nodes. The CSGCombiner3D node allows you to create this "
"structure. The node encapsulates the result of the CSG operations of its "
"children. In this way, it is possible to do operations on one set of shapes "
"that are children of one CSGCombiner3D node, and a set of separate operations "
"on a second set of shapes that are children of a second CSGCombiner3D node, "
"and then do an operation that takes the two end results as its input to "
"create the final shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ບາງຄັ້ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂຄງສ້າງໃຫ້ກັບໂນດ CSG. CSGCombiner3D "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງນີ້ ໂດຍລວມເອົາຜົນລັດຂອງການດຳເນີນການ CSG ຂອງໂນດລູກ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການຮູບຊົງກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງໃນ CSGCombiner3D ອັນໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ອີກກຸ່ມໃນອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ, "
"ແລ້ວນຳຜົນລັດທັງສອງມາລວມກັນເປັນຮູບຊົງສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "A CSG Cylinder shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ CSG."

msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a cylinder (or cone) for use with the CSG "
"system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງຊົງກະບອກ (ຫຼື ຮູບຈວຍ) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] a cone is created, the [member radius] will only apply "
"to one side."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະສ້າງເປັນຮູບຈວຍ, [member radius] ຈະມີຜົນກັບຂ້າງດຽວ."

msgid "The height of the cylinder."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid "The material used to render the cylinder."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid "The radius of the cylinder."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid ""
"The number of sides of the cylinder, the higher this number the more detail "
"there will be in the cylinder."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນດ້ານຂອງຊົງກະບອກ, ຍິ່ງຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ ກໍຍິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the cylinder are set to give a smooth "
"effect making the cylinder seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the cylinder "
"will have a flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] normals "
"ຂອງຊົງກະບອກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເຮັດໃຫ້ຊົງກະບອກເບິ່ງມົນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຊົງກະບອກຈະເບິ່ງເປັນແບບແປ (flat shaded)."

msgid "A CSG Mesh shape that uses a mesh resource."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ CSG Mesh ທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ mesh."

msgid ""
"This CSG node allows you to use any mesh resource as a CSG shape, provided it "
"is [i]manifold[/i]. A manifold shape is closed, does not self-intersect, does "
"not contain internal faces and has no edges that connect to more than two "
"faces. See also [CSGPolygon3D] for drawing 2D extruded polygons to be used as "
"CSG nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ CSG ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ mesh ໃດກໍໄດ້ເປັນຮູບຊົງ CSG ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າຕ້ອງເປັນ "
"[i]manifold[/i] (ຮູບຊົງປິດສົມບູນ). ຮູບຊົງ manifold ແມ່ນຮູບຊົງທີ່ປິດ, ບໍ່ຕັດກັບຕົວເອງ, ບໍ່ມີໜ້າພາຍໃນ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂອບທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໜ້າຫຼາຍກວ່າສອງໜ້າ. ເບິ່ງ [CSGPolygon3D] ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມ 2 "
"ມິຕິເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນໂນດ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "The [Material] used in drawing the CSG shape."
msgstr "[Material] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງ CSG."

msgid ""
"The [Mesh] resource to use as a CSG shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some [Mesh] types such as [PlaneMesh], [PointMesh], [QuadMesh], "
"and [RibbonTrailMesh] are excluded from the type hint for this property, as "
"these primitives are non-[i]manifold[/i] and thus not compatible with the CSG "
"algorithm.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using an [ArrayMesh], all vertex attributes except "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX], [constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] and [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] are left unused. Only [constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] and "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] will be passed to the GPU.\n"
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] is only used to determine which faces require "
"the use of flat shading. By default, CSGMesh will ignore the mesh's vertex "
"normals, recalculate them for each vertex and use a smooth shader. If a flat "
"shader is required for a face, ensure that all vertex normals of the face are "
"approximately equal."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Mesh] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນຮູບຊົງ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Mesh ບາງປະເພດເຊັ່ນ [PlaneMesh], [PointMesh], [QuadMesh], ແລະ "
"[RibbonTrailMesh] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນ [i]manifold[/i] ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບອັລກໍຣິທຶມ CSG ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [ArrayMesh], ຄຸນລັກສະນະ vertex ທັງໝົດຍົກເວັ້ນ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX], [constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] ແລະ [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ມີພຽງ [constant Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] ແລະ "
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ GPU.\n"
"[constant Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າໜ້າໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ flat shading. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"CSGMesh ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈ vertex normals ຂອງ mesh, ແຕ່ຈະຄຳນວນໃໝ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ vertex ແລະ ໃຊ້ "
"smooth shader. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ flat shader ສຳລັບບາງໜ້າ, ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ vertex normals "
"ທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້ານັ້ນມີຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ."

msgid "Extrudes a 2D polygon shape to create a 3D mesh."
msgstr "ດຶງ (Extrude) ຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມ 2 ມິຕິເພື່ອສ້າງ mesh 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"An array of 2D points is extruded to quickly and easily create a variety of "
"3D meshes. See also [CSGMesh3D] for using 3D meshes as CSG nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງຈຸດ 2 ມິຕິຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບເພື່ອສ້າງ mesh 3 ມິຕິໄດ້ງ່າຍ ແລະ ໄວ. ເບິ່ງ [CSGMesh3D] "
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ 3D mesh ເປັນໂນດ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "When [member mode] is [constant MODE_DEPTH], the depth of the extrusion."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_DEPTH], ນີ້ຄືຄວາມເລິກຂອງການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"Material to use for the resulting mesh. The UV maps the top half of the "
"material to the extruded shape (U along the length of the extrusions and V "
"around the outline of the [member polygon]), the bottom-left quarter to the "
"front end face, and the bottom-right quarter to the back end face."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ mesh ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. UV ຈະແມັບສ່ວນເທິງຂອງວັດສະດຸເຂົ້າກັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນ (U "
"ຕາມລວງຍາວ ແລະ V ຕາມຂອບຂອງ [member polygon]), ສ່ວນມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມສຳລັບໜ້າຕັດດ້ານໜ້າ, ແລະ "
"ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມສຳລັບໜ້າຕັດດ້ານຫຼັງ."

msgid "The [member mode] used to extrude the [member polygon]."
msgstr "[member mode] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການດຶງ [member polygon] ຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], by default, the top half of the "
"[member material] is stretched along the entire length of the extruded shape. "
"If [code]false[/code] the top half of the material is repeated every step of "
"the extrusion."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງ [member "
"material] ຈະຖືກຍືດຕາມລວງຍາວທັງໝົດ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງວັດສະດຸຈະຖືກເຮັດຊ້ຳໃນທຸກໆບາດກ້າວຂອງການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the path interval or ratio of "
"path points to extrusions."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ນີ້ຄືໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ ຫຼື "
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຈຸດໃນເສັ້ນທາງຕໍ່ການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], this will determine if the "
"interval should be by distance ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_DISTANCE]) or "
"subdivision fractions ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_SUBDIVIDE])."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງຄວນເປັນຕາມໄລຍະທາງ ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_DISTANCE]) ຫຼື "
"ຕາມການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ ([constant PATH_INTERVAL_SUBDIVIDE])."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the ends of "
"the path are joined, by adding an extrusion between the last and first points "
"of the path."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ປາຍຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບລະຫວ່າງຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ ຈຸດທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the "
"[Transform3D] of the [CSGPolygon3D] is used as the starting point for the "
"extrusions, not the [Transform3D] of the [member path_node]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະໃຊ້ "
"[Transform3D] ຂອງ [CSGPolygon3D] ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [Transform3D] ຂອງ [member "
"path_node]."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the location of the [Path3D] "
"object used to extrude the [member polygon]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ນີ້ຄືຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸ [Path3D] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການດຶງ "
"[member polygon] ຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], the path rotation method used to "
"rotate the [member polygon] as it is extruded."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ນີ້ຄືວິທີການໝຸນຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການໝຸນ "
"[member polygon] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], if [code]true[/code] the polygon "
"will be rotated according to the proper tangent of the path at the sampled "
"points. If [code]false[/code] an approximation is used, which decreases in "
"accuracy as the number of subdivisions decreases."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມຈະຖືກໝຸນຕາມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ (tangent) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຈະໃຊ້ການປະມານຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຈະຫຼຸດລົງຖ້າຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍໜ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], extrusions that are less than "
"this angle, will be merged together to reduce polygon count."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], "
"ການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບທີ່ມີມຸມນ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ polygon."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_PATH], this is the distance along the "
"path, in meters, the texture coordinates will tile. When set to 0, texture "
"coordinates will match geometry exactly with no tiling."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], ນີ້ຄືໄລຍະທາງຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ (ເປັນແມັດ) ທີ່ພິກັດ "
"texture ຈະປູຊ້ຳ (tile). ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ 0, ພິກັດ texture ຈະກົງກັບຮູບຊົງພໍດີໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປູຊ້ຳ."

msgid ""
"The point array that defines the 2D polygon that is extruded. This can be a "
"convex or concave polygon with 3 or more points. The polygon must [i]not[/i] "
"have any intersecting edges. Otherwise, triangulation will fail and no mesh "
"will be generated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If only 1 or 2 points are defined in [member polygon], no mesh "
"will be generated."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມ 2 ມິຕິທີ່ຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ. ສາມາດເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມແບບນູນ (convex) ຫຼື ເວົ້າ "
"(concave) ທີ່ມີ 3 ຈຸດຂຶ້ນໄປ. ຮູບຫຼາຍລ່ຽມຕ້ອງ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ມີຂອບທີ່ຕັດກັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການສ້າງສາມຫຼ່ຽມ "
"(triangulation) ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີ mesh ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າມີພຽງ 1 ຫຼື 2 ຈຸດໃນ [member polygon], ຈະບໍ່ມີ mesh ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], applies smooth shading to the extrusions."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ smooth shading ກັບສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_SPIN], the total number of degrees the "
"[member polygon] is rotated when extruding."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_SPIN], ນີ້ຄືຈຳນວນອົງສາທັງໝົດທີ່ [member polygon] "
"ຖືກໝຸນໃນຂະນະທີ່ດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is [constant MODE_SPIN], the number of extrusions made."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ເປັນ [constant MODE_SPIN], ນີ້ຄືຈຳນວນຄັ້ງຂອງການດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The [member polygon] shape is extruded along the negative Z axis."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຕາມແກນ Z ທາງລົບ."

msgid "The [member polygon] shape is extruded by rotating it around the Y axis."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is extruded along the [Path3D] specified in "
"[member path_node]."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຕາມ [Path3D] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [member path_node]."

msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is not rotated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires the path Z coordinates to continually decrease to "
"ensure viable shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໝຸນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພິກັດ Z ຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຫຼຸດລົງເລື້ອຍໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape is rotated along the path, but it is not rotated "
"around the path axis.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Requires the path Z coordinates to continually decrease to "
"ensure viable shapes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະຖືກໝຸນຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພິກັດ Z ຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຫຼຸດລົງເລື້ອຍໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The [member polygon] shape follows the path and its rotations around the path "
"axis."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ [member polygon] ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is set to [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"will determine the distance, in meters, each interval of the path will "
"extrude."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"ຈະກຳນົດໄລຍະທາງ (ເປັນແມັດ) ທີ່ແຕ່ລະຊ່ວງຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກດຶງຂຶ້ນຮູບ."

msgid ""
"When [member mode] is set to [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"will subdivide the polygons along the path."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ [member mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant MODE_PATH], [member path_interval] "
"ຈະແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ polygons ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ."

msgid "Base class for CSG primitives."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ CSG primitives."

msgid ""
"Parent class for various CSG primitives. It contains code and functionality "
"that is common between them. It cannot be used directly. Instead use one of "
"the various classes that inherit from it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສແມ່ສຳລັບ CSG primitives ຕ່າງໆ. ມັນມີໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງໄດ້, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄລາສທີ່ສືບທອດຈາກມັນແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid ""
"If set, the order of the vertices in each triangle are reversed resulting in "
"the backside of the mesh being drawn."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ລຳດັບຂອງ vertex ໃນແຕ່ລະສາມຫຼ່ຽມຈະຖືກກັບດ້ານ ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການແຕ້ມດ້ານຫຼັງຂອງ mesh ແທນ."

msgid "The CSG base class."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງ CSG."

msgid ""
"This is the CSG base class that provides CSG operation support to the various "
"CSG nodes in Godot.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] CSG nodes are only intended for prototyping as they have "
"a significant CPU performance cost. Consider baking final CSG operation "
"results into static geometry that replaces the CSG nodes.\n"
"Individual CSG root node results can be baked to nodes with static resources "
"with the editor menu that appears when a CSG root node is selected.\n"
"Individual CSG root nodes can also be baked to static resources with scripts "
"by calling [method bake_static_mesh] for the visual mesh or [method "
"bake_collision_shape] for the physics collision.\n"
"Entire scenes of CSG nodes can be baked to static geometry and exported with "
"the editor glTF scene exporter: [b]Scene > Export As... > glTF 2.0 Scene...[/"
"b]"
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຄືຄລາສພື້ນຖານ CSG ທີ່ຮອງຮັບການດຳເນີນການ CSG ໃຫ້ກັບໂນດ CSG ຕ່າງໆໃນ Godot.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພາະພວກມັນໃຊ້ CPU ສູງ. "
"ຄວນພິຈາລະນາການ bake ຜົນລັດຂອງ CSG ໃຫ້ເປັນ static geometry ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ໂນດ CSG.\n"
"ຜົນລັດຂອງ CSG root node ສາມາດ bake ເປັນໂນດທີ່ມີ static resources ໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູໃນ editor "
"ເມື່ອເລືອກ root node.\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດ bake ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບໄດ້ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ [method bake_static_mesh] ສຳລັບ "
"visual mesh ຫຼື [method bake_collision_shape] ສຳລັບ physics collision.\n"
"ທັງສາກທີ່ມີໂນດ CSG ສາມາດ bake ເປັນ static geometry ແລະ export ຜ່ານ glTF scene "
"exporter ໄດ້: [b]Scene > Export As... > glTF 2.0 Scene...[/b]"

msgid ""
"Returns a baked physics [ConcavePolygonShape3D] of this node's CSG operation "
"result. Returns an empty shape if the node is not a CSG root node or has no "
"valid geometry.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] If the CSG operation results in a very detailed geometry "
"with many faces physics performance will be very slow. Concave shapes should "
"in general only be used for static level geometry and not with dynamic "
"objects that are moving.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are updated "
"with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty shape or "
"outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/"
"code] before using [method bake_collision_shape] in [method Node._ready] or "
"after changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [ConcavePolygonShape3D] ທີ່ bake ແລ້ວຈາກຜົນລັດການດຳເນີນການ CSG ຂອງໂນດນີ້. "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຊົງວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ CSG root node ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຮູບຊົງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ຖ້າຜົນລັດ CSG ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ physics ຈະຊ້າຫຼາຍ. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ Concave shapes ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບ static level geometry ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CSG mesh ຈະຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປ (deferred), "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະອັບເດດຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໄດ້ຮູບຊົງວ່າງ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] ກ່ອນໃຊ້ [method "
"bake_collision_shape]."

msgid ""
"Returns a baked static [ArrayMesh] of this node's CSG operation result. "
"Materials from involved CSG nodes are added as extra mesh surfaces. Returns "
"an empty mesh if the node is not a CSG root node or has no valid geometry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are updated "
"with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty mesh or "
"outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/"
"code] before using [method bake_static_mesh] in [method Node._ready] or after "
"changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [ArrayMesh] ທີ່ bake ແລ້ວຈາກຜົນລັດການດຳເນີນການ CSG ຂອງໂນດນີ້. ວັດສະດຸຈາກໂນດ CSG "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນ mesh surfaces ພິເສດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CSG mesh ຈະຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປ (deferred), "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະອັບເດດຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໄດ້ mesh ວ່າງ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] ກ່ອນໃຊ້ [method "
"bake_static_mesh]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] with two elements, the first is the [Transform3D] of this "
"node and the second is the root [Mesh] of this node. Only works when this "
"node is the root shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG mesh data updates are deferred, which means they are updated "
"with a delay of one rendered frame. To avoid getting an empty shape or "
"outdated mesh data, make sure to call [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/"
"code] before using [method get_meshes] in [method Node._ready] or after "
"changing properties on the [CSGShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ທີ່ມີສອງອົງປະກອບ: ອັນທຳອິດຄື [Transform3D] ຂອງໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ອັນທີສອງຄື root "
"[Mesh]. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ເປັນ root shape ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CSG mesh ຈະຖືກເລື່ອນອອກໄປ (deferred). ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] ກ່ອນໃຊ້ [method "
"get_meshes]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is a root shape and is thus the object that "
"is rendered."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້ານີ້ເປັນ root shape ແລະ ເປັນວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid ""
"Enables automatic smoothing. This overrides any smoothing on the CSG node and "
"instead uses [member smoothing_angle] to calculate normals based on the angle "
"between faces.\n"
"Children of a [CSGCombiner3D] node will be treated as a single mesh."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບ (smoothing) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະທັບຊ້ອນການ smoothing ໃດໆໃນໂນດ "
"CSG ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ [member smoothing_angle] ໃນການຄຳນວນ normals ຕາມມຸມລະຫວ່າງໜ້າ.\n"
"ໂນດລູກຂອງ [CSGCombiner3D] ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດຄືກັບເປັນ mesh ດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Calculate tangents for the CSG shape which allows the use of normal and "
"height maps. This is only applied on the root shape, this setting is ignored "
"on any child. Setting this to [code]false[/code] can speed up shape "
"generation slightly."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນວນ tangents ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ CSG ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ normal maps ແລະ height maps ໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ root shape ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງຮູບຊົງໄວຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this area is in.\n"
"Collidable objects can exist in any of 32 different layers. These layers work "
"like a tagging system, and are not visual. A collidable can use these layers "
"to select with which objects it can collide, using the collision_mask "
"property.\n"
"A contact is detected if object A is in any of the layers that object B "
"scans, or object B is in any layer scanned by object A. See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-"
"masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] in the documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີຟີຊິກ (physics layers) ທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ນີ້ຢູ່.\n"
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ຕຳກັນໄດ້ສາມາດຢູ່ໃນເລເຍີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ 32 ເລເຍີ. ເລເຍີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບລະບົບແທັກ (tagging) "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວກັບການເບິ່ງເຫັນ. ວັດຖຸສາມາດໃຊ້ເລເຍີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກວ່າຈະຕຳກັບວັດຖຸໃດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"collision_mask.\n"
"ການສຳຜັດຈະຖືກກວດພົບຖ້າວັດຖຸ A ຢູ່ໃນເລເຍີທີ່ວັດຖຸ B ກວດສອບ, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸ B ຢູ່ໃນເລເຍີທີ່ວັດຖຸ A ກວດສອບ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-"
"layers-and-masks]Collision layers and masks[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The physics layers this CSG shape scans for collisions. Only effective if "
"[member use_collision] is [code]true[/code]. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"physics/physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers "
"and masks[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີຟີຊິກທີ່ຮູບຊົງ CSG ນີ້ກວດສອບການຕຳ. ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member use_collision] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"physics_introduction.html#collision-layers-and-masks]Collision layers and "
"masks[/url] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The priority used to solve colliding when occurring penetration. Only "
"effective if [member use_collision] is [code]true[/code]. The higher the "
"priority is, the lower the penetration into the object will be. This can for "
"example be used to prevent the player from breaking through the boundaries of "
"a level."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (priority) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແກ້ໄຂການຕຳເມື່ອເກີດການແຊກຊຶມ (penetration). "
"ມີຜົນສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member use_collision] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ຍິ່ງຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງ, "
"ການແຊກຊຶມເຂົ້າໄປໃນວັດຖຸກໍຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນທະລຸຂອບເຂດຂອງດ່ານ."

msgid ""
"The operation that is performed on this shape. This is ignored for the first "
"CSG child node as the operation is between this node and the previous child "
"of this nodes parent."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການ (operation) ທີ່ເຮັດກັບຮູບຊົງນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປສຳລັບ CSG child node ທຳອິດ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການດຳເນີນການຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນລະຫວ່າງໂນດນີ້ ແລະ ໂນດລູກກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"When autosmooth is enabled, faces with an angle between them greater than "
"this will be smoothed, while faces with a smaller angle will remain sharp.\n"
"Note: An angle lower than 0.1 will cause all smoothing to be disabled, this "
"can be used to increase performance."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ autosmooth, ໜ້າທີ່ມີມຸມລະຫວ່າງກັນໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໜ້າທີ່ມີມຸມນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະຄົງຄວາມຄົມໄວ້.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ມຸມທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 0.1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການ smoothing ທັງໝົດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້."

msgid "The CSG library no longer uses snapping."
msgstr "ໄລບຣາຣີ CSG ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ການ snapping ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "This property does nothing."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດຫຍັງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a collision shape to the physics engine for our CSG shape. This will "
"always act like a static body. Note that the collision shape is still active "
"even if the CSG shape itself is hidden. See also [member collision_mask] and "
"[member collision_priority]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ collision shape ໃຫ້ກັບ physics engine ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ CSG ຂອງເຮົາ. ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ "
"static body ສະເໝີ. ໝາຍເຫດ: collision shape ຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເຖິງວ່າຮູບຊົງ CSG "
"ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ກໍຕາມ. ເບິ່ງ [member collision_mask] ແລະ [member collision_priority]."

msgid "Geometry of both primitives is merged, intersecting geometry is removed."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຂອງທັງສອງອັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ, ສ່ວນທີ່ທັບກັນຈະຖືກນຳອອກ."

msgid "Only intersecting geometry remains, the rest is removed."
msgstr "ຈະເຫຼືອໄວ້ສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ທັບກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກນຳອອກ."

msgid ""
"The second shape is subtracted from the first, leaving a dent with its shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງທີສອງຈະຖືກຫັກອອກຈາກຮູບຊົງທຳອິດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍບຸ໋ມຕາມຮູບຊົງຂອງມັນ."

msgid "A CSG Sphere shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກົມ CSG."

msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a sphere for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງຊົງກົມສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "The material used to render the sphere."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Number of vertical slices for the sphere."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນໃນແນວຕັ້ງສຳລັບຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Radius of the sphere."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມ."

msgid "Number of horizontal slices for the sphere."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນໃນແນວນອນສຳລັບຊົງກົມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the sphere are set to give a smooth "
"effect making the sphere seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the sphere will "
"have a flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] normals ຂອງຊົງກົມຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເຮັດໃຫ້ຊົງກົມເບິ່ງມົນ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຊົງກົມຈະເບິ່ງເປັນແບບແປ (flat shaded)."

msgid "A CSG Torus shape."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງໂທຣັສ (Torus) CSG."

msgid ""
"This node allows you to create a torus for use with the CSG system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] CSG nodes are intended to be used for level prototyping. "
"Creating CSG nodes has a significant CPU cost compared to creating a "
"[MeshInstance3D] with a [PrimitiveMesh]. Moving a CSG node within another CSG "
"node also has a significant CPU cost, so it should be avoided during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໂໂທຣັສ (ຮູບຊົງຄ້າຍຄືໂດນັດ) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບ CSG.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂນດ CSG ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສ້າງຕົ້ນແບບດ່ານ. ການສ້າງໂນດ CSG ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງເມື່ອທຽບກັບ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [PrimitiveMesh]. ການຍ້າຍໂນດ CSG ພາຍໃນໂນດ CSG ອື່ນກໍໃຊ້ CPU "
"ຫຼາຍ, ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid "The inner radius of the torus."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີພາຍໃນຂອງໂທຣັສ."

msgid "The material used to render the torus."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງຜົນໂທຣັສ."

msgid "The outer radius of the torus."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີພາຍນອກຂອງໂທຣັສ."

msgid "The number of edges each ring of the torus is constructed of."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງແຕ່ລະວົງຂອງໂທຣັສ."

msgid "The number of slices the torus is constructed of."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງສ່ວນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໂທຣັສ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the normals of the torus are set to give a smooth effect "
"making the torus seem rounded. If [code]false[/code] the torus will have a "
"flat shaded look."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] normals ຂອງໂທຣັສຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທຣັສເບິ່ງມົນ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code] ໂທຣັສຈະເບິ່ງເປັນແບບແປ (flat shaded)."

msgid ""
"A script implemented in the C# programming language, saved with the "
"[code].cs[/code] extension (Mono-enabled builds only)."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ C#, ບັນທຶກດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ [code].cs[/code] (ສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Mono "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"This class represents a C# script. It is the C# equivalent of the [GDScript] "
"class and is only available in Mono-enabled Godot builds."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງສະຄຣິບ C#. ມັນທຽບເທົ່າກັບຄລາສ [GDScript] ໃນຮູບແບບ C# ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ "
"Godot ເວີຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Mono ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "C# documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດສະນີເອກະສານ C#"

msgid "Returns a new instance of the script."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ໃໝ່ຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"Six square textures representing the faces of a cube. Commonly used as a "
"skybox."
msgstr "Texture ຮູບສີ່ລ່ຽມ 6 ອັນທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງກ້ອນສີ່ລ່ຽມ (cube). ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ skybox."

msgid ""
"A cubemap is made of 6 textures organized in layers. They are typically used "
"for faking reflections in 3D rendering (see [ReflectionProbe]). It can be "
"used to make an object look as if it's reflecting its surroundings. This "
"usually delivers much better performance than other reflection methods.\n"
"This resource is typically used as a uniform in custom shaders. Few core "
"Godot methods make use of [Cubemap] resources.\n"
"To create such a texture file yourself, reimport your image files using the "
"Godot Editor import presets. To create a Cubemap from code, use [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] on an instance of the Cubemap class.\n"
"The expected image order is X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (in Godot's coordinate "
"system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\"). You can use one of the "
"following templates as a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp]2×3 cubemap template "
"(default layout option)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]3×2 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp]1×6 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]6×1 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot doesn't support using cubemaps in a [PanoramaSkyMaterial]. "
"To use a cubemap as a skybox, convert the default [PanoramaSkyMaterial] to a "
"[ShaderMaterial] using the [b]Convert to ShaderMaterial[/b] resource dropdown "
"option, then replace its code with the following:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"shader_type sky;\n"
"\n"
"uniform samplerCube source_panorama : filter_linear, source_color, "
"hint_default_black;\n"
"uniform float exposure : hint_range(0, 128) = 1.0;\n"
"\n"
"void sky() {\n"
"\t// If importing a cubemap from another engine, you may need to flip one of "
"the `EYEDIR` components below\n"
"\t// by replacing it with `-EYEDIR`.\n"
"\tvec3 eyedir = vec3(EYEDIR.x, EYEDIR.y, EYEDIR.z);\n"
"\tCOLOR = texture(source_panorama, eyedir).rgb * exposure;\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"After replacing the shader code and saving, specify the imported Cubemap "
"resource in the Shader Parameters section of the ShaderMaterial in the "
"inspector.\n"
"Alternatively, you can use [url=https://danilw.github.io/GLSL-howto/"
"cubemap_to_panorama_js/cubemap_to_panorama.html]this tool[/url] to convert a "
"cubemap to an equirectangular sky map and use [PanoramaSkyMaterial] as usual."
msgstr ""
"Cubemap ປະກອບດ້ວຍ 6 textures ທີ່ຈັດລຽງເປັນຊັ້ນໆ. ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການສະທ້ອນໃນການສະແດງຜົນ 3 "
"ມິຕິ (ເບິ່ງ [ReflectionProbe]). ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸເບິ່ງຄືວ່າກຳລັງສະທ້ອນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອ້ອມຂ້າງ "
"ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບດີກວ່າວິທີການສະທ້ອນແບບອື່ນ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ uniform ໃນ custom shaders. ມີຟັງຊັນຫຼັກຂອງ Godot "
"ພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ [Cubemap] ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ໃນການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ texture ແບບນີ້, ໃຫ້ reimport ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ import presets ຂອງ "
"Godot. ຖ້າຈະສ້າງ Cubemap ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images].\n"
"ລຳດັບຂອງຮູບທີ່ຕ້ອງການແມ່ນ X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (ໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງ Godot, Y+ ຄື \"ຂຶ້ນ\" "
"ແລະ Z- ຄື \"ໄປທາງໜ້າ\")."

msgid "Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderCubemap])."
msgstr "ສ້າງເວີຊັນ placeholder ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ ([PlaceholderCubemap])."

msgid "An array of [Cubemap]s, stored together and with a single reference."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງ [Cubemap] ຫຼາຍອັນ, ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຮ່ວມກັນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ການອ້າງອີງ (reference) ພຽງອັນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"[CubemapArray]s are made of an array of [Cubemap]s. Like [Cubemap]s, they are "
"made of multiple textures, the amount of which must be divisible by 6 (one "
"for each face of the cube).\n"
"The primary benefit of [CubemapArray]s is that they can be accessed in shader "
"code using a single texture reference. In other words, you can pass multiple "
"[Cubemap]s into a shader using a single [CubemapArray]. [Cubemap]s are "
"allocated in adjacent cache regions on the GPU, which makes [CubemapArray]s "
"the most efficient way to store multiple [Cubemap]s.\n"
"Godot uses [CubemapArray]s internally for many effects, including the [Sky] "
"if you set [member ProjectSettings.rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/"
"texture_array_reflections] to [code]true[/code].\n"
"To create such a texture file yourself, reimport your image files using the "
"Godot Editor import presets. To create a CubemapArray from code, use [method "
"ImageTextureLayered.create_from_images] on an instance of the CubemapArray "
"class.\n"
"The expected image order is X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z- (in Godot's coordinate "
"system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\"). You can use one of the "
"following templates as a base:\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_2x3.webp]2×3 cubemap template "
"(default layout option)[/url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_3x2.webp]3×2 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_1x6.webp]1×6 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"- [url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/"
"tutorials/assets_pipeline/img/cubemap_template_6x1.webp]6×1 cubemap template[/"
"url]\n"
"Multiple layers are stacked on top of each other when using the default "
"vertical import option (with the first layer at the top). Alternatively, you "
"can choose a horizontal layout in the import options (with the first layer at "
"the left).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [CubemapArray] is not supported in the Compatibility renderer "
"due to graphics API limitations."
msgstr ""
"[CubemapArray] ປະກອບດ້ວຍອາເຣຂອງ [Cubemap]. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ [Cubemap], ພວກມັນສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ "
"textures ຫຼາຍອັນ ໂດຍຈຳນວນຕ້ອງຫານຂາດໃຫ້ 6 (ໜຶ່ງອັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງ cube).\n"
"ປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກຂອງ [CubemapArray] ແມ່ນການເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນ shader ໂດຍໃຊ້ການອ້າງອີງ texture "
"ພຽງອັນດຽວ. ພວກມັນຖືກຈັດສັນໃນແຄຊທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນເທິງ GPU ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສຸດໃນການເກັບ "
"[Cubemap] ຫຼາຍອັນ.\n"
"Godot ໃຊ້ [CubemapArray] ພາຍໃນສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ ລວມທັງ [Sky].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [CubemapArray] ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Compatibility renderer ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ "
"graphics API."

msgid ""
"Creates a placeholder version of this resource ([PlaceholderCubemapArray])."
msgstr "ສ້າງເວີຊັນ placeholder ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ ([PlaceholderCubemapArray])."

msgid "A mathematical curve."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທາງຄະນິດສາດ."

msgid ""
"This resource describes a mathematical curve by defining a set of points and "
"tangents at each point. By default, it ranges between [code]0[/code] and "
"[code]1[/code] on the X and Y axes, but these ranges can be changed.\n"
"Please note that many resources and nodes assume they are given [i]unit "
"curves[/i]. A unit curve is a curve whose domain (the X axis) is between "
"[code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]. Some examples of unit curve usage are "
"[member CPUParticles2D.angle_curve] and [member Line2D.width_curve]."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທາງຄະນິດສາດ ໂດຍການກຳນົດຊຸດຂອງຈຸດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດ (tangents) "
"ໃນແຕ່ລະຈຸດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]1[/code] ໃນແກນ X "
"ແລະ Y, ແຕ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຊ່ວງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້.\n"
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ໂນດຫຼາຍອັນຕ້ອງການ [i]unit curves[/i]. Unit curve "
"ແມ່ນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ມີຄ່າໃນແກນ X ລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Adds a point to the curve. For each side, if the [code]*_mode[/code] is "
"[constant TANGENT_LINEAR], the [code]*_tangent[/code] angle (in degrees) uses "
"the slope of the curve halfway to the adjacent point. Allows custom "
"assignments to the [code]*_tangent[/code] angle if [code]*_mode[/code] is set "
"to [constant TANGENT_FREE]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຈຸດໃຫ້ກັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຂ້າງ, ຖ້າ [code]*_mode[/code] ເປັນ [constant "
"TANGENT_LINEAR], ມຸມ [code]*_tangent[/code] (ເປັນອົງສາ) "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເຄິ່ງທາງໄປຫາຈຸດຖັດໄປ. ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກຳນົດມຸມ [code]*_tangent[/code] "
"ເອງໄດ້ຖ້າ [code]*_mode[/code] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant TANGENT_FREE]."

msgid "Recomputes the baked cache of points for the curve."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Removes duplicate points, i.e. points that are less than 0.00001 units "
"(engine epsilon value) away from their neighbor on the curve."
msgstr "ນຳຈຸດທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນອອກ, ຄືຈຸດທີ່ຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດຂ້າງຄຽງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 0.00001 ຢູນິດ."

msgid "Removes all points from the curve."
msgstr "ນຳຈຸດທັງໝົດອອກຈາກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the difference between [member min_domain] and [member max_domain]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ [member min_domain] ແລະ [member max_domain]."

msgid "Returns the left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຊ້າຍສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the left tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຊ້າຍ (ເປັນອົງສາ) ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the curve coordinates for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພິກັດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid "Returns the right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຂວາສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the right tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຂວາ (ເປັນອົງສາ) ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Returns the difference between [member min_value] and [member max_value]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ [member min_value] ແລະ [member max_value]."

msgid "Removes the point at [param index] from the curve."
msgstr "ນຳຈຸດທີ່ [param index] ອອກຈາກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the Y value for the point that would exist at the X position [param "
"offset] along the curve."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ Y ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ X [param offset] ຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the Y value for the point that would exist at the X position [param "
"offset] along the curve using the baked cache. Bakes the curve's points if "
"not already baked."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ Y ສຳລັບຈຸດໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ X [param offset] ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຄຊທີ່ຄຳນວນໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Sets the left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index] to [param "
"mode]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ [enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຊ້າຍສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param mode]."

msgid ""
"Sets the left tangent angle for the point at [param index] to [param tangent]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຊ້າຍສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param tangent]."

msgid ""
"Assigns the horizontal position [param offset] to the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງແນວນອນ [param offset] ໃຫ້ກັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid ""
"Sets the right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [param index] to [param "
"mode]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ [enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຂວາສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param mode]."

msgid ""
"Sets the right tangent angle for the point at [param index] to [param "
"tangent]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຂວາສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index] ເປັນ [param tangent]."

msgid "Assigns the vertical position [param y] to the point at [param index]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງແນວຕັ້ງ [param y] ໃຫ້ກັບຈຸດທີ່ [param index]."

msgid "The number of points to include in the baked (i.e. cached) curve data."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດທີ່ຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ bake (cache) ໄວ້."

msgid "The maximum domain (x-coordinate) that points can have."
msgstr "ຄ່າໂດເມນສູງສຸດ (ພິກັດ x) ທີ່ຈຸດສາມາດມີໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The maximum value (y-coordinate) that points can have. Tangents can cause "
"higher values between points."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດ (ພິກັດ y) ທີ່ຈຸດສາມາດມີໄດ້. ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄ່າສູງກວ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດ."

msgid "The minimum domain (x-coordinate) that points can have."
msgstr "ຄ່າໂດເມນຕ່ຳສຸດ (ພິກັດ x) ທີ່ຈຸດສາມາດມີໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The minimum value (y-coordinate) that points can have. Tangents can cause "
"lower values between points."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ (ພິກັດ y) ທີ່ຈຸດສາມາດມີໄດ້. ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດ."

msgid "The number of points describing the curve."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຈຸດທີ່ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"The left [enum TangentMode] for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "[enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຊ້າຍສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The left tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຊ້າຍ (ເປັນອົງສາ) ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The position of the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The right [enum TangentMode] for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "[enum TangentMode] ດ້ານຂວາສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The right tangent angle (in degrees) for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ມຸມເສັ້ນສຳຜັດດ້ານຂວາ (ເປັນອົງສາ) ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid "Emitted when [member max_domain] or [member min_domain] is changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member max_domain] ຫຼື [member min_domain] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when [member max_value] or [member min_value] is changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [member max_value] ຫຼື [member min_value] ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "The tangent on this side of the point is user-defined."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນສຳຜັດໃນດ້ານນີ້ຂອງຈຸດແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The curve calculates the tangent on this side of the point as the slope "
"halfway towards the adjacent point."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະຄຳນວນເສັ້ນສຳຜັດໃນດ້ານນີ້ຂອງຈຸດ ເປັນຄ່າຄວາມຊັນເຄິ່ງທາງໄປຫາຈຸດຖັດໄປ."

msgid "The total number of available tangent modes."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນທັງໝົດຂອງໂໝດເສັ້ນສຳຜັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "Describes a Bézier curve in 2D space."
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Bézier ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"This class describes a Bézier curve in 2D space. It is mainly used to give a "
"shape to a [Path2D], but can be manually sampled for other purposes.\n"
"It keeps a cache of precalculated points along the curve, to speed up further "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Bézier ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 2 ມິຕິ. ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງແກ່ [Path2D]. "
"ມັນຈະເກັບແຄຊຂອງຈຸດທີ່ຄຳນວນໄວ້ແລ້ວຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຄຳນວນຖັດໄປໄວຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a point with the specified [param position] relative to the curve's own "
"position, with control points [param in] and [param out]. Appends the new "
"point at the end of the point list.\n"
"If [param index] is given, the new point is inserted before the existing "
"point identified by index [param index]. Every existing point starting from "
"[param index] is shifted further down the list of points. The index must be "
"greater than or equal to [code]0[/code] and must not exceed the number of "
"existing points in the line. See [member point_count]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຈຸດທີ່ມີ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ ທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເອງ, ພ້ອມດ້ວຍຈຸດຄວບຄຸມ [param "
"in] ແລະ [param out]. ຈະເພີ່ມຈຸດໃໝ່ໃສ່ທ້າຍລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total length of the curve, based on the cached points. Given "
"enough density (see [member bake_interval]), it should be approximate enough."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຍາວທັງໝົດຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຸດໃນແຄຊ."

msgid "Returns the cache of points as a [PackedVector2Array]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຄຊຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນຮູບແບບ [PackedVector2Array]."

msgid ""
"Returns the closest offset to [param to_point]. This offset is meant to be "
"used in [method sample_baked].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ offset ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດກັບ [param to_point]. offset ນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [method "
"sample_baked].\n"
"[param to_point] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ local space ຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the closest point on baked segments (in curve's local space) to "
"[param to_point].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດໃນສ່ວນທີ່ bake ແລ້ວ ທຽບກັບ [param to_point]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. "
"The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code]"
"(0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາເຂົ້າ (in) ຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param "
"idx]. The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the "
"index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and "
"returns [code](0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາອອກ (out) ຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of "
"bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0)[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Deletes the point [param idx] from the curve. Sends an error to the console "
"if [param idx] is out of bounds."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດ [param idx] ອອກຈາກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position between the vertex [param idx] and the vertex [code]idx "
"+ 1[/code], where [param t] controls if the point is the first vertex "
"([code]t = 0.0[/code]), the last vertex ([code]t = 1.0[/code]), or in "
"between. Values of [param t] outside the range ([code]0.0 <= t <= 1.0[/code]) "
"give strange, but predictable results.\n"
"If [param idx] is out of bounds it is truncated to the first or last vertex, "
"and [param t] is ignored. If the curve has no points, the function sends an "
"error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງລະຫວ່າງ vertex [param idx] ແລະ vertex ຖັດໄປ ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param t] "
"ເປັນຕົວຄວບຄຸມການແຊກຄ່າ (interpolation)."

msgid ""
"Returns a point within the curve at position [param offset], where [param "
"offset] is measured as a pixel distance along the curve.\n"
"To do that, it finds the two cached points where the [param offset] lies "
"between, then interpolates the values. This interpolation is cubic if [param "
"cubic] is set to [code]true[/code], or linear if set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"Cubic interpolation tends to follow the curves better, but linear is faster "
"(and often, precise enough)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດພາຍໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param offset] (ວັດແທກເປັນພິກເຊວຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ)."

msgid ""
"Similar to [method sample_baked], but returns [Transform2D] that includes a "
"rotation along the curve, with [member Transform2D.origin] as the point "
"position and the [member Transform2D.x] vector pointing in the direction of "
"the path at that point. Returns an empty transform if the length of the curve "
"is [code]0[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var baked = curve.sample_baked_with_rotation(offset)\n"
"# The returned Transform2D can be set directly.\n"
"transform = baked\n"
"# You can also read the origin and rotation separately from the returned "
"Transform2D.\n"
"position = baked.get_origin()\n"
"rotation = baked.get_rotation()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method sample_baked], ແຕ່ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform2D] ທີ່ລວມເອົາການໝຸນຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the position at the vertex [param fofs]. It calls [method sample] "
"using the integer part of [param fofs] as [code]idx[/code], and its "
"fractional part as [code]t[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ vertex [param fofs] ໂດຍໃຊ້ສ່ວນຈຳນວນເຕັມເປັນ index ແລະ ສ່ວນເສດເປັນຄ່າ t."

msgid ""
"Sets the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. If "
"the index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console. The "
"position is relative to the vertex."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາເຂົ້າ (in) ຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param idx]. "
"If the index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console. "
"The position is relative to the vertex."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາອອກ (out) ຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the position for the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of bounds, "
"the function sends an error to the console."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of points along the curve, with a curvature controlled point "
"density. That is, the curvier parts will have more points than the straighter "
"parts.\n"
"This approximation makes straight segments between each point, then "
"subdivides those segments until the resulting shape is similar enough.\n"
"[param max_stages] controls how many subdivisions a curve segment may face "
"before it is considered approximate enough. Each subdivision splits the "
"segment in half, so the default 5 stages may mean up to 32 subdivisions per "
"curve segment. Increase with care!\n"
"[param tolerance_degrees] controls how many degrees the midpoint of a segment "
"may deviate from the real curve, before the segment has to be subdivided."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຂອງຈຸດຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ໂດຍມີຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຈຸດຕາມຄວາມໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of points along the curve, with almost uniform density. [param "
"max_stages] controls how many subdivisions a curve segment may face before it "
"is considered approximate enough. Each subdivision splits the segment in "
"half, so the default 5 stages may mean up to 32 subdivisions per curve "
"segment. Increase with care!\n"
"[param tolerance_length] controls the maximal distance between two "
"neighboring points, before the segment has to be subdivided."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຂອງຈຸດຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ໂດຍມີຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຈຸດເກືອບສະເໝີກັນ."

msgid ""
"The distance in pixels between two adjacent cached points. Changing it forces "
"the cache to be recomputed the next time the [method get_baked_points] or "
"[method get_baked_length] function is called. The smaller the distance, the "
"more points in the cache and the more memory it will consume, so use with "
"care."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນພິກເຊວລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດໃນແຄຊ. ຍິ່ງຄ່ານ້ອຍ ຍິ່ງມີຈຸດຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The position of the control point leading to the vertex at [code]index[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The position of the control point leading out of the vertex at [code]index[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາອອກທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The position of for the vertex at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ vertex ທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid "Describes a Bézier curve in 3D space."
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Bézier ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"This class describes a Bézier curve in 3D space. It is mainly used to give a "
"shape to a [Path3D], but can be manually sampled for other purposes.\n"
"It keeps a cache of precalculated points along the curve, to speed up further "
"calculations."
msgstr "ຄລາສນີ້ອະທິບາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Bézier ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3 ມິຕິ. ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງແກ່ [Path3D]."

msgid "Returns the cache of points as a [PackedVector3Array]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຄຊຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນຮູບແບບ [PackedVector3Array]."

msgid "Returns the cache of tilts as a [PackedFloat32Array]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຄຊຂອງການອຽງ (tilts) ໃນຮູບແບບ [PackedFloat32Array]."

msgid ""
"Returns the cache of up vectors as a [PackedVector3Array].\n"
"If [member up_vector_enabled] is [code]false[/code], the cache will be empty."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຄຊຂອງ up vectors."

msgid ""
"Returns the closest offset to [param to_point]. This offset is meant to be "
"used in [method sample_baked] or [method sample_baked_up_vector].\n"
"[param to_point] must be in this curve's local space."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ offset ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດກັບ [param to_point]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading to the vertex [param idx]. "
"The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code]"
"(0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາເຂົ້າຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the control point leading out of the vertex [param "
"idx]. The returned position is relative to the vertex [param idx]. If the "
"index is out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and "
"returns [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂາອອກຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position of the vertex [param idx]. If the index is out of "
"bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0, "
"0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ vertex [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the tilt angle in radians for the point [param idx]. If the index is "
"out of bounds, the function sends an error to the console, and returns "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມອຽງ (tilt) ເປັນເຣດຽນ ສຳລັບຈຸດ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the position between the vertex [param idx] and the vertex [code]idx "
"+ 1[/code], where [param t] controls if the point is the first vertex "
"([code]t = 0.0[/code]), the last vertex ([code]t = 1.0[/code]), or in "
"between. Values of [param t] outside the range ([code]0.0 >= t <=1[/code]) "
"give strange, but predictable results.\n"
"If [param idx] is out of bounds it is truncated to the first or last vertex, "
"and [param t] is ignored. If the curve has no points, the function sends an "
"error to the console, and returns [code](0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕຳແໜ່ງລະຫວ່າງ vertex [param idx] ແລະ vertex ຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns a point within the curve at position [param offset], where [param "
"offset] is measured as a distance in 3D units along the curve. To do that, it "
"finds the two cached points where the [param offset] lies between, then "
"interpolates the values. This interpolation is cubic if [param cubic] is set "
"to [code]true[/code], or linear if set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"Cubic interpolation tends to follow the curves better, but linear is faster "
"(and often, precise enough)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດພາຍໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param offset] (ວັດແທກເປັນຢູນິດ 3 ມິຕິ)."

msgid ""
"Returns an up vector within the curve at position [param offset], where "
"[param offset] is measured as a distance in 3D units along the curve. To do "
"that, it finds the two cached up vectors where the [param offset] lies "
"between, then interpolates the values. If [param apply_tilt] is [code]true[/"
"code], an interpolated tilt is applied to the interpolated up vector.\n"
"If the curve has no up vectors, the function sends an error to the console, "
"and returns [code](0, 1, 0)[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ up vector ພາຍໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ [param offset]."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Transform3D] with [code]origin[/code] as point position, "
"[code]basis.x[/code] as sideway vector, [code]basis.y[/code] as up vector, "
"[code]basis.z[/code] as forward vector. When the curve length is 0, there is "
"no reasonable way to calculate the rotation, all vectors aligned with global "
"space axes. See also [method sample_baked]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Transform3D] ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການໝຸນຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the tilt angle in radians for the point [param idx]. If the index is out "
"of bounds, the function sends an error to the console.\n"
"The tilt controls the rotation along the look-at axis an object traveling the "
"path would have. In the case of a curve controlling a [PathFollow3D], this "
"tilt is an offset over the natural tilt the [PathFollow3D] calculates."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງມຸມອຽງ (tilt) ເປັນເຣດຽນ ສຳລັບຈຸດ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"The distance in meters between two adjacent cached points. Changing it forces "
"the cache to be recomputed the next time the [method get_baked_points] or "
"[method get_baked_length] function is called. The smaller the distance, the "
"more points in the cache and the more memory it will consume, so use with "
"care."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເປັນແມັດລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດໃນແຄຊ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and the curve has more than 2 control points, the last "
"point and the first one will be connected in a loop."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ ຈຸດທຳອິດຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນເປັນລູບ."

msgid ""
"The tilt angle in radians for the point at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. point_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr "ມຸມອຽງ (tilt) ເປັນເຣດຽນ ສຳລັບຈຸດທີ່ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the curve will bake up vectors used for orientation. "
"This is used when [member PathFollow3D.rotation_mode] is set to [constant "
"PathFollow3D.ROTATION_ORIENTED]. Changing it forces the cache to be "
"recomputed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະທຳການອົບ (bake) ເວກເຕີແນວຕັ້ງ (up vectors) "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກຳນົດທິດທາງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [member PathFollow3D.rotation_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant PathFollow3D.ROTATION_ORIENTED]. ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ແຄຊ໌ "
"(cache) ໃໝ່."

msgid "A 1D texture where pixel brightness corresponds to points on a curve."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບ 1 ມິຕິ ທີ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວສອດຄ່ອງກັບຈຸດຕ່າງໆເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"A 1D texture where pixel brightness corresponds to points on a unit [Curve] "
"resource, either in grayscale or in red. This visual representation "
"simplifies the task of saving curves as image files.\n"
"If you need to store up to 3 curves within a single texture, use "
"[CurveXYZTexture] instead. See also [GradientTexture1D] and "
"[GradientTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ແບບ 1 ມິຕິ ທີ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວສອດຄ່ອງກັບຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Curve] "
"ຫົວໜ່ວຍ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບສີເທົາ ຫຼື ແບບສີແດງ. "
"ການສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍພາບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການບັນທຶກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເປັນໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສູງສຸດ 3 ເສັ້ນພາຍໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [CurveXYZTexture] ແທນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [GradientTexture1D] ແລະ [GradientTexture2D] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid "The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr "[Curve] ທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີລົງເທິງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄວນເປັນ [Curve] ແບບຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid ""
"The format the texture should be generated with. When passing a CurveTexture "
"as an input to a [Shader], this may need to be adjusted."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບທີ່ພື້ນຜິວຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອສົ່ງ CurveTexture ເປັນອິນພຸດໃຫ້ກັບ [Shader], "
"ຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປ່ຽນ."

msgid ""
"The width of the texture (in pixels). Higher values make it possible to "
"represent high-frequency data better (such as sudden direction changes), at "
"the cost of increased generation time and memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງພື້ນຜິວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການປ່ຽນທິດທາງແບບກະທັນຫັນ), ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການສ້າງ ແລະ "
"ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Store the curve equally across the red, green and blue channels. This uses "
"more video memory, but is more compatible with shaders that only read the "
"green and blue values."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັນໃນທຸກຊ່ອງສີ ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳວິດີໂອຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ດີກວ່າກັບ shader ທີ່ອ່ານສະເພາະຄ່າສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ."

msgid ""
"Store the curve only in the red channel. This saves video memory, but some "
"custom shaders may not be able to work with this."
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໄວ້ສະເພາະໃນຊ່ອງສີແດງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳວິດີໂອ, ແຕ່ shader "
"ບາງອັນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານກັບສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A 1D texture where the red, green, and blue color channels correspond to "
"points on 3 curves."
msgstr "ພື້ນຜິວແບບ 1 ມິຕິ ທີ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ຂຽວ, ແລະ ຟ້າ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຈຸດຕ່າງໆເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ 3 ເສັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A 1D texture where the red, green, and blue color channels correspond to "
"points on 3 unit [Curve] resources. Compared to using separate "
"[CurveTexture]s, this further simplifies the task of saving curves as image "
"files.\n"
"If you only need to store one curve within a single texture, use "
"[CurveTexture] instead. See also [GradientTexture1D] and [GradientTexture2D]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວແບບ 1 ມິຕິ ທີ່ຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ຂຽວ, ແລະ ຟ້າ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Curve] ຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3 "
"ອັນ. ເມື່ອທຽບກັບການໃຊ້ [CurveTexture] ແຍກກັນ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການບັນທຶກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເປັນໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງພຽງເສັ້ນດຽວພາຍໃນພື້ນຜິວດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [CurveTexture] ແທນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[GradientTexture1D] ແລະ [GradientTexture2D] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's red channel. Should be a unit "
"[Curve]."
msgstr "[Curve] ທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີລົງເທິງຊ່ອງສີແດງຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄວນເປັນ [Curve] ແບບຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's green channel. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr "[Curve] ທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີລົງເທິງຊ່ອງສີຂຽວຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄວນເປັນ [Curve] ແບບຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid ""
"The [Curve] that is rendered onto the texture's blue channel. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr "[Curve] ທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີລົງເທິງຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຂອງພື້ນຜິວ. ຄວນເປັນ [Curve] ແບບຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid "Class representing a cylindrical [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "ຄລາດ (class) ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid ""
"Class representing a cylindrical [PrimitiveMesh]. This class can be used to "
"create cones by setting either the [member top_radius] or [member "
"bottom_radius] properties to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ [PrimitiveMesh] ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ຄລາດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຊົງຈວຍໄດ້ "
"ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [member top_radius] ຫຼື [member bottom_radius] ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Bottom radius of the cylinder. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the bottom faces "
"will not be generated, resulting in a conic shape. See also [member "
"cap_bottom]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ໜ້າດ້ານລຸ່ມຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຮູບຊົງຈວຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member cap_bottom] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generates a cap at the bottom of the cylinder. This can "
"be set to [code]false[/code] to speed up generation and rendering when the "
"cap is never seen by the camera. See also [member bottom_radius].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member bottom_radius] is [code]0.0[/code], cap generation is "
"always skipped even if [member cap_bottom] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງຝາປິດຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການສ້າງ ແລະ ການເຣນເດີ ເມື່ອຝາປິດນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເບິ່ງເຫັນໂດຍກ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"bottom_radius] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member bottom_radius] ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ການສ້າງຝາປິດຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member cap_bottom] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generates a cap at the top of the cylinder. This can be "
"set to [code]false[/code] to speed up generation and rendering when the cap "
"is never seen by the camera. See also [member top_radius].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member top_radius] is [code]0.0[/code], cap generation is "
"always skipped even if [member cap_top] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງຝາປິດຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການສ້າງ ແລະ ການເຣນເດີ ເມື່ອຝາປິດນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເບິ່ງເຫັນໂດຍກ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member top_radius] ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member top_radius] ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ການສ້າງຝາປິດຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ [member cap_top] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Full height of the cylinder."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid ""
"Number of radial segments on the cylinder. Higher values result in a more "
"detailed cylinder/cone at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສ່ວນ (segments) ຕາມລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ/ຈວຍ "
"ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"Number of edge rings along the height of the cylinder. Changing [member "
"rings] does not have any visual impact unless a shader or procedural mesh "
"tool is used to alter the vertex data. Higher values result in more "
"subdivisions, which can be used to create smoother-looking effects with "
"shaders or procedural mesh tools (at the cost of performance). When not "
"altering the vertex data using a shader or procedural mesh tool, [member "
"rings] should be kept to its default value."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນວົງແຫວນຂອບ (rings) ຕາມຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ການປ່ຽນແປງ [member rings] "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ສາຍຕາ ນອກຈາກຈະມີການໃຊ້ shader ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມື procedural mesh ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນ "
"vertex. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການແບ່ງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທີ່ເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ shader (ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບປະສິດທິພາບ). "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນ vertex ໂດຍໃຊ້ shader, ຄວນຕັ້ງ [member rings] ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Top radius of the cylinder. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the top faces will "
"not be generated, resulting in a conic shape. See also [member cap_top]."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີດ້ານເທິງຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ໜ້າດ້ານເທິງຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຮູບຊົງຈວຍ. ເບິ່ງ [member cap_top] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid "A 3D cylinder shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ 3 ມິຕິ ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະທະ (collision) ທາງຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"A 3D cylinder shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There are several known bugs with cylinder collision shapes. "
"Using [CapsuleShape3D] or [BoxShape3D] instead is recommended.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [CylinderShape3D] is fast to check collisions against, "
"but it is slower than [CapsuleShape3D], [BoxShape3D], and [SphereShape3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງກະບອກ 3 ມິຕິ, ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນທາງຟີຊິກ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປັນຮູບຊົງໃຫ້ກັບ "
"[CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີບັກ (bugs) ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກຫຼາຍຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບຮູບຊົງປະທະແບບກະບອກ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[CapsuleShape3D] ຫຼື [BoxShape3D] ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] [CylinderShape3D] ກວດສອບການປະທະໄດ້ໄວ, ແຕ່ມັນຊ້າກວ່າ "
"[CapsuleShape3D], [BoxShape3D], ແລະ [SphereShape3D]."

msgid "The cylinder's height."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid "The cylinder's radius."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູບຊົງກະບອກ."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 2D physics bodies with a spring-like force."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D ສອງອັນເຂົ້າກັນດ້ວຍແຮງແບບສະປຣິງ (spring)."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 2D physics bodies with a spring-like force. "
"This behaves like a spring that always wants to stretch to a given length."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຟີຊິກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 2D ສອງອັນເຂົ້າກັນດ້ວຍແຮງແບບສະປຣິງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບສະປຣິງທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຢືດຕົວໄປຫາຄວາມຍາວທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The spring joint's damping ratio. A value between [code]0[/code] and [code]1[/"
"code]. When the two bodies move into different directions the system tries to "
"align them to the spring axis again. A high [member damping] value forces the "
"attached bodies to align faster."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມໜ່ວງ (damping ratio) ຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສະປຣິງ. ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]1[/code]. ເມື່ອວັດຖຸທັງສອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ລະບົບຈະພະຍາຍາມຈັດວາງພວກມັນໃຫ້ກົງກັບແກນສະປຣິງອີກຄັ້ງ. ຄ່າ [member damping] "
"ທີ່ສູງຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ນັ້ນຈັດວາງຕົວໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The spring joint's maximum length. The two attached bodies cannot stretch it "
"past this value."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສະປຣິງ. ວັດຖຸທັງສອງທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດຢືດມັນໃຫ້ກາຍຄ່ານີ້ໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"When the bodies attached to the spring joint move they stretch or squash it. "
"The joint always tries to resize towards this length."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອວັດຖຸທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ສະປຣິງເຄື່ອນທີ່, ພວກມັນຈະຢືດ ຫຼື ຫົດສະປຣິງ. "
"ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມປັບຂະໜາດກັບຄືນມາຫາຄວາມຍາວນີ້ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"The higher the value, the less the bodies attached to the joint will deform "
"it. The joint applies an opposing force to the bodies, the product of the "
"stiffness multiplied by the size difference from its resting length."
msgstr ""
"ຍິ່ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເທົ່າໃດ, ວັດຖຸທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ຕໍ່ກໍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຜິດຮູບໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ຕໍ່ຈະໃຊ້ແຮງຕ້ານກັບວັດຖຸ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຜົນຄູນຂອງຄວາມແຂງ (stiffness) ຄູນກັບສ່ວນຕ່າງຂອງຂະໜາດຈາກຄວາມຍາວໃນຂະນະພັກ."

msgid "Node that projects a texture onto a [MeshInstance3D]."
msgstr "ໂນດ (node) ທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສາຍພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ລົງເທິງ [MeshInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"[Decal]s are used to project a texture onto a [Mesh] in the scene. Use Decals "
"to add detail to a scene without affecting the underlying [Mesh]. They are "
"often used to add weathering to building, add dirt or mud to the ground, or "
"add variety to props. Decals can be moved at any time, making them suitable "
"for things like blob shadows or laser sight dots.\n"
"They are made of an [AABB] and a group of [Texture2D]s specifying [Color], "
"normal, ORM (ambient occlusion, roughness, metallic), and emission. Decals "
"are projected within their [AABB] so altering the orientation of the Decal "
"affects the direction in which they are projected. By default, Decals are "
"projected down (i.e. from positive Y to negative Y).\n"
"The [Texture2D]s associated with the Decal are automatically stored in a "
"texture atlas which is used for drawing the decals so all decals can be drawn "
"at once. Godot uses clustered decals, meaning they are stored in cluster data "
"and drawn when the mesh is drawn, they are not drawn as a post-processing "
"effect after.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Decals cannot affect an underlying material's transparency, "
"regardless of its transparency mode (alpha blend, alpha scissor, alpha hash, "
"opaque pre-pass). This means translucent or transparent areas of a material "
"will remain translucent or transparent even if an opaque decal is applied on "
"them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Decals are only supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering "
"methods, not Compatibility. When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 "
"decals can be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more "
"than 8 decals on a single mesh resource will result in decals flickering in "
"and out as the camera moves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, decals will only "
"correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects with the decal's "
"AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that makes it go outside "
"its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] must be increased on "
"the mesh. Otherwise, the decal may not be visible on the mesh."
msgstr ""
"[Decal] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສາຍພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ລົງເທິງ [Mesh] ໃນສາກ. ໃຊ້ Decals "
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ກັບສາກໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ [Mesh] ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ. "
"ພວກມັນມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຮ່ອງຮອຍການກັດເຊາະໃຫ້ກັບອາຄານ, ເພີ່ມຂີ້ຝຸ່ນ ຫຼື ຂີ້ຕົມລົງເທິງພື້ນ, ຫຼື "
"ເພີ່ມຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃຫ້ກັບອຸປະກອນປະກອບສາກ. Decals ສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນເໝາະສຳລັບສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ເງົາແບບວົງມົນ (blob shadows) ຫຼື ຈຸດເລເຊີ.\n"
"ພວກມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍ [AABB] ແລະ ກຸ່ມຂອງ [Texture2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດ [Color], normal, ORM "
"(ambient occlusion, roughness, metallic), ແລະ emission. Decals ຈະຖືກສາຍພາຍໃນ "
"[AABB] ຂອງພວກມັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການປ່ຽນທິດທາງຂອງ Decal ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທິດທາງທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກສາຍອອກໄປ. "
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Decals ຈະຖືກສາຍລົງລຸ່ມ (ຄືຈາກ Y ຄ່າບວກ ຫາ Y ຄ່າລົບ).\n"
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Decal ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ texture atlas ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແຕ້ມ decals ເພື່ອໃຫ້ decals ທັງໝົດສາມາດຖືກແຕ້ມໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນ. Godot ໃຊ້ clustered "
"decals, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ cluster data ແລະ ຖືກແຕ້ມເມື່ອ mesh ຖືກແຕ້ມ, "
"ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກແຕ້ມເປັນ post-processing effect ພາຍຫຼັງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Decals ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງວັດສະດຸດ້ານລຸ່ມໄດ້, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໃດກໍຕາມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໂປ່ງແສງ ຫຼື "
"ໂປ່ງໃສຂອງວັດສະດຸຈະຍັງຄົງໂປ່ງແສງ ຫຼື ໂປ່ງໃສຢູ່ ຄືເກົ່າ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີ decal "
"ແບບທຶບແສງມາສາຍທັບກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Decals ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Compatibility. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile, ສາມາດສະແດງ decal ໄດ້ພຽງ 8 ອັນຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະ mesh "
"resource. ຫາກພະຍາຍາມສະແດງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 8 ອັນໃນ mesh ດຽວ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ decal "
"ກະພິບໄປມາເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Mobile, decal ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ mesh ທີ່ visibility AABB ຕັດກັບ AABB "
"ຂອງ decal ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກໃຊ້ shader ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ mesh ບິດບ້ຽວຈົນອອກນອກ AABB ຂອງມັນ, ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ "
"[member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] ໃນ mesh ນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, decal "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Texture2D] associated with the specified [enum DecalTexture]. "
"This is a convenience method, in most cases you should access the texture "
"directly.\n"
"For example, instead of [code]albedo_tex = "
"$Decal.get_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO)[/code], use [code]albedo_tex = "
"$Decal.texture_albedo[/code].\n"
"One case where this is better than accessing the texture directly is when you "
"want to copy one Decal's textures to another. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Texture2D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [enum DecalTexture] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ສະດວກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທ່ານຄວນເຂົ້າເຖິງພື້ນຜິວໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [Texture2D] associated with the specified [enum DecalTexture]. This "
"is a convenience method, in most cases you should access the texture "
"directly.\n"
"For example, instead of [code]$Decal.set_texture(Decal.TEXTURE_ALBEDO, "
"albedo_tex)[/code], use [code]$Decal.texture_albedo = albedo_tex[/code].\n"
"One case where this is better than accessing the texture directly is when you "
"want to copy one Decal's textures to another. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"for i in Decal.TEXTURE_MAX:\n"
"\t$NewDecal.set_texture(i, $OldDecal.get_texture(i))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"for (int i = 0; i < (int)Decal.DecalTexture.Max; i++)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<Decal>(\"NewDecal\").SetTexture(i, "
"GetNode<Decal>(\"OldDecal\").GetTexture(i));\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Texture2D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [enum DecalTexture] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ສະດວກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທ່ານຄວນເຂົ້າເຖິງພື້ນຜິວໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Blends the albedo [Color] of the decal with albedo [Color] of the underlying "
"mesh. This can be set to [code]0.0[/code] to create a decal that only affects "
"normal or ORM. In this case, an albedo texture is still required as its alpha "
"channel will determine where the normal and ORM will be overridden. See also "
"[member modulate]."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມສີ albedo [Color] ຂອງ decal ເຂົ້າກັບສີ albedo ຂອງ mesh ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ເພື່ອສ້າງ decal ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບສະເພາະ normal ຫຼື ORM ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, "
"ຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ albedo texture ເພາະຊ່ອງ alpha ຂອງມັນຈະເປັນຕົວຕັດສິນວ່າຈຸດໃດທີ່ normal ແລະ "
"ORM ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ. ເບິ່ງ [member modulate] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Specifies which [member VisualInstance3D.layers] this decal will project on. "
"By default, Decals affect all layers. This is used so you can specify which "
"types of objects receive the Decal and which do not. This is especially "
"useful so you can ensure that dynamic objects don't accidentally receive a "
"Decal intended for the terrain under them."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸວ່າ [member VisualInstance3D.layers] ໃດທີ່ decal ນີ້ຈະສາຍລົງໄປ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Decals "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກເລເຢີ (layers). ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ວ່າວັດຖຸປະເພດໃດຈະໄດ້ຮັບ Decal ແລະ "
"ປະເພດໃດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້ (dynamic objects) "
"ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບ Decal ທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະສາຍໃສ່ພື້ນດິນຢູ່ກ້ອງພວກມັນໂດຍບັງເອີນ."

msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the Decal begins to fade away (in 3D "
"units)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ Decal ເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍໄປ (ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], decals will smoothly fade away when far from the active "
"[Camera3D] starting at [member distance_fade_begin]. The Decal will fade out "
"over [member distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length], after "
"which it will be culled and not sent to the shader at all. Use this to reduce "
"the number of active Decals in a scene and thus improve performance."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], decals ຈະຄ່ອຍໆຈາງຫາຍໄປຢ່າງລຽບນຽນເມື່ອຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກ [Camera3D] "
"ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກ [member distance_fade_begin]. Decal ຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປຕະຫຼອດໄລຍະ "
"[member distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length], "
"ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກຄັດອອກ (culled) ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ shader ເລີຍ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ Decal "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນສາກ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"The distance over which the Decal fades (in 3D units). The Decal becomes "
"slowly more transparent over this distance and is completely invisible at the "
"end. Higher values result in a smoother fade-out transition, which is more "
"suited when the camera moves fast."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງທີ່ Decal ຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປ (ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D). Decal ຈະຄ່ອຍໆໂປ່ງໃສຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆຕາມໄລຍະນີ້ ແລະ "
"ຈະຫາຍໄປໝົດໃນຕອນທ້າຍ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈາງຫາຍເບິ່ງລຽບນຽນກວ່າ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເໝາະສົມກວ່າເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ."

msgid ""
"Energy multiplier for the emission texture. This will make the decal emit "
"light at a higher or lower intensity, independently of the albedo color. See "
"also [member modulate]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານສຳລັບ emission texture. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ decal ເປັ່ງແສງອອກມາດ້ວຍຄວາມເຂັ້ມທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ "
"ຫຼື ຕ່ຳລົງ ໂດຍແຍກເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຈາກສີ albedo. ເບິ່ງ [member modulate] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the curve over which the decal will fade as the surface gets further "
"from the center of the [AABB]. Only positive values are valid (negative "
"values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code]). See also [member upper_fade]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ decal ຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປເມື່ອພື້ນຜິວຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງ [AABB] ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຄ່າລົບຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ທີ່ [code]0.0[/code]). ເບິ່ງ [member "
"upper_fade] ຕື່ມອີກ."

msgid ""
"Changes the [Color] of the Decal by multiplying the albedo and emission "
"colors with this value. The alpha component is only taken into account when "
"multiplying the albedo color, not the emission color. See also [member "
"emission_energy] and [member albedo_mix] to change the emission and albedo "
"intensity independently of each other."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແປງ [Color] ຂອງ Decal ໂດຍການຄູນສີ albedo ແລະ emission ດ້ວຍຄ່ານີ້. ຄ່າ alpha "
"ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ສະເພາະເມື່ອຄູນກັບສີ albedo ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ລວມສີ emission. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"emission_energy] ແລະ [member albedo_mix] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ emission ແລະ albedo "
"ແຍກກັນ."

msgid ""
"Fades the Decal if the angle between the Decal's [AABB] and the target "
"surface becomes too large. A value of [code]0[/code] projects the Decal "
"regardless of angle, a value of [code]1[/code] limits the Decal to surfaces "
"that are nearly perpendicular.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member normal_fade] to a value greater than [code]0.0[/"
"code] has a small performance cost due to the added normal angle computations."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ Decal ຈາງລົງຖ້າມຸມລະຫວ່າງ [AABB] ຂອງ Decal ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວເປົ້າໝາຍມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]0[/code] ຈະສາຍ Decal ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈມຸມ, ຄ່າ [code]1[/code] ຈະຈຳກັດ Decal "
"ໄວ້ສະເພາະພື້ນຜິວທີ່ເກືອບຈະຕັ້ງສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member normal_fade] ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະມີການໃຊ້ປະສິດທິພາບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລັກໜ້ອຍ ເນື່ອງຈາກຕ້ອງມີການຄິດໄລ່ທາງຄະນິດສາດກ່ຽວກັບມຸມ normal ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the [AABB] used by the decal. All dimensions must be set to "
"a value greater than zero (they will be clamped to [code]0.001[/code] if this "
"is not the case). The AABB goes from [code]-size/2[/code] to [code]size/2[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To improve culling efficiency of \"hard surface\" decals, set "
"their [member upper_fade] and [member lower_fade] to [code]0.0[/code] and set "
"the Y component of the [member size] as low as possible. This will reduce the "
"decals' AABB size without affecting their appearance."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດຂອງ [AABB] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ decal. ທຸກຂະໜາດຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າສູນ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the base [Color] of the Decal. Either this or the [member "
"texture_emission] must be set for the Decal to be visible. Use the alpha "
"channel like a mask to smoothly blend the edges of the decal with the "
"underlying object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally with "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter]."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ມີສີພື້ນຖານ [Color] ຂອງ Decal. ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ ຫຼື [member "
"texture_emission] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Decal ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the emission [Color] of the Decal. Either this or the "
"[member texture_albedo] must be set for the Decal to be visible. Use the "
"alpha channel like a mask to smoothly blend the edges of the decal with the "
"underlying object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally with "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter]."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ມີສີການເປັ່ງແສງ (emission) ຂອງ Decal. ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ ຫຼື [member "
"texture_albedo] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Decal ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] with the per-pixel normal map for the decal. Use this to add "
"extra detail to decals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally with "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this texture alone will not result in a visible decal, "
"as [member texture_albedo] must also be set. To create a normal-only decal, "
"load an albedo texture into [member texture_albedo] and set [member "
"albedo_mix] to [code]0.0[/code]. The albedo texture's alpha channel will be "
"used to determine where the underlying surface's normal map should be "
"overridden (and its intensity)."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ມີ normal map ແບບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວສຳລັບ decal. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດພິເສດໃຫ້ກັບ "
"decals."

msgid ""
"[Texture2D] storing ambient occlusion, roughness, and metallic for the decal. "
"Use this to add extra detail to decals.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for [Decal] textures is set globally with "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/decals/filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this texture alone will not result in a visible decal, "
"as [member texture_albedo] must also be set. To create an ORM-only decal, "
"load an albedo texture into [member texture_albedo] and set [member "
"albedo_mix] to [code]0.0[/code]. The albedo texture's alpha channel will be "
"used to determine where the underlying surface's ORM map should be overridden "
"(and its intensity).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to technical limitations, modifying the underlying surface's "
"roughness using [member texture_orm] does [i]not[/i] affect screen-space "
"reflections ([member Environment.ssr_enabled]), reflections from [VoxelGI], "
"and reflections from SDFGI ([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]). Only "
"reflections from [ReflectionProbe]s are affected."
msgstr ""
"[Texture2D] ທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ambient occlusion, roughness, ແລະ metallic ສຳລັບ decal. "
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດພິເສດໃຫ້ກັບ decals."

msgid ""
"Sets the curve over which the decal will fade as the surface gets further "
"from the center of the [AABB]. Only positive values are valid (negative "
"values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code]). See also [member lower_fade]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ decal ຈະຈາງຫາຍໄປເມື່ອພື້ນຜິວຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງ [AABB] ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_albedo]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [member texture_albedo]."

msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_normal]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [member texture_normal]."

msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_orm]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [member texture_orm]."

msgid "[Texture2D] corresponding to [member texture_emission]."
msgstr "[Texture2D] ທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [member texture_emission]."

msgid "Max size of [enum DecalTexture] enum."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງ [enum DecalTexture] enum."

msgid "A built-in data structure that holds key-value pairs."
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃນຕົວ ເຊິ່ງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຮູບແບບຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າ (key-value pairs)."

msgid ""
"Dictionaries are associative containers that contain values referenced by "
"unique keys. Dictionaries will preserve the insertion order when adding new "
"entries. In other programming languages, this data structure is often "
"referred to as a hash map or an associative array.\n"
"You can define a dictionary by placing a comma-separated list of [code]key: "
"value[/code] pairs inside curly braces [code]{}[/code].\n"
"Creating a dictionary:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {} # Creates an empty dictionary.\n"
"\n"
"var dict_variable_key = \"Another key name\"\n"
"var dict_variable_value = \"value2\"\n"
"var another_dict = {\n"
"\t\"Some key name\": \"value1\",\n"
"\tdict_variable_key: dict_variable_value,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"\n"
"# Alternative Lua-style syntax.\n"
"# Doesn't require quotes around keys, but only string constants can be used "
"as key names.\n"
"# Additionally, key names must start with a letter or an underscore.\n"
"# Here, `some_key` is a string literal, not a variable!\n"
"another_dict = {\n"
"\tsome_key = 42,\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary(); // Creates an empty "
"dictionary.\n"
"var pointsDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"You can access a dictionary's value by referencing its corresponding key. In "
"the above example, [code]points_dict[\"White\"][/code] will return [code]50[/"
"code]. You can also write [code]points_dict.White[/code], which is "
"equivalent. However, you'll have to use the bracket syntax if the key you're "
"accessing the dictionary with isn't a fixed string (such as a number or "
"variable).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export_enum(\"White\", \"Yellow\", \"Orange\") var my_color: String\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# We can't use dot syntax here as `my_color` is a variable.\n"
"\tvar points = points_dict[my_color]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export(PropertyHint.Enum, \"White,Yellow,Orange\")]\n"
"public string MyColor { get; set; }\n"
"private Godot.Collections.Dictionary _pointsDict = new "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tint points = (int)_pointsDict[MyColor];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In the above code, [code]points[/code] will be assigned the value that is "
"paired with the appropriate color selected in [code]my_color[/code].\n"
"Dictionaries can contain more complex data:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"First Array\": [1, 2, 3, 4] # Assigns an Array to a String key.\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"First Array\", new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3, 4 } }\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To add a key to an existing dictionary, access it like an existing key and "
"assign to it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var points_dict = { \"White\": 50, \"Yellow\": 75, \"Orange\": 100 }\n"
"points_dict[\"Blue\"] = 150 # Add \"Blue\" as a key and assign 150 as its "
"value.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pointsDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"White\", 50 },\n"
"\t{ \"Yellow\", 75 },\n"
"\t{ \"Orange\", 100 },\n"
"};\n"
"pointsDict[\"Blue\"] = 150; // Add \"Blue\" as a key and assign 150 as its "
"value.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Finally, untyped dictionaries can contain different types of keys and values "
"in the same dictionary:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This is a valid dictionary.\n"
"# To access the string \"Nested value\" below, use `my_dict.sub_dict.sub_key` "
"or `my_dict[\"sub_dict\"][\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"# Indexing styles can be mixed and matched depending on your needs.\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"String Key\": 5,\n"
"\t4: [1, 2, 3],\n"
"\t7: \"Hello\",\n"
"\t\"sub_dict\": { \"sub_key\": \"Nested value\" },\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This is a valid dictionary.\n"
"// To access the string \"Nested value\" below, use "
"`((Godot.Collections.Dictionary)myDict[\"sub_dict\"])[\"sub_key\"]`.\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary {\n"
"\t{ \"String Key\", 5 },\n"
"\t{ 4, new Godot.Collections.Array { 1, 2, 3 } },\n"
"\t{ 7, \"Hello\" },\n"
"\t{ \"sub_dict\", new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"sub_key\", \"Nested "
"value\" } } },\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The keys of a dictionary can be iterated with the [code]for[/code] keyword:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var groceries = { \"Orange\": 20, \"Apple\": 2, \"Banana\": 4 }\n"
"for fruit in groceries:\n"
"\tvar amount = groceries[fruit]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var groceries = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"Orange\", 20 }, "
"{ \"Apple\", 2 }, { \"Banana\", 4 } };\n"
"foreach (var (fruit, amount) in groceries)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// `fruit` is the key, `amount` is the value.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To enforce a certain type for keys and values, you can create a [i]typed "
"dictionary[/i]. Typed dictionaries can only contain keys and values of the "
"given types, or that inherit from the given classes:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and int values.\n"
"# Attempting to use any other type for keys or values will result in an "
"error.\n"
"var typed_dict: Dictionary[String, int] = {\n"
"\t\"some_key\": 1,\n"
"\t\"some_other_key\": 2,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and values of any type.\n"
"# Attempting to use any other type for keys will result in an error.\n"
"var typed_dict_key_only: Dictionary[String, Variant] = {\n"
"\t\"some_key\": 12.34,\n"
"\t\"some_other_key\": \"string\",\n"
"}\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and int values.\n"
"// Attempting to use any other type for keys or values will result in an "
"error.\n"
"var typedDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, int> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 1},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", 2},\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Creates a typed dictionary with String keys and values of any type.\n"
"// Attempting to use any other type for keys will result in an error.\n"
"var typedDictKeyOnly = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary<String, Variant> {\n"
"\t{\"some_key\", 12.34},\n"
"\t{\"some_other_key\", \"string\"},\n"
"};\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries are always passed by reference. To get a copy of a "
"dictionary which can be modified independently of the original dictionary, "
"use [method duplicate].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Erasing elements while iterating over dictionaries is [b]not[/b] "
"supported and will result in unpredictable behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a dictionary will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's empty ([code]{}[/code]). Otherwise, a dictionary will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Dictionary ແມ່ນຕົວເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຊື່ອມໂຍງ (associative containers) "
"ເຊິ່ງເກັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆທີ່ອ້າງອີງດ້ວຍຄີ (keys) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. Dictionary "
"ຈະຮັກສາລຳດັບການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່. ໃນພາສາໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນໆ, "
"ໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມັກຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ hash map ຫຼື associative array."

msgid "GDScript basics: Dictionary"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານ GDScript: Dictionary"

msgid "Constructs an empty [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [Dictionary] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Creates a typed dictionary from the [param base] dictionary. A typed "
"dictionary can only contain keys and values of the given types, or that "
"inherit from the given classes, as described by this constructor's parameters."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ typed dictionary ຈາກ dictionary [param base]. typed dictionary "
"ສາມາດເກັບໄດ້ສະເພາະຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າ ຕາມປະເພດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the same dictionary as [param from]. If you need a copy of the "
"dictionary, use [method duplicate]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ dictionary ດຽວກັນກັບ [param from]. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳເນົາຂອງ dictionary, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method duplicate]."

msgid ""
"Assigns elements of another [param dictionary] into the dictionary. Resizes "
"the dictionary to match [param dictionary]. Performs type conversions if the "
"dictionary is typed."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າອົງປະກອບຈາກ [param dictionary] ອື່ນລົງໃນ dictionary ນີ້. ປັບຂະໜາດ dictionary "
"ໃຫ້ກົງກັບ [param dictionary]. ທຳການແປງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນຫາກເປັນ typed dictionary."

msgid "Clears the dictionary, removing all entries from it."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນ dictionary ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns a new copy of the dictionary.\n"
"By default, a [b]shallow[/b] copy is returned: all nested [Array], "
"[Dictionary], and [Resource] keys and values are shared with the original "
"dictionary. Modifying any of those in one dictionary will also affect them in "
"the other.\n"
"If [param deep] is [code]true[/code], a [b]deep[/b] copy is returned: all "
"nested arrays and dictionaries are also duplicated (recursively). Any "
"[Resource] is still shared with the original dictionary, though."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າການສຳເນົາໃໝ່ຂອງ dictionary.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະຄືນຄ່າການສຳເນົາແບບ [b]ຕື້ນ[/b] (shallow): ຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າ ທີ່ເປັນ [Array], "
"[Dictionary], ແລະ [Resource] ທີ່ຊ້ອນຢູ່ພາຍໃນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ dictionary ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. "
"ການແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນ dictionary ໜຶ່ງ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງນຳ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param deep] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຄືນຄ່າການສຳເນົາແບບ [b]ເລິກ[/b] (deep): "
"ອາເຣ (arrays) ແລະ dictionary ທີ່ຊ້ອນຢູ່ພາຍໃນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເຮັດສຳເນົາຂຶ້ນມາໃໝ່ (ແບບ "
"recursively). ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, [Resource] ໃດໆ ຍັງຄົງຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ dictionary ຕົ້ນສະບັບຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Duplicates this dictionary, deeply, like [method duplicate] when passing "
"[code]true[/code], with extra control over how subresources are handled.\n"
"[param deep_subresources_mode] must be one of the values from [enum "
"Resource.DeepDuplicateMode]. By default, only internal resources will be "
"duplicated (recursively)."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດສຳເນົາ dictionary ນີ້ແບບເລິກ, ຄືກັບ [method duplicate] ເມື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code], ໂດຍມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຈັດການ subresources."

msgid ""
"Removes the dictionary entry by key, if it exists. Returns [code]true[/code] "
"if the given [param key] existed in the dictionary, otherwise [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not erase entries while iterating over the dictionary. You "
"can iterate over the [method keys] array instead."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບລາຍການໃນ dictionary ຕາມຄີທີ່ກຳນົດ, ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param "
"key] ທີ່ລະບຸມີຢູ່ໃນ dictionary, ຖ້າບໍ່ມີແມ່ນຄືນຄ່າ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫ້າມລຶບລາຍການໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງວົນລູບ (iterating) dictionary. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດວົນລູບຜ່ານອາເຣ [method keys] ແທນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Finds and returns the first key whose associated value is equal to [param "
"value], or [code]null[/code] if it is not found.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]null[/code] is also a valid key. If inside the dictionary, "
"[method find_key] may give misleading results."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າຄີທຳອິດທີ່ມີຄ່າສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [param value], ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding value for the given [param key] in the dictionary. "
"If the [param key] does not exist, returns [param default], or [code]null[/"
"code] if the parameter is omitted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the [param default] argument is computationally expensive or "
"has unwanted side effects, consider using the [method has] method instead:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Always calls `expensive_function()`.\n"
"dict.get(\"key\", expensive_function())\n"
"# Calls `expensive_function()` only if the key does not exist.\n"
"dict.get(\"key\") if dict.has(\"key\") else expensive_function()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ dictionary. ຖ້າ [param key] ບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [param "
"default], ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Gets a value and ensures the key is set. If the [param key] exists in the "
"dictionary, this behaves like [method get]. Otherwise, the [param default] "
"value is inserted into the dictionary and returned."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຄ່າ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄີຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຖ້າ [param key] ມີຢູ່ໃນ dictionary, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ "
"[method get]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່າ [param default] ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ລົງໃນ dictionary ແລະ "
"ຄືນຄ່ານັ້ນອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns the built-in [Variant] type of the typed dictionary's keys as a [enum "
"Variant.Type] constant. If the keys are not typed, returns [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. See also [method is_typed_key]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃນຕົວຂອງຄີໃນ typed dictionary ເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"Variant.Type]. ຖ້າຄີບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດ, ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [constant TYPE_NIL]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [b]built-in[/b] class name of the typed dictionary's keys, if the "
"built-in [Variant] type is [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. Otherwise, returns an "
"empty [StringName]. See also [method is_typed_key] and [method "
"Object.get_class]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຄລາດ [b]built-in[/b] ຂອງຄີໃນ typed dictionary, ຫາກປະເພດ [Variant] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant TYPE_OBJECT]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Script] instance associated with this typed dictionary's keys, "
"or [code]null[/code] if it does not exist. See also [method is_typed_key]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [Script] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄີຂອງ typed dictionary ນີ້, ຫຼື "
"[code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the built-in [Variant] type of the typed dictionary's values as a "
"[enum Variant.Type] constant. If the values are not typed, returns [constant "
"TYPE_NIL]. See also [method is_typed_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າປະເພດ [Variant] ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃນຕົວຂອງຄ່າໃນ typed dictionary ເປັນຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [enum "
"Variant.Type]. ຖ້າຄ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດ, ຈະຄືນຄ່າ [constant TYPE_NIL]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [b]built-in[/b] class name of the typed dictionary's values, if "
"the built-in [Variant] type is [constant TYPE_OBJECT]. Otherwise, returns an "
"empty [StringName]. See also [method is_typed_value] and [method "
"Object.get_class]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຄລາດ [b]built-in[/b] ຂອງຄ່າໃນ typed dictionary, ຫາກປະເພດ [Variant] ແມ່ນ "
"[constant TYPE_OBJECT]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [Script] instance associated with this typed dictionary's values, "
"or [code]null[/code] if it does not exist. See also [method is_typed_value]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງ [Script] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄ່າຂອງ typed dictionary ນີ້, ຫຼື "
"[code]null[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ມີ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary contains an entry with the given "
"[param key].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var my_dict = {\n"
"\t\"Godot\" : 4,\n"
"\t210 : null,\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"print(my_dict.has(\"Godot\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(my_dict.has(210))     # Prints true\n"
"print(my_dict.has(4))       # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var myDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"Godot\", 4 },\n"
"\t{ 210, default },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(\"Godot\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(210));     // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(myDict.ContainsKey(4));       // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"In GDScript, this is equivalent to the [code]in[/code] operator:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"if \"Godot\" in { \"Godot\": 4 }:\n"
"\tprint(\"The key is here!\") # Will be printed.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns [code]true[/code] as long as the [param key] "
"exists, even if its corresponding value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ມີລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບ [param key] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary contains all keys in the given "
"[param keys] array.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = { \"width\": 10, \"height\": 20 }\n"
"data.has_all([\"height\", \"width\"]) # Returns true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ມີຄີທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນອາເຣ [param keys] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns a hashed 32-bit integer value representing the dictionary contents.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict1 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"var dict2 = { \"A\": 10, \"B\": 2 }\n"
"\n"
"print(dict1.hash() == dict2.hash()) # Prints true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict1 = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"var dict2 = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"A\", 10 }, { \"B\", "
"2 } };\n"
"\n"
"// Godot.Collections.Dictionary has no Hash() method. Use GD.Hash() instead.\n"
"GD.Print(GD.Hash(dict1) == GD.Hash(dict2)); // Prints True\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries with the same entries but in a different order will "
"not have the same hash.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Dictionaries with equal hash values are [i]not[/i] guaranteed to "
"be the same, because of hash collisions. On the contrary, dictionaries with "
"different hash values are guaranteed to be different."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ 32 ບິດ ທີ່ເປັນຄ່າແຮຊ (hashed) ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງເນື້ອໃນຂອງ dictionary."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is empty (its size is [code]0[/"
"code]). See also [method size]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ຂະໜາດແມ່ນ [code]0[/code])."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is read-only. See [method "
"make_read_only]. Dictionaries are automatically read-only if declared with "
"[code]const[/code] keyword."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ແມ່ນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is typed the same as [param "
"dictionary]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດຄືກັນກັບ [param dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's keys are typed the same as "
"[param dictionary]'s keys."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄີຂອງ dictionary ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດຄືກັນກັບຄີຂອງ [param "
"dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's values are typed the same as "
"[param dictionary]'s values."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າຂອງ dictionary ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດຄືກັນກັບຄ່າຂອງ [param "
"dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary is typed. Typed dictionaries can "
"only store keys/values of their associated type and provide type safety for "
"the [code][][/code] operator. Methods of typed dictionary still return "
"[Variant]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ແມ່ນແບບລະບຸປະເພດ (typed)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's keys are typed."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄີຂອງ dictionary ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the dictionary's values are typed."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄ່າຂອງ dictionary ຖືກລະບຸປະເພດ."

msgid "Returns the list of keys in the dictionary."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄີ (keys) ທັງໝົດໃນ dictionary."

msgid ""
"Makes the dictionary read-only, i.e. disables modification of the "
"dictionary's contents. Does not apply to nested content, e.g. content of "
"nested dictionaries."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ dictionary ເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ, ນັ້ນຄືການປິດການແກ້ໄຂເນື້ອໃນຂອງ dictionary."

msgid ""
"Adds entries from [param dictionary] to this dictionary. By default, "
"duplicate keys are not copied over, unless [param overwrite] is [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var dict = { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2 }\n"
"var other_dict = { \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": \"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# Overwriting of existing keys is disabled by default.\n"
"dict.merge(other_dict)\n"
"print(dict)  # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"# With overwriting of existing keys enabled.\n"
"dict.merge(other_dict, true)\n"
"print(dict)  # { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var dict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"item\"] = \"sword\",\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 2,\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"var otherDict = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t[\"quantity\"] = 15,\n"
"\t[\"color\"] = \"silver\",\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Overwriting of existing keys is disabled by default.\n"
"dict.Merge(otherDict);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 2, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"\n"
"// With overwriting of existing keys enabled.\n"
"dict.Merge(otherDict, true);\n"
"GD.Print(dict); // { \"item\": \"sword\", \"quantity\": 15, \"color\": "
"\"silver\" }\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method merge] is [i]not[/i] recursive. Nested dictionaries are "
"considered as keys that can be overwritten or not depending on the value of "
"[param overwrite], but they will never be merged together."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລາຍການຈາກ [param dictionary] ລົງໃນ dictionary ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this dictionary merged with the other [param dictionary]. "
"By default, duplicate keys are not copied over, unless [param overwrite] is "
"[code]true[/code]. See also [method merge].\n"
"This method is useful for quickly making dictionaries with default values:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var base = { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\" }\n"
"var extra = { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"dressing\": \"vinegar\" }\n"
"# Prints { \"fruit\": \"orange\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", \"dressing\": "
"\"vinegar\" }\n"
"print(extra.merged(base))\n"
"# Prints { \"fruit\": \"apple\", \"vegetable\": \"potato\", \"dressing\": "
"\"vinegar\" }\n"
"print(extra.merged(base, true))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າການສຳເນົາຂອງ dictionary ນີ້ທີ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບ [param dictionary] ອື່ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries contain the same keys and "
"values, inner [Dictionary] and [Array] keys and values are compared "
"recursively."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ທັງສອງມີຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the value of the element at the given [param key] to the given [param "
"value]. Returns [code]true[/code] if the value is set successfully. Fails and "
"returns [code]false[/code] if the dictionary is read-only, or if [param key] "
"and [param value] don't match the dictionary's types. This is the same as "
"using the [code][][/code] operator ([code]dict[key] = value[/code])."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ອົງປະກອບຕາມ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ [param value]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of entries in the dictionary. Empty dictionaries ([code]{ }"
"[/code]) always return [code]0[/code]. See also [method is_empty]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນລາຍການທັງໝົດໃນ dictionary."

msgid ""
"Sorts the dictionary in ascending order, by key. The final order is dependent "
"on the \"less than\" ([code]<[/code]) comparison between keys.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var numbers = { \"c\": 2, \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1 }\n"
"numbers.sort()\n"
"print(numbers) # Prints { \"a\": 0, \"b\": 1, \"c\": 2 }\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method ensures that the dictionary's entries are ordered consistently "
"when [method keys] or [method values] are called, or when the dictionary "
"needs to be converted to a string through [method @GlobalScope.str] or "
"[method JSON.stringify]."
msgstr "ຈັດລຽງ dictionary ຕາມລຳດັບຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີ."

msgid "Returns the list of values in this dictionary."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄ່າ (values) ທັງໝົດໃນ dictionary."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries do not contain the same "
"keys and values."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ທັງສອງມີຄີ ຫຼື ຄ່າ ບໍ່ຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the two dictionaries contain the same keys and "
"values. The order of the entries does not matter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, by convention, this operator compares by [b]reference[/"
"b]. If you need to compare by value, iterate over both dictionaries."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ dictionary ທັງສອງມີຄີ ແລະ ຄ່າ ຄືກັນ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding value for the given [param key] in the dictionary. "
"If the entry does not exist, fails and returns [code]null[/code]. For safe "
"access, use [method get] or [method has]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບ [param key] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ dictionary."

msgid "Provides methods for managing directories and their content."
msgstr "ສະໜອງວິທີການຕ່າງໆສຳລັບການຈັດການໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ (ໂຟນເດີ) ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"This class is used to manage directories and their content, even outside of "
"the project folder.\n"
"[DirAccess] can't be instantiated directly. Instead it is created with a "
"static method that takes a path for which it will be opened.\n"
"Most of the methods have a static alternative that can be used without "
"creating a [DirAccess]. Static methods only support absolute paths (including "
"[code]res://[/code] and [code]user://[/code]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Standard\n"
"var dir = DirAccess.open(\"user://levels\")\n"
"dir.make_dir(\"world1\")\n"
"# Static\n"
"DirAccess.make_dir_absolute(\"user://levels/world1\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessing project (\"res://\") directories once exported may "
"behave unexpectedly as some files are converted to engine-specific formats "
"and their original source files may not be present in the expected PCK "
"package. Because of this, to access resources in an exported project, it is "
"recommended to use [ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess].\n"
"Here is an example on how to iterate through the files of a directory:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func dir_contents(path):\n"
"\tvar dir = DirAccess.open(path)\n"
"\tif dir:\n"
"\t\tdir.list_dir_begin()\n"
"\t\tvar file_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\t\twhile file_name != \"\":\n"
"\t\t\tif dir.current_is_dir():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Found directory: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\telse:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Found file: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\tfile_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"An error occurred when trying to access the path.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void DirContents(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var dir = DirAccess.Open(path);\n"
"\tif (dir != null)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tdir.ListDirBegin();\n"
"\t\tstring fileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\twhile (fileName != \"\")\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (dir.CurrentIsDir())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Found directory: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\telse\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Found file: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tfileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\telse\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"An error occurred when trying to access the path.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Keep in mind that file names may change or be remapped after export. If you "
"want to see the actual resource file list as it appears in the editor, use "
"[method ResourceLoader.list_directory] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນຂອງພວກມັນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ນອກໂຟນເດີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[DirAccess] ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໂດຍກົງໄດ້. "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍເມທອດສະແຕຕິກທີ່ຮັບຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຈະເປີດ.\n"
"ເມທອດສ່ວນຫຼາຍມີທາງເລືອກແບບສະແຕຕິກທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງ [DirAccess]. "
"ເມທອດສະແຕຕິກຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນ (ລວມທັງ [code]res://[/code] ແລະ [code]user://"
"[/code]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# ແບບມາດຕະຖານ\n"
"var dir = DirAccess.open(\"user://levels\")\n"
"dir.make_dir(\"world1\")\n"
"# ແບບສະແຕຕິກ\n"
"DirAccess.make_dir_absolute(\"user://levels/world1\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ (\"res://\") ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທຳການສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ "
"ອາດຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ເນື່ອງຈາກໄຟລ໌ບາງຢ່າງຖືກແປງເປັນຮູບແບບສະເພາະຂອງເອນຈິນ ແລະ "
"ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດ PCK ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, "
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ResourceLoader] ແທນ "
"[FileAccess].\n"
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງວິທີການວົນລູບຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func dir_contents(path):\n"
"\tvar dir = DirAccess.open(path)\n"
"\tif dir:\n"
"\t\tdir.list_dir_begin()\n"
"\t\tvar file_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\t\twhile file_name != \"\":\n"
"\t\t\tif dir.current_is_dir():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"ພົບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\telse:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"ພົບໄຟລ໌: \" + file_name)\n"
"\t\t\tfile_name = dir.get_next()\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງ.\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void DirContents(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var dir = DirAccess.Open(path);\n"
"\tif (dir != null)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tdir.ListDirBegin();\n"
"\t\tstring fileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\twhile (fileName != \"\")\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (dir.CurrentIsDir())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"ພົບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\telse\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"ພົບໄຟລ໌: {fileName}\");\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tfileName = dir.GetNext();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\telse\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງ.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ຖືກກຳນົດໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກການສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຫັນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕົວຈິງຄືກັບທີ່ປາກົດໃນເອດິເຕີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"ResourceLoader.list_directory] ແທນ."

msgid "File system"
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌"

msgid ""
"Changes the currently opened directory to the one passed as an argument. The "
"argument can be relative to the current directory (e.g. [code]newdir[/code] "
"or [code]../newdir[/code]), or an absolute path (e.g. [code]/tmp/newdir[/"
"code] or [code]res://somedir/newdir[/code]).\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The new directory must be within the same scope, e.g. when you "
"had opened a directory inside [code]res://[/code], you can't change it to "
"[code]user://[/code] directory. If you need to open a directory in another "
"access scope, use [method open] to create a new instance instead."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່ ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ສົ່ງມາເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Copies the [param from] file to the [param to] destination. Both arguments "
"should be paths to files, either relative or absolute. If the destination "
"file exists and is not access-protected, it will be overwritten.\n"
"If [param chmod_flags] is different than [code]-1[/code], the Unix "
"permissions for the destination path will be set to the provided value, if "
"available on the current operating system.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ [param from] ໄປຫາປາຍທາງ [param to]."

msgid "Static version of [method copy]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method copy]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (absolute paths) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates symbolic link between files or folders.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, this method works only if the application is running "
"with elevated privileges or Developer Mode is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr "ສ້າງລິງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link) ລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Creates a temporary directory. This directory will be freed when the returned "
"[DirAccess] is freed.\n"
"If [param prefix] is not empty, it will be prefixed to the directory name, "
"separated by a [code]-[/code].\n"
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], the directory is not deleted when the "
"returned [DirAccess] is freed.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the directory failed. You can use "
"[method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the current item processed with the last [method get_next] "
"call is a directory ([code].[/code] and [code]..[/code] are considered "
"directories)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າບອກວ່າລາຍການປະຈຸບັນທີ່ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ [method get_next] ແມ່ນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the target directory exists. The argument can be relative to "
"the current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned [bool] in the editor and after exporting when used "
"on a path in the [code]res://[/code] directory may be different. Some files "
"are converted to engine-specific formats when exported, potentially changing "
"the directory structure."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າບອກວ່າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເປົ້າໝາຍມີຢູ່ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Static version of [method dir_exists]. Supports only absolute paths.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned [bool] in the editor and after exporting when used "
"on a path in the [code]res://[/code] directory may be different. Some files "
"are converted to engine-specific formats when exported, potentially changing "
"the directory structure."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method dir_exists]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the target file exists. The argument can be relative to the "
"current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"For a static equivalent, use [method FileAccess.file_exists].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many resources types are imported (e.g. textures or sound "
"files), and their source asset will not be included in the exported game, as "
"only the imported version is used. See [method ResourceLoader.exists] for an "
"alternative approach that takes resource remapping into account."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າບອກວ່າໄຟລ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍມີຢູ່ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the currently opened directory (e.g. [code]res://"
"folder[/code] or [code]C:\\tmp\\folder[/code])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (absolute path) ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the currently opened directory's drive index. See [method "
"get_drive_name] to convert returned index to the name of the drive."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີໄດຣຟ໌ (drive index) ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory contents, "
"excluding files. The array is sorted alphabetically.\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden] and [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned directories in the editor and after exporting in "
"the [code]res://[/code] directory may differ as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats when exported."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [PackedStringArray] ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທັງໝົດພາຍໃນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory contents, "
"excluding files, at the given [param path]. The array is sorted "
"alphabetically.\n"
"Use [method get_directories] if you want more control of what gets included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned directories in the editor and after exporting in "
"the [code]res://[/code] directory may differ as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats when exported."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [PackedStringArray] ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທັງໝົດພາຍໃນເສັ້ນທາງ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the number of drives (partitions) mounted on the current "
"filesystem.\n"
"On macOS and Android, returns the number of mounted volumes.\n"
"On Linux, returns the number of mounted volumes and GTK 3 bookmarks.\n"
"On other platforms, the method returns 0."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນໄດຣຟ໌ (partitions) ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the label of the drive (partition) passed as an "
"argument.\n"
"On other platforms, or if the requested drive does not exist, returns an "
"empty String."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ຂອງໄດຣຟ໌."

msgid ""
"On Windows, returns the name of the drive (partition) passed as an argument "
"(e.g. [code]C:[/code]).\n"
"On macOS, returns the path to the mounted volume passed as an argument.\n"
"On Linux, returns the path to the mounted volume or GTK 3 bookmark passed as "
"an argument.\n"
"On Android (API level 30+), returns the path to the mounted volume as an "
"argument.\n"
"On other platforms, or if the requested drive does not exist, returns an "
"empty String."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງໄດຣຟ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory contents, "
"excluding directories. The array is sorted alphabetically.\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used on a [code]res://[/code] path in an exported project, "
"only the files actually included in the PCK at the given folder level are "
"returned. In practice, this means that since imported resources are stored in "
"a top-level [code].godot/[/code] folder, only paths to [code]*.gd[/code] and "
"[code]*.import[/code] files are returned (plus a few files such as "
"[code]project.godot[/code] or [code]project.binary[/code] and the project "
"icon). In an exported project, the list of returned files will also vary "
"depending on whether [member ProjectSettings.editor/export/"
"convert_text_resources_to_binary] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [PackedStringArray] ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມເອົາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] containing filenames of the directory contents, "
"excluding directories, at the given [param path]. The array is sorted "
"alphabetically.\n"
"Use [method get_files] if you want more control of what gets included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used on a [code]res://[/code] path in an exported project, "
"only the files included in the PCK at the given folder level are returned. In "
"practice, this means that since imported resources are stored in a top-level "
"[code].godot/[/code] folder, only paths to [code].gd[/code] and "
"[code].import[/code] files are returned (plus a few other files, such as "
"[code]project.godot[/code] or [code]project.binary[/code] and the project "
"icon). In an exported project, the list of returned files will also vary "
"depending on [member ProjectSettings.editor/export/"
"convert_text_resources_to_binary]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [PackedStringArray] ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໃນເສັ້ນທາງ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມເອົາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"Returns file system type name of the current directory's disk. Returned "
"values are uppercase strings like [code]NTFS[/code], [code]FAT32[/code], "
"[code]EXFAT[/code], [code]APFS[/code], [code]EXT4[/code], [code]BTRFS[/code], "
"and so on.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, Windows and for PCK "
"virtual file system."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງດິສກ໌ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປະຈຸບັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: NTFS, FAT32)."

msgid ""
"Returns the next element (file or directory) in the current directory.\n"
"The name of the file or directory is returned (and not its full path). Once "
"the stream has been fully processed, the method returns an empty [String] and "
"closes the stream automatically (i.e. [method list_dir_end] would not be "
"mandatory in such a case)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອົງປະກອບຖັດໄປ (ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ) ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns the result of the last [method open] call in the current thread."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຜົນລັດຂອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method open] ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດໃນເທຣດ (thread) ປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the available space on the current directory's disk, in bytes. "
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the platform-specific method to query the available "
"space fails."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນດິສກ໌ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປະຈຸບັນ, ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌ (bytes)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the directory is a macOS bundle.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແມ່ນ macOS bundle."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file system or directory use case sensitive "
"file names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux (for EXT4 and F2FS "
"filesystems only) and Windows. On other platforms, it always returns "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີມີການຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ (case "
"sensitive)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if paths [param path_a] and [param path_b] resolve "
"to the same file system object. Returns [code]false[/code] otherwise, even if "
"the files are bit-for-bit identical (e.g., identical copies of the file that "
"are not symbolic links)."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເສັ້ນທາງ [param path_a] ແລະ [param path_b] "
"ອ້າງອີງເຖິງວັດຖຸໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ອັນດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file or directory is a symbolic link, "
"directory junction, or other reparse point.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແມ່ນລິງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link)."

msgid ""
"Initializes the stream used to list all files and directories using the "
"[method get_next] function, closing the currently opened stream if needed. "
"Once the stream has been processed, it should typically be closed with "
"[method list_dir_end].\n"
"Affected by [member include_hidden] and [member include_navigational].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of files and directories returned by this method is "
"not deterministic, and can vary between operating systems. If you want a list "
"of all files or folders sorted alphabetically, use [method get_files] or "
"[method get_directories]."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະຕຣີມ (stream) ເພື່ອລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Closes the current stream opened with [method list_dir_begin] (whether it has "
"been fully processed with [method get_next] does not matter)."
msgstr "ປິດສະຕຣີມປະຈຸບັນທີ່ເປີດດ້ວຍ [method list_dir_begin]."

msgid ""
"Creates a directory. The argument can be relative to the current directory, "
"or an absolute path. The target directory should be placed in an already "
"existing directory (to create the full path recursively, see [method "
"make_dir_recursive]).\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid "Static version of [method make_dir]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method make_dir]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a target directory and all necessary intermediate directories in its "
"path, by calling [method make_dir] recursively. The argument can be relative "
"to the current directory, or an absolute path.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເປົ້າໝາຍ ລວມທັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີລະຫວ່າງກາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Static version of [method make_dir_recursive]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method make_dir_recursive]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [DirAccess] object and opens an existing directory of the "
"filesystem. The [param path] argument can be within the project tree "
"([code]res://folder[/code]), the user directory ([code]user://folder[/code]) "
"or an absolute path of the user filesystem (e.g. [code]/tmp/folder[/code] or "
"[code]C:\\tmp\\folder[/code]).\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the directory failed. You can use "
"[method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr "ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [DirAccess] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເປີດໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Returns target of the symbolic link.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux, and Windows."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າປາຍທາງຂອງລິງສັນຍະລັກ."

msgid ""
"Permanently deletes the target file or an empty directory. The argument can "
"be relative to the current directory, or an absolute path. If the target "
"directory is not empty, the operation will fail.\n"
"If you don't want to delete the file/directory permanently, use [method "
"OS.move_to_trash] instead.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າອອກຢ່າງຖາວອນ."

msgid "Static version of [method remove]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method remove]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Renames (move) the [param from] file or directory to the [param to] "
"destination. Both arguments should be paths to files or directories, either "
"relative or absolute. If the destination file or directory exists and is not "
"access-protected, it will be overwritten.\n"
"Returns one of the [enum Error] code constants ([constant OK] on success)."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ (ຍ້າຍ) ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [param from] ໄປຫາປາຍທາງ [param to]."

msgid "Static version of [method rename]. Supports only absolute paths."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ static ຂອງ [method rename]. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hidden files are included when navigating the "
"directory.\n"
"Affects [method list_dir_begin], [method get_directories] and [method "
"get_files]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຊ່ອນໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເບິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code].[/code] and [code]..[/code] are included when "
"navigating the directory.\n"
"Affects [method list_dir_begin] and [method get_directories]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລວມເອົາ [code].[/code] ແລະ [code]..[/code] "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເບິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid "Directional 2D light from a distance."
msgstr "ແສງ 2D ແບບກຳນົດທິດທາງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"A directional light is a type of [Light2D] node that models an infinite "
"number of parallel rays covering the entire scene. It is used for lights with "
"strong intensity that are located far away from the scene (for example: to "
"model sunlight or moonlight).\n"
"Light is emitted in the +Y direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted downwards. The position "
"of the node is ignored; only the basis is used to determine light direction.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [DirectionalLight2D] does not support light cull masks (but it "
"supports shadow cull masks). It will always light up 2D nodes, regardless of "
"the 2D node's [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."
msgstr ""
"Directional light ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງໂນດ [Light2D] "
"ທີ່ຈຳລອງລັງສີຂະໜານແບບບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດໃຫ້ກວມເອົາທັງສາກ. ມັນໃຊ້ສຳລັບແສງທີ່ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມສູງ "
"ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ຫ່າງໄກຈາກສາກ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການຈຳລອງແສງຕາເວັນ ຫຼື ແສງເດືອນ)."

msgid ""
"The height of the light. Used with 2D normal mapping. Ranges from 0 (parallel "
"to the plane) to 1 (perpendicular to the plane)."
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງແສງ. ໃຊ້ກັບການເຮັດ 2D normal mapping."

msgid ""
"The maximum distance from the camera center objects can be before their "
"shadows are culled (in pixels). Decreasing this value can prevent objects "
"located outside the camera from casting shadows (while also improving "
"performance). [member Camera2D.zoom] is not taken into account by [member "
"max_distance], which means that at higher zoom values, shadows will appear to "
"fade out sooner when zooming onto a given point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດຈາກຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງກ້ອງທີ່ວັດຖຸສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ເງົາຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຄັດອອກ."

msgid "Directional light from a distance, as from the Sun."
msgstr "ແສງແບບກຳນົດທິດທາງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ, ເຊັ່ນແສງຈາກດວງຕາເວັນ."

msgid ""
"A directional light is a type of [Light3D] node that models an infinite "
"number of parallel rays covering the entire scene. It is used for lights with "
"strong intensity that are located far away from the scene to model sunlight "
"or moonlight.\n"
"Light is emitted in the -Z direction of the node's global basis. For an "
"unrotated light, this means that the light is emitted forwards, illuminating "
"the front side of a 3D model (see [constant Vector3.FORWARD] and [constant "
"Vector3.MODEL_FRONT]). The position of the node is ignored; only the basis is "
"used to determine light direction."
msgstr ""
"Directional light ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງໂນດ [Light3D] "
"ທີ່ຈຳລອງລັງສີຂະໜານແບບບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດໃຫ້ກວມເອົາທັງສາກ."

msgid "Faking global illumination"
msgstr "ການຈຳລອງການກະຈາຍແສງທົ່ວໄປ (global illumination)"

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shadow detail is sacrificed in exchange for smoother "
"transitions between splits. Enabling shadow blend splitting also has a "
"moderate performance cost. This is ignored when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເງົາຈະຖືກຫຼຸດລົງເພື່ອແລກກັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນແບ່ງ "
"(splits) ທີ່ລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Proportion of [member directional_shadow_max_distance] at which point the "
"shadow starts to fade. At [member directional_shadow_max_distance], the "
"shadow will disappear. The default value is a balance between smooth fading "
"and distant shadow visibility. If the camera moves fast and the [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance] is low, consider lowering [member "
"directional_shadow_fade_start] below [code]0.8[/code] to make shadow "
"transitions less noticeable. On the other hand, if you tuned [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance] to cover the entire scene, you can set "
"[member directional_shadow_fade_start] to [code]1.0[/code] to prevent the "
"shadow from fading in the distance (it will suddenly cut off instead)."
msgstr "ສັດສ່ວນຂອງ [member directional_shadow_max_distance] ທີ່ເງົາຈະເລີ່ມຈາງຫາຍ."

msgid ""
"The maximum distance for shadow splits. Increasing this value will make "
"directional shadows visible from further away, at the cost of lower overall "
"shadow detail and performance (since more objects need to be included in the "
"directional shadow rendering)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດສຳລັບການແບ່ງສ່ວນເງົາ."

msgid "The light's shadow rendering algorithm."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມ (algorithm) ໃນການເຣນເດີເງົາຂອງແສງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the size of the directional shadow pancake. The pancake offsets the "
"start of the shadow's camera frustum to provide a higher effective depth "
"resolution for the shadow. However, a high pancake size can cause artifacts "
"in the shadows of large objects that are close to the edge of the frustum. "
"Reducing the pancake size can help. Setting the size to [code]0[/code] turns "
"off the pancaking effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງ directional shadow pancake."

msgid ""
"The distance from camera to shadow split 1. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_2_SPLITS] or [constant "
"SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງຫາສ່ວນແບ່ງເງົາທີ 1."

msgid ""
"The distance from shadow split 1 to split 2. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກສ່ວນແບ່ງເງົາທີ 1 ຫາ ສ່ວນແບ່ງທີ 2."

msgid ""
"The distance from shadow split 2 to split 3. Relative to [member "
"directional_shadow_max_distance]. Only used when [member "
"directional_shadow_mode] is [constant SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກສ່ວນແບ່ງເງົາທີ 2 ຫາ ສ່ວນແບ່ງທີ 3."

msgid ""
"Whether this [DirectionalLight3D] is visible in the sky, in the scene, or "
"both in the sky and in the scene."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າ [DirectionalLight3D] ນີ້ຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນທ້ອງຟ້າ, ໃນສາກ, ຫຼື ທັງສອງຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Renders the entire scene's shadow map from an orthogonal point of view. This "
"is the fastest directional shadow mode. May result in blurrier shadows on "
"close objects."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີແຜນຜັງເງົາຂອງທັງສາກຈາກມຸມມອງແບບ orthogonal. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເງົາທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Splits the view frustum in 2 areas, each with its own shadow map. This shadow "
"mode is a compromise between [constant SHADOW_ORTHOGONAL] and [constant "
"SHADOW_PARALLEL_4_SPLITS] in terms of performance."
msgstr "ແບ່ງສ່ວນມຸມມອງອອກເປັນ 2 ສ່ວນ, ໂດຍແຕ່ລະສ່ວນມີແຜນຜັງເງົາຂອງຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Splits the view frustum in 4 areas, each with its own shadow map. This is the "
"slowest directional shadow mode."
msgstr "ແບ່ງສ່ວນມຸມມອງອອກເປັນ 4 ສ່ວນ, ໂດຍແຕ່ລະສ່ວນມີແຜນຜັງເງົາຂອງຕົນເອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເງົາທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Makes the light visible in both scene lighting and sky rendering."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນທັງໃນການໃຫ້ແສງສາກ ແລະ ໃນການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ."

msgid ""
"Makes the light visible in scene lighting only (including direct lighting and "
"global illumination). When using this mode, the light will not be visible "
"from sky shaders."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເພາະໃນການໃຫ້ແສງສາກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Makes the light visible to sky shaders only. When using this mode the light "
"will not cast light into the scene (either through direct lighting or through "
"global illumination), but can be accessed through sky shaders. This can be "
"useful, for example, when you want to control sky effects without "
"illuminating the scene (during a night cycle, for example)."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເພາະໃນ sky shaders ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "A server interface for low-level window management."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດເຊີເວີ (server interface) ສຳລັບການຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງໃນລະດັບຕ່ຳ."

msgid ""
"[DisplayServer] handles everything related to window management. It is "
"separated from [OS] as a single operating system may support multiple display "
"servers.\n"
"[b]Headless mode:[/b] Starting the engine with the [code]--headless[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url] disables all rendering and window management functions. Most "
"functions from [DisplayServer] will return dummy values in this case."
msgstr ""
"[DisplayServer] ຈັດການທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າຕ່າງ. ມັນຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກ [OS] "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໜຶ່ງອາດຈະຮອງຮັບ display server ໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ."

msgid "Use [AccessibilityServer] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [AccessibilityServer] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new, empty accessibility sub-element resource. Sub-elements can be "
"used to provide accessibility information for objects which are not [Node]s, "
"such as list items, table cells, or menu items. Sub-elements are freed "
"automatically when the parent element is freed, or can be freed early using "
"the [method accessibility_free_element] method."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນອົງປະກອບຍ່ອຍ (sub-element) ໃໝ່ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility)."

msgid ""
"Creates a new, empty accessibility sub-element from the shaped text buffer. "
"Sub-elements are freed automatically when the parent element is freed, or can "
"be freed early using the [method accessibility_free_element] method.\n"
"If [param is_last_line] is [code]true[/code], no trailing newline is appended "
"to the text content. Set to [code]true[/code] for the last line in multi-line "
"text fields and for single-line text fields."
msgstr "ສ້າງອົງປະກອບຍ່ອຍໃໝ່ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກ shaped text buffer."

msgid ""
"Frees the accessibility element [param id] created by [method "
"accessibility_create_element], [method accessibility_create_sub_element], or "
"[method accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍ (free) ອົງປະກອບສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [param id]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if a screen reader, Braille display or other assistive "
"app is active, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is "
"unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps and will not affect this value. To test your "
"project with these tools, set [member ProjectSettings.accessibility/general/"
"accessibility_support] to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າ screen reader ຫຼື ແອັບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອອື່ນໆກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if a high-contrast user interface theme should be "
"used, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is "
"unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland, GNOME), macOS, "
"and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຄວນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສີສູງ (high-contrast)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if flashing, blinking, and other moving content that "
"can cause seizures in users with photosensitive epilepsy should be disabled, "
"[code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຄວນປິດການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ເປັນການກະພິບ ຫຼື "
"ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດອາການຊັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]1[/code] if background images, transparency, and other features "
"that can reduce the contrast between the foreground and background should be "
"disabled, [code]0[/code] otherwise. Returns [code]-1[/code] if status is "
"unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]1[/code] ຖ້າຄວນປິດການໃຊ້ງານຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງ, ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆທີ່ຫຼຸດຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ພື້ນໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"Sets text selection to the text field. [param text_start_id] and [param "
"text_end_id] should be elements created by [method "
"accessibility_create_sub_text_edit_elements]. Character offsets are relative "
"to the corresponding element."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Plays the beep sound from the operative system, if possible. Because it comes "
"from the OS, the beep sound will be audible even if the application is muted. "
"It may also be disabled for the entire OS by the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Linux (X11/Wayland), and "
"Windows."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສຽງເຕືອນ (beep) ຈາກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the user's clipboard as a string if possible."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນຄລິບບອດ (clipboard) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string)."

msgid ""
"Returns the user's clipboard as an image if possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method uses the copied pixel data, e.g. from an image "
"editing software or a web browser, not an image file copied from file "
"explorer."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນຄລິບບອດເປັນຮູບພາບ, ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the user's [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/139191/whats-"
"the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-clipboard-buffer]primary[/url] "
"clipboard as a string if possible. This is the clipboard that is set when the "
"user selects text in any application, rather than when pressing [kbd]Ctrl + "
"C[/kbd]. The clipboard data can then be pasted by clicking the middle mouse "
"button in any application that supports the primary clipboard mechanism.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນຄລິບບອດຫຼັກ (primary clipboard) ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a text content on the user's clipboard."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີເນື້ອໃນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຢູ່ໃນຄລິບບອດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is an image content on the user's "
"clipboard."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີເນື້ອໃນເປັນຮູບພາບຢູ່ໃນຄລິບບອດ."

msgid "Sets the user's clipboard content to the given string."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເນື້ອໃນໃນຄລິບບອດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the user's [url=https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/139191/whats-"
"the-difference-between-primary-selection-and-clipboard-buffer]primary[/url] "
"clipboard content to the given string. This is the clipboard that is set when "
"the user selects text in any application, rather than when pressing [kbd]Ctrl "
"+ C[/kbd]. The clipboard data can then be pasted by clicking the middle mouse "
"button in any application that supports the primary clipboard mechanism.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເນື້ອໃນໃນຄລິບບອດຫຼັກ (primary clipboard) ໃຫ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Displays OS native color picker.\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, color: Color[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_COLOR_PICKER] feature.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux (X11/Wayland)."
msgstr "ສະແດງຕົວເລືອກສີ (color picker) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new application status indicator with the specified icon, tooltip, "
"and activation callback.\n"
"[param callback] should take two arguments: the pressed mouse button (one of "
"the [enum MouseButton] constants) and the click position in screen "
"coordinates (a [Vector2i])."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ ພ້ອມໄອຄອນ, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (tooltip) ແລະ ຄໍແບັກ "
"(callback)."

msgid "Returns the default mouse cursor shape set by [method cursor_set_shape]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets a custom mouse cursor image for the given [param shape]. This means the "
"user's operating system and mouse cursor theme will no longer influence the "
"mouse cursor's appearance.\n"
"[param cursor] can be either a [Texture2D] or an [Image], and it should not "
"be larger than 256×256 to display correctly. Optionally, [param hotspot] can "
"be set to offset the image's position relative to the click point. By "
"default, [param hotspot] is set to the top-left corner of the image. See also "
"[method cursor_set_shape].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Web, calling this method every frame can cause the cursor to "
"flicker."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຮ່າງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ແບບປັບແຕ່ງເອງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the default mouse cursor shape. The cursor's appearance will vary "
"depending on the user's operating system and mouse cursor theme. See also "
"[method cursor_get_shape] and [method cursor_set_custom_image]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບຮ່າງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Removes the application status indicator."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວບົ່ງບອກສະຖານະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອອກ."

msgid ""
"Shows a text input dialog which uses the operating system's native look-and-"
"feel. [param callback] should accept a single [String] parameter which "
"contains the text field's contents.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_INPUT] feature. Supported platforms include "
"macOS, Windows, and Android."
msgstr "ສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input dialog) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Shows a text dialog which uses the operating system's native look-and-feel. "
"[param callback] should accept a single [int] parameter which corresponds to "
"the index of the pressed button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG] feature. Supported platforms include macOS, "
"Windows, and Android."
msgstr "ສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (text dialog) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Allows the [param process_id] PID to steal focus from this window. In other "
"words, this disables the operating system's focus stealing protection for the "
"specified PID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ PID [param process_id] ສາມາດດຶງໂຟກັດໄປຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Displays OS native dialog for selecting files or directories in the file "
"system.\n"
"Each filter string in the [param filters] array should be formatted like "
"this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/jpeg[/code]. The "
"description text of the filter is optional and can be omitted. It is "
"recommended to set both file extension and MIME type. See also [member "
"FileDialog.filters].\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, selected_paths: "
"PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int[/code]. [b]On Android,[/b] the "
"third callback argument ([code]selected_filter_index[/code]) is always "
"[code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE] feature. Supported platforms include "
"Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows, macOS, and Android.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param current_directory] might be ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only file "
"extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support MIME "
"types.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android and Linux, [param show_hidden] is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android and macOS, native file dialogs have no title.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this method uses the Android Storage Access "
"Framework (SAF).\n"
"The file picker returns a URI instead of a filesystem path. This URI can be "
"passed directly to [FileAccess] to perform read/write operations.\n"
"When using [constant FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR], it returns a tree URI that "
"grants full access to the selected directory. File operations inside this "
"directory can be performed by passing a path on the form "
"[code]treeUri#relative/path/to/file[/code] to [FileAccess].\n"
"To avoid opening the file picker again after each app restart, you can take "
"persistable URI permission as follows:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"val uri = \"content://com.android...\" # URI of the selected file or folder.\n"
"val persist = true # Set to false to release the persistable permission.\n"
"var android_runtime = Engine.get_singleton(\"AndroidRuntime\")\n"
"android_runtime.updatePersistableUriPermission(uri, persist)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The persistable URI permission remains valid across app restarts as long as "
"the directory is not moved, renamed, or deleted."
msgstr "ສະແດງກ່ອງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Displays OS native dialog for selecting files or directories in the file "
"system with additional user selectable options.\n"
"Each filter string in the [param filters] array should be formatted like "
"this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/jpeg[/code]. The "
"description text of the filter is optional and can be omitted. It is "
"recommended to set both file extension and MIME type. See also [member "
"FileDialog.filters].\n"
"[param options] is array of [Dictionary]s with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code] - option's name [String].\n"
"- [code]\"values\"[/code] - [PackedStringArray] of values. If empty, boolean "
"option (check box) is used.\n"
"- [code]\"default\"[/code] - default selected option index ([int]) or default "
"boolean value ([bool]).\n"
"Callbacks have the following arguments: [code]status: bool, selected_paths: "
"PackedStringArray, selected_filter_index: int, selected_option: Dictionary[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented if the display server has the "
"[constant FEATURE_NATIVE_DIALOG_FILE_EXTRA] feature. Supported platforms "
"include Linux (X11/Wayland), Windows, and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param current_directory] might be ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only file "
"extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support MIME "
"types.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux (X11), [param show_hidden] is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, native file dialogs have no title.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks."
msgstr "ສະແດງກ່ອງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ພ້ອມຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Forces window manager processing while ignoring all [InputEvent]s. See also "
"[method process_events].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Windows and macOS."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ window manager ປະມວນຜົນ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈ [InputEvent] ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns OS theme accent color. Returns [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code], if "
"accent color is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Windows, Android, and Linux "
"(X11/Wayland)."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສີເນັ້ນ (accent color) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"Returns the OS theme base color (default control background). Returns "
"[code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] if the base color is unknown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on macOS, Windows, and Android."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າສີພື້ນຖານຂອງຮູບແບບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (ສີພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Rect2], each of which is the bounding rectangle for a "
"display cutout or notch. These are non-functional areas on edge-to-edge "
"screens used by cameras and sensors. Returns an empty array if the device "
"does not have cutouts. See also [method get_display_safe_area].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently only implemented on Android. Other platforms will "
"return an empty array even if they do have display cutouts or notches."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣ [Array] ຂອງ [Rect2], ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂອບເຂດສຳລັບສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຕັດອອກ (cutout) ຫຼື ຮອຍບາກ "
"(notch) ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Returns the unobscured area of the display where interactive controls should "
"be rendered. See also [method get_display_cutouts].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Currently only implemented on Android and iOS. On other "
"platforms, [code]screen_get_usable_rect(SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW)[/code] will be "
"returned as a fallback. See also [method screen_get_usable_rect]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງບັງ ເຊິ່ງຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the screen containing the window with the keyboard "
"focus, or the primary screen if there's no focused window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns the primary screen."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ມີໂຟກັດຄີບອດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the [DisplayServer] currently in use. Most operating "
"systems only have a single [DisplayServer], but Linux has access to more than "
"one [DisplayServer] (currently X11 and Wayland).\n"
"The names of built-in display servers are [code]Windows[/code], [code]macOS[/"
"code], [code]X11[/code] (Linux), [code]Wayland[/code] (Linux), [code]Android[/"
"code], [code]iOS[/code], [code]web[/code] (HTML5), and [code]headless[/code] "
"(when started with the [code]--headless[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url])."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງ [DisplayServer] ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the primary screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux/X11, macOS, and Windows. On "
"other platforms, this method always returns [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of displays available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux (X11 and Wayland), macOS, "
"and Windows. On other platforms, this method always returns [code]1[/code]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the screen that overlaps the most with the given "
"rectangle. Returns [constant INVALID_SCREEN] if the rectangle doesn't overlap "
"with any screen or has no area."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າດັດຊະນີຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັບຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if positions of [b]OK[/b] and [b]Cancel[/b] buttons "
"are swapped in dialogs. This is enabled by default on Windows to follow "
"interface conventions, and be toggled by changing [member ProjectSettings.gui/"
"common/swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This doesn't affect native dialogs such as the ones spawned by "
"[method DisplayServer.dialog_show]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມ [b]OK[/b] ແລະ [b]Cancel[/b] ຖືກສະລັບກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the window at the specified screen [param position] (in "
"pixels). On multi-monitor setups, the screen position is relative to the "
"virtual desktop area. On multi-monitor setups with different screen "
"resolutions or orientations, the origin may be located outside any display "
"like this:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"* (0, 0)        +-------+\n"
"                |       |\n"
"+-------------+ |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"|             | |       |\n"
"+-------------+ +-------+\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ ID ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໜ້າຈໍ [param position] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of Godot window IDs belonging to this process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native dialogs are not included in this list."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ ID ໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງ Godot ທີ່ເປັນຂອງຂະບວນການ (process) ນີ້."

msgid "Use [NativeMenu] or [PopupMenu] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [NativeMenu] ຫຼື [PopupMenu] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] to the global menu with ID "
"[param menu_root].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກໄດ້ ພ້ອມຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູສາກົນດ້ວຍ ID [param "
"menu_root].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ [param index].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param accelerator] ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ປຸ່ມເມນູເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຕອນນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ [param accelerator] ແມ່ນການປະສົມກັນຂອງ [enum KeyModifierMask] ແລະ "
"[enum Key] ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl "
"+ A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Callable ຂອງ [param callback] ແລະ [param key_callback] "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮັບພະລາມິເຕີ Variant ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ພະລາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ Callable "
"ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ [param tag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມັດທອດນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ID ເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ເພີ່ມລາຍການກຳນົດເອງກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ເພີ່ມລາຍການກຳນົດເອງຫຼັງຈາກ \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] and icon [param icon] to "
"the global menu with ID [param menu_root].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented only on macOS.\n"
"[b]Supported system menu IDs:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - Main menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - Dock popup menu (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - Apple menu (macOS, custom items added before \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - Window menu (macOS, custom items added after \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - Help menu (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ທີ່ສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກໄດ້ ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param label] ແລະ ໄອຄອນ [param icon] "
"ລົງໃນເມນູຫຼັກ (global menu) ດ້ວຍໄອດີ [param menu_root].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ແຊກເຂົ້າໄປ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນຈະມີຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບຄ່າ [param "
"index].\n"
"ສາມາດກຳນົດ [param accelerator] ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມທີ່ສາມາດກົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເມນູໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃນຕອນນັ້ນເມນູຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດຢູ່ກໍຕາມ. "
"[param accelerator] ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວແມ່ນການປະສົມປະສານລະຫວ່າງ [enum KeyModifierMask] "
"ແລະ [enum Key] ໂດຍໃຊ້ bitwise OR ເຊັ່ນ [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] "
"([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param callback] ແລະ [param key_callback] ທີ່ເປັນ Callable "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Variant ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາ Callable "
"ຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ [param tag].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດ (method) ນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໄອດີເມນູລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"\"_main\" - ເມນູຫຼັກ (macOS).\n"
"\"_dock\" - ເມນູປັອບອັບ Dock (macOS).\n"
"\"_apple\" - ເມນູ Apple (macOS, ລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຖືກເພີ່ມກ່ອນ \"Services\").\n"
"\"_window\" - ເມນູໜ້າຕ່າງ (macOS, ລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຖືກເພີ່ມຫຼັງຈາກ \"Bring All to "
"Front\").\n"
"\"_help\" - ເມນູຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (macOS).\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label] and icon [param icon] to the global "
"menu with ID [param menu_root].\n"
"Returns index of the inserted item, it's not guaranteed to be the same as "
"[param index] value.\n"
"An [param accelerator] can optionally be defined, which is a keyboard "
"shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even if it's not "
"currently open. The [param accelerator] is generally a combination of [enum "
"KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param callback] and [param key_callback] Callables need to "
"accept exactly one Variant parameter, the parameter passed to the Callables "
"will be the value passed to [param tag].\n"
