msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A12 Bionic and later "
"chips (devices supporting all Vulkan renderer features).\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad "
"Mini (5th gen.), iPad Air (3rd gen.), iPad (8th gen) and newer."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການປະສິດທິພາບກາຟິກ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊິບ A12 Bionic ຂຶ້ນໄປ (ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ "
"Vulkan renderer).\n"
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບໄວ້ທີ່: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad Mini (ລຸ້ນທີ "
"5), iPad Air (ລຸ້ນທີ 3), iPad (ລຸ້ນທີ 8) ແລະ ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shaders will be compiled and embedded in the "
"application. This option is only supported when using the Forward+ and Mobile "
"renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting as a dedicated server, the shader baker is always "
"disabled since no rendering is performed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເຊດເດີ (shaders) ຈະຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ ແລະ ຝັງໄວ້ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ Forward+ ແລະ Mobile renderer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກເປັນເຊີບເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server), ຕົວອົບເຊດເດີ (shader "
"baker) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ ເພາະບໍ່ມີການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering) ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Exporter for the Web."
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບເວັບ."

msgid ""
"The Web exporter customizes how a web build is handled. In the editor's "
"\"Export\" window, it is created when adding a new \"Web\" preset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot on Web is rendered inside a [code]<canvas>[/code] tag. "
"Normally, the canvas cannot be positioned or resized manually, but otherwise "
"acts as the main [Window] of the application."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສົ່ງອອກເວັບຈະປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການຈັດການການບິວເວັບ. ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ \"ສົ່ງອອກ\" ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເພີ່ມພຣີເຊັດ \"Web\" ໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ເທິງເວັບຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນພາຍໃນແທັກ [code]<canvas>[/code]. "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ແຄນວາ (canvas) ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ປັບຂະໜາດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ [Window] ຫຼັກຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid "Exporting for the Web"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບເວັບ"

msgid "Web documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານເວັບ"

msgid ""
"File path to the custom export template used for debug builds. If left empty, "
"the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາເທັມເພລດການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບິວເພື່ອດີບັກ. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ເທັມເພລດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"File path to the custom export template used for release builds. If left "
"empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາເທັມເພລດການສົ່ງອອກແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບິວເວີຊັນຕົວຈິງ. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ເທັມເພລດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Determines how the canvas should be resized by Godot.\n"
"- [b]None:[/b] The canvas is not automatically resized.\n"
"- [b]Project:[/b] The size of the canvas is dependent on the "
"[ProjectSettings].\n"
"- [b]Adaptive:[/b] The canvas is automatically resized to fit as much of the "
"web page as possible."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການປັບຂະໜາດແຄນວາ (canvas) ໂດຍ Godot.\n"
"- [b]None:[/b] ແຄນວາຈະບໍ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"- [b]Project:[/b] ຂະໜາດຂອງແຄນວາຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [ProjectSettings].\n"
"- [b]Adaptive:[/b] ແຄນວາຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າເວັບໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The custom HTML page that wraps the exported web build. If left empty, the "
"default HTML shell is used.\n"
"For more information, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/platform/web/"
"customizing_html5_shell.html]Customizing HTML5 Shell[/url] tutorial."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າ HTML ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ການບິວເວັບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ HTML shell ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/platform/web/"
"customizing_html5_shell.html]ການປັບແຕ່ງ HTML5 Shell[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], embeds support for a virtual keyboard into the web "
"page, which is shown when necessary on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຝັງການຮອງຮັບຄີບອດສະເມືອນເຂົ້າໃນໜ້າເວັບ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຈຳເປັນໃນອຸປະກອນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project icon will be used as the favicon for this "
"application's web page."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄອຄອນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ favicon "
"ສຳລັບໜ້າເວັບຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the canvas will be focused as soon as the application "
"is loaded, if the browser window is already in focus."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຄນວາ (canvas) ຈະຖືກໂຟກັສທັນທີທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກໂຫຼດ, "
"ຫາກໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີຖືກໂຟກັສຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Additional HTML tags to include inside the [code]<head>[/code], such as "
"[code]<meta>[/code] tags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You do not need to add a [code]<title>[/code] tag, as it is "
"automatically included based on the project's name."
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ HTML ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າພາຍໃນ [code]<head>[/code], ເຊັ່ນແທັກ [code]<meta>[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມແທັກ [code]<title>[/code], "
"ເພາະມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຊື່ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid "The background color used behind the web application."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ທາງຫຼັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເວັບ."

msgid ""
"The [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Manifest/"
"display/]display mode[/url] to use for this progressive web application. "
"Different browsers and platforms may not behave the same.\n"
"- [b]Fullscreen:[/b] Displays the app in fullscreen and hides all of the "
"browser's UI elements.\n"
"- [b]Standalone:[/b] Displays the app in a separate window and hides all of "
"the browser's UI elements.\n"
"- [b]Minimal UI:[/b] Displays the app in a separate window and only shows the "
"browser's UI elements for navigation.\n"
"- [b]Browser:[/b] Displays the app as a normal web page."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Manifest/"
"display/]ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ[/url] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ progressive web application ນີ້. "
"ແຕ່ລະບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ ແພລັດຟອມອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"- [b]Fullscreen:[/b] ສະແດງແອັບແບບເຕັມຈໍ ແລະ ເຊື່ອງອົງປະກອບ UI ທັງໝົດຂອງບຣາວເຊີ.\n"
"- [b]Standalone:[/b] ສະແດງແອັບໃນໜ້າຕ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ເຊື່ອງອົງປະກອບ UI "
"ທັງໝົດຂອງບຣາວເຊີ.\n"
"- [b]Minimal UI:[/b] ສະແດງແອັບໃນໜ້າຕ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ສະແດງສະເພາະອົງປະກອບ UI "
"ຂອງບຣາວເຊີສຳລັບການນຳທາງ.\n"
"- [b]Browser:[/b] ສະແດງແອັບເປັນໜ້າເວັບປົກກະຕິ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], turns this web build into a [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_web_app]progressive web application[/url] "
"(PWA)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປ່ຽນການບິວເວັບນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Progressive_web_app]progressive web application[/url] (PWA)."

msgid ""
"When enabled, the progressive web app will make sure that each request has "
"cross-origin isolation headers (COEP/COOP).\n"
"This can simplify the setup to serve the exported game."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, progressive web app ຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າແຕ່ລະຄຳຂໍມີເຮດເດີການແຍກຕ່າງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດ "
"(cross-origin isolation headers - COEP/COOP).\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກນັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"File path to the smallest icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 144×144, it will be automatically resized for "
"the final build."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາໄອຄອນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເວັບນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄອຄອນໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກໄອຄອນບໍ່ແມ່ນຂະໜາດ 144×144, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການບິວຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"File path to the small icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 180×180, it will be automatically resized for "
"the final build."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາໄອຄອນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເວັບນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄອຄອນໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກໄອຄອນບໍ່ແມ່ນຂະໜາດ 180×180, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການບິວຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"File path to the largest icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 512×512, it will be automatically resized for "
"the final build."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເວັບນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄອຄອນໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກໄອຄອນບໍ່ແມ່ນຂະໜາດ 512×512, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບການບິວຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"The page to display, should the server hosting the page not be available. "
"This page is saved in the client's machine."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຈະສະແດງຫາກເຊີບເວີທີ່ໂຮສໜ້ານັ້ນບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ໜ້ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງໄຄເອັນ (client)."

msgid ""
"The orientation to use when the web application is run through a mobile "
"device.\n"
"- [b]Any:[/b] No orientation is forced.\n"
"- [b]Landscape:[/b] Forces a horizontal layout (wider than it is taller).\n"
"- [b]Portrait:[/b] Forces a vertical layout (taller than it is wider)."
msgstr ""
"ແນວວາງ (orientation) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເວັບຖືກເປີດຜ່ານອຸປະກອນມືຖື.\n"
"- [b]Any:[/b] ບໍ່ບັງຄັບແນວວາງ.\n"
"- [b]Landscape:[/b] ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປັນແນວນອນ (ກວ້າງກວ່າຄວາມສູງ).\n"
"- [b]Portrait:[/b] ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປັນແນວຕັ້ງ (ສູງກວ່າຄວາມກວ້າງ)."

msgid ""
"The number of threads that emscripten will allocate at startup. A smaller "
"value will allocate fewer threads and consume fewer system resources, but you "
"may run the risk of running out of threads in the pool and needing to "
"allocate more threads at run time which may cause a deadlock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some browsers have a hard cap on the number of threads that can "
"be allocated, so it is best to be cautious and keep this number low."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເທຣດ (threads) ທີ່ emscripten ຈະຈັດສັນເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າຈະຈັດສັນເທຣດໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນລະບົບໜ້ອຍລົງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ເທຣດໃນພູລ (pool) ຈະໝົດ ແລະ "
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈັດສັນເທຣດເພີ່ມໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຢຸດສະງັກ (deadlock).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບາງບຣາວເຊີມີການຈຳກັດຈຳນວນເທຣດສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຈັດສັນໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນລະມັດລະວັງ "
"ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕໍ່າໄວ້ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Override for the default size of the [WorkerThreadPool]. This setting is used "
"when [member ProjectSettings.threading/worker_pool/max_threads] size is set "
"to [code]-1[/code] (which it is by default). This size must be smaller than "
"[member threads/emscripten_pool_size] otherwise deadlocks may occur.\n"
"When using threads, this size needs to be large enough to accommodate "
"features that rely on having a dedicated thread like [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/run_on_separate_thread] or [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/driver/threads/thread_model]. In general, it is "
"best to ensure that this is at least [code]4[/code] and is at least [code]2[/"
"code] or [code]3[/code] less than [member threads/emscripten_pool_size]."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແທນ (Override) ສຳລັບຂະໜາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [WorkerThreadPool]. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂະໜາດຂອງ [member ProjectSettings.threading/worker_pool/"
"max_threads] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]-1[/code] (ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ). ຂະໜາດນີ້ຕ້ອງນ້ອຍກວ່າ [member "
"threads/emscripten_pool_size] ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນອາດເກີດການຢຸດສະງັກ (deadlocks).\n"
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເທຣດ, ຂະໜາດນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕ້ອງອາໄສເທຣດສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/run_on_separate_thread] ຫຼື [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/driver/threads/thread_model]. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, "
"ຄວນຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [code]4[/code] ແລະ ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [member threads/"
"emscripten_pool_size] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [code]2[/code] ຫຼື [code]3[/code] ຄ່າ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code] enables [GDExtension] support for this web build."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ [GDExtension] ສຳລັບການບິວເວັບນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the exported game will support threads. It requires "
"[url=https://web.dev/articles/coop-coep]a \"cross-origin isolated\" website[/"
"url], which may be difficult to set up and is limited for security reasons "
"(such as not being able to communicate with third-party websites).\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the exported game will not support threads. As a "
"result, it is more prone to performance and audio issues, but will only "
"require to be run on an HTTPS website."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະຮອງຮັບເທຣດ (threads). ມັນຕ້ອງການ "
"[url=https://web.dev/articles/coop-coep]ເວັບໄຊທີ່ເປັນ \"cross-origin isolated\"[/"
"url], ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຍາກ ແລະ ຖືກຈຳກັດຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບເວັບໄຊພາຍນອກໄດ້).\n"
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບເທຣດ. "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ສຽງໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ, "
"ແຕ່ຈະຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ການເປີດເທິງເວັບໄຊ HTTPS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows textures to be optimized for desktop through the "
"S3TC/BPTC algorithm."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງເທັກເຈີ (textures) "
"ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບເດັສທັອບຜ່ານອັລກໍຣິດທຶມ S3TC/BPTC."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] allows textures to be optimized for mobile through the "
"ETC2/ASTC algorithm."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງເທັກເຈີ (textures) "
"ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບມືຖືຜ່ານອັລກໍຣິດທຶມ ETC2/ASTC."

msgid "Exporter for Windows."
msgstr "ຕົວສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ Windows."

msgid ""
"The Windows exporter customizes how a Windows build is handled. In the "
"editor's \"Export\" window, it is created when adding a new \"Windows\" "
"preset."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສົ່ງອອກ Windows ຈະປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການຈັດການການບິວ Windows. ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ \"ສົ່ງອອກ\" ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເພີ່ມພຣີເຊັດ \"Windows\" ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Company that produced the application. Required. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິສັດທີ່ຜະລິດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. (ຈຳເປັນ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Console wrapper icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"application/icon], then to [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"windows_native_icon], and lastly, [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"icon]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນສຳລັບ console wrapper. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member application/icon], "
"ຈາກນັ້ນແມ່ນ [member ProjectSettings.application/config/windows_native_icon], ແລະ "
"ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ [member ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

msgid ""
"Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user. Optional. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ແຈ້ງການລິຂະສິດສຳລັບຊຸດແອັບທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້. (ທາງເລືອກ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and [member application/export_d3d12] is set, the "
"Agility SDK DLLs will be stored in arch-specific subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ [member application/export_d3d12] ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້, ໄຟລ໌ "
"DLL ຂອງ Agility SDK ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍຕາມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], the Direct3D 12 runtime libraries (Agility SDK, "
"PIX) are exported with the exported application. If set to [code]0[/code], "
"Direct3D 12 libraries are exported only if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"rendering_device/driver] is set to [code]\"d3d12\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1[/code], ໄລບຣາຣີ Direct3D 12 (Agility SDK, PIX) "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code], ໄລບຣາຣີ Direct3D 12 "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/driver] "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]\"d3d12\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"File description to be presented to users. Required. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ. (ຈຳເປັນ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Version number of the file. Falls back to [member ProjectSettings.application/"
"config/version] if left empty. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເລກເວີຊັນຂອງໄຟລ໌. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [member ProjectSettings.application/"
"config/version]. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/"
"menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/windows_native_icon], and then to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ [member ProjectSettings.application/"
"config/windows_native_icon], ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນແມ່ນ [member ProjectSettings.application/"
"config/icon]."

msgid ""
"If enabled, icon and metadata of the exported executable is set according to "
"the other [code]application/*[/code] values."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) "
"ຂອງໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຕາມຄ່າອື່ນໆໃນ [code]application/*[/code]."

msgid ""
"Name of the application. Required. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. (ຈຳເປັນ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/"
"win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເວີຊັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version]. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Trademarks and registered trademarks that apply to the file. Optional. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າຈົດທະບຽນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ນີ້. (ທາງເລືອກ). ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], and "
"[code]arm64[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບ: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]arm64[/code]."

msgid ""
"Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the code signing "
"tool. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/"
"signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງອາຄິວເມນບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງມືລົງລາຍເຊັນໂຄ້ດ (code signing tool). ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

msgid ""
"Description of the signed content. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ລົງລາຍເຊັນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

msgid ""
"Digest algorithm to use for creating signature. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ອັລກໍຣິດທຶມໄດເຈສ (Digest algorithm) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສ້າງລາຍເຊັນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], executable signing is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການລົງລາຍເຊັນໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"PKCS #12 certificate file used to sign executable or certificate SHA-1 hash "
"(if [member codesign/identity_type] is set to \"Use certificate store\"). See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ PKCS #12 ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການລົງລາຍເຊັນໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື SHA-1 hash ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (ຫາກ "
"[member codesign/identity_type] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"Use certificate store\"). ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"ສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY[/code]."

msgid ""
"Type of identity to use. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY_TYPE[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງຕົວຕົນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"ສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY_TYPE[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Password for the certificate file used to sign executable. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/"
"url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການລົງລາຍເຊັນໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/"
"url].\n"
"ສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_PASSWORD[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], time-stamp is added to the signature. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການເພີ່ມການປະທັບຕາເວລາ (time-stamp) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍເຊັນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

msgid ""
"URL of the time stamp server. If left empty, the default server is used. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີປະທັບຕາເວລາ. ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a console wrapper executable is exported alongside the "
"main executable, which allows running the project with enabled console output."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການ console wrapper "
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການຫຼັກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເປີດໂປຣເຈັກພ້ອມກັບການສະແດງຜົນທາງຄອນໂຊນໄດ້."

msgid "A script that is executed when exporting the project."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"[EditorExportPlugin]s are automatically invoked whenever the user exports the "
"project. They can be used to modify scenes and resources during project "
"export based on what [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]Feature Tags[/url] are set. For each plugin, [method "
"_export_begin] is called at the beginning of the export process and then "
"[method _export_file] is called for each exported file.\n"
"Register a [EditorExportPlugin] by creating a new [EditorPlugin] and calling "
"its [method EditorPlugin.add_export_plugin] method."
msgstr ""
"[EditorExportPlugin] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ. "
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນສາກ (scenes) ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resources) "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]ແທັກຄຸນສົມບັດ (Feature Tags)[/url] ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປລັກອິນ, "
"[method _export_begin] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນ [method "
"_export_file] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorExportPlugin] ໂດຍການສ້າງ [EditorPlugin] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[method EditorPlugin.add_export_plugin] ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Export Android plugins"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກປລັກອິນ Android"

msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if this plugin will customize resources based on the "
"platform and features used.\n"
"When enabled, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] and [method "
"_customize_resource] will be called and must be implemented."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປລັກອິນນີ້ຈະປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນຕາມແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] ແລະ [method "
"_customize_resource] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບ (implemented)."

msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if this plugin will customize scenes based on the "
"platform and features used.\n"
"When enabled, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] and [method "
"_customize_scene] will be called and must be implemented.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _customize_scene] will only be called for scenes that "
"have been modified since the last export."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປລັກອິນນີ້ຈະປັບແຕ່ງສາກ (scenes) ຕາມແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] ແລະ [method "
"_customize_scene] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບ (implemented).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method _customize_scene] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສະເພາະສາກທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຕັ້ງແຕ່ການສົ່ງອອກຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Customize a resource. If changes are made to it, return the same or a new "
"resource. Otherwise, return [code]null[/code]. When a new resource is "
"returned, [param resource] will be replaced by a copy of the new resource.\n"
"The [param path] argument is only used when customizing an actual file, "
"otherwise this means that this resource is part of another one and it will be "
"empty.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_resources] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When customizing any of the following types and returning "
"another resource, the other resource should not be skipped using [method "
"skip] in [method _export_file]:\n"
"- [AtlasTexture]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemap]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemapArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2D]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2DArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture3D]"
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource). ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນເດີມ ຫຼື ອັນໃໝ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]. ເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່, [param resource] "
"ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍສຳເນົາຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່ນັ້ນ.\n"
"ອາຄິວເມນ [param path] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງອັນອື່ນ ແລະ ມັນຈະວ່າງ.\n"
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບເມທອດນີ້ ຫາກ [method _begin_customize_resources] ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອປັບແຕ່ງປະເພດໃດໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນ, "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຂ້າມໂດຍການໃຊ້ [method skip] ໃນ [method _export_file]:\n"
"- [AtlasTexture]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemap]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemapArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2D]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2DArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture3D]"

msgid ""
"Customize a scene. If changes are made to it, return the same or a new scene. "
"Otherwise, return [code]null[/code]. If a new scene is returned, it is up to "
"you to dispose of the old one.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_scenes] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To change a variable in your scene, use the [code]@export[/code] "
"annotation when declaring it."
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງສາກ (scene). ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນສາກເດີມ ຫຼື ສາກໃໝ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]null[/code]. ຫາກສົ່ງຄືນສາກໃໝ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການທຳລາຍສາກເກົ່າເອງ.\n"
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບເມທອດນີ້ ຫາກ [method _begin_customize_scenes] ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕົວແປໃນສາກຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳອະທິບາຍ [code]@export[/code] "
"ເມື່ອປະກາດຕົວແປນັ້ນ."

msgid "This is called when the customization process for resources ends."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid "This is called when the customization process for scenes ends."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງສາກ (scenes) ສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"This is called after Xcode project generation, but before it is built.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on iOS and visionOS."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode, ແຕ່ກ່ອນທີ່ມັນຈະຖືກບິວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ iOS ແລະ visionOS."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. It is called when the export "
"starts and provides all information about the export. [param features] is the "
"list of features for the export, [param is_debug] is [code]true[/code] for "
"debug builds, [param path] is the target path for the exported project. "
"[param flags] is only used when running a runnable profile, e.g. when using "
"native run on Android."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ (override). ມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອການສົ່ງອອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດກ່ຽວກັບການສົ່ງອອກ. [param features] ແມ່ນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກ, [param "
"is_debug] ແມ່ນ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບການບິວເພື່ອດີບັກ, [param path] "
"ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງປາຍທາງສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. [param flags] "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດແລ່ນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ການໃຊ້ native run ເທິງ Android."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. Called when the export is "
"finished."
msgstr "Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອການສົ່ງອອກສິ້ນສຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. Called for each exported file "
"before [method _customize_resource] and [method _customize_scene]. The "
"arguments can be used to identify the file. [param path] is the path of the "
"file, [param type] is the [Resource] represented by the file (e.g. "
"[PackedScene]), and [param features] is the list of features for the export.\n"
"Calling [method skip] inside this callback will make the file not included in "
"the export."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກກ່ອນ [method "
"_customize_resource] ແລະ [method _customize_scene]. "
"ອາຄິວເມນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. [param path] ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌, [param type] ແມ່ນ "
"[Resource] ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຕາງໜ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ [PackedScene]), ແລະ [param features] "
"ແມ່ນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method skip] ພາຍໃນ callback ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"set of Android dependencies provided by this plugin. Each returned Android "
"dependency should have the format of an Android remote binary dependency: "
"[code]org.godot.example:my-plugin:0.0.0[/code]\n"
"For more information see [url=https://developer.android.com/build/"
"dependencies?agpversion=4.1#dependency-types]Android documentation on "
"dependencies[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຊຸດ dependencies ຂອງ Android "
"ທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້. ແຕ່ລະ dependency ຂອງ Android ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Android "
"remote binary dependency: [code]org.godot.example:my-plugin:0.0.0[/code]\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງ [url=https://developer.android.com/build/dependencies?"
"agpversion=4.1#dependency-types]ເອກະສານ Android ກ່ຽວກັບ dependencies[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"URLs of Maven repositories for the set of Android dependencies provided by "
"this plugin.\n"
"For more information see [url=https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/"
"dependency_management.html#sec:maven_repo]Gradle documentation on dependency "
"management[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Google's Maven repo and the Maven Central repo are already "
"included by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ URL ຂອງ Maven repositories ສຳລັບຊຸດ "
"dependencies ຂອງ Android ທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້.\n"
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງ [url=https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/"
"dependency_management.html#sec:maven_repo]ເອກະສານ Gradle ກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ "
"dependency[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Maven repo ຂອງ Google ແລະ Maven Central repo "
"ແມ່ນຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"local paths of the Android libraries archive (AAR) files provided by this "
"plugin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative paths [b]must[/b] be relative to Godot's [code]res://"
"addons/[/code] directory. For example, an AAR file located under [code]res://"
"addons/hello_world_plugin/HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] can be returned as an "
"absolute path using [code]res://addons/hello_world_plugin/"
"HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] or a relative path using "
"[code]hello_world_plugin/HelloWorld.release.aar[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອດຶງເອົາເສັ້ນທາງທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງໄຟລ໌ Android libraries "
"archive (AAR) ທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເສັ້ນທາງສຳພັດ (Relative paths) [b]ຕ້ອງ[/b] ສຳພັດກັບໂຟນເດີ [code]res://"
"addons/[/code] ຂອງ Godot. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄຟລ໌ AAR ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [code]res://addons/"
"hello_world_plugin/HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] ສາມາດສົ່ງຄືນເປັນເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນ "
"(absolute path) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]res://addons/hello_world_plugin/"
"HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງສຳພັດໂດຍໃຊ້ [code]hello_world_plugin/"
"HelloWorld.release.aar[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]activity[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອອັບເດດເນື້ອຫາຂອງອົງປະກອບ "
"[code]activity[/code] ໃນ Android manifest ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]application[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອອັບເດດເນື້ອຫາຂອງອົງປະກອບ "
"[code]application[/code] ໃນ Android manifest ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]manifest[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Virtual method ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບ. ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກເພື່ອອັບເດດເນື້ອຫາຂອງອົງປະກອບ "
"[code]manifest[/code] ໃນ Android manifest ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Android ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build]."

msgid ""
"Return a hash based on the configuration passed (for both scenes and "
"resources). This helps keep separate caches for separate export "
"configurations.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_resources] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _customize_resource] and [method _customize_scene] will "
"not be called when the [EditorExportPlugin] script is modified unless this "
"hash changes too."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າແຮຊ (hash) ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງມາ (ທັງສາກ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນ). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັກສາແຄຊ "
"(caches) ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບເມທອດນີ້ ຫາກ [method _begin_customize_resources] ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method _customize_resource] ແລະ [method _customize_scene] "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອສະຄຣິບ [EditorExportPlugin] ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຄ່າແຮຊນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"Return a [PackedStringArray] of additional features this preset, for the "
"given [param platform], should have."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [PackedStringArray] ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ພຣີເຊັດນີ້ຄວນມີ ສຳລັບ [param platform] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns the visibility for the specified [param "
"platform]. The default implementation returns [code]true[/code] for all "
"options."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ [param option] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (visibility) ສຳລັບ [param "
"platform] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ການເຮັດວຽກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ສຳລັບທຸກຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Check the requirements for the given [param option] and return a non-empty "
"warning string if they are not met.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method get_option] to check the value of the export options."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບ [param option] ທີ່ກຳນົດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນຫາກບໍ່ຄົບຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຊ້ [method get_option] ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄ່າຂອງຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Return a list of export options that can be configured for this export "
"plugin.\n"
"Each element in the return value is a [Dictionary] with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]option[/code]: A dictionary with the structure documented by [method "
"Object.get_property_list], but all keys are optional.\n"
"- [code]default_value[/code]: The default value for this option.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility[/code]: An optional boolean value. If set to "
"[code]true[/code], the preset will emit [signal Object.property_list_changed] "
"when the option is changed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ສຳລັບປລັກອິນການສົ່ງອອກນີ້.\n"
"ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບໃນຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີຄີ (keys) ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"- [code]option[/code]: Dictionary ທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [method "
"Object.get_property_list], ແຕ່ທຸກຄີແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ.\n"
"- [code]default_value[/code]: ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກນີ້.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility[/code]: ຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean). ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ພຣີເຊັດຈະສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal Object.property_list_changed] ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Return a [Dictionary] of override values for export options, that will be "
"used instead of user-provided values. Overridden options will be hidden from "
"the user interface.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class MyExportPlugin extends EditorExportPlugin:\n"
"\tfunc _get_name() -> String:\n"
"\t\treturn \"MyExportPlugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _supports_platform(platform) -> bool:\n"
"\t\tif platform is EditorExportPlatformPC:\n"
"\t\t\t# Run on all desktop platforms including Windows, MacOS and Linux.\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _get_export_options_overrides(platform) -> Dictionary:\n"
"\t\t# Override \"Embed PCK\" to always be enabled.\n"
"\t\treturn {\n"
"\t\t\t\"binary_format/embed_pck\": true,\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແທນ (override) ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ແທນຄ່າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງຈາກສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class MyExportPlugin extends EditorExportPlugin:\n"
"\tfunc _get_name() -> String:\n"
"\t\treturn \"MyExportPlugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _supports_platform(platform) -> bool:\n"
"\t\tif platform is EditorExportPlatformPC:\n"
"\t\t\t# ແລ່ນເທິງທຸກແພລັດຟອມເດັສທັອບ ລວມມີ Windows, MacOS ແລະ Linux.\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _get_export_options_overrides(platform) -> Dictionary:\n"
"\t\t# ປ່ຽນແທນ \"Embed PCK\" ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ.\n"
"\t\treturn {\n"
"\t\t\t\"binary_format/embed_pck\": true,\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Return the name identifier of this plugin (for future identification by the "
"exporter). The plugins are sorted by name before exporting.\n"
"Implementing this method is required."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້ (ເພື່ອໃຊ້ລະບຸໂດຍຕົວສົ່ງອອກໃນອະນາຄົດ). "
"ປລັກອິນຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມຊື່ກ່ອນການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບເມທອດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the result of [method _get_export_options] has "
"changed and the export options of the preset corresponding to [param "
"platform] should be updated."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຜົນຂອງ [method _get_export_options] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ "
"ຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກຂອງພຣີເຊັດທີ່ກົງກັບ [param platform] ຄວນຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the plugin supports the given [param platform]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປລັກອິນຮອງຮັບ [param platform] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Provide access to the Android prebuilt manifest and allows the plugin to "
"modify it if needed.\n"
"Implementers of this virtual method should take the binary manifest data from "
"[param manifest_data], copy it, modify it, and then return it with the "
"modifications.\n"
"If no modifications are needed, then an empty [PackedByteArray] should be "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Android prebuilt manifest ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປລັກອິນແກ້ໄຂມັນໄດ້ຫາກຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"ຜູ້ທີ່ຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງຮອງຮັບ virtual method ນີ້ ຄວນເອົາຂໍ້ມູນ manifest ແບບໄບນາຣີຈາກ [param "
"manifest_data], ສຳເນົາມັນ, ແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນສົ່ງຄືນພ້ອມກັບສ່ວນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂໃດໆ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [PackedByteArray] ວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Adds an Apple embedded platform bundle file from the given [param path] to "
"the exported project."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ bundle ຂອງແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວຂອງ Apple ຈາກ [param path] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Adds C++ code to the Apple embedded platform export. The final code is "
"created from the code appended by each active export plugin."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດ C++ ເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວຂອງ Apple. "
"ໂໂຄ້ດສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກໂຄ້ດທີ່ເພີ່ມໂດຍແຕ່ລະປລັກອິນການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Adds a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to the Linking Phase in the "
"Apple embedded platform's Xcode project and embeds it into the resulting "
"binary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For static libraries (*.a), this works in the same way as "
"[method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used for System libraries as they are "
"already present on the device."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) ເຂົ້າໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ (Linking "
"Phase) ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode ຂອງແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວ Apple ແລະ ຝັງມັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີຜົນລັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ static libraries (*.a), ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ [method "
"add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບ System libraries ເພາະພວກມັນມີຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Adds a static library (*.a) or a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to "
"the Linking Phase to the Apple embedded platform's Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ static library (*.a) ຫຼື dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) "
"ເຂົ້າໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ (Linking Phase) ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode ແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວ Apple."

msgid "Adds linker flags for the Apple embedded platform export."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ linker flags ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວຂອງ Apple."

msgid ""
"Adds additional fields to the Apple embedded platform's project Info.plist "
"file."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟີວ (fields) ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ Info.plist ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວ Apple."

msgid ""
"Adds a static library from the given [param path] to the Apple embedded "
"platform project."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ static library ຈາກ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກແພລັດຟອມແບບຝັງຕົວ Apple."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom file to be exported. [param path] is the virtual path that can "
"be used to load the file, [param file] is the binary data of the file.\n"
"When called inside [method _export_file] and [param remap] is [code]true[/"
"code], the current file will not be exported, but instead remapped to this "
"custom file. [param remap] is ignored when called in other places.\n"
"[param file] will not be imported, so consider using [method "
"_customize_resource] to remap imported resources."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ. [param path] ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງສະເມືອນ (virtual path) "
"ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌, [param file] ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີຂອງໄຟລ໌.\n"
"ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ [method _export_file] ແລະ [param remap] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ໄຟລ໌ປັດຈຸບັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ແຕ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ (remap) ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ແບບກຳນົດເອງນີ້ແທນ. [param "
"remap] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນອື່ນ.\n"
"[param file] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ (import), ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"_customize_resource] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_bundle_file] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_bundle_file] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds an iOS bundle file from the given [param path] to the exported project."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ iOS bundle ຈາກ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_cpp_code] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_cpp_code] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds C++ code to the iOS export. The final code is created from the code "
"appended by each active export plugin."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດ C++ ເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກ iOS. "
"ໂຄ້ດສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກໂຄ້ດທີ່ເພີ່ມໂດຍແຕ່ລະປລັກອິນການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_embedded_framework] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_embedded_framework] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to Linking Phase in iOS's Xcode "
"project and embeds it into resulting binary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For static libraries (*.a), this works the in same way as "
"[method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used for System libraries as they are "
"already present on the device."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) ເຂົ້າໃນ Linking Phase ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode "
"ຂອງ iOS ແລະ ຝັງມັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີຜົນລັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ static libraries (*.a), ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ [method "
"add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບ System libraries ເພາະພວກມັນມີຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a static library (*.a) or a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to "
"the Linking Phase to the iOS Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ static library (*.a) ຫຼື dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) ເຂົ້າໃນ "
"Linking Phase ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ Xcode iOS."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_linker_flags] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_linker_flags] ແທນ."

msgid "Adds linker flags for the iOS export."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ linker flags ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກ iOS."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_plist_content] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_plist_content] ແທນ."

msgid "Adds additional fields to the iOS project Info.plist file."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຟີວເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ Info.plist ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ iOS."

msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_project_static_lib] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_apple_embedded_platform_project_static_lib] ແທນ."

msgid "Adds a static library from the given [param path] to the iOS project."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ static library ຈາກ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ iOS."

msgid ""
"Adds file or directory matching [param path] to [code]PlugIns[/code] "
"directory of macOS app bundle.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is useful only for macOS exports."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ກົງກັບ [param path] ເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]PlugIns[/code] ຂອງ macOS "
"app bundle.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເພາະການສົ່ງອອກ macOS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a shared object or a directory containing only shared objects with the "
"given [param tags] and destination [param path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In case of macOS exports, those shared objects will be added to "
"[code]Frameworks[/code] directory of app bundle.\n"
"In case of a directory code-sign will error if you place non code object in "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ shared object ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ບັນຈຸສະເພາະ shared objects ພ້ອມກັບ [param tags] ທີ່ກຳນົດ "
"ແລະ [param path] ປາຍທາງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງການສົ່ງອອກ macOS, shared objects ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີ "
"[code]Frameworks[/code] ຂອງ app bundle.\n"
"ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງໂຟນເດີ, ການລົງລາຍເຊັນໂຄ້ດ (code-sign) "
"ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກທ່ານວາງວັດຖຸທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂຄ້ດໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ."

msgid "Returns currently used export platform."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns currently used export preset."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພຣີເຊັດການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current value of an export option supplied by [method "
"_get_export_options]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ [method _get_export_options]."

msgid ""
"To be called inside [method _export_file]. Skips the current file, so it's "
"not included in the export."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ [method _export_file]. ຈະຂ້າມໄຟລ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Export preset configuration."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣີເຊັດການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Represents the configuration of an export preset, as created by the editor's "
"export dialog. An [EditorExportPreset] instance is intended to be used a read-"
"only configuration passed to the [EditorExportPlatform] methods when "
"exporting the project."
msgstr ""
"ຕາງໜ້າໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພຣີເຊັດການສົ່ງອອກ ຕາມທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ "
"(instance) ຂອງ [EditorExportPreset] "
"ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາເມທອດ [EditorExportPlatform] "
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the \"Advanced\" toggle is enabled in the export "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ \"Advanced\" (ຂັ້ນສູງ) ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns a comma-separated list of custom features added to this preset, as a "
"string. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]Feature tags[/"
"url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນພຣີເຊັດນີ້ ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]Feature tags[/url] "
"ໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of files selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the export "
"dialog. The dictionary's keys are file paths, and its values are the "
"corresponding export modes: [code]\"strip\"[/code], [code]\"keep\"[/code], or "
"[code]\"remove\"[/code]. See also [method get_file_export_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ dictionary ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນແທັບ \"Resources\" ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ຄີ (keys) "
"ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຄ່າ (values) ແມ່ນໂໝດການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ: [code]\"strip\"[/code], "
"[code]\"keep\"[/code], ຫຼື [code]\"remove\"[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"get_file_export_mode] ປະກອບນຳ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of files selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the export "
"dialog."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນແທັບ \"Resources\" ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if PCK directory encryption is enabled in the "
"export dialog."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂຟນເດີ PCK ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if PCK encryption is enabled in the export dialog."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns file filters to exclude during PCK encryption."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຕອງໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK."

msgid "Returns file filters to include during PCK encryption."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຕອງໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK."

msgid "Returns PCK encryption key."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄີ (key) ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ PCK."

msgid "Returns file filters to exclude during export."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຕອງໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns export file filter mode selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the "
"export dialog."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດຕົວຕອງໄຟລ໌ການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ເລືອກໃນແທັບ \"Resources\" ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns export target path."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງປາຍທາງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns file export mode for the specified file."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns array of files to export."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Returns file filters to include during export."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຕອງໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns export option value or value of environment variable if it is set."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ຄ່າຂອງຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຫາກມີການຕັ້ງໄວ້."

msgid "Returns the list of packs on which to base a patch export on."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການແພັກ (packs) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກແພັດ (patch)."

msgid "Returns this export preset's name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງພຣີເຊັດການສົ່ງອອກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting identified by [param name] using export "
"preset feature tag overrides instead of current OS features."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param name] ໂດຍໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແທນ (overrides) "
"ຂອງແທັກຄຸນສົມບັດໃນພຣີເຊັດການສົ່ງອອກ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ OS ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the export mode used by GDScript files. [code]0[/code] for \"Text\", "
"[code]1[/code] for \"Binary tokens\", and [code]2[/code] for \"Compressed "
"binary tokens (smaller files)\"."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂໝດການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໄຟລ໌ GDScript. [code]0[/code] ສຳລັບ \"Text\", [code]1[/"
"code] ສຳລັບ \"Binary tokens\", ແລະ [code]2[/code] ສຳລັບ \"Compressed binary "
"tokens (ໄຟລ໌ນ້ອຍກວ່າ)\"."

msgid ""
"Returns the preset's version number, or fall back to the [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] project setting if set to an "
"empty string.\n"
"If [param windows_version] is [code]true[/code], formats the returned version "
"number to be compatible with Windows executable metadata."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເລກເວີຊັນຂອງພຣີເຊັດ, ຫາກເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກ [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version].\n"
"ຫາກ [param windows_version] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະຈັດຮູບແບບເລກເວີຊັນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງໄຟລ໌ປະຕິບັດການ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the preset has the property named [param "
"property]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກພຣີເຊັດມີຄຸນສົມບັດ (property) ຊື່ [param property]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file at the specified [param path] will be "
"exported."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param path] ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dedicated server export mode is selected in "
"the export dialog."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກເລືອກໂໝດການສົ່ງອອກເປັນເຊີບເວີສະເພາະ (dedicated server) "
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the \"Runnable\" toggle is enabled in the export "
"dialog."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບ \"Runnable\" ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"An editor feature profile which can be used to disable specific features."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"An editor feature profile can be used to disable specific features of the "
"Godot editor. When disabled, the features won't appear in the editor, which "
"makes the editor less cluttered. This is useful in education settings to "
"reduce confusion or when working in a team. For example, artists and level "
"designers could use a feature profile that disables the script editor to "
"avoid accidentally making changes to files they aren't supposed to edit.\n"
"To manage editor feature profiles visually, use [b]Editor > Manage Feature "
"Profiles...[/b] at the top of the editor window."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດຄຸນສົມບັດສະເພາະຂອງ Godot editor ໄດ້. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂເບິ່ງເປັນລະບຽບຂຶ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮຽນການສອນເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສັບສົນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກເປັນທີມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສິລະປິນ ແລະ "
"ຜູ້ອອກແບບດ່ານ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ງານຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ.\n"
"ເພື່ອຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [b]Editor > Manage Feature Profiles...[/b] "
"ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Returns the specified [param feature]'s human-readable name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ທີ່ຄົນສາມາດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ຂອງ [param feature] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the class specified by [param class_name] is "
"disabled. When disabled, the class won't appear in the Create New Node dialog."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param class_name] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຄລາສນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງໂນດໃໝ່ (Create New Node)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if editing for the class specified by [param "
"class_name] is disabled. When disabled, the class will still appear in the "
"Create New Node dialog but the Inspector will be read-only when selecting a "
"node that extends the class."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກການແກ້ໄຂຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param class_name] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຄລາສຈະຍັງປາກົດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງໂນດໃໝ່ ແຕ່ໃນ Inspector "
"ຈະເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາສນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param property] is disabled in the class "
"specified by [param class_name]. When a property is disabled, it won't appear "
"in the Inspector when selecting a node that extends the class specified by "
"[param class_name]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param property] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"class_name]. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນ Inspector ເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາສນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param feature] is disabled. When a feature "
"is disabled, it will disappear from the editor entirely."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param feature] ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ມັນຈະຫາຍໄປຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Loads an editor feature profile from a file. The file must follow the JSON "
"format obtained by using the feature profile manager's [b]Export[/b] button "
"or the [method save_to_file] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are loaded from "
"the [code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the "
"[code].profile[/code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be found "
"by using [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດຈາກໄຟລ໌. ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ JSON ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກການກົດປຸ່ມ [b]Export[/b] "
"ໃນຕົວຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ຈາກເມທອດ [method save_to_file].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຜ່ານສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຈາກໂຟນເດີ [code]feature_profiles[/"
"code] ເປັນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].profile[/code]. "
"ໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."

msgid ""
"Saves the editor feature profile to a file in JSON format. It can then be "
"imported using the feature profile manager's [b]Import[/b] button or the "
"[method load_from_file] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are saved in the "
"[code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the [code].profile[/"
"code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be found by using "
"[method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຮູບແບບ JSON. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ [b]Import[/b] "
"ໃນຕົວຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ເມທອດ [method load_from_file].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຜ່ານສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]feature_profiles[/"
"code] ເປັນໄຟລ໌ນາມສະກຸນ [code].profile[/code]. "
"ໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."

msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables the class specified by "
"[param class_name]. When disabled, the class won't appear in the Create New "
"Node dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param disable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"class_name]. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຄລາສນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງໂນດໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables editing for the class "
"specified by [param class_name]. When disabled, the class will still appear "
"in the Create New Node dialog but the Inspector will be read-only when "
"selecting a node that extends the class."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param disable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການແກ້ໄຂຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param "
"class_name]. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຄລາສຈະຍັງປາກົດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງໂນດໃໝ່ ແຕ່ໃນ Inspector "
"ຈະເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables editing for [param "
"property] in the class specified by [param class_name]. When a property is "
"disabled, it won't appear in the Inspector when selecting a node that extends "
"the class specified by [param class_name]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param disable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການແກ້ໄຂ [param property] "
"ໃນຄລາສທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param class_name]. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables the editor feature "
"specified in [param feature]. When a feature is disabled, it will disappear "
"from the editor entirely."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ [param disable] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param "
"feature]. ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະຫາຍໄປຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor. If this feature is disabled, the 3D editor won't display but "
"3D nodes will still display in the Create New Node dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3D. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3D ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ ແຕ່ໂນດ 3D ຈະຍັງປາກົດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງໂນດໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The Script tab, which contains the script editor and class reference browser. "
"If this feature is disabled, the Script tab won't display."
msgstr ""
"ແທັບ Script ເຊິ່ງລວມມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຕົວເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຄລາສ. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແທັບ Script "
"ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"The Asset Store tab. If this feature is disabled, the Asset Store tab won't "
"display."
msgstr "ແທັບ Asset Store (ຮ້ານຄ້າຊັບສິນ). ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແທັບ Asset Store ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"Scene tree editing. If this feature is disabled, the Scene tree dock will "
"still be visible but will be read-only."
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂລຳດັບຊັ້ນສາກ (Scene tree). ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແຖບ Scene tree "
"ຈະຍັງເຫັນຢູ່ແຕ່ຈະເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ."

msgid "Replaced by the Signals and Groups docks."
msgstr "ຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍແຖບ Signals (ສັນຍານ) ແລະ Groups (ກຸ່ມ)."

msgid ""
"The Node dock. If this feature is disabled, signals and groups won't be "
"visible and modifiable from the editor."
msgstr "ແຖບ Node. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ສັນຍານ ແລະ ກຸ່ມ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The FileSystem dock. If this feature is disabled, the FileSystem dock won't "
"be visible."
msgstr "ແຖບ FileSystem. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແຖບ FileSystem ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"The Import dock. If this feature is disabled, the Import dock won't be "
"visible."
msgstr "ແຖບ Import. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແຖບ Import ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"The History dock. If this feature is disabled, the History dock won't be "
"visible."
msgstr "ແຖບ History (ປະຫວັດ). ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ແຖບ History ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"The Game tab, which allows embedding the game window and selecting nodes by "
"clicking inside of it. If this feature is disabled, the Game tab won't "
"display."
msgstr ""
"ແທັບ Game ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຝັງໜ້າຕ່າງເກມ ແລະ ເລືອກໂນດໂດຍການກົດພາຍໃນນັ້ນໄດ້. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, "
"ແທັບ Game ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"The Signals dock. If this feature is disabled, signals won't be visible and "
"modifiable from the editor."
msgstr "ແຖບ Signals. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ສັນຍານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The Groups dock. If this feature is disabled, groups won't be visible and "
"modifiable from the editor."
msgstr "ແຖບ Groups. ຫາກປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ກຸ່ມຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "A modified version of [FileDialog] used by the editor."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງຂອງ [FileDialog] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

msgid ""
"[EditorFileDialog] is a [FileDialog] tweaked to work in the editor. It "
"automatically handles favorite and recent directory lists, and synchronizes "
"some properties with their corresponding editor settings.\n"
"[EditorFileDialog] will automatically show a native dialog based on the "
"[member EditorSettings.interface/editor/appearance/use_native_file_dialogs] "
"editor setting and ignores [member FileDialog.use_native_dialog].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [EditorFileDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, "
"call one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such "
"as [method Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux and macOS, sandboxed apps always use native dialogs to "
"access the host file system."
msgstr ""
"[EditorFileDialog] ແມ່ນ [FileDialog] ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ມັນຈະຈັດການລາຍການໂຟນເດີທີ່ມັກ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ "
"ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[EditorFileDialog] ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ແບບ native ຂອງລະບົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/appearance/"
"use_native_file_dialogs] ແລະ ຈະລະເລີຍຄ່າ [member "
"FileDialog.use_native_dialog].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [EditorFileDialog] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງ, "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]popup_*[/code] ຈາກ [Window], ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເທິງ Linux ແລະ macOS, ແອັບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນແຊນບັອກ (sandboxed apps) "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບ native ສະເໝີເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຮສ."

msgid "This feature is no longer supported."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"This method is kept for compatibility and does nothing. As an alternative, "
"you can display another dialog after showing the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການເຮັດວຽກໃດໆ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນແທນໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Use [member FileDialog.overwrite_warning_enabled] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member FileDialog.overwrite_warning_enabled] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [EditorFileDialog] will not warn the user before "
"overwriting files."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [EditorFileDialog] ຈະບໍ່ເຕືອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Resource filesystem, as the editor sees it."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຕາມທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂເບິ່ງເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"This object holds information of all resources in the filesystem, their "
"types, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_resource_filesystem]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ປະເພດຂອງພວກມັນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄວນສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorInterface.get_resource_filesystem]."

msgid ""
"Returns the resource type of the file, given the full path. This returns a "
"string such as [code]\"Resource\"[/code] or [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], "
"[i]not[/i] a file extension such as [code]\".gd\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຊັ່ນ [code]"
"\"Resource\"[/code] ຫຼື [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]\".gd\"[/code]."

msgid "Gets the root directory object."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາວັດຖຸໂຟນເດີຮາກ (root directory)."

msgid "Returns a view into the filesystem at [param path]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນມຸມມອງເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param path]."

msgid "Returns the scan progress for 0 to 1 if the FS is being scanned."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການສະແກນຕັ້ງແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1 ຫາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ກຳລັງຖືກສະແກນ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if resources are currently being imported."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຊັບພະຍາກອນກຳລັງຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the filesystem is being scanned."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ກຳລັງຖືກສະແກນ."

msgid ""
"Reimports a set of files. Call this if these files or their [code].import[/"
"code] files were directly edited by script or an external program.\n"
"If the file type changed or the file was newly created, use [method "
"update_file] or [method scan].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function blocks until the import is finished. However, the "
"main loop iteration, including timers and [method Node._process], will occur "
"during the import process due to progress bar updates. Avoid calls to [method "
"reimport_files] or [method scan] while an import is in progress."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າຊຸດໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ (Reimports). ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຫາກໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ [code].import[/code] "
"ຂອງພວກມັນຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍກົງຜ່ານສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ຫາກປະເພດໄຟລ໌ປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method update_file] ຫຼື [method scan] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບລັອກການເຮັດວຽກຈົນກວ່າການນຳເຂົ້າຈະສຳເລັດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, main loop "
"ຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (ລວມທັງ timers ແລະ [method Node._process]) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມີການອັບເດດແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ. ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method reimport_files] ຫຼື "
"[method scan] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການນຳເຂົ້າກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່."

msgid "Scan the filesystem for changes."
msgstr "ສະແກນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຊອກຫາການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Check if the source of any imported resource changed."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Add a file in an existing directory, or schedule file information to be "
"updated on editor restart. Can be used to update text files saved by an "
"external program.\n"
"This will not import the file. To reimport, call [method reimport_files] or "
"[method scan] methods."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຢູ່, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງກຳນົດການໃຫ້ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບັນທຶກໂດຍໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌. ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method reimport_files] ຫຼື [method scan]."

msgid "Emitted if the filesystem changed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted if a resource is reimported."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາກຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ (reimported)."

msgid "Emitted before a resource is reimported."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານກ່ອນທີ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Emitted if at least one resource is reloaded when the filesystem is scanned."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາກມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໂຫຼດໃໝ່ເມື່ອລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຖືກສະແກນ."

msgid "Emitted when the list of global script classes gets updated."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອລາຍການຂອງຄລາສສະຄຣິບທົ່ວໂລກ (global script classes) ຖືກອັບເດດ."

msgid "Emitted if the source of any imported file changed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາກໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "A directory for the resource filesystem."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີສຳລັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ."

msgid "A more generalized, low-level variation of the directory concept."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ລະດັບຕໍ່າຂອງແນວຄິດເລື່ອງໂຟນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the directory with name [param name] or [code]-1[/code] "
"if not found."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຊື່ [param name] ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the file with name [param name] or [code]-1[/code] if "
"not found."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param name] ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກບໍ່ພົບ."

msgid "Returns the name of the file at index [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the number of files in this directory."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file at index [param idx] imported properly."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx] ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Returns the path to the file at index [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Returns the base class of the script class defined in the file at index "
"[param idx]. If the file doesn't define a script class using the "
"[code]class_name[/code] syntax, this will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງຄລາສສະຄຣິບທີ່ກຳນົດໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]. "
"ຫາກໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄລາສສະຄຣິບໂດຍໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນ [code]class_name[/code], ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the script class defined in the file at index [param "
"idx]. If the file doesn't define a script class using the [code]class_name[/"
"code] syntax, this will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງຄລາສສະຄຣິບທີ່ກຳນົດໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]. "
"ຫາກໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄລາສສະຄຣິບໂດຍໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນ [code]class_name[/code], ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the resource type of the file at index [param idx]. This returns a "
"string such as [code]\"Resource\"[/code] or [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], "
"[i]not[/i] a file extension such as [code]\".gd\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]. ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຊັ່ນ [code]"
"\"Resource\"[/code] ຫຼື [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]\".gd\"[/code]."

msgid "Returns the name of this directory."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງໂຟນເດີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the parent directory for this directory or [code]null[/code] if "
"called on a directory at [code]res://[/code] or [code]user://[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ (parent) ຂອງໂຟນເດີນີ້ ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຫາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ "
"[code]res://[/code] ຫຼື [code]user://[/code]."

msgid "Returns the path to this directory."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີນີ້."

msgid "Returns the subdirectory at index [param idx]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param idx]."

msgid "Returns the number of subdirectories in this directory."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍໃນໂຟນເດີນີ້."

msgid "Used to query and configure import format support."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບການນຳເຂົ້າ (import format)."

msgid ""
"This class is used to query and configure a certain import format. It is used "
"in conjunction with asset format import plugins."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສອບຖາມ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການນຳເຂົ້າບາງຢ່າງ. "
"ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບປລັກອິນການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບແບບຊັບສິນ (asset format import plugins)."

msgid "Return the file extensions supported."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Return whether this importer is active."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Query support. Return [code]false[/code] if import must not continue."
msgstr "ສອບຖາມການຮອງຮັບ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ຫາກການນຳເຂົ້າບໍ່ຄວນດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Registers a custom resource importer in the editor. Use the class to parse "
"any file and import it as a new resource type."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ໃຊ້ຄລາສນີ້ເພື່ອແຍກອົງປະກອບ (parse) "
"ໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມັນເປັນປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"[EditorImportPlugin]s provide a way to extend the editor's resource import "
"functionality. Use them to import resources from custom files or to provide "
"alternatives to the editor's existing importers.\n"
"EditorImportPlugins work by associating with specific file extensions and a "
"resource type. See [method _get_recognized_extensions] and [method "
"_get_resource_type]. They may optionally specify some import presets that "
"affect the import process. EditorImportPlugins are responsible for creating "
"the resources and saving them in the [code].godot/imported[/code] directory "
"(see [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory]).\n"
"Below is an example EditorImportPlugin that imports a [Mesh] from a file with "
"the extension \".special\" or \".spec\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorImportPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _get_importer_name():\n"
"\treturn \"my.special.plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_visible_name():\n"
"\treturn \"Special Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"]\n"
"\n"
"func _get_save_extension():\n"
"\treturn \"mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_resource_type():\n"
"\treturn \"Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_count():\n"
"\treturn 1\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_name(preset_index):\n"
"\treturn \"Default\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_import_options(path, preset_index):\n"
"\treturn [{\"name\": \"my_option\", \"default_value\": false}]\n"
"\n"
"func _import(source_file, save_path, options, platform_variants, gen_files):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(source_file, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tif file == null:\n"
"\t\treturn FAILED\n"
"\tvar mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"\t# Fill the Mesh with data read in \"file\", left as an exercise to the "
"reader.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar filename = save_path + \".\" + _get_save_extension()\n"
"\treturn ResourceSaver.save(mesh, filename)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MySpecialPlugin : EditorImportPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetImporterName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"my.special.plugin\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetVisibleName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Special Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetSaveExtension()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetResourceType()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override int _GetPresetCount()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetPresetName(int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Default\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetImportOptions(string path, int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\t\t[\n"
"\t\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"myOption\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"default_value\", false },\n"
"\t\t\t},\n"
"\t\t];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Error _Import(string sourceFile, string savePath, "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary options, Godot.Collections.Array<string> "
"platformVariants, Godot.Collections.Array<string> genFiles)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(sourceFile, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tif (file.GetError() != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\treturn Error.Failed;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tvar mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"\t\t// Fill the Mesh with data read in \"file\", left as an exercise to the "
"reader.\n"
"\t\tstring filename = $\"{savePath}.{_GetSaveExtension()}\";\n"
"\t\treturn ResourceSaver.Save(mesh, filename);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To use [EditorImportPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_import_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorImportPlugin] ໃຫ້ວິທີການຂະຫຍາຍຟັງຊັນການນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ໃຊ້ພວກມັນເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຈາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອເປັນທາງເລືອກໃຫ້ກັບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"EditorImportPlugins ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ສະເພາະ ແລະ ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ [method _get_recognized_extensions] ແລະ [method _get_resource_type]. "
"ພວກມັນອາດຈະກຳນົດຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າລ່ວງໜ້າບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. EditorImportPlugins "
"ມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກພວກມັນໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [code].godot/imported[/"
"code] (ເບິ່ງ [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory]).\n"
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງ EditorImportPlugin ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ [Mesh] ຈາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ \".special\" "
"ຫຼື \".spec\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorImportPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _get_importer_name():\n"
"\treturn \"my.special.plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_visible_name():\n"
"\treturn \"ເມຊພິເສດ\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"]\n"
"\n"
"func _get_save_extension():\n"
"\treturn \"mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_resource_type():\n"
"\treturn \"Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_count():\n"
"\treturn 1\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_name(preset_index):\n"
"\treturn \"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_import_options(path, preset_index):\n"
"\treturn [{\"name\": \"my_option\", \"default_value\": false}]\n"
"\n"
"func _import(source_file, save_path, options, platform_variants, gen_files):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(source_file, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tif file == null:\n"
"\t\treturn FAILED\n"
"\tvar mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"\t# ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ Mesh ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອ່ານໃນ \"file\", ເຊິ່ງປະໄວ້ເປັນບົດຝຶກຫັດສຳລັບຜູ້ອ່ານ.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar filename = save_path + \".\" + _get_save_extension()\n"
"\treturn ResourceSaver.save(mesh, filename)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MySpecialPlugin : EditorImportPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetImporterName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"my.special.plugin\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetVisibleName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"ເມຊພິເສດ\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetSaveExtension()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetResourceType()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override int _GetPresetCount()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetPresetName(int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetImportOptions(string path, int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\t\t[\n"
"\t\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"myOption\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"default_value\", false },\n"
"\t\t\t},\n"
"\t\t];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Error _Import(string sourceFile, string savePath, "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary options, Godot.Collections.Array<string> "
"platformVariants, Godot.Collections.Array<string> genFiles)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(sourceFile, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tif (file.GetError() != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\treturn Error.Failed;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tvar mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"\t\t// ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ Mesh ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອ່ານໃນ \"file\", ເຊິ່ງປະໄວ້ເປັນບົດຝຶກຫັດສຳລັບຜູ້ອ່ານ.\n"
"\t\tstring filename = $\"{savePath}.{_GetSaveExtension()}\";\n"
"\t\treturn ResourceSaver.Save(mesh, filename);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ [EditorImportPlugin], ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນມັນໂດຍການໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_import_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Import plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນການນຳເຂົ້າ"

msgid ""
"Tells whether this importer can be run in parallel on threads, or, on the "
"contrary, it's only safe for the editor to call it from the main thread, for "
"one file at a time.\n"
"If this importer's implementation is thread-safe and can be run in parallel, "
"override this with [code]true[/code] to optimize for concurrency.\n"
"If not overridden, returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ບອກວ່າຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ສາມາດແລ່ນແບບຂະໜານເທິງເທຣດ (threads) ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ຫຼື ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, "
"ມັນປອດໄພສະເພາະການເອີ້ນຈາກ main thread ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂເທື່ອລະໄຟລ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ເປັນແບບ thread-safe ແລະ ສາມາດແລ່ນຂະໜານໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍ "
"[code]true[/code] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the format version of this importer. Increment this version when making "
"incompatible changes to the format of the imported resources.\n"
"If not overridden, the format version is [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາເວີຊັນຮູບແບບຂອງຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້. "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເລກເວີຊັນນີ້ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າເຊິ່ງບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບເວີຊັນເກົ່າ.\n"
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນທັບ, ເວີຊັນຮູບແບບຈະເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the options and default values for the preset at this index. Returns an "
"Array of Dictionaries with the following keys: [code]name[/code], "
"[code]default_value[/code], [code]property_hint[/code] (optional), "
"[code]hint_string[/code] (optional), [code]usage[/code] (optional)."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາຕົວເລືອກ ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບພຣີເຊັດທີ່ດັດຊະນີນີ້. ສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ Array ຂອງ Dictionaries "
"ທີ່ມີຄີດັ່ງນີ້: [code]name[/code], [code]default_value[/code], [code]property_hint[/"
"code] (ທາງເລືອກ), [code]hint_string[/code] (ທາງເລືອກ), [code]usage[/code] "
"(ທາງເລືອກ)."

msgid ""
"Gets the order of this importer to be run when importing resources. Importers "
"with [i]lower[/i] import orders will be called first, and higher values will "
"be called later. Use this to ensure the importer runs after the dependencies "
"are already imported. The default import order is [code]0[/code] unless "
"overridden by a specific importer. See [enum ResourceImporter.ImportOrder] "
"for some predefined values."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້. ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ມີລຳດັບ [i]ຕໍ່າກວ່າ[/i] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນ, ແລະ "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກເອີ້ນທີຫຼັງ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ dependencies "
"ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ. ລຳດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]0[/code]. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"ResourceImporter.ImportOrder] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

msgid "Gets the unique name of the importer."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຊື່ສະເພາະ (unique name) ຂອງຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Gets the number of initial presets defined by the plugin. Use [method "
"_get_import_options] to get the default options for the preset and [method "
"_get_preset_name] to get the name of the preset.\n"
"By default, there are no presets."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາຈຳນວນພຣີເຊັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍປລັກອິນ. ໃຊ້ [method _get_import_options] "
"ເພື່ອດຶງຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ [method _get_preset_name] ເພື່ອດຶງຊື່ຂອງພຣີເຊັດ.\n"
"ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ມີພຣີເຊັດ."

msgid "Gets the name of the options preset at this index."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຊື່ຂອງພຣີເຊັດຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດັດຊະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Gets the priority of this plugin for the recognized extension. Higher "
"priority plugins will be preferred. The default priority is [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (priority) ຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້ສຳລັບນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. "
"ປລັກອິນທີ່ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກເລືອກໃຊ້ກ່ອນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the list of file extensions to associate with this loader (case-"
"insensitive). e.g. [code][\"obj\"][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາລາຍການນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້ (ບໍ່ແຍກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ). ເຊັ່ນ [code]"
"[\"obj\"][/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the Godot resource type associated with this loader. e.g. [code]"
"\"Mesh\"[/code] or [code]\"Animation\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນ Godot ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຕົວໂຫຼດນີ້. ເຊັ່ນ [code]\"Mesh\"[/code] ຫຼື [code]"
"\"Animation\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the extension used to save this resource in the [code].godot/imported[/"
"code] directory (see [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົານາມສະກຸນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ [code].godot/imported[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the name to display in the import window. You should choose this name as "
"a continuation to \"Import as\", e.g. \"Import as Special Mesh\"."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາຊື່ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ. ທ່ານຄວນເລືອກຊື່ນີ້ເພື່ອຕໍ່ທ້າຍຄຳວ່າ \"ນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ\", ເຊັ່ນ "
"\"ນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ Special Mesh\"."

msgid ""
"Imports [param source_file] with the import [param options] specified. Should "
"return [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if the import is successful, other values "
"indicate failure.\n"
"The imported resource is expected to be saved to [code]save_path + \".\" + "
"_get_save_extension()[/code]. If a different variant is preferred for a "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]feature tag[/url], save the "
"variant to [code]save_path + \".\" + tag + \".\" + _get_save_extension()[/"
"code] and add the feature tag to [param platform_variants].\n"
"If additional resource files are generated in the resource filesystem "
"([code]res://[/code]), add their full path to [param gen_files] so that the "
"editor knows they depend on [param source_file].\n"
"This method must be overridden to do the actual importing work. See this "
"class' description for an example of overriding this method."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າ [param source_file] ດ້ວຍ [param options] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [constant "
"@GlobalScope.OK] ຫາກນຳເຂົ້າສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຄວນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ທີ່ [code]save_path + \".\" + _get_save_extension()[/"
"code]. ຫາກມີເວີຊັນແຍກຕາມ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]feature tag[/url], ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ທີ່ [code]save_path + \".\" + tag "
"+ \".\" + _get_save_extension()[/code] ແລະ ເພີ່ມແທັກນັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນ [param "
"platform_variants].\n"
"ຫາກມີໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນເພີ່ມເຕີມຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ [code]res://[/code], "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນຂອງພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ [param gen_files] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນຂຶ້ນກັບ [param "
"source_file].\n"
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂຽນທັບເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກນຳເຂົ້າຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"This function can only be called during the [method _import] callback and it "
"allows manually importing resources from it. This is useful when the imported "
"file generates external resources that require importing (as example, "
"images). Custom parameters for the \".import\" file can be passed via the "
"[param custom_options]. Additionally, in cases where multiple importers can "
"handle a file, the [param custom_importer] can be specified to force a "
"specific one. This function performs a resource import and returns "
"immediately with a success or error code. [param generator_parameters] "
"defines optional extra metadata which will be stored as [code skip-"
"lint]generator_parameters[/code] in the [code]remap[/code] section of the "
"[code].import[/code] file, for example to store a md5 hash of the source data."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _import] callback ແລະ "
"ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກທີ່ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າອີກຄັ້ງ (ເຊັ່ນ ຮູບພາບ). "
"ສາມາດສົ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ \".import\" ຜ່ານ [param custom_options] ໄດ້. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຫຼາຍອັນຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ, ສາມາດລະບຸ [param custom_importer] "
"ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງໄດ້."

msgid "A control used to edit properties of an object."
msgstr "ຄອນໂທຣລ (Control) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ຂອງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"This is the control that implements property editing in the editor's Settings "
"dialogs, the Inspector dock, etc. To get the [EditorInspector] used in the "
"editor's Inspector dock, use [method EditorInterface.get_inspector].\n"
"[EditorInspector] will show properties in the same order as the array "
"returned by [method Object.get_property_list].\n"
"If a property's name is path-like (i.e. if it contains forward slashes), "
"[EditorInspector] will create nested sections for \"directories\" along the "
"path. For example, if a property is named [code]highlighting/gdscript/"
"node_path_color[/code], it will be shown as \"Node Path Color\" inside the "
"\"GDScript\" section nested inside the \"Highlighting\" section.\n"
"If a property has [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP] usage, it will group "
"subsequent properties whose name starts with the property's hint string. The "
"group ends when a property does not start with that hint string or when a new "
"group starts. An empty group name effectively ends the current group. "
"[EditorInspector] will create a top-level section for each group. For "
"example, if a property with group usage is named [code]Collide With[/code] "
"and its hint string is [code]collide_with_[/code], a subsequent "
"[code]collide_with_area[/code] property will be shown as \"Area\" inside the "
"\"Collide With\" section. There is also a special case: when the hint string "
"contains the name of a property, that property is grouped too. This is mainly "
"to help grouping properties like [code]font[/code], [code]font_color[/code] "
"and [code]font_size[/code] (using the hint string [code]font_[/code]).\n"
"If a property has [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP] usage, a subgroup will "
"be created in the same way as a group, and a second-level section will be "
"created for each subgroup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike sections created from path-like property names, "
"[EditorInspector] won't capitalize the name for sections created from groups. "
"So properties with group usage usually use capitalized names instead of "
"snake_cased names."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄອນໂທຣລທີ່ຈັດການການແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແຖບ Inspector ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາ "
"[EditorInspector] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແຖບ Inspector ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"EditorInterface.get_inspector].\n"
"[EditorInspector] ຈະສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາຈາກ [method "
"Object.get_property_list].\n"
"ຫາກຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດມີລັກສະນະເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ (ເຊັ່ນ ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍທັບ /), [EditorInspector] ຈະສ້າງສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ "
"(nested sections) ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດມີການໃຊ້ງານແບບ [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP], "
"ມັນຈະຈັດກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕາມມາທີ່ມີຊື່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ hint string ຂອງກຸ່ມນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກຄຸນສົມບັດມີການໃຊ້ງານແບບ [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP], "
"ມັນຈະສ້າງກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບກຸ່ມຫຼັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກສ່ວນທີ່ສ້າງຈາກຊື່ແບບເສັ້ນທາງ, [EditorInspector] "
"ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດເປັນຕົວໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບສ່ວນທີ່ສ້າງຈາກກຸ່ມ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ກຸ່ມມັກຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ເປັນຕົວໃຫຍ່ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Collapses all foldable sections."
msgstr "ຫຍໍ້ທຸກສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດພັບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Creates an inspector with the same configuration as the one used in the "
"editor's Inspector dock. When passing a [LineEdit] into [param "
"filter_line_edit], the inspector will filter its properties based on [member "
"LineEdit.text] whenever [signal LineEdit.text_changed] is emitted."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ Inspector ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແຖບ Inspector ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອສົ່ງ "
"[LineEdit] ເຂົ້າໃນ [param filter_line_edit], Inspector ຈະກອງຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ "
"[member LineEdit.text]."

msgid ""
"Shows the properties of the given [param object] in this inspector for "
"editing. To clear the inspector, call this method with [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to edit an object in the editor's main inspector, "
"use the [code]edit_*[/code] methods in [EditorInterface] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [param object] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ Inspector ນີ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ. ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ "
"Inspector, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ດ້ວຍ [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂວັດຖຸໃນ Inspector ຫຼັກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]edit_*[/code] ໃນ [EditorInterface] ແທນ."

msgid "Expands all foldable sections."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍທຸກສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດພັບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Expands only the foldable sections that contain a revertable (i.e. non-"
"default) property."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດພັບໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງມີຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ສາມາດຄືນຄ່າໄດ້ (ຄື ຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid "Returns the object currently selected in this inspector."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນໃນ Inspector ນີ້."

msgid "Gets the path of the currently selected property."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a property editor that can be used by plugin UI to edit the specified "
"property of an [param object]."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ UI ຂອງປລັກອິນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [param object]."

msgid "Emitted when the object being edited by the inspector has changed."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອວັດຖຸທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນ Inspector ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the Edit button of an [Object] has been pressed in the "
"inspector. This is mainly used in the remote scene tree Inspector."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອປຸ່ມ Edit ຂອງ [Object] ຖືກກົດໃນ Inspector. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນ Inspector "
"ຂອງ remote scene tree."

msgid "Emitted when a property is removed from the inspector."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ Inspector."

msgid "Emitted when a property is edited in the inspector."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a property is keyed in the inspector. Properties can be keyed by "
"clicking the \"key\" icon next to a property when the Animation panel is "
"toggled."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກໃສ່ຄີ (keyed) ໃນ Inspector. ສາມາດໃສ່ຄີໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດໄອຄອນ "
"\"ຮູບກະແຈ\" ຂ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດເມື່ອເປີດແຖບ Animation."

msgid "Emitted when a property is selected in the inspector."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກເລືອກໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a boolean property is toggled in the inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is never emitted if the internal [code]autoclear[/"
"code] property enabled. Since this property is always enabled in the editor "
"inspector, this signal is never emitted by the editor itself."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດແບບບູລີນ (boolean) ຖືກສະຫຼັບໃນ Inspector."

msgid "Emitted when a resource is selected in the inspector."
msgstr "ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກເລືອກໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a property that requires a restart to be applied is edited in "
"the inspector. This is only used in the Project Settings and Editor Settings."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຖືກສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ຈຶ່ງຈະມີຜົນ. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Project Settings "
"ແລະ Editor Settings."

msgid "Plugin for adding custom property editors on the inspector."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນສຳລັບການເພີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"[EditorInspectorPlugin] allows adding custom property editors to "
"[EditorInspector].\n"
"When an object is edited, the [method _can_handle] function is called and "
"must return [code]true[/code] if the object type is supported.\n"
"If supported, the function [method _parse_begin] will be called, allowing to "
"place custom controls at the beginning of the class.\n"
"Subsequently, the [method _parse_category] and [method _parse_property] are "
"called for every category and property. They offer the ability to add custom "
"controls to the inspector too.\n"
"Finally, [method _parse_end] will be called.\n"
"On each of these calls, the \"add\" functions can be called.\n"
"To use [EditorInspectorPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_inspector_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorInspectorPlugin] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດແບບກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນ "
"[EditorInspector].\n"
"ເມື່ອວັດຖຸຖືກແກ້ໄຂ, ຟັງຊັນ [method _can_handle] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຫາກຮອງຮັບປະເພດວັດຖຸນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, ຟັງຊັນ [method _parse_begin] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດວາງຄອນໂທຣລແບບກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງຄລາສ.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, [method _parse_category] ແລະ [method _parse_property] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບທຸກໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ ທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດ.\n"
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, [method _parse_end] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ [EditorInspectorPlugin], ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນມັນຜ່ານ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_inspector_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Inspector plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນ Inspector"

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this object can be handled by this plugin."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປລັກອິນນີ້ສາມາດຈັດການວັດຖຸນັ້ນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of the property list for "
"[param object]."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄອນໂທຣລໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ [param object]."

msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of a category in the "
"property list for [param object]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄອນໂທຣລໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງໝວດໝູ່ໃນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ [param object]."

msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the end of the property list for [param "
"object]."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄອນໂທຣລໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ [param object]."

msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of a group or a sub-group in "
"the property list for [param object]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄອນໂທຣລໄວ້ທີ່ສ່ວນຕົ້ນຂອງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍໃນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ [param "
"object]."

msgid ""
"Called to allow adding property-specific editors to the property list for "
"[param object]. The added editor control must extend [EditorProperty]. "
"Returning [code]true[/code] removes the built-in editor for this property, "
"otherwise allows to insert a custom editor before the built-in one."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ [param object]. "
"ຄອນໂທຣລຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [EditorProperty]. ຫາກສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະເປັນການລຶບຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ອອກ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນການແຊກຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ກ່ອນອັນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້."

msgid "Adds a custom control, which is not necessarily a property editor."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄອນໂທຣລແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດສະເໝີໄປ."

msgid ""
"Adds a property editor for an individual property. The [param editor] control "
"must extend [EditorProperty].\n"
"There can be multiple property editors for a property. If [param add_to_end] "
"is [code]true[/code], this newly added editor will be displayed after all the "
"other editors of the property whose [param add_to_end] is [code]false[/code]. "
"For example, the editor uses this parameter to add an \"Edit Region\" button "
"for [member Sprite2D.region_rect] below the regular [Rect2] editor.\n"
"[param label] can be used to choose a custom label for the property editor in "
"the inspector. If left empty, the label is computed from the name of the "
"property instead."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດດ່ຽວ. ຄອນໂທຣລ [param editor] ຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[EditorProperty].\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດໜຶ່ງສາມາດມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ. ຫາກ [param add_to_end] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ສາມາກໃຊ້ [param label] ເພື່ອກຳນົດປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Adds an editor that allows modifying multiple properties. The [param editor] "
"control must extend [EditorProperty]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍຄຸນສົມບັດພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ຄອນໂທຣລ [param editor] "
"ຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [EditorProperty]."

msgid "Godot editor's interface."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (interface) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot."

msgid ""
"[EditorInterface] gives you control over Godot editor's window. It allows "
"customizing the window, saving and (re-)loading scenes, rendering mesh "
"previews, inspecting and editing resources and objects, and provides access "
"to [EditorSettings], [EditorFileSystem], [EditorResourcePreview], "
"[ScriptEditor], the editor viewport, and information about scenes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton directly by its name.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var editor_settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// In C# you can access it via the static Singleton property.\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[EditorInterface] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງ Godot editor ໄດ້. "
"ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ໂຫຼດສາກໃໝ່, ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ mesh, ກວດສອບ ແລະ "
"ແກ້ໄຂຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ລວມທັງເຂົ້າເຖິງ [EditorSettings], [EditorFileSystem] ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຄວນສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຄລາສນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var editor_settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Makes [param node] root of the currently opened scene. Only works if the "
"scene is empty. If the [param node] is a scene instance, an inheriting scene "
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ [param node] ເປັນຮາກ (root) ຂອງສາກທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອສາກນັ້ນວ່າງຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກ [param node] ເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງສາກອື່ນ, "
"ມັນຈະສ້າງສາກທີ່ສືບທອດມານັ້ນແທນ."

msgid ""
"Closes the currently active scene, discarding any pending changes in the "
"process. Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] if "
"there is no scene to close."
msgstr ""
"ປິດສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] "
"ຫາກສຳເລັດ ຫຼື [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] ຫາກບໍ່ມີສາກທີ່ຈະປິດ."

msgid ""
"Edits the given [Node]. The node will be also selected if it's inside the "
"scene tree."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [Node] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ໂນດນັ້ນຈະຖືກເລືອກຄືກັນຫາກມັນຢູ່ໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນສາກ (scene tree)."

msgid ""
"Edits the given [Resource]. If the resource is a [Script] you can also edit "
"it with [method edit_script] to specify the line and column position."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂ [Resource] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຫາກຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນແມ່ນ [Script], ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂມັນດ້ວຍ "
"[method edit_script] ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງແຖວ ແລະ ຄໍລຳໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Edits the given [Script]. The line and column on which to open the script can "
"also be specified. The script will be open with the user-configured editor "
"for the script's language which may be an external editor."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂ [Script] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສາມາດລະບຸແຖວ ແລະ ຄໍລຳທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເປີດສະຄຣິບໄດ້. "
"ສະຄຣິບຈະຖືກເປີດດ້ວຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບພາສານັ້ນໆ (ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the main container of Godot editor's window. For example, you can use "
"it to retrieve the size of the container and place your controls "
"accordingly.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render the editor useless "
"and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄອນເທນເນີຫຼັກ (main container) ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຂະໜາດ ແລະ ວາງຄອນໂທຣລຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ຫຼື ທຳລາຍໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash)."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [EditorCommandPalette] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorCommandPalette] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ຫຼື ທຳລາຍໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current directory being viewed in the [FileSystemDock]. If a file "
"is selected, its base directory will be returned using [method "
"String.get_base_dir] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໃນ [FileSystemDock]. ຫາກມີໄຟລ໌ຖືກເລືອກ, "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນໂຟນເດີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຢູ່ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the currently activated feature profile. If the default "
"profile is currently active, an empty string is returned instead.\n"
"In order to get a reference to the [EditorFeatureProfile], you must load the "
"feature profile using [method EditorFeatureProfile.load_from_file].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are loaded from "
"the [code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the "
"[code].profile[/code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be found "
"by using [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດ (feature profile) ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຫາກກຳລັງໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ."

msgid "Returns the current path being viewed in the [FileSystemDock]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໃນ [FileSystemDock]."

msgid "Returns the edited (current) scene's root [Node]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Node] ຮາກ (root) ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (ສາກປັດຈຸບັນ)."

msgid "Returns the language currently used for the editor interface."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (interface) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor control responsible for main screen plugins and tools. Use "
"it with plugins that implement [method EditorPlugin._has_main_screen].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This node is a [VBoxContainer], which means that if you add a "
"[Control] child to it, you need to set the child's [member "
"Control.size_flags_vertical] to [constant Control.SIZE_EXPAND_FILL] to make "
"it use the full available space.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄອນໂທຣລຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບສຳລັບປລັກອິນ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືໃນໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ."

msgid "Returns the [EditorPaths] singleton."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) [EditorPaths]."

msgid ""
"Returns the actual scale of the editor UI ([code]1.0[/code] being 100% "
"scale). This can be used to adjust position and dimensions of the UI added by "
"plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is set via the [member EditorSettings.interface/"
"editor/appearance/display_scale] and [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/"
"appearance/custom_display_scale] settings. The editor must be restarted for "
"changes to be properly applied."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າມາດຕາສ່ວນ (scale) ຕົວຈິງຂອງ UI ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ([code]1.0[/code] ຄື 100%). "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອປັບຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງ UI ທີ່ເພີ່ມໂດຍປລັກອິນໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນ. "
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorSettings] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorSettings] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [Theme].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating custom editor UI, prefer accessing theme items "
"directly from your GUI nodes using the [code]get_theme_*[/code] methods."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Theme] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສ້າງ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ, "
"ຄວນເລືອກເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍການທີມໂດຍກົງຈາກໂນດ GUI ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]get_theme_*[/"
"code]."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorToaster]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [EditorToaster] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorUndoRedoManager]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [EditorUndoRedoManager] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 2D editor [SubViewport]. It does not have a camera. Instead, the "
"view transforms are done directly and can be accessed with [member "
"Viewport.global_canvas_transform]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [SubViewport] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິ. ມັນບໍ່ມີກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ. ແຕ່ການແປງມຸມມອງ (view "
"transforms) ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [member "
"Viewport.global_canvas_transform]."

msgid ""
"Returns the specified 3D editor [SubViewport], from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]3[/code]. The viewport can be used to access the active editor cameras "
"with [method Viewport.get_camera_3d]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [SubViewport] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ລະບຸ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ [code]0[/code] ຫາ [code]3[/code]. "
"ວິວພອດ (viewport) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ດ້ວຍ [method "
"Viewport.get_camera_3d]."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [FileSystemDock] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [FileSystemDock] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ແລະ ການຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freeing) "
"ໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash)."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [EditorInspector] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorInspector] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ແລະ ການຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freeing) "
"ໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash)."

msgid ""
"Returns the amount of degrees the 3D editor's rotational snapping is set to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອົງສາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບການຢຶດໝູນ (rotational snapping) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Returns the amount of units the 3D editor's scale snapping is set to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບການຢຶດຂະໜາດ (scale snapping) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"Returns the amount of units the 3D editor's translation snapping is set to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບການຢຶດຕຳແໜ່ງ (translation snapping) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with references to the root nodes of the currently opened "
"scenes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂນດຮາກ (root nodes) ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່."

msgid "Returns an array with the file paths of the currently opened scenes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the scene that is being played. If no scene is currently "
"being played, returns an empty string."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກຫຼິ້ນຢູ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສາກໃດຖືກຫຼິ້ນໃນຂະນະນີ້, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorFileSystem] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorFileSystem] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorResourcePreview] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorResourcePreview] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [ScriptEditor] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [ScriptEditor] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ແລະ ການຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freeing) "
"ໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ (crash)."

msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the paths of the currently selected files (and "
"directories) in the [FileSystemDock]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌ (ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ) ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນ [FileSystemDock]."

msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorSelection] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EditorSelection] ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Returns an array of file paths of currently unsaved scenes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣ (array) ຂອງເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ສາກທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"Shows the given property on the given [param object] in the editor's "
"Inspector dock. If [param inspector_only] is [code]true[/code], plugins will "
"not attempt to edit [param object]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນ [param object] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນແຜງ Inspector ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ຖ້າ "
"[param inspector_only] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປລັກອິນຈະບໍ່ພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂ [param "
"object]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if multiple window support is enabled in the "
"editor. Multiple window support is enabled if [i]all[/i] of these statements "
"are true:\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/multi_window/enable] is [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] is "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"- [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows] is [code]false[/code]. This is "
"forced to [code]true[/code] on platforms that don't support multiple windows "
"such as Web, or when the [code]--single-window[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url] is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຖ້າ [i]ທຸກໆ[/i] ເງື່ອນໄຂເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນຈິງ:\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/multi_window/enable] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] ເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"- [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]. "
"ເງື່ອນໄຂນີ້ຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ໃນແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຕ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ Web, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command "
"line argument[/url] ແບບ [code]--single-window[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the 3D editor currently has snapping mode "
"enabled, and [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຢຶດ (snapping) ຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object has been marked as edited through "
"[method set_object_edited]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າອອບເຈັກ (object) ຖືກໝາຍວ່າໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂຜ່ານ [method "
"set_object_edited]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a scene is currently being played, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise. Paused scenes are considered as being played."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສາກກຳລັງຖືກຫຼິ້ນຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ [code]false[/code]. "
"ສາກທີ່ຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ (paused) ກໍຖືວ່າກຳລັງຖືກຫຼິ້ນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param plugin] is enabled. The "
"plugin name is the same as its directory name."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param plugin] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່. "
"ຊື່ປລັກອິນແມ່ນຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຊື່ໂຟນເດີຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns mesh previews rendered at the given size as an [Array] of "
"[Texture2D]s."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຢ່າງເມຊ (mesh previews) ທີ່ຖືກເຣນເດີຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ເປັນ [Array] ຂອງ "
"[Texture2D]."

msgid "Marks the current scene tab as unsaved."
msgstr "ໝາຍແທັບສາກປັດຈຸບັນວ່າ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"Opens the scene at the given path. If [param set_inherited] is [code]true[/"
"code], creates a new inherited scene."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດສາກຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. ຖ້າ [param set_inherited] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະສ້າງສາກໃໝ່ທີ່ສືບທອດມາ (inherited scene)."

msgid "Plays the currently active scene."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid "Plays the scene specified by its filepath."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສາກທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Plays the main scene."
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນສາກຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for creating an object.\n"
"The [param callback] must take a single argument of type [String], which will "
"contain the type name of the selected object (or the script path of the type, "
"if the type is created from a script), or be an empty string if no item is "
"selected.\n"
"The [param base_type] specifies the base type of objects to display. For "
"example, if you set this to \"Resource\", all types derived from [Resource] "
"will display in the create dialog.\n"
"The [param current_type] will be passed in the search box of the create "
"dialog, and the specified type can be immediately selected when the dialog "
"pops up. If the [param current_type] is not derived from [param base_type], "
"there will be no result of the type in the dialog.\n"
"The [param dialog_title] allows you to define a custom title for the dialog. "
"This is useful if you want to accurately hint the usage of the dialog. If the "
"[param dialog_title] is an empty string, the dialog will use \"Create New "
"'Base Type'\" as the default title.\n"
"The [param type_blocklist] contains a list of type names, and the types in "
"the blocklist will be hidden from the create dialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Trying to list the base type in the [param type_blocklist] will "
"hide all types derived from the base type from the create dialog."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບ (dialog) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອສ້າງອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"[param callback] ຕ້ອງຮັບຄ່າອາກິວເມນດຽວເປັນ [String], ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຊື່ປະເພດຂອງອອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ "
"(ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງສະຄຣິບຂອງປະເພດນັ້ນ, ຖ້າປະເພດຖືກສ້າງມາຈາກສະຄຣິບ), ຫຼື "
"ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກລາຍການໃດ.\n"
"[param base_type] ລະບຸປະເພດພື້ນຖານຂອງອອບເຈັກທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"\"Resource\", ທຸກປະເພດທີ່ມາຈາກ [Resource] ຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສ້າງ.\n"
"[param current_type] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃນຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການສ້າງ, ແລະ "
"ປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸສາມາດຖືກເລືອກໄດ້ທັນທີເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງປາກົດຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າ [param current_type] ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ "
"[param base_type], ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນໜ້າຕ່າງນັ້ນ.\n"
"[param dialog_title] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງແບບກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການບອກຈຸດປະສົງການໃຊ້ງານຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນ. ຖ້າ [param dialog_title] "
"ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະໃຊ້ \"Create New 'Base Type'\" ເປັນຫົວຂໍ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"[param type_blocklist] ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ປະເພດ, ແລະ "
"ປະເພດໃນລາຍຊື່ນີ້ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງການສ້າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການພະຍາຍາມໃສ່ປະເພດພື້ນຖານໃນ [param type_blocklist] "
"ຈະເຊື່ອງທຸກປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກປະເພດພື້ນຖານນັ້ນນຳ."

msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive]. The dialog must have no current parent, otherwise "
"the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [param dialog] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ [method Window.popup_exclusive]. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີ parent ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."

msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered]. The dialog must have no current parent, "
"otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [param dialog] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered]. ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີ parent ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."

msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_clamped]. The dialog must have no current "
"parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [param dialog] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_clamped]. ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີ parent ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."

msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_ratio]. The dialog must have no current "
"parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [param dialog] ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍ [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_ratio]. ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີ parent ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."

msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting a method from [param object]. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [String] which will "
"contain the name of the selected method or be empty if the dialog is "
"canceled. If [param current_value] is provided, the method will be selected "
"automatically in the method list, if it exists."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບເພື່ອເລືອກເມທອດຈາກ [param object]. [param callback] "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບຄ່າອາກິວເມນດຽວເປັນ [String] ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຊື່ຂອງເມທອດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື ຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຍົກເລີກ. "
"ຖ້າ [param current_value] ຖືກລະບຸ, ເມທອດນັ້ນຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລາຍການເມທອດ "
"ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting a [Node] from the edited scene. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [NodePath]. It is called "
"on the selected [NodePath] or the empty path [code]^\"\"[/code] if the dialog "
"is canceled. If [param valid_types] is provided, the dialog will only show "
"Nodes that match one of the listed Node types. If [param current_value] is "
"provided, the Node will be automatically selected in the tree, if it exists.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Display the node selection dialog as soon as this node is "
"added to the tree for the first time:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_node_selector(_on_node_selected, [\"Button\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_node_selected(node_path):\n"
"\tif node_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"node selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", node_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບເພື່ອເລືອກ [Node] ຈາກສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ. [param callback] "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບຄ່າອາກິວເມນດຽວເປັນ [NodePath]. ມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນດ້ວຍ [NodePath] ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື "
"ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ [code]^\"\"[/code] ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຖ້າ [param valid_types] "
"ຖືກລະບຸ, ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງສະເພາະ Node ທີ່ກົງກັບປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າ [param current_value] "
"ຖືກລະບຸ, Node ຈະຖືກເລືອກໃນທຣີ (tree) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໂນດທັນທີເມື່ອໂນດນີ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນທຣີເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_node_selector(_on_node_selected, [\"Button\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_node_selected(node_path):\n"
"\tif node_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"node selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", node_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting properties from [param object]. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [NodePath]. It is called "
"on the selected property path (see [method NodePath.get_as_property_path]) or "
"the empty path [code]^\"\"[/code] if the dialog is canceled. If [param "
"type_filter] is provided, the dialog will only show properties that match one "
"of the listed [enum Variant.Type] values. If [param current_value] is "
"provided, the property will be selected automatically in the property list, "
"if it exists.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_property_selector(this, _on_property_selected, "
"[TYPE_INT])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_property_selected(property_path):\n"
"\tif property_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"property selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", property_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບເພື່ອເລືອກຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ຈາກ [param object]. [param "
"callback] ຕ້ອງຮັບຄ່າອາກິວເມນດຽວເປັນ [NodePath]. ມັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ "
"(ເບິ່ງ [method NodePath.get_as_property_path]) ຫຼື ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ [code]^\"\"[/"
"code] ຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຖ້າ [param type_filter] ຖືກລະບຸ, "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກົງກັບຄ່າ [enum Variant.Type] ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຖ້າ [param "
"current_value] ຖືກລະບຸ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະຖືກເລືອກໃນລາຍການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າມັນມີຢູ່.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_property_selector(this, _on_property_selected, "
"[TYPE_INT])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_property_selected(property_path):\n"
"\tif property_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"property selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", property_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for quick selecting a resource file. The [param "
"callback] must take a single argument of type [String] which will contain the "
"path of the selected resource or be empty if the dialog is canceled. If "
"[param base_types] is provided, the dialog will only show resources that "
"match these types. Only types deriving from [Resource] are supported."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resource) ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ. [param callback] "
"ຕ້ອງຮັບຄ່າອາກິວເມນດຽວເປັນ [String] ເຊິ່ງຈະມີເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຫຼື "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຖ້າ [param base_types] ຖືກລະບຸ, "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກົງກັບປະເພດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະປະເພດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[Resource] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Reloads the scene at the given path. Fails if the scene is not open."
msgstr "ໂຫຼດສາກຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄືນໃໝ່. ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວຖ້າສາກນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Restarts the editor. This closes the editor and then opens the same project. "
"If [param save] is [code]true[/code], the project will be saved before "
"restarting."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່. ນີ້ຈະປິດຕົວແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວເປີດໂປຣເຈັກເດີມຄືນໃໝ່. ຖ້າ [param save] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code], ໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກບັນທຶກກ່ອນການເລີ່ມໃໝ່."

msgid "Saves all opened scenes in the editor."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກທຸກສາກທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Saves the currently active scene. Returns either [constant OK] or [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE]."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສາກທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant OK] ຫຼື [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE]."

msgid "Saves the currently active scene as a file at [param path]."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສາກທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ເປັນໄຟລ໌ຕາມ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Selects the file, with the path provided by [param file], in the FileSystem "
"dock."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param file] ໃນແຜງ FileSystem."

msgid ""
"Selects and activates the specified feature profile with the given [param "
"profile_name]. Set [param profile_name] to an empty string to reset to the "
"default feature profile.\n"
"A feature profile can be created programmatically using the "
"[EditorFeatureProfile] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The feature profile that gets activated must be located in the "
"[code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the [code].profile[/"
"code] extension. If a profile could not be found, an error occurs. The editor "
"configuration folder can be found by using [method "
"EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດ (feature profile) ຕາມ [param profile_name] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. "
"ຕັ້ງ [param profile_name] ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າເພື່ອຣີເຊັດເປັນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານໂຄ້ດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄລາສ [EditorFeatureProfile].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]feature_profiles[/code], "
"ໂດຍເປັນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ [code].profile[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. "
"ໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາມາດຫາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."

msgid ""
"Sets the editor's current main screen to the one specified in [param name]. "
"[param name] must match the title of the tab in question exactly (e.g. "
"[code]2D[/code], [code]3D[/code], [code skip-lint]Script[/code], [code]Game[/"
"code], or [code]Asset Store[/code] for default tabs)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ເປັນຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [param name]. [param name] "
"ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງແທັບນັ້ນທຸກປະການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]2D[/code], [code]3D[/code], "
"[code]Script[/code], [code]Game[/code], ຫຼື [code]Asset Store[/code] "
"ສຳລັບແທັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"If [param edited] is [code]true[/code], the object is marked as edited.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is primarily used by the editor for [Resource] based "
"objects to track their modified state. For example, any changes to an open "
"scene, a resource in the inspector, or an edited script will cause this "
"method to be called with [code]true[/code]. Saving the scene, script, or "
"resource resets the edited state by calling this method with [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each call to this method increments the object's edited version. "
"This is used to track changes in the editor and to trigger when thumbnails "
"should be regenerated for resources."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [param edited] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອອບເຈັກຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບອອບເຈັກທີ່ເປັນ [Resource] "
"ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມສະຖານະການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນສາກທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ "
"Inspector, ຫຼື ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເມທອດນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນດ້ວຍຄ່າ [code]true[/code]. "
"ການບັນທຶກສາກ, ສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຈະຣີເຊັດສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍການເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ດ້ວຍ "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງທີ່ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ ຈະເພີ່ມເວີຊັນການແກ້ໄຂຂອງອອບເຈັກ. "
"ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຄວນສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnails) "
"ໃໝ່ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the enabled status of a plugin. The plugin name is the same as its "
"directory name."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງສະຖານະການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂອງປລັກອິນ. ຊື່ປລັກອິນແມ່ນຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຊື່ໂຟນເດີຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Stops the scene that is currently playing."
msgstr "ຢຸດສາກທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables distraction-free mode which hides side docks to "
"increase the space available for the main view."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດໄຮ້ສິ່ງລົບກວນ (distraction-free mode) "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເຊື່ອງແຜງດ້ານຂ້າງເພື່ອເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບມຸມມອງຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Movie Maker mode is enabled in the editor. See "
"[MovieWriter] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂໝດ Movie Maker ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ເບິ່ງ [MovieWriter] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Gizmo for editing [Node3D] objects."
msgstr "ກິສໂມ (Gizmo) ສຳລັບແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກ [Node3D]."

msgid ""
"Gizmo that is used for providing custom visualization and editing (handles "
"and subgizmos) for [Node3D] objects. Can be overridden to create custom "
"gizmos, but for simple gizmos creating an [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] is "
"usually recommended."
msgstr ""
"ກິສໂມທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ (handles ແລະ subgizmos) ສຳລັບອອບເຈັກ "
"[Node3D]. ສາມາດໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ (override) ເພື່ອສ້າງກິສໂມແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບກິສໂມແບບງ່າຍໆ "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ສ້າງ [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a handle being edited (handles must have been "
"previously added by [method add_handles]). This usually means creating an "
"[UndoRedo] action for the change, using the current handle value as \"do\" "
"and the [param restore] argument as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restore] "
"value should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the committed handle "
"is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຄອມມິດ (commit) ແຮນເດິນ (handle) ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ "
"(ແຮນເດິນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມມາກ່ອນໂດຍ [method add_handles]). ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໝາຍເຖິງການສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງ "
"[UndoRedo] ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າແຮນເດິນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນ \"do\" ແລະ ອາກິວເມນ [param "
"restore] ເປັນ \"undo\".\n"
"ຖ້າອາກິວເມນ [param cancel] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [param restore] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງ [UndoRedo].\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຖືກຄອມມິດນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_handles] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a group of subgizmos being edited (see [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method _subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). This "
"usually means creating an [UndoRedo] action for the change, using the current "
"transforms as \"do\" and the [param restores] transforms as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restores] "
"transforms should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຄອມມິດກຸ່ມຂອງກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (subgizmos) ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_ray] ແລະ [method _subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໝາຍເຖິງການສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງ [UndoRedo] ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ການແປງ (transforms) "
"ປັດຈຸບັນເປັນ \"do\" ແລະ [param restores] ເປັນ \"undo\".\n"
"ຖ້າອາກິວເມນ [param cancel] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງໃນ [param restores] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງ [UndoRedo]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return the name of an edited handle (handles must "
"have been previously added by [method add_handles]). Handles can be named for "
"reference to the user when editing.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle "
"is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງແຮນເດິນ (handle) ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (ແຮນເດິນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມມາກ່ອນໂດຍ "
"[method add_handles]). ແຮນເດິນສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເບິ່ງອ້າງອີງໃນເວລາແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_handles] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current value of a handle. This value will "
"be requested at the start of an edit and used as the [code]restore[/code] "
"argument in [method _commit_handle].\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle "
"is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງແຮນເດິນ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍເມື່ອເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນອາກິວເມນ [code]restore[/code] ໃນ [method _commit_handle].\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_handles] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current transform of a subgizmo. This "
"transform will be requested at the start of an edit and used as the "
"[code]restore[/code] argument in [method _commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ (transform) ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (subgizmo). "
"ການແປງນີ້ຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍເມື່ອເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນອາກິວເມນ [code]restore[/code] ໃນ "
"[method _commit_subgizmos]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return [code]true[/code] whenever the given handle "
"should be highlighted in the editor.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle "
"is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ແຮນເດິນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄວນຖືກໄຮໄລ້ "
"(highlight) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_handles] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to add all the gizmo elements whenever a gizmo update is "
"requested. It's common to call [method clear] at the beginning of this method "
"and then add visual elements depending on the node's properties."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບກິສໂມທັງໝົດເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍອັບເດດກິສໂມ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເອີ້ນ [method "
"clear] ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເມທອດນີ້ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບດ້ານພາບຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties when the user drags a "
"gizmo handle (previously added with [method add_handles]). The provided "
"[param point] is the mouse position in screen coordinates and the [param "
"camera] can be used to convert it to raycasts.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the edited handle is "
"secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລາກແຮນເດິນກິສໂມ (ທີ່ເພີ່ມມາກ່ອນດ້ວຍ [method "
"add_handles]). [param point] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ [param camera] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງມັນໃຫ້ເປັນເຣແຄສ (raycasts).\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method add_handles] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties during subgizmo editing "
"(see [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). The [param transform] is given in the "
"[Node3D]'s local coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດໃນລະຫວ່າງການແກ້ໄຂກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (ເບິ່ງ [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_ray] ແລະ [method _subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). [param "
"transform] ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local coordinate system) ຂອງ [Node3D]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse drag box "
"selection. Given a [param camera] and a [param frustum], this method should "
"return which subgizmos are contained within the frustum. The [param frustum] "
"argument consists of an array with all the [Plane]s that make up the "
"selection frustum. The returned value should contain a list of unique "
"subgizmo identifiers, which can have any non-negative value and will be used "
"in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] or [method "
"_commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໂດຍໃຊ້ການລາກເມົາສ໌ເປັນກ່ອງ (box selection). "
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດ [param camera] ແລະ [param frustum] ໃຫ້, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນວ່າກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໃດແດ່ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຟຣັສຕຳ (frustum). ອາກິວເມນ [param frustum] "
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍອາເຣຂອງ [Plane] ທັງໝົດທີ່ປະກອບເປັນຟຣັສຕຳການເລືອກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (subgizmo identifiers) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເປັນຄ່າບວກໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual methods) ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[method _get_subgizmo_transform] ຫຼື [method _commit_subgizmos]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse clicks. Given a "
"[param camera] and a [param point] in screen coordinates, this method should "
"return which subgizmo should be selected. The returned value should be a "
"unique subgizmo identifier, which can have any non-negative value and will be "
"used in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] or "
"[method _commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໂດຍໃຊ້ການຄລິກເມົາສ໌. ເມື່ອກຳນົດ [param camera] ແລະ "
"[param point] ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍໃຫ້, ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນວ່າກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໃດທີ່ຄວນຖືກເລືອກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນເປັນລະຫັດກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (identifier) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເປັນຄ່າບວກໃດໆກໍໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດສະເໝືອນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [method _get_subgizmo_transform] ຫຼື [method "
"_commit_subgizmos]."

msgid ""
"Adds the specified [param segments] to the gizmo's collision shape for "
"picking. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [param segments] ທີ່ລະບຸໃສ່ໃນຮູບຊົງການຕຳ (collision shape) ຂອງກິສໂມສຳລັບການເລືອກ "
"(picking). ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Adds collision triangles to the gizmo for picking. A [TriangleMesh] can be "
"generated from a regular [Mesh] too. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສາມລ່ຽມການຕຳ (collision triangles) ໃສ່ກິສໂມສຳລັບການເລືອກ. [TriangleMesh] "
"ສາມາດສ້າງມາຈາກ [Mesh] ປົກກະຕິໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Adds a list of handles (points) which can be used to edit the properties of "
"the gizmo's [Node3D]. The [param ids] argument can be used to specify a "
"custom identifier for each handle, if an empty array is passed, the ids will "
"be assigned automatically from the [param handles] argument order.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument marks the added handles as secondary, meaning "
"they will normally have lower selection priority than regular handles. When "
"the user is holding the shift key secondary handles will switch to have "
"higher priority than regular handles. This change in priority can be used to "
"place multiple handles at the same point while still giving the user control "
"on their selection.\n"
"There are virtual methods which will be called upon editing of these handles. "
"Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍຊື່ແຮນເດິນ (handles ຫຼື ຈຸດ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [Node3D] ຂອງກິສໂມ. "
"ອາກິວເມນ [param ids] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸລະຫັດກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແຮນເດິນ, "
"ຖ້າສົ່ງອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າໄປ, ລະຫັດຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມລຳດັບຂອງອາກິວເມນ [param handles].\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະໝາຍແຮນເດິນທີ່ເພີ່ມມາໃຫ້ເປັນແບບສຳຮອງ, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າປົກກະຕິແລ້ວພວກມັນຈະມີລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການເລືອກຕ່ຳກວ່າແຮນເດິນທົ່ວໄປ. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດປຸ່ມ "
"shift ຄ້າງໄວ້, ແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງຈະປ່ຽນມາມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າແຮນເດິນທົ່ວໄປ. "
"ການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອວາງຫຼາຍແຮນເດິນໄວ້ຢູ່ຈຸດດຽວກັນ "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມການເລືອກໄດ້.\n"
"ມີເມທອດສະເໝືອນທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການແກ້ໄຂແຮນເດິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Adds lines to the gizmo (as sets of 2 points), with a given material. The "
"lines are used for visualizing the gizmo. Call this method during [method "
"_redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນໃສ່ກິສໂມ (ເປັນຊຸດຂອງ 2 ຈຸດ), ພ້ອມກັບວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ເສັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງພາບຂອງກິສໂມ. ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Adds a mesh to the gizmo with the specified [param material], local [param "
"transform] and [param skeleton]. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເມຊ (mesh) ໃສ່ກິສໂມດ້ວຍ [param material], [param transform] ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ [param "
"skeleton] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Adds an unscaled billboard for visualization and selection. Call this method "
"during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມບິລບອດ (billboard) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການປັບຂະໜາດ (unscaled) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງພາບ ແລະ ການເລືອກ. "
"ເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Removes everything in the gizmo including meshes, collisions and handles."
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຢ່າງໃນກິສໂມ ອອກລວມທັງ ເມຊ, ການຕຳ ແລະ ແຮນເດິນ."

msgid "Returns the [Node3D] node associated with this gizmo."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ [Node3D] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກິສໂມນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] that owns this gizmo. It's useful to "
"retrieve materials using [method EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.get_material]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] ທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງກິສໂມນີ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນວັດສະດຸໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.get_material]."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of the currently selected subgizmos. Can be used to highlight "
"selected elements during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ (subgizmos) ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄຮໄລ້ອົງປະກອບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given subgizmo is currently selected. Can be "
"used to highlight selected elements during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າກິສໂມຍ່ອຍທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄຮໄລ້ອົງປະກອບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]."

msgid ""
"Sets the gizmo's hidden state. If [code]true[/code], the gizmo will be "
"hidden. If [code]false[/code], it will be shown."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງສະຖານະການເຊື່ອງຂອງກິສໂມ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກິສໂມຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງ. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the reference [Node3D] node for the gizmo. [param node] must inherit "
"from [Node3D]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໂນດ [Node3D] ອ້າງອີງສຳລັບກິສໂມ. [param node] ຕ້ອງສືບທອດມາຈາກ [Node3D]."

msgid "A class used by the editor to define Node3D gizmo types."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດປະເພດກິສໂມ (gizmo) ຂອງ Node3D."

msgid ""
"[EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] allows you to define a new type of Gizmo. There are "
"two main ways to do so: extending [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] for the simpler "
"gizmos, or creating a new [EditorNode3DGizmo] type. See the tutorial in the "
"documentation for more info.\n"
"To use [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດກິສໂມ (Gizmo) ປະເພດໃໝ່. ມີສອງວິທີຫຼັກໃນການເຮັດ: "
"ການຂະຫຍາຍ (extending) [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] ສຳລັບກິສໂມແບບງ່າຍໆ, ຫຼື ສ້າງປະເພດ "
"[EditorNode3DGizmo] ໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງບົດຮຽນໃນເອກະສານສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin], ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Node3D gizmo plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນກິສໂມ Node3D"

msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether the gizmos handled by this plugin can "
"be hidden or not. Returns [code]true[/code] if not overridden."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດວ່າກິສໂມທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍປລັກອິນນີ້ ສາມາດເຊື່ອງໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການໂອເວີໄຣດ໌."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether the gizmos should commit when the "
"final handle position is the same as the initial one. Returns [code]false[/"
"code] if not overridden."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດວ່າກິສໂມຄວນຄອມມິດ (commit) ຫຼືບໍ່ "
"ເມື່ອຕຳແໜ່ງສຸດທ້າຍຂອງແຮນເດິນຄືກັນກັບຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການໂອເວີໄຣດ໌."

msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a handle being edited (handles must have been "
"previously added by [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] during [method "
"_redraw]). This usually means creating an [UndoRedo] action for the change, "
"using the current handle value as \"do\" and the [param restore] argument as "
"\"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restore] "
"value should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the committed handle "
"is secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more "
"information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຄອມມິດ (commit) ແຮນເດິນທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (ແຮນເດິນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມມາກ່ອນໂດຍ "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] ໃນລະຫວ່າງ [method _redraw]). "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໝາຍເຖິງການສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງ [UndoRedo] ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າແຮນເດິນປັດຈຸບັນເປັນ "
"\"do\" ແລະ [param restore] ເປັນ \"undo\".\n"
"ຖ້າອາກິວເມນ [param cancel] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [param restore] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງ [UndoRedo].\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຖືກຄອມມິດນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ.\n"
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a group of subgizmos being edited (see [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method _subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). This "
"usually means creating an [UndoRedo] action for the change, using the current "
"transforms as \"do\" and the [param restores] transforms as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restores] "
"transforms should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action. As with all "
"subgizmo methods, transforms are given in local space respect to the gizmo's "
"Node3D. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຄອມມິດກຸ່ມຂອງກິສໂມຍ່ອຍທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວໝາຍເຖິງການສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງ "
"[UndoRedo] ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ການແປງປັດຈຸບັນເປັນ \"do\" ແລະ [param restores] ເປັນ "
"\"undo\".\n"
"ຖ້າ [param cancel] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການແປງຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ [UndoRedo]. "
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບເມທອດກິສໂມຍ່ອຍອື່ນໆ, ການແປງຈະຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ Node3D "
"ຂອງກິສໂມ. ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return a custom [EditorNode3DGizmo] for the 3D nodes "
"of your choice, return [code]null[/code] for the rest of nodes. See also "
"[method _has_gizmo]."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [EditorNode3DGizmo] ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບໂນດ 3 ມິຕິທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ, ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ສຳລັບໂນດອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ [method _has_gizmo] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to provide the name that will appear in the gizmo "
"visibility menu."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຊື່ທີ່ຈະປາກົດໃນເມນູການສະແດງພາບຂອງກິສໂມ (gizmo visibility menu)."

msgid ""
"Override this method to provide gizmo's handle names. The [param secondary] "
"argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle is secondary (see "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more information). Called for this "
"plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຊື່ແຮນເດິນຂອງກິສໂມ. ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current value of a handle. This value will "
"be requested at the start of an edit and used as the [code]restore[/code] "
"argument in [method _commit_handle].\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle "
"is secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more "
"information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງແຮນເດິນ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍເມື່ອເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນອາກິວເມນ [code]restore[/code] ໃນ [method _commit_handle].\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ.\n"
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to set the gizmo's priority. Gizmos with higher priority "
"will have precedence when processing inputs like handles or subgizmos "
"selection.\n"
"All built-in editor gizmos return a priority of [code]-1[/code]. If not "
"overridden, this method will return [code]0[/code], which means custom gizmos "
"will automatically get higher priority than built-in gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (priority) ຂອງກິສໂມ. ກິສໂມທີ່ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຈະມາກ່ອນ "
"ເມື່ອມີການປະມວນຜົນອິນພຸດ ເຊັ່ນ ການເລືອກແຮນເດິນ ຫຼື ກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"ກິສໂມທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນເປັນ [code]-1[/code]. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການໂອເວີໄຣດ໌, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]0[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າກິສໂມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າກິສໂມພື້ນຖານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current transform of a subgizmo. As with "
"all subgizmo methods, the transform should be in local space respect to the "
"gizmo's Node3D. This transform will be requested at the start of an edit and "
"used in the [code]restore[/code] argument in [method _commit_subgizmos]. "
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນການແປງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ. ການແປງຄວນຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local space) "
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ Node3D ຂອງກິສໂມ. ການແປງນີ້ຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍເມື່ອເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນອາກິວເມນ "
"[code]restore[/code] ຂອງ [method _commit_subgizmos]. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define which Node3D nodes have a gizmo from this "
"plugin. Whenever a [Node3D] node is added to a scene this method is called, "
"if it returns [code]true[/code] the node gets a generic [EditorNode3DGizmo] "
"assigned and is added to this plugin's list of active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດວ່າໂນດ Node3D ໃດທີ່ມີກິສໂມຈາກປລັກອິນນີ້. ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ໂນດ [Node3D] "
"ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກ ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ, ຖ້າມັນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດນັ້ນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດ "
"[EditorNode3DGizmo] ທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to return [code]true[/code] whenever to given handle "
"should be highlighted in the editor. The [param secondary] argument is "
"[code]true[/code] when the requested handle is secondary (see [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more information). Called for this "
"plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ແຮນເດິນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຄວນຖືກໄຮໄລ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether Node3D with this gizmo should be "
"selectable even when the gizmo is hidden."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດວ່າ Node3D ທີ່ມີກິສໂມນີ້ ຄວນຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າກິສໂມຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to add all the gizmo elements whenever a gizmo update is "
"requested. It's common to call [method EditorNode3DGizmo.clear] at the "
"beginning of this method and then add visual elements depending on the node's "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບກິສໂມທັງໝົດ ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍອັບເດດກິສໂມ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເອີ້ນ "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.clear] ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເມທອດນີ້ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບດ້ານພາບ "
"ຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node's properties when the user drags a "
"gizmo handle (previously added with [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles]). "
"The provided [param screen_pos] is the mouse position in screen coordinates "
"and the [param camera] can be used to convert it to raycasts.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the edited handle is "
"secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລາກແຮນເດິນກິສໂມ. [param screen_pos] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງເມົາສ໌ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ [param camera] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງມັນໃຫ້ເປັນເຣແຄສ.\n"
"ອາກິວເມນ [param secondary] ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ເມື່ອແຮນເດິນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂນັ້ນເປັນແຮນເດິນສຳຮອງ.\n"
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties during subgizmo editing "
"(see [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). The [param transform] is given in the "
"Node3D's local coordinate system. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດ ໃນລະຫວ່າງການແກ້ໄຂກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ. [param transform] "
"ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃນລະບົບພິກັດທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ Node3D. ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse drag box "
"selection. Given a [param camera] and [param frustum_planes], this method "
"should return which subgizmos are contained within the frustums. The [param "
"frustum_planes] argument consists of an array with all the [Plane]s that make "
"up the selection frustum. The returned value should contain a list of unique "
"subgizmo identifiers, these identifiers can have any non-negative value and "
"will be used in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] "
"or [method _commit_subgizmos]. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການລາກເມົາສ໌ເປັນກ່ອງ. ເມື່ອກຳນົດ [param "
"camera] ແລະ [param frustum_planes] ໃຫ້, "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນວ່າກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໃດແດ່ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຟຣັສຕຳ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດກິສໂມຍ່ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດສະເໝືອນອື່ນໆ. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse clicks. Given a "
"[param camera] and a [param screen_pos] in screen coordinates, this method "
"should return which subgizmo should be selected. The returned value should be "
"a unique subgizmo identifier, which can have any non-negative value and will "
"be used in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] or "
"[method _commit_subgizmos]. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກກິສໂມຍ່ອຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຄລິກເມົາສ໌. ເມື່ອກຳນົດ [param camera] "
"ແລະ [param screen_pos] ໃນພິກັດໜ້າຈໍໃຫ້, ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນວ່າກິສໂມຍ່ອຍໃດທີ່ຄວນຖືກເລືອກ. "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບກິສໂມທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຂອງປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a new material to the internal material list for the plugin. It can then "
"be accessed with [method get_material]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມວັດສະດຸ (material) ໃໝ່ໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນຂອງປລັກອິນ. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"get_material]. ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໂອເວີໄຣດ໌."

msgid ""
"Creates a handle material with its variants (selected and/or editable) and "
"adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles]. "
"Should not be overridden.\n"
"You can optionally provide a texture to use instead of the default icon."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດສະດຸແຮນເດິນ ພ້ອມກັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ (ແບບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ/ຫຼື ແບບທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້) ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມພວກມັນໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນ. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method get_material] ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ໃນ [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles]. ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໂອເວີໄຣດ໌.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸເທັກເຈີ (texture) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນໄອຄອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Creates an icon material with its variants (selected and/or editable) and "
"adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_unscaled_billboard]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດສະດຸໄອຄອນ ພ້ອມກັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ (ແບບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ/ຫຼື ແບບທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້) ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມພວກມັນໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນ. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method get_material] ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ໃນ [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_unscaled_billboard]. ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໂອເວີໄຣດ໌."

msgid ""
"Creates an unshaded material with its variants (selected and/or editable) and "
"adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_mesh] and "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_lines]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດສະດຸແບບໄຮ້ເງົາ (unshaded material) ພ້ອມກັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ (ແບບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ/ຫຼື "
"ແບບທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້) ແລະ ເພີ່ມພວກມັນໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນ. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [method "
"get_material] ແລະ ໃຊ້ໃນ [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_mesh] ແລະ [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_lines]. ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກໂອເວີໄຣດ໌."

msgid ""
"Gets material from the internal list of materials. If an [EditorNode3DGizmo] "
"is provided, it will try to get the corresponding variant (selected and/or "
"editable)."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນວັດສະດຸຈາກລາຍຊື່ວັດສະດຸພາຍໃນ. ຖ້າມີການລະບຸ [EditorNode3DGizmo], "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມດຶງຮູບແບບທີ່ກົງກັນ (ແບບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ/ຫຼື ແບບທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້)."

msgid ""
"Editor-only singleton that returns paths to various OS-specific data folders "
"and files."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງ (paths) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ ແລະ "
"ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຕາມແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"This editor-only singleton returns OS-specific paths to various data folders "
"and files. It can be used in editor plugins to ensure files are saved in the "
"correct location on each operating system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton is not accessible in exported projects. "
"Attempting to access it in an exported project will result in a script error "
"as the singleton won't be declared. To prevent script errors in exported "
"projects, use [method Engine.has_singleton] to check whether the singleton is "
"available before using it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Linux/BSD platform, Godot complies with the [url=https://"
"specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir-spec/basedir-spec-latest.html]XDG Base "
"Directory Specification[/url]. You can override environment variables "
"following the specification to change the editor and project data paths."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂນີ້ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງຕາມແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນ "
"ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄຟລ໌ຖືກບັນທຶກໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊິງເກິນຕັນນີ້ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (exported projects). "
"ການພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນສະຄຣິບ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຊິງເກິນຕັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະກາດໄວ້. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"Engine.has_singleton] ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າມີຊິງເກິນຕັນນີ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນແພລັດຟອມ Linux/BSD, Godot ປະຕິບັດຕາມ [url=https://"
"specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir-spec/basedir-spec-latest.html]XDG Base "
"Directory Specification[/url]. ທ່ານສາມາດໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment "
"variables) ຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດນັ້ນ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid "File paths in Godot projects"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ Godot"

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's cache folder. This folder should be "
"used for temporary data that can be removed safely whenever the editor is "
"closed (such as generated resource thumbnails).\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Godot\\\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Caches/Godot/\n"
"- Linux: ~/.cache/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງສົມບູນ (absolute path) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີແຄຊ (cache folder) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ໂຟນເດີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນຊົ່ວຄາວ ທີ່ສາມາດລຶບຖິ້ມໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພເມື່ອປິດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ).\n"
"[b]ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Godot\\\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Caches/Godot/\n"
"- Linux: ~/.cache/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's configuration folder. This folder "
"should be used for [i]persistent[/i] user configuration files.\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (same as `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (same as `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.config/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງສົມບູນ ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration folder) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ໂຟນເດີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບ [i]ຖາວອນ[/i].\n"
"[b]ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (ຄືກັນກັບ `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (ຄືກັນກັບ `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.config/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's data folder. This folder should be "
"used for [i]persistent[/i] user data files such as installed export "
"templates.\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (same as "
"`get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (same as `get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.local/share/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງສົມບູນ ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນ (data folder) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ໂຟນເດີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບ "
"[i]ຖາວອນ[/i] ເຊັ່ນ ເທັມເພລັດການສົ່ງອອກ (export templates) ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (ຄືກັນກັບ `get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (ຄືກັນກັບ `get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.local/share/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns the relative path to the editor settings for this project. This is "
"usually [code]\"res://.godot/editor\"[/code]. Projects all have a unique "
"subdirectory inside the settings path where project-specific editor settings "
"are saved."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງສຳພັດ (relative path) ໄປຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກນີ້. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນ "
"[code]\"res://.godot/editor\"[/code]. ທຸກໆໂປຣເຈັກຈະມີໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ "
"ພາຍໃນເສັ້ນທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະຂອງໂປຣເຈັກນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the self-contained file that makes the current "
"Godot editor instance be considered as self-contained. Returns an empty "
"string if the current Godot editor instance isn't self-contained. See also "
"[method is_self_contained]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງສົມບູນ ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot "
"ປັດຈຸບັນຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນແບບເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ (self-contained). ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ "
"ຖ້າຕົວແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ. ເບິ່ງ [method is_self_contained] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the editor is marked as self-contained, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise. When self-contained mode is enabled, user "
"configuration, data and cache files are saved in an [code]editor_data/[/code] "
"folder next to the editor binary. This makes portable usage easier and "
"ensures the Godot editor minimizes file writes outside its own folder. Self-"
"contained mode is not available for exported projects.\n"
"Self-contained mode can be enabled by creating a file named [code]._sc_[/"
"code] or [code]_sc_[/code] in the same folder as the editor binary or "
"macOS .app bundle while the editor is not running. See also [method "
"get_self_contained_file].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, quarantine flag should be manually removed before "
"using self-contained mode, see [url=https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"tutorials/export/running_on_macos.html]Running on macOS[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, placing [code]_sc_[/code] or any other file "
"inside .app bundle will break digital signature and make it non-portable, "
"consider placing it in the same folder as the .app bundle instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Steam release of Godot uses self-contained mode by default."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວແກ້ໄຂຖືກໝາຍວ່າເປັນແບບເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ (self-contained), "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແມ່ນ [code]false[/code]. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ, ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ແຄຊ "
"ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]editor_data/[/code] ຂ້າງໆກັບໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີ (binary) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການໃຊ້ງານແບບພົກພາ (portable) ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot "
"ຈະຂຽນໄຟລ໌ອອກນອກໂຟນເດີຂອງມັນໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ. ໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວນີ້ ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ ໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ [code]._sc_[/code] ຫຼື [code]_sc_[/code] "
"ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ບາຍນາຣີຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື .app bundle ຂອງ macOS "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ເບິ່ງ [method get_self_contained_file] ປະກອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ຄວນລຶບ quarantine flag "
"ອອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນໃຊ້ໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ macOS, ການວາງໄຟລ໌ [code]_sc_[/code] ໄວ້ພາຍໃນ .app bundle "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍເຊັນດິຈິຕອນເສຍ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດພົກພາໄດ້, ຄວນວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວກັນກັບ .app "
"bundle ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Godot ເວີຊັນໃນ Steam ຈະໃຊ້ໂໝດເບັດເສັດໃນຕົວເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Used by the editor to extend its functionality."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Plugins are used by the editor to extend functionality. The most common types "
"of plugins are those which edit a given node or resource type, import plugins "
"and export plugins. See also [EditorScript] to add functions to the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some names in this class contain \"left\" or \"right\" (e.g. "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_LEFT_UL]). These APIs assume left-to-right layout, and "
"would be backwards when using right-to-left layout. These names are kept for "
"compatibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ (Plugins) ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມສາມາດ. ປະເພດຂອງປລັກອິນທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດຄື "
"ປລັກອິນສຳລັບແກ້ໄຂໂນດ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນບາງປະເພດ, ປລັກອິນນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ແລະ ປລັກອິນສົ່ງອອກ "
"(export). ເບິ່ງ [EditorScript] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນໃຫ້ກັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບາງຊື່ໃນຄລາສນີ້ມີຄຳວ່າ \"left\" (ຊ້າຍ) ຫຼື \"right\" (ຂວາ) (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_LEFT_UL]). API ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສົມມຸດການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ, ແລະ "
"ຈະປີ້ນກັບກັນເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ. ຊື່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ (compatibility)."

msgid "Editor plugins documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ"

msgid ""
"This method is called when the editor is about to save the project, switch to "
"another tab, etc. It asks the plugin to apply any pending state changes to "
"ensure consistency.\n"
"This is used, for example, in shader editors to let the plugin know that it "
"must apply the shader code being written by the user to the object."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂກຳລັງຈະບັນທຶກໂປຣເຈັກ, ສະຫຼັບແທັບ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. "
"ມັນຈະບອກໃຫ້ປລັກອິນນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂເຊດເດີ (shader editors) ເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ປລັກອິນນຳໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດເຊດເດີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂຽນ "
"ໃສ່ໃນອອບເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"This method is called when the editor is about to run the project. The plugin "
"can then perform required operations before the project runs.\n"
"This method must return a boolean. If this method returns [code]false[/code], "
"the project will not run. The run is aborted immediately, so this also "
"prevents all other plugins' [method _build] methods from running."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂກຳລັງຈະຣັນ (run) ໂປຣເຈັກ. "
"ປລັກອິນສາມາດເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຈຳເປັນກ່ອນໂປຣເຈັກຈະຣັນ.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າບູລີນ (boolean). ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code], ໂປຣເຈັກຈະບໍ່ຣັນ. "
"ການຣັນຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກທັນທີ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເມທອດ [method _build] ຂອງປລັກອິນອື່ນໆເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

msgid ""
"Clear all the state and reset the object being edited to zero. This ensures "
"your plugin does not keep editing a currently existing node, or a node from "
"the wrong scene."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງສະຖານະທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຣີເຊັດອອບເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ເປັນສູນ. "
"ນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ແກ້ໄຂໂນດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ໂນດຈາກສາກທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the user disables the [EditorPlugin] in the Plugin "
"tab of the project settings window."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ (engine) ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ [EditorPlugin] ໃນແທັບ Plugin "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"This function is used for plugins that edit specific object types (nodes or "
"resources). It requests the editor to edit the given object.\n"
"[param object] can be [code]null[/code] if the plugin was editing an object, "
"but there is no longer any selected object handled by this plugin. It can be "
"used to cleanup editing state."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປລັກອິນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກບາງປະເພດ (ໂນດ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນ). ມັນຈະຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"ແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"
"[param object] ສາມາດເປັນ [code]null[/code] ໄດ້ ຖ້າປລັກອິນເຄີຍແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກຢູ່ "
"ແຕ່ຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ມີອອບເຈັກໃດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃຫ້ປລັກອິນນີ້ຈັດການແລ້ວ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລ້າງສະຖານະການແກ້ໄຂ "
"(cleanup state) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the user enables the [EditorPlugin] in the Plugin "
"tab of the project settings window."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [EditorPlugin] ໃນແທັບ Plugin "
"ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the 3D editor's viewport is updated. [param "
"viewport_control] is an overlay on top of the viewport and it can be used for "
"drawing. You can update the viewport manually by calling [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Forward3DDrawOverViewport(Control viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"viewportCamera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ ເມື່ອວິວພອດ (viewport) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິຖືກອັບເດດ. [param "
"viewport_control] ແມ່ນເລເຢີວາງຊ້ອນ (overlay) ເທິງວິວພອດ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດວິວພອດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງມົນຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີ (cursor).\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# ແຕ້ມວິວພອດໃໝ່ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"This method is the same as [method _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport], except it "
"draws on top of everything. Useful when you need an extra layer that shows "
"over anything else.\n"
"You need to enable calling of this method by using [method "
"set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຄືກັນກັບ [method _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport], "
"ແຕ່ວ່າມັນຈະແຕ້ມຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງທຸກຢ່າງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລເຢີພິເສດທີ່ສະແດງທັບທຸກສິ່ງ.\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Called when there is a root node in the current edited scene, [method "
"_handles] is implemented, and an [InputEvent] happens in the 3D viewport. The "
"return value decides whether the [InputEvent] is consumed or forwarded to "
"other [EditorPlugin]s. See [enum AfterGUIInput] for options.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method must return [constant AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS] in order to forward "
"the [InputEvent] to other Editor classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP if event is InputEventMouseMotion "
"else EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn @event is InputEventMouseMotion ? EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop : "
"EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີໂນດຮາກໃນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ, ມີການສ້າງ [method _handles], ແລະ ມີ [InputEvent] "
"ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນວິວພອດ 3 ມິຕິ. ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະກຳນົດວ່າ [InputEvent] ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ (consumed) ຫຼື ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໃຫ້ "
"[EditorPlugin] ອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ [enum AfterGUIInput] ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ InputEvent ສົ່ງໄປເຖິງຄລາສອື່ນໆຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນ [constant AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS] ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບຄລາສອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the 2D editor's viewport is updated. [param "
"viewport_control] is an overlay on top of the viewport and it can be used for "
"drawing. You can update the viewport manually by calling [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _ForwardCanvasDrawOverViewport(Control viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໂດຍເອນຈິນ ເມື່ອວິວພອດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິຖືກອັບເດດ. [param viewport_control] "
"ແມ່ນເລເຢີວາງຊ້ອນເທິງວິວພອດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດວິວພອດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການເອີ້ນ "
"[method update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# ແຕ້ມຮູບວົງມົນຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີ.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"This method is the same as [method _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], "
"except it draws on top of everything. Useful when you need an extra layer "
"that shows over anything else.\n"
"You need to enable calling of this method by using [method "
"set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຄືກັນກັບ [method _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], "
"ແຕ່ວ່າມັນຈະແຕ້ມຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງທຸກຢ່າງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລເຢີພິເສດ.\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."

msgid ""
"Called when there is a root node in the current edited scene, [method "
"_handles] is implemented, and an [InputEvent] happens in the 2D viewport. If "
"this method returns [code]true[/code], [param event] is intercepted by this "
"[EditorPlugin], otherwise [param event] is forwarded to other Editor "
"classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"public override bool ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn true;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method must return [code]false[/code] in order to forward the "
"[InputEvent] to other Editor classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif (event is InputEventMouseMotion):\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີໂນດຮາກໃນສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ, ມີການສ້າງ [method _handles], ແລະ ມີ [InputEvent] "
"ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນວິວພອດ 2 ມິຕິ. ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], [param event] "
"ຈະຖືກດັກຈັບໂດຍປລັກອິນນີ້, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ [param event] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໃຫ້ຄລາສອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ InputEvent ສົ່ງໄປເຖິງຄລາສອື່ນໆ.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code] ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບຄລາສອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"This is for editors that edit script-based objects. You can return a list of "
"breakpoints in the format ([code]script:line[/code]), for example: "
"[code]res://path_to_script.gd:25[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກທີ່ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ. ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoints) "
"ໃນຮູບແບບ ([code]script:line[/code]), ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]res://path_to_script.gd:25[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method in your plugin to return a [Texture2D] in order to give "
"it an icon.\n"
"For main screen plugins, this appears at the top of the screen, to the right "
"of the \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\", and \"Asset Store\" buttons.\n"
"Ideally, the plugin icon should be white with a transparent background and "
"16×16 pixels in size.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_plugin_icon():\n"
"\t# You can use a custom icon:\n"
"\treturn preload(\"res://addons/my_plugin/my_plugin_icon.svg\")\n"
"\t# Or use a built-in icon:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Texture2D _GetPluginIcon()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// You can use a custom icon:\n"
"\treturn ResourceLoader.Load<Texture2D>(\"res://addons/my_plugin/"
"my_plugin_icon.svg\");\n"
"\t// Or use a built-in icon:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorTheme().GetIcon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ໃນປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນ [Texture2D] ເພື່ອກຳນົດໄອຄອນໃຫ້ມັນ.\n"
"ສຳລັບປລັກອິນໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ, ໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງປຸ່ມ \"2D\", \"3D\", "
"\"Script\", \"Game\", ແລະ \"Asset Store\".\n"
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໄອຄອນປລັກອິນຄວນເປັນສີຂາວ ພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ມີຂະໜາດ 16×16 ພິກເຊວ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_plugin_icon():\n"
"\t# ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄອຄອນກຳນົດເອງ:\n"
"\treturn preload(\"res://addons/my_plugin/my_plugin_icon.svg\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Override this method in your plugin to provide the name of the plugin when "
"displayed in the Godot editor.\n"
"For main screen plugins, this appears at the top of the screen, to the right "
"of the \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\", and \"Asset Store\" buttons."
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ໃນປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊື່ປລັກອິນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Godot.\n"
"ສຳລັບປລັກອິນໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ, ຊື່ນີ້ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງປຸ່ມ \"2D\", \"3D\", "
"\"Script\", \"Game\", ແລະ \"Asset Store\"."

msgid ""
"Override this method to provide a state data you want to be saved, like view "
"position, grid settings, folding, etc. This is used when saving the scene (so "
"state is kept when opening it again) and for switching tabs (so state can be "
"restored when the tab returns). This data is automatically saved for each "
"scene in an [code]editstate[/code] file in the editor metadata folder. If you "
"want to store global (scene-independent) editor data for your plugin, you can "
"use [method _get_window_layout] instead.\n"
"Use [method _set_state] to restore your saved state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used to save important settings that "
"should persist with the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must implement [method _get_plugin_name] for the state to be "
"stored and restored correctly.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_state():\n"
"\tvar state = { \"zoom\": zoom, \"preferred_color\": my_color }\n"
"\treturn state\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກ ເຊັ່ນ ຕຳແໜ່ງມຸມມອງ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນຕາໜ່າງ, "
"ການພັບໂຄ້ດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອບັນທຶກສາກ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະຖານະຍັງຢູ່ເມື່ອເປີດຄືນໃໝ່) ແລະ "
"ເມື່ອສະຫຼັບແທັບ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສາກໃນໄຟລ໌ [code]editstate[/code]. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບທົ່ວໄປ (ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສາກ), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method _get_window_layout] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method _set_state] ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າສະຖານະທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ [method _get_plugin_name] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະຖານະຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະ "
"ຄືນຄ່າໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to provide a custom message that lists unsaved changes. "
"The editor will call this method when exiting or when closing a scene, and "
"display the returned string in a confirmation dialog. Return empty string if "
"the plugin has no unsaved changes.\n"
"When closing a scene, [param for_scene] is the path to the scene being "
"closed. You can use it to handle built-in resources in that scene.\n"
"If the user confirms saving, [method _save_external_data] will be called, "
"before closing the editor.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_unsaved_status(for_scene):\n"
"\tif not unsaved:\n"
"\t\treturn \"\"\n"
"\n"
"\tif for_scene.is_empty():\n"
"\t\treturn \"Save changes in MyCustomPlugin before closing?\"\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\treturn \"Scene %s has changes from MyCustomPlugin. Save before closing?\" "
"% for_scene.get_file()\n"
"\n"
"func _save_external_data():\n"
"\tunsaved = false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If the plugin has no scene-specific changes, you can ignore the calls when "
"closing scenes:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_unsaved_status(for_scene):\n"
"\tif not for_scene.is_empty():\n"
"\t\treturn \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສະແດງລາຍການການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກ. "
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ເມື່ອປິດໂປຣແກຣມ ຫຼື ປິດສາກ, ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຢືນຢັນ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ.\n"
"ເມື່ອປິດສາກ, [param for_scene] ຄືເສັ້ນທາງຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງຈະປິດ.\n"
"ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນການບັນທຶກ, [method _save_external_data] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນກ່ອນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະປິດ."

msgid ""
"Override this method to provide the GUI layout of the plugin or any other "
"data you want to be stored. This is used to save the project's editor layout "
"when [method queue_save_layout] is called or the editor layout was changed "
"(for example changing the position of a dock). The data is stored in the "
"[code]editor_layout.cfg[/code] file in the editor metadata directory.\n"
"Use [method _set_window_layout] to restore your saved layout.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_window_layout(configuration):\n"
"\tconfiguration.set_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"window_position\", "
"$Window.position)\n"
"\tconfiguration.set_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"icon_color\", $Icon.modulate)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ໂອເວີໄຣດ໌ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດວາງ GUI ຂອງປລັກອິນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດເກັບ. "
"ນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຈັດວາງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ ເມື່ອ [method queue_save_layout] ຖືກເອີ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງການຈັດວາງ (ເຊັ່ນ ການຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງແຜງດັອກ). ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"[code]editor_layout.cfg[/code].\n"
"ໃຊ້ [method _set_window_layout] ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າການຈັດວາງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Implement this function if your plugin edits a specific type of object "
"(Resource or Node). If you return [code]true[/code], then you will get the "
"functions [method _edit] and [method _make_visible] called when the editor "
"requests them. If you have declared the methods [method "
"_forward_canvas_gui_input] and [method _forward_3d_gui_input] these will be "
"called too.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each plugin should handle only one type of objects at a time. If "
"a plugin handles more types of objects and they are edited at the same time, "
"it will result in errors."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖ້າປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກບາງປະເພດ (Resource ຫຼື Node). ຖ້າທ່ານສົ່ງຄືນ "
"[code]true[/code], ຟັງຊັນ [method _edit] ແລະ [method _make_visible] "
"ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂຕ້ອງການ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີການປະກາດເມທອດ [method "
"_forward_canvas_gui_input] ແລະ [method _forward_3d_gui_input], "
"ພວກມັນກໍຈະຖືກເອີ້ນນຳເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແຕ່ລະປລັກອິນຄວນຈັດການອອບເຈັກພຽງປະເພດດຽວໃນຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງ. ຖ້າປລັກອິນຈັດການຫຼາຍປະເພດ "
"ແລະ ຖືກແກ້ໄຂພ້ອມກັນ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"This function will be called when the editor is requested to become visible. "
"It is used for plugins that edit a specific object type.\n"
"Remember that you have to manage the visibility of all your editor controls "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ສະແດງຜົນ (visible). "
"ມັນໃຊ້ສຳລັບປລັກອິນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂອອບເຈັກບາງປະເພດ.\n"
"ຢ່າລືມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນ (visibility) "
"ຂອງການຄວບຄຸມທັງໝົດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"This function is called when an individual scene is about to be played in the "
"editor. [param args] is a list of command line arguments that will be passed "
"to the new Godot instance, which will be replaced by the list returned by "
"this function.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _run_scene(scene, args):\n"
"\targs.append(\"--an-extra-argument\")\n"
"\treturn args\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Text that is printed in this method will not be visible in the "
"editor's Output panel unless [member EditorSettings.run/output/"
"always_clear_output_on_play] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອສາກໃດໜຶ່ງກຳລັງຈະຖືກຫຼິ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. [param args] "
"ແມ່ນລາຍການອາກິວເມນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປຫາ Godot ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍລາຍການທີ່ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກພິມ (print) ໃນເມທອດນີ້ ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນແຜງ Output ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ "
"ນອກຈາກວ່າ [member EditorSettings.run/output/always_clear_output_on_play] ຈະເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"This method is called after the editor saves the project or when it's closed. "
"It asks the plugin to save edited external scenes/resources."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນຫຼັງຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂບັນທຶກໂປຣເຈັກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອໂປຣແກຣມຖືກປິດ. ມັນຈະບອກໃຫ້ປລັກອິນບັນທຶກສາກ ຫຼື "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Restore the state saved by [method _get_state]. This method is called when "
"the current scene tab is changed in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Your plugin must implement [method _get_plugin_name], otherwise "
"it will not be recognized and this method will not be called.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _set_state(data):\n"
"\tzoom = data.get(\"zoom\", 1.0)\n"
"\tpreferred_color = data.get(\"my_color\", Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສະຖານະທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໂດຍ [method _get_state]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແທັບສາກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງມີ [method _get_plugin_name], ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້ "
"ແລະ ເມທອດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Restore the plugin GUI layout and data saved by [method _get_window_layout]. "
"This method is called for every plugin on editor startup. Use the provided "
"[param configuration] file to read your saved data.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _set_window_layout(configuration):\n"
"\t$Window.position = configuration.get_value(\"MyPlugin\", "
"\"window_position\", Vector2())\n"
"\t$Icon.modulate = configuration.get_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"icon_color\", "
"Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າການຈັດວາງ GUI ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງປລັກອິນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໂດຍ [method _get_window_layout]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນສຳລັບທຸກປລັກອິນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ [param configuration] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເພື່ອອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້."

msgid "Adds a script at [param path] to the Autoload list as [param name]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບຕາມ [param path] ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ Autoload ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ [param name]."

msgid ""
"Adds a plugin to the context menu. [param slot] is the context menu where the "
"plugin will be added.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A plugin instance can belong only to a single context menu slot."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປລັກອິນໃສ່ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ (context menu). [param slot] "
"ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງເມນູທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມປລັກອິນເຂົ້າໄປ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງປລັກອິນໜຶ່ງ ສາມາດຢູ່ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເມນູດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Use [method add_dock] instead, with [member EditorDock.default_slot] set to "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM]."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_dock] ແທນ, ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member EditorDock.default_slot] ເປັນ "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM]."

msgid ""
"Adds a control to the bottom panel (together with Output, Debug, Animation, "
"etc.). Returns a reference to a button that is outside the scene tree. It's "
"up to you to hide/show the button when needed. When your plugin is "
"deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control with [method "
"remove_control_from_bottom_panel] and free it with [method Node.queue_free].\n"
"[param shortcut] is a shortcut that, when activated, will toggle the bottom "
"panel's visibility. The shortcut object is only set when this control is "
"added to the bottom panel.\n"
"[b]Note[/b] See the default editor bottom panel shortcuts in the Editor "
"Settings for inspiration. By convention, they all use [kbd]Alt[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຄວບຄຸມ (control) ໃສ່ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ (ຮ່ວມກັບ Output, Debug, Animation, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). "
"ສົ່ງຄືນການອ້າງອີງເຖິງປຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ນອກທຣີຂອງສາກ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການການເຊື່ອງ/ສະແດງປຸ່ມນັ້ນເອງ. "
"ເມື່ອປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຢ່າລືມລຶບການຄວບຄຸມອອກດ້ວຍ [method "
"remove_control_from_bottom_panel] ແລະ ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳດ້ວຍ [method "
"Node.queue_free].\n"
"[param shortcut] ແມ່ນປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ເມື່ອກົດແລ້ວຈະສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom control to a container in the editor UI.\n"
"Please remember that you have to manage the visibility of your custom "
"controls yourself (and likely hide it after adding it).\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control with "
"[method remove_control_from_container] and free it with [method "
"Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຄວບຄຸມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ (container) ໃນ UI ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"ຢ່າລືມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການການສະແດງຜົນຂອງການຄວບຄຸມເອງ (ແລະ ຄວນເຊື່ອງມັນຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມແລ້ວ).\n"
"ເມື່ອປລັກອິນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ລຶບມັນອອກດ້ວຍ [method remove_control_from_container] ແລະ "
"ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳດ້ວຍ [method Node.queue_free]."

msgid "Use [method add_dock] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_dock] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Adds the control to a specific dock slot.\n"
"If the dock is repositioned and as long as the plugin is active, the editor "
"will save the dock position on further sessions.\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control with "
"[method remove_control_from_docks] and free it with [method "
"Node.queue_free].\n"
"Optionally, you can specify a shortcut parameter. When pressed, this shortcut "
"will open and focus the dock."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຄວບຄຸມໃສ່ຕຳແໜ່ງແຜງດັອກ (dock slot) ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"ຖ້າແຜງດັອກຖືກຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ປລັກອິນຍັງເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະບັນທຶກຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນໄວ້ສຳລັບຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"ເມື່ອປລັກອິນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ລຶບມັນອອກດ້ວຍ [method remove_control_from_docks] ແລະ "
"ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳດ້ວຍ [method Node.queue_free]."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom type, which will appear in the list of nodes or resources.\n"
"When a given node or resource is selected, the base type will be instantiated "
"(e.g. \"Node3D\", \"Control\", \"Resource\"), then the script will be loaded "
"and set to this object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The base type is the base engine class which this type's class "
"hierarchy inherits, not any custom type parent classes.\n"
"You can use the virtual method [method _handles] to check if your custom "
"object is being edited by checking the script or using the [code]is[/code] "
"keyword.\n"
"During run-time, this will be a simple object with a script so this function "
"does not need to be called then.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom types added this way are not true classes. They are just "
"a helper to create a node with specific script."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປະເພດກຳນົດເອງ (custom type), ເຊິ່ງຈະປາກົດໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງໂນດ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອໂນດ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນຖືກເລືອກ, ປະເພດພື້ນຖານຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ \"Node3D\", \"Control\", "
"\"Resource\"), ຈາກນັ້ນສະຄຣິບຈະຖືກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອອບເຈັກນີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດພື້ນຖານຄືຄລາສຂອງເອນຈິນທີ່ປະເພດນີ້ສືບທອດມາ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄລາສກຳນົດເອງອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method _handles] ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າອອບເຈັກຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປະເພດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄລາສແທ້ໆ, "
"ແຕ່ເປັນພຽງເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍສ້າງໂນດພ້ອມກັບສະຄຣິບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [Script] as debugger plugin to the Debugger. The script must extend "
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [Script] ເປັນປລັກອິນຕົວດີບັກ (debugger plugin) ເຂົ້າໃນ Debugger. "
"ສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງຂະຫຍາຍມາຈາກ [EditorDebuggerPlugin]."

msgid ""
"Adds a new dock.\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom dock with "
"[method remove_dock] and free it with [method Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແຜງດັອກ (dock) ໃໝ່.\n"
"ເມື່ອປລັກອິນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ລຶບແຜງດັອກອອກດ້ວຍ [method remove_dock] ແລະ ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳດ້ວຍ "
"[method Node.queue_free]."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorExportPlatform]. Export platforms provides "
"functionality of exporting to the specific platform."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorExportPlatform] ໃໝ່. "
"ແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກໄປຫາແພລັດຟອມນັ້ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorExportPlugin]. Export plugins are used to perform "
"tasks when the project is being exported.\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorExportPlugin] ໃໝ່. "
"ປລັກອິນສົ່ງອອກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣເຈັກກຳລັງຖືກສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_inspector_plugin] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການລົງທະບຽນປລັກອິນ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorImportPlugin]. Import plugins are used to import "
"custom and unsupported assets as a custom [Resource] type.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to import custom 3D asset formats use [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin] instead.\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorImportPlugin] ໃໝ່. ປລັກອິນນຳເຂົ້າໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ Godot ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"[Resource] ແບບກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param first_priority] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປລັກອິນຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ ແລະ "
"ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າປລັກອິນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ 3D ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorInspectorPlugin]. Inspector plugins are used to extend "
"[EditorInspector] and provide custom configuration tools for your object's "
"properties.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Always use [method remove_inspector_plugin] to remove the "
"registered [EditorInspectorPlugin] when your [EditorPlugin] is disabled to "
"prevent leaks and an unexpected behavior.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MyInspectorPlugin = preload(\"res://addons/your_addon/path/to/your/"
"script.gd\")\n"
"var inspector_plugin = MyInspectorPlugin.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorInspectorPlugin] ໃໝ່. ປລັກອິນ Inspector ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[EditorInspector] ແລະ ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງອອບເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວນໃຊ້ [method remove_inspector_plugin] "
"ເພື່ອລຶບປລັກອິນອອກສະເໝີເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານປລັກອິນ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin]. Gizmo plugins are used to add "
"custom gizmos to the 3D preview viewport for a [Node3D].\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] ໃໝ່. ປລັກອິນກິສໂມໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມກິສໂມກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນວິວພອດ "
"3 ມິຕິສຳລັບ [Node3D].\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [method add_inspector_plugin] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorResourceConversionPlugin]. Resource conversion plugins "
"are used to add custom resource converters to the editor inspector.\n"
"See [EditorResourceConversionPlugin] for an example of how to create a "
"resource conversion plugin."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorResourceConversionPlugin] ໃໝ່. "
"ປລັກອິນການແປງຊັບພະຍາກອນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງມືແປງປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ Inspector ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorSceneFormatImporter]. Scene importers are used to "
"import custom 3D asset formats as scenes.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorSceneFormatImporter] ໃໝ່. ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າສາກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ 3D "
"ປະເພດຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ເປັນສາກ (scene).\n"
"ຖ້າ [param first_priority] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ປລັກອິນຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຕົວທີ່ມີຢູ່ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Add an [EditorScenePostImportPlugin]. These plugins allow customizing the "
"import process of 3D assets by adding new options to the import dialogs.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [EditorScenePostImportPlugin]. ປລັກອິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນຫຼັງການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ "
"3D ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃໝ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom menu item to [b]Project > Tools[/b] named [param name]. When "
"clicked, the provided [param callable] will be called."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມລາຍການເມນູກຳນົດເອງໃນ [b]Project > Tools[/b] ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ [param name]. ເມື່ອຄລິກແລ້ວ, "
"[param callable] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom [PopupMenu] submenu under [b]Project > Tools >[/b] [param "
"name]. Use [method remove_tool_menu_item] on plugin clean up to remove the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍ [PopupMenu] ພາຍໃຕ້ [b]Project > Tools >[/b] [param name]. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method remove_tool_menu_item] ເມື່ອປິດປລັກອິນເພື່ອລຶບເມນູອອກ."

msgid ""
"Registers a custom translation parser plugin for extracting translatable "
"strings from custom files."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນປລັກອິນຕົວແປພາສາ (translation parser) ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈາກໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Hooks a callback into the undo/redo action creation when a property is "
"modified in the inspector. This allows, for example, to save other properties "
"that may be lost when a given property is modified.\n"
"The callback should have 4 arguments: [Object] [code]undo_redo[/code], "
"[Object] [code]modified_object[/code], [String] [code]property[/code] and "
"[Variant] [code]new_value[/code]. They are, respectively, the [UndoRedo] "
"object used by the inspector, the currently modified object, the name of the "
"modified property and the new value the property is about to take."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກ (callback) ເຂົ້າກັບການສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງ undo/redo ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນ "
"Inspector. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດບັນທຶກຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆທີ່ອາດຈະສູນຫາຍໄປເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຟັງຊັນ callback ຄວນມີ 4 ອາກິວເມນ: [code]undo_redo[/code], [code]modified_object[/"
"code], [code]property[/code] ແລະ [code]new_value[/code]."

msgid ""
"[EditorInterface] is a global singleton and can be accessed directly by its "
"name."
msgstr ""
"[EditorInterface] ແມ່ນຊິງເກິນຕັນ (singleton) ແບບທົ່ວໂລກ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານຊື່ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Returns the [EditorInterface] singleton instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຊິງເກິນຕັນຂອງ [EditorInterface]."

msgid "Returns the [PopupMenu] under [b]Scene > Export As...[/b]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [PopupMenu] ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ [b]Scene > Export As...[/b]."

msgid ""
"Provide the version of the plugin declared in the [code]plugin.cfg[/code] "
"config file."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເວີຊັນຂອງປລັກອິນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ [code]plugin.cfg[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets the Editor's dialog used for making scripts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Users can configure it before use.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບ (dialog) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນກ່ອນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການລຶບ ແລະ ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໂນດນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Gets the undo/redo object. Most actions in the editor can be undoable, so use "
"this object to make sure this happens when it's worth it."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງອອບເຈັກ undo/redo. ການກະທຳສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອອບເຈັກນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າສາມາດຍົກເລີກການກະທຳນັ້ນໄດ້."

msgid "Minimizes the bottom panel."
msgstr "ພັບແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມລົງ."

msgid "Makes a specific item in the bottom panel visible."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມສະແດງອອກມາ."

msgid "Queue save the project's editor layout."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄິວການບັນທຶກການຈັດວາງ (layout) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid "Removes an Autoload [param name] from the list."
msgstr "ລຶບ Autoload ຊື່ [param name] ອອກຈາກລາຍການ."

msgid "Removes the specified context menu plugin."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນເມນູຄລິກຂວາທີ່ລະບຸອອກ."

msgid "Use [method remove_dock] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method remove_dock] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Removes the control from the bottom panel. You have to manually [method "
"Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບການຄວບຄຸມອອກຈາກແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ [method Node.queue_free] "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

msgid ""
"Removes the control from the specified container. You have to manually "
"[method Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr "ລຶບການຄວບຄຸມອອກຈາກຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ລະບຸ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ [method Node.queue_free] ເອງ."

msgid ""
"Removes the control from the dock. You have to manually [method "
"Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr "ລຶບການຄວບຄຸມອອກຈາກແຜງດັອກ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນ [method Node.queue_free] ເອງ."

msgid "Removes a custom type added by [method add_custom_type]."
msgstr "ລຶບປະເພດກຳນົດເອງທີ່ເພີ່ມໂດຍ [method add_custom_type] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes the debugger plugin with given script from the Debugger."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນຕົວດີບັກທີ່ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນັ້ນອອກຈາກ Debugger."

msgid ""
"Removes [param dock] from the available docks. You should manually call "
"[method Node.queue_free] to free it."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບ [param dock] ອອກຈາກແຜງດັອກທີ່ມີຢູ່. ທ່ານຄວນເອີ້ນ [method Node.queue_free] "
"ເອງເພື່ອຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

msgid "Removes an export platform registered by [method add_export_platform]."
msgstr "ລຶບແພລັດຟອມການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_export_platform] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes an export plugin registered by [method add_export_plugin]."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_export_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes an import plugin registered by [method add_import_plugin]."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນການນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_import_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes an inspector plugin registered by [method add_inspector_plugin]."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນ Inspector ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_inspector_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes a gizmo plugin registered by [method add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin]."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນກິສໂມທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Removes a resource conversion plugin registered by [method "
"add_resource_conversion_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບປລັກອິນການແປງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_resource_conversion_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Removes a scene format importer registered by [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຮູບແບບສາກທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_scene_format_importer_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Remove the [EditorScenePostImportPlugin], added with [method "
"add_scene_post_import_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບ [EditorScenePostImportPlugin] ທີ່ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍ [method "
"add_scene_post_import_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid "Removes a menu [param name] from [b]Project > Tools[/b]."
msgstr "ລຶບເມນູຊື່ [param name] ອອກຈາກ [b]Project > Tools[/b]."

msgid ""
"Removes a custom translation parser plugin registered by [method "
"add_translation_parser_plugin]."
msgstr "ລຶບປລັກອິນຕົວແປພາສາທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍ [method add_translation_parser_plugin] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Removes a callback previously added by [method "
"add_undo_redo_inspector_hook_callback]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບ callback ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ໂດຍ [method add_undo_redo_inspector_hook_callback] ອອກ."

msgid "Use [member EditorDock.dock_icon] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member EditorDock.dock_icon] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the tab icon for the given control in a dock slot. Setting to "
"[code]null[/code] removes the icon."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໄອຄອນແທັບສຳລັບການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນແຜງດັອກ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]null[/code] "
"ຈະເປັນການລຶບໄອຄອນອອກ."

msgid ""
"Enables calling of [method _forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport] for the "
"2D editor and [method _forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] for the 3D editor "
"when their viewports are updated. You need to call this method only once and "
"it will work permanently for this plugin."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນ [method _forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport] ແລະ [method "
"_forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] ເມື່ອວິວພອດຖືກອັບເດດ. "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ ແລະ ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຕະຫຼອດໄປສຳລັບປລັກອິນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Use this method if you always want to receive inputs from 3D view screen "
"inside [method _forward_3d_gui_input]. It might be especially usable if your "
"plugin will want to use raycast in the scene."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮັບອິນພຸດຈາກໜ້າຈໍ 3D ສະເໝີໃນ [method _forward_3d_gui_input]. "
"ມັນຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຖ້າປລັກອິນຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ raycast ໃນສາກ."

msgid ""
"Updates the overlays of the 2D and 3D editor viewport. Causes methods [method "
"_forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_3d_draw_over_viewport] and [method "
"_forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] to be called."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດເລເຢີວາງຊ້ອນ (overlays) ຂອງວິວພອດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິ ແລະ 3 ມິຕິ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ເມທອດການແຕ້ມຕ່າງໆ "
"ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when user changes the workspace ([b]2D[/b], [b]3D[/b], [b]Script[/b], "
"[b]Game[/b], [b]Asset Store[/b]). Also works with custom screens defined by "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ ([b]2D[/b], [b]3D[/b], [b]Script[/b], [b]Game[/b], "
"[b]Asset Store[/b]). ຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບໜ້າຈໍກຳນົດເອງທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍປລັກອິນນຳ."

msgid "Use [signal ProjectSettings.settings_changed] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [signal ProjectSettings.settings_changed] ແທນ."

msgid "Emitted when any project setting has changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກໃດໜຶ່ງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the given [param resource] was saved on disc. See also [signal "
"scene_saved]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param resource] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌ (disc). ເບິ່ງ [signal "
"scene_saved] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the scene is changed in the editor. The argument will return the "
"root node of the scene that has just become active. If this scene is new and "
"empty, the argument will be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນສາກໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ. ອາກິວເມນຈະສົ່ງຄືນໂນດຮາກຂອງສາກທີ່ຫາກໍຖືກເປີດໃຊ້. "
"ຖ້າສາກນັ້ນເປັນສາກໃໝ່ ແລະ ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Emitted when user closes a scene. The argument is a file path to the closed "
"scene."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປິດສາກ. ອາກິວເມນແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຂອງສາກທີ່ຖືກປິດ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a scene was saved on disc. The argument is a file path to the "
"saved scene. See also [signal resource_saved]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອສາກຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌. ອາກິວເມນແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຂອງສາກທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ. ເບິ່ງ [signal "
"resource_saved] ປະກອບ."

msgid "Main editor toolbar, next to play buttons."
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ຢູ່ຂ້າງປຸ່ມຫຼິ້ນ (play buttons)."

msgid "The toolbar that appears when 3D editor is active."
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid "Left sidebar of the 3D editor."
msgstr "ແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Right sidebar of the 3D editor."
msgstr "ແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງຂວາຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Bottom panel of the 3D editor."
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 3 ມິຕິ."

msgid "The toolbar that appears when 2D editor is active."
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid "Left sidebar of the 2D editor."
msgstr "ແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Right sidebar of the 2D editor."
msgstr "ແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງຂວາຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Bottom panel of the 2D editor."
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2 ມິຕິ."

msgid "Bottom section of the inspector."
msgstr "ສ່ວນລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງ Inspector."

msgid "Tab of Project Settings dialog, to the left of other tabs."
msgstr "ແທັບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງແທັບອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Tab of Project Settings dialog, to the right of other tabs."
msgstr "ແທັບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແທັບອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, bottom-right (in default layout includes FileSystem "
"dock)."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງແຜງດັອກ, ດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ລຸ່ມ-ຂວາ (ໃນການຈັດວາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະລວມມີແຜງ FileSystem)."

msgid ""
"Dock slot, right side, upper-left (in default layout includes Inspector, "
"Node, and History docks)."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງແຜງດັອກ, ດ້ານຂວາ, ເທິງ-ຊ້າຍ (ໃນການຈັດວາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະລວມມີແຜງ Inspector, Node, ແລະ "
"History)."

msgid "Forwards the [InputEvent] to other EditorPlugins."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຕໍ່ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Prevents the [InputEvent] from reaching other Editor classes."
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ [InputEvent] ສົ່ງໄປເຖິງຄລາສອື່ນໆຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Pass the [InputEvent] to other editor plugins except the main [Node3D] one. "
"This can be used to prevent node selection changes and work with sub-gizmos "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ [InputEvent] ໃຫ້ກັບປລັກອິນຕົວແກ້ໄຂອື່ນໆ ຍົກເວັ້ນປລັກອິນ [Node3D] ຫຼັກ. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການປ່ຽນແປງການເລືອກໂນດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກກັບກິສໂມຍ່ອຍແທນ."

msgid ""
"Custom control for editing properties that can be added to the "
"[EditorInspector]."
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດ ທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [EditorInspector]."

msgid ""
"A custom control for editing properties that can be added to the "
"[EditorInspector]. It is added via [EditorInspectorPlugin]."
msgstr ""
"ການຄວບຄຸມແບບກຳນົດເອງ ສຳລັບແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດ ທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [EditorInspector] ໂດຍຜ່ານ "
"[EditorInspectorPlugin]."

msgid ""
"Called when the read-only status of the property is changed. It may be used "
"to change custom controls into a read-only or modifiable state."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນເມື່ອສະຖານະການອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only) ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ອາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ ຫຼື ແບບແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

msgid "When this virtual function is called, you must update your editor."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຟັງຊັນສະເໝືອນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບເດດຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid ""
"If any of the controls added can gain keyboard focus, add it here. This "
"ensures that focus will be restored if the inspector is refreshed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການຄວບຄຸມໃດໆທີ່ເພີ່ມມາ ສາມາດຮັບໂຟກັສຄີບອດໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນທີ່ນີ້. ນີ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂຟກັສຈະຖືກຄືນຄ່າມາ ຖ້າ "
"Inspector ຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh)."

msgid "Draw property as not selected. Used by the inspector."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃນສະຖານະທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector."

msgid ""
"If one or several properties have changed, this must be called. [param field] "
"is used in case your editor can modify fields separately (as an example, "
"Vector3.x). The [param changing] argument avoids the editor requesting this "
"property to be refreshed (leave as [code]false[/code] if unsure)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຢ່າງມີການປ່ຽນແປງ, ຕ້ອງເອີ້ນເມທອດນີ້. [param field] "
"ໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານສາມາດແຍກແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ລະຟິລ (field) ໄດ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: Vector3.x)."

msgid ""
"Returns the edited object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method could return [code]null[/code] if the editor has not "
"yet been associated with a property. However, in [method _update_property] "
"and [method _set_read_only], this value is [i]guaranteed[/i] to be non-"
"[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອອບເຈັກທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າຕົວແກ້ໄຂຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກເຊື່ອມກັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns the edited property. If your editor is for a single property (added "
"via [method EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]), then this will return "
"the property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method could return [code]null[/code] if the editor has not "
"yet been associated with a property. However, in [method _update_property] "
"and [method _set_read_only], this value is [i]guaranteed[/i] to be non-"
"[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າຕົວແກ້ໄຂຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກເຊື່ອມກັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if property is drawn as selected. Used by the "
"inspector."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແຕ້ມໃນສະຖານະທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector."

msgid "Draw property as selected. Used by the inspector."
msgstr "ແຕ້ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃນສະຖານະທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Puts the [param editor] control below the property label. The control must be "
"previously added using [method Node.add_child]."
msgstr ""
"ວາງການຄວບຄຸມ [param editor] ໄວ້ກ້ອງປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ. "
"ການຄວບຄຸມຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເພີ່ມໂດຍໃຊ້ [method Node.add_child] ມາກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to a control that will be used as a reference to "
"calculate the size of the label."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງເພື່ອຄຳນວນຂະໜາດຂອງປ້າຍຊື່."

msgid "Assigns object and property to edit."
msgstr "ກຳນົດອອບເຈັກ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Forces a refresh of the property display."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການຣີເຟຣຊການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is "
"checkable."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກ (checkable) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is checked."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກໝາຍເລືອກ (checked)."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property can be "
"deleted by the user."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດຖືກລຶບໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property background "
"is drawn."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property label is "
"drawn."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແຕ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is drawn "
"with the editor theme's warning color. This is used for editable children's "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍສີຄຳເຕືອນຂອງທີມຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property can add "
"keys for animation."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Inspector, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດເພີ່ມຄີ (keys) "
"ສຳລັບອານິເມຊັນໄດ້."

msgid "Set this property to change the label (if you want to show one)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນປ້າຍ (ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງ)."

msgid "Space distribution ratio between the label and the editing field."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນການແບ່ງປັນພື້ນທີ່ລະຫວ່າງປ້າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ອງແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is read-"
"only."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is "
"selectable."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is using "
"folding."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ, ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດມີການໃຊ້ການພັບ (folding)."

msgid ""
"Emit it if you want multiple properties modified at the same time. Do not use "
"if added via [method EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍຄຸນສົມບັດພ້ອມກັນ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຫາກຖືກເພີ່ມຜ່ານ [method "
"EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]."

msgid "Used by sub-inspectors. Emit it if what was selected was an Object ID."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂດຍຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດຍ່ອຍ. ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກສິ່ງທີ່ຖືກເລືອກແມ່ນ Object ID."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the revertability (i.e., whether it has a non-default value and "
"thus is displayed with a revert icon) of a property has changed."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຄືນຄ່າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມີຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສະແດງໄອຄອນຄືນຄ່າ) "
"ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Do not emit this manually, use the [method emit_changed] method instead."
msgstr "ຫ້າມສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method emit_changed] ແທນ."

msgid "Emitted when a property was checked. Used internally."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກໝາຍເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາຍໃນ."

msgid "Emitted when a property was deleted. Used internally."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກລຶບ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to mark a property as favorited, making it appear at the "
"top of the inspector."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການໝາຍຄຸນສົມບັດໃຫ້ເປັນລາຍການທີ່ມັກ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ."

msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to add this value as an animation key (check for keying "
"being enabled first)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຄີແອນິເມຊັນ (ໃຫ້ກວດສອບກ່ອນວ່າໄດ້ເປີດການໃຊ້ງານ keying ແລ້ວ)."

msgid "Emit it if you want to key a property with a single value."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການສ້າງຄີໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດດ້ວຍຄ່າດຽວ."

msgid "Emitted when a setting override for the current project is requested."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to mark (or unmark) the value of a property for being "
"saved regardless of being equal to the default value.\n"
"The default value is the one the property will get when the node is just "
"instantiated and can come from an ancestor scene in the inheritance/"
"instantiation chain, a script or a builtin class."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ຫາກຕ້ອງການໝາຍ (ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍ) ຄ່າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຄ່ານັ້ນຈະເທົ່າກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະໄດ້ຮັບເມື່ອໂນດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ (instantiated) ແລະ "
"ສາມາດມາຈາກສາກຕົ້ນຕະກູນໃນລະບົບການສືບທອດ, ສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ຄລາສທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ."

msgid ""
"If you want a sub-resource to be edited, emit this signal with the resource."
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງສັນຍານນີ້ພ້ອມກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນ."

msgid "Emitted when selected. Used internally."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຖືກເລືອກ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Plugin for adding custom converters from one resource format to another in "
"the editor resource picker context menu; for example, converting a "
"[StandardMaterial3D] to a [ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນສຳລັບເພີ່ມຕົວແປງຮູບແບບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງຕົວເລືອກຊັບພະຍາກອນ; ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການແປງ "
"[StandardMaterial3D] ເປັນ [ShaderMaterial]."

msgid ""
"[EditorResourceConversionPlugin] is invoked when the context menu is brought "
"up for a resource in the editor inspector. Relevant conversion plugins will "
"appear as menu options to convert the given resource to a target type.\n"
"Below shows an example of a basic plugin that will convert an [ImageTexture] "
"to a [PortableCompressedTexture2D].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends EditorResourceConversionPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _handles(resource: Resource):\n"
"\treturn resource is ImageTexture\n"
"\n"
"func _converts_to():\n"
"\treturn \"PortableCompressedTexture2D\"\n"
"\n"
"func _convert(itex: Resource):\n"
"\tvar ptex = PortableCompressedTexture2D.new()\n"
"\tptex.create_from_image(itex.get_image(), "
"PortableCompressedTexture2D.COMPRESSION_MODE_LOSSLESS)\n"
"\treturn ptex\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To use an [EditorResourceConversionPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_resource_conversion_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorResourceConversionPlugin] "
"ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອເມນູຄລິກຂວາຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນຕົວຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດ. "
"ປລັກອິນການແປງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະປາກົດເປັນຕົວເລືອກໃນເມນູເພື່ອແປງຊັບພະຍາກອນນັ້ນໄປເປັນປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງປລັກອິນພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈະແປງ [ImageTexture] ໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"[PortableCompressedTexture2D].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends EditorResourceConversionPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _handles(resource: Resource):\n"
"\treturn resource is ImageTexture\n"
"\n"
"func _converts_to():\n"
"\treturn \"PortableCompressedTexture2D\"\n"
"\n"
"func _convert(itex: Resource):\n"
"\tvar ptex = PortableCompressedTexture2D.new()\n"
"\tptex.create_from_image(itex.get_image(), "
"PortableCompressedTexture2D.COMPRESSION_MODE_LOSSLESS)\n"
"\treturn ptex\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ການໃຊ້ [EditorResourceConversionPlugin] ແມ່ນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນມັນດ້ວຍເມທອດ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_resource_conversion_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Takes an input [Resource] and converts it to the type given in [method "
"_converts_to]. The returned [Resource] is the result of the conversion, and "
"the input [Resource] remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [Resource] ເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ ແປງມັນເປັນປະເພດທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [method _converts_to]. [Resource] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບຄືນແມ່ນຜົນຂອງການແປງ, ສ່ວນ [Resource] ຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the class name of the target type of [Resource] that this plugin "
"converts source resources to."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຄລາສຂອງປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ສາມາດແປງໄປຫາໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Called to determine whether a particular [Resource] can be converted to the "
"target resource type by this plugin."
msgstr "ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າ [Resource] ໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດແປງເປັນປະເພດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍປລັກອິນນີ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Godot editor's control for selecting [Resource] type properties."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຂອງ Godot editor ສຳລັບເລືອກຄຸນສົມບັດປະເພດ [Resource]."

msgid ""
"This [Control] node is used in the editor's Inspector dock to allow editing "
"of [Resource] type properties. It provides options for creating, loading, "
"saving and converting resources. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to "
"recreate the same behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This [Control] does not include any editor for the resource, as "
"editing is controlled by the Inspector dock itself or sub-Inspectors."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [Control] ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Inspector ຂອງ editor ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດປະເພດ "
"[Resource]. ມັນມີຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການສ້າງ, ການໂຫຼດ, ການບັນທຶກ ແລະ ການແປງຊັບພະຍາກອນ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [EditorInspectorPlugin] ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Control] ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາຕົວແກ້ໄຂຊັບພະຍາກອນໃດໆ, "
"ເພາະການແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ Inspector ຫຼື sub-Inspectors ເອງ."

msgid ""
"This virtual method can be implemented to handle context menu items not "
"handled by default. See [method _set_create_options]."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ virtual ນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຈັດການລາຍການໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[method _set_create_options]."

msgid ""
"This virtual method is called when updating the context menu of an [member "
"editable] [EditorResourcePicker]. Implement this method to override the "
"\"New\" items section with your own options. [param menu_node] is a reference "
"to the [PopupMenu] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Implement [method _handle_menu_selected] to handle these custom "
"items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relevant built-in options (\"Load\", \"Copy\", \"Paste\", etc.) "
"are automatically added to the [param menu_node] afterwards, using their hard-"
"coded IDs starting from [code]0[/code]. Custom options need to use non-"
"colliding IDs to be handled properly. Using [code]id = 100 + "
"custom_option_index[/code] is safe (this is what the default items in the "
"\"New\" section use)."
msgstr ""
"ເມທອດ virtual ນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເມື່ອອັບເດດເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງ [EditorResourcePicker] ທີ່ [member "
"editable]. ໃຫ້ສ້າງເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຂຽນທັບລາຍການໃນສ່ວນ \"ໃໝ່\" (New) ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກຂອງທ່ານເອງ. "
"[param menu_node] ແມ່ນການອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂນດ [PopupMenu].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ສ້າງ [method _handle_menu_selected] "
"ເພື່ອຈັດການລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີມາກັບລະບົບ (\"ໂຫຼດ\", \"ກັອບປີ້\", \"ວາງ\", ແລະອື່ນໆ) "
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ [param menu_node] ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ ID ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ [code]0[/"
"code]. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ ID ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າຊ້ອນກັນ. ການໃຊ້ [code]id = 100 + "
"custom_option_index[/code] ແມ່ນປອດໄພ (ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ລາຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນສ່ວນ \"ໃໝ່\" ໃຊ້)."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of all allowed types and subtypes corresponding to the [member "
"base_type]. If the [member base_type] is empty, an empty list is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ປະເພດ ແລະ ປະເພດຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຕາມ [member base_type]. ຫາກ [member "
"base_type] ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the toggle mode state for the main button. Works only if [member "
"toggle_mode] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງສະຖານະ toggle mode ສຳລັບປຸ່ມຫຼັກ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ [member toggle_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The base type of allowed resource types. Can be a comma-separated list of "
"several options."
msgstr "ປະເພດພື້ນຖານຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ. ສາມາດເປັນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the value can be selected and edited."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະສາມາດເລືອກ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

msgid "The edited resource value."
msgstr "ຄ່າຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main button with the resource preview works in the "
"toggle mode. Use [method set_toggle_pressed] to manually set the state."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ປຸ່ມຫຼັກທີ່ມີຕົວຢ່າງຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນແບບ toggle. ໃຊ້ "
"[method set_toggle_pressed] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງສະຖານະດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Emitted when the value of the edited resource was changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄ່າຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the resource value was set and user clicked to edit it. When "
"[param inspect] is [code]true[/code], the signal was caused by the context "
"menu \"Edit\" or \"Inspect\" option."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄລິກເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ. ເມື່ອ [param inspect] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code], ສັນຍານນີ້ເກີດຈາກຕົວເລືອກ \"ແກ້ໄຂ\" (Edit) ຫຼື \"ກວດສອບ\" (Inspect) "
"ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid "A node used to generate previews of resources or files."
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview) ຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"This node is used to generate previews for resources or files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_resource_previewer]."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງໃຫ້ກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍກົງ. ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ singleton ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"EditorInterface.get_resource_previewer]."

msgid "Create an own, custom preview generator."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວສ້າງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview generator) ຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

msgid ""
"Check if the resource changed, if so, it will be invalidated and the "
"corresponding signal emitted."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼືບໍ່, ຫາກປ່ຽນ, ມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ສົ່ງສັນຍານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Queue the [param resource] being edited for preview. Once the preview is "
"ready, the [param receiver]'s [param receiver_func] will be called. The "
"[param receiver_func] must take the following four arguments: [String] path, "
"[Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, [Variant] userdata. "
"[param userdata] can be anything, and will be returned when [param "
"receiver_func] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If it was not possible to create the preview the [param "
"receiver_func] will still be called, but the preview will be [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ເອົາ [param resource] ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂເຂົ້າຄິວເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ. ເມື່ອຕົວຢ່າງພ້ອມແລ້ວ, [param "
"receiver_func] ຂອງ [param receiver] ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້. [param receiver_func] ຕ້ອງຮັບ 4 "
"ອາຄິວເມນຄື: [String] path, [Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, "
"[Variant] userdata. [param userdata] ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເມື່ອ [param "
"receiver_func] ຖືກຮຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້, [param receiver_func] ກໍຈະຍັງຖືກຮຽກຢູ່ "
"ແຕ່ຕົວຢ່າງຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Queue a resource file located at [param path] for preview. Once the preview "
"is ready, the [param receiver]'s [param receiver_func] will be called. The "
"[param receiver_func] must take the following four arguments: [String] path, "
"[Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, [Variant] userdata. "
"[param userdata] can be anything, and will be returned when [param "
"receiver_func] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If it was not possible to create the preview the [param "
"receiver_func] will still be called, but the preview will be [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ເອົາໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ [param path] ເຂົ້າຄິວເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ. ເມື່ອຕົວຢ່າງພ້ອມແລ້ວ, [param "
"receiver_func] ຂອງ [param receiver] ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້. [param receiver_func] ຕ້ອງຮັບ 4 "
"ອາຄິວເມນຄື: [String] path, [Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, "
"[Variant] userdata. [param userdata] ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນເມື່ອ [param "
"receiver_func] ຖືກຮຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້, [param receiver_func] ກໍຈະຍັງຖືກຮຽກຢູ່ "
"ແຕ່ຕົວຢ່າງຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid "Removes a custom preview generator."
msgstr "ລຶບຕົວສ້າງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted if a preview was invalidated (changed). [param path] corresponds to "
"the path of the preview."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານຫາກຕົວຢ່າງຖືກຍົກເລີກ (ປ່ຽນແປງ). [param path] ໝາຍເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນ."

msgid "Custom generator of previews."
msgstr "ຕົວສ້າງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"Custom code to generate previews. Check [member EditorSettings.filesystem/"
"file_dialog/thumbnail_size] to find a proper size to generate previews at."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ [member EditorSettings.filesystem/"
"file_dialog/thumbnail_size] ເພື່ອຫາຂະໜາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນການສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"If this function returns [code]true[/code], the generator will call [method "
"_generate] or [method _generate_from_path] for small previews as well.\n"
"By default, it returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], ຕົວສ້າງຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ [method _generate] ຫຼື [method "
"_generate_from_path] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຄືກັນ.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Generate a preview from a given resource with the specified size. This must "
"always be implemented.\n"
"Returning [code]null[/code] is an OK way to fail and let another generator "
"take care.\n"
"Care must be taken because this function is always called from a thread (not "
"the main thread).\n"
"[param metadata] dictionary can be modified to store file-specific metadata "
"that can be used in [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path] (like image size, sample "
"length etc.)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ລະບຸດ້ວຍຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສະເໝີ.\n"
"ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ສຳເລັດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຕົວສ້າງອື່ນຈັດການແທນ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງເພາະຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ຈາກ thread (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ main thread).\n"
"ດິກຊັນນະລີ [param metadata] ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path] (ເຊັ່ນ ຂະໜາດຮູບ, ຄວາມຍາວສຽງ "
"ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

msgid ""
"Generate a preview directly from a path with the specified size. Implementing "
"this is optional, as default code will load and call [method _generate].\n"
"Returning [code]null[/code] is an OK way to fail and let another generator "
"take care.\n"
"Care must be taken because this function is always called from a thread (not "
"the main thread).\n"
"[param metadata] dictionary can be modified to store file-specific metadata "
"that can be used in [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path] (like image size, sample "
"length etc.)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍກົງຈາກເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ດ້ວຍຂະໜາດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ການສ້າງເມທອດນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ, "
"ເພາະໂຄ້ດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຮຽກໃຊ້ [method _generate] ໃຫ້.\n"
"ການສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code] ແມ່ນການເຮັດບໍ່ສຳເລັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວສ້າງອື່ນຈັດການແທນ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງລະມັດລະວັງເພາະຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ຈາກ thread (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ main thread).\n"
"ດິກຊັນນະລີ [param metadata] ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path]."

msgid ""
"If this function returns [code]true[/code], the generator will automatically "
"generate the small previews from the normal preview texture generated by the "
"methods [method _generate] or [method _generate_from_path].\n"
"By default, it returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຕົວສ້າງຈະສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກເທັກເຈີຕົວຢ່າງປົກກະຕິທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ [method "
"_generate] ຫຼື [method _generate_from_path].\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if your generator supports the resource of type "
"[param type]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຕົວສ້າງຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພດ [param type]."

msgid ""
"Call from within [method _generate] to request the rendering server draw to "
"the [param viewport]."
msgstr ""
"ຮຽກໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [method _generate] ເພື່ອຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ rendering server ແຕ້ມລົງໃນ [param "
"viewport]."

msgid "A plugin that advanced tooltip for its handled resource type."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນທີ່ຊ່ວຍສະແດງ tooltip ແບບພິເສດສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນປະເພດທີ່ມັນຈັດການ."

msgid ""
"Resource tooltip plugins are used by [FileSystemDock] to generate customized "
"tooltips for specific resources. E.g. tooltip for a [Texture2D] displays a "
"bigger preview and the texture's dimensions.\n"
"A plugin must be first registered with [method "
"FileSystemDock.add_resource_tooltip_plugin]. When the user hovers a resource "
"in filesystem dock which is handled by the plugin, [method "
"_make_tooltip_for_path] is called to create the tooltip. It works similarly "
"to [method Control._make_custom_tooltip]."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ tooltip ຊັບພະຍາກອນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [FileSystemDock] ເພື່ອສ້າງ tooltip "
"ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສະເພາະ. ເຊັ່ນ tooltip ສຳລັບ [Texture2D] ຈະສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"ປລັກອິນຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນດ້ວຍ [method FileSystemDock.add_resource_tooltip_plugin]. "
"ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ FileSystem ທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ຈັດການ, [method "
"_make_tooltip_for_path] ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ tooltip. ມັນເຮັດວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [method "
"Control._make_custom_tooltip]."

msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the plugin is going to handle the given "
"[Resource] [param type]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກປລັກອິນຈະຈັດການ [Resource] ປະເພດ [param type] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Create and return a tooltip that will be displayed when the user hovers a "
"resource under the given [param path] in filesystem dock.\n"
"The [param metadata] dictionary is provided by preview generator (see [method "
"EditorResourcePreviewGenerator._generate]).\n"
"[param base] is the base default tooltip, which is a [VBoxContainer] with a "
"file name, type and size labels. If another plugin handled the same file "
"type, [param base] will be output from the previous plugin. For best result, "
"make sure the base tooltip is part of the returned [Control].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's unadvised to use [method ResourceLoader.load], especially "
"with heavy resources like models or textures, because it will make the editor "
"unresponsive when creating the tooltip. You can use [method "
"request_thumbnail] if you want to display a preview in your tooltip.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you decide to discard the [param base], make sure to call "
"[method Node.queue_free], because it's not freed automatically.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _make_tooltip_for_path(path, metadata, base):\n"
"\tvar t_rect = TextureRect.new()\n"
"\trequest_thumbnail(path, t_rect)\n"
"\tbase.add_child(t_rect) # The TextureRect will appear at the bottom of the "
"tooltip.\n"
"\treturn base\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ tooltip ທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ [param path] ໃນ "
"FileSystem dock.\n"
"ດິກຊັນນະລີ [param metadata] ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກ preview generator.\n"
"[param base] ແມ່ນ tooltip ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນ [VBoxContainer] ທີ່ມີຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ປະເພດ ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດ. ຫາກມີປລັກອິນອື່ນຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປະເພດດຽວກັນ, [param base] ຈະເປັນຜົນມາຈາກປລັກອິນກ່ອນໜ້າ. "
"ເພື່ອຜົນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ base tooltip ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ [Control] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method ResourceLoader.load] "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ໜັກ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ editor ຄ້າງໃນຂະນະສ້າງ tooltip. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"request_thumbnail] ແທນຫາກຕ້ອງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກທີ່ຈະຖິ້ມ [param base], ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຮຽກ [method "
"Node.queue_free] ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Requests a thumbnail for the given [TextureRect]. The thumbnail is created "
"asynchronously by [EditorResourcePreview] and automatically set when "
"available."
msgstr ""
"ຮ້ອງຂໍຮູບຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ [TextureRect] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບ asynchronous ໂດຍ "
"[EditorResourcePreview] ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອພ້ອມ."

msgid "Imports scenes from third-parties' 3D files."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າສາກຈາກໄຟລ໌ 3D ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ."

msgid ""
"[EditorSceneFormatImporter] allows to define an importer script for a third-"
"party 3D format.\n"
"To use [EditorSceneFormatImporter], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_scene_format_importer_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorSceneFormatImporter] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກຳນົດສະຄຣິບນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບຮູບແບບ 3D "
"ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ [EditorSceneFormatImporter] ແມ່ນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນມັນດ້ວຍ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_scene_format_importer_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Return supported file extensions for this scene importer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າສາກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Override to add general import options. These will appear in the main import "
"dock on the editor. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [EditorSceneFormatImporter] and "
"[EditorScenePostImportPlugin] instances will add options for all files. It is "
"good practice to check the file extension when [param path] is non-empty.\n"
"When the user is editing project settings, [param path] will be empty. It is "
"recommended to add all options when [param path] is empty to allow the user "
"to customize Import Defaults."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າທົ່ວໄປ. ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ Import dock ຂອງ editor. "
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກຜ່ານ [method add_import_option] ແລະ [method "
"add_import_option_advanced].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [EditorSceneFormatImporter] ແລະ [EditorScenePostImportPlugin] "
"ທຸກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈະເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໄຟລ໌. ມັນເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະກວດສອບນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອ [param path] "
"ບໍ່ວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ, [param path] ຈະວ່າງເປົ່າ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທຸກຕົວເລືອກເມື່ອ "
"[param path] ວ່າງເປົ່າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ Import Defaults ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Should return [code]true[/code] to show the given option, [code]false[/code] "
"to hide the given option, or [code]null[/code] to ignore."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ເພື່ອສະແດງຕົວເລືອກ, [code]false[/code] ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງ, ຫຼື "
"[code]null[/code] ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົນໃຈ."

msgid ""
"Perform the bulk of the scene import logic here, for example using "
"[GLTFDocument] or [FBXDocument]."
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການຈັດການການນຳເຂົ້າສາກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໃຊ້ [GLTFDocument] ຫຼື "
"[FBXDocument]."

msgid ""
"Add a specific import option (name and default value only). This function can "
"only be called from [method _get_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະ (ຊື່ ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ). ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກ [method "
"_get_import_options] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Add a specific import option. This function can only be called from [method "
"_get_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກ [method _get_import_options] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Unused flag (this has no effect when enabled)."
msgstr "ແຟລັກ (flag) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ (ບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້)."

msgid ""
"Import animations from the 3D scene. When importing a scene as an "
"[AnimationLibrary], this flag is always enabled."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າແອນິເມຊັນຈາກສາກ 3D. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສາກເປັນ [AnimationLibrary], ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generate vertex tangents using [url=http://"
"www.mikktspace.com/]Mikktspace[/url] if the input meshes don't have tangent "
"data. When possible, it's recommended to let the 3D modeling software "
"generate tangents on export instead of relying on this option. Tangents are "
"required for correct display of normal and height maps, along with any "
"material/shader features that require tangents.\n"
"If you don't need material features that require tangents, disabling this can "
"reduce output file size and speed up importing if the source 3D file doesn't "
"contain tangents."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ vertex tangents ໂດຍໃຊ້ [url=http://"
"www.mikktspace.com/]Mikktspace[/url] ຫາກເມສທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ tangent. ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຊອບແວສ້າງໂມເດວ 3D ສ້າງ tangents ຕອນ export ເລີຍດີກວ່າ. Tangents "
"ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ normal ແລະ height maps ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງວັດສະດຸທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ tangents, ການປິດສ່ວນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າໄວຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If checked, use named [Skin]s for animation. The [MeshInstance3D] node "
"contains 3 properties of relevance here: a skeleton [NodePath] pointing to "
"the [Skeleton3D] node (usually [code]..[/code]), a mesh, and a skin:\n"
"- The [Skeleton3D] node contains a list of bones with names, their pose and "
"rest, a name, and a parent bone.\n"
"- The mesh is all of the raw vertex data needed to display a mesh. In terms "
"of the mesh, it knows how vertices are weight-painted and uses some internal "
"numbering often imported from 3D modeling software.\n"
"- The skin contains the information necessary to bind this mesh onto this "
"Skeleton3D. For each of the internal bone IDs chosen by the 3D modeling "
"software, it contains two things. Firstly, a matrix known as the Bind Pose "
"Matrix, Inverse Bind Matrix, or IBM for short. Secondly, the [Skin] contains "
"each bone's name (if this flag is enabled), or the bone's index within the "
"[Skeleton3D] list (if this flag is disabled).\n"
"Together, this information is enough to tell Godot how to use the bone poses "
"in the [Skeleton3D] node to render the mesh from each [MeshInstance3D]. Note "
"that each [MeshInstance3D] may share binds, as is common in models exported "
"from Blender, or each [MeshInstance3D] may use a separate [Skin] object, as "
"is common in models exported from other tools such as Maya."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເລືອກ, ຈະໃຊ້ [Skin] ທີ່ມີຊື່ສຳລັບແອນິເມຊັນ. ໂນດ [MeshInstance3D] ປະກອບດ້ວຍ 3 "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຄື: skeleton [NodePath] ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂນດ [Skeleton3D], mesh, ແລະ skin:\n"
"- ໂນດ [Skeleton3D] ມີລາຍຊື່ກະດູກພ້ອມຊື່, ທ່າທາງ (pose), ຊື່ ແລະ ກະດູກແມ່.\n"
"- Mesh ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນ vertex ດິບທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນ. ມັນຮູ້ວ່າ vertex ແຕ່ລະອັນຖືກໃຫ້ຄ່ານ້ຳໜັກ (weight-"
"painted) ແນວໃດ.\n"
"- Skin ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຜູກ mesh ນີ້ເຂົ້າກັບ Skeleton3D. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍ Bind Pose Matrix (ຫຼື "
"IBM) ແລະ ຊື່ກະດູກ (ຫາກເປີດແຟລັກນີ້) ຫຼື ອິນເດັກຂອງກະດູກ (ຫາກປິດແຟລັກນີ້).\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບອກ Godot ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ທ່າທາງກະດູກໃນ [Skeleton3D] ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ mesh ແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"Ignore meshes and materials on import. When importing a scene as an "
"[AnimationLibrary], this flag is always enabled."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສົນໃຈ meshes ແລະ materials ຕອນນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສາກເປັນ [AnimationLibrary], "
"ແຟລັກນີ້ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], mesh compression will not be used. Consider enabling if "
"you notice blocky artifacts in your mesh normals or UVs, or if you have "
"meshes that are larger than a few thousand meters in each direction."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດ mesh. "
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ຫາກທ່ານພົບຈຸດຜິດພາດແບບເປັນບລັອກ (artifacts) ໃນ normals ຫຼື UVs, ຫຼື ຫາກທ່ານມີ "
"mesh ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ."

msgid "Importer for Blender's [code].blend[/code] scene file format."
msgstr "ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ສາກຮູບແບບ [code].blend[/code] ຂອງ Blender."

msgid ""
"Imports Blender scenes in the [code].blend[/code] file format through the "
"glTF 2.0 3D import pipeline. This importer requires Blender to be installed "
"by the user, so that it can be used to export the scene as glTF 2.0.\n"
"The location of the Blender binary is set via the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/blender_path] setting.\n"
"This importer is only used if [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/"
"blender/enabled] is enabled, otherwise [code].blend[/code] files present in "
"the project folder are not imported.\n"
"Blend import requires Blender 3.0.\n"
"Internally, the EditorSceneFormatImporterBlend uses the Blender glTF \"Use "
"Original\" mode to reference external textures."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າສາກ Blender ໃນຮູບແບບ [code].blend[/code] ຜ່ານລະບົບ glTF 2.0. "
"ຕົວນຳເຂົ້ານີ້ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Blender ເພື່ອໃຊ້ export ສາກເປັນ glTF 2.0.\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ Blender ຖືກຕັ້ງຜ່ານ [member EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/"
"blender_path].\n"
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/blender/enabled] "
"ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການ Blender ລຸ້ນ 3.0 ຂຶ້ນໄປ."

msgid "Importer for the [code].fbx[/code] scene file format."
msgstr "ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ສາກຮູບແບບ [code].fbx[/code]."

msgid ""
"Imports Autodesk FBX 3D scenes by way of converting them to glTF 2.0 using "
"the FBX2glTF command line tool.\n"
"The location of the FBX2glTF binary is set via the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/fbx2gltf_path] editor setting.\n"
"This importer is only used if [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/"
"fbx2gltf/enabled] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າສາກ Autodesk FBX 3D ໂດຍການແປງເປັນ glTF 2.0 ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື FBX2glTF.\n"
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ FBX2glTF ຖືກຕັ້ງໃນ [member EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/"
"fbx2gltf_path].\n"
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid "Import FBX files using the ufbx library."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ FBX ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ ufbx."

msgid ""
"EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX is designed to load FBX files and supports both "
"binary and ASCII FBX files from version 3000 onward. This class supports "
"various 3D object types like meshes, skins, blend shapes, materials, and "
"rigging information. The class aims for feature parity with the official FBX "
"SDK and supports FBX 7.4 specifications."
msgstr ""
"EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ FBX ແລະ ຮອງຮັບທັງແບບ binary "
"ແລະ ASCII ຕັ້ງແຕ່ລຸ້ນ 3000 ຂຶ້ນໄປ. ຮອງຮັບ meshes, skins, blend shapes, materials ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນ rigging."

msgid "Post-processes scenes after import."
msgstr "ຈັດການສາກຫຼັງຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Imported scenes can be automatically modified right after import by setting "
"their [b]Custom Script[/b] Import property to a [code]tool[/code] script that "
"inherits from this class.\n"
"The [method _post_import] callback receives the imported scene's root node "
"and returns the modified version of the scene:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool # Needed so it runs in editor.\n"
"extends EditorScenePostImport\n"
"\n"
"# This sample changes all node names.\n"
"# Called right after the scene is imported and gets the root node.\n"
"func _post_import(scene):\n"
"\t# Change all node names to \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\titerate(scene)\n"
"\treturn scene # Remember to return the imported scene\n"
"\n"
"func iterate(node):\n"
"\tif node != null:\n"
"\t\tnode.name = \"modified_\" + node.name\n"
"\t\tfor child in node.get_children():\n"
"\t\t\titerate(child)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"// This sample changes all node names.\n"
"// Called right after the scene is imported and gets the root node.\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class NodeRenamer : EditorScenePostImport\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override GodotObject _PostImport(Node scene)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Change all node names to \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\t\tIterate(scene);\n"
"\t\treturn scene; // Remember to return the imported scene\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic void Iterate(Node node)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (node != null)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tnode.Name = $\"modified_{node.Name}\";\n"
"\t\t\tforeach (Node child in node.GetChildren())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tIterate(child);\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສາກທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສາມາດຖືກດັດແກ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດການນຳເຂົ້າ "
"[b]Custom Script[/b] ຂອງພວກມັນໃຫ້ເປັນສະຄຣິບ [code]tool[/code] ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກຄລາດນີ້.\n"
"The [method _post_import] ຄໍແບັກຈະຮັບເອົາໂນດຮາກຂອງສາກທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກດັດແກ້ຂອງສາກນັ້ນ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool # ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ editor.\n"
"extends EditorScenePostImport\n"
"\n"
"# ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດທັງໝົດ.\n"
"# ຖືກເອີ້ນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກສາກຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບໂນດຮາກ.\n"
"func _post_import(scene):\n"
"\t# ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດທັງໝົດເປັນ \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\titerate(scene)\n"
"\treturn scene # ຢ່າລືມສົ່ງຄືນສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ\n"
"\n"
"func iterate(node):\n"
"\tif node != null:\n"
"\t\tnode.name = \"modified_\" + node.name\n"
"\t\tfor child in node.get_children():\n"
"\t\t\titerate(child)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"// ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດທັງໝົດ.\n"
"// ຖືກເອີ້ນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກສາກຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບໂນດຮາກ.\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class NodeRenamer : EditorScenePostImport\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override GodotObject _PostImport(Node scene)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດທັງໝົດເປັນ \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\t\tIterate(scene);\n"
"\t\treturn scene; // ຢ່າລືມສົ່ງຄືນສາກທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic void Iterate(Node node)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (node != null)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tnode.Name = $\"modified_{node.Name}\";\n"
"\t\t\tforeach (Node child in node.GetChildren())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tIterate(child);\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Importing 3D scenes: Configuration: Using import scripts for automation"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າສາກ 3D: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ: ການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid ""
"Called after the scene was imported. This method must return the modified "
"version of the scene."
msgstr "ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກສາກຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນສາກລຸ້ນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the source file path which got imported (e.g. [code]res://scene.dae[/"
"code])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]res://scene.dae[/code])."

msgid "Plugin to control and modifying the process of importing a scene."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນສຳລັບຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າສາກ."

msgid ""
"This plugin type exists to modify the process of importing scenes, allowing "
"to change the content as well as add importer options at every stage of the "
"process."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນປະເພດນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າສາກ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າໃນທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນ."

msgid ""
"Override to add general import options. These will appear in the main import "
"dock on the editor. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced]."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າທົ່ວໄປ. ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປາກົດໃນ Import dock ຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Override to add internal import options. These will appear in the 3D scene "
"import dialog. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced]."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າພາຍໃນ. ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະປາກົດໃນໄດອາລັອກນຳເຂົ້າສາກ 3D."

msgid ""
"Should return [code]true[/code] if the 3D view of the import dialog needs to "
"update when changing the given option."
msgstr ""
"ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມຸມມອງ 3D "
"ຂອງໄດອາລັອກນຳເຂົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Process a specific node or resource for a given category."
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນໂນດ ຫຼື ຊັບພະຍາກອນສະເພາະສຳລັບໝວດໝູ່ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Post-process the scene. This function is called after the final scene has "
"been configured."
msgstr "ຈັດການສາກຫຼັງການນຳເຂົ້າ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກສາກສຸດທ້າຍຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Pre-process the scene. This function is called right after the scene format "
"loader loaded the scene and no changes have been made.\n"
"Pre-process may be used to adjust internal import options in the [code]"
"\"nodes\"[/code], [code]\"meshes\"[/code], [code]\"animations\"[/code] or "
"[code]\"materials\"[/code] keys inside "
"[code]get_option_value(\"_subresources\")[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການສາກກ່ອນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກຕົວໂຫຼດຮູບແບບສາກໂຫຼດສາກສຳເລັດ ແລະ "
"ຍັງບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Add a specific import option (name and default value only). This function can "
"only be called from [method _get_import_options] and [method "
"_get_internal_import_options]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະ (ຊື່ ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Add a specific import option. This function can only be called from [method "
"_get_import_options] and [method _get_internal_import_options]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"Query the value of an option. This function can only be called from those "
"querying visibility, or processing."
msgstr "ສອບຖາມຄ່າຂອງຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid "Base script that can be used to add extension functions to the editor."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນສ່ວນເສີມໃຫ້ກັບ editor."

msgid ""
"Scripts extending this class and implementing its [method _run] method can be "
"executed from the Script Editor's [b]File > Run[/b] menu option (or by "
"pressing [kbd]Ctrl + Shift + X[/kbd]) while the editor is running. This is "
"useful for adding custom in-editor functionality to Godot. For more complex "
"additions, consider using [EditorPlugin]s instead.\n"
"If a script extending this class also has a global class name, it will be "
"included in the editor's command palette.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extending scripts need to have [code]tool[/code] mode enabled.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Running the following script prints \"Hello from the Godot "
"Editor!\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorScript\n"
"\n"
"func _run():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class HelloEditor : EditorScript\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override void _Run()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] EditorScript is [RefCounted], meaning it is destroyed when "
"nothing references it. This can cause errors during asynchronous operations "
"if there are no references to the script."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ສືບທອດຄລາສນີ້ ແລະ ສ້າງເມທອດ [method _run] ສາມາດສັ່ງລັນໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ [b]File > Run[/"
"b] ໃນ Script Editor. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃຫ້ Godot editor.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ [code]tool[/code]."

msgid "This method is executed by the Editor when [b]File > Run[/b] is used."
msgstr "ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຖືກລັນໂດຍ Editor ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເມນູ [b]File > Run[/b]."

msgid "Use [method EditorInterface.add_root_node] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method EditorInterface.add_root_node] ແທນ."

msgid "Use [method EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the edited (current) scene's root [Node]. Equivalent of [method "
"EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດຮາກ [Node] ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ (ສາກປັດຈຸບັນ)."

msgid ""
"Godot editor's control for selecting the [code]script[/code] property of a "
"[Node]."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຂອງ Godot editor ສຳລັບເລືອກຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]script[/code] ຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Similar to [EditorResourcePicker] this [Control] node is used in the editor's "
"Inspector dock, but only to edit the [code]script[/code] property of a "
"[Node]. Default options for creating new resources of all possible subtypes "
"are replaced with dedicated buttons that open the \"Attach Node Script\" "
"dialog. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to recreate the same "
"behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must set the [member script_owner] for the custom context "
"menu items to work."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [EditorResourcePicker] ແຕ່ໃຊ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]script[/code] "
"ຂອງໂນດ."

msgid "The owner [Node] of the script property that holds the edited resource."
msgstr "ໂນດເຈົ້າຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Manages the SceneTree selection in the editor."
msgstr "ຈັດການການເລືອກໃນ SceneTree ພາຍໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"This object manages the SceneTree selection in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_selection]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ຈັດການການເລືອກໃນ SceneTree. ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ [method "
"EditorInterface.get_selection]."

msgid ""
"Adds a node to the selection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The newly selected node will not be automatically edited in the "
"inspector. If you want to edit a node, use [method EditorInterface.edit_node]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂນດເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid "Clear the selection."
msgstr "ລ້າງລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Returns the list of selected nodes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ໂນດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of top selected nodes only, excluding any children. This is "
"useful for performing transform operations (moving them, rotating, etc.).\n"
"For example, if there is a node A with a child B and a sibling C, then "
"selecting all three will cause this method to return only A and C. Changing "
"the global transform of A will affect the global transform of B, so there is "
"no need to change B separately."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ສະເພາະໂນດລະດັບເທິງສຸດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (ບໍ່ລວມໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ)."

msgid "Use [method get_top_selected_nodes] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method get_top_selected_nodes] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of top selected nodes only, excluding any children. This is "
"useful for performing transform operations (moving them, rotating, etc.). See "
"[method get_top_selected_nodes]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ສະເພາະໂນດລະດັບເທິງສຸດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (ບໍ່ລວມໂນດລູກ)."

msgid "Removes a node from the selection."
msgstr "ເອົາໂນດອອກຈາກລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid "Emitted when the selection changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການເລືອກມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Object that holds the project-independent editor settings."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸທີ່ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ editor ທີ່ແຍກຈາກຕົວໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Object that holds the project-independent editor settings. These settings are "
"generally visible in the [b]Editor > Editor Settings[/b] menu.\n"
"Property names use slash delimiters to distinguish sections. Setting values "
"can be of any [Variant] type. It's recommended to use [code]snake_case[/code] "
"for editor settings to be consistent with the Godot editor itself.\n"
"Editor settings are saved automatically when changed.\n"
"Accessing the settings can be done using the following methods, such as:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"# `settings.set(\"some/property\", 10)` also works as this class overrides "
"`_set()` internally.\n"
"settings.set_setting(\"some/property\", 10)\n"
"# `settings.get(\"some/property\")` also works as this class overrides "
"`_get()` internally.\n"
"settings.get_setting(\"some/property\")\n"
"var list_of_settings = settings.get_property_list()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"// `settings.set(\"some/property\", value)` also works as this class "
"overrides `_set()` internally.\n"
"settings.SetSetting(\"some/property\", Value);\n"
"// `settings.get(\"some/property\", value)` also works as this class "
"overrides `_get()` internally.\n"
"settings.GetSetting(\"some/property\");\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> listOfSettings = "
"settings.GetPropertyList();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_editor_settings]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸທີ່ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ editor. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ໃນເມນູ [b]Editor > Editor Settings[/"
"b].\n"
"ຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ slash (/) ເພື່ອແຍກໝວດໝູ່. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a custom property info to a property. The dictionary must contain:\n"
"- [code]name[/code]: [String] (the name of the property)\n"
"- [code]type[/code]: [int] (see [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- optionally [code]hint[/code]: [int] (see [enum PropertyHint]) and "
"[code]hint_string[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"settings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"settings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var settings = GetEditorInterface().GetEditorSettings();\n"
"settings.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"settings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄຸນສົມບັດແບບກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Adds a [param shortcut] whose path is specified by [param path].\n"
"The [param path] determines how the shortcut is organized and displayed in "
"the editor's shortcut settings. The path format affects the display as "
"follows:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code] (no slash): Creates a category named [code]name[/"
"code] with the shortcut displayed as [code]name[/code].\n"
"- [code]\"category/name\"[/code] (single slash): Displays as [code]name[/"
"code] in the [code]category[/code] section.\n"
"- [code]\"category/name/extra\"[/code] (multiple slashes): Extra path "
"components are ignored, so this behaves the same as [code]\"category/name\"[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shortcuts are only saved to the editor settings if they differ "
"from their original/default state. This means empty shortcuts that were "
"originally empty will not persist between editor sessions and must be re-"
"added. If a shortcut with the same [param path] already exists, this method "
"will update it with the new [param shortcut] instead of creating a "
"duplicate.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Add a custom shortcut for a plugin action.\n"
"var my_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"var input_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"input_event.keycode = KEY_F5\n"
"input_event.ctrl_pressed = true\n"
"my_shortcut.events.append(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"# This will appear under the \"My Plugin\" category as \"Reload Data\".\n"
"EditorInterface.get_editor_settings().add_shortcut(\"my_plugin/reload_data\", "
"my_shortcut)\n"
"\n"
"# This will appear under the \"Test Action\" category as \"Test Action\".\n"
"EditorInterface.get_editor_settings().add_shortcut(\"test_action\", "
"my_shortcut)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມທາງລັດ (shortcut) ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Checks if any settings with the prefix [param setting_prefix] exist in the "
"set of changed settings. See also [method get_changed_settings]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix) ທີ່ລະບຸ ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Erases the setting whose name is specified by [param property]."
msgstr "ລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Gets an array of the settings which have been changed since the last save. "
"Note that internally [code]changed_settings[/code] is cleared after a "
"successful save, so generally the most appropriate place to use this method "
"is when processing [constant NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED]."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາລາຍຊື່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕັ້ງແຕ່ການບັນທຶກຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid "Returns the list of favorite files and directories for this project."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ມັກສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns project-specific metadata for the [param section] and [param key] "
"specified. If the metadata doesn't exist, [param default] will be returned "
"instead. See also [method set_project_metadata]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ metadata ສະເພາະໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of recently visited folders in the file dialog for this "
"project."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງຫຼ້າສຸດໃນ file dialog ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting specified by [param name]. This is "
"equivalent to using [method Object.get] on the EditorSettings instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the shortcut specified by [param path]. Tries to find a built-in "
"action if no shortcut with the provided path is found in the shortcut list. "
"If found, adds it to the list and returns it, otherwise returns [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທາງລັດ (shortcut) ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the list of stored shortcut paths."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງທາງລັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the setting specified by [param name] exists, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the shortcut specified by [param path] exists, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີທາງລັດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the shortcut specified by [param path] matches "
"the event specified by [param event], [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກທາງລັດທີ່ລະບຸຕົງກັບອິເວນ (event) ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Marks the passed editor setting as being changed, see [method "
"get_changed_settings]. Only settings which exist (see [method has_setting]) "
"will be accepted."
msgstr "ໝາຍວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ editor ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Removes the shortcut specified by [param path]."
msgstr "ລຶບທາງລັດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Overrides the built-in editor action [param name] with the input actions "
"defined in [param actions_list]."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບຄຳສັ່ງ (action) ຂອງ editor ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Sets the list of favorite files and directories for this project."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ມັກສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the initial value of the setting specified by [param name] to [param "
"value]. This is used to provide a value for the Revert button in the Editor "
"Settings. If [param update_current] is [code]true[/code], the setting is "
"reset to [param value] as well."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (initial value) ໃຫ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປຸ່ມຄືນຄ່າ (Revert)."

msgid ""
"Sets project-specific metadata with the [param section], [param key] and "
"[param data] specified. This metadata is stored outside the project folder "
"and therefore won't be checked into version control. See also [method "
"get_project_metadata]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ metadata ສະເພາະໂປຣເຈັກ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຂ້າງນອກໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Sets the list of recently visited folders in the file dialog for this project."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງລາຍຊື່ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງຫຼ້າສຸດໃນ file dialog."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param value] of the setting specified by [param name]. This is "
"equivalent to using [method Object.set] on the EditorSettings instance."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ (value) ໃຫ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"A list of the available URLs that can be chosen in the Asset Store to fetch "
"asset data. With the key being the name, and the value being the URL."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ URL ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ເລືອກໃນ Asset Store."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Asset Store uses multiple threads for its HTTP "
"requests. This prevents the Asset Store from blocking the main thread for "
"every loaded asset."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Asset Store ຈະໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ thread ໃນການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ "
"main thread ຄ້າງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically switches to the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree "
"when running the project from the editor. If [code]false[/code], stays on the "
"[b]Local[/b] scene tree when running the project from the editor.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Enabling this setting can cause stuttering when running a "
"project with a large amount of nodes (typically a few thousands of nodes or "
"more), even if the editor window isn't focused. This is due to the remote "
"scene tree being updated every second regardless of whether the editor is "
"focused."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະລັບໄປທີ່ Scene tree ແບບ [b]Remote[/b] "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກຫາກໂປຣເຈັກມີໂນດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically switches to the [b]Stack Trace[/b] panel "
"when the debugger hits a breakpoint or steps."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະລັບໄປໜ້າຕ່າງ [b]Stack Trace[/b] ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອ "
"debugger ເຈີຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint)."

msgid ""
"The limit of how many remote nodes can be selected at once.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Increasing this value is not recommended, as selecting too "
"many can make the editing and inspection of remote properties unreliable."
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຈຳນວນ remote nodes ທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables collection of profiling data from non-GDScript "
"Godot functions, such as engine class methods. Enabling this slows execution "
"while profiling further."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ profiling ຈາກຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ GDScript."

msgid ""
"The size of the profiler's frame history. The default value (3600) allows "
"seeing up to 60 seconds of profiling if the project renders at a constant 60 "
"FPS. Higher values allow viewing longer periods of profiling in the graphs, "
"especially when the project is running at high framerates."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງປະຫວັດເຟຣມໃນ profiler. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (3600) ສາມາດເບິ່ງຍ້ອນຫຼັງໄດ້ 60 ວິນາທີ ທີ່ 60 FPS."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of script functions that can be displayed per frame in the "
"profiler. If there are more script functions called in a given profiler "
"frame, these functions will be discarded from the profiling results "
"entirely.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only read when the profiler is first started, so "
"changing it during profiling will have no effect."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຟັງຊັນສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະສະແດງຕໍ່ເຟຣມໃນ profiler."

msgid ""
"The target frame rate shown in the visual profiler graph, in frames per "
"second."
msgstr "ອັດຕາເຟຣມເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນກຣາຟ profiler (FPS)."

msgid ""
"The refresh interval for the remote inspector's properties (in seconds). "
"Lower values are more reactive, but may cause stuttering while the project is "
"running from the editor and the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree is selected in the "
"Scene tree dock."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການອັບເດດ (refresh) ຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ remote inspector (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"The refresh interval for the remote scene tree (in seconds). Lower values are "
"more reactive, but may cause stuttering while the project is running from the "
"editor and the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree is selected in the Scene tree dock."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການອັບເດດ (refresh) ຂອງ remote scene tree (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays folders in the FileSystem dock's bottom pane "
"when split mode is enabled. If [code]false[/code], only files will be "
"displayed in the bottom pane. Split mode can be toggled by pressing the icon "
"next to the [code]res://[/code] folder path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when split mode is disabled (which is "
"the default)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໂຟນເດີໃນສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງ FileSystem dock ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ "
"split mode."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a confirmation dialog when moving or "
"duplicating items in the FileSystem dock. This dialog can also be bypassed by "
"holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໄດອາລັອກຢືນຢັນເມື່ອຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ສ້າງສຳເນົາລາຍການໃນ "
"FileSystem dock."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], scripts created in FileSystem dock will be "
"automatically edited."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຄຣິບທີ່ສ້າງໃນ FileSystem dock ຈະຖືກເປີດແກ້ໄຂໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"A comma separated list of unsupported file extensions to show in the "
"FileSystem dock, e.g. [code]\"ico,icns\"[/code]."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງໃນ FileSystem dock (ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ)."

msgid ""
"A comma separated list of file extensions to consider as editable text files "
"in the FileSystem dock (by double-clicking on the files), e.g. [code]"
"\"txt,md,cfg,ini,log,json,yml,yaml,toml,xml\"[/code]."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຫ້ຖືວ່າເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The thumbnail size to use in the FileSystem dock (in pixels). See also "
"[member filesystem/file_dialog/thumbnail_size]."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ FileSystem dock (ເປັນພິກເຊລ)."

msgid ""
"The refresh interval to use for the Inspector dock's properties. The effect "
"of this setting is mainly noticeable when adjusting gizmos in the 2D/3D "
"editor and looking at the inspector at the same time. Lower values make the "
"inspector refresh more often, but take up more CPU time."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການອັບເດດຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"The tint intensity to use for the subresources background in the Inspector "
"dock. The tint is used to distinguish between different subresources in the "
"inspector. Higher values result in a more noticeable background color "
"difference."
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (subresources) ໃນ Inspector dock."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], accessibility related warnings are displayed alongside "
"other configuration warnings."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄຳເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility) "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງພ້ອມກັບຄຳເຕືອນອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when a node is deleted with animation tracks "
"referencing it, a confirmation dialog appears before the tracks are deleted. "
"The dialog will appear even when using the \"Delete (No Confirm)\" shortcut."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະສະແດງໄດອາລັອກຢືນຢັນກ່ອນລຶບແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງຈະຖືກລຶບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a confirmation dialog after left-clicking the "
"\"percent\" icon next to a node name in the Scene tree dock. When clicked, "
"this icon revokes the node's scene-unique name, which can impact the behavior "
"of scripts that rely on this scene-unique name due to identifiers not being "
"found anymore."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໄດອາລັອກຢືນຢັນເມື່ອຄລິກຍົກເລີກການຕັ້ງຊື່ແບບ scene-unique "
"ຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scene tree dock will automatically unfold nodes "
"when a node that has folded parents is selected."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Scene tree dock "
"ຈະຂະຫຍາຍໂນດທີ່ຖືກພັບຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອໂນດນັ້ນຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], new node created when reparenting node(s) will be "
"positioned at the average position of the selected node(s)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດໃໝ່ທີ່ສ້າງຕອນປ່ຽນໂນດແມ່ (reparenting) "
"ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງສະເລ່ຍຂອງໂນດທີ່ເລືອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scene tree dock will only show nodes that match the "
"filter, without showing parents that don't. This settings can also be changed "
"in the Scene dock's top menu."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], Scene tree dock ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະໂນດທີ່ຕົງກັບຕົວຕອງ (filter)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Create dialog (Create New Node/Create New Resource) "
"will start with all its sections expanded. Otherwise, sections will be "
"collapsed until the user starts searching (which will automatically expand "
"sections as needed)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄດອາລັອກການສ້າງ (ໂນດໃໝ່/ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່) "
"ຈະສະແດງແບບຂະຫຍາຍທຸກສ່ວນ."

msgid "Delay time for automatic resampling in the 2D editor (in seconds)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການລໍຖ້າສຳລັບການ resampling ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ 2D editor (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"The \"start\" stop of the color gradient to use for bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr "ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ gradient ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກະດູກໃນ 2D skeleton editor."

msgid ""
"The \"end\" stop of the color gradient to use for bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr "ສີສິ້ນສຸດຂອງ gradient ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກະດູກໃນ 2D skeleton editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for inverse kinematics-enabled bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ inverse kinematics ໃນ 2D skeleton editor."

msgid ""
"The outline color to use for non-selected bones in the 2D skeleton editor. "
"See also [member editors/2d/bone_selected_color]."
msgstr "ສີເສັ້ນຂອບສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກໃນ 2D skeleton editor."

msgid ""
"The outline size in the 2D skeleton editor (in pixels). See also [member "
"editors/2d/bone_width].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this value only apply after modifying a [Bone2D] node "
"in any way, or closing and reopening the scene."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບໃນ 2D skeleton editor (ເປັນພິກເຊລ)."

msgid ""
"The color to use for selected bones in the 2D skeleton editor. See also "
"[member editors/2d/bone_outline_color]."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບກະດູກທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນ 2D skeleton editor."

msgid ""
"The bone width in the 2D skeleton editor (in pixels). See also [member "
"editors/2d/bone_outline_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this value only apply after modifying a [Bone2D] node "
"in any way, or closing and reopening the scene."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງກະດູກໃນ 2D skeleton editor (ເປັນພິກເຊລ)."

msgid "The grid color to use in the 2D editor."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນກຣິດ (grid) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"The guides color to use in the 2D editor. Guides can be created by dragging "
"the mouse cursor from the rulers."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນກຳກັບ (guides) ໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection rectangle that surrounds selected locked "
"nodes in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr "ສີຂອງກອບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການເລືອກສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ຖືກລັອກໃນ 2D viewport."

msgid ""
"The thickness of the coordinate ruler in the 2D editor. Increasing this will "
"also increase the size of the ruler font, improving readability when using a "
"lower editor scale. The editor may force a minimum size to keep the ruler "
"numbers legible."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜາຂອງໄມ້ບັນທັດ (ruler) ໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection rectangle outlines that surrounds selected "
"nodes in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr "ສີເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງກອບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການເລືອກສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນ 2D viewport."

msgid ""
"The color to use when drawing smart snapping lines in the 2D editor. The "
"smart snapping lines will automatically display when moving 2D nodes if smart "
"snapping is enabled in the Snapping Options menu at the top of the 2D editor "
"viewport."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນ smart snapping ໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 2D editor will snap to integer zoom values when not "
"holding the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key. If [code]false[/code], this behavior is "
"swapped."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], 2D editor ຈະ snap ໄປທີ່ຄ່າການຊູມແບບຕົວເລກຖ້ວນ."

msgid ""
"The color of the viewport border in the 2D editor. This border represents the "
"viewport's size at the base resolution defined in the Project Settings. "
"Objects placed outside this border will not be visible unless a [Camera2D] "
"node is used, or unless the window is resized and the stretch mode is set to "
"[code]disabled[/code]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງຂອບ viewport ໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"The factor to use when zooming in or out in the 2D editor. For example, "
"[code]1.1[/code] will zoom in by 10% with every step. If set to [code]2.0[/"
"code], zooming will only cycle through powers of two."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກໃນ 2D editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the active selection box that surrounds selected nodes "
"in the 3D editor viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The term \"active\" indicates that this object is the primary "
"selection used as the basis for certain operations. This is the last selected "
"[Node3D], which can be reordered with [kbd]Shift + Left mouse button[/kbd]."
msgstr "ສີຂອງກອບການເລືອກທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ (active) ໃນ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"The default camera vertical field of view to use in the 3D editor (in "
"degrees). The camera field of view can be adjusted on a per-scene basis using "
"the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the 3D editor. If a scene had its camera "
"field of view adjusted using the [b]View[/b] menu, this setting is ignored in "
"the scene in question. This setting is also ignored while a [Camera3D] node "
"is being previewed in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The editor camera always uses the [b]Keep Height[/b] aspect mode."
msgstr "ຄ່າ FOV ແນວຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກ້ອງໃນ 3D editor (ເປັນອົງສາ)."

msgid ""
"The default camera far clip distance to use in the 3D editor (in degrees). "
"Higher values make it possible to view objects placed further away from the "
"camera, at the cost of lower precision in the depth buffer (which can result "
"in visible Z-fighting in the distance). The camera far clip distance can be "
"adjusted on a per-scene basis using the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the 3D "
"editor. If a scene had its camera far clip distance adjusted using the "
"[b]View[/b] menu, this setting is ignored in the scene in question. This "
"setting is also ignored while a [Camera3D] node is being previewed in the "
"editor."
msgstr "ໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນໄກສຸດ (far clip) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກ້ອງໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The default camera near clip distance to use in the 3D editor (in degrees). "
"Lower values make it possible to view objects placed closer to the camera, at "
"the cost of lower precision in the depth buffer (which can result in visible "
"Z-fighting in the distance). The camera near clip distance can be adjusted on "
"a per-scene basis using the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the 3D editor. If "
"a scene had its camera near clip distance adjusted using the [b]View[/b] "
"menu, this setting is ignored in the scene in question. This setting is also "
"ignored while a [Camera3D] node is being previewed in the editor."
msgstr "ໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນໃກ້ສຸດ (near clip) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກ້ອງໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The modifier key to use to enable freelook in the 3D editor (on top of "
"pressing the right mouse button).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting, the freelook toggle keyboard "
"shortcut ([kbd]Shift + F[/kbd] by default) is always available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On certain window managers on Linux, the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key will "
"be intercepted by the window manager when clicking a mouse button at the same "
"time. This means Godot will not see the modifier key as being pressed."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມເສີມ (modifier key) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດການເບິ່ງແບບອິດສະຫຼະ (freelook) ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The base 3D freelook speed in units per second. This can be adjusted by using "
"the mouse wheel while in freelook mode, or by holding down the \"fast\" or "
"\"slow\" modifier keys ([kbd]Shift[/kbd] and [kbd]Alt[/kbd] by default, "
"respectively)."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວພື້ນຖານຂອງການເບິ່ງແບບອິດສະຫຼະ (3D freelook) ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"The inertia of the 3D freelook camera. Higher values make the camera start "
"and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr "ຄວາມເສື່ອມ (inertia) ຂອງກ້ອງ 3D freelook."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the vertical mouse axis when using freelook mode "
"in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະກັບແກນເມົາສ໌ແນວຕັ້ງເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ freelook ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The navigation scheme to use when freelook is enabled in the 3D editor. Some "
"of the navigation schemes below may be more convenient when designing "
"specific levels in the 3D editor.\n"
"- [b]Default:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\", \"Freelook Backward\", \"Freelook "
"Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" keys will move relative to the camera, taking its "
"pitch angle into account for the movement.\n"
"- [b]Partially Axis-Locked:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\" and \"Freelook "
"Backward\" keys will move relative to the camera, taking its pitch angle into "
"account for the movement. The \"Freelook Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" keys will "
"move in an \"absolute\" manner, [i]not[/i] taking the camera's pitch angle "
"into account for the movement.\n"
"- [b]Fully Axis-Locked:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\", \"Freelook Backward\", "
"\"Freelook Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" keys will move in an \"absolute\" "
"manner, [i]not[/i] taking the camera's pitch angle into account for the "
"movement.\n"
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation/navigation_scheme]."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ (navigation scheme) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອເປີດ freelook ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The mouse sensitivity to use while freelook mode is active in the 3D editor. "
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation_feel/orbit_sensitivity]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາສ໌ (sensitivity) ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ freelook ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], freelook speed is linked to the zoom value used in the "
"camera orbit mode in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄວາມໄວ freelook ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄ່າການຊູມໃນໂໝດ camera "
"orbit."

msgid ""
"The grid division bias to use in the 3D editor. Negative values will cause "
"small grid divisions to appear earlier, whereas positive values will cause "
"small grid divisions to appear later."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມລຳອຽງຂອງການແບ່ງເສັ້ນກຣິດ (grid division bias) ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The largest grid division to use in the 3D editor. Together with [member "
"editors/3d/primary_grid_steps], this determines how large the grid divisions "
"can be. The grid divisions will not be able to get larger than "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_max[/code] units. By default, "
"when [member editors/3d/primary_grid_steps] is [code]8[/code], this means "
"grid divisions cannot get larger than [code]64[/code] units each (so primary "
"grid lines are [code]512[/code] units apart), no matter how far away the "
"camera is from the grid."
msgstr "ການແບ່ງເສັ້ນກຣິດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The smallest grid division to use in the 3D editor. Together with [member "
"editors/3d/primary_grid_steps], this determines how small the grid divisions "
"can be. The grid divisions will not be able to get smaller than "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_min[/code] units. By default, "
"this means grid divisions cannot get smaller than 1 unit each, no matter how "
"close the camera is from the grid."
msgstr "ການແບ່ງເສັ້ນກຣິດທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The grid size in units. Higher values prevent the grid from appearing \"cut "
"off\" at certain angles, but make the grid more demanding to render. "
"Depending on the camera's position, the grid may not be fully visible since a "
"shader is used to fade it progressively."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເສັ້ນກຣິດ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the XY plane in perspective view. "
"This can be useful for 3D side-scrolling games."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນກຣິດໃນລະນັບ (plane) XY ໃນມຸມມອງ perspective."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the XZ plane in perspective view."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນກຣິດໃນລະນັບ XZ ໃນມຸມມອງ perspective."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the YZ plane in perspective view. "
"This can be useful for 3D side-scrolling games."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນກຣິດໃນລະນັບ YZ ໃນມຸມມອງ perspective."

msgid "Opacity of the default gizmo for moving, rotating, and scaling 3D nodes."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງກິສໂມ (gizmo) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຍ້າຍ, ໝູນ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໂນດ 3D."

msgid "Size of the default gizmo for moving, rotating, and scaling 3D nodes."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກິສໂມ (gizmo) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຍ້າຍ, ໝູນ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໂນດ 3D."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables 3-button mouse emulation mode. This is useful "
"on laptops when using a trackpad.\n"
"When 3-button mouse emulation mode is enabled, the pan, zoom and orbit "
"modifiers can always be used in the 3D editor viewport, even when not holding "
"down any mouse button."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຈຳລອງເມົາສ໌ 3 ປຸ່ມ. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຄອມພິວເຕີພົກພາທີ່ໃຊ້ແທຣັກແພັດ (trackpad)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows using the top row [kbd]0[/kbd]-[kbd]9[/kbd] keys "
"to function as their equivalent numpad keys for 3D editor navigation. This "
"should be enabled on keyboards that have no numeric keypad available."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມຕົວເລກ [kbd]0[/kbd]-[kbd]9[/kbd] "
"ແຖວເທິງ ແທນປຸ່ມ numpad ສຳລັບການຄວບຄຸມໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the horizontal mouse axis when panning or "
"orbiting in the 3D editor. This setting does [i]not[/i] apply to freelook "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະກັບແກນເມົາສ໌ແນວນອນເມື່ອເຮັດການ pan ຫຼື orbit ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the vertical mouse axis when panning or orbiting "
"in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະກັບແກນເມົາສ໌ແນວຕັ້ງເມື່ອເຮັດການ pan ຫຼື orbit ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The navigation scheme preset to use in the 3D editor. Changing this setting "
"will affect the mouse button and modifier keys used to navigate the 3D editor "
"viewport.\n"
"All schemes can use [kbd]Mouse wheel[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Godot:[/b] [kbd]Middle mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Shift + Middle "
"mouse button[/kbd] to pan. [kbd]Ctrl + Middle mouse button[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Maya:[/b] [kbd]Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Middle mouse "
"button[/kbd] to pan, [kbd]Shift + Middle mouse button[/kbd] to pan 10 times "
"faster. [kbd]Alt + Right mouse button[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Modo:[/b] [kbd]Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Alt + Shift "
"+ Left mouse button[/kbd] to pan. [kbd]Ctrl + Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] "
"to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Tablet/Trackpad:[/b] [kbd]Alt[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Shift[/kbd] to pan. "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] to zoom. Enables 3-button mouse emulation mode.\n"
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation/orbit_mouse_button], [member editors/"
"3d/navigation/pan_mouse_button], [member editors/3d/navigation/"
"zoom_mouse_button], [member editors/3d/freelook/freelook_navigation_scheme], "
"and [member editors/3d/navigation/emulate_3_button_mouse].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On certain window managers on Linux, the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key will "
"be intercepted by the window manager when clicking a mouse button at the same "
"time. This means Godot will not see the modifier key as being pressed."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຄວບຄຸມ (navigation scheme preset) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to orbit in the 3D editor "
"viewport."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງກົດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອ orbit ໃນ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to pan in the 3D editor viewport."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງກົດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອ pan ໃນ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows gizmos for moving and rotating the camera in the "
"bottom corners of the 3D editor's viewport. Useful for devices that use touch "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງກິສໂມສຳລັບການຍ້າຍ ແລະ ໝູນກ້ອງຢູ່ມຸມລຸ່ມຂອງ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows a small orientation gizmo in the top-right corner "
"of the 3D editor's viewports."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງກິສໂມບອກທິດທາງ (orientation gizmo) "
"ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], warps the mouse around the 3D viewport while panning in "
"the 3D editor. This makes it possible to pan over a large area without having "
"to exit panning and adjust the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະທຳການ warp ເມົາສ໌ອ້ອມ 3D viewport ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງ pan ໃນ "
"3D editor."

msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to zoom in the 3D editor viewport."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງກົດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຊູມໃນ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"The mouse cursor movement direction to use when zooming by moving the mouse. "
"This does not affect zooming with the mouse wheel."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຊູມ."

msgid ""
"The angle threshold for snapping camera rotation to 45-degree angles while "
"orbiting with [kbd]Alt[/kbd] held."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມຸມ (threshold) ສຳລັບການ snap ກ້ອງໄປທີ່ 45 ອົງສາໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດ [kbd]Alt[/kbd] "
"ຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The inertia to use when orbiting in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr "ຄວາມເສື່ອມ (inertia) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ orbit ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The mouse sensitivity to use when orbiting in the 3D editor. See also [member "
"editors/3d/freelook/freelook_sensitivity]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາສ໌ (sensitivity) ເມື່ອ orbit ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The inertia to use when panning in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr "ຄວາມເສື່ອມ (inertia) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອ pan ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid "The mouse sensitivity to use when panning in the 3D editor."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງເມົາສ໌ (sensitivity) ເມື່ອ pan ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The inertia to use when zooming in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr "ຄວາມເສື່ອມ (inertia) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອຊູມໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the primary 3D grid. The color's alpha channel affects "
"the grid's opacity."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນກຣິດຫຼັກ (primary grid) ໃນ 3D."

msgid ""
"If set above 0, where a primary grid line should be drawn. By default, "
"primary lines are configured to be more visible than secondary lines. This "
"helps with measurements in the 3D editor. See also [member editors/3d/"
"primary_grid_color] and [member editors/3d/secondary_grid_color]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນກຣິດຫຼັກທຸກໆຈັກຊ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the secondary 3D grid. This is generally a less visible "
"color than [member editors/3d/primary_grid_color]. The color's alpha channel "
"affects the grid's opacity."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນກຣິດຮອງ (secondary grid) ໃນ 3D."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection box that surrounds selected nodes in the "
"3D editor viewport."
msgstr "ສີຂອງກອບການເລືອກສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນ 3D viewport."

msgid ""
"If checked, the transform gizmo remains visible during rotation in that "
"transform mode."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກ, ກິສໂມການແປງຮູບ (transform gizmo) ຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໝູນ."

msgid ""
"The scale of the outer circle of the rotation gizmo as view plane rotation in "
"the 3D editor. If set to [code]2.0[/code], the outer circle has twice the "
"radius of the XYZ rotation gizmo sphere."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງວົງມົນຊັ້ນນອກຂອງກິສໂມການໝູນ (rotation gizmo) ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the AABB gizmo that displays the [GeometryInstance3D]'s "
"custom [AABB]."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ AABB gizmo."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Camera3D]s."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບ [Camera3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color for CSG nodes (such as [CSGShape3D] or [CSGBox3D])."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບໂນດ CSG (ເຊັ່ນ [CSGShape3D] ຫຼື [CSGBox3D])."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Decal] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບໂນດ [Decal]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [FogVolume] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບໂນດ [FogVolume]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for the [GridMap] grid."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບເສັ້ນກຣິດ [GridMap]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for the [IKModifier3D] guides."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບເສັ້ນກຳກັບ [IKModifier3D]."

msgid ""
"The color override to use for 3D editor gizmos if the [Node3D] in question is "
"part of an instantiated scene file (from the perspective of the current "
"scene)."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ຂຽນທັບສຳລັບກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ຫາກໂນດນັ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງສາກທີ່ຖືກ instantiate ເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Joint3D]s and [PhysicalBone3D]s."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ສຳລັບ [Joint3D] ແລະ [PhysicalBone3D]."

msgid "Color for representing [member Joint3D.node_a] for some [Joint3D] types."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ [member Joint3D.node_a] ສຳລັບບາງປະເພດຂອງ [Joint3D]."

msgid "Color for representing [member Joint3D.node_b] for some [Joint3D] types."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນ [member Joint3D.node_b] ສຳລັບບາງປະເພດຂອງ [Joint3D]."

msgid "Color of lines displayed in baked [LightmapGI] node's grid."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເສັ້ນທີ່ສະແດງໃນກຣິດຂອງໂນດ [LightmapGI] ທີ່ຖືກເບັກ (baked) ແລ້ວ."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [LightmapProbe] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [LightmapProbe]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [OccluderInstance3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [OccluderInstance3D]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [GPUParticlesAttractor3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [GPUParticlesAttractor3D]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [GPUParticlesCollision3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [GPUParticlesCollision3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [CPUParticles3D] and [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [CPUParticles3D] ແລະ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [Path3D] tilt circles, which indicate the "
"direction the [Curve3D] is tilted towards."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບວົງມົນບອກຄວາມອຽງຂອງ [Path3D]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [ReflectionProbe] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [ReflectionProbe]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for the currently selected [Skeleton3D] bone."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [Skeleton3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [Skeleton3D]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneCollision3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [SpringBoneCollision3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneCollision3D] nodes with inside "
"mode."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [SpringBoneCollision3D] ໃນໂໝດ inside."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneSimulator3D] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [AudioStreamPlayer3D]'s emission angle."
msgstr ""
"ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບມຸມການປ່ອຍສຽງ (emission angle) ຂອງ "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D]."

msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] and "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] ແລະ "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D]."

msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [VoxelGI] nodes."
msgstr "ສີກິສໂມໃນ 3D editor ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂນດ [VoxelGI]."

msgid "The length of [Skeleton3D] bone gizmos in the 3D editor."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງກິສໂມກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"The shape of [Skeleton3D] bone gizmos in the 3D editor. [b]Wire[/b] is a thin "
"line, while [b]Octahedron[/b] is a set of lines that represent a thicker "
"hollow line pointing in a specific direction (similar to most 3D animation "
"software)."
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງກິສໂມກະດູກ [Skeleton3D] ໃນ 3D editor."

msgid ""
"Size of probe gizmos displayed when editing [LightmapGI] and [LightmapProbe] "
"nodes. Setting this to [code]0.0[/code] will hide the probe spheres of "
"[LightmapGI] and wireframes of [LightmapProbe] nodes, but will keep the "
"wireframes linking probes from [LightmapGI] and billboard icons from "
"[LightmapProbe] intact."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກິສໂມ probe ທີ່ສະແດງເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂໂນດ [LightmapGI] ແລະ [LightmapProbe]."

msgid "Size of the disk gizmo displayed when editing [Path3D]'s tilt handles."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກິສໂມຮູບຈານ (disk gizmo) ທີ່ສະແດງເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂ tilt handles ຂອງ [Path3D]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], collision shapes in the 3D editor are visible only when "
"selected. If [code]false[/code], collision shapes are always visible."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຮູບຮ່າງການຕຳ (collision shapes) ໃນ 3D editor "
"ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະເມື່ອຖືກເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically updates animation tracks' target paths "
"when renaming or reparenting nodes in the Scene tree dock."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນຊື່ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display a confirmation dialog when adding a new track "
"to an animation by pressing the \"key\" icon next to a property. Holding "
"Shift will bypass the dialog.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the behavior is reversed, i.e. the dialog only appears "
"when Shift is held."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໄດອາລັອກຢືນຢັນເມື່ອເພີ່ມແທຣັກໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid ""
"Default step used when creating a new [Animation] in the Animation bottom "
"panel. Only affects the first animation created in the [AnimationPlayer]. By "
"default, other newly created animations will use the step from the previous "
"ones.\n"
"This value is always expressed in seconds. If you want e.g. [code]10[/code] "
"FPS to be the default, you need to set the default step to [code]0.1[/code]."
msgstr "ຄ່າ step ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງ [Animation] ໃໝ່ໃນ Animation panel."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], create a Bezier track instead of a standard track when "
"pressing the \"key\" icon next to a property. Bezier tracks provide more "
"control over animation curves, but are more difficult to adjust quickly."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ Bezier track ແທນແທຣັກມາດຕະຖານເມື່ອກົດໄອຄອນ \"ຄີ\"."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], create a [code]RESET[/code] track when creating a new "
"animation track. This track can be used to restore the animation to a "
"\"default\" state."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງແທຣັກ [code]RESET[/code] ເມື່ອສ້າງແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນໃໝ່. "
"ແທຣັກນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າແອນິເມຊັນໃຫ້ເປັນສະຖານະ \"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\"."

msgid ""
"Controls whether [AnimationPlayer] will apply snapping to nearest integer FPS "
"when snapping is in Seconds mode. The option is remembered locally for a "
"scene and this option only determines the default value when scene doesn't "
"have local state yet."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າ [AnimationPlayer] ຈະໃຊ້ການສະແນັບ (snapping) ເຂົ້າກັບຄ່າ FPS "
"ທີ່ເປັນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຫຼືບໍ່ ເມື່ອການສະແນັບຢູ່ໃນໂໝດວິນາທີ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກຈື່ໄວ້ສະເພາະສາກນັ້ນໆ ແລະ "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກຳນົດພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສາກຍັງບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Default step mode for [AnimationPlayer] (seconds or FPS). The option is "
"remembered locally for a scene and this option only determines the default "
"value when scene doesn't have local state yet."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຂັ້ນຕອນ (step mode) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [AnimationPlayer] (ວິນາທີ ຫຼື FPS). "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກຈື່ໄວ້ສະເພາະສາກນັ້ນໆ ແລະ "
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກຳນົດພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສາກຍັງບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຕົວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], animation keys and markers are inserted at the current "
"time in the animation.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], they are inserted at the mouse cursor's position."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຄີແອນິເມຊັນ ແລະ ມາກເກີຈະຖືກແຊກໃສ່ໃນເວລາປັດຈຸບັນຂອງແອນິເມຊັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], ພວກມັນຈະຖືກແຊກໃສ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"The modulate color to use for \"future\" frames displayed in the animation "
"editor's onion skinning feature."
msgstr ""
"ສີປັບແຕ່ງ (modulate color) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຟຣມ \"ໃນອະນາຄົດ\" ທີ່ສະແດງໃນຟີເຈີ onion skinning "
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid ""
"The modulate color to use for \"past\" frames displayed in the animation "
"editor's onion skinning feature."
msgstr ""
"ສີປັບແຕ່ງ (modulate color) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຟຣມ \"ໃນອະດີດ\" ທີ່ສະແດງໃນຟີເຈີ onion skinning "
"ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂແອນິເມຊັນ."

msgid "The color at the top of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr "ສີຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color at the bottom of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr "ສີຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color at 0 dB of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ລະດັບ 0 dB ຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color at the top of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "ສີຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color at the bottom of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "ສີຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color at 0 dB of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ລະດັບ 0 dB ຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The multiplier color for the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "ສີຕົວຄູນສຳລັບການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"The multiplier color for the VU meter gradient where audio is not reaching."
msgstr "ສີຕົວຄູນສຳລັບການໄລ່ລະດັບສີແຖບວັດລະດັບສຽງ (VU meter) ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສຽງໄປບໍ່ເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum distance at which tiles can be placed on a GridMap, relative to "
"the camera position (in 3D units)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດວາງທາຍ (tiles) ເທິງ GridMap ໄດ້, ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກ້ອງ (ໃນໜ່ວຍ "
"3D)."

msgid "Texture size of mesh previews generated for GridMap's MeshLibrary."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເທັກເຈີ (Texture size) ຂອງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເມຊ (mesh) ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບ MeshLibrary "
"ຂອງ GridMap."

msgid ""
"The panning speed when using the mouse wheel or touchscreen events in the 2D "
"editor. This setting does not apply to panning by holding down the middle or "
"right mouse buttons."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການເລື່ອນ (panning) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ເຫດການຈາກໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບການເລື່ອນໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມກາງ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມຂວາຂອງເມົາສ໌ຄ້າງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in the 2D editor. See "
"also [member editors/panning/sub_editors_panning_scheme] and [member editors/"
"panning/animation_editors_panning_scheme]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າການກິ້ງລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ຈະເປັນການຊູມ ຫຼື ການເລື່ອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member editors/"
"panning/sub_editors_panning_scheme] ແລະ [member editors/panning/"
"animation_editors_panning_scheme]."

msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in the animation track "
"and Bezier editors. See also [member editors/panning/"
"2d_editor_panning_scheme] and [member editors/panning/"
"sub_editors_panning_scheme] (which controls the animation blend tree editor's "
"pan behavior)."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າການກິ້ງລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ຈະເປັນການຊູມ ຫຼື ການເລື່ອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂແທຣັກແອນິເມຊັນ ແລະ ເບຊຽຣ໌ (Bezier). "
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member editors/panning/2d_editor_panning_scheme] ແລະ [member "
"editors/panning/sub_editors_panning_scheme]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows panning by holding down [kbd]Space[/kbd] in the "
"2D editor viewport (in addition to panning with the middle or right mouse "
"buttons). If [code]false[/code], the left mouse button must be held down "
"while holding down [kbd]Space[/kbd] to pan in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລື່ອນໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ [kbd]Space[/kbd] "
"ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນວິວພອດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D. ຖ້າ [code]false[/code], ຕ້ອງກົດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຊ້າຍຄ້າງໄວ້ພ້ອມກັບກົດ "
"[kbd]Space[/kbd] ເພື່ອເລື່ອນໃນວິວພອດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D."

msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in subeditors. The list "
"of affected subeditors is: animation blend tree editor, [Polygon2D] editor, "
"tileset editor, texture region editor and visual shader editor. See also "
"[member editors/panning/2d_editor_panning_scheme] and [member editors/panning/"
"animation_editors_panning_scheme]."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າການກິ້ງລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ຈະເປັນການຊູມ ຫຼື ການເລື່ອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຍ່ອຍ (subeditors)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], warps the mouse around the 2D viewport while panning in "
"the 2D editor. This makes it possible to pan over a large area without having "
"to exit panning and adjust the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະວາບ (warp) ເມົາສ໌ກັບໄປມາໃນວິວພອດ 2D "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງເລື່ອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ 2D. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລື່ອນໄປໃນພື້ນທີ່ກວ້າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປ່ອຍເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອປັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The mouse cursor movement direction to use when drag-zooming in any editor "
"(except 3D scene editor) by moving the mouse. This does not affect zooming "
"with the mouse wheel."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການລາກເພື່ອຊູມ (drag-zooming) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃດໆ "
"(ຍົກເວັ້ນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສາກ 3D). ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບການຊູມດ້ວຍລໍ້ເມົາສ໌."

msgid ""
"The delay in seconds until more complex and performance costly polygon "
"editors commit their outlines, e.g. the 2D navigation polygon editor rebakes "
"the navigation mesh polygons. A negative value stops the auto bake."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂພລີກອນທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຈະຢືນຢັນຂອບຮູບ (outlines). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນລົບຈະຢຸດການອົບ (bake) ອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The radius in which points can be selected in the [Polygon2D] and "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] editors (in pixels). Higher values make it easier to "
"select points quickly, but can make it more difficult to select the expected "
"point when several points are located close to each other."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກຈຸດໄດ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ [Polygon2D] ແລະ [CollisionPolygon2D] (ເປັນພິກເຊວ). "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເລືອກຈຸດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເລືອກຈຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ຍາກຂຶ້ນຖ້າມີຫຼາຍຈຸດຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the polygon's previous shape in the 2D polygon "
"editors with an opaque gray outline. This outline is displayed while dragging "
"a point until the left mouse button is released."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຮູບຊົງກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງໂພລີກອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂພລີກອນ 2D "
"ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນຂອບສີເທົາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reopens shader files that were open in the shader "
"editor when the project was last closed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໄຟລ໌ເຊດເດີ (shader) ທີ່ເຄີຍເປີດໄວ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂເຊດເດີຄືນໃໝ່ "
"ເມື່ອມີການເປີດໂປຣເຈັກຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a grid while the TileMap editor is active. See "
"also [member editors/tiles_editor/grid_color]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ (grid) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ TileMap "
"ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"The color to use for the TileMap editor's grid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member editors/tiles_editor/display_grid] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ TileMap.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member editors/tiles_editor/display_grid] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"Highlight the currently selected TileMapLayer by dimming the other ones in "
"the scene."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນ TileMapLayer ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ເລເຢີອື່ນໆໃນສາກມຶດລົງ."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Color\" category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Color\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Conditional\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Conditional\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Input\" category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Input\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Output\" category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Output\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Particle\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Particle\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Scalar\" category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Scalar\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Special\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Special\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Textures\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Textures\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Transform\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Transform\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Utility\" "
"category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Utility\"."

msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Vector\" category."
msgstr "ສີຂອງສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂນດກຣາຟ (graph node) ເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ໃນໝວດໝູ່ \"Vector\"."

msgid "The color theme to use in the visual shader editor."
msgstr "ທີມສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂວິຊວນເຊດເດີ (visual shader editor)."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of boolean type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບບູລີນ (boolean)."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of sampler type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບແຊມເປຼີ (sampler)."

msgid ""
"The color of a port/connection of scalar type (float, int, unsigned int)."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບສະກາລາ (float, int, unsigned int)."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of transform type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບທຣານສະຟອມ (transform)."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector2 type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ Vector2."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector3 type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ Vector3."

msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector4 type."
msgstr "ສີຂອງພອດ (port) ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ Vector4."

msgid "The pattern used for the background grid."
msgstr "ລວດລາຍທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The curvature to use for connection lines in the visual shader editor. Higher "
"values will make connection lines appear more curved, with values above "
"[code]0.5[/code] resulting in more \"angular\" turns in the middle of "
"connection lines."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂຄ້ງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂວິຊວນເຊດເດີ."

msgid ""
"The opacity of the minimap displayed in the bottom-right corner of the visual "
"shader editor."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂປ່ງແສງຂອງແຜນທີ່ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (minimap) ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂວິຊວນເຊດເດີ."

msgid ""
"The size to use for port previews in the visual shader uniforms (toggled by "
"clicking the \"eye\" icon next to an output). The value is defined in pixels "
"at 100% zoom, and will scale with zoom automatically."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງພອດໃນ visual shader uniforms."

msgid ""
"Path to the SCP (secure copy) executable (used for remote deploy to desktop "
"platforms). If left empty, the editor will attempt to run [code]scp[/code] "
"from [code]PATH[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SCP is not the same as SFTP. Specifying the SFTP executable here "
"will not work."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ SCP executable."

msgid ""
"Path to the SSH executable (used for remote deploy to desktop platforms). If "
"left empty, the editor will attempt to run [code]ssh[/code] from [code]PATH[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ SSH executable."

msgid ""
"The folder where projects should be scanned for (recursively), in a way "
"similar to the project manager's [b]Scan[/b] button. This can be set to the "
"same value as [member filesystem/directories/default_project_path] for "
"convenience.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this path to a folder with very large amounts of files/"
"folders can slow down the project manager startup significantly. To keep the "
"project manager quick to start up, it is recommended to set this value to a "
"folder as \"specific\" as possible."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສະແກນຫາໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The folder where new projects should be created by default when clicking the "
"project manager's [b]New Project[/b] button. This can be set to the same "
"value as [member filesystem/directories/autoscan_project_path] for "
"convenience."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The program that opens 3D model scene files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ສາກໂມເດລ 3D ເມື່ອກົດເລືອກ \"ເປີດໃນໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ\"."

msgid ""
"The program that opens audio files when clicking \"Open in External Program\" "
"option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be opened in the "
"system's default program."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ສຽງເມື່ອກົດເລືອກ \"ເປີດໃນໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ\"."

msgid ""
"The program that opens raster image files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບແບບຣັສເຕີ (raster image) ເມື່ອກົດເລືອກ "
"\"ເປີດໃນໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ\"."

msgid ""
"The terminal emulator program to use when using [b]Open in Terminal[/b] "
"context menu action in the FileSystem dock. You can enter an absolute path to "
"a program binary, or a path to a program that is present in the [code]PATH[/"
"code] environment variable.\n"
"If left empty, Godot will use the default terminal emulator for the system:\n"
"- [b]Windows:[/b] PowerShell\n"
"- [b]macOS:[/b] Terminal.app\n"
"- [b]Linux:[/b] The first terminal found on the system in this order: gnome-"
"terminal, konsole, xfce4-terminal, lxterminal, kitty, alacritty, urxvt, "
"xterm.\n"
"To use Command Prompt (cmd) instead of PowerShell on Windows, enter "
"[code]cmd[/code] in this field and the correct flags will automatically be "
"used.\n"
"On macOS, make sure to point to the actual program binary located within the "
"[code]Programs/MacOS[/code] folder of the .app bundle, rather than the .app "
"bundle directory.\n"
"If specifying a custom terminal emulator, you may need to override [member "
"filesystem/external_programs/terminal_emulator_flags] so it opens in the "
"correct folder."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມຈຳລອງເທີມິນອລ (terminal emulator) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to pass to the terminal emulator that is run when "
"using [b]Open in Terminal[/b] context menu action in the FileSystem dock. See "
"also [member filesystem/external_programs/terminal_emulator].\n"
"If left empty, the default flags are [code]{directory}[/code], which is "
"replaced by the absolute path to the directory that is being opened in the "
"terminal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the terminal emulator is set to PowerShell, cmd, or Konsole, "
"Godot will automatically prepend arguments to this list, as these terminals "
"require nonstandard arguments to open in the correct folder."
msgstr ""
"ອາຄິວເມນແຖວຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປຍັງຕົວຈຳລອງເທີມີນອລ ທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [b]ເປີດໃນເທີມີນອລ[/b] "
"ຈາກເມນູລັດໃນແຖບລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ເບິ່ງຕື່ມຢູ່ທີ່ [member filesystem/external_programs/"
"terminal_emulator].\n"
"ຖ້າປະວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ [code]{directory}[/code], "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງສົມບູນຂອງໂຟນເດີທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກເປີດໃນເທີມີນອລ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕົວຈຳລອງເທີມີນອລຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ PowerShell, cmd, ຫຼື Konsole, Godot "
"ຈະຕື່ມອາຄິວເມນໃສ່ທາງໜ້າລາຍການນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເທີມີນອລເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງການອາຄິວເມນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອເປີດໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The program that opens vector image files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບແບບເວກເຕີເມື່ອກົດເລືອກ \"ເປີດໃນໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ\"."

msgid ""
"The display mode to use in the editor's file dialogs.\n"
"- [b]Thumbnails[/b] takes more space, but displays dynamic resource "
"thumbnails, making resources easier to preview without having to open them.\n"
"- [b]List[/b] is more compact but doesn't display dynamic resource "
"thumbnails. Instead, it displays static icons based on the file extension."
msgstr "ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display hidden files in the editor's file dialogs. "
"Files that have names starting with [code].[/code] are considered hidden "
"(e.g. [code].hidden_file[/code])."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The thumbnail size to use in the editor's file dialogs (in pixels). See also "
"[member docks/filesystem/thumbnail_size]."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail) ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Password used for file server when exporting project with remote file system."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ file server ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກດ້ວຍລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໄລຍະໄກ (remote file "
"system)."

msgid ""
"Port used for file server when exporting project with remote file system."
msgstr "ພອດ (Port) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ file server ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂປຣເຈັກດ້ວຍລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໄລຍະໄກ."

msgid ""
"The path to the Blender executable used for converting the Blender 3D scene "
"files [code].blend[/code] to glTF 2.0 format during import. Blender 3.0 or "
"later is required.\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/blender/enabled].\n"
"If this setting is empty, Blender's default paths will be detected and used "
"automatically if present in this order:\n"
"[b]Windows:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- C:\\Program Files\\Blender Foundation\\blender.exe\n"
"- C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Blender Foundation\\blender.exe\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]macOS:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- /opt/homebrew/bin/blender\n"
"- /opt/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/opt/blender\n"
"- /Applications/Blender.app/Contents/MacOS/Blender\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Linux/*BSD:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- /usr/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /opt/blender/bin/blender\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ Blender executable."

msgid ""
"The port number used for Remote Procedure Call (RPC) communication with "
"Godot's created process of the blender executable.\n"
"Setting this to 0 effectively disables communication with Godot and the "
"blender process, making performance slower."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກພອດສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບ Blender ຜ່ານ RPC."

msgid ""
"The maximum idle uptime (in seconds) of the Blender process.\n"
"This prevents Godot from having to create a new process for each import "
"within the given seconds."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ໂປຣເຊສ Blender ຈະເປີດຖ້າໄວ້ (idle)."

msgid ""
"The path to the FBX2glTF executable used for converting Autodesk FBX 3D scene "
"files [code].fbx[/code] to glTF 2.0 format during import.\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ FBX2glTF executable."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], uses lossless compression for binary resources."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ (lossless) "
"ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໄບນາຣີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when saving a file, the editor will rename the old file "
"to a different name, save a new file, then only remove the old file once the "
"new file has been saved. This makes loss of data less likely to happen if the "
"editor or operating system exits unexpectedly while saving (e.g. due to a "
"crash or power outage).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, this feature can interact negatively with certain "
"antivirus programs. In this case, you may have to set this to [code]false[/"
"code] to prevent file locking issues."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ແບບປອດໄພເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນເສຍຫາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a warning toast message when saving a text-"
"based scene or resource that is larger than 500 KiB on disk. This is "
"typically caused by binary subresources being embedded as text, which results "
"in slow and inefficient conversion to text. This in turn impacts scene saving "
"and loading times.\n"
"This should usually be resolved by moving the embedded binary subresource to "
"its own binary resource file ([code].res[/code] extension instead of "
"[code].tres[/code]). This is the preferred approach. Alternatively, the "
"entire scene can be saved with the binary [code].scn[/code] format as opposed "
"to [code].tscn[/code], but this will make it less friendly to version control "
"systems."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນເມື່ອບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]Adaptive[/code], the dialog opens in list view or grid view "
"depending on the requested type. If set to [code]Last Used[/code], the "
"display mode will always open the way you last used it."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບ (dialog)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], together with exact matches of a filename, the dialog "
"includes approximate matches.\n"
"This is useful for finding the correct files even when there are typos in the "
"search query; for example, searching \"nprmal\" will find \"normal\". "
"Additionally, it allows you to write shorter search queries; for example, "
"searching \"nml\" will also find \"normal\".\n"
"See also [member filesystem/quick_open_dialog/max_fuzzy_misses]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ແບບໃກ້ຄຽງ (fuzzy search)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results will include files located in the [code]addons[/"
"code] folder."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາຈະລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]addons[/code] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlighting a resource will preview it quickly without "
"confirming the selection or closing the dialog."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການເລືອກຊັບພະຍາກອນຈະສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"The number of missed query characters allowed in a match when fuzzy matching "
"is enabled. For example, with the default value of [code]2[/code], [code]"
"\"normal\"[/code] would match [code]\"narmal\"[/code] and [code]\"norma\"[/"
"code] but not [code]\"nor\"[/code]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຜິດພາດໄດ້ສູງສຸດເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບໃກ້ຄຽງ."

msgid "Maximum number of matches to show in dialog."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results will be highlighted with their search matches."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັບຄຳຄົ້ນຫາໃນຜົນລັບ."

msgid ""
"The path to the directory containing the Open Image Denoise (OIDN) "
"executable, used optionally for denoising lightmaps. It can be downloaded "
"from [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/"
"downloads.html]openimagedenoise.org[/url].\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ເກັບ OIDN executable."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], input events will be flushed just before every idle and "
"physics frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], these events will be flushed only once per process "
"frame, between iterations of the engine.\n"
"Enabling this setting can greatly improve input responsiveness, especially in "
"devices that struggle to run at the project's intended frame rate."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຄລຍເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (input events) ກ່ອນທຸກໆເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], similar input events sent by the operating system are "
"accumulated. When input accumulation is enabled, all input events generated "
"during a frame will be merged and emitted when the frame is done rendering. "
"Therefore, this limits the number of input method calls per second to the "
"rendering FPS.\n"
"Input accumulation can be disabled to get slightly more precise/reactive "
"input at the cost of increased CPU usage.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input accumulation is [i]enabled[/i] by default."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີການສະສົມເຫດການການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Editor accessibility support mode:\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ([code]0[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, but updates "
"to the accessibility information are processed only if an assistive app (such "
"as a screen reader or a Braille display) is active (default).\n"
"- [b]Always Active[/b] ([code]1[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, "
"and updates to the accessibility information are always processed, regardless "
"of the status of assistive apps.\n"
"- [b]Disabled[/b] ([code]2[/code]): Accessibility support is fully disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps. To test the editor with these tools, use "
"[b]Always Active[/b]."
msgstr "ໂໝດການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (Accessibility)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor inspector uses property documentation as an "
"accessible description of the property."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ອິນສະເປັກເຕີຈະໃຊ້ຄຳອະທິບາຍຄຸນສົມບັດ (property documentation) "
"ເປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"How to position the Cancel and OK buttons in the editor's [AcceptDialog] "
"windows. Different platforms have different conventions for this, which can "
"be overridden through this setting to avoid accidental clicks when using "
"Godot on multiple platforms.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] follows the platform convention: OK first on Windows, KDE, and "
"LXQt; Cancel first on macOS and other Linux desktop environments.\n"
"- [b]Cancel First[/b] forces the Cancel/OK ordering.\n"
"- [b]OK First[/b] forces the OK/Cancel ordering.\n"
"To check if these buttons are swapped at runtime, use [method "
"DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok]."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມ Cancel ແລະ OK ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main menu collapses into a [MenuButton].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only applicable on macOS when [member interface/"
"editor/appearance/use_embedded_menu] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on the Android editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ເມນູຫຼັກຈະຖືກຍຸບລົງໃນ [MenuButton]."

msgid ""
"The custom editor scale factor to use. This can be used for displays with "
"very high DPI where a scale factor of 200% is not sufficient.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member interface/editor/appearance/"
"display_scale] is set to [b]Custom[/b]."
msgstr "ຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນ (scale factor) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"The display scale factor to use for the editor interface. Higher values are "
"more suited to hiDPI/Retina displays.\n"
"If set to [b]Auto[/b], the editor scale is automatically determined based on "
"the screen resolution and reported display DPI. This heuristic is not always "
"ideal, which means you can get better results by setting the editor scale "
"manually.\n"
"If set to [b]Custom[/b], the scaling value in [member interface/editor/"
"appearance/custom_display_scale] will be used."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນການສະແດງຜົນຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The preferred monitor to display the editor. If [b]Auto[/b], the editor will "
"remember the last screen it was displayed on across multiple sessions."
msgstr "ຈໍພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Expanding main editor window content to the title, if supported by "
"[DisplayServer]. See [constant DisplayServer.WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE].\n"
"Specific to the macOS platform."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄປຍັງແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ (ສະເພາະ macOS)."

msgid "The preferred monitor to display the project manager."
msgstr "ຈໍພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a renderer selector that can be used to change the "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] project setting "
"will be shown in the top right of the main editor window."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກເຣນເດີເຣີ (renderer) ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays an icon in the top-right corner of the editor that spins "
"when the editor redraws a frame. This can be used to diagnose situations "
"where the engine is constantly redrawing, which should be avoided as this "
"increases CPU and GPU utilization for no good reason. To further troubleshoot "
"these situations, start the editor with the [code]--debug-canvas-item-redraw[/"
"code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url].\n"
"Consider enabling this if you are developing editor plugins to ensure they "
"only make the editor redraw when required.\n"
"The default [b]Auto[/b] value will only enable this if the editor was "
"compiled with the [code]dev_build=yes[/code] SCons option (the default is "
"[code]dev_build=no[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member interface/editor/display/update_continuously] is "
"[code]true[/code], the spinner icon displays in red.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the editor was started with the [code]--debug-canvas-item-"
"redraw[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url], the update spinner "
"will [i]never[/i] display regardless of this setting's value. This is to "
"avoid confusion with what would cause redrawing in real world scenarios."
msgstr "ສະແດງໄອຄອນໝູນເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂມີການແຕ້ມເຟຣມໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor main menu is using embedded [MenuBar] instead of "
"system global menu.\n"
"Specific to the macOS platform."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ເມນູຫຼັກຈະໃຊ້ [MenuBar] ແບບຝັງແທນເມນູຂອງລະບົບ (ສະເພາະ macOS)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor UI uses OS native file/directory selection "
"dialogs."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌/ໂຟນເດີຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically opens screenshots with the default "
"program associated to [code].png[/code] files after a screenshot is taken "
"using the [b]Editor > Take Screenshot[/b] action."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດຮູບພາບທີ່ຖ່າຍໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], (re)imports resources even if the editor window is "
"unfocused or minimized. If [code]false[/code], resources are only "
"(re)imported when the editor window is focused. This can be set to "
"[code]true[/code] to speed up iteration by starting the import process "
"earlier when saving files in the project folder. This also allows getting "
"visual feedback on changes without having to click the editor window, which "
"is useful with multi-monitor setups. The downside of setting this to "
"[code]true[/code] is that it increases idle CPU usage and may steal CPU time "
"from other applications when importing resources."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະນຳເຂົ້າຊັບພະຍາກອນຄືນໃໝ່ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the editor will save all scenes when confirming the "
"[b]Save[/b] action when quitting the editor or quitting to the project list. "
"If [code]true[/code], the editor will ask to save each scene individually."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຖາມໃຫ້ບັນທຶກແຕ່ລະສາກແຍກກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], scenes and scripts are saved when the editor loses "
"focus. Depending on the work flow, this behavior can be less intrusive than "
"[member text_editor/behavior/files/autosave_interval_secs] or remembering to "
"save manually."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ສາກ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເມື່ອຕົວແກ້ໄຂຫຼຸດໂຟກັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor's Script tab will have a separate "
"distraction mode setting from the 2D/3D/Game/AssetLib tabs. If [code]false[/"
"code], the distraction-free mode toggle is shared between all tabs."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ແຖບສະຄຣິບຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດໄຮ້ສິ່ງລົບກວນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, displays internal engine errors in toast notifications "
"(toggleable by clicking the \"bell\" icon at the bottom of the editor). No "
"matter the value of this setting, non-internal engine errors will always be "
"visible in toast notifications.\n"
"The default [b]Auto[/b] value will only enable this if the editor was "
"compiled with the [code]dev_build=yes[/code] SCons option (the default is "
"[code]dev_build=no[/code])."
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພາຍໃນຂອງເອນຈິນໃນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], keeps the screen on (even in case of inactivity), so "
"the screensaver does not take over. Works on desktop and mobile platforms."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຮັກສາໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍເປີດຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດ (ປ້ອງກັນການພັກໜ້າຈໍ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], embed modal windows such as docks inside the main "
"editor window. When single-window mode is enabled, tooltips will also be "
"embedded inside the main editor window, which means they can't be displayed "
"outside of the editor window. Single-window mode can be faster as it does not "
"need to create a separate window for every popup and tooltip, which can be a "
"slow operation depending on the operating system and rendering method in "
"use.\n"
"This is equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/"
"embed_subwindows] in the running project, except the setting's value is "
"inverted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To query whether the editor can use multiple windows in an "
"editor plugin, use [method EditorInterface.is_multi_window_enabled] instead "
"of querying the value of this editor setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [code]true[/code], game embedding is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຝັງໜ້າຕ່າງທັງໝົດໄວ້ພາຍໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (ໂໝດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມດຽວ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], redraws the editor every frame even if nothing has "
"changed on screen. When this setting is enabled, the update spinner displays "
"in red (see [member interface/editor/appearance/show_update_spinner]).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This greatly increases CPU and GPU utilization, leading to "
"increased power usage. This should only be enabled for troubleshooting "
"purposes."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະແຕ້ມເຟຣມໃໝ່ທຸກໆເຟຣມ (ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດຖ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the V-Sync mode for the editor. Does not affect the project when run "
"from the editor (this is controlled by [member ProjectSettings.display/window/"
"vsync/vsync_mode]).\n"
"Depending on the platform and used renderer, the engine will fall back to "
"[b]Enabled[/b] if the desired mode is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] V-Sync modes other than [b]Enabled[/b] are only supported in the "
"Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດ V-Sync ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Tab style of editor docks located at the bottom."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບແຖບຂອງ Dock ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

msgid "Tab style of editor docks, except bottom docks."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບແຖບຂອງ Dock (ຍົກເວັ້ນດ້ານລຸ່ມ)."

msgid ""
"The font to use for the script editor. Must be a resource of a [Font] type "
"such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file."
msgstr "ຟອນ (font) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The font ligatures to enable for the currently configured code font. Not all "
"fonts include support for ligatures.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has contextual ligatures in its font file."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ font ligatures ສຳລັບຟອນລະຫັດ."

msgid ""
"List of custom OpenType features to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured code font. Not all fonts include support for custom OpenType "
"features. The string should follow the OpenType specification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has custom OpenType features in its font file, "
"but there is no documented list yet."
msgstr "ລາຍການຟີເຈີ OpenType ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"List of alternative characters to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured code font. Not all fonts include support for custom variations. "
"The string should follow the OpenType specification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has alternate characters in its font file, but "
"there is no documented list yet."
msgstr "ລາຍການຕົວອັກສອນທາງເລືອກ (alternative characters) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The size of the font in the script editor. This setting does not impact the "
"font size of the Output panel (see [member run/output/font_size])."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], MSDF font rendering will be used for the visual "
"shader graph editor. You may need to set this to [code]false[/code] when "
"using a custom main font, as some fonts will look broken due to the use of "
"self-intersecting outlines in their font data. Downloading the font from the "
"font maker's official website as opposed to a service like Google Fonts can "
"help resolve this issue."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການເຣນເດີຟອນແບບ MSDF."

msgid ""
"FreeType's font anti-aliasing mode used to render the editor fonts. Most "
"fonts are not designed to look good with anti-aliasing disabled, so it's "
"recommended to leave this enabled unless you're using a pixel art font."
msgstr "ໂໝດການລົບຮອຍຢັກ (anti-aliasing) ຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], embedded font bitmap loading is disabled (bitmap-"
"only and color fonts ignore this property)."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການໂຫຼດ bitmap ທີ່ຝັງໃນຟອນຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"The font hinting mode to use for the editor fonts. FreeType supports the "
"following font hinting modes:\n"
"- [b]None:[/b] Don't use font hinting when rasterizing the font. This results "
"in a smooth font, but it can look blurry.\n"
"- [b]Light:[/b] Use hinting on the X axis only. This is a compromise between "
"font sharpness and smoothness.\n"
"- [b]Normal:[/b] Use hinting on both X and Y axes. This results in a sharp "
"font, but it doesn't look very smooth.\n"
"If set to [b]Auto[/b], the font hinting mode will be set to match the current "
"operating system in use. This means the [b]Light[/b] hinting mode will be "
"used on Windows and Linux, and the [b]None[/b] hinting mode will be used on "
"macOS."
msgstr "ໂໝດການເຮັດ Hinting ຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"The subpixel positioning mode to use when rendering editor font glyphs. This "
"affects both the main and code fonts. [b]Disabled[/b] is the fastest to "
"render and uses the least memory. [b]Auto[/b] only uses subpixel positioning "
"for small font sizes (where the benefit is the most noticeable). [b]One Half "
"of a Pixel[/b] and [b]One Quarter of a Pixel[/b] force the same subpixel "
"positioning mode for all editor fonts, regardless of their size (with [b]One "
"Quarter of a Pixel[/b] being the highest-quality option)."
msgstr "ໂໝດການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງລະດັບຊັບພິກເຊວ (subpixel positioning) ຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"The font to use for the editor interface. Must be a resource of a [Font] type "
"such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the provided font is variable, a weight of 400 (normal) will "
"be used."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The font to use for bold text in the editor interface. Must be a resource of "
"a [Font] type such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the provided font is variable, a weight of 700 (bold) will be "
"used."
msgstr "ຟອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວເຂັ້ມໃນອິນເຕີເຟດ."

msgid ""
"List of custom OpenType features to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured main font. Check what OpenType features are supported by your font "
"first.\n"
"The string should follow the OpenType specification, e.g. "
"[code]ss01,tnum,calt=false[/code]. Microsoft's documentation contains a list "
"of [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/"
"featurelist]all registered features[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor main font ([url=https://rsms.me/inter]Inter[/"
"url]) has custom OpenType features in its font file, with [code]ss04[/code] "
"and [code]tnum[/code] enabled and [code]calt[/code] disabled by default. "
"Supported features can be found at its website."
msgstr "ລາຍການຟີເຈີ OpenType ແບບກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບຟອນຫຼັກ."

msgid "The size of the font in the editor interface."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse's additional side buttons will be usable to "
"navigate in the script editor's file history. Set this to [code]false[/code] "
"if you're using the side buttons for other purposes (such as a push-to-talk "
"button in a VoIP program)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມຂ້າງຂອງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບ/ໄປໜ້າໃນປະຫວັດໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Overrides the tablet driver used by the editor."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີແທັບເລັດ (tablet driver) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"The language to use for the editor interface. If set to [b]Auto[/b], the "
"language is automatically determined based on the system locale. See also "
"[method EditorInterface.get_editor_language].\n"
"Translations are provided by the community. If you spot a mistake, "
"[url=https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/translation/"
"index.html]contribute to editor translations on Weblate![/url]"
msgstr "ພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], setting names in the editor are localized when "
"possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting affects most [EditorInspector]s in the editor UI, "
"primarily Project Settings and Editor Settings. To control names displayed in "
"the Inspector dock, use [member interface/inspector/"
"default_property_name_style] instead."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຊື່ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກແປເປັນພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້)."

msgid "Editor UI default layout direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການວາງເລເອົາ (layout) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"During a drag-and-drop, this is how long to wait over a UI element before it "
"triggers a reaction (e.g. a section unfolds to show nested items)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກວາງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເກີດການຕອບສະໜອງ."

msgid ""
"The amount of sleeping between frames in the editor (in microseconds). Higher "
"values will result in lower CPU/GPU usage, which can improve battery life on "
"laptops. However, higher values will result in a less responsive editor. The "
"default value is set to allow for maximum smoothness on monitors up to 144 "
"Hz. See also [member interface/editor/timers/"
"unfocused_low_processor_mode_sleep_usec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored if [member interface/editor/display/"
"update_continuously] is [code]true[/code], as enabling that setting disables "
"low-processor mode."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມ (microseconds) ເພື່ອປະຢັດຊັບພະຍາກອນ."

msgid ""
"When the editor window is unfocused, the amount of sleeping between frames "
"when the low-processor usage mode is enabled (in microseconds). Higher values "
"will result in lower CPU/GPU usage, which can improve battery life on laptops "
"(in addition to improving the running project's performance if the editor has "
"to redraw continuously). However, higher values will result in a less "
"responsive editor. The default value is set to limit the editor to 10 FPS "
"when the editor window is unfocused. See also [member interface/editor/timers/"
"low_processor_mode_sleep_usec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored if [member interface/editor/display/"
"update_continuously] is [code]true[/code], as enabling that setting disables "
"low-processor mode."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມເມື່ອປ່ອງຢ້ຽມບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ (unfocused)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when extending a script, the global class name of the "
"script is inserted in the script creation dialog, if it exists. If "
"[code]false[/code], the script's file path is always inserted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ຄລາສ (global class name) ເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ (extend) "
"ສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically unfolds Inspector property groups "
"containing modified values when opening a scene for the first time. Only "
"affects scenes without saved folding preferences and only unfolds groups with "
"properties that have been changed from their default values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only works in specific scenarios: when opening a "
"scene brought in from another project, or when opening a new scene that "
"already has modified properties (e.g., from version control). Duplicated "
"scenes are not considered foreign, so this setting will not affect them."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], show the intensity slider in the [ColorPicker]s opened "
"in the editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງແຖບປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນ (intensity) ໃນຕົວເລືອກສີ."

msgid ""
"The default color picker mode to use when opening [ColorPicker]s in the "
"editor. This mode can be temporarily adjusted on the color picker itself."
msgstr "ໂໝດເລືອກສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The default color picker shape to use when opening [ColorPicker]s in the "
"editor. This shape can be temporarily adjusted on the color picker itself."
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຕົວເລືອກສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The floating-point precision to use for properties that don't define an "
"explicit precision step. Lower values allow entering more precise values."
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງທົດສະນິຍົມສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"The default property name style to display in the Inspector dock. This style "
"can be temporarily adjusted in the Inspector dock's menu.\n"
"- [b]Raw:[/b] Displays properties in [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"- [b]Capitalized:[/b] Displays properties capitalized.\n"
"- [b]Localized:[/b] Displays the localized string for the current editor "
"language if a translation is available for the given property. If no "
"translation is available, falls back to [b]Capitalized[/b].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To display translated setting names in Project Settings and "
"Editor Settings, use [member interface/editor/localization/localize_settings] "
"instead."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຊື່ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], add a margin around Array, Dictionary, and Resource "
"Editors that are not already colored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member interface/inspector/nested_color_mode] is set to "
"[b]Containers & Resources[/b] this parameter will have no effect since those "
"editors will already be colored."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເພີ່ມຂອບ (margin) ອ້ອມຮອບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Array, Dictionary ແລະ "
"Resource."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces all property groups to be expanded in the "
"Inspector dock and prevents collapsing them."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ກຸ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດຂະຫຍາຍອອກ ແລະ ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຍຸບເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Base speed for increasing/decreasing float values by dragging them in the "
"inspector."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວພື້ນຖານໃນການປ່ຽນຄ່າຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມໂດຍການລາກໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Vector2] and [Vector2i] properties are shown on a "
"single line in the inspector instead of two lines. This is overall more "
"compact, but it can be harder to view and edit large values without expanding "
"the inspector horizontally."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຄຸນສົມບັດ [Vector2] ຈະສະແດງໃນແຖວດຽວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i], [Rect2], "
"[Rect2i], [Plane], and [Quaternion] properties are shown on a single line in "
"the inspector instead of multiple lines. This is overall more compact, but it "
"can be harder to view and edit large values without expanding the inspector "
"horizontally."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຄຸນສົມບັດ Vector ແລະ Rect ຕ່າງໆຈະສະແດງໃນແຖວດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Base speed for increasing/decreasing integer values by dragging them in the "
"inspector."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວພື້ນຖານໃນການປ່ຽນຄ່າຕົວເລກຖ້ວນໂດຍການລາກໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"The number of [Array] or [Dictionary] items to display on each \"page\" in "
"the inspector. Higher values allow viewing more values per page, but take "
"more time to load. This increased load time is noticeable when selecting "
"nodes that have array or dictionary properties in the editor."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ຈະສະແດງຕໍ່ໜ້າສຳລັບ Array ຫຼື Dictionary."

msgid ""
"Control which property editors are colored when they are opened.\n"
"- [b]Containers & Resources:[/b] Color all Array, Dictionary, and Resource "
"Editors.\n"
"- [b]Resources:[/b] Color all Resource Editors.\n"
"- [b]External Resources:[/b] Color Resource Editors that edits an external "
"resource."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃດແດ່ທີ່ຈະມີການໃສ່ສີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subresources can be edited in the current inspector "
"view. If the resource type is defined in [member interface/inspector/"
"resources_to_open_in_new_inspector] or if this setting is [code]false[/code], "
"attempting to edit a subresource always opens a new inspector view."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊັບພະຍາກອນຍ່ອຍ (subresources) ໃນ Inspector "
"ປະຈຸບັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"List of resources that should always be opened in a new inspector view, even "
"if [member interface/inspector/open_resources_in_current_inspector] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ລາຍການຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຄວນເປີດໃນ Inspector ໃໝ່ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display OpenType features marked as [code]hidden[/code] "
"by the font file in the [Font] editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຟີເຈີ OpenType ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], multiple window support in editor is enabled. The "
"following panels can become dedicated windows (i.e. made floating): Docks, "
"Script editor, Shader editor, and Game Workspace.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] is "
"[code]true[/code], the multi window support is always disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To query whether the editor can use multiple windows in an "
"editor plugin, use [method EditorInterface.is_multi_window_enabled] instead "
"of querying the value of this editor setting."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when panels are made floating they will be maximized.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], when panels are made floating their position and size "
"will match the ones when they are attached (excluding window border) to the "
"editor window."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ແຍກອອກມາຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມຈໍ (maximized)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the floating panel position, size, and screen will be "
"saved on editor exit. On next launch the panels that were floating will be "
"made floating in the saved positions, sizes and screens, if possible."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັນທຶກຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ແຍກອອກໄວ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the FileSystem dock will automatically navigate to the "
"currently selected scene tab."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], Dock ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຈະເລື່ອນໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Controls when the Close (X) button is displayed on scene tabs at the top of "
"the editor."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມການສະແດງປຸ່ມປິດ (X) ໃນແຖບສາກ."

msgid "The maximum width of each scene tab at the top editor (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະແຖບສາກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when a project is loaded, restores scenes that were "
"opened on the last editor session.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With many opened scenes, the editor may take longer to become "
"usable. If starting the editor quickly is necessary, consider setting this to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດສາກທີ່ເຄີຍເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອໂຫຼດໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], show a button next to each scene tab that opens the "
"scene's \"dominant\" script when clicked. The \"dominant\" script is the one "
"that is at the highest level in the scene's hierarchy."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເປີດສະຄຣິບຫຼັກຂ້າງໆແຖບສາກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display an automatically-generated thumbnail when "
"hovering scene tabs with the mouse. Scene thumbnails are generated when "
"saving the scene."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຊີ້ທີ່ແຖບສາກ."

msgid ""
"The color to use for \"highlighted\" user interface elements in the editor "
"(pressed and hovered items)."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບອົງປະກອບອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ຖືກ \"ເນັ້ນ\"."

msgid ""
"The extra spacing to add to various GUI elements in the editor (in pixels). "
"Increasing this value is useful to improve usability on touch screens, at the "
"cost of reducing the amount of usable screen real estate.\n"
"See also [member interface/theme/spacing_preset]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ GUI."

msgid ""
"The base color to use for user interface elements in the editor. Secondary "
"colors (such as darker/lighter variants) are derived from this color."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຖານຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The base spacing used by various GUI elements in the editor (in pixels). See "
"also [member interface/theme/spacing_preset]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງອົງປະກອບ GUI."

msgid "The border size to use for interface elements (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງອົງປະກອບອິນເຕີເຟດ."

msgid "The editor color preset to use."
msgstr "ຊຸດສີ (preset) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The contrast factor to use when deriving the editor theme's base color (see "
"[member interface/theme/base_color]). When using positive values, the derived "
"colors will be [i]darker[/i] than the base color. This contrast factor can be "
"set to a negative value, which will make the derived colors [i]brighter[/i] "
"than the base color. Negative contrast rates often look better for light "
"themes."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສີ (contrast) ສຳລັບທີມຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The corner radius to use for interface elements (in pixels). [code]0[/code] "
"is square."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຄວາມໂຄ້ງຂອງມຸມອົງປະກອບອິນເຕີເຟດ."

msgid ""
"The custom theme resource to use for the editor. Must be a Godot theme "
"resource in [code].tres[/code] or [code].res[/code] format."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີມແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draws additional borders around interactive UI elements "
"in the editor. This is automatically enabled when using the [b]Black (OLED)[/"
"b] theme preset, as this theme preset uses a fully black background."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບເພີ່ມເຕີມອ້ອມອົງປະກອບ UI."

msgid ""
"What relationship lines to draw in the editor's [Tree]-based GUIs (such as "
"the Scene tree dock).\n"
"- [b]None[/b] will make it so that no relationship lines are drawn.\n"
"- [b]Selected Only[/b] will only draw them for selected items.\n"
"- [b]All[/b] will always draw them for all items."
msgstr "ການສະແດງເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄວາມສຳພັນໃນລາຍການແບບ Tree."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor theme preset will attempt to automatically "
"match the system theme."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະພະຍາຍາມປັບທີມໃຫ້ກົງກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid ""
"The icon and font color scheme to use in the editor.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] determines the color scheme to use automatically based on "
"[member interface/theme/base_color].\n"
"- [b]Dark[/b] makes fonts and icons dark (suitable for light themes). Icon "
"colors are automatically converted by the editor following the set of rules "
"defined in [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/"
"themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp]this file[/url].\n"
"- [b]Light[/b] makes fonts and icons light (suitable for dark themes)."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບສີຂອງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຟອນ."

msgid ""
"The saturation to use for editor icons. Higher values result in more vibrant "
"colors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor icon saturation was increased by 30% in Godot "
"4.0 and later. To get Godot 3.x's icon saturation back, set [member interface/"
"theme/icon_saturation] to [code]0.77[/code]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ (saturation) ສຳລັບໄອຄອນ."

msgid ""
"The opacity to use when drawing relationship lines in the editor's [Tree]-"
"based GUIs (such as the Scene tree dock)."
msgstr "ຄວາມໂປ່ງແສງຂອງເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄວາມສຳພັນ."

msgid ""
"The editor theme spacing preset to use. See also [member interface/theme/"
"base_spacing] and [member interface/theme/additional_spacing]."
msgstr "ຊຸດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ (spacing preset) ຂອງທີມ."

msgid "The editor theme style to use."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (style) ຂອງທີມຕົວແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], use the monospace font for some labels in the editor "
"that display code symbols, such as signals, properties, and methods."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຟອນແບບ monospace ສຳລັບຊື່ສັນຍານ, ຄຸນສົມບັດ ແລະ ເມທອດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], set accent color based on system settings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is effective on Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ສີເນັ້ນ (accent color) ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], long press on touchscreen is treated as right click.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການກົດຄ້າງເທິງໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດຈະຖືວ່າເປັນການຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enable two finger pan and scale gestures on touchscreen "
"devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານທ່າທາງ (gestures) ສອງນິ້ວເພື່ອເລື່ອນ ແລະ ຍໍ້ຂະຫຍາຍ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], increases the scrollbar touch area, enables a larger "
"dragger for split containers, and increases PopupMenu vertical separation to "
"improve usability on touchscreen devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະປັບປຸງ UI ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the device will vibrate when a long-press gesture "
"triggers a right-click context menu in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only has an effect on devices with haptic feedback hardware. "
"Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ອຸປະກອນຈະສັ່ນເມື່ອມີການກົດຄ້າງ."

msgid ""
"Specify the multiplier to apply to the scale for the editor gizmo handles to "
"improve usability on touchscreen devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]1[/code] on non-touchscreen devices."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນຂະໜາດຂອງມືຈັບ (gizmo handles) ສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"A touch-friendly panel that provides easy access to common actions such as "
"save, delete, undo, and redo without requiring a keyboard.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Android and XR editor."
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຮອງຮັບການສຳຜັດ."

msgid ""
"Specifies how the engine should check for updates.\n"
"- [b]Disable Update Checks[/b] will block the engine from checking updates "
"(see also [member network/connection/network_mode]).\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] (default) will check for newest stable or unstable version, "
"depending on which version are you currently using. Switch to another option "
"if you want to lock in.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Preview[/b] will check for the newest available development "
"snapshot.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Stable[/b] will check for the newest available stable "
"version.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Patch[/b] will check for the latest available stable "
"version, but only within the same minor version. E.g. if your version is "
"[code]4.3.stable[/code], you will be notified about [code]4.3.1.stable[/"
"code], but not [code]4.4.stable[/code].\n"
"All update modes will ignore builds with different major versions (e.g. Godot "
"4 -> Godot 5)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການກວດສອບການອັບເດດ."

msgid ""
"Determines whether online features, such as the Asset Store or update checks, "
"are enabled in the editor. If this is a privacy concern, disabling these "
"online features prevents the editor from making HTTP requests to the Godot "
"website or third-party platforms hosting assets from the Asset Store.\n"
"Editor plugins and tool scripts are recommended to follow this setting. "
"However, Godot can't prevent them from violating this rule."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີອອນໄລນ໌ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"The address to listen to when starting the remote debugger. This can be set "
"to this device's local IP address to allow external clients to connect to the "
"remote debugger (instead of restricting the remote debugger to connections "
"from [code]localhost[/code])."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສຳລັບການລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກຕົວດີບັກທາງໄກ (remote debugger)."

msgid ""
"The port to listen to when starting the remote debugger. Godot will try to "
"use port numbers above the configured number if the configured number is "
"already taken by another application."
msgstr "ພອດສຳລັບການລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກຕົວດີບັກທາງໄກ."

msgid ""
"The host to use to contact the HTTP and HTTPS proxy in the editor (for the "
"asset store and export template downloads). See also [member network/"
"http_proxy/port].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot currently doesn't automatically use system proxy settings, "
"so you have to enter them manually here if needed."
msgstr "ໂຮສ (Host) ຂອງພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) HTTP/HTTPS."

msgid ""
"The port number to use to contact the HTTP and HTTPS proxy in the editor (for "
"the asset store and export template downloads). See also [member network/"
"http_proxy/host].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot currently doesn't automatically use system proxy settings, "
"so you have to enter them manually here if needed."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກພອດຂອງພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) HTTP/HTTPS."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the language server will try to provide additional "
"results when resolving symbols at the cost of showing wrong results. All "
"symbols in the project are checked and resolved just based on their name, "
"without taking context into account.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func untyped(param):\n"
"\tparam.print() # Will resolve to the global print method for e.g. hover "
"hints.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"When using static typing it is recommended to disable this setting, since it "
"will mostly add false positives for typed code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting also influences how symbols are resolved when using "
"renaming capabilities.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this setting might change in future "
"versions."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], language server ຈະພະຍາຍາມຄົ້ນຫາຜົນລັບເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The upper limit of time, that the language server spends for IO each poll."
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດເວລາທີ່ language server ໃຊ້ໃນການເຮັດ IO."

msgid "The host used to listen for language server clients."
msgstr "ໂຮສທີ່ໃຊ້ລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ language server clients."

msgid ""
"The port used to listen for language server clients.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A port configured with command-line options will take priority "
"over this setting: [code]--lsp-port <port>[/code]."
msgstr "ພອດທີ່ໃຊ້ລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ language server clients."

msgid ""
"The declaration of native symbols can't be resolved to a position in the file "
"system. If [code]true[/code] the language server will instead open the "
"documentation for native symbols in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The VSCode plugin adds additional functionality which allows "
"viewing Godot documentation directly in VSCode, so this option is usually not "
"needed in VSCode."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດເອກະສານອ້າງອີງສຳລັບຕົວແປພື້ນຖານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the language server will run in a separate thread, if "
"[code]false[/code] it will run on the main thread."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], language server ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນເທຣດ (thread) ແຍກ."

msgid ""
"The TLS certificate bundle to use for HTTP requests made within the editor "
"(e.g. from the Asset Store tab). If left empty, the [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/ca-bundle.crt]included Mozilla "
"certificate bundle[/url] will be used."
msgstr "ຊຸດໃບຮັບຮອງ TLS ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enable TLSv1.3 negotiation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using Mbed TLS 3.0 or later (Linux "
"distribution packages may be compiled against older system Mbed TLS "
"packages), otherwise the maximum supported TLS version is always TLSv1.2."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ TLSv1.3."

msgid ""
"The renderer type that will be checked off by default when creating a new "
"project. Accepted strings are \"forward_plus\", \"mobile\" or "
"\"gl_compatibility\"."
msgstr "ປະເພດເຣນເດີເຣີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Directory naming convention for the project manager. Options are \"No "
"Convention\" (project name is directory name), \"kebab-case\" (default), "
"\"snake_case\", \"camelCase\", \"PascalCase\", or \"Title Case\"."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຟນເດີໃນຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The sorting order to use in the project manager. When changing the sorting "
"order in the project manager, this setting is set permanently in the editor "
"settings."
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງໃນຕົວຈັດການໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], saves all scenes and scripts automatically before "
"running the project. Setting this to [code]false[/code] prevents the editor "
"from saving if there are no changes which can speed up the project startup "
"slightly, but it makes it possible to run a project that has unsaved changes. "
"(Unsaved changes will not be visible in the running project.)"
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັນທຶກທຸກສາກ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບກ່ອນຈະລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The action to execute on the bottom panel when running the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option won't do anything if the bottom panel switching is "
"locked using the pin button in the corner of the bottom panel."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The action to execute on the bottom panel when stopping the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option won't do anything if the bottom panel switching is "
"locked using the pin button in the corner of the bottom panel."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມເມື່ອຢຸດໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor will clear the Output panel when running the "
"project."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະເຄລຍແຖບ Output ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The size of the font in the [b]Output[/b] panel at the bottom of the editor. "
"This setting does not impact the font size of the script editor (see [member "
"interface/editor/fonts/code_font_size])."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນໃນແຖບ Output."

msgid "Maximum number of lines to show at any one time in the Output panel."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແຖບ Output."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], on Linux/BSD, the editor will check for Wayland first "
"instead of X11 (if available)."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະກວດສອບ Wayland ກ່ອນ X11 (ໃນ Linux/BSD)."

msgid ""
"Specifies how the Play window is launched relative to the Android editor.\n"
"- [b]Auto (based on screen size)[/b] (default) will automatically choose how "
"to launch the Play window based on the device and screen metrics. Defaults to "
"[b]Same as Editor[/b] on phones and [b]Side-by-side with Editor[/b] on "
"tablets.\n"
"- [b]Same as Editor[/b] will launch the Play window in the same window as the "
"Editor.\n"
"- [b]Side-by-side with Editor[/b] will launch the Play window side-by-side "
"with the Editor window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Android editor."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງລັນເກມໃນ Android."

msgid ""
"Overrides game embedding setting for all newly opened projects. If enabled, "
"game embedding settings are not saved."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຝັງເກມສຳລັບທຸກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ເປີດໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"The window mode to use to display the project when starting the project from "
"the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Game embedding is not available for [b]\"Force Maximized\"[/b] "
"or [b]\"Force Fullscreen\"[/b]."
msgstr "ໂໝດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The custom position to use when starting the project from the editor (in "
"pixels from the top-left corner). Only effective if [member run/"
"window_placement/rect] is set to [b]Custom Position[/b]."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງແບບກຳນົດເອງເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"The monitor to display the project on when starting the project from the "
"editor."
msgstr "ຈໍພາບທີ່ຈະສະແດງເກມເມື່ອລັນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], makes the caret blink according to [member text_editor/"
"appearance/caret/caret_blink_interval]. Disabling this setting can improve "
"battery life on laptops if you spend long amounts of time in the script "
"editor, since it will reduce the frequency at which the editor needs to be "
"redrawn."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີ (caret) ກະພິບ."

msgid ""
"The interval at which the caret will blink (in seconds). See also [member "
"text_editor/appearance/caret/caret_blink]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໃນການກະພິບຂອງເຄີເຊີ (ເປັນວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights all occurrences of the currently selected "
"text in the script editor. See also [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"word_highlighted_color]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເນັ້ນທຸກບ່ອນທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເລືອກປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], colors the background of the line the caret is "
"currently on with [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃສ່ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຖວທີ່ເຄີເຊີຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The shape of the caret to use in the script editor. [b]Line[/b] displays a "
"vertical line to the left of the current character, whereas [b]Block[/b] "
"displays an outline over the current character."
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງເຄີເຊີໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows an info label listing available drop options when "
"dragging an object into the script text editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກເມື່ອລາກວັດຖຸລົງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a colored button before any [Color] "
"constructor in the script editor. Clicking on them allows the color to be "
"modified through a color picker."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມສີຂ້າງໜ້າໂຄ້ດ [Color]."

msgid ""
"The column at which to display a subtle line as a line length guideline for "
"scripts. This should generally be greater than [member text_editor/appearance/"
"guidelines/line_length_guideline_soft_column]."
msgstr "ຖ້ັນ (column) ທີ່ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນບອກຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມຍາວແຖວແບບເຂັ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The column at which to display a [i]very[/i] subtle line as a line length "
"guideline for scripts. This should generally be lower than [member "
"text_editor/appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."
msgstr "ຖ້ັນ (column) ທີ່ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນບອກຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມຍາວແຖວແບບອ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays line length guidelines to help you keep line "
"lengths in check. See also [member text_editor/appearance/guidelines/"
"line_length_guideline_soft_column] and [member text_editor/appearance/"
"guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນບອກຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຖວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights type-safe lines by displaying their line "
"number color with [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"safe_line_number_color] instead of [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"line_number_color]. Type-safe lines are lines of code where the type of all "
"variables is known at compile-time. These type-safe lines may run faster "
"thanks to typed instructions."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເນັ້ນແຖວທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ (type-safe)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays line numbers with zero padding (e.g. "
"[code]007[/code] instead of [code]7[/code])."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເລກແຖວດ້ວຍການຕື່ມເລກສູນທາງໜ້າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a gutter at the left containing icons for "
"methods with signal connections and for overridden methods."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ ແລະ ການ override ຢູ່ຂ້າງເລກແຖວ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], displays line numbers in a gutter at the left."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງເລກແຖວທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"If [member text_editor/appearance/lines/word_wrap] is set to [code]1[/code], "
"sets text wrapping mode. To see how each mode behaves, see [enum "
"TextServer.AutowrapMode]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດການຕັດແຖວຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the folding arrows next to indented code "
"sections and allows code folding. If [code]false[/code], hides the folding "
"arrows next to indented code sections and disallows code folding."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງລູກສອນສຳລັບຍຸບ/ຂະຫຍາຍໂຄ້ດ (code folding)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], wraps long lines over multiple lines to avoid "
"horizontal scrolling. This is a display-only feature; it does not actually "
"insert line breaks in your scripts."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຕັດແຖວທີ່ຍາວເກີນໄປໃຫ້ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ (ສະເພາະການສະແດງຜົນ)."

msgid "The width of the minimap in the script editor (in pixels)."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຜນທີ່ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (minimap)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draws an overview of the script near the scroll bar. "
"The minimap can be left-clicked to scroll directly to a location in an "
"\"absolute\" manner."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງແຜນທີ່ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (minimap) ຂອງສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws space characters as centered points."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນຍະຫວ່າງ (space) ເປັນຈຸດ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws tab characters as chevrons."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຕົວອັກສອນແທັບ (tab) ເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍລູກສອນ."

msgid ""
"The space to add between lines (in pixels). Greater line spacing can help "
"improve readability at the cost of displaying fewer lines on screen. Negative "
"values allow for even more compact text, but may look broken with certain "
"fonts."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງແຖວ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], documentation tooltips will appear when hovering over a "
"symbol."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຄຳອະທິບາຍ (tooltips) ເມື່ອຊີ້ໄປທີ່ຊື່ຕົວແປ ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], tool scripts will be automatically soft-reloaded after "
"they are saved."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ສະຄຣິບປະເພດ tool ຈະຖືກໂຫຼດໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically reloads scripts and text-based shaders in "
"the editor when they have been modified and saved by external editors or "
"tools and the editor regains focus. External changes can be discarded by "
"using the Undo function after they've been loaded in the editor.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], a file conflict dialog will always be displayed when "
"the editor regains focus. This dialog allows you to choose whether to keep "
"local changes or discard them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even when this setting is [code]true[/code], a file conflict "
"dialog is still displayed in certain situations. For instance, it will "
"display when the script editor has unsaved changes that the external editor "
"did not account for."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບຄືນໃໝ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0[/code], automatically saves the "
"current script following the specified interval (in seconds). This can be "
"used to prevent data loss if the editor crashes."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການບັນທຶກສະຄຣິບອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາ (ວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], converts indentation to match the script editor's "
"indentation settings when saving a script. See also [member text_editor/"
"behavior/indent/type]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະປັບຮູບແບບການຍໍ້ໜ້າ (indent) ໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມື່ອບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when dropping a [Resource] file to script editor while "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] is held, the resource will be preloaded with a UID. If "
"[code]false[/code], the resource will be preloaded with a path.\n"
"When you hold [kbd]Ctrl+Shift[/kbd], the behavior is reversed."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ UID ເມື່ອລາກໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນມາລົງໃນສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], opening a scene automatically opens the script attached "
"to the root node, or the topmost node if the root has no script."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການເປີດສາກຈະເປີດສະຄຣິບຂອງໂນດຫຼັກນຳໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reopens scripts that were opened in the last session "
"when the editor is reopened on a given project."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດສະຄຣິບທີ່ເຄີຍເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອເປີດຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trims all empty newlines after the final newline when "
"saving a script. Final newlines refer to the empty newlines found at the end "
"of files. Since these serve no practical purpose, they can and should be "
"removed to make version control diffs less noisy."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະລຶບແຖວຫວ່າງເປົ່າທີ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trims trailing whitespace when saving a script. "
"Trailing whitespace refers to tab and space characters placed at the end of "
"lines. Since these serve no practical purpose, they can and should be removed "
"to make version control diffs less noisy."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະລຶບຊ່ອງຫວ່າງທີ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍແຖວອອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], copying or cutting without a selection is performed on "
"all lines with a caret. Otherwise, copy and cut require a selection."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ການກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ຕັດໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະເຮັດກັບທັງແຖວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically indents code when pressing the "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] key based on blocks above the new line."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະຍໍ້ໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອກົດ [kbd]Enter[/kbd]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], all wrapped lines are indented to the same amount as "
"the unwrapped line."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ແຖວທີ່ຖືກຕັດຈະຍໍ້ໜ້າໃຫ້ກົງກັບແຖວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"When using tab indentation, determines the length of each tab. When using "
"space indentation, determines how many spaces are inserted when pressing "
"[kbd]Tab[/kbd] and when automatic indentation is performed."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງການຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ແທັບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ)."

msgid ""
"The indentation style to use (tabs or spaces).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_styleguide.html]GDScript style guide[/url] recommends using tabs for "
"indentation. It is advised to change this setting only if you need to work on "
"a project that currently uses spaces for indentation."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຍໍ້ໜ້າ (ແທັບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ)."

msgid ""
"The characters to consider as word delimiters if [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/use_custom_word_separators] is [code]true[/code]. This is in "
"addition to default characters if [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/"
"use_default_word_separators] is [code]true[/code]. The characters should be "
"defined without separation, for example [code]_♥=[/code]."
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວແບ່ງຄຳແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows drag-and-dropping text in the script editor to "
"move text. Disable this if you find yourself accidentally drag-and-dropping "
"text in the script editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລາກວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the caret will be moved when right-clicking somewhere "
"in the script editor (like when left-clicking or middle-clicking). If "
"[code]false[/code], the caret will only be moved when left-clicking or middle-"
"clicking somewhere."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ເຄີເຊີຈະຍ້າຍໄປບ່ອນທີ່ຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], opens the script editor when connecting a signal to an "
"existing script method from the Signals dock."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສັນຍານ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], allows scrolling past the end of the file."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດເລື່ອນ (scroll) ເລີຍຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a smooth scrolling animation when using the "
"mouse wheel to scroll. See [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/"
"v_scroll_speed] for the speed of this animation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/smooth_scrolling] "
"currently behaves poorly in projects where [member ProjectSettings.physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second] has been increased significantly from its "
"default value ([code]60[/code]). In this case, it is recommended to disable "
"this setting."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເລື່ອນແບບນຸ້ມນວນ (smooth scrolling)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], prevents automatically switching between the Script and "
"2D/3D screens when selecting a node in the Scene tree dock."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະປ້ອງກັນການສະລັບໜ້າຈໍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເລືອກໂນດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses the characters in [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/custom_word_separators] as word separators for word navigation and "
"operations. This is in addition to the default characters if [member "
"text_editor/behavior/navigation/use_default_word_separators] is also enabled. "
"Word navigation and operations include double-clicking on a word or holding "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] on macOS) while pressing [kbd]left[/kbd], "
"[kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/kbd], or [kbd]delete[/kbd]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວແບ່ງຄຳແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses the characters in [code]`!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?"
"@[\\]^`{|}~[/code], the Unicode General Punctuation table, and the Unicode "
"CJK Punctuation table as word separators for word navigation and operations. "
"If [code]false[/code], a subset of these characters are used and does not "
"include the characters [code]<>$~^=+|[/code]. This is in addition to custom "
"characters if [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/"
"use_custom_word_separators] is also enabled. These characters are used to "
"determine where a word stops. Word navigation and operations include double-"
"clicking on a word or holding [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] on macOS) while "
"pressing [kbd]left[/kbd], [kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/kbd], or "
"[kbd]delete[/kbd]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດມາດຕະຖານເປັນຕົວແບ່ງຄຳ."

msgid ""
"The speed of scrolling in lines per second when [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/smooth_scrolling] is [code]true[/code]. Higher values make the "
"script scroll by faster when using the mouse wheel.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can hold down [kbd]Alt[/kbd] while using the mouse wheel to "
"temporarily scroll 5 times faster."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວໃນການເລື່ອນແຖວສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [NodePath] instead of [String] when appropriate "
"for code autocompletion or for drag and dropping object properties into the "
"script editor."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ [NodePath] ແທນ [String] ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [StringName] instead of [String] when appropriate "
"for code autocompletion."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ [StringName] ແທນ [String] ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically adds [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/"
"gdscript/static_typing.html]GDScript static typing[/url] (such as [code]-> "
"void[/code] and [code]: int[/code]) in many situations where it's possible "
"to, including when:\n"
"- Accepting a suggestion from code autocompletion;\n"
"- Creating a new script from a template;\n"
"- Connecting signals from the Signals dock;\n"
"- Creating variables prefixed with [annotation @GDScript.@onready], by "
"dropping nodes from the Scene dock into the script editor while holding "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃສ່ຊະນິດຂໍ້ມູນ (static typing) ໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically inserts the matching closing brace when "
"the opening brace is inserted by typing or autocompletion. Also automatically "
"removes the closing brace when pressing [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] on the opening "
"brace. This includes brackets ([code]()[/code], [code][][/code], [code]{}[/"
"code]), string quotation marks ([code]''[/code], [code]\"\"[/code]), and "
"comments ([code]/**/[/code]) if the language supports it."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃສ່ວົງເລັບ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າປິດຕົວເອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The delay in seconds after which autocompletion suggestions should be "
"displayed when the user stops typing."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າ (ວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນຈະສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳການຕື່ມໂຄ້ດ (autocompletion)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], code completion will be triggered automatically after "
"[member text_editor/completion/code_complete_delay]. Even if [code]false[/"
"code], code completion can be triggered manually with the "
"[code]ui_text_completion_query[/code] action (by default [kbd]Ctrl + Space[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Cmd + Space[/kbd] on macOS)."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳການຕື່ມໂຄ້ດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] enables the coloring for some items in the "
"autocompletion suggestions, like vector components."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃສ່ສີໃຫ້ບາງລາຍການໃນຄຳແນະນຳການຕື່ມໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], provides autocompletion suggestions for file paths in "
"methods such as [code]load()[/code] and [code]preload()[/code]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະແນະນຳເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file paths) ໃນໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"The delay in seconds after which the script editor should check for errors "
"when the user stops typing."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (errors) ໃນສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The delay used instead of [member text_editor/completion/idle_parse_delay], "
"when the parser has found errors. A lower value should feel more responsive "
"while fixing code, but may cause notable stuttering and increase CPU usage."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າການກວດສອບເມື່ອພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the code completion tooltip will appear below the "
"current line unless there is no space on screen below the current line. If "
"[code]false[/code], the code completion tooltip will appear above the current "
"line."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ກ່ອງຄຳແນະນຳໂຄ້ດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງແຖວ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs string autocompletion with single quotes. If "
"[code]false[/code], performs string autocompletion with double quotes (which "
"matches the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_styleguide.html]GDScript style guide[/url])."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວ (single quotes) ໃນການຕື່ມໂຄ້ດ."

msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to pass to the external text editor that is run "
"when [member text_editor/external/use_external_editor] is [code]true[/code]. "
"See also [member text_editor/external/exec_path]."
msgstr "ອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ສຳລັບຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"The path to the text editor executable used to edit text files if [member "
"text_editor/external/use_external_editor] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ executable ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses an external editor instead of the built-in Script "
"Editor. See also [member text_editor/external/exec_path] and [member "
"text_editor/external/exec_flags]."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂພາຍນອກແທນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Controls which multi-line code blocks should be displayed in the editor help. "
"This setting does not affect single-line code literals in the editor help."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມການສະແດງບລັອກໂຄ້ດຫຼາຍແຖວໃນສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (help)."

msgid "The font size to use for the editor help (built-in class reference)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນສຳລັບສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"The font size to use for code samples in the editor help (built-in class "
"reference)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດໃນສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"The font size to use for headings in the editor help (built-in class "
"reference)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ໃນສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a table of contents at the left of the editor "
"help (at the location where the members overview would appear when editing a "
"script)."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງສາລະບານໃນສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the script's method list in the Script Editor is sorted "
"alphabetically."
msgstr "ຖ້າ [code]true[/code], ລາຍການເມທອດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບຈະຖືກລຽງຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], class reference pages are grouped together at the "
"bottom of the Script Editor's script list."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໜ້າການອ້າງອີງຄລາດ (class reference) "
"ຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເຂົ້າກັນຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງລາຍການສະຄຣິບໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scripts that are used by the current scene are "
"highlighted in the Script Editor's script list."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍສາກ (scene) "
"ປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນລາຍການສະຄຣິບຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"Specifies how script paths should be displayed in Script Editor's script "
"list. If using the \"Name\" option and some scripts share the same file name, "
"more parts of their paths are revealed to avoid conflicts."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຮູບແບບການສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ຂອງສະຄຣິບໃນລາຍການສະຄຣິບຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. "
"ຖ້ານຳໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ \"Name\" ແລະ ມີບາງສະຄຣິບທີ່ໃຊ້ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ, "
"ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຊ້ຳກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the names of recently opened scripts in the Script "
"Editor are highlighted with the accent color, with its intensity based on how "
"recently they were opened."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຊື່ຂອງສະຄຣິບທີ່ຫາກໍ່ເປີດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບຈະຖືກເນັ້ນດ້ວຍສີເນັ້ນ "
"(accent color), ໂດຍຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າສະຄຣິບນັ້ນຫາກໍ່ຖືກເປີດມາບໍ່ດົນມານີ້."

msgid ""
"How many script names can be highlighted at most, if [member text_editor/"
"script_list/script_temperature_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. Scripts older "
"than this value use the default font color."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊື່ສະຄຣິບສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເນັ້ນໄດ້, ຖ້າຫາກ [member text_editor/script_list/"
"script_temperature_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະໃຊ້ສີຕົວອັກສອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays an overview of the current script's member "
"functions at the left of the script editor. See also [member text_editor/"
"script_list/sort_members_outline_alphabetically]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະສະແດງພາບລວມຂອງຟັງຊັນສະມາຊິກໃນສະຄຣິບປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ "
"[member text_editor/script_list/sort_members_outline_alphabetically]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sorts the members outline (located at the left of the "
"script editor) using alphabetical order. If [code]false[/code], sorts the "
"members outline depending on the order in which members are found in the "
"script.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member text_editor/script_list/"
"show_members_overview] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະລຽງລຳດັບໂຄງຮ່າງສະມາຊິກ (ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ) "
"ຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ. ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະລຽງຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພົບສະມາຊິກໃນສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member text_editor/script_list/"
"show_members_overview] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Specifies sorting used for Script Editor's open script list."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການລຽງລຳດັບທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລາຍການສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The syntax theme to use in the script editor.\n"
"You can save your own syntax theme from your current settings by using "
"[b]File > Theme > Save As...[/b] at the top of the script editor. The syntax "
"theme will then be available locally in the list of color themes.\n"
"You can find additional syntax themes to install in the [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-syntax-themes]godot-syntax-themes[/url] "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"ທິມໄວຍາກອນ (syntax theme) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດບັນທຶກທິມໄວຍາກອນຂອງທ່ານເອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການໃຊ້ [b]File > Theme > Save "
"As...[/b] ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນທິມໄວຍາກອນຈະມີໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການທິມສີ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາທິມໄວຍາກອນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນຄັງເກັບ [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-syntax-themes]godot-syntax-themes[/url]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background color. If set to a translucent color, the "
"editor theme's base color will be visible behind."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ, ສີພື້ນຖານຂອງທິມຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's base type color (used for types like [Vector2], "
"[Vector3], [Color], ...)."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງປະເພດພື້ນຖານ (base type) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບປະເພດຄື [Vector2], [Vector3], "
"[Color], ...)."

msgid "The script editor's bookmark icon color (displayed in the gutter)."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນບຸກມາກ (bookmark) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບຂ້າງ)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's brace mismatch color. Used when the caret is currently on "
"a mismatched brace, parenthesis or bracket character."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບວົງເລັບທີ່ບໍ່ຄູ່ກັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີ (caret) ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງວົງເລັບປິດ, ວົງເລັບມົນ ຫຼື "
"ວົງເລັບຂໍ້ ທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid "The script editor's breakpoint icon color (displayed in the gutter)."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບຂ້າງ)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's caret background color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect as it's currently unused."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເຄີເຊີ (caret) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ ເນື່ອງຈາກປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "The script editor's caret color."
msgstr "ສີຂອງເຄີເຊີ (caret) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the code folding icon (displayed in the gutter)."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນພັບໂຄດ (code folding) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບຂ້າງ)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's comment color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, unlike Python, multiline strings are not considered "
"to be comments, and will use the string highlighting color instead."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຄຳເຫັນ (comment) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ GDScript ຈະຕ່າງຈາກ Python, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍບັນທັດ (multiline strings) "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຄຳເຫັນ ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ສີເນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມແທນ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's critical comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"critical_list]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເຫັນລະດັບວິກິດ (critical) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/critical_list]."

msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/critical_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄຳສັບ (ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ) ທີ່ຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ ເພື່ອເນັ້ນໃນຄຳເຫັນ. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍສີ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/critical_color]. ຄຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ສັນຍາລັກ "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເນັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນຂອງ GDScript ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's notice comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"notice_list]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເຫັນແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (notice) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/notice_list]."

msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/notice_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄຳສັບ (ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ) ທີ່ຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ ເພື່ອເນັ້ນໃນຄຳເຫັນ. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍສີ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/notice_color]. ຄຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ສັນຍາລັກ "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເນັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນຂອງ GDScript ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's warning comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"warning_list]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເຫັນເຕືອນໄພ (warning) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"[member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/warning_list]."

msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/warning_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄຳສັບ (ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ) ທີ່ຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ ເພື່ອເນັ້ນໃນຄຳເຫັນ. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍສີ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/warning_color]. ຄຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ສັນຍາລັກ "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເນັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນຂອງ GDScript ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box background color."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ (autocompletion) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box background color to highlight existing "
"characters in the completion results. This should be a translucent color so "
"that [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/completion_selected_color] can be "
"seen behind."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອເນັ້ນຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຜົນການເຕີມຄຳ. ສີນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຫັນ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"completion_selected_color] ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງໄດ້."

msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box text color."
msgstr "ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box scroll bar color."
msgstr "ສີຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ (scroll bar) ໃນກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box scroll bar color when hovered or "
"pressed with the mouse."
msgstr "ສີຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນໃນກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ ຫຼື ກົດ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box background color for the currently "
"selected line."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຖວທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນພາຍໃນກ່ອງເຕີມຄຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's control flow keyword color (used for keywords like "
"[code]if[/code], [code]for[/code], [code]return[/code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຄຳຫຼັກທີ່ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກ (control flow keyword) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຳຄື "
"[code]if[/code], [code]for[/code], [code]return[/code], ...)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for the line the caret is currently on. "
"This should be set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of "
"other line color modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"mark_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຖວທີ່ເຄີເຊີ (caret) ຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນ. ສີນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງທັບເທິງການປ່ຽນສີແຖວອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"mark_color]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's documentation comment color. In GDScript, this is used "
"for comments starting with [code]##[/code]. In C#, this is used for comments "
"starting with [code]///[/code] or [code]/**[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຄຳເຫັນສຳລັບເອກະສານ (documentation comment) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ໃນ GDScript "
"ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຳເຫັນທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]##[/code]. ໃນ C# ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຳເຫັນທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]///[/"
"code] ຫຼື [code]/**[/code]."

msgid "The script editor's engine type color ([Object], [Mesh], [Node], ...)."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງປະເພດໃນເອັນຈິນ (engine type) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ ([Object], [Mesh], [Node], ...)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the debugger's executing line icon (displayed "
"in the gutter)."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໄອຄອນແຖວທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກໃນຕົວດີບັກ (debugger) (ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບຂ້າງ)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background line highlighting color for folded code region."
msgstr "ສີເນັ້ນພື້ນຫຼັງແຖວສຳລັບບໍລິເວນໂຄດທີ່ຖືກພັບໄວ້."

msgid ""
"The script editor's function call color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the GDScript syntax highlighter, this is only used "
"when calling some functions since function definitions and global functions "
"have their own colors [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/gdscript/"
"function_definition_color] and [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"gdscript/global_function_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ (function call) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນຂອງ GDScript, "
"ສີນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕອນເອີ້ນໃຊ້ບາງຟັງຊັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເນື່ອງຈາກການກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນກາງ (global "
"functions) ມີສີຂອງຕົນເອງຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for annotations (e.g. "
"[code]@export[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍເສີມ (annotations) (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]@export[/code])."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for function definitions (e.g. the "
"[code]_ready[/code] in [code]func _ready():[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບການກຳນົດຟັງຊັນ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]_ready[/code] ໃນ "
"[code]func _ready():[/code])."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for global functions, such as the "
"ones in [@GlobalScope] (e.g. [code]preload()[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບຟັງຊັນສ່ວນກາງ (global functions) ເຊັ່ນ ຟັງຊັນໃນ "
"[@GlobalScope] (ເຊັ່ນ [code]preload()[/code])."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for [NodePath] literals (e.g. "
"[code]^\"position:x\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [NodePath] (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]^\"position:x\"[/code])."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for node reference literals (e.g. "
"[code]$\"Sprite\"[/code] and [code]%\"Sprite\"[/code]])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ການອ້າງອີງໂນດ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]$\"Sprite\"[/"
"code] ແລະ [code]%\"Sprite\"[/code])."

msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for [StringName] literals (e.g. "
"[code]&\"example\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ສີຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ GDScript ສຳລັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ [StringName] (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]&\"example\"[/code])."

msgid ""
"The script editor's non-control flow keyword color (used for keywords like "
"[code]var[/code], [code]func[/code], [code]extends[/code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຄຳຫຼັກທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນການຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກ (non-control flow keyword) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ "
"(ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຳຄື [code]var[/code], [code]func[/code], [code]extends[/code], ...)."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the line length guideline. The \"hard\" line "
"length guideline will be drawn with this color, whereas the \"soft\" line "
"length guideline will be drawn with half of its opacity."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງເສັ້ນກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຖວໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເສັ້ນກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວແບບ \"ຕາຍຕົວ\" (hard) "
"ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍສີນີ້, ສ່ວນເສັ້ນແບບ \"ຢືດຢຸ່ນ\" (soft) ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for line numbers. See also [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/safe_line_number_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງເລກລຳດັບແຖວໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member text_editor/theme/"
"highlighting/safe_line_number_color]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for lines with errors. This should be "
"set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color "
"modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບແຖວທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error). ສີນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງທັບເທິງການປ່ຽນສີແຖວອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"current_line_color]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for member variables on objects (e.g. "
"[code]self.some_property[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This color is not used for local variable declaration and access."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກ (member variables) ໃນວັດຖຸ (ເຊັ່ນ [code]self.some_property[/"
"code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະກາດ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local variable)."

msgid "The script editor's color for numbers (integer and floating-point)."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບຕົວເລກ (ຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ ແລະ ຈຳນວນເສດ) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for type-safe line numbers. See also [member "
"text_editor/theme/highlighting/line_number_color].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only displayed if [member text_editor/appearance/gutters/"
"highlight_type_safe_lines] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບເລກລຳດັບແຖວທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພທາງປະເພດ (type-safe). ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ [member "
"text_editor/theme/highlighting/line_number_color].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member text_editor/appearance/gutters/"
"highlight_type_safe_lines] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the border of search results. This border helps "
"bring further attention to the search result. Set this color's opacity to 0 "
"to disable the border."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຂອບຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ. ຂອບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ. "
"ກຳນົດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງສີນີ້ເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອບ."

msgid "The script editor's background color for search results."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "The script editor's background color for the currently selected text."
msgstr "ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "The script editor's color for strings (single-line and multi-line)."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string) (ທັງແບບບັນທັດດຽວ ແລະ ຫຼາຍບັນທັດ) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for string placeholders, such as [code]%s[/code] "
"and [code]{_}[/code]. Refer to the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/"
"gdscript/gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings documentation[/"
"url] for more details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the default [code]{_}[/code] placeholder patterns are "
"highlighted for the [method String.format] method. Custom patterns still "
"appear as plain strings."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງຕົວແທນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string placeholders) ເຊັ່ນ [code]%s[/code] ແລະ [code]{_}[/"
"code]. ສາມາດອ່ານລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_format_string.html]ເອກະສານການກຳນົດຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ GDScript[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສະເພາະຮູບແບບຕົວແທນ [code]{_}[/code] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກເນັ້ນສຳລັບເມທອດ "
"[method String.format]. ຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for operators ([code]( ) [ ] { } + - * /[/"
"code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບຕົວດຳເນີນການ (operators) ([code]( ) [ ] { } + - * /[/code], ...) "
"ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for text not highlighted by any syntax highlighting "
"rule."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກເນັ້ນໂດຍກົດເກນການເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for text. This should be set to a "
"translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color modifiers "
"such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ສີນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງທັບເທິງການປ່ຽນສີແຖວອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for user-defined types (using [code]class_name[/"
"code])."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບປະເພດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ (ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [code]class_name[/code])."

msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for lines with warnings. This should be "
"set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color "
"modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບແຖວທີ່ມີຄຳເຕືອນ (warning). ສີນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນສີໂປ່ງໃສ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງທັບເທິງການປ່ຽນສີແຖວອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"current_line_color]."

msgid ""
"The script editor's color for words highlighted by selecting them. Only "
"visible if [member text_editor/appearance/caret/highlight_all_occurrences] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສີສຳລັບຄຳສັບທີ່ຖືກເນັ້ນໂດຍການເລືອກ. ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member text_editor/appearance/"
"caret/highlight_all_occurrences] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Path to private SSH key file for the editor's Version Control integration "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຄີ SSH ສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ "
"(Version Control) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Path to public SSH key file for the editor's Version Control integration "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຄີ SSH ສາທາລະນະ (public key) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ "
"(Version Control) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Default username for editor's Version Control integration."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (Version Control) ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Emitted after any editor setting has changed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted after any editor setting has changed. It's used by various editor "
"plugins to update their visuals on theme changes or logic on configuration "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍປລັກອິນຕ່າງໆຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອອັບເດດການສະແດງຜົນເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງທິມ ຫຼື ອັບເດດຕັກກະ "
"(logic) ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງການກຳນົດຄ່າ."

msgid "Godot editor's control for editing numeric values."
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຂອງ Godot editor ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຕົວເລກ."

msgid ""
"This [Control] node is used in the editor's Inspector dock to allow editing "
"of numeric values. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to recreate the "
"same behavior.\n"
"If the [member Range.step] value is [code]1[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] "
"will display up/down arrows, similar to [SpinBox]. If the [member Range.step] "
"value is not [code]1[/code], a slider will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ [Control] ນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Inspector dock ຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຕົວເລກ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [EditorInspectorPlugin] ເພື່ອສ້າງພຶດຕິກຳແບບດຽວກັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າຄ່າ [member Range.step] ເປັນ [code]1[/code], [EditorSpinSlider] ຈະສະແດງລູກສອນ "
"ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ຄືກັນກັບ [SpinBox]. ຖ້າຄ່າ [member Range.step] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [code]1[/code], "
"ຈະສະແດງແຖບເລື່ອນ (slider) ແທນ."

msgid "The state in which the control used to manipulate the value will be."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈັດການຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], changing via dragging is applied only at the end of the "
"input (for example, when the user releases a mouse button)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການລາກຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົ້າ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] is considered to be editing an "
"integer value. If [code]false[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] is considered to "
"be editing a floating-point value. This is used to determine whether a slider "
"should be drawn by default. The slider is only drawn for floats; integers use "
"up-down arrows similar to [SpinBox] instead, unless [member control_state] is "
"set to [constant CONTROL_STATE_PREFER_SLIDER]. It will also use [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/inspector/integer_drag_speed] instead of [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/inspector/float_drag_speed] if the slider is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [EditorSpinSlider] ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນການແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ "
"(integer). ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະຖືວ່າເປັນການແກ້ໄຂຄ່າຈຳນວນເສດ (floating-"
"point). ສ່ວນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າຄວນແຕ້ມແຖບເລື່ອນ (slider) ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະຖືກແຕ້ມສະເພາະສຳລັບຈຳນວນເສດ; ສ່ວນຈຳນວນຖ້ວນຈະໃຊ້ລູກສອນ ຂຶ້ນ-ລົງ ແບບດຽວກັບ "
"[SpinBox] ແທນ, ຍົກເວັ້ນ [member control_state] ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ [constant "
"CONTROL_STATE_PREFER_SLIDER]. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ມັນຈະໃຊ້ [member EditorSettings.interface/"
"inspector/integer_drag_speed] ແທນທີ່ [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/"
"float_drag_speed] ຖ້າຫາກມີແຖບເລື່ອນໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider will not draw background."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະບໍ່ແຕ້ມພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Use [member control_state] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member control_state] ແທນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider and up/down arrows are hidden."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນ ແລະ ລູກສອນ ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid "The text that displays to the left of the value."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງຄ່າ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider can't be interacted with."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The suffix to display after the value (in a faded color). This should "
"generally be a plural word. You may have to use an abbreviation if the suffix "
"is too long to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix) ທີ່ຈະສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກຄ່າ (ໃນສີທີ່ຈາງລົງ). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນເປັນຄຳທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງພະຫຸພົດ. "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳຫຍໍ້ຖ້າຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍຍາວເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid "Emitted when the spinner/slider is grabbed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອ spinner/slider ຖືກຈັບ (grabbed)."

msgid "Emitted when the spinner/slider is ungrabbed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອ spinner/slider ຖືກປ່ອຍ (ungrabbed)."

msgid "Emitted when the updown button is pressed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອປຸ່ມ ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ຖືກກົດ."

msgid "Emitted when the value form gains focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອຟອມປ້ອນຄ່າໄດ້ຮັບໂຟກັດ (gains focus)."

msgid "Emitted when the value form loses focus."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອຟອມປ້ອນຄ່າເສຍໂຟກັດ (loses focus)."

msgid ""
"The type of control used will depend on the value of [member "
"editing_integer]. Up-down arrows if [code]true[/code], a slider if "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄ່າຂອງ [member editing_integer]. ຈະເປັນລູກສອນ ຂຶ້ນ-ລົງ "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ແລະ ເປັນແຖບເລື່ອນ (slider) ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"A slider will always be used, even if [member editing_integer] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຈະໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນ (slider) ສະເໝີ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ [member editing_integer] ກໍຕາມ."

msgid "Neither the up-down arrows nor the slider will be shown."
msgstr "ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງທັງລູກສອນ ຂຶ້ນ-ລົງ ແລະ ແຖບເລື່ອນ."

msgid "Single texture representing both the up and down buttons."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ດຽວທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນທັງປຸ່ມ ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ."

msgid ""
"Single texture representing both the up and down buttons, when the control is "
"readonly or disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີດຽວທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນທັງປຸ່ມ ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ, ເມື່ອຕົວຄວບຄຸມຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ ຫຼື ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Base class for [SyntaxHighlighter] used by the [ScriptEditor]."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ [SyntaxHighlighter] ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ [ScriptEditor]."

msgid ""
"Base class that all [SyntaxHighlighter]s used by the [ScriptEditor] extend "
"from.\n"
"Add a syntax highlighter to an individual script by calling [method "
"ScriptEditorBase.add_syntax_highlighter]. To apply to all scripts on open, "
"call [method ScriptEditor.register_syntax_highlighter]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານທີ່ [SyntaxHighlighter] ທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [ScriptEditor] ສືບທອດມາ.\n"
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ (syntax highlighter) ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະສະຄຣິບໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"ScriptEditorBase.add_syntax_highlighter]. ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດເມື່ອເປີດ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method ScriptEditor.register_syntax_highlighter]."

msgid "Virtual method which creates a new instance of the syntax highlighter."
msgstr "ເມທອດສະເມືອນ (virtual method) ທີ່ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to return the syntax highlighter name."
msgstr "ເມທອດສະເມືອນທີ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບ (override) ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to return the supported language names."
msgstr "ເມທອດສະເມືອນທີ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບເພື່ອສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ພາສາທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Manages toast notifications within the editor."
msgstr "ຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບປັອບອັບ (toast notifications) ພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"This object manages the functionality and display of toast notifications "
"within the editor, ensuring immediate and informative alerts are presented to "
"the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_editor_toaster]."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບປັອບອັບ (toast) "
"ພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ທັນທີ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາດນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໂດຍກົງ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorInterface.get_editor_toaster]."

msgid "Pushes a toast notification to the editor for display."
msgstr "ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບປັອບອັບ (toast notification) ໄປຍັງຕົວແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid "Toast will display with an INFO severity."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງແບບຂໍ້ມູນ (INFO)."

msgid ""
"Toast will display with a WARNING severity and have a corresponding color."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງແບບເຕືອນໄພ (WARNING) ແລະ ມີສີທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Toast will display with an ERROR severity and have a corresponding color."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງແບບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (ERROR) ແລະ ມີສີທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Plugin for adding custom parsers to extract strings that are to be translated "
"from custom files (.csv, .json etc.)."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນສຳລັບເພີ່ມຕົວແຍກ (parsers) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ (strings) "
"ທີ່ຈະນຳໄປແປພາສາຈາກໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ (.csv, .json ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

msgid ""
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin] is invoked when a file is being parsed to "
"extract strings that require translation. To define the parsing and string "
"extraction logic, override the [method _parse_file] method in script.\n"
"The return value should be an [Array] of [PackedStringArray]s, one for each "
"extracted translatable string. Each entry should contain [code][msgid, "
"msgctxt, msgid_plural, comment, source_line][/code], where all except "
"[code]msgid[/code] are optional. Empty strings will be ignored.\n"
"The extracted strings will be written into a translation template file "
"selected by user under \"Template Generation\" in \"Localization\" tab in "
"\"Project Settings\" menu.\n"
"Below shows an example of a custom parser that extracts strings from a CSV "
"file to write into a template.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar ret: Array[PackedStringArray] = []\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar text = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\tvar split_strs = text.split(\",\", false)\n"
"\tfor s in split_strs:\n"
"\t\tret.append(PackedStringArray([s]))\n"
"\t\t#print(\"Extracted string: \" + s)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn ret\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"csv\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class CustomParser : EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<string[]> ret;\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tstring text = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\t\tstring[] splitStrs = text.Split(\",\", allowEmpty: false);\n"
"\t\tforeach (string s in splitStrs)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tret.Add([s]);\n"
"\t\t\t//GD.Print($\"Extracted string: {s}\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn ret;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"csv\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To add a translatable string associated with a context, plural, comment, or "
"source line:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\", and source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", "
"\"test 1 comment\", \"7\"]))\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"A test without context\" and "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"A test without context\", \"\", "
"\"plurals\"]))\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"Only with context\" and msgctxt \"a "
"friendly context\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly "
"context\"]))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\", and source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 comment\", "
"\"7\"]);\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"A test without context\" and "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"A test without context\", \"\", \"plurals\"]);\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"Only with context\" and msgctxt \"a "
"friendly context\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly context\"]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you override parsing logic for standard script types "
"(GDScript, C#, etc.), it would be better to load the [code]path[/code] "
"argument using [method ResourceLoader.load]. This is because built-in scripts "
"are loaded as [Resource] type, not [FileAccess] type. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.load(path, \"Script\")\n"
"\tvar text = res.source_code\n"
"\t# Parsing logic.\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.Load<Script>(path, \"Script\");\n"
"\tstring text = res.SourceCode;\n"
"\t// Parsing logic.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Alternatively, the plugin can directly modify the final list of strings, by "
"implementing [method _customize_strings].\n"
"To use [EditorTranslationParserPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_translation_parser_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin] ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການແຍກ (parse) "
"ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການແປພາສາອອກມາ. ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕັກກະການແຍກ ແລະ ການດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ຂຽນທັບ "
"(override) ເມທອດ [method _parse_file] ໃນສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຄວນເປັນ [Array] ຂອງ [PackedStringArray] ໂດຍແຕ່ລະອັນແທນໜຶ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະຖືກແປ. "
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຄວນປະກອບມີ [code][msgid, msgctxt, msgid_plural, comment, source_line]"
"[/code], ເຊິ່ງທຸກອັນຍົກເວັ້ນ [code]msgid[/code] ແມ່ນມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີກໍໄດ້. "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ດຶງອອກມາຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບການແປ (translation template) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກພາຍໃຕ້ "
"\"Template Generation\" ໃນແຖບ \"Localization\" ໃນເມນູ \"Project Settings\".\n"
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຕົວແຍກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເຊິ່ງດຶງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກໄຟລ໌ CSV ເພື່ອຂຽນລົງໃນແມ່ແບບ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar ret: Array[PackedStringArray] = []\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar text = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\tvar split_strs = text.split(\",\", false)\n"
"\tfor s in split_strs:\n"
"\t\tret.append(PackedStringArray([s]))\n"
"\n"
"\treturn ret\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"csv\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class CustomParser : EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<string[]> ret = new "
"Godot.Collections.Array<string[]>();\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tstring text = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\t\tstring[] splitStrs = text.Split(\",\", allowEmpty: false);\n"
"\t\tforeach (string s in splitStrs)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tret.Add(new string[] {s});\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn ret;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn new string[] {\"csv\"};\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມແປທີ່ມີການກຳນົດບໍລິບົດ (context), ພະຫຸພົດ (plural), ຄຳເຫັນ (comment), ຫຼື "
"ບັນທັດທີ່ມາ (source line):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີ msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", msgid_plural \"test "
"1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\", ແລະ source line \"7\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", "
"\"test 1 comment\", \"7\"]))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າທ່ານຂຽນທັບຕັກກະການແຍກສຳລັບປະເພດສະຄຣິບມາດຕະຖານ (GDScript, C#, ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ), ຄວນໂຫຼດ [code]path[/code] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method ResourceLoader.load] ດີກວ່າ "
"ເພາະສະຄຣິບທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາຈະຖືກໂຫຼດເປັນປະເພດ [Resource] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ [FileAccess].\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ປລັກອິນຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງລາຍການຂໍ້ຄວາມສຸດທ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ [method "
"_customize_strings].\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ [EditorTranslationParserPlugin], ໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_translation_parser_plugin] ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Called after parsing all files. You can modify the [param strings] array to "
"add or remove entries from the final list of strings, then return it after "
"modifications. Each entry is a [PackedStringArray] like explained in the "
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin]'s description.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _customize_strings(strings):\n"
"\t# Add new string.\n"
"\tstrings.append([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 "
"comment\"])\n"
"\n"
"\t# Remove all strings that begin with $.\n"
"\tstrings = strings.filter(func(s): return not s[0].begins_with(\"$\"))\n"
"\n"
"\treturn strings\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນຫຼັງຈາກແຍກໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນອາເຣ (array) [param strings] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື "
"ລົບລາຍການອອກຈາກລາຍການຂໍ້ຄວາມສຸດທ້າຍ, ແລ້ວສົ່ງຄືນມັນຫຼັງຈາກປັບປ່ຽນແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ລະລາຍການແມ່ນ "
"[PackedStringArray] ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ "
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _customize_strings(strings):\n"
"\t# ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່.\n"
"\tstrings.append([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 "
"comment\"])\n"
"\n"
"\t# ລົບຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ $.\n"
"\tstrings = strings.filter(func(s): return not s[0].begins_with(\"$\"))\n"
"\n"
"\treturn strings\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Gets the list of file extensions to associate with this parser, e.g. [code]"
"[\"csv\"][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເອົາລາຍການນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຕົວແຍກ (parser) ນີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ [code][\"csv\"][/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"Override this method to define a custom parsing logic to extract the "
"translatable strings."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ (override) ເມທອດນີ້ເພື່ອຕົກລົງຕັກກະການແຍກ (parsing logic) "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການແປອອກມາ."

msgid "Manages undo history of scenes opened in the editor."
msgstr "ຈັດການປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດ (undo) ຂອງສາກຕ່າງໆທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] is a manager for [UndoRedo] objects associated with "
"edited scenes. Each scene has its own undo history and "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] ensures that each action performed in the editor gets "
"associated with a proper scene. For actions not related to scenes "
"([ProjectSettings] edits, external resources, etc.), a separate global "
"history is used.\n"
"The usage is mostly the same as [UndoRedo]. You create and commit actions and "
"the manager automatically decides under-the-hood what scenes it belongs to. "
"The scene is deduced based on the first operation in an action, using the "
"object from the operation. The rules are as follows:\n"
"- If the object is a [Node], use the currently edited scene;\n"
"- If the object is a built-in resource, use the scene from its path;\n"
"- If the object is external resource or anything else, use global history.\n"
"This guessing can sometimes yield false results, so you can provide a custom "
"context object when creating an action.\n"
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] is intended to be used by Godot editor plugins. You "
"can obtain it using [method EditorPlugin.get_undo_redo]. For non-editor uses "
"or plugins that don't need to integrate with the editor's undo history, use "
"[UndoRedo] instead.\n"
"The manager's API is mostly the same as in [UndoRedo], so you can refer to "
"its documentation for more examples. The main difference is that "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] uses object + method name for actions, instead of "
"[Callable]."
msgstr ""
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] ແມ່ນຕົວຈັດການສຳລັບວັດຖຸ [UndoRedo] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາກທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ແຕ່ລະສາກມີປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດຂອງຕົນເອງ ແລະ [EditorUndoRedoManager] "
"ຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າແຕ່ລະການກະທຳທີ່ເຮັດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບສາກທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. "
"ສຳລັບການກະທຳທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາກ (ການແກ້ໄຂ [ProjectSettings], ຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ ແລະ "
"ອື່ນໆ), ຈະມີການໃຊ້ປະຫວັດສ່ວນກາງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ.\n"
"ການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ [UndoRedo]. ທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ຄອມມິດ (commit) ການກະທຳ "
"ແລ້ວຕົວຈັດການຈະຕັດສິນໃຈເອງວ່າການກະທໍານັ້ນເປັນຂອງສາກໃດ. "
"ສາກຈະຖືກຄາດຄະເນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດໃນການກະທຳນັ້ນ.\n"
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໂດຍປລັກອິນຂອງ Godot editor. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງມັນມາໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍ [method EditorPlugin.get_undo_redo]. "
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ປລັກອິນທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [UndoRedo] ແທນ.\n"
"API ຂອງຕົວຈັດການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບໃນ [UndoRedo], ແຕ່ຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງຫຼັກຄື "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] ຈະໃຊ້ object + method name ສຳລັບການກະທຳ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ "
"[Callable]."

msgid ""
"Register a method that will be called when the action is committed (i.e. the "
"\"do\" action).\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນເມທອດທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອການກະທຳຖືກຄອມມິດ (ຄື ການກະທຳ \"do\").\n"
"ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດ, [param object] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Register a property value change for \"do\".\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ (property) ສຳລັບ \"do\".\n"
"ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດ, [param object] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Register a reference for \"do\" that will be erased if the \"do\" history is "
"lost. This is useful mostly for new nodes created for the \"do\" call. Do not "
"use for resources."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການອ້າງອີງສຳລັບ \"do\" ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລົບຖິ້ມຖ້າປະຫວັດ \"do\" ສູນຫາຍ. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂນດໃໝ່ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນການເອີ້ນ \"do\". ຫ້າມໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ (resources)."

msgid ""
"Register a method that will be called when the action is undone (i.e. the "
"\"undo\" action).\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນເມທອດທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອການກະທຳຖືກເລີກເຮັດ (ຄື ການກະທຳ \"undo\").\n"
"ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດ, [param object] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Register a property value change for \"undo\".\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ \"undo\".\n"
"ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດ, [param object] ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Register a reference for \"undo\" that will be erased if the \"undo\" history "
"is lost. This is useful mostly for nodes removed with the \"do\" call (not "
"the \"undo\" call!)."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການອ້າງອີງສຳລັບ \"undo\" ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລົບຖິ້ມຖ້າປະຫວັດ \"undo\" ສູນຫາຍ. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂນດທີ່ຖືກລົບອອກດ້ວຍການເອີ້ນ \"do\" (ບໍ່ແມ່ນການເອີ້ນ \"undo\"!)."

msgid ""
"Clears the given undo history. You can clear history for a specific scene, "
"global history, or for all histories at once (except [constant "
"REMOTE_HISTORY]) if [param id] is [constant INVALID_HISTORY].\n"
"If [param increase_version] is [code]true[/code], the undo history version "
"will be increased, marking it as unsaved. Useful for operations that modify "
"the scene, but don't support undo.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var scene_root = EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root()\n"
"var undo_redo = EditorInterface.get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"undo_redo.clear_history(undo_redo.get_object_history_id(scene_root))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to mark an edited scene as unsaved without clearing "
"its history, use [method EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved] instead."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບປະຫວັດການເລີກເຮັດທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບປະຫວັດສຳລັບສາກສະເພາະ, ປະຫວັດສ່ວນກາງ, ຫຼື "
"ປະຫວັດທັງໝົດພ້ອມກັນ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ [constant REMOTE_HISTORY]) ຖ້າ [param id] ເປັນ [constant "
"INVALID_HISTORY].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param increase_version] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເວີຊັນຂອງປະຫວັດຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ໝາຍວ່າບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໝາຍສາກວ່າບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກໂດຍບໍ່ລຶບປະຫວັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Commits the action. If [param execute] is [code]true[/code] (default), all "
"\"do\" methods/properties are called/set when this function is called."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມມິດ (commit) ການກະທຳ. ຖ້າ [param execute] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ເມທອດ/ຄຸນສົມບັດ \"do\" ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້/ກຳນົດຄ່າເມື່ອຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Create a new action. After this is called, do all your calls to [method "
"add_do_method], [method add_undo_method], [method add_do_property], and "
"[method add_undo_property], then commit the action with [method "
"commit_action].\n"
"The way actions are merged is dictated by the [param merge_mode] argument.\n"
"If [param custom_context] object is provided, it will be used for deducing "
"target history (instead of using the first operation).\n"
"The way undo operation are ordered in actions is dictated by [param "
"backward_undo_ops]. When [param backward_undo_ops] is [code]false[/code] undo "
"option are ordered in the same order they were added. Which means the first "
"operation to be added will be the first to be undone.\n"
"If [param mark_unsaved] is [code]false[/code], the action will not mark the "
"history as unsaved. This is useful for example for actions that change a "
"selection, or a setting that will be saved automatically. Otherwise, this "
"should be left to [code]true[/code] if the action requires saving by the user "
"or if it can cause data loss when left unsaved."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການກະທຳໃໝ່. ຫຼັງຈາກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການເອີ້ນ [method add_do_method], [method "
"add_undo_method], [method add_do_property] ແລະ [method add_undo_property] "
"ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວຄອມມິດການກະທຳດ້ວຍ [method commit_action].\n"
"ຮູບແບບການຮວມການກະທຳຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບ [param merge_mode].\n"
"ຖ້າຫາກມີການລະບຸ [param custom_context], ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນປະຫວັດເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param mark_unsaved] ເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການກະທໍານີ້ຈະບໍ່ໝາຍປະຫວັດວ່າບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກ. "
"ເໝາະສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນ ເຊັ່ນ ການເລືອກ (selection)."

msgid ""
"Forces the next operation (e.g. [method add_do_method]) to use the action's "
"history rather than guessing it from the object. This is sometimes needed "
"when a history can't be correctly determined, like for a nested resource that "
"doesn't have a path yet.\n"
"This method should only be used when absolutely necessary, otherwise it might "
"cause invalid history state. For most of complex cases, the "
"[code]custom_context[/code] parameter of [method create_action] is sufficient."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປໃຊ້ປະຫວັດຂອງການກະທຳນັ້ນ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ລະບົບຄາດຄະເນເອງຈາກວັດຖຸ. "
"ບາງຄັ້ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸປະຫວັດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the [UndoRedo] object associated with the given history [param id].\n"
"[param id] above [code]0[/code] are mapped to the opened scene tabs (but it "
"doesn't match their order). [param id] of [code]0[/code] or lower have "
"special meaning (see [enum SpecialHistory]).\n"
"Best used with [method get_object_history_id]. This method is only provided "
"in case you need some more advanced methods of [UndoRedo] (but keep in mind "
"that directly operating on the [UndoRedo] object might affect editor's "
"stability)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸ [UndoRedo] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param id] ຂອງປະຫວັດທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the history ID deduced from the given [param object]. It can be used "
"with [method get_history_undo_redo]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງປະຫວັດທີ່ຄາດຄະເນຈາກ [param object] ທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບ [method "
"get_history_undo_redo] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [EditorUndoRedoManager] is currently "
"committing the action, i.e. running its \"do\" method or property change (see "
"[method commit_action])."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [EditorUndoRedoManager] ກຳລັງຄອມມິດການກະທຳຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the list of actions in any history has changed, either when an "
"action is committed or a history is cleared."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອລາຍການການກະທຳໃນປະຫວັດໃດໜຶ່ງປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the version of any history has changed as a result of undo or "
"redo call."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອເວີຊັນຂອງປະຫວັດໃດໜຶ່ງປ່ຽນແປງ ເນື່ອງຈາກການເອີ້ນ undo ຫຼື redo."

msgid ""
"Global history not associated with any scene, but with external resources etc."
msgstr "ປະຫວັດສ່ວນກາງທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສາກໃດໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນພາຍນອກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"History associated with remote inspector. Used when live editing a running "
"project."
msgstr ""
"ປະຫວັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ remote inspector. ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາແກ້ໄຂໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (live "
"editing)."

msgid ""
"Invalid \"null\" history. It's a special value, not associated with any "
"object."
msgstr "ປະຫວັດ \"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ\" (null) ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ມັນແມ່ນຄ່າພິເສດທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວັດຖຸໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Version Control System (VCS) interface, which reads and writes to the local "
"VCS in use."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (VCS), ເຊິ່ງອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄປຍັງ VCS ທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Defines the API that the editor uses to extract information from the "
"underlying VCS. The implementation of this API is included in VCS plugins, "
"which are GDExtension plugins that inherit [EditorVCSInterface] and are "
"attached (on demand) to the singleton instance of [EditorVCSInterface]. "
"Instead of performing the task themselves, all the virtual functions listed "
"below are calling the internally overridden functions in the VCS plugins to "
"provide a plug-n-play experience. A custom VCS plugin is supposed to inherit "
"from [EditorVCSInterface] and override each of these virtual functions."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ API ທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ VCS ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຢູ່. ປລັກອິນ VCS ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຄວນສືບທອດມາຈາກ "
"[EditorVCSInterface] ແລະ ຂຽນທັບຟັງຊັນສະເມືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid "Version control systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (Version control systems)"

msgid "Returns whether or not the plugin allows commit amends."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າປລັກອິນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄອມມິດ (commit amends) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Checks out a [param branch_name] in the VCS."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ check out [param branch_name] ໃນ VCS."

msgid ""
"Commits the currently staged changes and applies the commit [param msg] to "
"the resulting commit. If [param amend] is [code]true[/code] the commit will "
"modify the most recent commit instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມມິດ (commit) ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຖືກ stage ໄວ້ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ [param msg]. ຖ້າ [param "
"amend] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະເປັນການແກ້ໄຂຄອມມິດຫຼ້າສຸດແທນ."

msgid "Creates a new branch named [param branch_name] in the VCS."
msgstr "ສ້າງບຣານຊ໌ (branch) ໃໝ່ຊື່ [param branch_name] ໃນ VCS."

msgid ""
"Creates a new remote destination with name [param remote_name] and points it "
"to [param remote_url]. This can be an HTTPS remote or an SSH remote."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງປາຍທາງຣີໂມດ (remote) ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຊື່ [param remote_name] ແລະ ຊີ້ໄປຍັງ [param "
"remote_url]."

msgid "Discards the changes made in a file present at [param file_path]."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກ (discard) ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param file_path]."

msgid ""
"Fetches new changes from the [param remote], but doesn't write changes to the "
"current working directory. Equivalent to [code]git fetch[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການປ່ຽນແປງໃໝ່ຈາກ [param remote] (fetch) ແຕ່ບໍ່ຂຽນລົງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປັດຈຸບັນ. ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ "
"[code]git fetch[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets an instance of an [Array] of [String]s containing available branch names "
"in the VCS."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາລາຍການຊື່ບຣານຊ໌ (branches) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດໃນ VCS."

msgid "Gets the current branch name defined in the VCS."
msgstr "ດຶງເອົາຊື່ບຣານຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ VCS."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_diff_file], "
"[method create_diff_hunk], [method create_diff_line], [method "
"add_line_diffs_into_diff_hunk] and [method add_diff_hunks_into_diff_file]), "
"each containing information about a diff. If [param identifier] is a file "
"path, returns a file diff, and if it is a commit identifier, then returns a "
"commit diff."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [Dictionary] ທີ່ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ (diff)."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_diff_hunk]), "
"each containing a line diff between a file at [param file_path] and the "
"[param text] which is passed in."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງແຕ່ລະບັນທັດລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param file_path] ແລະ [param text] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_status_file]), "
"each containing the status data of every modified file in the project folder."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຂອງທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນໂຟນເດີໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_commit]), each "
"containing the data for a past commit."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການຄອມມິດ (commit) ໃນອະດີດ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [String]s, each containing the name of a remote "
"configured in the VCS."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຊື່ຣີໂມດ (remote) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ VCS."

msgid "Returns the name of the underlying VCS provider."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ VCS ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Initializes the VCS plugin when called from the editor. Returns whether or "
"not the plugin was successfully initialized. A VCS project is initialized at "
"[param project_path]."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບປລັກອິນ VCS ເມື່ອຖືກເອີ້ນຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Pulls changes from the remote. This can give rise to merge conflicts."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງ (pull) ການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຣີໂມດ. ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຂັດແຍ້ງໃນການຮວມ (merge conflicts) "
"ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Pushes changes to the [param remote]. If [param force] is [code]true[/code], "
"a force push will override the change history already present on the remote."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງ (push) ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງ [param remote]. ຖ້າ [param force] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຈະເປັນການບັງຄັບສົ່ງເພື່ອຂຽນທັບປະຫວັດໃນຣີໂມດ."

msgid "Remove a branch from the local VCS."
msgstr "ລົບບຣານຊ໌ (branch) ອອກຈາກ VCS ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid "Remove a remote from the local VCS."
msgstr "ລົບຣີໂມດ (remote) ອອກຈາກ VCS ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid ""
"Set user credentials in the underlying VCS. [param username] and [param "
"password] are used only during HTTPS authentication unless not already "
"mentioned in the remote URL. [param ssh_public_key_path], [param "
"ssh_private_key_path], and [param ssh_passphrase] are only used during SSH "
"authentication."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ VCS."

msgid ""
"Shuts down VCS plugin instance. Called when the user either closes the editor "
"or shuts down the VCS plugin through the editor UI."
msgstr "ປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປລັກອິນ VCS."

msgid "Stages the file present at [param file_path] to the staged area."
msgstr "ນຳໄຟລ໌ທີ່ [param file_path] ເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດຕຽມ (staged area)."

msgid ""
"Unstages the file present at [param file_path] from the staged area to the "
"unstaged area."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການຈັດຕຽມ (unstage) ໄຟລ໌ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ staged ໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ unstaged."

msgid ""
"Helper function to add an array of [param diff_hunks] into a [param "
"diff_file]."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍເພື່ອເພີ່ມອາເຣຂອງ [param diff_hunks] ລົງໃນ [param diff_file]."

msgid ""
"Helper function to add an array of [param line_diffs] into a [param "
"diff_hunk]."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍເພື່ອເພີ່ມອາເຣຂອງ [param line_diffs] ລົງໃນ [param diff_hunk]."

msgid ""
"Helper function to create a commit [Dictionary] item. [param msg] is the "
"commit message of the commit. [param author] is a single human-readable "
"string containing all the author's details, e.g. the email and name "
"configured in the VCS. [param id] is the identifier of the commit, in "
"whichever format your VCS may provide an identifier to commits. [param "
"unix_timestamp] is the UTC Unix timestamp of when the commit was created. "
"[param offset_minutes] is the timezone offset in minutes, recorded from the "
"system timezone where the commit was created."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍສຳລັບສ້າງລາຍການ [Dictionary] ຂອງການຄອມມິດ (commit)."

msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing old and new diff file "
"paths."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍສຳລັບສ້າງ [Dictionary] ເພື່ອເກັບເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ diff ທັງເກົ່າ ແລະ ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing diff hunk data. [param "
"old_start] is the starting line number in old file. [param new_start] is the "
"starting line number in new file. [param old_lines] is the number of lines in "
"the old file. [param new_lines] is the number of lines in the new file."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍສຳລັບສ້າງ [Dictionary] ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ diff hunk."

msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing a line diff. [param "
"new_line_no] is the line number in the new file (can be [code]-1[/code] if "
"the line is deleted). [param old_line_no] is the line number in the old file "
"(can be [code]-1[/code] if the line is added). [param content] is the diff "
"text. [param status] is a single character string which stores the line "
"origin."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍສຳລັບສ້າງ [Dictionary] ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງແຕ່ລະບັນທັດ."

msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] used by editor to read the status of "
"a file."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍສຳລັບສ້າງ [Dictionary] ທີ່ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ່ານສະຖານະຂອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Pops up an error message in the editor which is shown as coming from the "
"underlying VCS. Use this to show VCS specific error messages."
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂໂດຍລະບຸວ່າວ່າມາຈາກ VCS."

msgid "A new file has been added."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "An earlier added file has been modified."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "An earlier added file has been renamed."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່."

msgid "An earlier added file has been deleted."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ຖືກລົບຖິ້ມ."

msgid "An earlier added file has been typechanged."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄີຍເພີ່ມໄວ້ຖືກປ່ຽນປະເພດ (typechanged)."

msgid "A file is left unmerged."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຮວມ (unmerged)."

msgid "A commit is encountered from the commit area."
msgstr "ພົບການຄອມມິດຈາກພື້ນທີ່ຄອມມິດ."

msgid "A file is encountered from the staged area."
msgstr "ພົບໄຟລ໌ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ staged."

msgid "A file is encountered from the unstaged area."
msgstr "ພົບໄຟລ໌ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ unstaged."

msgid "Holds a reference to an [Object]'s instance ID."
msgstr "ເກັບການອ້າງອີງໄປຍັງ Instance ID ຂອງ [Object]."

msgid ""
"Utility class which holds a reference to the internal identifier of an "
"[Object] instance, as given by [method Object.get_instance_id]. This ID can "
"then be used to retrieve the object instance with [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id].\n"
"This class is used internally by the editor inspector and script debugger, "
"but can also be used in plugins to pass and display objects as their IDs."
msgstr "ຄລາດອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກທີ່ເກັບການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ ID ພາຍໃນຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"The [Object] identifier stored in this [EncodedObjectAsID] instance. The "
"object instance can be retrieved with [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id]."
msgstr "ID ຂອງ [Object] ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [EncodedObjectAsID] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"A wrapper class for an [url=http://enet.bespin.org/group__host.html]ENetHost[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວຫຸ້ມ (wrapper) ສຳລັບ [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__host.html]ENetHost[/url]."

msgid ""
"ENet's purpose is to provide a relatively thin, simple and robust network "
"communication layer on top of UDP (User Datagram Protocol)."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງ ENet ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊັ້ນການສື່ສານເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເບົາບາງ, ງ່າຍດາຍ ແລະ ແຂງແຮງ ຢູ່ເທິງ "
"UDP."

msgid "API documentation on the ENet website"
msgstr "ເອກະສານ API ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊ ENet"

msgid "Adjusts the bandwidth limits of a host."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນຂີດຈຳກັດແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ຂອງໂຮສຕ໌ (host)."

msgid ""
"Queues a [param packet] to be sent to all peers associated with the host over "
"the specified [param channel]. See [ENetPacketPeer] [code]FLAG_*[/code] "
"constants for available packet flags."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດຄິວ [param packet] ເພື່ອສົ່ງໄປຍັງພີເຢີ (peers) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຮສຕ໌ຜ່ານ [param channel] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Limits the maximum allowed channels of future incoming connections."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາເຂົ້າໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid ""
"Sets the compression method used for network packets. These have different "
"tradeoffs of compression speed versus bandwidth, you may need to test which "
"one works best for your use case if you use compression at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most games' network design involve sending many small packets "
"frequently (smaller than 4 KB each). If in doubt, it is recommended to keep "
"the default compression algorithm as it works best on these small packets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The compression mode must be set to the same value on both the "
"server and all its clients. Clients will fail to connect if the compression "
"mode set on the client differs from the one set on the server."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການບີບອັດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Initiates a connection to a foreign [param address] using the specified "
"[param port] and allocating the requested [param channels]. Optional [param "
"data] can be passed during connection in the form of a 32 bit integer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must call either [method create_host] or [method "
"create_host_bound] on both ends before calling this method."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ [param address] ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param port] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Creates an ENetHost that allows up to [param max_peers] connected peers, each "
"allocating up to [param max_channels] channels, optionally limiting bandwidth "
"to [param in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] (if greater than zero).\n"
"This method binds a random available dynamic UDP port on the host machine at "
"the [i]unspecified[/i] address. Use [method create_host_bound] to specify the "
"address and port.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is necessary to create a host in both client and server in "
"order to establish a connection."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ENetHost ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພີເຢີ (peers) ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ສູງສຸດ [param max_peers] ເຄື່ອງ."

msgid ""
"Creates an ENetHost bound to the given [param bind_address] and [param "
"bind_port] that allows up to [param max_peers] connected peers, each "
"allocating up to [param max_channels] channels, optionally limiting bandwidth "
"to [param in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] (if greater than zero).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is necessary to create a host in both client and server in "
"order to establish a connection."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ENetHost ທີ່ຜູກມັດກັບ [param bind_address] ແລະ [param bind_port] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Destroys the host and all resources associated with it."
msgstr "ທຳລາຍໂຮສຕ໌ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບມັນ."

msgid ""
"Configure this ENetHost to use the custom Godot extension allowing DTLS "
"encryption for ENet clients. Call this before [method connect_to_host] to "
"have ENet connect using DTLS validating the server certificate against [param "
"hostname]. You can pass the optional [param client_options] parameter to "
"customize the trusted certification authorities, or disable the common name "
"verification. See [method TLSOptions.client] and [method "
"TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ ENetHost ນີ້ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ DTLS encryption ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ ENet."

msgid ""
"Configure this ENetHost to use the custom Godot extension allowing DTLS "
"encryption for ENet servers. Call this right after [method create_host_bound] "
"to have ENet expect peers to connect using DTLS. See [method "
"TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ ENetHost ນີ້ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ DTLS encryption ສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ ENet."

msgid "Sends any queued packets on the host specified to its designated peers."
msgstr "ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວທັງໝົດເທິງໂຮສຕ໌ໄປຍັງພີເຢີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "Returns the local port to which this peer is bound."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພອດ (port) ທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ພີເຢີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the maximum number of channels allowed for connected peers."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of peers associated with this host.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This list might include some peers that are not fully connected "
"or are still being disconnected."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການພີເຢີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຮສຕ໌ນີ້."

msgid "Returns and resets host statistics."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ແລະ ລ້າງຄ່າສະຖິຕິຂອງໂຮສຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Configures the DTLS server to automatically drop new connections.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only relevant after calling [method "
"dtls_server_setup]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ເຊີບເວີ DTLS ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Waits for events on this connection and shuttles packets between the host and "
"its peers, with the given [param timeout] (in milliseconds). The returned "
"[Array] will have 4 elements. An [enum EventType], the [ENetPacketPeer] which "
"generated the event, the event associated data (if any), the event associated "
"channel (if any). If the generated event is [constant EVENT_RECEIVE], the "
"received packet will be queued to the associated [ENetPacketPeer].\n"
"Call this function regularly to handle connections, disconnections, and to "
"receive new packets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method must be called on both ends involved in the event "
"(sending and receiving hosts)."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າເຫດການ (events) ເທິງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້ ແລະ ຮັບ-ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດລະຫວ່າງໂຮສຕ໌ ແລະ ພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"No compression. This uses the most bandwidth, but has the upside of requiring "
"the fewest CPU resources. This option may also be used to make network "
"debugging using tools like Wireshark easier."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ແບນວິດຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ ແຕ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"ENet's built-in range encoding. Works well on small packets, but is not the "
"most efficient algorithm on packets larger than 4 KB."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບຊ່ວງ (range encoding) ທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາກັບ ENet. ເໝາະສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"[url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url] compression. This option uses less CPU "
"resources compared to [constant COMPRESS_ZLIB], at the expense of using more "
"bandwidth."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດແບບ FastLZ. ໃຊ້ CPU ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ZLIB ແຕ່ໃຊ້ແບນວິດຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"[url=https://www.zlib.net/]Zlib[/url] compression. This option uses less "
"bandwidth compared to [constant COMPRESS_FASTLZ], at the expense of using "
"more CPU resources."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດແບບ Zlib. ໃຊ້ແບນວິດໜ້ອຍກວ່າ FastLZ ແຕ່ໃຊ້ CPU ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"[url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url] compression. Note that "
"this algorithm is not very efficient on packets smaller than 4 KB. Therefore, "
"it's recommended to use other compression algorithms in most cases."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດແບບ Zstandard. ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະສິດທິພາບກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 4 KB."

msgid ""
"An error occurred during [method service]. You will likely need to [method "
"destroy] the host and recreate it."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງທຳລາຍໂຮສຕ໌ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່."

msgid "No event occurred within the specified time limit."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເຫດການໃດໆເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນກຳນົດເວລາ."

msgid ""
"A connection request initiated by enet_host_connect has completed. The array "
"will contain the peer which successfully connected."
msgstr "ຄຳຂໍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ອາເຣຈະປະກອບມີພີເຢີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"A peer has disconnected. This event is generated on a successful completion "
"of a disconnect initiated by [method ENetPacketPeer.peer_disconnect], if a "
"peer has timed out, or if a connection request initialized by [method "
"connect_to_host] has timed out. The array will contain the peer which "
"disconnected. The data field contains user supplied data describing the "
"disconnection, or 0, if none is available."
msgstr "ພີເຢີໄດ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"A packet has been received from a peer. The array will contain the peer which "
"sent the packet and the channel number upon which the packet was received. "
"The received packet will be queued to the associated [ENetPacketPeer]."
msgstr "ໄດ້ຮັບແພັກເກັດຈາກພີເຢີ."

msgid "Total data sent."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ສົ່ງໄປ."

msgid "Total UDP packets sent."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ UDP ທັງໝົດທີ່ສົ່ງໄປ."

msgid "Total data received."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

msgid "Total UDP packets received."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ UDP ທັງໝົດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

msgid ""
"A MultiplayerPeer implementation using the [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"index.html]ENet[/url] library."
msgstr "ການຈັດການ MultiplayerPeer ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ ENet."

msgid ""
"A MultiplayerPeer implementation that should be passed to [member "
"MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] after being initialized as either a client, "
"server, or mesh. Events can then be handled by connecting to [MultiplayerAPI] "
"signals. See [ENetConnection] for more information on the ENet library "
"wrapper.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] ENet only uses UDP, not TCP. When forwarding the server port to "
"make your server accessible on the public Internet, you only need to forward "
"the server port in UDP. You can use the [UPNP] class to try to forward the "
"server port automatically when starting the server."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ MultiplayerPeer ທີ່ຄວນສົ່ງໃຫ້ [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] "
"ຫຼັງຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ."

msgid "High-level multiplayer"
msgstr "ລະບົບຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນຫຼາຍຄົນລະດັບສູງ (High-level multiplayer)"

msgid ""
"Add a new remote peer with the given [param peer_id] connected to the given "
"[param host].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param host] must have exactly one peer in the [constant "
"ENetPacketPeer.STATE_CONNECTED] state."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພີເຢີ (peer) ຣີໂມດໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ [param peer_id] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Create client that connects to a server at [param address] using specified "
"[param port]. The given address needs to be either a fully qualified domain "
"name (e.g. [code]\"www.example.com\"[/code]) or an IP address in IPv4 or IPv6 "
"format (e.g. [code]\"192.168.1.1\"[/code]). The [param port] is the port the "
"server is listening on. The [param channel_count] parameter can be used to "
"specify the number of ENet channels allocated for the connection. The [param "
"in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] parameters can be used to limit the "
"incoming and outgoing bandwidth to the given number of bytes per second. The "
"default of 0 means unlimited bandwidth. Note that ENet will strategically "
"drop packets on specific sides of a connection between peers to ensure the "
"peer's bandwidth is not overwhelmed. The bandwidth parameters also determine "
"the window size of a connection which limits the amount of reliable packets "
"that may be in transit at any given time. Returns [constant OK] if a client "
"was created, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] if this ENetMultiplayerPeer "
"instance already has an open connection (in which case you need to call "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.close] first) or [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the "
"client could not be created. If [param local_port] is specified, the client "
"will also listen to the given port; this is useful for some NAT traversal "
"techniques."
msgstr "ສ້າງລູກຂ່າຍ (client) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ ແລະ ພອດ ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Initialize this [MultiplayerPeer] in mesh mode. The provided [param "
"unique_id] will be used as the local peer network unique ID once assigned as "
"the [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer]. In the mesh configuration you "
"will need to set up each new peer manually using [ENetConnection] before "
"calling [method add_mesh_peer]. While this technique is more advanced, it "
"allows for better control over the connection process (e.g. when dealing with "
"NAT punch-through) and for better distribution of the network load (which "
"would otherwise be more taxing on the server)."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [MultiplayerPeer] ນີ້ໃນໂໝດ mesh."

msgid ""
"Create server that listens to connections via [param port]. The port needs to "
"be an available, unused port between 0 and 65535. Note that ports below 1024 "
"are privileged and may require elevated permissions depending on the "
"platform. To change the interface the server listens on, use [method "
"set_bind_ip]. The default IP is the wildcard [code]\"*\"[/code], which "
"listens on all available interfaces. [param max_clients] is the maximum "
"number of clients that are allowed at once, any number up to 4095 may be "
"used, although the achievable number of simultaneous clients may be far lower "
"and depends on the application. For additional details on the bandwidth "
"parameters, see [method create_client]. Returns [constant OK] if a server was "
"created, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] if this ENetMultiplayerPeer instance "
"already has an open connection (in which case you need to call [method "
"MultiplayerPeer.close] first) or [constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the server "
"could not be created."
msgstr "ສ້າງເຊີບເວີ (server) ທີ່ຄອຍຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ [param port]."

msgid "Returns the [ENetPacketPeer] associated to the given [param id]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [ENetPacketPeer] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param id] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"The IP used when creating a server. This is set to the wildcard [code]\"*\"[/"
"code] by default, which binds to all available interfaces. The given IP needs "
"to be in IPv4 or IPv6 address format, for example: [code]\"192.168.1.1\"[/"
"code]."
msgstr "IP ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງເຊີບເວີ."

msgid ""
"The underlying [ENetConnection] created after [method create_client] and "
"[method create_server]."
msgstr "[ENetConnection] ພາຍໃນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກ create_client ຫຼື create_server."

msgid ""
"A wrapper class for an [url=http://enet.bespin.org/group__peer.html]ENetPeer[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດຕົວຫຸ້ມ (wrapper) ສຳລັບ [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__peer.html]ENetPeer[/url]."

msgid ""
"A PacketPeer implementation representing a peer of an [ENetConnection].\n"
"This class cannot be instantiated directly but can be retrieved during "
"[method ENetConnection.service] or via [method ENetConnection.get_peers].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr "ການຈັດການ PacketPeer ທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງພີເຢີໃນ [ENetConnection]."

msgid "Returns the number of channels allocated for communication with peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຈັດສັນໄວ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the ENet flags of the next packet in the received queue. See "
"[code]FLAG_*[/code] constants for available packet flags. Note that not all "
"flags are replicated from the sending peer to the receiving peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ ENet flags ຂອງແພັກເກັດຖັດໄປໃນຄິວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

msgid "Returns the IP address of this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງພີເຢີນີ."

msgid "Returns the remote port of this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນພອດ (port) ຣີໂມດຂອງພີເຢີນີ."

msgid "Returns the current peer state."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພີເຢີ."

msgid "Returns the requested [param statistic] for this peer."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສະຖິຕິ [param statistic] ທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍສຳລັບພີເຢີນີ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the peer is currently active (i.e. the "
"associated [ENetConnection] is still valid)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າພີເຢີນັ້ນຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Request a disconnection from a peer. An [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be generated during [method "
"ENetConnection.service] once the disconnection is complete."
msgstr "ຮ້ອງຂໍການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"Request a disconnection from a peer, but only after all queued outgoing "
"packets are sent. An [constant ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be "
"generated during [method ENetConnection.service] once the disconnection is "
"complete."
msgstr "ຮ້ອງຂໍການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງແພັກເກັດໃນຄິວທັງໝົດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Force an immediate disconnection from a peer. No [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be generated. The foreign peer is not "
"guaranteed to receive the disconnect notification, and is reset immediately "
"upon return from this function."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Sends a ping request to a peer. ENet automatically pings all connected peers "
"at regular intervals, however, this function may be called to ensure more "
"frequent ping requests."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄຳຂໍ ping ໄປຍັງພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [param ping_interval] in milliseconds at which pings will be sent to "
"a peer. Pings are used both to monitor the liveness of the connection and "
"also to dynamically adjust the throttle during periods of low traffic so that "
"the throttle has reasonable responsiveness during traffic spikes. The default "
"ping interval is [code]500[/code] milliseconds."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງການ ping (ເປັນມິລລິວິນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"Forcefully disconnects a peer. The foreign host represented by the peer is "
"not notified of the disconnection and will timeout on its connection to the "
"local host."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ແຈ້ງເຕືອນອີກຝ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Queues a [param packet] to be sent over the specified [param channel]. See "
"[code]FLAG_*[/code] constants for available packet flags."
msgstr "ຈັດຄິວ [param packet] ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜ່ານ [param channel] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Sets the timeout parameters for a peer. The timeout parameters control how "
"and when a peer will timeout from a failure to acknowledge reliable traffic. "
"Timeout values are expressed in milliseconds.\n"
"The [param timeout] is a factor that, multiplied by a value based on the "
"average round trip time, will determine the timeout limit for a reliable "
"packet. When that limit is reached, the timeout will be doubled, and the peer "
"will be disconnected if that limit has reached [param timeout_min]. The "
"[param timeout_max] parameter, on the other hand, defines a fixed timeout for "
"which any packet must be acknowledged or the peer will be dropped."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີການໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ສຳລັບພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"Configures throttle parameter for a peer.\n"
"Unreliable packets are dropped by ENet in response to the varying conditions "
"of the Internet connection to the peer. The throttle represents a probability "
"that an unreliable packet should not be dropped and thus sent by ENet to the "
"peer. By measuring fluctuations in round trip times of reliable packets over "
"the specified [param interval], ENet will either increase the probability by "
"the amount specified in the [param acceleration] parameter, or decrease it by "
"the amount specified in the [param deceleration] parameter (both are ratios "
"to [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE]).\n"
"When the throttle has a value of [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE], no "
"unreliable packets are dropped by ENet, and so 100% of all unreliable packets "
"will be sent.\n"
"When the throttle has a value of [code]0[/code], all unreliable packets are "
"dropped by ENet, and so 0% of all unreliable packets will be sent.\n"
"Intermediate values for the throttle represent intermediate probabilities "
"between 0% and 100% of unreliable packets being sent. The bandwidth limits of "
"the local and foreign hosts are taken into account to determine a sensible "
"limit for the throttle probability above which it should not raise even in "
"the best of conditions."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ throttle ສຳລັບພີເຢີເພື່ອຈັດການການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ (unreliable)."

msgid "The peer is disconnected."
msgstr "ພີເຢີຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "The peer is currently attempting to connect."
msgstr "ພີເຢີກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "The peer has acknowledged the connection request."
msgstr "ພີເຢີໄດ້ຕອບຮັບຄຳຂໍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "The peer is currently connecting."
msgstr "ພີເຢີກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"The peer has successfully connected, but is not ready to communicate with yet "
"([constant STATE_CONNECTED])."
msgstr "ພີເຢີເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມສື່ສານ."

msgid "The peer is currently connected and ready to communicate with."
msgstr "ພີເຢີເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະສື່ສານ."

msgid ""
"The peer is expected to disconnect after it has no more outgoing packets to "
"send."
msgstr "ພີເຢີຄາດວ່າຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງແພັກເກັດຂາອອກທັງໝົດແລ້ວ."

msgid "The peer is currently disconnecting."
msgstr "ພີເຢີກຳລັງຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "The peer has acknowledged the disconnection request."
msgstr "ພີເຢີໄດ້ຕອບຮັບຄຳຂໍຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The peer has lost connection, but is not considered truly disconnected (as "
"the peer didn't acknowledge the disconnection request)."
msgstr "ພີເຢີຂາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Mean packet loss of reliable packets as a ratio with respect to the [constant "
"PACKET_LOSS_SCALE]."
msgstr "ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ."

msgid "Packet loss variance."
msgstr "ຄວາມຜັນຜວນຂອງການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ."

msgid ""
"The time at which packet loss statistics were last updated (in milliseconds "
"since the connection started). The interval for packet loss statistics "
"updates is 10 seconds, and at least one packet must have been sent since the "
"last statistics update."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ອັບເດດສະຖິຕິການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid "Mean packet round trip time for reliable packets."
msgstr "ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເວລາເດີນທາງໄປ-ກັບ (round trip time) ຂອງແພັກເກັດ."

msgid "Variance of the mean round trip time."
msgstr "ຄວາມຜັນຜວນຂອງຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເວລາເດີນທາງໄປ-ກັບ."

msgid "Last recorded round trip time for a reliable packet."
msgstr "ເວລາເດີນທາງໄປ-ກັບ ຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້."

msgid "Variance of the last trip time recorded."
msgstr "ຄວາມຜັນຜວນຂອງເວລາເດີນທາງຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid "The peer's current throttle status."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ throttle ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພີເຢີ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of unreliable packets that should not be dropped. This "
"value is always greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]. The initial value is "
"equal to [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ສູງສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຖິ້ມ."

msgid ""
"Internal value used to increment the packet throttle counter. The value is "
"hardcoded to [code]7[/code] and cannot be changed. You probably want to look "
"at [constant PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_ACCELERATION] instead."
msgstr "ຄ່າພາຍໃນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວນັບ packet throttle."

msgid ""
"The time at which throttle statistics were last updated (in milliseconds "
"since the connection started). The interval for throttle statistics updates "
"is [constant PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_INTERVAL]."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ອັບເດດສະຖິຕິ throttle ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The throttle's acceleration factor. Higher values will make ENet adapt to "
"fluctuating network conditions faster, causing unrelaible packets to be sent "
"[i]more[/i] often. The default value is [code]2[/code]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມເລັ່ງຂອງ throttle."

msgid ""
"The throttle's deceleration factor. Higher values will make ENet adapt to "
"fluctuating network conditions faster, causing unrelaible packets to be sent "
"[i]less[/i] often. The default value is [code]2[/code]."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມໜ່ວງຂອງ throttle."

msgid ""
"The interval over which the lowest mean round trip time should be measured "
"for use by the throttle mechanism (in milliseconds). The default value is "
"[code]5000[/code]."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ວັດແທກຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເວລາເດີນທາງໄປ-ກັບ ທີ່ຕ່ຳສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The reference scale for packet loss. See [method get_statistic] and [constant "
"PEER_PACKET_LOSS]."
msgstr "ມາດຕາສ່ວນອ້າງອີງສຳລັບການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ."

msgid ""
"The reference value for throttle configuration. The default value is "
"[code]32[/code]. See [method throttle_configure]."
msgstr "ຄ່າອ້າງອີງສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ throttle."

msgid "Mark the packet to be sent as reliable."
msgstr "ໝາຍແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະສົ່ງວ່າເປັນແບບເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ (reliable)."

msgid "Mark the packet to be sent unsequenced (unreliable)."
msgstr "ໝາຍແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະສົ່ງວ່າເປັນແບບບໍ່ລຽງລຳດັບ (unreliable)."

msgid ""
"Mark the packet to be sent unreliable even if the packet is too big and needs "
"fragmentation (increasing the chance of it being dropped)."
msgstr "ໝາຍແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະສົ່ງວ່າເປັນແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າແພັກເກັດຈະໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Provides access to engine properties."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຂອງເອັນຈິນ (engine)."

msgid ""
"The [Engine] singleton allows you to query and modify the project's run-time "
"parameters, such as frames per second, time scale, and others. It also stores "
"information about the current build of Godot, such as the current version."
msgstr ""
"ຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) [Engine] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບ ແລະ "
"ປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມິເຕີໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"Captures and returns backtraces from all registered script languages.\n"
"By default, the returned [ScriptBacktrace] will only contain stack frames in "
"editor builds and debug builds. To enable them for release builds as well, "
"you need to enable [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_call_stacks].\n"
"If [param include_variables] is [code]true[/code], the backtrace will also "
"include the names and values of any global variables (e.g. autoload "
"singletons) at the point of the capture, as well as local variables and class "
"member variables at each stack frame. This will however will only be "
"respected when running the game with a debugger attached, like when running "
"the game from the editor. To enable it for export builds as well, you need to "
"enable [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_local_variables].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] When [param include_variables] is [code]true[/code], any "
"captured variables can potentially (e.g. with GDScript backtraces) be their "
"actual values, including any object references. This means that storing such "
"a [ScriptBacktrace] will prevent those objects from being deallocated, so "
"it's generally recommended not to do so."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມຄືນ (backtraces) ຈາກພາສາສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the CPU architecture the Godot binary was built for. "
"Possible return values include [code]\"x86_64\"[/code], [code]\"x86_32\"[/"
"code], [code]\"arm64\"[/code], [code]\"arm32\"[/code], [code]\"rv64\"[/code], "
"[code]\"ppc64\"[/code], [code]\"loongarch64\"[/code], [code]\"wasm64\"[/"
"code], and [code]\"wasm32\"[/code].\n"
"To detect whether the current build is 64-bit, or the type of architecture, "
"don't use the architecture name. Instead, use [method OS.has_feature] to "
"check for the [code]\"64\"[/code] feature tag, or tags such as [code]\"x86\"[/"
"code] or [code]\"arm\"[/code]. See the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]Feature Tags[/url] documentation for more details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does [i]not[/i] return the name of the system's CPU "
"architecture (like [method OS.get_processor_name]). For example, when running "
"an [code]x86_32[/code] Godot binary on an [code]x86_64[/code] system, the "
"returned value will still be [code]\"x86_32\"[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ CPU ທີ່ Godot binary ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາ (built)."

msgid ""
"Returns the engine author information as a [Dictionary], where each entry is "
"an [Array] of strings with the names of notable contributors to the Godot "
"Engine: [code]lead_developers[/code], [code]founders[/code], "
"[code]project_managers[/code], and [code]developers[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ສ້າງເອັນຈິນໃນຮູບແບບ [Dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of dictionaries with copyright information for every "
"component of Godot's source code.\n"
"Every [Dictionary] contains a [code]name[/code] identifier, and a "
"[code]parts[/code] array of dictionaries. It describes the component in "
"detail with the following entries:\n"
"- [code]files[/code] - [Array] of file paths from the source code affected by "
"this component;\n"
"- [code]copyright[/code] - [Array] of owners of this component;\n"
"- [code]license[/code] - The license applied to this component (such as "
"\"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"MIT_License#Ambiguity_and_variants]Expat[/url]\" or \"[url=https://"
"creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/]CC-BY-4.0[/url]\")."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງດິກຊັນນາຣີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນລິຂະສິດສຳລັບທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງຊອຣ໌ສໂຄດ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] of categorized donor names. Each entry is an [Array] "
"of strings:\n"
"{[code]platinum_sponsors[/code], [code]gold_sponsors[/code], "
"[code]silver_sponsors[/code], [code]bronze_sponsors[/code], "
"[code]mini_sponsors[/code], [code]gold_donors[/code], [code]silver_donors[/"
"code], [code]bronze_donors[/code]}"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ຂອງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ບໍລິຈາກທີ່ແຍກຕາມປະເພດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames drawn since the engine started.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On headless platforms, or if rendering is disabled with [code]--"
"disable-render-loop[/code] via command line, this method always returns "
"[code]0[/code]. See also [method get_process_frames]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນເຟຣມທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ເອັນຈິນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the average frames rendered every second (FPS), also known as the "
"framerate."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເຟຣມທີ່ສະແດງຜົນຕໍ່ວິນາທີ (FPS)."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] of licenses used by Godot and included third party "
"components. Each entry is a license name (such as \"[url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIT_License#Ambiguity_and_variants]Expat[/url]\") and "
"its associated text."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ຂອງໃບອະນຸຍາດ (licenses) ທີ່ Godot ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບພາຍນອກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Returns the full Godot license text."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃບອະນຸຍາດ Godot ແບບເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the instance of the [MainLoop]. This is usually the main [SceneTree] "
"and is the same as [method Node.get_tree].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The type instantiated as the main loop can changed with [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/main_loop_type]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [MainLoop]. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນ [SceneTree] ຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames passed since the engine started. This "
"number is increased every [b]physics frame[/b]. See also [method "
"get_process_frames].\n"
"This method can be used to run expensive logic less often without relying on "
"a [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _physics_process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_physics_frames() % 2 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Run expensive logic only once every 2 physics frames here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _PhysicsProcess(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._PhysicsProcess(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetPhysicsFrames() % 2 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Run expensive logic only once every 2 physics frames here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນເຟຣມທັງໝົດທີ່ຜ່ານມາຕັ້ງແຕ່ເອັນຈິນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ ໂດຍຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນທຸກໆ physics frame."

msgid ""
"Returns the fraction through the current physics tick we are at the time of "
"rendering the frame. This can be used to implement fixed timestep "
"interpolation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເສດສ່ວຍຂອງ physics tick ປັດຈຸບັນໃນເວລາທີ່ກຳລັງແຕ້ມເຟຣມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames passed since the engine started. This "
"number is increased every [b]process frame[/b], regardless of whether the "
"render loop is enabled. See also [method get_frames_drawn] and [method "
"get_physics_frames].\n"
"This method can be used to run expensive logic less often without relying on "
"a [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_process_frames() % 5 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Run expensive logic only once every 5 process (render) frames "
"here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._Process(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetProcessFrames() % 5 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Run expensive logic only once every 5 process (render) frames here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນເຟຣມທັງໝົດທີ່ຜ່ານມາຕັ້ງແຕ່ເອັນຈິນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ ໂດຍຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນທຸກໆ process frame."

msgid "Returns an instance of a [ScriptLanguage] with the given [param index]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ [ScriptLanguage] ຕາມ [param index] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of available script languages. Use with [method "
"get_script_language]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the global singleton with the given [param name], or [code]null[/"
"code] if it does not exist. Often used for plugins. See also [method "
"has_singleton] and [method get_singleton_list].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Global singletons are not the same as autoloaded nodes, which "
"are configurable in the project settings."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊິງເກິລຕັນສ່ວນກາງ (global singleton) ຕາມ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of names of all available global singletons. See also [method "
"get_singleton]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊິງເກິລຕັນສ່ວນກາງທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the current engine version information as a [Dictionary] containing "
"the following entries:\n"
"- [code]major[/code] - Major version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]minor[/code] - Minor version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]patch[/code] - Patch version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]hex[/code] - Full version encoded as a hexadecimal int with one byte "
"(2 hex digits) per number (see example below);\n"
"- [code]status[/code] - Status (such as \"beta\", \"rc1\", \"rc2\", "
"\"stable\", etc.) as a String;\n"
"- [code]build[/code] - Build name (e.g. \"custom_build\") as a String;\n"
"- [code]hash[/code] - Full Git commit hash as a String;\n"
"- [code]timestamp[/code] - Holds the Git commit date UNIX timestamp in "
"seconds as an int, or [code]0[/code] if unavailable;\n"
"- [code]string[/code] - [code]major[/code], [code]minor[/code], [code]patch[/"
"code], [code]status[/code], and [code]build[/code] in a single String.\n"
"The [code]hex[/code] value is encoded as follows, from left to right: one "
"byte for the major, one byte for the minor, one byte for the patch version. "
"For example, \"3.1.12\" would be [code]0x03010C[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [code]hex[/code] value is still an [int] internally, and "
"printing it will give you its decimal representation, which is not "
"particularly meaningful. Use hexadecimal literals for quick version "
"comparisons from code:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.get_version_info().hex >= 0x040100:\n"
"\tpass # Do things specific to version 4.1 or later.\n"
"else:\n"
"\tpass # Do things specific to versions before 4.1.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if ((int)Engine.GetVersionInfo()[\"hex\"] >= 0x040100)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Do things specific to version 4.1 or later.\n"
"}\n"
"else\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Do things specific to versions before 4.1.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ມູນເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເອັນຈິນໃນຮູບແບບ [Dictionary]."

msgid ""
"Returns the path to the [MovieWriter]'s output file, or an empty string if "
"the engine wasn't started in Movie Maker mode. The default path can be "
"changed in [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/movie_file]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຜົນລັບຂອງ [MovieWriter]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a singleton with the given [param name] exists "
"in the global scope. See also [method get_singleton].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"OS\"))          # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Engine\"))      # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"AudioServer\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Unknown\"))     # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"OS\"));          // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Engine\"));      // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"AudioServer\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Unknown\"));     // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Global singletons are not the same as autoloaded nodes, which "
"are configurable in the project settings."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຊິງເກິລຕັນຕາມ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດສ່ວນກາງ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is currently running inside the "
"editor, otherwise returns [code]false[/code]. This is useful for [code]@tool[/"
"code] scripts to conditionally draw editor helpers, or prevent accidentally "
"running \"game\" code that would affect the scene state while in the editor:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\tdraw_gizmos()\n"
"else:\n"
"\tsimulate_physics()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if (Engine.IsEditorHint())\n"
"\tDrawGizmos();\n"
"else\n"
"\tSimulatePhysics();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html]Running "
"code in the editor[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To detect whether the script is running on an editor [i]build[/"
"i] (such as when pressing [kbd]F5[/kbd]), use [method OS.has_feature] with "
"the [code]\"editor\"[/code] argument instead. [code]OS.has_feature(\"editor\")"
"[/code] evaluate to [code]true[/code] both when the script is running in the "
"editor and when running the project from the editor, but returns [code]false[/"
"code] when run from an exported project."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສະຄຣິບກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor hint)."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the engine is running embedded in the editor. "
"This is useful to prevent attempting to update window mode or window flags "
"that are not supported when running the project embedded in the editor."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເອັນຈິນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກແບບຝັງຕົວຢູ່ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the engine is inside the fixed physics process "
"step of the main loop.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# Depending on when the node is added to the tree,\n"
"\t# prints either \"true\" or \"false\".\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame())\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame()) # Prints false\n"
"\n"
"func _physics_process(delta):\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame()) # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເອັນຈິນຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ physics process ຂອງ loop ຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Registers a [ScriptLanguage] instance to be available with "
"[code]ScriptServer[/code].\n"
"Returns:\n"
"- [constant OK] on success;\n"
"- [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if [code]ScriptServer[/code] has reached the "
"limit and cannot register any new language;\n"
"- [constant ERR_ALREADY_EXISTS] if [code]ScriptServer[/code] already contains "
"a language with similar extension/name/type."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [ScriptLanguage] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບ [code]ScriptServer[/code]."

msgid ""
"Registers the given [Object] [param instance] as a singleton, available "
"globally under [param name]. Useful for plugins."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ [Object] [param instance] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຊິງເກິລຕັນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກພາຍໃຕ້ [param name]."

msgid ""
"Unregisters the [ScriptLanguage] instance from [code]ScriptServer[/code].\n"
"Returns:\n"
"- [constant OK] on success;\n"
"- [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] if the language is not registered in "
"[code]ScriptServer[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [ScriptLanguage] ຈາກ [code]ScriptServer[/code].\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ:\n"
"- [constant OK] ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ;\n"
"- [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] ຖ້າພາສາບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໃນ [code]ScriptServer[/code]."

msgid ""
"Removes the singleton registered under [param name]. The singleton object is "
"[i]not[/i] freed. Only works with user-defined singletons registered with "
"[method register_singleton]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຊິງເກິລຕັນ (singleton) ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນພາຍໃຕ້ [param name]. ອັອບເຈັກຊິງເກິລຕັນຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ຖືກປ່ອຍ (freed). ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຊິງເກິລຕັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ [method "
"register_singleton] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of frames that can be rendered every second (FPS). A value "
"of [code]0[/code] means the framerate is uncapped.\n"
"Limiting the FPS can be useful to reduce the host machine's power "
"consumption, which reduces heat, noise emissions, and improves battery life.\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [b]Enabled[/b] "
"or [b]Adaptive[/b], the setting takes precedence and the max FPS number "
"cannot exceed the monitor's refresh rate. See also [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [b]Enabled[/"
"b], on monitors with variable refresh rate enabled (G-Sync/FreeSync), using "
"an FPS limit a few frames lower than the monitor's refresh rate will "
"[url=https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]reduce input lag while "
"avoiding tearing[/url]. At higher refresh rates, the difference between the "
"FPS limit and the monitor refresh rate should be increased to ensure frames "
"to account for timing inaccuracies. The optimal formula for the FPS limit "
"value in this scenario is [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], where [code]r[/"
"code] is the monitor's refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual number of frames per second may still be below this "
"value if the CPU or GPU cannot keep up with the project's logic and "
"rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is "
"[b]Disabled[/b], limiting the FPS to a high value that can be consistently "
"reached on the system can reduce input lag compared to an uncapped framerate. "
"Since this works by ensuring the GPU load is lower than 100%, this latency "
"reduction is only effective in GPU-bottlenecked scenarios, not CPU-"
"bottlenecked scenarios."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນເຟຣມສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເຣນເດີໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະວິນາທີ (FPS). ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ຈຳກັດເຟຣມເຣດ.\n"
"ການຈຳກັດ FPS ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານຂອງເຄື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມຮ້ອນ, ສຽງລົບກວນ "
"ແລະ ຢືດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານຂອງແບັດເຕີຣີ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] ເປັນ [b]Enabled[/"
"b] ຫຼື [b]Adaptive[/b], ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກ່ອນ ແລະ ຄ່າ FPS "
"ສູງສຸດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເກີນອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh rate) ຂອງຈໍພາບໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] ເປັນ [b]Enabled[/"
"b], ໃນຈໍພາບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊແບບປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ (G-Sync/FreeSync), ການຈຳກັດ FPS "
"ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊຂອງຈໍພາບປະມານ 2-3 ເຟຣມ ຈະຊ່ວຍ [url=https://blurbusters.com/"
"howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]ຫຼຸດການດີເລ (input lag) ແລະ ຫຼີກລ່ຽງພາບຂາດ (tearing)[/url]. "
"ໃນອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊທີ່ສູງ, ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂີດຈຳກັດ FPS ແລະ "
"ອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊຄວນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຄວາມບໍ່ແມ່ນຢຳຂອງເວລາ. ສູດທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຄ່າຈຳກັດ FPS "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], ໂດຍທີ່ [code]r[/code] "
"ແມ່ນອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊຂອງຈໍພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈຳນວນເຟຣມຕໍ່ວິນາທີຕົວຈິງອາດຈະຍັງຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ ຖ້າ CPU ຫຼື GPU "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນຕາມໂລຈິກ ແລະ ການເຣນເດີຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ທັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] "
"ເປັນ [b]Disabled[/b], ການຈຳກັດ FPS ໄວ້ໃນຄ່າທີ່ສູງເຊິ່ງລະບົບສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຄົງທີ່ "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການດີເລໄດ້ດີກວ່າການບໍ່ຈຳກັດເຟຣມເຣດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ພາລະຂອງ GPU "
"ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 100%, ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ນີ້ຈະໄດ້ຜົນສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕິດຄໍຂວດ (bottleneck) "
"ຢູ່ GPU ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄໍຂວດຢູ່ CPU."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of physics steps that can be simulated each rendered "
"frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value is tuned to prevent expensive physics "
"simulations from triggering even more expensive simulations indefinitely. "
"However, the game will appear to slow down if the rendering FPS is less than "
"[code]1 / max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] of [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second]. This occurs even if [code]delta[/code] is "
"consistently used in physics calculations. To avoid this, increase [member "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] if you have increased [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its default value."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນຟີຊິກສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດຈຳລອງໄດ້ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມທີ່ເຣນເດີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] "
"ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຖືກປັບມາເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງໄປກະຕຸ້ນການຈຳລອງທີ່ໜັກກວ່າເກົ່າຢ່າງບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ. "
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເກມຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຊ້າລົງຖ້າ FPS ທີ່ເຣນເດີນັ້ນຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1 / "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] ຂອງ [member physics_ticks_per_second]. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການໃຊ້ [code]delta[/code] ໃນການຄຳນວນຟີຊິກຢ່າງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີກໍຕາມ. "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່າ [member max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຖ້າທ່ານມີການເພີ່ມຄ່າ "
"[member physics_ticks_per_second] ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"How much physics ticks are synchronized with real time. If [code]0[/code] or "
"less, the ticks are fully synchronized. Higher values cause the in-game clock "
"to deviate more from the real clock, but they smooth out framerate jitters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of [code]0.5[/code] should be good enough for "
"most cases; values above [code]2[/code] could cause the game to react to "
"dropped frames with a noticeable delay and are not recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom physics interpolation solution, or within a "
"network game, it's recommended to disable the physics jitter fix by setting "
"this property to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂອງຕິກຟີຊິກ (physics ticks) ກັບເວລາຈິງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code] ຫຼື "
"ຕ່ຳກວ່າ, ຕິກຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມງໃນເກມຄາດເຄື່ອນຈາກໂມງຈິງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການສັ່ນ (jitters) ຂອງເຟຣມເຣດນິ່ງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ [code]0.5[/code] ຖືວ່າພຽງພໍສຳລັບກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່; ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນ "
"[code]2[/code] ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກມຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ເຟຣມທີ່ຕົກ (dropped frames) ຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ "
"ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການແທນຄ່າຟີຊິກ (physics interpolation) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື "
"ໃນເກມອອນໄລນ໌, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດການແກ້ໄຂການສັ່ນຟີຊິກໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The number of fixed iterations per second. This controls how often physics "
"simulation and the [method Node._physics_process] method are run.\n"
"CPU usage scales approximately with the physics tick rate. However, at very "
"low tick rates (usually below 30), physics behavior can break down. Input can "
"also become less responsive at low tick rates as there can be a gap between "
"input being registered, and the response on the next physics tick. High tick "
"rates give more accurate physics simulation, particularly for fast moving "
"objects. For example, racing games may benefit from increasing the tick rate "
"above the default 60.\n"
"See also [member max_fps] and [member ProjectSettings.physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [member max_physics_steps_per_frame] physics ticks may be "
"simulated per rendered frame at most. If more physics ticks have to be "
"simulated per rendered frame to keep up with rendering, the project will "
"appear to slow down (even if [code]delta[/code] is used consistently in "
"physics calculations). Therefore, it is recommended to also increase [member "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] if increasing [member physics_ticks_per_second] "
"significantly above its default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider enabling [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/interpolation/"
"index.html]physics interpolation[/url] if you change [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] to a value that is not a multiple of [code]60[/"
"code]. Using physics interpolation will avoid jittering when the monitor "
"refresh rate and physics update rate don't exactly match."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄົງທີ່ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກ ແລະ "
"ເມັດທອດ [method Node._physics_process].\n"
"ການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມອັດຕາຕິກຟີຊິກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນອັດຕາທີ່ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ (ປົກກະຕິຕ່ຳກວ່າ 30), "
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຟີຊິກອາດຈະຜິດພ້ຽນ. ການຄວບຄຸມ (Input) ອາດຈະຕອບສະໜອງຊ້າລົງໃນອັດຕາຕິກທີ່ຕ່ຳ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງການຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ການຕອບສະໜອງໃນຕິກຟີຊິກຖັດໄປ. "
"ອັດຕາຕິກທີ່ສູງຈະໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກທີ່ແມ່ນຢຳກວ່າ, ໂດຍສະເພາະກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ເກມແຂ່ງລົດອາດຈະໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການເພີ່ມອັດຕາຕິກໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ 60.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [member max_fps] ແລະ [member ProjectSettings.physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະມີການຈຳລອງຕິກຟີຊິກໄດ້ສູງສຸດບໍ່ເກີນ [member "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຕິກຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເຟຣມທີ່ເຣນເດີ. "
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງມີການຈຳລອງຕິກຟີຊິກຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນຕໍ່ເຟຣມເພື່ອໃຫ້ທັນກັບການເຣນເດີ, ໂປຣເຈັກຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຊ້າລົງ "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ [code]delta[/code] ໃນການຄຳນວນຟີຊິກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ "
"[member max_physics_steps_per_frame] ຖ້າທ່ານເພີ່ມ [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວນພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/interpolation/"
"index.html]physics interpolation[/url] ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນ [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວຄູນຂອງ [code]60[/code]. ການໃຊ້ physics "
"interpolation ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການສັ່ນ ເມື່ອອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊຂອງຈໍພາບ ແລະ ອັດຕາການອັບເດດຟີຊິກບໍ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], stops printing error and warning messages to the "
"console and editor Output log. This can be used to hide error and warning "
"messages during unit test suite runs. This property is equivalent to the "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/run/disable_stderr] project setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property does not impact the editor's Errors tab when "
"running a project from the editor.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] If set to [code]false[/code] anywhere in the project, "
"important error messages may be hidden even if they are emitted from other "
"scripts. In a [code]@tool[/code] script, this will also impact the editor "
"itself. Do [i]not[/i] report bugs before ensuring error messages are enabled "
"(as they are by default)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະຢຸດການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (error) ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນ "
"(warning) ໄປຍັງຄອນໂຊລ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ Output ຂອງດີໄຊເນີ. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການທົດສອບ unit test. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/run/disable_stderr] ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ແຖບ Errors ຂອງດີໄຊເນີເມື່ອຣັນໂປຣເຈັກຈາກຕົວແກ້ໄຂ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/code] ຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດໜຶ່ງໃນໂປຣເຈັກ, "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ສຳຄັນອາດຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາຈາກສະຄຣິບອື່ນກໍຕາມ. ໃນສະຄຣິບ "
"[code]@tool[/code], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຕົວດີໄຊເນີເອງນຳ. [i]ຫ້າມ[/i] "
"ແຈ້ງບັກກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເປີດຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແລ້ວ (ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິຈະເປີດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ)."

msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], stops printing messages (for example using [method "
"@GlobalScope.print]) to the console, log files, and editor Output log. This "
"property is equivalent to the [member ProjectSettings.application/run/"
"disable_stdout] project setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not stop printing errors or warnings produced by "
"scripts to the console or log files, for more details see [member "
"print_error_messages]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ຈະຢຸດການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.print]) ໄປຍັງຄອນໂຊລ, ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ Output ຂອງດີໄຊເນີ. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ProjectSettings.application/run/"
"disable_stdout] ຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢຸດການສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ຄຳເຕືອນທີ່ເກີດຈາກສະຄຣິບ, "
"ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ [member print_error_messages]."

msgid ""
"The speed multiplier at which the in-game clock updates, compared to real "
"time. For example, if set to [code]2.0[/code] the game runs twice as fast, "
"and if set to [code]0.5[/code] the game runs half as fast.\n"
"This value affects [Timer], [SceneTreeTimer], and all other simulations that "
"make use of [code]delta[/code] time (such as [method Node._process] and "
"[method Node._physics_process]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to keep this property above [code]0.0[/code], "
"as the game may behave unexpectedly otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect audio playback speed. Use [member "
"AudioServer.playback_speed_scale] to adjust audio playback speed "
"independently of [member Engine.time_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not automatically adjust [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second]. With values above [code]1.0[/code] physics "
"simulation may become less precise, as each physics tick will stretch over a "
"larger period of engine time. If you're modifying [member Engine.time_scale] "
"to speed up simulation by a large factor, consider also increasing [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] to make the simulation more reliable."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມໄວທີ່ໂມງໃນເກມອັບເດດ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບເວລາຈິງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]2.0[/code] "
"ເກມຈະເຮັດວຽກໄວຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າ, ແລະ ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.5[/code] ເກມຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [Timer], [SceneTreeTimer] ແລະ ການຈຳລອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາ [code]delta[/"
"code] (ເຊັ່ນ [method Node._process] ແລະ [method Node._physics_process]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ເພາະວ່າເກມອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມໄວການຫຼິ້ນສຽງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member "
"AudioServer.playback_speed_scale] ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມໄວສຽງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ [member "
"Engine.time_scale].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບ [member physics_ticks_per_second] ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ການຈຳລອງຟີຊິກອາດຈະແມ່ນຢຳໜ້ອຍລົງ "
"ເພາະແຕ່ລະຕິກຟີຊິກຈະຄອບຄຸມໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຍາວຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງປັບ [member Engine.time_scale] "
"ເພື່ອເລັ່ງການຈຳລອງຫຼາຍໆ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເພີ່ມ [member physics_ticks_per_second] "
"ນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຈຳລອງມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Exposes the internal debugger."
msgstr "ເປີດເຜີຍຕົວດີບັກພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"[EngineDebugger] handles the communication between the editor and the running "
"game. It is active in the running game. Messages can be sent/received through "
"it. It also manages the profilers."
msgstr ""
"[EngineDebugger] ຈັດການການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງດີໄຊເນີ ແລະ ເກມທີ່ກຳລັງຣັນຢູ່. "
"ມັນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເກມທີ່ກຳລັງຣັນ. ສາມາດສົ່ງ/ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຜ່ານທາງນີ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ຍັງຈັດການຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບ "
"(profilers) ອີກດ້ວຍ."

msgid "Clears all breakpoints."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoints) ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Starts a debug break in script execution, optionally specifying whether the "
"program can continue based on [param can_continue] and whether the break was "
"due to a breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມການຢຸດດີບັກໃນການປະມວນຜົນສະຄຣິບ, ໂດຍສາມາດເລືອກລະບຸໄດ້ວ່າໂປຣແກຣມຈະໄປຕໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ຕາມ [param "
"can_continue] ແລະ ລະບຸວ່າການຢຸດນັ້ນເກີດຈາກຈຸດຢຸດ (breakpoint) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid "Returns the current debug depth."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຂອງການດີບັກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Returns the number of lines that remain."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a capture with the given name is present "
"otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີການດັກຈັບ (capture) ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a profiler with the given name is present "
"otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບ (profiler) ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code]."

msgid "Inserts a new breakpoint with the given [param source] and [param line]."
msgstr "ແຊກຈຸດຢຸດໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ [param source] ແລະ [param line] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debugger is active otherwise [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວດີບັກກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param source] and [param line] "
"represent an existing breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param source] ແລະ [param line] ທີ່ລະບຸຄືຈຸດຢຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a profiler with the given name is present and "
"active otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບ (profiler) ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ ແລະ "
"ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debugger is skipping breakpoints otherwise "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວດີບັກກຳລັງຂ້າມຈຸດຢຸດ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Forces a processing loop of debugger events. The purpose of this method is "
"just processing events every now and then when the script might get too busy, "
"so that bugs like infinite loops can be caught."
msgstr ""
"ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການປະມວນຜົນຮອບວຽນຂອງເຫດການຕົວດີບັກ. "
"ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງເມັດທອດນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນເຫດການຕ່າງໆໃນບາງຄັ້ງຄາວເມື່ອສະຄຣິບອາດຈະຫຍຸ້ງເກີນໄປ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດກວດຈັບບັກເຊັ່ນ ລູບບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ (infinite loops) ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Calls the [code]add[/code] callable of the profiler with given [param name] "
"and [param data]."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ callable [code]add[/code] ຂອງຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ [param name] ແລະ [param "
"data] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Calls the [code]toggle[/code] callable of the profiler with given [param "
"name] and [param arguments]. Enables/Disables the same profiler depending on "
"[param enable] argument."
msgstr ""
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ callable [code]toggle[/code] ຂອງຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ [param name] ແລະ "
"[param arguments]. ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບນັ້ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບອາກິວເມັ້ນ [param enable]."

msgid ""
"Registers a message capture with given [param name]. If [param name] is "
"\"my_message\" then messages starting with \"my_message:\" will be called "
"with the given callable.\n"
"The callable must accept a message string and a data array as argument. The "
"callable should return [code]true[/code] if the message is recognized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The callable will receive the message with the prefix stripped, "
"unlike [method EditorDebuggerPlugin._capture]. See the [EditorDebuggerPlugin] "
"description for an example."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນການດັກຈັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message capture) ດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ [param name] "
"ແມ່ນ \"my_message\" ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"my_message:\" ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ callable ທີ່ລະບຸ.\n"
"callable ຕ້ອງຮັບອາກິວເມັ້ນເປັນສະຕຣິງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ອາເຣຂໍ້ມູນ. callable ຄວນຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຖືກຮັບຮູ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] callable ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກຕັດຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix) ອອກແລ້ວ, ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ "
"[method EditorDebuggerPlugin._capture]. ເບິ່ງຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງ [EditorDebuggerPlugin] "
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Registers a profiler with the given [param name]. See [EngineProfiler] for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ [EngineProfiler] "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Removes a breakpoint with the given [param source] and [param line]."
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດຢຸດດ້ວຍ [param source] ແລະ [param line] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sends a message with given [param message] and [param data] array."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param message] ແລະ ອາເຣ [param data] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Sets the current debugging depth."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເລິກຂອງການດີບັກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "Sets the current debugging lines that remain."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນແຖວດີບັກທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່."

msgid "Unregisters the message capture with given [param name]."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນການດັກຈັບຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Unregisters a profiler with given [param name]."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ [param name] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Base class for creating custom profilers."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການສ້າງຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບ (profilers) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"This class can be used to implement custom profilers that are able to "
"interact with the engine and editor debugger.\n"
"See [EngineDebugger] and [EditorDebuggerPlugin] for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບກັບເອນຈິນ ແລະ ຕົວດີບັກຂອງດີໄຊເນີໄດ້.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [EngineDebugger] ແລະ [EditorDebuggerPlugin] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Called when data is added to profiler using [method "
"EngineDebugger.profiler_add_frame_data]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"EngineDebugger.profiler_add_frame_data]."

msgid ""
"Called once every engine iteration when the profiler is active with "
"information about the current frame. All time values are in seconds. Lower "
"values represent faster processing times and are therefore considered better."
msgstr ""
"ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນທຸກໆຮອບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເອນຈິນເມື່ອຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ "
"ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄ່າເວລາທັງໝົດເປັນວິນາທີ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າໝາຍເຖິງເວລາປະມວນຜົນທີ່ໄວກວ່າ "
"ແລະ ຖືວ່າດີກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Called when the profiler is enabled/disabled, along with a set of [param "
"options]."
msgstr "ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕົວວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດ, ພ້ອມກັບຊຸດຂອງ [param options]."

msgid ""
"Resource for environment nodes (like [WorldEnvironment]) that define multiple "
"rendering options."
msgstr ""
"ຣີຊອດສຳລັບໂນດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ເຊັ່ນ [WorldEnvironment]) ທີ່ກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກການເຣນເດີຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"Resource for environment nodes (like [WorldEnvironment]) that define multiple "
"environment operations (such as background [Sky] or [Color], ambient light, "
"fog, depth-of-field...). These parameters affect the final render of the "
"scene. The order of these operations is:\n"
"- Depth of Field Blur\n"
"- Auto Exposure\n"
"- Glow\n"
"- Tonemap\n"
"- Adjustments"
msgstr ""
"ຣີຊອດສຳລັບໂນດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ເຊັ່ນ [WorldEnvironment]) "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆ (ເຊັ່ນ ພື້ນຫຼັງ [Sky] ຫຼື [Color], ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, "
"ໝອກ, ຄວາມຊັດເລິກ...). ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຣນເດີສຸດທ້າຍຂອງຊາກ (scene). "
"ລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກຄື:\n"
"- Depth of Field Blur (ເບຼີຕາມຄວາມຊັດເລິກ)\n"
"- Auto Exposure (ການປັບການຮັບແສງອັດຕະໂນມັດ)\n"
"- Glow (ແສງຟຸ້ງ)\n"
"- Tonemap (ການປັບໂທນສີ)\n"
"- Adjustments (ການປັບແຕ່ງ)"

msgid "Environment and post-processing"
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ການປະມວນຜົນຫຼັງການເຣນເດີ (post-processing)"

msgid "High dynamic range lighting"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ແສງແບບ High dynamic range (HDR)"

msgid "3D Material Testers Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການທົດສອບວັດສະດຸ 3D (3D Material Testers Demo)"

msgid "Returns the intensity of the glow level [param idx]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງລະດັບແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow level) [param idx]."

msgid ""
"Sets the intensity of the glow level [param idx]. A value above [code]0.0[/"
"code] enables the level. Each level relies on the previous level. This means "
"that enabling higher glow levels will slow down the glow effect rendering, "
"even if previous levels aren't enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງລະດັບແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow level) [param idx]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະດັບນັ້ນ. ແຕ່ລະລະດັບຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບລະດັບກ່ອນໜ້າ. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການເປີດໃຊ້ລະດັບແສງຟຸ້ງທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຣນເດີເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງຊ້າລົງ, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລະດັບກ່ອນໜ້າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"Applies a simple brightness adjustment to the rendered image after "
"tonemaping. To adjust scene brightness use [member tonemap_exposure] instead, "
"which is applied before tonemapping and thus less prone to issues with bright "
"colors. Effective only if [member adjustment_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ການປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງແບບງ່າຍໆໃຫ້ກັບພາບທີ່ເຣນເດີຫຼັງຈາກການປັບໂທນສີ (tonemapping). "
"ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຊາກ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member tonemap_exposure] ແທນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອນການປັບໂທນສີ ແລະ ມີໂອກາດເກີດບັນຫາກັບສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍໄດ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ "
"[member adjustment_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The [Texture2D] or [Texture3D] lookup table (LUT) to use for the built-in "
"post-process color grading. Can use a [GradientTexture1D] for a 1-dimensional "
"LUT, or a [Texture3D] for a more complex LUT. Effective only if [member "
"adjustment_enabled] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Color correction does not currently support HDR output due to "
"only supporting values in the SDR (0.0 to 1.0) range."
msgstr ""
"ຕາຕະລາງຄົ້ນຫາ (Lookup Table - LUT) ແບບ [Texture2D] ຫຼື [Texture3D] "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບເກຣດສີ (color grading) ໃນຕົວ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ [GradientTexture1D] ສຳລັບ LUT "
"ແບບ 1 ມິຕິ, ຫຼື [Texture3D] ສຳລັບ LUT ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"adjustment_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການແກ້ໄຂສີໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ HDR ເນື່ອງຈາກຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າໃນຊ່ວງ SDR (0.0 "
"ຫາ 1.0) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Increasing [member adjustment_contrast] will make dark values darker and "
"bright values brighter. This simple adjustment is applied to the rendered "
"image after tonemaping. When set to a value greater than [code]1.0[/code], "
"[member adjustment_contrast] is prone to clipping colors that become too "
"bright or too dark. Effective only if [member adjustment_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມ [member adjustment_contrast] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ມືດມືດລົງ ແລະ ສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ການປັບແຕ່ງແບບງ່າຍໆນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບພາບທີ່ເຣນເດີຫຼັງຈາກການປັບໂທນສີ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງກວ່າ [code]1.0[/"
"code], [member adjustment_contrast] ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ມືດເກີນໄປຖືກຕັດ "
"(clipping). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member adjustment_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the [code]adjustment_*[/code] properties "
"provided by this resource. If [code]false[/code], modifications to the "
"[code]adjustment_*[/code] properties will have no effect on the rendered "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]adjustment_*[/code] "
"ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຣີຊອດນີ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ການປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]adjustment_*[/"
"code] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆຕໍ່ຊາກທີ່ເຣນເດີ."

msgid ""
"Applies a simple saturation adjustment to the rendered image after "
"tonemaping. When [member adjustment_saturation] is set to [code]0.0[/code], "
"the rendered image will be fully converted to a grayscale image. Effective "
"only if [member adjustment_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ການປັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (saturation) ແບບງ່າຍໆໃຫ້ກັບພາບທີ່ເຣນເດີຫຼັງຈາກການປັບໂທນສີ. ເມື່ອ "
"[member adjustment_saturation] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ພາບທີ່ເຣນເດີຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນພາບຂາວດຳ (grayscale) ທັງໝົດ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"adjustment_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The ambient light's [Color]. Only effective if [member "
"ambient_light_sky_contribution] is lower than [code]1.0[/code] (exclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ສີ [Color] ຂອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light). ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"ambient_light_sky_contribution] ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The ambient light's energy. The higher the value, the stronger the light. "
"Only effective if [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] is lower than "
"[code]1.0[/code] (exclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ພະລັງງານຂອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງແຮງຂຶ້ນ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"ambient_light_sky_contribution] ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Defines the amount of light that the sky brings on the scene. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] means that the sky's light emission has no effect on the "
"scene illumination, thus all ambient illumination is provided by the ambient "
"light. On the contrary, a value of [code]1.0[/code] means that [i]all[/i] the "
"light that affects the scene is provided by the sky, thus the ambient light "
"parameter has no effect on the scene.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] is internally clamped "
"between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດປະລິມານແສງທີ່ທ້ອງຟ້າມອບໃຫ້ກັບຊາກ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການສົ່ງແສງຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງຂອງຊາກ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທັງໝົດຈະມາຈາກແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ambient light). "
"ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງ [i]ທັງໝົດ[/i] "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຊາກແມ່ນມາຈາກທ້ອງຟ້າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພາຣາມິເຕີແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຊາກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຄ່າຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"The ambient light source to use for rendering materials and global "
"illumination."
msgstr ""
"ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີວັດສະດຸ ແລະ ການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວໂລກ (global "
"illumination)."

msgid "The ID of the camera feed to show in the background."
msgstr "ID ຂອງຟີດກ້ອງ (camera feed) ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum layer ID to display. Only effective when using the [constant "
"BG_CANVAS] background mode."
msgstr "Layer ID ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງ [constant BG_CANVAS] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The [Color] displayed for clear areas of the scene. Only effective when using "
"the [constant BG_COLOR] background mode."
msgstr ""
"ສີ [Color] ທີ່ສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງຂອງຊາກ. ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງ [constant BG_COLOR] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Multiplier for background energy. Increase to make background brighter, "
"decrease to make background dimmer."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບພະລັງງານພື້ນຫຼັງ. ເພີ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນຫຼັງສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນຫຼັງມືດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Luminance of background measured in nits (candela per square meter). Only "
"used when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] is enabled. The default value is roughly equivalent "
"to the sky at midday."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ວັດແທກເປັນ nits (ແຄນເດລາຕໍ່ຕາແມັດ). ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອເປີດ [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນໃກ້ຄຽງກັບທ້ອງຟ້າໃນຕອນທ່ຽງ."

msgid "The background mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"If set above [code]0.0[/code] (exclusive), blends between the fog's color and "
"the color of the background [Sky], as read from the radiance cubemap. This "
"has a small performance cost when set above [code]0.0[/code]. Must have "
"[member background_mode] set to [constant BG_SKY].\n"
"This is useful to simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Aerial_perspective]aerial perspective[/url] in large scenes with low density "
"fog. However, it is not very useful for high-density fog, as the sky will "
"shine through. When set to [code]1.0[/code], the fog color comes completely "
"from the [Sky]. If set to [code]0.0[/code], aerial perspective is disabled.\n"
"Notice that this does not sample the [Sky] directly, but rather the radiance "
"cubemap. The cubemap is sampled at a mipmap level depending on the depth of "
"the rendered pixel; the farther away, the higher the resolution of the "
"sampled mipmap. This results in the actual color being a blurred version of "
"the sky, with more blur closer to the camera. The highest mipmap resolution "
"is used at a depth of [member Camera3D.far]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະມີການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງສີຂອງໝອກ ແລະ ສີຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າ [Sky], "
"ໂດຍອ່ານຈາກ radiance cubemap. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code]. ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member background_mode] ເປັນ [constant BG_SKY].\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈຳລອງ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Aerial_perspective]aerial perspective[/url] ໃນຊາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີໝອກເບົາບາງ. "
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີປະໂຫຍດກັບໝອກທີ່ໜາຫຼາຍ ເພາະທ້ອງຟ້າຈະຊອດອອກມາ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1.0[/"
"code], ສີຂອງໝອກຈະມາຈາກ [Sky] ທັງໝົດ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ "
"aerial perspective.\n"
"ສັງເກດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈາກ [Sky] ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ຈະສຸ່ມຈາກ radiance cubemap. Cubemap "
"ຈະຖືກສຸ່ມໃນລະດັບ mipmap ຕາມຄວາມເລິກຂອງພິກເຊລ; ຍິ່ງໄກເທົ່າໃດ, ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ mipmap "
"ກໍຈະຍິ່ງສູງຂຶ້ນ. ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ສີຕົວຈິງເປັນທ້ອງຟ້າແບບເບຼີ, ໂດຍຈະເບຼີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໃກ້ກ້ອງ. ຄວາມລະອຽດ mipmap "
"ສູງສຸດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ທີ່ຄວາມເລິກ [member Camera3D.far]."

msgid ""
"The fog density to be used. This is demonstrated in different ways depending "
"on the [member fog_mode] mode chosen:\n"
"[b]Exponential Fog Mode:[/b] Higher values result in denser fog. The fog "
"rendering is exponential like in real life.\n"
"[b]Depth Fog mode:[/b] The maximum intensity of the deep fog, effect will "
"appear in the distance (relative to the camera). At [code]1.0[/code] the fog "
"will fully obscure the scene, at [code]0.0[/code] the fog will not be visible."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງໝອກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງອອກໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຕາມໂໝດ [member fog_mode] "
"ທີ່ເລືອກ:\n"
"[b]Exponential Fog Mode:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝອກໜາຂຶ້ນ. "
"ການເຣນເດີໝອກຈະເປັນແບບເອັກໂປເນນຊຽລຄືກັບໃນຊີວິດຈິງ.\n"
"[b]Depth Fog mode:[/b] ຄວາມເຂັ້ມສູງສຸດຂອງໝອກໃນສ່ວນເລິກ, ເອັບເຟັກຈະປາກົດໃນໄລຍະໄກ "
"(ທຽບກັບກ້ອງ). ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ໝອກຈະບັງຊາກທັງໝົດ, ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນໝອກ."

msgid ""
"The fog's depth starting distance from the camera. Only available when "
"[member fog_mode] is set to [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄວາມເລິກຂອງໝອກຈາກກ້ອງ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member fog_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"FOG_MODE_DEPTH] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The fog depth's intensity curve. A number of presets are available in the "
"Inspector by right-clicking the curve. Only available when [member fog_mode] "
"is set to [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງຄວາມເລິກໝອກ. ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets) ຫຼາຍແບບໃນ Inspector "
"ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member fog_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"FOG_MODE_DEPTH] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The fog's depth end distance from the camera. If this value is set to "
"[code]0[/code], it will be equal to the current camera's [member "
"Camera3D.far] value. Only available when [member fog_mode] is set to "
"[constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະສິ້ນສຸດຄວາມເລິກຂອງໝອກຈາກກ້ອງ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]0[/code], ມັນຈະເທົ່າກັບຄ່າ [member "
"Camera3D.far] ຂອງກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອ [member fog_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"FOG_MODE_DEPTH] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], fog effects are enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກໝອກ."

msgid "The height at which the height fog effect begins."
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມສູງທີ່ເອັບເຟັກໝອກຕາມຄວາມສູງ (height fog) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The density used to increase fog as height decreases. To make fog increase as "
"height increases, use a negative value."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໝອກເມື່ອຄວາມສູງຫຼຸດລົງ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝອກເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມຄວາມສູງທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບ."

msgid "The fog's color."
msgstr "ສີຂອງໝອກ."

msgid "The fog's brightness. Higher values result in brighter fog."
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງໝອກ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝອກສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The fog mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດໝອກ."

msgid ""
"The factor to use when affecting the sky with non-volumetric fog. [code]1.0[/"
"code] means that fog can fully obscure the sky. Lower values reduce the "
"impact of fog on sky rendering, with [code]0.0[/code] not affecting sky "
"rendering at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member fog_sky_affect] has no visual effect if [member "
"fog_aerial_perspective] is [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອໝອກແບບບໍ່ມີປະລິມານ (non-volumetric) ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທ້ອງຟ້າ. [code]1.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໝອກສາມາດບັງທ້ອງຟ້າໄດ້ທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຂອງໝອກຕໍ່ການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ, ໂດຍຄ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າເລີຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member fog_sky_affect] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນທາງສາຍຕາຖ້າ [member "
"fog_aerial_perspective] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"If set above [code]0.0[/code], renders the scene's directional light(s) in "
"the fog color depending on the view angle. This can be used to give the "
"impression that the sun is \"piercing\" through the fog."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະເຣນເດີແສງແບບສ່ອງທາງ (directional light) "
"ຂອງຊາກໃນສີຂອງໝອກຕາມມຸມເບິ່ງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງພາບທີ່ຄືກັບວ່າແສງອາທິດກຳລັງ \"ສ່ອງທະລຸ\" ຜ່ານໝອກ."

msgid ""
"The glow blending mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Compatibility renderer always uses [constant "
"GLOW_BLEND_MODE_SCREEN] and [member glow_blend_mode] will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປະສົມແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow blending mode).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເຣນເດີ Compatibility ຈະໃຊ້ [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_SCREEN] "
"ສະເໝີ ແລະ [member glow_blend_mode] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ."

msgid ""
"The bloom's intensity. If set to a value higher than [code]0[/code], this "
"will make glow visible in areas darker than the [member glow_hdr_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງບລູມ (bloom). ຖ້າຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ [code]0[/code], ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແສງຟຸ້ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມືດກວ່າ "
"[member glow_hdr_threshold]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the glow effect is enabled. This simulates real world "
"atmosphere and eye/camera behavior by causing bright pixels to bleed onto "
"surrounding pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, glow looks different due "
"to the lower dynamic range available in the Mobile rendering method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Compatibility rendering method, glow uses a "
"different implementation with some properties being unavailable and hidden "
"from the inspector: [code]glow_levels/*[/code], [member glow_normalized], "
"[member glow_strength], [member glow_blend_mode], [member glow_mix], [member "
"glow_map], and [member glow_map_strength]. This implementation is optimized "
"to run on low-end devices and is less flexible as a result."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ (glow). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳລອງບັນຍາກາດໃນໂລກຈິງ "
"ແລະ ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຕາ/ກ້ອງ ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊລທີ່ສະຫວ່າງແຜ່ກະຈາຍໄປຫາພິກເຊລອ້ອມຂ້າງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Mobile, "
"ແສງຟຸ້ງຈະເບິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງໄປເນື່ອງຈາກຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility, "
"ແສງຟຸ້ງຈະໃຊ້ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງອອກໄປ ໂດຍບາງຄຸນສົມບັດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ຖືກເຊື່ອງຈາກ "
"inspector: [code]glow_levels/*[/code], [member glow_normalized], [member "
"glow_strength], [member glow_blend_mode], [member glow_mix], [member "
"glow_map], ແລະ [member glow_map_strength]. "
"ການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາເພື່ອອຸປະກອນສະເປັກຕ່ຳ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໜ້ອຍລົງ."

msgid ""
"The higher threshold of the HDR glow. Areas brighter than this threshold will "
"be clamped for the purposes of the glow effect."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຂອງ HDR glow. ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (clamped) "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Smooths the transition between values that are below and above [member "
"glow_hdr_threshold] by reducing the amount of glow generated by values that "
"are close to [member glow_hdr_threshold]. Values above "
"[code]glow_hdr_threshold + glow_hdr_scale[/code] will not have glow reduced "
"in this way."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ແລະ ສູງກວ່າ [member glow_hdr_threshold] ນິ່ງຂຶ້ນ "
"ໂດຍການຫຼຸດປະລິມານແສງຟຸ້ງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກຄ່າທີ່ໃກ້ກັບ [member glow_hdr_threshold]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ "
"[code]glow_hdr_threshold + glow_hdr_scale[/code] ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຫຼຸດແສງຟຸ້ງໃນລັກສະນະນີ້."

msgid ""
"The lower threshold of the HDR glow. When using the Mobile rendering method "
"(which only supports a lower dynamic range up to [code]2.0[/code]), this may "
"need to be below [code]1.0[/code] for glow to be visible. A value of "
"[code]0.9[/code] works well in this case. This value also needs to be "
"decreased below [code]1.0[/code] when using glow in 2D, as 2D rendering is "
"performed in SDR."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ HDR glow. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Mobile (ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳສຸດພຽງ "
"[code]2.0[/code]), ອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນແສງຟຸ້ງ. ຄ່າ "
"[code]0.9[/code] ຖືວ່າໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີໃນກໍລະນີນີ້. ຄ່ານີ້ຍັງຕ້ອງຫຼຸດໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ແສງຟຸ້ງໃນ 2D, ເພາະການເຣນເດີ 2D ແມ່ນເຮັດໃນ SDR."

msgid ""
"The overall brightness multiplier that is applied to the glow effect just "
"before it is blended with the scene. When using the Mobile rendering method "
"(which only supports a lower dynamic range up to [code]2.0[/code]), this "
"should be increased to [code]1.5[/code] to compensate."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກປະສົມເຂົ້າກັບຊາກ. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Mobile (ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳພຽງ [code]2.0[/code]), "
"ຄວນເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]1.5[/code] ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍ."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 1st level of glow. This is the most \"local\" level "
"(least blurry).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/1] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 1. ນີ້ແມ່ນລະດັບທີ່ເປັນ \"ພື້ນທີ່\" ທີ່ສຸດ (ເບຼີນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/1] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 2nd level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/2] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 2.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/2] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 3rd level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/3] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 3.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/3] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 4th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/4] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 4.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/4] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 5th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/5] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 5.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/5] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 6th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/6] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 6.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/6] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the 7th level of glow. This is the most \"global\" level "
"(blurriest).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/7] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງລະດັບທີ 7. ນີ້ແມ່ນລະດັບທີ່ເປັນ \"ໂດຍລວມ\" ທີ່ສຸດ (ເບຼີຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_levels/7] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The texture that should be used as a glow map to [i]multiply[/i] the "
"resulting glow color according to [member glow_map_strength]. This can be "
"used to create a \"lens dirt\" effect. The texture's RGB color channels are "
"used for modulation, but the alpha channel is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The texture will be stretched to fit the screen. Therefore, it's "
"recommended to use a texture with an aspect ratio that matches your project's "
"base aspect ratio (typically 16:9).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_map] has no effect when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler glow "
"implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຜິວ (texture) ທີ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເປັນ glow map ເພື່ອ [i]ຄູນ[/i] ກັບສີຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງທີ່ໄດ້ຕາມ [member "
"glow_map_strength]. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ \"ເລນເປື້ອນ\" (lens dirt). ຊ່ອງສີ RGB "
"ຂອງພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ, ແຕ່ຊ່ອງອັລຟາ (alpha) ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພື້ນຜິວຈະຖືກຢືດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຈໍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ (aspect "
"ratio) ຕົງກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນພື້ນຖານຂອງໂປຣເຈັກ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 16:9).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_map] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"How strong of an influence the [member glow_map] should have on the overall "
"glow effect. A strength of [code]0.0[/code] means the glow map has no "
"influence, while a strength of [code]1.0[/code] means the glow map has full "
"influence.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the glow map has black areas, a value of [code]1.0[/code] can "
"also turn off the glow effect entirely in specific areas of the screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_map_strength] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບອິດທິພົນທີ່ [member glow_map] ມີຕໍ່ເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງໂດຍລວມ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ glow map ບໍ່ມີອິດທິພົນໃດໆ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ glow map "
"ມີອິດທິພົນຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ glow map ມີພື້ນທີ່ສີດຳ, ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຍັງສາມາດປິດເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງໃນບາງພື້ນທີ່ຂອງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_map_strength] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ "
"Compatibility."

msgid ""
"When using the [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_MIX] [member glow_blend_mode], this "
"controls how much the source image is blended with the glow layer. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] makes the glow rendering invisible, while a value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] is equivalent to [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_REPLACE].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_mix] has no effect when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler glow "
"implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_MIX] ໃນ [member glow_blend_mode], "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະຖືກປະສົມກັບເລເຍີແສງຟຸ້ງຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນແສງຟຸ້ງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] ຈະເທົ່າກັບ [constant "
"GLOW_BLEND_MODE_REPLACE].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_mix] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], glow levels will be normalized so that summed together "
"their intensities equal [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_normalized] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລະດັບແສງຟຸ້ງຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (normalized) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜົນລວມຂອງຄວາມເຂັ້ມເທົ່າກັບ [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_normalized] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ "
"Compatibility."

msgid ""
"The strength that is used when blurring across the screen to generate the "
"glow effect. This affects the distance and intensity of the blur. When using "
"the Mobile rendering method, this should be increased to compensate for the "
"lower dynamic range.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_strength] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເບຼີທົ່ວໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໄລຍະ ແລະ ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການເບຼີ. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Mobile, ຄວນເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member glow_strength] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Compatibility."

msgid "The reflected (specular) light source."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສະທ້ອນ (specular)."

msgid ""
"The energy multiplier applied to light every time it bounces from a surface "
"when using SDFGI. Values greater than [code]0.0[/code] will simulate multiple "
"bounces, resulting in a more realistic appearance. Increasing [member "
"sdfgi_bounce_feedback] generally has no performance impact. See also [member "
"sdfgi_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values greater than [code]0.5[/code] can cause infinite feedback "
"loops and should be avoided in scenes with bright materials.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member sdfgi_bounce_feedback] is [code]0.0[/code], indirect "
"lighting will not be represented in reflections as light will only bounce one "
"time."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແສງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມັນສະທ້ອນຈາກພື້ນຜິວເມື່ອໃຊ້ SDFGI. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ຈະຈຳລອງການສະທ້ອນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືຈິງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການເພີ່ມ [member "
"sdfgi_bounce_feedback] ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ເບິ່ງ [member sdfgi_energy] "
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]0.5[/code] ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດລູບສະທ້ອນບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ "
"ຄວນຫຼີກລ່ຽງໃນຊາກທີ່ມີວັດສະດຸທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member sdfgi_bounce_feedback] ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ແສງທາງອ້ອມຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນການສະທ້ອນ ເພາະແສງຈະສະທ້ອນພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ."

msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] and "
"[member sdfgi_max_distance]. Changing its value will automatically change "
"those properties as well."
msgstr ""
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] ແລະ [member "
"sdfgi_max_distance]. ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The number of cascades to use for SDFGI (between 1 and 8). A higher number of "
"cascades allows displaying SDFGI further away while preserving detail up "
"close, at the cost of performance. When using SDFGI on small-scale levels, "
"[member sdfgi_cascades] can often be decreased between [code]1[/code] and "
"[code]4[/code] to improve performance."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ cascades ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SDFGI (ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 8). ຈຳນວນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະແດງ SDFGI "
"ໄດ້ໄກຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ໄວ້ໄດ້, ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາດ້ວຍການກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"SDFGI ໃນດ່ານຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ສາມາດຫຼຸດ [member sdfgi_cascades] ມາຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]1[/code] "
"ຫາ [code]4[/code] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables signed distance field global illumination for "
"meshes that have their [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] set to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC]. SDFGI is a real-time global illumination "
"technique that works well with procedurally generated and user-built levels, "
"including in situations where geometry is created during gameplay. The signed "
"distance field is automatically generated around the camera as it moves. "
"Dynamic lights are supported, but dynamic occluders and emissive surfaces are "
"not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SDFGI is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] SDFGI is relatively demanding on the GPU and is not "
"suited to low-end hardware such as integrated graphics (consider [LightmapGI] "
"instead). To improve SDFGI performance, enable [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution] in the "
"Project Settings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meshes should have sufficiently thick walls to avoid light leaks "
"(avoid one-sided walls). For interior levels, enclose your level geometry in "
"a sufficiently large box and bridge the loops to close the mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ signed distance field global illumination "
"(SDFGI) ສຳລັບເມຊ (meshes) ທີ່ຕັ້ງ [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ເປັນ "
"[constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC]. SDFGI "
"ແມ່ນເຕັກນິກການໃຫ້ແສງທົ່ວໂລກແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບດ່ານທີ່ສ້າງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ. Signed "
"distance field ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອ້ອມກ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່. ຮອງຮັບແສງແບບໄດນາມິກ, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຕົວບັງແສງ (occluders) ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເອງ (emissive) ແບບໄດນາມິກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] SDFGI ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະວິທີການເຣນເດີແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] SDFGI ຂ້ອນຂ້າງກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນ GPU ແລະ ບໍ່ເໝາະກັບຮາດແວສະເປັກຕ່ຳ "
"ເຊັ່ນກາດຈໍອອນບອດ (ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [LightmapGI] ແທນ). ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ SDFGI, ໃຫ້ເປີດ "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution] "
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມຊຄວນມີຝາທີ່ໜາພໍເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງແສງຮົ່ວ (ຫຼີກລ່ຽງຝາທີ່ມີດ້ານດຽວ). "
"ສຳລັບດ່ານພາຍໃນອາຄານ, ໃຫ້ຫຸ້ມດ່ານຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນກ່ອງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍ ແລະ ປິດຊ່ອງຫວ່າງຂອງເມຊໃຫ້ສະໜິດ."

msgid ""
"The energy multiplier to use for SDFGI. Higher values will result in brighter "
"indirect lighting and reflections. See also [member sdfgi_bounce_feedback]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນພະລັງງານສຳລັບ SDFGI. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງທາງອ້ອມ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[member sdfgi_bounce_feedback] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The maximum distance at which SDFGI is visible. Beyond this distance, "
"environment lighting or other sources of GI such as [ReflectionProbe] will be "
"used as a fallback.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] and "
"[member sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. Changing its value will automatically "
"change those properties as well."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະສູງສຸດທີ່ SDFGI ຈະປາກົດ. ເມື່ອເກີນໄລຍະນີ້, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງ GI ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[ReflectionProbe] ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] ແລະ [member "
"sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The cell size to use for the closest SDFGI cascade (in 3D units). Lower "
"values allow SDFGI to be more precise up close, at the cost of making SDFGI "
"updates more demanding. This can cause stuttering when the camera moves fast. "
"Higher values allow SDFGI to cover more ground, while also reducing the "
"performance impact of SDFGI updates.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_max_distance] and "
"[member sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. Changing its value will automatically "
"change those properties as well."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເຊລ (cell size) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SDFGI cascade ທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ (ໃນໜ່ວຍ 3D). ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ "
"SDFGI ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳໃນໄລຍະໃກ້, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການອັບເດດ SDFGI ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະຕຸກເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ SDFGI ຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ [member sdfgi_max_distance] ແລະ [member "
"sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. ການປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງມັນຈະປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The normal bias to use for SDFGI probes. Increasing this value can reduce "
"visible streaking artifacts on sloped surfaces, at the cost of increased "
"light leaking."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ normal bias ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SDFGI probes. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຮອຍຂີດ (artifacts) "
"ເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ອຽງໄດ້, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງຮົ່ວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The constant bias to use for SDFGI probes. Increasing this value can reduce "
"visible streaking artifacts on sloped surfaces, at the cost of increased "
"light leaking."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ constant bias ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SDFGI probes. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຮອຍຂີດ (artifacts) "
"ເທິງພື້ນຜິວທີ່ອຽງໄດ້, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງຮົ່ວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], SDFGI takes the environment lighting into account. This "
"should be set to [code]false[/code] for interior scenes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], SDFGI ຈະນຳເອົາແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມາຄຳນວນນຳ. ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code] ສຳລັບຊາກພາຍໃນອາຄານ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], SDFGI uses an occlusion detection approach to reduce "
"light leaking. Occlusion may however introduce dark blotches in certain "
"spots, which may be undesired in mostly outdoor scenes. [member "
"sdfgi_use_occlusion] has a performance impact and should only be enabled when "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], SDFGI ຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການກວດຈັບການບັງແສງ (occlusion) ເພື່ອຫຼຸດແສງຮົ່ວ. "
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການບັງແສງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍດຳໃນບາງຈຸດ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນຊາກກາງແຈ້ງ. "
"[member sdfgi_use_occlusion] ມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The Y scale to use for SDFGI cells. Lower values will result in SDFGI cells "
"being packed together more closely on the Y axis. This is used to balance "
"between quality and covering a lot of vertical ground. [member sdfgi_y_scale] "
"should be set depending on how vertical your scene is (and how fast your "
"camera may move on the Y axis)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສະເກລແກນ Y ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊລ SDFGI. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊລ SDFGI ຢູ່ເບຍດກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນແກນ Y. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ການຄອບຄຸມພື້ນທີ່ໃນແນວຕັ້ງ. [member sdfgi_y_scale] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຕາມຄວາມສູງຂອງຊາກ (ແລະ ຄວາມໄວທີ່ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Y)."

msgid "The [Sky] resource used for this [Environment]."
msgstr "ຣີຊອດ [Sky] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [Environment] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code], overrides the field of view "
"to use for sky rendering. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the same FOV as the "
"current [Camera3D] is used for sky rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], ຈະແທນທີ່ມຸມເບິ່ງ (FOV) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ FOV ດຽວກັບ [Camera3D] ປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid "The rotation to use for sky rendering."
msgstr "ການໝຸນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຣນເດີທ້ອງຟ້າ."

msgid ""
"The screen-space ambient occlusion intensity on materials that have an AO "
"texture defined. Values higher than [code]0[/code] will make the SSAO effect "
"visible in areas darkened by AO textures."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion (SSAO) ເທິງວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີ AO texture. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເອັບເຟັກ SSAO ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມືດໂດຍ AO texture."

msgid ""
"Sets the strength of the additional level of detail for the screen-space "
"ambient occlusion effect. A high value makes the detail pass more prominent, "
"but it may contribute to aliasing in your final image."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄວາມແຮງຂອງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ SSAO. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເດັ່ນຊັດຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍຫຍັກ (aliasing) ໃນພາບສຸດທ້າຍໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the screen-space ambient occlusion effect is enabled. "
"This darkens objects' corners and cavities to simulate ambient light not "
"reaching the entire object as in real life. This works well for small, "
"dynamic objects, but baked lighting or ambient occlusion textures will do a "
"better job at displaying ambient occlusion on large static objects. Godot "
"uses a form of SSAO called Adaptive Screen Space Ambient Occlusion which is "
"itself a form of Horizon Based Ambient Occlusion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSAO is only supported in the Forward+ and Compatibility "
"rendering methods, not Mobile."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກ screen-space ambient occlusion "
"(SSAO). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມຸມ ແລະ ຊອກຫຼືບຂອງວັດຖຸມືດລົງ "
"ເພື່ອຈຳລອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ເຂົ້າບໍ່ເຖິງຄືກັບໃນຊີວິດຈິງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ສຳລັບວັດຖຸຄົງທີ່ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ການໃຊ້ baked lighting ຫຼື AO textures ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ດີກວ່າ. Godot "
"ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ SSAO ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ Adaptive Screen Space Ambient Occlusion.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] SSAO ຮອງຮັບໃນ Forward+ ແລະ Compatibility, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Mobile."

msgid ""
"The threshold for considering whether a given point on a surface is occluded "
"or not represented as an angle from the horizon mapped into the "
"[code]0.0-1.0[/code] range. A value of [code]1.0[/code] results in no "
"occlusion."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດໃນການພິຈາລະນາວ່າຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງພື້ນຜິວຖືກບັງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍສະແດງເປັນມຸມຈາກເສັ້ນຂອບຟ້າທີ່ຖືກແມັບ "
"(mapped) ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0.0-1.0[/code]. ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີການບັງແສງ."

msgid ""
"The primary screen-space ambient occlusion intensity. Acts as a multiplier "
"for the screen-space ambient occlusion effect. A higher value results in "
"darker occlusion."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຫຼັກຂອງ screen-space ambient occlusion. ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ SSAO. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການບັງແສງມືດລົງ."

msgid ""
"The screen-space ambient occlusion intensity in direct light. In real life, "
"ambient occlusion only applies to indirect light, which means its effects "
"can't be seen in direct light. Values higher than [code]0[/code] will make "
"the SSAO effect visible in direct light."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງ SSAO ໃນແສງໂດຍກົງ. ໃນຊີວິດຈິງ, ambient occlusion "
"ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະກັບແສງທາງອ້ອມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນໃນແສງໂດຍກົງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ "
"[code]0[/code] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເອັບເຟັກ SSAO ໃນແສງໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"The distribution of occlusion. A higher value results in darker occlusion, "
"similar to [member ssao_intensity], but with a sharper falloff."
msgstr ""
"ການກະຈາຍຂອງການບັງແສງ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການບັງແສງມືດລົງ ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [member "
"ssao_intensity], ແຕ່ມີການຫຼຸດລົງ (falloff) ທີ່ຄົມຊັດກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The distance at which objects can occlude each other when calculating screen-"
"space ambient occlusion. Higher values will result in occlusion over a "
"greater distance at the cost of performance and quality."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທີ່ວັດຖຸສາມາດບັງແສງກັນໄດ້ເມື່ອຄຳນວນ SSAO. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການບັງແສງໃນໄລຍະທີ່ໄກຂຶ້ນ "
"ແຕ່ຈະແລກມາດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບ."

msgid ""
"The amount that the screen-space ambient occlusion effect is allowed to blur "
"over the edges of objects. Setting too high will result in aliasing around "
"the edges of objects. Setting too low will make object edges appear blurry."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານທີ່ເອັບເຟັກ SSAO ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເບຼີເກີນຂອບຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງສູງເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍຫຍັກອ້ອມຂອບວັດຖຸ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຕ່ຳເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບວັດຖຸເບິ່ງເບຼີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the screen-space indirect lighting effect is enabled. "
"Screen space indirect lighting is a form of indirect lighting that allows "
"diffuse light to bounce between nearby objects. Screen-space indirect "
"lighting works very similarly to screen-space ambient occlusion, in that it "
"only affects a limited range. It is intended to be used along with a form of "
"proper global illumination like SDFGI or [VoxelGI]. Screen-space indirect "
"lighting is not affected by individual light's [member "
"Light3D.light_indirect_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSIL is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກ screen-space indirect lighting "
"(SSIL). SSIL ແມ່ນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງແສງທາງອ້ອມທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນ. SSIL "
"ເຮັດວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບ SSAO ໂດຍຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃນໄລຍະທີ່ຈຳກັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ global "
"illumination ເຊັ່ນ SDFGI ຫຼື [VoxelGI]. SSIL ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ [member "
"Light3D.light_indirect_energy] ຂອງແສງແຕ່ລະດວງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] SSIL ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The brightness multiplier for the screen-space indirect lighting effect. A "
"higher value will result in brighter light."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກ SSIL. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Amount of normal rejection used when calculating screen-space indirect "
"lighting. Normal rejection uses the normal of a given sample point to reject "
"samples that are facing away from the current pixel. Normal rejection is "
"necessary to avoid light leaking when only one side of an object is "
"illuminated. However, normal rejection can be disabled if light leaking is "
"desirable, such as when the scene mostly contains emissive objects that emit "
"light from faces that cannot be seen from the camera."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການປະຕິເສດນໍມໍ (normal rejection) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຄຳນວນ SSIL. "
"ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ຄ່ານໍມໍຂອງຈຸດຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອປະຕິເສດຈຸດທີ່ຫັນໜ້າອອກຈາກພິກເຊລປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງແສງຮົ່ວເມື່ອວັດຖຸຖືກສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງພຽງດ້ານດຽວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແສງຮົ່ວ ເຊັ່ນໃນຊາກທີ່ມີວັດຖຸສະຫວ່າງເອງ (emissive) ຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The distance that bounced lighting can travel when using the screen space "
"indirect lighting effect. A larger value will result in light bouncing "
"further in a scene, but may result in under-sampling artifacts which look "
"like long spikes surrounding light sources."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທີ່ແສງສະທ້ອນສາມາດເດີນທາງໄດ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ SSIL. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງສະທ້ອນໄປໄດ້ໄກຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍຂີດ (artifacts) ທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືໜາມຍາວໆອ້ອມແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ."

msgid ""
"The amount that the screen-space indirect lighting effect is allowed to blur "
"over the edges of objects. Setting too high will result in aliasing around "
"the edges of objects. Setting too low will make object edges appear blurry."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານທີ່ເອັບເຟັກ SSIL ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເບຼີເກີນຂອບຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງສູງເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍຫຍັກອ້ອມຂອບວັດຖຸ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຕ່ຳເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບວັດຖຸເບິ່ງເບຼີ."

msgid "The depth tolerance for screen-space reflections."
msgstr "ຄ່າຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງຄວາມເລິກສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນໃນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ (SSR)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space reflections are enabled. Screen-space "
"reflections are more accurate than reflections from [VoxelGI]s or "
"[ReflectionProbe]s, but are slower and can't reflect surfaces occluded by "
"others.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSR is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSR is not supported on viewports that have a transparent "
"background (where [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is [code]true[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ screen-space reflections (SSR). SSR "
"ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຢຳກວ່າການສະທ້ອນຈາກ [VoxelGI] ຫຼື [ReflectionProbe], ແຕ່ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດສະທ້ອນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຖືກວັດຖຸອື່ນບັງໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] SSR ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] SSR ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ viewport ທີ່ມີພື້ນຫຼັງໂປ່ງໃສ."

msgid ""
"The fade-in distance for screen-space reflections. Affects the area from the "
"reflected material to the screen-space reflection. Only positive values are "
"valid (negative values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະການຄ່ອຍໆປາກົດ (fade-in) ສຳລັບ SSR. ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ພື້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ວັດສະດຸທີ່ສະທ້ອນໄປຫາພາບສະທ້ອນ. "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The fade-out distance for screen-space reflections. Affects the area from the "
"screen-space reflection to the \"global\" reflection. Only positive values "
"are valid (negative values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະການຄ່ອຍໆຫາຍໄປ (fade-out) ສຳລັບ SSR. "
"ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ພື້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ພາບສະທ້ອນໃນໜ້າຈໍໄປຫາການສະທ້ອນແບບ \"ໂດຍລວມ\". ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຄ່າບວກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of steps for screen-space reflections. Higher values are "
"slower."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນສູງສຸດສຳລັບ SSR. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນຊ້າລົງ."

msgid ""
"Increasing [member tonemap_agx_contrast] will make dark values darker and "
"bright values brighter. Produces a higher quality result than [member "
"adjustment_contrast] without any additional performance cost, but is only "
"available when using the [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມ [member tonemap_agx_contrast] ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ມືດມືດລົງ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ [member adjustment_contrast] "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The white reference value for tonemapping, which indicates where bright white "
"is located in the scale of values provided to the tonemapper. For "
"photorealistic lighting, it is recommended to set [member tonemap_agx_white] "
"to at least [code]6.0[/code]. Higher values result in less blown out "
"highlights, but may make the scene appear lower contrast. [member "
"tonemap_agx_white] is the same as [member tonemap_white], but is only "
"effective with the [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper. See also [member "
"tonemap_exposure].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile renderer with [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"disabled, [member tonemap_agx_white] is ignored and a white value of "
"[code]2.0[/code] will always be used instead. Otherwise, [member "
"tonemap_agx_white] will be dynamically adjusted at runtime by multiplying it "
"by the parent window's [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] when using "
"[member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] to ensure good behavior with both SDR and HDR "
"output."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອ້າງອີງສີຂາວສຳລັບການປັບໂທນສີ (tonemapping). ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ແສງທີ່ສົມຈິງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"tonemap_agx_white] ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [code]6.0[/code]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດແສງຈ້າເກີນໄປ (blown "
"out highlights). [member tonemap_agx_white] ຄືກັນກັບ [member tonemap_white] "
"ແຕ່ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບ [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເຣນເດີ Mobile ໂດຍປິດ [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d], "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄ່າ [code]2.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Adjusts the brightness of values before they are provided to the tonemapper. "
"Higher [member tonemap_exposure] values result in a brighter image. See also "
"[member tonemap_white].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values provided to the tonemapper will also be multiplied by "
"[code]2.0[/code] and [code]1.8[/code] for [constant TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC] and "
"[constant TONE_MAPPER_ACES] respectively to produce a similar apparent "
"brightness as [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຄ່າຕ່າງໆກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ຕົວປັບໂທນສີ. ຄ່າ [member tonemap_exposure] "
"ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member tonemap_white] ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The tonemapping mode to use. Tonemapping is the process that \"converts\" HDR "
"values to be suitable for rendering on an LDR display. (Godot doesn't support "
"rendering on HDR displays yet.)"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການປັບໂທນສີ (tonemapping) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. Tonemapping ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ \"ແປງ\" ຄ່າ HDR "
"ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນເທິງຈໍພາບແບບ LDR. (Godot ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຣນເດີເທິງຈໍ HDR ໃນຕອນນີ້.)"

msgid ""
"The white reference value for tonemapping, which indicates where bright white "
"is located in the scale of values provided to the tonemapper. For "
"photorealistic lighting, it is recommended to set [member tonemap_white] to "
"at least [code]6.0[/code]. Higher values result in less blown out highlights, "
"but may make the scene appear lower contrast. [member tonemap_agx_white] will "
"be used instead when using the [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper. See "
"also [member tonemap_exposure].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member tonemap_white] must be set to [code]2.0[/code] or lower "
"on the Mobile renderer to produce bright images.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member tonemap_white] is ignored when using [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and will be dynamically adjusted at runtime to never be "
"less than the parent window's [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] "
"when using [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] with [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອ້າງອີງສີຂາວສຳລັບການປັບໂທນສີ. ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ແສງທີ່ສົມຈິງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member tonemap_white] "
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [code]6.0[/code]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດແສງຈ້າເກີນໄປ. [member tonemap_agx_white] "
"ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ແທນເມື່ອໃຊ້ [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງ [member tonemap_white] ເປັນ [code]2.0[/code] ຫຼື "
"ຕ່ຳກວ່າໃນຕົວເຣນເດີ Mobile ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ."

msgid ""
"The [Color] of the volumetric fog when interacting with lights. Mist and fog "
"have an albedo close to [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 1)[/code] while smoke has a "
"darker albedo."
msgstr ""
"ສີ [Color] ຂອງໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ (volumetric fog) ເມື່ອມີປະຕິສຳພັນກັບແສງ. ໝອກຄວັນ ແລະ "
"ໝອກປົກກະຕິຈະມີຄ່າ albedo ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 1)[/code] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄວັນໄຟຈະມີ "
"albedo ທີ່ມືດກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Scales the strength of ambient light used in the volumetric fog. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] means that ambient light will not impact the volumetric fog. "
"[member volumetric_fog_ambient_inject] has a small performance cost when set "
"above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This has no visible effect if [member volumetric_fog_density] is "
"[code]0.0[/code] or if [member volumetric_fog_albedo] is a fully black color."
msgstr ""
"ປັບລະດັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໝອກ. ຈະມີການກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າ [member volumetric_fog_density] ແມ່ນ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຫຼື [member volumetric_fog_albedo] ເປັນສີດຳສະໜິດ."

msgid ""
"The direction of scattered light as it goes through the volumetric fog. A "
"value close to [code]1.0[/code] means almost all light is scattered forward. "
"A value close to [code]0.0[/code] means light is scattered equally in all "
"directions. A value close to [code]-1.0[/code] means light is scattered "
"mostly backward. Fog and mist scatter light slightly forward, while smoke "
"scatters light equally in all directions."
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງຂອງແສງທີ່ກະຈາຍເມື່ອຜ່ານໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ. ຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງແສງເກືອບທັງໝົດກະຈາຍໄປທາງໜ້າ. ຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງແສງກະຈາຍເທົ່າກັນທຸກທິດທາງ. ຄ່າໃກ້ຄຽງ [code]-1.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍເຖິງແສງກະຈາຍໄປທາງຫຼັງເປັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"The base [i]exponential[/i] density of the volumetric fog. Set this to the "
"lowest density you want to have globally. [FogVolume]s can be used to add to "
"or subtract from this density in specific areas. Fog rendering is exponential "
"as in real life.\n"
"A value of [code]0.0[/code] disables global volumetric fog while allowing "
"[FogVolume]s to display volumetric fog in specific areas.\n"
"To make volumetric fog work as a volumetric [i]lighting[/i] solution, set "
"[member volumetric_fog_density] to the lowest non-zero value ([code]0.0001[/"
"code]) then increase lights' [member Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] to "
"values between [code]10000[/code] and [code]100000[/code] to compensate for "
"the very low density."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນພື້ນຖານແບບ [i]ເອັກໂປເນນຊຽລ[/i] ຂອງໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ. "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີທົ່ວໂລກ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ [FogVolume] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼຸດຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນໃນບາງພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້.\n"
"ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະປິດໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານໂດຍລວມ ແຕ່ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ [FogVolume] "
"ສະແດງໝອກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສະເພາະໄດ້.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝອກເຮັດວຽກເປັນລະບົບ [i]ແສງ[/i] ແບບມີປະລິມານ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"volumetric_fog_density] ໄວ້ຕ່ຳສຸດ ([code]0.0001[/code]) ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ [member "
"Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] ຂອງແສງໃຫ້ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ [code]10000[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]100000[/code] ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍ."

msgid ""
"The distribution of size down the length of the froxel buffer. A higher value "
"compresses the froxels closer to the camera and places more detail closer to "
"the camera."
msgstr ""
"ການກະຈາຍຂະໜາດຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງ froxel buffer. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະບີບອັດ froxels ໃຫ້ໃກ້ກ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີລາຍລະອຽດໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ກ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The emitted light from the volumetric fog. Even with emission, volumetric fog "
"will not cast light onto other surfaces. Emission is useful to establish an "
"ambient color. As the volumetric fog effect uses single-scattering only, fog "
"tends to need a little bit of emission to soften the harsh shadows."
msgstr ""
"ແສງທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການປ່ອຍແສງ (emission), "
"ໝອກກໍຈະບໍ່ສ່ອງແສງໃສ່ພື້ນຜິວອື່ນ. Emission ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກຳນົດສີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເອັບເຟັກໝອກນີ້ໃຊ້ການກະຈາຍແສງພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, "
"ໝອກຈຶ່ງມັກຈະຕ້ອງການການປ່ອຍແສງເລັກນ້ອຍເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາທີ່ແຂງເບົາບາງລົງ."

msgid "The brightness of the emitted light from the volumetric fog."
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງແສງທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ."

msgid ""
"Enables the volumetric fog effect. Volumetric fog uses a screen-aligned "
"froxel buffer to calculate accurate volumetric scattering in the short to "
"medium range. Volumetric fog interacts with [FogVolume]s and lights to "
"calculate localized and global fog. Volumetric fog uses a PBR single-"
"scattering model based on extinction, scattering, and emission which it "
"exposes to users as density, albedo, and emission.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Volumetric fog is only supported in the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ (volumetric fog). ມັນໃຊ້ froxel buffer "
"ເພື່ອຄຳນວນການກະຈາຍແສງທີ່ແມ່ນຢຳໃນໄລຍະໃກ້ຫາປານກາງ. ໝອກຈະມີປະຕິສຳພັນກັບ [FogVolume] ແລະ "
"ແສງຕ່າງໆ. ໝອກນີ້ໃຊ້ໂມເດລ PBR ແບບ single-scattering.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Scales the strength of Global Illumination used in the volumetric fog's "
"albedo color. A value of [code]0.0[/code] means that Global Illumination will "
"not impact the volumetric fog. [member volumetric_fog_gi_inject] has a small "
"performance cost when set above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This has no visible effect if [member volumetric_fog_density] is "
"[code]0.0[/code] or if [member volumetric_fog_albedo] is a fully black "
"color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) "
"are taken into account when using [member volumetric_fog_gi_inject]. Global "
"illumination from [LightmapGI], [ReflectionProbe] and SSIL (see [member "
"ssil_enabled]) will be ignored by volumetric fog."
msgstr ""
"ປັບລະດັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງ Global Illumination ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນສີ albedo ຂອງໝອກ. ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code] ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ GI ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໝອກ. ມີການກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອຕັ້ງສູງກວ່າ [code]0.0[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຈະມີພຽງ [VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກນຳມາຄຳນວນ."

msgid ""
"The distance over which the volumetric fog is computed. Increase to compute "
"fog over a greater range, decrease to add more detail when a long range is "
"not needed. For best quality fog, keep this as low as possible. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/volumetric_fog/volume_depth]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງທີ່ໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານຈະຖືກຄຳນວນ. ເພີ່ມເພື່ອຄຳນວນໝອກໃນໄລຍະທີ່ໄກຂຶ້ນ, "
"ຫຼຸດເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດເມື່ອບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄລຍະທາງທີ່ໄກ. ເພື່ອຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ຕ່ຳເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The factor to use when affecting the sky with volumetric fog. [code]1.0[/"
"code] means that volumetric fog can fully obscure the sky. Lower values "
"reduce the impact of volumetric fog on sky rendering, with [code]0.0[/code] "
"not affecting sky rendering at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member volumetric_fog_sky_affect] also affects [FogVolume]s, "
"even if [member volumetric_fog_density] is [code]0.0[/code]. If you notice "
"[FogVolume]s are disappearing when looking towards the sky, set [member "
"volumetric_fog_sky_affect] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທ້ອງຟ້າ. [code]1.0[/code] "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໝອກສາມາດບັງທ້ອງຟ້າໄດ້ທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບລົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ [FogVolume] ນຳ."

msgid ""
"The amount by which to blend the last frame with the current frame. A higher "
"number results in smoother volumetric fog, but makes \"ghosting\" much worse. "
"A lower value reduces ghosting but can result in the per-frame temporal "
"jitter becoming visible."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງເຟຣມກ່ອນໜ້າກັບເຟຣມປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝອກນິ່ງຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"\"ພາບຊ້ອນ\" (ghosting) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Enables temporal reprojection in the volumetric fog. Temporal reprojection "
"blends the current frame's volumetric fog with the last frame's volumetric "
"fog to smooth out jagged edges. The performance cost is minimal; however, it "
"leads to moving [FogVolume]s and [Light3D]s \"ghosting\" and leaving a trail "
"behind them. When temporal reprojection is enabled, try to avoid moving "
"[FogVolume]s or [Light3D]s too fast. Short-lived dynamic lighting effects "
"should have [member Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] set to [code]0.0[/"
"code] to avoid ghosting."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ temporal reprojection ໃນໝອກແບບມີປະລິມານ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບທີ່ຫຍັກນິ່ງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄວເກີດພາບຊ້ອນ ຫຼື ເປັນຫາງຕາມຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Clears the background using the clear color defined in [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງພື້ນຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ [member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/defaults/"
"default_clear_color]."

msgid "Clears the background using a custom clear color."
msgstr "ລ້າງພື້ນຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Displays a user-defined sky in the background."
msgstr "ສະແດງທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Displays a [CanvasLayer] in the background."
msgstr "ສະແດງ [CanvasLayer] ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Keeps on screen every pixel drawn in the background. This is the fastest "
"background mode, but it can only be safely used in fully-interior scenes (no "
"visible sky or sky reflections). If enabled in a scene where the background "
"is visible, \"ghost trail\" artifacts will be visible when moving the camera."
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາທຸກໆພິກເຊວທີ່ແຕ້ມໃນພື້ນຫຼັງໄວ້ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໃນສາກພາຍໃນອາຄານເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ບໍ່ມີທ້ອງຟ້າ ຫຼື ການສະທ້ອນທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້). "
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນສາກທີ່ເຫັນພື້ນຫຼັງ, ຈະເກີດມີຮອຍເງົາ \"ghost trail\" ເມື່ອມີການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍກ້ອງ."

msgid "Displays a camera feed in the background."
msgstr "ສະແດງພາບຈາກກ້ອງໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum BGMode] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum BGMode]."

msgid ""
"Gather ambient light from whichever source is specified as the background."
msgstr "ດຶງແສງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈາກແຫຼ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Disable ambient light. This provides a slight performance boost over "
"[constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານແສງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant "
"AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."

msgid ""
"Specify a specific [Color] for ambient light. This provides a slight "
"performance boost over [constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ [Color] ໂດຍສະເພາະໃຫ້ກັບແສງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບ [constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."

msgid ""
"Gather ambient light from the [Sky] regardless of what the background is."
msgstr "ດຶງແສງສະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈາກ [Sky] ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າພື້ນຫຼັງແມ່ນຫຍັງ."

msgid "Use the background for reflections."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນ."

msgid ""
"Disable reflections. This provides a slight performance boost over other "
"options."
msgstr "ປິດການສະທ້ອນ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ເລັກນ້ອຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Use the [Sky] for reflections regardless of what the background is."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [Sky] ສຳລັບການສະທ້ອນໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າພື້ນຫຼັງແມ່ນຫຍັງ."

msgid ""
"Does not modify color data, resulting in a linear tonemapping curve which "
"unnaturally clips bright values, causing bright lighting to look blown out. "
"The simplest and fastest tonemapper."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີການປັບປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນສີ, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ເປັນແບບ linear "
"ທີ່ຕັດຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອອກແບບບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍເບິ່ງຄືມີແສງຈ້າເກີນໄປ. ເປັນ "
"tonemapper ທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"A simple tonemapping curve that rolls off bright values to prevent clipping. "
"This results in an image that can appear dull and low contrast. Slower than "
"[constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member tonemap_white] is left at the default value of "
"[code]1.0[/code], [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] produces an identical "
"image to [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບງ່າຍໆທີ່ຊ່ວຍລົດລະດັບຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຖືກຕັດຄ່າສີ "
"(clipping). ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄືມືດມົວ ແລະ ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) ຕໍ່າ. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [member tonemap_white] ຖືກປະໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ [code]1.0[/code], "
"[constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] ຈະສ້າງພາບທີ່ຄືກັນກັບ [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."

msgid ""
"Uses a film-like tonemapping curve to prevent clipping of bright values and "
"provide better contrast than [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT]. Slightly "
"slower than [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper when "
"rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບຮູບເງົາ (film-like) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຕັດຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ "
"ໃຫ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ດີກວ່າ [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT]. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] ເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Tonemapper ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສະແດງຜົນແບບ HDR ເພາະມັນສ້າງຜົນລັດໃນຊ່ວງ SDR. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ tonemapper ອື່ນເມື່ອຕ້ອງການສະແດງຜົນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ HDR."

msgid ""
"Uses a high-contrast film-like tonemapping curve and desaturates bright "
"values for a more realistic appearance. Slightly slower than [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapping operator is called \"ACES Fitted\" in Godot "
"3.x.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper when "
"rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບຮູບເງົາທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (desaturates) "
"ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຊ້າກວ່າ [constant TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC] "
"ເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວປະຕິບັດການ tonemapping ນີ້ມີຊື່ວ່າ \"ACES Fitted\" ໃນ Godot 3.x.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Tonemapper ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສະແດງຜົນແບບ HDR ເພາະມັນສ້າງຜົນລັດໃນຊ່ວງ SDR. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ tonemapper ອື່ນເມື່ອຕ້ອງການສະແດງຜົນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ HDR."

msgid ""
"Uses an adjustable film-like tonemapping curve and desaturates bright values "
"for a more realistic appearance. Better than other tonemappers at maintaining "
"the hue of colors as they become brighter. The slowest tonemapping option."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ tonemapping ແບບຮູບເງົາທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ດີກວ່າ tonemapper "
"ອື່ນໆໃນການຮັກສາຄ່າສີ (hue) ເມື່ອສີມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເປັນຕົວເລືອກ tonemapping ທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Adds the glow effect to the scene."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກແສງເຮືອງ (glow) ໃຫ້ກັບສາກ."

msgid ""
"Adds the glow effect to the scene after modifying the glow influence based on "
"the scene value; dark values will be highly influenced by glow and bright "
"values will not be influenced by glow. This approach avoids bright values "
"becoming overly bright from the glow effect. [member tonemap_white] is used "
"to determine the maximum scene value where the glow should have no influence. "
"When [member tonemap_mode] is set to [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and "
"[member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] is [code]true[/code], the parent window's "
"[method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] will be used as the maximum scene "
"value."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເອັບເຟັກແສງເຮືອງໃຫ້ກັບສາກຫຼັງຈາກປັບປ່ຽນອິດທິພົນຂອງແສງເຮືອງຕາມຄ່າຂອງສາກ; "
"ຄ່າມືດຈະໄດ້ຮັບອິດທິພົນຈາກແສງເຮືອງສູງ ແລະ ຄ່າສະຫວ່າງຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອິດທິພົນ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຢູ່ແລ້ວສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປຈາກເອັບເຟັກແສງເຮືອງ. [member "
"tonemap_white] ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງສາກທີ່ແສງເຮືອງບໍ່ຄວນມີອິດທິພົນ. ເມື່ອ [member "
"tonemap_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] ແລະ [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າ [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງສາກ."

msgid ""
"Replaces all pixels' color by the glow effect. This can be used to simulate a "
"full-screen blur effect by tweaking the glow parameters to match the original "
"image's brightness or to preview glow configuration in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ສີຂອງທຸກພິກເຊວດ້ວຍເອັບເຟັກແສງເຮືອງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງເອັບເຟັກການເບຼີທົ່ວໜ້າຈໍ (full-screen "
"blur) ໂດຍການປັບຄ່າແສງເຮືອງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ ຫຼື "
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແສງເຮືອງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂ (editor)."

msgid ""
"Mixes the glow image with the scene image. Best used with [member glow_bloom] "
"to avoid darkening the scene."
msgstr ""
"ປະສົມພາບແສງເຮືອງເຂົ້າກັບພາບຂອງສາກ. ເໝາະສຳລັບໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [member glow_bloom] "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ສາກມືດລົງ."

msgid "Use a physically-based fog model defined primarily by fog density."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແບບຈຳລອງໝອກຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ ໂດຍກຳນົດຈາກຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງໝອກເປັນຫຼັກ."

msgid ""
"Use a simple fog model defined by start and end positions and a custom curve. "
"While not physically accurate, this model can be useful when you need more "
"artistic control."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແບບຈຳລອງໝອກແບບງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕຳແໜ່ງສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ, "
"ແຕ່ແບບຈຳລອງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຄວບຄຸມໃນທາງສິລະປະຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Use 50% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. SDFGI cells will be twice "
"as short as they are wide. This allows providing increased GI detail and "
"reduced light leaking with thin floors and ceilings. This is usually the best "
"choice for scenes that don't feature much verticality."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສະເກລ 50% ສຳລັບ SDFGI ໃນແກນ Y (ແນວຕັ້ງ). ເຊລຂອງ SDFGI "
"ຈະມີຄວາມສູງເປັນເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ GI ແລະ ຫຼຸດການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງແສງ "
"ຜ່ານພື້ນ ແລະ ເພດານທີ່ບາງ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບສາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄວາມສູງຊັນຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"Use 75% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. This is a balance between "
"the 50% and 100% SDFGI Y scales."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສະເກລ 75% ສຳລັບ SDFGI ໃນແກນ Y. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຸດສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງສະເກລ 50% ແລະ 100%."

msgid ""
"Use 100% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. SDFGI cells will be as "
"tall as they are wide. This is usually the best choice for highly vertical "
"scenes. The downside is that light leaking may become more noticeable with "
"thin floors and ceilings."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສະເກລ 100% ສຳລັບ SDFGI ໃນແກນ Y. ເຊລຂອງ SDFGI ຈະມີຄວາມສູງເທົ່າກັບຄວາມກວ້າງ. "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບສາກທີ່ມີຄວາມສູງຊັນຫຼາຍ. "
"ແຕ່ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງແສງອາດຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນໃນພື້ນ ແລະ ເພດານທີ່ບາງ."

msgid "A class that stores an expression you can execute."
msgstr "ຄລາສທີ່ເກັບສຳນວນ (expression) ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"An expression can be made of any arithmetic operation, built-in math function "
"call, method call of a passed instance, or built-in type construction call.\n"
"An example expression text using the built-in math functions could be "
"[code]sqrt(pow(3, 2) + pow(4, 2))[/code].\n"
"In the following example we use a [LineEdit] node to write our expression and "
"show the result.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var expression = Expression.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$LineEdit.text_submitted.connect(self._on_text_submitted)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_text_submitted(command):\n"
"\tvar error = expression.parse(command)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tprint(expression.get_error_text())\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\tvar result = expression.execute()\n"
"\tif not expression.has_execute_failed():\n"
"\t\t$LineEdit.text = str(result)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Expression _expression = new Expression();\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").TextSubmitted += OnTextEntered;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnTextEntered(string command)\n"
"{\n"
"\tError error = _expression.Parse(command);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(_expression.GetErrorText());\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tVariant result = _expression.Execute();\n"
"\tif (!_expression.HasExecuteFailed())\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").Text = result.ToString();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສຳນວນ (expression) ສາມາດປະກອບດ້ວຍການດຳເນີນການທາງຄະນິດສາດໃດໆ, "
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນຄະນິດສາດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ຫຼື ການສ້າງປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງສຳນວນທີ່ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນຄະນິດສາດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ຄື [code]sqrt(pow(3, 2) + pow(4, 2))[/code].\n"
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ໂນດ [LineEdit] ເພື່ອຂຽນສຳນວນ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນລັດ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var expression = Expression.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$LineEdit.text_submitted.connect(self._on_text_submitted)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_text_submitted(command):\n"
"\tvar error = expression.parse(command)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tprint(expression.get_error_text())\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\tvar result = expression.execute()\n"
"\tif not expression.has_execute_failed():\n"
"\t\t$LineEdit.text = str(result)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Expression _expression = new Expression();\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").TextSubmitted += OnTextEntered;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnTextEntered(string command)\n"
"{\n"
"\tError error = _expression.Parse(command);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(_expression.GetErrorText());\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tVariant result = _expression.Execute();\n"
"\tif (!_expression.HasExecuteFailed())\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").Text = result.ToString();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Evaluating Expressions"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນສຳນວນ"

msgid ""
"Executes the expression that was previously parsed by [method parse] and "
"returns the result. Before you use the returned object, you should check if "
"the method failed by calling [method has_execute_failed].\n"
"If you defined input variables in [method parse], you can specify their "
"values in the inputs array, in the same order."
msgstr ""
"ປະມວນຜົນສຳນວນທີ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານການວິເຄາະໂດຍ [method parse] ມາກ່ອນແລ້ວ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັດ. "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ, ທ່ານຄວນກວດສອບວ່າການປະມວນຜົນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"has_execute_failed].\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດຕົວແປຂາເຂົ້າໃນ [method parse], ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໃນອາເຣຂາເຂົ້າ "
"ຕາມລຳດັບດຽວກັນ."

msgid "Returns the error text if [method parse] or [method execute] has failed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫາກ [method parse] ຫຼື [method execute] ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if [method execute] has failed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [method execute] ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid ""
"Parses the expression and returns an [enum Error] code.\n"
"You can optionally specify names of variables that may appear in the "
"expression with [param input_names], so that you can bind them when it gets "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"ວິເຄາະສຳນວນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດ [enum Error].\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ຂອງຕົວແປທີ່ອາດຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນສຳນວນໄດ້ຜ່ານ [param input_names], "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນໄດ້ເມື່ອມີການປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "Texture which displays the content of an external buffer."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ (Texture) ທີ່ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງບັບເຟີພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Displays the content of an external buffer provided by the platform.\n"
"Requires the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/OES/"
"OES_EGL_image_external.txt]OES_EGL_image_external[/url] extension (OpenGL) or "
"[url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.1-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer]VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer[/"
"url] extension (Vulkan).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is currently only supported in Android builds."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງບັບເຟີພາຍນອກທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍແພລັດຟອມ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/OES/"
"OES_EGL_image_external.txt]OES_EGL_image_external[/url] (OpenGL) ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ "
"[url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.1-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer]VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer[/"
"url] (Vulkan).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ Android ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the external texture ID.\n"
"Depending on your use case, you may need to pass this to platform APIs, for "
"example, when creating an [code]android.graphics.SurfaceTexture[/code] on "
"Android."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ ID ຂອງເທັກເຈີພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ອີງຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບ API ຂອງແພລັດຟອມ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອສ້າງ "
"[code]android.graphics.SurfaceTexture[/code] ເທິງ Android."

msgid ""
"Sets the external buffer ID.\n"
"Depending on your use case, you may need to call this with data received from "
"a platform API, for example, [code]SurfaceTexture.getHardwareBuffer()[/code] "
"on Android."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ID ຂອງບັບເຟີພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ອີງຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກ API ຂອງແພລັດຟອມ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"[code]SurfaceTexture.getHardwareBuffer()[/code] ເທິງ Android."

msgid "External texture size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເທັກເຈີພາຍນອກ."

msgid "Position based forward and backward reaching inverse kinematics solver."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Inverse Kinematics ແບບອາໄສຕຳແໜ່ງໂດຍການໄລ່ໄປທາງໜ້າ ແລະ ທາງຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"[FABRIK3D] is position based IK, allowing precise and accurate tracking of "
"targets. It's ideal for simple chains without limitations.\n"
"The resulting twist around the forward vector will always be kept from the "
"previous pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the target is close to the root, it tends to produce zig-"
"zag patterns, resulting in unnatural visual movement."
msgstr ""
"[FABRIK3D] ແມ່ນ IK ທີ່ອາໄສຕຳແໜ່ງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕາມເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ມັນເໝາະສຳລັບໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ເປັນຕ່ອງໂສ້ແບບງ່າຍໆໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ.\n"
"ການບິດ (twist) ທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຮອບແກນທາງໜ້າ ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຈາກທ່າທາງກ່ອນໜ້າສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (root), ມັນມັກຈະສ້າງຮູບແບບຊິກແຊກ (zig-zag), "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ."

msgid "Inverse Kinematics Returns to Godot 4.6 - IKModifier3D"
msgstr "Inverse Kinematics ກັບຄືນສູ່ Godot 4.6 - IKModifier3D"

msgid "Generates noise using the FastNoiseLite library."
msgstr "ສ້າງນອຍສ໌ (noise) ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ FastNoiseLite."

msgid ""
"This class generates noise using the FastNoiseLite library, which is a "
"collection of several noise algorithms including Cellular, Perlin, Value, and "
"more.\n"
"Most generated noise values are in the range of [code][-1, 1][/code], but not "
"always. Some of the cellular noise algorithms return results above [code]1[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ສ້າງນອຍສ໌ (noise) ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ FastNoiseLite, ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາອັລກໍຣິທຶມນອຍສ໌ຫຼາຍແບບ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: Cellular, Perlin, Value ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"ຄ່ານອຍສ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][-1, 1][/code], ແຕ່ກໍບໍ່ສະເໝີໄປ. "
"ອັລກໍຣິທຶມນອຍສ໌ບາງແບບເຊັ່ນ cellular ອາດສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັດທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Determines how the distance to the nearest/second-nearest point is computed."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການຄິດໄລ່ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຫຼື ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ."

msgid ""
"Maximum distance a point can move off of its grid position. Set to [code]0[/"
"code] for an even grid."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງສູງສຸດທີ່ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ອອກຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງກຣິດ (grid) ຂອງມັນ. ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]0[/code] "
"ສຳລັບກຣິດທີ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

msgid "Return type from cellular noise calculations."
msgstr "ປະເພດຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກການຄິດໄລ່ cellular noise."

msgid "Sets the maximum warp distance from the origin."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະບິດເບືອນ (warp) ສູງສຸດຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, another FastNoiseLite instance is used to warp the space, "
"resulting in a distortion of the noise."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ FastNoiseLite ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່, ເຮັດໃຫ້ນອຍສ໌ເກີດການບິດບ້ຽວ."

msgid ""
"Determines the strength of each subsequent layer of the noise which is used "
"to warp the space.\n"
"A low value places more emphasis on the lower frequency base layers, while a "
"high value puts more emphasis on the higher frequency layers."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນນອຍສ໌ຖັດໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ຊັ້ນພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ຕໍ່າ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ຊັ້ນທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The change in frequency between octaves, also known as \"lacunarity\", of the "
"fractal noise which warps the space. Increasing this value results in higher "
"octaves, producing noise with finer details and a rougher appearance."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມຖີ່ລະຫວ່າງຊັ້ນ (octaves), ຫຼື ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"lacunarity\", ຂອງນອຍສ໌ແບບ fractal "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຊັ້ນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສ້າງນອຍສ໌ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຫຍາບຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of noise layers that are sampled to get the final value for the "
"fractal noise which warps the space."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊັ້ນນອຍສ໌ທີ່ຖືກນຳມາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍສຳລັບນອຍສ໌ແບບ fractal ທີ່ໃຊ້ບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່."

msgid ""
"The method for combining octaves into a fractal which is used to warp the "
"space."
msgstr "ວິທີການລວມຊັ້ນຕ່າງໆ (octaves) ໃຫ້ເປັນ fractal ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Frequency of the noise which warps the space. Low frequency results in smooth "
"noise while high frequency results in rougher, more granular noise."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງນອຍສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່. ຄວາມຖີ່ຕໍ່າຈະໃຫ້ໝາກນອຍສ໌ທີ່ລຽບນຽນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຈະໃຫ້ໝາກນອຍສ໌ທີ່ຫຍາບ ແລະ ເປັນເມັດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The warp algorithm."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມການບິດເບືອນ (warp)."

msgid ""
"Determines the strength of each subsequent layer of noise in fractal noise.\n"
"A low value places more emphasis on the lower frequency base layers, while a "
"high value puts more emphasis on the higher frequency layers."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມແຮງຂອງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນນອຍສ໌ຖັດໄປໃນນອຍສ໌ແບບ fractal.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕໍ່າຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ຊັ້ນພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ຕໍ່າ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ຊັ້ນທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"Frequency multiplier between subsequent octaves. Increasing this value "
"results in higher octaves producing noise with finer details and a rougher "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມຖີ່ລະຫວ່າງຊັ້ນຖັດໄປ. ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຊັ້ນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສ້າງນອຍສ໌ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເບິ່ງຫຍາບຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of noise layers that are sampled to get the final value for "
"fractal noise types."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊັ້ນນອຍສ໌ທີ່ຖືກນຳມາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍສຳລັບນອຍສ໌ປະເພດ fractal."

msgid "Sets the strength of the fractal ping pong type."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມແຮງຂອງ fractal ປະເພດ ping pong."

msgid "The method for combining octaves into a fractal."
msgstr "ວິທີການລວມຊັ້ນຕ່າງໆ (octaves) ໃຫ້ເປັນ fractal."

msgid ""
"Higher weighting means higher octaves have less impact if lower octaves have "
"a large impact."
msgstr "ການຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຊັ້ນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະມີຜົນກະທົບໜ້ອຍລົງ ຫາກຊັ້ນທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າມີຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍ."

msgid ""
"The frequency for all noise types. Low frequency results in smooth noise "
"while high frequency results in rougher, more granular noise."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຖີ່ສຳລັບນອຍສ໌ທຸກປະເພດ. ຄວາມຖີ່ຕໍ່າຈະໃຫ້ໝາກນອຍສ໌ທີ່ລຽບນຽນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຈະໃຫ້ໝາກນອຍສ໌ທີ່ຫຍາບ ແລະ ເປັນເມັດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The noise algorithm used."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມນອຍສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້."

msgid "Translate the noise input coordinates by the given [Vector3]."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງ (Translate) ຈຸດປະສານງານຂາເຂົ້າຂອງນອຍສ໌ຕາມ [Vector3] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "The random number seed for all noise types."
msgstr "ຄ່າຊີດ (seed) ຕົວເລກສຸ່ມສຳລັບນອຍສ໌ທຸກປະເພດ."

msgid ""
"A lattice of points are assigned random values then interpolated based on "
"neighboring values."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຂ່າຍຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າສຸ່ມ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກປະສົມ (interpolated) ຕາມຄ່າຂອງຈຸດທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງ."

msgid ""
"Similar to value noise ([constant TYPE_VALUE]), but slower. Has more variance "
"in peaks and valleys.\n"
"Cubic noise can be used to avoid certain artifacts when using value noise to "
"create a bumpmap. In general, you should always use this mode if the value "
"noise is being used for a heightmap or bumpmap."
msgstr ""
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ value noise ([constant TYPE_VALUE]), ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ. ມີຄວາມຜັນຜວນໃນສ່ວນສູງ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນຕ່ຳຫຼາຍກວ່າ.\n"
"Cubic noise ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງແປກປອມ (artifacts) ບາງຢ່າງເມື່ອໃຊ້ value noise "
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ bumpmap. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ສະເໝີຫາກມີການໃຊ້ value noise ສຳລັບ "
"heightmap ຫຼື bumpmap."

msgid ""
"A lattice of random gradients. Their dot products are interpolated to obtain "
"values in between the lattices."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຂ່າຍຂອງຄ່າຄວາມຊັນ (gradients) ແບບສຸ່ມ. ຄ່າ dot product "
"ຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກປະສົມເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງໂຄງຂ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Cellular includes both Worley noise and Voronoi diagrams which creates "
"various regions of the same value."
msgstr ""
"Cellular ລວມມີທັງ Worley noise ແລະ Voronoi diagrams ເຊິ່ງສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີຄ່າດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"As opposed to [constant TYPE_PERLIN], gradients exist in a simplex lattice "
"rather than a grid lattice, avoiding directional artifacts. Internally uses "
"FastNoiseLite's OpenSimplex2 noise type."
msgstr ""
"ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ [constant TYPE_PERLIN], ຄ່າຄວາມຊັນຈະຢູ່ໃນໂຄງຂ່າຍແບບ simplex "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໂຄງຂ່າຍແບບກຣິດ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງແປກປອມທາງທິດທາງ. ພາຍໃນແມ່ນໃຊ້ປະເພດນອຍສ໌ "
"OpenSimplex2 ຂອງ FastNoiseLite."

msgid ""
"Modified, higher quality version of [constant TYPE_SIMPLEX], but slower. "
"Internally uses FastNoiseLite's OpenSimplex2S noise type."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນລຸ້ນທີ່ປັບປຸງໃຫ້ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າ [constant TYPE_SIMPLEX], ແຕ່ຊ້າກວ່າ. "
"ພາຍໃນແມ່ນໃຊ້ປະເພດນອຍສ໌ OpenSimplex2S ຂອງ FastNoiseLite."

msgid "No fractal noise."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີ fractal noise."

msgid ""
"Method using Fractional Brownian Motion to combine octaves into a fractal."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ໃຊ້ Fractional Brownian Motion ເພື່ອລວມຊັ້ນຕ່າງໆ (octaves) ເຂົ້າເປັນ fractal."

msgid ""
"Method of combining octaves into a fractal resulting in a \"ridged\" look."
msgstr "ວິທີການລວມຊັ້ນຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ເປັນ fractal ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືມີ \"ສັນຂອບ\" (ridged)."

msgid "Method of combining octaves into a fractal with a ping pong effect."
msgstr "ວິທີການລວມຊັ້ນຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ເປັນ fractal ດ້ວຍເອັບເຟັກແບບ ping pong."

msgid "Euclidean distance to the nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບຢູຄຼິດ (Euclidean distance) ໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Squared Euclidean distance to the nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບຢູຄຼິດຍົກກຳລັງສອງ ໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Manhattan distance (taxicab metric) to the nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບແມນຮັດຕັນ (Manhattan distance) ໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Blend of [constant DISTANCE_EUCLIDEAN] and [constant DISTANCE_MANHATTAN] to "
"give curved cell boundaries."
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ [constant DISTANCE_EUCLIDEAN] ແລະ [constant DISTANCE_MANHATTAN] "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂອບເຂດເຊລທີ່ມີຄວາມໂຄ້ງ."

msgid ""
"The cellular distance function will return the same value for all points "
"within a cell."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນໄລຍະຫ່າງ cellular ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າດຽວກັນສຳລັບທຸກໆຈຸດພາຍໃນເຊລ."

msgid ""
"The cellular distance function will return a value determined by the distance "
"to the nearest point."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນໄລຍະຫ່າງ cellular ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The cellular distance function returns the distance to the second-nearest "
"point."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນໄລຍະຫ່າງ cellular ຈະສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ."

msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is added to the distance to the second-"
"nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ບວກກັບ ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ."

msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is subtracted from the distance to the "
"second-nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ ລົບດ້ວຍ ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is multiplied with the distance to the "
"second-nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຄູນກັບ ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ."

msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is divided by the distance to the second-"
"nearest point."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ ຫານດ້ວຍ ໄລຍະຫ່າງໄປຫາຈຸດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດອັນດັບສອງ."

msgid "The domain is warped using the simplex noise algorithm."
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດ (domain) ຖືກບິດເບືອນໂດຍໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມ simplex noise."

msgid ""
"The domain is warped using a simplified version of the simplex noise "
"algorithm."
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດ (domain) ຖືກບິດເບືອນໂດຍໃຊ້ simplex noise ເວີຊັນທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The domain is warped using a simple noise grid (not as smooth as the other "
"methods, but more performant)."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດ (domain) ຖືກບິດເບືອນໂດຍໃຊ້ກຣິດນອຍສ໌ແບບງ່າຍໆ (ບໍ່ລຽບນຽນເທົ່າກັບວິທີອື່ນ, "
"ແຕ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າ)."

msgid "No fractal noise for warping the space."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີ fractal noise ສຳລັບການບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Warping the space progressively, octave for octave, resulting in a more "
"\"liquified\" distortion."
msgstr "ການບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່ແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເທື່ອລະຊັ້ນ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດການບິດບ້ຽວທີ່ເບິ່ງຄື \"ຂອງແຫຼວ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Warping the space independently for each octave, resulting in a more chaotic "
"distortion."
msgstr "ການບິດເບືອນພື້ນທີ່ແບບເປັນອິດສະຫຼະໃນແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນ, ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດການບິດບ້ຽວທີ່ວຸ່ນວາຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Handles FBX documents."
msgstr "ຈັດການເອກະສານ FBX."

msgid ""
"The FBXDocument handles FBX documents. It provides methods to append data "
"from buffers or files, generate scenes, and register/unregister document "
"extensions.\n"
"When exporting FBX from Blender, use the \"FBX Units Scale\" option. The "
"\"FBX Units Scale\" option sets the correct scale factor and avoids manual "
"adjustments when re-importing into Blender, such as through glTF export."
msgstr ""
"FBXDocument ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈັດການເອກະສານ FBX. ມັນມີເມທອດເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກບັບເຟີ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌, ສ້າງສາກ, "
"ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນ/ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງເອກະສານ.\n"
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ FBX ຈາກ Blender, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ \"FBX Units Scale\". ຕົວເລືອກ \"FBX Units "
"Scale\" ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຄູນສະເກລທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການປັບແຕ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ Blender "
"ອີກຄັ້ງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຜ່ານການສົ່ງອອກ glTF."

msgid "The FBXState handles the state data imported from FBX files."
msgstr "FBXState ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະທີ່ນຳມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ FBX."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the import process used auxiliary nodes called geometry "
"helper nodes. These nodes help preserve the pivots and transformations of the "
"original 3D model during import."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໃຊ້ໂນດເສີມທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ geometry helper "
"nodes. ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັກສາຈຸດໝູນ (pivots) ແລະ ການປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງ (transformations) ຂອງໂມເດວ "
"3D ຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid "Provides methods for file reading and writing operations."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເມທອດສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"This class can be used to permanently store data in the user device's file "
"system and to read from it. This is useful for storing game save data or "
"player configuration files.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] How to write and read from a file. The file named [code]"
"\"save_game.dat\"[/code] will be stored in the user data folder, as specified "
"in the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]Data paths[/url] "
"documentation:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func save_to_file(content):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE)\n"
"\tfile.store_string(content)\n"
"\n"
"func load_from_file():\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar content = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\treturn content\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void SaveToFile(string content)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\n"
"\tfile.StoreString(content);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public string LoadFromFile()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tstring content = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\treturn content;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"A [FileAccess] instance has its own file cursor, which is the position in "
"bytes in the file where the next read/write operation will occur. Functions "
"such as [method get_8], [method get_16], [method store_8], and [method "
"store_16] will move the file cursor forward by the number of bytes read/"
"written. The file cursor can be moved to a specific position using [method "
"seek] or [method seek_end], and its position can be retrieved using [method "
"get_position].\n"
"A [FileAccess] instance will close its file when the instance is freed. Since "
"it inherits [RefCounted], this happens automatically when it is no longer in "
"use. [method close] can be called to close it earlier. In C#, the reference "
"must be disposed manually, which can be done with the [code]using[/code] "
"statement or by calling the [code]Dispose[/code] method directly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To access project resources once exported, it is recommended to "
"use [ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess], as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats and their original source files might not be present "
"in the exported PCK package. If using [FileAccess], make sure the file is "
"included in the export by changing its import mode to [b]Keep File (exported "
"as is)[/b] in the Import dock, or, for files where this option is not "
"available, change the non-resource export filter in the Export dialog to "
"include the file's extension (e.g. [code]*.txt[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Files are automatically closed only if the process exits "
"\"normally\" (such as by clicking the window manager's close button or "
"pressing [kbd]Alt + F4[/kbd]). If you stop the project execution by pressing "
"[kbd]F8[/kbd] while the project is running, the file won't be closed as the "
"game process will be killed. You can work around this by calling [method "
"flush] at regular intervals."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຢ່າງຖາວອນໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງອຸປະກອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ເພື່ອອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກເກມ (save data) ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ຕົວຢ່າງ:[/b] ວິທີການຂຽນ ແລະ ອ່ານຈາກໄຟລ໌. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [code]\"save_game.dat\"[/code] "
"ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/"
"data_paths.html]ເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ມູນ (Data paths)[/url]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func save_to_file(content):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE)\n"
"\tfile.store_string(content)\n"
"\n"
"func load_from_file():\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar content = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\treturn content\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void SaveToFile(string content)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\n"
"\tfile.StoreString(content);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public string LoadFromFile()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tstring content = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\treturn content;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [FileAccess] ມີເຄີເຊີໄຟລ໌ (file cursor) ຂອງຕົນເອງ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງໃນຮູບແບບໄບຕ໌ "
"(bytes) ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ການດຳເນີນການອ່ານ/ຂຽນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ [method get_8], "
"[method get_16], [method store_8], ແລະ [method store_16] "
"ຈະຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີໄຟລ໌ໄປທາງໜ້າຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ອ່ານ/ຂຽນ. ເຄີເຊີໄຟລ໌ສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[method seek] ຫຼື [method seek_end], ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນສາມາດດຶງຄືນມາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"get_position].\n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [FileAccess] ຈະປິດໄຟລ໌ຂອງມັນເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກປ່ອຍ (freed). "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນສືບທອດມາຈາກ [RefCounted], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມັນບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method close] ເພື່ອປິດມັນກ່ອນກຳນົດໄດ້. ໃນ C#, "
"ການອ້າງອີງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳຈັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [code]using[/code] ຫຼື "
"ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]Dispose[/code] ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງອອກ (export) ແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[ResourceLoader] ແທນ [FileAccess], ເພາະໄຟລ໌ບາງຢ່າງຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຮູບແບບສະເພາະຂອງເອນຈິນ "
"ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກັດ PCK ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ຫາກໃຊ້ [FileAccess], "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກໂດຍການປ່ຽນໂໝດການນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ [b]Keep File (exported "
"as is)[/b] ໃນແຖບ Import, ຫຼື ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກນີ້, "
"ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຕົວຕອງການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ (non-resource export filter) ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ Export "
"ເພື່ອລວມນາມສະກຸນຂອງໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນເຂົ້າໄປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [code]*.txt[/code]).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສະເພາະເມື່ອໂປຣເຊສອອກຈາກການເຮັດງານແບບ "
"\"ປົກກະຕິ\" (ເຊັ່ນ: ການຄລິກປຸ່ມປິດຂອງຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ກົດ [kbd]Alt + F4[/kbd]). "
"ຫາກທ່ານຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍການກົດ [kbd]F8[/kbd] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂປຣເຈັກກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປິດເນື່ອງຈາກໂປຣເຊສຂອງເກມຈະຖືກຂ້າ (killed). ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method flush] ເປັນໄລຍະໆ."

msgid "Binary serialization API"
msgstr "API ການຈັດລຳດັບແບບບີນາຣີ (Binary serialization API)"

msgid ""
"Closes the currently opened file and prevents subsequent read/write "
"operations. Use [method flush] to persist the data to disk without closing "
"the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileAccess] will automatically close when it's freed, which "
"happens when it goes out of scope or when it gets assigned with [code]null[/"
"code]. In C# the reference must be disposed after we are done using it, this "
"can be done with the [code]using[/code] statement or calling the "
"[code]Dispose[/code] method directly."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນການອ່ານ/ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ. ໃຊ້ [method flush] "
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນດິສກ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປິດໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [FileAccess] ຈະປິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມັນຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (freed), "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມັນຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ (out of scope) ຫຼື ເມື່ອຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເປັນ [code]null[/code]. "
"ໃນ C# ຕ້ອງຈັດການ Dispose ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ງານສຳເລັດ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [code]using[/"
"code] ຫຼື ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]Dispose[/code] ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Creates a temporary file. This file will be freed when the returned "
"[FileAccess] is freed.\n"
"If [param prefix] is not empty, it will be prefixed to the file name, "
"separated by a [code]-[/code].\n"
"If [param extension] is not empty, it will be appended to the temporary file "
"name.\n"
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], the file is not deleted when the "
"returned [FileAccess] is freed.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເມື່ອ [FileAccess] ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າມາຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param prefix] ບໍ່ວ່າງ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທາງໜ້າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]-[/code].\n"
"ຖ້າ [param extension] ບໍ່ວ່າງ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທາງທ້າຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບເມື່ອ [FileAccess] "
"ຖືກຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າເປີດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file cursor has already read past the end of "
"the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]eof_reached() == false[/code] cannot be used to check "
"whether there is more data available. To loop while there is more data "
"available, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"while file.get_position() < file.get_length():\n"
"\t# Read data\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"while (file.GetPosition() < file.GetLength())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Read data\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ອ່ານກາຍຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ [code]eof_reached() == false[/code] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຍັງມີຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼືອຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ເພື່ອເຮັດວົງຈອນ (loop) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼືອຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"while file.get_position() < file.get_length():\n"
"\t# Read data\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"while (file.GetPosition() < file.GetLength())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Read data\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file exists in the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many resources types are imported (e.g. textures or sound "
"files), and their source asset will not be included in the exported game, as "
"only the imported version is used. See [method ResourceLoader.exists] for an "
"alternative approach that takes resource remapping into account.\n"
"For a non-static, relative equivalent, use [method DirAccess.file_exists]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າມີໄຟລ໌ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍປະເພດຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ: textures ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ສຽງ), ແລະ "
"ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນເກມທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ (exported game), "
"ເພາະຈະໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເວີຊັນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method ResourceLoader.exists] "
"ສຳລັບວິທີທາງເລືອກອື່ນທີ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການຈັບຄູ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່ (resource remapping).\n"
"ສຳລັບການກວດສອບແບບບໍ່ຄົງທີ່ (non-static) ແລະ ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງສຳພັນ (relative), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"DirAccess.file_exists]."

msgid ""
"Writes the file's buffer to disk. Flushing is automatically performed when "
"the file is closed. This means you don't need to call [method flush] manually "
"before closing a file. Still, calling [method flush] can be used to ensure "
"the data is safe even if the project crashes instead of being closed "
"gracefully.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only call [method flush] when you actually need it. Otherwise, "
"it will decrease performance due to constant disk writes."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນບັບເຟີຂອງໄຟລ໌ລົງໃນດິສກ໌. ການ Flush ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອປິດໄຟລ໌. "
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method flush] ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນປິດໄຟລ໌. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method flush] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຈະປອດໄພ ເຖິງວ່າໂປຣເຈັກຈະຂັດຂ້ອງ "
"(crash) ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method flush] ເມື່ອຈຳເປັນແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງເນື່ອງຈາກການຂຽນດິສກ໌ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 8 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 1 byte. See [method store_8] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 8 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 1 ໄບຕ໌ (byte). ເບິ່ງ "
"[method store_8] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ອ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 16 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 2 bytes. See [method store_16] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 16 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 2 ໄບຕ໌ (bytes). ເບິ່ງ "
"[method store_16] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ອ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 32 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 4 bytes. See [method store_32] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 32 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 4 ໄບຕ໌ (bytes). ເບິ່ງ "
"[method store_32] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ອ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 64 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 8 bytes. See [method store_64] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 64 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 8 ໄບຕ໌ (bytes). ເບິ່ງ "
"[method store_64] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ອ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the last time the [param file] was accessed in Unix timestamp format, "
"or [code]0[/code] on error. This Unix timestamp can be converted to another "
"format using the [Time] singleton."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເວລາລ່າສຸດທີ່ມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງ [param file] ໃນຮູບແບບ Unix timestamp, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] "
"ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. Unix timestamp ນີ້ສາມາດແປງເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [Time] singleton."

msgid ""
"Returns the whole file as a [String]. Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 "
"encoded. This ignores the file cursor and does not affect it."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດເປັນ [String]. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8. "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ມັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns next [param length] bytes of the file as a [PackedByteArray]. This "
"advances the file cursor by [param length] bytes."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [param length] ໄບຕ໌ຖັດໄປຂອງໄຟລ໌ເປັນ [PackedByteArray]. "
"ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປຕາມຈຳນວນ [param length] ໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns the next value of the file in CSV (Comma-Separated Values) format. "
"You can pass a different delimiter [param delim] to use other than the "
"default [code]\",\"[/code] (comma). This delimiter must be one-character "
"long, and cannot be a double quotation mark.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded. Text values must be enclosed in "
"double quotes if they include the delimiter character. Double quotes within a "
"text value can be escaped by doubling their occurrence. This advances the "
"file cursor to after the newline character at the end of the line.\n"
"For example, the following CSV lines are valid and will be properly parsed as "
"two strings each:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Alice,\"Hello, Bob!\"\n"
"Bob,Alice! What a surprise!\n"
"Alice,\"I thought you'd reply with \"\"Hello, world\"\".\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Note how the second line can omit the enclosing quotes as it does not include "
"the delimiter. However it [i]could[/i] very well use quotes, it was only "
"written without for demonstration purposes. The third line must use [code]"
"\"\"[/code] for each quotation mark that needs to be interpreted as such "
"instead of the end of a text value."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຖັດໄປຂອງໄຟລ໌ໃນຮູບແບບ CSV (Comma-Separated Values). ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວຂັ້ນ [param "
"delim] ອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]\",\"[/code] (ຈຸດ) ໄດ້. "
"ຕົວຂັ້ນນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວພຽງຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ ແລະ ຫ້າມເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມ (double quotation mark).\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນ UTF-8. ຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມຫາກມີຕົວອັກສອນຕົວຂັ້ນຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. "
"ເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມພາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃຊ້ escape ໄດ້ໂດຍການຂຽນຊ້ອນກັນສອງອັນ. "
"ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫຼັງຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍແຖວ.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ແຖວ CSV ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກແຍກເປັນສອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຕ່ລະແຖວ:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Alice,\"ສະບາຍດີ, Bob!\"\n"
"Bob,Alice! ເປັນຕາແປກໃຈຫຼາຍ!\n"
"Alice,\"ຂ້ອຍຄິດວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຕອບວ່າ \"\"ສະບາຍດີ, ຊາວໂລກ\"\".\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"ສັງເກດວ່າແຖວທີສອງສາມາດລະເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມໄດ້ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີຕົວຂັ້ນຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ແຖວທີສາມຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [code]\"\"[/code] ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 64 bits from the file as a floating-point number. This "
"advances the file cursor by 8 bytes."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 64 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point). ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ "
"8 ໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns the last error that happened when trying to perform operations. "
"Compare with the [code]ERR_FILE_*[/code] constants from [enum Error]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຂໍ້ຜິດພາດລ່າສຸດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມດຳເນີນການ. ສາມາດປຽບທຽບໄດ້ກັບຄ່າຄົງທີ່ "
"[code]ERR_FILE_*[/code] ຈາກ [enum Error]."

msgid ""
"Reads the file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a byte "
"array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attribute) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param attribute_name] ເປັນອາເຣໄບຕ໌ "
"(byte array).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະສູນຫາຍໄປຫາກໄຟລ໌ຖືກຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນລວມເອົາຄຳນຳໜ້າ namespace.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Reads the file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a UTF-8 "
"encoded string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attribute) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param attribute_name] "
"ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຈະສູນຫາຍໄປຫາກໄຟລ໌ຖືກຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of file extended attributes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attributes) ຂອງໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the whole [param path] file contents as a [PackedByteArray] without "
"any decoding.\n"
"Returns an empty [PackedByteArray] if an error occurred while opening the "
"file. You can use [method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເນື້ອໃນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌ [param path] ເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຖອດລະຫັດ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [PackedByteArray] ວ່າງ ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການເປີດໄຟລ໌. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method "
"get_open_error] ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the whole [param path] file contents as a [String]. Text is "
"interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded.\n"
"Returns an empty [String] if an error occurred while opening the file. You "
"can use [method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເນື້ອໃນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌ [param path] ເປັນ [String]. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ "
"UTF-8.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [String] ວ່າງ ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການເປີດໄຟລ໌. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 32 bits from the file as a floating-point number. This "
"advances the file cursor by 4 bytes."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ 32 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ. ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 4 ໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns the next 16 bits from the file as a half-precision floating-point "
"number. This advances the file cursor by 2 bytes."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ 16 ບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງ (half-precision). "
"ນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ເລື່ອນໄປ 2 ໄບຕ໌."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [b]hidden[/b] attribute is set on the file "
"at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [b]hidden[/b] (ເຊື່ອງ) "
"ໃຫ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, BSD, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of the file in bytes. For a pipe, returns the number of "
"bytes available for reading from the pipe."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ເປັນໄບຕ໌. ສຳລັບ pipe, ຈະຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ອ່ານຈາກ pipe ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the next line of the file as a [String]. The returned string doesn't "
"include newline ([code]\\n[/code]) or carriage return ([code]\\r[/code]) "
"characters, but does include any other leading or trailing whitespace. This "
"advances the file cursor to after the newline character at the end of the "
"line.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າແຖວຖັດໄປຂອງໄຟລ໌ເປັນ [String]. ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄືນມານັ້ນຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ([code]"
"\\n[/code]) ຫຼື carriage return ([code]\\r[/code]), ແຕ່ຈະລວມເອົາຊ່ອງວ່າງ "
"(whitespace) ທາງໜ້າ ຫຼື ທາງທ້າຍ. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫຼັງຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ຢູ່ທ້າຍແຖວ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8."

msgid ""
"Returns an MD5 String representing the file at the given path or an empty "
"[String] on failure."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ MD5 String ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ ຫຼື [String] ວ່າງ ຫາກຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the last time the [param file] was modified in Unix timestamp format, "
"or [code]0[/code] on error. This Unix timestamp can be converted to another "
"format using the [Time] singleton."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າເວລາລ່າສຸດທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂ [param file] ໃນຮູບແບບ Unix timestamp, ຫຼື [code]0[/code] "
"ຫາກຜິດພາດ. Unix timestamp ນີ້ສາມາດແປງເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [Time] singleton."

msgid ""
"Returns a [String] saved in Pascal format from the file, meaning that the "
"length of the string is explicitly stored at the start. See [method "
"store_pascal_string]. This may include newline characters. The file cursor is "
"advanced after the bytes read.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [String] ທີ່ບັນທຶກໃນຮູບແບບ Pascal ຈາກໄຟລ໌, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"store_pascal_string]. ນີ້ອາດຈະລວມເອົາຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່. "
"ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະເລື່ອນໄປຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ອ່ານໄບຕ໌ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8."

msgid "Returns the path as a [String] for the current open file."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ເປັນ [String] ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the absolute path as a [String] for the current open file."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງສຳບູນ (absolute path) ເປັນ [String] ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the file cursor's position in bytes from the beginning of the file. "
"This is the file reading/writing cursor set by [method seek] or [method "
"seek_end] and advanced by read/write operations."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ເປັນໄບຕ໌ ໂດຍນັບຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄີເຊີການອ່ານ/"
"ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍ [method seek] ຫຼື [method seek_end] ແລະ ເລື່ອນໄປຕາມການດຳເນີນການອ່ານ/"
"ຂຽນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [b]read only[/b] attribute is set on the "
"file at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [b]read only[/b] (ອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ) "
"ໃຫ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, BSD, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Returns the next bits from the file as a floating-point number. This advances "
"the file cursor by either 4 or 8 bytes, depending on the precision used by "
"the Godot build that saved the file.\n"
"If the file was saved by a Godot build compiled with the "
"[code]precision=single[/code] option (the default), the number of read bits "
"for that file is 32. Otherwise, if compiled with the [code]precision=double[/"
"code] option, the number of read bits is 64."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າບິດຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 4 ຫຼື 8 ໄບຕ໌, ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດ "
"(precision) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເວີຊັນຂອງ Godot ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ.\n"
"ຫາກໄຟລ໌ຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍ Godot ທີ່ຄອມພາຍດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [code]precision=single[/code] "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຈຳນວນບິດທີ່ຈະອ່ານແມ່ນ 32. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຫາກຄອມພາຍດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ "
"[code]precision=double[/code], ຈຳນວນບິດທີ່ຈະອ່ານແມ່ນ 64."

msgid ""
"Returns an SHA-256 [String] representing the file at the given path or an "
"empty [String] on failure."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ SHA-256 [String] ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ ຫຼື [String] ວ່າງ ຫາກຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of the file at the given path, in bytes, or [code]-1[/code] "
"on error."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນໄບຕ໌, ຫຼື [code]-1[/code] ຫາກຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the UNIX permissions of the file at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, Linux/BSD, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ UNIX (UNIX permissions) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, Linux/BSD, ແລະ macOS."

msgid ""
"Returns the next [Variant] value from the file. If [param allow_objects] is "
"[code]true[/code], decoding objects is allowed. This advances the file cursor "
"by the number of bytes read.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method, as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.html]Binary serialization API[/url] "
"documentation.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. Do "
"not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources to "
"avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ [Variant] ຖັດໄປຈາກໄຟລ໌. ຫາກ [param allow_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຖອດລະຫັດວັດຖຸ (objects) ໄດ້. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ອ່ານ.\n"
"ພາຍໃນຈະໃຊ້ກົນໄກການຖອດລະຫັດດຽວກັບເມທອດ [method @GlobalScope.bytes_to_var], "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/"
"binary_serialization_api.html]Binary serialization API[/url].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກ Deserialized ອາດມີໂຄ້ດທີ່ສາມາດຖືກສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. "
"ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກວັດຖຸທີ່ຖືກຈັດລຽງລຳດັບນັ້ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງໄພຄຸກຄາມຄວາມປອດໄພ "
"ເຊັ່ນການສັ່ງລັນໂຄ້ດຈາກໄລຍະໄກ (remote code execution)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the file is currently opened."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກໄຟລ໌ເປີດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens the file for writing or reading, "
"depending on the flags.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [FileAccess] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເປີດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຂຽນ ຫຼື ອ່ານ, ຂຶ້ນກັບແຟຼັກ (flags) ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຫາກເປີດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens a compressed file for reading or "
"writing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method open_compressed] can only read files that were saved by "
"Godot, not third-party compression formats. See [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/issues/28999]GitHub issue #28999[/url] for a workaround.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [FileAccess] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເປີດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດເພື່ອອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method open_compressed] ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບັນທຶກໂດຍ Godot "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບການບີບອັດຈາກພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຫາກເປີດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens an encrypted file in write or "
"read mode. You need to pass a binary key to encrypt/decrypt it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The provided key must be 32 bytes long.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [FileAccess] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເປີດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນໂໝດຂຽນ ຫຼື ອ່ານ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄີບີນາຣີ "
"(binary key) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດ/ຖອດລະຫັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄີທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວ 32 ໄບຕ໌.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຫາກເປີດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens an encrypted file in write or "
"read mode. You need to pass a password to encrypt/decrypt it.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງວັດຖຸ [FileAccess] ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເປີດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນໂໝດຂຽນ ຫຼື ອ່ານ. "
"ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສົ່ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ (password) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດ/ຖອດລະຫັດ.\n"
"ຄືນຄ່າ [code]null[/code] ຫາກເປີດໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [method get_open_error] "
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Removes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attribute) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param attribute_name].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Resizes the file to a specified length. The file must be open in a mode that "
"permits writing. If the file is extended, NUL characters are appended. If the "
"file is truncated, all data from the end file to the original length of the "
"file is lost."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດ. ໄຟລ໌ຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃນໂໝດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂຽນໄດ້. "
"ຫາກໄຟລ໌ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກ, ຕົວອັກສອນ NUL ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທາງທ້າຍ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ສັ້ນລົງ, "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດຈາກຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດໃໝ່ໄປຫາຄວາມຍາວເດີມຈະສູນຫາຍໄປ."

msgid ""
"Sets the file cursor to the specified position in bytes, from the beginning "
"of the file. This changes the value returned by [method get_position]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນໄບຕ໌, ໂດຍນັບຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າທີ່ຄືນມາຈາກ "
"[method get_position]."

msgid ""
"Sets the file cursor to the specified position in bytes, from the end of the "
"file. This changes the value returned by [method get_position].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an offset, so you should use negative numbers otherwise "
"the file cursor will move past the end of the file."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນໄບຕ໌, ໂດຍນັບຈາກຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າທີ່ຄືນມາຈາກ "
"[method get_position].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າອັອບເຊັດ (offset), ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ຕົວເລກລົບ "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຄີເຊີຈະເລື່ອນກາຍຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Writes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a byte "
"array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attribute) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param attribute_name] ເປັນອາເຣໄບຕ໌ "
"(byte array).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Writes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a UTF-8 "
"encoded string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ (extended attribute) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ [param attribute_name] "
"ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ Linux, macOS, ແລະ Windows.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Linux, ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ namespace \"user\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນ Windows, ຈະໃຊ້ alternate data streams ເພື່ອເກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Sets file [b]hidden[/b] attribute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [b]hidden[/b] (ເຊື່ອງ) ໃຫ້ກັບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, BSD, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets file [b]read only[/b] attribute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [b]read only[/b] (ອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ) ໃຫ້ກັບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, BSD, macOS, ແລະ Windows."

msgid ""
"Sets file UNIX permissions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, Linux/BSD, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ UNIX (UNIX permissions) ໃຫ້ກັບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຮອງຮັບໃນ iOS, Linux/BSD, ແລະ macOS."

msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 8 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 1 "
"byte. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 255][/"
"code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64], or convert it manually (see "
"[method store_16] for an example)."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນເປັນ 8 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 1 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param value] ຄວນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, 255][/code]. ຄ່າອື່ນໆຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ "
"overflow ແລະ ວົນຄືນໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (signed integer), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method store_64] ຫຼື "
"ແປງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ເບິ່ງ [method store_16] ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ)."

msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 16 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 2 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 2^16 - 1]"
"[/code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64] or store a signed integer "
"from the interval [code][-2^15, 2^15 - 1][/code] (i.e. keeping one bit for "
"the signedness) and compute its sign manually when reading. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MAX_15B = 1 << 15\n"
"const MAX_16B = 1 << 16\n"
"\n"
"func unsigned16_to_signed(unsigned):\n"
"\treturn (unsigned + MAX_15B) % MAX_16B - MAX_15B\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar f = FileAccess.open(\"user://file.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE_READ)\n"
"\tf.store_16(-42) # This wraps around and stores 65494 (2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.store_16(121) # In bounds, will store 121.\n"
"\tf.seek(0) # Go back to start to read the stored value.\n"
"\tvar read1 = f.get_16() # 65494\n"
"\tvar read2 = f.get_16() # 121\n"
"\tvar converted1 = unsigned16_to_signed(read1) # -42\n"
"\tvar converted2 = unsigned16_to_signed(read2) # 121\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var f = FileAccess.Open(\"user://file.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.WriteRead);\n"
"\tf.Store16(unchecked((ushort)-42)); // This wraps around and stores 65494 "
"(2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.Store16(121); // In bounds, will store 121.\n"
"\tf.Seek(0); // Go back to start to read the stored value.\n"
"\tushort read1 = f.Get16(); // 65494\n"
"\tushort read2 = f.Get16(); // 121\n"
"\tshort converted1 = (short)read1; // -42\n"
"\tshort converted2 = (short)read2; // 121\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນເປັນ 16 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 2 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param value] ຄວນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, 2^16 - 1][/code]. "
"ຄ່າອື່ນໆຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ overflow.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method store_64] ຫຼື ບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈາກຊ່ວງ "
"[code][-2^15, 2^15 - 1][/code] ແລະ ຄິດໄລ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນເວລາອ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MAX_15B = 1 << 15\n"
"const MAX_16B = 1 << 16\n"
"\n"
"func unsigned16_to_signed(unsigned):\n"
"\treturn (unsigned + MAX_15B) % MAX_16B - MAX_15B\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar f = FileAccess.open(\"user://file.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE_READ)\n"
"\tf.store_16(-42) # ນີ້ຈະວົນຄືນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນ 65494 (2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.store_16(121) # ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດ, ຈະບັນທຶກເປັນ 121.\n"
"\tf.seek(0) # ກັບໄປຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້.\n"
"\tvar read1 = f.get_16() # 65494\n"
"\tvar read2 = f.get_16() # 121\n"
"\tvar converted1 = unsigned16_to_signed(read1) # -42\n"
"\tvar converted2 = unsigned16_to_signed(read2) # 121\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var f = FileAccess.Open(\"user://file.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.WriteRead);\n"
"\tf.Store16(unchecked((ushort)-42)); // ນີ້ຈະວົນຄືນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນ 65494 (2^16 - "
"42).\n"
"\tf.Store16(121); // ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດ, ຈະບັນທຶກເປັນ 121.\n"
"\tf.Seek(0); // ກັບໄປຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອອ່ານຄ່າທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້.\n"
"\tushort read1 = f.Get16(); // 65494\n"
"\tushort read2 = f.Get16(); // 121\n"
"\tshort converted1 = (short)read1; // -42\n"
"\tshort converted2 = (short)read2; // 121\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 32 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 4 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 2^32 - 1]"
"[/code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64], or convert it manually (see "
"[method store_16] for an example)."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນເປັນ 32 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 4 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param value] ຄວນຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][0, 2^32 - 1][/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method store_64] ຫຼື ແປງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 64 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 8 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] must lie in the interval [code][-2^63, 2^63 - "
"1][/code] (i.e. be a valid [int] value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກຖ້ວນເປັນ 64 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 8 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] "
"ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param value] ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code][-2^63, 2^63 - 1][/code] (ຄືເປັນຄ່າ "
"[int] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores the given array of bytes in the file. This advances the file cursor by "
"the number of bytes written. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກອາເຣຂອງໄບຕ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຂຽນ. ຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores the given [PackedStringArray] in the file as a line formatted in the "
"CSV (Comma-Separated Values) format. You can pass a different delimiter "
"[param delim] to use other than the default [code]\",\"[/code] (comma). This "
"delimiter must be one-character long.\n"
"Text will be encoded as UTF-8. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກ [PackedStringArray] ທີ່ກຳນົດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ເປັນແຖວໃນຮູບແບບ CSV (Comma-Separated "
"Values). ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວຂັ້ນ [param delim] ອື່ນນອກຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [code]\",\"[/code] "
"ໄດ້. ຕົວຂັ້ນນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວພຽງຕົວອັກສອນດຽວ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ UTF-8. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number as 64 bits in the file. This advances the file "
"cursor by 8 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມເປັນ 64 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 8 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number as 32 bits in the file. This advances the file "
"cursor by 4 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມເປັນ 32 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 4 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores a half-precision floating-point number as 16 bits in the file. This "
"advances the file cursor by 2 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the "
"operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງເປັນ 16 ບິດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 2 ໄບຕ໌. ຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores [param line] in the file followed by a newline character ([code]\\n[/"
"code]), encoding the text as UTF-8. This advances the file cursor by the "
"length of the line, after the newline character. The amount of bytes written "
"depends on the UTF-8 encoded bytes, which may be different from [method "
"String.length] which counts the number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກ [param line] ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ ຕາມດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ([code]\\n[/code]), "
"ໂດຍເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ UTF-8. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຖວ "
"ລວມທັງຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່. ຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຂຽນຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/"
"code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores the given [String] as a line in the file in Pascal format (i.e. also "
"store the length of the string). Text will be encoded as UTF-8. This advances "
"the file cursor by the number of bytes written depending on the UTF-8 encoded "
"bytes, which may be different from [method String.length] which counts the "
"number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກ [String] ທີ່ກຳນົດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໃນຮູບແບບ Pascal (ຄືບັນທຶກຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປນຳ). "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ UTF-8. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຂຽນ. ຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number in the file. This advances the file cursor by "
"either 4 or 8 bytes, depending on the precision used by the current Godot "
"build.\n"
"If using a Godot build compiled with the [code]precision=single[/code] option "
"(the default), this method will save a 32-bit float. Otherwise, if compiled "
"with the [code]precision=double[/code] option, this will save a 64-bit float. "
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປ 4 ຫຼື 8 ໄບຕ໌, ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເວີຊັນ "
"Godot ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"ຫາກໃຊ້ Godot ທີ່ຄອມພາຍດ້ວຍ [code]precision=single[/code], ຈະບັນທຶກເປັນ 32-bit float. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຫາກໃຊ້ [code]precision=double[/code], ຈະບັນທຶກເປັນ 64-bit float. ຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores [param string] in the file without a newline character ([code]\\n[/"
"code]), encoding the text as UTF-8. This advances the file cursor by the "
"length of the string in UTF-8 encoded bytes, which may be different from "
"[method String.length] which counts the number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used to write text files. The "
"string is stored as a UTF-8 encoded buffer without string length or "
"terminating zero, which means that it can't be loaded back easily. If you "
"want to store a retrievable string in a binary file, consider using [method "
"store_pascal_string] instead. For retrieving strings from a text file, you "
"can use [code]get_buffer(length).get_string_from_utf8()[/code] (if you know "
"the length) or [method get_as_text].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກ [param string] ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ([code]\\n[/code]), "
"ໂດຍເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ UTF-8. ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ UTF-8. ຄືນຄ່າ "
"[code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບຂຽນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເກັບເປັນບັບເຟີ UTF-8 "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການບອກຄວາມຍາວ ຫຼື ສູນປິດທ້າຍ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນອາດຈະໂຫຼດກັບຄືນມາໄດ້ຍາກ. "
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂຫຼດຄືນໄດ້ງ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method store_pascal_string] "
"ແທນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"Stores any Variant value in the file. If [param full_objects] is [code]true[/"
"code], encoding objects is allowed (and can potentially include code). This "
"advances the file cursor by the number of bytes written. Returns [code]true[/"
"code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method, as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.html]Binary serialization API[/url] "
"documentation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not all properties are included. Only properties that are "
"configured with the [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] flag set will be "
"serialized. You can add a new usage flag to a property by overriding the "
"[method Object._get_property_list] method in your class. You can also check "
"how property usage is configured by calling [method "
"Object._get_property_list]. See [enum PropertyUsageFlags] for the possible "
"usage flags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກຄ່າ Variant ໃດໆລົງໃນໄຟລ໌. ຫາກ [param full_objects] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດວັດຖຸໄດ້ (ແລະ ອາດລວມເຖິງໂຄ້ດ). "
"ນີ້ຈະເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄປຕາມຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຂຽນ. ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດ.\n"
"ພາຍໃນຈະໃຊ້ກົນໄກດຽວກັບເມທອດ [method @GlobalScope.var_to_bytes].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດ (properties) ທີ່ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ. ສະເພາະຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕັ້ງແຟຼັກ "
"[constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] ໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງລຳດັບ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແຟຼັກການໃຊ້ງານໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການ override ເມທອດ [method "
"Object._get_property_list].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ຄ່າຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີໃນໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the file is read with big-endian [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endianness]endianness[/url]. If [code]false[/code], the "
"file is read with little-endian endianness. If in doubt, leave this to "
"[code]false[/code] as most files are written with little-endian endianness.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is always reset to system endianness, which is little-"
"endian on all supported platforms, whenever you open the file. Therefore, you "
"must set [member big_endian] [i]after[/i] opening the file, not before."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກອ່ານດ້ວຍລຳດັບໄບຕ໌ແບບ big-endian. ຫາກເປັນ "
"[code]false[/code], ຈະອ່ານແບບ little-endian. ຫາກບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]false[/"
"code] ເພາະໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຖືກຂຽນດ້ວຍ little-endian.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄືນເປັນ endianness ຂອງລະບົບ (ເຊິ່ງເປັນ little-endian "
"ໃນທຸກແພລັດຟອມທີ່ຮອງຮັບ) ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເປີດໄຟລ໌. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member big_endian] "
"[i]ຫຼັງຈາກ[/i] ເປີດໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Opens the file for read operations. The file cursor is positioned at the "
"beginning of the file."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ. ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Opens the file for write operations. If the file exists, it is truncated to "
"zero length and its contents are cleared. Otherwise, it is created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating a file it must be in an already existing "
"directory. To recursively create directories for a file path, see [method "
"DirAccess.make_dir_recursive]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວເປັນສູນ ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌, ມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແບບຊ້ອນກັນ, ເບິ່ງ "
"[method DirAccess.make_dir_recursive]."

msgid ""
"Opens the file for read and write operations. Does not truncate the file. The "
"file cursor is positioned at the beginning of the file."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອທັງອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັດເນື້ອໃນໄຟລ໌. ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Opens the file for read and write operations. If the file exists, it is "
"truncated to zero length and its contents are cleared. Otherwise, it is "
"created. The file cursor is positioned at the beginning of the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating a file it must be in an already existing "
"directory. To recursively create directories for a file path, see [method "
"DirAccess.make_dir_recursive]."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອທັງອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍາວເປັນສູນ ແລະ "
"ເນື້ອໃນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່. ເຄີເຊີຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌, ມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Uses the [url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url] compression method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url]."

msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE]DEFLATE[/url] compression "
"method."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE]DEFLATE[/url]."

msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url] compression "
"method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url]."

msgid "Uses the [url=https://www.gzip.org/]gzip[/url] compression method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [url=https://www.gzip.org/]gzip[/url]."

msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://github.com/google/brotli]brotli[/url] compression "
"method (only decompression is supported)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ວິທີການບີບອັດແບບ [url=https://github.com/google/brotli]brotli[/url] "
"(ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການຖອດການບີບອັດ)."

msgid "Read for owner bit."
msgstr "ບິດອ່ານສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງ (Read for owner bit)."

msgid "Write for owner bit."
msgstr "ບິດຂຽນສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງ (Write for owner bit)."

msgid "Execute for owner bit."
msgstr "ບິດປະຕິບັດການສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງ (Execute for owner bit)."

msgid "Read for group bit."
msgstr "ບິດອ່ານສຳລັບກຸ່ມ (Read for group bit)."

msgid "Write for group bit."
msgstr "ບິດຂຽນສຳລັບກຸ່ມ (Write for group bit)."

msgid "Execute for group bit."
msgstr "ບິດປະຕິບັດການສຳລັບກຸ່ມ (Execute for group bit)."

msgid "Read for other bit."
msgstr "ບິດອ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ອື່ນ (Read for other bit)."

msgid "Write for other bit."
msgstr "ບິດຂຽນສຳລັບຜູ້ອື່ນ (Write for other bit)."

msgid "Execute for other bit."
msgstr "ບິດປະຕິບັດການສຳລັບຜູ້ອື່ນ (Execute for other bit)."

msgid "Set user id on execution bit."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ user id ໃນບິດການປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid "Set group id on execution bit."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ group id ໃນບິດການປະຕິບັດການ."

msgid "Restricted deletion (sticky) bit."
msgstr "ບິດການລຶບແບບຈຳກັດ (sticky bit)."

msgid "A dialog for selecting files or directories in the filesystem."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສຳລັບເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"[FileDialog] is a preset dialog used to choose files and directories in the "
"filesystem. It supports filter masks. [FileDialog] automatically sets its "
"window title according to the [member file_mode]. If you want to use a custom "
"title, disable this by setting [member mode_overrides_title] to [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call "
"one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""
"[FileDialog] ແມ່ນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສຳເລັດຮູບທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌. "
"ມັນຮອງຮັບການກັ່ນຕອງ (filter masks). [FileDialog] ຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ໜ້າຕ່າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມ [member "
"file_mode]. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານນີ້ໂດຍຕັ້ງ [member "
"mode_overrides_title] ເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [FileDialog] ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງອອກມາ, "
"ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ [code]popup_*[/code] ຈາກ [Window] ເຊັ່ນ [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped]."

msgid ""
"Adds a comma-separated file extension [param filter] and comma-separated MIME "
"type [param mime_type] option to the [FileDialog] with an optional [param "
"description], which restricts what files can be picked.\n"
"A [param filter] should be of the form [code]\"filename.extension\"[/code], "
"where filename and extension can be [code]*[/code] to match any string. "
"Filters starting with [code].[/code] (i.e. empty filenames) are not allowed.\n"
"For example, a [param filter] of [code]\"*.png, *.jpg\"[/code], a [param "
"mime_type] of [code]image/png, image/jpeg[/code], and a [param description] "
"of [code]\"Images\"[/code] results in filter text \"Images (*.png, *.jpg)\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only file "
"extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support MIME "
"types."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການກັ່ນຕອງນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ [param filter] ແລະ ປະເພດ MIME [param mime_type] "
"ໃຫ້ກັບ [FileDialog] ພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍ [param description] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍຈຳກັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້.\n"
"[param filter] ຄວນຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ [code]\"filename.extension\"[/code]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຕັ້ງ "
"[param filter] ເປັນ [code]\"*.png, *.jpg\"[/code] ແລະ [param description] ເປັນ "
"[code]\"Images\"[/code] ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Images (*.png, *.jpg)\".\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌ໃນ Windows ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Android, "
"Linux, ແລະ macOS ຮອງຮັບປະເພດ MIME ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Adds an additional [OptionButton] to the file dialog. If [param values] is "
"empty, a [CheckBox] is added instead.\n"
"[param default_value_index] should be an index of the value in the [param "
"values]. If [param values] is empty it should be either [code]1[/code] "
"(checked), or [code]0[/code] (unchecked)."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [OptionButton] ເສີມເຂົ້າໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌. ຫາກ [param values] ວ່າງ, ຈະມີການເພີ່ມ "
"[CheckBox] ແທນ.\n"
"[param default_value_index] ຄວນເປັນລຳດັບ (index) ຂອງຄ່າໃນ [param values]. ຫາກ "
"[param values] ວ່າງ, ມັນຄວນຈະເປັນ [code]1[/code] (ເລືອກ) ຫຼື [code]0[/code] (ບໍ່ເລືອກ)."

msgid "Clear the filter for file names."
msgstr "ລ້າງຕົວອັກສອນກັ່ນຕອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Clear all the added filters in the dialog."
msgstr "ລ້າງຕົວກັ່ນຕອງທັງໝົດທີ່ເພີ່ມໄວ້ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid "Clear all currently selected items in the dialog."
msgstr "ລ້າງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກທັງໝົດໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of favorite directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to store the list of favorites between project sessions. This "
"method can be called only from the main thread."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ (favorites), ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທຸກໆໂນດ [FileDialog]. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເກັບລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບລະຫວ່າງການໃຊ້ງານໂປຣເຈັກ. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກ main "
"thread ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the LineEdit for the selected file.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ LineEdit ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດພາຍໃນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ການລຶບ ຫຼື ຄືນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຂັດຂ້ອງ. "
"ຫາກຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງມັນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.visible] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the default value index of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with "
"index [param option]."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລຳດັບ (index) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [OptionButton] ຫຼື [CheckBox] ຕາມລຳດັບຕົວເລືອກ [param "
"option]."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index [param "
"option]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຊື່ຂອງ [OptionButton] ຫຼື [CheckBox] ຕາມລຳດັບຕົວເລືອກ [param option]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of values of the [OptionButton] with index [param option]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າອາເຣຂອງ [OptionButton] ຕາມລຳດັບຕົວເລືອກ [param option]."

msgid ""
"Returns the list of recent directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to store the list of recents between project sessions. This "
"method can be called only from the main thread."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ລ່າສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທຸກໂນດ [FileDialog]. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກ main thread ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] with the selected values of the additional "
"[OptionButton]s and/or [CheckBox]es. [Dictionary] keys are names and values "
"are selected value indices."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [Dictionary] ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຈາກ [OptionButton] ແລະ [CheckBox] ເສີມ."

msgid ""
"Returns the vertical box container of the dialog, custom controls can be "
"added to it.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it may "
"cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this node are ignored by native file dialogs, use "
"[method add_option] to add custom elements to the dialog instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄືນຄ່າ vertical box container ຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວຄວບຄຸມກຳນົດເອງໃສ່ໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂນດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌ຂອງລະບົບ (native file "
"dialogs), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method add_option] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Invalidates and updates this dialog's content list.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does nothing on native file dialogs."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການເນື້ອໃນຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ໝົດອາຍຸ ແລະ ອັບເດດໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ native file dialogs."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param flag] is enabled."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [param flag] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Shows the [FileDialog] using the default size and position for file dialogs, "
"and selects the file name if there is a current file."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ [FileDialog] ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ເລືອກຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຫາກມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the specified customization [param flag], allowing to customize the "
"features available in this [FileDialog]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param flag] ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຟີເຈີທີ່ມີໃນ [FileDialog] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Sets the list of favorite directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to restore the list of favorites saved with [method "
"get_favorite_list]. This method can be called only from the main thread.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] will update its internal [ItemList] of favorites "
"when its visibility changes. Be sure to call this method earlier if you want "
"your changes to have effect."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຈາກ main thread ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [FileDialog] ຈະອັບເດດລາຍການພາຍໃນເມື່ອການສະແດງຜົນປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback used by the [FileDialog] nodes to get a file icon, when "
"[constant DISPLAY_LIST] mode is used. The callback should take a single "
"[String] argument (file path), and return a [Texture2D]. If an invalid "
"texture is returned, the [theme_item file] icon will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ callback ເພື່ອດຶງໄອຄອນໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant DISPLAY_LIST]. Callback "
"ຄວນຮັບຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າ [Texture2D]."

msgid ""
"Sets the callback used by the [FileDialog] nodes to get a file icon, when "
"[constant DISPLAY_THUMBNAILS] mode is used. The callback should take a single "
"[String] argument (file path), and return a [Texture2D]. If an invalid "
"texture is returned, the [theme_item file_thumbnail] icon will be used "
"instead.\n"
"Thumbnails are usually more complex and may take a while to load. To avoid "
"stalling the application, you can use [ImageTexture] to asynchronously create "
"the thumbnail.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tFileDialog.set_get_thumbnail_callback(thumbnail_method)\n"
"\n"
"func thumbnail_method(path):\n"
"\tvar image_texture = ImageTexture.new()\n"
"\tmake_thumbnail_async(path, image_texture)\n"
"\treturn image_texture\n"
"\n"
"func make_thumbnail_async(path, image_texture):\n"
"\tvar thumbnail_texture = await generate_thumbnail(path) # Some method that "
"generates a thumbnail.\n"
"\timage_texture.set_image(thumbnail_texture.get_image())\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ callback ເພື່ອດຶງໄອຄອນໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ [constant DISPLAY_THUMBNAILS]."

msgid ""
"Sets the default value index of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index "
"[param option]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [OptionButton] ຫຼື [CheckBox] ຕາມລຳດັບ [param option]."

msgid ""
"Sets the name of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index [param option]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ຂອງ [OptionButton] ຫຼື [CheckBox] ຕາມລຳດັບ [param option]."

msgid "Sets the option values of the [OptionButton] with index [param option]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກຂອງ [OptionButton] ຕາມລຳດັບ [param option]."

msgid ""
"Sets the list of recent directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to restore the list of recents saved with [method "
"set_recent_list]. This method can be called only from the main thread.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] will update its internal [ItemList] of recent "
"directories when its visibility changes. Be sure to call this method earlier "
"if you want your changes to have effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ລ່າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"The file system access scope.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] In Web builds, FileDialog cannot access the host file system. "
"In sandboxed Linux and macOS environments, [member use_native_dialog] is "
"automatically used to allow limited access to host file system."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ໃນເວີຊັນ Web, FileDialog ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຮສໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The current working directory of the file dialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For native file dialogs, this property is only treated as a hint "
"and may not be respected by specific OS implementations."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການເຮັດວຽກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບ native file dialogs, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປັນພຽງຄຳແນະນຳ (hint) ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບາງ OS."

msgid "The currently selected file of the file dialog."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "The currently selected file path of the file dialog."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the context menu will show the \"Delete\" option, which "
"allows moving files and folders to trash."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມນູຄລິກຂວາຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກ \"Delete\" (ລຶບ), "
"ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີລົງຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ."

msgid "Display mode of the dialog's file list."
msgstr "ໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງລາຍການໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle favorite button and favorite list on "
"the left side of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເປີດປິດລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ ແລະ "
"ລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle file filter button."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເປີດປິດການກັ່ນຕອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid "The dialog's open or save mode, which affects the selection behavior."
msgstr "ໂໝດການເປີດ ຫຼື ບັນທຶກຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນຕໍ່ພຶດຕິກຳການເລືອກ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the file sorting options button."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມຕົວເລືອກການຈັດລຽງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The filter for file names (case-insensitive). When set to a non-empty string, "
"only files that contains the substring will be shown. [member "
"filename_filter] can be edited by the user with the filter button at the top "
"of the file dialog.\n"
"See also [member filters], which should be used to restrict the file types "
"that can be selected instead of [member filename_filter] which is meant to be "
"set by the user."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊອກຫາຊື່ໄຟລ໌ (ບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່). ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The available file type filters. Each filter string in the array should be "
"formatted like this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/"
"jpeg[/code]. The description text of the filter is optional and can be "
"omitted. Both file extensions and MIME type should be always set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only file "
"extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support MIME "
"types."
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງປະເພດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the button for creating new directories (when "
"using [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_DIR], [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY], or "
"[constant FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE]), and the context menu will have the \"New "
"Folder...\" option."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມສຳລັບສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃໝ່."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle hidden files button."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເປີດປິດການສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the layout switch buttons (list/thumbnails)."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມປ່ຽນຮູບແບບການສະແດງຜົນ (ລາຍການ/ຮູບຫຍໍ້)."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], changing the [member file_mode] property will set the "
"window title accordingly (e.g. setting [member file_mode] to [constant "
"FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILE] will change the window title to \"Open a File\")."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການປ່ຽນ [member file_mode] ຈະປ່ຽນຊື່ໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ."

msgid "The number of additional [OptionButton]s and [CheckBox]es in the dialog."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງ [OptionButton] ແລະ [CheckBox] ເສີມໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid ""
"The default value for the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກຕາມ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The name of the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຕົວເລືອກຕາມ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"The list of values for the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr "ລາຍການຄ່າສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກຕາມ [code]index[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [FileDialog] will warn the user before overwriting "
"files in save mode."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [FileDialog] ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ໃນໂໝດບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the recent directories list on the left side of "
"the dialog."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ລ່າສຸດຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ."

msgid ""
"If non-empty, the given sub-folder will be \"root\" of this [FileDialog], "
"i.e. user won't be able to go to its parent directory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored by native file dialogs."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ວ່າງ, ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ລະບຸຈະເປັນ \"root\" ຂອງ [FileDialog] ນີ້, "
"ຄືຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອອກໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອກວ່າມັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dialog will show hidden files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored by native file dialogs on Android and "
"Linux."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຈະສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and if supported by the current [DisplayServer], OS "
"native dialog will be used instead of custom one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, it is only supported when using [constant "
"ACCESS_FILESYSTEM]. For access mode [constant ACCESS_RESOURCES] and [constant "
"ACCESS_USERDATA], the system will fall back to custom FileDialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux and macOS, sandboxed apps always use native dialogs to "
"access the host file system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native dialogs are isolated from the base process, file dialog "
"properties can't be modified once the dialog is shown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored in [EditorFileDialog]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງລະບົບ (OS native dialog) "
"ແທນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Emitted when the user selects a directory."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the user selects a file by double-clicking it or pressing the "
"[b]OK[/b] button."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໂດຍການດັບເບິນຄລິກ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ [b]OK[/b]."

msgid "Emitted when the filter for file names changes."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Emitted when the user selects multiple files."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌."

msgid "The dialog allows selecting one, and only one file."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ພຽງໄຟລ໌ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The dialog allows selecting multiple files."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The dialog only allows selecting a directory, disallowing the selection of "
"any file."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "The dialog allows selecting one file or directory."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກໄດ້ທັງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "The dialog will warn when a file exists."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The dialog only allows accessing files under the [Resource] path ([code]res://"
"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃຕ້ເສັ້ນທາງ [Resource] ([code]res://[/code])."

msgid ""
"The dialog only allows accessing files under user data path ([code]user://[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃຕ້ເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ ([code]user://[/code])."

msgid "The dialog allows accessing files on the whole file system."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ໃນທົ່ວລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The dialog displays files as a grid of thumbnails. Use [theme_item "
"thumbnail_size] to adjust their size."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສະແດງໄຟລ໌ເປັນຕາຕະລາງຮູບຫຍໍ້."

msgid "The dialog displays files as a list of filenames."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບສະແດງໄຟລ໌ເປັນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Toggles visibility of the favorite button, and the favorite list on the left "
"side of the dialog.\n"
"Equivalent to [member hidden_files_toggle_enabled]."
msgstr "ເປີດປິດການສະແດງປຸ່ມ ແລະ ລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the button for creating new directories (when using "
"[constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_DIR], [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY], or [constant "
"FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE]).\n"
"Equivalent to [member folder_creation_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມສຳລັບສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the toggle file filter button.\n"
"Equivalent to [member file_filter_toggle_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເປີດປິດການກັ່ນຕອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the file sorting options button.\n"
"Equivalent to [member file_sort_options_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມຕົວເລືອກການຈັດລຽງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the toggle favorite button and favorite list on the left "
"side of the dialog.\n"
"Equivalent to [member favorites_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the recent directories list on the left side of the "
"dialog.\n"
"Equivalent to [member recent_list_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ລ່າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the layout switch buttons (list/thumbnails).\n"
"Equivalent to [member layout_toggle_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມປ່ຽນຮູບແບບການສະແດງຜົນ."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the [FileDialog] will warn the user before overwriting files in "
"save mode.\n"
"Equivalent to [member overwrite_warning_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ອນການຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"If enabled, the context menu will show the \"Delete\" option, which allows "
"moving files and folders to trash.\n"
"Equivalent to [member deleting_enabled]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ເມນູຄລິກຂວາຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກ \"ລຶບ\"."

msgid ""
"The color tint for disabled files (when the [FileDialog] is used in open "
"folder mode)."
msgstr "ສີສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The color modulation applied to the file icon."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບໄອຄອນໄຟລ໌."

msgid "The color modulation applied to the folder icon."
msgstr "ສີທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບໄອຄອນໂຟນເດີ."

msgid ""
"The size of thumbnail icons when [constant DISPLAY_THUMBNAILS] is enabled."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຫຍໍ້ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [constant DISPLAY_THUMBNAILS]."

msgid "Custom icon for the back arrow."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບລູກສອນກັບຄືນ."

msgid "Custom icon for the create folder button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມສ້າງໂຟນເດີ."

msgid "Custom icon for favorite folder button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມໂຟນເດີທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບ."

msgid "Custom icon for button to move down a favorite entry."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມຍ້າຍລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບລົງ."

msgid "Custom icon for button to move up a favorite entry."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມຍ້າຍລາຍການທີ່ຊື່ນຊອບຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Custom icon for files."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Icon for files when in thumbnail mode."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດຮູບຫຍໍ້."

msgid "Custom icon for folders."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ."

msgid "Icon for folders when in thumbnail mode."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບໂຟນເດີເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໂໝດຮູບຫຍໍ້."

msgid "Custom icon for the forward arrow."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບລູກສອນໄປທາງໜ້າ."

msgid "Icon for the button that enables list mode."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດລາຍການ."

msgid "Icon for the \"Copy Path\" context menu option."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"Copy Path\" ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid "Icon for the \"Delete\" context menu option."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"ລຶບ\" ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Icon for the \"New Folder...\" context menu option. Usually it should be the "
"same as [theme_item create_folder]; leave it empty if you want the context "
"menu to show no icons."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"ໂຟນເດີໃໝ່...\" ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Icon for the \"Show Package Contents\" context menu option. The option only "
"appears for macOS bundles."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"Show Package Contents\" (ສະເພາະ macOS)."

msgid ""
"Icon for the \"Refresh\" context menu option. Usually it should be the same "
"as [theme_item reload]; leave it empty if you want the context menu to show "
"no icons."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"Refresh\" ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

msgid "Icon for the \"Show in File Manager\" context menu option."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກ \"ສະແດງໃນ File Manager\"."

msgid "Custom icon for the parent folder arrow."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບລູກສອນໄປຫາໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ (parent folder)."

msgid "Custom icon for the reload button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມໂຫຼດໃໝ່ (reload)."

msgid "Custom icon for the sorting options menu."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບເມນູຕົວເລືອກການຈັດລຽງ."

msgid "Icon for the button that enables thumbnail mode."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຮູບຫຍໍ້."

msgid "Custom icon for the toggle button for the filter for file names."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມເປີດປິດການກັ່ນຕອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Custom icon for the toggle hidden button."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສຳລັບປຸ່ມເປີດປິດການສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້."

msgid "Godot editor's dock for managing files in the project."
msgstr "Dock ຂອງ Godot editor ສຳລັບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

msgid ""
"This class is available only in [EditorPlugin]s and can't be instantiated. "
"You can access it using [method EditorInterface.get_file_system_dock].\n"
"While [FileSystemDock] doesn't expose any methods for file manipulation, it "
"can listen for various file-related signals."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ [EditorPlugin] ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ instance ໂດຍກົງໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [method EditorInterface.get_file_system_dock].\n"
"ເຖິງວ່າ [FileSystemDock] ຈະບໍ່ມີເມທອດສຳລັບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນສາມາດຮັບສັນຍານຕ່າງໆທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

msgid "Registers a new [EditorResourceTooltipPlugin]."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ [EditorResourceTooltipPlugin] ໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Sets the given [param path] as currently selected, ensuring that the selected "
"file/directory is visible."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [param path] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Removes an [EditorResourceTooltipPlugin]. Fails if the plugin wasn't "
"previously added."
msgstr "ລຶບ [EditorResourceTooltipPlugin] ອອກ."

msgid "Emitted when the user switches file display mode or split mode."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂໝດແຍກໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Emitted when the given [param file] was removed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param file] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a file is moved from [param old_file] path to [param new_file] "
"path."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຖືກຍ້າຍຈາກ [param old_file] ໄປຫາ [param new_file]."

msgid "Emitted when folders change color."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂຟນເດີມີການປ່ຽນສີ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a folder is moved from [param old_folder] path to [param "
"new_folder] path."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອໂຟນເດີຖືກຍ້າຍຈາກ [param old_folder] ໄປຫາ [param new_folder]."

msgid "Emitted when the given [param folder] was removed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param folder] ທີ່ລະບຸຖືກລຶບອອກ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when a new scene is created that inherits the scene at [param file] "
"path."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ scene ໃໝ່ທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ scene ໃນເສັ້ນທາງ [param file]."

msgid "Emitted when the given scenes are being instantiated in the editor."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ scene ທີ່ລະບຸກຳລັງຖືກສ້າງ instance ໃນ editor."

msgid "Emitted when an external [param resource] had its file removed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອ [param resource] ພາຍນອກຖືກລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when the selection changes. Use [method "
"EditorInterface.get_selected_paths] in the connected method to get the "
"selected paths."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອການເລືອກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "A built-in type for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນສຳລັບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point)."

msgid ""
"The [float] built-in type is a 64-bit double-precision floating-point number, "
"equivalent to [code]double[/code] in C++. This type has 14 reliable decimal "
"digits of precision. The maximum value of [float] is approximately "
"[code]1.79769e308[/code], and the minimum is approximately "
"[code]-1.79769e308[/code].\n"
"Many methods and properties in the engine use 32-bit single-precision "
"floating-point numbers instead, equivalent to [code skip-lint]float[/code] in "
"C++, which have 6 reliable decimal digits of precision. For data structures "
"such as [Vector2] and [Vector3], Godot uses 32-bit floating-point numbers by "
"default, but it can be changed to use 64-bit doubles if Godot is compiled "
"with the [code]precision=double[/code] option.\n"
"Math done using the [float] type is not guaranteed to be exact and will often "
"result in small errors. You should usually use the [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] and [method @GlobalScope.is_zero_approx] "
"methods instead of [code]==[/code] to compare [float] values for equality.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [float] will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's exactly equal to [code]0.0[/code], and to [code]true[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ [float] ແມ່ນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດສອງເທົ່າ (double-precision) ຂະໜາດ 64 ບິດ, "
"ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [code]double[/code] ໃນ C++. ປະເພດນີ້ມີຄວາມລະອຽດທົດສະນິຍົມທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ 14 "
"ຕຳແໜ່ງ.\n"
"ການຄິດໄລ່ທາງຄະນິດສາດດ້ວຍ [float] ອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ 100% ແລະ ມັກຈະມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເລັກນ້ອຍ. ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ "
"[method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] ແທນການໃຊ້ [code]==[/code] ໃນການປຽບທຽບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ boolean, [float] ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code] "
"ຫາກມັນມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ [code]0.0[/code] ພໍດີ, ແລະ ຈະເປັນ [code]true[/code] ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ."

msgid "Wikipedia: Double-precision floating-point format"
msgstr "Wikipedia: ຮູບແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດສອງເທົ່າ (Double-precision)"

msgid "Wikipedia: Single-precision floating-point format"
msgstr "Wikipedia: ຮູບແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຄວາມລະອຽດດ່ຽວ (Single-precision)"

msgid "Constructs a default-initialized [float] set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [float] ທີ່ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [code]0.0[/code]."

msgid "Constructs a [float] as a copy of the given [float]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ [float] ໃໝ່ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຄ່າຈາກ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Converts a [String] to a [float], following the same rules as [method "
"String.to_float]."
msgstr "ແປງ [String] ເປັນ [float]."

msgid ""
"Cast a [bool] value to a floating-point value, [code]float(true)[/code] will "
"be equal to 1.0 and [code]float(false)[/code] will be equal to 0.0."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າ [bool] ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, [code]float(true)[/code] ຈະເທົ່າກັບ 1.0 ແລະ "
"[code]float(false)[/code] ຈະເທົ່າກັບ 0.0."

msgid ""
"Cast an [int] value to a floating-point value, [code]float(1)[/code] will be "
"equal to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ແປງຄ່າ [int] ເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ, [code]float(1)[/code] ຈະເທົ່າກັບ [code]1.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if two floats are different from each other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຕົວມີຄ່າຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the integer has different value than the float."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກເລກຖ້ວນມີຄ່າຕ່າງຈາກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Color], including the alpha, by the given "
"[float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(1.5 * Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.5)) # Prints (0.75, 0.75, 0.75, 1.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Color] ດ້ວຍ [float] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the given [float]. This "
"operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of a "
"larger expression."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Quaternion] ດ້ວຍ [float]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2] by the given [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2.5 * Vector2(1, 3)) # Prints (2.5, 7.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector2] ດ້ວຍ [float]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector2].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector2i(10, 15)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector2i] ດ້ວຍ [float]. ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [Vector2]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3] by the given [float]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector3] ດ້ວຍ [float]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector3i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector3].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector3i(10, 15, 20)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5, 18.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector3i] ດ້ວຍ [float]. ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [Vector3]."

msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4] by the given [float]."
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4] ດ້ວຍ [float]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector4].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector4i(10, 15, 20, -10)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5, 18.0, -9.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຄູນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ [Vector4i] ດ້ວຍ [float]. ຈະຄືນຄ່າເປັນ [Vector4]."

msgid "Multiplies two [float]s."
msgstr "ຄູນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຕົວ."

msgid "Multiplies a [float] and an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ຄູນ [float] ກັບ [int]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid ""
"Raises a [float] to a power of a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(39.0625**0.25) # 2.5\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຍົກກຳລັງ [float] ດ້ວຍ [float]."

msgid ""
"Raises a [float] to a power of an [int]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9**3) # 0.729\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr "ຍົກກຳລັງ [float] ດ້ວຍ [int]."

msgid "Adds two floats."
msgstr "ບວກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຕົວ."

msgid "Adds a [float] and an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ບວກ [float] ກັບ [int]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid "Subtracts a float from a float."
msgstr "ລົບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມອອກຈາກເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ."

msgid "Subtracts an [int] from a [float]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ລົບ [int] ອອກຈາກ [float]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid "Divides two floats."
msgstr "ຫານເລກທົດສະນິຍົມສອງຕົວ."

msgid "Divides a [float] by an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "ຫານ [float] ດ້ວຍ [int]. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະເປັນ [float]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is less than the right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄ່າທາງຊ້າຍນ້ອຍກວ່າຄ່າທາງຂວາ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is less than the given [int]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [float] ນີ້ນ້ອຍກວ່າ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is less than or equal to the "
"right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄ່າທາງຊ້າຍນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າທາງຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is less than or equal to the given "
"[int]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [float] ນີ້ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both floats are exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] or [method @GlobalScope.is_zero_approx] "
"instead, which are more reliable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກທັງສອງຄ່າເທົ່າກັນພໍດີ."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [float] and the given [int] are equal."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [float] ແລະ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is greater than the right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄ່າທາງຊ້າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າທາງຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is greater than the given [int]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [float] ນີ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is greater than or equal to the "
"right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກຄ່າທາງຊ້າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າທາງຂວາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is greater than or equal to the "
"given [int]."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຫາກ [float] ນີ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ [int] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [float]. If positive, turns the number "
"negative. If negative, turns the number positive. With floats, the number "
"zero can be either positive or negative."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າລົບຂອງ [float]. ຫາກເປັນບວກຈະກາຍເປັນລົບ, ຫາກເປັນລົບຈະກາຍເປັນບວກ."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"wraps them around at the borders."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດລຽງຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທາງນອນ ຫຼື ທາງຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈະຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ເມື່ອຮອດຂອບ."

msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"wraps them around at the borders. This is similar to how text in a book wraps "
"around when no more words can fit on a line."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຈັດລຽງຕົວຄວບຄຸມລູກທາງນອນ ຫຼື ທາງຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈະຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ເມື່ອຮອດຂອບ. "
"ນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕັດຄຳໃນປຶ້ມເມື່ອບໍ່ມີບ່ອນຫວ່າງໃນແຖວນັ້ນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Returns the current line count."
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຈຳນວນແຖວໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"The wrap behavior of the last, partially filled row or column (must be one of "
"[constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_INHERIT], [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_BEGIN], "
"[constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_CENTER], or [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_END])."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ຂອງແຖວ ຫຼື ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reverses fill direction. Horizontal [FlowContainer]s "
"will fill rows bottom to top, vertical [FlowContainer]s will fill columns "
"right to left.\n"
"When using a vertical [FlowContainer] with a right to left [member "
"Control.layout_direction], columns will fill left to right instead."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະກັບທິດທາງການຈັດວາງ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [FlowContainer] will arrange its children "
"vertically, rather than horizontally.\n"
"Can't be changed when using [HFlowContainer] and [VFlowContainer]."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], [FlowContainer] ຈະຈັດລຽງລູກໃນແນວຕັ້ງແທນແນວນອນ."

msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the previous row "
"or column in accordance with [member alignment]."
msgstr "ແຖວ ຫຼື ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຕັມ ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງຕາມ [member alignment]."

msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the beginning of "
"the previous row or column."
msgstr "ແຖວ ຫຼື ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຕັມ ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໃຫ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the center of "
"the previous row or column."
msgstr "ແຖວ ຫຼື ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຕັມ ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໃຫ້ຢູ່ກາງ."

msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the end of the "
"previous row or column."
msgstr "ແຖວ ຫຼື ຄໍລຳສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຕັມ ຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໃຫ້ຢູ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍ."

msgid "The horizontal separation of child nodes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງທາງນອນລະຫວ່າງໂນດລູກ."

msgid "The vertical separation of child nodes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງທາງຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງໂນດລູກ."

msgid ""
"A material that controls how volumetric fog is rendered, to be assigned to a "
"[FogVolume]."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ (material) ທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສະແດງຜົນໝອກແບບ volumetric."

msgid ""
"A [Material] resource that can be used by [FogVolume]s to draw volumetric "
"effects.\n"
"If you need more advanced effects, use a custom [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.html]fog shader[/url]."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Material] ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍ [FogVolume] ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ volumetric."

msgid ""
"The single-scattering [Color] of the [FogVolume]. Internally, [member albedo] "
"is converted into single-scattering, which is additively blended with other "
"[FogVolume]s and the [member Environment.volumetric_fog_albedo]."
msgstr "ສີ albedo ຂອງ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"The density of the [FogVolume]. Denser objects are more opaque, but may "
"suffer from under-sampling artifacts that look like stripes. Negative values "
"can be used to subtract fog from other [FogVolume]s or global volumetric "
"fog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited precision, [member density] values between "
"[code]-0.001[/code] and [code]0.001[/code] (exclusive) act like [code]0.0[/"
"code]. This does not apply to [member Environment.volumetric_fog_density]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ [FogVolume]. ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຫຼາຍຈະມີຄວາມທຶບແສງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The 3D texture that is used to scale the [member density] of the [FogVolume]. "
"This can be used to vary fog density within the [FogVolume] with any kind of "
"static pattern. For animated effects, consider using a custom [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.html]fog shader[/url]."
msgstr "Texture 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"The hardness of the edges of the [FogVolume]. A higher value will result in "
"softer edges, while a lower value will result in harder edges."
msgstr "ຄວາມແຂງຂອງຂອບ [FogVolume]. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບນຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The [Color] of the light emitted by the [FogVolume]. Emitted light will not "
"cast light or shadows on other objects, but can be useful for modulating the "
"[Color] of the [FogVolume] independently from light sources."
msgstr "ສີຂອງແສງທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາຈາກ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"The rate by which the height-based fog decreases in density as height "
"increases in world space. A high falloff will result in a sharp transition, "
"while a low falloff will result in a smoother transition. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] results in uniform-density fog. The height threshold is "
"determined by the height of the associated [FogVolume]."
msgstr "ອັດຕາການຫຼຸດລົງຂອງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຕາມຄວາມສູງ."

msgid ""
"A region that contributes to the default volumetric fog from the world "
"environment."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ໝອກ volumetric ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

msgid ""
"[FogVolume]s are used to add localized fog into the global volumetric fog "
"effect. [FogVolume]s can also remove volumetric fog from specific areas if "
"using a [FogMaterial] with a negative [member FogMaterial.density].\n"
"Performance of [FogVolume]s is directly related to their relative size on the "
"screen and the complexity of their attached [FogMaterial]. It is best to keep "
"[FogVolume]s relatively small and simple where possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FogVolume]s only have a visible effect if [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. If you don't want "
"fog to be globally visible (but only within [FogVolume] nodes), set [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_density] to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[FogVolume] ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໝອກສະເພາະຈຸດເຂົ້າໃນເອັບເຟັກໝອກ volumetric ທົ່ວໂລກ. [FogVolume] "
"ຍັງສາມາດລຶບໝອກອອກຈາກບາງພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຫາກໃຊ້ [FogMaterial] ທີ່ມີຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນເປັນຄ່າລົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [FogVolume] ຈະສະແດງຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Volumetric fog and fog volumes"
msgstr "ໝອກ Volumetric ແລະ ບໍລິມາດໝອກ (fog volumes)"

msgid ""
"The [Material] used by the [FogVolume]. Can be either a built-in "
"[FogMaterial] or a custom [ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr "ວັດສະດຸ [Material] ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"The shape of the [FogVolume]. This can be set to either [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_WORLD]."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຂອງ [FogVolume]."

msgid ""
"The size of the [FogVolume] when [member shape] is [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Thin fog volumes may appear to flicker when the camera moves or "
"rotates. This can be alleviated by increasing [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/volumetric_fog/volume_depth] (at a "
"performance cost) or by decreasing [member Environment.volumetric_fog_length] "
"(at no performance cost, but at the cost of lower fog range). Alternatively, "
"the [FogVolume] can be made thicker and use a lower density in the [member "
"material].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member shape] is [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], the cone/cylinder will be "
"adjusted to fit within the size. Non-uniform scaling of cone/cylinder shapes "
"via the [member size] property is not supported, but you can scale the "
"[FogVolume] node instead."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ [FogVolume]."

msgid "A container that can be expanded/collapsed."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫຍໍ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"A container that can be expanded/collapsed, with a title that can be filled "
"with controls, such as buttons. This is also called an accordion.\n"
"The title can be positioned at the top or bottom of the container. The "
"container can be expanded or collapsed by clicking the title or by pressing "
"[code]ui_accept[/code] when focused. Child control nodes are hidden when the "
"container is collapsed. Ignores non-control children.\n"
"A FoldableContainer can be grouped with other FoldableContainers so that only "
"one of them can be opened at a time; see [member foldable_group] and "
"[FoldableGroup]."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ/ຫຍໍ້ໄດ້ ພ້ອມກັບມີຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ສາມາດໃສ່ຕົວຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Adds a [Control] that will be placed next to the container's title, obscuring "
"the clickable area. Prime usage is adding [Button] nodes, but it can be any "
"[Control].\n"
"The control will be added as a child of this container and removed from "
"previous parent if necessary. The controls will be placed aligned to the "
"right, with the first added control being the leftmost one."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຄວບຄຸມ [Control] ທີ່ຈະວາງໄວ້ຂ້າງຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid "Expands the container and emits [signal folding_changed]."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal folding_changed]."

msgid "Folds the container and emits [signal folding_changed]."
msgstr "ຫຍໍ້ຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ສົ່ງສັນຍານ [signal folding_changed]."

msgid ""
"Removes a [Control] added with [method add_title_bar_control]. The node is "
"not freed automatically, you need to use [method Node.queue_free]."
msgstr "ລຶບ [Control] ທີ່ເພີ່ມໄວ້ໃນແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ອອກ."

msgid ""
"The [FoldableGroup] associated with the container. When multiple "
"[FoldableContainer] nodes share the same group, only one of them is allowed "
"to be unfolded."
msgstr "[FoldableGroup] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the container will become folded and will hide all its "
"children."
msgstr "ຫາກເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄອນເທນເນີຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ ແລະ ເຊື່ອງລູກທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Language code used for text shaping algorithms. If left empty, the current "
"locale is used instead."
msgstr "ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້."

msgid "The container's title text."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid "Title's horizontal text alignment."
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້ໃນແນວນອນ."

msgid "Title's position."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "Title text writing direction."
msgstr "ທິດທາງການຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid ""
"Defines the behavior of the title when the text is longer than the available "
"space."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມຍາວກວ່າພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Emitted when the container is folded/expanded."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານເມື່ອຄອນເທນເນີຖືກຫຍໍ້ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍ."

msgid "Makes the title appear at the top of the container."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຫົວຂໍ້ສະແດງຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid ""
"Makes the title appear at the bottom of the container. Also makes all "
"StyleBoxes flipped vertically."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຫົວຂໍ້ສະແດງຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ."

msgid "The title's font color when collapsed."
msgstr "ສີຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ເມື່ອຫຍໍ້ຢູ່."

msgid "The title's font color when expanded."
msgstr "ສີຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid "The title's font outline color."
msgstr "ສີເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The title's font hover color."
msgstr "ສີຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ (hover)."

msgid ""
"The horizontal separation between the title's icon and text, and between "
"title bar controls."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງທາງນອນລະຫວ່າງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The title's font outline size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The title's font."
msgstr "ຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The title's font size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້."

msgid "The title's icon used when expanded."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid "The title's icon used when expanded (for bottom title)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍອອກ (ສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ທາງລຸ່ມ)."

msgid "The title's icon used when folded (for left-to-right layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອພັບໄວ້ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ)."

msgid "The title's icon used when collapsed (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ (ສຳລັບການຈັດວາງຈາກຂວາຫາຊ້າຍ)."

msgid ""
"Background used when [FoldableContainer] has GUI focus. The [theme_item "
"focus] [StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a "
"partially transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base [StyleBox] "
"remains visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline "
"works well for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a "
"[StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will "
"harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອ [FoldableContainer] ມີຈຸດໂຟກັດ GUI. [StyleBox] ຂອງ [theme_item focus] "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງ [i]ທັບ[/i] [StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ [StyleBox] "
"ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສບາງສ່ວນເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າ [StyleBox] ພື້ນຖານຍັງຄົງເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. [StyleBox] "
"ທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງເສັ້ນຂອບ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. "
"ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກສາຍຕາຂອງໂຟກັດ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊັບພະຍາກອນ [StyleBoxEmpty]. ໝາຍເຫດ: "
"ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານເອັບເຟັກສາຍຕາຂອງໂຟກັດຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ການນຳໃຊ້ການນຳທາງດ້ວຍຄີບອດ/ຄອນໂທຣລເລີ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນດ້ານການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (accessibility)."

msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ [FoldableContainer]."

msgid ""
"Background used when the mouse cursor enters the title's area when collapsed."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ບໍລິເວນຫົວຂໍ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ."

msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]'s title when collapsed."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງ [FoldableContainer] ເມື່ອຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Background used when the mouse cursor enters the title's area when expanded."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ບໍລິເວນຫົວຂໍ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]'s title when expanded."
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງ [FoldableContainer] ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid ""
"A group of foldable containers that doesn't allow more than one container to "
"be expanded at a time."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຂອງຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ພັບໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຄອນເທນເນີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"A group of [FoldableContainer]-derived nodes. Only one container can be "
"expanded at a time."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມຂອງໂນດທີ່ສືບທອດມາຈາກ [FoldableContainer]. "
"ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຄອນເທນເນີໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ອັນດຽວໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [FoldableContainer]s that have this as their "
"FoldableGroup (see [member FoldableContainer.foldable_group]). This is "
"equivalent to [ButtonGroup] but for FoldableContainers."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງ [FoldableContainer] ທີ່ມີອັນນີ້ເປັນ FoldableGroup ຂອງພວກມັນ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[member FoldableContainer.foldable_group]). ອັນນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ [ButtonGroup] "
"ແຕ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ FoldableContainers."

msgid "Returns the current expanded container."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it is possible to fold all containers in this "
"FoldableGroup."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສາມາດພັບຄອນເທນເນີທັງໝົດໃນ FoldableGroup ນີ້ໄດ້."

msgid "Emitted when one of the containers of the group is expanded."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານອອກມາເມື່ອໜຶ່ງໃນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງກຸ່ມຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid "Abstract base class for fonts and font variations."
msgstr "ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (Abstract base class) ສຳລັບຟອນ ແລະ ຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for different font types. It has methods for drawing text "
"and font character introspection."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາສພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ ສຳລັບຟອນປະເພດຕ່າງໆ. ມັນມີເມທອດສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ "
"ການກວດສອບຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Draw a single Unicode character [param char] into a canvas item using the "
"font, at a given position, with [param modulate] color. [param pos] specifies "
"the baseline, not the top. To draw from the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added "
"to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as "
"font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to draw strings character by character, "
"use [method draw_string] or [TextLine] instead."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ດ່ຽວ [param char] ລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, "
"ດ້ວຍສີ [param modulate]. [param pos] ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ (baseline), ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. "
"ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, ຕ້ອງບວກ [i]ascent[/i] ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ oversampling ຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"oversampling ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມສະຕຣິງແບບເທື່ອລະຕົວອັກສອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"draw_string] ຫຼື [TextLine] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Draw a single Unicode character [param char] outline into a canvas item using "
"the font, at a given position, with [param modulate] color and [param size] "
"outline size. [param pos] specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from "
"the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] "
"is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise "
"viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to draw strings character by character, "
"use [method draw_string] or [TextLine] instead."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ດ່ຽວ [param char] ລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, "
"ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ດ້ວຍສີ [param modulate] ແລະ ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບ [param size]. [param pos] "
"ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, ຕ້ອງບວກ [i]ascent[/i] ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. "
"ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ oversampling ຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversampling ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອແຕ້ມສະຕຣິງແບບເທື່ອລະຕົວອັກສອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"draw_string] ຫຼື [TextLine] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] into lines using rules specified by [param brk_flags] and "
"draws it into a canvas item using the font, at a given position, with [param "
"modulate] color, optionally clipping the width and aligning horizontally. "
"[param pos] specifies the baseline of the first line, not the top. To draw "
"from the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param "
"oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, "
"otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string]."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກ [param text] ອອກເປັນຫຼາຍບັນທັດໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param brk_flags] ແລະ "
"ແຕ້ມລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ດ້ວຍສີ [param modulate], "
"ສາມາດເລືອກຕັດຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດວາງລຽງຕາມລວງນອນໄດ້. [param pos] "
"ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານຂອງບັນທັດທຳອິດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, ຕ້ອງບວກ [i]ascent[/i] "
"ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ oversampling "
"ຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversampling ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string]."

msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] to the lines using rules specified by [param brk_flags] "
"and draws text outline into a canvas item using the font, at a given "
"position, with [param modulate] color and [param size] outline size, "
"optionally clipping the width and aligning horizontally. [param pos] "
"specifies the baseline of the first line, not the top. To draw from the top, "
"[i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is greater "
"than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport "
"oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string_outline]."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກ [param text] ອອກເປັນຫຼາຍບັນທັດໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param brk_flags] ແລະ "
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂໍ້ຄວາມລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ດ້ວຍສີ [param modulate] "
"ແລະ ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບ [param size], ສາມາດເລືອກຕັດຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດວາງລຽງຕາມລວງນອນໄດ້. "
"[param pos] ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານຂອງບັນທັດທຳອິດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, ຕ້ອງບວກ "
"[i]ascent[/i] ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ "
"oversampling ຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversampling ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string_outline]."

msgid ""
"Draw [param text] into a canvas item using the font, at a given position, "
"with [param modulate] color, optionally clipping the width and aligning "
"horizontally. [param pos] specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from "
"the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] "
"is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise "
"viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_string]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມ [param text] ລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ດ້ວຍສີ [param "
"modulate], ສາມາດເລືອກຕັດຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດວາງລຽງຕາມລວງນອນໄດ້. [param pos] "
"ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, ຕ້ອງບວກ [i]ascent[/i] ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. "
"ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ oversampling ຂອງຟອນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversampling ຂອງ viewport.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method CanvasItem.draw_string]."

msgid ""
"Draw [param text] outline into a canvas item using the font, at a given "
"position, with [param modulate] color and [param size] outline size, "
"optionally clipping the width and aligning horizontally. [param pos] "
"specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from the top, [i]ascent[/i] must "
"be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is "
"used as font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings "
"are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_string_outline]."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ້ມເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງ [param text] ລົງໃນ canvas item ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟອນ, ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ, ດ້ວຍສີ "
"[param modulate] ແລະ ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບ [param size], ສາມາດເລືອກຕັດຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ "
"ຈັດວາງລຽງຕາມລວງນອນໄດ້. [param pos] ກຳນົດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນເທິງ. ເພື່ອແຕ້ມຈາກສ່ວນເທິງ, "
"ຕ້ອງບວກ [i]ascent[/i] ເຂົ້າໃນແກນ Y. ຖ້າ [param oversampling] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ, "
"ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວຄູນ oversampling ຂອງຟອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ oversampling ຂອງ "
"viewport.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method CanvasItem.draw_string_outline]."

msgid "Returns [TextServer] RID of the font cache for specific variation."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ RID ຂອງ [TextServer] ຂອງແຄຊຟອນສຳລັບຮູບແບບສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum font ascent (number of pixels above the baseline) of this "
"font and all fallback fonts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real ascent of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it only "
"as rough estimate (e.g. as the ascent of empty line)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ascent ສູງສຸດຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ) ຂອງຟອນນີ້ ແລະ ຟອນສຳຮອງ "
"(fallback) ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ ascent ຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນການຄາດຄະເນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເປັນຄ່າ "
"ascent ຂອງບັນທັດຫວ່າງ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of a character. Does not take kerning into account.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to calculate width of the string "
"character by character, use [method get_string_size] or [TextLine] instead. "
"The height returned is the font height (see also [method get_height]) and has "
"no relation to the glyph height."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ. ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການປັບໄລຍະຫ່າງ (kerning).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ເພື່ອຄຳນວນຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງສະຕຣິງແບບເທື່ອລະຕົວອັກສອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"[method get_string_size] ຫຼື [TextLine] ແທນ. ຄວາມສູງທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນຄວາມສູງຂອງຟອນ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[method get_height]) ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄວາມສູງຂອງກລິບ (glyph)."

msgid ""
"Returns the maximum font descent (number of pixels below the baseline) of "
"this font and all fallback fonts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real descent of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it only "
"as rough estimate (e.g. as the descent of empty line)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ descent ສູງສຸດຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ) ຂອງຟອນນີ້ ແລະ ຟອນສຳຮອງ "
"(fallback) ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ descent ຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນການຄາດຄະເນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເປັນຄ່າ "
"descent ຂອງບັນທັດຫວ່າງ)."

msgid "Returns number of faces in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນ face ໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນ TrueType / OpenType."

msgid "Returns font family name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຕະກຸນຟອນ (font family name)."

msgid ""
"Returns font stretch amount, compared to a normal width. A percentage value "
"between [code]50%[/code] and [code]200%[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນປະລິມານການຍືດຂອງຟອນ, ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄວາມກວ້າງປົກກະຕິ. ເປັນຄ່າເປີເຊັນລະຫວ່າງ [code]50%[/"
"code] ແລະ [code]200%[/code]."

msgid "Returns font style flags."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນແຟລັກຮູບແບບຟອນ (font style flags)."

msgid "Returns font style name."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຮູບແບບຟອນ (font style name)."

msgid ""
"Returns weight (boldness) of the font. A value in the [code]100...999[/code] "
"range, normal font weight is [code]400[/code], bold font weight is [code]700[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນນ້ຳໜັກ (ຄວາມໜາ) ຂອງຟອນ. ຄ່າຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]100...999[/code], ນ້ຳໜັກຟອນປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ "
"[code]400[/code], ນ້ຳໜັກຟອນໜາແມ່ນ [code]700[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the total average font height (ascent plus descent) in pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real height of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it only "
"as rough estimate (e.g. as the height of empty line)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມສູງສະເລ່ຍທັງໝົດຂອງຟອນ (ascent ບວກ descent) ເປັນພິກເຊວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມສູງຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນການຄາດຄະເນເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ເປັນຄວາມສູງຂອງບັນທັດຫວ່າງ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of a bounding box of a string broken into the lines, taking "
"kerning and advance into account.\n"
"See also [method draw_multiline_string]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງ bounding box ຂອງສະຕຣິງທີ່ຖືກແຍກເປັນຫຼາຍບັນທັດ, ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ kerning ແລະ "
"advance.\n"
"ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method draw_multiline_string]."

msgid ""
"Returns a set of OpenType feature tags. More info: [url=https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags]OpenType "
"feature tags[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊຸດຂອງແທັກຄຸນສົມບັດ OpenType. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ: [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"typography/opentype/spec/featuretags]OpenType feature tags[/url]."

msgid ""
"Returns [Dictionary] with OpenType font name strings (localized font names, "
"version, description, license information, sample text, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ມີສະຕຣິງຊື່ຟອນ OpenType (ຊື່ຟອນຕາມທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ເວີຊັນ, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ, "
"ຂໍ້ມູນໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວຢ່າງ, ແລະອື່ນໆ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the array in the predefined color palette at [param index]. Palette "
"contains all colors used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same "
"number of colors. Colors can be overridden using [FontVariation]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣໃນພາເລດສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ພາເລດປະກອບດ້ວຍສີທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີກລິບຟອນ. ແຕ່ລະພາເລດມີຈຳນວນສີເທົ່າກັນ. "
"ສາມາດຂຽນທັບສີໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [FontVariation]."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of predefined color palettes. Palette contains all colors "
"used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same number of colors."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນພາເລດສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ພາເລດປະກອບດ້ວຍສີທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີກລິບຟອນ. "
"ແຕ່ລະພາເລດມີຈຳນວນສີເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns the name of the predefined color palette at [param index]. Palette "
"contains all colors used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same "
"number of colors."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງພາເລດສີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ [param index]. "
"ພາເລດປະກອບດ້ວຍສີທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຣນເດີກລິບຟອນ. ແຕ່ລະພາເລດມີຈຳນວນສີເທົ່າກັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [Array] of valid [Font] [RID]s, which can be passed to the "
"[TextServer] methods."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Array] ຂອງ [RID] ຂອງ [Font] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສົ່ງໄປຫາເມທອດຂອງ [TextServer] "
"ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns the amount of spacing for the given [param spacing] type."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນປະລິມານໄລຍະຫ່າງສຳລັບປະເພດ [param spacing] ທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Returns the size of a bounding box of a single-line string, taking kerning, "
"advance and subpixel positioning into account. See also [method "
"get_multiline_string_size] and [method draw_string].\n"
"For example, to get the string size as displayed by a single-line Label, "
"use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var string_size = "
"$Label.get_theme_font(\"font\").get_string_size($Label.text, "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, $Label.get_theme_font_size(\"font_size\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Label label = GetNode<Label>(\"Label\");\n"
"Vector2 stringSize = label.GetThemeFont(\"font\").GetStringSize(label.Text, "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, label.GetThemeFontSize(\"font_size\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since kerning, advance and subpixel positioning are taken into "
"account by [method get_string_size], using separate [method get_string_size] "
"calls on substrings of a string then adding the results together will return "
"a different result compared to using a single [method get_string_size] call "
"on the full string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real height of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by [method get_height]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດຂອງ bounding box ຂອງສະຕຣິງບັນທັດດ່ຽວ, ໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງ kerning, advance ແລະ "
"ການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ subpixel. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [method get_multiline_string_size] ແລະ "
"[method draw_string].\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຫາຂະໜາດສະຕຣິງທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ Label ບັນທັດດ່ຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var string_size = "
"$Label.get_theme_font(\"font\").get_string_size($Label.text, "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, $Label.get_theme_font_size(\"font_size\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Label label = GetNode<Label>(\"Label\");\n"
"Vector2 stringSize = label.GetThemeFont(\"font\").GetStringSize(label.Text, "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, label.GetThemeFontSize(\"font_size\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກ kerning, advance ແລະ ການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ subpixel "
"ຖືກຄຳນຶງເຖິງໂດຍ [method get_string_size], ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method get_string_size] "
"ແຍກກັນໃນສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງສະຕຣິງແລ້ວນຳຜົນລັດມາບວກກັນ ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເມື່ອທຽບກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method get_string_size] ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນສະຕຣິງເຕັມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມສູງຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍ "
"[method get_height]."

msgid ""
"Returns a string containing all the characters available in the font.\n"
"If a given character is included in more than one font data source, it "
"appears only once in the returned string."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສະຕຣິງທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຟອນ.\n"
"ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນໃດໜຶ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຟອນຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງແຫຼ່ງ, ມັນຈະປາກົດພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວໃນສະຕຣິງທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ."

msgid "Returns list of OpenType features supported by font."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຄຸນສົມບັດ OpenType ທີ່ຟອນຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"Returns list of supported [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/"
"opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg]variation coordinates[/url], each coordinate is "
"returned as [code]tag: Vector3i(min_value,max_value,default_value)[/code].\n"
"Font variations allow for continuous change of glyph characteristics along "
"some given design axis, such as weight, width or slant.\n"
"To print available variation axes of a variable font:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://RobotoFlex.ttf\")\n"
"var variation_list = fv.get_supported_variation_list()\n"
"for tag in variation_list:\n"
"\tvar name = TextServerManager.get_primary_interface().tag_to_name(tag)\n"
"\tvar values = variation_list[tag]\n"
"\tprint(\"variation axis: %s (%d)\\n\\tmin, max, default: %s\" % [name, tag, "
"values])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To set and get variation coordinates of a [FontVariation], use "
"[member FontVariation.variation_opentype]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການ [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/"
"dvaraxisreg]ພິກັດຮູບແບບ (variation coordinates)[/url] ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, "
"ແຕ່ລະພິກັດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນໃນຮູບແບບ [code]tag: Vector3i(min_value,max_value,default_value)"
"[/code].\n"
"ຮູບແບບຟອນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງກລິບຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຕາມແກນການອອກແບບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ນ້ຳໜັກ, ຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມອຽງ.\n"
"ເພື່ອສະແດງແກນຮູບແບບທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງ variable font:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://RobotoFlex.ttf\")\n"
"var variation_list = fv.get_supported_variation_list()\n"
"for tag in variation_list:\n"
"\tvar name = TextServerManager.get_primary_interface().tag_to_name(tag)\n"
"\tvar values = variation_list[tag]\n"
"\tprint(\"variation axis: %s (%d)\\n\\tmin, max, default: %s\" % [name, tag, "
"values])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອກຳນົດ ແລະ ດຶງຄ່າພິກັດຮູບແບບຂອງ [FontVariation], ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member "
"FontVariation.variation_opentype]."

msgid ""
"Returns average pixel offset of the underline below the baseline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real underline position of the string is context-dependent and "
"can be significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use "
"it only as rough estimate."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອບເຊັດພິກເຊວສະເລ່ຍຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕຳແໜ່ງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນການຄາດຄະເນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns average thickness of the underline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real underline thickness of the string is context-dependent and "
"can be significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use "
"it only as rough estimate."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໜາສະເລ່ຍຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄວາມໜາເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງຕົວຈິງຂອງສະຕຣິງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈາກຟັງຊັນນີ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນການຄາດຄະເນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a Unicode [param char] is available in the font."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode [param char] ມີຢູ່ໃນຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the font supports the given language (as a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-1]ISO 639[/url] code)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຟອນຮອງຮັບພາສາທີ່ກຳນົດ (ໃນຮູບແບບລະຫັດ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-1]ISO 639[/url])."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the font supports the given script (as a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15924]ISO 15924[/url] code)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຟອນຮອງຮັບສະຄຣິບທີ່ກຳນົດ (ໃນຮູບແບບລະຫັດ [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15924]ISO 15924[/url])."

msgid "Sets LRU cache capacity for [code]draw_*[/code] methods."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມຈຸແຄຊ LRU ສຳລັບເມທອດ [code]draw_*[/code]."

msgid ""
"Array of fallback [Font]s to use as a substitute if a glyph is not found in "
"this current [Font].\n"
"If this array is empty in a [FontVariation], the [member "
"FontVariation.base_font]'s fallbacks are used instead."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງ [Font] ສຳຮອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແທນຖ້າບໍ່ພົບກລິບໃນ [Font] ປະຈຸບັນນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າອາເຣນີ້ວ່າງໃນ [FontVariation], ຈະໃຊ້ຟອນສຳຮອງຂອງ [member "
"FontVariation.base_font] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Holds font source data and prerendered glyph cache, imported from a dynamic "
"or a bitmap font."
msgstr "ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຫຼ່ງຟອນ ແລະ ແຄຊກລິບທີ່ເຣນເດີໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ, ນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກຟອນແບບໄດນາມິກ ຫຼື ບິດແມັບ."

msgid ""
"[FontFile] contains a set of glyphs to represent Unicode characters imported "
"from a font file, as well as a cache of rasterized glyphs, and a set of "
"fallback [Font]s to use.\n"
"Use [FontVariation] to access specific OpenType variation of the font, create "
"simulated bold / slanted version, and draw lines of text.\n"
"For more complex text processing, use [FontVariation] in conjunction with "
"[TextLine] or [TextParagraph].\n"
"Supported font formats:\n"
"- Dynamic font importer: TrueType (.ttf), TrueType collection (.ttc), "
"OpenType (.otf), OpenType collection (.otc), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 (.woff2), "
"Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm).\n"
"- Bitmap font importer: AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font), text and binary "
"(version 3) format variants.\n"
"- Monospace image font importer: All supported image formats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A character is a symbol that represents an item (letter, digit "
"etc.) in an abstract way.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A glyph is a bitmap or a shape used to draw one or more "
"characters in a context-dependent manner. Glyph indices are bound to the "
"specific font data source.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If none of the font data sources contain glyphs for a character "
"used in a string, the character in question will be replaced with a box "
"displaying its hexadecimal code.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var f = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\")\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", f)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var f = ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", f);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[FontFile] ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊຸດຂອງກລິບເພື່ອແທນຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ຟອນ, "
"ລວມທັງແຄຊຂອງກລິບທີ່ຖືກແປງເປັນບິດແມັບ (rasterized), ແລະ ຊຸດຂອງຟອນສຳຮອງ [Font] ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [FontVariation] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຮູບແບບ OpenType ສະເພາະຂອງຟອນ, ສ້າງເວີຊັນໜາ/ອຽງຈຳລອງ, "
"ແລະ ແຕ້ມບັນທັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"
"ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [FontVariation] ຮ່ວມກັບ [TextLine] ຫຼື "
"[TextParagraph].\n"
"ຮູບແບບຟອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:\n"
"- Dynamic font importer: TrueType (.ttf), TrueType collection (.ttc), "
"OpenType (.otf), OpenType collection (.otc), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 (.woff2), "
"Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm).\n"
"- Bitmap font importer: AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font), ທັງຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ "
"ໄບນາຣີ (ເວີຊັນ 3).\n"
"- Monospace image font importer: ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວອັກສອນ (Character) ແມ່ນສັນຍາລັກທີ່ແທນລາຍການ (ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ "
"ແລະອື່ນໆ) ໃນແບບນາມມະທຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ກລິບ (Glyph) ແມ່ນບິດແມັບ ຫຼື ຮູບຊົງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການແຕ້ມຕົວອັກສອນໜຶ່ງຕົວ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບບໍລິບົດ. ດັດຊະນີກລິບ (Glyph indices) ແມ່ນຜູກມັດກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຟອນສະເພາະ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຟອນໃດທີ່ມີກລິບສຳລັບຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນສະຕຣິງ, "
"ຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍກ່ອງທີ່ສະແດງລະຫັດຖານສິບຫົກຂອງມັນ.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var f = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\")\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", f)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var f = ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", f);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Removes all font cache entries."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການແຄຊຟອນທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Removes all rendered glyph information from the cache entry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function will not remove textures associated with the "
"glyphs, use [method remove_texture] to remove them manually."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນກລິບທີ່ເຣນເດີແລ້ວທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລຶບເທັກເຈີ (texture) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກລິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"remove_texture] ເພື່ອລຶບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Removes all kerning overrides."
msgstr "ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ kerning ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Removes all font sizes from the cache entry."
msgstr "ລຶບຂະໜາດຟອນທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊ."

msgid ""
"Removes all textures from font cache entry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function will not remove glyphs associated with the "
"texture, use [method remove_glyph] to remove them manually."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບເທັກເຈີທັງໝົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊຟອນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລຶບກລິບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເທັກເຈີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method remove_glyph] "
"ເພື່ອລຶບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Returns the font ascent (number of pixels above the baseline)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ ascent ຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ)."

msgid "Returns number of the font cache entries."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນລາຍການແຄຊຟອນ."

msgid "Returns the font descent (number of pixels below the baseline)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ descent ຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ)."

msgid "Returns scaling factor of the color bitmap font."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດ (scaling factor) ຂອງຟອນບິດແມັບແບບສີ."

msgid "Returns pixel offset of the underline below the baseline."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອບເຊັດພິກເຊວຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Returns thickness of the underline in pixels."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Returns character code associated with [param glyph_index], or [code]0[/code] "
"if [param glyph_index] is invalid. See [method get_glyph_index]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [param glyph_index], ຫຼື [code]0[/code] ຖ້າ [param "
"glyph_index] ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_glyph_index]."

msgid ""
"Returns embolden strength, if is not equal to zero, emboldens the font "
"outlines. Negative values reduce the outline thickness."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄວາມແຮງຂອງການເຮັດຕົວໜາ, ຖ້າບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບສູນ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນໜາຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າລົບຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid "Returns extra baseline offset (as a fraction of font height)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອບເຊັດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຄວາມສູງຟອນ)."

msgid ""
"Returns spacing for [param spacing] in pixels (not relative to the font size)."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນໄລຍະຫ່າງສຳລັບ [param spacing] ເປັນພິກເຊວ (ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຟອນ)."

msgid "Returns an active face index in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີ face ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນ TrueType / OpenType."

msgid ""
"Returns glyph advance (offset of the next glyph).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Advance for glyphs outlines is the same as the base glyph "
"advance and is not saved."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ advance ຂອງກລິບ (ອອບເຊັດຂອງກລິບຖັດໄປ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ advance ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຂອບກລິບແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຄ່າ advance ຂອງກລິບພື້ນຖານ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"Returns the glyph index of a [param char], optionally modified by the [param "
"variation_selector]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີກລິບຂອງ [param char], ສາມາດເລືອກປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍ [param variation_selector] ໄດ້."

msgid "Returns list of rendered glyphs in the cache entry."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການກລິບທີ່ເຣນເດີແລ້ວໃນລາຍການແຄຊ."

msgid "Returns glyph offset from the baseline."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອບເຊັດຂອງກລິບຈາກເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Returns glyph size."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຂະໜາດກລິບ."

msgid "Returns index of the cache texture containing the glyph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງແຄຊເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີກລິບຢູ່."

msgid "Returns rectangle in the cache texture containing the glyph."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໃນແຄຊເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີກລິບຢູ່."

msgid "Returns kerning for the pair of glyphs."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າ kerning ສຳລັບຄູ່ຂອງກລິບ."

msgid "Returns list of the kerning overrides."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການການຂຽນທັບ kerning."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if support override is enabled for the [param "
"language]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [param language]."

msgid "Returns list of language support overrides."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບພາສາ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if support override is enabled for the [param "
"script]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [param script]."

msgid "Returns list of script support overrides."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບສະຄຣິບ."

msgid ""
"Returns list of the font sizes in the cache. Each size is [Vector2i] with "
"font size and outline size."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍການຂະໜາດຟອນໃນແຄຊ. ແຕ່ລະຂະໜາດແມ່ນ [Vector2i] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂະໜາດຟອນ ແລະ "
"ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid "Returns number of textures used by font cache entry."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍລາຍການແຄຊຟອນ."

msgid "Returns a copy of the font cache texture image."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງຮູບພາບແຄຊເທັກເຈີຟອນ."

msgid "Returns a copy of the array containing glyph packing data."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສຳເນົາຂອງອາເຣທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດເກັບກລິບ (glyph packing data)."

msgid ""
"Returns 2D transform, applied to the font outlines, can be used for slanting, "
"flipping and rotating glyphs."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນການແປງ 2D (2D transform) ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ກລິບອຽງ, ພິກ ຫຼື ໝຸນ "
"ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Returns variation coordinates for the specified font cache entry. See [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list] for more info."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນພິກັດຮູບແບບສຳລັບລາຍການແຄຊຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Loads an AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font) bitmap font from file [param path].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method should only be used in the editor or in cases "
"when you need to load external fonts at run-time, such as fonts located at "
"the [code]user://[/code] directory."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຟອນບິດແມັບ AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font) ຈາກໄຟລ໌ [param path].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດຟອນພາຍນອກໃນເວລາຣັນໄທມ໌ (run-time), ເຊັ່ນ: ຟອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ "
"[code]user://[/code]."

msgid ""
"Loads a TrueType (.ttf), OpenType (.otf), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 (.woff2) or "
"Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm) dynamic font from file [param path].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method should only be used in the editor or in cases "
"when you need to load external fonts at run-time, such as fonts located at "
"the [code]user://[/code] directory."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຟອນໄດນາມິກ TrueType (.ttf), OpenType (.otf), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 (.woff2) ຫຼື "
"Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm) ຈາກໄຟລ໌ [param path].\n"
"[b]ຄຳເຕືອນ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຫຼື "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໂຫຼດຟອນພາຍນອກໃນເວລາຣັນໄທມ໌ (run-time), ເຊັ່ນ: ຟອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ "
"[code]user://[/code]."

msgid "Removes specified font cache entry."
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການແຄຊຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Removes specified rendered glyph information from the cache entry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function will not remove textures associated with the "
"glyphs, use [method remove_texture] to remove them manually."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນກລິບທີ່ເຣນເດີແລ້ວທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລຶບເທັກເຈີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບກລິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method remove_texture] "
"ເພື່ອລຶບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid "Removes kerning override for the pair of glyphs."
msgstr "ລຶບການຂຽນທັບ kerning ສຳລັບຄູ່ຂອງກລິບ."

msgid "Remove language support override."
msgstr "ລຶບການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບພາສາ."

msgid "Removes script support override."
msgstr "ລຶບການຂຽນທັບການຮອງຮັບສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "Removes specified font size from the cache entry."
msgstr "ລຶບຂະໜາດຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊ."

msgid ""
"Removes specified texture from the cache entry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function will not remove glyphs associated with the "
"texture. Remove them manually using [method remove_glyph]."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບເທັກເຈີທີ່ກຳນົດອອກຈາກລາຍການແຄຊ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລຶບກລິບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເທັກເຈີ. ໃຫ້ລຶບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"remove_glyph]."

msgid "Renders specified glyph to the font cache texture."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີກລິບທີ່ກຳນົດລົງໃນແຄຊເທັກເຈີຟອນ."

msgid "Renders the range of characters to the font cache texture."
msgstr "ເຣນເດີຊ່ວງຂອງຕົວອັກສອນລົງໃນແຄຊເທັກເຈີຟອນ."

msgid "Sets the font ascent (number of pixels above the baseline)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ ascent ຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ)."

msgid "Sets the font descent (number of pixels below the baseline)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ descent ຂອງຟອນ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ)."

msgid "Sets scaling factor of the color bitmap font."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕົວຄູນການປັບຂະໜາດຂອງຟອນບິດແມັບແບບສີ."

msgid "Sets pixel offset of the underline below the baseline."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າອອບເຊັດພິກເຊວຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Sets thickness of the underline in pixels."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດກ້ອງເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"Sets embolden strength, if is not equal to zero, emboldens the font outlines. "
"Negative values reduce the outline thickness."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄວາມແຮງຂອງການເຮັດຕົວໜາ, ຖ້າບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບສູນ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນໜາຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄ່າລົບຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບ."

msgid "Sets extra baseline offset (as a fraction of font height)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າອອບເຊັດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຄວາມສູງຟອນ)."

msgid ""
"Sets the spacing for [param spacing] to [param value] in pixels (not relative "
"to the font size)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໄລຍະຫ່າງສຳລັບ [param spacing] ເປັນ [param value] ໃນຮູບແບບພິກເຊວ "
"(ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຟອນ)."

msgid "Sets an active face index in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "ກຳນົດດັດຊະນີ face ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນ TrueType / OpenType."

msgid ""
"Sets glyph advance (offset of the next glyph).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Advance for glyphs outlines is the same as the base glyph "
"advance and is not saved."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າ advance ຂອງກລິບ (ອອບເຊັດຂອງກລິບຖັດໄປ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄ່າ advance ສຳລັບເສັ້ນຂອບກລິບແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຄ່າ advance ຂອງກລິບພື້ນຖານ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ."

msgid "Sets glyph offset from the baseline."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າອອບເຊັດຂອງກລິບຈາກເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານ."

msgid "Sets glyph size."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດກລິບ."

msgid "Sets index of the cache texture containing the glyph."
msgstr "ກຳນົດດັດຊະນີຂອງແຄຊເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີກລິບຢູ່."

msgid "Sets rectangle in the cache texture containing the glyph."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກໃນແຄຊເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີກລິບຢູ່."

msgid "Sets kerning for the pair of glyphs."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ kerning ສຳລັບຄູ່ຂອງກລິບ."

msgid "Adds override for [method Font.is_language_supported]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການຂຽນທັບສຳລັບ [method Font.is_language_supported]."

msgid "Adds override for [method Font.is_script_supported]."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການຂຽນທັບສຳລັບ [method Font.is_script_supported]."

msgid "Sets font cache texture image."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຮູບພາບແຄຊເທັກເຈີຟອນ."

msgid "Sets array containing glyph packing data."
msgstr "ກຳນົດອາເຣທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດເກັບກລິບ."

msgid ""
"Sets 2D transform, applied to the font outlines, can be used for slanting, "
"flipping, and rotating glyphs."
msgstr "ກຳນົດການແປງ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ກລິບອຽງ, ພິກ ຫຼື ໝຸນ ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Sets variation coordinates for the specified font cache entry. See [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list] for more info."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດພິກັດຮູບແບບສຳລັບລາຍການແຄຊຟອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ເບິ່ງ [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], system fonts can be automatically used as "
"fallbacks."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຟອນຂອງລະບົບຈະສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຟອນສຳຮອງໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Font anti-aliasing mode."
msgstr "ໂໝດການລົບຮອຍຢັກຂອງຟອນ (Font anti-aliasing)."

msgid "Contents of the dynamic font source file."
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ແຫຼ່ງຟອນແບບໄດນາມິກ."

msgid "Font size, used only for the bitmap fonts."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຟອນ, ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຟອນບິດແມັບເທ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Scaling mode, used only for the bitmap fonts with [member fixed_size] greater "
"than zero."
msgstr "ໂໝດການປັບຂະໜາດ, ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຟອນບິດແມັບທີ່ມີ [member fixed_size] ຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Font family name."
msgstr "ຊື່ຕະກຸນຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Font stretch amount, compared to a normal width. A percentage value between "
"[code]50%[/code] and [code]200%[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຍືດຂອງຟອນ, ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄວາມກວ້າງປົກກະຕິ. ເປັນຄ່າເປີເຊັນລະຫວ່າງ [code]50%[/code] "
"ແລະ [code]200%[/code]."

msgid "Font style flags."
msgstr "ແຟລັກຮູບແບບຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Weight (boldness) of the font. A value in the [code]100...999[/code] range, "
"normal font weight is [code]400[/code], bold font weight is [code]700[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ນ້ຳໜັກ (ຄວາມໜາ) ຂອງຟອນ. ຄ່າຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]100...999[/code], ນ້ຳໜັກຟອນປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ "
"[code]400[/code], ນ້ຳໜັກຟອນໜາແມ່ນ [code]700[/code]."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], auto-hinting is supported and preferred over "
"font built-in hinting. Used by dynamic fonts only (MSDF fonts don't support "
"hinting)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະຮອງຮັບການເຮັດ auto-hinting ແລະ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກ່ອນ hinting "
"ທີ່ມາກັບຟອນ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຟອນແບບໄດນາມິກເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຟອນ MSDF ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ hinting)."

msgid "If set to [code]true[/code], generate mipmaps for the font textures."
msgstr "ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະສ້າງ mipmaps ສຳລັບເທັກເຈີຟອນ."

msgid "Font hinting mode. Used by dynamic fonts only."
msgstr "ໂໝດ font hinting. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຟອນແບບໄດນາມິກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], when aligning glyphs to the pixel boundaries "
"rounding remainders are accumulated to ensure more uniform glyph "
"distribution. This setting has no effect if subpixel positioning is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເມື່ອຈັດວາງກລິບໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂອບພິກເຊວ, "
"ເສດທີ່ເຫຼືອຈາກການປັດເສດຈະຖືກສະສົມໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກະຈາຍຂອງກລິບສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີຂຶ້ນ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ subpixel."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], color modulation is applied when drawing colored "
"glyphs, otherwise it's applied to the monochrome glyphs only."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະໃຊ້ການປັບສີ (color modulation) ເມື່ອແຕ້ມກລິບທີ່ມີສີ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກັບກລິບຂາວດຳເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The width of the range around the shape between the minimum and maximum "
"representable signed distance. If using font outlines, [member "
"msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the size of the "
"largest font outline. The default [member msdf_pixel_range] value of "
"[code]16[/code] allows outline sizes up to [code]8[/code] to look correct."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຊ່ວງອ້ອມຮອບຮູບຊົງລະຫວ່າງຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ (signed distance) ຕໍ່າສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ. "
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນ, [member msdf_pixel_range] ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/"
"i] ຂອງຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [member msdf_pixel_range] ແມ່ນ "
"[code]16[/code] ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ [code]8[/code] ເບິ່ງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"Source font size used to generate MSDF textures. Higher values allow for more "
"precision, but are slower to render and require more memory. Only increase "
"this value if you notice a visible lack of precision in glyph rendering."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຟອນຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງເທັກເຈີ MSDF. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະເຣນເດີຊ້າລົງ "
"ແລະ ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າການເຣນເດີກລິບຂາດຄວາມຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], glyphs of all sizes are rendered using single "
"multichannel signed distance field (MSDF) generated from the dynamic font "
"vector data. Since this approach does not rely on rasterizing the font every "
"time its size changes, this allows for resizing the font in real-time without "
"any performance penalty. Text will also not look grainy for [Control]s that "
"are scaled down (or for [Label3D]s viewed from a long distance). As a "
"downside, font hinting is not available with MSDF. The lack of font hinting "
"may result in less crisp and less readable fonts at small sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using font outlines, [member msdf_pixel_range] must be set to "
"at least [i]twice[/i] the size of the largest font outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] MSDF font rendering does not render glyphs with overlapping "
"shapes correctly. Overlapping shapes are not valid per the OpenType standard, "
"but are still commonly found in many font files, especially those converted "
"by Google Fonts. To avoid issues with overlapping glyphs, consider "
"downloading the font file directly from the type foundry instead of relying "
"on Google Fonts."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກລິບທຸກຂະໜາດຈະຖືກເຣນເດີໂດຍໃຊ້ multichannel signed "
"distance field (MSDF) ອັນດຽວທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກຂໍ້ມູນເວັກເຕີຂອງຟອນໄດນາມິກ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບການແປງຟອນເປັນບິດແມັບໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຂະໜາດປ່ຽນແປງ, "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດຟອນໄດ້ແບບຣຽລໄທມ໌ໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະບໍ່ເບິ່ງເປັນເມັດສຳລັບ "
"[Control] ທີ່ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ເລັກລົງ (ຫຼື ສຳລັບ [Label3D] ທີ່ເບິ່ງຈາກໄລຍະໄກ). ຂໍ້ເສຍແມ່ນ font "
"hinting ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ MSDF. ການຂາດ font hinting ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຟອນເບິ່ງບໍ່ຄົມຊັດ ແລະ "
"ອ່ານຍາກໃນຂະໜາດເລັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າໃຊ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນ, [member msdf_pixel_range] "
"ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ [i]ສອງເທົ່າ[/i] ຂອງຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເຣນເດີຟອນແບບ MSDF ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຣນເດີກລິບທີ່ມີຮູບຊົງຊ້ອນທັບກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ຮູບຊົງທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນນັ້ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ OpenType, ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງພົບເຫັນໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປໃນໄຟລ໌ຟອນຫຼາຍຊະນິດ, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຟອນທີ່ແປງມາຈາກ Google Fonts. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາກັບກລິບທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຟອນໂດຍກົງຈາກຜູ້ສ້າງຟອນແທນການໃຊ້ Google Fonts."

msgid "Font OpenType feature set override."
msgstr "ການຂຽນທັບຊຸດຄຸນສົມບັດ OpenType ຂອງຟອນ."

msgid ""
"If set to a positive value, overrides the oversampling factor of the viewport "
"this font is used in. See [member Viewport.oversampling]. This value doesn't "
"override the [code skip-lint]oversampling[/code] parameter of [code skip-"
"lint]draw_*[/code] methods."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າກຳນົດເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ຈະຂຽນທັບຕົວຄູນ oversampling ຂອງ viewport ທີ່ຟອນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Viewport.oversampling]. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຂຽນທັບພາຣາມິເຕີ [code skip-lint]oversampling[/"
"code] ຂອງເມທອດ [code skip-lint]draw_*[/code]."

msgid "Font style name."
msgstr "ຊື່ຮູບແບບຟອນ."

msgid ""
"Font glyph subpixel positioning mode. Subpixel positioning provides shaper "
"text and better kerning for smaller font sizes, at the cost of higher memory "
"usage and lower font rasterization speed. Use [constant "
"TextServer.SUBPIXEL_POSITIONING_AUTO] to automatically enable it based on the "
"font size."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ subpixel ຂອງກລິບຟອນ. ການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງແບບ subpixel ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄົມຊັດກວ່າ "
"ແລະ kerning ທີ່ດີກວ່າສຳລັບຟອນຂະໜາດເລັກ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມໄວໃນການແປງຟອນເປັນບິດແມັບທີ່ຊ້າລົງ. ໃຊ້ [constant "
"TextServer.SUBPIXEL_POSITIONING_AUTO] ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງຟອນ."

msgid "A variation of a font with additional settings."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຟອນທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Provides OpenType variations, simulated bold / slant, and additional font "
"settings like OpenType features and extra spacing.\n"
"To use simulated bold font variant:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Regular.ttf\")\n"
"fv.variation_embolden = 1.2\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", fv)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fv = new FontVariation();\n"
"fv.SetBaseFont(ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-"
"Regular.ttf\"));\n"
"fv.SetVariationEmbolden(1.2);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", fv);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To set the coordinate of multiple variation axes:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new();\n"
"var ts = TextServerManager.get_primary_interface()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Regular.ttf\")\n"
"fv.variation_opentype = { ts.name_to_tag(\"wght\"): 900, "
"ts.name_to_tag(\"custom_hght\"): 900 }\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຮູບແບບ OpenType, ການຈຳລອງຕົວໜາ / ຕົວອຽງ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"OpenType ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຟອນໜາຈຳລອງ:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Regular.ttf\")\n"
"fv.variation_embolden = 1.2\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", fv)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fv = new FontVariation();\n"
"fv.SetBaseFont(ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-"
"Regular.ttf\"));\n"
"fv.SetVariationEmbolden(1.2);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", fv);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດພິກັດຂອງແກນຮູບແບບຫຼາຍແກນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new();\n"
"var ts = TextServerManager.get_primary_interface()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Regular.ttf\")\n"
"fv.variation_opentype = { ts.name_to_tag(\"wght\"): 900, "
"ts.name_to_tag(\"custom_hght\"): 900 }\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Base font used to create a variation. If not set, default [Theme] font is "
"used."
msgstr "ຟອນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງຮູບແບບ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ຈະໃຊ້ຟອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ [Theme]."

msgid "Extra baseline offset (as a fraction of font height)."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອບເຊັດເສັ້ນພື້ນຖານເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເປັນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຄວາມສູງຟອນ)."

msgid ""
"A set of OpenType feature tags. More info: [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags]OpenType feature tags[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດຂອງແທັກຄຸນສົມບັດ OpenType. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ: [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"typography/opentype/spec/featuretags]OpenType feature tags[/url]."

msgid ""
"An array of colors to override predefined palette. Use [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)"
"[/code], to keep predefined palette color at specific position."
msgstr ""
"ອາເຣຂອງສີເພື່ອຂຽນທັບພາເລດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ໃຊ້ [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] "
"ເພື່ອຄົງສີຂອງພາເລດເດີມໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນໄວ້."

msgid "A palette index."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີພາເລດ."

msgid "Extra spacing at the bottom of the line in pixels."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງບັນທັດເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid "Extra spacing between graphical glyphs."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມລະຫວ່າງກລິບກຣາບຟິກ."

msgid "Extra width of the space glyphs."
msgstr "ຄວາມກວ້າງເພີ່ມເຕີມຂອງກລິບຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ (space glyphs)."

msgid "Extra spacing at the top of the line in pixels."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງເພີ່ມເຕີມຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງບັນທັດເປັນພິກເຊວ."

msgid ""
"If is not equal to zero, emboldens the font outlines. Negative values reduce "
"the outline thickness.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Emboldened fonts might have self-intersecting outlines, which "
"will prevent MSDF fonts and [TextMesh] from working correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບສູນ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນໜາຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າລົບຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມໜາຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຟອນທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ໜາອາດມີເສັ້ນຂອບທີ່ຕັດກັນເອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟອນ MSDF ແລະ "
"[TextMesh] ເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Active face index in the TrueType / OpenType collection file."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີ face ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຄໍເລັກຊັນ TrueType / OpenType."

msgid ""
"Font OpenType variation coordinates. More info: [url=https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg]OpenType "
"variation tags[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This [Dictionary] uses OpenType tags as keys. Variation axes can "
"be identified both by tags ([int], e.g. [code]0x77678674[/code]) and names "
"([String], e.g. [code]wght[/code]). Some axes might be accessible by multiple "
"names. For example, [code]wght[/code] refers to the same axis as "
"[code]weight[/code]. Tags on the other hand are unique. To convert between "
"names and tags, use [method TextServer.name_to_tag] and [method "
"TextServer.tag_to_name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To get available variation axes of a font, use [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list]."
msgstr ""
"ພິກັດຮູບແບບ OpenType ຂອງຟອນ. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ: [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg]OpenType variation tags[/url].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [Dictionary] ນີ້ໃຊ້ແທັກ OpenType ເປັນຄີ (key). "
"ແກນຮູບແບບສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ທັງດ້ວຍແທັກ ([int], ເຊັ່ນ [code]0x77678674[/code]) ແລະ ຊື່ "
"([String], ເຊັ່ນ [code]wght[/code]). ບາງແກນອາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຫຼາຍຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"[code]wght[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງແກນດຽວກັນກັບ [code]weight[/code]. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, "
"ແທັກຈະມີລັກສະນະສະເພາະຕົວ (unique). ເພື່ອແປງລະຫວ່າງຊື່ ແລະ ແທັກ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"TextServer.name_to_tag] ແລະ [method TextServer.tag_to_name].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຫາແກນຮູບແບບທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງຟອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"Font.get_supported_variation_list]."

msgid ""
"2D transform, applied to the font outlines, can be used for slanting, "
"flipping and rotating glyphs.\n"
"For example, to simulate italic typeface by slanting, apply the following "
"transform [code]Transform2D(1.0, slant, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ການແປງ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບເສັ້ນຂອບຟອນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ກລິບອຽງ, ພິກ ຫຼື ໝຸນ ໄດ້.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຈຳລອງຕົວອັກສອນອຽງໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ອຽງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການແປງດັ່ງນີ້ [code]Transform2D(1.0, "
"slant, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0)[/code]."

msgid "Framebuffer cache manager for Rendering Device based renderers."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການແຄຊ Framebuffer ສຳລັບເຣນເດີເຣີ (renderer) ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Rendering Device."

msgid ""
"Framebuffer cache manager for [RenderingDevice]-based renderers. Provides a "
"way to create a framebuffer and reuse it in subsequent calls for as long as "
"the used textures exists. Framebuffers will automatically be cleaned up when "
"dependent objects are freed."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການແຄຊ Framebuffer ສຳລັບເຣນເດີເຣີທີ່ອີງໃສ່ [RenderingDevice]. ໃຫ້ວິທີການສ້າງ "
"framebuffer ແລະ ນຳມັນມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ ຕາບໃດທີ່ເທັກເຈີທີ່ໃຊ້ຍັງມີຢູ່. Framebuffer "
"ຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອວັດຖຸທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖືກປ່ອຍ (freed)."

msgid ""
"Creates, or obtains a cached, framebuffer. [param textures] lists textures "
"accessed. [param passes] defines the subpasses and texture allocation, if "
"left empty a single pass is created and textures are allocated depending on "
"their usage flags. [param views] defines the number of views used when "
"rendering."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ ຫຼື ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ framebuffer ຈາກແຄຊ. [param textures] ລາຍຊື່ເທັກເຈີທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງ. [param "
"passes] ກຳນົດ subpasses ແລະ ການຈັດສັນເທັກເຈີ, ຖ້າປ່ອຍໃຫ້ວ່າງ ຈະມີການສ້າງ pass ດ່ຽວ ແລະ "
"ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຈັດສັນຕາມແຟລັກການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງພວກມັນ. [param views] ກຳນົດຈຳນວນມຸມມອງ (views) "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາມີການເຣນເດີ."

msgid "A native library for GDExtension."
msgstr "ໄລບຣາຣີເນທີບ (native library) ສຳລັບ GDExtension."

msgid ""
"The [GDExtension] resource type represents a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Shared_library]shared library[/url] which can expand the functionality "
"of the engine. The [GDExtensionManager] singleton is responsible for loading, "
"reloading, and unloading [GDExtension] resources.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] GDExtension itself is not a scripting language and has no "
"relation to [GDScript] resources."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຊັບພະຍາກອນ [GDExtension] ແທນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Shared_library]shared library[/url] ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເອນຈິນ (engine) "
"ໄດ້. [GDExtensionManager] ທີ່ເປັນ singleton ມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການໂຫຼດ, ໂຫຼດໃໝ່ "
"(reloading), ແລະ ຖອນການໂຫຼດ (unloading) ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [GDExtension].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] GDExtension ຕົວມັນເອງບໍ່ແມ່ນພາສາສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ "
"[GDScript]."

msgid "GDExtension overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ GDExtension"

msgid "GDExtension example in C++"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ GDExtension ໃນ C++"

msgid ""
"Returns the lowest level required for this extension to be properly "
"initialized (see the [enum InitializationLevel] enum)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນລະດັບຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (extension) ນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (initialized) "
"ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ (ເບິ່ງ enum [enum InitializationLevel])."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this extension's library has been opened."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າໄລບຣາຣີຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍນີ້ຖືກເປີດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The library is initialized at the same time as the core features of the "
"engine."
msgstr "ໄລບຣາຣີຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາດຽວກັນກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກ (core features) ຂອງເອນຈິນ."

msgid ""
"The library is initialized at the same time as the engine's servers (such as "
"[RenderingServer] or [PhysicsServer3D])."
msgstr ""
"ໄລບຣາຣີຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາດຽວກັນກັບເຊີບເວີ (servers) ຂອງເອນຈິນ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"[RenderingServer] ຫຼື [PhysicsServer3D])."

msgid ""
"The library is initialized at the same time as the engine's scene-related "
"classes."
msgstr "ໄລບຣາຣີຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາດຽວກັນກັບຄລາສທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ scene ຂອງເອນຈິນ."

msgid ""
"The library is initialized at the same time as the engine's editor classes. "
"Only happens when loading the GDExtension in the editor."
msgstr ""
"ໄລບຣາຣີຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາດຽວກັນກັບຄລາສ editor ຂອງເອນຈິນ. ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການໂຫຼດ "
"GDExtension ໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Provides access to GDExtension functionality."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ GDExtension."

msgid ""
"The GDExtensionManager loads, initializes, and keeps track of all available "
"[GDExtension] libraries in the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not worry about GDExtension unless you know what you are "
"doing."
msgstr ""
"GDExtensionManager ມີໜ້າທີ່ໂຫຼດ, ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຮັດວຽກ, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໄລບຣາຣີ [GDExtension] "
"ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນກ່ຽວກັບ GDExtension ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານຈະຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Returns the [GDExtension] at the given file [param path], or [code]null[/"
"code] if it has not been loaded or does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [GDExtension] ທີ່ຢູ່ຕາມ [param path] ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ຫຼື [code]null[/code] "
"ຖ້າມັນຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Returns the file paths of all currently loaded extensions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file paths) ຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the extension at the given file [param path] has "
"already been loaded successfully. See also [method get_loaded_extensions]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຕາມ [param path] "
"ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງ [method get_loaded_extensions] ປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Loads an extension by absolute file path. The [param path] needs to point to "
"a valid [GDExtension]. Returns [constant LOAD_STATUS_OK] if successful."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ແບບເຕັມ (absolute file path). [param path] "
"ຈະຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ [GDExtension] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant LOAD_STATUS_OK] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Loads the extension already in address space via the given path and "
"initialization function. The [param path] needs to be unique and start with "
"[code]\"libgodot://\"[/code]. Returns [constant LOAD_STATUS_OK] if successful."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແອດເດຣສ (address space) ແລ້ວຜ່ານເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ "
"ຟັງຊັນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. [param path] ຈະຕ້ອງບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [code]\"libgodot://"
"\"[/code]. ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant LOAD_STATUS_OK] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ."

msgid ""
"Reloads the extension at the given file path. The [param path] needs to point "
"to a valid [GDExtension], otherwise this method may return either [constant "
"LOAD_STATUS_NOT_LOADED] or [constant LOAD_STATUS_FAILED].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can only reload extensions in the editor. In release builds, "
"this method always fails and returns [constant LOAD_STATUS_FAILED]."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໃໝ່ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດ. [param path] ຈະຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ [GDExtension] "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດນີ້ອາດຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant LOAD_STATUS_NOT_LOADED] ຫຼື [constant "
"LOAD_STATUS_FAILED].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ທ່ານສາມາດໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໃໝ່ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນ release "
"builds, ເມທອດນີ້ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວສະເໝີ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນ [constant LOAD_STATUS_FAILED]."

msgid ""
"Unloads an extension by file path. The [param path] needs to point to an "
"already loaded [GDExtension], otherwise this method returns [constant "
"LOAD_STATUS_NOT_LOADED]."
msgstr ""
"ຖອນການໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌. [param path] ຈະຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ [GDExtension] "
"ທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດແລ້ວ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເມທອດນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [constant LOAD_STATUS_NOT_LOADED]."

msgid ""
"Emitted after the editor has finished loading a new extension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted in editor builds."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ editor ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາສະເພາະໃນ editor builds ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Emitted before the editor starts unloading an extension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted in editor builds."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງສັນຍານກ່ອນທີ່ editor ຈະເລີ່ມຖອນການໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາສະເພາະໃນ editor builds ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Emitted after the editor has finished reloading one or more extensions."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສັນຍານຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ editor ໂຫຼດສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "The extension has loaded successfully."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ຮັບການໂຫຼດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The extension has failed to load, possibly because it does not exist or has "
"missing dependencies."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໂຫຼດບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນວ່າມັນບໍ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ຂາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies)."

msgid "The extension has already been loaded."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດໄປແລ້ວ."

msgid "The extension has not been loaded."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຫຼດ."

msgid "The extension requires the application to restart to fully load."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພື່ອໂຫຼດໃຫ້ສົມບູນ."

msgid "A script implemented in the GDScript programming language."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍພາສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ GDScript."

msgid ""
"A script implemented in the GDScript programming language, saved with the "
"[code].gd[/code] extension. The script extends the functionality of all "
"objects that instantiate it.\n"
"Calling [method new] creates a new instance of the script. [method "
"Object.set_script] extends an existing object, if that object's class matches "
"one of the script's base classes.\n"
"If you are looking for GDScript's built-in functions, see [@GDScript] instead."
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ GDScript, ບັນທຶກດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ [code].gd[/code]. "
"ສະຄຣິບຈະຂະຫຍາຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງວັດຖຸທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instantiate) ຈາກມັນ.\n"
"ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method new] ຈະສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງສະຄຣິບ. [method Object.set_script] "
"ຈະຂະຫຍາຍວັດຖຸທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຖ້າຄລາສຂອງວັດຖຸນັ້ນກົງກັບໜຶ່ງໃນຄລາສພື້ນຖານຂອງສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາຟັງຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕົ້າມາ (built-in functions) ຂອງ GDScript, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"[@GDScript] ແທນ."

msgid "GDScript documentation index"
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີເອກະສານຂອງ GDScript"

msgid ""
"Returns a new instance of the script.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var MyClass = load(\"myclass.gd\")\n"
"var instance = MyClass.new()\n"
"print(instance.get_script() == MyClass) # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງສະຄຣິບ.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var MyClass = load(\"myclass.gd\")\n"
"var instance = MyClass.new()\n"
"print(instance.get_script() == MyClass) # ສະແດງຜົນເປັນ true\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid "GDScript language server."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີພາສາ (language server) ຂອງ GDScript."

msgid ""
"Provides access to certain features that are implemented in the language "
"server.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not a language server client that can be used to "
"access LSP functionality. It only provides access to a limited set of "
"features that is implemented using the same technical foundation as the "
"language server."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງບາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຖືກຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດໃນ language server.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ language server client "
"ທີ່ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ LSP ໄດ້. ມັນພຽງແຕ່ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊຸດຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈຳກັດ "
"ເຊິ່ງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ພື້ນຖານທາງເຕັກນິກດຽວກັນກັບ language server."

msgid "[GDScriptTextDocument] is deprecated."
msgstr "[GDScriptTextDocument] ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ."

msgid "Returns the language server's [GDScriptTextDocument] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [GDScriptTextDocument] ຂອງ language server."

msgid "Returns the language server's [GDScriptWorkspace] instance."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [GDScriptWorkspace] ຂອງ language server."

msgid ""
"Accessing LSP endpoints directly might lead to unwanted side effects. Connect "
"to the server via TCP, like a regular language server client."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ LSP endpoints ໂດຍກົງອາດນຳໄປສູ່ຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີຜ່ານ TCP "
"ຄືກັບ language server client ທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the language server was initialized by a "
"language server client, [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ language server ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍ language server client, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Might result in unwanted side effects for connected clients."
msgstr "ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງສຳລັບຄລາຍແອນ (clients) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"A GDScript syntax highlighter that can be used with [TextEdit] and [CodeEdit] "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ (syntax highlighter) ຂອງ GDScript ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໂນດ [TextEdit] ແລະ "
"[CodeEdit] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] This class can only be used for editor plugins because it relies "
"on editor settings.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var code_preview = TextEdit.new()\n"
"var highlighter = GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter.new()\n"
"code_preview.syntax_highlighter = highlighter\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var codePreview = new TextEdit();\n"
"var highlighter = new GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter();\n"
"codePreview.SyntaxHighlighter = highlighter;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປລັກອິນ (plugins) ຂອງ editor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເພາະວ່າມັນຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ editor.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var code_preview = TextEdit.new()\n"
"var highlighter = GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter.new()\n"
"code_preview.syntax_highlighter = highlighter\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var codePreview = new TextEdit();\n"
"var highlighter = new GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter();\n"
"codePreview.SyntaxHighlighter = highlighter;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid "Document related language server functionality."
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ language server ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເອກະສານ."

msgid "Provides language server functionality related to documents."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ language server ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເອກະສານ."

msgid "Use [method ScriptEditor.goto_help] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method ScriptEditor.goto_help] ແທນ."

msgid "Workspace related language server functionality."
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ language server ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (workspace)."

msgid "Provides language server functionality related to the workspace."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ language server ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Returns the interface of the script in a machine-readable format."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອິນເຕີເຟສ (interface) ຂອງສະຄຣິບໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້."

msgid "Converts a URI to a file path."
msgstr "ແປງ URI ໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Converts a file path to a URI."
msgstr "ແປງເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ເປັນ URI."

msgid ""
"A physics joint that allows for complex movement and rotation between two 3D "
"physics bodies."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຕໍ່ຟີຊິກ (physics joint) ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ການໝຸນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນລະຫວ່າງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ 3D "
"ສອງອັນ."

msgid ""
"The [Generic6DOFJoint3D] (6 Degrees Of Freedom) joint allows for implementing "
"custom types of joints by locking the rotation and translation of certain "
"axes.\n"
"The first 3 DOF represent the linear motion of the physics bodies and the "
"last 3 DOF represent the angular motion of the physics bodies. Each axis can "
"be either locked, or limited."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຕໍ່ [Generic6DOFJoint3D] (6 Degrees Of Freedom) "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດຈຸດຕໍ່ແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ ໂດຍການລັອກການໝຸນ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງບາງແກນ.\n"
"3 DOF ທຳອິດແທນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear motion) ຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ ແລະ 3 DOF "
"ສຸດທ້າຍແທນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບມຸມ (angular motion) ຂອງວັດຖຸຟີຊິກ. ແຕ່ລະແກນສາມາດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຈຳກັດໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the X axis.\n"
"The lower, the longer an impulse from one side takes to travel to the other "
"side."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຂອງການໝຸນ (rotational damping) ຕາມແກນ X.\n"
"ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ແຮງກະຕຸ້ນຈາກຂ້າງໜຶ່ງຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນໃນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປຫາອີກຂ້າງໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], rotation across the X axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການໝຸນຕາມແກນ X ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"When rotating across the X axis, this error tolerance factor defines how much "
"the correction gets slowed down. The lower, the slower."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໝຸນຕາມແກນ X, ຕົວຄູນຄວາມທົນທານຕໍ່ຄວາມຜິດພາດ (error tolerance) "
"ນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າການແກ້ໄຂຈະຊ້າລົງເທົ່າໃດ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the X axis."
msgstr "ປະລິມານແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ເມື່ອໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ X."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in negative direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the X axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງລົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ X."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the X axis. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການໝຸນ (rotational restitution) ຕາມແກນ X. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, "
"ການຄືນຕົວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The speed of all rotations across the X axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງການໝຸນທັງໝົດຕາມແກນ X."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in positive direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the X axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງບວກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ X."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the Y axis. The lower, the more "
"damping occurs."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Y. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], rotation across the Y axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Y ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"When rotating across the Y axis, this error tolerance factor defines how much "
"the correction gets slowed down. The lower, the slower."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໝຸນຕາມແກນ Y, ຕົວຄູນຄວາມທົນທານຕໍ່ຄວາມຜິດພາດນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າການແກ້ໄຂຈະຊ້າລົງເທົ່າໃດ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, "
"ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the Y axis."
msgstr "ປະລິມານແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ເມື່ອໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in negative direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the Y axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງລົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the Y axis. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Y. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຄືນຕົວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The speed of all rotations across the Y axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງການໝຸນທັງໝົດຕາມແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in positive direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the Y axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງບວກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the Z axis. The lower, the more "
"damping occurs."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Z. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], rotation across the Z axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Z ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"When rotating across the Z axis, this error tolerance factor defines how much "
"the correction gets slowed down. The lower, the slower."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໝຸນຕາມແກນ Z, ຕົວຄູນຄວາມທົນທານຕໍ່ຄວາມຜິດພາດນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າການແກ້ໄຂຈະຊ້າລົງເທົ່າໃດ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, "
"ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the Z axis."
msgstr "ປະລິມານແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ເມື່ອໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Z."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in negative direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the Z axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງລົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Z."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the Z axis. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ Z. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຄືນຕົວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The speed of all rotations across the Z axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງການໝຸນທັງໝົດຕາມແກນ Z."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in positive direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the Z axis."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງບວກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ Z."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a rotating motor at the X axis is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມໍເຕີໝຸນທີ່ແກນ X ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor at the X axis."
msgstr "ອັດຕາເລັ່ງສູງສຸດສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ X."

msgid "Target speed for the motor at the X axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ X."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a rotating motor at the Y axis is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມໍເຕີໝຸນທີ່ແກນ Y ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor at the Y axis."
msgstr "ອັດຕາເລັ່ງສູງສຸດສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ Y."

msgid "Target speed for the motor at the Y axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ Y."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], a rotating motor at the Z axis is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ມໍເຕີໝຸນທີ່ແກນ Z ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor at the Z axis."
msgstr "ອັດຕາເລັ່ງສູງສຸດສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ Z."

msgid "Target speed for the motor at the Z axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ Z."

msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the X motion."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ X."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the linear motion across the X axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຕາມແກນ X ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' X axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ X ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot points)."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the X axis movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ X. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ໂມເມນຕຳ (momentum) ຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the X axis. The lower, the slower the "
"movement."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ X. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' X axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ X ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the Y motion."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Y."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the linear motion across the Y axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຕາມແກນ Y ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' Y axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ Y ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the Y axis movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Y. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ໂມເມນຕຳຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the Y axis. The lower, the slower the "
"movement."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ Y. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' Y axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ Y ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the Z motion."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Z."

msgid "If [code]true[/code], the linear motion across the Z axis is limited."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຕາມແກນ Z ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ."

msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' Z axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ Z ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the Z axis movement. The lower, the more "
"momentum gets lost."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແກນ Z. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ໂມເມນຕຳຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the Z axis. The lower, the slower the "
"movement."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ Z. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' Z axis."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນ Z ຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the X axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear motor) ຢູ່ເທິງແກນ X. "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the X axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr "ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບແກນ X ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the X axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຢູ່ເທິງແກນ X."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the Y axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຢູ່ເທິງແກນ Y. "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the Y axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr "ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບແກນ Y ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the Y axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຢູ່ເທິງແກນ Y."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], then there is a linear motor on the Z axis. It will "
"attempt to reach the target velocity while staying within the force limits."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຢູ່ເທິງແກນ Z. "
"ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງແຮງ."

msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor can apply on the Z axis while trying to "
"reach the target velocity."
msgstr "ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບແກນ Z ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid "The speed that the linear motor will attempt to reach on the Z axis."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຢູ່ເທິງແກນ Z."

msgid "The minimum difference between the pivot points' axes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕໍ່າສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid "The maximum difference between the pivot points' axes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງສູງສຸດລະຫວ່າງແກນຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the axes. The lower, the slower the "
"movement."
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the axes' movement. The lower, the more momentum "
"gets lost."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ໂມເມນຕຳຈະຍິ່ງສູນເສຍຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The amount of damping that happens at the linear motion across the axes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບການເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຕາມແກນ."

msgid "The velocity the linear motor will try to reach."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດ."

msgid ""
"The maximum force the linear motor will apply while trying to reach the "
"velocity target."
msgstr "ແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອດຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in negative direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the axes."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງລົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ."

msgid ""
"The minimum rotation in positive direction to break loose and rotate around "
"the axes."
msgstr "ການໝຸນຕໍ່າສຸດໃນທິດທາງບວກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຫຼຸດອອກ ແລະ ໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ."

msgid "The speed of all rotations across the axes."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວຂອງການໝຸນທັງໝົດຕາມແກນ."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the axes. The lower, the more damping "
"occurs."
msgstr ""
"ປະລິມານການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຫຼຸດແຮງສັ່ນສະເທືອນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the axes. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການຄືນຕົວຂອງການໝຸນຕາມແກນ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ການຄືນຕົວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the axes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານແຮງສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ເມື່ອໝຸນອ້ອມແກນ."

msgid ""
"When rotating across the axes, this error tolerance factor defines how much "
"the correction gets slowed down. The lower, the slower."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໝຸນຕາມແກນ, ຕົວຄູນຄວາມທົນທານຕໍ່ຄວາມຜິດພາດນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າການແກ້ໄຂຈະຊ້າລົງເທົ່າໃດ. ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕໍ່າ, ຍິ່ງຊ້າ."

msgid "Target speed for the motor at the axes."
msgstr "ຄວາມໄວເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ."

msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor at the axes."
msgstr "ອັດຕາເລັ່ງສູງສຸດສຳລັບມໍເຕີທີ່ແກນ."

msgid "If enabled, linear motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະສາມາດເຄື່ອນທີ່ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໄດ້ພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "If enabled, rotational motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ພາຍໃນຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "If enabled, there is a rotational motor across these axes."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະມີມໍເຕີໝຸນຕາມແກນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid "If enabled, there is a linear motor across these axes."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະມີມໍເຕີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ຕາມແກນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Flag] enum."
msgstr "ແທັນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum Flag]."

msgid "Provides methods for some common 2D geometric operations."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເມທອດສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດການທາງເລຂາຄະນິດ 2D ທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Provides a set of helper functions to create geometric shapes, compute "
"intersections between shapes, and process various other geometric operations "
"in 2D."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ຊຸດຂອງຟັງຊັນຕົວຊ່ວຍເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຊົງເລຂາຄະນິດ, ຄຳນວນການຕັດກັນລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງ, ແລະ "
"ປະມວນຜົນການປະຕິບັດການທາງເລຂາຄະນິດອື່ນໆໃນ 2D."

msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bresenham%27s_line_algorithm]Bresenham line[/url] between the [param from] "
"and [param to] points. A Bresenham line is a series of pixels that draws a "
"line and is always 1-pixel thick on every row and column of the drawing "
"(never more, never less).\n"
"Example code to draw a line between two [Marker2D] nodes using a series of "
"[method CanvasItem.draw_rect] calls:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _draw():\n"
"\tfor pixel in Geometry2D.bresenham_line($MarkerA.position, "
"$MarkerB.position):\n"
"\t\tdraw_rect(Rect2(pixel, Vector2.ONE), Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bresenham%27s_line_algorithm]ເສັ້ນ "
"Bresenham[/url] ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດ [param from] ແລະ [param to]. ເສັ້ນ Bresenham "
"ແມ່ນລຳດັບຂອງພິກເຊວທີ່ແຕ້ມເປັນເສັ້ນ ແລະ ມີຄວາມໜາ 1 ພິກເຊວສະເໝີໃນທຸກໆແຖວ ແລະ ຄໍລຳຂອງການແຕ້ມ "
"(ບໍ່ມີຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍກວ່ານີ້).\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດເພື່ອແຕ້ມເສັ້ນລະຫວ່າງໂນດ [Marker2D] ສອງອັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນ [method "
"CanvasItem.draw_rect] ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _draw():\n"
"\tfor pixel in Geometry2D.bresenham_line($MarkerA.position, "
"$MarkerB.position):\n"
"\t\tdraw_rect(Rect2(pixel, Vector2.ONE), Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Clips [param polygon_a] against [param polygon_b] and returns an array of "
"clipped polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] between "
"polygons. Returns an empty array if [param polygon_b] completely overlaps "
"[param polygon_a].\n"
"If [param polygon_b] is enclosed by [param polygon_a], returns an outer "
"polygon (boundary) and inner polygon (hole) which could be distinguished by "
"calling [method is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດ (Clip) [param polygon_a] ດ້ວຍ [param polygon_b] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ "
"(polygons) ທີ່ຖືກຕັດແລ້ວ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດ [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] "
"ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າ [param polygon_b] ທັບຊ້ອນ [param polygon_a] "
"ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param polygon_b] ຖືກລ້ອມຮອບໂດຍ [param polygon_a], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) "
"ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນ (ຮູ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຍກແຍະໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

msgid ""
"Clips [param polyline] against [param polygon] and returns an array of "
"clipped polylines. This performs [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] between the "
"polyline and the polygon. This operation can be thought of as cutting a line "
"with a closed shape."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດ [param polyline] ດ້ວຍ [param polygon] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງເສັ້ນຫຼາຍທ່ອນ (polylines) "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕັດແລ້ວ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດ [constant OPERATION_DIFFERENCE] ລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນຫຼາຍທ່ອນ ແລະ "
"ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ສາມາດປຽບໄດ້ກັບການຕັດເສັ້ນດ້ວຍຮູບຊົງປິດ."

msgid ""
"Given an array of [Vector2]s, returns the convex hull as a list of points in "
"counterclockwise order. The last point is the same as the first one."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດອາເຣຂອງ [Vector2], ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ convex hull "
"ເປັນລາຍການຂອງຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນລຳດັບທວນເຂັມໂມງ. ຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍຈະເປັນຈຸດດຽວກັບຈຸດທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"Decomposes the [param polygon] into multiple convex hulls and returns an "
"array of [PackedVector2Array]."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກ [param polygon] ອອກເປັນ convex hull ຫຼາຍອັນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ "
"[PackedVector2Array]."

msgid ""
"Mutually excludes common area defined by intersection of [param polygon_a] "
"and [param polygon_b] (see [method intersect_polygons]) and returns an array "
"of excluded polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_XOR] between "
"polygons. In other words, returns all but common area between polygons.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"ແຍກພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນຮ່ວມທີ່ເກີດຈາກການຕັດກັນຂອງ [param polygon_a] ແລະ [param polygon_b] "
"ອອກຈາກກັນ (ເບິ່ງ [method intersect_polygons]) ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ຖືກແຍກອອກ. "
"ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດ [constant OPERATION_XOR] ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດຍົກເວັ້ນພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນຮ່ວມລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນ (ຮູ) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຍກແຍະໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

msgid ""
"Returns the 2D point on the 2D segment ([param s1], [param s2]) that is "
"closest to [param point]. The returned point will always be inside the "
"specified segment."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດ 2D ຢູ່ເທິງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ([param s1], [param s2]) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ [param point] "
"ທີ່ສຸດ. ຈຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 2D point on the 2D line defined by ([param s1], [param s2]) that "
"is closest to [param point]. The returned point can be inside the segment "
"([param s1], [param s2]) or outside of it, i.e. somewhere on the line "
"extending from the segment."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຸດ 2D ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ ([param s1], [param s2]) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ [param point] "
"ທີ່ສຸດ. ຈຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນອາດຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param s1], [param s2]) ຫຼື ຢູ່ນອກກໍໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງກໍຄືຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງໃນເສັ້ນທີ່ຕໍ່ອອກມາຈາກສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່."

msgid ""
"Given the two 2D segments ([param p1], [param q1]) and ([param p2], [param "
"q2]), finds those two points on the two segments that are closest to each "
"other. Returns a [PackedVector2Array] that contains this point on ([param "
"p1], [param q1]) as well the accompanying point on ([param p2], [param q2])."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ສອງສ່ວນ ([param p1], [param q1]) ແລະ ([param p2], [param "
"q2]), ຈະຫາຈຸດສອງຈຸດໃນສອງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນທີ່ສຸດ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [PackedVector2Array] "
"ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດນີ້ໃນ ([param p1], [param q1]) ລວມທັງຈຸດທີ່ຄູ່ກັນໃນ ([param p2], [param "
"q2])."

msgid ""
"Intersects [param polygon_a] with [param polygon_b] and returns an array of "
"intersected polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] between "
"polygons. In other words, returns common area shared by polygons. Returns an "
"empty array if no intersection occurs.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"ຫາສ່ວນທີ່ຕັດກັນຂອງ [param polygon_a] ດ້ວຍ [param polygon_b] ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ຕັດກັນ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດ [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] "
"ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ສົ່ງຄືນພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນຮ່ວມລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. "
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັດກັນເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນ (ຮູ) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຍກແຍະໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນ [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

msgid ""
"Intersects [param polyline] with [param polygon] and returns an array of "
"intersected polylines. This performs [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] "
"between the polyline and the polygon. This operation can be thought of as "
"chopping a line with a closed shape."
msgstr ""
"ຫາສ່ວນທີ່ຕັດກັນຂອງ [param polyline] ດ້ວຍ [param polygon] ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງເສັ້ນຫຼາຍທ່ອນທີ່ຕັດກັນ. ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດ [constant OPERATION_INTERSECTION] "
"ລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນຫຼາຍທ່ອນ ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ສາມາດປຽບໄດ້ກັບການຕັດເສັ້ນດ້ວຍຮູບຊົງປິດ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside the circle or if it's "
"located exactly [i]on[/i] the circle's boundary, otherwise returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param point] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນວົງມົນ ຫຼື ຖ້າມັນຕັ້ງຢູ່ [i]ເທິງ[/i] "
"ຂອບຂອງວົງມົນພໍດີ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside [param polygon] or if "
"it's located exactly [i]on[/i] polygon's boundary, otherwise returns "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [param point] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ [param polygon] ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າມັນຕັ້ງຢູ່ເທິງຂອບຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈພໍດີ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param polygon]'s vertices are ordered in "
"clockwise order, otherwise returns [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Assumes a Cartesian coordinate system where [code]+x[/code] is "
"right and [code]+y[/code] is up. If using screen coordinates ([code]+y[/code] "
"is down), the result will need to be flipped (i.e. a [code]true[/code] result "
"will indicate counter-clockwise)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າຈຸດຈອມຂອງ [param polygon] ຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມເຂັມໂມງ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສົມມຸດໃຊ້ລະບົບພິກັດ Cartesian ທີ່ [code]+x[/code] ແມ່ນເບື້ອງຂວາ ແລະ [code]"
"+y[/code] ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນເທິງ. ຖ້າໃຊ້ພິກັດໜ້າຈໍ ([code]+y[/code] ແມ່ນລົງລຸ່ມ), ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຕ້ອງຖືກປີ້ນ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜົນເປັນ [code]true[/code] ຈະບົ່ງບອກເຖິງການທວນເຂັມໂມງ)."

msgid ""
"Returns the point of intersection between the two lines ([param from_a], "
"[param dir_a]) and ([param from_b], [param dir_b]). Returns a [Vector2], or "
"[code]null[/code] if the lines are parallel.\n"
"[code]from[/code] and [code]dir[/code] are [i]not[/i] endpoints of a line "
"segment or ray but the slope ([code]dir[/code]) and a known point "
"([code]from[/code]) on that line. To get the intersection between two line "
"segments, use [method segment_intersects_segment].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var from_a = Vector2.ZERO\n"
"var dir_a = Vector2.RIGHT\n"
"var from_b = Vector2.DOWN\n"
"\n"
"# Returns Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(1, -1))\n"
"# Returns Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(-1, -1))\n"
"# Returns null\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2.RIGHT)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fromA = Vector2.Zero;\n"
"var dirA = Vector2.Right;\n"
"var fromB = Vector2.Down;\n"
"\n"
"// Returns new Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(1, -1));\n"
"// Returns new Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(-1, -1));\n"
"// Returns null\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, Vector2.Right);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຕັດກັນລະຫວ່າງສອງເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param from_a], [param dir_a]) ແລະ ([param from_b], "
"[param dir_b]). ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [Vector2], ຫຼື [code]null[/code] ຖ້າເສັ້ນຊື່ຂະໜານກັນ.\n"
"[code]from[/code] ແລະ [code]dir[/code] [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ຈຸດປາຍຂອງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ຫຼື ລັງສີ "
"ແຕ່ແມ່ນຄວາມຊັນ ([code]dir[/code]) ແລະ ຈຸດທີ່ຮູ້ ([code]from[/code]) ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນ. "
"ເພື່ອຫາຈຸດຕັດກັນລະຫວ່າງສອງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method segment_intersects_segment].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var from_a = Vector2.ZERO\n"
"var dir_a = Vector2.RIGHT\n"
"var from_b = Vector2.DOWN\n"
"\n"
"# ສົ່ງຄ່າ Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(1, -1))\n"
"# ສົ່ງຄ່າ Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2(-1, -1))\n"
"# ສົ່ງຄ່າ null\n"
"Geometry2D.line_intersects_line(from_a, dir_a, from_b, Vector2.RIGHT)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fromA = Vector2.Zero;\n"
"var dirA = Vector2.Right;\n"
"var fromB = Vector2.Down;\n"
"\n"
"// ສົ່ງຄ່າ new Vector2(1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(1, -1));\n"
"// ສົ່ງຄ່າ new Vector2(-1, 0)\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, new Vector2(-1, -1));\n"
"// ສົ່ງຄ່າ null\n"
"Geometry2D.LineIntersectsLine(fromA, dirA, fromB, Vector2.Right);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Given an array of [Vector2]s representing tiles, builds an atlas. The "
"returned dictionary has two keys: [code]points[/code] is a "
"[PackedVector2Array] that specifies the positions of each tile, [code]size[/"
"code] contains the overall size of the whole atlas as [Vector2i]."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກອາເຣຂອງ [Vector2] ທີ່ແທນແຜ່ນກະເບື້ອງ (tiles), ສ້າງເປັນ atlas. Dictionary "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາມີສອງ key: [code]points[/code] ແມ່ນ [PackedVector2Array] "
"ທີ່ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຕ່ລະແຜ່ນ, [code]size[/code] ແມ່ນຂະໜາດລວມຂອງ atlas ທັງໝົດໃນຮູບແບບ "
"[Vector2i]."

msgid ""
"Merges (combines) [param polygon_a] and [param polygon_b] and returns an "
"array of merged polygons. This performs [constant OPERATION_UNION] between "
"polygons.\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and multiple inner "
"polygons (holes) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"ຮວມ (combines) [param polygon_a] ແລະ [param polygon_b] ເຂົ້າກັນ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ຮວມແລ້ວ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການເຮັດ [constant OPERATION_UNION] "
"ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນຫຼາຍຮູບ (ຮູ) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຈຳແນກໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

msgid ""
"Inflates or deflates [param polygon] by [param delta] units (pixels). If "
"[param delta] is positive, makes the polygon grow outward. If [param delta] "
"is negative, shrinks the polygon inward. Returns an array of polygons because "
"inflating/deflating may result in multiple discrete polygons. Returns an "
"empty array if [param delta] is negative and the absolute value of it "
"approximately exceeds the minimum bounding rectangle dimensions of the "
"polygon.\n"
"Each polygon's vertices will be rounded as determined by [param join_type].\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To translate the polygon's vertices specifically, multiply them "
"to a [Transform2D]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon = PackedVector2Array([Vector2(0, 0), Vector2(100, 0), "
"Vector2(100, 100), Vector2(0, 100)])\n"
"var offset = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"polygon = Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon\n"
"print(polygon) # Prints [(50.0, 50.0), (150.0, 50.0), (150.0, 150.0), (50.0, "
"150.0)]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Vector2[] polygon = [new Vector2(0, 0), new Vector2(100, 0), new Vector2(100, "
"100), new Vector2(0, 100)];\n"
"var offset = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"polygon = new Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon;\n"
"GD.Print((Variant)polygon); // Prints [(50, 50), (150, 50), (150, 150), (50, "
"150)]\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຍໍ້ [param polygon] ດ້ວຍຫົວໜ່ວຍ [param delta] (ພິກເຊວ). ຖ້າ [param delta] "
"ເປັນບວກ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຂະຫຍາຍອອກ. ຖ້າ [param delta] ເປັນລົບ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ. "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ ເພາະການຂະຫຍາຍ/ຍໍ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແຍກກັນຫຼາຍຮູບ. "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຖ້າ [param delta] ເປັນລົບ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າສຳບູນຂອງມັນໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂະໜາດສີ່ແຈອ້ອມຮອບຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ.\n"
"ຈຸດຈອມຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົນຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param join_type].\n"
"ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນ (ຮູ) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຈຳແນກໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method is_polygon_clockwise].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຈຸດຈອມຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈໂດຍສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ຄູນພວກມັນດ້ວຍ "
"[Transform2D]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon = PackedVector2Array([Vector2(0, 0), Vector2(100, 0), "
"Vector2(100, 100), Vector2(0, 100)])\n"
"var offset = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"polygon = Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon\n"
"print(polygon) # ສະແດງ [(50.0, 50.0), (150.0, 50.0), (150.0, 150.0), (50.0, "
"150.0)]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Vector2[] polygon = [new Vector2(0, 0), new Vector2(100, 0), new Vector2(100, "
"100), new Vector2(0, 100)];\n"
"var offset = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"polygon = new Transform2D(0, offset) * polygon;\n"
"GD.Print((Variant)polygon); // ສະແດງ [(50, 50), (150, 50), (150, 150), (50, "
"150)]\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

msgid ""
"Inflates or deflates [param polyline] by [param delta] units (pixels), "
"producing polygons. If [param delta] is positive, makes the polyline grow "
"outward. Returns an array of polygons because inflating/deflating may result "
"in multiple discrete polygons. If [param delta] is negative, returns an empty "
"array.\n"
"Each polygon's vertices will be rounded as determined by [param join_type].\n"
"Each polygon's endpoints will be rounded as determined by [param end_type].\n"
"The operation may result in an outer polygon (boundary) and inner polygon "
"(hole) produced which could be distinguished by calling [method "
"is_polygon_clockwise]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຍໍ້ [param polyline] ດ້ວຍຫົວໜ່ວຍ [param delta] (ພິກເຊວ) ເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ. "
"ຖ້າ [param delta] ເປັນບວກ, ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນ polyline ຂະຫຍາຍອອກ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ "
"ເພາະການຂະຫຍາຍ/ຍໍ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈແຍກກັນຫຼາຍຮູບ. ຖ້າ [param delta] ເປັນລົບ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"
"ຈຸດຈອມຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົນຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param join_type].\n"
"ຈຸດປາຍຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົນຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param end_type].\n"
"ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນນອກ (ຂອບ) ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຊັ້ນໃນ (ຮູ) "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຈຳແນກໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method is_polygon_clockwise]."

msgid ""
"Returns if [param point] is inside the triangle specified by [param a], "
"[param b] and [param c]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າວ່າ [param point] ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param a], [param b] ແລະ [param c] "
"ຫຼື ບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Given the 2D segment ([param segment_from], [param segment_to]), returns the "
"position on the segment (as a number between 0 and 1) at which the segment "
"hits the circle that is located at position [param circle_position] and has "
"radius [param circle_radius]. If the segment does not intersect the circle, "
"-1 is returned (this is also the case if the line extending the segment would "
"intersect the circle, but the segment does not)."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ 2D ([param segment_from], [param segment_to]), ສົ່ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງໃນສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ "
"(ເປັນຕົວເລກລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1) ທີ່ສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນຕັດກັບຮູບວົງມົນທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ [param circle_position] ແລະ "
"ມີລັດສະໝີ [param circle_radius]. ຖ້າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ບໍ່ຕັດກັບວົງມົນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ -1 "
"(ລວມທັງໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ຕໍ່ອອກຈາກສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນຕັດກັບວົງມົນ ແຕ່ຕົວສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ເອງບໍ່ຕັດ)."

msgid ""
"Checks if two line segments intersect, with line [code]a[/code] between "
"[param from_a] and [param to_a] and line [code]b[/code] between [param "
"from_b] and [param to_b]. If the line segments intersect, the point of "
"intersection is returned as a [Vector2]. If no intersection takes place, "
"[code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າສອງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ຕັດກັນຫຼືບໍ່, ໂດຍມີເສັ້ນ [code]a[/code] ລະຫວ່າງ [param from_a] ແລະ "
"[param to_a] ແລະ ເສັ້ນ [code]b[/code] ລະຫວ່າງ [param from_b] ແລະ [param to_b]. "
"ຖ້າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຕັດເປັນ [Vector2]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Triangulates the area specified by discrete set of [param points] such that "
"no point is inside the circumcircle of any resulting triangle. Returns a "
"[PackedInt32Array] where each triangle consists of three consecutive point "
"indices into [param points] (i.e. the returned array will have [code]n * 3[/"
"code] elements, with [code]n[/code] being the number of found triangles). If "
"the triangulation did not succeed, an empty [PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍຊຸດຂອງ [param points] ໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບສາມແຈ "
"ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຈຸດໃດຢູ່ພາຍໃນວົງມົນລ້ອມຮອບຂອງຮູບສາມແຈໃດໆທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedInt32Array] "
"ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະຮູບສາມແຈປະກອບດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີຈຸດສາມຈຸດລຽງກັນໃນ [param points] "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະມີ [code]n * 3[/code] ອົງປະກອບ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]n[/code] "
"ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ພົບ). ຖ້າການແບ່ງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedInt32Array] "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Triangulates the polygon specified by the points in [param polygon]. Returns "
"a [PackedInt32Array] where each triangle consists of three consecutive point "
"indices into [param polygon] (i.e. the returned array will have [code]n * 3[/"
"code] elements, with [code]n[/code] being the number of found triangles). "
"Output triangles will always be counter clockwise, and the contour will be "
"flipped if it's clockwise. If the triangulation did not succeed, an empty "
"[PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນ [param polygon] ໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບສາມແຈ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"[PackedInt32Array] ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະຮູບສາມແຈປະກອບດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີຈຸດສາມຈຸດລຽງກັນໃນ [param polygon] "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະມີ [code]n * 3[/code] ອົງປະກອບ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]n[/code] "
"ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ພົບ). ຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ໄດ້ຈະເປັນແບບທວນເຂັມໂມງສະເໝີ, ແລະ "
"ເສັ້ນຂອບຈະຖືກປີ້ນຖ້າມັນເປັນແບບຕາມເຂັມໂມງ. ຖ້າການແບ່ງເປັນຮູບສາມແຈບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"[PackedInt32Array] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Create regions where either subject or clip polygons (or both) are filled."
msgstr "ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຫຼັກ (subject) ຫຼື ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕັດ (clip) (ຫຼື ທັງສອງ) ຖືກເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Create regions where subject polygons are filled except where clip polygons "
"are filled."
msgstr "ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຫຼັກຖືກເຕັມ ຍົກເວັ້ນບ່ອນທີ່ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕັດຖືກເຕັມ."

msgid "Create regions where both subject and clip polygons are filled."
msgstr "ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທັງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຫຼັກ ແລະ ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕັດຖືກເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Create regions where either subject or clip polygons are filled but not where "
"both are filled."
msgstr "ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຫຼັກ ຫຼື ຮູບຫຼາຍແຈຕັດຖືກເຕັມ ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ທັງສອງຖືກເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"Squaring is applied uniformally at all convex edge joins at [code]1 * delta[/"
"code]."
msgstr "ການເຮັດເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງສະເໝີພາບກັບທຸກໆຈຸດຕໍ່ຂອບນູນທີ່ [code]1 * delta[/code]."

msgid ""
"While flattened paths can never perfectly trace an arc, they are approximated "
"by a series of arc chords."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ແປ (flattened paths) ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລາກຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, "
"ແຕ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກປະມານດ້ວຍຊຸດຂອງເສັ້ນຄອດ (arc chords)."

msgid ""
"There's a necessary limit to mitered joins since offsetting edges that join "
"at very acute angles will produce excessively long and narrow \"spikes\". For "
"any given edge join, when miter offsetting would exceed that maximum "
"distance, \"square\" joining is applied."
msgstr ""
"ມີການກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດສຳລັບການຕໍ່ແບບມຸມແຫຼມ (mitered joins) ເພາະວ່າການເຮັດ offset "
"ຂອບທີ່ຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍມຸມທີ່ແຫຼມຫຼາຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"ໜາມ\" ທີ່ຍາວ ແລະ ແຄບເກີນໄປ. ສຳລັບການຕໍ່ຂອບໃດໆ, "
"ເມື່ອການເຮັດ miter offset ເກີນໄລຍະສູງສຸດນັ້ນ, ການຕໍ່ແບບ \"ສີ່ແຈ\" (square) ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Endpoints are joined using the [enum PolyJoinType] value and the path filled "
"as a polygon."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍຖືກຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ [enum PolyJoinType] ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກເຕັມເປັນຮູບຫຼາຍແຈ."

msgid ""
"Endpoints are joined using the [enum PolyJoinType] value and the path filled "
"as a polyline."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍຖືກຕໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ [enum PolyJoinType] ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງຈະຖືກເຕັມເປັນ polyline."

msgid "Endpoints are squared off with no extension."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕໍ່ຍາວອອກໄປ."

msgid "Endpoints are squared off and extended by [code]delta[/code] units."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈ ແລະ ຕໍ່ຍາວອອກໄປ [code]delta[/code] ຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid "Endpoints are rounded off and extended by [code]delta[/code] units."
msgstr "ຈຸດປາຍຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົນ ແລະ ຕໍ່ຍາວອອກໄປ [code]delta[/code] ຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid "Provides methods for some common 3D geometric operations."
msgstr "ສະໜອງເມທອດສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທາງເລຂາຄະນິດ 3D ທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Provides a set of helper functions to create geometric shapes, compute "
"intersections between shapes, and process various other geometric operations "
"in 3D."
msgstr ""
"ສະໜອງຊຸດຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຊົງເລຂາຄະນິດ, ຄິດໄລ່ຈຸດຕັດກັນລະຫວ່າງຮູບຊົງ, ແລະ "
"ປະມວນຜົນການດຳເນີນການທາງເລຂາຄະນິດອື່ນໆໃນ 3D."

msgid ""
"Returns an array with 6 [Plane]s that describe the sides of a box centered at "
"the origin. The box size is defined by [param extents], which represents one "
"(positive) corner of the box (i.e. half its actual size)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣທີ່ມີ 6 [Plane] ທີ່ອະທິບາຍດ້ານຕ່າງໆຂອງກ່ອງທີ່ມີຈຸດສູນກາງຢູ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin). "
"ຂະໜາດຂອງກ່ອງຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [param extents], ເຊິ່ງແທນມຸມໜຶ່ງ (ດ້ານບວກ) ຂອງກ່ອງ "
"(ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະໜາດຕົວຈິງ)."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Plane]s closely bounding a faceted capsule centered at "
"the origin with radius [param radius] and height [param height]. The "
"parameter [param sides] defines how many planes will be generated for the "
"side part of the capsule, whereas [param lats] gives the number of "
"latitudinal steps at the bottom and top of the capsule. The parameter [param "
"axis] describes the axis along which the capsule is oriented (0 for X, 1 for "
"Y, 2 for Z)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Plane] ທີ່ອ້ອມຮອບແຄບຊູນແບບມີຫຼ່ຽມ (faceted capsule) "
"ທີ່ມີຈຸດສູນກາງຢູ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດ ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີ [param radius] ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ [param height]. ພາລາມິເຕີ "
"[param sides] ກຳນົດຈຳນວນລະນາບ (planes) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບສ່ວນດ້ານຂ້າງຂອງແຄບຊູນ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [param lats] ບອກຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຂອງເສັ້ນຂະໜານ (latitudinal steps) ຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງແຄບຊູນ. ພາລາມິເຕີ [param axis] ອະທິບາຍແກນທີ່ແແຄບຊູນວາງຕົວຢູ່ (0 ສຳລັບ X, 1 ສຳລັບ "
"Y, 2 ສຳລັບ Z)."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Plane]s closely bounding a faceted cylinder centered at "
"the origin with radius [param radius] and height [param height]. The "
"parameter [param sides] defines how many planes will be generated for the "
"round part of the cylinder. The parameter [param axis] describes the axis "
"along which the cylinder is oriented (0 for X, 1 for Y, 2 for Z)."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Plane] ທີ່ອ້ອມຮອບຮູບທໍ່ກົມແບບມີຫຼ່ຽມ (faceted cylinder) "
"ທີ່ມີຈຸດສູນກາງຢູ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດ ດ້ວຍລັດສະໝີ [param radius] ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ [param height]. ພາລາມິເຕີ "
"[param sides] ກຳນົດຈຳນວນລະນາບ (planes) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບສ່ວນມົນຂອງຮູບທໍ່ກົມ. ພາລາມິເຕີ "
"[param axis] ອະທິບາຍແກນທີ່ຮູບທໍ່ກົມວາງຕົວຢູ່ (0 ສຳລັບ X, 1 ສຳລັບ Y, 2 ສຳລັບ Z)."

msgid ""
"Clips the polygon defined by the points in [param points] against the [param "
"plane] and returns the points of the clipped polygon."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຈຸດຕ່າງໆໃນ [param points] ດ້ວຍ [param plane] ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈທີ່ຖືກຕັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Calculates and returns all the vertex points of a convex shape defined by an "
"array of [param planes]."
msgstr ""
"ຄິດໄລ່ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຈອມທັງໝົດຂອງຮູບຊົງນູນ (convex shape) ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍອາເຣຂອງ [param planes]."

msgid ""
"Returns the 3D point on the 3D segment ([param s1], [param s2]) that is "
"closest to [param point]. The returned point will always be inside the "
"specified segment."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດ 3D ຢູ່ເທິງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ 3D ([param s1], [param s2]) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ [param point] ທີ່ສຸດ. "
"ຈຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Returns the 3D point on the 3D line defined by ([param s1], [param s2]) that "
"is closest to [param point]. The returned point can be inside the segment "
"([param s1], [param s2]) or outside of it, i.e. somewhere on the line "
"extending from the segment."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດ 3D ຢູ່ເທິງເສັ້ນຊື່ 3D ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ ([param s1], [param s2]) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ [param point] "
"ທີ່ສຸດ. ຈຸດທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາອາດຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param s1], [param s2]) ຫຼື ຢູ່ນອກມັນກໍໄດ້, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງເທິງເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ຕໍ່ອອກມາຈາກສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Given the two 3D segments ([param p1], [param p2]) and ([param q1], [param "
"q2]), finds those two points on the two segments that are closest to each "
"other. Returns a [PackedVector3Array] that contains this point on ([param "
"p1], [param p2]) as well the accompanying point on ([param q1], [param q2])."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກສອງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ 3D ([param p1], [param p2]) ແລະ ([param q1], [param q2]), "
"ຊອກຫາສອງຈຸດຢູ່ເທິງສອງສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ນັ້ນທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນທີ່ສຸດ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedVector3Array] "
"ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດນີ້ຢູ່ເທິງ ([param p1], [param p2]) ລວມທັງຈຸດທີ່ຄູ່ກັນຢູ່ເທິງ ([param q1], [param "
"q2])."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Vector3] containing weights based on how close a 3D position "
"([param point]) is to a triangle's different vertices ([param a], [param b] "
"and [param c]). This is useful for interpolating between the data of "
"different vertices in a triangle. One example use case is using this to "
"smoothly rotate over a mesh instead of relying solely on face normals.\n"
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barycentric_coordinate_system]Here is a "
"more detailed explanation of barycentric coordinates.[/url]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າ [Vector3] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍນ້ຳໜັກ (weights) ອີງຕາມຄວາມໃກ້ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງ 3D ([param point]) "
"ກັບຈຸດຈອມຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບສາມແຈ ([param a], [param b] ແລະ [param c]). "
"ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເຮັດ interpolation ລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຈຸດຈອມຕ່າງໆໃນຮູບສາມແຈ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງໃນການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໝູນຕົວຢູ່ເທິງ mesh ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ແທນທີ່ຈະອາໄສພຽງແຕ່ face "
"normals.\n"
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Barycentric_coordinate_system]ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພິກັດ barycentric.[/"
"url]"

msgid ""
"Tests if the 3D ray starting at [param from] with the direction of [param "
"dir] intersects the triangle specified by [param a], [param b] and [param c]. "
"If yes, returns the point of intersection as [Vector3]. If no intersection "
"takes place, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ທົດສອບວ່າລັງສີ 3D ທີ່ເລີ່ມຈາກ [param from] ດ້ວຍທິດທາງຂອງ [param dir] "
"ຕັດກັບຮູບສາມແຈທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [param a], [param b] ແລະ [param c] ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າແມ່ນ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຕັດເປັນ [Vector3]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Given a convex hull defined though the [Plane]s in the array [param planes], "
"tests if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects with that hull. If "
"an intersection is found, returns a [PackedVector3Array] containing the point "
"the intersection and the hull's normal. Otherwise, returns an empty array."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໂຄງນູນ (convex hull) ທີ່ກຳນົດຜ່ານ [Plane] ໃນອາເຣ [param planes], ທົດສອບວ່າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ "
"([param from], [param to]) ຕັດກັບໂຄງນູນນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າພົບຈຸດຕັດ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[PackedVector3Array] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດຕັດ ແລະ ຄ່າ normal ຂອງໂຄງນູນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Checks if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the cylinder with "
"height [param height] that is centered at the origin and has radius [param "
"radius]. If no, returns an empty [PackedVector3Array]. If an intersection "
"takes place, the returned array contains the point of intersection and the "
"cylinder's normal at the point of intersection."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param from], [param to]) ຕັດກັບຮູບທໍ່ກົມທີ່ມີຄວາມສູງ [param height], "
"ມີຈຸດສູນກາງຢູ່ຈຸດກຳເນີດ ແລະ ມີລັດສະໝີ [param radius] ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າບໍ່, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[PackedVector3Array] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ຖ້າມີການຕັດກັນ, ອາເຣທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດຕັດ ແລະ ຄ່າ "
"normal ຂອງຮູບທໍ່ກົມຢູ່ຈຸດຕັດນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Checks if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the sphere that "
"is located at [param sphere_position] and has radius [param sphere_radius]. "
"If no, returns an empty [PackedVector3Array]. If yes, returns a "
"[PackedVector3Array] containing the point of intersection and the sphere's "
"normal at the point of intersection."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param from], [param to]) ຕັດກັບຮູບຊົງກົມທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ [param "
"sphere_position] ແລະ ມີລັດສະໝີ [param sphere_radius] ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າບໍ່, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[PackedVector3Array] ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ຖ້າແມ່ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [PackedVector3Array] "
"ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຈຸດຕັດ ແລະ ຄ່າ normal ຂອງຮູບຊົງກົມຢູ່ຈຸດຕັດນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Tests if the segment ([param from], [param to]) intersects the triangle "
"[param a], [param b], [param c]. If yes, returns the point of intersection as "
"[Vector3]. If no intersection takes place, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ທົດສອບວ່າສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ([param from], [param to]) ຕັດກັບຮູບສາມແຈ [param a], [param b], "
"[param c] ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າແມ່ນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຈຸດຕັດເປັນ [Vector3]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຕັດກັນ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Tetrahedralizes the volume specified by a discrete set of [param points] in "
"3D space, ensuring that no point lies within the circumsphere of any "
"resulting tetrahedron. The method returns a [PackedInt32Array] where each "
"tetrahedron consists of four consecutive point indices into the [param "
"points] array (resulting in an array with [code]n * 4[/code] elements, where "
"[code]n[/code] is the number of tetrahedra found). If the tetrahedralization "
"is unsuccessful, an empty [PackedInt32Array] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ແບ່ງບໍລິມາດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍຊຸດຂອງ [param points] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D ໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບສີ່ໜ້າ (tetrahedron), "
"ໂດຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າບໍ່ມີຈຸດໃດຢູ່ພາຍໃນໜ້າກົມລ້ອມຮອບ (circumsphere) ຂອງຮູບສີ່ໜ້າໃດໆທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. "
"ເມທອດນີ້ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedInt32Array] ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະຮູບສີ່ໜ້າປະກອບດ້ວຍດັດຊະນີຈຸດສີ່ຈຸດລຽງກັນໃນອາເຣ "
"[param points] (ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ອາເຣທີ່ມີ [code]n * 4[/code] ອົງປະກອບ, ໂດຍທີ່ [code]n[/code] "
"ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຮູບສີ່ໜ້າທີ່ພົບ). ຖ້າການແບ່ງເປັນຮູບສີ່ໜ້າບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedInt32Array] "
"ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "Base node for geometry-based visual instances."
msgstr "ໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ visual instances ທີ່ອີງຕາມເລຂາຄະນິດ."

msgid ""
"Base node for geometry-based visual instances. Shares some common "
"functionality like visibility and custom materials."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດພື້ນຖານສຳລັບ visual instances ທີ່ອີງຕາມເລຂາຄະນິດ. ມີຟັງຊັນການເຮັດງານທົ່ວໄປຮ່ວມກັນ ເຊັ່ນ "
"ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ ແລະ ວັດສະດຸ (materials) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid "Visibility ranges (HLOD)"
msgstr "ໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ (HLOD)"

msgid ""
"Set the value of a shader uniform for this instance only ([url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.html#per-instance-"
"uniforms]per-instance uniform[/url]). See also [method "
"ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] to assign a uniform on all instances "
"using the same [ShaderMaterial].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For a shader uniform to be assignable on a per-instance basis, "
"it [i]must[/i] be defined with [code]instance uniform ...[/code] rather than "
"[code]uniform ...[/code] in the shader code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param name] is case-sensitive and must match the name of the "
"uniform in the code exactly (not the capitalized name in the inspector).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Per-instance shader uniforms are only available in Spatial and "
"CanvasItem shaders, but not for Fog, Sky, or Particles shaders."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ shader uniform ສຳລັບ instance ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ([url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/"
"shader_reference/shading_language.html#per-instance-uniforms]per-instance "
"uniform[/url]). ເບິ່ງ [method ShaderMaterial.set_shader_parameter] ນຳອີກ "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ uniform ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກ instance ທີ່ໃຊ້ [ShaderMaterial] ດຽວກັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ shader uniform ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າແບບແຍກ instance ໄດ້, ມັນ [i]ຕ້ອງ[/"
"i] ຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ [code]instance uniform ...[/code] ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ [code]uniform ...[/"
"code] ໃນ code ຂອງ shader.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param name] ແມ່ນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍມີຄວາມໝາຍຕ່າງກັນ (case-sensitive) ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ຂອງ uniform ໃນ code ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ທີ່ເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ໃນ inspector).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] Per-instance shader uniforms ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນ Spatial ແລະ "
"CanvasItem shaders ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Fog, Sky, ຫຼື Particles shaders."

msgid "The mode used to cast shadows from this instance."
msgstr "ໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງເງົາຈາກ instance ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Overrides the bounding box of this node with a custom one. This can be used "
"to avoid the expensive [AABB] recalculation that happens when a skeleton is "
"used with a [MeshInstance3D] or to have precise control over the "
"[MeshInstance3D]'s bounding box. To use the default AABB, set value to an "
"[AABB] with all fields set to [code]0.0[/code]. To avoid frustum culling, set "
"[member custom_aabb] to a very large AABB that covers your entire game world "
"such as [code]AABB(-10000, -10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]. To "
"disable all forms of culling (including occlusion and layer culling), call "
"[method RenderingServer.instance_set_ignore_culling] on the "
"[GeometryInstance3D]'s [RID]."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບ bounding box ຂອງໂນດນີ້ດ້ວຍອັນໃໝ່ແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຄິດໄລ່ [AABB] "
"ຄືນໃໝ່ທີ່ມີລາຄາແພງ ເຊິ່ງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ skeleton ກັບ [MeshInstance3D] ຫຼື ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ "
"bounding box ຂອງ [MeshInstance3D] ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ AABB ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"[AABB] ທີ່ທຸກຟິວເປັນ [code]0.0[/code]. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງ frustum culling, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [member "
"custom_aabb] ເປັນ AABB ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍເຊິ່ງກວມເອົາໂລກເກມທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ [code]AABB(-10000, "
"-10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]. ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ culling ທຸກຮູບແບບ "
"(ລວມທັງ occlusion ແລະ layer culling), ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.instance_set_ignore_culling] ຢູ່ໃນ [RID] ຂອງ "
"[GeometryInstance3D]."

msgid ""
"The extra distance added to the GeometryInstance3D's bounding box ([AABB]) to "
"increase its cull box."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ບວກໃສ່ bounding box ([AABB]) ຂອງ GeometryInstance3D ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂະໜາດ "
"cull box ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Use [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] ແທນ."

msgid "The texel density to use for lightmapping in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ lightmapping ໃນ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"The texel density to use for lightmapping in [LightmapGI]. Greater scale "
"values provide higher resolution in the lightmap, which can result in sharper "
"shadows for lights that have both direct and indirect light baked. However, "
"greater scale values will also increase the space taken by the mesh in the "
"lightmap texture, which increases the memory, storage, and bake time "
"requirements. When using a single mesh at different scales, consider "
"adjusting this value to keep the lightmap texel density consistent across "
"meshes.\n"
"For example, doubling [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] doubles the lightmap "
"texture resolution for this object [i]on each axis[/i], so it will "
"[i]quadruple[/i] the texel count."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ lightmapping ໃນ [LightmapGI]. ຄ່າ scale "
"ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ສູງກວ່າໃນ lightmap, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນສຳລັບໄຟທີ່ມີການ bake "
"ທັງແສງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ແສງສະທ້ອນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄ່າ scale ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນກໍຈະເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ mesh ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"lightmap texture, ເຊິ່ງຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ເວລາໃນການ "
"bake. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ mesh ດຽວກັນໃນຂະໜາດ (scales) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາປັບຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ lightmap texel ໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ໃນທຸກໆ mesh.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການເພີ່ມ [member gi_lightmap_texel_scale] ຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ "
"lightmap texture ສຳລັບວັດຖຸນີ້ນີ້ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າ [i]ໃນແຕ່ລະແກນ[/i], ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຳນວນ "
"texel ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ [i]ສີ່ເທົ່າ[/i]."

msgid ""
"The global illumination mode to use for the whole geometry. To avoid "
"inconsistent results, use a mode that matches the purpose of the mesh during "
"gameplay (static/dynamic).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Lights' bake mode will also affect the global illumination "
"rendering. See [member Light3D.light_bake_mode]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ global illumination ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດທັງໝົດ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ບໍ່ຄົງທີ່, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດທີ່ກົງກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງ mesh ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ (static/dynamic).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໂໝດ bake ຂອງແສງໄຟຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ການ rendering ຂອງ global illumination "
"ນຳອີກ. ເບິ່ງ [member Light3D.light_bake_mode]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables occlusion culling for this instance. Useful "
"for gizmos that must be rendered even when occlusion culling is in use.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ignore_occlusion_culling] does not affect frustum "
"culling (which is what happens when an object is not visible given the "
"camera's angle). To avoid frustum culling, set [member custom_aabb] to a very "
"large AABB that covers your entire game world such as [code]AABB(-10000, "
"-10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ occlusion culling ສຳລັບ instance ນີ້. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ gizmos ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການ render ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີການໃຊ້ occlusion culling "
"ກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ignore_occlusion_culling] ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ frustum culling "
"(ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອວັດຖຸເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນຈາກມຸມຂອງກ້ອງ). ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງ frustum culling, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ "
"[member custom_aabb] ເປັນ AABB ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍເຊິ່ງກວມເອົາໂລກເກມທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ "
"[code]AABB(-10000, -10000, -10000, 20000, 20000, 20000)[/code]."

msgid ""
"The material overlay for the whole geometry.\n"
"If a material is assigned to this property, it will be rendered on top of any "
"other active material for all the surfaces."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸທັບຊ້ອນ (material overlay) ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດວັດສະດຸໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກ render ທັບຢູ່ເທິງວັດສະດຸອື່ນໆທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສຳລັບທຸກພື້ນຜິວ."

msgid ""
"The material override for the whole geometry.\n"
"If a material is assigned to this property, it will be used instead of any "
"material set in any material slot of the mesh."
msgstr ""
"ວັດສະດຸຂຽນທັບ (material override) ສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດວັດສະດຸໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນທີ່ວັດສະດຸໃດໆທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ slot ວັດສະດຸຂອງ mesh."

msgid ""
"The transparency applied to the whole geometry (as a multiplier of the "
"materials' existing transparency). [code]0.0[/code] is fully opaque, while "
"[code]1.0[/code] is fully transparent. Values greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"(exclusive) will force the geometry's materials to go through the transparent "
"pipeline, which is slower to render and can exhibit rendering issues due to "
"incorrect transparency sorting. However, unlike using a transparent material, "
"setting [member transparency] to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"(exclusive) will [i]not[/i] disable shadow rendering.\n"
"In spatial shaders, [code]1.0 - transparency[/code] is set as the default "
"value of the [code]ALPHA[/code] built-in.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member transparency] is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code], so this property cannot be used to make transparent "
"materials more opaque than they originally are.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, [member transparency] is "
"ignored and is considered as always being [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບເລຂາຄະນິດທັງໝົດ (ເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງວັດສະດຸ). [code]0.0[/"
"code] ແມ່ນທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸຂອງເລຂາຄະນິດໄປຜ່ານ transparent pipeline, ເຊິ່ງຈະ "
"render ຊ້າກວ່າ ແລະ ອາດຈະສະແດງບັນຫາການ render ຍ້ອນການຈັດລຽງຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕ່າງຈາກການໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸໂປ່ງໃສ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member transparency] "
"ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] ຈະ [i]ບໍ່[/i] ປິດການ render ເງົາ.\n"
"ໃນ spatial shaders, [code]1.0 - transparency[/code] ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ "
"[code]ALPHA[/code] ທີ່ມານຳລະບົບ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member transparency] ຖືກຈຳກັດຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ "
"[code]1.0[/code], "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດສະດຸທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຢູ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ທຶບແສງກວ່າເກົ່າໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ "
"render ແບບ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility, [member transparency] ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ ແລະ ຖືວ່າເປັນ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Starting distance from which the GeometryInstance3D will be visible, taking "
"[member visibility_range_begin_margin] into account as well. The default "
"value of 0 is used to disable the range check."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ GeometryInstance3D ຈະເລີ່ມເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້, ໂດຍຄິດໄລ່ລວມກັບ [member "
"visibility_range_begin_margin] ນຳ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດການກວດສອບໄລຍະທາງ."

msgid ""
"Margin for the [member visibility_range_begin] threshold. The "
"GeometryInstance3D will only change its visibility state when it goes over or "
"under the [member visibility_range_begin] threshold by this amount.\n"
"If [member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], this acts as a hysteresis distance. If "
"[member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] "
"or [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], this acts as a fade "
"transition distance and must be set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"for the effect to be noticeable."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບ (Margin) ສຳລັບເກນ [member visibility_range_begin]. GeometryInstance3D "
"ຈະປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເບິ່ງເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເກີນ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນ [member visibility_range_begin] "
"ດ້ວຍຈຳນວນນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member visibility_range_fade_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນໄລຍະຫ່າງ hysteresis. ຖ້າ [member "
"visibility_range_fade_mode] ເປັນ [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] ຫຼື "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນໄລຍະການປ່ຽນຜ່ານແບບຈາງຫາຍ (fade transition) ແລະ ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນຜົນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Distance from which the GeometryInstance3D will be hidden, taking [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin] into account as well. The default value of 0 is "
"used to disable the range check."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງທີ່ GeometryInstance3D ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້, ໂດຍຄິດໄລ່ລວມກັບ [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin] ນຳ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດການກວດສອບໄລຍະທາງ."

msgid ""
"Margin for the [member visibility_range_end] threshold. The "
"GeometryInstance3D will only change its visibility state when it goes over or "
"under the [member visibility_range_end] threshold by this amount.\n"
"If [member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], this acts as a hysteresis distance. If "
"[member visibility_range_fade_mode] is [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] "
"or [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], this acts as a fade "
"transition distance and must be set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code] "
"for the effect to be noticeable."
msgstr ""
"ຂອບ (Margin) ສຳລັບເກນ [member visibility_range_end]. GeometryInstance3D "
"ຈະປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເບິ່ງເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເກີນ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນ [member visibility_range_end] "
"ດ້ວຍຈຳນວນນີ້.\n"
"ຖ້າ [member visibility_range_fade_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນໄລຍະຫ່າງ hysteresis. ຖ້າ [member "
"visibility_range_fade_mode] ເປັນ [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_SELF] ຫຼື "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DEPENDENCIES], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນໄລຍະການປ່ຽນຜ່ານແບບຈາງຫາຍ (fade transition) ແລະ ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຈຶ່ງຈະເຫັນຜົນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Controls which instances will be faded when approaching the limits of the "
"visibility range."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າ instance ໃດຈະຖືກຈາງຫາຍເມື່ອເຂົ້າໃກ້ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"Will not cast any shadows. Use this to improve performance for small geometry "
"that is unlikely to cast noticeable shadows (such as debris)."
msgstr ""
"ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງເງົາໃດໆ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບສຳລັບເລຂາຄະນິດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຈະສ້າງເງົາທີ່ສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ "
"(ເຊັ່ນ: ເສດວັດຖຸ)."

msgid ""
"Will cast shadows from all visible faces in the GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"Will take culling into account, so faces not being rendered will not be taken "
"into account when shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສ້າງເງົາຈາກທຸກດ້ານທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໃນ GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"ຈະຄິດໄລ່ລວມ culling ນຳ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນດ້ານທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ render ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນເວລາສ້າງເງົາ."

msgid ""
"Will cast shadows from all visible faces in the GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"Will not take culling into account, so all faces will be taken into account "
"when shadow casting."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສ້າງເງົາຈາກທຸກດ້ານທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໃນ GeometryInstance3D.\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ຄິດໄລ່ລວມ culling, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທຸກດ້ານຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນເວລາສ້າງເງົາ."

msgid ""
"Will only show the shadows casted from this object.\n"
"In other words, the actual mesh will not be visible, only the shadows casted "
"from the mesh will be."
msgstr ""
"ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະເງົາທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກວັດຖຸນີ້ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ຕົວ mesh ແທ້ໆຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ, ຈະເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ເງົາທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກ mesh ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Disabled global illumination mode. Use for dynamic objects that do not "
"contribute to global illumination (such as characters). When using [VoxelGI] "
"and SDFGI, the geometry will [i]receive[/i] indirect lighting and reflections "
"but the geometry will not be considered in GI baking."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ global illumination ທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ (dynamic) ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຊ່ວຍໃນ "
"global illumination (ເຊັ່ນ: ຕົວລະຄອນ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [VoxelGI] ແລະ SDFGI, ເລຂາຄະນິດຈະ "
"[i]ໄດ້ຮັບ[/i] ແສງສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ການສະທ້ອນ ແຕ່ເລຂາຄະນິດຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການ GI baking."

msgid ""
"Baked global illumination mode. Use for static objects that contribute to "
"global illumination (such as level geometry). This GI mode is effective when "
"using [VoxelGI], SDFGI and [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ global illumination ແບບ baked. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ຄົງທີ່ (static) ເຊິ່ງມີສ່ວນຊ່ວຍໃນ global "
"illumination (ເຊັ່ນ: ເລຂາຄະນິດຂອງສາກ). ໂໝດ GI ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ [VoxelGI], SDFGI ແລະ "
"[LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"Dynamic global illumination mode. Use for dynamic objects that contribute to "
"global illumination. This GI mode is only effective when using [VoxelGI], but "
"it has a higher performance impact than [constant GI_MODE_STATIC]. When using "
"other GI methods, this will act the same as [constant GI_MODE_DISABLED]. When "
"using [LightmapGI], the object will receive indirect lighting using lightmap "
"probes instead of using the baked lightmap texture."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ global illumination ແບບ dynamic. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ເຊິ່ງມີສ່ວນຊ່ວຍໃນ global "
"illumination. ໂໝດ GI ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອໃຊ້ [VoxelGI] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍຈະກິນຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"[constant GI_MODE_STATIC]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີ GI ອື່ນໆ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant "
"GI_MODE_DISABLED]. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ [LightmapGI], ວັດຖຸຈະໄດ້ຮັບແສງສະທ້ອນໂດຍໃຊ້ lightmap probes "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ baked lightmap texture."

msgid "The standard texel density for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບ lightmapping ດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]."

msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 2× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"between 1.5 and 3.0."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ຂຶ້ນ 2 ເທົ່າ ສຳລັບ lightmapping ດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຂອງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ texel, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) mesh "
"ດ້ວຍປັດໄຈລະຫວ່າງ 1.5 ຫາ 3.0."

msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 4× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"between 3.0 and 6.0."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ຂຶ້ນ 4 ເທົ່າ ສຳລັບ lightmapping ດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຂອງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ texel, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) mesh "
"ດ້ວຍປັດໄຈລະຫວ່າງ 3.0 ຫາ 6.0."

msgid ""
"Multiplies texel density by 8× for lightmapping with [LightmapGI]. To ensure "
"consistency in texel density, use this when scaling a mesh by a factor "
"greater than 6.0."
msgstr ""
"ຄູນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງ texel ຂຶ້ນ 8 ເທົ່າ ສຳລັບ lightmapping ດ້ວຍ [LightmapGI]. "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຂອງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ texel, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອມີການຂະຫຍາຍ (scaling) mesh "
"ດ້ວຍປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 6.0."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum LightmapScale] enum."
msgstr "ແທນຂະໜາດຂອງ enum [enum LightmapScale]."

msgid ""
"Will not fade itself nor its visibility dependencies, hysteresis will be used "
"instead. This is the fastest approach to manual LOD, but it can result in "
"noticeable LOD transitions depending on how the LOD meshes are authored. See "
"[member visibility_range_begin] and [member Node3D.visibility_parent] for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົວມັນເອງ ຫຼື dependencies ຂອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈາງຫາຍ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ hysteresis ແທນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບ manual LOD, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງ LOD ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າ "
"LOD meshes ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງ [member visibility_range_begin] ແລະ [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent] ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Will fade-out itself when reaching the limits of its own visibility range. "
"This is slower than [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], but it can "
"provide smoother transitions. The fading range is determined by [member "
"visibility_range_begin_margin] and [member visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, this mode acts like "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] but with hysteresis disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຈາງຫາຍ (fade-out) ອອກໄປເອງເມື່ອຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມັນເອງ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], ແຕ່ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານນຸ້ມນວນກວ່າ. "
"ໄລຍະການຈາງຫາຍແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member visibility_range_begin_margin] ແລະ [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ "
"render ແບບ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility, ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] ແຕ່ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ hysteresis."

msgid ""
"Will fade-in its visibility dependencies (see [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent]) when reaching the limits of its own visibility "
"range. This is slower than [constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], but it "
"can provide smoother transitions. The fading range is determined by [member "
"visibility_range_begin_margin] and [member visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using the Forward+ rendering method. When "
"using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering method, this mode acts like "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] but with hysteresis disabled."
msgstr ""
"ຈະຄ່ອຍໆສະແດງ (fade-in) ຕົວ dependencies ຂອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມັນ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"Node3D.visibility_parent]) ເມື່ອຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄລຍະການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມັນເອງ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າ "
"[constant VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED], ແຕ່ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານນຸ້ມນວນກວ່າ. "
"ໄລຍະການຈາງຫາຍແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ [member visibility_range_begin_margin] ແລະ [member "
"visibility_range_end_margin].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ render ແບບ Forward+ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ວິທີການ "
"render ແບບ Mobile ຫຼື Compatibility, ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ [constant "
"VISIBILITY_RANGE_FADE_DISABLED] ແຕ່ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ hysteresis."

msgid "Represents a glTF accessor."
msgstr "ແທນ glTF accessor."

msgid ""
"GLTFAccessor is a data structure representing a glTF [code]accessor[/code] "
"that would be found in the [code]\"accessors\"[/code] array. A buffer is a "
"blob of binary data. A buffer view is a slice of a buffer. An accessor is a "
"typed interpretation of the data in a buffer view.\n"
"Most custom data stored in glTF does not need accessors, only buffer views "
"(see [GLTFBufferView]). Accessors are for more advanced use cases such as "
"interleaved mesh data encoded for the GPU."
msgstr ""
"GLTFAccessor ແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແທນ glTF [code]accessor[/code] ທີ່ພົບເຫັນໃນອາເຣ [code]"
"\"accessors\"[/code]. buffer ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີ (binary data). buffer view "
"ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງທີ່ແຍກອອກມາຈາກ buffer. accessor ແມ່ນການແປຄວາມໝາຍຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນ buffer view "
"ຕາມປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ເກັບໃນ glTF ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ accessor, ມີພຽງແຕ່ buffer views ກໍພໍ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[GLTFBufferView]). Accessors ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບກໍລະນີທີ່ສັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ ຂໍ້ມູນ mesh ແບບ "
"interleaved ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດສຳລັບ GPU."

msgid "Buffers, BufferViews, and Accessors in Khronos glTF specification"
msgstr "Buffers, BufferViews, ແລະ Accessors ໃນຂໍ້ກຳນົດ Khronos glTF"

msgid "Creates a new GLTFAccessor instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFAccessor ໂດຍການ parse ຈາກ [Dictionary] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Serializes this GLTFAccessor instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFAccessor ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary] (Serialize)."

msgid "The glTF accessor type, as an enum."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງ glTF accessor, ໃນຮູບແບບ enum."

msgid ""
"The index of the buffer view this accessor is referencing. If [code]-1[/"
"code], this accessor is not referencing any buffer view."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງ buffer view ທີ່ accessor ນີ້ກຳລັງອ້າງອີງເຖິງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]-1[/code], "
"accessor ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ buffer view ໃດໆ."

msgid "The offset relative to the start of the buffer view in bytes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທີ່ກ່ຽວພັນກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ buffer view ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌ (bytes)."

msgid ""
"The glTF component type as an enum. See [enum GLTFComponentType] for possible "
"values. Within the core glTF specification, a value of 5125 or "
"\"UNSIGNED_INT\" must not be used for any accessor that is not referenced by "
"mesh.primitive.indices."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບ (component type) ຂອງ glTF ໃນຮູບແບບ enum. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"GLTFComponentType] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້. ພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຫຼັກຂອງ glTF, ຄ່າ 5125 ຫຼື "
"\"UNSIGNED_INT\" ຕ້ອງບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ accessor ໃດໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍ "
"mesh.primitive.indices."

msgid "The number of elements referenced by this accessor."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບທີ່ accessor ນີ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid "Maximum value of each component in this accessor."
msgstr "ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບໃນ accessor ນີ້."

msgid "Minimum value of each component in this accessor."
msgstr "ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບໃນ accessor ນີ້."

msgid "Specifies whether integer data values are normalized before usage."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເລກຖ້ວນ (integer) ຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນ normalize ກ່ອນການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "Number of deviating accessor values stored in the sparse array."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງຄ່າ accessor ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ (deviating) ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ sparse array."

msgid ""
"The index of the buffer view with sparse indices. The referenced buffer view "
"MUST NOT have its target or byteStride properties defined. The buffer view "
"and the optional byteOffset MUST be aligned to the componentType byte length."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງ buffer view ທີ່ມີ sparse indices. buffer view ທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"target ຫຼື byteStride ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້. buffer view ແລະ byteOffset (ຖ້າມີ) "
"ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດລຽງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມຍາວໄບຕ໌ຂອງ componentType."

msgid ""
"The indices component data type as an enum. Possible values are 5121 for "
"\"UNSIGNED_BYTE\", 5123 for \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\", and 5125 for \"UNSIGNED_INT\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນອົງປະກອບຂອງ indices ໃນຮູບແບບ enum. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນ 5121 ສຳລັບ "
"\"UNSIGNED_BYTE\", 5123 ສຳລັບ \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\", ແລະ 5125 ສຳລັບ "
"\"UNSIGNED_INT\"."

msgid ""
"The index of the bufferView with sparse values. The referenced buffer view "
"MUST NOT have its target or byteStride properties defined."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງ bufferView ທີ່ມີ sparse values. buffer view ທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ target "
"ຫຼື byteStride ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "The offset relative to the start of the bufferView in bytes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ທີ່ກ່ຽວພັນກັບຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ bufferView ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌ (bytes)."

msgid "Use [member accessor_type] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member accessor_type] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The glTF accessor type, as an [int]. Possible values are [code]0[/code] for "
"\"SCALAR\", [code]1[/code] for \"VEC2\", [code]2[/code] for \"VEC3\", "
"[code]3[/code] for \"VEC4\", [code]4[/code] for \"MAT2\", [code]5[/code] for "
"\"MAT3\", and [code]6[/code] for \"MAT4\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງ glTF accessor ໃນຮູບແບບ [int]. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນ [code]0[/code] ສຳລັບ "
"\"SCALAR\", [code]1[/code] ສຳລັບ \"VEC2\", [code]2[/code] ສຳລັບ \"VEC3\", "
"[code]3[/code] ສຳລັບ \"VEC4\", [code]4[/code] ສຳລັບ \"MAT2\", [code]5[/code] "
"ສຳລັບ \"MAT3\", ແລະ [code]6[/code] ສຳລັບ \"MAT4\"."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"SCALAR\". For the glTF object model, this can be used to map "
"to a single float, int, or bool value, or a float array."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"SCALAR\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ map ໄປຫາຄ່າ "
"float, int, ຫຼື bool ພຽງຄ່າດຽວ, ຫຼື ອາເຣຂອງ float."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC2\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float2\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of two floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"VEC2\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float2\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ສອງຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC3\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float3\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of three floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"VEC3\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float3\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ສາມຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"VEC4\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float4\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of four floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"VEC4\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float4\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ສີ່ຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT2\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float2x2\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of four floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"MAT2\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float2x2\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ສີ່ຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT3\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float3x3\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of nine floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"MAT3\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float3x3\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ເກົ້າຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Accessor type \"MAT4\". For the glTF object model, this maps to \"float4x4\", "
"represented in the glTF JSON as an array of sixteen floats."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ Accessor ແມ່ນ \"MAT4\". ສຳລັບຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ glTF, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາ \"float4x4\", "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ float ສິບຫົກຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Component type \"NONE\". This is not a valid component type, and is used to "
"indicate that the component type is not set."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"NONE\". ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນປະເພດອົງປະກອບທີ່ໃຊ້ການໄດ້, ແລະ "
"ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອບົ່ງບອກວ່າປະເພດອົງປະກອບຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Component type \"BYTE\". The value is [code]0x1400[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 1-byte or 8-bit signed integers. "
"This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"BYTE\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1400[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 1 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 8 ບິດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ "
"glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_BYTE\". The value is [code]0x1401[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 1-byte or 8-bit unsigned "
"integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"UNSIGNED_BYTE\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1401[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ "
"OpenGL. ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 1 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 8 ບິດ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"SHORT\". The value is [code]0x1402[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit signed integers. "
"This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"SHORT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1402[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 2 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 16 ບິດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ "
"glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\". The value is [code]0x1403[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit unsigned "
"integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"UNSIGNED_SHORT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1403[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ "
"OpenGL. ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 2 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 16 ບິດ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"INT\". The value is [code]0x1404[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit signed integers. "
"This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be supported "
"by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"INT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1404[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 4 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 32 ບິດ. ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] "
"ສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ glTF ທັງໝົດ. "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງ extension ລວມທັງ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_INT\". The value is [code]0x1405[/code] which comes "
"from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit unsigned "
"integers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"UNSIGNED_INT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1405[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 4 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 32 ບິດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ "
"glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"FLOAT\". The value is [code]0x1406[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 4-byte or 32-bit floating-point "
"numbers. This is a core part of the glTF specification."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"FLOAT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x1406[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating-point) ຂະໜາດ 4 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 32 ບິດ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF."

msgid ""
"Component type \"DOUBLE\". The value is [code]0x140A[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit floating-point "
"numbers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be "
"supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"DOUBLE\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x140A[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຂະໜາດ 8 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 64 ບິດ. ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] "
"ສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ glTF ທັງໝົດ. "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງ extension ລວມທັງ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

msgid ""
"Component type \"HALF_FLOAT\". The value is [code]0x140B[/code] which comes "
"from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 2-byte or 16-bit floating-point "
"numbers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be "
"supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"HALF_FLOAT\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x140B[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກທົດສະນິຍົມຂະໜາດ 2 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 16 ບິດ. ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] "
"ສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ glTF ທັງໝົດ. "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງ extension ລວມທັງ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

msgid ""
"Component type \"LONG\". The value is [code]0x140E[/code] which comes from "
"OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit signed integers. "
"This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be supported "
"by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"LONG\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x140E[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ OpenGL. "
"ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 8 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 64 ບິດ. ນີ້ [i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] "
"ສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ glTF ທັງໝົດ. "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງ extension ລວມທັງ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

msgid ""
"Component type \"UNSIGNED_LONG\". The value is [code]0x140F[/code] which "
"comes from OpenGL. This indicates data is stored in 8-byte or 64-bit unsigned "
"integers. This is NOT a core part of the glTF specification, and may not be "
"supported by all glTF importers. May be used by some extensions including "
"[code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດອົງປະກອບແມ່ນ \"UNSIGNED_LONG\". ມີຄ່າແມ່ນ [code]0x140F[/code] ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກ "
"OpenGL. ນີ້ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖ້ວນທີ່ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂະໜາດ 8 ໄບຕ໌ ຫຼື 64 ບິດ. ນີ້ "
"[i]ບໍ່ແມ່ນ[/i] ສ່ວນຫຼັກຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF, ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ glTF ທັງໝົດ. "
"ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງ extension ລວມທັງ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code]."

msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFAnimation] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFAnimation] ນີ້. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດໃນຄລາສ [GLTFDocumentExtension], "
"ເຊິ່ງສຳຄັນເພາະວ່າມັນເປັນແບບ stateless.\n"
"argument ຄວນຈະເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ extension ໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"glTF), ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາສາມາດເປັນຫຍັງກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຍັງ, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFAnimation] instance. This can be "
"used to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can be "
"anything you want."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFAnimation] ນີ້. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດໃນຄລາສ [GLTFDocumentExtension], "
"ເຊິ່ງສຳຄັນເພາະວ່າມັນເປັນແບບ stateless.\n"
"argument ທຳອິດຄວນຈະເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ extension "
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF), ແລະ argument ທີສອງສາມາດເປັນຫຍັງກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "The original name of the animation."
msgstr "ຊື່ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງ animation."

msgid "Represents a glTF buffer view."
msgstr "ແທນ glTF buffer view."

msgid ""
"GLTFBufferView is a data structure representing a glTF [code]bufferView[/"
"code] that would be found in the [code]\"bufferViews\"[/code] array. A buffer "
"is a blob of binary data. A buffer view is a slice of a buffer that can be "
"used to identify and extract data from the buffer.\n"
"Most custom uses of buffers only need to use the [member buffer], [member "
"byte_length], and [member byte_offset]. The [member byte_stride] and [member "
"indices] properties are for more advanced use cases such as interleaved mesh "
"data encoded for the GPU."
msgstr ""
"GLTFBufferView ແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແທນ glTF [code]bufferView[/code] ທີ່ພົບເຫັນໃນອາເຣ "
"[code]\"bufferViews\"[/code]. buffer ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄບນາຣີ. buffer view "
"ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງທີ່ແຍກອອກມາຈາກ buffer ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸ ແລະ ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນອອກຈາກ buffer ໄດ້.\n"
"ການນຳໃຊ້ buffer ແບບກຳນົດເອງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ [member buffer], [member "
"byte_length], ແລະ [member byte_offset]. ສ່ວນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member byte_stride] ແລະ "
"[member indices] ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບກໍລະນີທີ່ສັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ ຂໍ້ມູນ mesh ແບບ interleaved "
"ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດສຳລັບ GPU."

msgid "Creates a new GLTFBufferView instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFBufferView ໂດຍການ parse ຈາກ [Dictionary] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Loads the buffer view data from the buffer referenced by this buffer view in "
"the given [GLTFState]. Interleaved data with a byte stride is not yet "
"supported by this method. The data is returned as a [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ buffer view ຈາກ buffer ທີ່ຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍ buffer view ນີ້ໃນ [GLTFState] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນແບບ interleaved ທີ່ມີ byte stride ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍເມທອດນີ້ເທື່ອ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ [PackedByteArray]."

msgid "Serializes this GLTFBufferView instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFBufferView ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary] (Serialize)."

msgid ""
"The index of the buffer this buffer view is referencing. If [code]-1[/code], "
"this buffer view is not referencing any buffer."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງ buffer ທີ່ buffer view ນີ້ກຳລັງອ້າງອີງເຖິງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]-1[/code], buffer "
"view ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ buffer ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"The length, in bytes, of this buffer view. If [code]0[/code], this buffer "
"view is empty."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຂອງ buffer view ນີ້ ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code], ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ buffer "
"view ນີ້ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"The offset, in bytes, from the start of the buffer to the start of this "
"buffer view."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (offset) ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌, ຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ buffer ຫາຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ buffer view ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The stride, in bytes, between interleaved data. If [code]-1[/code], this "
"buffer view is not interleaved."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະກ້າວ (stride) ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍໄບຕ໌, ລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ມູນແບບ interleaved. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]-1[/"
"code], buffer view ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ interleaved."

msgid ""
"[code]true[/code] if the GLTFBufferView's OpenGL GPU buffer type is an "
"[code]ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] used for vertex indices (integer constant "
"[code]34963[/code]). [code]false[/code] if the buffer type is any other "
"value. See [url=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/"
"gltfTutorial/gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, "
"BufferViews, and Accessors[/url] for possible values. This property is set on "
"import and used on export."
msgstr ""
"[code]true[/code] ຖ້າປະເພດ buffer ຂອງ OpenGL GPU ຂອງ GLTFBufferView ນີ້ແມ່ນ "
"[code]ELEMENT_ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ vertex indices (ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເລກຖ້ວນ "
"[code]34963[/code]). [code]false[/code] ຖ້າປະເພດ buffer ເປັນຄ່າອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[url=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/gltfTutorial/"
"gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, BufferViews, ແລະ "
"Accessors[/url] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຕອນນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ຕອນສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"[code]true[/code] if the GLTFBufferView's OpenGL GPU buffer type is an "
"[code]ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] used for vertex attributes (integer constant "
"[code]34962[/code]). [code]false[/code] if the buffer type is any other "
"value. See [url=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/"
"gltfTutorial/gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, "
"BufferViews, and Accessors[/url] for possible values. This property is set on "
"import and used on export."
msgstr ""
"[code]true[/code] ຖ້າປະເພດ buffer ຂອງ OpenGL GPU ຂອງ GLTFBufferView ນີ້ແມ່ນ "
"[code]ARRAY_BUFFER[/code] ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ vertex attributes (ຄ່າຄົງທີ່ເລກຖ້ວນ [code]34962[/"
"code]). [code]false[/code] ຖ້າປະເພດ buffer ເປັນຄ່າອື່ນໆ. ເບິ່ງ [url=https://"
"github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Tutorials/blob/master/gltfTutorial/"
"gltfTutorial_005_BuffersBufferViewsAccessors.md]Buffers, BufferViews, ແລະ "
"Accessors[/url] ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຕອນນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ຕອນສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "Represents a glTF camera."
msgstr "ແທນກ້ອງ glTF."

msgid "Represents a camera as defined by the base glTF spec."
msgstr "ແທນກ້ອງຕາມທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຂໍ້ກຳນົດພື້ນຖານຂອງ glTF."

msgid "glTF camera detailed specification"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງກ້ອງ glTF"

msgid "glTF camera spec and example file"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງກ້ອງ glTF ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Creates a new GLTFCamera instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFCamera ໂດຍການ parse ຈາກ [Dictionary] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Create a new GLTFCamera instance from the given Godot [Camera3D] node."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFCamera ຈາກໂນດ [Camera3D] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Serializes this GLTFCamera instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFCamera ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary] (Serialize)."

msgid "Converts this GLTFCamera instance into a Godot [Camera3D] node."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFCamera ໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ [Camera3D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"The distance to the far culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis, in meters. This maps to glTF's [code]zfar[/code] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງໄປຫາຂອບເຂດ culling ດ້ານໄກ (far boundary) ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້ ໂດຍທຽບກັບແກນ Z "
"ຂອງມັນເອງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]zfar[/code] ຂອງ glTF."

msgid ""
"The distance to the near culling boundary for this camera relative to its "
"local Z axis, in meters. This maps to glTF's [code]znear[/code] property."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງໄປຫາຂອບເຂດ culling ດ້ານໃກ້ (near boundary) ສຳລັບກ້ອງນີ້ ໂດຍທຽບກັບແກນ Z "
"ຂອງມັນເອງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]znear[/code] ຂອງ glTF."

msgid ""
"The FOV of the camera. This class and glTF define the camera FOV in radians, "
"while Godot uses degrees. This maps to glTF's [code]yfov[/code] property. "
"This value is only used for perspective cameras, when [member perspective] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ FOV ຂອງກ້ອງ. ຄລາສນີ້ ແລະ glTF ກຳນົດຄ່າ FOV ເປັນເຣດຽນ (radians), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Godot "
"ໃຊ້ເປັນອົງສາ (degrees). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]yfov[/code] ຂອງ glTF. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບກ້ອງແບບ perspective ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເມື່ອ [member perspective] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the camera is in perspective mode. Otherwise, the "
"camera is in orthographic/orthogonal mode. This maps to glTF's camera "
"[code]type[/code] property. See [member Camera3D.projection] and the glTF "
"spec for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ກ້ອງຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ perspective. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ກ້ອງຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດ "
"orthographic/orthogonal. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]type[/code] ຂອງກ້ອງໃນ "
"glTF. ເບິ່ງ [member Camera3D.projection] ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ glTF ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The size of the camera. This class and glTF define the camera size magnitude "
"as a radius in meters, while Godot defines it as a diameter in meters. This "
"maps to glTF's [code]ymag[/code] property. This value is only used for "
"orthographic/orthogonal cameras, when [member perspective] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງກ້ອງ. ຄລາສນີ້ ແລະ glTF ກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງກ້ອງເປັນລັດສະໝີ (radius) ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍແມັດ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Godot ກຳນົດເປັນເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງ (diameter) ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍແມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ map ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[code]ymag[/code] ຂອງ glTF. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບກ້ອງແບບ orthographic/orthogonal "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເມື່ອ [member perspective] ເປັນ [code]false[/code]."

msgid "Class for importing and exporting glTF files in and out of Godot."
msgstr "ຄລາສສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ glTF ເຂົ້າ ແລະ ອອກຈາກ Godot."

msgid ""
"GLTFDocument supports reading data from a glTF file, buffer, or Godot scene. "
"This data can then be written to the filesystem, buffer, or used to create a "
"Godot scene.\n"
"All of the data in a glTF scene is stored in the [GLTFState] class. "
"GLTFDocument processes state objects, but does not contain any scene data "
"itself. GLTFDocument has member variables to store export configuration "
"settings such as the image format, but is otherwise stateless. Multiple "
"scenes can be processed with the same settings using the same GLTFDocument "
"object and different [GLTFState] objects.\n"
"GLTFDocument can be extended with arbitrary functionality by extending the "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] class and registering it with GLTFDocument via "
"[method register_gltf_document_extension]. This allows for custom data to be "
"imported and exported."
msgstr ""
"GLTFDocument ຮອງຮັບການອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF, buffer, ຫຼື scene ຂອງ Godot. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌, buffer, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ scene ຂອງ Godot ໄດ້.\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນ scene ຂອງ glTF ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຄລາສ [GLTFState]. GLTFDocument ຈະປະມວນຜົນ "
"state objects, ແຕ່ຕົວມັນເອງຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ scene ໃດໆ. GLTFDocument "
"ມີຕົວປ່ຽນສະມາຊິກເພື່ອເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກ ເຊັ່ນ ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຈະເປັນແບບ stateless. "
"ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນ scene ຫຼາຍໆ scene ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ GLTFDocument ດຽວກັນ ແລະ "
"[GLTFState] ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"
"GLTFDocument ສາມາດເພີ່ມຟັງຊັນການເຮັດງານຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍຄລາສ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນມັນກັບ GLTFDocument ຜ່ານ [method "
"register_gltf_document_extension]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ "
"ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

msgid "glTF 'What the duck?' guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມື glTF 'What the duck?'"

msgid "Khronos glTF specification"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ Khronos glTF"

msgid ""
"Takes a [PackedByteArray] defining a glTF and imports the data to the given "
"[GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param base_path] tells [method append_from_buffer] where to "
"find dependencies and can be empty."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ກຳນົດ glTF ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງ [GLTFState] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ "
"[param state].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param base_path] ຈະບອກ [method append_from_buffer] "
"ວ່າຈະໄປຊອກຫາ dependencies ຢູ່ໃສ ແລະ ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Takes a path to a glTF file and imports the data at that file path to the "
"given [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param base_path] tells [method append_from_file] where to "
"find dependencies and can be empty."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ glTF ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ທີ່ເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນໄປຍັງ [GLTFState] "
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ [param state].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [param base_path] ຈະບອກ [method append_from_file] ວ່າຈະໄປຊອກຫາ "
"dependencies ຢູ່ໃສ ແລະ ສາມາດເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Takes a Godot Engine scene node and exports it and its descendants to the "
"given [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບໂນດ scene ຂອງ Godot Engine ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກມັນລວມທັງລູກຫຼານ (descendants) ຂອງມັນໄປຍັງ "
"[GLTFState] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ [param state]."

msgid ""
"Determines a mapping between the given Godot [param node_path] and the "
"corresponding glTF Object Model JSON pointer(s) in the generated glTF file. "
"The details of this mapping are returned in a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] "
"object. Additional mappings can be supplied via the [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._import_object_model_property] callback method."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການ map ລະຫວ່າງ [param node_path] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ ກັບ glTF Object Model "
"JSON pointer(s) ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການ map ນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາໃນ "
"[GLTFObjectModelProperty]. ສາມາດເພີ່ມການ map ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຜ່ານເມທອດ callback [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._import_object_model_property]."

msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and returns a "
"glTF [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [GLTFState] ຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ [param state] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ຂອງ "
"glTF."

msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and returns a "
"Godot Engine scene node.\n"
"The [param bake_fps] parameter overrides the bake_fps in [param state]."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [GLTFState] ຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ [param state] ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາເປັນໂນດ scene ຂອງ Godot "
"Engine.\n"
"ພາລາມິເຕີ [param bake_fps] ຈະຂຽນທັບ bake_fps ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [param state]."

msgid ""
"Returns a list of all support glTF extensions, including extensions supported "
"directly by the engine, and extensions supported by user plugins registering "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] classes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method is run before a GLTFDocumentExtension is "
"registered, its extensions won't be included in the list. Be sure to only run "
"this method after all extensions are registered. If you run this when the "
"engine starts, consider waiting a frame before calling this method to ensure "
"all extensions are registered."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່າລາຍຊື່ຂອງ glTF extensions ທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ລວມທັງ extensions ທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກ (engine) "
"ຮອງຮັບໂດຍກົງ ແລະ extensions ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ plugin ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຄລາສ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າເມທອດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ [GLTFDocumentExtension] ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນ, "
"extensions ຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ extensions "
"ທັງໝົດຖືກລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຕອນທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຖ້າຈັກໜຶ່ງເຟຣມ (frame) "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກ extensions ຖືກລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Determines a mapping between the given glTF Object Model [param json_pointer] "
"and the corresponding Godot node path(s) in the generated Godot scene. The "
"details of this mapping are returned in a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] object. "
"Additional mappings can be supplied via the [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_object_model_property] callback method."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການ map ລະຫວ່າງ [param json_pointer] ຂອງ glTF Object Model ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ "
"ກັບເສັ້ນທາງໂນດ (node path) ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ scene ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການ map ນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາໃນ [GLTFObjectModelProperty]. ສາມາດເພີ່ມການ map "
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ຜ່ານເມທອດ callback [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_object_model_property]."

msgid ""
"Registers the given [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance with GLTFDocument. If "
"[param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], this extension will be run "
"first. Otherwise, it will be run last.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Like GLTFDocument itself, all GLTFDocumentExtension classes must "
"be stateless in order to function properly. If you need to store data, use "
"the [code]set_additional_data[/code] and [code]get_additional_data[/code] "
"methods in [GLTFState] or [GLTFNode]."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາກັບ GLTFDocument. ຖ້າ [param "
"first_priority] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], extension ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານເປັນອັນດັບສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ GLTFDocument ເອງ, ຄລາສ GLTFDocumentExtension "
"ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງເປັນແບບ stateless ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]set_additional_data[/code] ແລະ [code]get_additional_data[/code] ໃນ "
"[GLTFState] ຫຼື [GLTFNode]."

msgid "Unregisters the given [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid ""
"Takes a [GLTFState] object through the [param state] parameter and writes a "
"glTF file to the filesystem.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The extension of the glTF file determines if it is a .glb binary "
"file or a .gltf text file."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບ [GLTFState] ຜ່ານພາລາມິເຕີ [param state] ແລະ ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ glTF ລົງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ນາມສະກຸນຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF ຈະເປັນຕົວບອກວ່າມັນເປັນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ .glb ຫຼື "
"ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ .gltf."

msgid ""
"The user-friendly name of the fallback image format. This is used when "
"exporting the glTF file, including writing to a file and writing to a byte "
"array.\n"
"This property may only be one of \"None\", \"PNG\", or \"JPEG\", and is only "
"used when the [member image_format] is not one of \"None\", \"PNG\", or "
"\"JPEG\". If having multiple extension image formats is desired, that can be "
"done using a [GLTFDocumentExtension] class - this property only covers the "
"use case of providing a base glTF fallback image when using a custom image "
"format."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍຂອງຮູບແບບຮູບພາບສຳຮອງ (fallback). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ glTF, "
"ລວມທັງການຂຽນລົງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການຂຽນລົງ byte array. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ \"None\", "
"\"PNG\", ຫຼື \"JPEG\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member image_format] ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"\"None\", \"PNG\", ຫຼື \"JPEG\". ຖ້າຕ້ອງການມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບຮູບພາບ, ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄລາສ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] - ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ກວມເອົາສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຮູບພາບສຳຮອງພື້ນຖານຂອງ glTF "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

msgid ""
"The quality of the fallback image, if any. For PNG files, this downscales the "
"image on both dimensions by this factor. For JPEG files, this is the lossy "
"quality of the image. A low value is recommended, since including multiple "
"high quality images in a glTF file defeats the file size gains of using a "
"more efficient image format."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຮູບພາບສຳຮອງ (ຖ້າມີ). ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ PNG, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຍໍ້ຂະໜາດຮູບພາບທັງສອງມິຕິດ້ວຍປັດໄຈນີ້. "
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ JPEG, ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນນະພາບແບບສູນເສຍ (lossy) ຂອງຮູບພາບ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າຕ່ຳ "
"ເພາະວ່າການລວມເອົາຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງຫຼາຍຮູບໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສຍປະໂຫຍດເລື່ອງຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄວນຈະຫຼຸດລົງຈາກການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າ."

msgid ""
"The user-friendly name of the export image format. This is used when "
"exporting the glTF file, including writing to a file and writing to a byte "
"array.\n"
"By default, Godot allows the following options: \"None\", \"PNG\", \"JPEG\", "
"\"Lossless WebP\", and \"Lossy WebP\". Support for more image formats can be "
"added in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes. A single extension class can "
"provide multiple options for the specific format to use, or even an option "
"that uses multiple formats at once."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍຂອງຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ. ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ glTF, ລວມທັງການຂຽນລົງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ "
"byte array. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Godot ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້: \"None\", \"PNG\", \"JPEG\", "
"\"Lossless WebP\", ແລະ \"Lossy WebP\". ສາມາດເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບອື່ນໆໄດ້ໃນຄລາສ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension]. extension ດຽວສາມາດໃຫ້ຕົວເລືອກໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ຫຼື "
"ແມ່ນແຕ່ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [member image_format] is a lossy image format, this determines the lossy "
"quality of the image. On a range of [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code], "
"where [code]0.0[/code] is the lowest quality and [code]1.0[/code] is the "
"highest quality. A lossy quality of [code]1.0[/code] is not the same as "
"lossless."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ [member image_format] ເປັນຮູບແບບຮູບພາບແບບສູນເສຍ (lossy), "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຮູບພາບ. ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code], ໂດຍທີ່ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ແມ່ນຄຸນນະພາບຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ [code]1.0[/code] ແມ່ນຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ. "
"ຄຸນນະພາບແບບ lossy ທີ່ [code]1.0[/code] ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເປັນແບບ lossless (ບໍ່ສູນເສຍ)."

msgid ""
"How to process the root node during export. The default and recommended value "
"is [constant ROOT_NODE_MODE_SINGLE_ROOT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of how the glTF file is exported, when importing, the "
"root node type and name can be overridden in the scene import settings tab."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນ root node ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນ [constant "
"ROOT_NODE_MODE_SINGLE_ROOT].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ວ່າຈະສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ glTF ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນເວລາທຳການນຳເຂົ້າ, ປະເພດ ແລະ ຊື່ຂອງ "
"root node ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບໄດ້ໃນແທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການນຳເຂົ້າ scene."

msgid ""
"How to handle texture maps during import. The default and recommended value "
"is [constant TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_REMAP_TO_STANDARD_MATERIAL], which "
"automatically remaps from glTF's flexible texture map system to the more "
"specific texture map slots in Godot's [StandardMaterial3D] class. "
"Alternatively, [constant TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_DO_NOT_REMAP] can be used to "
"preserve the original texture maps from the glTF file, which may be desirable "
"if using the glTF file with custom shaders, but may not display correctly "
"with Godot's built-in materials."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການຈັດການ texture maps ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນ [constant "
"TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_REMAP_TO_STANDARD_MATERIAL], ເຊິ່ງຈະທຳການ remap ຈາກລະບົບ "
"texture map ທີ່ປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ຂອງ glTF ໄປຫາ slot ຂອງ texture map ທີ່ເຈາະຈົງກວ່າໃນຄລາສ "
"[StandardMaterial3D] ຂອງ Godot ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫຼື ສາມາດໃຊ້ [constant "
"TEXTURE_MAP_MODE_DO_NOT_REMAP] ເພື່ອຮັກສາ texture maps ດັ້ງເດີມຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF ໄວ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຖ້າໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ glTF ກັບ shader ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບວັດສະດຸ "
"(materials) ທີ່ມີມານຳ Godot."

msgid ""
"How to deal with node visibility during export. This setting does nothing if "
"all nodes are visible. The default and recommended value is [constant "
"VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_REQUIRED], which uses the [code]KHR_node_visibility[/"
"code] extension."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການຈັດການການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງໂນດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງຖ້າທຸກໂນດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳແມ່ນ [constant VISIBILITY_MODE_INCLUDE_REQUIRED], ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ "
"extension [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code]."

msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the root node of the glTF file, and mark "
"it as the single root node via the [code]GODOT_single_root[/code] glTF "
"extension. This will be parsed the same as [constant "
"ROOT_NODE_MODE_KEEP_ROOT] if the implementation does not support "
"[code]GODOT_single_root[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖືວ່າ root node ຂອງ scene ໃນ Godot ເປັນ root node ຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF, ແລະ ໝາຍມັນໄວ້ວ່າເປັນ "
"root node ດ່ຽວຜ່ານ glTF extension [code]GODOT_single_root[/code]. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກ parse "
"ຄືກັນກັບ [constant ROOT_NODE_MODE_KEEP_ROOT] ຖ້າການເຮັດວຽກນັ້ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"[code]GODOT_single_root[/code]."

msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the root node of the glTF file, but do "
"not mark it as anything special. An extra root node will be generated when "
"importing into Godot. This uses only vanilla glTF features. This is "
"equivalent to the behavior in Godot 4.1 and earlier."
msgstr ""
"ຖືວ່າ root node ຂອງ scene ໃນ Godot ເປັນ root node ຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍມັນໄວ້ວ່າເປັນຫຍັງເປັນພິເສດ. root node ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ Godot. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຟີເຈີພື້ນຖານ (vanilla) ຂອງ glTF ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບພຶດຕິກຳໃນ Godot 4.1 ແລະ "
"ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Treat the Godot scene's root node as the name of the glTF scene, and add all "
"of its children as root nodes of the glTF file. This uses only vanilla glTF "
"features. This avoids an extra root node, but only the name of the Godot "
"scene's root node will be preserved, as it will not be saved as a node."
msgstr ""
"ຖືວ່າ root node ຂອງ scene ໃນ Godot ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ scene ໃນ glTF, ແລະ ເພີ່ມລູກທັງໝົດຂອງມັນເປັນ "
"root nodes ຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຟີເຈີພື້ນຖານຂອງ glTF ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການມີ "
"root node ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແຕ່ຈະມີພຽງຊື່ຂອງ root node ຂອງ scene ໃນ Godot ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້, "
"ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນໂນດ."

msgid ""
"Import the texture maps in the glTF file as they are, without trying to fit "
"them into specific texture slots suitable for Godot's built-in materials. "
"This may be desirable if using the glTF file with custom shaders, but may not "
"display correctly with Godot's built-in materials. This is equivalent to the "
"behavior in Godot 4.6 and earlier."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າ texture maps ໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF ຕາມທີ່ພວກມັນເປັນຢູ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ພະຍາຍາມປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບ texture "
"slots ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບວັດສະດຸທີ່ມີມານຳ Godot. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນຖ້າໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ glTF ກັບ shader "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບວັດສະດຸພື້ນຖານຂອງ Godot. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບພຶດຕິກຳໃນ "
"Godot 4.6 ແລະ ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Import the texture maps in the glTF file remapped to the most suitable "
"texture slots based on Godot's [StandardMaterial3D] class. This is the "
"default behavior."
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າ texture maps ໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF ໂດຍທຳການ remap ໄປຫາ texture slots "
"ທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດໂດຍອີງຕາມຄລາສ [StandardMaterial3D] ຂອງ Godot. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, include them, mark them as non-"
"visible with [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], and require that importers "
"respect their non-visibility. Downside: If the importer does not support "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], the file cannot be imported."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ scene ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ, ໃຫ້ລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໄປນຳ, ໝາຍພວກມັນວ່າເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນດ້ວຍ "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມການເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນນັ້ນ. "
"ຂໍ້ເສຍ: ຖ້າຕົວນຳເຂົ້າບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], ໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, include them, mark them as non-"
"visible with [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], and do not impose any "
"requirements on importers. Downside: If the importer does not support "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], invisible objects will be visible."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ scene ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ, ໃຫ້ລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໄປນຳ, ໝາຍພວກມັນວ່າເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນດ້ວຍ "
"[code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັງຄັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃດໆກັບຕົວນຳເຂົ້າ. ຂໍ້ເສຍ: "
"ຖ້າຕົວນຳເຂົ້າບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ [code]KHR_node_visibility[/code], ວັດຖຸທີ່ຄວນຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນກໍຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If the scene contains any non-visible nodes, do not include them in the "
"export. This is the same as the behavior in Godot 4.4 and earlier. Downside: "
"Invisible nodes will not exist in the exported file."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ scene ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳດຽວກັນກັບໃນ "
"Godot 4.4 ແລະ ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ເສຍ: ໂນດທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "[GLTFDocument] extension class."
msgstr "ຄລາສ extension ຂອງ [GLTFDocument]."

msgid ""
"Extends the functionality of the [GLTFDocument] class by allowing you to run "
"arbitrary code at various stages of glTF import or export.\n"
"To use, make a new class extending GLTFDocumentExtension, override any "
"methods you need, make an instance of your class, and register it using "
"[method GLTFDocument.register_gltf_document_extension].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All GLTFDocumentExtension classes are duplicated when beginning "
"the import or export process. Except for configuration values, these classes "
"must be stateless in order to function properly. If you need to store data, "
"use the [code]set_additional_data[/code] and [code]get_additional_data[/code] "
"methods in [GLTFState] or [GLTFNode]."
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມສາມາດຂອງຄລາສ [GLTFDocument] ໂດຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ code "
"ຕ່າງໆໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆຂອງການນຳເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກ glTF.\n"
"ວິທີໃຊ້ແມ່ນໃຫ້ສ້າງຄລາສໃໝ່ທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍຈາກ GLTFDocumentExtension, override ເມທອດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, "
"ສ້າງ instance ຂອງຄລາສຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"GLTFDocument.register_gltf_document_extension].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຄລາສ GLTFDocumentExtension ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເຮັດຊ້ຳ (duplicated) "
"ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກ. ຍົກເວັ້ນຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຄລາສເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນແບບ stateless "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມທອດ "
"[code]set_additional_data[/code] ແລະ [code]get_additional_data[/code] ໃນ "
"[GLTFState] ຫຼື [GLTFNode]."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_export_preflight] and before [method _export_post_convert].\n"
"Runs when converting the data from a Godot scene node. This method can be "
"used to process the Godot scene node data into a format that can be used by "
"[method _export_node]."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _export_preflight] ແລະ ກ່ອນ "
"[method _export_post_convert].\n"
"ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການແປງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂນດ scene ຂອງ Godot. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນໂນດ "
"scene ຂອງ Godot ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍ [method _export_node] ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Runs prior to the export process. This method is run before [method "
"_export_preflight] when exporting a scene from the editor, or it may not be "
"run at all in other situations.\n"
"Unlike the rest of the export methods, this does not run when calling a "
"[GLTFDocument]'s export methods in sequence with everything else, but rather "
"runs before that entire process occurs, allowing configuration to occur "
"beforehand, potentially minutes or hours in advance of [method "
"_export_preflight]. This allows extensions to decide which properties to show "
"in the editor export settings dialog based on the contents of the scene, "
"hiding any settings that are not relevant for that scene. The [param "
"root_node] parameter may be [code]null[/code], in which case all properties "
"should be shown."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນ [method _export_preflight] ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ "
"scene ຈາກ editor, ຫຼື ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກເລີຍໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ຕ່າງຈາກເມທອດສົ່ງອອກອື່ນໆ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດສົ່ງອອກຂອງ [GLTFDocument] ຕາມລຳດັບ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກກ່ອນທີ່ຂະບວນການທັງໝົດນັ້ນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ "
"extension ຕັດສິນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຈະສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອອກຂອງ editor "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມເນື້ອໃນຂອງ scene, ແລະ ເຊື່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ scene ນັ້ນ. ພາລາມິເຕີ [param "
"root_node] ອາດຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code], ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດຄວນຈະຖືກສະແດງ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _export_post]. If this "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] is used for exporting images, this runs after [method "
"_serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final JSON of each node. Data should be "
"primarily stored in [param gltf_node] prior to serializing the JSON, but the "
"original Godot [Node] is also provided if available. [param node] may be "
"[code]null[/code] if not available, such as when exporting glTF data not "
"generated from a Godot scene."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] ແລະ ກ່ອນ [method _export_post]. ຖ້າ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method "
"_serialize_texture_json]. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ JSON ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນຄວນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ [param gltf_node] ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການ serialize JSON, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງມີໂນດ "
"Godot [Node] ດັ້ງເດີມໃຫ້ມາຖ້າມີ. [param node] ອາດຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ ໃນເວລາສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນ glTF ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງມາຈາກ scene ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. Allows GLTFDocumentExtension classes to provide "
"mappings for properties of nodes in the Godot scene tree, to JSON pointers to "
"glTF properties, as defined by the glTF object model.\n"
"Returns a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] instance that defines how the property "
"should be mapped. If your extension can't handle the property, return "
"[code]null[/code] or an instance without any JSON pointers (see [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.has_json_pointers]). You should use [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] to set the types, and set the JSON "
"pointer(s) using the [member GLTFObjectModelProperty.json_pointers] "
"property.\n"
"The parameters provide context for the property, including the NodePath, the "
"Godot node, the GLTF node index, and the target object. The [param "
"target_object] will be equal to [param godot_node] if no sub-object can be "
"found, otherwise it will point to a sub-object. For example, if the path is "
"[code]^\"A/B/C/MeshInstance3D:mesh:surface_0/material:emission_intensity\"[/"
"code], it will get the node, then the mesh, and then the material, so [param "
"target_object] will be the [Material] resource, and [param target_depth] will "
"be 2 because 2 levels were traversed to get to the target."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄລາສ GLTFDocumentExtension ສ້າງການ map "
"ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດໃນ scene tree ຂອງ Godot ໄປຫາ JSON pointers ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ glTF, "
"ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ glTF object model. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFObjectModelProperty] "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດວິທີການ map ຄຸນສົມບັດ. ຖ້າ extension ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນໄດ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ "
"[code]null[/code] ຫຼື instance ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ JSON pointers. ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງປະເພດ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງ JSON pointer(s) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member GLTFObjectModelProperty.json_pointers]. "
"ພາລາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນ, ລວມທັງ NodePath, ໂນດ Godot, ດັດຊະນີໂນດ GLTF, "
"ແລະ ວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run last, after all other parts of "
"the export process.\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final JSON of the generated glTF file."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັນດັບສຸດທ້າຍ, "
"ຫຼັງຈາກພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ JSON ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_convert_scene_node] and before [method _export_preserialize].\n"
"This method can be used to modify the converted node data structures before "
"serialization with any additional data from the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _convert_scene_node] ແລະ "
"ກ່ອນ [method _export_preserialize].\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນໂນດທີ່ຖືກແປງແລ້ວ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການ serialization "
"ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆຈາກ scene tree."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run first, before all other parts "
"of the export process.\n"
"The return value is used to determine if this [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"instance should be used for exporting a given glTF file. If [constant OK], "
"the export will use this [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance. If not overridden, "
"[constant OK] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ, ກ່ອນພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າ instance ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"ນີ້ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant OK], ການສົ່ງອອກຈະໃຊ້ "
"instance ນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການ override, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant OK] ເປັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_export_post_convert] and before [method _get_saveable_image_formats].\n"
"This method can be used to alter the state before performing serialization. "
"It runs every time when generating a buffer with [method "
"GLTFDocument.generate_buffer] or writing to the file system with [method "
"GLTFDocument.write_to_filesystem]."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _export_post_convert] ແລະ "
"ກ່ອນ [method _get_saveable_image_formats].\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການ serialization. "
"ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກທຸກຄັ້ງເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ buffer ດ້ວຍ [method GLTFDocument.generate_buffer] ຫຼື "
"ການຂຽນລົງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍ [method GLTFDocument.write_to_filesystem]."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_pre_generate] and before [method _import_node].\n"
"Runs when generating a Godot scene node from a GLTFNode. The returned node "
"will be added to the scene tree. Multiple nodes can be generated in this step "
"if they are added as a child of the returned node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param scene_parent] parameter may be [code]null[/code] if "
"this is the single root node."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _import_pre_generate] ແລະ "
"ກ່ອນ [method _import_node].\n"
"ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອສ້າງໂນດ scene ຂອງ Godot ຈາກ GLTFNode. ໂນດທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ scene "
"tree. ສາມາດສ້າງຫຼາຍໆໂນດໄດ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມານັ້ນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ພາລາມິເຕີ [param scene_parent] ອາດຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code] ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນ "
"root node ດ່ຽວ."

msgid ""
"Returns the file extension to use for saving image data into, for example, "
"[code]\".png\"[/code]. If defined, when this extension is used to handle "
"images, and the images are saved to a separate file, the image bytes will be "
"copied to a file with this extension. If this is set, there should be a "
"[ResourceImporter] class able to import the file. If not defined or empty, "
"Godot will save the image into a PNG file."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄ່ານາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ, ຕົວຢ່າງ [code]\".png\"[/code]. ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້, "
"ເມື່ອ extension ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຮູບພາບຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກ, "
"ໄບຕ໌ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະຖືກກັອບປີ້ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນນີ້. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້, ຄວນມີຄລາສ [ResourceImporter] "
"ທີ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ ຫຼື ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ, Godot ຈະບັນທຶກຮູບພາບເປັນໄຟລ໌ PNG."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_convert_scene_node] and before [method _export_node].\n"
"Returns an array of the image formats that can be saved/exported by this "
"extension. This extension will only be selected as the image exporter if the "
"[GLTFDocument]'s [member GLTFDocument.image_format] is in this array. If this "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image exporter, one of the [method "
"_save_image_at_path] or [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] methods will run "
"next, otherwise [method _export_node] will run next. If the format name "
"contains [code]\"Lossy\"[/code], the lossy quality slider will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທີ່ extension ນີ້ສາມາດບັນທຶກ ຫຼື "
"ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້. extension ນີ້ຈະຖືກເລືອກເປັນຕົວສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member "
"GLTFDocument.image_format] ຂອງ [GLTFDocument] ຢູ່ໃນອາເຣນີ້. ຖ້າຖືກເລືອກ, ເມທອດ "
"[method _save_image_at_path] ຫຼື [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ. ຖ້າຊື່ຮູບແບບມີຄຳວ່າ [code]\"Lossy\"[/code], ປຸ່ມປັບຄຸນນະພາບແບບ "
"lossy ຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_preflight] and before [method _parse_node_extensions].\n"
"Returns an array of the glTF extensions supported by this "
"GLTFDocumentExtension class. This is used to validate if a glTF file with "
"required extensions can be loaded."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _import_preflight] ແລະ ກ່ອນ "
"[method _parse_node_extensions].\n"
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນອາເຣຂອງ glTF extensions ທີ່ຄລາສ GLTFDocumentExtension ນີ້ຮອງຮັບ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີ extensions ທີ່ຈຳເປັນນັ້ນສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_generate_scene_node] and before [method _import_post].\n"
"This method can be used to make modifications to each of the generated Godot "
"scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _generate_scene_node] ແລະ "
"ກ່ອນ [method _import_post].\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ລະໂນດ scene ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. Allows GLTFDocumentExtension classes to provide "
"mappings for JSON pointers to glTF properties, as defined by the glTF object "
"model, to properties of nodes in the Godot scene tree.\n"
"Returns a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] instance that defines how the property "
"should be mapped. If your extension can't handle the property, return "
"[code]null[/code] or an instance without any NodePaths (see [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.has_node_paths]). You should use [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] to set the types, and [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.append_path_to_property] function is useful for most "
"simple cases.\n"
"In many cases, [param partial_paths] will contain the start of a path, "
"allowing the extension to complete the path. For example, for [code]/nodes/3/"
"extensions/MY_ext/prop[/code], Godot will pass you a NodePath that leads to "
"node 3, so the GLTFDocumentExtension class only needs to resolve the last "
"[code]MY_ext/prop[/code] part of the path. In this example, the extension "
"should check [code]split.size() > 4 and split[0] == \"nodes\" and split[2] == "
"\"extensions\" and split[3] == \"MY_ext\"[/code] at the start of the function "
"to check if this JSON pointer applies to it, then it can use [param "
"partial_paths] and handle [code]split[4][/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄລາສ GLTFDocumentExtension ສ້າງການ map ຈາກ JSON "
"pointers ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ glTF ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດໃນ scene tree ຂອງ Godot. ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"instance ຂອງ [GLTFObjectModelProperty] ທີ່ກຳນົດວິທີການ map. ຖ້າ extension "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]null[/code]. ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ [method "
"GLTFObjectModelProperty.set_types] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງປະເພດ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run last, after all other parts of "
"the import process.\n"
"This method can be used to modify the final Godot scene generated by the "
"import process."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັນດັບສຸດທ້າຍ, ຫຼັງຈາກພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ scene ສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ Godot ທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] and before [method _import_pre_generate].\n"
"This method can be used to modify any of the data imported so far after "
"parsing each node, but before generating the scene or any of its nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _parse_node_extensions] "
"ແລະ ກ່ອນ [method _import_pre_generate].\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາແລ້ວ ຫຼັງຈາກການ parse ແຕ່ລະໂນດ, ແຕ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງ "
"scene ຫຼື ໂນດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_import_post_parse] and before [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"This method can be used to modify or read from any of the processed data "
"structures, before generating the nodes and then running the final per-node "
"import step."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _import_post_parse] ແລະ "
"ກ່ອນ [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ອ່ານຈາກໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໂນດ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າແຕ່ລະໂນດຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run first, before all other parts "
"of the import process.\n"
"The return value is used to determine if this [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"instance should be used for importing a given glTF file. If [constant OK], "
"the import will use this [GLTFDocumentExtension] instance. If not overridden, "
"[constant OK] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ, ກ່ອນພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າ instance ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"ນີ້ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant OK], ການນຳເຂົ້າຈະໃຊ້ "
"instance ນີ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການ override, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ [constant OK] ເປັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_node_extensions] and before [method _parse_texture_json].\n"
"Runs when parsing image data from a glTF file. The data could be sourced from "
"a separate file, a URI, or a buffer, and then is passed as a byte array."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _parse_node_extensions] "
"ແລະ ກ່ອນ [method _parse_texture_json].\n"
"ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການ parse ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF. ຂໍ້ມູນອາດຈະມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ແຍກ, URI, ຫຼື buffer, "
"ແລະ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບ byte array."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_supported_extensions] and before [method _import_post_parse].\n"
"Runs when parsing the node extensions of a GLTFNode. This method can be used "
"to process the extension JSON data into a format that can be used by [method "
"_generate_scene_node]. The return value should be a member of the [enum "
"Error] enum."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _get_supported_extensions] "
"ແລະ ກ່ອນ [method _import_post_parse].\n"
"ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການ parse ໂນດ extensions ຂອງ GLTFNode. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນ "
"JSON ຂອງ extension ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂດຍ [method _generate_scene_node] ໄດ້. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຄວນເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງ enum [enum Error]."

msgid ""
"Part of the import process. This method is run after [method "
"_parse_image_data] and before [method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"Runs when parsing the texture JSON from the glTF textures array. This can be "
"used to set the source image index to use as the texture."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ [method _parse_image_data] ແລະ ກ່ອນ "
"[method _generate_scene_node].\n"
"ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການ parse ຂໍ້ມູນ texture JSON ຈາກອາເຣ textures ຂອງ glTF. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງດັດຊະນີຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນ texture."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method is run when saving images separately from the glTF file. When "
"images are embedded, [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] runs instead. Note "
"that these methods only run when this [GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as "
"the image exporter."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອບັນທຶກຮູບພາບແຍກຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF. ຖ້າຮູບພາບຖືກຝັງ "
"(embedded), ເມທອດ [method _serialize_image_to_bytes] ຈະເຮັດວຽກແທນ. ໝາຍເຫດ: "
"ເມທອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [GLTFDocumentExtension] ນີ້ຖືກເລືອກເປັນຕົວສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_get_saveable_image_formats] and before [method _serialize_texture_json].\n"
"This method is run when embedding images in the glTF file. When images are "
"saved separately, [method _save_image_at_path] runs instead. Note that these "
"methods only run when this [GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image "
"exporter.\n"
"This method must set the image MIME type in the [param image_dict] with the "
"[code]\"mimeType\"[/code] key. For example, for a PNG image, it would be set "
"to [code]\"image/png\"[/code]. The return value must be a [PackedByteArray] "
"containing the image data."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອມີການຝັງຮູບພາບໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"MIME type ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນ [param image_dict] ດ້ວຍ key [code]\"mimeType\"[/code]. "
"ສົ່ງຄ່າເປັນ [PackedByteArray] ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ."

msgid ""
"Part of the export process. This method is run after [method "
"_save_image_at_path] or [method _serialize_image_to_bytes], and before "
"[method _export_node]. Note that this method only runs when this "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] is selected as the image exporter.\n"
"This method can be used to set up the extensions for the texture JSON by "
"editing [param texture_json]. The extension must also be added as used "
"extension with [method GLTFState.add_used_extension], be sure to set "
"[code]required[/code] to [code]true[/code] if you are not providing a "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການສົ່ງອອກ. ເມທອດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ extensions ສຳລັບ texture JSON "
"ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂ [param texture_json]. ຕ້ອງມີການເພີ່ມ extension ເປັນ used extension ດ້ວຍ "
"[method GLTFState.add_used_extension] ນຳອີກ."

msgid "Represents a glTF light."
msgstr "ແທນແສງໄຟ glTF."

msgid ""
"Represents a light as defined by the [code]KHR_lights_punctual[/code] glTF "
"extension."
msgstr "ແທນແສງໄຟຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ glTF extension [code]KHR_lights_punctual[/code]."

msgid "KHR_lights_punctual glTF extension spec"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ KHR_lights_punctual glTF extension"

msgid "Creates a new GLTFLight instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFLight ໂດຍການ parse ຈາກ [Dictionary] ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Create a new GLTFLight instance from the given Godot [Light3D] node."
msgstr "ສ້າງ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ GLTFLight ຈາກໂນດ [Light3D] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ."

msgid "Serializes this GLTFLight instance into a [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFLight ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary] (Serialize)."

msgid "Converts this GLTFLight instance into a Godot [Light3D] node."
msgstr "ແປງ instance ນີ້ຂອງ GLTFLight ໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ [Light3D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"The [Color] of the light in linear space. Defaults to white. A black color "
"causes the light to have no effect.\n"
"This value is linear to match glTF, but will be converted to nonlinear sRGB "
"when creating a Godot [Light3D] node upon import, or converted to linear when "
"exporting a Godot [Light3D] to glTF."
msgstr ""
"ສີ [Color] ຂອງແສງໄຟໃນ linear space. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີຂາວ. ສີດຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແສງໄຟບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ.\n"
"ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນແບບ linear ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ glTF, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ nonlinear sRGB ເມື່ອສ້າງໂນດ "
"[Light3D] ຂອງ Godot ໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ, ຫຼື ຖືກແປງເປັນ linear ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ [Light3D] ຂອງ "
"Godot ໄປເປັນ glTF."

msgid ""
"The inner angle of the cone in a spotlight. Must be less than or equal to the "
"outer cone angle.\n"
"Within this angle, the light is at full brightness. Between the inner and "
"outer cone angles, there is a transition from full brightness to zero "
"brightness. When creating a Godot [SpotLight3D], the ratio between the inner "
"and outer cone angles is used to calculate the attenuation of the light."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມພາຍໃນ (inner angle) ຂອງຮູບຈວຍໃນ spotlight. ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບມຸມພາຍນອກ "
"(outer cone angle). ພາຍໃນມຸມນີ້, ແສງໄຟຈະມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

msgid ""
"The intensity of the light. This is expressed in candelas (lumens per "
"steradian) for point and spot lights, and lux (lumens per m²) for directional "
"lights. When creating a Godot light, this value is converted to a unitless "
"multiplier."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສະແດງໃນ Candela ສຳລັບ point ແລະ spot lights, ແລະ Lux ສຳລັບ "
"directional lights. ເມື່ອສ້າງແສງໄຟໃນ Godot, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນຕົວຄູນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍ."

msgid ""
"The type of the light. The values accepted by Godot are \"point\", \"spot\", "
"and \"directional\", which correspond to Godot's [OmniLight3D], "
"[SpotLight3D], and [DirectionalLight3D] respectively."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງແສງໄຟ. ຄ່າທີ່ Godot ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ \"point\", \"spot\", ແລະ \"directional\", "
"ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ [OmniLight3D], [SpotLight3D], ແລະ [DirectionalLight3D] ຂອງ Godot "
"ຕາມລຳດັບ."

msgid ""
"The outer angle of the cone in a spotlight. Must be greater than or equal to "
"the inner angle.\n"
"At this angle, the light drops off to zero brightness. Between the inner and "
"outer cone angles, there is a transition from full brightness to zero "
"brightness. If this angle is a half turn, then the spotlight emits in all "
"directions. When creating a Godot [SpotLight3D], the outer cone angle is used "
"as the angle of the spotlight."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມພາຍນອກ (outer angle) ຂອງຮູບຈວຍໃນ spotlight. ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບມຸມພາຍໃນ. "
"ຢູ່ທີ່ມຸມນີ້, ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈະຫຼຸດລົງເປັນສູນ."

msgid "GLTFMesh represents a glTF mesh."
msgstr "GLTFMesh ແມ່ນຕົວແທນຂອງ glTF mesh."

msgid ""
"GLTFMesh handles 3D mesh data imported from glTF files. It includes "
"properties for blend channels, blend weights, instance materials, and the "
"mesh itself."
msgstr ""
"GLTFMesh ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນ mesh 3D ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດສຳລັບ blend "
"channels, blend weights, instance materials, ແລະ ຕົວ mesh ເອງ."

msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFMesh] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFMesh] ນີ້. "
"ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດໃນຄລາສ [GLTFDocumentExtension]."

msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFMesh] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can be "
"anything you want."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFMesh] ນີ້."

msgid "An array of floats representing the blend weights of the mesh."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງ float ທີ່ແທນຄ່າ blend weights ຂອງ mesh."

msgid ""
"An array of Material objects representing the materials used in the mesh."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງວັດຖຸ Material ທີ່ແທນວັດສະດຸທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ mesh."

msgid "The [ImporterMesh] object representing the mesh itself."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸ [ImporterMesh] ທີ່ແທນຕົວ mesh ເອງ."

msgid "The original name of the mesh."
msgstr "ຊື່ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງ mesh."

msgid "glTF node class."
msgstr "ຄລາສໂນດ glTF."

msgid ""
"Represents a glTF node. glTF nodes may have names, transforms, children "
"(other glTF nodes), and more specialized properties (represented by their own "
"classes).\n"
"glTF nodes generally exist inside of [GLTFState] which represents all data of "
"a glTF file. Most of GLTFNode's properties are indices of other data in the "
"glTF file. You can extend a glTF node with additional properties by using "
"[method get_additional_data] and [method set_additional_data]."
msgstr ""
"ແທນໂນດ glTF. ໂນດ glTF ອາດຈະມີຊື່, transforms, ລູກ (ໂນດ glTF ອື່ນໆ) ແລະ "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດພິເສດອື່ນໆ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ໂນດ glTF ຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນ [GLTFState]."

msgid "glTF scene and node spec"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ scene ແລະ ໂນດ glTF"

msgid "Appends the given child node index to the [member children] array."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມດັດຊະນີໂນດລູກທີ່ໃຫ້ມາເຂົ້າໃນອາເຣ [member children]."

msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFNode] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFNode] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns the [NodePath] that this GLTF node will have in the Godot scene tree "
"after being imported. This is useful when importing glTF object model "
"pointers with [GLTFObjectModelProperty], for handling extensions such as "
"[code]KHR_animation_pointer[/code] or [code]KHR_interactivity[/code].\n"
"If [param handle_skeletons] is [code]true[/code], paths to skeleton bone glTF "
"nodes will be resolved properly. For example, a path that would be [code]^\"A/"
"B/C/Bone1/Bone2/Bone3\"[/code] if [code]false[/code] will become [code]^\"A/B/"
"C/Skeleton3D:Bone3\"[/code]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [NodePath] ທີ່ໂນດ GLTF ນີ້ຈະມີໃນ scene tree ຂອງ Godot ຫຼັງຈາກນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFNode] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-node state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can be "
"anything you want."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນ instance ຂອງ [GLTFNode] ນີ້."

msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a camera, the index of the [GLTFCamera] in the "
"[GLTFState] that describes the camera's properties. If [code]-1[/code], this "
"node is not a camera."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ glTF ນີ້ເປັນກ້ອງ, ຈະເປັນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFCamera] ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]-1[/code], ໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນກ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"The indices of the child nodes in the [GLTFState]. If this glTF node has no "
"children, this will be an empty array."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີຂອງໂນດລູກໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີລູກ, ຈະເປັນອາເຣຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"How deep into the node hierarchy this node is. A root node will have a height "
"of 0, its children will have a height of 1, and so on. If -1, the height has "
"not been calculated."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລິກໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂນດ. root node ຈະມີຄວາມສູງເປັນ 0. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຄິດໄລ່."

msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a light, the index of the [GLTFLight] in the [GLTFState] "
"that describes the light's properties. If -1, this node is not a light."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ glTF ນີ້ເປັນແສງໄຟ, ຈະເປັນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFLight] ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, "
"ໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນແສງໄຟ."

msgid ""
"If this glTF node is a mesh, the index of the [GLTFMesh] in the [GLTFState] "
"that describes the mesh's properties. If -1, this node is not a mesh."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ glTF ນີ້ເປັນ mesh, ຈະເປັນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFMesh] ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, "
"ໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ mesh."

msgid "The original name of the node."
msgstr "ຊື່ດັ້ງເດີມຂອງໂນດ."

msgid ""
"The index of the parent node in the [GLTFState]. If -1, this node is a root "
"node."
msgstr "ດັດຊະນີຂອງໂນດແມ່ (parent) ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, ໂນດນີ້ແມ່ນ root node."

msgid "The position of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດ glTF ໂດຍທຽບກັບໂນດແມ່."

msgid "The rotation of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "ການໝູນຂອງໂນດ glTF ໂດຍທຽບກັບໂນດແມ່."

msgid "The scale of the glTF node relative to its parent."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ (scale) ຂອງໂນດ glTF ໂດຍທຽບກັບໂນດແມ່."

msgid ""
"If this glTF node has a skeleton, the index of the [GLTFSkeleton] in the "
"[GLTFState] that describes the skeleton's properties. If -1, this node does "
"not have a skeleton."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ glTF ນີ້ມີ skeleton, ຈະເປັນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFSkeleton] ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"-1, ໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ມີ skeleton."

msgid ""
"If this glTF node has a skin, the index of the [GLTFSkin] in the [GLTFState] "
"that describes the skin's properties. If -1, this node does not have a skin."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂນດ glTF ນີ້ມີ skin, ຈະເປັນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFSkin] ໃນ [GLTFState]. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, ໂນດນີ້ບໍ່ມີ "
"skin."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the GLTF node is visible. If [code]false[/code], the "
"GLTF node is not visible. This is converted to the [member Node3D.visible] "
"property in the Godot scene, and is exported to [code]KHR_node_visibility[/"
"code] when [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ໂນດ GLTF ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"The transform of the glTF node relative to its parent. This property is "
"usually unused since the position, rotation, and scale properties are "
"preferred."
msgstr "ຄ່າ transform ຂອງໂນດ glTF ໂດຍທຽບກັບໂນດແມ່."

msgid "Describes how to access a property as defined in the glTF object model."
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ glTF object model."

msgid ""
"GLTFObjectModelProperty defines a mapping between a property in the glTF "
"object model and a NodePath in the Godot scene tree. This can be used to "
"animate properties in a glTF file using the [code]KHR_animation_pointer[/"
"code] extension, or to access them through an engine-agnostic script such as "
"a behavior graph as defined by the [code]KHR_interactivity[/code] extension.\n"
"The glTF property is identified by JSON pointer(s) stored in [member "
"json_pointers], while the Godot property it maps to is defined by [member "
"node_paths]. In most cases [member json_pointers] and [member node_paths] "
"will each only have one item, but in some cases a single glTF JSON pointer "
"will map to multiple Godot properties, or a single Godot property will be "
"mapped to multiple glTF JSON pointers, or it might be a many-to-many "
"relationship.\n"
"[Expression] objects can be used to define conversions between the data, such "
"as when glTF defines an angle in radians and Godot uses degrees. The [member "
"object_model_type] property defines the type of data stored in the glTF file "
"as defined by the object model, see [enum GLTFObjectModelType] for possible "
"values."
msgstr ""
"GLTFObjectModelProperty ກຳນົດການ map ລະຫວ່າງຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ glTF object model ກັບ "
"NodePath ໃນ scene tree ຂອງ Godot."

msgid "GLTF Object Model"
msgstr "glTF Object Model"

msgid "KHR_animation_pointer GLTF extension"
msgstr "KHR_animation_pointer GLTF extension"

msgid ""
"Appends a [NodePath] to [member node_paths]. This can be used by "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] classes to define how a glTF object model property "
"maps to a Godot property, or multiple Godot properties. Prefer using [method "
"append_path_to_property] for simple cases. Be sure to also call [method "
"set_types] once (the order does not matter)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ [NodePath] ເຂົ້າໃນ [member node_paths]."

msgid ""
"High-level wrapper over [method append_node_path] that handles the most "
"common cases. It constructs a new [NodePath] using [param node_path] as a "
"base and appends [param prop_name] to the subpath. Be sure to also call "
"[method set_types] once (the order does not matter)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຫໍ່ຫຸ້ມລະດັບສູງຂອງ [method append_node_path] ທີ່ຈັດການກັບກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ສຸດ. ມັນສ້າງ "
"[NodePath] ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ [param node_path] ເປັນພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ [param prop_name] "
"ຕໍ່ໃສ່ເສັ້ນທາງຍ່ອຍ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method set_types] ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ (ລໍາດັບແມ່ນບໍ່ສໍາຄັນ)."

msgid ""
"The GLTF accessor type associated with this property's [member "
"object_model_type]. See [member GLTFAccessor.accessor_type] for possible "
"values, and see [enum GLTFObjectModelType] for how the object model type maps "
"to accessor types."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງ GLTF accessor ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [member object_model_type] ຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member json_pointers] is not empty. This is "
"used during export to determine if a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] can handle "
"converting a Godot property to a glTF object model property."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member json_pointers] ບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [member node_paths] is not empty. This is used "
"during import to determine if a [GLTFObjectModelProperty] can handle "
"converting a glTF object model property to a Godot property."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າ [member node_paths] ບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [member variant_type] and [member object_model_type] properties. "
"This is a convenience method to set both properties at once, since they are "
"almost always known at the same time. This method should be called once. "
"Calling it again with the same values will have no effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ [member variant_type] ແລະ [member object_model_type] ພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"If set, this [Expression] will be used to convert the property value from the "
"glTF object model to the value expected by the Godot property. This is useful "
"when the glTF object model uses a different unit system, or when the data "
"needs to be transformed in some way. If [code]null[/code], the value will be "
"copied as-is."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້, [Expression] ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງຄ່າຈາກ glTF object model ໄປຫາຄ່າທີ່ Godot "
"ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"If set, this [Expression] will be used to convert the property value from the "
"Godot property to the value expected by the glTF object model. This is useful "
"when the glTF object model uses a different unit system, or when the data "
"needs to be transformed in some way. If [code]null[/code], the value will be "
"copied as-is."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້, [Expression] ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງຄ່າຈາກ Godot ໄປຫາຄ່າທີ່ glTF object model "
"ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"The glTF object model JSON pointers used to identify the property in the glTF "
"object model. In most cases, there will be only one item in this array, but "
"specific cases may require multiple pointers. The items are themselves arrays "
"which represent the JSON pointer split into its components."
msgstr "JSON pointers ຂອງ glTF object model ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄຸນສົມບັດ."

msgid ""
"An array of [NodePath]s that point to a property, or multiple properties, in "
"the Godot scene tree. On import, this will either be set by [GLTFDocument], "
"or by a [GLTFDocumentExtension] class. For simple cases, use [method "
"append_path_to_property] to add properties to this array.\n"
"In most cases [member node_paths] will only have one item, but in some cases "
"a single glTF JSON pointer will map to multiple Godot properties. For "
"example, a [GLTFCamera] or [GLTFLight] used on multiple glTF nodes will be "
"represented by multiple Godot nodes."
msgstr "ອາເຣຂອງ [NodePath] ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາຄຸນສົມບັດໃນ scene tree ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"The type of data stored in the glTF file as defined by the object model. This "
"is a superset of the available accessor types, and determines the accessor "
"type."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ object model."

msgid ""
"The type of data stored in the Godot property. This is the type of the "
"property that the [member node_paths] point to."
msgstr "ປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເກັບໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Unknown or not set object model type. If the object model type is set to this "
"value, the real type still needs to be determined."
msgstr "ປະເພດ object model ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"bool\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a boolean, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\". When encoded in an accessor, a "
"value of [code]0[/code] is [code]false[/code], and any other value is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr "ປະເພດ object model ແມ່ນ \"bool\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນ boolean."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a number, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\"."
msgstr "ປະເພດ object model ແມ່ນ \"float\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນຕົວເລກ."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float[lb][rb]\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array "
"of numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ object model ແມ່ນ \"float[lb][rb]\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກ."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float2\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of two "
"numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC2\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ object model ແມ່ນ \"float2\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກສອງຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float3\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"three numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC3\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ object model ແມ່ນ \"float3\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກສາມຕົວ."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float4\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"four numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"VEC4\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ \"float4\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກສີ່ຕົວ, "
"ແລະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ [GLTFAccessor] ເປັນ \"VEC4\"."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float2x2\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"four numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT2\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ \"float2x2\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກສີ່ຕົວ, "
"ແລະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ [GLTFAccessor] ເປັນ \"MAT2\"."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float3x3\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"nine numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT3\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ \"float3x3\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກເກົ້າຕົວ, "
"ແລະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ [GLTFAccessor] ເປັນ \"MAT3\"."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"float4x4\". Represented in the glTF JSON as an array of "
"sixteen numbers, and encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"MAT4\"."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ \"float4x4\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນອາເຣຂອງຕົວເລກສິບຫົກຕົວ, "
"ແລະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ [GLTFAccessor] ເປັນ \"MAT4\"."

msgid ""
"Object model type \"int\". Represented in the glTF JSON as a number, and "
"encoded in a [GLTFAccessor] as \"SCALAR\". The range of values is limited to "
"signed integers. For [code]KHR_interactivity[/code], only 32-bit integers are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຮູບແບບວັດຖຸ \"int\". ສະແດງໃນ glTF JSON ເປັນຕົວເລກ, ແລະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ "
"[GLTFAccessor] ເປັນ \"SCALAR\". ຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ສະເພາະຈຳນວນຖ້ວນແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ. "
"ສຳລັບ [code]KHR_interactivity[/code], ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຈຳນວນຖ້ວນແບບ 32-bit ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Represents a glTF physics body."
msgstr "ສະແດງແທນຕົວຟີຊິກ (physics body) ຂອງ glTF."

msgid ""
"Represents a physics body as an intermediary between the "
"[code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF data and Godot's nodes, and it's "
"abstracted in a way that allows adding support for different glTF physics "
"extensions in the future."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງແທນຕົວຟີຊິກທີ່ເປັນຕົວກາງລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ມູນ [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] ຂອງ glTF ແລະ "
"ໂນດຂອງ Godot, ແລະ ມັນຖືກສ້າງໃຫ້ເປັນນາມມະທຳໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມຟີຊິກ "
"glTF ອື່ນໆໄດ້ໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid "OMI_physics_body glTF extension"
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມ OMI_physics_body ຂອງ glTF"

msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsBody instance by parsing the given [Dictionary] in "
"the [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF extension format."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsBody ໃໝ່ໂດຍການແຍກຄ່າ [Dictionary] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບສ່ວນເສີມ "
"[code]OMI_physics_body[/code] ຂອງ glTF."

msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsBody instance from the given Godot "
"[CollisionObject3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsBody ໃໝ່ຈາກໂນດ [CollisionObject3D] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Serializes this GLTFPhysicsBody instance into a [Dictionary]. It will be in "
"the format expected by the [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] glTF extension."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລຊ໌ (Serialize) ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsBody ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary]. "
"ມັນຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສ່ວນເສີມ [code]OMI_physics_body[/code] ຂອງ glTF ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Converts this GLTFPhysicsBody instance into a Godot [CollisionObject3D] node."
msgstr "ແປງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsBody ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ [CollisionObject3D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"The angular velocity of the physics body, in radians per second. This is only "
"used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງມຸມຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ເຣດຽນຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ "
"\"rigid\" ຫຼື \"vehicle\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The type of the body.\n"
"When importing, this controls what type of [CollisionObject3D] node Godot "
"should generate. Valid values are [code]\"static\"[/code], [code]"
"\"animatable\"[/code], [code]\"character\"[/code], [code]\"rigid\"[/code], "
"[code]\"vehicle\"[/code], and [code]\"trigger\"[/code].\n"
"When exporting, this will be squashed down to one of [code]\"static\"[/code], "
"[code]\"kinematic\"[/code], or [code]\"dynamic\"[/code] motion types, or the "
"[code]\"trigger\"[/code] property."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ.\n"
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າ Godot ຄວນສ້າງໂນດ [CollisionObject3D] ປະເພດໃດ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ແມ່ນ [code]\"static\"[/code], [code]\"animatable\"[/code], [code]"
"\"character\"[/code], [code]\"rigid\"[/code], [code]\"vehicle\"[/code], ແລະ "
"[code]\"trigger\"[/code].\n"
"ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນປະເພດການເຄື່ອນທີ່ [code]\"static\"[/code], [code]"
"\"kinematic\"[/code], ຫຼື [code]\"dynamic\"[/code], ຫຼື ຄຸນສົມບັດ [code]\"trigger\"[/"
"code]."

msgid ""
"The center of mass of the body, in meters. This is in local space relative to "
"the body. By default, the center of the mass is the body's origin."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂລໂຄລ (local space) ທຽບກັບຕົວຟີຊິກ. "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດສູນກາງມວນແມ່ນຈຸດກຳເນີດ (origin) ຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ."

msgid ""
"The inertia strength of the physics body, in kilogram meter squared (kg⋅m²). "
"This represents the inertia around the principle axes, the diagonal of the "
"inertia tensor matrix. This is only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or "
"\"vehicle\".\n"
"When converted to a Godot [RigidBody3D] node, if this value is zero, then the "
"inertia will be calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງຂອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia) ຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ກິໂລກຣາມ ແມັດກຳລັງສອງ (kg⋅m²). "
"ນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມເສື່ອຍອ້ອມແກນຫຼັກ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນເສັ້ນທແຍງມຸມຂອງມາຕຣິກເຊັນເຊີຄວາມເສື່ອຍ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ \"rigid\" ຫຼື \"vehicle\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອແປງເປັນໂນດ [RigidBody3D] ຂອງ Godot, ຖ້າຄ່ານີ້ເປັນສູນ, ຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The inertia orientation of the physics body. This defines the rotation of the "
"inertia's principle axes relative to the object's local axes. This is only "
"used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\" and [member "
"inertia_diagonal] is set to a non-zero value."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດທິດທາງຄວາມເສື່ອຍຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ. "
"ນີ້ກຳນົດການໝຸນຂອງແກນຫຼັກຂອງຄວາມເສື່ອຍທຽບກັບແກນໂລໂຄລຂອງວັດຖຸ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ \"rigid\" ຫຼື \"vehicle\" ແລະ [member "
"inertia_diagonal] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ."

msgid ""
"The inertia tensor of the physics body, in kilogram meter squared (kg⋅m²). "
"This is only used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\".\n"
"When converted to a Godot [RigidBody3D] node, if this value is zero, then the "
"inertia will be calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເທັນເຊີຄວາມເສື່ອຍ (inertia tensor) ຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ກິໂລກຣາມ ແມັດກຳລັງສອງ "
"(kg⋅m²). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ \"rigid\" ຫຼື \"vehicle\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເມື່ອແປງເປັນໂນດ [RigidBody3D] ຂອງ Godot, ຖ້າຄ່ານີ້ເປັນສູນ, ຄວາມເສື່ອຍຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"The linear velocity of the physics body, in meters per second. This is only "
"used when the body type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໄວເຊີງເສັ້ນຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ແມັດຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ "
"\"rigid\" ຫຼື \"vehicle\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The mass of the physics body, in kilograms. This is only used when the body "
"type is \"rigid\" or \"vehicle\"."
msgstr ""
"ມວນຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ກິໂລກຣາມ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຂອງຕົວຟີຊິກເປັນ \"rigid\" ຫຼື "
"\"vehicle\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Represents a glTF physics shape."
msgstr "ສະແດງແທນຮູບຊົງຟີຊິກ (physics shape) ຂອງ glTF."

msgid ""
"Represents a physics shape as defined by the [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code] "
"or [code]OMI_collider[/code] glTF extensions. This class is an intermediary "
"between the glTF data and Godot's nodes, and it's abstracted in a way that "
"allows adding support for different glTF physics extensions in the future."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງແທນຮູບຊົງຟີຊິກຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍສ່ວນເສີມ [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code] ຫຼື "
"[code]OMI_collider[/code] ຂອງ glTF. ຄລາດນີ້ເປັນຕົວກາງລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ມູນ glTF ແລະ ໂນດຂອງ "
"Godot, ແລະ ມັນຖືກສ້າງໃຫ້ເປັນນາມມະທຳໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສ່ວນເສີມຟີຊິກ glTF "
"ອື່ນໆໄດ້ໃນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid "OMI_physics_shape glTF extension"
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມ OMI_physics_shape ຂອງ glTF"

msgid "OMI_collider glTF extension"
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມ OMI_collider ຂອງ glTF"

msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance by parsing the given [Dictionary]."
msgstr "ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ໃໝ່ໂດຍການແຍກຄ່າ [Dictionary] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance from the given Godot "
"[CollisionShape3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ໃໝ່ຈາກໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Creates a new GLTFPhysicsShape instance from the given Godot [Shape3D] "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ໃໝ່ຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shape3D] ຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Serializes this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a [Dictionary] in the format "
"defined by [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລຊ໌ (Serialize) ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ [Dictionary] "
"ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ [code]OMI_physics_shape[/code]."

msgid ""
"Converts this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a Godot [CollisionShape3D] node."
msgstr "ແປງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ [CollisionShape3D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid "Converts this GLTFPhysicsShape instance into a Godot [Shape3D] resource."
msgstr "ແປງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ GLTFPhysicsShape ນີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຊັບພະຍາກອນ [Shape3D] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"The height of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"capsule\"[/code] or [code]\"cylinder\"[/code]. This value should not "
"be negative, and for [code]\"capsule\"[/code] it should be at least twice the "
"radius."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຮູບຊົງເປັນ [code]\"capsule\"[/code] "
"ຫຼື [code]\"cylinder\"[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຄວນເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ແລະ ສຳລັບ [code]"
"\"capsule\"[/code] ມັນຄວນຈະມີຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງເທົ່າຂອງລັດສະໝີ."

msgid ""
"The [ImporterMesh] resource of the shape. This is only used when the shape "
"type is [code]\"hull\"[/code] (convex hull) or [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] "
"(concave trimesh)."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນ [ImporterMesh] ຂອງຮູບຊົງ. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຮູບຊົງເປັນ [code]\"hull\"[/"
"code] (convex hull) ຫຼື [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] (concave trimesh) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], indicates that this shape is a trigger. For Godot, this "
"means that the shape should be a child of an [Area3D] node.\n"
"This is the only variable not used in the [method to_node] method, it's "
"intended to be used alongside when deciding where to add the generated node "
"as a child."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ສະແດງວ່າຮູບຊົງນີ້ເປັນຕົວຈຸດຊະນວນ (trigger). ສຳລັບ Godot, "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບຊົງຄວນເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງ [Area3D].\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນດຽວທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເມທອດ [method to_node], "
"ມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນຕອນທີ່ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະເພີ່ມໂນດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນໂນດລູກຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດ."

msgid ""
"The index of the shape's mesh in the glTF file. This is only used when the "
"shape type is [code]\"hull\"[/code] (convex hull) or [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] "
"(concave trimesh)."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີ (index) ຂອງເມຊ (mesh) ຂອງຮູບຊົງໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຮູບຊົງເປັນ [code]"
"\"hull\"[/code] (convex hull) ຫຼື [code]\"trimesh\"[/code] (concave trimesh) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The radius of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], or [code]\"sphere\"[/"
"code]. This value should not be negative."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຮູບຊົງເປັນ [code]\"capsule\"[/code], "
"[code]\"cylinder\"[/code], ຫຼື [code]\"sphere\"[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຄວນເປັນຄ່າລົບ."

msgid ""
"The type of shape this shape represents. Valid values are [code]\"box\"[/"
"code], [code]\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], [code]\"sphere\"[/"
"code], [code]\"hull\"[/code], and [code]\"trimesh\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ຮູບຊົງນີ້ສະແດງແທນ. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ແມ່ນ [code]\"box\"[/code], [code]"
"\"capsule\"[/code], [code]\"cylinder\"[/code], [code]\"sphere\"[/code], [code]"
"\"hull\"[/code], ແລະ [code]\"trimesh\"[/code]."

msgid ""
"The size of the shape, in meters. This is only used when the shape type is "
"[code]\"box\"[/code], and it represents the [code]\"diameter\"[/code] of the "
"box. This value should not be negative."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຊົງ, ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອປະເພດຮູບຊົງເປັນ [code]\"box\"[/code] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ມັນສະແດງເຖິງ [code]\"diameter\"[/code] (ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງ) ຂອງກ່ອງ. "
"ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຄວນເປັນຄ່າລົບ."

msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] that maps skeleton bone indices to the indices of glTF "
"nodes. This property is unused during import, and only set during export. In "
"a glTF file, a bone is a node, so Godot converts skeleton bones to glTF nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [Dictionary] ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ດັດຊະນີກະດູກຂອງໂຄງກະດູກກັບດັດຊະນີຂອງໂນດ glTF. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"glTF, ກະດູກແມ່ນໂນດໜຶ່ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈຶ່ງແປງກະດູກຂອງໂຄງກະດູກໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ glTF."

msgid ""
"Sets a [Dictionary] that maps skeleton bone indices to the indices of glTF "
"nodes. This property is unused during import, and only set during export. In "
"a glTF file, a bone is a node, so Godot converts skeleton bones to glTF nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Dictionary] ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ດັດຊະນີກະດູກຂອງໂຄງກະດູກກັບດັດຊະນີຂອງໂນດ glTF. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"glTF, ກະດູກແມ່ນໂນດໜຶ່ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Godot ຈຶ່ງແປງກະດູກຂອງໂຄງກະດູກໃຫ້ເປັນໂນດ glTF."

msgid "Archived glTF extension for specular/glossy materials."
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມ glTF ທີ່ຖືກເກັບຖາວອນແລ້ວ ສຳລັບວັດສະດຸແບບ specular/glossy."

msgid ""
"KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness is an archived glTF extension. This means "
"that it is deprecated and not recommended for new files. However, it is still "
"supported for loading old files."
msgstr ""
"KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness ແມ່ນສ່ວນເສີມ glTF ທີ່ຖືກເກັບຖາວອນແລ້ວ. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ (deprecated) ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ມັນຍັງຮອງຮັບການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ເກົ່າຢູ່."

msgid "KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness glTF extension spec"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສ່ວນເສີມ KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness ຂອງ glTF"

msgid "The reflected diffuse factor of the material."
msgstr "ຄ່າການສະທ້ອນແບບກະຈາຍ (diffuse factor) ຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

msgid "The diffuse texture."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ແບບກະຈາຍ."

msgid "The glossiness or smoothness of the material."
msgstr "ຄວາມເງົາ ຫຼື ຄວາມລຽບນຽນຂອງວັດສະດຸ."

msgid "The specular-glossiness texture."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ (texture) ແບບ specular-glossiness."

msgid "The specular RGB color of the material. The alpha channel is unused."
msgstr "ສີ RGB ແບບ specular ຂອງວັດສະດຸ. ຊ່ອງອັນຟາ (alpha channel) ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້."

msgid "Represents all data of a glTF file."
msgstr "ສະແດງແທນຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF."

msgid ""
"Contains all nodes and resources of a glTF file. This is used by "
"[GLTFDocument] as data storage, which allows [GLTFDocument] and all "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] classes to remain stateless.\n"
"GLTFState can be populated by [GLTFDocument] reading a file or by converting "
"a Godot scene. Then the data can either be used to create a Godot scene or "
"save to a glTF file. The code that converts to/from a Godot scene can be "
"intercepted at arbitrary points by [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes. This "
"allows for custom data to be stored in the glTF file or for custom data to be "
"converted to/from Godot nodes."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ [GLTFDocument] "
"ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ [GLTFDocument] ແລະ ຄລາດ [GLTFDocumentExtension] "
"ທັງໝົດບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເກັບສະຖານະ (stateless).\n"
"GLTFState ສາມາດຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍ [GLTFDocument] ທີ່ອ່ານຈາກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂດຍການແປງສາກ (scene) "
"ຂອງ Godot. ຈາກນັ້ນຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສາກ Godot ຫຼື ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ໂຄ້ດທີ່ແປງໄປ-"
"ມາລະຫວ່າງສາກ Godot ສາມາດຖືກແຊກແຊງໃນຈຸດຕ່າງໆໂດຍຄລາດ [GLTFDocumentExtension]. "
"ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF ຫຼື ແປງຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງໄປ-ມາລະຫວ່າງໂນດ Godot ໄດ້."

msgid "glTF asset header schema"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງສ່ວນຫົວ (header schema) ຂອງຊັບສິນ glTF"

msgid ""
"Appends an extension to the list of extensions used by this glTF file during "
"serialization. If [param required] is [code]true[/code], the extension will "
"also be added to the list of required extensions. Do not run this in [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_post], as that stage is too late to add "
"extensions. The final list is sorted alphabetically."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສ່ວນເສີມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍໄຟລ໌ glTF ນີ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດຊີຣຽວໄລຊ໌ "
"(serialization). ຖ້າ [param required] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], "
"ສ່ວນເສີມຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນນຳ. ຢ່າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໃນ [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_post], ເພາະວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນນັ້ນມັນຊ້າເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມສ່ວນເສີມ. "
"ລາຍການສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກຈັດຮຽງຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Appends the given byte array [param data] to the buffers and creates a "
"[GLTFBufferView] for it. The index of the destination [GLTFBufferView] is "
"returned. If [param deduplication] is [code]true[/code], the buffers are "
"first searched for duplicate data, otherwise new bytes are always appended."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມອາເຣໄບຕ໌ (byte array) [param data] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃນບັບເຟີ (buffers) ແລະ ສ້າງ "
"[GLTFBufferView] ສຳລັບມັນ. ດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFBufferView] ປາຍທາງຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນ. ຖ້າ [param "
"deduplication] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ລະບົບຈະຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນບັບເຟີກ່ອນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ໄບຕ໌ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Appends the given [GLTFNode] to the state, and returns its new index. This "
"can be used to export one Godot node as multiple glTF nodes, or inject new "
"glTF nodes at import time. On import, this must be called before [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._generate_scene_node] finishes for the parent node. On "
"export, this must be called before [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._export_node] runs for the parent node.\n"
"The [param godot_scene_node] parameter is the Godot scene node that "
"corresponds to this glTF node. This is highly recommended to be set to a "
"valid node, but may be [code]null[/code] if there is no corresponding Godot "
"scene node. One Godot scene node may be used for multiple glTF nodes, so if "
"exporting multiple glTF nodes for one Godot scene node, use the same Godot "
"scene node for each.\n"
"The [param parent_node_index] parameter is the index of the parent [GLTFNode] "
"in the state. If [code]-1[/code], the node will be a root node, otherwise the "
"new node will be added to the parent's list of children. The index will also "
"be written to the [member GLTFNode.parent] property of the new node."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ [GLTFNode] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃນສະຖານະ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີໃໝ່ຂອງມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກໂນດ Godot ໜຶ່ງໂນດໃຫ້ເປັນຫຼາຍໂນດ glTF, ຫຼື ແຊກໂນດ glTF "
"ໃໝ່ໃນເວລາການນຳເຂົ້າ. ໃນການນຳເຂົ້າ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._generate_scene_node] ຈະສຳເລັດສຳລັບໂນດແມ່. ໃນການສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ [method GLTFDocumentExtension._export_node] "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບໂນດແມ່.\n"
"ພາລາມິເຕີ [param godot_scene_node] ແມ່ນໂນດສາກຂອງ Godot ທີ່ກົງກັບໂນດ glTF ນີ້. "
"ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນໂນດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະເປັນ [code]null[/code] ໄດ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂນດສາກ Godot "
"ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໂນດສາກ Godot ໜຶ່ງໂນດອາດຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຫຼາຍໂນດ glTF ໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຖ້າສົ່ງອອກຫຼາຍໂນດ glTF "
"ສຳລັບໂນດສາກ Godot ດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂນດສາກ Godot ດຽວກັນນັ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອັນ.\n"
"ພາລາມິເຕີ [param parent_node_index] ແມ່ນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFNode] ແມ່ໃນສະຖານະ. ຖ້າເປັນ "
"[code]-1[/code], ໂນດຈະເປັນໂນດຮາກ (root node), ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ໂນດໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການລູກຂອງໂນດແມ່. ດັດຊະນີຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"GLTFNode.parent] ຂອງໂນດໃໝ່ນຳ."

msgid ""
"Gets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFState] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-file state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have to "
"match the extension name in the glTF file), and the return value can be "
"anything you set. If nothing was set, the return value is [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [GLTFState] ນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະແຍກຕາມໄຟລ໌ໃນຄລາດ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension], ເຊິ່ງສຳຄັນເພາະວ່າພວກມັນບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ (stateless). ອາກິວເມນ "
"(argument) ຄວນເປັນຊື່ຂອງ [GLTFDocumentExtension] (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"glTF), ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນສາມາດເປັນສິ່ງໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຫຍັງໄວ້, ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນຈະເປັນ "
"[code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns the [AnimationPlayer] node with the given index. These nodes are only "
"used during the export process when converting Godot [AnimationPlayer] nodes "
"to glTF animations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ຕາມດັດຊະນີທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້. "
"ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການສົ່ງອອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເມື່ອແປງໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ຂອງ Godot "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນແອນີເມຊັນ glTF."

msgid ""
"Returns the number of [AnimationPlayer] nodes in this [GLTFState]. These "
"nodes are only used during the export process when converting Godot "
"[AnimationPlayer] nodes to glTF animations."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ໃນ [GLTFState] ນີ້. "
"ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການສົ່ງອອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເມື່ອແປງໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ຂອງ Godot "
"ໃຫ້ເປັນແອນີເມຊັນ glTF."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFAnimation]s in the glTF file. When importing, "
"these will be generated as animations in an [AnimationPlayer] node. When "
"exporting, these will be generated from Godot [AnimationPlayer] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFAnimation] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ, "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງເປັນແອນີເມຊັນໃນໂນດ [AnimationPlayer]. ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງມາຈາກໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ຂອງ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFCamera]s in the glTF file. These are the cameras "
"that the [member GLTFNode.camera] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFCamera] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນກ້ອງທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member "
"GLTFNode.camera] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid "Use [member handle_binary_image_mode] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [member handle_binary_image_mode] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Deprecated untyped alias for [member handle_binary_image_mode]. When "
"importing a glTF file with unimported raw binary images embedded inside of "
"binary blob buffers, in data URIs, or separate files not imported by Godot, "
"this controls how the images are handled."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ປອມ (alias) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີປະເພດທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ແລ້ວສຳລັບ [member handle_binary_image_mode]. "
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີດິບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າເຊິ່ງຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນບັບເຟີໄບນາຣີ, ໃນ data URI, ຫຼື "
"ໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ Godot ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມວິທີຈັດການກັບຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Gets the images of the glTF file as an array of [Texture2D]s. These are the "
"images that the [member GLTFTexture.src_image] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF ເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Texture2D]. ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບພາບທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member "
"GLTFTexture.src_image] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFLight]s in the glTF file. These are the lights "
"that the [member GLTFNode.light] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFLight] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.light] "
"ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFMesh]es in the glTF file. These are the meshes "
"that the [member GLTFNode.mesh] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFMesh] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນເມຊທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.mesh] "
"ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Returns the index of the [GLTFNode] corresponding to this Godot scene node. "
"This is the inverse of [method get_scene_node]. Useful during the export "
"process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not every Godot scene node will have a corresponding [GLTFNode], "
"and not every [GLTFNode] will have a scene node generated. If there is no "
"[GLTFNode] index for this scene node, [code]-1[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນດັດຊະນີຂອງ [GLTFNode] ທີ່ກົງກັບໂນດສາກ Godot ນີ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ [method "
"get_scene_node]. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການສົ່ງອອກ. [b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໂນດສາກ "
"Godot ຈະມີ [GLTFNode] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກ [GLTFNode] ຈະມີໂນດສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີດັດຊະນີ [GLTFNode] ສຳລັບໂນດສາກນີ້, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]-1[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFNode]s in the glTF file. These are the nodes "
"that [member GLTFNode.children] and [member root_nodes] refer to. This "
"includes nodes that may not be generated in the Godot scene, or nodes that "
"may generate multiple Godot scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFNode] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດທີ່ [member GLTFNode.children] "
"ແລະ [member root_nodes] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ. ນີ້ລວມມີໂນດທີ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງໃນສາກ Godot, ຫຼື "
"ໂນດທີ່ອາດຈະສ້າງຫຼາຍໂນດສາກ Godot."

msgid ""
"Returns the Godot scene node that corresponds to the same index as the "
"[GLTFNode] it was generated from. This is the inverse of [method "
"get_node_index]. Useful during the import process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not every [GLTFNode] will have a scene node generated, and not "
"every generated scene node will have a corresponding [GLTFNode]. If there is "
"no scene node for this [GLTFNode] index, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນໂນດສາກ Godot ທີ່ກົງກັບດັດຊະນີດຽວກັນກັບ [GLTFNode] ທີ່ມັນຖືກສ້າງມາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນກັບຂອງ "
"[method get_node_index]. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ. [b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກ "
"[GLTFNode] ຈະມີໂນດສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໂນດສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະມີ [GLTFNode] ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂນດສາກສຳລັບດັດຊະນີ [GLTFNode] ນີ້, ຈະສົ່ງຄືນ [code]null[/code]."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFSkeleton]s in the glTF file. These are the "
"skeletons that the [member GLTFNode.skeleton] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFSkeleton] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member "
"GLTFNode.skeleton] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of all [GLTFSkin]s in the glTF file. These are the skins "
"that the [member GLTFNode.skin] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງ [GLTFSkin] ທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF. ນີ້ແມ່ນສະກິນ (skins) ທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member "
"GLTFNode.skin] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Retrieves the array of texture samplers that are used by the textures "
"contained in the glTF."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນອາເຣຂອງຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີ (texture samplers) ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ glTF."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of unique animation names. This is only used during the "
"import process."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຊື່ແອນີເມຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Returns an array of unique node names. This is used in both the import "
"process and export process."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນອາເຣຂອງຊື່ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ທັງໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"Sets additional arbitrary data in this [GLTFState] instance. This can be used "
"to keep per-file state data in [GLTFDocumentExtension] classes, which is "
"important because they are stateless.\n"
"The first argument should be the [GLTFDocumentExtension] name (does not have "
"to match the extension name in the glTF file), and the second argument can be "
"anything you want."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ [GLTFState] ນີ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະແຍກຕາມໄຟລ໌ໃນຄລາດ [GLTFDocumentExtension], "
"ເຊິ່ງສຳຄັນເພາະວ່າພວກມັນບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ (stateless). ອາກິວເມນທຳອິດຄວນເປັນຊື່ຂອງ "
"[GLTFDocumentExtension] (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF), ແລະ "
"ອາກິວເມນທີສອງສາມາດເປັນສິ່ງໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFAnimation]s in the state. When importing, these will be "
"generated as animations in an [AnimationPlayer] node. When exporting, these "
"will be generated from Godot [AnimationPlayer] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFAnimation] ໃນສະຖານະ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ, ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງເປັນແອນີເມຊັນໃນໂນດ "
"[AnimationPlayer]. ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງມາຈາກໂນດ [AnimationPlayer] ຂອງ "
"Godot."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFCamera]s in the state. These are the cameras that the [member "
"GLTFNode.camera] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFCamera] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນກ້ອງທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.camera] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the images in the state stored as an array of [Texture2D]s. This can be "
"used during export. These are the images that the [member "
"GLTFTexture.src_image] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບໃນສະຖານະທີ່ເກັບເປັນອາເຣຂອງ [Texture2D]. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບພາບທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFTexture.src_image] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFLight]s in the state. These are the lights that the [member "
"GLTFNode.light] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFLight] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.light] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFMesh]es in the state. These are the meshes that the [member "
"GLTFNode.mesh] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFMesh] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນເມຊທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.mesh] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFNode]s in the state. These are the nodes that [member "
"GLTFNode.children] and [member root_nodes] refer to. Some of the nodes set "
"here may not be generated in the Godot scene, or may generate multiple Godot "
"scene nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFNode] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂນດທີ່ [member GLTFNode.children] ແລະ [member "
"root_nodes] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ. ບາງໂນດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງໃນສາກ Godot, ຫຼື "
"ອາດຈະສ້າງຫຼາຍໂນດສາກ Godot."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFSkeleton]s in the state. These are the skeletons that the "
"[member GLTFNode.skeleton] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFSkeleton] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໂຄງກະດູກທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.skeleton] "
"ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the [GLTFSkin]s in the state. These are the skins that the [member "
"GLTFNode.skin] index refers to."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [GLTFSkin] ໃນສະຖານະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສະກິນທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [member GLTFNode.skin] ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ."

msgid ""
"Sets the array of texture samplers that are used by the textures contained in "
"the glTF."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອາເຣຂອງຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີ (texture samplers) ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເທັກເຈີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ glTF."

msgid ""
"Sets the unique animation names in the state. This is only used during the "
"import process."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ແອນີເມຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນສະຖານະ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Sets the unique node names in the state. This is used in both the import "
"process and export process."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ໂນດທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນສະຖານະ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ທັງໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid "The baking fps of the animation for either import or export."
msgstr "ຄ່າ FPS ໃນການເບກ (baking) ຂອງແອນີເມຊັນ ສຳລັບທັງການນຳເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ການສົ່ງອອກ."

msgid ""
"The folder path associated with this glTF data. This is used to find other "
"files the glTF file references, like images or binary buffers. This will be "
"set during import when appending from a file, and will be set during export "
"when writing to a file."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໂຟນເດີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຂໍ້ມູນ glTF ນີ້. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ໄຟລ໌ glTF ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ, ເຊັ່ນ "
"ຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ບັບເຟີໄບນາຣີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າເມື່ອເພີ່ມຈາກໄຟລ໌, ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຂຽນລົງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"The copyright string in the asset header of the glTF file. This is set during "
"import if present and export if non-empty. See the glTF asset header "
"documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມລິຂະສິດ (copyright string) ໃນສ່ວນຫົວຊັບສິນຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າຖ້າມີ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກຖ້າມັນບໍ່ຫວ່າງ. ເບິ່ງເອກະສານສ່ວນຫົວຊັບສິນ glTF "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"The file name associated with this glTF data. If it ends with [code].gltf[/"
"code], this is text-based glTF, otherwise this is binary GLB. This will be "
"set during import when appending from a file, and will be set during export "
"when writing to a file. If writing to a buffer, this will be an empty string."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຂໍ້ມູນ glTF ນີ້. ຖ້າມັນລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [code].gltf[/code], ນີ້ແມ່ນ glTF ແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນແມ່ນໄບນາຣີ GLB. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າເມື່ອເພີ່ມຈາກໄຟລ໌, ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອຂຽນລົງໄຟລ໌. ຖ້າຂຽນລົງບັບເຟີ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The binary buffer attached to a .glb file."
msgstr "ບັບເຟີໄບນາຣີທີ່ຕິດມາກັບໄຟລ໌ .glb."

msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with unimported raw binary images embedded inside "
"of binary blob buffers, in data URIs, or separate files not imported by "
"Godot, this controls how the images are handled. Images can be discarded, "
"saved as separate files, or embedded in the scene lossily or losslessly. See "
"[enum HandleBinaryImageMode] for options.\n"
"This property does nothing for image files in the [code]res://[/code] folder "
"imported by Godot, as those are handled by Godot's image importer directly, "
"and then the Godot scene generated from the glTF file will use the images as "
"Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີດິບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າເຊິ່ງຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນບັບເຟີໄບນາຣີ, ໃນ data URI, ຫຼື "
"ໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ Godot ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມວິທີຈັດການກັບຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຮູບພາບສາມາດຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ, ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ຫຼື ຝັງໄວ້ໃນສາກແບບມີການສູນເສຍ ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບ. ເບິ່ງ [enum HandleBinaryImageMode] ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ.\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]res://[/code] ທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍ Godot ແລ້ວ, "
"ເພາະວ່າຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຂອງ Godot ໂດຍກົງ, ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນສາກ Godot "
"ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກໄຟລ໌ glTF ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບພາບຕາມທີ່ Godot ນຳເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces all GLTFNodes in the document to be bones of a "
"single [Skeleton3D] Godot node."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ GLTFNode ທັງໝົດໃນເອກະສານເປັນກະດູກຂອງໂນດ "
"[Skeleton3D] ຂອງ Godot ພຽງອັນດຽວ."

msgid "The original raw JSON document corresponding to this GLTFState."
msgstr "ເອກະສານ JSON ດິບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ກົງກັບ GLTFState ນີ້."

msgid ""
"The root nodes of the glTF file. Typically, a glTF file will only have one "
"scene, and therefore one root node. However, a glTF file may have multiple "
"scenes and therefore multiple root nodes, which will be generated as siblings "
"of each other and as children of the root node of the generated Godot scene."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດຮາກ (root nodes) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ glTF. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ໄຟລ໌ glTF ຈະມີພຽງສາກດຽວ, ແລະ "
"ມີໂນດຮາກດຽວ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ໄຟລ໌ glTF ອາດຈະມີຫຼາຍສາກ ແລະ ມີຫຼາຍໂນດຮາກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນໂນດລະດັບດຽວກັນ ແລະ ເປັນລູກຂອງໂນດຮາກຂອງສາກ Godot ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The name of the scene. When importing, if not specified, this will be the "
"file name. When exporting, if specified, the scene name will be saved to the "
"glTF file."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງສາກ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ, ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກ, ຖ້າລະບຸໄວ້, "
"ຊື່ສາກຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF."

msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, discards all images "
"and uses untextured materials in their place. Images stored as separate files "
"in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; those will be "
"used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີຝັງຢູ່, ຈະຖິ້ມຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ ແລະ ໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ມີເທັກເຈີແທນ. "
"ຮູບພາບທີ່ເກັບເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]res://[/code] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກສິ່ງນີ້; "
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ Godot ນຳເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, extracts them and "
"saves them to their own files. This allows the image to be imported by "
"Godot's image importer, which can then have their import options customized "
"by the user, including optionally compressing the image to VRAM texture "
"formats.\n"
"This will save the images's bytes exactly as-is, without recompression. For "
"image formats supplied by glTF extensions, the file will have a filename "
"ending with the file extension supplied by [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._get_image_file_extension] of the extension class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option is editor-only. At runtime, this acts the same as "
"[constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED]."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີຝັງຢູ່, ຈະດຶງພວກມັນອອກມາ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂອງໃຜມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮູບພາບຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍຕົວນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຂອງ Godot, "
"ເຊິ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຕົວເລືອກການນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ເອງ, ລວມທັງການບີບອັດຮູບພາບເປັນຮູບແບບເທັກເຈີ VRAM.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກໄບຕ໌ຂອງຮູບພາບຕາມເດີມທຸກຢ່າງ, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດໃໝ່. "
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍສ່ວນເສີມ glTF, ໄຟລ໌ຈະມີນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ [method "
"GLTFDocumentExtension._get_image_file_extension] ຂອງຄລາດສ່ວນເສີມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນເອດິເຕີ (editor) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນເວລາເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"(runtime), ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນກັບ [constant "
"HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED]."

msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, embeds textures VRAM "
"compressed with Basis Universal into the generated scene. Images stored as "
"separate files in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; "
"those will be used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີຝັງຢູ່, ຈະຝັງເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດ VRAM ດ້ວຍ Basis Universal "
"ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສາກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຮູບພາບທີ່ເກັບເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]res://[/code] "
"ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກສິ່ງນີ້; ພວກມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ Godot ນຳເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid ""
"When importing a glTF file with embedded binary images, embeds textures "
"compressed losslessly into the generated scene. Images stored as separate "
"files in the [code]res://[/code] folder are not affected by this; those will "
"be used as Godot imported them."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ glTF ທີ່ມີຮູບພາບໄບນາຣີຝັງຢູ່, "
"ຈະຝັງເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບເຂົ້າໄປໃນສາກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຮູບພາບທີ່ເກັບເປັນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນໂຟນເດີ [code]res://[/code] ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກສິ່ງນີ້; "
"ພວກມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ Godot ນຳເຂົ້າມາ."

msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_DISCARD_TEXTURES] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_DISCARD_TEXTURES] ແທນ."

msgid "Discards all embedded textures and uses untextured materials."
msgstr "ຖິ້ມເທັກເຈີທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ໃຊ້ວັດສະດຸທີ່ບໍ່ມີເທັກເຈີແທນ."

msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EXTRACT_TEXTURES] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EXTRACT_TEXTURES] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Extracts embedded textures to be reimported and compressed. Editor only. Acts "
"as uncompressed at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງເທັກເຈີທີ່ຝັງຢູື່ອອກມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ ແລະ ບີບອັດ. ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນເອດິເຕີ. ໃນເວລາເປີດໃຊ້ງານ "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ບີບອັດ."

msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_BASISU] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_BASISU] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Embeds textures VRAM compressed with Basis Universal into the generated scene."
msgstr "ຝັງເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດ VRAM ດ້ວຍ Basis Universal ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສາກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Use [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED] instead."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant HANDLE_BINARY_IMAGE_MODE_EMBED_AS_UNCOMPRESSED] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Embeds textures compressed losslessly into the generated scene, matching old "
"behavior."
msgstr "ຝັງເທັກເຈີທີ່ບີບອັດແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍຄຸນນະພາບເຂົ້າໄປໃນສາກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳເກົ່າ."

msgid "GLTFTexture represents a texture in a glTF file."
msgstr "GLTFTexture ສະແດງແທນເທັກເຈີ (texture) ໃນໄຟລ໌ glTF."

msgid ""
"ID of the texture sampler to use when sampling the image. If -1, then the "
"default texture sampler is used (linear filtering, and repeat wrapping in "
"both axes)."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີ (texture sampler) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນເວລາສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຮູບພາບ. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ການກອງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່, ແລະ ການຫໍ່ແບບຊ້ຳຄືນໃນທັງສອງແກນ)."

msgid ""
"The index of the image associated with this texture, see [method "
"GLTFState.get_images]. If -1, then this texture does not have an image "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"ດັດຊະນີຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເທັກເຈີນີ້, ເບິ່ງ [method GLTFState.get_images]. ຖ້າເປັນ -1, "
"ສະແດງວ່າເທັກເຈີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຮູບພາບໃຫ້."

msgid "Represents a glTF texture sampler"
msgstr "ສະແດງແທນຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີ (texture sampler) ຂອງ glTF"

msgid ""
"Represents a texture sampler as defined by the base glTF spec. Texture "
"samplers in glTF specify how to sample data from the texture's base image, "
"when rendering the texture on an object."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງແທນຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຂໍ້ກຳນົດພື້ນຖານຂອງ glTF. ຕົວຢ່າງເທັກເຈີໃນ glTF "
"ລະບຸວິທີການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຮູບພາບພື້ນຖານຂອງເທັກເຈີ, ໃນເວລາສະແດງຜົນເທັກເຈີເທິງວັດຖຸ."

msgid ""
"Texture's magnification filter, used when texture appears larger on screen "
"than the source image."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງການຂະຫຍາຍ (magnification filter) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ, "
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເທັກເຈີປາກົດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"Texture's minification filter, used when the texture appears smaller on "
"screen than the source image."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວກອງການຫຍໍ້ (minification filter) ຂອງເທັກເຈີ, "
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອເທັກເຈີປາກົດນ້ອຍກວ່າຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Wrapping mode to use for S-axis (horizontal) texture coordinates."
msgstr "ໂໝດການຫໍ່ (wrapping mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບພິກັດເທັກເຈີແກນ S (ແນວນອນ)."

msgid "Wrapping mode to use for T-axis (vertical) texture coordinates."
msgstr "ໂໝດການຫໍ່ (wrapping mode) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບພິກັດເທັກເຈີແກນ T (ແນວຕັ້ງ)."

msgid "Provides access to an embedded Godot instance."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ Godot ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"GodotInstance represents a running Godot instance that is controlled from an "
"outside codebase, without a perpetual main loop. It is created by the C API "
"[code]libgodot_create_godot_instance[/code]. Only one may be created per "
"process."
msgstr ""
"GodotInstance ສະແດງແທນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ Godot ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງຖືກຄວບຄຸມຈາກຊຸດໂຄ້ດພາຍນອກ, "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີລູບບໍລິຫານຫຼັກ (main loop) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຕະຫຼອດ. ມັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ C API "
"[code]libgodot_create_godot_instance[/code]. ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂປຣເຊສ "
"(process)."

msgid "Notifies the instance that it is now in focus."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວ່າຕອນນີ້ມັນຢູ່ໃນຈຸດສົນໃຈ (focus)."

msgid "Notifies the instance that it is now not in focus."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວ່າຕອນນີ້ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນຈຸດສົນໃຈ (focus)."

msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this instance has been fully started."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Runs a single iteration of the main loop. Returns [code]true[/code] if the "
"engine is attempting to quit."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານລູບບໍລິຫານຫຼັກ (main loop) ພຽງຮອບດຽວ. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຖ້າເອັນຈິນກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມປິດການເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid "Notifies the instance that it is going to be paused."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວ່າມັນກຳລັງຈະຖືກພັກການເຮັດວຽກ (paused)."

msgid "Notifies the instance that it is being resumed."
msgstr "ແຈ້ງເຕືອນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ວ່າມັນກຳລັງຖືກກັບມາເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ (resumed)."

msgid ""
"Finishes this instance's startup sequence. Returns [code]true[/code] on "
"success."
msgstr "ສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າສຳເລັດ."

msgid "A 2D particle emitter."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (particle emitter) ແບບ 2D."

msgid ""
"2D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and effects. "
"[GPUParticles2D] features an emitter that generates some number of particles "
"at a given rate.\n"
"Use the [member process_material] property to add a [ParticleProcessMaterial] "
"to configure particle appearance and behavior. Alternatively, you can add a "
"[ShaderMaterial] which will be applied to all particles.\n"
"2D particles can optionally collide with [LightOccluder2D], but they don't "
"collide with [PhysicsBody2D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດອະນຸພາກ 2D ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງລະບົບອະນຸພາກ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ. [GPUParticles2D] "
"ມີຕົວປ່ອຍທີ່ສ້າງອະນຸພາກຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງຕາມອັດຕາທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ [member process_material] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ [ParticleProcessMaterial] "
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ [ShaderMaterial] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດ.\n"
"ອະນຸພາກ 2D ສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ຕຳກັບ [LightOccluder2D] ໄດ້, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຕຳກັບໂນດ "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."

msgid "2D Particles Demo"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງອະນຸພາກ 2D"

msgid ""
"2D Dodge The Creeps Demo (uses GPUParticles2D for the trail behind the player)"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເກມ 2D Dodge The Creeps (ໃຊ້ GPUParticles2D ສຳລັບຫາງທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງຜູ້ຫຼິ້ນ)"

msgid ""
"Returns a rectangle containing the positions of all existing particles.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using threaded rendering this method synchronizes the "
"rendering thread. Calling it often may have a negative impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່. [b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນແບບຫຼາຍເທຣດ (threaded rendering) "
"ເມທອດນີ້ຈະປະສານງານກັບເທຣດການສະແດງຜົນ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆອາດສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid "Sets this node's properties to match a given [CPUParticles2D] node."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດນີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂນດ [CPUParticles2D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Emits a single particle. Whether [param xform], [param velocity], [param "
"color] and [param custom] are applied depends on the value of [param flags]. "
"See [enum EmitFlags].\n"
"The default ParticleProcessMaterial will overwrite [param color] and use the "
"contents of [param custom] as [code](rotation, age, animation, lifetime)[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method emit_particle] is only supported on the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກດຽວ. ວ່າຈະນຳໃຊ້ [param xform], [param velocity], [param color] ແລະ "
"[param custom] ຫຼື ບໍ່ນັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າຂອງ [param flags]. ເບິ່ງ [enum EmitFlags].\n"
"ParticleProcessMaterial ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຂຽນທັບ [param color] ແລະ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ [param "
"custom] ເປັນ [code](rotation, age, animation, lifetime)[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [method emit_particle] ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະວິທີການສະແດງຜົນແບບ Forward+ ແລະ "
"Mobile ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Compatibility."

msgid ""
"Restarts the particle emission cycle, clearing existing particles. To avoid "
"particles vanishing from the viewport, wait for the [signal finished] signal "
"before calling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [signal finished] signal is only emitted by [member "
"one_shot] emitters.\n"
"If [param keep_seed] is [code]true[/code], the current random seed will be "
"preserved. Useful for seeking and playback."
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກໃໝ່, ໂດຍລຶບອະນຸພາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວອອກ. "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຫາຍໄປຂອງອະນຸພາກຈາກວິວພອດ (viewport), ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າສັນຍານ [signal finished] "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສັນຍານ [signal finished] ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [member one_shot] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [param keep_seed] ເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຄ່າຊີດ (seed) ສຸ່ມປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້. "
"ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ການຫຼິ້ນຄືນ."

msgid ""
"The number of particles to emit in one emission cycle. The effective emission "
"rate is [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] particles per second. "
"Higher values will increase GPU requirements, even if not all particles are "
"visible at a given time or if [member amount_ratio] is decreased.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value will cause the particle system to restart. "
"To avoid this, change [member amount_ratio] instead."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນອະນຸພາກທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃນໜຶ່ງຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍ. ອັດຕາການປ່ອຍທີ່ມີຜົນຄື [code](amount * "
"amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] ອະນຸພາກຕໍ່ວິນາທີ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ GPU, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ຫຼື ຖ້າ [member amount_ratio] "
"ຖືກຫຼຸດລົງກໍຕາມ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ [member "
"amount_ratio] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The ratio of particles that should actually be emitted. If set to a value "
"lower than [code]1.0[/code], this will set the amount of emitted particles "
"throughout the lifetime to [code]amount * amount_ratio[/code]. Unlike "
"changing [member amount], changing [member amount_ratio] while emitting does "
"not affect already-emitted particles and doesn't cause the particle system to "
"restart. [member amount_ratio] can be used to create effects that make the "
"number of emitted particles vary over time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Reducing the [member amount_ratio] has no performance benefit, "
"since resources need to be allocated and processed for the total [member "
"amount] of particles regardless of the [member amount_ratio]. If you don't "
"intend to change the number of particles emitted while the particles are "
"emitting, make sure [member amount_ratio] is set to [code]1[/code] and change "
"[member amount] to your liking instead."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງອະນຸພາກທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາແທ້ໆ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code], "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຕັ້ງຈຳນວນອະນຸພາກທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາຕະຫຼອດຊ່ວງຊີວິດໃຫ້ເປັນ [code]amount * amount_ratio[/"
"code]. ຕ່າງຈາກການປ່ຽນ [member amount], ການປ່ຽນ [member amount_ratio] "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປ່ອຍຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບອະນຸພາກທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່. [member "
"amount_ratio] ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຳນວນອະນຸພາກທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຫຼຸດ [member amount_ratio] ບໍ່ໄດ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, "
"ເພາະວ່າຊັບພະຍາກອນຍັງຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດສັນ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນສຳລັບຈຳນວນ [member amount] ທັງໝົດຂອງອະນຸພາກ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ [member amount_ratio]. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນຈຳນວນອະນຸພາກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປ່ອຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [member amount_ratio] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [code]1[/code] ແລະ ປ່ຽນ [member amount] "
"ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແທນ."

msgid ""
"Multiplier for particle's collision radius. [code]1.0[/code] corresponds to "
"the size of the sprite. If particles appear to sink into the ground when "
"colliding, increase this value. If particles appear to float when colliding, "
"decrease this value. Only effective if [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] is [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles always have a spherical collision shape."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນສຳລັບລັດສະໝີການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ. [code]1.0[/code] ໝາຍເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງສະໄປຣຕ໌ (sprite). "
"ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດວ່າຈົມລົງໃນພື້ນດິນເມື່ອຕຳ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້. ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດວ່າລອຍຢູ່ເມື່ອຕຳ, ໃຫ້ຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້. "
"ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອະນຸພາກຈະມີຮູບຊົງການຕຳແບບຊົງກົມສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles are being emitted. [member emitting] can be "
"used to start and stop particles from emitting. However, if [member one_shot] "
"is [code]true[/code] setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/code] will not "
"restart the emission cycle unless all active particles have finished "
"processing. Use the [signal finished] signal to be notified once all active "
"particles finish processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For [member one_shot] emitters, due to the particles being "
"computed on the GPU, there may be a short period after receiving the [signal "
"finished] signal during which setting this to [code]true[/code] will not "
"restart the emission cycle.\n"
"[b]Tip:[/b] If your [member one_shot] emitter needs to immediately restart "
"emitting particles once [signal finished] signal is received, consider "
"calling [method restart] instead of setting [member emitting]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກກຳລັງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ. [member emitting] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມ ແລະ ຢຸດການປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ [member one_shot] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member emitting] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍໃໝ່ ຈົນກວ່າອະນຸພາກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສັນຍານ [signal "
"finished] ເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [member one_shot], ເນື່ອງຈາກອະນຸພາກຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໃນ GPU, "
"ອາດຈະມີຊ່ວງເວລາສັ້ນໆຫຼັງຈາກໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ [signal finished] ເຊິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຈະຍັງບໍ່ເລີ່ມຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍໃໝ່.\n"
"[b]ເຄັດລັບ:[/b] ຖ້າຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [member one_shot] "
"ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກໃໝ່ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ [signal finished], ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method restart] ແທນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member emitting]."

msgid ""
"Causes all the particles in this node to interpolate towards the end of their "
"lifetime.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works when used with a [ParticleProcessMaterial]. It "
"needs to be manually implemented for custom process shaders."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດໃນໂນດນີ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າ (interpolate) ໄປຫາຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງຊີວິດຂອງພວກມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ [ParticleProcessMaterial]. ສຳລັບເຊເດີ "
"(shader) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຂຽນລະບົບນີ້ເພີ່ມເອງ."

msgid ""
"Enables particle interpolation, which makes the particle movement smoother "
"when their [member fixed_fps] is lower than the screen refresh rate."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການແຊກຄ່າ (interpolation) ຂອງອະນຸພາກ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຂອງອະນຸພາກລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ "
"ເມື່ອ [member fixed_fps] ຕ່ຳກວ່າອັດຕາການຣີເຟຣຊໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid ""
"The amount of time each particle will exist (in seconds). The effective "
"emission rate is [code](amount * amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] particles "
"per second."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ອະນຸພາກແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຄົງຢູ່ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ອັດຕາການປ່ອຍທີ່ມີຜົນຄື [code](amount * "
"amount_ratio) / lifetime[/code] ອະນຸພາກຕໍ່ວິນາທີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space (known "
"as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate along the "
"[GPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or rotated. If "
"[code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will not move or "
"rotate along the [GPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດຂອງໂນດແມ່ (ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ພິກັດໂລໂຄລ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄປພ້ອມກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles2D] (ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນ) "
"ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດສາກົນ (global "
"coordinates); ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ໝຸນໄປພ້ອມກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles2D] ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"Particle system starts as if it had already run for this many seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can be very expensive if set to a high number as it "
"requires running the particle shader a number of times equal to the [member "
"fixed_fps] (or 30, if [member fixed_fps] is 0) for every second. In extreme "
"cases it can even lead to a GPU crash due to the volume of work done in a "
"single frame."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄືກັບວ່າມັນໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກມາແລ້ວເປັນເວລາຈັກວິນາທີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງຫຼາຍຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງ "
"ເພາະມັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ເຊເດີອະນຸພາກເປັນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງເທົ່າກັບ [member fixed_fps] (ຫຼື 30 ຖ້າ [member "
"fixed_fps] ເປັນ 0) ສຳລັບທຸກໆວິນາທີ. ໃນກໍລະນີຮ້າຍແຮງ ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ GPU ຄ້າງໄດ້ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກປະລິມານວຽກທີ່ເຮັດໃນເຟຣມດຽວນັ້ນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"[Material] for processing particles. Can be a [ParticleProcessMaterial] or a "
"[ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"[Material] ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນອະນຸພາກ. ສາມາດເປັນ [ParticleProcessMaterial] ຫຼື "
"[ShaderMaterial]."

msgid ""
"Path to another [GPUParticles2D] node that will be used as a subemitter (see "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Subemitters can be used "
"to achieve effects such as fireworks, sparks on collision, bubbles popping "
"into water drops, and more.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member sub_emitter] is set, the target [GPUParticles2D] "
"node will no longer emit particles on its own."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດ [GPUParticles2D] ອື່ນທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). ຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ "
"ເຊັ່ນ ດອກໄມ້ໄຟ, ປະກາຍໄຟເມື່ອຕຳ, ຟອງສະບູທີ່ແຕກເປັນຢອດນ້ຳ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [member sub_emitter] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໂນດ [GPUParticles2D] "
"ທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍຈະບໍ່ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Particle texture. If [code]null[/code], particles will be squares with a size "
"of 1×1 pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To use a flipbook texture, assign a new [CanvasItemMaterial] to "
"the [GPUParticles2D]'s [member CanvasItem.material] property, then enable "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation] and set [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_h_frames], [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_v_frames], and [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] to match the flipbook texture."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]null[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີຂະໜາດ 1×1 "
"ພິກເຊວ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເທັກເຈີແບບຟລິບບຸກ (flipbook texture), ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ "
"[CanvasItemMaterial] ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ [member CanvasItem.material] ຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles2D], ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດໃຊ້ [member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation] "
"ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_h_frames], [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_v_frames], ແລະ [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] ໃຫ້ກົງກັບເທັກເຈີຟລິບບຸກ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables particle trails using a mesh skinning system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [GPUParticles3D], the number of trail sections and "
"subdivisions is set with the [member trail_sections] and [member "
"trail_section_subdivisions] properties."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຫາງອະນຸພາກ (particle trails) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບເມຊສະກິນນິງ (mesh skinning system).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກ [GPUParticles3D], ຈຳນວນສ່ວນຂອງຫາງ ແລະ "
"ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດ [member trail_sections] ແລະ [member "
"trail_section_subdivisions]."

msgid ""
"The amount of time the particle's trail should represent (in seconds). Only "
"effective if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຫາງຂອງອະນຸພາກຄວນສະແດງອອກມາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member trail_enabled] "
"ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of subdivisions to use for the particle trail rendering. Higher "
"values can result in smoother trail curves, at the cost of performance due to "
"increased mesh complexity. See also [member trail_sections]. Only effective "
"if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍ (subdivisions) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຫາງອະນຸພາກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງຫາງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງເມຊທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member trail_sections] "
"ປະກອບນຳ. ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member trail_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The number of sections to use for the particle trail rendering. Higher values "
"can result in smoother trail curves, at the cost of performance due to "
"increased mesh complexity. See also [member trail_section_subdivisions]. Only "
"effective if [member trail_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສ່ວນ (sections) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຫາງອະນຸພາກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງຫາງລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງເມຊທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [member "
"trail_section_subdivisions] ປະກອບນຳ. ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member trail_enabled] ເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The [Rect2] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active.\n"
"Grow the rect if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [Rect2] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles "
"→ Generate Visibility Rect[/b] editor tool."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ [Rect2] ທີ່ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດທີ່ຕ້ອງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເທິງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກ (rect) ນີ້ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປທັນທີເມື່ອໂນດເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ. "
"ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ [Rect2] ຜ່ານໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [b]Particles → Generate Visibility Rect[/"
"b] ໃນເອດິເຕີ."

msgid ""
"Emitted when all active particles have finished processing. To immediately "
"restart the emission cycle, call [method restart].\n"
"This signal is never emitted when [member one_shot] is disabled, as particles "
"will be emitted and processed continuously.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For [member one_shot] emitters, due to the particles being "
"computed on the GPU, there may be a short period after receiving the signal "
"during which setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/code] will not restart "
"the emission cycle. This delay is avoided by instead calling [method restart]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອອະນຸພາກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທັງໝົດປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ. ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍໃໝ່ທັນທີ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method restart].\n"
"ສັນຍານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ [member one_shot], ເພາະວ່າອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍ ແລະ "
"ປະມວນຜົນຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສຳລັບຕົວປ່ອຍແບບ [member one_shot], ເນື່ອງຈາກອະນຸພາກຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໃນ GPU, "
"ອາດມີຊ່ວງເວລາສັ້ນໆຫຼັງຈາກໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ ເຊິ່ງການຕັ້ງ [member emitting] ເປັນ [code]true[/code] "
"ຈະຍັງບໍ່ເລີ່ມຮອບວຽນໃໝ່. ຄວາມຊັກຊ້ານີ້ສາມາດຫຼີກລ່ຽງໄດ້ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method restart] ແທນ."

msgid ""
"Particles are drawn in reverse order of remaining lifetime. In other words, "
"the particle with the lowest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໃນລຳດັບປີ້ນກັບຊ່ວງຊີວິດທີ່ເຫຼືອ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, "
"ອະນຸພາກທີ່ມີຊ່ວງຊີວິດເຫຼືອນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໄວ້ທາງໜ້າສຸດ."

msgid "Particle starts at the specified position."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Particle starts with specified rotation and scale."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການໝຸນ ແລະ ຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid ""
"Particle starts with the specified velocity vector, which defines the "
"emission direction and speed."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເວັກເຕີຄວາມໄວທີ່ລະບຸ, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດທິດທາງ ແລະ ຄວາມໄວໃນການປ່ອຍ."

msgid "Particle starts with specified color."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍສີທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Particle starts with specified [code]CUSTOM[/code] data."
msgstr "ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ [code]CUSTOM[/code] ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "A 3D particle emitter."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກ (particle emitter) ແບບ 3D."

msgid ""
"3D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and effects. "
"[GPUParticles3D] features an emitter that generates some number of particles "
"at a given rate.\n"
"Use [member process_material] to add a [ParticleProcessMaterial] to configure "
"particle appearance and behavior. Alternatively, you can add a "
"[ShaderMaterial] which will be applied to all particles."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດອະນຸພາກ 3D ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງລະບົບອະນຸພາກ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ. [GPUParticles3D] "
"ມີຕົວປ່ອຍທີ່ສ້າງອະນຸພາກຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງຕາມອັດຕາທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ [member process_material] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ [ParticleProcessMaterial] "
"ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ [ShaderMaterial] "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Controlling thousands of fish with Particles"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມປາຫຼາຍພັນໂຕດ້ວຍອະນຸພາກ"

msgid "Sets this node's properties to match a given [CPUParticles3D] node."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂນດນີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບໂນດ [CPUParticles3D] ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້."

msgid "Returns the [Mesh] that is drawn at index [param pass]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນ [Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param pass]."

msgid "Sets the [Mesh] that is drawn at index [param pass]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມຢູ່ດັດຊະນີ [param pass]."

msgid ""
"The base diameter for particle collision in meters. If particles appear to "
"sink into the ground when colliding, increase this value. If particles appear "
"to float when colliding, decrease this value. Only effective if [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] is [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles always have a spherical collision shape."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນແມັດ. "
"ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດວ່າຈົມລົງໃນພື້ນດິນເມື່ອຕຳ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້. ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດວ່າລອຍຢູ່ເມື່ອຕຳ, ໃຫ້ຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້. "
"ມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອະນຸພາກຈະມີຮູບຊົງການຕຳແບບຊົງກົມສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Particle draw order.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant DRAW_ORDER_INDEX] is the only option that supports "
"motion vectors for effects like TAA. It is suggested to use this draw order "
"if the particles are opaque to fix ghosting artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບການແຕ້ມອະນຸພາກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [constant DRAW_ORDER_INDEX] "
"ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກດຽວທີ່ຮອງຮັບເວັກເຕີການເຄື່ອນທີ່ສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ TAA. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລຳດັບການແຕ້ມນີ້ຖ້າອະນຸພາກມີລັກສະນະທຶບແສງ ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພາບເງົາ (ghosting "
"artifacts)."

msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the first draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຮອບທີໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the second draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຮອບທີສອງ."

msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the third draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຮອບທີສາມ."

msgid "[Mesh] that is drawn for the fourth draw pass."
msgstr "[Mesh] ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມສຳລັບການແຕ້ມຮອບທີສີ່."

msgid "The number of draw passes when rendering particles."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຮອບການແຕ້ມ (draw passes) ໃນເວລາສະແດງຜົນອະນຸພາກ."

msgid ""
"Time ratio between each emission. If [code]0[/code], particles are emitted "
"continuously. If [code]1[/code], all particles are emitted simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນເວລາລະຫວ່າງການປ່ອຍແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]0[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກປ່ອຍຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. "
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]1[/code], ອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space (known "
"as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate along the "
"[GPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or rotated. If "
"[code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will not move or "
"rotate along the [GPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ພິກັດຂອງໂນດແມ່ (ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ພິກັດໂລໂຄລ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໝຸນໄປພ້ອມກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles3D] (ແລະ ໂນດແມ່ຂອງມັນ) "
"ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], ອະນຸພາກຈະໃຊ້ພິກັດສາກົນ (global "
"coordinates); ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ໝຸນໄປພ້ອມກັບໂນດ [GPUParticles3D] ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ໝຸນ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only the number of particles equal to [member amount] "
"will be emitted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ອະນຸພາກຈຳນວນທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ [member amount] "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ."

msgid ""
"Amount of time to preprocess the particles before animation starts. Lets you "
"start the animation some time after particles have started emitting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This can be very expensive if set to a high number as it "
"requires running the particle shader a number of times equal to the [member "
"fixed_fps] (or 30, if [member fixed_fps] is 0) for every second. In extreme "
"cases it can even lead to a GPU crash due to the volume of work done in a "
"single frame."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນອະນຸພາກລ່ວງໜ້າກ່ອນທີ່ແອນີເມຊັນຈະເລີ່ມ. "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລີ່ມແອນີເມຊັນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ອະນຸພາກເລີ່ມປ່ອຍອອກມາແລ້ວໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງຫຼາຍຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງ "
"ເພາະມັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ເຊເດີອະນຸພາກເປັນຈຳນວນຄັ້ງເທົ່າກັບ [member fixed_fps] (ຫຼື 30 ຖ້າ [member "
"fixed_fps] ເປັນ 0) ສຳລັບທຸກໆວິນາທີ. ໃນກໍລະນີຮ້າຍແຮງ ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ GPU ຄ້າງໄດ້ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກປະລິມານວຽກທີ່ເຮັດໃນເຟຣມດຽວນັ້ນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Emission randomness ratio."
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄວາມສຸ່ມໃນການປ່ອຍ."

msgid ""
"Speed scaling ratio. A value of [code]0[/code] can be used to pause the "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນການປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມໄວ. ຄ່າ [code]0[/code] "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງອະນຸພາກຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"Path to another [GPUParticles3D] node that will be used as a subemitter (see "
"[member ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). Subemitters can be used "
"to achieve effects such as fireworks, sparks on collision, bubbles popping "
"into water drops, and more.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member sub_emitter] is set, the target [GPUParticles3D] "
"node will no longer emit particles on its own."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂນດ [GPUParticles3D] ອື່ນທີ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍ (subemitter) (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.sub_emitter_mode]). ຕົວປ່ອຍຍ່ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກຕ່າງໆ "
"ເຊັ່ນ ດອກໄມ້ໄຟ, ປະກາຍໄຟເມື່ອຕຳ, ຟອງສະບູທີ່ແຕກເປັນຢອດນ້ຳ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມື່ອ [member sub_emitter] ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D] "
"ທີ່ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍຈະບໍ່ປ່ອຍອະນຸພາກດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables particle trails using a mesh skinning system. "
"Designed to work with [RibbonTrailMesh] and [TubeTrailMesh].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member BaseMaterial3D.use_particle_trails] must also be enabled "
"on the particle mesh's material. Otherwise, setting [member trail_enabled] to "
"[code]true[/code] will have no effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [GPUParticles2D], the number of trail sections and "
"subdivisions is set in the [RibbonTrailMesh] or the [TubeTrailMesh]'s "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຫາງອະນຸພາກ (particle trails) "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບເມຊສະກິນນິງ (mesh skinning system). ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ "
"[RibbonTrailMesh] ແລະ [TubeTrailMesh].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [member BaseMaterial3D.use_particle_trails] "
"ໃນວັດສະດຸຂອງເມຊອະນຸພາກນຳ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງ [member trail_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/"
"code] ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕ່າງຈາກ [GPUParticles2D], ຈຳນວນສ່ວນຂອງຫາງ ແລະ "
"ການແບ່ງຍ່ອຍແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ [RibbonTrailMesh] ຫຼື [TubeTrailMesh]."

msgid ""
"The alignment of particles. Use this for billboarding and aligning to "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດວາງແນວ (alignment) ຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດບິລບອດ (billboarding) ແລະ "
"ການຈັດວາງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມໄວ."

msgid ""
"When using transform align local billboard, which axis to use for the "
"billboarding. Supports only X or Y."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຈັດວາງແນວແບບ local billboard, ຈະໃຊ້ແກນໃດສຳລັບການເຮັດບິລບອດ. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະແກນ "
"X ຫຼື Y ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"In the case of billboarded particles, which custom channel to read from to "
"calculate their angle."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບບິລບອດ, ຈະອ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງ (custom channel) "
"ໃດເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ມຸມຂອງພວກມັນ."

msgid ""
"The [AABB] that determines the node's region which needs to be visible on "
"screen for the particle system to be active. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] is added on each of the AABB's axes. "
"Particle collisions and attraction will only occur within this area.\n"
"Grow the box if particles suddenly appear/disappear when the node enters/"
"exits the screen. The [AABB] can be grown via code or with the [b]Particles → "
"Generate AABB[/b] editor tool.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member visibility_aabb] is overridden by [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb] if that property is set to a non-default "
"value."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ [AABB] ທີ່ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂອງໂນດທີ່ຕ້ອງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນເທິງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກ. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຕ່ລະແກນຂອງ AABB. ການຕຳ ແລະ "
"ການດຶງດູດຂອງອະນຸພາກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນຂອບເຂດນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍກ່ອງນີ້ຖ້າອະນຸພາກປາກົດ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປທັນທີເມື່ອໂນດເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ອອກຈາກໜ້າຈໍ. ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ [AABB] "
"ຜ່ານໂໂຄ້ດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [b]Particles → Generate AABB[/b] ໃນເອດິເຕີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member visibility_aabb] ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບໂດຍ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.custom_aabb] ຖ້າຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Maximum number of draw passes supported."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຮອບການແຕ້ມ (draw passes) ສູງສຸດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Do not align particle transforms relative to the camera or velocity."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຈັດວາງການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ຂອງອະນຸພາກໃຫ້ກົງກັບກ້ອງ ຫຼື ຄວາມໄວ."

msgid "Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera."
msgstr "ຈັດວາງແກນ Z ຂອງອະນຸພາກແຕ່ລະອັນໃຫ້ປິ່ນໜ້າໄປຫາກ້ອງ."

msgid "Align each particle's Y axis to the velocity vector."
msgstr "ຈັດວາງແກນ Y ຂອງອະນຸພາກແຕ່ລະອັນໃຫ້ກົງກັບເວັກເຕີຄວາມໄວ."

msgid ""
"Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera and Y axis to the velocity "
"vector."
msgstr "ຈັດວາງແກນ Z ຂອງອະນຸພາກແຕ່ລະອັນໃຫ້ປິ່ນໜ້າໄປຫາກ້ອງ ແລະ ຈັດແກນ Y ໃຫ້ກົງກັບເວັກເຕີຄວາມໄວ."

msgid ""
"Align each particle's Z axis to face the camera, while preserving a given "
"axis (X or Y)."
msgstr "ຈັດວາງແກນ Z ຂອງອະນຸພາກແຕ່ລະອັນໃຫ້ປິ່ນໜ້າໄປຫາກ້ອງ, ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາແກນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ (X ຫຼື Y)."

msgid "Abstract base class for 3D particle attractors."
msgstr "ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D."

msgid ""
"Particle attractors can be used to attract particles towards the attractor's "
"origin, or to push them away from the attractor's origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"Attractors can be temporarily disabled by hiding them, or by setting their "
"[member strength] to [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຂົ້າຫາຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ, ຫຼື "
"ຍູ້ພວກມັນອອກໄປຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ (real-time) ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ "
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ຕ່າງຈາກຮູບຊົງການຕຳ, ຕົວດຶງດູດຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ "
"(non-uniform scaling) ນຳ.\n"
"ຕົວດຶງດູດສາມາດຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ໂດຍການເຊື່ອງພວກມັນ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member strength] "
"ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກຈະມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"The particle attractor's attenuation. Higher values result in more gradual "
"pushing of particles as they come closer to the attractor's origin. Zero or "
"negative values will cause particles to be pushed very fast as soon as the "
"touch the attractor's edges."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຄວາມຖົດຖອຍ (attenuation) ຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກ. "
"ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຍູ້ອະນຸພາກຄ່ອຍໆເປັນຄ່ອຍໆໄປເມື່ອພວກມັນເຂົ້າມາໃກ້ຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ. ຄ່າສູນ ຫຼື "
"ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຖືກຍູ້ອອກຢ່າງໄວວາທັນທີທີ່ພວກມັນແຕະຂອບຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ."

msgid ""
"The particle rendering layers ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) that will be "
"affected by the attractor. By default, all particles are affected by an "
"attractor.\n"
"After configuring particle nodes accordingly, specific layers can be "
"unchecked to prevent certain particles from being affected by attractors. For "
"example, this can be used if you're using an attractor as part of a spell "
"effect but don't want the attractor to affect unrelated weather particles at "
"the same position.\n"
"Particle attraction can also be disabled on a per-process material basis by "
"setting [member ParticleProcessMaterial.attractor_interaction_enabled] on the "
"[GPUParticles3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີການສະແດງຜົນອະນຸພາກ ([member VisualInstance3D.layers]) "
"ທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ອະນຸພາກທັງໝົດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ.\n"
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂນດອະນຸພາກຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ, "
"ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການເລືອກເລເຍີສະເພາະເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຕົວດຶງດູດເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເອັບເຟັກເວດມົນ "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕົວດຶງດູດມີຜົນກັບອະນຸພາກສະພາບອາກາດທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນ.\n"
"ການດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກຍັງສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍແຍກຕາມວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນ (per-process material) "
"ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member ParticleProcessMaterial.attractor_interaction_enabled] "
"ໃນໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"Adjusts how directional the attractor is. At [code]0.0[/code], the attractor "
"is not directional at all: it will attract particles towards its center. At "
"[code]1.0[/code], the attractor is fully directional: particles will always "
"be pushed towards local -Z (or +Z if [member strength] is negative).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member directionality] is greater than [code]0.0[/code], the "
"direction in which particles are pushed can be changed by rotating the "
"[GPUParticlesAttractor3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຄວາມເປັນທິດທາງຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]0.0[/code], ຕົວດຶງດູດຈະບໍ່ມີທິດທາງເລີຍ: "
"ມັນຈະດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຂົ້າຫາຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງມັນ. ທີ່ຄ່າ [code]1.0[/code], ຕົວດຶງດູດຈະມີທິດທາງຢ່າງສົມບູນ: "
"ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກຍູ້ໄປທາງແກນ -Z ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງ (ຫຼື +Z ຖ້າ [member strength] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຖ້າ [member directionality] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code], "
"ທິດທາງທີ່ອະນຸພາກຖືກຍູ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການໝຸນໂນດ [GPUParticlesAttractor3D]."

msgid ""
"Adjusts the strength of the attractor. If [member strength] is negative, "
"particles will be pushed in the opposite direction. Particles will be pushed "
"[i]away[/i] from the attractor's origin if [member directionality] is "
"[code]0.0[/code], or towards local +Z if [member directionality] is greater "
"than [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ. ຖ້າ [member strength] ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, "
"ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກຍູ້ໄປໃນທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ. ອະນຸພາກຈະຖືກຍູ້ [i]ອອກໄປ[/i] ຈາກຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດຖ້າ "
"[member directionality] ເປັນ [code]0.0[/code], ຫຼື ຍູ້ໄປທາງແກນ +Z ຂອງຕົວມັນເອງຖ້າ "
"[member directionality] ຫຼາຍກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr "ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes. "
"Can be used to attract particles towards its origin, or to push them away "
"from its origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຂົ້າຫາຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງມັນ, ຫຼື ຍູ້ພວກມັນອອກໄປກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. "
"ຕ່າງຈາກຮູບຊົງການຕຳ, ຕົວດຶງດູດຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກຈະມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid "The attractor box's size in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກ່ອງຕົວດຶງດູດໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid ""
"A spheroid-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr "ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງຊົງກົມທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A spheroid-shaped attractor that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes. Can be used to attract particles towards its origin, or to push them "
"away from its origin.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງຊົງກົມທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]. "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຂົ້າຫາຈຸດກຳເນີດຂອງມັນ, ຫຼື ຍູ້ພວກມັນອອກໄປກໍໄດ້.\n"
"ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. "
"ຕ່າງຈາກຮູບຊົງການຕຳ, ຕົວດຶງດູດຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກຈະມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"The attractor sphere's radius in 3D units.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Stretched ellipses can be obtained by using non-uniform scaling "
"on the [GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D] node."
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມຕົວດຶງດູດໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຊົງຮີທີ່ຢືດອອກໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນໃນໂນດ "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorSphere3D]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor with varying directions and strengths defined in it "
"that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ມີການກຳນົດທິດທາງ ແລະ ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນພາຍໃນ ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped attractor with varying directions and strengths defined in it "
"that influences particles from [GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Unlike [GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D], [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] "
"uses a [member texture] to affect attraction strength within the box. This "
"can be used to create complex attraction scenarios where particles travel in "
"different directions depending on their location. This can be useful for "
"weather effects such as sandstorms.\n"
"Particle attractors work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and scaled "
"during gameplay. Unlike collision shapes, non-uniform scaling of attractors "
"is also supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle attractors only affect [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຶງດູດຮູບຊົງກ່ອງທີ່ມີການກຳນົດທິດທາງ ແລະ ຄວາມແຮງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນພາຍໃນ ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ອະນຸພາກຈາກໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D].\n"
"ຕ່າງຈາກ [GPUParticlesAttractorBox3D], [GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] "
"ຈະໃຊ້ [member texture] (ເທັກເຈີ) ເພື່ອສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມແຮງຂອງການດຶງດູດພາຍໃນກ່ອງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງສະຖານະການການດຶງດູດທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເຊິ່ງອະນຸພາກຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງຕ່າງໆ "
"ຂຶ້ນກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພວກມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສະພາບອາກາດ ເຊັ່ນ ພະຍຸຊາຍ.\n"
"ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. "
"ຕ່າງຈາກຮູບຊົງການຕຳ, ຕົວດຶງດູດຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນນຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ຕົວດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກຈະມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid "The size of the vector field box in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກ່ອງສະໜາມເວັກເຕີ (vector field box) ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid ""
"The 3D texture to be used. Values are linearly interpolated between the "
"texture's pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To get better performance, the 3D texture's resolution should "
"reflect the [member size] of the attractor. Since particle attraction is "
"usually low-frequency data, the texture can be kept at a low resolution such "
"as 64×64×64."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີ 3D ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ຄ່າຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linearly interpolated) "
"ລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວຂອງເທັກເຈີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ, ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງເທັກເຈີ 3D ຄວນສອດຄ່ອງກັບ [member "
"size] ຂອງຕົວດຶງດູດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການດຶງດູດອະນຸພາກມັກຈະເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ, "
"ເທັກເຈີຈຶ່ງສາມາດຮັກສາໄວ້ທີ່ຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ ເຊັ່ນ 64×64×64 ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Abstract base class for 3D particle collision shapes affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຄລາດພື້ນຖານແບບນາມມະທຳ (abstract) ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"Particle collision shapes can be used to make particles stop or bounce "
"against them.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"Particle collision shapes can be temporarily disabled by hiding them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particles pushed by a collider that is being moved will not be "
"interpolated, which can result in visible stuttering. This can be alleviated "
"by setting [member GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps] to [code]0[/code] or a value "
"that matches or exceeds the target framerate."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກຢຸດ ຫຼື ກະເດັນອອກຈາກພວກມັນ.\n"
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ "
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ, ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ຖືກຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳ.\n"
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ໂດຍການເຊື່ອງພວກມັນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] ໃນວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕຳເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ອະນຸພາກທີ່ຖືກຍູ້ໂດຍຕົວຕຳທີ່ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຊກຄ່າ (interpolate), "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນການກະຕຸກໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"GPUParticles3D.fixed_fps] ເປັນ [code]0[/code] ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍກວ່າອັດຕາເຟຣມເປົ້າໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A box-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງກ່ອງ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ "
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ, ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ຖືກຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] ໃນວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕຳເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid "The collision box's size in 3D units."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງກ່ອງການຕຳໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid ""
"A real-time heightmap-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ (heightmap) ແບບຮຽວທາມ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A real-time heightmap-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Heightmap shapes allow for efficiently representing collisions for convex and "
"concave objects with a single \"floor\" (such as terrain). This is less "
"flexible than [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D], but it doesn't require a baking "
"step.\n"
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] can also be regenerated in real-time "
"when it is moved, when the camera moves, or even continuously. This makes "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] a good choice for weather effects such "
"as rain and snow and games with highly dynamic geometry. However, this class "
"is limited since heightmaps cannot represent overhangs (e.g. indoors or "
"caves).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[code]true[/code] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s process material for collision to "
"work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ (heightmap) ແບບຮຽວທາມ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D].\n"
"ຮູບຊົງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງການຕຳສຳລັບວັດຖຸທັງແບບນູນ ແລະ ແບບວ້ຳໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍ "
"\"ພື້ນ\" ດຽວ (ເຊັ່ນ ພື້ນທີ່ພູມສັນຖານ). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D], ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການເບກ (baking).\n"
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] ຍັງສາມາດສ້າງໃໝ່ແບບຮຽວທາມໄດ້ເມື່ອມັນຖືກຍ້າຍ, "
"ເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ ຫຼື ເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"ເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບເອັບເຟັກສະພາບອາກາດ ເຊັ່ນ ຝົນ ແລະ ຫິມະ ແລະ "
"ເກມທີ່ມີເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງສູງ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຄລາດນີ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເນື່ອງຈາກແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງສ່ວນທີ່ຍື່ນອອກມາໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ ພາຍໃນເຮືອນ ຫຼື ຖ້ຳ).\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[code]true[/code] ໃນວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນຂອງ [GPUParticles3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕຳເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified layer of the [member "
"heightfield_mask] is enabled, given a [param layer_number] between [code]1[/"
"code] and [code]20[/code], inclusive."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນ [code]true[/code] ຖ້າເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [member heightfield_mask] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, "
"ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ [code]1[/code] ຫາ [code]20[/code]."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member heightfield_mask], given a [param layer_number] between [code]1[/"
"code] and [code]20[/code], inclusive."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມ [param value], ໃຫ້ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member heightfield_mask], "
"ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ [code]1[/code] ຫາ [code]20[/code]."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] will follow "
"the current camera in global space. The [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"does not need to be a child of the [Camera3D] node for this to work.\n"
"Following the camera has a performance cost, as it will force the heightmap "
"to update whenever the camera moves. Consider lowering [member resolution] to "
"improve performance if [member follow_camera_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"ຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມກ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສາກົນ. [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນໂນດລູກຂອງ [Camera3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"ການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມກ້ອງມີຜົນຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ, ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງອັບເດດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່. "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຫຼຸດ [member resolution] ລົງເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຖ້າ [member "
"follow_camera_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]."

msgid ""
"The visual layers to account for when updating the heightmap. Only "
"[MeshInstance3D]s whose [member VisualInstance3D.layers] match with this "
"[member heightfield_mask] will be included in the heightmap collision update. "
"By default, all 20 user-visible layers are taken into account for updating "
"the heightmap collision.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since the [member heightfield_mask] allows for 32 layers to be "
"stored in total, there are an additional 12 layers that are only used "
"internally by the engine and aren't exposed in the editor. Setting [member "
"heightfield_mask] using a script allows you to toggle those reserved layers, "
"which can be useful for editor plugins.\n"
"To adjust [member heightfield_mask] more easily using a script, use [method "
"get_heightfield_mask_value] and [method set_heightfield_mask_value]."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຈະນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນເວລາອັບເດດແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ. ສະເພາະ [MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ "
"[member VisualInstance3D.layers] ກົງກັບ [member heightfield_mask] "
"ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການອັບເດດການຕຳຂອງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທັງໝົດ 20 "
"ເລເຍີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໄດ້ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເນື່ອງຈາກ [member heightfield_mask] ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເກັບເລເຍີໄດ້ທັງໝົດ 32 "
"ເລເຍີ, ຈຶ່ງມີອີກ 12 ເລເຍີທີ່ໃຊ້ສະເພາະພາຍໃນເອັນຈິນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງໃນເອດິເຕີ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [member "
"heightfield_mask] ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ-ປິດເລເຍີທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບປລັກອິນຂອງເອດິເຕີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອປັບ [member heightfield_mask] ໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"get_heightfield_mask_value] ແລະ [method set_heightfield_mask_value]."

msgid ""
"Higher resolutions can represent small details more accurately in large "
"scenes, at the cost of lower performance. If [member update_mode] is "
"[constant UPDATE_MODE_ALWAYS], consider using the lowest resolution possible."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສາມາດສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆໄດ້ຊັດເຈນກວ່າໃນສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງ. ຖ້າ [member update_mode] ເປັນ [constant "
"UPDATE_MODE_ALWAYS], ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid ""
"The collision heightmap's size in 3D units. To improve heightmap quality, "
"[member size] should be set as small as possible while covering the parts of "
"the scene you need."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງການຕຳໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D. ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງ, [member size] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດໂດຍໃຫ້ຄອບຄຸມສະເພາະສ່ວນຂອງສາກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "The update policy to use for the generated heightmap."
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍການອັບເດດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 256×256 heightmap. Intended for small-scale scenes, or larger "
"scenes with no distant particles."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 256×256. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ຫຼື "
"ສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 512×512 heightmap. Intended for medium-scale scenes, or larger "
"scenes with no distant particles."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 512×512. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດກາງ, ຫຼື "
"ສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 1024×1024 heightmap. Intended for large scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr "ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 1024×1024. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 2048×2048 heightmap. Intended for very large scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr "ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 2048×2048. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 4096×4096 heightmap. Intended for huge scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr "ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 4096×4096. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຍັກທີ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid ""
"Generate a 8192×8192 heightmap. Intended for gigantic scenes with distant "
"particles."
msgstr "ສ້າງແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງຂະໜາດ 8192×8192. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສາກຂະໜາດມະຫາສານທີ່ມີອະນຸພາກທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ."

msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Resolution] enum."
msgstr "ສະແດງແທນຂະໜາດຂອງອີນຳ (enum) [Resolution]."

msgid ""
"Only update the heightmap when the [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] node "
"is moved, or when the camera moves if [member follow_camera_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]. An update can be forced by slightly moving the "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] in any direction, or by calling [method "
"RenderingServer.particles_collision_height_field_update]."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງສະເພາະເມື່ອໂນດ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] ຖືກຍ້າຍ, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອກ້ອງເຄື່ອນທີ່ຖ້າ [member follow_camera_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. "
"ສາມາດບັງຄັບໃຫ້ອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍການຍ້າຍ [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D] "
"ເລັກໜ້ອຍໄປໃນທິດທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [method "
"RenderingServer.particles_collision_height_field_update]."

msgid ""
"Update the heightmap every frame. This has a significant performance cost. "
"This update should only be used when geometry that particles can collide with "
"changes significantly during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດແຜນທີ່ຄວາມສູງທຸກໆເຟຣມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງຫຼາຍ. "
"ການອັບເດດນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ອະນຸພາກສາມາດຕຳໄດ້ນັ້ນມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ."

msgid ""
"A baked signed distance field 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງສະໜາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (signed distance field - "
"SDF) ທີ່ເບກແລ້ວ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A baked signed distance field 3D particle collision shape affecting "
"[GPUParticles3D] nodes.\n"
"Signed distance fields (SDF) allow for efficiently representing approximate "
"collision shapes for convex and concave objects of any shape. This is more "
"flexible than [GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D], but it requires a baking "
"step.\n"
"[b]Baking:[/b] The signed distance field texture can be baked by selecting "
"the [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] node in the editor, then clicking [b]Bake "
"SDF[/b] at the top of the 3D viewport. Any [i]visible[/i] [MeshInstance3D]s "
"within the [member size] will be taken into account for baking, regardless of "
"their [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Baking a [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]'s [member texture] is only "
"possible within the editor, as there is no bake method exposed for use in "
"exported projects. However, it's still possible to load pre-baked "
"[Texture3D]s into its [member texture] property in an exported project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງສະໜາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (SDF) ທີ່ເບກແລ້ວ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ "
"[GPUParticles3D].\n"
"SDF ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງຮູບຊົງການຕຳໂດຍປະມານສຳລັບວັດຖຸທັງແບບນູນ ແລະ "
"ແບບວ້ຳໃນຮູບຊົງໃດກໍໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນກວ່າ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D], ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການເບກ (baking).\n"
"[b]ການເບກ:[/b] ເທັກເຈີ SDF ສາມາດເບກໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໂນດ [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] "
"ໃນເອດິເຕີ, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ [b]Bake SDF[/b] ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງວິວພອດ 3D. ທຸກໆ [MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ "
"[i]ເຫັນໄດ້[/i] ພາຍໃນ [member size] ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນການເບກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າ [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] ຂອງພວກມັນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການເບກ [member texture] ຂອງ [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] "
"ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນເອດິເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າບໍ່ມີເມທອດເບກທີ່ເປີດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ. "
"ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໂຫຼດ [Texture3D] ທີ່ເບກໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເຂົ້າໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ [member "
"texture] ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວໄດ້.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] ໃນວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕຳເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"Returns whether or not the specified layer of the [member bake_mask] is "
"enabled, given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸຂອງ [member bake_mask] ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່, ໂດຍກຳນົດ [param "
"layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid ""
"Based on [param value], enables or disables the specified layer in the "
"[member bake_mask], given a [param layer_number] between 1 and 32."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມ [param value], ໃຫ້ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານເລເຍີທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [member bake_mask], ໂດຍກຳນົດ "
"[param layer_number] ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 32."

msgid ""
"The visual layers to account for when baking the particle collision SDF. Only "
"[MeshInstance3D]s whose [member VisualInstance3D.layers] match with this "
"[member bake_mask] will be included in the generated particle collision SDF. "
"By default, all objects are taken into account for the particle collision SDF "
"baking."
msgstr ""
"ເລເຍີການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຈະນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນເວລາເບກ SDF ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກ. ສະເພາະ "
"[MeshInstance3D] ທີ່ມີ [member VisualInstance3D.layers] ກົງກັບ [member bake_mask] "
"ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ SDF ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວັດຖຸທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່."

msgid ""
"The bake resolution to use for the signed distance field [member texture]. "
"The texture must be baked again for changes to the [member resolution] "
"property to be effective. Higher resolutions have a greater performance cost "
"and take more time to bake. Higher resolutions also result in larger baked "
"textures, leading to increased VRAM and storage space requirements. To "
"improve performance and reduce bake times, use the lowest resolution possible "
"for the object you're representing the collision of."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມລະອຽດການເບກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ [member texture] ຂອງ SDF. "
"ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເບກເທັກເຈີໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງ [member resolution] ມີຜົນ. "
"ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເວລາເບກດົນຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ເທັກເຈີທີ່ເບກແລ້ວມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕ້ອງການ VRAM ແລະ "
"ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຫຼຸດເວລາເບກ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"The collision SDF's size in 3D units. To improve SDF quality, the [member "
"size] should be set as small as possible while covering the parts of the "
"scene you need."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງ SDF ການຕຳໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D. ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ SDF, [member size] "
"ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດໂດຍໃຫ້ຄອບຄຸມສະເພາະສ່ວນຂອງສາກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "The 3D texture representing the signed distance field."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ 3D ທີ່ສະແດງແທນສະໜາມໄລຍະຫ່າງແບບມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (SDF)."

msgid ""
"The collision shape's thickness. Unlike other particle colliders, "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] is actually hollow on the inside. [member "
"thickness] can be increased to prevent particles from tunneling through the "
"collision shape at high speeds, or when the [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] is "
"moved."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໜາຂອງຮູບຊົງການຕຳ. ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວຕຳອະນຸພາກອື່ນໆ, [GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] "
"ແທ້ຈິງແລ້ວແມ່ນຈະກວ້າງທາງໃນ. ສາມາດເພີ່ມ [member thickness] "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ອະນຸພາກທະລຸຜ່ານຮູບຊົງການຕຳໃນເວລາທີ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວສູງ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອ "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D] ຖືກຍ້າຍ."

msgid ""
"Bake a 16×16×16 signed distance field. This is the fastest option, but also "
"the least precise."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 16×16×16. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid "Bake a 32×32×32 signed distance field."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 32×32×32."

msgid "Bake a 64×64×64 signed distance field."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 64×64×64."

msgid "Bake a 128×128×128 signed distance field."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 128×128×128."

msgid "Bake a 256×256×256 signed distance field."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 256×256×256."

msgid ""
"Bake a 512×512×512 signed distance field. This is the slowest option, but "
"also the most precise."
msgstr "ເບກ SDF ຂະໜາດ 512×512×512. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳທີ່ສຸດ."

msgid ""
"A sphere-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] nodes."
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງຊົງກົມ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D]."

msgid ""
"A sphere-shaped 3D particle collision shape affecting [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes.\n"
"Particle collision shapes work in real-time and can be moved, rotated and "
"scaled during gameplay. Unlike attractors, non-uniform scaling of collision "
"shapes is [i]not[/i] supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] must be "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] or [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] on the [GPUParticles3D]'s "
"process material for collision to work.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Particle collision only affects [GPUParticles3D], not "
"[CPUParticles3D]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກແບບ 3D ຮູບຊົງຊົງກົມ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ໂນດ [GPUParticles3D].\n"
"ຮູບຊົງການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກເຮັດວຽກແບບຮຽວທາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້າຍ, ໝຸນ ແລະ "
"ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼິ້ນເກມ. ຕ່າງຈາກຕົວດຶງດູດ, ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ສະເໝີກັນ [i]ບໍ່[/i] "
"ຖືກຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບຊົງການຕຳ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] [member ParticleProcessMaterial.collision_mode] ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_RIGID] ຫຼື [constant "
"ParticleProcessMaterial.COLLISION_HIDE_ON_CONTACT] ໃນວັດສະດຸປະມວນຜົນຂອງ "
"[GPUParticles3D] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕຳເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕຳຂອງອະນຸພາກມີຜົນກັບ [GPUParticles3D] ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບ "
"[CPUParticles3D]."

msgid "The collision sphere's radius in 3D units."
msgstr "ລັດສະໝີຂອງຊົງກົມການຕຳໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ 3D."

msgid "A color transition."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານສີ."

msgid ""
"This resource describes a color transition by defining a set of colored "
"points and how to interpolate between them.\n"
"See also [Curve] which supports more complex easing methods, but does not "
"support colors."
msgstr ""
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ອະທິບາຍການປ່ຽນຜ່ານສີໂດຍການກຳນົດກຸ່ມຂອງຈຸດສີ ແລະ ວິທີການແຊກຄ່າ (interpolate) "
"ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ເບິ່ງ [Curve] ປະກອບນຳ ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບວິທີການປັບຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ (easing) ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບສີ."

msgid "Adds the specified color to the gradient, with the specified offset."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສີທີ່ລະບຸເຂົ້າໃນກຣາເດຍນ (gradient), ພ້ອມດ້ວຍຄ່າອອຟເຊັດ (offset) ທີ່ລະບຸ."

msgid "Returns the color of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນສີຂອງກຣາເດຍນທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param point]."

msgid "Returns the offset of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຂອງສີກຣາເດຍນທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param point]."

msgid "Returns the number of colors in the gradient."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນຈຳນວນສີໃນກຣາເດຍນ."

msgid "Removes the color at index [param point]."
msgstr "ລຶບສີທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param point] ອອກ."

msgid ""
"Reverses/mirrors the gradient.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method mirrors all points around the middle of the "
"gradient, which may produce unexpected results when [member "
"interpolation_mode] is set to [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."
msgstr ""
"ປີ້ນກັບ ຫຼື ສະທ້ອນເງົາ (mirror) ກຣາເດຍນ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ເມທອດນີ້ຈະສະທ້ອນທຸກຈຸດອ້ອມຈຸດກາງຂອງກຣາເດຍນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດເມື່ອ [member interpolation_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [constant "
"GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."

msgid ""
"Returns the interpolated color specified by [param offset]. [param offset] "
"should be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Using a "
"value lower than [code]0.0[/code] will return the same color as [code]0.0[/"
"code], and using a value higher than [code]1.0[/code] will return the same "
"color as [code]1.0[/code]. If your input value is not within this range, "
"consider using [method @GlobalScope.remap] on the input value with output "
"values set to [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນສີທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການແຊກຄ່າຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ [param offset]. [param offset] ຄວນມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ "
"[code]0.0[/code] ຫາ [code]1.0[/code]. ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ [code]0.0[/code] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສີດຽວກັບ [code]0.0[/code], ແລະ ການໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ [code]1.0[/code] "
"ຈະສົ່ງຄືນສີດຽວກັບ [code]1.0[/code]. ຖ້າຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານປ້ອນເຂົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງນີ້, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ [method "
"@GlobalScope.remap] ກັບຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າໂດຍຕັ້ງຄ່າຜົນລັດເປັນ [code]0.0[/code] ແລະ [code]1.0[/"
"code]."

msgid "Sets the color of the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຂອງກຣາເດຍນທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param point]."

msgid "Sets the offset for the gradient color at index [param point]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອອຟເຊັດສຳລັບສີກຣາເດຍນທີ່ດັດຊະນີ [param point]."

msgid ""
"Gradient's colors as a [PackedColorArray].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates all colors at once. To update any "
"color individually use [method set_color]."
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງກຣາເດຍນໃນຮູບແບບ [PackedColorArray].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະອັບເດດທຸກສີພ້ອມກັນ. ເພື່ອອັບເດດແຕ່ລະສີແຍກກັນ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method "
"set_color]."

msgid ""
"The color space used to interpolate between points of the gradient. It does "
"not affect the returned colors, which will always use nonlinear sRGB "
"encoding.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when [member interpolation_mode] is "
"set to [constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີ (color space) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຊກຄ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງກຣາເດຍນ. ມັນບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບສີທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນມາ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ sRGB ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ (nonlinear) ສະເໝີ.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນເມື່ອ [member interpolation_mode] ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ "
"[constant GRADIENT_INTERPOLATE_CONSTANT]."

msgid "The algorithm used to interpolate between points of the gradient."
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຊກຄ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງກຣາເດຍນ."

msgid ""
"Gradient's offsets as a [PackedFloat32Array].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates all offsets at once. To update any "
"offset individually use [method set_offset]."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດຂອງກຣາເດຍນໃນຮູບແບບ [PackedFloat32Array].\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຈະອັບເດດທຸກອອຟເຊັດພ້ອມກັນ. ເພື່ອອັບເດດແຕ່ລະອອຟເຊັດແຍກກັນ "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [method set_offset]."

msgid ""
"Constant interpolation, color changes abruptly at each point and stays "
"uniform between. This might cause visible aliasing when used for a gradient "
"texture in some cases."
msgstr ""
"ການແຊກຄ່າແບບຄົງທີ່ (constant interpolation), ສີຈະປ່ຽນຢ່າງທັນທີຢູ່ແຕ່ລະຈຸດ ແລະ "
"ຄົງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຮອຍຢັກ (aliasing) ໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບເທັກເຈີກຣາເດຍນ."

msgid "Cubic interpolation."
msgstr "ການແຊກຄ່າແບບກຳລັງສາມ (cubic interpolation)."

msgid "sRGB color space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີ sRGB."

msgid "Linear sRGB color space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ສີ sRGB ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear sRGB)."

msgid ""
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/]Oklab[/url] color space. This "
"color space provides a smooth and uniform-looking transition between colors."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີ [url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/]Oklab[/url]. "
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງສີລຽບນຽນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

msgid "A 1D texture that uses colors obtained from a [Gradient]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ 1D ທີ່ໃຊ້ສີທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ [Gradient]."

msgid ""
"A 1D texture that obtains colors from a [Gradient] to fill the texture data. "
"The texture is filled by sampling the gradient for each pixel. Therefore, the "
"texture does not necessarily represent an exact copy of the gradient, as it "
"may miss some colors if there are not enough pixels. See also "
"[GradientTexture2D], [CurveTexture] and [CurveXYZTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີ 1D ທີ່ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນສີຈາກ [Gradient] ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ. "
"ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງກຣາເດຍນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ເທັກເຈີອາດຈະບໍ່ຄືກັບກຣາເດຍນທຸກຢ່າງ ເພາະສີບາງສີອາດຈະຫາຍໄປຖ້າມີພິກເຊວບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ເບິ່ງ "
"[GradientTexture2D], [CurveTexture] ແລະ [CurveXYZTexture] ປະກອບນຳ."

msgid "The [Gradient] used to fill the texture."
msgstr "[Gradient] ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ."

msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the generated texture will support high dynamic range "
"([constant Image.FORMAT_RGBAF] format). This allows for glow effects to work "
"if [member Environment.glow_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. If [code]false[/"
"code], the generated texture will use low dynamic range; overbright colors "
"will be clamped ([constant Image.FORMAT_RGBA8] format)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນ [code]true[/code], ເທັກເຈີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຮອງຮັບຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກສູງ (ຮູບແບບ [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBAF]). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເອັບເຟັກແສງເຮືອງ (glow) ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖ້າ [member "
"Environment.glow_enabled] ເປັນ [code]true[/code]. ຖ້າເປັນ [code]false[/code], "
"ເທັກເຈີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳ; ສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (ຮູບແບບ [constant "
"Image.FORMAT_RGBA8])."

msgid "The number of color samples that will be obtained from the [Gradient]."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສີທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຈາກ [Gradient]."

msgid ""
"A 2D texture that creates a pattern with colors obtained from a [Gradient]."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີ 2D ທີ່ສ້າງລວດລາຍດ້ວຍສີທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ [Gradient]."

msgid ""
"A 2D texture that obtains colors from a [Gradient] to fill the texture data. "
"This texture is able to transform a color transition into different patterns "
"such as a linear or a radial gradient. The texture is filled by interpolating "
"colors starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] offsets by "
"default, but the gradient fill can be repeated to cover the entire texture.\n"
"The gradient is sampled individually for each pixel so it does not "
"necessarily represent an exact copy of the gradient (see [member width] and "
"[member height]). See also [GradientTexture1D], [CurveTexture] and "
"[CurveXYZTexture]."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີ 2D ທີ່ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນສີຈາກ [Gradient] ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ. "
"ເທັກເຈີນີ້ສາມາດແປງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານສີໃຫ້ເປັນລວດລາຍຕ່າງໆໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ກຣາເດຍນແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ ຫຼື ແບບລັດສະໝີ. "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການແຊກຄ່າສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກອອຟເຊັດ [member fill_from] ໄປຫາ "
"[member fill_to], ແຕ່ການຕື່ມກຣາເດຍນສາມາດເຮັດຊ້ຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄອບຄຸມທັງໝົດເທັກເຈີໄດ້.\n"
"ກຣາເດຍນຈະຖືກສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງແຍກກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ຄືກັບກຣາເດຍນທຸກຢ່າງ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"width] ແລະ [member height]). ເບິ່ງ [GradientTexture1D], [CurveTexture] ແລະ "
"[CurveXYZTexture] ປະກອບນຳ."

msgid "The gradient's fill type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຂອງກຣາເດຍນ."

msgid "The initial offset used to fill the texture specified in UV coordinates."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ ໂດຍລະບຸໃນພິກັດ UV."

msgid "The final offset used to fill the texture specified in UV coordinates."
msgstr "ຄ່າອອຟເຊັດສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເທັກເຈີ ໂດຍລະບຸໃນພິກັດ UV."

msgid ""
"The number of vertical color samples that will be obtained from the "
"[Gradient], which also represents the texture's height."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສີໃນແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຈາກ [Gradient], ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມສູງຂອງເທັກເຈີນຳ."

msgid "The gradient's repeat type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການເຮັດຊ້ຳຂອງກຣາເດຍນ."

msgid ""
"The number of horizontal color samples that will be obtained from the "
"[Gradient], which also represents the texture's width."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຕົວຢ່າງສີໃນແນວນອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຈາກ [Gradient], ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເທັກເຈີນຳ."

msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a straight line."
msgstr "ສີຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນແນວເສັ້ນຊື່."

msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a circular pattern."
msgstr "ສີຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນຮູບແບບວົງມົນ."

msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a square pattern."
msgstr "ສີຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນຮູບແບບສີ່ແຈສາກ."

msgid "The colors are linearly interpolated in a cone pattern."
msgstr "ສີຈະຖືກແຊກຄ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ໃນຮູບແບບຈວຍ."

msgid ""
"The gradient fill is restricted to the range defined by [member fill_from] to "
"[member fill_to] offsets."
msgstr ""
"ການຕື່ມກຣາເດຍນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍອອຟເຊັດ [member fill_from] ຫາ [member "
"fill_to]."

msgid ""
"The texture is filled starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] "
"offsets, repeating the same pattern in both directions."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກອອຟເຊັດ [member fill_from] ຫາ [member fill_to], ແລະ "
"ເຮັດຊ້ຳຮູບແບບເດີມໃນທັງສອງທິດທາງ."

msgid ""
"The texture is filled starting from [member fill_from] to [member fill_to] "
"offsets, mirroring the pattern in both directions."
msgstr ""
"ເທັກເຈີຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກອອຟເຊັດ [member fill_from] ຫາ [member fill_to], ແລະ "
"ສະທ້ອນເງົາ (mirror) ຮູບແບບໃນທັງສອງທິດທາງ."

msgid "An editor for graph-like structures, using [GraphNode]s."
msgstr "ເອດິເຕີສຳລັບໂຄງສ້າງແບບກຣາຟ (graph), ໂດຍໃຊ້ [GraphNode]."

msgid ""
"[GraphEdit] provides tools for creation, manipulation, and display of various "
"graphs. Its main purpose in the engine is to power the visual programming "
"systems, such as visual shaders, but it is also available for use in user "
"projects.\n"
"[GraphEdit] by itself is only an empty container, representing an infinite "
"grid where [GraphNode]s can be placed. Each [GraphNode] represents a node in "
"the graph, a single unit of data in the connected scheme. [GraphEdit], in "
"turn, helps to control various interactions with nodes and between nodes. "
"When the user attempts to connect, disconnect, or delete a [GraphNode], a "
"signal is emitted in the [GraphEdit], but no action is taken by default. It "
"is the responsibility of the programmer utilizing this control to implement "
"the necessary logic to determine how each request should be handled.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] It is greatly advised to enable low-processor usage mode "
"(see [member OS.low_processor_usage_mode]) when using GraphEdits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Keep in mind that [method Node.get_children] will also return "
"the connection layer node named [code]_connection_layer[/code] due to "
"technical limitations. This behavior may change in future releases."
msgstr ""
"[GraphEdit] ໃຫ້ບໍລິການເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບການສ້າງ, ການຈັດການ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງກຣາຟຕ່າງໆ. "
"ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກຂອງມັນໃນເອັນຈິນແມ່ນເພື່ອຂັບເຄື່ອນລະບົບການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມແບບພາບ (visual programming), "
"ເຊັ່ນ visual shaders, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ນຳ.\n"
"[GraphEdit] ໂດຍຕົວມັນເອງແມ່ນເປັນພຽງພາຊະນະຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຕາຕະລາງທີ່ບໍ່ມີທີ່ສິ້ນສຸດ "
"ເຊິ່ງສາມາດວາງ [GraphNode] ໄດ້. [GraphNode] ແຕ່ລະອັນສະແດງເຖິງໂນດໃນກຣາຟ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນຂໍ້ມູນໜ່ວຍດຽວໃນແຜນຜັງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, [GraphEdit] "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍຄວບຄຸມການຕອບໂຕ້ຕ່າງໆກັບໂນດ ແລະ ລະຫວ່າງໂນດ. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື "
"ລຶບ [GraphNode], ສັນຍານຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກມາໃນ [GraphEdit], "
"ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການດຳເນີນການໃດໆໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ມັນແມ່ນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ເພື່ອຂຽນໂລຈິກທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະຈັດການກັບແຕ່ລະຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍແນວໃດ.\n"
"[b]ປະສິດທິພາບ:[/b] ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວປະມວນຜົນຕ່ຳ (ເບິ່ງ [member "
"OS.low_processor_usage_mode]) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ GraphEdit.\n"
"[b]ໝາຍເຫດ:[/b] ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ [method Node.get_children] ຈະສົ່ງຄືນໂນດຊັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ "
"[code]_connection_layer[/code] ນຳ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງເຕັກນິກ. "
"ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ."

msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to customize how connections are drawn."
msgstr "ເມທອດສະເໝືອນ (virtual method) ທີ່ສາມາດຖືກຂຽນທັບເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid ""
"Returns whether the [param mouse_position] is in the input hot zone.\n"
"By default, a hot zone is a [Rect2] positioned such that its center is at "
"[param in_node].[method GraphNode.get_input_port_position]([param in_port]) "
"(For output's case, call [method GraphNode.get_output_port_position] "
"instead). The hot zone's width is twice the Theme Property "
"[code]port_grab_distance_horizontal[/code], and its height is twice the "
"[code]port_grab_distance_vertical[/code].\n"
"Below is a sample code to help get started:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_input_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_input_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param mouse_position] ຢູ່ໃນເຂດຮັບຮູ້ (hot zone) ຂອງອິນພຸດ (input) ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຂດຮັບຮູ້ແມ່ນ [Rect2] ທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໂດຍໃຫ້ຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງມັນຢູ່ທີ່ [param in_node].[method "
"GraphNode.get_input_port_position]([param in_port]) (ສຳລັບກໍລະນີເອົາພຸດ, ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ "
"[method GraphNode.get_output_port_position] ແທນ). "
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເຂດຮັບຮູ້ແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງ Theme Property "
"[code]port_grab_distance_horizontal[/code], ແລະ ຄວາມສູງແມ່ນສອງເທົ່າຂອງ "
"[code]port_grab_distance_vertical[/code].\n"
"ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_input_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_input_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

msgid ""
"Returns whether the [param mouse_position] is in the output hot zone. For "
"more information on hot zones, see [method _is_in_input_hotzone].\n"
"Below is a sample code to help get started:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_output_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_output_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຄືນວ່າ [param mouse_position] ຢູ່ໃນເຂດຮັບຮູ້ (hot zone) ຂອງເອົາພຸດ (output) ຫຼື ບໍ່. "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເຂດຮັບຮູ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [method _is_in_input_hotzone].\n"
"ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _is_in_output_hotzone(in_node, in_port, mouse_position):\n"
"\tvar port_size = "
"Vector2(get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_horizontal\"), "
"get_theme_constant(\"port_grab_distance_vertical\"))\n"
"\tvar port_pos = in_node.get_position() + "
"in_node.get_output_port_position(in_port) - port_size / 2\n"
"\tvar rect = Rect2(port_pos, port_size)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn rect.has_point(mouse_position)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
